    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_162009.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like a little experiment that helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:29.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:33.400\nOr, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:37.600\nSee?\nTests aren't scary, they're just helpful tools.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:44.600\nAnother example: a car company might test a new car to see if it's safe.\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:50.100\nSo, to recap: a test is a way of gathering information.\nIt helps us learn, understand, and improve things.\nIt's all about finding out what's what.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
