    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:11.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:16.300\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:25.100\nWe use tests all the time to see if something is working correctly, or to learn more about something.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:26.800\nFor example, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:28.500\nOr, a doctor might give you a quick eye exam to test your vision.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:29.200\nSee?\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:29.800\nSimple!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:30.500\nTests help us gather information and make better decisions.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:37.400\nSo, a test is just a process to gather information.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:42.100\nIt helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working the way it should.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:43.800\nRemember, testing is all about learning!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:46.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
