    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_162628.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:06.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are, and why we use them.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:10.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:14.000\nThink of it like this: a test is like a detective, searching for the truth about your knowledge.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:19.000\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:23.000\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best!\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:25.000\nSee? Tests aren't always scary.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:27.000\nThey can be fun too!\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.000\nSo, to recap: A test is a way to measure your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:39.000\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from quizzes in school to deciding which snack tastes the yummiest.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:44.000\nAnd they help us understand where we're at and what we can learn next.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:46.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
