    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:22.800\nIt\u2019s a process designed to get information.\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of bathwater to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:28.600\nThat's a test!\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:38.600\nAgain, a test!\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like seeing if your shoes still fit.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:50.200\nThe important thing is that a test gives you some kind of result or answer.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:53.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
