    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_165228.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests,\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:06.140\nspecifically what a test is in a general sense.\n\n00:06.140 --> 00:09.920\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:09.920 --> 00:13.380\nIt's a process or procedure that helps us gather information.\n\n00:13.380 --> 00:16.660\nThink of it like this: a taste test tells you how something tastes.\n\n00:16.660 --> 00:20.480\nA spelling test tells you how well you can spell. A medical test can tell you about your health.\n\n00:20.480 --> 00:23.280\nSee? Each one is designed to measure or evaluate something specific.\n\n00:23.280 --> 00:28.240\nFor example, if you want to know if water is hot, you might dip your finger in it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:28.240 --> 00:32.839\nOr, if you want to see if a plant needs water, you might check the soil \u2013 another test.\n\n00:32.839 --> 00:38.160\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:38.160 --> 00:41.880\nIt's a way to explore and understand the world around us.\n\n00:41.880 --> 00:44.230\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
