    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:09.300\nIn everyday language, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:16.700\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\nThink of it like this: you might test if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:21.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cookies pass the test!\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:27.200\nOr, a doctor might test your eyesight to see how well you can see.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:36.500\nEssentially, a test is a procedure.\nIt's a simple way to check something, learn something, or see if something works.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:42.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:47.900\nSo remember, a test is just a way to find things out.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:51.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
