    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.200\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but really, a test is just a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:22.900\nIt's a process designed to give you information.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:33.200\nThe test? Sticking a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:36.500\nOr, maybe you want to know if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:42.700\nThe test is simple: you screw it into a lamp and turn it on. Does it light up?\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:48.900\nThat's your answer! So, basically, a test is a procedure, an action, that helps you determine something you want to know.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:55.100\nIt gives you data or results. It's a simple concept, but it's used everywhere!\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:02.000\nRemember, a test helps you get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
