    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_165631.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer, or a problem you're trying to solve.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:39.000\nWe use tests all the time to see if something works, or to measure how well we understand something.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:44.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:55.000\nOr, in school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
