    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:05.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:08.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:12.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:13.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:17.600\nOr, maybe you test a toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:18.700\nThat's another test.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:23.800\nSo, testing helps us understand if something works correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:28.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:30.300\nA medical test checks your health.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:36.000\nIn short, a test is just a process of checking something to see if it's right.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:38.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
