    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.900\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:32.800\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie you like best.\nOr even, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:40.700\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes.\nThey help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:53.200\nThey're a valuable tool for measuring progress and identifying areas for improvement.\nRemember, a test isn't always about grades; it's about gathering information.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:58.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
