    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:04.300\nToday, we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:07.800\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out information or measure something.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:14.400\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:18.100\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:27.500\nTests can be quizzes in school, experiments in science, or even just trying out different flavors of ice cream to see which one you like best \u2013 that's a kind of test, too!\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:32.900\nThe main idea is that you're trying to learn something or confirm something.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:38.900\nSo, tests help us learn, grow, and make better decisions.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:42.300\nRemember, a test is simply a tool for understanding.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:47.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
