    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:23.800\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\nWe use tests every day, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:33.700\nThink about it: If you try a new food, you're testing if you like it.\nOr, if you jiggle a door handle, you're testing if the door is locked.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:43.800\nIn school, tests help us see what we've learned.\nFor example, a math test shows if we understand addition or subtraction.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:55.200\nA spelling test shows if we know how to write words correctly.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what we already know.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.800\nIt's a tool to help us understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
