    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_170342.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be anything!\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to the answer, you're also checking to see if it's correct.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:31.700\nWe use tests all the time. Think about a spelling test at school. It's designed to see if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:39.900\nOr a taste test \u2013 you try different flavors to see which one you like best.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:51.800\nEven something as simple as checking if a light switch works is a test! You flip the switch to see if the light turns on. That's the question, and the light turning on is the answer.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:57.000\nSo, in short, a test helps us understand something by asking a question and looking for the answer. It\u2019s all about finding things out!\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
