    "updated_at": "2025-12-31T17:06:51.922747",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20251231_170651.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_170651.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:22.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge or ability.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:32.900\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy, or a chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:43.500\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell different words. A math test shows if you can solve problems.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:49.200\nSo, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding where you are and what you might need to work on. It helps us to know something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
