    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_170737.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.200\nIt's like an experiment, but usually with a specific goal in mind.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:28.400\nThink about it: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:33.800\nThat's a test!\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:43.000\nOr your teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a topic. That's a test too!\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:52.600\nTests can be used to measure all sorts of things. They can tell us if something is working correctly, if we're learning something new, or even if we like a certain flavor of ice cream!\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:00.000\nTests help us gather information and make decisions. So, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out. It helps us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
