    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_170824.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:25.600\nIt's like checking to make sure things are doing what they're supposed to. Think about it like this: a spelling test shows how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:35.100\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Even a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:45.500\nThey might check your temperature or listen to your heartbeat. So, tests can be anything from quizzes in school to checking if your bike's brakes work.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:53.900\nThe main idea is to get information and see if you're reaching a goal. Remember, tests help us learn and improve!\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
