    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a structured process to gather information and see how well something performs, or what its qualities are.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works \u2013 that's a test!\nYou're testing its functionality.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:33.600\nOr, if you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how much you've learned.\nEven trying a new recipe is a test!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:42.200\nYou're testing if it tastes good.\nSo, a test can be anything from a simple check to a more complex evaluation.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:49.400\nBasically, it's all about gathering information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
