    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like a measuring tool for your brain.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:31.200\nIt helps you and your teachers see what you've learned and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:41.300\nThere are different kinds of tests, like multiple-choice questions where you pick the best answer, or maybe a short answer test where you write a few sentences.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:51.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr a math test might ask you to solve some simple addition problems.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:57.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool for measuring knowledge.\nIt comes in different forms and helps identify areas where you're doing great and areas where you can improve.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:04.700\nRemember, tests are learning opportunities! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
