    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_171159.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:34.300\nFor example, when you check if the water is hot enough for a shower, that's a test! You're testing the water temperature.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:47.600\nOr, if you try a new recipe and taste it, you're testing if it tastes good. Tests help us confirm things or discover new information.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:59.600\nThey can be simple, like touching something to see if it's cold, or more complex, like a science experiment. The key is, you're trying to learn something through observation or action.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:03.300\nSo next time you're wondering about something, remember you can probably create a test to find out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
