    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:27.400\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. Maybe your doctor orders a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:37.500\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned. Even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:47.400\nSo, tests help us understand something better by providing information. They give us a way to measure or assess things around us.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:51.900\nIn short, a test is just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
