    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more formal and structured way.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:33.400\nEven a baker tests the dough to make sure it's ready for the oven! So, tests help us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.800\nThey can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like a driving test. The important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.900\nTo recap, a test helps us find something out, it could be about your health, your knowledge, or even the quality of some dough!\n\n00:52.900 --> 01:01.700\nTests are a fundamental way to measure and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
