    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:25.000\nIt's a process to see if something works, or if it's true, or if it meets a certain standard. Think about it like this: a chef tastes the soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:34.500\nOr, a doctor asks you questions to test your memory. Even trying out a new video game is a way of testing if you like it!\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:45.700\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions. They're everywhere, from science experiments to school exams.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:54.900\nBasically, if you're checking something to see how it measures up, you're performing a test. That's a basic overview of what a test is.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
