    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:18.300\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:24.700\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:32.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you test them with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:41.100\nIn school, tests are used to see how much you've learned about a subject.\nThey can be multiple choice, where you pick the best answer, or written, where you have to explain your thoughts.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:50.300\nAnother example: a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\nThey could test your blood or take an X-ray.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:57.600\nSo, tests are just tools that help us gather information.\nWhether it's checking cookies, showing what you know in class, or figuring out a medical problem, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
