    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, or works, or is the way we expect it to be.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:31.400\nThink about it like this: a recipe is a test for making a cake. You follow the instructions and test if it results in a delicious cake!\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:41.900\nOr, when you check if your phone is charged, you're testing its battery level.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:49.200\nEven taking a quiz in school is a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:57.200\nSo, tests are everywhere! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working properly. Remember, a test is just a way to find out information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
