    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_172056.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:20.100\nIt's how we check if something is working correctly, or if we know something, or even how we feel about something.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:29.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:37.600\nEven baking a cake is a test! You're testing to see if your recipe and oven will produce a delicious treat.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:45.300\nSo, tests help us learn and improve. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:51.900\nFrom simple quizzes to complex experiments, tests are all about finding answers.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:57.800\nRemember, a test isn't always about right or wrong, it's about understanding.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:01.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
