    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're diving into the concept of a test.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on \u2013 that's a simple test to see if it's working.\nTests can be anything from a quiz in school to checking the temperature of your food to make sure it's cooked.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:42.600\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it \u2013 if it comes out clean, that's a test to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:53.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\nIt helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
