    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:07.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:08.800\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:08.800 --> 00:14.100\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:18.900\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:24.700\nAnother common test is baking a cake.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:27.600\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it comes out delicious!\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:31.600\nIf it doesn't, you know you need to adjust something next time.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:34.800\nSo, tests help us understand things better and make improvements.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.200\nBasically, a test is any process designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:45.800\nIt could be your knowledge, your health, or even a cake recipe!\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:48.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
