    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready, so you poke it with a toothpick. That poke is a test!\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:21.800\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time. A doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:29.900\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject. Even checking if the water is hot enough for a shower is a type of test!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:40.100\nSo, a test helps us gather information and make decisions. It can be a simple observation, like looking at the sky to see if it will rain, or a more formal procedure like taking an exam.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:49.900\nThe important thing is that it provides us with data. In essence, a test is a question and the answer it provides.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:58.700\nHopefully, that gives you a good basic understanding of what a test is.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:07.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
