    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:10.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:20.800\nWe use them all the time, even if we don\u2019t realize it. Think of it like this: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:29.400\nOr, you might try on a shoe to test if it fits.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:39.600\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just class projects.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:44.800\nTests aren't about failing; they're about learning and improving.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.000\nThey give us information. The chef learns the soup needs more salt. You learn if you need a bigger shoe size.\n\n00:52.000 --> 01:01.700\nAnd your teacher learns what topics might need more explanation.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:05.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for finding things out.\n\n01:05.800 --> 01:11.700\nIt helps us understand where we are and where we need to go.\n\n01:11.700 --> 01:15.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
