    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.099\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but we're talking about something a little broader: a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:28.099\nThink of it like this: a doctor does a blood test to find out about your health. Or, you might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:35.499\nThe key thing is that a test gives you information. It helps you make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:42.299\nFor example, you might test different recipes to see which one tastes the best. That's a test!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:52.299\nSo, a test is just a process to gather information and learn something new. Hopefully, that makes tests a little less scary!\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
