    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_173013.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:23.100\nIt's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:31.900\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words. A taste test helps you decide which food you like best.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:43.600\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is a kind of test to see if you're healthy. So, whether it's a quiz in school, a survey online, or trying out a new recipe,\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:49.500\ntests help us learn and understand things better. They give us information.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:53.100\nRemember, a test is just a way to get answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
