    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works or if it's true.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:32.400\nThat's a test! In school, you take tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:41.600\nA doctor might run tests to see what's causing you to feel sick. Even trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like how it tastes!\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:47.900\nSo, tests are everywhere. They help us learn, diagnose problems, and even discover new things.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:50.800\nRemember, a test is just a way of checking something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
