    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like a question or a set of questions designed to give us information.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:44.700\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it! For example, when a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever. Or, when you try a new recipe, tasting it is a test to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:57.900\nTests can be formal, like a school exam to measure what you've learned, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit before you go outside. The key thing is that a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.500\nSo, whether it\u2019s a pop quiz or a taste test, remember that tests are all about learning and understanding.\n```"
