    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:06.200\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:09.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.900 --> 00:16.800\nIt could be a quiz in school, a medical exam, or even just trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:21.400\nBasically, it's a process designed to gather information.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:29.200\nThink of it like this: you have a question, and the test is the tool you use to get the answer.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:33.500\nFor example, a simple spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:38.600\nOr, if you bake a cake for the first time, tasting it is a test to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:44.700\nSo, a test is any procedure used to evaluate knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:49.500\nIt helps us learn where we are and what we need to work on.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
