    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:18.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us see if something works, if it's true, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:35.000\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:43.200\nAnd a doctor might give you a physical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:53.500\nSo, it's all about finding out information. Whether it's about your knowledge, your health, or even your opinion. Tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:55.800\nThey give us a way to measure and evaluate different aspects of our world.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:58.400\nBasically, a test is a question, task, or procedure designed to reveal characteristics of an individual or something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
