    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like an experiment, but often with a clear right or wrong answer.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:19.600\nWe use tests all the time! Your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:31.200\nYour teacher gives tests to see how well you understand the material. Even baking a cake is kind of a test \u2013 you're testing a recipe to see if it turns out delicious!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:42.200\nFor example, a simple math test might ask \"2 + 2 = ?\" The answer, of course, is 4. That's a correct result!\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:52.900\nOr a science test might ask about the parts of a plant. So, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and check understanding.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:58.900\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
