    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:13.100\nWhat are they? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like an experiment, but often a lot simpler.\nWe use tests to measure or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the strength of a material, or even how well a new recipe tastes.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:32.900\nFor example, a spelling test shows what words you know how to spell.\nA doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:42.200\nAnd a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:50.400\nThey help us understand things better.\nIn short, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:52.400\nPretty simple, right?\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
