    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.400\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process or a tool we use to gather information and see what's what.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like this: a cooking test! You taste the soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:24.900\nThat taste is a test. Or, imagine taking a spelling test at school.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:30.100\nThat test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:43.200\nTests can be simple, like checking if the water is hot enough for a bath, or more complex, like a medical test to check your health.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:53.300\nThe main idea is always the same: to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect. So, a test helps us learn, evaluate, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
