    "updated_at": "2025-12-31T17:41:47.111034",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20251231_174147.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_174147.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.500\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:31.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\nMore formally, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:39.600\nIt could be a test in school to see what you've learned, a medical test to check your health, or even a software test to make sure a program works correctly.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:46.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\nA blood test checks for things like cholesterol levels.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.400\nAnd a click of a button on a website?\nThat's tested to make sure it takes you to the right page.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:58.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:02.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working as it should or if we need to make some changes.\n01:02.000 --> 01:04.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```\nMANIM_CODE:\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass TestExplanation(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # ===== SECTION 1: TITLE (7.5 seconds) =====\n        title = Text(\"What is a Test?\", font_size=42, color=GOLD)\n        title.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(Write(title), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(6.0)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n\n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n\n        # ===== SECTION 2: Cake Example (8.0 seconds) =====\n        cake_example_text = Text(\"Cake Test: Toothpick!\", font_size=36, color=GREEN_B)\n        cake_example_text.move_to(UP)\n        cake = ImageMobject(\"cake.png\").scale(0.7)  # Requires cake.png in the same directory\n        cake.move_to(DOWN)\n\n        self.play(FadeIn(cake_example_text), FadeIn(cake), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(6.5)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n\n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n\n        # ===== SECTION 3: Formal Definition (15.7 seconds) =====\n        definition_bg = RoundedRectangle(corner_radius=0.2, width=10, height=2, fill_color=BLUE_B, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        definition_text = Text(\"Test: A procedure to evaluate something.\", font_size=32, color=WHITE)\n        definition_text.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        definition_bg.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(FadeIn(definition_bg), Write(definition_text), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(14.2)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n\n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n\n        # ===== SECTION 4: Examples (8.4 seconds) =====\n        examples_text = Text(\"Examples:\", font_size=36, color=ORANGE)\n        examples_text.move_to(UP)\n        \n        example1 = BulletedList(\"Spelling Test\", \"Blood Test\", \"Website Button Click\", buff=0.5)\n        example1.scale(0.7)\n        example1.move_to(DOWN)\n        \n        self.play(Write(examples_text),FadeIn(example1), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(6.9)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n\n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n\n        # ===== SECTION 5: Purpose (6.4 seconds) =====\n        purpose_text = Text(\"Purpose: Check and Evaluate\", font_size=32, color=TEAL_A)\n        purpose_text.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(Write(purpose_text), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(4.9)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n\n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n\n        # ===== SECTION 6: Why Tests Matter (12.3 seconds) =====\n        why_text = Text(\"Why Tests Matter:\", font_size=36, color=PINK)\n        why_text.move_to(UP)\n\n        bullet1 = Text(\"Working as it should?\", font_size=28, color=WHITE)\n        bullet2 = Text(\"Need to make changes?\", font_size=28, color=WHITE)\n\n        bullet1.move_to(DOWN + UP*0.5)\n        bullet2.move_to(DOWN + DOWN*0.5)\n        \n        group = VGroup(bullet1, bullet2)\n        self.play(Write(why_text),FadeIn(group), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(10.8)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n\n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n\n        # ===== SECTION 7: ENDING (3.6 seconds) =====\n        ending_bg = Rectangle(width=14, height=8, fill_color=BLUE_E, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        ending_text = Text(\"Apilage AI Video\", font_size=48, color=GOLD)\n        ending_text.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(FadeIn(ending_bg), run_time=1.1)\n        self.play(FadeIn(ending_text, scale=0.8), run_time=1.0)\n        self.wait(2.5)\n        self.play(FadeOut(ending_text), FadeOut(ending_bg), run_time=0.5)\n```"
  },
