    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_174341.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:28.000\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:34.000\nThink of it like checking if something works, or understanding how much you know about a topic.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:42.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A driving test checks your ability to drive a car safely.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:51.800\nAnd a taste test? Well, that checks your preference for different flavors! So, tests help us measure and understand things.\n\n00:51.800 --> 01:00.000\nThey can be used to learn, improve, and make informed decisions. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the core idea is always the same: to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
