    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_174428.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works \u2013 you're testing to see if it shines!\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:37.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. There are quizzes at school, taste tests at the grocery store, or even testing out a new video game.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:42.700\nThey all have the same basic idea: to gather information.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:51.100\nFor example, a math test shows how well you understand numbers. A spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:58.200\nAnd that taste test? It tells you if you like the new flavor or not! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
