    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_174703.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:24.600\nIt\u2019s a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities on a particular subject.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:33.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.000\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:50.700\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.400\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve problems, or a spelling test might ask you to write words correctly.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:02.000\nThe results of a test help you, and your teacher, understand where you're doing well and where you might need some extra help.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:05.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn and grow.\n\n01:05.600 --> 01:08.500\nIt's a way to measure what you know.\n\n01:08.500 --> 01:11.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
