    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:21.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:31.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:46.000\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. Even tasting a new food is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.200\nSo, tests help us learn more about ourselves, the world around us, and even how much we know.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:58.400\nThey can be short, like a quick question, or long, like a big exam. The important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:04.600\nThat's the main idea of a test.\n\n01:04.600 --> 01:15.300\nTo recap, a test helps us find out something new. They come in all shapes and sizes, but their purpose is always to give us information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
