    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_175104.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:19.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information and see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to show your teacher how well you understand different words.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:40.000\nOr, a company might test a new phone to see how long the battery lasts.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:42.800\nEssentially, a test helps us measure something.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.800\nWe can test your knowledge, a product's strength, or even someone's skills. For example, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nSee? Testing is everywhere! So, to recap, a test is just a method for getting information and measuring something. It helps us understand and evaluate. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "0f03903f-ead7-4109-9b51-710a4180b26a": {
    "id": "0f03903f-ead7-4109-9b51-710a4180b26a",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T16:13:24.018438",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-31T17:51:49.864007",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20251231_175149.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_175149.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.600 --> 00:03.600\nToday we're diving into something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:07.000\nNow, a test isn't just something you take in school.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.400\nIt\u2019s really just a way of finding out something about something else.\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:12.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:17.700\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you can do a simple test!\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:21.400\nYou stick a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:24.500\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test and it's ready to eat!\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:33.500\nAnother example: you might test if a toy car needs new batteries by turning it on. If it goes, the batteries are good. If it doesn't, time for new ones!\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:36.400\nSo, a test is a simple way to check something.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:40.500\nIt helps us make decisions based on what we find out.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:43.500\nWe ask a question, and the test gives us the answer.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:45.100\nPretty neat, right?\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:47.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "4ebfec96-1fce-4a5f-a9e6-5dbf8e551d4e": {
