    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a process designed to give you information about a person, place, or thing. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher know how well you understand spelling.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:33.800\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which kind of ice cream you like best! Tests aren\u2019t just for school, though.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:47.400\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe. Basically, a test involves asking a question or performing an action to get an answer.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:59.100\nWe then use that answer to learn something new. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and understand the world around us a little bit better.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:02.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
