    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:21.000\nIt helps us understand if something is true, correct, or working as expected.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like checking if your cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:25.800\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:29.700\nWe use tests all the time in everyday life.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:34.400\nWhen you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit, that's a test.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:38.500\nOr when you ask a friend a question to see if they know the answer, that's another kind of test.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:44.400\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like tasting soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:47.900\nThey all give us information to help us make decisions or learn something new.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:52.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
