    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a new topic, or checking if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:31.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready. Another example is a spelling test in school.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:43.100\nIt's a way for your teacher to see how well you know your spelling words. Or, if you're building a tower of blocks, you might gently push it to test how stable it is.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:51.800\nSo, basically, a test is just a method to find out information or see if something meets a certain standard. Pretty simple, right?\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
