    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:11.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you test them with a toothpick.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:13.900\nIf it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:17.500\nIn other areas, a test could be a quiz at school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:22.200\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:23.600\nSee?\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:26.900\nWe use tests all the time to get information and make decisions.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:31.200\nAnother example is when you try a new video game.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:32.800\nYou're testing it to see if you like it!\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.100\nTests aren't scary; they're just tools that help us understand things better.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:43.300\nSo, remember: tests are all about checking things to get information.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:49.300\nThey can be simple, like checking cookies, or more complex, like medical tests.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:50.600\nThey're everywhere!\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:52.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
