    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.000\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:6.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:10.400\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:13.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don\u2019t realize it.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:18.200\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:19.300\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:24.500\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again to see if that fixes it.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:25.800\nAgain, a test!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:29.800\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:37.400\nBut tests aren't just for school. They're a useful tool for learning and problem-solving in all areas of life.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:45.100\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:54.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
