    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.800\nIt's a process designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:31.600\nOr, when you learn a new skill like riding a bike, trying it out is a test to see if you\u2019ve learned it.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:43.700\nTests come in many forms. They could be written exams with multiple choice questions, practical demonstrations where you show what you can do, or even simple quizzes. The point is always to measure something specific.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:54.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for evaluating your understanding or skills. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
