    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like this: you take a test in school to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:25.900\nBut tests aren't just for school.\nThey're everywhere!\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:33.400\nA doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA chef might taste a sauce to test if it's seasoned just right.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:37.700\nSo, examples?\nA spelling quiz is a test.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:43.600\nA car's safety check is a test.\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test!\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:46.500\nYou're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:54.600\nBasically, a test is any process used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or quality.\nIt helps us understand and improve things.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
