    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_180600.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is really just a way to find something out. Think of it like a question you're asking, or a challenge you're facing, and you're trying to get an answer.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:24.400\nThe main thing to remember is that a test helps you understand something better. It gives you information.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:33.100\nFor example, a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor. A spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:50.200\nAnd even trying to fix a broken toy is a kind of test, to see if you can make it work again. So, whether it's a quiz in school, trying a new recipe, or even seeing if your shoes still fit, you're performing a test!\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:56.300\nIt's all about learning and discovering. Remember, tests help us learn and grow!\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
