    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.300\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like an investigation. We want to learn more, so we ask questions or perform actions to get answers.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:31.200\nFor example, a taste test tells you if you like a food. A spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:42.000\nAnd even checking if a light switch works is a kind of test! You flip the switch, and if the light comes on, you know the test passed.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:51.900\nTests help us learn, improve, and make decisions. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
