    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.000\nIt helps us check if something is true, or if something works the way it should.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.500\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:43.900\nOr maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:52.100\nA baker might even taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
