    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_181738.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about yourself or something else. It's a method of measuring or evaluating.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test can tell you which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:33.500\nTests aren't just for school, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:42.500\nScientists use tests to see if a new medicine works. Even bakers test their cake batter to make sure it tastes just right.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:52.300\nSo, remember, a test is a way to learn something, whether it's about spelling, cake, or even your health. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
