    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_181915.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:24.800\nTests can be anything from a quiz in school to a doctor checking your temperature. The main idea behind a test is to measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:33.000\nWe want to see how well you understand a subject, or how healthy you are, or even how strong a material is.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:42.300\nThink about it: A spelling test checks how well you can spell words. A taste test helps decide which cookies taste the best.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:53.100\nEven trying to open a jar is a test of your strength! So, a test is a method for gathering information by asking a question and observing the result.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:59.500\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
