    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:21.700\nIt's a process that gives us information. Think about it like this: You go to the doctor, and they give you a vision test.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:29.800\nThat test helps them understand how well you can see. Or maybe you're baking a cake, and you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:36.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test to see if the cake is cooked.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:45.200\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:51.800\nThe key is that they provide us with data. They help us make decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:51.800 --> 01:00.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
