    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:31.500\nTests can be many things. They could be a written quiz, a physical examination, or even an experiment. The important thing is they give us information.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:40.400\nFor example, a school test helps your teacher understand what you've learned. A battery test tells you how much power is left.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:44.500\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:52.500\nSo, to recap: A test is a method used to gather information about something. They help us learn, diagnose, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
