    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:26.400\nIt helps us understand what someone knows, or how well something works. Think of it like this: Your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:35.000\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:46.500\nTests aren't just for school or baking, though. Doctors use tests to check your health, and companies test their products to make sure they're safe and work properly.\n\n00:46.500 --> 01:00.000\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and make sure things are on the right track. In short, tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:03.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
