    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_182942.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.100\nIt's like a mini-experiment to see what's what.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:32.200\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:44.000\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even trying out a new recipe is kind of a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:54.800\nTests can be written, like exams, or practical, like trying to ride a bike. The important thing is they help us gather information and learn. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to learn more about something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
