    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:22.300\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if something is true. Think of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:34.000\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. In school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:43.600\nThey might ask you questions or give you problems to solve. So, tests are all about gathering information and checking understanding.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:50.400\nThey help us learn and improve. So remember, a test is a method of finding something out.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:57.000\nIt can be used in many ways, from health to baking to school.\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
