    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake, and you use a toothpick to see if it's done.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:32.900\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\nMaybe you'll have a multiple-choice test, where you pick the best answer, or a true or false test.\nEven a quiz is a type of test!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:38.700\nOutside of school, tests are everywhere.\nDoctors use tests to check your health.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:45.700\nCar manufacturers test their cars to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:58.500\nSo, tests are a way to gather information and see if something is working the way it should.\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to check something and gather information.\nThey come in many forms, and we use them all the time!\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
