    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:14.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, it's simply a way to check something, to see if it works, or to find out information.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like this: You might test the temperature of your bath water to make sure it's not too hot or too cold.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:32.200\nOr, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health. Teachers use tests in school to see how well you understand the lessons.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:43.400\nSo, tests can be used for all sorts of things! They help us learn, they help us make sure things are safe, and they help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:50.500\nIn short, a test is just a way of getting information by checking something.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:53.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
