    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:19.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it. Or a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:33.500\nThese are all tests! They help us understand something better.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:45.000\nFor example, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Or a company might test a new product to make sure it works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:55.600\nSo, to recap: a test is a procedure for gathering information, used to evaluate something and see if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:55.600 --> 01:01.500\nIt\u2019s a way to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
