    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:19.100\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:25.300\nThink about it.\nWhen you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.500\nThat's a test!\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz helps you test how well you're understanding the vocabulary.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:42.800\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:51.100\nThe important thing is they give us information.\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:61.700\nSo, a test is just a way to learn something new, or confirm what we already know.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
