    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_184044.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.300\nToday we're diving into the world of \"tests.\"\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:6.600\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:10.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:10.200 --> 00:12.300\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:13.600\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:17.600\nYour doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:21.700\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:25.600\nEven trying a new recipe is kind of a test \u2013 will it taste good?\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:29.700\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and figure things out.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:32.500\nThey come in all shapes and sizes,\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:34.900\nbut the basic idea is always the same:\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:37.700\nto gather information.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:41.900\nRemember, a test is just a structured way to find out something you want to know.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
