    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_184419.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.100\nToday we're diving into something super important: the concept of a test.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:33.600\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:43.400\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake, and you stick a toothpick in to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:54.200\nOr, maybe you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is working. You flip the switch \u2013 that's a test too. Tests aren't just for baking or lightbulbs.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:01.900\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:08.800\nIn all these cases, the test helps us get information and make decisions.\n\n01:08.800 --> 01:15.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get an answer.\n\n01:15.200 --> 01:18.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
