    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:24.300\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.900\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a lightbulb works, you screw it in and flip the switch.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:41.500\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's cooked all the way through.\nThat's another kind of test.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:48.900\nWe use tests all the time to learn about the world around us and make sure things are working the way they should.\nTesting helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:53.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a check to see if something is working or true.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
