    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:19.000\nIt's like an experiment or a check-up to see how well something works or how much you know.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:28.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you can spell words.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:40.700\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes better.\nA car safety test checks how safe a car is in a crash.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:48.600\nSo, a test can be written, like a quiz, or it can be something you do, like trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:52.100\nThe important thing is that it gives you information.\nIt helps you learn, improve, or make a decision.\nBasically, a test is just a way to get answers!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
