    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_184655.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.000\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it like a question you're trying to answer, or a puzzle you're trying to solve.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:28.900\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. For example, if you're baking a cake, you might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar. Or, when you try on a new pair of shoes, you're testing to see if they fit.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:40.200\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big exams.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:53.400\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and see if something is true or correct. It helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
