    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:35.700\nThe \"something else\" could be anything! For example, your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:43.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious!\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:47.800\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information, so we can learn and improve.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:50.500\nRemember, a test is just a tool for learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
