    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.500\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:20.400\nIt's a process we use to check, examine, or evaluate something.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:28.900\nThink about it like this.\nA doctor might run a test to see if you're sick.\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:36.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe!\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:44.800\nThey can be simple, like checking if your car starts.\nOr they can be complex, like a scientific experiment.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:58.200\nThe important thing is that a test helps us get information.\nSo, to recap, a test is just a method for finding information or evaluating something.\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
