    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.400\nIt's a process or a procedure designed to give us information.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.300\nThink of it like this: a taste test tells you which food tastes better.\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\nOr a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:40.200\nSo, tests help us measure knowledge, skills, or even physical conditions.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:46.800\nThey give us data that we can then use to make decisions or learn more.\nThey're all about getting answers!\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:53.700\nIn short, a test is a tool for gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
