    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests. What are they, really?\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out. It\u2019s a process designed to give you information, whether it's about yourself, a product, or even an idea.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake and you want to know if it's done. You stick a toothpick in it, right? That's a test!\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:30.400\nOr, maybe you\u2019re trying out a new app. You play around with it to see if you like it. That\u2019s also a test.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:35.200\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:47.200\nThere are quizzes in school, medical checkups at the doctor, and even taste tests when a company is creating a new snack.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:58.600\nThe goal is always the same: to gather data and learn something new. So, remember, a test is simply a method for finding information.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:04.500\nIt's a way to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
