    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:14.100\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working, or if you understand a concept.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:31.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:38.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:52.700\nSo, tests help us learn, check things, and make sure everything is working as it should. They come in all shapes and sizes, from simple questions to complex experiments.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:60.300\nIn short, a test helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
