    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:27.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we've learned something new. Think about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:36.900\nOr, when you learn a new word, your teacher might give you a quiz to test your understanding.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:46.800\nTests can come in many forms. They can be written, like a multiple-choice quiz, or practical, like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:57.900\nThe main goal is always the same: to gather information and check something.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.600\nSo remember, a test is simply a way to find something out!\n```"
