    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:19.200\nThink of it like an experiment where you're trying to get an answer.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:27.000\nWe use tests all the time! A doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:40.100\nA baker might taste their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:48.800\nSo, tests help us learn things, make decisions, and improve our understanding. They're a valuable tool in many different areas of life.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:52.400\nRemember, a test is just a process to gain information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
