    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:22.000\nIt's like a quick check-up. Think about it: your teacher gives you a quiz, that's a test!\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:28.400\nIt shows how much you've learned in class. Or, imagine you're trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:37.200\nTasting it is a test to see if it's delicious. Here's another example: a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:53.800\nOr, engineers test bridges to make sure they're strong enough to hold cars. So, remember, a test is just a method for finding out information, whether it's about your knowledge, a recipe, or even a bridge.\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:00.200\nIt helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
