    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:19.800\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:29.400\nWe use tests all the time to see if something is working, or to measure how much of something we have.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:37.500\nFor example, you might take a math test at school to see how well you understand addition.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:45.600\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might test the oven temperature to make sure it's hot enough.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:59.000\nEven checking if your phone is charged is a kind of test!\nSo, tests help us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\nThey all serve the same purpose: to gain information.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:04.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
