    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:03.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:07.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out, to see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:12.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you something useful.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:16.300\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:20.700\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:23.400\nYou might take a little taste \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it tastes good enough.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:27.500\nAnother example: your doctor might order a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:31.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.000\nIt helps us understand things better and make decisions.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:38.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
