    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:18.200\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something. It could be to see if something works, to find out if something is true, or even to measure how well you understand something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:29.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re sick. Or, you might test a recipe to see if it tastes good before you make it for a party.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:40.300\nEven a simple light switch has been tested to make sure it turns the light on and off! So, tests help us learn and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:48.900\nThey're used everywhere, from science experiments to everyday life. They help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:56.900\nIn short, a test is simply a check to see if something is correct, working, or true.\n\n00:56.900 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
