    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_193127.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.300\nThink of a test as a way to check something. It could be a check to see if you understand a lesson, or if a machine is working correctly.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.800\nBasically, a test helps us find out if something is the way it should be. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:35.100\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Even a simple taste test can tell you if food is yummy!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:42.100\nSo, tests help us measure and understand things. They give us information we can use.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:53.900\nTo recap, a test is simply a way of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard. They're everywhere, from classrooms to hospitals to even your kitchen!\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
