    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into something super fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:22.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something, right? It's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the strength of a material.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:33.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks what words you know how to spell.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:45.000\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. And a stress test on a bridge makes sure it can handle lots of weight.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:56.100\nSo, a test involves doing something, and then looking at the results to learn something new. It's a simple concept, but tests are used everywhere to help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.800\nIn short, a test is just a process for evaluation. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
