    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:03.800\nToday we're diving into the basics\n\n00:03.800 --> 00:06.600\nof what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:09.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.900 --> 00:12.500\nIt helps us check if something is working,\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:14.500\nor if something is true.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like this: a recipe test!\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:20.400\nYou follow the recipe and then, you taste the cake.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:23.600\nThe tasting is the test to see if the recipe worked.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:27.900\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:31.400\nYou practice, and then try to ride without holding on.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:34.400\nThat little ride is a test to see if you've learned to balance.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:37.000\nTests are super useful because they give us information.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:41.600\nThey help us improve things, learn new skills, and just generally\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:44.800\nunderstand the world around us better.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:49.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and get some information.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:52.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
