    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even performance.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:36.900\nTests can come in many forms.\nThere are multiple choice questions, true or false statements, and even hands-on activities.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:46.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words, while a driving test evaluates your ability to operate a car safely.\n\n00:46.700 --> 01:00.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for evaluating something, whether it's your understanding of a subject, your physical condition, or your skill at a particular task.\nIt's all about finding things out!\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
