    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_194444.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nHi everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:04.700\nToday we're going to explore something super important: a test.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:08.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:10.500\nThink of it like a little quiz to see what's up!\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:12.900\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:18.000\nA simple example is a spelling test in school \u2013 it checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:22.700\nAnother example is testing a new toy to make sure it's safe and fun to play with.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:24.400\nYou might even test a recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:33.700\nSo, to recap, a test is just a tool we use to learn more about something, whether it's your knowledge, a product's quality, or even a new recipe.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:38.600\nIt's all about finding out what works and what doesn't.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:40.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
