    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_194620.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.500\nToday we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:08.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:12.300\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:16.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:19.800\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is tastier.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:24.500\nEven a doctor giving you an exam is a type of test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:27.400\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:31.000\nThey help us understand where we're at and what we need to learn.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:33.800\nIn short, a test is a way to measure something.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:36.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
