    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_194752.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's a process, a procedure, or a set of questions designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or performance.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:28.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:37.700\nA taste test lets you decide which food you like best.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:45.000\nEven a medical test helps doctors figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:51.600\nSo, tests aren't just about getting a grade.\nThey're a tool.\nThey help us learn where we're strong, and where we might need a little extra practice.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nThey give us information.\nIn short, a test is a way to gather information about something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
