    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_194829.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:17.000\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something. It could be checking if a light bulb works, or seeing how well you understand a new concept.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:29.400\nEssentially, it's a way to get information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:38.000\nThink about it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it\u2019s sweet enough.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:48.400\nOr, a doctor might test your reflexes to see if your nervous system is working properly. These are all tests!\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and see if it meets a certain requirement or gives us the information we need. Hopefully this gives you a good foundation to understand testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
