    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nIt's a process used to see if something is working correctly, or to measure a certain quality.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a physical test to check your overall health.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:33.300\nOr, a chef might taste a dish to test its flavor.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:49.600\nAnother common example is a classroom test.\nThese are designed to see how well you've learned something.\nA test can also be something like testing a new toy to see if it's safe for kids.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:56.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or to measure a specific aspect.\nIt helps us understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
