    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_195223.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:24.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skill, or performance in a specific area.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.600\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:42.100\nOr, if you want to know if you understand a new math problem, you might try to solve it.\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:49.000\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like checking the cake.\n\n00:49.000 --> 01:00.500\nThe important thing is they give you information.\nSchool tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\nTests in general help you understand where you are and what you might need to work on.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:04.300\nSo, a test is just a way to learn something about yourself or something else.\n\n01:04.300 --> 01:07.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
