    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:17.600\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and then figuring out the answer.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:23.700\nThink about it. When you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\nThat's a test to see if it's done.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:31.200\nOr, when you try on a new pair of shoes, you're testing if they fit.\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:41.900\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:53.700\nThey help us understand things better and make good decisions.\nSo, a test is really just a method of finding information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nWhether it's a cake, shoes, or a school exam, it's all about learning something new.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
