    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_195401.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nWhat is a Test?\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:20.400\nA test helps you find something out.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:28.400\nDoes a lightbulb work?\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:36.000\nDoes a plant grow in sunlight?\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:43.300\nWhich paper towel absorbs water?\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:51.700\nDoes the cake taste good?\n\n00:51.700 --> 01:02.800\nTests help us learn by observing and measuring.\n\n01:02.800 --> 01:06.400\nApilage AI Video\n```"
