    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_195603.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:07.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:14.000\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake recipe by baking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:26.000\nOr, a doctor might test your vision to see how well you can see.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.200\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:37.400\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just activities.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:40.700\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:52.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information about something, whether it's your understanding of a subject, the quality of a product, or even your own skills.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
