    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_200601.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:15.000\nWhat are they, and why are they important? Simply put, a test is a way to check something, like your knowledge or the quality of a product.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test checks if you like the flavor of a new ice cream.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:38.100\nTests help us understand what we know, what needs improvement, and if something meets our standards. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:46.400\nA teacher gives you an exam to see what you've learned in class. Each test helps us get information and make decisions.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:57.700\nSo, tests are all about checking things and giving us valuable information. They come in many forms and help us in lots of different areas of life.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
