    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like an experiment, but sometimes with questions! It helps us understand if something works, or if someone understands a concept.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:42.500\nFor example, a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words. Or, a test drive of a new car helps you see if you like how it drives. Another common example is a medical test, like a blood test, that gives doctors information about your health.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:51.400\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the common goal of providing us with valuable information.\n\n00:51.400 --> 01:03.300\nIn short, a test is a method of gathering information to learn something. Whether it\u2019s about your knowledge, the performance of a product, or anything in between.\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:08.200\nThanks for watching! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
