    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.000\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:33.700\nOr, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Even baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:40.400\nYou're testing whether you know the recipe and can follow the instructions to get a delicious result.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:54.800\nSo, tests can come in many forms, from written exams to practical demonstrations. They help us understand where we are, what we know, and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:04.500\nIn short, tests are a valuable tool for measuring progress and gaining insights. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
