    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.200\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:21.500\nIt helps us see if something works, or if something is true. Think of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:25.900\nYou screw it into a lamp and turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:32.300\nOr maybe you want to know if your cookies taste good. You give one to a friend and ask them.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:37.200\nAnother test! Tests aren't just for lightbulbs and cookies, though.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:43.600\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:56.800\nBasically, a test is just a question or action that helps us get an answer. So, tests help us understand things better, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
