    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:22.200\nWe use them all the time to check our knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:33.100\nThink about it. You take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nOr maybe you test a recipe to make sure it tastes good before serving it to guests.\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:43.600\nSo, a test is really just a process.\nWe ask a question, perform an action, and then look at the result to get an answer.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:58.800\nWhether it\u2019s a quiz, an experiment, or just trying something out, tests help us learn and improve.\nIn short, a test is a way to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:02.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
