    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 specifically, what a test actually is.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:17.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:28.400\nThat \"something\" could be anything! Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:38.300\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:50.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:50.900 --> 01:00.100\nSo, tests help us learn things. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:04.800\nThey can be formal, like a standardized exam, or informal, like trying a new pizza topping to see if you like it.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:10.100\nEssentially, a test is a process to gather data and draw conclusions.\n\n01:10.100 --> 01:13.600\nIt helps us understand the world around us.\n\n01:13.600 --> 01:17.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "88152549-d7e4-477b-bf1a-baff787a13a4": {
    "id": "88152549-d7e4-477b-bf1a-baff787a13a4",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T16:14:39.958600",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-31T20:17:09.593766",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20251231_201709.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_201709.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:06.100\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:09.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:10.900\nIt's like asking a question to see what the answer is.\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:16.700\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you test it by sticking a toothpick in.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:20.300\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:27.100\nOr, if you want to know if your friend knows their colors, you might point to something blue and ask them what color it is.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:27.900\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:30.100\nTests aren't just for school.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:33.500\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy,\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:37.800\nand engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:41.500\nSo, a test is really just a way to check something and get information.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:44.600\nTo recap, a test helps us discover or confirm something.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:48.600\nIt can be a simple question, or a complex procedure.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:50.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "16661177-06af-4e56-92fd-a08d379e0977": {
