    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:05.700\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:08.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:10.700\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:15.000\nImagine you're baking a cake, you might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:19.800\nOr, if your car won't start, you might try turning on the headlights to test if the battery is dead.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:23.200\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:26.200\nDoctors use tests to figure out what's making you sick.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:31.200\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:35.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:37.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
