    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.300\nNow, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:34.900\nBasically, a test helps us see if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:46.900\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:55.200\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and check if something is as it should be. It's a simple tool we use to learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
