    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_202332.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.219 --> 00:07.219\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.219 --> 00:19.419\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but getting your answer through an activity or set of questions.\n\n00:19.419 --> 00:25.319\nIt helps us measure knowledge, skills, or even abilities.\n\n00:25.319 --> 00:32.319\nTests aren't just about school, though!\nImagine baking a cake and tasting it.\nThat's a test to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:32.319 --> 00:39.319\nOr checking if your shoelaces are tied tightly before running.\nThat's a test too, making sure you won\u2019t trip.\n\n00:39.319 --> 00:51.019\nSchool tests, like quizzes or exams, help teachers see how well you understand what you\u2019ve learned.\nBut remember, tests are just one way to learn and improve.\n\n00:51.019 --> 01:00.819\nThey help us understand where we are and what we need to work on.\nSo, a test is a way to discover something about ourselves or the world around us!\n\n01:00.819 --> 01:02.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
