    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:19.300\nIt's a method we use to check if something is working, or to see how well someone understands a topic.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:32.000\nThink of it like this: a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, before you buy a new phone, you might test its camera by taking a few pictures.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:44.700\nTests can be formal, like a school exam where you answer questions. Or, they can be informal, like checking if a lightbulb works by screwing it into a lamp.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:50.900\nThe key thing is, a test gives us information. It helps us make decisions.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:60.200\nSo, a test is simply a way to find out something and gain information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
