    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20251231_202915.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_202915.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:20.900\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: when you go to the doctor, they might give you a vision test to see how well you can see. That's a test!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:41.100\nOr, if you're learning to bake, you might test your cake with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's another kind of test!\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:51.800\nTests can be big and formal, like a school exam, or small and informal, like checking if the bathwater is too hot. The main idea is that you're trying to learn something by doing something.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.500\nSo, a test is just a way to get information and learn more about something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
