    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:16.900\nThink of it like an experiment. You're trying to discover information.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:31.400\nIt could be a math test at school, designed to see how well you understand addition and subtraction. Or, it could be a taste test, where you try different foods and decide which one you like best.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:39.200\nThe goal is always to learn something new. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:44.900\nOr, a company might test a new product to see if people like it.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:50.600\nSee? Tests are all around us! So, remember, a test is just a method for discovering information.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:59.500\nIt helps us learn and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
