    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_203141.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:20.200\nIt's a process that helps us see if something is working correctly, or to measure how much of something there is.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:30.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\nA taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:39.300\nAnd when you go to the doctor, they might run tests to see how healthy you are.\nSo, tests help us get information.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:53.700\nThey can be simple, like asking a friend a question, or more complex, like scientific experiments.\nThe important thing is that a test gives us data to learn and understand things better.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:04.000\nIn short, a test is a process for gathering information.\nIt's a way to learn, measure, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:04.000 --> 01:07.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "7c05fcb2-57c9-4b9f-8e92-3a80ea41dc56": {
