    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_203228.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:22.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you understand something. Think of it like this: you've learned a new recipe, and a test is like cooking that recipe to see if you remember all the steps and ingredients.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:28.700\nThey can come in many forms. Multiple choice, like choosing the right answer from a list.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:36.800\nOr true or false, where you decide if a statement is correct. You might even have to write out your own answers!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:45.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:53.000\nA math test makes sure you can solve problems.\n\n00:53.000 --> 01:00.800\nTests help you and your teachers know what you've mastered and what you might need a little extra help with.\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:04.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure your understanding.\n01:04.300 --> 01:07.300\nIt helps you learn and grow!\n\n01:07.300 --> 01:07.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
