    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.600\nThink about it like this: a taste test lets you find out which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:38.700\nOr, a spelling test shows your teacher which words you know how to spell. Even a simple tap on your knee by a doctor is a test to check your reflexes!\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:49.600\nTests can be written, like exams in school, or they can be practical, like trying out a new recipe. The key is that they help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see what's what. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
