    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.200\nIt's a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:33.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\nA taste test determines which food tastes best.\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:46.900\nSo, tests come in many forms, from written exams to practical demonstrations.\nThey all share the same goal: to provide information and measure something specific.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:57.700\nThey can help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\nIn short, a test is just a structured way of gathering information.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:03.400\nWe use them all the time! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
