    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:20.100\nNow, a test, in the simplest terms, is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give us information about a person, thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:31.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a medical test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:44.200\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Companies test new products to make sure they work before selling them.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:52.800\nSo, a test can be a quiz, a medical exam, or even just observing how something behaves. The key thing is that it helps us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nBasically, it's all about gathering information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
