    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:24.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:33.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:43.400\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class. These tests help them understand something important.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:51.400\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if you like a certain food. Or, a quick quiz can help you remember facts.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:59.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes! So, to recap: a test is a way to gather information. It helps us understand things better by asking questions and looking at the answers.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
