    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.220 --> 00:09.200\nEver wondered what a test really is?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something, or someone!\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:16.070\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready.\nSo, you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:16.070 --> 00:19.770\nThat's a test!\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\n\n00:19.770 --> 00:26.480\nThe cake passes the test, it's done!\nIf it's gooey, the cake needs more time.\n\n00:26.480 --> 00:32.850\nTests help us learn, measure, and understand things better.\nAnother example?\n\n00:32.850 --> 00:40.250\nA doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher uses tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:40.250 --> 00:51.140\nTests are everywhere, helping us make decisions and learn more.\nSo, a test is just a process to gather information and find something out.\n\n00:51.140 --> 01:02.100\nIt\u2019s a simple way to check if something is working, if something is true, or if something is ready.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
