    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:27.000\nIt's a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even a physical attribute.\nThink about it like this: when you take a spelling test, you're showing how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, if a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:36.400\nTests aren't just in school, though.\nChefs test their food to see if it tastes right, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:43.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a structured way of gathering information.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:54.100\nIt helps us measure things and make informed decisions.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
