    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, where you're trying to get an answer.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:27.100\nIt could be a written exam at school, to see how well you understand a subject. Or, it could be a medical test, like a blood test, to check your health.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:35.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you get a delicious result.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:45.300\nSo, a test helps us learn, diagnose, or just see if something works. It\u2019s all about getting information.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:55.100\nWhether it's answering questions, giving a sample, or following instructions, a test helps us understand the world a little better.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:01.100\nIn short, a test is a process designed to get information. I hope this helps!\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:04.799\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
