    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: you might test a cookie to see if it tastes good, right?\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:35.000\nOr a doctor might test your temperature to see if you have a fever. In school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:44.500\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve some problems to show you know your addition and subtraction. A spelling test checks if you can spell words correctly.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:51.300\nSo, tests are just ways to check our understanding and make sure we're learning. They help us see what we know and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:54.800\nRemember, tests are just a tool! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
