    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:07.500\nToday we're going to talk about tests, what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:16.000\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:27.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:30.500\nMaybe you even test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:35.000\nThese tests all have a common goal: to get information.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:41.000\nThey help us understand something better or make important decisions.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:48.000\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a tool for learning and discovery!\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
