    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:20.900\nIt's a process of asking a question or presenting a challenge to see what the answer is or how something performs.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:35.100\nThink of it like this: A spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words. Or, if you're baking a cake, you might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:48.400\nTests can be formal, like exams at school, or informal, like checking if your shoes are tied. They help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:56.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and discover. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
