    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:18.600\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\nThink of it like this: you're testing to see if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:28.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might take a test in school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:35.200\nEven checking if your car starts is a kind of test!\nYou're testing if the car's engine is working.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:44.300\nSo, tests help us understand the world around us by giving us information.\nThey're a way to confirm or deny something.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.600\nIn short, a test is a check, a way to find out if something is the way it should be.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
