    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_204645.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:12.200\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something called a \"test.\" Now, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:19.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:26.800\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:35.000\nOr maybe you're buying a new phone. You might read reviews online, which are like tests done by other people.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:44.300\nAnother example: a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Teachers give tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:55.600\nSo, basically, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:55.600 --> 01:07.000\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information and see how something performs or measures up. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
