    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.700\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question, but instead of just hearing an answer, you're getting evidence.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:26.700\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:36.900\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned. So, a test can be anything from a quick check to a really involved process.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:44.300\nThe important thing is that it helps you learn something new or confirm something you already suspected.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:57.000\nTests help us measure, understand, and improve all sorts of things. To recap, a test is a procedure designed to gather information and evaluate something.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:06.500\nIt can be used in many different areas, from health to baking to school. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
