    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you get the right answer.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:32.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. In school, you might take a quiz to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:44.800\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Even trying out a new recipe is a test to see if you like how it tastes!\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.800\nFor example, if you're learning your ABCs, someone might ask you, \"What letter comes after A?\"\n\n00:52.800 --> 01:00.800\nIf you say \"B,\" you pass the test! Or, if you bake a cake and everyone says it's delicious, that's a successful test of your baking skills!\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:08.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n01:08.600 --> 01:12.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
