    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_205258.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.700\nIt could be about you, like a quiz in school, or about something else entirely, like testing if a bridge is strong enough.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:31.000\nThe main idea is to gather information. Think of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:37.800\nOr, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:44.600\nThese are all tests! They help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:56.900\nSo, tests are all about gathering information. They come in many forms, but the goal is always the same: to learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
