    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:06.700\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:14.200\nWhether it\u2019s knowing if you've learned something new, checking if something is working correctly, or even seeing if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.000\nThink about it: a quiz in school is a test to see what you remember from class.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:25.900\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what\u2019s making you feel sick.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:29.300\nAnd when you try a sample at the grocery store, that\u2019s a taste test!\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:34.600\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:37.700\nThey give us evidence to understand things better.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:44.300\nBasically, a test is a question with a method of finding the answer.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:47.700\nThat's the fundamental idea of a test!\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
