    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:22.100\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if we understand something.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:34.600\nOr, imagine you're building a tower of blocks.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:40.300\nYou might gently push it to test if it's stable.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:46.000\nAnother example is a quiz at school. It tests what you've learned in class.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:53.000\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something is true or correct. It can be used for all sorts of things, from checking your health to seeing how well you understand a new subject. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
