    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:17.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like a question, or a set of questions, designed to reveal information.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:29.900\nIt could be a test to see if you know your ABCs, or a test to check if a cake is done baking. In school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:37.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A math test checks your math skills.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:53.700\nAnd even tasting a new flavor of ice cream is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you like it! So, remember, a test is just a method to discover something, whether it's knowledge, a skill, or even a preference.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:59.800\nIt helps us learn and understand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
