    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:07.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:11.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:15.100\nIt's like asking a question and then checking the answer.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:21.200\nThink about it: You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:26.200\nOr maybe you've seen a doctor use a test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:33.200\nAnother example is baking a cake. You taste it afterward, right? That's a test to see if you added enough sugar, or if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:38.900\nSo, tests help us learn, check, and understand things better.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:41.300\nThey give us information.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:45.500\nRemember, a test is just a way of gathering information!\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:50.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
