    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:08.500\nSimply put, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:13.500\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of bathwater to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:14.500\nThat's a test!\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:19.500\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've learned.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:24.000\nIt's like checking if you know your ABCs or how to add numbers.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:27.500\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a type of test.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:29.500\nSo is a spelling bee!\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:37.000\nEven baking a cake and tasting it to see if it needs more sugar is a kind of test.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:49.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
