    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore something super important: the test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:14.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:26.300\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:34.600\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:42.500\nA chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt. Or in school, you take tests to show what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:48.300\nSo, tests aren\u2019t just about grades. They help us understand where we are and what we need to work on.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:54.100\nThey help us make decisions based on evidence and information. They\u2019re everywhere!\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.700\nIn short, a test is a way to gather information and evaluate something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
