    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us learn more about ourselves, objects, or even ideas.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like this: you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject. That's a test!\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:33.800\nOr, imagine you're trying out a new recipe. Tasting it along the way is also a type of test, checking if the flavors are right.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:46.300\nTests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like seeing if a toy car rolls down a ramp. The important thing is that they provide information.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:55.100\nThey give us data to understand something better, or make decisions. So, tests help us learn and improve!\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
