    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:23.100\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:29.100\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it \u2013 that's a test! You're testing to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:35.100\nAnother example is a math quiz at school. That's a test to see how well you understand math concepts.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:48.200\nTests can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all have the same goal: to gain information.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:60.100\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check something and learn more about it. It helps us understand, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:60.100 --> 00:63.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
