    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it as asking a question and then finding the answer in a structured way.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:37.300\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:47.100\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing your recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:53.900\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information that we can use to make decisions or learn more.\n```"
