    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.899\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. It could be checking if a lightbulb works, or if you understand a new concept.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.699\nBasically, a test helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:26.499\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake and taste it.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:29.599\nThat's a test! You're checking if it tastes good.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:36.699\nIf it doesn't, you know what to change next time.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:43.799\nAnother example is taking a quiz in school. The quiz tests your knowledge on a subject,\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:50.299\nso you and your teacher know what you've learned and what you need to work on.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.799\nSo, remember, a test is a tool for checking and learning.\n```"
