    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:33.400\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned. They ask questions or give you problems to solve.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.900\nA math test might have problems like \"2 + 2 = ?\" The answer, of course, is 4!\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:48.900\nA spelling test asks you to write words correctly. So, a test is just a way to see if you understand something.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:52.400\nIt helps you and others know what you're doing well and what you might need to work on. It's all about learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
