    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.600\nIt could be a way to see if something works, or to check how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:36.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, imagine you're baking a cake, and you taste it to see if it's sweet enough \u2013 that's a test too!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:46.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:54.000\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, or checking if your phone charger works, tests help us learn and make sure things are going the way they should. Remember, a test is just a way of checking something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
