    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_212130.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it as a tool to check your understanding.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:27.200\nThere are all sorts of tests! Some are written, like quizzes in school.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:34.000\nOthers are practical, like a driving test.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:43.900\nThey all have the same purpose: to measure something. For example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:46.700\nA taste test might check which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:57.600\nSee? Tests can be fun too! So, remember, a test is just a way to measure knowledge or skills. It helps us understand what we already know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
