    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.100\nIt's a method for gathering information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:38.700\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:48.000\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you like it!\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.600\nSo, tests come in many forms and help us learn and understand the world around us better. They give us data, which we can then use to make decisions. In a nutshell, a test is a tool for discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
