    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.220 --> 00:05.220\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.760 --> 00:16.360\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.360 --> 00:24.360\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb lights up. That's a test!\n\n00:24.360 --> 00:33.060\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you've learned new words.\n\n00:33.060 --> 00:37.560\nOr, a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:37.560 --> 00:43.060\nTests help us measure things and find out what we need to improve.\n\n00:43.060 --> 00:50.060\nThey can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like trying to ride a bike.\n\n00:50.060 --> 00:54.060\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check knowledge or ability.\n```"
