    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:08.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.800 --> 00:10.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:14.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:18.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:23.000\nFor example, when you try a new food, you're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:27.100\nOr when you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:31.400\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:37.000\nThey might ask you questions on a piece of paper or have you complete a task to show what you know.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:42.900\nThe results of the test then show how much you\u2019ve learned!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:48.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:54.600\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
