    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:09.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.100 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about a person or thing.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:17.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:24.000\nWe use tests all the time. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:29.300\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:35.700\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test \u2013 you\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:40.200\nSo, a math test checks your math skills.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:43.300\nA blood test checks your blood.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:45.900\nA taste test\u2026 well, that checks if something tastes good!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:54.100\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better, whether it's your knowledge, your health, or even just how delicious a cookie is.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:55.100\nThey give us information.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
