    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:24.500\nIt's like an experiment, but often used to measure knowledge, skills, or abilities. Think of it like this: your doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:34.400\nOr, when you're learning to ride a bike, falling down a few times is a test of your balance.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:40.900\nEven trying a new recipe is a test! You're testing to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:48.400\nSo, tests aren't just about exams in school. They're about learning and understanding things better.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:59.000\nThey help us see where we're at and what we need to work on. They come in many forms and are used in lots of different situations.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:02.400\nIn short, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new.\n01:02.400 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
