    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:20.800\nWe use tests all the time. Your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:29.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see what you've learned. For example, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:37.800\nYou might test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:45.100\nAnother example is checking the batteries in a toy. If the toy works, the batteries pass the test.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:55.200\nSo, remember, a test helps us learn or confirm something. It's a way to get information and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
