    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHello everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to explore something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:19.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and measure a specific skill, knowledge, or ability.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nA chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:44.800\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\nSo, whether it's a written exam, a physical challenge, or even just observing something, a test helps us understand where things stand.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:54.400\nIt gives us data that we can use to make decisions or track progress.\nIn essence, a test is a tool for learning and improvement.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
