    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.300\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:29.100\nThink about it: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:41.200\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:51.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if the ingredients and instructions will make a delicious treat.\n\n00:51.600 --> 01:01.700\nSo, tests help us learn, understand, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:06.700\nThey come in many forms, but the basic idea is always the same: to gain information.\n```"
  },
