    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_213904.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about\u2026 tests!\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:14.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like a little experiment. We ask a question or perform an action, and then we see what happens.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:31.500\nFor example, a simple spelling test helps us see how well someone knows their words. Or, think about baking a cake.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:39.100\nYou're essentially testing your recipe! You follow the instructions and see if the cake comes out the way you expect.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:47.100\nIf it doesn't, you know you need to adjust something. Tests can be big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:59.000\nWhat matters is that they give us data, which we can then use to learn and improve. So, remember, a test is just a tool to gather information.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:03.700\nIt's all about learning!\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:08.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
