    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.500\nFor example, a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words.\nA taste test helps us decide which flavor of ice cream we like best.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:37.500\nOr, a battery test can show us if a battery still has power.\nSo, tests help us measure things, understand things, and make decisions.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:49.600\nThey can be fun, like picking your favorite candy, or important, like checking if a bridge is safe.\nThe important thing is, they give us information.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:59.500\nTo recap, a test is a method for gathering information or evaluating something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
