    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_214415.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:20.700\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer. It helps us learn more about things, whether it's your knowledge, a product\u2019s quality, or even how well a medicine works.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:32.200\nFor example, a school exam is a test to see how much you've learned in class. Or, a taste test helps us decide which ice cream flavor is the best. We can even test a new phone to see if it's durable.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:36.600\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:43.800\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is just a method for getting information.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:51.900\nIt helps us understand, evaluate, and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
