    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_214504.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:13.400\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you put it in a lamp. You're testing the lightbulb.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:29.600\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. When you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like the taste. Or when you ask a friend a question, you're testing their knowledge.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:37.600\nSo, a test is really just a check. It helps us confirm something or find out if something needs fixing.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:46.100\nThey are used everyday and in almost every field.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:55.400\nTo sum it up, a test helps us verify or validate something. It's a simple yet powerful tool for learning and improvement.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
