    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.600\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:32.700\nThink about it: a taste test tells you if you like a food or not.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:44.500\nA spelling test shows how well you know your words. And even trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if it works!\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:52.200\nSo, basically, a test helps us learn, check our understanding, or see how something works. It\u2019s a simple tool that gives us information. Remember, a test is just a way to find out something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
