    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:20.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:23.100\nThat poke?\nThat's a test!\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:25.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:32.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nA spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\nA taste test tells you if you like a certain flavor.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:39.300\nAnd even a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:52.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and make a decision.\nIt helps us understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
