    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\nYou perform the test, and the result helps you understand something better.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:33.600\nFor example, a simple test could be tasting a new food to see if you like it.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:42.000\nOr maybe checking if a light bulb works by turning it on.\nThe \"test\" is turning it on, and the result is either light or no light!\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:54.700\nTests are everywhere, from checking if your car is working properly to seeing if you understand a new lesson at school.\nThey help us learn, troubleshoot problems, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and answer a question.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
