    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.400\nWhat is a test, really?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nThink about it: a taste test to see if you like a new flavor of ice cream, that's a test!\nOr checking the weather forecast to test if you need an umbrella.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:33.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\nThey can be multiple choice, short answer, or even projects.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:42.500\nThe goal is to see how well you understand the topic.\nSo, whether it's testing a new recipe or taking a quiz, remember that tests are just tools to help us learn and discover.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
