    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: the test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:13.600\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific goal in mind. We use tests all the time.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:27.200\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:33.300\nOr, think about a doctor. They might give you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:39.500\nAnother example is a quiz at school. Your teacher uses it to test what you've learned.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:45.700\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn more.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:48.300\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:57.600\nTests can be big or small, simple or complex, but they all have the same basic purpose: to find something out.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
