    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:14.500\nWhat are they and why do we even use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz after a lesson to see if you understood what was taught. That's a test!\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:26.700\nOr, maybe you try out for a sports team. The tryout is a test to see if you have the skills they're looking for.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:39.100\nTests can be written, like exams in school, or practical, like that sports tryout. They help us measure progress and see where we might need to improve.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:49.700\nSo, a test is just a tool to check your knowledge or skills in a specific area. It helps you and others understand what you've learned.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
