    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.400\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like this: you're building a tower of blocks, and you test its stability by gently pushing it.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:28.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. A spelling quiz is a test of your spelling skills.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:40.100\nA doctor giving you a checkup is performing a test to see how healthy you are. Even baking a cake is a sort of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and baking skills!\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:54.100\nSo, to recap, a test is just a method of figuring something out. It helps us measure and understand different things, from how well we know our ABCs to how strong a bridge is.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
