    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_220206.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like a snapshot of your current skills or knowledge. Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:31.800\nYou might take a quiz in school, which is a small test. Or, you might take a driving test to see if you're ready to get your license.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:41.000\nEven trying out a new recipe is kind of a test! You're testing your cooking abilities.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:51.400\nSo, tests help us understand where we're at and what we might need to learn more about. They're a tool for learning and improvement, not something to be afraid of.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.000\nRemember, every test is a chance to see what you know and grow from there.\n```"
