    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_220256.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:18.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if someone understands, or using a tool to see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:28.700\nFor example, a school test helps your teacher see how well you understand a subject. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:33.100\nSee? They're both tests, just checking different things.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.200\nAnother example is testing a toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with. It's all about finding out information.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:52.700\nSo, a test is really just a process for evaluating or examining something. It helps us learn, diagnose, or ensure quality.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
