    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.800\nWe use them all the time to see if something is working correctly, or to check our understanding.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:32.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:40.100\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:52.900\nEven a simple light switch is a kind of test. You flip it, and if the light turns on, the test passed! Tests help us learn and improve. They tell us what we know, and what we need to work on.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find something out, and that information can be really helpful. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
