    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_220454.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:19.500\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs or how much someone knows.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: a cooking test. You follow a recipe, and the taste of the food is the result of the test.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.900\nOr, imagine taking a spelling test in school. The test shows how well you've learned the words.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:43.100\nTests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying out a new app to see if you like it.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:56.800\nThey all involve a set of conditions or questions to get a specific result. So, a test is just a method for gathering information and measuring something.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.500\nPretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
