    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like a question you\u2019re trying to answer. It could be anything from checking if a cake is done by poking it with a fork,\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:29.300\nto seeing if you know your multiplication tables. Essentially, a test helps us understand something better.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:37.200\nFor example, a spelling test shows you how well you know your words. Or, a taste test can tell you which flavor of ice cream you like best!\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:52.200\nSo, a test is just a tool. It helps us learn, explore, and discover new things about ourselves and the world around us. Remember, it's not always about getting the \"right\" answer, but about understanding the process.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
