    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.400\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:29.600\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:38.500\nHere are a few more examples. A taste test can tell you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:41.100\nA light switch test makes sure your lights turn on and off correctly.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:49.500\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is just a way to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:54.000\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
