    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:22.500\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if something is true. Think of it like this: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:32.400\nOr, a doctor checks your temperature to test if you have a fever. In both cases, they are performing a test to gain information.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:41.200\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if your bike tires have enough air.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:51.100\nThey all involve a process to gather data and reach a conclusion. So, a test is a method to\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:57.000\nevaluate or verify something. Pretty straightforward, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
