    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're tackling a fundamental concept: tests!\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like an investigation. We ask a question and a test helps us find the answer.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:30.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:36.900\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:47.700\nEven baking a cake is a sort of test! You follow the recipe and then see if the cake tastes good. That\u2019s the result of your test!\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:55.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a process for finding out information. It\u2019s about asking a question and using a method to get an answer.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.200\nIt can be as simple as tasting a cake or as complex as a medical exam. Hopefully you found that helpful! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
