    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:14.000\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:18.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it\u2019s too hot or too cold.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:27.000\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:30.000\nThe goal of a test is to give us information.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:33.000\nWe can use that information to make decisions.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:39.000\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:42.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:47.000\nAnother example is a spelling test at school; it helps your teacher know what words you need to practice.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:55.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and get information to help us make better choices.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
