    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE duration:61.3\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:21.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something, or even how well something performs.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:32.200\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:41.400\nA car company might test a new car to see how fast it can go.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:54.300\nSo, tests are all about gathering information. They give us results that we can use to learn and improve. They can be big or small, easy or hard, but they all serve the same purpose: to help us find something out.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:61.300\nRemember, a test is just a way to learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
