    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:32.500\nOr a chef tastes a dish to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:46.400\nEven when you try a new video game, you're testing to see if you like it! Tests are used everywhere!\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:56.700\nFrom science experiments to school exams, they help us learn and understand the world around us. They help us figure out what works, what doesn't, and what needs improvement.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n01:00.200 --> 01:03.900\nIt's a structured way of asking a question and getting a useful answer.\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:06.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
