    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It helps us understand how well something works, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:37.300\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you know. Or a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it makes people feel better.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:46.900\nEven baking a cake is a bit of a test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:51.900\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and learning from the results.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:54.800\nThey help us improve things and make better decisions.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:56.600\nRemember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and understand the world around us.\n```"
