    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:11.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt could be about anything!\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:19.500\nThink of it like this: you might test if a cake is done by poking it with a fork.\nThat poke is the test!\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:27.000\nOr, a doctor might test your eyesight to see how well you can see.\nTests help us make decisions.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:37.000\nIf the cake fork comes out clean, you know it's time to eat!\nIf the eye test shows you need glasses, you know it's time to get some.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:45.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\nIt helps us learn and make better choices.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:51.100\nThat's the basics of testing!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
