    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:13.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:21.700\nIt helps us understand if something is working, if something is true, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:30.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:40.200\nOr, a doctor might test your blood to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:47.500\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:54.800\nFor example, a simple test could be asking \"What is the capital of France?\" If you answer \"Paris,\" you pass the test!\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:01.400\nAnother example could be testing a toy car to see if it rolls down a ramp.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:04.800\nIf it rolls, it passes!\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:11.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something and get an answer.\n\n01:11.700 --> 01:18.500\nIt's a way to learn and understand more about the world around us.\n\n01:18.500 --> 01:22.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
