    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_222620.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to gather information about a skill, knowledge, or ability.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to understand your health.\nOr a chef tastes food to test if it needs more seasoning.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:38.000\nThe most common tests you probably think of are in school.\nYou might take a quiz to test your understanding of a chapter in a book, or an exam to show what you've learned over a whole semester.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:47.000\nBut tests are everywhere!\nYou might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or test a toy to make sure it\u2019s safe for kids.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:56.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding.\nIt helps us see where we are and where we need to go.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
