    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:30.300\nThe toothpick tells you if the inside is still gooey or baked through. In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:37.500\nA spelling test shows if you know how to spell words. A math test shows if you can solve problems.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:45.300\nThey\u2019re just tools to help everyone learn! So remember, a test is just a way to check your understanding.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:51.800\nIt helps you and your teachers see what you\u2019ve learned and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
