    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:16.100\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out information.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:37.000\nFor example, if you touch a hot stove, that's a test! You're testing to see if it's hot, and the answer is\u2026yes!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:50.300\nOr, if you try a new flavor of ice cream, you're testing to see if you like it. The result might be delicious or\u2026maybe not so much.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:59.700\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The important thing is that they help us learn and understand things better. So, a test is basically a method to get information and learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
