    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like checking in on progress. The main idea is to ask questions or try something out to get a result.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:40.000\nThis result then tells you if you're on the right track, or if maybe you need to make some adjustments.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:49.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or, think about baking a cake \u2013 tasting it is a test to see if you added enough sugar.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:55.700\nIf it tastes good, you passed the test! So, remember, a test is just a way to check understanding or performance. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
