    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\nWhat are they?\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.000\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\nThink of it as a little investigation.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:25.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:33.100\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter to test if it's sweet enough.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:48.000\nOr, if you're buying a new phone, you might try out the camera to test its quality.\nSo, tests help us learn, decide, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:48.000 --> 01:01.000\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from simple taste tests to complicated scientific experiments.\nBasically, a test is just a method to get information.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.900\nIn summary, a test helps us gain knowledge,\n01:04.900 --> 01:08.800\nmake decisions, and ensure things are as they should be!\n\n01:08.800 --> 01:12.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
