    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.100\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:27.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:38.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking you questions in class.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:46.000\nThe important thing is that tests help us learn and improve. They show us what we know and what we need to work on.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:51.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and grow.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
