    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_223216.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well something performs.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: you test a recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, you test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:33.400\nTesting helps us find problems before they become big issues. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check for any health problems.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:47.800\nOr, a builder might test the strength of a bridge before it's open to the public. So, tests are all about checking things, big or small, to make sure they're doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:55.000\nThey help us improve things and make sure everything is safe and reliable. That's the basics of testing!\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
