    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something. It's a process designed to give you information.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:26.000\nThe toothpick comes out clean? The cake is probably done! It comes out gooey? Needs more time.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:29.300\nAnother example: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:38.000\nThey check your temperature, look at your throat. So, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:49.700\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like poking a cake. The important thing is that they help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
