    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:35.900\nFor example, a simple math test checks if you know your addition. A taste test tells you if you like a food. Even trying to turn on a light switch is a test to see if the power is on!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:46.200\nTests are used everywhere, from school to science to figuring out if your favorite snack is actually any good. The important thing is that a test gives you information.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:52.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a process designed to gather information and help us learn something new.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:55.300\nIt's all about asking questions and finding answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
