    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nNow, you've probably taken lots of tests in school, but in general, a test is really just a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:26.200\nIt's a process to see if something works, or if something is true. Think about it like this: a chef tests a soup by tasting it to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:31.400\nOr, a doctor runs a blood test to find out if you're healthy. See? Simple.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:36.900\nLet's say you bake a cake. The \"test\" is eating it!\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:42.400\nIf it tastes good, the recipe works. If it's burnt, well, the test failed,\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:52.500\nand you know you need to adjust something next time. So, in a nutshell, a test is just a way of checking something. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
