    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.700\nWell, a test is simply a way to find something out. It's a process we use to see if something is true, correct, or working the way it should.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test sees if you like a certain flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:36.600\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out if you're healthy! Tests can be big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:50.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a tool to help us understand the world a little bit better.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:56.600\nThat's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
