    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_224833.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore something called a test.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. The test is screwing it into a lamp and seeing if it lights up.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:31.600\nTests aren't just for lightbulbs though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:41.800\nTeachers use tests to see how well you've learned something. Even bakers test their cake batter to make sure it\u2019s ready for the oven!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:54.700\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us information. They can be simple, like looking at a color, or more complicated, like solving a math problem.\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:06.600\nBut the main idea is the same: a test helps us learn something. To recap, a test is a method for gathering information.\n\n01:06.600 --> 01:10.200\nIt can be used in many different situations, and it helps us understand the world around us.\n\n01:10.200 --> 01:13.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
