    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:06.000\nToday we're tackling something super important: tests.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:12.500\nA test is basically a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how much you know about a subject.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:17.400\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you've learned your words.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:24.000\nOr, a mechanic might run a test on your car engine to make sure everything's running smoothly.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:28.500\nAnother example? Baking!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:32.500\nIf you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:35.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that means the cake is ready.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:46.500\nSo, to recap, a test helps us find out information or confirm if something is working properly. It's all about checking and verifying.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
