    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out information about something. Think of it like an experiment, or a way to check if something is working like it should.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:28.200\nBasically, you're giving something a challenge and seeing how it responds. For example, a doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:36.800\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how much you've learned. Even baking a cake is a bit of a test, right? You're testing your recipe!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:50.300\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to learn something new or confirm something we already suspected.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:57.800\nTests help us understand the world around us better! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
