    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_225415.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:20.000\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:41.800\nOr, you might take a test at school to show what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:51.600\nSo, tests can be anything from a quiz at school, to a scientific experiment, to even just trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:59.000\nThey all help us answer questions and learn more about the world around us. The important thing is that they give us some kind of result or answer.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:02.400\nTo recap, a test is a method for gathering information.\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:05.400\nIt helps us learn and answer questions.\n\n01:05.400 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
