    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:18.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something. Think of it like an experiment, but usually with a set of questions or tasks.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:29.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words. A taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:45.700\nAnd a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. So, whether it's answering questions, trying out different options, or undergoing a medical examination, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:51.700\nIt's all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
