    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:28.600\nTests can be used for lots of things. In school, you take tests to see how much you\u2019ve learned. A doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:38.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the recipe works!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:47.400\nFor example, a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly. A blood test can show if you're getting enough vitamins. And when you taste that cake, you're testing if it tastes good!\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.000\nSo remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
