    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:21.000\nIt's a process designed to gather information or evidence.\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:27.600\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt.\nBoth are using tests!\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:40.800\nTests can be as simple as observing something, or as complex as a standardized exam.\nThe key is that they have a purpose: to help us learn or understand something better.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:55.700\nFor example, a plant test can tell you if it needs more water.\nSo, a test is a procedure for gathering information, whether it's about your health, your cooking, or even your plants.\nIt's all about finding things out!\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
