    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:25.000\nFor example, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.900\nYou might stick a toothpick in the middle.\nThat's a test!\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:40.000\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is broken, you might try turning it on.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:44.100\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:52.100\nIf it lights up, it works.\nIf not, it's probably broken.\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us information.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.500\nThey're a fundamental tool for learning and problem-solving.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
