    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:14.900\nSimple as that, what exactly is a test? Well, in its most basic form, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.600\nIt's a process we use to gather information. Think about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:33.400\nA chef tastes their soup to see if it needs more salt. Or, even simpler, you might test if a lightbulb works by plugging it in.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:43.400\nSo, a test involves doing something, observing the result, and then using that result to make a decision or learn something new.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:49.300\nIt's all about gathering information in a structured way. Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:56.100\nThey help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
