    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about yourself or something else.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:24.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:29.500\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie you like best!\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:37.100\nSee? Tests help us learn and make decisions. Another example: a doctor might give you a physical exam.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:44.900\nThat\u2019s a test to check if you're healthy. Or even trying out a new recipe can be a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:54.200\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
