    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:16.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you know something. \nThink of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:21.300\nWe use tests all the time! \nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:31.400\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar. \nOr, if your flashlight isn't working, you might test the batteries to see if they're dead.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:42.900\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. \nThey can be written, like a quiz, or even hands-on, like building something.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:59.500\nThe point is to see if you understand the main ideas. \nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check understanding, whether it's about baking, batteries, or big ideas!\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:02.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
