    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:20.200\nThink about it. A doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:29.600\nA chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. Or, your teacher might give you a quiz to test how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:41.200\nEach of these examples uses a test to gather information. The vision test checks eyesight, the tasting checks flavor, and the quiz checks knowledge.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:52.200\nSo, a test is just a simple method for gathering information or checking something. Remember, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
