    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:28.600\nIt could be a quiz at school to see what you\u2019ve learned, or a taste test to see which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:33.900\nEven checking if a light bulb works is a kind of test! You're testing if it lights up.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:39.200\nSo, examples! A doctor might use a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:45.000\nA company might test a new product before it's sold to make sure it works properly.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:50.000\nAnd you might test a recipe by making a small batch first.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:56.600\nBasically, a test is a process to evaluate something, find out information, and see if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:56.600 --> 00:59.600\nPretty straightforward, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
