    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:19.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand something, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:28.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:34.200\nYou might taste it before it's finished to test if it needs more sugar. That's a test, too!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:40.000\nAnother example? A doctor might give you a physical test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:45.800\nThey're checking different things about your body to make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:52.100\nSo, tests are all about checking, verifying, and finding out information. They help us learn and improve!\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
