    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:21.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:30.800\nWe use them all the time!\nThink of it like this: you're trying a new recipe.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:38.500\nYou taste the food as you go \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt or pepper.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:46.200\nTests help us understand if something is working, or if we need to make a change.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:48.500\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:51.300\nSchools use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:55.100\nEven video games use tests to see how well you're playing!\n```"
