    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_231732.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:14.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:27.100\nOr, a chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:33.900\nSee? Tests aren't just in school. They help us understand where we're at and what we need to learn next.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:40.200\nSo remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn and grow.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:42.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
