    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_231826.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something called a \"test\".\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us learn or decide.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:22.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. That's one kind of test!\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:29.300\nOr maybe you're learning your ABCs; your teacher might give you a quiz to see if you understand them. That's another kind of test!\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:35.800\nTests can be written, spoken, or even hands-on. The important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:45.500\nIf you take a taste test of two different cookies, you're testing which one you like better!\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:56.100\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information, see what you know, or find out something new. It's all about learning!\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "f145f470-c0f6-45d2-b98a-c593532d067c": {
