    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_231912.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nThink of it like a question you ask to see if you understand something, or an experiment to see how something works.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:27.700\nTests help us learn and make sure things are working correctly.\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:36.000\nOr a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:43.700\nAnother example is when you bake a cake.\nYou can test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:58.300\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready!\nSo, tests are all about checking, learning, and making sure things are good.\nIn short, a test is a way to evaluate or examine something to see how it performs or what its qualities are.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
