    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:05.100\nToday we're going to talk about something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:08.800\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.800 --> 00:14.300\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something works, or how much of something there is.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:19.200\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you have enough iron.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:24.700\nOr maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how many words you know.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:29.500\nA test can also be used to check if a new lightbulb works before you screw it in.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:35.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool. It helps us learn, diagnose, and confirm things.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:38.700\nIt\u2019s all about gathering information.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:42.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
