    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:13.800\nThink of a test like a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you've learned something new.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:21.300\nIt's a way to measure performance. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:27.900\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see if you understand the lesson. Even your phone runs tests!\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:39.500\nIt checks its battery, its connection to the internet, all sorts of things. So, a test is really just a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:54.200\nIt gives us information about how well something is performing, or what someone knows. Whether it's a spelling test, a blood test, or a software test, they all help us learn and improve.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:62.800\nIn short, a test is a way to check, measure, and evaluate. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
