    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, or to see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:27.400\nThink about it like this: maybe you want to know if your cake is done baking. You can use a toothpick \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:36.000\nYou poke it in, and if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test. Tests aren't just for baking, though.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:49.800\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature. And in schools, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:57.600\nSo, whether it's checking a cake, your health, or your knowledge, a test helps us understand something better. Remember, a test is simply a way to get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
