    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like an experiment you do to get information. The main idea is to see how something behaves or performs under certain conditions.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:38.700\nWe set up those conditions, the test, and then observe the results.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:45.900\nFor example, a baking test! You might test a new recipe by baking a small batch first to see if it tastes good before making a whole cake.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:56.100\nOr, think about a spelling test at school. That test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:06.200\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions. They give us evidence to understand something better.\n\n01:06.200 --> 01:16.100\nWhether it's baking a cake or checking your knowledge, tests are all about finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
