    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:10.799\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:15.399\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think about it.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:20.799\nWhen you take a spelling test at school, you're finding out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:34.299\nOr, if you're baking a cake and you poke it with a toothpick, that's a test to see if it's done! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:39.699\nAnother example? A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:48.199\nSo, a test is just a way to check something, to see if it works, or to learn more about it.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:54.299\nIn short, tests help us understand the world around us. They give us information and help us make decisions.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
