    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_232832.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE This VTT file is a placeholder.  It is not synchronized to the audio.  You will need to generate accurate subtitles using an appropriate tool and synchronize them.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like this: a school test checks your knowledge of a subject, like math or history. Or, imagine you're baking a cake; you might taste a little bit of the batter.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:35.500\nThat's a test to see if it tastes good! Another example could be testing out a new toy to see if it works as expected.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:50.900\nTests help us understand, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. So, a test is all about checking something, whether it\u2019s knowledge, taste, or functionality.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:56.900\nIn summary, tests are everywhere, helping us learn and make informed decisions.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
