    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_232915.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, you might take a spelling test in school.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.800\nThat test is designed to find out how well you know your spelling words. Or, imagine a doctor ordering a blood test.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:38.000\nThat test helps them understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:45.200\nAnother example is testing a new recipe. You try it out to see if it tastes good and if it works!\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:54.300\nSo, a test is really just a process for gathering information. We use tests all the time to learn and improve things.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.800\nIn short, tests help us measure knowledge, health, or even the quality of something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
