    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:27.500\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. Imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might test the oven temperature to make sure it's just right.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:31.900\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check on your health.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:36.400\nAnother example? Think about taking a quiz in school.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:46.800\nThat's a test too! It helps your teacher see what you've learned.\nSo, whether it's checking oven temperature, blood samples, or school quizzes, a test is all about gathering information.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:56.600\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better.\nIt\u2019s a method of getting data to make decisions or understand a situation.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
