    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20251231_233146.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a method of checking or evaluating something to see if it meets a certain standard or to learn more about it.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:25.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:37.200\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie you like best.\nEven a simple experiment to see if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade is a kind of test.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:52.700\nSo, tests help us gather information, measure progress, and make informed decisions.\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to complex scientific experiments.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:60.600\nIn a nutshell, a test is a way to learn and understand.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
