    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:5.700\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:10.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:14.700\nIt helps us see if something is true, or if it works the way we think it should.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:20.600\nThink about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:26.600\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each try is a little test to see if you can balance.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.600\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:39.300\nThe important thing is that they give us information to help us learn and improve.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:42.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get answers.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:53.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
