    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:24.100\nIt's a process designed to evaluate knowledge, skill, or performance. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:29.600\nA driving test evaluates your driving skills. And a taste test?\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:36.700\nWell, that checks your opinion on how something tastes! Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:47.500\nThey can be written, spoken, practical, or even just observing something. The important thing is that they provide information.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:58.300\nThey help us understand where we are, and what we might need to learn or practice. So, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and assessment.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:05.000\nIt helps us measure something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
