    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, it\u2019s a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:27.400\nA test can be anything from checking if a lightbulb works, to seeing if you can ride your bike without training wheels.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:31.400\nThe lightbulb test is easy: you turn it on.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:35.400\nIf it lights up, it passes the test! If it doesn't, it fails.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:41.900\nAnother example? A cookie recipe! You follow the steps, bake the cookies, and then\u2026 you taste them!\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:44.400\nThat\u2019s the test.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:46.900\nAre they delicious? Great!\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:53.000\nDid you forget the sugar? Maybe not so great.\n\n00:53.000 --> 01:00.000\nSo, a test helps us understand if something works, if something is true, or if something meets certain standards.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:00.500\nIt's all about gathering information.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:06.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
