    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.210 --> 00:01.060\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.060 --> 00:02.150\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:02.770 --> 00:03.880\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.880 --> 00:06.090\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.090 --> 00:08.390\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:08.390 --> 00:11.620\nTests can be used to check if something works, or to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:11.970 --> 00:15.450\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:15.450 --> 00:18.550\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:18.960 --> 00:24.030\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:24.410 --> 00:29.110\nOr, if your toy car isn\u2019t moving, you might check the batteries \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if they still have power.\n\n00:29.490 --> 00:36.340\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new by checking something out. They help us understand things better.\n\n00:36.340 --> 00:37.980\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
