    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific goal in mind.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:26.400\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:32.500\nImagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:38.500\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:44.500\nOr, think about taking a quiz in school.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:50.100\nThat's a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:56.100\nAnother example?\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:03.000\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:08.400\nThey check things like your blood pressure or temperature.\n\n01:08.400 --> 01:15.000\nSo, a test is really just a method for gathering information and making a decision, big or small.\n\n01:15.000 --> 01:21.100\nWe use them to learn, to diagnose, and to improve things.\n\n01:21.100 --> 01:23.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
