    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:22.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like a question you ask to get an answer, but sometimes the answer isn't so simple.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:34.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:40.200\nAnother example: a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:46.000\nSo, a test helps us understand something better, whether it's your health, your knowledge, or even the sweetness of a cake!\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:49.700\nIt\u2019s all about gathering information.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:53.300\nIt\u2019s a simple way to learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
