    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. It's how we see if something works, if something is true, or how good something is.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:34.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling. A taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes better. And a durability test might see how much weight a chair can hold before it breaks.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:47.000\nSo, a test is just a method for learning more. We use tests all the time, in school, in science, and even in everyday life to make informed decisions.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:51.700\nRemember, it's all about finding out something!\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:54.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
