    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.700\nA test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works, if it's true, or if you know something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:34.100\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:45.800\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:53.500\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz, a science experiment, or even just tasting your food, a test helps us learn and understand the world around us. Remember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
