    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:21.700\nIt could be about you, a product, or even an idea.\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:31.300\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\nA test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:42.800\nFor example, a student might take a quiz to test their knowledge on a subject.\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate or measure something.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
