    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:20.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something, or can do something.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:27.700\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:36.200\nOr, in school, you take quizzes and exams to show what you've learned.\nEven baking a cake is a test!\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:46.700\nYou're testing if your recipe works and if you can follow the instructions.\nSo, tests can be big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:58.800\nThey all have the same goal: to get information and learn something new.\nRemember, a test isn't about being perfect, it's about understanding and improving.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:02.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
