    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.500\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:27.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:31.500\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:40.900\nIt's a process we use all the time to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:45.800\nFor example, you might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:49.700\nIf it comes out clean, the test tells you the cake is ready!\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:54.600\nOr, imagine you\u2019re testing a new toy to see if it's fun.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:57.500\nYou play with it and decide if you like it or not.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:00.400\nThat's a test too!\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:03.800\nSo remember, a test is basically just a way to check something.\n\n01:03.800 --> 01:08.100\nWe ask a question, we do something, and then we look at the result to see what we learned.\n\n01:08.100 --> 01:09.700\nEasy peasy!\n\n01:09.700 --> 01:14.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
