    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:23.900\nIt helps us understand if something is true, correct, or working properly. Think about it like this: you might test if a cake is done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:32.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or maybe you test a lightbulb to see if it works. If it lights up, it passes!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:38.500\nTests aren't just for cakes and lightbulbs though. Doctors use tests to check your health,\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:48.700\nand teachers use tests to see what you've learned. They all help us learn and make sure things are running smoothly.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:59.500\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information and check if something is right. It's a simple idea that's used in all sorts of ways.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
