    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_000349.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:22.800\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:38.000\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:45.900\nThese are both tests! They help us learn information.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:52.100\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if you like a certain food.\nOr, a quick experiment can test if a toy car needs new batteries.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a method used to gather information.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.100\nIt helps us understand things better by observing the results. Hope that makes sense! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
