    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:04.300\nToday, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:08.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:10.400\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:14.900\nThink about it this way: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:18.500\nA taste test checks if you like a certain food.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:21.600\nEven a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:26.800\nSo, tests help us learn what we know, what we like, and even what's going on inside our bodies.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:30.600\nThey're used in lots of different ways to get information.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:34.800\nBasically, a test is just a tool to help us understand something better.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:38.300\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:41.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
