    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_000557.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:18.000\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:30.900\nYou poke it with a toothpick. That's a test! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:35.600\nOr, imagine you're trying to guess which key unlocks a door.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:43.100\nYou try each key, one by one. Each try is a test! You're testing to see which key works.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:46.600\nSo, a test is really just a simple way to check something. It helps us learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
