    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us measure or check what we know, or what something can do.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:30.500\nOr, a doctor might run a test to check your health.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:33.500\nAnother example? A chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:44.900\nSee? Tests are all around us! They help us understand things better.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:48.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new, or confirm what we already suspect.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:52.200\nTests help us measure and check. Now you know! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
