    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a check-up. That's a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:33.000\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:38.700\nTests are used everywhere! Schools use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:50.300\nCompanies test new products to make sure they're safe and reliable. So, a test is just a way to gather information and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:58.700\nSo remember, a test is a way to find something out, like checking if a cake is ready or if you're feeling well.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:02.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
