    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_001321.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:19.800\nIt's a process designed to gather information and see how well something performs, or if something is true.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:26.900\nThink about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:34.000\nThat's a test! Or, when a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:46.200\nTests can be simple, like that toothpick, or complex, like an exam in school. But the basic idea is always the same: to learn something new.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:55.400\nThey help us understand the world around us and make better decisions. So, tests are all about learning and finding out the truth!\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
