    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.000\nIn simple terms, a test is really just a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:23.000\nIt's like asking a question, but instead of just getting a verbal answer, you're getting data or results that you can use.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. That test provides information about your body.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:41.000\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:49.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give you information.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.400\nSo, a test is just a process designed to gather data and answer a question. Pretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
