    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_001458.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:31.900\nThose are both tests!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:38.400\nAnother example could be testing a recipe. You follow the instructions and see if the cake comes out delicious.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:48.000\nThat's testing the recipe. So, remember, a test is a process for checking something. It helps us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
