    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_001705.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something about something! Think of it like asking a question to get an answer.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:25.500\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:33.400\nOr, a taste test tells us which food tastes the best.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:46.900\nEven checking if a light bulb works is a type of test! You're checking if it passes the \"working\" test.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:54.600\nSo, a test is a process to gather information or check if something meets a certain standard. It can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just a simple observation. Remember, tests are all about learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
