    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_001808.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:18.700\nToday, we\u2019re diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:30.200\nThink of a test as a way to check how well you understand something.\nIt could be a quiz at school, a sports trial, or even trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:37.500\nBasically, a test helps us see what we know, or how good we are at a skill.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:45.000\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\nOr, a test drive helps you decide if you like a car.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:57.300\nSo, tests aren\u2019t just about grades.\nThey help us learn and improve!\nThey point out what we\u2019re doing well and where we might need a little more practice.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:01.000\nRemember, every test is a chance to learn something new.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.600\nIn short, tests are tools that measure knowledge or skill, give us feedback, and help us grow.\n\n01:04.600 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
