    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_001909.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test, at its most basic, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:29.800\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:34.300\nFor example, you might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it\u2019s too hot or too cold.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:39.300\nOr, you might taste your food to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:46.500\nSee? Simple! In school, tests help show what you've learned.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:54.400\nA math test shows if you understand addition. A spelling test shows if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.500\nThey\u2019re just tools to help us learn and grow.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.000\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to find out information.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:08.400\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n01:08.400 --> 01:18.600\nTests help us learn about the world and about ourselves. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
