    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_002244.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:20.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\nIt could be about you, like a quiz in school, or about a thing, like checking if a new toy is safe.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:29.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\nThey might check your temperature or listen to your heart.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:44.400\nSimilarly, a food company tests its products to make sure they taste good and are safe to eat.\nSo, tests help us learn, make decisions, and ensure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:55.100\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the main idea is always the same: to gather information.\nThat's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
