    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.500\nNow, a test, in the simplest terms, is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is working. You turn it on \u2013 that's the test!\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:32.000\nIn school, a test helps your teacher understand what you've learned. It could be a quiz, an exam, or even just answering questions in class.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:42.900\nOutside of school, tests are everywhere! A doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:51.600\nFor example, a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, imagine baking a cake. Tasting it is a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:59.900\nSo, a test is just a way to check knowledge or performance. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:05.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
