    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_002532.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:25.300\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. Think about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test of what you've learned in class.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:34.100\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:47.100\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions. They can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like trying out different flavors of ice cream.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:54.800\nThe important thing is that they give us data. In short, a test is a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:01.900\nIt helps us measure and assess things around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
