    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:22.700\nThink about it like this: Your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:30.900\nOr, imagine you're trying out a new recipe. Tasting it is a test to see if it needs more salt or pepper.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:44.600\nTests can be used for all sorts of things! From checking your eyesight at the doctor, to making sure a new phone is working properly, tests help us understand and improve things.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:58.200\nSo, to recap, a test is just a way to gather information and see how something measures up. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
