    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:21.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us measure or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, your skills, or even how well something works.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:31.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:39.600\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:47.800\nIn science, a test might involve experimenting to see if a plant grows faster with a certain type of fertilizer.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:52.900\nWe use tests every day, even without realizing it!\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:57.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information. It\u2019s a way to explore and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
