    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:19.500\nIt's like asking a question, but instead of just getting a verbal answer, you're looking for proof or evidence.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes a sauce to test if it needs more salt. Or a doctor checks your temperature to test if you have a fever.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:34.100\nSee? In both cases, they're using the test to get information.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:44.300\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. You might take a spelling test at school, or a mechanic might run a diagnostic test on your car.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.200\nThey all help us understand something better. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:02.599\nIt helps us check things out and make sure everything is working as it should! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
