    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_003207.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:27.800\nThink about it: your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:42.000\nA test helps us measure knowledge, skills, or even the presence of something, like a virus.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:48.600\nFor example, a simple test could be checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:59.500\nIf it lights up, the test is positive! If it doesn't, well, it failed the test. Tests help us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a structured way of finding out information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
