    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat are they? Well, a test is really just a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You plug it in, and if it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:25.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:35.700\nA quiz in school is a test. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if it tastes good!\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:41.700\nLet's say you want to know if your toy car can roll down a ramp.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:51.300\nYou push it down. If it rolls, it passes the \"rolling down the ramp\" test. If it doesn't, well, it didn't pass this time.\n\n00:51.300 --> 01:00.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something. It helps us understand if something works or if someone knows something.\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:04.300\nTests are everywhere, helping us learn and explore the world.\n```"
