    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:10.800\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:17.000\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening for an answer, you're looking for proof.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:26.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:30.500\nOr a taste test can help you decide which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:37.000\nTests aren't just for school.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:41.500\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and chefs test their recipes to make sure they taste great.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:49.500\nSo, a test is a tool that helps us learn, improve, and make better choices. It's a way to gather information and understand something more clearly.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:51.500\nRemember, tests are here to help!\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
