    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like an experiment or a question you ask to see what happens, or what someone knows.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:27.100\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:34.500\nA test can also be something like trying a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\nYou're testing the recipe!\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:43.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something, learning something, or seeing what happens.\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:49.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
