    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_003701.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:19.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:32.200\nIt helps us check if we've learned what we need to, or if a product is doing its job correctly.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:43.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:57.700\nTests can be written, like exams, or they can be practical, like trying out a new bike. Essentially, a test gives us information. It tells us what we know, what we need to learn, or if something needs to be improved.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.200\nSo, tests are tools for learning and improvement, not just things to be scared of. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
