    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_003740.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.400\nWhat is a test, anyway? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.400\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly or if we understand something.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:31.300\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:35.100\nOr, when you learn new things in school, your teacher gives you a test to see if you've understood the lessons.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:43.100\nAnother example? Imagine you're baking a cake. You might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:51.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! So, a test is really just a check-up.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:58.300\nIt's a way to gather information and see if things are as they should be. It can be used for all sorts of things! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
