    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something! Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:24.000\nFor example, a math test helps us understand how well you know your numbers. A taste test tells us how good something tastes.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:40.100\nEven a simple check-up at the doctor is a kind of test to see if you're healthy. So, whether it's a written exam, a physical activity, or even just trying a new food, a test helps us learn and understand more.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:46.500\nIt gives us information. Remember, tests are all about learning and finding things out.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:52.300\nThey help us improve and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
