    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_003910.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.200\nWhat is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:26.000\nIt helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard. Think about it like this: When you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:38.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, before buying a used car, you might take it for a test drive to see if it runs smoothly.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:46.800\nThat's another kind of test. Tests can also be used to measure things, like how well you understand a subject in school.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.500\nThey can even be used to check the quality of water! So, tests are all about checking and measuring.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:01.500\nThey help us make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "93a5c63d-c380-491c-9554-a4885623eddb": {
    "id": "93a5c63d-c380-491c-9554-a4885623eddb",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T16:17:10.162195",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T00:40:04.068068",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_004003.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_004003.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to see how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies taste good, so you ask a friend to try one.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:35.000\nThat's a test! Tests can be written, like quizzes in school, or they can be hands-on, like a driving test. They help us measure skills, knowledge, abilities, and even personality.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:44.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills, while a physical fitness test checks your physical abilities.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:53.100\nThe important thing is that tests give us information to help us learn and improve.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:59.100\nThey aren't scary, they're just helpful tools!\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:02.700\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to learn more about yourself and the world around you.\n01:02.700 --> 01:05.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
