    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:19.100\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:24.100\nYou turn it on, and that's the test. If it lights up, it passes!\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:34.400\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be questions on paper, or even showing how to do something.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:45.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or a science experiment could test if a certain plant food makes plants grow faster.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:53.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something by trying it out or asking questions.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:57.600\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we might need to learn next. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
