    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.200\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like checking if you understand the rules of a game after someone explains them to you. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:35.000\nA math test checks if you can solve problems using numbers. And even tasting a new food is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:45.300\nSo, tests help us see what we've learned and what we might need to practice more. They aren't scary; they're just tools to help us learn and grow.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:54.000\nRemember, tests are a way to check your knowledge and help you improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "e6010614-c780-494f-88ca-bb7318044f76": {
    "id": "e6010614-c780-494f-88ca-bb7318044f76",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T16:17:14.892345",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T00:47:16.463904",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_004716.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_004716.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. Think of it as a question with a purpose.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. When you taste a new food to see if you like it, that's a test!\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:36.400\nOr when you try to turn on a light switch to see if the bulb is working, you're performing a test. In school, a test helps your teacher understand how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:48.900\nIn science, a test might be an experiment to see if a hypothesis is correct. The core idea is always the same: to gather information and draw a conclusion.\n\n00:48.900 --> 01:00.300\nSo, a test is just a question or procedure designed to give you information about something. It helps us learn, understand, and make decisions.\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:03.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
