    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:36.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:48.100\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're kind of testing it to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:57.500\nOr, if you press a button on a toy, you're testing to see if it makes a sound.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:07.800\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n01:07.800 --> 01:17.100\nThey might ask you questions about a book you read or have you solve a math problem.\n\n01:17.100 --> 01:26.300\nThe answers you give show them how well you understood the lesson.\n\n01:26.300 --> 01:36.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to get information, whether it's about cooking, toys, or what you've learned in class.\n\n01:36.600 --> 01:43.700\nIt's all about asking a question and finding the answer.\n\n01:43.700 --> 01:51.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
