    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:12.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how well you understand something, or how well something works.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:18.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch. That's a simple test!\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:25.100\nWe use tests all the time. In school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.000\nDoctors use tests to check if you're healthy. Even when you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:43.400\nSo, a school exam is a test, a blood exam is a test, and even tasting your food while cooking is a test!\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:54.800\nThey all give you information to see if something is right, or if it needs to be improved. Basically, a test is a way of getting information about something.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:04.200\nTo recap, a test helps us understand something, whether it's your knowledge, your health, or even your baking skills.\n\n01:04.200 --> 01:09.100\nIt's a simple way to check how things are going.\n\n01:09.100 --> 01:12.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
