    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, you're observing something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.700\nThink about it like this: a chef tastes the soup \u2013 that's a test!\nThey're testing if it needs more salt.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.900\nOr, if you try on a new pair of shoes, you're testing if they fit.\nYou're gathering information by doing something.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:48.900\nTests can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like checking if the oven is hot.\nThe important thing is that a test helps you learn something new or confirm something you already suspected.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:57.700\nSo, a test is just a way of checking things out and getting answers.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
