    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_005455.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE\nAll timings are approximate.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something or someone to see how well they do.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:37.900\nOr, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned. Tests aren't just for people, either!\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:46.400\nWe can test a recipe to see if it tastes good, or test a new toy to make sure it\u2019s safe.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:50.100\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and understand something better.\n```"
