    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_005552.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.900\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something about, well, anything! It's a method or procedure used to determine the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:29.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:44.600\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes best. And a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:52.000\nSo, whether it's checking if a cake is cooked all the way through with a toothpick, or taking a quiz at school, they're all tests. They're all designed to give us information.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:59.400\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. In short, a test is a way to get answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "d8c8a417-e92d-4931-8116-47a57a811f91": {
