    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_005637.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like this: A doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick. A teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:30.500\nA chef might even taste their food, that's a test to see if it tastes good! Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:41.800\nMultiple choice, true or false, even just trying something out to see what happens can be a test. The key is that you're gathering information.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:51.000\nSo, whether it's checking if your cake is ready or figuring out if you understand a new idea, tests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:58.500\nTests are an important part of everyday life. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
