    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_005805.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.700\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in a broader sense, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:26.700\nWe're checking to see if it works, if it's true, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:33.600\nThink about it like this: you might test a new lightbulb to see if it lights up.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:42.100\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. These are all simple tests.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:52.600\nTests help us understand things better and make sure things are working correctly. They're a key part of learning and improving. So, remember, a test is simply a check to see if something meets expectations. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
