    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:30.300\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:36.900\nTests aren't just for school or the doctor, though. You might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:48.600\nOr you might test out different routes to get to school faster. See, tests are everywhere! They help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:54.200\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. It's a tool for discovery! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
