    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_005929.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:07.000\nToday we're tackling something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:12.500\nThink of a test as a way to check what you know about a specific topic.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:21.000\nIt could be a quiz in school, a survey online, or even a scientist running an experiment.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:28.000\nBasically, a test gives you a chance to show your understanding, or it helps someone gather information.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:38.600\nOr, a taste test helps decide which ice cream flavor people like best!\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:44.600\nSo, tests help us measure knowledge, preferences, and all sorts of things.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:50.200\nThey are a fundamental part of learning and discovery.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:54.400\nRemember, a test is just a tool to learn and improve!\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
