    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it as a question we ask to get an answer.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:37.800\nIt can be anything from a simple quiz in school to checking if a light bulb works. The quiz tests your knowledge, and flicking the switch tests if the bulb will light up.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:43.100\nTests help us understand, diagnose, and make decisions.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:50.700\nFor example, a doctor might order a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:57.300\nSee? Tests are all around us! So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information. It's a question we ask to learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
