    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:19.100\nIt's a method we use to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone understands a topic.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:29.400\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to check if you have a cold. Or your teacher might give you a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:40.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it tastes good! So, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:49.700\nThey can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like quickly checking if your bike tires have enough air. They\u2019re all about finding answers.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:55.700\nBasically, a test is a way to learn more. Remember that!\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
