    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.100\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:06.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or can do.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:08.900\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge!\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:11.700\nIt's not just about school; tests are everywhere!\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:15.000\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:18.300\nWhen a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:21.800\nLet's say you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:24.100\nThe first time you try, you might wobble a lot.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:25.500\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:27.500\nYou're testing your balance.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:31.600\nAs you practice, you'll get better, and the \"test\" of riding becomes easier.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:37.200\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information, to see where you are and what you've learned.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:42.300\nIt helps you understand your strengths and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:44.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
