    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.700\nTests can be used for all sorts of things, like figuring out how well you understand a topic, or checking if something is working correctly.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.900\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\nA taste test tells you if you like a certain food.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:46.900\nEven a doctor giving you a check-up is a kind of test, to see if you're healthy!\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for learning something new or confirming something you already suspect.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:54.300\nIt helps us gather information and make decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
