    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_011203.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.800\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something, like your knowledge, a product's quality, or even a scientific idea.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:34.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, a taste test might help you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:46.200\nScientists also use tests, like experiments, to see if their ideas about the world are correct.\nThey might test a new medicine to see if it works.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:52.800\nSo, tests are everywhere!\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:59.400\nThey are a way to gather information and understand things better.\nRemember, a test is just a tool for learning and discovery.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:03.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
