    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with questions or tasks.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:34.700\nThe goal is to see how much you know, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:46.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\nA math test checks your math skills.\nEven a taste test is a type of test \u2013 it helps you decide which flavor you like best!\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:58.200\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nSome are multiple choice, some ask you to write out answers, and some might even involve doing a physical activity.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool to measure knowledge, skill, or preference.\nIt helps us understand what we know and where we can improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
