    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_011713.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. Or a teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.000\nIn cooking, you might taste your food to test if it needs more salt. Tests help us make decisions.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:40.200\nA car company might test their cars to make sure they're safe. Scientists use tests to see if their ideas are right.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:52.100\nThe results give them data, and that data helps them understand their experiment. So, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:59.800\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better choices. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
