    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_011805.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or what you can do. Think of it like a measuring tool, but instead of measuring how tall you are, it measures your understanding of something.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:26.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might have a quiz in school, which is a small test on a specific topic.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:35.800\nOr maybe you've taken a driving test to show you can safely operate a car. Even baking a cake can be a test of your cooking skills!\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:47.500\nIf the cake turns out great, you passed the test! So, a test is just a process to evaluate knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:56.100\nIt helps us understand where we're at and what we might need to learn next. Tests are a fundamental part of learning and growing.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
