    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.400\nThink of a test as a way to check something. It helps us see if things are working the way they should, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:24.600\nFor example, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. Or, in school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:31.400\nImagine you're building a tower of blocks. You might test if it's strong enough by gently pushing it.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:40.800\nIf it falls, you know it needs some adjustments. Tests can be simple, like that block tower, or more complicated.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:54.300\nBut they all have the same goal: to find out something. So, to recap, a test is a way to check something \u2013 to see if it works, or to see if someone knows something.\n\n00:54.300 --> 01:04.000\nKeep that in mind, and you're already well on your way to understanding tests! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
