    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:19.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like a question you ask, or a challenge you set, to get an answer or to see how well something works.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:31.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, when you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:44.000\nEven a doctor using a thermometer is running a test to check your temperature! So, a test helps us learn more, measure something, or see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:56.500\nIt's a fundamental part of learning and understanding the world around us. To recap, a test is a method of inquiry that allows us to gather information and evaluate a condition.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
