    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_012031.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:25.900\nIt's a process used to gather information or evaluate something.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:31.000\nThink about it like this: a cookie taste test tells you if a cookie is yummy!\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:36.500\nOr, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:46.000\nTests aren't just for school! They're everywhere. You test the temperature of your bath water before getting in. You test if your shoes fit before buying them.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:53.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for learning or checking something. It helps us understand things better and make good decisions.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.300\nAnd that's the basics of what a test is all about! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
