    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is working, or if we understand something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:26.700\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:35.100\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you get a delicious result.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:44.500\nSo, a test can be anything that helps us learn more, check our understanding, or see if something is working as it should.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:51.800\nBasically, tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
