    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_012144.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.600\nNow, a test is basically a way to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like a check-up, but for your brain! It helps you, and maybe your teacher or instructor, figure out what you already know and what you might need to practice a little more.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:34.500\nFor example, if you\u2019re learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of animals or what they eat.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:45.000\nOr, if you\u2019re learning about numbers, a test might ask you to solve simple math problems. So, tests are just tools to help you learn better.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:52.700\nThey show you where you're strong and where you can improve. Remember, they're not scary, they're helpful!\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
