    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_012226.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:22.000\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:26.500\nOr, maybe you take a quiz at school to show what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:33.500\nThose are both tests! They help us understand something better. Let\u2019s say you want to know if your plant needs water.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:38.400\nYou can test it by sticking your finger in the soil. If it's dry, the plant needs water!\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:43.300\nThat's a simple test. So, a test is just a way to check something, learn something, or prove something.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:50.400\nIt helps us make informed decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:53.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
