    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.899\nNow, a test is basically a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch. That's a test!\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:35.099\nWe use tests every day, even without realizing it. For example, when you pour milk into your cereal and taste it to see if it's fresh, that's a test. Or when you try on a pair of shoes to see if they fit, that\u2019s testing the size.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:45.099\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:51.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out something. It helps us confirm if something is right, working, or true. It\u2019s all about checking!\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
