    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_012424.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly IS a test?\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:25.700\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process of asking questions or performing actions to see what the result will be.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:36.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:46.100\nOr, if you're baking a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:55.300\nEven shaking a wrapped gift to guess what\u2019s inside is a kind of test!\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:07.700\nTests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like checking if your shoes are tied before you go outside. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n01:07.700 --> 01:19.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what we already know. It's all about gathering information!\n\n01:19.300 --> 01:25.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
