    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_012607.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.700\nSpecifically, what a test is. Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done. You poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:23.100\nThe toothpick comes out clean? The cake passes the test! It's ready.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:26.500\nAnother example: a doctor checks your temperature.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:34.800\nThat temperature reading is a test to see if you have a fever. So, a test is just a simple way to get information.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:43.500\nWe use them all the time to learn things and make decisions. They help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:50.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
