    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.999\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something really fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.899\nNow, you've probably heard that word a lot, but what does it really mean? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.399\nIt's a process or procedure designed to measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:36.099\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:49.799\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic. Even baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:59.099\nYou're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you get a delicious result. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:05.699\nWhether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even just how well a cake bakes, a test helps us learn and understand.\n\n01:05.700 --> 01:06.599\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about!\n01:06.600 --> 01:07.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
