    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE duration:58.9\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.299\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. In science, a test helps us see if something is true or not.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.799\nWe might test a new medicine to see if it makes people feel better. Or, we could test a toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:41.900\nFor example, imagine you want to know if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:51.400\nYou'd plant two plants, put one in the sun and one in the shade, and then test which one grows taller! That's a test!\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:58.899\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something by asking a question and looking at the results. It helps us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
