    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:19.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, right?\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:23.200\nYou do a test! You stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:28.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test. It's done!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:34.800\nIf it's gooey, the cake fails, and needs more time. Tests are used everywhere.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.400\nYour doctor runs tests to see if you're healthy. Teachers give tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:47.800\nAnother example? Checking if your shoes are tied. You give the laces a little tug.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:51.400\nThat's a mini-test! So, a test is simply a process or method used to determine something.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:56.800\nWe use them to make decisions based on the results. Tests help us every day.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
