    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_014341.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like an investigation.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:28.600\nWe're trying to gather information. Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:34.200\nIt could be a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:39.800\nIt could be a doctor running blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:45.400\nOr even baking a cake! You\u2019re testing a recipe to see if it turns out right.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:54.200\nThe important thing is that a test gives us results. These results help us make decisions or learn something new. So, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:55.000\nHopefully, now you have a better idea of what a test is.\n```"
