    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_014636.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.300\nThe main idea behind a test is to give something a challenge, or a set of challenges, and then see how it responds.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:33.400\nThis helps us understand its qualities or performance. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:45.700\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. Even baking a cake is a bit of a test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it turns out right!\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:56.700\nSo, in short, a test is a method for gathering information and evaluating performance. It helps us learn and improve things all around us.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
