    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_015117.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something, to check or examine something closely.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like this: you use a test to see if you know your multiplication tables, or to check if a cake is baked all the way through.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:26.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:31.400\nA quiz at school is a test.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:36.000\nA doctor checking your temperature is performing a test.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:40.700\nEven tasting a new sauce to see if it needs more salt is a kind of test!\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:46.300\nSo, basically, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:50.200\nIt's a process of trying something out and then evaluating the results.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:55.200\nWe use tests every day, often without even realizing it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
