    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_015159.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:20.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process or procedure designed to evaluate something \u2013 it could be your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:32.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test can help decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest!\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:44.900\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on inside your body. So, a test is just a method of gathering information to make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:51.100\nIt helps us learn and improve. Basically, it's just a way of checking things out!\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
