    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:29.200\nThink of it like an experiment, but instead of a science lab, it could be anything!\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:39.500\nBasically, a test helps us understand if something is true, correct, or working as it should.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:49.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:57.600\nOr, you might test a new cookie recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nAnother example is checking if your bicycle brakes work before riding it.\n```"
