    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_015554.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:30.200\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if we know something, or even what something is made of.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:36.100\nFor example, a simple test could be checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:49.100\nIf it lights up, the test says it's good! Or, imagine taking a quiz in school. That's a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:55.900\nTests can be big or small, simple or complicated, but they all help us gather information. So, in short, a test is a process to get answers. It's a way of checking things and learning more. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "97899ea1-3932-43cc-86a9-c73bb1f19b58": {
    "id": "97899ea1-3932-43cc-86a9-c73bb1f19b58",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T16:17:54.803368",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T01:56:38.020255",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_015637.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_015637.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is true, or how well someone understands something.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:26.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:39.000\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie you like better. Or even a weather test, seeing if you need to wear a jacket outside.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:51.500\nSo, tests help us learn, make choices, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:51.500 --> 01:01.700\nThey can be simple, like asking a question, or more complex, like a science experiment. But at their core, tests are all about finding answers.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:05.300\nIn short, a test is a procedure for evaluating something.\n\n01:05.300 --> 01:08.900\nFrom school exams to product trials, tests are everywhere!\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:12.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
