    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_015853.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE\nAll timings are approximate.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:25.900\nIt could be to see if you understand a topic, like in school. Or, it could be to check if something is working correctly, like a machine.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:37.400\nThink about it this way: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words. And when you get your eyes checked, that's a test to see how well you can see!\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:50.100\nTests aren't just about grades; they help us learn and improve things. So, tests are a way to measure knowledge, skills, or the condition of something.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:58.700\nThey help us understand more about ourselves and the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
