    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:24.300\nIt\u2019s a process of asking questions or performing actions to see what the result will be.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:31.700\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:38.400\nOr, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:45.100\nAnother example? You might test the water in a pool to make sure it's safe to swim in.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:51.800\nThe test gives you information. So, remember, a test is a tool used to learn something new, confirm something you already suspect, or make sure something is working correctly.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:57.000\nIt helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
