    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_020707.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:21.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: you're trying to figure out if an oven is hot.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.700\nYou might carefully reach out and feel the air near it.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:36.800\nThat\u2019s a test! You're testing the oven's temperature.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:45.900\nTests can be more formal too. A spelling test at school checks your knowledge of spelling rules.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:53.600\nOr a taste test can help you decide which cookie is the tastiest. The main idea is that a test gives you information about something. It helps you understand it better, or decide what to do next. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
