    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_020750.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. It's how we find out if something is working the way it should, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:27.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:30.600\nAnother example? Imagine you bake a cake. You might taste it to test if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:35.400\nThat's a test too! So, to recap, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:46.700\nIt can be a medical exam, a school quiz, or even tasting a cake! It helps us learn and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
