    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_020833.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nNow, you might think of tests as scary quizzes at school, but in general, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:27.300\nIt's how we check if something works, or if something is true. Think about it like this: if you want to know if a lightbulb is working, you screw it in and flip the switch. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:35.100\nOr, if you want to know if your cookies are done baking, you poke them with a toothpick.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:42.600\nIf it comes out clean, they\u2019re ready \u2013 you\u2019ve tested them! Tests help us make sure things are good to go.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:50.100\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to get information and confirm something. It's a check!\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
