    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:22.200\nIt's like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, you're getting proof, or evidence.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:32.100\nThink of it like testing a cake. You bake it, then you might poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test showing the cake is done!\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:45.500\nOr, imagine you're taking a spelling test in school. That test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:55.300\nTests can be short or long, simple or complex, but the main idea is always the same: to gather information. So, a test helps us understand something better by giving us results we can look at. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
