    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:32.700\nIt's a process, or a set of questions, designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even your preferences.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:45.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test at school checks how well you know your words. A taste test helps decide which ice cream flavor is the best.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:54.800\nOr even a simple yes or no question can be a test! So, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to gather information.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. In short, a test is just a tool for finding things out.\n```"
