    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests! Think of a test as a way to see what you know, or how well something works.\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:23.000\nIt's like a check-up for your brain, or for a new toy. Basically, a test gives you a set of questions or tasks, and then looks at your answers or the results to see if they're correct or successful.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:35.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or, testing a new cookie recipe helps you see if it tastes good before you bake a whole batch.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:39.900\nSee? Tests are super helpful for learning and improving things.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:53.500\nThey help us understand what we've learned, and where we might need a little extra practice. So, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of checking things out!\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
