    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something called a test.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:17.300\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:27.600\nIt could be anything! Like, a taste test to see which cookie you like best, or a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:32.700\nLet's say you want to know if your plant needs water.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:39.500\nYou can do a test! Stick your finger in the soil. If it feels dry, the test tells you your plant needs water.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:41.200\nSee? Simple!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:50.900\nSo, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
