    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.500\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:12.100\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:18.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:26.500\nWe use tests all the time! Your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:33.900\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:47.200\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it. So, a test helps us learn. It could be about your health, your knowledge, or even just your taste!\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:53.300\nWe gather information from tests to help us make decisions and understand the world around us a little better.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:59.600\nTests really are everywhere! In short, a test is a way to get information.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:03.200\nIt's a question, an experiment, or anything that gives you an answer.\n\n01:03.200 --> 01:05.900\nThanks for watching!\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:09.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
