    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:23.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand something better.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you test it with a toothpick.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:34.200\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready! That's a test.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:39.600\nOr, maybe you want to see if your toy car still works.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:44.800\nYou put batteries in it and try it out. If it drives, the test passed!\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.100\nSo, a test is just a way to check something or learn something new. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it. They help us make decisions and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
