    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:19.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:26.200\nTests can come in many forms.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:39.100\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough. Or, if you're buying a new car, you'll probably take it for a test drive to see how it handles. Schools use tests to see how well you understand the material you've been learning.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:49.300\nSo, whether it's tasting batter, driving a car, or answering questions in class, a test helps us gather information.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:56.500\nIt allows us to learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:56.500 --> 00:59.500\nIn short, a test is an evaluation.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
