    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:20.900\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a procedure we use to evaluate something. Think of it as a way to gather information and see how well something performs, or what its characteristics are.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:31.200\nFor example, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:38.300\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:52.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious. So, a test is really just a way to learn more about something.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:59.900\nWe perform the test, observe the results, and then use that information to make decisions or understand things better. It's a simple, but powerful, way to gather knowledge. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
