    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_022800.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like an experiment, but sometimes it's just a set of questions.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:34.600\nWe use tests all the time to check if something works, to measure something, or to see what someone knows.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:46.700\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Or, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:57.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing your recipe! So, tests help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us. Whether it's a quiz at school or a scientific experiment, tests are a valuable tool. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
