    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, your abilities, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:29.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:39.300\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes best. Or a stress test on a bridge determines how much weight it can handle.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:46.500\nSo, tests help us measure things and make informed decisions. They give us useful information.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:50.000\nRemember, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
