    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:20.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:29.100\nFor example, imagine you bake a cake.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:42.100\nThe \"test\" is tasting it! Does it taste good? Is it sweet enough? That taste tells you if you followed the recipe correctly.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:52.300\nOr, if you're planting a seed, waiting to see if it sprouts is a test to see if the seed is healthy and the conditions are right.\n\n00:52.300 --> 01:00.600\nTests help us learn and improve, whether it's baking a cake, planting a seed, or even figuring out what kind of pet you'd like best.\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:04.200\nThey give us information to make better choices. So remember, a test is simply a way to find out something!\n\n01:04.200 --> 01:07.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
