    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.600\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but we're talking about something a little broader.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:28.700\nA test is really just a way to find out something. It's a process we use to check if something is working, or to see what the result is.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:33.200\nThink of it like this: if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:42.200\nThat's a test! You're checking to see if the inside is cooked. Another example?\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:53.300\nA doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature or listening to your heartbeat. Tests help us understand things better and make sure everything is as it should be.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:58.700\nSo, a test is a simple way to gather information and check on something. We use them everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
