    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, you're actually putting something to the test to see how it responds.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:26.300\nFor example, if you want to know if a cookie is good, you taste it! That's a test.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:34.300\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if a toy car can roll down a ramp, you let it go and see what happens. Again, that's a test!\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:41.300\nWe use tests all the time to learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:54.600\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and make decisions. Testing different things, or testing the same thing in different ways, can give you even more information!\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:04.000\nSo next time you\u2019re trying to figure something out, remember to put it to the test!\n\n01:04.000 --> 01:07.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
