    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand something, or if something works properly.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if your cake is baked, you do a simple test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it!\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:30.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready. Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:37.800\nYour school exams are tests to see how well you\u2019ve learned. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:47.300\nEven trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it! Basically, a test helps us learn something or confirm something.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:57.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking, whether it's in school, at the doctor, or even in the kitchen.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
