    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_023954.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:14.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests to measure things, see if something works, or understand what someone knows.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:35.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:42.900\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see if you understand the lesson.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:50.100\nAnd a company might test a new product to see if people like it. So, tests help us get information.\n\n00:50.100 --> 01:04.500\nThey're all about gathering data and learning something new. Whether it's a simple yes or no question, or a long, complicated experiment, it's all a test.\n\n01:04.500 --> 01:10.900\nIn short, a test is a method for gathering information or evaluating something. It's a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n01:10.900 --> 01:17.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
