    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_024042.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like this: You might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:31.000\nThat's testing your knowledge. Or, imagine a toy car \u2013 you might roll it down a ramp to test how fast it goes. That's testing how well it works.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:38.700\nAnother example: a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:43.700\nOr a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:55.300\nSee? Tests are all around us! So, to recap: a test helps us understand something better, whether it's our own abilities or how something functions.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:01.700\nIt's all about learning and improving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
