    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to see what you know, what you can do, or even how something works.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:26.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.400\nA taste test tells you which food tastes better.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:45.100\nAnd a stress test on a bridge checks if it's strong enough to hold traffic.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:52.400\nSo, tests help us measure things and learn more.\nThey can be as simple as asking a question or as complex as running a scientific experiment.\nThe key is that a test gives us information. In short, a test helps us learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
