    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:17.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to check your knowledge or skills on a specific topic.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:27.100\nThink of it as a friendly challenge to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:36.200\nThe main point of a test is to help you, and your teachers, understand what you already know and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:44.000\nIt's not about being perfect, it's about learning!\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:51.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you can spell words correctly. A math test might ask you to solve problems. And even a simple quiz about a book you read is a type of test!\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:57.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool to measure what you know and identify areas for improvement.\n\n00:57.500 --> 00:59.800\nIt helps you learn and grow. Good luck with your next test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
