    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a light bulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:27.200\nThat's a test! We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:37.100\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it. Or, if you push a door to see if it's locked, that's another test.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:44.100\nTests help us learn and improve things. If the light bulb doesn't turn on, we know it's broken.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:55.400\nIf you don't like the new recipe, you know to adjust it next time. So, tests are all about checking, learning, and making things better.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
