    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to explore the concept of a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is true.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:21.000\nWe use tests all the time!\nA doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:26.900\nOr, think about baking a cake.\nYou might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:32.500\nTests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:43.800\nFor example, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it works.\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to test how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:43.800 --> 01:00.100\nThese are all different types of tests designed to provide answers.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find something out, whether it's about your health, your baking skills, or something brand new.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:03.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
