    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer. It helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if you've learned something new.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:34.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:49.500\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, too! They might check your temperature, or listen to your heartbeat.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:57.200\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give us information and help us understand something better. Remember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
