    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_025116.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:11.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:19.200\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:22.300\nThink about checking if a lightbulb works. You flip the switch. That's a test!\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:27.200\nOr maybe you taste a new food to see if you like it. That's a test too!\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:36.100\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like figuring out if your keys are in your pocket.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:51.900\nThe main idea is always the same: to gather information and learn something new. So, a test is just a question, an action, or a process designed to reveal something about the world around us.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:54.400\nPretty simple, right?\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
