    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like a question you ask to see what the answer is.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:19.900\nTests are used everywhere. In school, we take tests to see what we've learned.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:27.300\nDoctors use tests to check our health. Even video games use tests to see if you\u2019ve completed a level.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:34.500\nFor example, a math test checks your math skills. A blood test checks things like your cholesterol.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:52.800\nAnd in a game, passing through a doorway might test if you have the right key. So, to recap, a test is a way to find something out, used in lots of different situations to check skills, health, or even progress in a game.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
