    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_025338.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like checking if your shoes fit before you go for a run. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:28.100\nDid the cake rise properly? That's a test!\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:32.100\nDoes your phone connect to the Wi-Fi? Another test!\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:39.100\nLet's say you're building a birdhouse. A test would be making sure the roof doesn't leak when it rains.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:53.700\nOr, if you're writing a story, reading it aloud is a test to see if it sounds good. So, a test is just a way to check, verify, and confirm something is as it should be.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:01.100\nThey help us make sure things are working the way we expect. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
