    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:23.500\nIt's a process we use to gather information\nor see if something is working correctly.\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake,\nyou might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:27.700\nThat's a test!\nYou're testing to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.600\nOr, when you go to the doctor,\nthey might check your temperature.\nThat's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:39.800\nTests can be simple,\nlike checking the weather before you go outside,\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:47.700\nor more complex,\nlike a science experiment.\nThe important thing is that a test helps us\nlearn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:54.900\nSo, a test is really just a way to\ngather information and learn.\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:01.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
