    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_030457.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:13.300\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:19.300\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think about it.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:31.800\nWhen you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see what you've learned. Or when a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:43.900\nEven baking a cake can be a test \u2013 you're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious!\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.700\nSo, a test is really just a process. You have something you want to know, you perform an action or ask a question, and then you see what the result tells you.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.200\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, and even create! In short, tests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "2f220915-ed4f-4b57-9a41-a777838defe2": {
    "id": "2f220915-ed4f-4b57-9a41-a777838defe2",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T16:18:35.565287",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T03:05:44.603988",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_030544.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_030544.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:20.200\nSimply put, a test is just a way to measure something. It could be anything from your knowledge of a subject, to how well a new product works, or even how fast you can run.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like this: if you want to know how much flour you have, you use a measuring cup \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:36.400\nOr, if you want to know if your cookies are done, you poke them with a toothpick. That's also a test!\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:45.100\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:55.300\nThe important thing is that they give you information. So, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and measure something.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:01.200\nIt's a tool for understanding! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
