    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_030713.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.900\nIt\u2019s a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:33.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you can spell words.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:44.800\nA taste test helps decide which ice cream flavor is the best.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:57.200\nOr, a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic goal: to gather information and help us understand something better.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:01.400\nWhether it's for school, for fun, or for important decisions, tests are a part of life.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:04.800\nIn short, a test is just a tool we use to learn and measure.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:08.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
