    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_031123.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:23.500\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if something is true.\nThink about it like this: you might test a new recipe by making it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:32.800\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:42.900\nFor example, a simple test could be checking if a light bulb works by screwing it into a lamp.\nIf it lights up, the test is passed!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:55.800\nOr, you might test your knowledge of colors by naming them when someone points to them.\nSo, a test is basically a way to gather information and make sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:02.900\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
