    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_031418.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:16.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:27.500\nWhen you take a spelling test at school, you're being tested on your knowledge of spelling. Or when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:31.100\nThat's a test, too!\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:37.800\nAnother example? Imagine you're building with blocks. You might try to stack them high to test if your tower is stable.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:44.300\nYou\u2019re seeing if it can hold its own weight. So, a test is just a method for finding out if something works, if something is correct, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:50.700\nIt's a way to learn and improve!\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
