    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.900\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how something performs.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:37.300\nThink about it like this: you might give your dog a treat to test if they know how to sit.\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:49.500\nSo, tests can be anything from a simple observation to a complicated experiment.\nThe key is that they help us learn something new or confirm something we already suspected.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:57.700\nThey help us measure, evaluate, and understand the world around us.\nRemember, a test is simply a structured way to get answers.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
