    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_031550.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE\nAll subtitles are timed to match the audio provided.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:12.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a process where you ask a question or perform an action to see what the result will be. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:33.100\nOr, if you\u2019re baking a cake, you might taste the batter \u2013 that's a little test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:44.900\nTests aren't just for school or baking, though. Doctors use tests to figure out if you're healthy, and scientists use them to learn new things about the world.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:54.300\nSo, a test is really just a way to check something out and get some information. In short, it's a method of evaluation.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
