    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_031632.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:20.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to check or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even how well a new medicine works.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:29.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:34.100\nA taste test decides which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:46.100\nAnd a medical test can tell you if you have a cold. See? All different, but they all test something.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:53.200\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information, measure something, and see where things stand. It helps us understand and make decisions.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.800\nIn short, tests are all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
