    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:27.000\nIt's a process, or a set of questions, that helps us understand or measure something specific.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:44.600\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. See? Tests can be formal, like a classroom exam, or informal, like trying out different snacks.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:54.800\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information. It allows us to evaluate, compare, and learn.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:01.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find something out. It\u2019s a process for gaining information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
