    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:23.000\nIt's a method we use to gather information or see if something is true.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.000\nThink about it like this: when you go to the doctor, they might give you a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.000\nOr, when you're learning something new, you might take a quiz.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:35.800\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:42.000\nAnother example: A baker might test their oven's temperature to make sure it's hot enough to bake a cake.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:46.000\nSee? Tests can be big or small, simple or complex, but they all help us learn something.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:53.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a process used to gather information and check if something is accurate.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.000\nIt's a fundamental tool we use in all sorts of situations.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
