    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_032316.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test is?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with questions and answers.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:31.700\nIt's a method used to measure your knowledge, skills, or even physical abilities.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:38.100\nA common example is a school exam. That tests what you've learned in class.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:44.500\nBut it could also be a taste test to see which juice people like best. Or even a medical test to check your health.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:53.400\nSo, a test helps us gather information. It can confirm if you understand a topic, identify your strengths and weaknesses, or compare different things.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:59.200\nIn short, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. It\u2019s all about gathering data and learning more. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
