    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_032530.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of a test.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:25.300\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well someone or something performs.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:43.400\nOr, a taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:54.800\nTests can be used for all sorts of things! From checking your knowledge in school, to seeing if a new medicine works, to even figuring out which phone has the best camera.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.300\nSo, to recap, a test is just a structured way of getting information and measuring performance.\n```"
  },
