    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.200\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but often quicker and simpler. The main idea is to ask a question or present a challenge and see what happens.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:38.800\nFor example, a simple spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:53.600\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the light bulb works! So, tests help us learn, compare things, and make decisions.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:01.100\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have one thing in common: they\u2019re designed to give us information. Basically, a test is a way of checking something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
