    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.500\nThink of it like a question, but instead of just asking, we're trying to get an answer through a controlled process.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:27.600\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:34.400\nOr if you want to know if your friend knows the answer to a question, you ask them! Another test!\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:45.300\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things. They can be formal like a school exam, or informal like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:52.800\nBasically, any method you use to gather information and see if something is true or correct is a test.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:59.000\nThat's the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
