    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.700\nIt helps us understand if something is true or false, or how well something works. Think of it like this: you might test a new recipe by cooking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:34.100\nOr, imagine you're testing a toy to see if it's safe for kids to play with. We do this by trying it out and observing the results.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:44.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:55.500\nTests help us learn and make better decisions. So, remember, a test is a way to learn something new or confirm what we already think.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:01.900\nIt's all about gathering information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
