    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? \nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.700\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something. \nThink of it like this: A chef tastes their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:35.200\nOr, a doctor might give you an eye exam to test your vision. \nIn school, a quiz is a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:41.000\nThese tests give us information. \nThe soup test tells the chef what to add.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:48.000\nThe eye exam tells the doctor if you need glasses. \nAnd the quiz tells your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:57.600\nSo, tests are just tools we use to gather information and make sure things are on the right track. \nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
