    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_033949.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests, and don't worry, it's not the scary kind.\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:18.900\nA test is simply a way to check if something works the way it should.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: you want to see if your new toy car goes fast. The test is pushing it and seeing how far it travels.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:34.300\nIn everyday life, we run tests all the time!\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:43.900\nYou taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. Or you try turning on a light switch to test if the bulb works.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.200\nTests are super important because they help us learn and improve things. If your car doesn't go far, you know you need to fix something. If the sauce needs salt, you add it!\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.800\nSo, tests are just simple ways to check things and make sure they're working properly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
