    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_034247.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:19.900\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we're usually talking about a way to check something.\nIt's like an experiment or a procedure we use to see if something is working properly, or to find out more about it.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:30.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a fever.\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:34.300\nSee? We're checking something to get information.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:42.700\nAnother example is a math test at school.\nIt's a way for your teacher to check how well you understand the math concepts.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:47.900\nTests aren't always scary!\nThey're just a way to learn and improve.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:56.400\nSo, to sum it up, a test is a process or procedure designed to evaluate something and give us information.\nIt can be about anything!\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:02.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
