    "subtitles": "[WebVTT]\n```\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:22.600\nIt's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is. Think about it: a cooking test might be trying a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:32.700\nA spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:43.100\nTests can be simple or complex, but they all have the same basic idea: to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:51.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
