    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nOkay, so you're curious about tests! That's great.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:12.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:21.200\nThink of it like an investigation. You're trying to get information.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:32.900\nIt could be a test to see how well you understand a topic, like the one you might take in school. Or, it could be a test to check if something is working properly, like a car engine.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:41.000\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, you might test the water in your pool to see if it's safe to swim in.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:56.000\nSee how different tests can be? So, remember, a test is all about gathering information and finding out something specific. Whether it's checking your knowledge or checking the condition of something else, tests help us learn and understand.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
