    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.100\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:25.000\nIt's like a little experiment to see if something works, or if something is true. Think about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might take a little bite to test if it tastes good.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.300\nOr, when you get a new toy, you test it out to see how it works. In school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:43.500\nAnd doctors use tests to check if you're healthy. Basically, a test is just a way to find out information.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:55.100\nSo, whether it's tasting a cake, playing with a toy, or taking a quiz, we use tests all the time to learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
