    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_035026.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests.\nWhat are they and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:18.700\nBasically, a test is just a way to check something.\nIt could be checking if you understand a lesson, or if a machine is working correctly, or even if a new medicine is safe.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: If you\u2019re baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:35.600\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, a test would be trying to ride without training wheels to see if you can balance.\nTests give us information.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:45.200\nThey tell us if something is working, if something is correct, or if something needs improvement.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:55.000\nSo, in short, a test is a way to find out if something is as it should be!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "125bf224-58bf-413e-b3f8-ffa3cd438d51": {
    "id": "125bf224-58bf-413e-b3f8-ffa3cd438d51",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T16:19:02.372331",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T03:51:11.731946",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_035111.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_035111.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something, like how good you are at something, or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz. That's a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:30.100\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:37.100\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Some are long and complicated, like a big exam.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:47.100\nOthers are quick and easy, like checking if a light bulb turns on. But the main idea is always the same: to get information!\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:53.900\nSo, a test helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "c9dd7af5-8bb2-4fe4-8003-8bfb004cbdbb": {
    "id": "c9dd7af5-8bb2-4fe4-8003-8bfb004cbdbb",
