    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_035153.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or how much of something we have.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:36.300\nA taste test lets you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:51.500\nAnd when you visit the doctor, they might run tests to see how healthy you are. So, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:51.500 --> 01:00.900\nThey give us valuable data that we can use to make decisions, improve things, or just learn more.\n\n01:00.900 --> 01:04.500\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying out a new recipe.\n\n01:04.500 --> 01:08.100\nBasically, a test is a question or a procedure designed to reveal an answer.\n\n01:08.100 --> 01:11.000\nAnd that's the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n01:11.000 --> 01:14.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
