    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.300\nNot the kind you cram for, but tests in the general sense. A test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:23.400\nIt's like an investigation, a way to gather information.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.000\nThink about it: a taste test tells you if you like a food.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:41.900\nA health test tells you if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:52.100\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a mini-test \u2013 does the light come on, or not?\n\n00:52.100 --> 01:01.100\nSo, a test involves doing something, observing the result, and then using that result to draw a conclusion.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:05.500\nYou do the action \u2013 like tasting the food \u2013 you see the result \u2013 you like it or you don't \u2013 and then you know whether you like that food!\n\n01:05.500 --> 01:10.900\nIn short, tests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n01:10.900 --> 01:17.300\nThey're everywhere, helping us understand the world around us.\n\n01:17.300 --> 01:20.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
