    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like checking your understanding of something. It could be a written exam, a practical demonstration, or even just answering questions out loud.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.500\nThe main idea is to measure your skills or knowledge. For example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:47.100\nA driving test checks if you can safely operate a car. And even a simple quiz after reading a chapter in a book is a test of your comprehension.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:55.300\nSo, remember, a test helps you and others understand what you've learned. It's a way to see where you're strong and where you might need to learn a bit more. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
