    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:30.300\nThe main idea behind a test is to see how well something performs or behaves under certain conditions.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:38.900\nWe do this to learn more about it. For example, a simple taste test tells you if you like a certain flavor.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:47.100\nOr, a spelling test shows you how well you know your words. Even checking if a light bulb works is a type of test!\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:53.800\nYou\u2019re testing to see if it turns on. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. They're all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
