    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.800 --> 00:06.100\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:8.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:13.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:17.800\nFor example, when you flick a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:22.100\nOr, if you taste a new food, you're testing whether you like the flavor.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:28.000\nThe test is the action \u2013 flicking the switch or tasting the food \u2013 and the result tells you something, like if the bulb is good or if you enjoy the taste.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:34.800\nAnother example is a spelling test in school. The test is writing down the words, and it shows how well you know how to spell them.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:40.600\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:44.700\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:49.700\nIn short, tests are a fundamental part of learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:52.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
