    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you information.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:26.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:33.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:47.100\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information. It helps us understand something better, whether it's your health, your knowledge, or even how well a cake recipe works.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:54.800\nRemember, tests are all about learning and discovering! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
