    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_040329.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something specific. Think of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:23.900\nTests can be used for all sorts of things! For example, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:34.600\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing to see if the recipe works!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:45.600\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a medical check-up, or even trying a new recipe, a test helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:55.400\nIt's a way of checking something out and getting some results. Basically, a test helps us to confirm or deny what we believe to be true.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
