    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there, welcome! Today, we\u2019re diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us gather information to see if something is working, or to check our knowledge.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, when you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:35.600\nThat's a test too! Even clicking a button on a website to see if it takes you to the right page is a type of test.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:43.600\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz in school, to checking if your car's engine is running smoothly.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:54.300\nIt's all about getting information and confirming something. Basically, a test is just a process we use to learn more and be sure about something.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
