    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.600\nWhat is a test, really?\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:11.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:16.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like checking if your food is too hot before you eat it \u2013 that's a little test!\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:27.000\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:31.500\nMaybe it's a math test to see if you know your addition, or a spelling test to check your vocabulary.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:35.000\nHere's another example:\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:39.000\na doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:42.000\nDifferent tests give us different information.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:47.000\nSo, a test is just a tool to help us learn or check something.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:48.000\nRemember that!\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:52.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
