    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:20.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:33.300\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:43.900\nTests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. A doctor might run tests to understand what\u2019s making you feel unwell.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:55.400\nA developer might run tests to make sure their software is working before it is released. The goal is always to gather information or confirm something is true.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:03.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something or learn more about it.\n\n01:03.600 --> 01:07.200\nWhether it\u2019s your knowledge, a product, or even your health, tests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
