    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.000\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:34.600\nA cooking test might see how well you can follow a recipe. Even a taste test, like trying different flavors of ice cream, is a type of test!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:46.100\nSo, whether it's a written exam in school, a hands-on demonstration, or even just trying something out to see if it works, that\u2019s a test.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:53.600\nTests help us understand what we know and what we still need to learn. They give us valuable information.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:02.600\nIn short, a test is a method used to evaluate or measure something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
