    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if we understand something, or even just to see what happens.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like this: you might \"test\" if a lightbulb works by screwing it in.\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to \"test\" your knowledge.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe!\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:32.300\nSo, let's say you want to test if a toy car rolls down a ramp faster with different wheels.\nYou try it with small wheels, then big wheels, and see which one goes faster.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:39.700\nThat's a test!\nTests help us learn and improve things.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:47.100\nBasically, a test is any process designed to gather information.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:52.900\nIt's all about checking things out!\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
