    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_041101.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:13.000\nThink of a test as simply a way to check if something works, or if you understand something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:18.000\nIt's like a little experiment to see if you get the right answer, or if a tool does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:24.000\nFor example, a simple math test makes sure you know your numbers.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:31.000\nOr, think about testing a new toy car to see if it goes fast enough. You\u2019re checking if it meets your expectations.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:39.000\nTests help us learn and improve things all the time. So, basically, a test is a process of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or works correctly.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:55.000\nIt's how we learn, how we improve, and how we make sure things are doing what they're supposed to be doing.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
