    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.210 --> 00:02.170\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.170 --> 00:04.490\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:04.640 --> 00:06.650\nA test, at its core, is simply a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:06.980 --> 00:11.300\nThink of it like this: you test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it to see if it's done.\n\n00:11.640 --> 00:14.210\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time.\n\n00:14.470 --> 00:17.570\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you sick.\n\n00:17.990 --> 00:21.200\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:21.480 --> 00:25.160\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:25.480 --> 00:29.230\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and make better decisions.\n\n00:29.570 --> 00:35.100\nThey can be big or small, formal or informal, but the basic idea is always the same: to gather information and see how something performs.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:36.900\nThat's the lowdown on tests!\n\n00:37.240 --> 00:40.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
