    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt\u2019s a process or a procedure designed to see if something is true, accurate, or effective.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\nA chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:42.700\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to test what you've learned.\nTests can be formal, like a standardized exam, or informal, like quickly checking if your phone charger is working by plugging it into another device.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:53.300\nThe main thing is, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:02.400\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
