    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_042057.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.400\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a method we use to gather information about a person, object, or even an idea.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:35.400\nTests can be anything from a simple yes or no question, to a multiple-choice quiz, to a complicated experiment.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:46.200\nFor example, you might test a cake recipe by baking it and seeing how it tastes. Or you might test a new lightbulb to see how long it lasts.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:58.600\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better and make decisions based on the results. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:02.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
