    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, that help us understand more.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.700\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nOr, a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:39.100\nEven your doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature, to see if you're healthy.\nSo, a test helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:50.200\nIt helps us get information!\nTo recap, a test is a way to learn about something, using questions or observations to understand it better.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:53.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
