    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: you test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:29.600\nIn the world around us, tests are everywhere.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:37.100\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Schools use tests to see what you've learned. Even engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:47.700\nSo, a test helps us confirm something. We give an input, and based on the output, we can decide if the test passed or failed. Easy peasy, right?\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:56.200\nTo sum it up, a test is just a check to make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:03.700\nI hope this gave you a clearer idea of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
