    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_042916.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us learn more about ourselves, other people, or even things.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: you might taste a new fruit to test if you like it. That's a test!\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:31.500\nOr, your doctor might run some tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.900\nMaybe you take a quiz at school to test what you've learned in class.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:48.600\nThese are all different kinds of tests. They all give us information. So, a test is just a process, big or small, to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:52.200\nRemember, it's all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "2bba719e-7a61-4ac9-8b26-66349a88f11d": {
    "id": "2bba719e-7a61-4ac9-8b26-66349a88f11d",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T16:19:26.694766",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T04:30:00.407950",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_043000.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_043000.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.220 --> 00:05.340\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.340 --> 00:19.430\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out information about something. It helps us understand if something works, if something is true, or even how good something is.\n\n00:19.430 --> 00:27.550\nThink of it like this: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. That's a test!\n\n00:27.550 --> 00:36.390\nOr, if you\u2019re trying to fix a toy, you might try different things until it works. Each try is a little test.\n\n00:36.390 --> 00:44.750\nScientists use tests all the time, too. They might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:44.750 --> 00:54.380\nOr, they might test a new toy to see if it's safe for kids. So, a test is just a way of learning by doing and observing.\n\n00:54.380 --> 01:02.200\nIt helps us figure things out. Tests are used in lots of different ways to learn and improve the world around us.\n\n01:02.200 --> 01:05.690\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
