    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_043604.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.000\nWhat is a test anyway? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.800\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate a certain skill, knowledge, or ability. Think of it like this: a baking test tells you if your cake is ready.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:35.700\nYou stick a toothpick in, and if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, a spelling test in school checks how well you remember your words.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:47.800\nYou write down the words, and your teacher checks if they're spelled correctly. Tests come in all shapes and sizes, from quizzes to exams to even experiments.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:57.300\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and improve. They show us what we know, and where we might need a little more practice.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:05.200\nSo remember, a test is just a tool to help you grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
