    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.000\nA test is really just a way to find out how much you know about something. \nThink of it like checking your understanding.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:22.200\nIt's not about being perfect, but about seeing what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:32.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. \nA math test shows how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:41.500\nSo, tests help you, and your teachers, understand what you're doing well and what you might need some extra help with.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:49.400\nThey're like a learning tool, not something to be scared of! \nRemember, it\u2019s all about learning and growing.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:53.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
