    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_043809.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something. Think of it like checking your understanding.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.200\nTests can come in many forms. Maybe it\u2019s a quiz at school, or a driving test to get your license.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:35.700\nIt could even be testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good! For example, in a math test, you might have to solve problems to show you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:50.600\nOr, in a science test, you might identify different parts of a plant. So, remember, a test is just a tool to help you see what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:56.600\nIt's all about learning and growing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
