    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.200\nIt helps us understand if something is true, or working correctly. Think of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:33.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or maybe you test your knowledge by taking a quiz at school.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:39.400\nTests can be used for lots of things. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:46.800\nEngineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe. And even you use tests every day to figure things out!\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:56.100\nSo, a test is just a process to gather information and make a decision. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
