    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_044027.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:31.800\nThe main idea behind a test is to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:45.500\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a taste test tells you if you like a certain food. A spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words. And a medical test helps doctors figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:51.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a process, or a set of questions, designed to get information.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.000\nThey help us learn and understand. Think of them as helpful tools for discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
