    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\nYou can test it by sticking a toothpick in \u2013 if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:31.800\nOr, imagine you're checking if your bike tires have enough air.\nYou can squeeze them.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:44.100\nIf they feel firm, they pass the test!\nTests help us understand things better, from the ingredients in a recipe to how well you understand a new concept.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:55.500\nThey're all about getting information in a clear and reliable way.\nSo, remember, a test is just a structured way of asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
