    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_044425.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.990\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.990 --> 00:11.610\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.610 --> 00:23.810\nIt's a process designed to give us information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:23.810 --> 00:32.700\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you can spell.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:41.900\nA taste test tells you which flavor you like best. Or, a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:51.200\nSo, tests can be used for lots of different things! They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:55.000\nThey are really just a way of gathering information in a structured way.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.190\nIn short, a test is a method to measure something and learn from the results.\n\n00:58.190 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
