    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let\u2019s talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:18.400\nIt could be checking if you understand a topic, like in a school exam.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:27.500\nOr it could be checking if something is working correctly, like a car engine.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:31.900\nBasically, a test gives you information.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:42.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\nA baker tastes their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:49.200\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and make sure everything is working the way it should.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:51.600\nThey are a valuable tool in many different areas.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:53.900\nRemember, a test is just a way to check something and get useful information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
