    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_044955.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.200\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with questions and answers. The main idea behind a test is to measure your knowledge or skills in a specific area.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:38.600\nIt helps you, and sometimes others, understand what you know well and what you might need to learn more about.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:55.900\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you can spell words. A math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations. And even tasting a new food is a kind of test, helping you decide if you like it or not!\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:02.700\nSo, a test is simply a method of evaluating something, whether it's your knowledge, your abilities, or even just your opinion. It's a tool to help us understand and learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
