    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_045038.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey there, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're going to talk about something super important:\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:05.000\ntests!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:07.000\nWhat is a test, anyway?\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.000\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:12.000\nIt's like an experiment, but usually with a specific question in mind.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:15.000\nThink about it: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:19.000\nA chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:22.000\nOr maybe you take a quiz in school to test what you've learned.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.000\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's about our health, the taste of food, or even how much we know.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:29.000\nThey give us information we can use.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:32.000\nRemember, a test is just a way to learn something new!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:34.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
