    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are done baking \u2013 you use a toothpick! That's a test!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:28.300\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. Falling down a few times? That's a test!\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:34.000\nYou're testing your balance and learning what works and what doesn't. In school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:42.300\nThey're just a way to check your understanding of a topic. So, remember, tests are just tools to learn and improve.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:51.900\nThey help us understand how things work and where we can get better.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
