    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.210 --> 00:04.810\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.810 --> 00:06.010\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:06.410 --> 00:07.910\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.910 --> 00:12.210\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.210 --> 00:15.510\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer\n\n00:15.510 --> 00:18.710\nthat helps us understand things better.\n\n00:19.010 --> 00:22.610\nThink about it like this: you might test the temperature of water\n\n00:22.610 --> 00:24.910\nto see if it's hot enough for tea.\n\n00:25.310 --> 00:28.810\nOr, you might test a cake to see if it's baked all the way through.\n\n00:29.210 --> 00:31.810\nIn school, tests help your teachers\n\n00:31.810 --> 00:33.210\nsee what you've learned.\n\n00:33.510 --> 00:35.510\nSo, testing isn't just about exams.\n\n00:35.810 --> 00:38.310\nIt's about exploring and learning!\n\n00:38.610 --> 00:44.010\nWhether it\u2019s checking if your bike tires have enough air, or seeing if a new recipe tastes good,\n\n00:44.010 --> 00:45.610\nyou're running a test.\n\n00:45.910 --> 00:49.810\nTests help us make decisions and learn new things all the time.\n\n00:50.210 --> 00:55.910\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
