    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:29.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:46.300\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see what you've learned. And even trying out a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:56.900\nSo, whether it's a math exam, a science experiment, or even just trying a new flavor of ice cream, a test helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:07.500\nThey help us prove something is true or false, or even just to see what happens! In short, a test is a way to gather information.\n\n01:07.500 --> 01:14.300\nIt's a question asked and an answer received. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
