    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:30.000\nThink of it like checking your knowledge or the quality of something. For example, you might take a test in school to see how much you learned about a certain topic.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:39.500\nOr, a company might test a new product to make sure it's safe and effective before they sell it.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:53.200\nTests can be written, like a quiz, or they can be practical, like trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good. So, basically, a test is just a way to find out information.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:59.400\nIn short, tests help us measure knowledge, evaluate performance, and ensure quality. It's all about learning and improving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
