    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a method used to evaluate knowledge, skill, or performance.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:32.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:46.900\nA driving test evaluates your skill behind the wheel.\nOr, a product test checks if something works as it should.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:56.900\nSo, tests come in many forms.\nThey help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.600\nIn summary, a test is an evaluation method to discover information.\n```"
