    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:18.700\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like a game where you answer questions to show what you've learned.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:39.500\nIt could be a quiz in school, a driving test to get your license, or even a taste test to see which snack you like best.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:44.200\nThe main idea is to see if you understand the information or can perform a task.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:51.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test checks if you can solve problems.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:54.000\nAnd that taste test? It checks your preference!\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:01.200\nSo, remember, a test is a tool to measure your knowledge or ability. It helps you and others understand what you've learned and where you might need some extra help. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
