    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_050221.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHey there! Ever wonder how you really know something? That's where tests come in.\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:10.400\nA test is basically a way to check if something is true or correct.\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:18.200\nThink of it like this: you study for a spelling test, then the test shows how well you learned the words.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:23.200\nTests aren't just in school, though. Imagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:32.000\nYou taste it to test if it needs more sugar. Or, when you try on a new shirt, you're testing to see if it fits.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:43.000\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz at school to simply trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:51.400\nThey help us learn and make sure things are as they should be. Basically, tests help us confirm our knowledge or the quality of something.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.000\nThat's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
