    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in this case, a test is simply a way of checking if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like this: you buy a new lightbulb. Before you screw it into the lamp, you want to test it, right?\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:29.500\nYou might quickly touch it to a battery to see if it lights up. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:35.700\nOr imagine baking a cake. You can test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:41.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready. That's another test!\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:52.200\nBasically, a test is a simple way to know if something is correct or working as expected. It's all about making sure things are doing what they\u2019re supposed to do.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:59.300\nSo, remember, testing is checking! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
