    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:26.000\nIt helps us understand where we're at, or how good something is. Think about it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.700\nOr, imagine a chef tasting a soup to see if it needs more salt. Those are both tests!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:37.400\nTests can come in many forms.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:47.800\nThey can be written, like a quiz. They can be practical, like baking a cake. Or they can even be observational, like watching how someone reacts in a certain situation.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:57.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us improve and understand the world around us a little better.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
