    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_051107.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, maybe in school.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.300\nBut what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.600\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance in a specific area.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:41.900\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:49.100\nOr, if you want to know if you can lift a heavy box, you try to lift it. That's also a test!\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:56.400\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in class, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:05.900\nThe important thing is that they give you information to help you understand something better. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:09.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
