    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working as it should, or to see how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.400\nTests can be anything from a simple yes or no question, to a multiple-choice exam, or even a physical activity.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:41.500\nFor example, a taste test can tell you which flavor you prefer. A product test checks if a new gadget works correctly.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:54.300\nAnd, of course, school tests help your teachers understand what you're learning. So, to recap, a test is a method to evaluate something and get information.\n\n00:54.300 --> 01:04.500\nIt helps us understand performance, knowledge, or functionality. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
