    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.800\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like asking a question to see what the answer is. In the world of learning, tests help us see how much we've understood.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:33.400\nIt's like checking if you remember the ingredients in your favorite sandwich recipe.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:39.800\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a test.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:46.200\nSo is trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good! Or even checking if your phone charger works by plugging it in.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:57.800\nAll are kinds of tests. Basically, a test is any process designed to gather information. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:02.500\nSo, the next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
