    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:21.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process, usually with questions or tasks, that helps us measure knowledge, skill, or ability.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:32.800\nThink of it like this: Your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:42.000\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:50.000\nTests can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like seeing if a toy car fits through a doorway.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:58.300\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us learn, improve, and make decisions. So, a test is just a structured way of gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
