    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.400\nThink of a test as just a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:26.500\nIt\u2019s like a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:35.000\nIn everyday life, we test things all the time.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:47.000\nIf you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's cooked all the way through. Or, before buying a new phone, you might test out the camera and screen.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:53.400\nThese are all simple tests! Tests help us catch mistakes early, so we can fix them before they become bigger problems. So remember, a test is just a way to check if something is working as expected. That's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
