    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey there, welcome! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:18.800\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way of finding something out. It's a procedure to check the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: If you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:31.600\nYou're testing to see if the cake is done. Or, imagine you get a new toy.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:39.100\nYou play with it to test if it works like it's supposed to. Tests aren't just for cakes and toys, though.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:51.500\nScientists use tests to prove theories, doctors use tests to diagnose illnesses, and even you use tests to see how well you understand what you're learning in school.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:59.800\nSo, a test is simply a structured way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:06.200\nIt's all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
