    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:14.400\nAt its core, a test is simply a way to gather information and see how well someone or something performs.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might do a \"toothpick test.\" You stick a toothpick in, and if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:34.600\nTests can be quizzes in school, or even checking if a lightbulb works. Does it turn on? That's a test!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:43.900\nIt helps us understand what's working, what needs improvement, and if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:52.100\nSo, a test is an evaluation, a way to check something. It helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
