    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_052733.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nHi everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:13.800\nToday, we\u2019re going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:25.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even how well something works.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:36.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\nOr, a taste test helps us decide which ice cream flavor is the yummiest.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:47.500\nA doctor might run tests to see if you\u2019re healthy.\nSo, in essence, a test helps us gather information to make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:50.900\nIt's a tool for learning and improvement.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:54.500\nWe test things all the time in everyday life, even without realizing it!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
