    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to get information or measure a skill, knowledge, or performance.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:34.800\nA medical test helps doctors understand what's happening in your body.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:48.400\nAnd a taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best!\nSo, a test isn't just about getting a grade. It's about learning and understanding where you are now.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:52.000\nTo recap, a test is a process used to gather information or evaluate something, from your spelling ability to your favorite ice cream. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
