    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_053116.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's like an experiment or a check-up to see how well something works, or to see if something is true.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:36.600\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:45.700\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:45.700 --> 01:02.300\nFor example, a simple spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly. A taste test can tell you which flavor of ice cream you like best. Even trying to open a door is a mini-test to see if it's unlocked!\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:05.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and learning something new.\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:12.200\nWhether it's about cooking, your health, or your understanding of a subject, tests help us understand the world around us better.\n\n01:12.200 --> 01:15.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
