    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:25.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:32.000\nBasically, a test checks if something is true or false, right or wrong, or even just to see how well something works.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:38.400\nThink about it: You might taste a new sauce to test if you like it.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:47.300\nThat's a test! Or, imagine you\u2019re building a tower of blocks. You keep adding blocks to test how high you can go before it falls over.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:52.900\nSee? So, a test is just a way of checking something, learning something new, and making sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.200\nTesting helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
