    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_054102.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us check if something is working, if we understand something, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: A doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:32.300\nA teacher gives you a test to see if you learned the lesson.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:41.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:51.300\nSo, a test is really just a way to get information and learn something new. We use them every day in all sorts of ways. Tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
