    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_054653.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:34.200\nTests aren't just in school, though. A doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:51.200\nAnd engineers test new designs to make sure they're safe and strong. So, to recap, a test is a method for gathering information, whether it's about your skills, your preferences, or even the strength of a bridge!\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:57.700\nIt helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
