    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_054851.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: the concept of a test.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:18.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process to check knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:31.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school checks how well you know your words. Or, a taste test for new ice cream flavors helps decide which one is the most delicious.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:48.200\nEven a doctor uses tests, like blood tests, to understand what's going on inside your body. So, tests can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like asking a friend a quick question.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:59.400\nThey all serve the same purpose: to gather information and learn something new. They help us understand where we are, and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:09.900\nIn short, a test is a way to get information, whether it's about your math skills, the best kind of cookie, or your overall health.\n\n01:09.900 --> 01:15.500\nIt's all about finding out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
