    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_055646.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:24.900\nWhether it's a multiple-choice quiz in school or checking if your cookies are baked properly by poking them with a toothpick, you're performing a test.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:34.900\nThe quiz tests your knowledge, the toothpick tests the cookie's doneness. For example, a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.800\nThey might check your temperature \u2013 that's a test! Or a chef tastes their soup to see if it needs more salt \u2013 another test!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:56.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information or checking something. It helps us understand what we're looking at, and make better decisions.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
