    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_055730.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: the test.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:12.600\nWhat is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it as a question you're trying to answer. For example, you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:32.700\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Tests can be written, spoken, or even practical, like a driving test!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:47.800\nThe main goal of a test is to gather information and get a result. That result helps us understand something better, whether it's your spelling skills, your overall health, or your ability to drive safely.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:57.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
