    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see if something is working correctly, or to check if something is true.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes the soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:33.100\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. A scientist might run an experiment to test a new theory.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:42.200\nYour doctor might order blood tests to check your health. Even pressing the power button on your TV is a quick test to see if it turns on!\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:49.200\nSo, a test is really just a way of gathering information and making sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:56.300\nIt helps us learn, improve, and solve problems. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
