    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super fundamental:\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.500\nwhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to measure something.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:12.000\nThink of it like using a ruler to see how long a table is. We use tests to find out information about all sorts of things.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:18.000\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words. A taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best!\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:24.000\nAnd scientists use tests to see if new medicines actually work. So, a test is just a method or a procedure to gather information and evaluate something.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:29.000\nIt helps us learn and make decisions. That's the basic idea of a test.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:32.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
