    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:16.000\nA test, simply put, is a way to find out something.\nIt's like an experiment or a check to see if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.700\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:31.500\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.200\nEven baking a cake is kind of like a test!\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:43.000\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:51.700\nSo, tests help us understand things better.\nThey give us information.\nWe use them all the time, in lots of different ways, to learn and to improve.\nRemember, a test is just a way to find something out.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
