    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:13.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:17.600\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an answer, you're getting evidence.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:25.000\nTests help us understand how well we know something, like in a school exam.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.600\nThey can also help us figure out if something is working correctly, like testing a new toy to see if it's safe.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:38.200\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:45.900\nOr, a doctor might run tests to figure out why you're not feeling well.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:47.000\nSee?\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:47.800\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:52.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:54.900\nThey help us measure, understand, and improve.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
