    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_060247.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:23.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something. It could be anything from your knowledge of a subject to how well a new medicine works.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:32.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test measures how well you know your spelling words. A doctor might use a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:42.000\nOr a scientist might test a new fertilizer to see if it helps plants grow bigger. So, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:50.500\nThey give us information that we can use to make decisions or learn more. They're a vital tool in all sorts of fields.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:53.200\nIn short, tests help measure, understand, and improve.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:54.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
