    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_060327.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.500\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:27.100\nIt helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a topic.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:30.900\nThink about it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:39.400\nOr, your teacher might give you a test to see if you've learned the material.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:47.000\nAnother example?\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:50.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.200\nSo, tests are just ways to check things, from your health to your knowledge, even your cake!\nThey give us information and help us make decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
