    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an answer, you're gathering information to see if something is true or working correctly.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:25.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:33.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\nYou're testing if the recipe works and if you can follow the instructions.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:45.800\nSo, in short, a test is just a method for checking something.\nIt helps us learn, diagnose problems, and make sure things are going according to plan.\nPretty simple, right?\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
