    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_060503.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.800\nWhat are they and why do we use them?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.400\nIt could be about your knowledge, your skills, or even just to see how something works.\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr, a taste test can tell you which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:35.100\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas about the world are right.\nThey might test a new medicine to see if it actually helps people get better.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:48.400\nTests can be simple, like asking someone their favorite color, or complicated, like a big exam.\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:58.900\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:02.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
