    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.000\nIt\u2019s a process designed to gather information.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like this: you might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:33.000\nThe toothpick comes out clean? That\u2019s your test result \u2013 the cake is ready!\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:38.600\nTests aren't just for baking, though. A spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:51.100\nA medical test can check your health. Even trying a new restaurant is a kind of test, seeing if you like the food.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.400\nWhether it's about cakes, spelling, or anything else, tests help us understand the world around us a little better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
