    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_060627.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to gather information about an object or even a person.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:35.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:48.000\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. Even a doctor's visit involves tests to check your health!\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:57.700\nSo, whether it's figuring out how well you know something, what you prefer, or even how healthy you are, tests are a common and important way to learn and gather information.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.300\nTo recap, a test is a process to gather information.\n01:01.300 --> 01:04.900\nThey come in many forms and help us learn about all sorts of things.\n01:04.900 --> 01:08.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
