    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_060711.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.600\nHey there, welcome!\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:21.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure, like an experiment or an exam, designed to reveal information about a person, object, or process.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:31.100\nThink of it like this: a simple taste test to see if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\nOr, a doctor running blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:45.800\nEven when you try to turn on a light switch, you're testing if the bulb works!\nSo, a test is really just a method used to gather data and make an informed decision or understand something better.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:51.600\nIt helps us learn and improve.\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
