    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:29.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:37.500\nA doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:44.400\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see if you understand the lesson.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:51.000\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test! You're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:57.000\nFor example, imagine you're trying to figure out if a plant needs more water.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:01.600\nYou might test it by poking your finger into the soil. If it's dry, you know it needs watering.\n```"
