    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_061006.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in this case, a test is simply a way to check if something works the way it should.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you test it by sticking a toothpick in. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That\u2019s a test.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:30.300\nOr imagine you\u2019re building with LEGOs.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:37.100\nYou put two pieces together and wiggle them to see if they\u2019re connected securely. That's another test.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:46.800\nBasically, a test is just a way of making sure things are doing what you expect them to do. It helps you find problems and fix them.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a check! It's a way to see if something is working right.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
