    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:27.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working the way it should, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:31.200\nThink of it like this: a simple test could be checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:37.300\nYou screw it in, flip the switch, and see if it lights up. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:43.400\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:55.900\nTests are used everywhere. Doctors use tests to check your health, teachers use tests to see how well you understand a subject, and even video games use tests to make sure everything is running smoothly.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.900\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and making sure things are as they should be. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
