    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:07.100\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:14.900\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:21.800\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or even just to see what someone knows.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a new lightbulb to see if it turns on. That's a test!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:37.800\nOr maybe you give your dog a command like \"sit\" to see if he's learned it. That's a test too!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:48.400\nTests can be simple, like checking the temperature outside, or more complex, like taking a quiz in school. But at their core, they all involve asking a question and then finding an answer.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:53.800\nSo, a test helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:56.300\nBasically, a test is just a way to get information!\n```"
  },
