    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, if you're learning a new language, a test helps you see how much you've learned.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:35.200\nTests aren't just for school or the doctor's office, though. Your phone has tests built in to make sure all the parts are working correctly.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:45.900\nAnd even baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:56.600\nSo, a test is just a way of finding out information. It could be about your knowledge, your health, or even whether a cake is ready to eat.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.200\nThe main idea is to check something and learn from the results. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
