    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:14.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something, or someone.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:31.800\nThe whole point is to get information. We use tests all the time! For example, a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:44.200\nOr, when you check the weather, that's kind of like a test to see if it will rain. Even a doctor checking your temperature is a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:52.000\nSo, tests help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us better. Remember, a test is just a way to gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
