    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:17.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about a person or thing. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:27.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:42.300\nA taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes better. Or, if your doctor taps your knee with a little hammer, that's a test to check your reflexes!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:52.500\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to complicated experiments. They help us learn, evaluate, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:58.800\nIn short, a test is just a way to gather information. And that's what makes them so useful! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
