    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_061927.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re diving into something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:18.600\nNow, a test isn't just about grades. Think of it as a way to see what you already know about a topic, and what you might need to learn more about.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:31.500\nBasically, a test is a set of questions designed to measure your knowledge or skills. These questions can be multiple choice, true or false, or even short answer.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:45.500\nFor example, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask, \"Does a dog bark?\" or \"What does a cat eat?\" Your answers show how well you understand different animals.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:54.400\nSo remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn. It shows you what you\u2019ve mastered and where you can focus your efforts.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:03.300\nLearning is a journey, and tests are just milestones along the way! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
