    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cookie is good, so you taste it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:32.400\nTests can be more formal, too. Like a spelling test at school, which tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:38.600\nOr a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:48.600\nSee, tests help us understand things better. They give us information.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:55.800\nSo, whether it\u2019s tasting a cookie, taking a quiz, or getting a check-up, tests help us learn and make decisions. They give us information to help us find things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
