    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:16.200\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:36.600\nThe main idea behind a test is to find out information. You're trying to learn something, confirm something, or identify a problem.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:46.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test checks if you like a certain food.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:53.900\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a test to see if the lightbulb works!\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way of checking something to get information.\n```"
