    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.700\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well we know our words. A taste test lets us decide if we like a new flavor.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:45.900\nEven checking if the light switch works is a mini-test \u2013 does it turn on the light? Yes or no?\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:50.200\nSo, a test helps us understand something better, whether it's our knowledge, our preferences, or just how things work.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:53.800\nThey give us information. That's the basics of a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
