    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_062656.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the concept of a test.\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:22.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even how well a new medicine works.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:31.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A taste test helps decide which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:43.800\nAnd scientists use tests to see if their ideas about the world are actually true. So, tests are all about gathering information and making decisions based on that information.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:56.800\nThey help us learn, improve, and understand things better. They're a super important part of everyday life, from school to science to just figuring out what snack to choose!\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
