    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_062737.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:28.900\nIn science, tests are used to see if an idea is correct. Let's say you think plants grow taller in sunlight.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:36.200\nYou could test that by putting one plant in the sun and another in the shade and watching what happens.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:42.600\nOr, maybe you get a new toy and want to see if it works. You try it out, right? That's a test!\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:53.600\nSo, tests are all about finding things out, whether it's baking a cake, growing a plant, or playing with a toy.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:01.000\nThey help us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
