    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_062839.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.400\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:22.300\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:31.900\nThink of it like this: Your doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:40.200\nA teacher uses a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:47.700\nAnd even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like the taste!\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:55.200\nSo, a test can be anything that gives us information.\n\n00:55.200 --> 01:02.700\nMaybe you take a multiple-choice quiz, or maybe you try to bake a cake.\n\n01:02.700 --> 01:10.300\nBoth give you results that tell you something.\n\n01:10.300 --> 01:16.900\nThe quiz tells you how well you remember the material, and the cake tells you how well you followed the recipe.\n\n01:16.900 --> 01:24.500\nBasically, a test is just a question, or a set of questions, designed to get an answer.\n\n01:24.500 --> 01:28.800\nAnd that answer helps us understand something better.\n\n01:28.800 --> 01:32.300\nThat's it! Tests help us learn and discover.\n\n01:32.300 --> 01:35.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
