    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_062927.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:19.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.300\nOr, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:47.100\nFor example, a baking test could be poking a cake with a toothpick to see if it comes out clean. That tells you if the cake is done!\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:55.800\nOr, you might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with. So, a test is just a process to evaluate or examine something. It helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
