    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.300\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we understand something. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:34.600\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Testing is all about confirming or verifying something.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:39.400\nAnother example? A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:47.100\nOr, when you play a video game, you're constantly testing your skills to see if you can beat the level.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:57.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something or check if something is right. It helps us understand the world around us!\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
