    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE: The timings here are approximate and should be adjusted based on the actual audio.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:22.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about you or something else.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:35.400\nIt could be a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject, or a test to check if a cake is baked all the way through.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:43.400\nThink of it like this: your spelling test tells your teacher how well you know your words.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:53.800\nOr, poking a cake with a toothpick tells you if it\u2019s still gooey inside or ready to eat. Tests help us make decisions.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:59.000\nIf you do well on a math test, you know you're ready for the next lesson. If the toothpick comes out clean, you know the cake is perfect!\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:03.300\nSo, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:05.700\nWe use them all the time in different ways.\n\n01:05.700 --> 01:09.000\nI hope this clears things up!\n\n01:09.000 --> 01:12.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
