    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer. You perform the test, observe the results, and then you've got your answer!\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:30.800\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:39.500\nThat's a test! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done. Or, if you want to know if your friend likes chocolate, you might offer them some.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:48.100\nTheir reaction is the test result! So, tests are all about gathering information. They help us understand things better by giving us evidence.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:56.900\nRemember, a test is just a way to ask a question and get an answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
