    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:11.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:18.300\nIt's a process you use to gather information and see if something is true, correct, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:25.100\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:28.800\nOr, maybe you're baking a cake.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:31.600\nTasting the batter to see if it's sweet enough?\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:32.900\nAlso a test!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:37.300\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:42.700\nTests can be simple, like checking the weather before you go outside, or more complicated, like a medical exam.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:47.600\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:53.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something checks out.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
