    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_063729.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:16.000\nYou've probably taken a few in your life, but what exactly is a test?\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:34.700\nThink of it like this: imagine you're learning to ride a bike. A test might be seeing if you can ride around the block without falling.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:47.700\nOr, if you're learning to bake cookies, a test could be tasting them to see if they're sweet enough. Tests aren't just about getting a grade. They help you, and your teachers, understand what you've learned and what you still need to work on.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:51.400\nSo, a test is really just a tool to measure your understanding and help you grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
