    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:21.600\nTests can be used to check all sorts of things. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:32.000\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a test \u2013 you're testing if your recipe works!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:37.300\nImagine you're trying to figure out if a plant needs water. You touch the soil.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:43.100\nIf it's dry, that's a test telling you the plant probably needs watering. See?\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:50.300\nTests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:58.500\nThey help us understand things better and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
