    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:23.400\nIt helps us figure out if something is working the way it should, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:35.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it\u2019s sweet enough.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:46.900\nMaybe you try to turn on a light switch - that's a quick test to see if the lightbulb works! So, a test is just a way to get information, to confirm or deny something.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:53.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. They help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:56.900\nRemember, a test is simply a check. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
