    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE This subtitles file was autogenerated by an AI.  Please review and correct any errors.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.140\nHey there, welcome to this quick explanation\n00:02.140 --> 00:02.880\nof what a test is!\n00:03.290 --> 00:05.280\nSimply put, a test is a way to find\n00:05.280 --> 00:05.700\nout something.\n00:06.080 --> 00:09.070\nIt's a process or procedure designed to\n00:09.070 --> 00:13.180\nevaluate your knowledge, skill, or performance\n00:13.180 --> 00:14.080\nin a specific area.\n00:14.560 --> 00:17.720\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give\n00:17.720 --> 00:20.510\nyou a blood test to find out if you're\n00:20.510 --> 00:21.060\nhealthy.\n00:21.490 --> 00:24.830\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter\n00:24.830 --> 00:27.050\nto test if it has enough sugar.\n00:27.540 --> 00:31.800\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well\n00:31.800 --> 00:34.090\nyou understand the material they've been\n00:34.090 --> 00:34.500\nteaching.\n00:34.930 --> 00:38.310\nFor example, a spelling test checks your\n00:38.310 --> 00:41.210\nknowledge of spelling words.\n00:41.420 --> 00:44.800\nA math test checks your ability to solve\n00:44.800 --> 00:45.890\nmath problems.\n00:46.280 --> 00:50.080\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but\n00:50.080 --> 00:51.650\nthey all have the same goal:\n00:51.650 --> 00:53.000\nto measure something.\n00:53.330 --> 00:59.250\nSo, remember, a test is a tool used to\n00:59.250 --> 01:01.920\nevaluate something, whether it's your\n01:01.920 --> 01:04.570\nknowledge, your health, or even the taste\n01:04.570 --> 01:05.020\nof a cake.\n01:05.390 --> 01:06.180\nThis video was created\n01:06.180 --> 01:06.680\nby Apilage AI.\n```"
