    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.300\nNow, you might be thinking about school, but a \"test\" in general just means checking something to see if it works, or if it's true.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: you test a lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:34.200\nYou test a cake to see if it's cooked by poking it with a fork. You're checking something to confirm it's doing what it should.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.100\nSo, if you're building a toy car, you might test if the wheels roll.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:50.400\nIf you're planting a seed, you might test the soil to see if it has enough water. These are all simple tests!\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:54.000\nThey help us understand if something is right or needs fixing. In short, a test is simply checking something! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
