    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T06:46:27.566473",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_064627.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_064627.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:20.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it as a little experiment!\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:36.700\nWe use tests all the time. For example, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:47.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is like a test to see if you can balance.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:59.400\nYou try, you might fall, but you learn! So, a test helps us understand something better by giving us information.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:08.500\nIt can be about anything, from baking to biking, or even quizzes at school! It's all about learning and figuring things out.\n\n01:08.500 --> 01:17.600\nIn short, a test is an action performed to evaluate or assess something.\n\n01:17.600 --> 01:21.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "409352d0-8b1f-4be5-b81a-d6bfd8f0bcdb": {
    "id": "409352d0-8b1f-4be5-b81a-d6bfd8f0bcdb",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:35:19.712487",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T06:47:14.252224",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_064714.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_064714.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:21.400\nIt's a process, a set of questions, or even an experiment designed to measure or evaluate something specific.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:29.000\nThink about it like this: a math test helps your teacher understand how well you know addition and subtraction.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:36.900\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite! Tests aren't just for school, though.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:50.100\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and chefs use tests to see if their food tastes good.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:57.100\nSo, tests help us learn, measure, and understand things better. They give us information to make decisions.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:01.900\nRemember, a test is just a tool for discovery.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:02.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
