    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:28.800\nOr, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:35.300\nLet's say you want to know if a cake is done. You can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:40.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! That's a test!\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:50.900\nAnother example is checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:57.300\nIt's a simple process of asking a question and finding the answer. Thanks for watching!\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
