    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:26.800\nIt\u2019s a process designed to give us information about a person, an object, or even an idea. Think of it like this: if you want to know if your cake is done baking, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:33.600\nThat's a test! Or, if your doctor wants to see if you have a fever, they'll take your temperature.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:40.400\nThat's also a test! Tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:50.100\nThe important thing is that they give us useful information. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:54.200\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
