    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:27.000\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\nTests can be anything from trying out a new recipe to taking an exam at school.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:39.500\nThe main idea is to gather information and see if something is true or works the way we expect.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:49.600\nFor example, you might test if a toy car rolls faster on a smooth floor versus a carpet.\nOr, you could test if watering your plant more often makes it grow taller.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:57.700\nYou\u2019re experimenting and observing! So, a test is all about exploring, asking questions, and learning by doing.\nIt's a fundamental part of how we understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
