    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:18.200\nIt could be about anything! Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:22.200\nYou take a toothpick and poke it. That's a test!\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready. Or maybe you want to know if you've learned your alphabet.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:40.800\nYour teacher might give you a quiz, a test to see how well you know your letters. Tests help us understand what we already know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:50.400\nSo, tests are just tools for finding things out, whether it's about cake or about the alphabet! They help us learn and grow.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
