    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_065732.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.600\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check something or someone to see how well they perform or how much they know.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's baked all the way through by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:25.800\nThat toothpick is your test! Tests come in many forms.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:36.400\nThere are written tests like quizzes in school, where you answer questions. There are physical tests, like a doctor checking your reflexes. And there are even tests for machines, like making sure a car engine is working properly.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:48.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test can tell you if a new recipe is delicious.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:58.300\nSo, a test is simply a method to evaluate something. It helps us understand how things work and where we might need to improve.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:06.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
