    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.800\nThink of a test as a way to check something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.600\nIn the simplest terms, a test helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:32.300\nFor example, a doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:43.800\nEven playing a game involves tests \u2013 you\u2019re testing your skills! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something out and learn more about it.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:50.000\nIt\u2019s about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
