    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_070018.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.600\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:18.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us measure or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the strength of a material, or even the freshness of a food product.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:30.300\nThink of it like this: a quiz at school is a test to see how well you understand a subject. A doctor uses tests, like blood work, to check your health.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:44.200\nOr, if you're baking a cake, tasting the batter is a test to see if it needs more sugar! So, a test is just a procedure, a method, used to gather information.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:54.100\nIt gives us results that we can then analyze and understand. It's a fundamental tool in learning, science, and everyday life.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
