    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.700\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of school, but tests are really just a way to find out information.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:23.700\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.800\nThink of it like this: A chef might taste the soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:41.600\nOr, you might try on a new pair of shoes to test if they fit.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:50.900\nThese are all examples of using a test to learn something! So, a test is just a process of gathering information to help us make decisions or understand something better.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:55.900\nFrom baking to buying shoes, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:00.100\nIn short, tests are a simple way to check things and learn more. They help us understand the world around us, one question at a time. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
