    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.200\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in general, a test is just a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like this: you might test if a light bulb works by screwing it into a lamp.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.400\nOr you might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.500\nTests are important because they help us make sure things are safe, reliable, and do what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:48.900\nWhether it's a doctor testing your eyesight or an engineer testing a bridge, tests help us every day.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:56.800\nSo remember, a test is simply a way to check something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
