    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:23.600\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we understand something well.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:32.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:41.600\nOr, a teacher might give you a test after a lesson to see if you learned the material.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:51.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes! A simple test could be checking if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:55.800\nA more complex test could be answering questions on a big exam.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:01.600\nSo, to recap: a test is a tool for checking something, it can be simple or complex, and it helps us understand if things are working or if we've learned something. Tests help us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
