    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.400 --> 00:02.200\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:03.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:07.400\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:12.100\nIt's a method to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:16.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:20.700\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:23.400\nEven a simple battery test tells you how much power is left.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:28.600\nTests are used everywhere, from checking your understanding in school, to making sure products are safe and reliable.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:32.600\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:38.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and find things out.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:39.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
