    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, it's really just a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:19.500\nThink of it like this: You might test a cake to see if it's sweet enough, right? That's testing!\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:30.900\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just a few questions at the end of a lesson.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:40.500\nA scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people feel better. Or, you might test your toys to see if they still work.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:51.200\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and finding out if something works, if you understand something, or if something is good enough. They help us learn and improve!\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
