  "979c66ec-be2c-46bc-90c9-8acc1d55a266": {
    "id": "979c66ec-be2c-46bc-90c9-8acc1d55a266",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:35:33.430326",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T07:10:59.496892",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_071059.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_071059.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:14.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.700\nTests aren\u2019t just in classrooms or doctor's offices, though! A chef might test a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:38.100\nA mechanic might test a car battery to check if it's working properly.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:47.400\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, to sum it up, a test is a process used to gather information and make an evaluation.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.700\nThey help us understand things better and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
