    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_071224.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.900\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it: you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:30.000\nOr, maybe you try a new recipe to test if it's delicious. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:39.900\nTests can be anything from a quick quiz to a big science experiment. The important thing is that they help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:50.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of asking a question and finding the answer! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
