    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_071355.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:32.700\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:43.000\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:53.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the recipe works!\n\n00:53.000 --> 01:03.000\nSo, a test helps us gather information. It could be about your health, your knowledge, or even how well a recipe performs.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:09.000\nIt's all about finding out the answer to a specific question.\n\n01:09.000 --> 01:12.600\nTests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n01:12.600 --> 01:16.200\nIn short, a test is a method to get an answer.\n\n01:16.200 --> 01:19.100\nIt's about finding something out!\n\n01:19.100 --> 01:22.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
