    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.799\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.799 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.600\nIt\u2019s a process or procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:25.799\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:25.799 --> 00:31.000\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of food. And a stress test on a bridge checks if it can handle a lot of weight.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:36.200\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, to recap, a test is a method used to assess something.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:47.600\nIt can be your understanding of a subject, a physical ability, or even the strength of a material. It helps us get information and make decisions.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
