    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:07.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're tackling something fundamental: the concept of a test.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:19.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information and see what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb is working by switching it on. That's a test!\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:31.600\nIt could be a quiz at school, designed to see what you\u2019ve learned in class.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:37.200\nOr imagine a doctor giving you a check-up. That\u2019s a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:54.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it turns out right. So, tests come in many forms, but they all share the same purpose: to evaluate or assess something.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:59.200\nWhether it's your knowledge, your health, or even a cake recipe, tests help us understand and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
