    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:20.300\nIt's like asking a question and looking for the answer. Think about it: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:29.300\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is your favorite. Even a doctor's appointment involves tests to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:42.500\nThey all help us understand something better. For example, a simple test could be asking \"Does this float?\" You put something in water, and boom, you've got your answer!\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:52.100\nOr, you might test a new recipe by cooking it and seeing if you like the taste. Testing helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:52.100 --> 01:02.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and find things out. It\u2019s all about asking questions and finding the answers.\n\n01:02.900 --> 01:06.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
