    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.600\nWe use tests to see if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:28.200\nThink of it like this: when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick. That's a test to see if it's cooked through!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:37.000\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, you might test your balance by slowly lifting your feet. That's a test too.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:50.900\nTests are all around us. Doctors use tests to diagnose illnesses, teachers use tests to see what you've learned, and even video games use tests to see if you've completed a level.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:60.000\nSo, a test is really just a way of finding out information about something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
