    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something, right?\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:20.600\nThink of it as a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:27.800\nIt can be used to see how much you've learned about a topic, or to check if something is working properly.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:42.200\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words.\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might do a taste test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:56.600\nThe results of a test give you information.\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a medical examination, or even just trying out a new recipe, tests help us learn and improve.\nThey give us data to make informed decisions.\n\n00:56.600 --> 00:58.300\nRemember, a test is just a way to gather information!\n```"
