    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_072225.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:25.900\nIt's a method for gathering information. Think of it like this: you're trying to figure something out, and a test helps you do that.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:32.000\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:35.300\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:49.200\nYou might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. See? It's all about figuring things out. So, a test is really just a way to learn something new, or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:55.700\nIt helps us understand the world around us, one question or taste at a time. It's all about gathering information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
