    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:07.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:12.600\nWhether it's checking if you understand a lesson, checking if a machine is working right,\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:15.000\nor even checking if a recipe tastes good!\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:19.800\nThe main idea behind a test is to give you information.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:23.300\nIt helps you see what's working well and what needs improvement.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:27.700\nFor example, a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:31.100\nA car inspection checks if your brakes are safe.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:33.900\nAnd tasting your soup lets you know if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:38.400\nSo, a test is really just a tool.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:43.000\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:45.300\nThink of it as a helpful check-up!\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:53.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
