    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:28.200\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:38.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:49.200\nThink about it: When you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:51.800\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:56.000\nThat's a test to see if it fixes the problem!\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:02.300\nTests can be formal too, like the ones you take in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:07.700\nOr, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n01:07.700 --> 01:17.600\nSo, remember, a test is simply a process for gathering information and understanding something better.\n\n01:17.600 --> 01:24.000\nIt helps us learn, solve problems, and make decisions.\n\n01:24.000 --> 01:26.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
