    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:07.400\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:12.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:17.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:25.000\nIt\u2019s a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:30.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you insert a toothpick.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:31.800\nThat's a test!\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:38.000\nOr, if you're trying to see how well you understand a new topic, you might take a quiz.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:38.900\nThat's also a test!\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:46.200\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather forecast to see if you need a coat.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:53.700\nBasically, tests help us gather information and make decisions based on that information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:59.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
