    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.300\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:06.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:12.000\nThink of it as a question or a series of questions designed to give us information.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.800\nIt could be a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic, like math or science.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:23.100\nOr, it could be a taste test to see which brand of soda people like best.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:27.800\nEven your doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature, to learn about your health.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:34.800\nSo, tests help us measure knowledge, preferences, or even the condition of something.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:40.500\nThey give us data, which we can then use to make decisions or understand things better.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:43.500\nBasically, a test helps us learn!\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
