    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_073215.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:23.500\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\nThink of it this way: a spelling test helps us see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:34.300\nOr, a taste test lets us decide which cookie is the yummiest!\nIn science, you might test if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:50.900\nYou try something, and then you see what happens.\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to learn more about something, whether it\u2019s your knowledge, your preferences, or how things work in the world around us.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:57.200\nIt helps us understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
