    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:26.400\nIt helps us learn more about a person, a thing, or even an idea. Think about it like this: When you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you understand the subject.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:37.300\nOr, when a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever. Even trying a new recipe can be a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:52.400\nSo, tests come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to gather information. They help us make decisions, solve problems, and understand the world around us better.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:61.500\nIn short, a test is just a way to learn more by asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Pretty simple, right?\n\n00:61.500 --> 00:65.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
