    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_073645.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is really just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:28.400\nYou might use a toothpick \u2013 that's a test! You stick the toothpick in, and if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test, it's ready! If it comes out with batter, it fails the test, and needs more time.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:37.600\nAnother example is a spelling test in school. It checks if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:44.900\nOr even checking if your shoes fit before you buy them! That's a test too!\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:52.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to see if something meets a certain standard or requirement.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:59.000\nIt helps us make decisions and understand things better.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
