    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_073726.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be checking if something works, or seeing how much you know about a topic.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you take a quiz in school to test your understanding of the lesson.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:33.000\nThese are both tests! Another example is testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:40.000\nOr even tasting a new recipe to see if it's delicious! It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:50.400\nSo, a test is really just a method for gathering information, whether it's about health, knowledge, or even the flavor of your dinner.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:58.700\nHopefully, now you have a better understanding of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "c2202d2a-f1f7-46b6-a479-1065e8dc24ea": {
    "id": "c2202d2a-f1f7-46b6-a479-1065e8dc24ea",
