    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It can be a written quiz in school, sure, but it's also much more than that.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:28.000\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A chef might taste-test a new recipe.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:39.700\nEven a game like \"Would you rather?\" is kind of a test to learn about someone's preferences. So, a test is just a process to gather information.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:49.100\nWe ask a question, perform an action, or present a scenario, and then we analyze the result to learn something new.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:56.700\nTo recap, tests are all about learning and discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
