    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.500\nIt's a process designed to gather information. Think about it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:33.100\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Even tasting a new recipe is a type of test \u2013 you're testing to see if you like it!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:49.100\nTests can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like trying on a new shirt to see if it fits. The key is that you're using the process to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:59.500\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's our health, our knowledge, or even just whether a shirt looks good!\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
