    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.500\nIt\u2019s a process designed to gather information. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:32.500\nOr a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Tests can be used for all sorts of things!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:44.200\nYou might test a recipe to see if it tastes good, or test a new toy to see if it's durable. The key is that you're trying to learn something by observing the results.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:51.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a process to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
