    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_074907.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:17.100\nThink of a test as a way to check something, to see if it works, or to see if it's true. It's really just a simple way of finding things out.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:26.400\nFor example, you might test a new toy to see if it's fun. Or a baker might test a cake recipe to make sure it tastes good.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:35.500\nScientists use tests all the time to see if their ideas are right. They might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:46.600\nSo, a test is just a procedure used to evaluate something. It helps us understand if something meets certain requirements or if an idea is correct.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:54.200\nRemember, testing is all about learning and improving! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
