    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.400\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:25.200\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nFor example, if you touch a hot stove, that's a test to see if it's hot.\nThe result?\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:27.500\nOuch!\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:29.800\nOr, if you try a new recipe,\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:32.500\ntasting it is a test to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:33.800\nHopefully it is!\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:47.100\nTests can also be more formal, like a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\nThe goal is always the same: to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:53.600\nSo, a test is really just a method for learning and understanding.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
