    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.400\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like an experiment, but more focused. We use tests to see if something is true, or to measure how well something works.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:35.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to test what you've learned.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:48.100\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it! The results of a test give us information, and that information helps us make decisions.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:56.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure used to gather information. It helps us understand something better, whether it's our health, our knowledge, or even just if a cake tastes good.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
