    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests, and what they really mean.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is just a way to see how well you understand something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: maybe your mom asks you a few questions about a book you read. That's a mini-test to see if you understood the story.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:31.000\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste a little bit of the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:43.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. They can be quizzes at school, experiments in a science lab, or even just trying out a new video game to see if you like it.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:57.100\nThe key thing is that a test gives you information. So, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and see how well something performs or how much you've learned.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
