    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like checking to see if you understand the rules of a game.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:35.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test checks if you can solve math problems. And even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you can follow the instructions and make something delicious!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:41.900\nSo, a test helps us measure knowledge or ability.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:50.700\nIt's a tool for learning, really. It shows us what we're good at and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.100\nRemember, tests are just one way to learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
