    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_075334.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.600\nIt's a process designed to gather information, often to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:31.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:46.900\nA chef tastes their soup; that's a test to see if it needs more salt! Tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share that common goal: to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:57.400\nSo, tests help us measure, understand, and improve things all around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
