    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE duration:60.0\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:23.900\nIt's a method we use to gather information or evaluate something. Think about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:31.500\nOr, imagine baking a cake; you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. That's a test too!\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:47.300\nSo, tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like checking the temperature of bathwater. The key thing is that a test gives us a result, telling us something we didn't know before.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:55.100\nWe use tests everyday! In short, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate or measure something.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:60.000\nThanks for watching! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
