    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe by tasting it to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.200\nOr, imagine you're buying a new toy. You might test it out by playing with it to make sure all the buttons work and that it does what it says on the box.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:39.200\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:49.800\nSo, tests are all about checking things. They help us understand if something is good, bad, working, or not working. They give us information to make decisions.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:56.200\nThat's the basic idea behind tests!\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
