    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:13.300\nA test is really just a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it as a simple check to see if something is working, or if something is true.\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr, a taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:36.200\nEven pressing the button on a remote control to see if the TV turns on is a kind of test!\nYou're testing if the remote is working.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:46.800\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are doing what they\u2019re supposed to do.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:57.100\nWhether it's a pop quiz or checking if your shoelaces are tied, tests are all around us!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
