    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE duration:61.9\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something, right? It's a process to check if something is true, or to see how well something works.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:23.700\nThink about it like this: a recipe test. You try a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.900\nOr a spelling test at school, which checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:44.900\nSo, a test is really just a way of gathering information. You perform a test, you get results, and those results help you understand something better.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:54.800\nWhether it's figuring out if a cake is delicious, or checking your knowledge of the alphabet, tests are all about learning and finding things out.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:01.900\nThat\u2019s the basics of what a test is all about! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
