    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_080328.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is just a way to check how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like a quiz at school.\nThat's a test to see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:30.000\nBut tests aren't just for school.\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:43.900\nA software developer might test a new app to make sure it doesn't crash.\nEven a baker might test their cake recipe to make sure it tastes good!\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:55.900\nSo, basically, a test is any process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or quality.\nIt helps us understand something better and make improvements.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:07.900\nIt can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like trying out a new flavor combination.\nIn short, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n01:07.900 --> 01:12.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
