    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like this: you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:32.700\nThat's a test! Or, maybe a doctor does a blood test to check your health. The whole idea is to gather information.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:43.500\nTests help us measure things, like knowledge, skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:51.800\nFor example, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, a company might let people try a new product to test if they like it.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.900\nSee how tests are everywhere?\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:58.700\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and learning something new.\n```"
  },
