    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.800\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but it doesn't always need be in a lab.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.100\nYou can test all sorts of things! For example, a teacher gives you a quiz to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:31.700\nA doctor might run a blood test to see how healthy you are. Or, you might even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:46.500\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and make decisions. So, whether it's a school exam or trying a new flavor of ice cream, remember that a test is just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:50.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
