    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.200\nA test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to help you understand where you're at.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:28.600\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Or, a chef might taste a sauce \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more salt!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:42.600\nAnother example: your doctor might run a blood test to check your overall health. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give you information.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:53.900\nIn short, a test helps us learn something new, or confirm something we already suspect. It\u2019s a simple, powerful tool for understanding.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
