    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:23.300\nWe use tests all the time to figure things out.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:32.400\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:41.500\nThat's a test! Or, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again to see if that fixes it.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:50.400\nAnother test. Basically, a test is any action or experiment we do to see if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:59.300\nWe can test recipes, we can test our knowledge with quizzes, or even test new products to see if people like them.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:00.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a check.\n```"
  },
