    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE\nAll timings are approximate.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:09.100\nSimple, right? But what is a test, really?\n\n00:09.100 --> 00:22.300\nA test is just a way to find out information about something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but sometimes the answer is a number, a color, or even just a pass or fail.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:33.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your words.\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\nEven a simple check to see if your phone is charged is a kind of test!\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:41.800\nIt's seeing if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:50.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and see if something works or meets expectations.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:53.700\nThey come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
