    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:22.800\nNow, the word \"test\" can mean a lot of things, but basically, it's a way to find out something.\nIt's a process of checking or examining something to see if it meets a certain standard or tells us something we want to know.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:32.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:38.800\nA taste test lets you decide which food you like best.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:54.600\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\nSee? Different kinds of tests, but all helping us learn something.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:03.100\nSo, to recap, a test is a way of finding something out, whether it's your knowledge, your preferences, or something else entirely.\nHopefully, this gives you a better understanding of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
