    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. The test? You poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:28.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test says the cake is ready! Or, imagine you want to know if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:34.800\nYou put it in a lamp and turn it on. If it lights up, the test is passed!\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.500\nTests help us make decisions, understand things, and see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:52.300\nThey're all around us, in all sorts of different forms. So remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
