    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or even your ability to do something.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:27.500\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that\u2019s a test!\nIt helps them see how well you understand the lessons.\nOr when you go to the doctor, they might run some blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:35.500\nTests come in many forms.\nThere are multiple choice tests, true or false tests, and even tests where you have to show what you can do, like playing a musical instrument.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:46.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\nIt helps us understand where we are, and what we might need to learn next.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:49.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
