    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_082802.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_082802.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:26.900\nTests help us see if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:35.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:45.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it comes out delicious.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:52.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for figuring something out.\nIt's a way to gather information and learn more.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "f3ca1d0d-35a6-4238-9f73-1b9b55e3bc9c": {
    "id": "f3ca1d0d-35a6-4238-9f73-1b9b55e3bc9c",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:36:19.092899",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T08:28:47.995305",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_082847.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_082847.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.300 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works, or if it's true.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:27.700\nFor example,\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:40.000\nif you want to know if a lightbulb works, you can test it by screwing it into a lamp and turning it on.\nDoes it light up? That's your test!\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:52.300\nOr, if you want to know if your cake is ready, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test that tells you the cake is done.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:56.900\nSo, tests are all about finding out information by doing something and observing the result.\nThey help us understand things better and make sure everything is working the way it should.\n\n00:56.900 --> 00:58.500\nRemember, a test is just a way to check!\n\n00:58.500 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "ef4804b8-92c9-42a6-8c5d-951091fc6199": {
    "id": "ef4804b8-92c9-42a6-8c5d-951091fc6199",
    "topic": "Test",
