    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_082923.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:18.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be used to check if something works, if you understand something, or even to see how strong something is.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:28.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:39.700\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of a new food. And even a crash test for a car checks how safe it is in an accident.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:47.600\nSo, a test helps us gather information and make decisions based on that information. It's a simple concept with lots of uses.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:51.100\nHopefully, now you have a better understanding of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "fc6f350d-cc06-42e9-9ccd-4966b3d843af": {
