    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_083009.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know or what you can do.\nThink of it like checking in on your progress.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:23.100\nThe basic idea is simple: you're given a set of questions or tasks, and your answers or performance are then evaluated.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:35.100\nThis helps show how well you understand something or how skilled you are at a particular activity.\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:47.500\nOr, think about a taste test, where you try different foods to see which one you like best.\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if it turns out well!\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:58.900\nSo, tests are all about assessing knowledge, skills, or even preferences.\nThey're a common and useful tool in learning and in everyday life.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:02.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
