    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:29.600\nIt could be finding out how well you know a subject, or how strong a material is, or even if something is working correctly.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:37.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.300\nA strength test on a bridge tells engineers if it's safe to drive on.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:46.900\nAnd a simple battery test tells you if your flashlight will turn on.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:51.800\nTests help us learn and improve.\nThey give us information that we can use to make better decisions.\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to gather information and see where we stand.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
