    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_083501.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.700\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's a process we use to check or evaluate something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even how well something works.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:30.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test can tell you if you like a new flavor of ice cream!\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:34.500\nSee? Different tests, different goals.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:45.600\nSo, to recap, a test is just a procedure designed to gather information. It helps us understand something better or measure its effectiveness.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:49.200\nThey're everywhere! And now you know what they are.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
