    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE\nAll timings are approximate, adjust as needed during final rendering.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nIn the simplest terms, a test is really just a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:19.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, right?\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:27.200\nYou poke it with a toothpick. That's a test! The toothpick tells you if the batter is still wet inside.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:35.000\nOr maybe you want to know if you know all your letters. Someone might ask you to recite the alphabet \u2013 that's a test, too!\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.800\nIt helps see how much you've learned. Tests can be big, like exams at school, or small, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:51.400\nIt all boils down to figuring something out by asking a question or trying something out.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:58.900\nSo, remember, tests are just tools to help us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
