    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_083623.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:23.700\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:33.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it needs batteries. Or, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:46.100\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned about a subject. They can be multiple choice, true or false, or even just answering questions.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:53.400\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn more. We use them all the time, in many different ways! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
