    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:24.500\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:29.800\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:35.100\nSee? Different situations, same idea!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:42.500\nLet's say you're building a birdhouse. You could test it by putting it outside and seeing if birds actually use it.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:47.200\nThat's a real-world test!\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:54.000\nTests are everywhere, helping us learn and improve things. So, remember, a test is a way to check something and learn about it.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.500\nIt's all about finding things out!\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
