    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_083846.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_083846.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.000\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\"\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:03.000\nand wondered what it really means?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:9.500\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer,\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:11.800\nbut in a more structured way.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:16.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test helps us find out how well we know how to spell words.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:21.000\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste a little bit to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:22.200\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:25.000\nTests aren't just for school, though.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:27.000\nDoctors use tests to check our health.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:31.500\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:38.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what we already know.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:41.500\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:44.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "d61b6432-6572-4e62-9375-5870607f75ee": {
    "id": "d61b6432-6572-4e62-9375-5870607f75ee",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:36:25.459754",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T08:39:29.861347",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_083929.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_083929.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:32.900\nOr, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it works and is safe.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:46.100\nTests aren't just for classrooms or labs, though! Imagine baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. That's a test too!\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:56.900\nSo, whether it's a written exam, a scientific experiment, or even tasting your cooking, a test is all about finding out information.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.600\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n```"
  },
  "c6de831e-78ef-4c2c-8a6e-70f0e0ca6753": {
    "id": "c6de831e-78ef-4c2c-8a6e-70f0e0ca6753",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:36:26.111650",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T08:40:14.163065",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_084014.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_084014.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:20.800\nTests can be about anything! Like, a taste test to see if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:30.100\nOr a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Even a doctor checking your temperature is a kind of test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:37.800\nSo, if you're baking a cake and you poke it with a toothpick to see if it comes out clean? That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:41.300\nYou're testing to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:53.400\nSee? Tests are all around us, helping us learn and understand the world. Basically, a test is a way to learn something new or confirm what we already suspect. It's about gathering information!\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
