    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.700\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more organized way. Think about it like this: a recipe is a test to see if you can bake a cake.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:30.700\nYou follow the steps, and at the end, you have a cake, or maybe... something else!\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:41.500\nOr, a spelling test at school checks to see if you know how to spell certain words. Tests can be big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:52.100\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and understand. So, to recap: a test is a process to discover or confirm something. It helps us evaluate and learn.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
