    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_084301.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.799\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.799 --> 00:15.999\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It helps us understand if something works as expected or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:15.999 --> 00:23.200\nThink about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:31.800\nOr, if you're buying a new toy, you might test it out to see if it's fun and works properly.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:43.000\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:50.000\nSo, a test is really just a process of checking something. It helps us make informed decisions and understand the world around us better.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.700\nTests are everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
