    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.700\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like a tool that helps us measure or evaluate.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.700\nIt can be anything from a simple quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic, to a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:38.100\nThe main idea is that it gives us information.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:46.800\nFor example, a taste test helps us decide which flavor we like best. Or, a spelling test shows us which words we need to practice.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:55.500\nSee? Pretty simple. So, remember, a test is an evaluation method that helps us learn or measure something.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:58.100\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all serve the same purpose: to give us information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
