    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:23.200\nIt's a process designed to gather information. Think of it like this: you might \"test\" the temperature of a bathwater to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:32.700\nOr a baker might \"test\" a cake with a toothpick to see if it's done. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:42.600\nThese tests can be multiple choice, essays, or even projects. The goal is to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:50.900\nSo, a test is just a way to measure knowledge, skills, or abilities. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:54.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
