    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:21.700\nIt helps us measure or evaluate. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:26.100\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:31.700\nSee? Tests can be used for all sorts of things! Let's say you're baking a cake.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:38.300\nYou might taste the batter. That\u2019s a mini-test to see if it tastes good before you bake the whole thing.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:44.900\nOr, if you're buying a used car, you take it for a test drive to see if it runs smoothly.\n\n00:44.900 --> 01:04.900\nSo, remember, a test is a tool we use to learn more about something, whether it's your spelling skills, your health, or even the taste of cake batter! It helps us make informed decisions.\n\n01:04.900 --> 01:11.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
