    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:22.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process of asking a question or performing an action to see what happens.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:31.200\nThink about it like this: a taste test tells you how something tastes.\nOr a spelling test shows you how well you can spell.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:40.600\nTests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to figure out what\u2019s making you sick.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:48.000\nA baker might test a new recipe to see if it works.\nSo, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.600\nThey help us understand the world around us better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
