    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give us information.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:28.600\nTests can be anything from a simple taste test to see if you like a new flavor of ice cream, to a spelling test at school, to even a medical test at the doctor's office.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:38.000\nThe goal is always the same: to learn something. For example, that ice cream test tells you if you like the flavor.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:45.800\nThe spelling test shows what words you know how to spell. And a medical test helps the doctor understand your health.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:54.500\nSo, in short, a test is a tool we use to gather information and learn about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:01.900\nIt's all about asking questions and finding answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
