    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:26.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. For example, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:35.200\nOr, if you're trying to figure out which route to take to school, you might try different routes to test which is fastest.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:44.400\nTests help us learn and make better decisions. So, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:56.000\nIt could be a quiz at school, trying out a new recipe, or even just seeing if your shoes fit! They all help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:04.400\nTo recap, tests help us find things out. We use them everywhere, and they're a key part of learning!\n\n01:04.400 --> 01:08.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
