    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how much you know about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:23.400\nIt's like a quiz, but it can be anything from a simple pop quiz in class to a big exam.\nThink of it like this: Imagine you're learning to bake a cake.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:27.300\nThe test is tasting the cake!\nDoes it taste good?\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:32.600\nDid you follow the recipe?\nThat taste tells you how well you learned to bake.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:38.800\nAnother example is a spelling test.\nIt checks if you know how to spell certain words correctly.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:51.600\nOr, a math test can show if you understand how to solve problems.\nSo, tests help you and your teachers figure out what you've learned and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:58.300\nThey're a snapshot of your knowledge at that moment.\nAnd remember, tests are just one way to learn!\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
