    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, it's a way to check something. We want to see if it works, if it's correct, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:24.600\nThink about it like this: a chef tastes the soup to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:34.800\nOr a doctor asks you questions to test your memory. In both cases, they're using a test to get information.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:46.200\nIn the world of computers and software, tests are super important! We use them to make sure that programs do what they're supposed to do and don't have any errors.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:57.300\nFor example, we might test if a website button takes you to the right page. Or we could test if a calculator app gives the correct answer.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:05.800\nSo, remember, a test is all about checking something to see if it's working properly. It's a way to gather information and make sure everything is doing what it should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
