    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:24.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:34.300\nhow well something is working, or even what something is made of.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:44.500\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:53.700\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Even a chef tastes their food \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more seasoning!\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nSo, tests can be big or small, simple or complicated, but they all have the same goal: to give us information.\n```"
