    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:04.600\nToday we're diving into the basics\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:05.200\nof something\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:05.720\ncalled a \"test.\"\n\n00:05.720 --> 00:08.180\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just\n\n00:08.180 --> 00:09.760\na way to find out something.\n\n00:09.760 --> 00:12.820\nIt's a process designed to give you information\n\n00:12.820 --> 00:15.220\nor show you what you know, or how something\n\n00:15.220 --> 00:15.720\nworks.\n\n00:15.720 --> 00:19.380\nThink of it like this: a simple spelling\n\n00:19.380 --> 00:22.680\ntest in school helps your teacher see how\n\n00:22.680 --> 00:23.480\nwell you understand\n\n00:23.480 --> 00:23.840\nspelling rules.\n\n00:23.840 --> 00:28.020\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which flavor\n\n00:28.020 --> 00:29.120\nof ice cream you like best!\n\n00:29.120 --> 00:32.400\nEven testing a new toy to see if it's safe\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:33.520\nis a type of test.\n\n00:33.520 --> 00:37.540\nSo, basically, a test is a method for gathering\n\n00:37.540 --> 00:40.320\ninformation or evaluating something.\n\n00:40.320 --> 00:43.740\nIt can be formal, like an exam, or informal,\n\n00:43.740 --> 00:46.320\nlike trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:46.320 --> 00:49.300\nThe key is that it helps us learn and understand.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:51.160\nThat\u2019s a quick look at what a test is.\n\n00:51.160 --> 00:54.080\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
