    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_090401.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nEver wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:14.600\nAt its core, a test is just a way to find something out!\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like this: you\u2019re trying to learn about a new subject, or see how well you understand something.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:31.700\nA test helps measure that. It's like a snapshot of your knowledge at a specific moment in time.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:37.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:48.700\nOr a math test shows how well you understand numbers and equations. Tests aren't meant to be scary! They're actually tools to help you learn and grow.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:56.100\nThey show you what you already know, and what you might need to study more. So, a test is simply a way to measure knowledge or skill in a specific area. It helps you and your teachers understand what you've learned. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
