    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_090534.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like checking if your cake is done baking \u2013 you use a toothpick, and that's a test! If it comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:39.700\nTests aren't just about school. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, engineers test bridges to make sure they're strong, and even when you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if you like it!\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:51.100\nSo, tests help us learn and make sure things are safe and working properly. In short, a test is a method used to evaluate knowledge or performance. It's a valuable tool in many areas of life.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
