    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_090620.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test is, in the simplest terms?\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:16.400\nWell, a test is really just a way to see how much you know or how well you can do something. Think of it like this: a test is like a measuring stick for your brain!\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.200\nIt helps you, and sometimes your teachers, understand what you've learned.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:34.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you can spell words correctly. A math test shows if you understand how to add or subtract.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:42.800\nTests aren't just about grades, though. They can also help you figure out what you need to practice more.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.900\nSo, a test is a tool to help you learn and grow. It shows where you're strong and where you can improve.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.200\nSo remember, a test is just a way to measure your knowledge and help you learn even more!\n```"
