    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.600\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:30.200\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Even baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:43.400\nYou're testing if your ingredients and instructions will result in a delicious cake. Tests can be written, like exams, or they can be hands-on, like experiments.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:54.800\nThey help us understand things better by providing information. So, a test is just a method to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:02.100\nRemember, tests are all about finding answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
