    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_090831.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:06.200\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:12.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:16.800\nYou test them by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:20.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you they're ready.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:23.700\nIf it's gooey, they need more time.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:24.500\nSee?\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:25.000\nA test!\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:29.400\nTests aren't just for baking, though.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:32.800\nYour doctor uses tests to check your health.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.300\nTeachers use tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:42.500\nEven trying a new restaurant is a test to see if you like the food!\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:48.900\nSo, a test is really just a way of gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:52.600\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:54.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
