    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:28.000\nTests can be about anything! For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:35.100\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:39.800\nImagine you\u2019re planting seeds.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:49.800\nYou could do a little test to see which seeds grow faster. You plant some in sunlight and some in the shade. Then, you watch and see which ones sprout first. That's a test!\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of learning about something by trying it out. It helps us understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
