    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_090957.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:32.400\nThink of it like checking your knowledge or checking if a product does what it's supposed to do. For example, when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how much you learned.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:45.400\nOr, if a company makes a new toy, they'll test it to make sure it's safe and doesn't break easily. Tests help us learn and improve things.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:58.300\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz, a science experiment, or even trying out a new recipe, you\u2019re performing a test! Basically, a test is a way to get information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.800\nTests are all around us, helping us learn and make sure things are working correctly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
