    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something or someone to see how well they perform or what they know.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you put it in a lamp.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:31.100\nSo, what does that mean in practice? Well, your teacher might give you a test at school to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:42.000\nOr, a doctor might run a test to check your health. Even baking a cake is a kind of test, to see if your recipe and technique work!\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:47.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:54.900\nA blood test checks different things about your blood. And tasting your cake batter? That's a test to see if you need more sugar!\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:03.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us understand things better and see if we're on the right track. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
