    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nIt's how we find out if something works the way it should, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:32.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nFor example, you might take a multiple-choice test at school.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:38.500\nOr, you might test a new toy to see if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:49.500\nThe important thing is that you're trying to get information.\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:53.600\nIt helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
