    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:22.600\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:31.200\nOr, if you're trying out a new video game, you might play a level to test your skills.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:35.100\nAnother example? A doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:42.500\nSee? Tests are everywhere! They help us understand things better and figure out what we need to learn or improve.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:54.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check knowledge, skills, or even how something is functioning. Tests help us learn and grow.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
