    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_091807.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and looking for the answer.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:17.100\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don\u2019t realize it. Think about it.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.600\nWhen you bake a cake and poke it with a fork to see if it's done, that's a test! You're testing if the cake is cooked through.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:37.800\nOr, when you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit, you're testing their size. Tests can also be more formal, like a spelling quiz at school.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:50.400\nThat test helps your teacher see what words you know. So, a test is basically a way to check something, whether it\u2019s a cake, a pair of shoes, or your knowledge.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:57.600\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
