    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:21.900\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge or skills in a particular area.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:32.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:42.900\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt. In school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned in class.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:55.100\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz on the planets is a test of your astronomy knowledge. Or, spelling words correctly on paper is a test of your spelling skills.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:03.000\nSo, a test is just a method to check on something, whether it's your understanding, your health, or even the taste of your soup!\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:07.700\nIt helps us understand where we're at and what we might need to work on.\n\n01:07.700 --> 01:09.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
