    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_092344.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like this: you use a test to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:33.400\nFor example, your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you\u2019re healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to see how much you\u2019ve learned about a topic.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.000\nEven baking a cake is a sort of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing your recipe! Tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:52.400\nThey give us information we can use to make better decisions. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and understand things better.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
