    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_092509.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how well you understand something, or how good you are at doing something.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\nThe test isn't a written exam, but rather, seeing if you can actually ride the bike without falling!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:37.100\nOr, if you\u2019re learning about colors, a test might be showing you a red apple and asking you what color it is.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:50.300\nTests can come in many forms, like quizzes, exams, or even just trying something new.\nThe goal is to see what you've learned and where you might need some extra help.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:56.300\nSo, remember, tests are just tools to help us learn and grow.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
