    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.599\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:22.399\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.700\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is the best.\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:36.300\nSo, tests aren't just about school. They're everywhere!\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:48.800\nThey help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\nThey use questions, observations, or experiments to give us information.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:54.400\nBasically, a test is just a method for finding something out. That's it!\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
