    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_092757.mp4",
    "subtitles": "WebVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:18.900\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of bathwater to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:26.800\nIn school, tests help us see what we've learned. A spelling test checks if we know how to spell words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:32.700\nA math test checks if we understand math problems.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:40.200\nLet's say you're baking cookies. You might test the first cookie to see if it's cooked perfectly before taking the whole batch out of the oven.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:51.600\nThat's another example of a test! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something and see if it's working, learned, or ready.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:57.900\nTests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI."
