    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:26.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:37.300\nThink about it: When you try a new recipe, you're testing it out to see if it tastes good. Or, when you try to open a door, you're testing if it's locked or unlocked.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:46.800\nIn school, tests help us see how much we've learned about a subject.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:56.400\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve problems, and the answers show how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool for finding information or checking understanding. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
