    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:26.200\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate a person, a skill, a product, or anything, really.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:35.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:42.600\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:49.100\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:55.900\nSo, tests help us measure things and make informed decisions. They give us information.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:01.800\nWhether it's checking your knowledge, comparing different flavors, or understanding your health, tests are all about getting answers.\n\n01:01.800 --> 01:07.600\nTests are very useful for many things. That's the basics of what a test is.\n\n01:07.600 --> 01:11.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
