    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the concept of a test.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something. It could be anything!\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's just right.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:36.000\nOr, a baker might test a cake with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:46.500\nDoctors use tests to check your health, like taking your blood pressure. And of course, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:51.700\nSo, a test is just a method for finding out information about something.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:56.700\nWhether it's checking if the water is warm enough, or seeing how much you know about a subject, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:56.700 --> 00:59.200\nRemember, tests are all about gathering information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
