    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out if something is working correctly, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a physical exam to test your overall health.\nOr, in school, you take quizzes and exams to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:36.200\nSo, tests help us understand something better.\nFor example, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:41.700\nA software developer might run a program to test if it has any errors.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:48.800\nSee?\nTests are everywhere!\nBasically, a test is just a way to check something and get some information.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:55.000\nIt's a fundamental tool for learning and improving.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
