    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like a question you ask to get an answer. The main idea behind a test is to see if something works, if something is true, or how well something performs.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:30.100\nIt's all about gathering information.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:40.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:51.600\nEven trying a new recipe is a test \u2013 you're testing whether you like it! So, to recap, a test is a way of asking a question to get an answer about something.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
