    "subtitles": "[WebVTT]\n```\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like an investigation. You've probably taken tests in school, but tests are all around us!\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:34.400\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. Or, if your phone isn't working, you might try restarting it to test if that fixes the problem.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:45.200\nThe result, or the outcome, of the test tells you something important. So, a test is really just a way to gather information.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:59.900\nYou perform an action, observe what happens, and then learn from the result. Whether you're checking if your shoes fit or a scientist is running an experiment, you're using a test to learn something new!\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:09.800\nIn summary, a test helps us understand things better by giving us information about them.\n01:09.800 --> 01:11.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
