    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_094535.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.700\nHey there! Welcome!\n\n00:01.700 --> 00:05.100\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:06.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:10.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:14.600\nThink of it like asking a question, but with a specific way to get an answer.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:18.400\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well we know how to spell words.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:22.000\nA taste test helps us decide which flavor we like best.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.000\nEven a simple \"yes\" or \"no\" question can be a test! We're testing if someone agrees or disagrees.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:31.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.000\nIt can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just a simple question.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:38.100\nIt\u2019s all about learning something new.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:41.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
