    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_094956.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.800\nIt's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:29.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You perform a test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:37.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you the cake is ready!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:45.700\nOr maybe you're taking a spelling test at school. That test helps your teacher see how well you understand spelling rules.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:55.100\nTests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking the weather to figuring out what kind of medicine will help you feel better.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:59.400\nThey're all about gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:02.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something!\n\n01:02.800 --> 01:06.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
