    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_095038.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests! You've probably taken a bunch of them in school, but what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out what you know about something. It helps measure your understanding.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like this: Imagine you're learning to bake cookies. A test would be like asking you to explain the steps, or even having you bake a batch!\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:34.600\nThe result, good or bad, shows how well you learned. Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:43.900\nThere are multiple choice tests, where you pick the right answer from a list. There are written tests, where you write out your answers.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.600\nAnd there are even practical tests, like baking those cookies! So, a test is just a tool to check your knowledge and skills.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:02.400\nIt helps you and your teachers see what you've learned and what you might need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
