    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:19.700\nTests can be used for lots of things. Think about a spelling test at school.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:27.200\nThat helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words. Or imagine tasting a new cookie recipe.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:34.800\nThat's a test to see if you like it! Another example is testing a toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:48.000\nScientists and engineers use tests all the time to learn more about the world around us. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.700\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:54.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
