    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_095158.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. Think of it like this: a test helps us find out if something works, if something is true, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:29.000\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:49.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and find something out. It can be used for all sorts of things, from schoolwork to science experiments.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:55.600\nThat's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
