    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:18.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's how we check if something is working, how well we understand something, or what's true about something.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:26.600\nThink about it: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.800\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how much you've learned.\nEven baking a cake is a bit of a test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:45.600\nSo, tests help us gather information. They can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying a new brand of coffee to see if you like it.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:55.200\nThe key thing is, a test is an organized way to get an answer. Basically, a test helps you learn or confirm something.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
