    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_095445.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use them all the time!\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:33.900\nThink of it like this: you test the water to see if it's too hot before jumping in the pool. Or, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:42.300\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:50.700\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even just writing an essay. The main goal is to check your understanding of a topic.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.300\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve a problem. A science test might ask you to explain a concept.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.900\nAnd a reading test might ask you questions about a story.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:05.800\nSo, tests are basically tools we use to check understanding and learn more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n01:05.800 --> 01:09.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
