    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it as a mini-experiment. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:35.500\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:50.500\nOr, if you're feeling under the weather, a doctor might run some tests to figure out what's going on. Tests help us make decisions, confirm our assumptions, and learn new things.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:59.300\nThey can be simple like tasting food to see if it needs more salt, or complex like scientific experiments. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
