    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like a little experiment where you're trying to find out if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:33.500\nIt could be anything! Like, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:41.500\nOr, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:47.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:50.700\nSo, basically, tests help us understand things better and make sure everything is working as expected.\n```"
