    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_095926.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:13.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:25.900\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if someone knows something. Think of it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:33.500\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:38.600\nThat's a test too! Tests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:43.700\nDoctors use tests to check your health.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:50.000\nEngineers test bridges to make sure they're safe. Even video games sometimes test your skills with challenges.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:58.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn or check something. It helps us get information and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:02.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
