    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_100012.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.700\nNow, a test, at its most basic, is simply a way to find something out. Think of it like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:31.000\nTests help us measure things, see how well something works, or even check if something is true.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:41.700\nFor example, a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test helps us figure out which flavor of ice cream people like best.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:51.100\nAnother example: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:59.900\nSo, tests are really just tools that help us learn and understand the world around us. They give us data we can use to make decisions.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:05.600\nIn short, a test is a way to collect information and measure things. We use them all the time! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
