    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\nThink of it like a measuring tool, but instead of measuring length, it measures your understanding.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:28.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, a quiz about animals checks if you remember what you've learned about different creatures.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:40.400\nTests can be written, spoken, or even hands-on!\nSo, to recap, a test helps us see what we've learned and where we might need some extra help.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:46.700\nIt's just one way to learn and grow.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
