    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_100908.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:20.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about you, or something you've learned.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:29.600\nThink of it like this: it's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or even your abilities.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:41.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words. A driving test shows if you can safely operate a car. And a taste test tells you which flavor you prefer!\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:51.900\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give us information. They help us understand where we are, and where we need to go next.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.500\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools for learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
