    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:16.600\nA test, at its core, is simply a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:23.300\nThat's a test! In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.300\nThey might ask you questions about what you've learned, or have you solve a problem. Even outside of school, we use tests all the time.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:40.900\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A car mechanic might run tests to see what's wrong with your car.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:48.500\nSo, tests are just tools that give us information. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:55.500\nRemember, a test isn't good or bad, it just is. It's a way to learn something new!\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
