    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_101117.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:19.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to evaluate your knowledge, skill, or ability in a particular area.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:29.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:39.900\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\nThese can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:47.800\nThe key is that a test gives you a chance to demonstrate your understanding.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:58.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks your ability to spell words correctly.\nA math test shows how well you can solve problems.\nAnd a history test reveals your knowledge of past events.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:02.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for measuring something.\nIt helps you and your teachers see what you know and where you might need some extra help.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
