    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:23.900\nIt's a process that helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:32.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:39.800\nOr, when you're baking, you test the cake with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:46.700\nTests aren't just for doctors or bakers, though! We use them every day, often without even realizing it.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:51.800\nLike checking the weather to see if you need an umbrella, or tasting food to see if it needs more salt. So, a test is a way to check something and learn more about it. That\u2019s the basics of what a test is all about! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
