    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_101345.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:14.700\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:25.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:30.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:35.500\nOr, when you learn something new in school, you might take a quiz.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:39.800\nThat's a test too! It shows how well you understand the material.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:44.100\nLet's say you bake a cake.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:48.400\nYou might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:52.700\nOr maybe you try pushing a door to test if it's locked.\n\n00:52.700 --> 01:04.000\nSee? Tests are everywhere, big and small. Basically, a test is a process to gather information and make a decision.\n\n01:04.000 --> 01:07.400\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n01:07.400 --> 01:11.200\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a simple way to find things out.\n\n01:11.200 --> 01:14.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
