    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if you understand a lesson, so you take a quiz.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:23.100\nOr, you want to see if a new recipe tastes good, so you try it.\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:27.500\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:37.200\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you sick.\nA car company might test a new car to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:39.800\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:49.300\nThey help us gather information and make better decisions.\nSo, to recap, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:58.200\nIt can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just trying something new.\nThey help us understand things better.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
