    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:14.700\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you get the right answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:39.200\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good. Or, if you try to open a door, you're testing if you have the right key.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:50.200\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if your shoes are tied. The important thing is that they help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:54.600\nThey tell us if something is working the way it should, or if we need to make some changes.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:57.600\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:57.600 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "fc3d7b7c-7cf1-4ad8-9787-3f8a7c815daa": {
