    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_102047.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\nThink of it like checking up on things!\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.000\nThe main idea behind a test is to ask questions or perform actions and then compare the results to what's expected.\nThis helps us understand if we're on the right track.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:33.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr, if you're baking a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:46.300\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\nSo, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:55.100\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\nThey're a really important part of learning and building things.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:02.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
