    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.100\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:30.400\nThere are all kinds of tests. You might take a quiz in school to see how well you understood a lesson.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:38.700\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:48.100\nEven trying a new recipe and seeing if it tastes good is a kind of test!\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:57.500\nSo, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of animals or what they eat.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:00.000\nIf you're learning about colors, a test might show you a picture and ask you to identify the color.\n```"
