    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_102303.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:25.100\nIt helps you and others see what you've learned and where you might need some extra practice.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:46.800\nOr, a taste test lets you see if you can tell the difference between different flavors. Tests aren't scary, they're just a tool!\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:58.100\nFor example, you might take a test after reading a book to see if you understood the story. Or, you might take a test in math to practice your addition and subtraction skills.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:01.600\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check your understanding and help you learn. It's a chance to show what you know and identify areas for improvement. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
