    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_102424.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are, and why they're important.\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:19.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like a simple check-up. For example, a doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:38.500\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to check your understanding of a lesson. Even baking a cake involves a test: you taste it to see if it\u2019s good!\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:45.300\nTests help us learn and improve. If the vision test shows you need glasses, you can get them.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:55.900\nIf the quiz shows you need to study more, you know what to focus on. So, tests are all about gathering information and making things better.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:03.200\nThey are a fundamental part of learning and progress. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
