    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:04.700\nToday we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:08.100\nYou might think of tests as scary exams, but really, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:11.800\nThink of it like a question, and the test helps you find the answer.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:15.900\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:20.100\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:21.700\nSee? It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:28.100\nAnother example? Imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You test it with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:30.700\nThe test told you the cake is ready to eat.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.100\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method used to determine something.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:42.700\nIt\u2019s a way to check, evaluate, or find out about something.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:44.400\nAnd tests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:47.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
