    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_103248.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.100\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a check-up.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:25.900\nWe use tests all the time to see how well something works, or to see if something is true. For example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:35.500\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is the yummiest. And a medical test can help a doctor understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:46.500\nSo, a test is really just a method for gathering information and learning something new. They help us understand the world around us and make better decisions.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:50.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
