    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:22.600\nIt could be checking if a light bulb works, or if you know the answer to a question.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:35.000\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:46.600\nSo, a test helps us find out information or see if something is working correctly. For example, you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:49.600\nOr, a mechanic tests your car's engine to make sure it's running smoothly.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:52.600\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:03.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn more about it. Tests help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
