    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.000\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.700\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:22.900\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:33.300\nSo, you poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:39.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake's ready.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:45.600\nOr, imagine you want to know if you know your ABCs.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:51.700\nSomeone might ask you to recite them. That's another test!\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:57.500\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking if the water is hot enough for a bath.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:00.000\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and understand things better.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:03.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n01:03.600 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
