    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_103918.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:23.700\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well something works. Think about it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:33.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, maybe you're testing a new toy to see if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:38.000\nYou give it to a friend and watch them play. That's a test too!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:50.500\nTests can be formal, like school exams, or informal, like trying a new recipe. The main idea is that you're trying to learn something or confirm something.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:57.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something out. It helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
