    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_104002.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:25.600\nThink about it this way: a spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:34.500\nA taste test tells you which food you like better.\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:45.600\nSo, a test is really just a tool.\nIt helps us gather information, measure skills, or understand qualities.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:56.000\nWe use tests all the time, without even realizing it!\nThey help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\nHopefully, that makes testing a little less\u2026 well, test-y!\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:01.000\nThanks for watching.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
