    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to get an answer. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:34.800\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even trying a new recipe is like a test \u2013 you're testing if you'll like the taste!\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:45.200\nThe important thing to remember is that tests help us learn and understand things better. They show us what we know, and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:51.700\nSo, don't be afraid of tests! See them as a chance to grow and learn something new.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
