    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nEver wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:11.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:18.000\nIt's how we gather information, whether it's about you, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like this: A doctor gives you a physical test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:26.200\nOr maybe you take a quiz in school to test your knowledge on a subject.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:27.800\nSee? Finding something out.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:32.400\nHere's another example: A company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:36.300\nThey're testing its durability and safety.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:41.200\nSo, a test is just a process used to evaluate something.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:45.800\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:47.500\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:51.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
