    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.400\nIt\u2019s a method for gathering information or checking if something is working correctly.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a medical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:44.400\nOr, maybe you take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:54.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing a recipe! So, tests can be different things, but they all share the same goal: to help us learn something new, confirm something we already know, or identify any problems. In short, a test helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
