    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_104508.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it as an experiment, but not always in a science lab. For example, you might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.600\nIf it comes out clean, the test is successful! Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:43.800\nThe test helps you, and your teacher, understand what you've learned. Tests can be big or small, simple or complicated.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:51.700\nBut the main idea is always the same: to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:58.400\nSo, tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
