    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore the concept of a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests to see if something is working correctly, or to learn more about it.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:33.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:46.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing to see if your ingredients and recipe will create something delicious.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:55.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information and learning something new. It helps us understand the world around us and make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
