    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.900\nA test is simply a way to check something, or find out more about it. Think of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see how it works.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:28.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:41.100\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes the best!\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:50.700\nScientists also use tests, like testing a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something. It helps us understand things better, whether it\u2019s knowing how to spell, picking a yummy treat, or making sure medicines are safe. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
