    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_104927.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:15.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like checking if you understand a lesson, or making sure a toy is safe to play with.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:34.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a quiz in school, that's a test! Or, a doctor might run some blood work, that's also a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:38.800\nAnother example?\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:44.200\nImagine you're baking cookies. Tasting one to make sure it's delicious? Yep, that's a test too!\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:59.700\nSo remember, a test is just a method for finding out information. Whether it's checking your knowledge, your health, or even the taste of your cookies, tests help us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:03.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
