    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: imagine you\u2019re learning to ride a bike. A test would be seeing if you can ride without falling over.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:37.400\nTests can come in many forms, like quizzes in school, or even a doctor checking your reflexes.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:45.000\nThey all have the same goal: to measure your understanding or ability.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:54.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your words. A math test sees if you can solve problems. And a driving test makes sure you can operate a car safely.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to see what you've learned or what you can do. It helps you and others understand your progress. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
