    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're tackling a fundamental concept: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, right? We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:28.100\nIt\u2019s a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. Think about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:36.800\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject. Even trying a new recipe is a test!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:44.900\nYou're testing if you like the taste. So, tests are all about gathering information and seeing where you stand.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:57.700\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. They can be formal, like a final exam, or informal, like asking a friend for their opinion.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:03.900\nIn short, a test is just a way to measure something. Pretty simple, right?\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:07.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
