    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.320 --> 00:05.720\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.720 --> 00:15.020\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:15.020 --> 00:18.720\nWe use tests all the time! Think about it.\n\n00:18.720 --> 00:25.620\nA doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. A baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:25.620 --> 00:36.220\nAnd, of course, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned! Each of these tests helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:36.220 --> 00:47.020\nWe use them to check something, to prove something, or just to learn something new. So, a test is really just a simple way to get answers.\n\n00:47.020 --> 00:50.320\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
