    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a lightbulb works, you screw it in and flip the switch. That's a test!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:28.700\nOr, if you want to know if a cake is done, you stick a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:37.100\nTests help us make sure things are accurate and reliable. From checking if your car is safe to drive, to making sure your computer software is working properly, tests are everywhere.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:46.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. Easy, right?\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
