    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.900\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health, or a baker tastes the cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:31.400\nIn many areas, like science or school, tests help us understand if something works, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:42.800\nFor example, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people. Or, your teacher might give you a quiz to test your understanding of a lesson.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:48.700\nThese tests give us information. They help us make decisions and learn more.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:59.100\nSo, whether it's a taste test, a medical test, or a school test, remember it's all about checking and understanding something better.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:04.900\nThat's the basics of tests! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
