    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_110938.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works. Think of it like checking if a cake is done by sticking a fork in it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:29.000\nThe main idea behind a test is to get information. It helps us understand if we've learned something new, or if a product is ready to be used.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:39.000\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school. That tells your teacher, and you, how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:48.300\nOr, a company might test a new phone to make sure it doesn\u2019t break easily.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:55.700\nSo, tests help us learn and improve. They give us important information to make better choices. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
