    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_111054.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:08.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:19.800\nA test is basically a way to check if something works, or if you know something.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:33.200\nOr, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand what you've been learning in class.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:38.600\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:44.400\nSometimes it's a simple yes or no question.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:50.400\nOther times, it might be a longer exam with lots of different questions.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:53.800\nFor example, a cookie recipe might be tested to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.100\nOr, a new medicine is tested to make sure it's safe and helpful.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information or check if something is working properly.\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:03.300\nIt helps us learn and improve things!\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:06.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
