    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:23.200\nIt's like asking a question and then trying to get the answer.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:31.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:34.000\nThink about it:\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:36.600\nWhen you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:39.200\nOr, if your phone isn't working,\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:41.800\nyou might try turning it off and on again to test if that fixes the problem.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:44.400\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:53.300\nSo, a test helps us understand something, confirm an idea, or see if something works the way it should.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:59.800\nWhether it's a school exam or just checking if the milk is still good, tests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:03.400\nTo recap, a test is just a method for getting information.\n\n01:03.400 --> 01:05.100\nIt's all about asking questions and finding the answers!\n\n01:05.100 --> 01:06.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
