    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_111620.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking. You do a test \u2013 you poke them with a toothpick.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:28.400\nIf it comes out clean, they pass the test!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:33.900\nTests are used everywhere! Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:41.100\nTeachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:55.000\nAnd even you use tests every day without realizing it. For example, when you try a new food, you're testing if you like it!\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:02.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly. That's the basic idea behind a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
