    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_111829.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:18.000\nIn simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:28.900\nWhether it's checking if you know the answers to a quiz, or seeing if your car can handle a bumpy road, it's all about gathering information.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:36.100\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:47.800\nThe test gives you a score, which tells you how good you are at spelling. Or, imagine a doctor testing your vision.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:53.800\nThey ask you to read letters to see how well you can see.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.400\nSo, tests help us understand something better by giving us results.\n```"
