    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_111951.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nNow, you've probably heard the word \"test\" used in lots of ways, but at its core, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.100\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether that's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even how well something works.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:35.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:47.400\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes better. And a car test drive lets you see if you like the way a car handles.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.100\nSo, in each of these examples, we're using a test to gather information and make a decision. Tests are all about finding answers!\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:02.000\nTo recap, a test is a procedure to evaluate something. They help us learn and make informed choices. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
