    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like this: a test helps us measure knowledge, skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you can spell words. A fitness test shows how physically fit you are.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:42.900\nAnd a taste test can help decide which ice cream flavor is the best! So, tests aren't just about getting a grade.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:53.800\nThey're about learning where you're strong, and where you might need a little more practice. They help us understand ourselves and the world around us better.\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:00.300\nTo sum it up, a test is a method for evaluating knowledge, skills, or performance.\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:03.100\nIt gives us information to help us improve.\n\n01:03.100 --> 01:06.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
