    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:21.600\nIt helps us find out if something works the way it should, or if something is true or false.\nThink about it like this: a taste test!\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:26.200\nYou taste a new cookie to see if it's delicious.\nThat's a test.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:32.600\nOr, maybe you're checking if a light bulb works by turning it on.\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.000\nWe use tests every day, even without realizing it.\nAnother example could be a spelling test in school.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:45.800\nIt checks if you know how to spell certain words correctly.\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:48.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something\nand see if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
