    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:21.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to measure or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, a product's quality, or even the speed of your internet connection.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:33.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, imagine a food critic testing a new dish at a restaurant to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:43.400\nEven your doctor uses tests, like blood tests, to check your health. So, a test is just a structured way to get information.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:53.700\nIt helps us understand something better by giving us data or results that we can then analyze. In short, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
