    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific right or wrong answer.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:32.000\nWe use tests all the time!\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:46.600\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you can balance.\nTests help us understand things better and see if we've learned something new.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:55.800\nSo, tests can be small and informal, like tasting batter, or big and official, like a school exam.\nThe important thing is they give us information.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:05.000\nThey show us what we know, what we don't, and what we need to work on.\nIn a nutshell, a test is just a way to check something and learn from the results.\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:05.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
