    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.800\nThink of a test as a way to see how well you know something.\nIt's like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:25.600\nBasically, a test is a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge or skills.\nIt could be a written exam, a practical demonstration, or even just a quick quiz.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:35.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you can spell words.\nA math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:48.200\nAnd a cooking test could see if you can follow a recipe correctly.\nSo, tests help you and your teachers understand what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:55.200\nRemember, they're just one tool to help you learn!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
