    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:24.200\nIt could be anything! A recipe test to see if your new cake recipe tastes good.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:32.300\nA medical test to see if you're healthy. Or even a school test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:36.200\nFor example, let's say you want to know if your plant needs water.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:46.600\nYou can test it! Stick your finger in the soil. If it feels dry, that's a test telling you the plant needs water.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:50.500\nAnother example: you want to know if the oven is hot enough to bake cookies.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.400\nYou can do a visual test and see if the indicator light is on.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:00.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:01.800\nIt's a question and an answer!\n\n01:01.800 --> 01:04.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
