    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_113339.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.200\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\nYou might think of tests as something you take in school, but in a broader sense, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.300\nIt's a process designed to see how something works, or if something is true.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works.\nYou screw it in and flip the switch.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:27.500\nOr maybe you want to know if a cake is done baking.\nYou stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:32.500\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nTests help us understand things better.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:38.900\nThey give us information we can use to make decisions.\nSo, a test is really just a simple way to ask a question and get an answer.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:44.900\nHopefully, this helps you understand what a test is all about!\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
