    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and then checking the answer.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it as a method for gathering information.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:28.900\nThere are all sorts of tests.\nYou might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\nOr a doctor might run tests to figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:38.900\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing to see if you like the taste!\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:46.400\nSo, a test is just a process.\nYou have a question, you perform a procedure, and then you get a result that helps answer that question.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:54.400\nIn short, tests help us learn and understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
