    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_113617.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test is really just a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to make sure it doesn't break easily. Or, when you learn something new in school, your teacher might give you a test to see how much you understand.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:35.900\nSo, let's say you're baking a cake. You might test the oven temperature to make sure it's hot enough.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:46.000\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, a test could be as simple as saying them all out loud. Tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.900\nThey show us what we're doing well and what we need to work on. Basically, a test is a check-up.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:59.600\nIt helps us see if things are on the right track. Remember that, and don't be afraid of tests!\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:03.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
