    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_113707.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:20.600\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in general, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to check the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: you test the temperature of your bath water to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:34.600\nOr, a chef might test a sauce to see if it needs more salt. These are all simple tests!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:45.300\nTests can be formal, like a doctor running a blood test to check your health, or informal, like shaking a can of spray paint to see if it's empty.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:54.100\nThe key is that you're trying to get information. Basically, you're asking a question and using the test to find the answer.\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:03.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
