    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:05.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:08.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:12.800\nIt's like an experiment, but not always in a science lab.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:16.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:19.200\nThink about it: A doctor asks you questions to test your memory.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:23.000\nA teacher gives you a quiz to test your knowledge.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:26.400\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you like it!\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:29.000\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:34.000\nFor example, if you get a low score on a quiz, you know what you need to study more.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:37.900\nIf your new recipe doesn't taste great, you know what to change next time.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:42.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:47.700\nIt helps us understand things better and make smarter choices.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:50.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
