    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:19.700\nA test, simply put, is a way to check something. It helps us find out if something works, if something is true, or even just to see what we know.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:31.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:37.600\nA teacher uses tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:49.000\nSo, a test involves a specific process or set of questions designed to get some kind of result.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:59.800\nLet\u2019s say you\u2019re baking a cake. The recipe is the \"test\" for making a delicious cake. If you follow the steps, you expect a good result.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:03.100\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is broken, you screw it into a lamp.\n\n01:03.100 --> 01:06.800\nIf it lights up, the lightbulb passes the test!\n\n01:06.800 --> 01:10.100\nBasically, tests are all around us, helping us learn and understand the world better.\n\n01:10.100 --> 01:13.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
