    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out what you know or how well you can do something. Think of it like checking your understanding.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:29.700\nThe main idea is to present you with questions or tasks, and your answers show what you've learned. These questions can be multiple choice, true or false, or even problems you have to solve.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:39.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. A math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:48.100\nEven trying a new recipe is a test \u2013 you're testing if you can follow the instructions and make something delicious!\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:58.100\nSo, to recap: a test helps measure your knowledge or ability. It uses questions or tasks to see what you understand.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:04.800\nAnd they come in all sorts of forms! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
