    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how much you know about something.\nThink of it like a measuring tool for your brain!\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:26.700\nBasically, a test presents you with questions or tasks, and your answers show what you\u2019ve learned.\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:35.700\nA math test shows how good you are at solving math problems.\nTests can be written, like on paper, or even online.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:45.500\nThey can also be practical, like showing someone how to bake a cake.\nThe goal is always the same: to see what you understand.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:56.600\nSo, to recap: A test is a way of measuring knowledge, it uses questions or tasks, and helps you and others see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
