    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_114655.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:18.600\nToday we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:30.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:41.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate or measure a skill, knowledge, or performance.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:50.200\nThink of it like this: a baking test tells you if a cake is done.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:57.100\nYou stick a toothpick in, and if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:04.000\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n01:04.000 --> 01:10.900\nThey check your blood, your heart, all sorts of things.\n\n01:10.900 --> 01:17.800\nSo, tests aren't just about school.\n\n01:17.800 --> 01:24.700\nThey're used everywhere to help us understand and learn.\n\n01:24.700 --> 01:31.600\nThey help us see where we're at and what we need to work on.\n\n01:31.600 --> 01:43.000\nTo recap, a test is a way to measure something, using a specific procedure to get results.\n\n01:43.000 --> 01:46.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
