    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_114827.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.100\nNow, you've probably taken a lot of tests in school, but in general, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:27.100\nWe use tests to check if something is working properly, or to see if we understand something new. Think about it like this: a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:33.500\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:41.400\nSee? Tests are everywhere! They help us learn and make sure things are going the way they should.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:47.200\nSo, tests help us measure, understand, and improve things all around us.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:50.800\nPretty cool, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
