    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_114914.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be a quiz in school, a medical exam, or even checking if your cookies are done baking!\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:26.000\nBasically, you're giving something a try to see what happens. Think of it like this: you're testing your knowledge when you take a spelling test.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.600\nOr, you're testing the temperature of the water before you jump in the pool.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:36.800\nAnother example? A taste test! You're testing the flavor of something new.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:50.900\nTests help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us. So, next time you hear the word \"test\", remember it's just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:56.100\nIn short, a test is an investigation. It's an experiment. It gives you information.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
