    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey there, and welcome! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. It could be about you, about a product, or even about an idea.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:24.500\nBasically, you're trying to get information. Think about it: a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:32.100\nA taste test tells you which food tastes better. And a medical test can tell you if you're feeling under the weather.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:39.700\nSo, tests help us learn, compare, and understand things better. They give us useful data.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:49.200\nRemember, a test is just a tool for gathering information. Tests can be big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:59.500\nBut no matter the size or type, they all have the same goal: to get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
