    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.600\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:25.800\nThe main idea behind a test is to gather information. We want to learn something!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:37.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or, if you\u2019re baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:45.400\nAnother example: doctors use tests to check your health, like taking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:57.200\nSo, tests help us understand things better and make decisions based on what we find out. Basically, a test is an action taken to learn about something.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:07.100\nIt's a question, an experiment, or an observation that gives us information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
