    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:20.300\nIt's a process for checking or evaluating something to see if it meets a certain standard or requirement.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:29.700\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:39.100\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check if you're healthy. Tests help us understand more about the world around us and even about ourselves.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:50.600\nThey can be used to measure knowledge, abilities, or even preferences. So, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out!\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
