    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE\nAll subtitles are timed to match the narration.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:01.000 --> 00:05.000\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:07.500\nA test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.000\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:18.000\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:20.000\nThat's one kind!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:24.000\nBut tests aren't just about health.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:29.000\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:33.000\nOr imagine baking a cake.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:36.500\nYou might taste it \u2013 that's a test \u2013 to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:42.000\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's our own health, our knowledge, or even the flavor of a cake!\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:48.000\nIn short, a test is an experiment or procedure designed to answer a question or evaluate something.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.000\nHopefully, that helps you understand what a test is.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
