    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.100\nWhat are they and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:21.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It helps us understand if something is working properly, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:29.400\nThink about a spelling test at school. It checks if you know how to spell different words.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:37.800\nOr imagine testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:47.800\nWe can even test a recipe to see if it tastes good! So, tests help us find out information and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:50.900\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same basic goal: to check something.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:54.500\nIn a nutshell, tests are a way to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
