    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_115706.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to check your overall health.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:32.400\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean \u2013 that's a test to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:39.500\nAnother example is a spelling quiz at school, it's a test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:50.300\nSo, a test helps us understand things better and make sure everything's running smoothly. Basically, testing is all about learning and improving!\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
