    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey there, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.200\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:23.600\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:32.600\nIt's like a question you ask to see what someone knows, or how something works.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:36.500\nThink about it like this: A spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:40.400\nOr, if you bake a cake, you test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:42.300\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:43.200\nSuccess!\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:46.900\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:49.300\nThey give us information that we can use to make better decisions.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:51.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and check something out.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:53.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
