    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.100\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt\u2019s how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is cooked, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:33.100\nOr, if you want to know if your friend knows the answer to a question, you ask them.\nThat's another kind of test.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:45.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nFrom simple quizzes in school to big experiments in science, they all help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:55.900\nBasically, we use tests to gather information and make decisions.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
