    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_115957.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be about you, about a product, or even about an idea.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:29.700\nWe use tests all the time. In school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:38.900\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. And scientists use tests to see if a new medicine works.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:50.800\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and answer a question. It helps us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:58.200\nUltimately, tests are all about finding answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
