    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:18.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it into the lamp.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:25.500\nThat\u2019s a test! Tests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:32.300\nYour doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A baker might test a cake to see if it's done.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:45.600\nAnd in school, you take tests to show what you've learned. So, a test helps us understand the quality, performance, or knowledge about something.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:54.400\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if your soup needs more salt. Or, a quiz can test your understanding of a book.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:00.800\nSo remember, a test is just a way to find things out.\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:04.400\nBasically, it's a method of evaluation.\n\n01:04.400 --> 01:06.800\nI hope this clears things up!\n\n01:06.800 --> 01:09.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
