    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.400\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:24.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, when you try a new recipe, you're essentially testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.700\nOr, if you try to open a door, you're testing if it's unlocked. Tests help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:39.400\nImagine a doctor giving you a checkup. They're running tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:50.600\nOr a teacher giving a quiz, they're testing what you\u2019ve learned. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:59.600\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all serve the same purpose: to help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:03.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
