    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or works the way we expect it to.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:26.300\nThink about it like this: when you\u2019re baking a cake, you might taste the batter. That's a mini-test to see if you need more sugar!\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:35.500\nOr, if you're trying to fix a toy, you might try different things until it works again. Each attempt is a little test.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:42.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Sometimes they're formal, like a quiz at school. Other times, they're informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:52.500\nSo, a test is just a way to learn and confirm things. It's how we explore and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:60.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "b083034d-9f5b-48a0-9ae8-58863e7dae01": {
