    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:26.300\nTests help us understand how well we know something, or how well something works. For example, a spelling test shows how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:33.600\nOr, imagine a toy car. We might test it by pushing it down a ramp to see how far it goes. That's a test too!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:44.000\nOther examples include testing a recipe to see if it tastes good, or even a doctor giving you a check-up to test your health.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:57.200\nSo, to recap: a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. They come in all shapes and sizes, and help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
