    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a structured way. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.900\nA recipe test checks if a new dish tastes good. Or, a medical test can help doctors figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:43.900\nThe goal is always to get information. So, a test can be anything from a quiz at school to trying out a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:56.300\nThe key is that it\u2019s designed to give you clear results about something you want to know. In short, tests help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
