    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:22.600\nThat's a test! You're checking to see if the lightbulb passes the test of working.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.300\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time. A doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:37.700\nA chef tastes the soup to test if it needs more salt. Even playing a video game is a test of your skills!\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:50.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a process to determine if something meets a certain requirement or standard. It helps us learn more and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.600\nTests are all around us!\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
