    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.400\nIt's a process designed to give us information. Think about it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.000\nThat's a test! Or, if you want to know if you understand a new word, you might try using it in a sentence.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:41.100\nAnother test! Tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:48.700\nThey all have the same basic purpose: to gather data and help us make decisions.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:52.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:55.900\nIt's a simple tool we use every day.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
