    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, abilities, or even the quality of something.\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a chef might taste the soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.200\nIn school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand the lessons.\nThey can be in different forms, like multiple choice, short answer questions, or even projects.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:46.400\nSo, tests are everywhere!\nThey help us gather information and make decisions.\nThey\u2019re a fundamental way to learn and improve.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:53.400\nRemember, tests aren\u2019t scary, they're just tools!\n\n00:53.400 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
