    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE\nAll subtitles are timed to match the audio and slide durations.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.700\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer back. Tests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if the water is hot before you get in the shower.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.900\nThe goal is always the same: to gather information.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:38.700\nThink about baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar. Or, imagine you're trying to figure out why your bike isn't working.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:50.100\nYou might test the brakes, then the tires, until you find the problem. So, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:60.900\nIt's a question, a check, an experiment \u2013 anything that helps you understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
