    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_123233.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:25.700\nIt helps us find out if something works correctly, or if it meets certain standards. Think of it like this: You might test a new recipe by cooking it and tasting it to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:35.400\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. In schools, tests help teachers understand what you've learned in class.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:48.700\nAnd in science, tests are used to experiment and see if a hypothesis is correct. So, a test is just a way of gathering information and making sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:56.700\nHopefully, this helps you understand the basics of testing. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
