    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. It's like asking questions to see what you know, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it as a tool for measuring. For example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:34.100\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\nEven a doctor using a thermometer to check your temperature is performing a kind of test!\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:48.100\nThey're gathering information to understand your health.\nSo, a test is just a way to get information about something, whether it's your knowledge, the flavor of a cookie, or your body temperature.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:54.700\nIt's a simple tool for finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
