    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_123507.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:06.300\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:10.600\nIt helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:10.600 --> 00:15.200\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:18.200\nThat's a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:23.300\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter before you bake it\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:26.400\n\u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:31.100\nTests aren't just for school or baking, though.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:34.600\nEngineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:39.100\nDoctors run medical tests to figure out what's wrong when you're sick.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:46.000\nSo, a test is just a way of getting information and checking on things.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.300\nIt's a tool we use every day to learn and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
