    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:17.000\nNow, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is true, or how good something is.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: You have a cake recipe, and you want to know if it works. You bake the cake \u2013 that's the test! You taste it \u2013 that's the result.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:30.900\nAnother example? Let's say you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:37.300\nThe \"test\" is actually trying to ride! If you stay upright and pedal, you're passing the test.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:44.700\nIf you fall, you learn something and try again. So, to recap:\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:58.400\nA test is a way to check something, whether it's a recipe, a skill, or even an idea. It gives you information and helps you learn and improve.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
