    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more. For example, if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n00:26.400 --> 00:32.100\nThat's a test! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is probably ready.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:37.800\nOr, think about spelling tests in school. They help your teacher see if you understand how to spell certain words.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:46.200\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. They can be quick and easy, like that toothpick test, or they can be longer and more detailed.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:56.300\nThe important thing is that they give us information. So, a test is just a method for gathering information or checking something.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.800\nHopefully, that makes sense!\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
