    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.100\nWhat is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:19.500\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:24.000\nto see what we've learned, how well something works, or even just to check if something is true.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:33.900\nThink about it: you might take a quiz at school \u2013 that's a test to see what you remember from class. Or, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:39.900\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:43.600\nEven checking if a light bulb works by flipping the switch is a kind of test!\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:51.000\nSo, tests can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all have the same purpose: to give us information.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:53.900\nThey help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "70449304-11f9-4467-adf0-0963e7b8a63a": {
    "id": "70449304-11f9-4467-adf0-0963e7b8a63a",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:38:58.743599",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T12:44:05.499398",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_124405.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_124405.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.700\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in a broader sense, a test is simply a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like this: If you bake a cake, you might test it by poking it with a toothpick to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:34.700\nThat's a test! Or, if you build a birdhouse, you might test it by putting it outside and seeing if birds actually use it.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:48.000\nSo, tests help us learn if our assumptions are correct. They can be formal, like a science experiment, or informal, like checking the temperature of your bathwater.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:56.600\nWhether it's checking if a lightbulb turns on, or seeing if your dog knows a new trick, you're performing a test.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:05.200\nBasically, a test is any process you use to evaluate something. It's all about finding out if things are working as expected!\n\n01:05.200 --> 01:09.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "ce06d25f-6c13-48f8-bbb3-6db8222e5df4": {
    "id": "ce06d25f-6c13-48f8-bbb3-6db8222e5df4",
