    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.400\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in general, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.600\nIt\u2019s a process to see if something works, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:33.000\nThink of it like this: a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:37.800\nOr, a doctor might give you a quick eye exam to test your vision.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:42.600\nSee? Tests are everywhere! They help us understand things better.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:48.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and see if it\u2019s working correctly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
