    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.800\nIt could be about your knowledge, like a school test, or about something else entirely.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:29.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done. You can test it by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:37.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! That's a test!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:43.100\nOr, maybe you want to know if your toy car needs new batteries.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:51.200\nYou put the batteries in and see if it moves. If it doesn\u2019t, that's a test telling you it's time for new ones.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.800\nSo, a test is just a way of checking something to see if it's true or working correctly.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:57.300\nIt helps us learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
