    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.300\nIt's how we gather information about something, whether it\u2019s your knowledge, a product's quality, or even how well a new medicine works.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:32.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks what words you know. A taste test helps determine if a new cookie recipe is delicious.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:40.200\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:50.400\nSo, tests are everywhere! They help us learn, improve things, and make important decisions.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:55.900\nRemember, a test is just a tool to gather information. It's a way to learn more. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
