    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.100\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You use a toothpick \u2013 that's your test!\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:31.700\nYou poke the cake, and if the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test and is ready. Another example is a spelling test.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:41.600\nIt helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words. Or maybe a taste test to see which juice you like better, apple or orange.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:51.800\nIn all these cases, you're doing something to get an answer. So, a test is simply a way to check something and learn more about it.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:56.300\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
