    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:17.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:24.700\nWe use tests all the time! Your doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:31.700\nYour teacher gives you a quiz to see what you've learned.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:42.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 are the ingredients mixed correctly? Will it taste good?\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:49.200\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's our own health, how well we're learning, or even if a recipe works.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.700\nThey give us information we can use. In short, a test is a method of evaluation.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.000\nThat's the basic idea behind tests. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
