    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:21.100\nThink about it like this: a chef tastes a soup to see if it needs more salt. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:27.400\nOr maybe you try on a pair of shoes to see if they fit. That\u2019s testing the shoe size.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:35.600\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand a topic. It's just a way of checking your knowledge.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:45.800\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even writing an essay. So, remember, a test is just a check-up.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:56.300\nIt helps us see if something is working correctly or if we understand something well. Don't be nervous, just think of it as a chance to show what you know!\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
