    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:18.000\nThink of a test as a way to check what you know or what something can do. It's like a little experiment to see if you've learned something or if something works the way it should.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:25.000\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see if you know how to spell different words. Or, a baker might test a new cake recipe to see if it tastes good and rises properly.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:32.100\nSee? It's all about checking and learning.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:40.600\nSo, tests help us understand what we've learned and help us make things better. They give us information.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:48.400\nIn short, a test is a way to evaluate knowledge, skills or performance.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:52.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
