    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:21.900\nIt helps us learn about something we're curious about. Think of it like this: You might test if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:26.500\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:38.300\nSee? It's all about getting information. Tests can be simple, like tasting soup to see if it needs more salt, or more complex, like a school exam.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:51.200\nBut the basic idea is the same: you do something, observe the result, and learn from it. So, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:57.600\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
