    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:06.500\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out information.\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:10.800\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you an answer about something specific.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:13.600\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:17.800\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:22.200\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. See? It's about gathering information.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:27.700\nAnother common example is a taste test! Maybe you\u2019re trying two different types of cookies and deciding which one you like better.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:29.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:31.500\nYou're testing your preference.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:39.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool used to discover something, whether it\u2019s knowledge, health, or even just your favorite cookie.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:41.500\nIt's all about finding answers.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:44.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
