    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:18.700\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:27.000\nThink about it this way: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. That's a test!\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:36.900\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each time you try, you're kind of testing your balance.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:49.000\nTests aren't just in school. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're strong.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:56.400\nSo, a test is just a way to find out information about something. It helps us learn and make sure things are working properly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
