    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_132648.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:19.400\nNow, a test, in the simplest terms, is just a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:26.200\nThink about it like this: your teacher might give you a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:36.100\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test its flavor. Doctors use tests to check your health, like a blood test or an eye exam.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:45.000\nThe goal of a test is to give us some information. It helps us understand where we're at, and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:55.400\nSo, whether it's a math quiz, a cooking competition, or a medical checkup, a test is all about gathering information.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:01.100\nIn short, tests help us measure, evaluate, and understand things better.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
