    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:18.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like a snapshot of your skills at a particular moment.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:37.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a written test in school, or maybe a physical test like running a race.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:42.900\nEven trying a new recipe is kind of a test to see if you can cook!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:54.300\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words. A math test shows how well you can solve equations.\n\n00:54.300 --> 01:04.100\nAnd that recipe? Well, the taste will tell you how well you followed the instructions! So, remember, a test is simply a tool to measure knowledge or ability.\n```"
