    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:09.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:17.100\nIt's a process we use to check, measure, or evaluate something.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:27.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:37.300\nA taste test lets you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. Even checking if the water is hot before you shower is a kind of test!\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:50.000\nSo, tests help us learn things, make decisions, or see if something is working the way it should. They're everywhere in our lives, helping us understand the world a little better.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:52.900\nThat's the basic idea of what a test is!\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
