    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:28.800\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate or measure knowledge, ability, or performance. Think of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy, or a teacher uses a test to see how well you've learned something.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:39.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes! You might take a multiple-choice test in school, or a taste test to see which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:45.600\nEven a simple experiment can be a test! The key is that you're trying to get some information.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:59.700\nSo, to recap, a test helps us learn something by measuring or evaluating. Whether it's checking your spelling or checking your temperature, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:03.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
