    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:09.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:09.800 --> 00:16.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready, so you poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:24.600\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material. In science, tests can tell you if a chemical reaction worked.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:30.100\nEven your doctor runs tests to see if you're healthy. See, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:37.000\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a test. Checking your phone's battery level is also a kind of test.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:46.200\nThey all give you information. So, to recap, a test is a way to find out information about something by examining or evaluating it.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:51.500\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
