    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:18.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:25.500\nSo, you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test! The toothpick tells you if the inside is still gooey or if it's cooked through.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.600\nTests aren't just for cakes though. Doctors use tests to check your health, like taking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:43.600\nAnd in school, tests help show what you've learned. Basically, a test is just a tool that helps us get information.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:46.700\nWe use them all the time to learn and understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
