    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_134514.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.300\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:18.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:28.500\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something works, or how much of something there is.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:34.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:41.300\nOr, a taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you like best!\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:54.000\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Scientists use tests to see if their experiments work. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions. They can be simple or complex, but the main goal is always the same: to gather information. Remember, a test helps us find things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
