    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:22.300\nIt's really just a method of checking something, or evaluating something.\nThink about it like this: a chef tastes a soup \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:30.300\nThey're testing if it has enough salt.\nOr, imagine you're trying to turn on a light switch and the light doesn't come on.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:33.400\nYou're testing if the lightbulb works.\nSee?\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:43.100\nSo, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\nIt can be as simple as tasting soup, or as complex as a medical exam.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:51.700\nThe main idea is to check something and learn from the result.\nIn short, tests are everywhere, helping us understand the world around us.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
