    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:15.200\nNow, you might be thinking about school tests, but a test, in general, is just a way to check if something is working correctly, or to find out more information about it.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like this: you test a lightbulb to see if it turns on.\nOr, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:29.400\nThe idea is to learn something by putting something to the test.\nFor example, a baker might test a new recipe by baking a small batch first.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:36.000\nA car manufacturer tests new cars to make sure they're safe.\nIt's all about figuring things out!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:46.600\nSo, in short, a test is a process used to evaluate or examine something.\nIt helps us understand if something is working as it should, or gives us new data.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:52.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
