    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.900\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:24.900\nIt helps us find out if something is working as it should, or if it's meeting certain standards.\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.300\nEven baking a cake involves a test!\nYou check if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\nIf it comes out clean, your cake passed the test!\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:40.900\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:53.200\nThey're a fundamental part of figuring things out.\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:60.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
