    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_135601.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.700\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:17.400\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:25.600\nIt helps us understand if something works, if it's true, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:33.500\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if your cake is baked, you do a test!\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:41.700\nYou stick a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:55.400\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. It helps the teacher see if you understand how to spell certain words. If you spell them correctly, you pass!\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.400\nSo, tests are just tools we use to gather information and make sure things are as they should be.\n```"
