    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_135953.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know or how well you can do something. Think of it like a check-up for your brain.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:27.500\nThe main idea behind a test is to measure your understanding. It could be about anything, from math problems to spelling words, or even your ability to follow instructions.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:34.500\nIt's all about finding out what you've learned. For example, a pop quiz in class is a quick test.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:45.900\nA driver's license exam is a test to make sure you can drive safely. Even trying out a new recipe can be seen as a test to see if you can bake a delicious cake.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:56.900\nSo, to sum it up, a test is a tool to measure knowledge or ability. It helps you and others understand what you know and where you might need to learn more.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
