    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_140124.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process or a procedure designed to evaluate or measure something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick. Or, a doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:41.100\nTests give us information! There are all sorts of tests, from simple ones like tasting food to see if it needs more salt, to more complex ones like taking a math exam to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:50.700\nThe important thing is that a test helps us understand something better. So, a test is a way to gather information and learn!\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
