    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_140212.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.120 --> 00:01.820\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.820 --> 00:05.220\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.220 --> 00:07.620\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.620 --> 00:9.920\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:09.920 --> 00:15.220\nWe use tests all the time, without even realizing it.\n\n00:15.220 --> 00:20.620\nThink about it: When you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:20.620 --> 00:25.520\nOr, when you check if a light bulb works, you're testing if it's still good.\n\n00:25.520 --> 00:29.120\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:29.120 --> 00:36.020\nFor example, a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:36.020 --> 00:41.120\nA math test shows if you understand how to solve problems.\n\n00:41.120 --> 00:44.920\nTests help us learn and improve!\n\n00:44.920 --> 00:52.020\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see how things are working.\n\n00:52.020 --> 00:58.720\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
