    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:18.500\nThink of it like an experiment, but with a specific question in mind.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:30.300\nWe use tests all the time. For example, when you try a new recipe, that's a test to see if you like it! Or, if you push a door to see if it's locked, you're testing the door.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:43.300\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:54.600\nThe important thing is that you're gathering information to answer a question. So, a test is just a way to learn more about something by trying it out.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:00.700\nTo recap, tests help us discover new things by providing data. They can be formal or informal. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
