    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:04.900\nToday we're diving into something called a \"Test.\"\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:09.700\nNow, in the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:14.400\nIt could be checking if something works, seeing how good you are at something, or even figuring out what you think about something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:18.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:22.600\nYou screw it in and flip the switch \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:27.100\nOr when you take a spelling quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:31.400\nEven trying a new flavor of ice cream is a test \u2013 you're testing if you like it!\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:38.800\nSo, basically, a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already thought.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:46.800\nIt\u2019s about gathering information and making decisions based on that information.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:48.500\nHopefully, that clears things up!\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
