    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nOkay, so you're wondering what a test actually is, right?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:09.000\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:17.000\nWe use them all the time, even without realizing it.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:22.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows what words you know how to spell.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:27.500\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:33.500\nAnd when you try to turn on a light switch, that's a test to see if the lightbulb works!\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:40.000\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:46.500\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:55.000\nThe key thing is that they give us data to understand something better.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
