    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.500\nNow, you might be thinking about school exams, but in general, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly or meeting a certain standard.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake and taste it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.300\nYou're checking if it tastes good.\nOr, if you build a tower out of blocks, you might gently push it to test if it's stable.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:41.800\nTests help us find problems and fix them.\nIn computers, we use tests to make sure our programs are working the way they should.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:55.300\nFor example, we might test if a calculator app gives the right answer to simple math problems.\nSo, a test is just a way of checking something to see if it works or meets our expectations.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:01.700\nIt\u2019s a simple idea that\u2019s used everywhere!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
