    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:20.700\nTests can be used in lots of different ways. Maybe you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:29.800\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:35.700\nLet\u2019s say you want to know if a plant needs water. You could poke your finger in the soil.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:45.300\nIf it feels dry, that\u2019s a test that tells you the plant probably needs a drink. Another example is when you press a button on a toy.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:55.800\nThat's a test to see if the toy will make a sound. So, remember, a test is just a simple way to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:03.100\nIt's all about asking a question and finding the answer! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
