    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:24.300\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:36.200\nThink about it: When you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if you like the food. Or, when you check the weather forecast, you're testing to see if you need an umbrella.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:40.200\nIn school, tests help us see how well we understand what we've learned.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:51.400\nSo, tests aren't scary! They're just a tool. They help us learn more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:54.600\nRemember, every test, big or small, gives us valuable information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
