    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_141824.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like an experiment, but focused on getting a specific answer.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:34.200\nWe use tests all the time! Maybe your doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or a teacher gives you a quiz to check if you understood the lesson.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:47.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the recipe works! Tests can involve questions, like on a school exam. Or they can involve observing something, like watching how a plant grows in different kinds of soil.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:59.200\nThe key is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspected.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.400\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something is true or works as expected.\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:05.900\nIt\u2019s a tool for learning and understanding the world around us!\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:09.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
