    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.000\nIn simple terms, a test is really just a way to find out something. It helps us check if something is working correctly, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:32.500\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good before you bake the whole thing!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:42.200\nTests are everywhere, from checking if your car's brakes work, to seeing if you remembered to turn off the lights before you left the house.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:57.400\nBasically, a test is a question or a procedure designed to give you an answer or a result. So, remember, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
