    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nA test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: it's a snapshot of your current skills or understanding.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:33.600\nTests come in lots of different forms. You might have a quiz at school, or a driving test to get your license. Even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test, to see if you can make it taste good!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:42.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test checks if you can solve problems.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:49.700\nAnd that recipe test? It checks if you can follow the instructions and create something delicious!\n\n00:49.700 --> 01:02.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure your knowledge or ability in a specific area. It helps you see what you already know and what you might need to learn more about.\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:05.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
