    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T14:26:36.305237",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_142636.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_142636.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process that helps us understand if something is working as expected, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:23.600\nThink about it like this: a baking test.\nYou taste a cake to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:27.300\nThat\u2019s a test!\nOr, a science test.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:32.000\nYou mix chemicals to see what happens.\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:46.600\nTests are all around us.\nDoctors use tests to check your health, teachers use tests to see what you've learned, and even you use tests every day, like testing if your shoes are tied tight enough.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:56.100\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information through observation or action.\nIt helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
