    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_142722.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:16.500\nWe use them all the time!\nThink about it.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:24.900\nYour doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA chef tastes food to test if it needs more salt.\nEven trying out a new video game is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:32.200\nTests help us understand things better.\nThey give us information we can use to make decisions.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:42.700\nFor example, a test in school helps your teacher understand what you've learned.\nOr a test drive of a car helps you decide if it's the right one for you.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:54.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\nTests are everywhere, helping us understand the world around us!\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
