    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.500\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a way to check your understanding.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:26.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, when you try a new recipe, tasting it is a kind of test to see if it's good.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:36.200\nOr, when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you learned the material. Tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:43.500\nA driving test makes sure you're safe on the road.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:54.800\nA spelling test shows you which words you need to practice. So, remember, a test is just a method for checking something or gaining information.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.400\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
