    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.200\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:06.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:10.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:10.300 --> 00:12.700\nWe use tests every day, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:17.600\nThink about it: when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:21.000\nOr when you push a button on a remote, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:25.500\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:29.500\nThey might be multiple choice, true or false, or even writing an essay.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:33.200\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:36.300\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:40.400\nSo, a test is just a tool for learning and finding things out.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:44.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
