    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHello everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:13.500\nToday, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:22.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt\u2019s a method to evaluate or measure.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:35.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you\u2019ve learned.\nEven baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you taste it to see if it's good!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.400\nTests can be written questions, like quizzes, or they can be hands-on activities, like experiments.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:55.300\nThe goal is always to get information.\nWhether it\u2019s about your knowledge, your skills, or the properties of something else.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:58.800\nSo, a test is just a process for gathering information and checking something.\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
