    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_143231.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something!\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. The toothpick is the test! If it comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:29.500\nOr, imagine you want to know if it's raining outside. You could look out the window. Looking out the window is the test, and seeing rain means you've got a positive result.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:37.700\nTests are everywhere! They help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:45.100\nSo, a test is just a method to check something and get a result.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:53.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
