    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something, or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:36.800\nOr, maybe you have a remote control and you're not sure if the batteries are working. You can test it by pressing a button and seeing if the TV responds. That's testing!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:44.200\nSo, tests help us learn, make sure things are working, and give us information.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:51.700\nRemember, a test is just a way to check something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
