    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:20.900\nIt's a process we use to see if something is true, or to measure something.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:27.600\nThink about it like this: a cookie test! You bake a batch of cookies, and you taste one to see if the whole batch is good.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:34.300\nThat's a test! Or maybe you're testing if your car will start on a cold morning \u2013 you turn the key and see what happens.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:42.100\nTests can be simple, like checking if the lights are on, or more complicated, like a science experiment.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:53.700\nThe important thing is, you're trying to get an answer. So, a test is just a way of checking things or finding information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:58.700\nI hope that helps! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
