    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's a process to check if something is working, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:27.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:34.200\nA taste test checks if you like a certain food.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:41.300\nAnd a medical test checks if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:50.100\nSo, tests can be used for all sorts of things! They help us learn, they help us improve, and they help us make sure things are working the way they should. In short, a test is just a way to get information and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
