    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something, to see if it works like it's supposed to, or to see how much of something there is.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:33.100\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:43.300\nEven baking a cake involves a test! You test the batter with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:52.500\nSo, tests can be big or small, simple or complicated, but they all have the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.000\nThey help us understand something better, solve problems, and make sure things are working properly. Tests are everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
