  "823cec85-39a6-4492-8740-f52d38ae15c1": {
    "id": "823cec85-39a6-4492-8740-f52d38ae15c1",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:39:47.984201",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T14:41:11.496749",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_144111.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_144111.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.300\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is baked, you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:33.000\nThat's a test!\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\nThe cake's done.\nIf it's covered in batter, it needs more time.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:39.100\nTests aren't just for cakes though!\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:45.200\nTeachers use tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:53.000\nEven video games use tests to see if you can jump over obstacles.\n\n00:53.000 --> 01:01.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a method to gather information and make a decision based on the results.\nIt's a simple way to check something and see if it meets a certain standard.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "0bbb6710-ac3c-45d5-bc76-b3dc654392d0": {
    "id": "0bbb6710-ac3c-45d5-bc76-b3dc654392d0",
    "topic": "Test",
