    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_144608.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:28.300\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:32.200\nAnother example? A doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:38.800\nSee? Tests are all around us! They help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:49.200\nSo, remember: a test is a way of checking knowledge or performance. It helps us figure out what we know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
