    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_144930.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It's like a quick way to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:19.800\nThink about it like this: a taste test! You're testing the flavor of food.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:26.000\nOr, maybe a spelling test at school \u2013 you're testing your knowledge of spelling. See?\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.200\nTests are everywhere. Another example: If you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:42.300\nThat's a test to see if the cake is done! Tests help us learn and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:55.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something. Whether it's tasting food, taking a quiz, or even baking a cake, you're using tests every day.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
