    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_145025.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:23.100\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:30.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to check your health.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.700\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar.\nThat's also a kind of test.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:47.500\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:57.800\nThey all help measure how well you understand the material.\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding.\nIt helps us see where we are and where we might need a little extra help.\n\n00:57.800 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
