    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_145124.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:19.200\nNow, a test is basically a way to see what you know, or how well something works.\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are done baking \u2013 you might poke them with a toothpick, that's a test!\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:25.900\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\nBut tests aren't just for school.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:33.700\nScientists use tests to see if a medicine works, and engineers use tests to make sure a bridge is strong.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:41.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\nA taste test checks how good something tastes.\nAnd a strength test checks how much weight something can hold.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:53.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for checking knowledge, performance, or quality.\nThey come in all shapes and sizes and are used everywhere.\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:01.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
