    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.400\nIt's a process designed to check knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:35.300\nOr, a taste test checks the quality of a food. Maybe you even take a test to see if you're ready to move on to the next level in a video game.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:47.500\nSo, tests come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to provide information. They help us learn where we are strong and where we need to improve.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:55.000\nRemember, tests are just a tool to help us grow! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
