    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with questions or tasks. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:36.700\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt or pepper. Another example, a doctor might order a blood test to find out more about your health.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:45.100\nSo, a test helps us learn something new or confirm what we already know. It\u2019s a way to gather information!\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:53.200\nIn short, tests are all about figuring things out. They give us data and help us make informed decisions.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
