    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us learn more about an object, a skill, or even an idea.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:27.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:41.500\nA taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes best. Or, a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:49.500\nSo, a test can be a quiz, an experiment, or just a way of trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:57.100\nThe important thing is that it gives us information. We use tests every day, even without realizing it! They help us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.400\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
