    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_150001.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why they're so important.\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:17.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:27.900\nThe light bulb either lights up, or it doesn\u2019t. That's a test!\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:40.200\nWe use tests all the time. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:51.800\nEven cooking a new recipe involves testing \u2013 you taste the food to see if it needs more salt or pepper.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:57.100\nSo, tests help us learn, check things, and make sure everything is working correctly.\n\n00:57.100 --> 00:59.600\nThey give us information we can use to improve things.\n```"
