    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:18.500\nIt's like an experiment or a question you ask to see what happens or what the answer is.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:24.500\nThink about it. When you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:31.100\nThat's a test! Or maybe you take a quiz at school to test your knowledge on a subject.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:37.700\nThat's another kind of test. Another example is when you try a new key in a lock.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:47.300\nYou're testing to see if it opens the door! Tests can be formal, like a science experiment, or informal, like checking if your bath water is the right temperature.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:58.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out. It helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:02.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
