    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.700\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:25.900\nIt's like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests all the time to see if something is working correctly, or to learn more about it.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:38.500\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a test in school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:50.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good! So, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:57.200\nWe can use the results to improve things, fix problems, or just learn something new. That's the basic idea behind a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
