    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:05.100\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:09.100\nNow, in really simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.100 --> 00:12.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:16.400\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:21.200\nMaybe you take a test in school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:25.700\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:28.700\nEven baking a cake is kind of like a test!\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:32.300\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:37.100\nSo, let's say you want to know if your plant needs water.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:40.400\nYou can test it by sticking your finger in the soil.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:43.800\nIf it feels dry, that's your answer \u2013 it needs water!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:44.700\nSee?\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:45.600\nEasy test.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:50.100\nBasically, a test is a procedure designed to get information.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:53.500\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, or just figure things out.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:55.900\nRemember, a test is simply a question and an answer.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
