    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.400\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:28.600\nThink about it this way: a recipe is a test!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:38.300\nYou follow the steps, and the test is whether you get a delicious cake at the end.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:48.100\nOr, imagine checking if a lightbulb works. You flip the switch, and if it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:52.100\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:57.000\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly. So remember, a test is just a way to check something and get an answer. Tests are great! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
