    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to see what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:27.100\nIt helps us understand things better. For example, a school test helps your teacher see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:35.900\nOr, think about testing a new toy to make sure it's safe and fun to play with. They're checking to see if it works the way it should.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.300\nDoctors even use tests to see if you're healthy. So, remember, a test is simply a way of gathering information.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:53.300\nIt\u2019s a method for learning and understanding. It helps us make sure things are working correctly and that we're on the right track.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
