    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.400\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it as a question you're trying to answer through action.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:27.900\nBasically, you perform a set of actions, or answer a set of questions, and then you look at the results.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:33.600\nThis helps you understand more about the person or thing you're testing.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:39.300\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know how to spell.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:43.500\nOr, when you bake a cake, you're testing the recipe.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:48.900\nDoes it taste good? Did it rise properly? The results tell you if it worked.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:54.300\nSo, tests are all about figuring things out!\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.000\nThey involve doing something, and then looking at what happens to learn more.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.000\nWe use them every day, often without even realizing it.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:02.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
