    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:34.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:43.800\nOr, you might take a test at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:51.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test - you're testing if the recipe works!\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:55.000\nSo, tests can be anything from a simple experiment to a formal exam.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:02.700\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us learn and improve things.\n\n01:02.700 --> 01:06.900\nNow you know a little bit more about what tests are and why they're important.\n\n01:06.900 --> 01:09.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
