    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us see if something is true, or if something works the way it should.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it tastes good.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:28.800\nSee? Everyday examples!\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:37.900\nTests can also be more formal, like a spelling test at school, or a quality test on a product before it's sold.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:50.200\nThey all have the same goal: to gather information and make a decision. So, remember, a test helps us learn, check, and improve things.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:53.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
