    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.999\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:13.500\nBasically, a test is a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:18.600\nThink of it like this: you buy a new toy, and you try it out to see if it does what the box says.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:20.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:23.700\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:27.300\nA doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:32.100\nA teacher gives tests to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:35.800\nEven baking a cake is a test \u2013 you're testing your recipe!\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:42.900\nSo, tests help us understand things, find problems, and make sure everything is working correctly.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:47.900\nThey can be simple or complex, but the main idea is always the same: to check something.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:51.600\nIn short, a test is a way to verify a result.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:59.999\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
