    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:26.700\nIt's a process to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true. Think of it like this: if you want to know if your cake is done, you can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:32.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! That\u2019s a test.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:44.000\nOr, if you want to know if your toy car needs new batteries, you can try to turn it on. If it doesn't move, that's a test showing you need new batteries.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:49.400\nTests are all around us! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:61.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
