    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:03.100\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:04.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:08.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:12.900\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate or measure a quality, ability, or performance.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:16.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:21.100\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:24.300\nEven baking a cake can be a test \u2013 did you follow the recipe correctly?\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:30.200\nTests can be short quizzes, long exams, experiments in a lab, or even just trying something new.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:33.800\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:37.700\nThey help us understand things better and learn from our experiences.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:40.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and measure.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:42.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
