    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.000\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it like a mini-experiment or a really thorough check-up.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:22.300\nWe use them all the time! For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:29.400\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:40.700\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test! You\u2019re testing your recipe and your baking skills to see if you get a delicious result.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:54.800\nSo, tests help us gather information and understand things better. They can be used to measure knowledge, check for problems, or even just see if something works.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.400\nIn a nutshell, a test helps you discover something new or confirm something you already suspect. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
