    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:24.300\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly or if it meets certain standards. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.500\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. In both cases, we're gathering information to learn something.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:36.300\nAnother example?\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:45.100\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might test the cake with a toothpick to see if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:54.700\nSo, to recap: a test is a procedure to determine the quality, performance, or reliability of something. It gives us valuable information and helps us make decisions.\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:02.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
