    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE This VTT file is a placeholder, as no audio was provided.  Timings are based on the narration script.\nNOTE The actual timings will need to be adjusted based on the audio.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:07.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.700\nIt's a process designed to gather information. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:24.200\nThink about it: your doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:30.500\nA chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:36.800\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:43.100\nEach of these is a test! They all have a specific purpose, and they're all trying to answer a question.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:50.500\nTests can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like quickly checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:58.100\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better by giving us data or observations.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:01.500\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of collecting information!\n\n01:01.500 --> 01:04.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
