    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_151958.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:07.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:11.000\nThink of it as a tool for checking or measuring.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:15.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.000\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're essentially testing it to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:26.000\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test of your balance.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.000\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, where you answer questions to show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:38.000\nOr, they can be informal, like checking if the water in your shower is warm enough.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:43.000\nThe key is that a test helps you gather information and make a decision.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:47.000\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to learn more about something.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:52.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
