    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:22.500\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:32.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a test to see if you have the flu. A chef might taste a sauce to test its flavor.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:40.200\nAnd, of course, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:51.500\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a type of test. So is a driving exam to get your license. Even a simple experiment in science class is a kind of test!\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:58.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see where you stand. It's a tool for learning and improvement. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
