    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:23.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps us see how well you can spell words.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.900\nOr, if you bake a cake and taste it, that's a test to see if it tastes good! Tests aren't just for school, though.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:40.400\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Car manufacturers test their cars to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:47.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn information. It helps us understand things better and make good decisions.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
