    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.800\nNow, what is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:27.100\nIt helps us figure out if something is working the way it should, or if something is true or false.\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health, like taking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\nOr, imagine baking a cake.\nYou might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:33.000\nTests are everywhere!\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:39.400\nA scientist runs a test to see if their experiment worked.\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and make sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:50.300\nWe use them all the time!\nTo sum it up, a test is a check, an evaluation, a way to find out if something is accurate or functioning correctly.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
