    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us see if something is working, if we know something, or if we can do something.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like checking if your bike tires have enough air. That's a test!\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:28.900\nMaybe you take a spelling test at school. That shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:41.200\nOr, if you try to bake a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:52.400\nA test can be a question, a task, or even just an observation. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:00.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm something we already think is true. It's a valuable tool for understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
