    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:27.100\nWe use tests all the time! If you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:33.700\nThat's a test to see if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:40.300\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is broken. You try turning it on.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:46.900\nIf it doesn't light up, that's a test telling you the bulb probably needs replacing.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:56.200\nSo, testing is just a way of checking things, making sure they're working, or learning more about them. It\u2019s a fundamental way we learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
