    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_153340.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand things better.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:33.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nSometimes it's a quiz with multiple choice questions.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.700\nOther times, it could be a physical examination.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test - you're testing the recipe!\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:55.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a process to gather information and learn something new.\nIt helps us measure, evaluate, and ultimately, improve.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
