    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:20.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works, or if it's true.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like checking if your bike tires have enough air before you go for a ride. That's a test!\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:32.200\nIn school, a test helps your teacher understand what you've learned. It's a way to see if you understand the material.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:42.300\nBut tests aren't just for school. Doctors use tests to check your health, like taking your temperature.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:51.500\nChefs taste their food, that's a test to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:57.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn and make sure things are working as they should. It's all about checking and confirming. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
