    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out, or to see how well something works.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are done baking. You might poke one with a toothpick \u2013 that\u2019s a test!\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. A doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:38.000\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see what you've learned. Even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:48.000\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. They give us information and feedback.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:57.700\nRemember, a test isn't always about right or wrong, it's about understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
