    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like checking in on your understanding. The main idea is to ask questions or perform actions to get results.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:35.900\nThese results then tell you something. For example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words. Or, if you bake a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:46.700\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. So, tests help us measure knowledge, performance, or even the condition of something.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.100\nThey give us information to make decisions. In short, a test is a method to evaluate something.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
