    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:21.700\nIt's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:33.200\nThink about it like this: you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge of a subject. Or, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:44.200\nEven baking a cake involves a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it turns out right!\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:49.800\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same purpose: to provide information and help us understand something better.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.400\nRemember, a test is simply a tool. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
