    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:19.000\nWe use them every day, without even realizing it.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: you taste some soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:30.400\nThat's a test! Or maybe you try turning on a light switch to see if the power is on.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:40.900\nAnother test! In school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned. And in science, tests are used to see if a new idea is correct.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:49.300\nFor example, scientists might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:51.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and check something out.\n```"
