    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.300\nIn school, tests help us see how well we've learned something. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:42.800\nA math test checks if you understand how to do math problems. Tests aren't scary; they're just a way to measure what we know.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:50.200\nSo, remember, a test is a way to find things out. It can be about anything!\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:53.900\nAnd while they might seem a little daunting, they\u2019re a useful tool for learning. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
