    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_154218.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process we use to check if something is true, or to see how well something works.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like this: a taste test! You try a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it. That's a test.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:31.300\nOr, when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:38.900\nEven checking if a light bulb works when you screw it in is a kind of test! You're testing if it will light up.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:49.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out, whether it's about ice cream, your knowledge, or a light bulb.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:53.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
