    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it as a question you're asking, and the test helps you find the answer.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:24.600\nIt can be anything from a simple quiz at school to something a little more involved, like checking if a cake is done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:31.300\nThe quiz tests your knowledge, and the toothpick test checks if the cake is cooked all the way through.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:36.100\nAnother example? A doctor might run tests to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.000\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if you like how it tastes. Tests help us understand something better by giving us information.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and answer a question. It helps us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:56.400 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
