    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_154445.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to see what you know, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:27.600\nBasically, it\u2019s a method to gather information. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:34.500\nOr, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:41.500\nAnother example? Bakers test cake batter by inserting a toothpick. If it comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:49.600\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something and give us useful information.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:57.000\nIt helps us understand more about the topic at hand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
