    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like a detective gathering clues. It could be anything from a quiz in school to a taste test for new ice cream flavors.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:31.900\nThe main goal is to collect data and see what we can learn.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:38.800\nFor example, a doctor might run blood tests to check your health. Or, a software developer might test their code to make sure it works correctly.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:47.800\nSee? Tests are everywhere! Basically, a test is a process designed to evaluate something. It helps us understand more about the world around us and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
