    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_154612.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:18.000\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, but what is it, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or can do.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done. You stick a toothpick in it, right? That's a test!\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:30.100\nOr imagine you're checking if your bike tires have enough air. You squeeze them. Another test!\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:32.900\nSchool tests, like quizzes or exams, are just more formal ways of testing your knowledge on a specific subject.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:41.500\nThey help you and your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:51.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure understanding.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
