    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really important: a test.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how well you understand something, or how good you are at doing something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like this: imagine you've been practicing baking cookies. A taste test is a way to see if your cookies are delicious! Or maybe you've been learning your ABCs. A quiz is a test to see if you remember them.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:31.100\nTests can come in lots of forms. They might be written questions, like a multiple-choice quiz, or a practical task, like showing you can tie your shoes.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:42.600\nThe main idea is to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:53.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check your understanding or skills. Don't be afraid of them; they help you learn!\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
