    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:18.800\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you put it in a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:23.800\nThat's a test! You're checking if the lightbulb passes or fails.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:38.000\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. A doctor might run tests to check your health, a teacher gives tests to see what you've learned, and even a baker tastes their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:48.200\nSo, basically, a test is an action or procedure designed to reveal if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:57.700\nIt's all about finding out if something works, is true, or is good enough. Tests help us make informed decisions.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
