    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.000\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, maybe in school. But in general, a test is simply a way to see if something works correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: You bake a cake, and then you taste it. Tasting the cake is a test!\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:31.900\nYou're testing to see if it tastes good. Or, imagine you buy a new phone.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:41.700\nYou try making a call, taking a picture, and browsing the internet. Those are all tests to see if the phone is working as it should.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:52.500\nTests help us catch mistakes early and make sure things are working the way we expect. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
