    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like a question you're asking, but instead of asking a person, you're asking a system, a process, or even yourself.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:28.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A taste test checks how something tastes.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:38.100\nAnd a stress test on a bridge checks how much weight it can handle. So, a test helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:46.600\nIt gives us information we didn't have before. That information can then be used to make decisions or improvements.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:54.000\nRemember, tests are all about finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
