    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_155251.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to get information.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of water to see if it's hot enough for tea. Or a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:25.900\nTests aren't just for school! They're everywhere.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:35.700\nYour phone's camera tests the lighting to make sure your pictures look good. Even baking a cake is a test to see if you followed the recipe correctly.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:44.200\nSo, tests help us understand things, check if something works, and make sure we're on the right track.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:51.400\nThey're a fundamental tool for learning and improving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
