    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:22.900\nWe use tests all the time! Think of it like this: you might take a test in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:33.000\nOr, a doctor might run tests to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:42.100\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:50.800\nSo, a test is really just a process. You do something, and then you look at the result to learn something.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:59.500\nMaybe you're testing if your plant needs water by touching the soil. Or testing a new video game to see if it's fun.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.700\nBasically, tests help us understand the world around us better.\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:07.200\nThey give us information and help us make decisions.\n\n01:07.200 --> 01:10.300\nThat's the main idea behind a test!\n\n01:10.300 --> 01:13.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
