    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific. Think of it like a detective searching for clues.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:23.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:34.200\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. And a medical test can help doctors figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:41.400\nSo, tests help us learn, decide, and understand things. They give us information.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:49.700\nRemember, a test is just a tool to help us discover something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
