    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:13.300\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\nIt could be a quiz at school, a doctor checking your temperature, or even trying a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:34.800\nThe main goal of a test is to gather information.\nFor example, a spelling test tells your teacher how well you know your words.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:42.500\nA taste test tells you if you like chocolate or vanilla better.\nSo, you see tests are all around us!\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:52.700\nThey help us learn, discover, and understand the world a little bit better.\nRemember, a test is just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
