    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_160022.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:14.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:27.100\nIt helps us gather information and see how something works, or if it works at all. Think of it like this: if you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:33.400\nThat's a test! Or, if you build a toy car, you'd push it to see if it rolls.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:44.400\nThat's another test! Tests can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb turns on, or more complicated, like a doctor running blood work.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:53.500\nThe key is that they help us learn and improve things. So, a test is just a way of checking something to understand it better.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
