    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.700\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:05.200\nToday we're going to explore something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.300\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of school, but a test is really just a way to find something out.\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:13.500\nIt's a process we use to see if something is true, or to measure something specific.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:16.800\nThink about it like this: a taste test!\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:19.600\nYou taste something to find out if you like it.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:23.800\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:28.500\nIn science, we use tests to see if our ideas about the world are correct.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:33.100\nWe might run an experiment and then test the results to see if they support our original thought.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:37.100\nSo, a test is simply a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:42.800\nRemember, it\u2019s about finding things out, whether it\u2019s your favorite flavor or understanding how the world works.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:45.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
