    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:17.800\nThink of it like an investigation. We ask a question, and the test helps us find the answer.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:26.600\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school. That test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:34.100\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter to test if it has enough sugar. That's a test too!\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:38.800\nTests aren't just for school or baking.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:43.500\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:50.300\nScientists use tests to try out new ideas.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:57.400\nBasically, whenever you want to learn more about something, you can use a test.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:01.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to ask a question and find an answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
