    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:20.500\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:31.600\nIt's a process to check if something is working, or to see how well you understand a topic, or even to discover what's in something.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:46.000\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a food company might test a new recipe to see if people like it. And in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:56.300\nBasically, a test involves a procedure, followed by an observation, and then a conclusion based on that observation. We use tests all the time in different ways to get information and make decisions.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.900\nSo remember, a test is simply a method to gain knowledge. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "f109faa1-e837-4234-ade0-f8efdfcc66df": {
