    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_160800.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:07.700\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:13.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like an investigation.\nWe use tests to gather information.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:31.200\nThe main idea is to ask a question, or present a problem, and then see how someone, or something, responds.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:39.800\nThis response then gives us data.\nFor example, a simple math test checks how well you understand numbers.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:50.200\nA taste test tells us how good a food tastes.\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:55.800\nSo, tests are everywhere!\nThey help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us by giving us valuable information.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:58.600\nTests are a way of asking questions, and getting answers.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
