    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:24.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. We use them all the time! It\u2019s just a process to see if something is true, or to measure something.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:29.700\nThink about it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:38.500\nThat's a test! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready. Or, if you want to know if you know your ABCs, someone might ask you to recite them.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:43.900\nThat's also a test.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:54.800\nSo, a test can be anything from a simple check to a complicated experiment. It helps us learn, understand, and make decisions. Remember, it's all about gathering information.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
