    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.300\nNow, a test is basically a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like this: you test a lightbulb to make sure it turns on. That\u2019s a simple test!\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:32.800\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how much you've learned about a topic. They can be multiple choice, true or false, or even just asking you to explain something.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:41.300\nLet's say you\u2019re learning about animals. A test might ask you to name different kinds of animals, or describe what they eat.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:50.300\nPassing the test means you understand the basics. So, a test is a way to check understanding or functionality.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:56.900\nIt helps us learn and improve. Remember, tests are just one way to measure progress.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
