    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out how much you know about something. Think of it like a measuring stick for your brain!\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:23.200\nIt's not just about school. We take tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:34.200\nLike, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you can follow the instructions. Or when you play a video game, you're testing your skills.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:41.000\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:47.800\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just a fun activity. The important thing is they show how much you understand.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:55.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure your knowledge. It's a way to see how far you've come.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:62.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
