    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.700\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like gathering information.\nYou're trying to get a result or an answer.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:30.300\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:40.600\nEven tasting a new food is a kind of test to see if you like it!\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz at school to a scientific experiment.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:49.600\nIt's all about gathering information and learning something new.\nEssentially, a test helps us understand where we are and what we need to learn or do next.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.300\nPretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
