    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.699\nNow, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:26.399\nThink of it like an experiment or a question that helps us learn more.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:34.899\nBasically, a test checks if something is true or not.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.399\nIt could be a science experiment to see if a plant grows in sunlight, or even just tasting a cookie to see if it's sweet.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:46.999\nThe key is that we're trying to get an answer.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:50.499\nFor example, a simple test could be dropping a ball to see if it falls.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:53.299\nWe know it will, but the test proves it.\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:00.099\nOr, asking someone their favorite color is a test to find out their preference.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:02.999\nTests help us understand the world around us.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:08.699\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and check if something is true.\n\n01:08.700 --> 01:13.299\nIt helps us learn and discover new things.\n\n01:13.300 --> 01:15.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
