    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.100\nTests are used everywhere! Your doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:28.300\nA chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more salt. Or, you might take a quiz at school to show what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:43.000\nSo, a blood test checks your health, a taste test checks flavor, and a quiz checks your knowledge. Basically, a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already thought was true.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:51.700\nThey help us make decisions and understand the world around us a little bit better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
