    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_162132.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:15.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\nThink of it like this: you're checking if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:24.900\nThe core idea is to present a question or a challenge, and then observe the response.\nThat response tells you something.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:34.500\nFor example, a simple taste test tells you if you like a food.\nOr, a spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:42.100\nEven checking if a light switch turns on the light is a type of test!\nYou're seeing if it works as expected.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:50.800\nSo, tests help us learn and understand.\nThey help us make sure things are working correctly and give us feedback.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:53.400\nPretty useful, right?\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
