    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:14.600\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:25.400\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:36.300\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Think about it: when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:44.700\nOr, if you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it turns on the TV.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:51.900\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They might be written questions, or even a project you build.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.500\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information.\n```"
