    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_162257.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.250 --> 00:03.330\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.330 --> 00:06.510\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:06.510 --> 00:10.100\nThink of it like this: a test is like a measuring stick for your skills and knowledge.\n\n00:10.970 --> 00:16.900\nThere are all kinds of tests, from simple quizzes in school to big exams that help you get into college.\n\n00:17.520 --> 00:21.690\nMaybe you've taken a spelling test, or a math test.\n\n00:21.690 --> 00:23.340\nThose are both tests!\n\n00:23.340 --> 00:26.310\nThey help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:26.310 --> 00:31.220\nAnother example is a taste test.\nYou try different foods and decide which one you like best.\n\n00:31.220 --> 00:33.270\nThat's a test too, testing your preferences!\n\n00:34.010 --> 00:39.270\nSo, a test is really just a way to evaluate something.\nIt can be your knowledge, your ability, or even your opinion.\n\n00:39.270 --> 00:42.580\nAnd that's the basics of what a test is all about.\n\n00:52.510 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
