    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like a simple question. We ask the question, and the test gives us the answer.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:31.600\nFor example, a math test tells us how well you understand math problems.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:41.800\nA taste test tells us which flavor of ice cream we like the best. Even a doctor\u2019s exam is a test, checking to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:53.100\nSo, tests are all about finding information. They help us learn, make choices, and understand the world around us. They can be big or small, easy or hard, but they all have the same goal: to give us answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
