    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_162724.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes the soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:37.000\nOr, a doctor checks your temperature to test if you have a fever. Those are tests!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:42.700\nWe use tests all the time in school, too. A quiz is a test to see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.000\nA science experiment is a test to see if your hypothesis is correct. See? So, a test is just a simple way to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.500\nIt helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
