    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:10.400\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:18.800\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:38.300\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:48.100\nTests can be simple, like checking if a light bulb works by turning it on. If it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:54.400\nOr, they can be more complicated, like a multiple-choice quiz. No matter what, the goal is always to learn something or confirm something. So, a test helps us understand things better. That's the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
