    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:26.700\nNow, the word \"test\" can mean a lot of things, but basically, it's a way to find out something. Think of it like this: a test is a question, or a series of questions, that helps us learn more about a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:36.300\nFor example, your doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:49.100\nAnother example could be testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good! So, to recap, a test is simply a process used to gather information or evaluate something.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:56.500\nIt helps us understand more about the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
