    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know or how well you can do something. Think of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:28.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you can follow the instructions.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:43.700\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test of your balance.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:56.100\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like seeing if you can remember your friend's phone number. The main goal is always the same: to check your understanding or ability.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to see what you know or can do. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
