    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.300\nNot the kind you stress about in school, but tests in the general sense. A test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: a taste test for a new recipe. You're testing if the flavors are right.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:30.600\nOr, imagine checking the battery in your flashlight. You're testing if it still has power.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:40.100\nTests can be simple, like pressing a button to see if a light turns on, or more complex, like a doctor running bloodwork.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:52.900\nThe main idea is always the same: to learn something about the thing you're testing. So, remember, a test is just a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
