    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_163528.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. It helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:27.900\nThink about it like this: You might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:39.400\nIn school, tests are used to see how well you understand what you've been learning. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test checks if you can solve math problems.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:52.100\nSo, to recap: A test is a way of checking something, whether it\u2019s a recipe, your health, or your knowledge. It helps us understand how things are working and if they're meeting expectations.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:61.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
