    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.400\nA test is basically a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand better.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:31.600\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:45.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is probably ready. Or, if you're learning to ride a bike and you practice balancing, that's also a test \u2013 you're testing your balancing skills.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:53.100\nTests can be simple, like the toothpick in the cake, or more complicated, like a school exam.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:59.500\nBut the main idea is always the same: to learn or confirm something.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:02.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:03.800\nPretty useful, right?\n\n01:03.800 --> 01:07.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
