    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.100\nIt could be checking if a light bulb works, if a cake is cooked, or even if you know the answers to some questions.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:32.400\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and to test if it's ready, you poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:40.500\nOr, imagine you're learning your ABCs. A quiz about the alphabet is a test to see how well you're learning.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:50.000\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly or if we've learned something new. They're a really useful way to learn and improve.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:55.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check on things and see how we're doing.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:60.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
