    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.200\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:22.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:29.400\nThink of it like a checkpoint to measure your understanding.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:38.600\nThe main idea behind a test is to give you a chance to show what you've learned.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:47.700\nIt could be about anything! From math problems to identifying different kinds of plants.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:51.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:56.200\nA quiz on a book tells you if you understood the story.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:01.700\nAnd even trying out a new recipe is like a test to see if you can bake a cake!\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:09.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to measure your knowledge or skills, using different methods like answering questions or completing tasks.\n\n01:09.000 --> 01:16.600\nIt helps you and others see what you understand and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n01:16.600 --> 01:19.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
