    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.300\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It helps us learn more about ourselves, things around us, or even how well we've learned something new.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:29.600\nThink about it like this: a taste test lets you find out which snack you like best.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:33.200\nOr, a spelling test shows how many words you know how to spell.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:42.400\nSee? It's all about gathering information. For example, your doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:57.400\nYour teacher might give you a test to see if you understood the lesson. And you might even test a new toy to see how it works. So, to recap, a test is a process or procedure designed to collect information and measure knowledge, abilities, or qualities.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:03.000\nPretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
