    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:30.000\nIt could be checking if you understand a topic at school, or checking if a new medicine works, or even checking if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:39.100\nThe main idea is to see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:48.200\nWe gather information and then use that information to make a judgment.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:53.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.300\nA doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.800\nAnd a chef pokes a cake with a toothpick \u2013 if it comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:06.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and see if it meets our expectations.\n\n01:06.200 --> 01:11.700\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n01:11.700 --> 01:14.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
