    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like a little investigation to check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:23.400\nThink about it like this.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:30.400\nYou want to know if your cookies are baked enough. So, you test them by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:36.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, they're done! That's a test!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:40.400\nOr, maybe you want to see if you know your ABCs.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:44.800\nSomeone might ask you to recite them. That's a test too!\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:51.400\nTests help us learn and improve. They let us know where we stand and what we need to work on.\n\n00:51.400 --> 01:02.700\nThey're everywhere, from cooking to school, and even when you're playing games! So, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out.\n\n01:02.700 --> 01:06.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
