    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_165621.mp4",
    "subtitles": "[WebVTT]\n```\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey there, welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:18.500\nThink of a test as a way to check your understanding. It's like a snapshot of what you know about a particular topic, whether it's math, science, or even your memory.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:25.700\nBasically, a test presents you with questions or tasks designed to see how well you've learned something.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:42.700\nThese questions can be multiple choice, short answer, or even practical demonstrations. For example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words, while a driving test checks your ability to operate a vehicle safely.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:53.500\nSo, remember, tests are simply tools to help you and your teachers understand what you've mastered and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:01.000\nThey're not scary, just a chance to show off your knowledge! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "011710f0-1681-40cb-b988-a234ae3df9d9": {
    "id": "011710f0-1681-40cb-b988-a234ae3df9d9",
