    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_165812.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:25.100\nThe main idea behind a test is to give something a try and then see what happens.\nWe look at the results to understand more about whatever we're testing.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:35.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:49.300\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test, to see if you like how it tastes!\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to learn something by trying it out and observing the results.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:55.700\nIt helps us understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
