    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like an experiment or a quiz. We use tests to see if something is working correctly, or to check our understanding of a subject.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.400\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, your teacher might give you a math test to see how well you understand fractions.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:47.600\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it! Basically, a test helps us gather information and make decisions based on that information.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:51.200\nSo, remember, a test is a tool for learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
