    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_170159.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, you're gathering evidence.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:26.500\nIt could be anything from a quiz at school to checking if a lightbulb works. The main point is to see if something meets a certain standard or has a specific quality.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:36.800\nFor example, a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor of ice cream. Or, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:40.600\nSee? Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:51.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for gathering information to determine if something meets a certain criteria or standard.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:59.000\nIt\u2019s a way to learn and understand more about the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "7fd306df-2e11-43a0-a50d-24648405fc6b": {
    "id": "7fd306df-2e11-43a0-a50d-24648405fc6b",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:41:10.711512",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T17:02:43.759601",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_170243.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_170243.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:13.800\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is really just a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:22.800\nIt helps us understand if we're on the right track. Think of it like this: you bake a cake, and you test it with a toothpick.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:29.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! Or, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:39.100\nEach time you try, you're testing your balance and coordination. You might fall a few times, but that's part of the test!\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:46.600\nAnother example is when you take a quiz at school. It's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:57.600\nSo, whether it's baking a cake, riding a bike, or taking a quiz, a test helps us see what we've learned and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:08.200\nIn short, a test is just a way to check something and see if it's working as expected. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
