    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_170338.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.500\nSimply put, it's a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:32.000\nThat shows your spelling knowledge. Or, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:43.000\nYou might taste a little bit of the batter before you bake it to test if it has enough sugar. That's testing the batter!\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:55.200\nSo, tests help us measure things. They can be quizzes, experiments, or even just trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.000\nBasically, a test gives us information.\n\n00:58.000 --> 00:58.800\nWhether it's knowing your ABCs or knowing if your cake will be sweet enough, tests are all about learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "cbd195d8-95b1-4c95-87db-d8389dfe0b65": {
    "id": "cbd195d8-95b1-4c95-87db-d8389dfe0b65",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:41:11.628166",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T17:04:27.636572",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_170427.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_170427.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.200\nNo, not the kind you cram for! In the world of, well, everything, a test is really just a way to see if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, right? Tasting it is a test to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:35.200\nOr, if you're building a tower of blocks, gently pushing it is a test to see if it's stable.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:46.200\nTesting helps us find problems and fix them. Maybe the cake needs more sugar, or the tower needs a wider base.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:55.700\nSo, a test is simply a way to check if something meets our expectations. It can be anything from a simple taste to a complicated experiment.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.300\nIn short, it's all about making sure things are working correctly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "23535b80-16e6-4667-9547-583e27211fd1": {
    "id": "23535b80-16e6-4667-9547-583e27211fd1",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:41:12.075658",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T17:05:19.920655",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_170519.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_170519.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, but more focused.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:23.100\nWe\u2019re trying to answer a specific question.\nThe main idea is to see how something behaves or performs under certain conditions.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:33.700\nWe set up a controlled situation and then observe what happens.\nFor example, a simple test could be seeing how long it takes you to run around the block.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:41.900\nThe condition is running around the block, and the observation is the time it takes.\nOr, a taste test!\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:47.500\nYou try two different cookies and decide which one you like better.\nThe condition? Tasting the cookies.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:50.800\nThe observation? Which one you prefer.\n\n00:50.800 --> 01:01.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a structured way to answer a question by observing something in a controlled environment.\nIt helps us learn and understand more about the world around us.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:09.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "2b81dc16-3c55-4dc2-8be8-c41fbd95e12e": {
    "id": "2b81dc16-3c55-4dc2-8be8-c41fbd95e12e",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:41:12.546489",
