    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:22.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:32.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:41.800\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:56.900\nWe can even test a recipe by trying it out to see if it tastes good! So, tests help us understand things better. They give us information we can use to make decisions or learn more.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:03.200\nThey can be big, like a final exam, or small, like checking if your shoes fit.\n```"
  },
