    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:31.200\nFor example, your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:45.000\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, tests help us learn, check, and explore.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:54.900\nThey can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all share the same goal: to get information. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
