    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:10.600\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.600 --> 00:21.400\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:32.000\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:35.900\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.900\nTests can also be used on other things, like food. Is it safe to eat? You might test it to find out!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:49.500\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information by checking something. It helps us make decisions and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
