    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like this: a test helps us measure something.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:31.600\nIt could be a quiz in school, checking your understanding of a lesson. Or maybe a taste test, where you decide which cookie is tastier.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:40.700\nEven a doctor checking your reflexes is a type of test!\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:50.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words. A driving test checks your ability to operate a car safely. And a simple memory test might ask you to remember a list of items.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:57.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.800\nWhether it's your knowledge, your skills, or even your preferences.\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:02.700\nThanks for watching!\n\n01:02.700 --> 01:05.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
