    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:41:20.187691",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T17:18:12.923016",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_171812.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_171812.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:18.100\nWhat is a test anyway? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:27.200\nIt could be about you, like a quiz in school, or about something else, like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:35.400\nThe main idea is that you're performing an action and observing the result.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:43.600\nThink of it like this: You're testing if your shoes fit. The action is putting them on, and the result is whether they feel comfortable.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:55.200\nAnother example is baking a cake. You follow the recipe, and then you test if it tastes good! The recipe is the action, and the taste is the result.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:59.700\nTests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly. So, a test is an action followed by an observation of the result. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "2508e21a-b81f-4ffc-9253-7b6ac46516a4": {
    "id": "2508e21a-b81f-4ffc-9253-7b6ac46516a4",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-12-31T20:41:20.716735",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-01T17:19:09.867986",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_171909.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_171909.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:22.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process used to evaluate or measure something, whether it's your knowledge, a product's quality, or even the strength of a material.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:32.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. A taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. And a stress test on a bridge makes sure it can handle heavy traffic.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:43.300\nSo, tests help us learn, choose, and ensure things are working properly. They give us valuable information.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:50.400\nRemember, a test is just a method for finding something out.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
