    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_171950.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.600\nNow, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:31.700\nIt could be a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject, or it could be a medical test to check your health.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:36.500\nThe main idea is to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:41.300\nFor example, a taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:45.800\nOr a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:46.900\nSee?\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:48.200\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:53.300\nSo, remember, a test is simply a tool for learning and understanding. It helps us measure things and find out more about ourselves and the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
