    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_172039.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something super fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:13.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out information.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:19.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:27.700\nTests can take many forms. A quiz at school is a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.900\nA doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even tasting food to see if it needs more salt is a kind of test!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:40.700\nSo, let's say you're baking cookies. You taste one, and it's not sweet enough.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:45.100\nThat's the test! The result tells you to add more sugar. See how that works?\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:55.500\nEssentially, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. It helps us learn, diagnose, and make decisions. Pretty useful, right?\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
