    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like a question you ask, and the answer helps you understand something. There are all kinds of tests!\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:29.400\nYour doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:45.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it works! So, a test is just a method for gathering information, whether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even a delicious cake.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:55.400\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us. Remember, tests are tools, and understanding them helps us succeed.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:58.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
