    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, welcome! \n\n00:04.600 --> 00:06.600\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:09.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:13.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:15.900\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly,\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:18.100\nor if we know something.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:22.900\nThink about it like this: a school test checks if you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:28.300\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:35.600\nAnother example is when you get your eyes checked; the eye doctor is running tests to see how well you can see.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:39.500\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:47.900\nWhether it\u2019s about your knowledge, the quality of a cake, or your eyesight, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:55.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
