    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_172250.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:16.600\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:26.400\nWe use them all the time to check our understanding, see how well something works, or even just to explore and experiment.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:34.800\nThink about it: Baking a cake is like a test.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:40.700\nYou follow a recipe, and the result \u2013 the cake \u2013 tells you if you did it right.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:46.600\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:53.000\nEach time you try, you're testing your balance and coordination.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:59.000\nIf you fall, you learn something!\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:05.400\nAnother example is a simple math problem.\n\n01:05.400 --> 01:11.100\nSolving it is a test of your math skills.\n\n01:11.100 --> 01:15.500\nThe answer shows if you understood the concept.\n\n01:15.500 --> 01:21.700\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn.\n\n01:21.700 --> 01:29.900\nIn short, tests help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:29.900 --> 01:33.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
