    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:44.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it! Think about it: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. And when you try to turn on a light switch, you're testing if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:54.200\nSo, a test is just a process to gather information, whether it's about your knowledge, your preferences, or even if something is working correctly.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.800\nWe use tests to learn, to improve, and to make better decisions. In short, a test helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
