    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. The important thing is that the test is designed to give us useful information.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.700\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if you like a new flavor of ice cream. Or, a quiz in school tests how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:42.200\nTests aren't just about right or wrong answers. They can help us learn and improve. Maybe you take a practice test before a big game to see where you need to focus your training.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:51.100\nSo, a test is really just a tool to measure, learn, and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
