    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.000\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.500\nIt's like a little investigation. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:32.600\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste a little bit to test if it needs more sugar. In school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned and where you might need some extra help.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:41.600\nSo, tests are just tools. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:52.500\nThey aren't something to be afraid of, but rather a way to gain valuable information. In short, a test is a method for finding out information.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:57.000\nThat's it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
