    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHi there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: a chef might test a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:34.700\nOr, maybe you test the water in the bath to make sure it's not too hot.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:47.400\nEven a doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature, to see if you're healthy. Tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:58.800\nThey give us information so we can make good decisions. Whether it's figuring out if a cake is done baking, or if you understand a new math problem, a test helps us know for sure.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:02.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something by trying it out and observing the results. Tests are everywhere, helping us every day!\n```"
  },
