    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_172942.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information. Think of it like a question, or a series of questions, designed to see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:28.400\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:37.700\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:47.800\nEven a simple taste test, like trying a new flavor of ice cream, is a type of test! You're testing whether you like it.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:56.000\nTests help us understand things better, whether it\u2019s our own knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the health of our bodies. So remember, a test is just a way of gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
