    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_173119.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:26.600\nThe main idea behind any test is to see if something is true, accurate, or working correctly. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.800\nFor example, a simple spelling test shows if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:37.000\nA taste test helps decide if you like a certain food.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:47.800\nAnd a medical test can tell you if you're healthy. All of these are tests! So, remember, a test is a process we use to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:52.200\nIt's a way to check things and see how they measure up.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
