    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_173217.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.200\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:50.200\nSo, tests help us measure things, check for problems, or just learn more about the world around us. They can be as simple as tasting a new food or as complex as launching a rocket into space.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:59.000\nIn short, a test is just a structured way of gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
