    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.100 --> 00:18.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information or measure something.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:31.000\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:41.000\nTests aren't just for school or the doctor's office, though. You use tests all the time!\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:50.300\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like it. When you push a button on a toy, you're testing to see if it works.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:54.000\nSo, a test is just a way to check something out and get some information.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.200\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.200 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
