    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_174101.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_174101.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something. Think of it like checking the temperature of a cake \u2013 it tells you if it's ready.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.100\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:32.600\nBut tests aren't just for school! You take tests all the time without even realizing it. For example, trying a new recipe is a test to see if you can follow instructions and make something yummy.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:44.400\nOr playing a video game is a test of your skills and reflexes.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:54.200\nSo, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge, skills, or abilities. It helps you and others understand where you're at and what you might want to learn next.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.800\nRemember, tests are just one way to learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
