    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_174151.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:17.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:28.200\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:36.200\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test of your balance.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:48.000\nSchools use tests to see how well you understand different subjects, and doctors use tests to check your health.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:55.800\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:01.400\nThey can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like tasting cake batter.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:07.000\nThe important thing is they give us information.\n\n01:07.000 --> 01:10.600\nThey help us figure out what we know and what we still need to learn.\n\n01:10.600 --> 01:14.200\nTests are all about finding answers.\n\n01:14.200 --> 01:17.400\nKeep testing, keep learning!\n\n01:17.400 --> 01:20.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
