    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: Tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, where you try something out to see what happens.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:30.100\nWe use tests all the time in everyday life, even without realizing it! For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:41.600\nOr, when you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it works. In school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:50.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and discover new things. It's all about finding out information!\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
