    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:16.400\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.200\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. For example, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean.\n00:35.200 --> 00:43.500\nThat's a test! Or, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.400\nThat's a test too, to see if it fixes the problem. Basically, a test helps us understand if something is working as expected, or if something needs to be fixed.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.000\nIt's a simple but powerful tool for learning and problem-solving. Remember, testing is all about asking questions and finding answers.\n```"
