    "subtitles": "[WebVTT]\n```\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.100\nNow, you might think of school exams, but a test is really just a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate a quality, ability, or performance.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: a taste test tells you how something tastes.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:34.700\nA strength test tells you how strong something is.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:46.300\nAnd a medical test can tell you about your health. So, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:54.800\nThey help us understand things better by giving us results we can look at. They\u2019re used everywhere from checking if a cake is done, to making sure a new car is safe.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.300\nIn short, a test is a way to check something and get an answer. That's the basic idea of what a test is all about! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
