    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_175258.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It helps us find out if something works, if something is true, or if something is present.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:22.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to check for certain things in your body.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:35.900\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see if you understand the lesson. Or, you might even test the temperature of your bath water before getting in to make sure it's not too hot or too cold.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:50.700\nSo, tests help us learn information, solve problems, and make decisions. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the main idea is always the same: to check something out.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
