    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:17.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:31.100\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea, or using a tool to see if something works the way it should.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:38.200\nBasically, it helps us figure out if things are right or wrong, working or broken.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:47.800\nFor example, your teacher gives you a test in school to see how well you've learned the material. A doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:56.200\nOr you might test a new toy to see if it's fun to play with. Tests are super useful because they give us information. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working properly. So, remember, a test is just a way of checking something! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
