    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_175512.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. It could be anything, really!\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:18.900\nThink of it like asking a question and then finding the answer. The main goal of a test is to get information.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:30.300\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, when you check if the water in the shower is warm enough, that's a test! You're testing the water temperature.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:40.000\nOr, if you try a new recipe and taste it to see if it needs more salt, that's another test. You're testing the flavor.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:48.900\nSo, a test is just a process to gather information by observing or trying something out. It helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:55.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
