    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_175604.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.800\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:18.600\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:28.900\nThere are tests all around us! Your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:41.600\nA chef might taste food to test if it's seasoned just right. Even a game of hide-and-seek is a kind of test, seeing if someone can find you!\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:51.600\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done. You poke the cake and if the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.300\nSo, a test is just a way to check something, find out information, or see if something works. Easy peasy! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
