    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests!\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:06.800\nIn simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:09.800\nWe use them all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:09.800 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it like this: you\u2019re trying to figure out if an oven is hot.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:18.600\nYou carefully reach out and feel the air coming from it.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:19.500\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:25.000\nA more formal test might be a quiz in school, designed to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:28.400\nOr maybe a medical test to check your health.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:33.000\nThe point is, a test gives you information.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:38.500\nIt helps you understand something better, or make a decision based on the results.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:43.000\nFor example, if your oven test shows it's cold, you know you need to turn it on!\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:47.700\nSo, tests are simply ways of gathering information.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
