    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something, to see if it works or if it's true.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you put it in a lamp. You're testing the bulb!\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:35.000\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning. It's like a quick check to see if the information is sticking.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you remember how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:51.700\nA math test checks if you can solve problems. So, remember, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.200\nWhether it's a lightbulb, your knowledge, or anything else, it helps us understand if things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
