    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: you're trying to solve a puzzle, and the test is like asking someone if you're on the right track.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.000\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. Maybe it's a multiple-choice quiz in school, or perhaps a doctor checking your reflexes.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:43.600\nThey all have the same goal: to give us information. For example, a spelling test shows how well you've learned your words.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:52.500\nOr, a taste test helps decide which cookie is the tastiest! So, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.200\nIt helps us measure something, whether it's knowledge, skill, or even preference. That's the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
