    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_180633.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:18.200\nWe use tests all the time. Think about baking a cake.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:24.800\nYou might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. Or, imagine taking a quiz in school.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:32.400\nThat's a test to see how well you understand the material. Even doctors use tests to check if you're healthy!\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:43.100\nSo, a test can be anything from a simple taste to a complex exam. The key thing is, it helps us get information or learn something new.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:49.900\nBasically, it's a way to check things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "aea71aae-5401-41b0-826a-251cf5974697": {
