    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_180723.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:25.200\nWe use them all the time, even without realizing it. Think of it like this: you try a new recipe and taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good. Or, you try to open a door with a key \u2013 that's a test to see if the key works.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:35.100\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, short answer, or even projects.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:47.400\nThe main idea is to find out what you know and where you might need a little more help.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:51.000\nSo, a test is just a way of checking something, from recipes to keys to your knowledge. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
