    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_180908.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.200\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.700\nIt can be a written exam in school, a doctor checking your temperature, or even trying a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:36.400\nThe main idea behind a test is to gather information.\nWe want to see if something is true, false, working correctly, or even just to understand it better.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:45.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\nAnd a fitness test checks how strong you are.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:55.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for gathering information to answer a question.\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:02.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
