    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.300\nIt could be anything from a simple quiz to a more complex experiment. Think of it like this: you want to know if a plant needs water.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:27.700\nYou can test it by touching the soil. If the soil is dry, that's your test result!\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:33.300\nYou can also test your knowledge. That's what happens when you take a school exam.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:37.500\nIt\u2019s a test to see how much you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:44.800\nAnother example? A doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you sick.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:53.700\nThey use different methods to find clues. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nIt's about finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
