    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.900\nA test, simply put, is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:28.400\nYou screw it in, flip the switch, and see if it lights up.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:37.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nA doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:47.000\nA baker might taste their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar.\nEven checking if your shoes are tied is a little test to avoid tripping!\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:56.100\nSo, tests help us learn, check, and make sure things are working the way they should.\nThey give us information to make better decisions.\nRemember, a test is just a way to find out something!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
