    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_181219.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's how we check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:28.200\nYou might use a toothpick to poke them, right?\nThat's a test! You're testing if they're ready.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:37.400\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\nEach time you try to balance, you're testing your ability.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:51.600\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\nThey show what you understand and maybe where you need a little more help.\nSo, whether it's baking cookies, riding a bike, or answering questions, a test is all about finding things out.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:58.500\nBasically, it's a way to learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
