    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process or procedure designed to measure or evaluate a specific thing.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:26.300\nThink about it like this: a math test checks your understanding of math problems. Or a taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:34.500\nThe key is that a test gives you information. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:43.600\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you learned the lesson. And you might even test out a new recipe before making it for your friends.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:56.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to learn something new or confirm what you already know. It helps us measure, evaluate, and understand different things.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
