    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:22.000\nIt's how we check if something is working, or if we understand something.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if the light bulb in your lamp is working.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:32.400\nYou turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:37.900\nOr, imagine you're learning your ABCs.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:43.700\nYour teacher might ask you to recite them. That's a test to see if you've learned them.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:49.500\nTests aren't scary; they're just tools. They help us learn and improve.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
