    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a cake is done baking.\nYou might use a toothpick as a test.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:31.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is likely done!\nAnother example is a spelling test in school.\nIt helps your teacher see how well you understand spelling rules.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:39.400\nTests aren\u2019t just for school or baking though.\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy,\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:47.000\nand scientists use tests to understand the world around us.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
