    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something.\nThink of it like a question that helps you figure out if something works, or if you understand something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:27.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:35.000\nIn science, a test might involve setting up an experiment to see if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:48.100\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and find out more information.\nThey can be simple or complex, but the main idea is to check something to see what happens.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:58.900\nTo recap, a test is a check, a question, or an experiment that helps us find things out.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
