    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.100\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is actually working before you screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:29.800\nThere are all sorts of tests! In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:38.600\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:42.800\nSo, a math test checks your math skills.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:49.200\nA blood test checks your health. And tasting a new cookie? That tests if it's delicious!\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:57.100\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better. It gives us information.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:04.200\nTests are everywhere, helping us learn and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n01:04.200 --> 01:09.800\nRemember, a test is just a way to get information!\n\n01:09.800 --> 01:14.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
