    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:20.600\nIt's a process that helps us gather information to see if something is true, or to check how well something works.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:31.700\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:40.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe and your baking skills to see if you can make a delicious treat.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:51.700\nSo, tests can be big or small, simple or complex, but they all have the same goal: to give us information and help us learn.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:59.600\nThey're a fundamental part of understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
