    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_183123.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:12.100\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:22.200\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. We use tests every day, without even realizing it!\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:31.600\nThink about it: when you try a new food, you're testing if you like it.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:42.000\nOr when you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:52.700\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They might ask you questions about a book you read, or have you solve a math problem.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:58.700\nThese tests help them understand if you need a little more help with something. So, a test is really just a way of gathering information.\n```"
