    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out, or to see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:33.600\nTests aren't just for baking though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature or blood pressure.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:43.400\nAnd in school, tests help show what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, essays, or even just a quick quiz.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:53.900\nSo, remember, tests are just ways to get information. They help us understand things better and make sure everything is running smoothly.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:00.800\nFrom cakes to check-ups, tests are everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
