    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but often a little simpler.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:20.100\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you're baking a cake and you taste the batter.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:28.500\nThat's a test to see if it's sweet enough. Or when you try on shoes before buying them \u2013 that's a test to see if they fit!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:40.700\nIn science, a test could be checking if a plant grows faster with more sunlight. We change something, like the amount of sunlight, and then see what happens.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:51.500\nIf the plant grows taller, that shows a relationship. So, to recap, a test is a way of checking or finding something out.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:57.000\nIt involves trying something and observing the result. It's all about learning!\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
