    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_184338.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something or someone to see how well they perform or what they know.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a checkup \u2013 that's a test to see how healthy you are.\nOr, when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:35.200\nTests can come in many forms.\nThey can be written, like a multiple-choice exam, or practical, like a driving test.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:44.700\nEven tasting food to see if it needs more salt is a kind of test!\nThe goal is always to gather information and understand something better.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:54.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something out and learn more.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
