    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:16.700\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:26.800\nThink about it. You take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Or maybe you bake a cake and taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:36.700\nAnother example is checking if a lightbulb works. You plug it in, and if it lights up, the test is positive, it works! If it doesn't, well, it failed the test.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:46.700\nSo, a test helps us understand something better by giving us information or a result. They come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to find something out.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
