    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.699\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.399\nThink about it like this: a recipe is a set of instructions. A test is when you actually bake the cake to see if the recipe works!\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:35.799\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, you might test a new toy to see if it\u2019s durable enough to play with.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:46.099\nDoctors use tests to find out if you're healthy. So, a test is really just a question, and the answer tells you something important.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:52.100\nIt's a way to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
