    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a cookie to see if it tastes good, or test the water to see if it's warm enough to swim in.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:29.900\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the things you've been learning. It's like a little quiz to show what you know!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:39.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you can spell words correctly. And a math test checks if you can solve problems using numbers.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:49.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out something. It can be about anything, from cookies to spelling.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:55.800\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
