    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in this case, a test is a way of checking if something works as it should.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like this: if you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:30.400\nYou're checking to see if it's cooked all the way through. Or, before buying a new bike, you might take it for a quick ride.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:38.700\nThat\u2019s testing it to see if you like the way it handles. Tests help us find problems before they become bigger problems.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:46.900\nThey're a simple way to make sure things are working correctly, whether it's a cake, a bike, or anything else.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:50.900\nSo, testing is simply checking something to see if it works.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
