    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out what you know, or what something can do.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.700\nThink about it. When you take a spelling test in school, it shows how well you understand spelling.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:31.200\nOr, imagine you're trying out a new recipe. Tasting it is a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:41.800\nAnother example: a doctor might run blood tests to check your health. Or, a company might test a new product to see if it works properly before selling it.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:51.400\nSo, tests are all about gathering information. They help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.100\nThey\u2019re a fundamental tool for understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
