    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something\nor how well something works.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.800\nIt's like checking if your cookies are done by sticking a toothpick in them.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:29.800\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\nThese tests can be multiple choice, true or false, or even essays.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:37.000\nOutside of school, tests are used all the time!\nA doctor might run tests to see what's making you sick.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:43.600\nOr, a company might test a new product to see if it's safe and effective.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:48.600\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz in class or a safety check on a car,\na test helps us understand something better.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:50.600\nIt gives us information.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.800\nRemember, tests aren't always scary.\nThey're just tools for learning and improvement.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
