    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if the batteries work. Or, you might test a recipe by making a small batch to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:36.500\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit before you go outside.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:46.300\nWhether it\u2019s testing the water temperature before you jump in the pool, or trying out a new game to see if it's fun, you're performing a test.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:54.200\nSo remember, a test helps us learn and confirm something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
