    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_185843.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:08.300\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:08.300 --> 00:18.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something.\nThink of it like using a ruler to see how long something is.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:29.100\nWe use tests to figure out what you know, how well you can do something, or even what you like!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:37.500\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how many words you can spell correctly.\nA taste test might help us decide which new flavor of ice cream is the most popular.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:44.300\nAnd a multiple-choice quiz helps us understand what you've learned in class.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:50.800\nSo, tests are just tools.\nThey help us understand where we're at, and how we can improve.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:56.200\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic purpose: to measure something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
