    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:39.300\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. Even a simple squeeze of a fruit, to see if it's ripe, is a type of test!\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:48.200\nTests help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us. They can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your bath water is the right temperature.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:55.800\nSo, a test is all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
