    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_191409.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.300\nWhat is a test, exactly? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:24.000\nIt's how we check if something is true, or if something works the way it should.\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:35.900\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\nOr, if you're building with blocks, you might test if your tower is strong enough to stand up by gently pushing it.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:42.500\nSo, tests help us learn and improve. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:51.000\nThey're a fundamental part of learning and understanding the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
