    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_191546.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like this: it's a set of questions or tasks designed to see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:31.400\nWe use tests all the time. A spelling test shows how well you can spell words. A taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:34.600\nA stress test on a bridge checks if it's strong enough to hold traffic.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:37.800\nSee? Tests aren't always scary!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:45.200\nThey're just tools that give us information. They help us learn, improve things, and make decisions.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:52.600\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test\", remember it's just a way to learn more. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
