    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.100\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like an experiment, but usually with a specific question in mind.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:38.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. If you try a new recipe, you\u2019re testing if it tastes good. Or, if you press a light switch and the light turns on, you\u2019ve just tested that the switch works.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:49.100\nTests can be formal, like a school exam to see what you've learned. Or they can be informal, like checking if your shoes fit before you go out.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:59.100\nThe important thing is that a test helps us gather information and make a decision. So, remember, a test is simply a method for learning or confirming something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
