    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_191717.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.700\nWhat is a test, exactly? Well, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:26.100\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs or exists. Think about it like this: a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:38.500\nOr, a taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes the best! Doctors use tests to check your health, and scientists use tests to see if their experiments work.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:51.000\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz at school to a complex experiment in a lab. The important thing is that it helps us learn and understand more about the world around us.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:58.700\nTests are a fundamental part of gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
