    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_191806.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.400\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in reality, a test is just a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like this: if you bake a cake, you might take a little taste to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:32.800\nOr, if you're building a tower of blocks, you might gently push it to test if it's stable. These are all simple tests!\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:45.300\nThey help us understand if something is good, bad, or needs some tweaking. So, a test is really just a way to get information and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:51.500\nBasically, we test to learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
