    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_192031.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:16.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's a process you use to see if something is true or correct, or to check how well something works.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it's fun.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:36.200\nOr a chef might test a sauce to see if it tastes good. In school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:45.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A science experiment is a test to see if a hypothesis is true.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:53.800\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, tests are all about gathering information and checking things out.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.400\nThey help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
