    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:22.700\nThat's a test! In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.900\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even simple homework assignments. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:39.300\nA math test checks if you can solve problems.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:46.200\nTests aren't meant to be scary. They're just a tool to help you and your teachers learn what you know and what you still need to practice.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:53.300\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check understanding. It's a tool for learning.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
