    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:05.300\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:06.900\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:11.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:15.700\nIt's a process designed to give you information about a skill, knowledge, or ability.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:19.200\nThink of it like this: you might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:23.400\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:26.800\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:33.500\nSo, whether it's a quiz, an exam, a survey, or even just trying something out to see if it works, they all are types of tests.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:38.500\nThey help us understand where we are and what we might need to learn or do next.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:41.600\nBasically, a test helps you learn about something or someone.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:44.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
