    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: a test.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:16.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to check your knowledge or skills on a specific topic.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: imagine you\u2019ve been learning about colors. A test would be a way to see if you can identify red, blue, and yellow.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:34.200\nFor example, a teacher might give you a quiz after teaching you about animals. That quiz is a test!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:43.500\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, successfully riding without falling is like passing a test of your balance and coordination.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:52.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you see what you've learned and where you might need to practice a little more.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:58.600\nIt's all about learning and growing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
