    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.799\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.799 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information about something. Think of it like checking if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:21.700\nYou wouldn't just guess, right? You'd poke them with a toothpick to test if they're ready.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:26.900\nThat's the same idea! Tests can be used in lots of different ways.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:32.100\nA doctor might use a test to check your health, like taking your temperature.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:42.700\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Even trying a new recipe is kind of a test \u2013 you're seeing if it turns out delicious!\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:53.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for finding out more information about something. It helps us make better decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:58.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
