    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_193009.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:11.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.100\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:33.500\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you if something is true, correct, or working as it should.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:49.300\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Or, if your phone isn't turning on, you might try plugging it in to test if the battery is dead.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:56.300\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:00.000\nSo, a test is really just a method, a process, a way of gathering information to learn more about something.\n```"
  },
