    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:03.400\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:05.500\nThink of it like asking a question.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:08.300\nYou ask a question, and the answer you get back\nis the result of the test.\n\n00:08.300 --> 00:12.100\nTests can be big, like a school exam to see what you've learned.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:16.600\nOr they can be small, like testing if a light switch\nworks by flipping it on and off.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:21.300\nFor example, a doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:25.600\nOr a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:26.800\nSee?\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:28.400\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:34.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to gather information\nand see what the outcome is.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:37.200\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:41.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
