    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:13.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like this: a cookie recipe is a test. You follow the recipe, and the result tells you if you understand baking.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:30.900\nOr maybe you've taken a spelling test at school. That test helps your teacher understand how well you've learned your spelling words.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:41.000\nTests aren't just about school, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:50.600\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. Remember, tests help us learn and improve!\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
