    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or checking if something works the way it should.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:25.900\nTests help us learn and improve.\nFor example, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:33.900\nOr, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it's safe and effective.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:47.100\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter before you bake it \u2013 that's a kind of test to see if it needs more sugar!\nOr, after the cake is baked, you'd cut a slice to make sure it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:56.200\nSo, a test is just a way to check something, whether it's your knowledge, a new invention, or even a cake!\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:04.800\nIt helps us understand things better and make sure things are working properly.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
