    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone understands something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if your body is healthy.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:39.800\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:55.200\nTests come in all shapes and sizes! It could be a simple \"yes\" or \"no\" question, or a more complex problem you need to solve. The important thing is that a test gives us information.\n\n00:55.200 --> 01:01.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to evaluate something, whether it\u2019s your health, your knowledge, or even how well a machine is working. They help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
