    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.500\nIt's a process designed to see if something is true, or to check the quality of something. Think of it like this: a spelling test in school checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:32.600\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake; you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. That's a test too!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:40.400\nTests can be big or small, formal or informal. The important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:51.700\nThey help us understand things better, and make decisions based on what we learn. So, in short, a test is just a way of checking things.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
