    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.400\nToday we're talking about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to see if something works, or if you know something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:24.900\nThat's a test! We use tests all the time.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:30.800\nDid you study for your math quiz? The quiz itself is the test!\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:36.700\nDid you try a new recipe? Tasting the food is testing if it turned out right.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:44.800\nAnother example is when you're building something with blocks. You might test if the tower is stable by gently pushing it.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:48.800\nIf it falls, you know it needs more support.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:55.200\nSo, to recap, a test is just a way to check if something is true, working, or correct. It helps us learn and improve things.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
