    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_194030.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests, what they are, and why we use them.\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:27.100\nThink of it like an investigation. We ask a question, and the test helps us find the answer.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:36.200\nFor example, a spelling test helps us figure out how well someone knows their spelling words.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:49.400\nA taste test helps us decide which food we like best. Even a simple temperature check is a test to see if someone has a fever!\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:56.300\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions. They come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.900\nRemember, tests aren't always scary! They're just tools to help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
