    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:18.100\nIt could be about anything! We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:23.700\nThink about it. When you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.300\nOr when you press the power button on your TV, you're testing if it turns on.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:40.100\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned. They might be multiple choice, short answer, or even a hands-on project.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:55.500\nSo, a test is really just a structured way to gather information and see if something works, or if you understand something. It's a tool for learning and discovery.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:01.000\nTests help us improve and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
