    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like a detective trying to solve a mystery! The main idea is to give something a challenge, and then see how it responds.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:33.000\nThat response gives us information. For example, a taste test tells us how something tastes.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:43.600\nA spelling test tells us how well you can spell. A strength test tells us how much weight something can hold.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:51.700\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information by observing a response to a challenge. Remember, tests help us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
