    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like an investigation. We ask questions or perform actions to see what happens and learn from it.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:34.300\nTests can be all sorts of things! A simple example is testing if a lightbulb works by plugging it in. Or, if you're baking, you might test the cake with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:46.100\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:56.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a method of gathering information. By asking questions or trying things out, we can learn more about the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
