    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_194528.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:05.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:07.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:12.500\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:18.300\nThink of it like this: Your teacher gives you a quiz, that's a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:23.700\nOr, imagine you're trying out a new recipe. You taste it, right?\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:25.600\nThat's a test to see if it's good!\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:30.300\nTests aren't just for school or cooking.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:34.000\nScientists use tests to see if a medicine is safe.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:37.400\nEngineers test bridges to make sure they're strong.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:44.700\nSo, to recap, a test is basically a way to check knowledge or performance.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:47.800\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:53.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
