    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:17.100\nA test is basically a way to see how well you understand something, or how well something works. Think of it like checking to see if a lightbulb lights up when you flip the switch.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:21.000\nThat's a test! We use tests all the time.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:27.400\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. But it's not just about school.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:36.200\nYou might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or you might test out different running shoes to see which ones are the most comfortable.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:45.600\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and make better decisions. They give us information to work with.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:54.100\nIn short, a test is a process to evaluate something. Whether it's your knowledge, a product, or even an idea, tests are super useful!\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
