    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, or to check how well you know something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:28.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:31.100\nOr, if you're learning a new language, you might take a test to see how many words you know.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:36.900\nAnother example? Baking a cake! You test it with a toothpick.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:43.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! It's a way of checking.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:51.700\nSo, a test is just a tool we use to learn or check something. It helps us understand where we are and what we need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
