    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_195016.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:21.100\nIt's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is. Think about it like this.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:26.800\nA spelling test helps you find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:32.500\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:41.800\nHere's another one. If you're baking a cake and you poke it with a toothpick, that's a test!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:51.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done. If it's gooey, it needs more time in the oven.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:56.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information. It can be anything from a school quiz to trying out a new recipe. It's all about learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
