    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.212 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:25.800\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:32.800\nThink about it like this: you might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:42.200\nOr, imagine testing if a toy car works by winding it up and letting it go.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:46.900\nDoes it move? That's a test!\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:55.300\nTests aren't just for cakes and toys, though. They're used everywhere!\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:02.000\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:09.300\nSo, a test is really just a way to check something and see if it meets a certain standard.\n\n01:09.300 --> 01:18.500\nIn short, testing is all about asking questions and finding answers to learn more.\n\n01:18.500 --> 01:21.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
