    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260101_195432.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_195432.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:28.700\nIt's a process, a procedure, or an evaluation designed to measure your knowledge, skill, aptitude, or even your personality.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:41.500\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:50.500\nOr even trying out a new recipe \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good! Tests come in all shapes and sizes, from multiple-choice questions to hands-on experiments.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:59.700\nThey help us understand where we stand, identify areas for improvement, and ultimately, learn and grow. So, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "3892847c-075a-4911-b603-b4ff27ed9468": {
    "id": "3892847c-075a-4911-b603-b4ff27ed9468",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
