    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_195523.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.400\nTests help us measure things, understand things, and make decisions.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:30.200\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:36.300\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health. See? Different kinds of tests for different things.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:44.900\nAnother example is testing a recipe. You follow the instructions, and then taste the result.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:56.000\nThe taste is the \"test\" of whether the recipe worked! So, a test is just a process to get information. It can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like tasting food.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:02.000\nIt's all about finding something out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
