    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:31.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, then the cake passes the test! Or, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:40.600\nTests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking if a lightbulb works to seeing how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:52.100\nThe important thing is that a test helps us learn and understand things better. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
