    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:38.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you the cake is done!\nOr, when you try to start your car, and it doesn't turn on, that's a test showing you there might be a problem with the battery.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:47.000\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather before you leave the house.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:57.500\nThe important thing is they help us gather information and make decisions.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
