    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_195829.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:24.300\nIt could be about a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:34.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:41.700\nA chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:48.700\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to test how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:52.700\nSo, tests help us learn and make informed decisions.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:55.700\nThey give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:02.000\nWe use them every day, even without realizing it.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:06.000\nFrom checking if your phone is charged, that's a test,\n\n01:06.000 --> 01:10.700\nto seeing if the water is hot enough for a shower, that's a test too.\n\n01:10.700 --> 01:14.700\nBasically, a test is any procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n01:14.700 --> 01:17.700\nHopefully, now you have a better understanding of what a test is.\n\n01:17.700 --> 01:23.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
