    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_200045.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! \nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You're performing a test! Basically, you're applying a condition, like turning on the switch, and then observing the result to see if the lightbulb passes, meaning it lights up, or fails, meaning it doesn\u2019t.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:41.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A food allergy test checks if your body reacts negatively to certain foods.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:56.700\nEven a simple \"yes\" or \"no\" question can be a test! So, remember, a test is just a process to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or condition.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:02.700\nIt\u2019s all about finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
