    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_200139.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.200\nThink of a test as a way to check something. It could be checking if a lightbulb works, checking if your cookies taste good, or checking if you understand a new idea.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:26.800\nBasically, a test is a process that helps you find out information. You perform an action, and then you see the result.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:38.800\nFor example, if you\u2019re baking a cake, you might use a toothpick test. You poke the cake with a toothpick, and if it comes out clean, that means the cake is done. That's a test!\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:46.100\nOr, if you\u2019re trying to learn your ABCs, you might ask someone to quiz you.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:56.500\nThat quiz is a test to see how well you know them. So, remember, a test is simply a way to check something and gather information.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:02.400\nNow you know what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
