    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_200435.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE\nAll timings are approximate due to the nature of AI-generated content.\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:26.100\nIt helps us measure or check something to see if it's working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:41.800\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to check your health. Or, when baking, you might test a cake with a toothpick to see if it's done. A test could even be something as simple as checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:50.400\nSo, tests are used everywhere to confirm something, identify problems, and make sure things are working the way they should. They help us make informed decisions and ensure quality.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:52.500\nBasically, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:54.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
