    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see if something is working correctly, or to check its quality.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:34.800\nA chef tastes their soup to test the flavor. And a software developer might test their code to make sure it does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:50.700\nSo, tests can be used in lots of different situations. They can check for errors, measure performance, or just make sure things are up to standard. Basically, they help us know if something passes or fails, meets expectations, or needs improvement.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:59.100\nTesting is a vital part of making sure things are reliable and safe. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
