    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in this case, we're talking about a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like this: before you buy a new toy, you probably want to make sure it actually works, right?\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:30.300\nTests can be simple, like checking if a light bulb turns on.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:39.200\nOr, they can be a bit more complicated, like making sure all the buttons on your TV remote do what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:53.500\nBasically, a test helps us confirm that something behaves the way we expect it to.\nSo, next time you're checking if your shoelaces are tied tight, remember, you're performing a test!\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:00.000\nIt's all about making sure things are in order.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
