    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:18.800\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:26.500\nWhether it's to check if you understand a topic, see how well something works, or even just to figure out your favorite flavor of ice cream, it's all a test.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:35.500\nThe main idea is to ask a question or present a challenge, and then look at the results to learn something new.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:43.100\nThink about a spelling test at school. It helps you and your teacher understand which words you know and which ones you need to practice.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:50.700\nOr imagine testing a new recipe \u2013 you try it out and see if it tastes good!\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:63.100\nIf it does, great! If not, you can adjust the ingredients and test it again. So, a test is a method for gathering information and making informed decisions. It helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
