    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:14.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:37.800\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes better. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and scientists use tests to learn more about the world.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:46.600\nFor example, you might test if a plant grows taller with more sunlight.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:57.800\nOr, you could test if a toy car goes faster on a smooth surface versus a rough one. These are all simple tests.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:01.300\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information and learn something new.\n```"
