    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_201256.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:14.100\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working properly, or if you've learned something new.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:23.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing if you can answer it correctly.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:33.900\nWe use tests all the time, in all sorts of ways. For example, your doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:46.700\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Even when you try out a new video game, you're testing to see if you like it!\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:57.700\nSo, a test is simply a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard. It helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:04.399\nRemember, tests can be big or small, formal or informal. It\u2019s all about finding out what we need to know. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
