    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:29.100\nIt's a process, or a set of questions, designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or even just your opinion on something.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:37.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you can spell words.\nA taste test lets you decide which food tastes best.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.500\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:57.000\nTests aren't just about getting a grade.\nThey help us learn what we already know, and what we need to work on.\nThey can also help us make decisions, like which product to buy or which job is the best fit.\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:59.600\nSo, tests are everywhere, helping us learn and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
