    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.100\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works, or if you know something. It's like a little investigation!\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:23.000\nBasically, a test compares what's supposed to happen with what actually happens.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:28.600\nDoes your cake taste good? That's a taste test!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:33.900\nDoes your flashlight turn on when you flip the switch? That's a test too.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:45.900\nFor example, imagine you're baking cookies. The test is whether they taste like cookies and aren't burned. Or, if you're learning your ABCs, a test might be saying them out loud to see if you remember them all.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:55.600\nSo, tests are all about checking things. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:62.400\nThey're everywhere, from cooking to learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
