    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:08.590\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:08.590 --> 00:18.090\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something.\n\n00:18.090 --> 00:28.880\nIt could be your knowledge, your skills, or even how something works.\n\n00:28.880 --> 00:38.900\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:43.030\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:43.030 --> 00:47.590\nAnd engineers use tests to make sure a bridge can hold a lot of weight.\n\n00:47.590 --> 00:49.700\nSo, tests help us understand things better and make important decisions.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:51.100\nThey give us information, whether it's about you, a product, or even a scientific idea.\n```"
