    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:18.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working, how good something is, or even what someone knows.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:24.800\nThink about it like this: a recipe test. You follow the recipe, and then you taste the cake.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:34.000\nThe taste is your test result, telling you if the recipe is good or needs tweaking. Or imagine a spelling test at school.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:40.500\nIt shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:45.200\nAnother example is testing a new toy.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:49.900\nYou play with it to see if it's fun and durable. That's a test!\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:56.200\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new. Remember, tests aren't scary, they\u2019re helpful!\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
