    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE: The following subtitles are timed according to the original narration.\n      They are not perfectly synced to the animations in the code.\n      You may need to adjust the timings to match the animation speeds.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:03.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:05.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:07.500\nIt's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:11.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:15.300\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:19.500\nTests aren't always about right or wrong answers, though.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:22.100\nSometimes, like a taste test, it's about your opinion!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:26.200\nFor example, which cookie tastes better? That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:34.200\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information, whether it's checking your knowledge, your health, or even your taste preferences.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:38.600\nRemember, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:42.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
