    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:07.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.000\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:14.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:17.000\nYou can test it by sticking a toothpick in.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:20.000\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:24.000\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a light bulb works.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:26.000\nYou plug it in.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:28.000\nIf it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:32.000\nTests help us make decisions and understand things better.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:37.000\nThey can be as simple as checking if your shoelaces are tied or as complex as a science experiment.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:42.000\nSo basically, a test is just a method for checking something.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:47.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
