    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_202806.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is true, or working correctly, or even just what someone knows.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:27.500\nThink of it like this: a baker tests their cake by poking it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:32.900\nOr, a doctor might test your eyesight to see how well you can see.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:42.100\nLet's say you're learning to ride a bike. Falling down is actually a test!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:55.200\nYou're testing your balance and figuring out what works and what doesn't. Tests aren't scary; they're just a way to learn and improve.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to gather information and see where things stand. It helps us learn, grow, and make sure everything's working the way it should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
