    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_202940.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:18.000\nThink of it like a question. You ask the question, and the answer tells you what you need to know.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:30.700\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher find out how well you know your spelling words. Or, if you bake a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:39.900\nThe results of a test can help you improve, like studying harder for the next spelling test, or adding more sugar to your cake.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:46.000\nSo remember, tests are just tools. They help us learn and get better at things.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:53.600\nThey are a way to check and see if the process is working. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
