    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_203043.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:18.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or maybe your teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:36.200\nTests can be anything from a simple yes or no question, to a more complicated set of problems to solve.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:45.200\nFor example, a taste test can tell you if you like a certain food. A spelling test can show how well you know your words.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:59.000\nSo, in a nutshell, tests are tools that help us measure and understand things. They give us information about performance, knowledge, or even just personal preferences.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:02.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
