    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.900\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we simply mean a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:24.900\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think of it like this: a test is a process.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:35.400\nYou give something a try, or you ask a question, and then you see what happens.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:39.200\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well we know our spelling words.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:44.800\nOr, a taste test tells us which flavor we like best.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.500\nAnother example? Imagine you're baking a cake. You follow a recipe and then\u2026you test it!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:59.300\nYou taste it to see if it's good. That\u2019s a test too.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:06.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for learning or checking something.\n\n01:06.700 --> 01:10.000\nIt could be a quiz, a taste, or even just trying something out to see if it works.\n\n01:10.000 --> 01:13.200\nSimple, right?\n\n01:13.200 --> 01:16.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
