    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_203319.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nWhat is a test, really?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:25.300\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:38.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA baker tastes their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:44.300\nIn school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:49.700\nMaybe it's a multiple-choice quiz, or a written assignment, or even just answering questions in class.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:55.200\nThese are all tests!\nThey give you and your teacher valuable information.\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for checking something.\nIt's a way to learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
