    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.200\nWell, simply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:26.100\nIt's like an experiment, but often a little simpler. We use tests to see if something is true or false, good or bad, or even just to measure something.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:32.500\nThink about it: a recipe test tells you if a cake tastes good. A spelling test shows if you know your words.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:38.900\nAnd a medical test can tell you if you're healthy. So, tests help us gather information.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:47.900\nThey give us evidence to make decisions and understand the world around us a little better.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:51.100\nWhether it's baking a cake or checking your health, tests are a useful tool. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
