    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.600\nIt could be checking if a light bulb works, or if you understand a new concept. Think of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it\u2019s sweet enough.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:34.700\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you've learned the material. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or a math test sees if you can solve problems.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:40.500\nTesting isn't just for school, though! Doctors use tests to check your health, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:54.000\nSo, tests are all about checking something to see if it works, or if you understand it. That's the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
