    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.599\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we don't just mean school exams.\nA test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see if something is true.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:24.699\nThink of it like this: you might test if a lightbulb works by screwing it in.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:31.899\nOr you might test a recipe by making a small batch before cooking for a crowd.\nAgain, a test!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:41.399\nIn science, tests are often called experiments.\nScientists design experiments to test their ideas about the world.\nThey change one thing, and see what happens.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:49.599\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nIt could be a lightbulb, a recipe, or a scientific idea.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:59.199\nIt\u2019s all about finding out if things are as we expect them to be.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.899\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
