    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_204127.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:25.200\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something about a topic.\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school checks if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:40.800\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which cookie tastes better!\nTests can be simple, like asking a friend if they like your new haircut, or more complex, like a scientist running an experiment.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:54.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\nWhether it's a quiz, a survey, or an experiment, it's all about finding out the answer.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
