    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea, or checking if something is working properly.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:26.200\nThe main idea behind a test is to get information. It helps us figure out what we know, or if something needs to be fixed.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:36.300\nFor example, a spelling test shows you what words you can spell correctly. Or, testing a new toy makes sure it's safe to play with.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:38.900\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:47.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and get information. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:51.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
