    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:18.600\nThink of it like an investigation. We ask a question, and the test helps us find the answer.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:30.700\nIt can be anything from a simple check to see if a lightbulb works, to a big exam in school.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.900\nIf you press the light switch and the light turns on, that's a test! The question was, \"Does the lightbulb work?\" And the answer was yes.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:43.300\nAnother example? Baking a cake! Tasting it afterward is a test to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:49.900\nTests help us understand things better. They give us information to make decisions.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:58.200\nSo remember, a test is just a way to learn something. It's an investigation that helps us answer a question.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
