    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.200\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:33.100\nOr, you take a test at school to show what you've learned. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:38.700\nFor example, you might test if a toy car rolls faster on a smooth floor or a carpet.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:47.500\nOr, you could test different light bulbs to see which one shines the brightest. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:54.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to explore and understand the world around us. It helps us answer questions and learn new things.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.100\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
