    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:21.100\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, you\u2019re looking for proof.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:30.900\nIt could be anything! Like, a taste test to see which cookie is yummier. Or, a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:43.100\nEven a medical test can help doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:51.800\nBasically, a test is a process to measure something. We use tests to check our knowledge, to see if something works, or even to compare different things.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.300\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of gathering information and learning something new.\n```"
