    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_205429.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.800\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It helps us see if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a topic.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:30.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:41.100\nOr, a medical test checks if you're healthy. Tests give us information.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:43.700\nFor example, a bakery might test a new recipe to see if people like the taste.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:54.300\nA car company might test a new car to see if it's safe. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.800\nSo, to recap, a test is just a way to check something. It gives us information to help us make decisions or understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
