    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:20.600\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:29.200\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned.\nA chef might taste a soup; that's a test to see if it needs more salt!\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:38.500\nTests can be formal, like a written exam, or informal, like checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:51.600\nThe key is that you're trying to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
