    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_205649.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:06.700\nToday we're talking about tests, and what they really mean.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how much you know about something.\nIt's like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:19.800\nWe use tests all the time.\nThink about when you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:25.200\nYou might wobble at first, but with practice, you get better.\nThat's a test \u2013 you're testing your balance and coordination.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:34.200\nOr imagine baking a cake.\nYou follow the recipe, and then you taste it to see if it came out right.\nThat taste test tells you if you did a good job!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:48.900\nSo, whether it's a quiz in school, trying a new recipe, or even learning a new game, remember that tests are just a way to learn and improve.\nThey help us see what we know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:56.100\nTests aren't scary; they're helpful!\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
