    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.000\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, maybe in school or even online. But what exactly is a test?\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:27.600\nEssentially, a test is just a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a topic, if a product works correctly, or even if a recipe tastes good!\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:36.500\nWe use tests to get information. Think of it like this: A math test checks your knowledge of addition and subtraction.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:41.500\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of a new ice cream. See? Different things, but the same idea.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:48.600\nSo, a test helps us find out something specific. They give us data or results we can then use.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:56.000\nIn short, tests help us to learn and improve.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
