    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to give us information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a physical test to check your health.\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:39.200\nOr, you might even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\nSo, a test always involves asking a question or performing a task, and then analyzing the results.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:51.000\nIt helps us learn and make decisions.\nFor example, a test might tell you that you need to study a bit more, or that your new recipe is a total success!\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:59.900\nIn short, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
