    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like an experiment, but with a specific goal: to see what happens, or to measure something.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:26.800\nWe use tests all the time! A doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:37.600\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you like the taste!\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:49.700\nSo, whether it's checking your spelling with a quiz, or seeing if a plant grows with different amounts of water, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:56.500\nThey help us gather information and make better decisions. That's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
