    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:18.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process that helps us gather information and see how well something works, or how much of something is present.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. A baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:40.800\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to test what you've learned. So, a test is just a structured way of asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand something better.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:54.300\nIt's used everywhere, from medicine to baking, and even in school. To recap, a test is a procedure, it gives us information, and it helps us to understand.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
