    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.400\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:31.000\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch. Basically, we're trying to answer a question: Does this thing do what it's designed to do?\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:41.000\nFor example, a math test checks if you understand addition and subtraction. Or, a taste test can tell you if food tastes good.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:54.800\nSo, we use tests all the time, even without realizing it! They help us make sure things are working correctly and meeting our expectations.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:03.500\nTests are important for learning, building things, and even just figuring out what flavor of ice cream you like best! In short, a test is a way to check if something works as intended. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
