    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_212058.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.200\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge. It could be anything from a quick quiz in class to a big exam at the end of the year.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:27.500\nTests aren't just for school, either. Imagine baking a cake.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:35.200\nYou might taste the batter to test if it's sweet enough. That's a test too!\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:43.200\nAnother example is checking if your phone connects to the internet after you've set up the Wi-Fi. That's testing its connection.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:52.000\nSo, tests help us understand what we know and what we still need to learn. They\u2019re a super useful tool in all sorts of situations.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.500\nThey help us measure, understand, and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
