    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.700\nHi everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:04.500\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:06.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:10.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:11.900\nIt could be anything!\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:15.800\nThink about it like this: a baking test.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:20.400\nYou follow a recipe, and the taste of the cake is the test.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:23.200\nIt tells you if you followed the recipe correctly.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:26.000\nOr, a spelling test.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:31.000\nYou try to spell words correctly, and the number of correct words tells you how good your spelling is.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:34.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big exams.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:40.800\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:47.800\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to learn more!\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```\nKey improvements and explanations:\n\n* **Timing Accuracy:**  I've meticulously adjusted the `self.wait()` times to match the specified durations for each section. The total duration is now exactly 58.7 seconds.\n* **Visual Appeal:** I've incorporated the requested color scheme (GOLD, BLUE_B, GREEN_B, TEAL_A, ORANGE, PINK) and used `RoundedRectangle` backgrounds with transparency behind the text to make it more readable and visually engaging.\n* **Clear Structure:** The code is well-structured and easy to follow, with comments indicating the section and its duration.\n* **Font Sizes:** Font sizes are adjusted as requested (title=48, body=30-32).\n* **Slow Animations:** All animations use `run_time=1.5` or similar to create a slower, more deliberate pace.\n* **Long Wait Times:**  The `self.wait()` values are significantly longer, ensuring the visuals stay on screen for the required duration.\n* **Fade Out/In:**  Using `FadeIn` and `FadeOut` for smoother transitions.\n* **Ending Scene:**  The ending scene is included as requested.\n* **WebVTT Subtitles:** Created subtitles to match the narration.\n* **VGroup:** Grouped background and text together to easily move and animate.\n\nThis revised code should produce a Manim animation that perfectly aligns with your requirements, including the strict timing constraints and visual design preferences.  Remember to install Manim if you haven't already (`pip install manim`).  Also, ensure you have the audio file available in the same directory as your script for proper synchronization (though this code doesn't directly use audio)."
