    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_212320.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:24.800\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\nThink about it: if you're baking a cake and you poke it with a toothpick, that's a test.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:32.600\nYou're testing to see if the cake is done.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:40.200\nOr, imagine checking the temperature outside before deciding what to wear.\nThat's testing the weather.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:47.800\nSo, tests help us learn things, confirm things, and make decisions based on the information we get.\n\n00:47.800 --> 01:03.700\nFrom simple things like baking to more complex things like science experiments, tests are everywhere.\nThey help us understand the world around us.\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:06.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
