    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_212355.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:07.000\nYou've probably taken a test before, whether it's a pop quiz at school\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.000\nor even just trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:13.000\nBasically, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:16.500\nWe use tests to check if something is working correctly,\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:19.500\nor to see if we understand something.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a new lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:24.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:28.000\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, your teacher might give you a test to see which letters you know.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:36.000\nSo, a test helps us measure something, check for understanding, or make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:38.500\nIt\u2019s a simple way to get information.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:42.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
