    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:22.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a topic, like in school,\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:30.400\nor checking if something is working correctly, like a new toy.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:41.300\nThink of it like this: You build a tower of blocks. To test if it's strong, you might gently push it. If it stays standing, it passes the test!\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:51.000\nOr, if you're learning about animals, your teacher might give you a quiz to test what you remember.\n\n00:51.000 --> 01:01.300\nTests help us see what we know, what works, and what needs improvement. They're a tool for learning and making things better. So, remember, a test is just a check-up, a way to see how things are going. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
