    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something called a test.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:31.100\nThe \"something else\" could be anything! Maybe you want to test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:38.900\nOr, maybe you want to test if a lightbulb works by flipping the switch.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:47.000\nThe test gives you information. For example, a spelling test at school tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:53.900\nA medical test at the doctor tells you about your health. The result of the test, like a cooked cake or a correct spelling, helps you understand the thing you\u2019re testing.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:59.400\nSo, a test is just a simple way to learn and check things. That's the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
