    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHello, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like an experiment, but often simpler. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:36.800\nFor example, if you\u2019re baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:45.700\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again to see if that fixes it. Another test!\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:54.100\nEssentially, a test helps us understand how something works, or if something is working correctly. It gives us information we didn\u2019t have before.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.600\nSo, a test is a method used to learn or confirm something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
