    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.000\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:29.200\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. A chef might taste a dish to test if it's seasoned correctly.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:42.200\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to test your knowledge. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic goal: to give us information.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:53.800\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. Remember, a test isn't about being right or wrong, it's about discovering something new!\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "5766bc16-43a8-435d-8db9-352d849724cf": {
