    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_212824.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned. These can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.900\nThe main goal of a test is to measure something.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.900\nFor instance, a spelling test measures your spelling skills. A math test measures your understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:52.000\nSo, tests help us understand where we are and what we need to learn. They\u2019re a tool for learning and growth. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
