    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_212910.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a physical test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:32.800\nEven baking a cake is a test! You're testing your recipe to see if it comes out delicious.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:39.400\nSo, a test involves setting something up, observing what happens, and then drawing a conclusion based on what you saw.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:50.800\nTests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. Understanding this basic idea is the first step to understanding all kinds of tests.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
