    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.100\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:25.100\nTests help us understand if something is working as it should, or if something needs to be improved.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:29.700\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:36.000\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. See? Different tests, same idea \u2013 finding out information.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:42.600\nImagine you bake a cake. You can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:51.700\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test! So, to recap, a test is a way to get information and check if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:57.800\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
