    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_213054.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we don't just mean exams at school.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.200\nA test is simply a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:35.200\nThink of it like this: a baker might taste their cake batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough.\nOr, a gardener might check the soil \u2013 that's a test to see if the plants have enough nutrients.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:46.200\nEven just pressing a button to see if a light turns on is a simple test!\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:53.000\nIt helps us understand what's going on and make improvements.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.600\nIn short, a test is a check. It\u2019s a way of finding out if something is working the way it should.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
