    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.900\nWhat are they, and why do we need them?\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:20.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a new topic, like we're doing now!\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:32.900\nOr it could be checking if something works correctly. Tests help us see what we know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:40.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows you which words you can spell correctly and which ones you need to practice.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:48.100\nOr a taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like the best. They both give you information!\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:57.000\nSo, tests are just tools to help us learn and improve. They show us where we're strong and where we need to focus our efforts. They are a valuable part of learning and building things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
