    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_213353.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something really important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:18.000\nYou've probably taken a bunch of them in school, but what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:26.100\nIt could be checking your knowledge, like a quiz, or checking if something works, like testing a new toy.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:36.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, imagine building a tower of blocks.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:45.000\nTesting it means seeing if it can stand up without falling over! Tests help us learn what we know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:53.400\nThey also help us make sure things are working the way they should. So, tests are all about checking and evaluating.\n\n00:53.400 --> 01:00.200\nThey're super useful for learning and improving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
