    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_213432.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, so you're hearing the word \"test\" and maybe thinking of school, right?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:07.000\nBut in the world of science and technology, a test is simply a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.000\nIt's how we check if something works the way we think it should.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:16.000\nThink of it like this: you build a paper airplane and want to see how far it flies. The flight is the test!\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:21.000\nOr maybe you\u2019re baking a cake and want to know if it's done. Sticking a toothpick in is a test.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:24.000\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:28.000\nTests help us understand things better.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.000\nThey let us see if our ideas are correct and they give us information we can use to improve things.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:37.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get answers.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:41.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
