    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_213521.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.900\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:28.900\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:34.900\nThat's a test! Or, if your bike tire is flat, you might check for a hole.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:52.100\nThat's testing the tire. In school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They can be written exams, quizzes, or even projects.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:59.100\nSo, a test helps us understand something better, whether it's if a cake tastes good, where a hole in a tire is, or what you know about a subject. Remember, a test is just a way to learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
