    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_213931.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:29.000\nIt's how we check to see if something is true, or if something works the way it should. Think about it like this: a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:36.800\nA doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. So, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:48.200\nThey help us learn and understand things better. They come in all shapes and sizes, from simple taste tests to complex scientific experiments.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:59.200\nIn a nutshell, a test is a method for finding information or verifying something. It's a fundamental tool for learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
