    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:28.200\nIt's a method we use to check, measure, or evaluate something.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:39.600\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's just right.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:51.000\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Tests can be anything from a simple check, like tasting food to see if it needs salt, to a more formal assessment, like a multiple-choice exam.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:55.700\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.200\nSo, whether you're testing a recipe, testing a new product, or even testing your own knowledge, remember that a test is just a tool to help you learn and understand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
