    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like this: you take a quiz in school to see how much you've learned about a subject.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:24.200\nThat's a test! But tests aren't just for school.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:31.400\nA doctor might run blood tests to check your health. Or a chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:34.000\nSee? All of these are tests.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:43.600\nSo, tests help us gather information. They give us data that we can then use to make decisions or understand things better.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:51.200\nWhether it's checking your knowledge, your health, or just the flavor of a sauce, tests are all about finding answers.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:57.600\nIn short, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
