    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_214459.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.300\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but really, a test is just a way to find out if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.100\nIt's a way to check and see if things are okay. Think about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:32.100\nThat's a test! Or if you're checking if your bike tires are full, you might squeeze them.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:40.900\nThat's another test! In all sorts of situations, we use tests to make sure things are doing what they're supposed to.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:50.400\nIt helps us catch problems early and make sure everything is running smoothly. So remember, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:54.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
