    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_214916.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of school, but a test in general is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.400\nIt's a process we use to see if something works, or to check its quality.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:32.100\nThink of it like this: a taste test checks if food tastes good.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:38.800\nA doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:54.600\nOr, imagine you're building a tower of blocks. You're constantly testing its stability to make sure it doesn't fall down. So, a test is just a way of gathering information, checking if something is correct, or making sure something works the way it's supposed to. It's a fundamental part of learning and improving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
