    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:06.500\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:09.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:09.600 --> 00:14.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:18.900\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:23.900\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:28.600\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're seeing if it tastes good!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:35.000\nEssentially, a test helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:41.000\nIt could be your knowledge, your health, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:45.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:52.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
