    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:14.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.800\nIt's how we gather information by asking a question or performing an action and then observing the result.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:25.600\nThink about it like this. A simple quiz in school?\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:29.600\nThat's a test to see what you've learned. Baking a cake?\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:38.100\nThat's a test to see if you can follow a recipe! Even checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in is a mini-test.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:44.300\nYou're testing to see if it's functional. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:53.600\nThey help us understand things, make decisions, and learn new skills. They\u2019re all about finding out information!\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:59.000\nIn short, a test is a procedure to find out something.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
