    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.100\nIt could be about anything \u2013 your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.100\nA taste test lets you decide if you like a new flavor. And a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:48.700\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions. They can be simple, like asking a friend if they like your new haircut, or more complicated, like a standardized exam.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:59.000\nThe important thing is that they give us data to work with. Basically, a test is just a question or a series of questions designed to get an answer.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:06.700\nThat answer helps us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
