    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.600\nA test is simply a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to find out if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:34.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing your recipe to see if it tastes good! Tests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:44.200\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:52.000\nBasically, a test is just a way to gather information. It gives us data we can use.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:58.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for finding something out. It's asking a question and looking at the result. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
