    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:16.900\nIt's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\nThink about it.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:24.000\nWhen you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it comes out clean.\nThat's a test!\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz checks your understanding.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:31.100\nThat's also a test!\nTests can be big or small.\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy, or you might test out a new video game to see if you like it.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:40.900\nThe key is, you're trying to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:53.700\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
