    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:37.000\nThe main idea is to see if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:46.700\nWe use tests all the time! For example, if you\u2019re baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to test if it\u2019s done.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:56.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, if you're checking if your bike tires are full of air, you might squeeze them.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.600\nIf they feel firm, they pass that test.\n```"
