    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:24.200\nThat's a test! The toothpick comes out clean?\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:28.800\nThe cake passes the test! If it's gooey, it fails. Simple as that.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:38.300\nTests can be more complicated too, like a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:45.800\nOr a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:51.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information. It helps us learn, diagnose, or even just make sure our cake is perfectly baked.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:54.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
