    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_220119.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.800 --> 00:03.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:08.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:14.000\nThink of it like a question you're asking, but instead of just asking it out loud, you're setting up a situation to get an answer.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:18.500\nIt could be a quiz in school to see what you've learned,\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:23.000\nor a taste test to find out which flavor of ice cream is the best.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:28.500\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a type of test!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:31.500\nYou flip the switch, and if the light comes on, the test passes.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:38.500\nSo, tests help us learn, decide, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:45.500\nThey're all around us, helping us understand the world a little bit better.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:52.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
