    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.400\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:18.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:33.800\nWe use tests all the time! Your doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:43.200\nA baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar. Or, you might take a quiz in school to test your knowledge on a subject.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:50.800\nThe key is that a test gives us information. It helps us understand something better, make a decision, or solve a problem. So, whether it's a multiple-choice exam or just trying out a new recipe, remember that a test is just a way to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
