    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_220301.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHello, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:19.700\nIt helps us understand if something is working, if something is true, or even if we've learned something new.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:31.100\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a physical test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:39.900\nA test can be as simple as checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch. That's a test to see if the bulb is working!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:50.700\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn about something. We use them every day, often without even realizing it.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.600\nRemember, tests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
