    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_220353.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore something called a \"test\".\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.900\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone knows something.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it needs batteries.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:36.100\nOr, your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. In school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:44.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A math test checks if you can solve problems.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:56.800\nAnd testing a new recipe ensures it tastes good before you share it with others! So, remember, a test is a way to evaluate, check, or understand something better.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.300\nThey come in many forms and are used all around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
