    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_220441.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:18.000\nNow, a test, in the simplest terms, is just a way to see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:25.200\nIt's like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:32.400\nThink about it this way.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:39.600\nWhen you bake a cake, you might take a little taste to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:43.800\nOr, if you\u2019re learning to ride a bike, you test your balance by trying to stay upright.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:54.000\nTests can be big, like a school exam, or small, like checking if your shoelaces are tied. The goal is always the same: to find out something specific. So, a test helps us understand things better by giving us clear results. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
