    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.500\nIt's like asking a question and then finding the answer through a specific process.\nThink of it like baking a cake.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:28.300\nYou test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:36.800\nOr, imagine a doctor giving you a test to see if you have a cold.\nThey might check your temperature or look at your throat.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:50.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give us information.\nSo, a test helps us learn, confirm, or discover something.\nThat\u2019s the basic idea!\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
