    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it as a tool to measure or evaluate.\nIt helps us understand more about whatever we're testing.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:28.600\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:34.400\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\nSee?\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:37.800\nIt's all about gathering information.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:43.600\nAnother example is a battery test.\nThat tells you how much power is left in your battery.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:54.200\nOr a blood test, which tells doctors important information about your health.\nSo, to recap, a test is a process or tool used to gather information and evaluate something.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.900\nIt helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:57.900 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
