    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:17.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:27.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:33.000\nOr, think about baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:44.200\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The important thing is they give us information.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:55.800\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:03.600\nTo recap: a test is a method to gain knowledge or understanding about something. It involves asking a question and getting an answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
