    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your lightbulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch.\nThe light turning on is the test passing!\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:30.400\nIn school, a test is how teachers see if you understand the material.\nIf you answer the questions correctly, you pass the test.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:36.800\nAnd it's not just about school! Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:50.900\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check if something is working or if something is true.\nFrom lightbulbs to exams, tests help us learn and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:50.900 --> 01:01.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
