    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_221538.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.100\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it like an experiment where you ask a question and then try to find the answer.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:27.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:45.000\nA baker might even \"test\" a cake batter to see if it tastes good before baking the whole thing!\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's about our health, our knowledge, or even our baking skills.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:54.200\nThey give us information we didn't have before.\nIn short, a test is just a way of getting information and learning something new.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
