    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into something really important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:23.000\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz, that's a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:39.700\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:50.300\nHere's another example: a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. Or, an engineer might test a bridge to make sure it can hold a lot of weight.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:55.600\nSo, tests help us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.200\nIn short, a test is a way to get information. It's like asking a question and getting an answer. Pretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
