    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:16.500\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something. Think of it like a simple question you ask to see if you understand something, or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:25.500\nIt's all about finding out information. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.900\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even tasting a new food is a kind of test, to see if you like it!\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:42.700\nSo, a test is a method to evaluate or examine something to determine its characteristics or qualities.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:55.900\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, and make informed decisions. Whether it's in school, at the doctor, or even in the kitchen, tests are all around us.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
