    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.200\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it's doing what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: a cooking test.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:32.100\nYou taste the soup to see if it needs more salt. That's a test!\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:37.300\nOr, imagine you're checking if a light bulb works.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:46.800\nYou turn it on. If it lights up, the test passes! If not, it fails. Tests can be big or small, simple or complicated, but they all have the same purpose: to give us information.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:56.000\nSo remember, a test is just a way to learn something new about how things work. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
