    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but getting an answer in a more formal way.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:26.100\nBasically, a test helps us measure or evaluate something. It could be your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:38.800\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words. Or think about a taste test, where you try different foods to see which one you like best. Even a simple battery test can tell you if your remote control will work!\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:51.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool we use to learn more about something through measurement and evaluation. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
