    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:27.500\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:34.400\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter before putting it in the oven \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:43.500\nTests aren't just for school or baking. Scientists use tests to see if a medicine works.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:55.000\nEngineers test bridges to make sure they're safe. Pretty much anything you want to know more about, you can create a test for it.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information. It helps us learn, improve things, and make sure things are working properly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
