    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:04.100\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:07.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to check if something is working correctly,\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:09.500\nor to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:14.500\nThink of it like this: if you build a toy car, you might test it by pushing it to see if the wheels turn and it goes straight.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:18.400\nIn everyday life, tests are everywhere.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:20.600\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:23.700\nYour teacher gives you tests to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:28.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test, checking if the ingredients combine to make something delicious!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:31.300\nSo, a test is simply a way to gather information and confirm something.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:35.600\nIt helps us understand, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:39.400\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they\u2019re just tools for learning and growth.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:42.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
