    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_222232.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:07.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:11.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:18.000\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or skills in a specific area.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:24.800\nThat's a simple test!\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:29.400\nMore formally, tests are used in schools to see how well you've learned a subject.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:35.300\nThey can also be used to check your eyesight, your physical fitness, or even your personality.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:39.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:43.500\nA physical test, like running a mile, checks your endurance.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us understand something better, whether it's how much you know, or what you're capable of doing.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
