    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_222453.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.000\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:39.900\nDoctors use tests to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:50.200\nEngineers use tests to make sure bridges are strong enough. Tests help us learn and improve things all the time!\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:53.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something out. It helps us understand what we know, and what we still need to learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
