    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like checking if something works, or seeing how well you understand a new idea.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:21.600\nTests can be all sorts of things.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:32.000\nA doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives tests to see if you've learned the material in class.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:41.300\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test \u2013 you're testing if the recipe works!\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:50.600\nFor example, you might test if a lightbulb works by screwing it into a lamp. If it lights up, it passes the test.\n\n00:50.600 --> 01:03.900\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you can balance.\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:10.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn more about it.\n\n01:10.600 --> 01:14.400\nIt helps us understand if things are working the way they should, or if we need to try something different.\n\n01:14.400 --> 01:18.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
