    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. We're basically asking a question and trying to get an answer.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:24.200\nThink about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:32.700\nOr, if you\u2019re checking to see if your bicycle tires have enough air, you might give them a squeeze. That's also a test!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:38.900\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking questions in class.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:49.800\nThe important thing is that a test helps us understand something better. So, remember, a test is all about finding things out.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
