    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.100\nNow, in the simplest terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you\u2019re trying to figure out if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:30.700\nYou put it to the test! So, what does that mean in practice?\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:35.600\nWell, imagine you bake a cake. You might test it by sticking a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:41.400\nThat's a test! Or maybe you\u2019re trying to see if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:47.200\nYou screw it in and flip the switch. If it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:47.200 --> 01:00.100\nTests are everywhere, from checking if your shoes fit to figuring out if your homework is correct. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:05.900\nBasically, a test is just a simple way to find out if something is true or working correctly.\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:06.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
