    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_223501.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:26.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see what the results tell us.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:30.700\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:38.600\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\nBoth of those are tests!\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:46.200\nAnother example is baking a cake.\nYou follow a recipe, which is like the test procedure, and then you see if the cake rises and tastes good.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:49.800\nThat's the result!\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:55.400\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and make decisions.\nThey're all about getting information and understanding what it means.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nRemember, a test is just a method for finding something out.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
