    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or performance.\nThink of it like this: you have a question, and the test helps you find the answer.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:30.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nA simple quiz in school is a test.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:40.600\nSo is a doctor checking your reflexes, or even a taste test when trying a new ice cream flavor!\nThey all help us understand something better.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:49.400\nFor example, a math test shows how well you understand numbers.\nA spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:55.400\nAnd that ice cream taste test?\nWell, it shows which flavor you like best!\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:06.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of learning something new, or confirming what you already know.\nIt's a tool for understanding.\n\n01:06.000 --> 01:09.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
