    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.700\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.700 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're going to talk about something really important: tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:09.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:09.800 --> 00:14.700\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time!\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:18.700\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:22.500\nOr when you push a door, you're testing if it's unlocked.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:25.200\nThese aren't formal tests, but the idea is the same.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:28.800\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:32.000\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:38.200\nThe results of the test tell you and your teacher what you understand well and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:42.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and improve.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:46.700\nIt's a tool to help us understand things better.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:49.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
