    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_224028.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:20.300\nTests are everywhere.\nThink about when you check if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:25.800\nOr when you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit.\nAnother test!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:30.800\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:38.600\nEven scientists use tests to prove if their ideas are right.\nSo, a test is just a way to learn or confirm something.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:47.400\nIt's a simple but powerful tool we use all the time.\nRemember, tests help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
