    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_224117.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:32.300\nThink about it: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:40.700\nA chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:50.200\nAnd in school, we take tests to show what we've learned.\n\n00:50.200 --> 01:00.000\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:03.400\nFor example, if your doctor's test shows you have a cold, they might tell you to rest and drink plenty of fluids.\n\n01:03.400 --> 01:09.900\nIf the chef's sauce needs salt, they'll add some.\n\n01:09.900 --> 01:18.300\nAnd if you do well on a school test, it shows you understand the material!\n\n01:18.300 --> 01:28.000\nTests are a fundamental tool for learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n01:28.000 --> 01:31.600\nThey help us to measure, evaluate, and improve.\n\n01:31.600 --> 01:35.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
