    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:20.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your light bulb works, so you put it in a lamp and turn it on.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:30.800\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time.\nDid I study enough for my math quiz?\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:36.400\nThe quiz itself is the test!\nDoes this cake taste good?\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:45.700\nYou take a bite \u2013 that's your taste test!\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for checking if something is functioning as expected, or verifying a statement.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:55.100\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
