    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_224255.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.600\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a check-up.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:23.800\nWe use tests all the time! For example, when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:35.800\nOr, if you're baking a cake, tasting the batter is a test to see if it needs more sugar. Another example could be checking if a lightbulb works before screwing it in.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:41.900\nThat quick check is a test! We want to make sure it works before we commit to using it.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:52.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information or confirming something. It helps us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
