    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_224655.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nThink of a test as a way to see what you know or how well something works. It\u2019s like asking a question and seeing if you can answer it correctly.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.500\nTests can come in lots of forms. You might take a test in school to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:32.300\nOr, a company might test a new product to make sure it's safe and reliable.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:45.300\nFor example, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. A test might be successfully riding from one end of the driveway to the other without falling.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:56.100\nOr, if you're baking a cake, tasting it to see if it's sweet enough is a type of test. So, in short, a test is just a way to check knowledge, abilities, or the quality of something.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.000\nIt helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:59.000 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
