    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us see what we know, what we can do, or even what something is like.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:34.900\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.700\nAnd a science experiment is a test to see if a hypothesis is correct.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:52.700\nTests can be written, like quizzes in school. They can be practical, like a driving test. Or they can be observations, like watching how a plant grows over time.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information. It's a way to learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
