    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.500\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\nYou screw it in, flip the switch, and see if it lights up \u2013 that's the test!\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:33.100\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nA pop quiz in class is a test.\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you can follow the instructions and make something delicious!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words.\nA fitness test sees how many push-ups you can do.\nAnd a taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:50.700\nSo, a test helps us measure something.\nIt could be knowledge, skill, or even just personal preference.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.500\nIt gives us a way to understand where we are and what we might need to learn next.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
