    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? \nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but usually with a specific question we're trying to answer. \nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.900\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check if you're healthy. \nEven tasting a new food to see if you like it is a kind of test!\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:42.800\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, or just make decisions. \nThey're all about gathering information.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:50.800\nRemember, a test is just a method for finding something out. \nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
