    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_225709.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:10.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:21.900\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the strength of a material.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:30.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\nA taste test tells you which food tastes best.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:39.800\nAnd a stress test on a bridge makes sure it can handle a lot of weight.\nSo, tests help us measure things, compare things, and make decisions.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:49.100\nThey're all about gathering information.\nIn short, a test is a way to learn more about something through a structured process.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
