    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:24.000\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if the water in your bath is too hot.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:30.800\nYou don't just jump in, right? You test it with your hand.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:34.200\nThat's a test!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:40.300\nOr maybe you're baking a cake, and you want to see if it's done.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:41.900\nYou poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:44.800\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:51.000\nTests are used everywhere. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:53.600\nTeachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:58.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way of checking something to see if it's working, ready, or correct. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
