    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:06.200\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:09.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:13.400\nIt's basically a process where we give something a try to see what happens.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:17.700\nThink about it like this: You're baking a cake, and you taste the batter.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:18.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:22.200\nYou're checking if it tastes good before baking the whole thing.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:26.100\nOr, imagine you're trying out a new video game.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:28.900\nPlaying the first level is a test to see if you like the game.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:34.200\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something works, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:39.500\nIt's a fundamental part of learning and discovery!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:42.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
