    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.000\nIt's a method we use to check, measure, or evaluate something.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.400\nThink about it like this: a recipe calls for baking a cake for 30 minutes. You can test if the cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:41.700\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, imagine you're learning a new skill, like riding a bike.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:56.500\nYou might test yourself by trying to ride further each day. The distance you manage is your test score. So, a test helps us understand something better, whether it's the doneness of a cake, how well we're learning a new skill, or anything else you can think of.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:03.900\nIt's just a way of checking in and seeing where things stand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
