    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:26.100\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or ability on a particular topic.\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is ready, you test it with a toothpick.\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:35.500\nSimilarly, a school test helps your teacher see how well you understand the lessons.\nMaybe it's a quiz on the alphabet, or a math test with addition problems.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:43.000\nTests aren\u2019t just for school though.\nDoctors use tests to see if you\u2019re healthy, and scientists use tests to prove their ideas.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:56.500\nSo, to recap, a test is just a method to check something and get information.\nIt helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:02.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
