    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_230437.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of testing.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:11.500\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like this: You want to know if your cookies are done baking.\nYou perform a test \u2013 maybe you poke them with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you they're ready!\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:29.000\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\nEach time you try, you're testing your balance.\nYou might wobble and fall, that's a test showing you need more practice.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:38.000\nEventually, you'll balance and ride smoothly, proving you've learned the skill.\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something is true, correct, or working as expected.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:53.200\nIt helps us learn and improve!\n```"
