    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_230833.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:28.500\nThink about it: a chef tastes the soup \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt.\nOr, when you check if a lightbulb works before screwing it in \u2013 that's a test too!\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:39.300\nA doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on inside your body.\nTests help us make informed decisions, big or small.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:49.300\nSo, tests are ways to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:53.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
