    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_230915.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:26.300\nTests help us check if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:33.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:42.500\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:51.300\nAnother example is a taste test! You try different flavors to see which one you like best.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:58.500\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz in class to trying out a new recipe. It's all about gathering information. Basically, a test is just a procedure used to check something and get results. We use tests every day in lots of different ways! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
