    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests help us learn more about ourselves, about objects, or even about ideas.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:37.900\nFor example, a simple spelling test tells you how well you know your words. Or, if you're baking a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:49.000\nScientists use tests too, to see if their ideas are right. They might test a new medicine to see if it makes people feel better.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:59.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. It can be as easy as tasting a cake or as complex as testing a new medicine.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:03.300\nThe important thing is that it helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
