    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_231548.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.300\nIt helps us check if something is true, working, or good. Think of it like this: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:32.200\nOr, when you get a new toy, you might test it out to see if it works the way it should.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:38.800\nTests are used everywhere! Doctors use tests to check your health.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:50.000\nTeachers use tests to see what you've learned in class. And even scientists use tests to discover new things about the world.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and understand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
