    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_231719.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:07.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:13.700\nIt\u2019s like a little check-up for your brain! Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:17.700\nThink of a spelling quiz in school. That's a test!\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:21.700\nOr even when you try out a new recipe to see if it tastes good \u2013 that's kind of a test too, right?\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:31.600\nLet's say you're learning about animals. A test might ask you to name different animals, or match pictures to their names.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:42.200\nIf you get most of them right, that shows you know your animals! So, a test is just a tool to see what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:49.300\nIt helps you and your teachers understand your progress.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
