    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_231939.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:34.700\nTests aren't just for baking, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, teachers use tests to see what you've learned, and even scientists use tests to discover new things.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:44.800\nFor example, a doctor might use a blood test to check your vitamin levels, or a teacher might give you a quiz to see if you understand the lesson.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:55.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a process to gather information and see if something is true or correct. It's a simple way to check up on things.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
