    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_232023.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore something really fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:22.900\nWe use tests all the time! When you bake a cake and stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done, that's a test.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:33.600\nOr when a doctor checks your temperature to see if you have a fever, that\u2019s another test. Even trying on a pair of shoes to see if they fit is a type of test!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:44.300\nSo, a test helps us gather information and make decisions. It's a simple way to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:55.800\nTests can be simple or complex, but they all have the same goal: to get an answer. Remember, a test is just a method for finding something out.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
