    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_232159.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something really fundamental: a test!\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like asking a question, but in a structured way.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:32.400\nThe main idea is to gather information. We set up a procedure, then we observe the result.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:39.800\nThat result then tells us something about what we\u2019re testing.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:44.700\nFor example, think about a simple spelling test.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:49.600\nYou\u2019re given words, and the test reveals how well you can spell.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:54.500\nOr, think about testing a cake. You taste it!\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:08.300\nThe taste test tells you if the cake is delicious. So, remember, a test is all about finding things out! We ask a question, perform a procedure, and the results give us information.\n\n01:08.300 --> 01:14.000\nThat's the basic idea of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
