    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:15.000\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You might use a toothpick, right?\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:31.100\nSticking the toothpick in and seeing if it comes out clean is a test. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:40.300\nYour doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. A teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:49.500\nEven tasting a new food to see if you like it is a kind of test! So, a test is really just a method, a procedure, to gather information.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:53.800\nIt helps us make decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.300\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools.\n\n00:57.300 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
