    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.400\nWhat is a test, anyway?\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:29.700\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a new concept.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:34.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:37.800\nOr, your teacher might give you a test to see if you learned about, say, fractions.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:41.600\nThose are tests! We can test all sorts of things.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:45.400\nAnother example?\nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:49.800\nYou can test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:55.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\nThat's a simple test.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.500\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check something.\nIt helps us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n```"
