    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:27.000\nThat\u2019s one kind of test. But tests aren\u2019t just for school.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:34.200\nImagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it\u2019s sweet enough. That's a test too!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:41.400\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:48.600\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz to a taste test to a safety check. It\u2019s all about gathering information and seeing if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:51.900\nBasically, a test helps us understand things better.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
