    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:25.400\nThe test? You screw it into a lamp and flip the switch. If it lights up, the test passed!\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:31.300\nAnother example: you want to know if you understand a math problem.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:37.100\nThe test? You try to solve it. If you get the right answer, you passed that test too!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:48.800\nSo, a test is just a method of checking something. It helps us understand if something is working, if something is true, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:54.600\nIt's all about finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
