    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_233048.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific answer in mind.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:38.900\nBasically, a test helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:48.300\nIt could be anything from a quiz at school to see what you've learned, to checking if a new recipe actually tastes good.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:55.400\nFor example, a doctor might run a test to see if you have a fever. Or, you might test a toy to see if it's strong enough not to break easily.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nWe can even test a new lightbulb to see how long it lasts.\n```"
  },
