    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:18.200\nToday, we're diving into the basics of a test. Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:27.200\nIt could be about your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:34.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:41.400\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is tastier.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:52.800\nEven a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy. So, tests help us gather information. They help teachers see what students have learned, companies check if their products are working well, and even you can use a test to see how well you remember something.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:57.200\nIn short, a test is just a way of checking or evaluating. That's the basic idea of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
