    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.500\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like this: you test the water in a pool to see if it's the right temperature.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:34.700\nOr, a doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:39.300\nTests come in many forms. You've probably taken quizzes in school.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:41.200\nThose are tests!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:46.900\nBut tests can also be practical, like a driving test to see if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:51.600\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:54.800\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:57.500\nSo, next time you encounter a test, remember it's just a tool for learning and growth.\n```"
