    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_233451.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to see how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works \u2013 you turn it on, and the light tells you if it's good or needs replacing.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Maybe it's a quiz at school, or a driving test to get your license.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:44.200\nEven tasting a new recipe is a kind of test, to see if you like it! They help us measure our progress and identify areas where we might need to learn more.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:53.700\nSo, a test is just a tool to understand what we know and what we can do. Remember, tests are a learning opportunity!\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
