    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_233537.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the concept of a test.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it as a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:21.900\nIt can be anything! Is this cake delicious?\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:28.000\nThat's a test. Does this lightbulb work? Another test!\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:36.200\nWe use tests all the time to gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:45.700\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a quiz to test your knowledge. Even trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:51.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information. It helps us answer a question and learn something new.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.500\nAnd that's tests in a nutshell! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
