    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260101_233813.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.300\nThink of a test as a way to find out what you know about something. It's like checking your understanding.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:24.900\nSo, how does it work? Basically, you're given a set of questions or tasks, and your answers show how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:37.400\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see if you know how to spell different words. Or, a quiz after reading a chapter in a book checks if you understood what you read.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:50.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but the main idea is always the same: to measure your knowledge. Remember, tests are just one way to learn and improve!\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:56.600\nThey help you and your teachers see where you're doing well and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
