    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE This subtitle file was automatically generated by Apilage AI\nNOTE Total duration: 60.7 seconds\n\n00:00.229 --> 00:05.409\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.409 --> 00:12.729\nWhat exactly is a test?\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.729 --> 00:20.029\nIt's a process designed to gather information and see how well something performs or how much you know.\n\n00:20.029 --> 00:30.899\nThink about it like this: a food taste test helps determine which recipe tastes best.\nOr a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:30.899 --> 00:47.009\nTests can be used in lots of different situations.\nSo, whether it's a driving test to prove you can safely operate a car, or a math test to see how well you understand fractions, remember that tests are tools.\n\n00:47.009 --> 00:53.739\nThey help us learn and understand things better.\nThey give us feedback, so we can improve.\n\n00:53.739 --> 01:00.709\nTests are a way to measure knowledge or skill.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
