    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.000\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nIt's a method to see if something works, if you know something, or if something is true.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:29.200\nYou put it in a lamp, turn it on, and that's the test!\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:31.900\nDoes it light up?\nYes or no?\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:36.800\nOr maybe you're taking a spelling test in school.\nThat test helps your teacher see how well you understand spelling.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:44.600\nAnother example: a doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold.\nThey check your temperature and look in your throat.\nThat\u2019s a test, too!\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:53.000\nSo, to recap, a test is just a procedure or a method used to gather information and figure something out.\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
