    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:29.900\nYou can test anything! For example, you might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:38.500\nIf it comes out clean, the test is successful! Or, you could test if your phone has enough battery by trying to turn it on.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:46.800\nIf it turns on, that's a good sign! Tests help us understand things better and make decisions based on the results. So next time you're trying something new, remember to test it out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
