    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.400\nA test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are done baking \u2013 you stick a toothpick in, and if it comes out clean, the test says they're ready!\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.600\nTests aren't just for school. Your doctor uses tests to check your health, like a blood test.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:44.100\nOr, when you play a video game, the game itself is constantly testing your skills. You win if you pass the tests, right?\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:50.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to measure something, whether it's your knowledge, your health, or even your gaming abilities.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:56.700\nThey help us understand where we are and what we need to work on. That's tests in a nutshell!\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
