    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of Tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:21.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:32.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your lightbulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:43.300\nAnother example: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:54.700\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. The key is to have a way to observe the result and see if it meets your expectations.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It could be anything from checking if a lightbulb works, to seeing if a cake tastes good.\n```"
