    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like an experiment, but usually shorter and more focused.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:23.500\nWe use tests all the time! Think about it: a taste test of a new ice cream flavor tells you if you like it.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:33.200\nA spelling test at school shows your teacher how well you know your words. Even pressing a button to see if a light turns on is a kind of test.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:45.100\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions. They can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like trying a new recipe.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:52.000\nThe main idea is that you're trying to learn something new, or confirm something you already suspect. In short, a test is an action or procedure that helps you discover or prove something.\n\n00:52.000 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
