    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:09.100\nBasically, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:09.100 --> 00:17.600\nThink of it like a quiz, but it doesn\u2019t always have to be about school.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:21.400\nFor example, you might test if a lightbulb works by screwing it in.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:24.600\nIf it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:28.800\nOr, a chef might test the soup by tasting it to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:38.200\nSo, a test helps us confirm if something is working as expected, or if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:42.400\nIt helps us make sure things are correct and reliable.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:46.000\nIn short, a test is a way to check if something works.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:48.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
