    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:22.700\nThe toothpick test tells you if the batter is still wet inside. Or maybe you want to see if you can lift a heavy box.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:28.500\nThat's a test of your strength. Companies use tests all the time to make sure their products work correctly before selling them.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:38.900\nLike testing a new phone to see if it can survive being dropped. So, a test is just a simple way to check something.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:47.300\nIt helps us learn and make sure things are working as they should. Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:52.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
