    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_000026.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.500\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like this: A doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.600\nA teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:41.800\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a test. You read the question and choose the best answer.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:46.600\nOr, imagine you're testing if a toy car needs new batteries.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:56.300\nYou put in fresh batteries and see if it works. That\u2019s a test! So, remember, a test helps us learn or check something.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.800\nIt\u2019s about gathering information in a clear and organized way. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
