    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:27.800\nIt could be a math test at school, where the questions help your teacher see how well you understand numbers.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.100\nOr it could be a taste test, where you try different foods to see which one you like best.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:44.400\nAnother example is a medical test. Doctors use them to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:54.900\nThey might take a sample of your blood and test it to see if everything is working properly. So, remember, a test is just a method or procedure for determining something.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.900\nIt helps us gather information and make decisions. We use tests all the time, in school, in the kitchen, and even at the doctor's office!\n```"
