    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:12.500\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:21.800\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something.\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:36.300\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\nTests can be written, like quizzes in school, or they can be hands-on, like trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:46.600\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\nThey're all about gathering information.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:54.600\nWhether it's checking your knowledge or figuring out if something is working correctly, tests are a super useful tool.\nThat's the basics of tests!\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
