    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_000755.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.700\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:06.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:8.400\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:11.200\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:16.800\nThink about it this way: When you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:20.800\nOr, if you press a button on a remote, you're testing to see if it works.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:24.700\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:28.800\nThey might ask you questions or give you problems to solve.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:32.100\nThe answers show them how well you understand the topic.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:35.700\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:40.100\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:41.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
