    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_000850.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:15.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, it's a way to find out how much you know or can do.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like checking if your cake is ready. You poke it with a toothpick, right? The toothpick is your little test!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:31.700\nIn school, tests can be things like quizzes, exams, or even just answering questions in class. They help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:45.500\nOutside of school, tests can be things like a driving test to see if you're ready to be on the road, or even trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:53.200\nSo, tests are everywhere, helping us measure and learn. They give us feedback, so we can improve.\n\n00:53.200 --> 01:02.200\nRemember, a test is just a tool, not something to be scared of. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
