    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_001129.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how well someone knows something, or how well something works.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like checking if you understand the rules of a game after someone explains them.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:34.500\nSo, how does it work? Well, it usually involves answering questions or performing tasks. The results are then used to measure your understanding or the performance of whatever is being tested.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:45.700\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words. Or, a stress test on a bridge checks how much weight it can safely hold.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:48.300\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:57.100\nEssentially, a test is just a way to gather information and see where things stand. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
