    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:05.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:09.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:14.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might order a blood test to see what\u2019s going on inside your body.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:15.700\nThat's one kind of test.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:18.800\nBut tests aren't just for doctors.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:21.200\nYou take tests in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:25.400\nA chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:26.200\nSee?\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:27.800\nLots of things can be tests!\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:32.000\nBasically, a test helps us gather information.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:37.000\nIt gives us a result that we can then use to make decisions or understand something better.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:42.500\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:47.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
