    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:21.200\nIt helps us check if something is working, if we understand something, or even what someone's opinion is.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:31.500\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you take a test in school to see if you understand the lesson.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:40.700\nEven trying a new recipe is a test to see if it tastes good! So, a test is really just a way to gather information.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:48.500\nIt can be as simple as tasting a cookie to see if it's sweet enough, or as complex as a science experiment.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:58.400\nThe important thing is that it gives us an answer. In short, a test helps us learn, explore, and make better decisions.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:02.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
