    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is basically a way to check if something works, or if something is true.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing if you get the answer you expect.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:26.300\nThink about it like this: you might test a lightbulb by plugging it in to see if it lights up.\nIf it does, the test passes!\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:32.600\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:38.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready. That's a test!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:43.400\nTests are super important because they help us make sure things are working correctly and doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:51.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nAnd that\u2019s the basics of testing!\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
