    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:16.700\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:32.400\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:42.000\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might stick a toothpick in it to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:48.100\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:57.700\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz helps you test how well you're understanding the words and grammar.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:02.100\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like that toothpick in the cake.\n\n01:02.100 --> 01:09.600\nBasically, a test is any process that gives you information about something's quality, knowledge, or performance.\n\n01:09.600 --> 01:16.400\nIt helps us figure out what we know, how well something works, or if something is ready.\n\n01:16.400 --> 01:19.600\nSo remember, a test is just a check-up.\n\n01:19.600 --> 01:23.700\nIt helps us learn and improve!\n\n01:23.700 --> 01:25.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
