    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:05.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:09.700\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer.\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:11.100\nIt could be anything!\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:14.500\nA test can check if your cookies are done baking, or if you know your ABCs.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:17.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you can spell words correctly.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:21.300\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:26.600\nAnd a medical test can help doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.500\nSo, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.500\nA way to gather information and learn something new, or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:48.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
