    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_001958.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:21.200\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer. It helps us understand if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:29.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:41.600\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Even baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:48.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something passes or fails. It's a tool for learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
