    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.900\nIt could be about how much you know, like a quiz in school, or it could be about checking if something works correctly.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:29.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or maybe you're testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:35.700\nThe test gives you information. So, a school test shows how well you learned something.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:40.300\nA car safety test checks if the car is safe to drive.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:53.800\nSee? Tests are all around us, helping us learn and make sure things are working as they should. To sum it up, a test is a process designed to evaluate something and give us valuable information.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
