    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:22.100\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Think about it: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:32.300\nOr, you might try on a pair of shoes to test if they fit. In school, tests help us see how well we understand what we've learned.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:40.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling, while a math test checks your knowledge of math problems.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:49.100\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic purpose: to give us information.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:55.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:01.500\nIt's a way to measure something, whether it's your shoe size or your understanding of a topic.\n\n01:01.500 --> 01:04.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
