    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:13.800\nThink of a test like a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you understand something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.700\nBasically, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. It could be a multiple-choice quiz at school to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:35.200\nOr, it could be a safety check on a new car to make sure the brakes work. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:39.800\nA chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt. See?\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:51.000\nTests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is simply a way to find out if something is working as it should, or to measure understanding.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.000\nIt's all about checking things out.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
