    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.000\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt could be about anything!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:31.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nWe use tests to check our knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:37.400\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:43.500\nA taste test helps decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:49.600\nAnd a stress test on a bridge checks if it's safe.\nSee how different tests can be?\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:51.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool.\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\nTests aren't scary, they're helpful! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
