    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:22.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:27.800\nImagine you're trying a new recipe. You taste it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:37.600\nYou're testing if it tastes good. Or, if you're trying to turn on a light and it doesn't work, you might check the lightbulb.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:54.800\nThat's testing to see if the bulb is the problem. Tests can be simple, like tasting that recipe, or more complicated, like a math exam. But the idea is the same: to learn something, to confirm something, or to make sure something is working correctly.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:59.900\nSo, a test is just a way to get information!\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:07.396\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
