    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_002704.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:03.800\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:03.800 --> 00:05.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:09.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:12.600\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:16.600\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:19.300\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:20.300\nSee?\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:22.800\nDifferent tests, different purposes.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:26.400\nAnother example is a taste test!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:30.200\nYou might try a few different kinds of cookies and then rate which one you like best.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:31.500\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and measure something.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:41.700\nIt helps us understand more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:44.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
