    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with questions and answers. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:36.100\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good. Or, if you press a button on a remote and the TV turns on, that's a test to see if the remote works.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.400\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. They ask questions, and your answers show how well you understand the material.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:57.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and understand things better. It helps us see if something works, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:01.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
