    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:19.800\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting a verbal answer, you're observing a result.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:28.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your words. A taste test helps decide which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:39.800\nA medical test helps your doctor understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:46.900\nSo, tests help us learn, compare, and understand. They're all about getting information.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:53.900\nRemember, a test is just a way to find something out. We use them every day, in all sorts of situations.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.400\nThat's it for the basics of tests! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
