    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.000\nToday, we're diving into what a test actually is. Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give us information.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:40.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a fever. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:49.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 it tells you if you followed the recipe correctly!\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:53.000\nSo, a test helps us learn something new, check our knowledge, or confirm something we suspect.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:54.400\nIt's all about gathering information in a structured way.\n```"
