    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_003242.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_003242.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like an investigation. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:29.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:34.700\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:46.100\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. That's a test too!\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:53.200\nIt's just a simple way to check something out. So, a test can be a quiz, a medical exam, or even just tasting something to see if it's right. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.800\nBasically, a test helps us understand things better! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
