    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:21.300\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:29.300\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:37.900\nOr, if you're trying to guess a flavor of ice cream while blindfolded, that's also a test. You're trying to learn something.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:46.600\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:56.900\nThe important thing is they help us understand the world around us. So, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
