    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_003500.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a right or wrong answer.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:38.800\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:51.000\nA taste test tells you which food you like better. And a medical test helps doctors figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:60.200\nThe goal of a test is usually to measure knowledge, skills, or even preferences. It gives us information that we didn't have before. So, a test helps us learn, helps us improve, and helps us understand the world around us a little better. Remember, tests aren't always scary, they're just a way to learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
