    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_004224.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:24.300\nWe use them every day, even if we don't realize it.\nBasically, a test helps us understand how well something works, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:33.500\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:43.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\nA taste test checks if you like a certain food.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:54.300\nOr even just checking if the light switch works is a kind of test!\nYou flip the switch, and if the light comes on, the test passes.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:58.000\nSo, a test is just a simple method for checking something.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:01.500\nIt helps us learn, explore, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:01.500 --> 01:05.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
