    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:17.600\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a light bulb works, so you put it in a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:26.700\nThat's a test! Basically, a test helps you find out if something is true, correct, or working as expected.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:32.200\nLet's say you're baking a cake. You taste the batter before putting it in the oven.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:41.200\nThat's a test to see if it tastes good! Or, if you're planting a seed, you check back every day to see if it's sprouted.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:47.700\nYou're testing to see if it will grow. So, tests are all about checking things.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:58.800\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure everything is working the way it should. Remember, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
