    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:18.900\nThink of it as a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:27.900\nThese questions can be about anything! Maybe you want to test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:40.800\nOr perhaps you want to test if a toy car works by pushing it. Even a doctor asking you questions is a kind of test to see how you're feeling.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:53.800\nSo, in all these examples, we\u2019re performing an action or asking a question to learn something new. We're testing to see if our cake is baked, our toy car rolls, or if you're feeling healthy.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:59.500\nBasically, a test helps us understand the world around us a little better. That's all there is to it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
