    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:19.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process designed to gather information and see if something is true, or if something works.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:37.900\nOr, maybe you take a quiz at school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:48.100\nAnother example could be testing a recipe. You follow the instructions, and the taste test at the end tells you if the recipe is good.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:54.500\nTests aren't just for school or doctors, though. They're all around us! So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something is true or works correctly. It helps us learn and improve things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
