    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.200\nThink of it like this: your teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you've learned the material in class.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:26.400\nThat's a test! Or, maybe you want to see how fast you can run.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:31.600\nYou could time yourself running a race. That\u2019s also a kind of test.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:40.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Some are written, some are spoken, and some involve doing something practical.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:51.300\nThe important thing is that they help us measure something. So, a test is a tool for measuring knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:57.500\nThat\u2019s the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
