    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:25.600\nMaybe you want to know if a cake is done. You can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:32.400\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready! Or maybe you want to know if your plants need water.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:39.300\nYou can test by sticking your finger in the soil. If it feels dry, it\u2019s time to water them.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:48.800\nTests help us make decisions. They give us information so we can understand things better. So remember, a test is just a way to get information and answer a question. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
