    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:38.900\nTests can come in many forms.\nThere are multiple-choice tests, true or false tests, even performance-based tests where you actually do something to show what you know.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:48.000\nFor example, baking a cake could be a test of your baking skills!\nThe main goal of a test is to give us information.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:59.300\nInformation that helps us learn, improve, or make decisions.\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
