    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_004955.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.900\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:23.800\nIt helps measure your understanding. Think of it like this: if you\u2019re learning to ride a bike, falling down a few times is like a test.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:31.700\nIt shows you what you need to work on. In school, tests can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:40.000\nThey help your teacher see how well you've grasped the material. They also help you see where you might need a little extra practice.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:45.600\nSo, a test isn't just about getting a grade. It's about learning and growing.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:53.400\nRemember, every test is a chance to learn something new! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
