    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nYou've probably taken a few in your life, but what exactly is a test in a more general sense?\n\n00:09.900 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to gather information.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a cake is done.\nYou stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:28.200\nThat's a test!\nThe result tells you if it's ready or not.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:33.000\nOr maybe you want to see if a lightbulb works.\nYou screw it in.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:37.400\nThat's a test!\nIt either lights up, or it doesn't.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:50.200\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like seeing if your shoes still fit.\nThey all share the same goal: to check something and get an answer.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:58.200\nThey help us understand the world around us.\nSo remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
