    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:04.600\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out information.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:06.800\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:09.700\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:13.300\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it's delicious.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:16.000\nOr, if you push a door, you're testing if it's open or closed.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:18.700\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:22.900\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even writing an essay.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:27.400\nSo, whether it's trying a new food or answering questions in class, a test is simply a way to gather information and see what's what.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:32.400\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:35.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
