    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re diving into what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:21.000\nIt could be a quiz in school to see if you've learned the material, or a taste test to see if you like a new flavor.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:28.900\nA doctor might run a test to check your health, or a software developer might test their code to make sure it works right.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:38.400\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz, a blood test, or even trying a new ice cream flavor, you're performing a test.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:49.300\nBasically, anything that helps you learn something or figure something out is a test. Remember, tests aren't scary, they're just ways to learn and improve!\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:52.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
