    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.700\nNow, a test is really just a way to check how much you know or understand about something.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like a measuring tool for your brain!\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:35.900\nIt could be a quiz in class, a driving exam, or even just trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:42.300\nThe main idea is to see if you can do something or remember something correctly.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:51.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or, a taste test lets you see if you can tell the difference between different flavors.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:56.300\nSee? It's all about finding out what you know!\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:58.400\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check your knowledge or skills. It helps you and others understand what you've learned. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
