    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:22.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\nIt could be checking if you understand a new idea, if a recipe tastes good, or even if a machine is working properly.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:30.900\nThink of it like this: you've just learned about the alphabet.\nA test might ask you to write down the letters to see if you remember them.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:37.000\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking cookies.\nYou taste one to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:43.100\nTests help us learn and improve.\nBy identifying what we know and what we don't, we can focus on the areas where we need more practice.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:53.300\nSo, tests are basically tools to help us understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
