    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:18.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something, right? It\u2019s a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs, or how much of something is present.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:26.900\nThink about it like this: a taste test! You're trying something new, and the \"test\" is seeing if you like it.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:33.500\nOr, imagine a doctor giving you a physical. That's a series of tests to check your health.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:48.600\nThey might measure your blood pressure, or test your reflexes. So, tests can be anything from simple, like asking a friend if they like a song, to complex, like a science experiment.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:58.700\nThe key is that they help us learn and understand something better. In short, a test is a method for collecting data and drawing conclusions.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:02.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
