    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.700\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.200\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:35.100\nThe toothpick comes out clean? That's a test that tells you the cake is ready!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:41.000\nOr, imagine checking if your bike tires have enough air. You can squeeze them.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:47.900\nIf they feel firm, that's a test that tells you they're good to go. So, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:51.800\nThey help us understand things and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:53.800\nThey're all about checking and finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
