    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.900\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it as a question or a set of questions designed to see what you know, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. A taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:35.100\nAnd a medical test can help a doctor understand what's going on inside your body. So, tests come in many forms.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:43.700\nThey can be written, spoken, or even involve doing something. The key is that they give us information.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:56.300\nThey help us measure, understand, and learn. In short, a test is a method for gathering information about knowledge, preferences, or function.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
