    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us check if something is working correctly, or to see how much we know about a subject.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, in school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:37.700\nTests can be written questions, like a quiz, or they can be practical, like seeing if a toy car still runs.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:45.900\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information or checking performance. It\u2019s a way to learn more!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:49.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
