    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_011136.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:14.400\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:28.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nIt can be a written exam, like you might take in school, to see what you've learned.\nOr, it could be something more practical, like testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:37.800\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\nOr, you might test the water in a swimming pool to make sure it's clean.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:50.800\nWe even test new apps on our phones to make sure they work properly before we use them.\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:59.100\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
