    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:19.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:36.400\nThat's a test! The toothpick tells you if the batter is still wet or if it comes out clean.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:44.300\nAnother example: maybe you're learning to ride a bike. Each time you try and don't fall, that's a little test, showing you're getting better.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:52.200\nOr a spelling test in school \u2013 it shows what words you know. Tests help us learn and understand things. They give us information.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:59.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and see where you stand. It's a tool for learning and improving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
