    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.800\nIt's a process we use to gather information or see how well something works. Think about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:33.500\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. Or, a health test can help your doctor understand how your body is doing.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:44.500\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, trying out a new recipe, or checking your car's engine, all of these are different types of tests.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:54.200\nThey all help us learn and understand things better. To recap, a test is a method for gathering information or assessing something.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:01.600\nIt comes in many forms and helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
