    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_011417.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like an investigation. We ask a question, and the test helps us find the answer.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.200\nFor example, a simple math quiz is a test to see how well you understand addition.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:46.400\nOr, a taste test is a way to find out which ice cream flavor people like best. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:54.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a process for gathering information. It helps us learn, understand, and make better decisions.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.400\nIt can be as simple as tasting something new or as complex as a scientific experiment. Tests are everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
