    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to measure something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:24.300\nIt could be your knowledge, your skills, or even the strength of a material. Think of it like this: a spelling test measures how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.200\nA taste test measures how good something tastes. Or a strength test on a bridge measures how much weight it can hold.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:40.100\nTests help us understand things better. They give us information we can use to make decisions,\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:48.300\nlike whether you're ready to move on to the next grade, if a new recipe is a winner, or if a bridge is safe to drive on.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:55.600\nSo, tests are all about measuring and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
