    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_011839.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:17.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\nIt's a process or a procedure designed to measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.500\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\nThat's another kind of test.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:52.500\nTests can be formal, like a standardized exam, or informal, like asking a friend if they like a new restaurant.\nThe key is that you're trying to gather information or assess something.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.100\nSo, whether it's a spelling test, a taste test, or even testing out a new recipe, remember that a test is simply a tool to help us learn and understand.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
