    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like a tool to measure your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:30.800\nThere are all kinds of tests. A simple pop quiz in school is a test. Your doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:39.500\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if it tastes good!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:48.200\nFor example, if you\u2019re learning to ride a bike, falling down a few times is part of the test. You\u2019re testing your balance.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:52.200\nOr, if you're taking a spelling test, it shows how well you've learned your words.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:58.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see where you're at. It helps you learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
