    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 specifically, what a test is and why we use them.\n\n00:09.900 --> 00:20.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a cake is ready, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:37.900\nThat's a test! The toothpick tells you if the cake is cooked through. In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:52.600\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just answering questions in class. For example, a math test might ask you to solve a problem, showing you understand addition.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:59.700\nOr, a history test might ask about a specific event, showing you remember important facts.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:06.800\nSo, tests are just tools to measure knowledge and understanding. They help us learn and improve!\n\n01:06.800 --> 01:10.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
