    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done. You use a toothpick to test it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:35.700\nIn more formal situations, tests help us measure knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:47.500\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words. Or a fitness test shows how strong you are.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:55.200\nSo, a test is just a method, a process, for gathering information. It helps us understand something better by giving us measurable results.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.900\nRemember, tests aren't always about right or wrong answers; they're about learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
