    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_012542.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:06.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:11.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:16.500\nIn everyday life, we take tests all the time!\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:20.800\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:24.500\nOr if you flip a light switch and the light comes on, you've just tested that the bulb works.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:29.600\nThe same idea applies in more formal settings too.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:33.500\nA doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:37.900\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:42.100\nBasically, a test is just a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:45.700\nIt helps us learn, understand, and make decisions.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:51.700\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test\", remember it's just a way of finding out information!\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
