    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.300\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:29.400\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test!\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:37.800\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, you test your balance by taking your feet off the ground.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:49.900\nBasically, a test helps you find out if something is true, or if something works correctly. So, remember, a test is just a way to check things.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:53.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
