    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:26.000\nIt's a process, a procedure, a set of questions, all designed to give us information. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:38.100\nOr, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Even baking a cake involves a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe and your skills!\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:52.000\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and understand things better. They\u2019re used in all sorts of situations, from science experiments to everyday life.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:59.800\nRemember, a test is just a tool to gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
