    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_012909.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like a little experiment.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:25.200\nWe ask a question, or present a challenge, and then see what happens. Tests can be anything from a simple spelling quiz in school to a doctor checking your reflexes.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:33.000\nThe quiz helps find out what words you know, and the doctor's test helps them see if your nerves are working correctly.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:40.800\nFor example, a cookie recipe is a test. You follow the instructions, and the result \u2013 the cookies \u2013 shows if the recipe works.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:51.400\nOr, think about trying a new phone. You use it, explore its features, and that\u2019s a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:51.400 --> 01:05.100\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and see if things are working as they should. They're a fundamental part of how we understand the world around us.\n\n01:05.100 --> 01:08.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
