    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_013127.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.600\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:10.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:10.200 --> 00:15.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:23.800\nThink about it. You take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words. Or a taste test to see which flavor you like best.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:30.700\nEven trying on a new pair of shoes is a kind of test to see if they fit!\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.600\nTests aren't just in school. When you bake a cake, you test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:48.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! So, a test helps us learn, decide, and make sure things are working right.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:57.600\nBasically, a test is a method to evaluate or measure something. It could be knowledge, a preference, or even the quality of a baked good.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
