    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_013752.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like a question, and you're trying to find the answer.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:32.400\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. A doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:38.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:43.600\nSo, let\u2019s say you want to know if your plant needs water.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:50.000\nYou can test it! Stick your finger in the soil. If it feels dry, the plant probably needs watering. That's a simple test.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:56.300\nBasically, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
