    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHello there! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:23.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is ready, you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:35.100\nThat's a test! The toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\nIf it's gooey, the cake needs more time.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:41.800\nOr, imagine you're learning your ABCs. Your teacher might give you a quiz \u2013 that's a test too!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:49.800\nIt helps them see how well you understand the letters. So, a test is just a tool to check something.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.800\nIt could be a quiz, a science experiment, or even just checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:58.300\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
