    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:29.600\nThink of it like this: a test helps measure your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:44.100\nFor example, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different animals or describe where they live.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:54.800\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, a test might be how well you can balance and steer. Tests can be written, like quizzes, or practical, like showing someone how to do something.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:01.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool. It helps you and others understand what you\u2019ve learned and where you might need a little more practice. It's all about learning and growing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
