    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_014753.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or what you can do. Think of it like this: you want to see if your cake is done baking.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:18.800\nYou use a toothpick! That toothpick is a little test.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:30.100\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. It could be a quiz in school, a driving test to get your license, or even a medical test to check your health.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:34.900\nThey all help us measure something.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.800\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words. A fitness test might measure how strong you are.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:51.300\nSo, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge, skills, or abilities. It helps us understand where we are and what we might need to learn next.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
