    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_014846.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\nThink of it like a check-up.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:28.300\nThe main idea is to see if you've learned the material or if a product meets certain standards.\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:36.900\nOr, a company might test a new phone to make sure the battery lasts long enough.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:43.400\nAnother example is a taste test.\nYou try different flavors of ice cream and decide which one you like best.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:52.800\nThat's a test, too!\nSo, tests help us measure knowledge, performance, or preference.\nThey're a great way to learn and improve.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
