    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_015004.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you information.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:26.000\nIt could be a quiz at school, which helps your teacher see what you\u2019ve learned. Or, it could be a doctor giving you an exam to check your health.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:31.700\nEven tasting a new food is a kind of test! You're testing whether you like the flavor.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:44.900\nSo, tests are all about gathering information. They help us understand things better, whether it's about our knowledge, our health, or even just our preferences.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:49.300\nThey help us learn and improve. Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
