    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_015439.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer. We use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:38.600\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:49.100\nOr, if your bike tire feels flat, you might press on it to test if it needs more air. Tests aren't always about grades!\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:59.600\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, short answer, or even projects.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:04.900\nThe goal is to see if you understand the topic.\n\n01:04.900 --> 01:09.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information and seeing what you know.\n\n01:09.600 --> 01:15.100\nIt's a tool for learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
