    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_015524.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling a really important topic: tests!\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:20.400\nAt its core, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting a verbal answer, you're often getting a result that you can measure.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:30.100\nFor example, a math test helps us see how well you understand addition or subtraction.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:36.100\nOr, think about a taste test! You might try two different cookies and decide which one tastes better.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.000\nThat's a test! We're finding out your preference. Tests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big, important exams.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.900\nThe key thing to remember is that they're all about gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:52.900 --> 01:04.100\nSo, whether you're taking a spelling test or trying a new recipe, you're participating in a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "7821dc30-474a-4c53-85ab-90d816b524ae": {
    "id": "7821dc30-474a-4c53-85ab-90d816b524ae",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T01:50:12.967052",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-02T01:56:10.633492",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_015610.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_015610.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:19.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:31.300\nThe toothpick is the test!\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:45.800\nIn the world of, say, science, you might test a hypothesis, which is basically an educated guess.\nYou run an experiment, and the results of that experiment are the test.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:57.900\nFor example, if you think plants grow better with more sunlight, you can test that by growing some plants in the sun and some in the shade, and comparing the results.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:05.300\nSo, a test helps us understand if our ideas are right or wrong.\nIt's all about checking things out!\n\n01:05.300 --> 01:08.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
