    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:24.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:33.300\nIt's a way to measure or evaluate something to see how well it performs or what it's like.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:42.100\nThink of it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:49.600\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which ice cream flavor you like best!\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.700\nTests aren't just for school, though.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:00.900\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and scientists use tests to learn about the world around us.\n\n01:00.900 --> 01:07.800\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information, make decisions, or check on something.\n\n01:07.800 --> 01:12.300\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n01:12.300 --> 01:18.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
