    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:17.100\nNow, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is ready, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:36.300\nOr, if you want to know if you understand a new concept, you might answer some questions about it. Those questions are a test, too.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:47.100\nTests can come in many forms, like quizzes, exams, surveys, or even just trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:58.300\nThe important thing is that a test helps us get information and learn something new. So, remember, a test is simply a way to evaluate something.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:06.200\nIt helps us understand where we stand and what we need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
