    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like checking if your bike tires have enough air. That's a test!\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:29.500\nYou\u2019re testing if they\u2019re ready to ride. Or, maybe you\u2019re trying to remember a friend's phone number.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:43.500\nTrying to recall it is a test of your memory. So, tests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like seeing if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.300\nWhether it's a school exam, a taste test, or checking if your code runs without errors, they all help us learn and improve.\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:03.300\nTo recap: a test is a way to evaluate something, whether it\u2019s your knowledge, a skill, or even the quality of a product.\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:11.299\nIt helps us understand where we stand and what we need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
