    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:04.600\nToday, we're diving into the world of \"tests.\"\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:7.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:10.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb still lights up \u2013 that's a simple test!\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:17.400\nEssentially, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or performance in a specific area.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:21.400\nIt can be written, like a quiz in school, or it can be practical, like testing a new recipe.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:26.800\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:31.700\nOr, a company might test a new product to make sure it's safe and reliable.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:37.100\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to evaluate or check something.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:42.100\nIt helps us understand performance, knowledge, or the quality of something.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:44.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
