    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_021258.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHey there, welcome!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:11.200\nEver wondered what a test is?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:24.000\nIt's like an experiment or a check-up.\nWe use tests all the time to see if something is working, or to understand what we know.\nThink about it: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:29.700\nSee?\nTesting is all about gathering information.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:35.800\nAnother example is when you try to figure out if a toy car needs new batteries.\nYou test it by turning it on.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:39.000\nIf it doesn't work, you know it needs new batteries.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:48.100\nTests help us learn and make decisions every day.\nSo, to recap: a test is a way of finding something out.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:54.100\nIt helps us understand, learn, and make choices based on the results.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
