    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:27.100\nTests aren't just for people, though! We can test anything.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:37.500\nFor example, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, a company might test a new product to see if people like it.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:50.000\nSo, a test is just a tool to help us learn, understand, and improve things. It helps us see if something works, or if we need to make some changes.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.500\nRemember, testing is all about finding things out!\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
