    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:17.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is good before you put it in a lamp.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:36.700\nThere are lots of different kinds of tests. You might take a test in school to see what you've learned about a subject.\nOr, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it's safe and effective.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:44.800\nFor example, a simple spelling test can show how well you know how to spell words.\nAnd a car company might test their new cars to make sure they're safe to drive.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:56.900\nTests help us learn and improve things. So, to sum it up, a test is a way to check something out.\nWhether it's your knowledge or a brand-new invention, tests help us understand what's going on.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
