    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! \n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like asking a question and then finding the answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:34.100\nFor example, if you touch a hot stove, that's a test! You're testing to see if it's hot, and unfortunately, you find out it is.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:45.900\nOr, if you're trying to open a door, you might jiggle the handle. That's a test to see if it's locked.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:57.200\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like figuring out if the milk is sour by smelling it. They all share the same goal: to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:01.300\nSo, a test is just a way to explore and understand the world around us.\n01:01.300 --> 01:04.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
