    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:14.600\nNow, you might think of school exams, but a test in a broader sense is just a way to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:25.800\nYou're testing the lightbulb.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:31.600\nOr maybe you're baking a cake and you want to know if it's done.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:34.900\nYou poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:41.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:52.700\nBasically, a test is any action you take to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard. It helps us understand how things work and make sure they're doing what they're supposed to.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:55.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check things out!\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
