    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:36.400\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test showing the cake is done!\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:53.900\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is broken, you might try turning it on. If it doesn't light up, that's a test telling you it's not working.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:00.900\nSo, a test is just a simple way to gather information and see if something is true or false, working or not working, or just generally understanding something better. It's a helpful tool for learning and problem-solving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
