    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:21.000\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: you go to the doctor for a check-up.\nThey might run tests like checking your temperature or taking a blood sample.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:36.700\nThese tests help them understand your health.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:41.700\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might test the batter by tasting it to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:46.700\nThat's a test too! It helps you make sure the cake will be delicious.\n\n00:46.700 --> 01:00.500\nSo, tests can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like tasting your cooking.\nThey all help us learn something new or confirm what we already suspect.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:11.200\nTests help us make better decisions based on the information we get.\n\n01:11.200 --> 01:15.900\nIn short, a test is a way to gather information and understand something better.\n\n01:15.900 --> 01:19.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
