    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.500\nEver wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:10.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:16.600\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it's just right.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:27.500\nOr, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel unwell.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:31.700\nTests can be simple, like tasting a new food to see if you like it.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:38.100\nOr, they can be more complicated, like a school exam to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:42.100\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:46.200\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:51.300\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information by checking something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "2e8261de-0c6a-4e9e-a14e-64699dd03ca8": {
