    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_022318.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something really fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:18.400\nNow, you've probably taken a bunch of tests in your life, but what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:30.200\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or abilities. Think about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:40.000\nOr, you might take a written test in school to show what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe!\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:49.800\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information and allow us to make decisions based on that information.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:57.700\nIn short, a test is just a way of checking something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
