    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_022404.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to see what you know about something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:27.500\nThe main idea is to find out how much information you've learned and understood about a particular subject.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:38.400\nFor example, if you've been learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of animals or what they eat.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:45.500\nOr, if you're learning about colors, you might have to point to the color blue.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:52.600\nSo, a test isn't something to be scared of, it\u2019s just a tool.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:58.600\nIt helps you and your teachers see where you're doing great and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:00.000\nIt's all about learning and growing!\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:06.000\nIn short, a test helps measure what you know.\n\n01:06.000 --> 01:12.800\nIt gives you a chance to show off your knowledge.\n\n01:12.800 --> 01:14.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
