    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.700\nThink of a test as a way to check something, to see if it works, or if it's true.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.300\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:30.900\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:38.600\nEven baking a cake involves a test! You taste it to see if it\u2019s delicious.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:49.200\nSo, a test is just a process of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:54.000\nWe use tests all the time, in lots of different ways, to learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:54.800\nThat's the basic idea of a test. Pretty simple, right?\n```"
