    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.000\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information or evaluate something.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:11.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:13.500\nYou\u2019re testing to see if it lights up!\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:17.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:22.000\nThere are tests to see what you\u2019ve learned in school, like quizzes and exams.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.200\nBut there are also tests to see if a car is safe to drive, or if a new medicine is effective.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:32.000\nLet's say you're baking a cake.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:35.500\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:40.200\nOr, you could have a friend try it and give you feedback.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:41.500\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:46.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for checking something or getting information.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:52.700\nIt helps us understand how things work and make better decisions.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
