    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.000\nIt's a method we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:33.500\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:47.300\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject. Even baking a cake is a kind of test to see if you can follow a recipe!\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:51.000\nThe results of a test can help us make decisions, learn new things, or even just have fun.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.700\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn and explore the world.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
