    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_022741.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.800\nNow, you might be thinking about school exams, but a test in this case is simply a way to check if something works the way it should.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: imagine you bake a cake. You wouldn't just serve it without checking if it tastes good, right?\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:33.000\nYou'd take a little bite - that's a test! Or, if you're building a tower of blocks, you gently push it to see if it's stable. That's also a test!\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:41.500\nBasically, a test is any action you take to make sure something is doing what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:50.300\nIt can be as simple as turning on a light switch to see if the light comes on, or bouncing a ball to see if it inflates properly.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:59.800\nSo, remember, a test helps us confirm that things are working correctly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
