    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:18.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:27.800\nYou turn it on to see if it lights up, right?\nThat's a test!\nTests come in many forms.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.900\nThey can be written, like a quiz in school, or practical, like a driving test.\nThe goal is always the same: to measure something.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:46.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\nA math test checks your ability to solve problems.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:54.600\nAnd a taste test\u2026 well, that checks how good something tastes!\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:03.000\nSo, remember, a test is a way to measure knowledge or skills.\nIt can be written, practical, or even involve tasting!\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:05.900\nAnd it helps us understand what we know\nand what we might need to learn.\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:08.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
