    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.800\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in this case, a test is really just a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:22.800\nIt's like asking a question and seeing if you get the right answer.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:30.400\nThink of it this way: imagine you're baking a cake. You test the batter by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:43.500\nOr, if you\u2019re watering a plant, you might test the soil with your finger.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:48.300\nIf it feels dry, it needs more water. That\u2019s another test!\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:57.300\nSo, a test helps us understand something's status. It's simply a way of checking to make sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:57.300 --> 00:58.500\nTests are used everywhere, from baking to science!\n```"
