    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.900\nIt's like an experiment or a question designed to give us an answer.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:31.800\nThink of it this way: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor is best.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:39.700\nEven pressing a button to see if a light turns on is a type of test.\nYou're testing if the button works!\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:52.100\nTests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying a new recipe.\nThe goal is always to gather information.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:59.700\nSo, a test is an action performed to gain knowledge or information about something.\nIt's all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
