    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_023259.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:21.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an answer, you get a result that shows you how well something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:31.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:38.400\nOr, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:51.300\nEven baking a cake is like a test! You follow the recipe and see if it turns out delicious. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working properly.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:59.500\nThey're all around us, in everyday life and in more formal situations. Basically, a test is just a way of gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
