    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:18.700\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt's how we check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:28.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\nOr, you might test a new toy to see if it works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:42.000\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\nThey can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like building something.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:48.300\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and see if things are as they should be.\nTests help us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
