    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_023418.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:03.000 --> 00:08.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:18.500\nIt could be about your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:28.000\nOr a chef might taste a sauce to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.000\nCompanies test new medicines to see if they're safe and effective.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:37.500\nSo, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:42.000\nThey give us information we can use to make better decisions.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:52.000\nWhether it's figuring out what to study more, or ensuring a product is safe, tests play a really important role.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:54.500\nThat's the basics of testing!\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
