    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_023504.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: tests.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is basically a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you've learned something new.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you taste it to test if it's good.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:35.000\nOr, your doctor might give you a physical exam to test your overall health.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:45.200\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\n\n00:45.200 --> 01:00.600\nA software developer might write tests to make sure their computer program doesn't have any bugs. Even scientists use tests when they're experimenting!\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:04.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to find out information.\n```"
