    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works, or if it\u2019s true.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like checking if your shoes fit before you go for a run.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.700\nYou wouldn't just assume they fit, right? You'd test them by putting them on and walking around.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:40.000\nTests can be big, like a final exam at school, or small, like tasting a soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:47.300\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Scientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:58.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to find out information or confirm something. It helps us make better decisions and understand the world around us. It's all about checking and verifying. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
