    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:18.200\nNow, a test, in the simplest terms, is just a way to find out something. It's a question or a series of questions designed to see what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:32.400\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you learn a new skill, like riding a bike, falling down a few times is a test to see how well you're learning.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:38.800\nAnother example is a taste test! Trying a new food is a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:50.200\nTests help us learn, improve, and understand things better. So, remember, a test is simply a way to gain information.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:53.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
