    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_023828.mp4",
    "subtitles": "WEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something specific. Think of it like an experiment, but often with a right or wrong answer.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:23.700\nThe main idea of a test is to measure something. Maybe it's your knowledge of a subject, like a math test.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.600\nOr maybe it's the strength of a material, like testing a bridge. The results help us understand whatever we're testing better.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:42.100\nFor example, your doctor might run blood tests to check your health. Or a company might test a new product to make sure it works properly.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:52.700\nThese tests provide important information. So, in short, a test is a process that helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:52.700 --> 01:00.700\nIt gives us data and insights we can use to make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI."
