    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.800\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.800 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out,\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.800\nor to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if your cake is done, you do a test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.400\nIf it comes out clean, the test tells you the cake is ready!\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:24.800\nTests aren't just for cooking, though.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:27.900\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy,\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:32.000\nteachers give you tests to see what you've learned in school,\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:36.700\nand even video games have tests to see if you can beat a level.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:45.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something, whether it's cake, your health, your knowledge, or your gaming skills.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:50.400\nIt helps us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
