    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.900\nNow, you've probably taken lots of tests in school, but in general, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:26.300\nIt's a method for checking if something is working correctly, or to see what someone knows. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:36.900\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good! A test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:47.000\nSo, whether it's a math quiz, a science experiment, or even just trying out a new recipe, you're performing a test.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:52.100\nIt's all about learning and confirming. Tests show you what\u2019s true.\n\n00:52.100 --> 01:05.500\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to gather information and check something. It can be as simple as tasting food, or as complicated as a medical examination.\n\n01:05.500 --> 01:12.700\nJust remember, it's all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
