    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_024453.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:05.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:11.000\nIt's a set of questions or activities designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even performance.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:14.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:18.500\nOr a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:22.100\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:27.600\nThey can be multiple choice, like picking the right answer from a few options, or essay questions where you write out your thoughts.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:34.900\nThe important thing is that tests give us information to learn and improve.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:38.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and understand.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:43.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
