    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:21.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:31.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:42.700\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:55.800\nA baker might even taste their cake batter \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more sugar! So, tests can come in all shapes and sizes. They can be as simple as tasting something, or as complicated as a long exam.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.300\nBut the main idea is always the same: to get information and learn something new.\n```"
