    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or a teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.800\nFor example, a simple spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A fitness test checks your physical abilities.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:44.300\nEven baking a cake can be seen as a test of your cooking skills! So, a test is just a method used to gather information and assess something.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:52.500\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we might need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
