    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_025527.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.900\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It could be a math test in school, to see how well you understand numbers.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:31.200\nOr it could be testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good! The main idea is that you're trying to learn information.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:40.700\nFor example, you might test a toy to see if it's safe for kids to play with. Or you might test the water in a pool to make sure it's clean.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:50.700\nTests help us make informed decisions. So, remember, a test is all about gathering information to learn something new.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:57.500\nIt\u2019s a way to investigate and find answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
