    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone understands something.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a new lightbulb to see if it lights up.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:32.300\nThat's a test! Or, your teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:45.300\nTests can come in many forms. It could be a quiz, a physical exam, or even just trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:54.000\nThe important thing is that it helps us gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something out, to see if it works or to measure understanding.\n```"
