    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_025655.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:26.200\nWe use tests all the time to see if things work as they should, or to check on progress.\nFor example, your teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:35.600\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\nSo, tests help us gather information, make decisions,\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:52.700\nand understand the world around us better.\nThey can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all have the same goal: to learn something new.\nRemember, a test isn't about being right or wrong, it\u2019s about learning!\n\n00:52.700 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
