    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.400\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:28.100\nIt could be a physical exam at the doctor, a quiz at school, or even a simple taste test when you're cooking.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:36.800\nEssentially, we use tests to gather information.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:42.500\nWe want to see if something is working correctly, if someone understands a topic, or if a food tastes good.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:48.200\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:52.600\nA blood test at the doctor helps understand your health.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.200\nAnd that cookie you just baked? A taste test will tell you if it needs more sugar.\n```"
