    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_025825.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:15.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:23.300\nIt's a method for gathering information.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:31.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to find out if you're sick.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:43.900\nA teacher uses a test to see what you've learned. Or maybe you test the temperature of the water before you jump in the pool! Each of these gives you valuable information.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.200\nSo, examples include a math quiz, a blood test, or even just trying a new recipe to see if you like it. They all help you learn something new.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.700\nIn short, a test is a process used to gather information and learn more about something.\n\n00:56.700 --> 00:59.000\nHopefully, this has cleared things up!\n\n00:59.000 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
