    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_025906.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are done baking \u2013 you might poke them with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:29.400\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:39.200\nIt could be a multiple-choice quiz, a written exam, or even a practical demonstration, like showing you can build a tower with blocks.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:49.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to write words. A math test checks if you understand numbers and equations.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:57.200\nEven tasting a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:00.500\nSo, whether it's cookies, spelling, or math, a test is just a method for finding out information.\n```"
  },
