    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_025947.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:18.000\nToday we're going to explore something super important: what is a test?\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:25.300\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:29.600\nIt's a process we use to gather information and learn more about a specific thing.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:32.700\nThink about it like this: a taste test!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:36.200\nYou try a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:36.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:41.500\nOr, when you take a quiz at school, that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:44.800\nEven checking if a light bulb works is a simple test.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:53.700\nSo, whether it's checking if something works, learning how much you know, or just trying something new to see if you like it, that's what a test is all about: gathering information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:55.800\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
