    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_030029.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.300\nToday we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:22.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. \nThink of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:32.700\nWe use tests to see if something is true, or to measure how well something works. \nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:43.200\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to test how much you've learned. \nEven baking a cake is a sort of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing if your recipe works!\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:46.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for finding out information.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:48.900\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions. \nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
