    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_030626.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you test it with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:34.800\nTests are used everywhere. Doctors use tests to check your health, teachers use tests to see what you've learned, and even scientists use tests to prove their ideas.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:43.600\nFor example, a simple math test might ask you to solve a problem, or a spelling test might ask you to write down words.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:51.000\nThe answers you give show what you know. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:59.200\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we still need to learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
