    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:19.200\nIt could be to see if something works, if you understand something, or even to check the quality of something.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:30.600\nThink about it like this: You take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:41.500\nEven a doctor uses tests, like blood tests, to check your health. So, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:52.900\nThey're a valuable tool in learning, creating, and making sure things are working as they should. Basically, a test helps us answer a question!\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
