    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_030745.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.500\nIt's a process that helps us measure or evaluate something, like how well you know a subject or how strong a material is.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:33.300\nThink about it like this: a quiz in school is a test to see what you've learned. Or, imagine dropping a ball from different heights; that's a test to see how high it bounces.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:45.300\nEven tasting a new recipe is a test to see if you like the flavor! Tests can be simple or complex, but they all have the same goal: to get information.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:54.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a structured way to find something out. It's all about gathering information!\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
