    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:08.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:22.000\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:29.000\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:34.300\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:39.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test - you're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:44.900\nAnother example is testing a toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:51.300\nSee? Tests help us understand things, check if things work, and make sure things are safe.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:55.900\nSo, remember: a test is a way to ask a question and get an answer, whether it's about your health, your knowledge, or how well something works.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
