    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you test them with a toothpick.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:32.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cookies pass the test!\nIn general, a test helps us understand if something is working correctly, if it meets certain standards, or if it's true or false.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:41.000\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr a teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:50.400\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check things.\nIt helps us understand if something is the way it's supposed to be.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:57.200\nAnd that's the basic idea of what a test is!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
