    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:21.900\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:30.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.100\nA teacher uses tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:42.300\nEven baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you taste it to see if it's good!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:47.500\nFor example, a simple test could be checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:52.700\nYou flip the switch. If it lights up, the test passes. If it doesn't, it fails.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:59.900\nAnother example is a spelling test, where you see if you can spell words correctly.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:03.500\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and figuring things out.\n\n01:03.500 --> 01:07.700\nThey help us understand what's going on around us.\n\n01:07.700 --> 01:11.300\nAnd, they're used in all sorts of situations!\n\n01:11.300 --> 01:14.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
