    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:09.300\nWhat are they and why do we use them?\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\nIt helps us understand if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is cooked, you do a simple test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:29.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:34.700\nTests aren't just for cakes, though. We use them everywhere!\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:39.700\nYour doctor might do tests to check your health.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:49.000\nTeachers give you tests to see how well you understand a subject.\nEven video games are tested to make sure they're fun and work properly.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:55.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nIt gives us information to help us make decisions.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
