    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_031618.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a question, or a set of questions, designed to see what you know, or what you can do. Think about it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:33.400\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good before you bake it!\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.200\nTests can be written, like a quiz in school, or they can be practical, like seeing if you can ride a bike.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:54.900\nThe important thing is that they help us understand something better. So, tests help us measure knowledge, skills, or even just check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
