    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:21.000\nThink about it. A spelling test helps us see how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:29.800\nA taste test helps us decide which flavor of ice cream is the best. And a medical test can tell a doctor if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:36.800\nBasically, tests give us information. They help us measure, evaluate, and learn.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:49.600\nThey can be used to check our knowledge, skills, or even our opinions. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
