    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:21.700\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer. Think about it: a spelling test helps us see how well we know our spelling words.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:26.800\nOr, a taste test lets us decide which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:35.800\nSee? We're figuring something out. Another example: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:42.400\nThat's a test! The toothpick tells you if the inside is still gooey or perfectly baked.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:53.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better by providing evidence.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:59.200\nThat's all there is to it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
