    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_032703.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like checking to see if you've learned what you've been studying. It can be as simple as a quick quiz, or something bigger like a final exam.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:33.700\nThe important thing is that it helps us understand where we're at.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:41.300\nFor example, if you're learning to ride a bike, a test could be just seeing if you can balance on your own.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:50.700\nOr if you're learning to bake, a test could be tasting the cookies to see if they're sweet enough.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.600\nSo, remember, a test is a way to measure your knowledge or skills. It helps you and others see how far you've come and what you might need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
