    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_032826.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.100\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or if we understand something.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:36.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:45.700\nA test is basically just a question or a set of questions designed to give us information.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:55.500\nFor example, you might test a lightbulb to see if it turns on. Or, you could test a recipe to see if it tastes good. Tests help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:02.000\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information and check things out. It's a tool we use to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
