    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHello everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:23.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:28.300\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:32.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.300\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:45.200\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. A school exam is a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:52.500\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and skills!\n\n00:52.500 --> 01:01.200\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and making sure things are as they should be. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n01:01.200 --> 01:04.700\nRemember, a test is just a tool to help us understand something better.\n\n01:04.700 --> 01:08.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
