    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:10.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:18.500\nThink of it as a question you ask, and the answer helps you learn.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:27.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Maybe you\u2019re testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:36.700\nOr, you might be testing a toy to see if it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:49.800\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on inside your body. For example, when you take a spelling test at school, you're testing your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:58.400\nOr, when you try a new bike, you're testing if you like riding it. So, a test is just a method to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
