    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_033439.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.300 --> 00:03.400\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process, a procedure, that helps us gather information or check if something is true.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.200\nOr a doctor runs a blood test to test for certain diseases.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:41.500\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a simple test \u2013 does the light come on, or does it stay off?\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:51.300\nSo, tests are everywhere, in all kinds of forms. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. They're all about gathering evidence.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:54.000\nIn short, a test is just a systematic way to get an answer or understand something better.\n00:54.000 --> 00:54.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "ab2fbf37-0e48-47f2-9e9e-c388e14cd93c": {
