    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_033515.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.500\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out. It's how we check if something is true, or if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:44.500\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, whether it's a science experiment, an exam, or even just trying something new, a test helps us gather information and learn something.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:50.600\nIt's all about finding out the answer to a question. That's the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
