    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_033603.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check your understanding. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:36.900\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good. Or, if you're trying to open a door with a key, you're testing to see if it's the right key.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:46.400\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned. They ask questions or give you problems to solve.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:56.300\nThese problems help them understand what you know and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:03.000\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information, whether it's about cooking, opening doors, or learning new things. It's a useful tool for figuring things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
