    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:19.000\nA test, simply put, is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are baked enough \u2013 you might poke them to see if they're firm. That's a test!\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:36.400\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. In science, scientists use tests to see if their experiments worked.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:46.300\nFor example, a taste test can tell you if a new recipe is delicious. Or, imagine testing a toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:52.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
