    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_033940.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.700\nWe use tests all the time to see if something is working correctly, or to measure how well we've learned something.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:31.100\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:44.900\nTests help us understand things better by giving us information or data.\nThey can be as simple as tasting food to see if it's sweet, or as complicated as launching a rocket to test its engine.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:53.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
