    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.300\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:19.100\nThink of it as a question you ask to get an answer.\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:27.800\nMaybe you want to know if a cake is done baking \u2013 you can test it with a toothpick.\nIf it comes out clean, the cake's ready!\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:35.700\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a toy needs new batteries.\nYou can test it by turning it on.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:46.300\nIf it doesn't work, new batteries are probably the answer.\nSo remember, a test is just a simple way to check something and get information.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:56.000\nIt helps us learn, solve problems, and make sure things are working correctly.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
