    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_034101.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.600\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:32.800\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\nThey can be multiple choice, fill-in-the-blank, or even writing an essay.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:46.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nA math test checks if you understand how to add, subtract, multiply, and divide.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:58.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check your knowledge or skills.\nIt helps you and your teachers understand what you already know and what you still need to learn.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:03.800\nGood luck with your next test!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
