    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:04.200\nToday we're diving into something super important: a test.\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:06.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:09.300\nThink of it like a little quiz to see what you've learned.\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:13.000\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:16.500\nMaybe it's a multiple-choice quiz where you pick the right answer, or perhaps it's a short answer test where you write a few sentences.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:21.800\nImagine you're learning about animals. A test might ask you to name different types of animals or describe what they eat.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:23.100\nSee?\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:23.900\nPretty straightforward.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:31.600\nThe point of a test isn't to trick you, but to help you and your teacher understand what you already know and what you might need to learn more about.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:36.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to check your knowledge.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:37.800\nGood luck with your next one!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:39.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
