    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find something out. Think of it like asking a question and then trying to get the answer.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.900\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. For example, when you try a new recipe, that's a test!\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:35.800\nYou're testing if the recipe works and if you like the taste. Or, when you push a door, you're testing if it's unlocked.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:48.700\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like seeing if your shoes still fit. The important thing is that they help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:58.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to ask a question and get an answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
