    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:19.100\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how much you know about something. Think of it like a tool that helps you and your teacher understand what you've learned and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:26.500\nThere are all sorts of tests. You might have a spelling test to see how well you remember your spelling words.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:35.300\nOr maybe a math test to check your understanding of addition and subtraction. Even a quiz about a book you read is a type of test!\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:48.200\nSo, whether it's answering questions on paper, filling in the blanks, or even just showing what you know in a fun activity, tests are all about measuring your knowledge.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:54.200\nThey're a learning tool, not something to be scared of! Remember, they help you grow.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
