    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process or a procedure designed to see what you know, what you can do, or even how something works.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks what words you know how to spell.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:35.300\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:48.400\nOr, a car company might test a new car to see how well it handles on the road. So, a test helps us gather information. It gives us data to understand something better.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:54.700\nWhether it's checking your knowledge, comparing products, or evaluating performance, tests are all about finding answers.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.300\nBasically, it's a planned way to get information. And that's what a test is all about! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
