    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.600\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in this case, a test is simply a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: you buy a new lightbulb. The test is, does it light up when you flip the switch?\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:29.000\nOr, imagine you bake a cake. The test is, does it taste good?\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:41.900\nTests are important because they help us catch mistakes and make sure things are working correctly. In everyday life, you're constantly doing little tests, even without realizing it.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:56.600\nSo, to recap, a test is just a way to verify if something is performing as expected. Whether it's a lightbulb, a cake, or anything else, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
