    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:21.800\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:34.100\nThink about it. When you take a spelling test at school, it shows how well you know your spelling words. Or, if a doctor gives you a check-up, that's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:40.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it turns out yummy.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:50.000\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things. They give us information we can use to make decisions or improve.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:58.100\nIn a nutshell, a test is a method for gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
