    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.600\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn or understand.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:24.600\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. That taste is a test!\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.000\nOr, imagine you're trying to learn a new skill, like riding a bike. Each time you try, you're testing your balance and coordination.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:46.500\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:57.000\nThe main thing is, they give you information. They help you see what you know, what works, and what needs improvement. So, tests are really just tools for learning and discovery.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
