    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, or check if something works.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:28.200\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of the bathwater to see if it's too hot or just right.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:36.900\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the things you've been learning.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:48.100\nBut tests aren't just for school!\nA chef might test a new recipe to make sure it tastes good.\nA car manufacturer tests new cars to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:56.900\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to learn something new or confirm that something is working as it should.\nRemember, a test is just a tool to help us understand the world better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
