    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_040354.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why they're important.\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:18.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:29.700\nThink of it like this: you might test the water in a pool to make sure it's safe to swim in.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:38.400\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've learned.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:48.300\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just activities. For example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words. A math test sees if you can solve problems.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:57.600\nTests aren't meant to be scary! They're just a tool to help you and your teachers understand what you know and where you might need a little extra help. So, remember, tests are simply a way to check your understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
