    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us measure or evaluate things, like how much you know, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:30.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test tells your teacher how well you understand spelling rules. Or, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:39.700\nAnother example: imagine you\u2019re building a tower with blocks. You test its stability by gently pushing it to see if it falls over.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:46.300\nThat\u2019s a test too! So, a test is just a method for checking or measuring something.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:56.400\nIt can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just trying something out to see what happens. Tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
