    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling a really important concept: a test!\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:34.400\nWe use tests for all sorts of things. A doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:44.100\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see what you've learned.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:58.800\nAnd even baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you check if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it! So, a test is just a procedure designed to gather information.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:00.600\nWhether it's checking your spelling, finding out the temperature, or seeing if a lightbulb works, tests help us make decisions and learn more about the world around us.\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:04.300\nIn short, tests are a fundamental part of learning and problem-solving.\n\n01:04.300 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
