    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.800\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:39.600\nWe use tests all the time to check if something is working, to see how well we understand something, or even just to learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:51.800\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. Or, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how many words you remember.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:59.200\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on inside your body. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It's all about asking questions and finding answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
