    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.400\nIt's how we gather information or check if something is working correctly. Think of it like this: you might test if your soup is hot enough by taking a small spoonful.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.700\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health. In school, tests help show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:42.900\nFor example, a simple spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A taste test can tell you which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:53.100\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a type of test! So, a test is just a method for finding information or evaluating something.\n\n00:53.100 --> 01:00.200\nFrom soup to spelling, tests are all around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
