    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well someone knows something or how well something works.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like checking if you've learned your ABCs. You might take a quiz, and that's a test!\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:27.700\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it to see if it's sweet enough. That's also a kind of test!\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:34.900\nBusinesses use tests all the time to make sure their products are working correctly before they sell them.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check understanding or performance. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:47.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
