    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.799\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.799 --> 00:15.599\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well something performs.\n\n00:15.599 --> 00:26.999\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\nOr, a builder might test the strength of a bridge before people start driving on it.\n\n00:26.999 --> 00:34.399\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\nSo, examples of tests are all around us!\n\n00:34.399 --> 00:40.999\nA doctor might run tests to check your health.\nA factory might test a product to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:40.999 --> 00:52.699\nBasically, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\nIt helps us understand if things are working as expected, or if improvements are needed.\n\n00:52.699 --> 00:56.399\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
