    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something, or to see how well you know something.\nThink of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.500\nThe main idea behind a test is to ask questions or perform tasks that help us measure knowledge or ability.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:35.400\nThese questions or tasks are designed to show what you understand about a particular subject.\nFor example, a spelling test helps show how well you know how to spell words.\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which ice cream flavor you like best!\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:41.700\nSee?\nTests are everywhere.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:50.000\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see where you stand on something.\nIt helps you and others understand what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
