    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.700\nWell, simply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like a detective solving a mystery, but instead of clues, we use questions or tasks.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:40.000\nThe main idea behind a test is to see how much someone knows or how well they can do something. It helps us measure skills and knowledge.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:47.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you remember how to spell words.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:57.700\nOr, a taste test might help you decide which kind of ice cream you like best! Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and bakers test their cakes to see if they're done.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:03.300\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, a test is a tool to gather information, measure abilities, and help us make decisions. Pretty useful, right?\n```"
  },
  "bd5ebcf0-6e76-48cc-a197-9305b8ec4d37": {
    "id": "bd5ebcf0-6e76-48cc-a197-9305b8ec4d37",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T01:51:01.617720",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-02T04:22:16.568866",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_042216.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_042216.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is true or works as expected.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:27.400\nIt's like when you bake a cake and taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\nOr when a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:38.500\nTests aren't just for school!\nThey're used everywhere, from checking if a new toy is safe to play with, to making sure a bridge can hold lots of weight.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:51.300\nThey help us understand the world around us and make sure things are working correctly.\nSo remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:58.500\nIt's a simple tool, but a very powerful one!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
