    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_042303.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:24.300\nIt could be checking if something works, if something is true, or even how well you know something.\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you give it a taste.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:28.100\nThat's a test!\nYou're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:36.500\nOr, imagine you're buying a new toy, and you press all the buttons to see if they work.\nThat\u2019s testing too!\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:44.900\nYou\u2019re checking if the toy functions properly.\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:59.300\nThey all share the same basic idea: to find out something specific.\nSo, remember, a test is all about checking something to see if it's working, true, or just plain right.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
