    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.900\nA test is basically a way to check something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like a question you ask to see if you get the right answer. It could be a written test in school, where you answer questions about what you've learned.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:30.900\nOr, it could be something simpler, like testing if a light bulb works by screwing it into a lamp.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:37.600\nIf it lights up, it passes the test! Another example?\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:45.300\nImagine you're baking cookies. You might test the dough by tasting it to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:53.900\nThat's a test too! So, tests help us understand if something is working, correct, or ready. They\u2019re a really important part of learning and making sure things are done right. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
