    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:18.800\nThink of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:32.200\nWe use tests all the time! For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like the taste. Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you can stay balanced.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:39.600\nTests can be formal too, like the quizzes you take in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:52.200\nThe main idea is that you're checking something, confirming something, or learning something new. So, a test is a way to explore and understand the world around you.\n\n00:52.200 --> 01:01.000\nBasically, tests are all about learning through trying and observing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
