    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:27.500\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:33.600\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:39.700\nIt helps you know if you need more sugar.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:45.800\nOr, think about a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:52.500\nAnother example is a quiz at school. That test helps your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:52.500 --> 01:06.800\nSo, a test isn't always scary; it's just a tool for gathering information. In short, a test is a way to learn more about something through a process of questioning or observation.\n\n01:06.800 --> 01:15.500\nIt helps us make better decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n01:15.500 --> 01:18.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
