    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like an experiment, or a way of checking if something is true or correct.\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:32.900\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\nOr even a doctor giving you a check-up is a kind of test, to see if you're healthy!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:48.800\nSo, tests help us learn, discover, and make sure things are working the way they should.\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: it's a way to gather information.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:53.400\nThat's it!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
