    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:24.500\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:36.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know how to spell. A taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes best.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:47.500\nEven a medical test, like checking your temperature, helps doctors understand what's going on with your body.\n\n00:47.500 --> 01:03.600\nTests can come in many forms, like multiple choice questions, essays, or even hands-on activities. They all share the same goal: to give you information about a specific skill or understanding.\n\n01:03.600 --> 01:14.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn and grow. It's a way to check your progress and identify areas where you can improve.\n\n01:14.200 --> 01:17.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
