    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like a little investigation. It's a process designed to give you information about a person, object, or even an idea.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:34.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. For example, you might take a math test at school to see how well you understand fractions.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:38.500\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your overall health.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:45.700\nSee? Different tests, different purposes. Another example could be testing a new recipe.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:55.900\nYou follow the instructions and then taste the results. That tasting is a test to see if the recipe is any good!\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:04.300\nSo, to sum it up, a test is a procedure used to gather information.\n\n01:04.300 --> 01:07.800\nIt helps us understand something better, whether it's our knowledge, our health, or even the tastiness of a cookie.\n\n01:07.800 --> 01:11.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
