    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_043917.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: the concept of a test.\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you put it in a lamp. That's a test!\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:29.500\nWe use tests all the time. A doctor gives you a check-up to test your health.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:38.900\nA teacher gives you an exam to test your knowledge. Even baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:46.300\nThe results of a test help us make decisions. If the lightbulb doesn't work, we get a new one.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:56.900\nIf the cake is still gooey, we bake it longer. So, remember, a test is a way to get information and make informed choices.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
