    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.700\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but a test, in general, is just a way to find out if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works. Your test is screwing it into a lamp and turning it on. If it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:31.600\nOr maybe you want to know if your cookies are done baking. You can test them by sticking a toothpick in. If it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:37.600\nTesting is all about finding proof or evidence.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:47.100\nIt helps us make sure things are working properly, and that we're on the right track.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:55.100\nSo remember, a test is simply a way to check something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
