    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:34.300\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:43.200\nEven checking if the water is hot before you get in the shower is a kind of test! You're testing the water temperature.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:56.300\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions based on that information. They can be big and formal, like a school exam, or small and informal, like checking the weather.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.900\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
