    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:8.000\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:11.000\nIt helps us gather information about something specific.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is ready, you might use a toothpick.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:20.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:23.000\nYou stick the toothpick in, and if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:28.000\nAnother example? Your doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:31.000\nThey take a sample, analyze it, and then tell you the results.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:35.000\nSo, tests help us make decisions and learn more.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:37.000\nThey give us evidence!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:42.000\nBasically, a test is a way of asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:47.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
