    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:28.300\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working as expected.\nBasically, you're giving something a task or a question, and then seeing how it responds.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:39.100\nFor example, a school test checks how well you understand a subject.\nOr, a taste test checks which food people like best.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:49.600\nAnother example: if you\u2019re baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:59.100\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions. In short, a test is a method used to evaluate something and gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
