    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling a fundamental concept: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:31.300\nWe use tests all the time. For example, a doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:42.100\nA baker might taste their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar. Or you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:52.600\nSo, tests can be about health, food, knowledge, or just about anything! The important thing is they give us information. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:57.600\nBasically, a test is a structured way to get information about something.\n\n00:57.600 --> 00:59.400\nIt's a simple, but super powerful tool.\n```"
