    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:23.100\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it! Think about it: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:29.900\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:43.400\nAnother example? When you're baking, you might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:52.100\nSo, tests help us learn things, check things, and make sure everything is working correctly. They can be big or small, formal or informal, but the goal is always the same: to get some information!\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:58.800\nThat's the basic idea behind tests. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
