    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:20.000\nToday we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\nBasically, a test is a way to find out if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a new lightbulb to see if it turns on.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:38.600\nOr maybe you take a quiz in school \u2013 that's a test to see how much you've learned.\nTests can be simple, like checking if your shoelaces are tied.\nOr they can be more complex, like a doctor running tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:44.800\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\nThey help us understand something better.\n\n00:44.800 --> 01:00.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to check something and learn about it.\nFrom lightbulbs to quizzes, tests are all around us, helping us make sure things are working and understand the world a little bit better.\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:04.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
