    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_045325.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_045325.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE This subtitle file was automatically generated by Apilage AI\nNOTE Total video duration: 54.0 seconds\n\n00:00.240 --> 00:05.140\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.140 --> 00:17.440\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, but what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know or can do something.\nIt's like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:17.440 --> 00:27.240\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:27.240 --> 00:37.140\nA math test sees how well you can solve problems.\nEven trying out a new recipe is kind of like a test to see if you can bake a delicious cake!\n\n00:37.140 --> 00:46.440\nSo, tests help us understand where we're strong and where we might need to learn a little more.\nThey're a tool for learning and improvement.\n\n00:46.440 --> 00:51.540\nIn short, tests help measure knowledge or skills.\n\n00:51.540 --> 00:54.040\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
