    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_045412.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:22.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or just to see what we know.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:26.700\nThink about it: a spelling test at school?\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:35.600\nThat\u2019s a test! It checks if you know how to spell words.\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:42.800\nYou might taste the batter before you bake it \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:48.800\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:55.400\nSo, a test is really just a way of gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:57.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but the goal is always the same: to check or find something out.\n\n00:57.500 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
