    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.000\nIt helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.800\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:42.600\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. In both cases, the test is giving you information.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:46.300\nAnother example?\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:54.100\nImagine baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter \u2013 that\u2019s a small test to see if it tastes good before you bake the whole thing!\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:06.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all help us learn and improve.\n\n01:06.300 --> 01:14.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and get information.\n\n01:14.100 --> 01:21.800\nWe use them every day, in all sorts of situations. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
