    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_045625.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:22.500\nIt could be about anything! Think of it like checking if something works, or seeing how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:34.600\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, your teacher might give you a quiz to test your knowledge of history.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:44.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing if the recipe works and if it tastes good!\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:56.000\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\nThey're a crucial part of understanding the world around us.\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the core idea is always the same: to get information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
