    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is basically a way to see if something is working correctly, or to find out something about it.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:19.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch. That's a test!\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:26.600\nWe use tests all the time. For example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:41.200\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to test how well you understand a topic. Even baking a cake is a bit of a test \u2013 you\u2019re checking if the ingredients and recipe work to create something delicious!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:53.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to check something out and get some information. It helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
