    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_045956.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:19.600\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to see what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:30.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:46.000\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a mini-test to see if the lightbulb works!\nSo, tests help us understand what we've learned, make choices, or even just figure out if something is working correctly.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:55.900\nThey come in many different forms, but the core idea is always the same: to gain information.\nThat's the basics of testing!\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
