    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:24.100\nIt helps us see if something works as expected, or if it meets certain requirements. Think of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:32.500\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:37.200\nCar companies test new cars to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:44.100\nSee? Tests are everywhere! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working properly.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:53.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It's a simple but powerful tool we use all the time.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
