    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:31.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:36.900\nFor example, if you want to know if your cookies are done, you might poke them with a toothpick.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:41.900\nThat's a test! Or, if you're not sure if your friend is happy, you might ask them.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:46.900\nThat's another test! Tests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:53.900\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Teachers use tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:58.000\nThey all help us understand something better.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:01.000\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information to answer a question.\n```"
