    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something works correctly or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like checking if your bike tires have enough air before you go for a ride. That's a test!\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:28.500\nAnother example is a spelling test in school. It checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:39.900\nOr, a taste test for a new cookie recipe makes sure it tastes good. Tests help us find out if things are good to go, or if they need some improvement.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:48.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us make sure things are working as expected.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:52.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
