    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.600\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a way to see how well something works or how much of something there is.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are baked. You might poke one with a toothpick \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:30.000\nThe toothpick coming out clean means the cookie passed the test, it's ready. In school, a quiz is a test to see how much you learned.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:39.000\nIf you get most of the questions right, you pass that test. Another example is testing the water temperature before you get in the shower.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:41.700\nIs it too hot? Too cold?\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:44.600\nJust right? That\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:47.500\nSo, whether it's cookies, quizzes, or showers,\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:61.000\na test helps us understand something better. Basically, a test is just a way of checking something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
