    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:30.200\nWe use tests all the time to check our knowledge, see how things work, or even just to learn more.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:44.400\nThink about it: a spelling test at school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:58.900\nOr, when you try a new recipe, you're essentially testing if it tastes good. Tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying a new video game to see if you like it.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:02.500\nBasically, a test is any procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n01:02.500 --> 01:06.800\nIt gives us information, and that information helps us make decisions or understand things better.\n\n01:06.800 --> 01:12.400\nSo, whether you're taking a quiz or experimenting in the kitchen, remember you're conducting a test!\n\n01:12.400 --> 01:15.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
