    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore the concept of a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:24.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. It could be as simple as tasting a new fruit to see if you like it. That's a test!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:30.600\nOr, imagine checking the temperature outside to see if you need a jacket. Again, a test!\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:38.400\nA more formal test might be taking a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:50.500\nOr, a doctor might run some tests to figure out what's making you feel sick. So, tests help us learn, make decisions, and solve problems.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:58.500\nThey give us information we didn't have before. They're all about gathering data to understand the world around us better.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
