    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.450\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:01.450 --> 00:03.880\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:03.880 --> 00:06.720\nIt helps us understand more about a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:06.720 --> 00:11.060\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:11.060 --> 00:15.200\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might test the batter to see if it tastes right.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:17.940\nAnother example?\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:17.940 --> 00:21.410\nSee?\nDifferent kinds of tests, but the same basic idea: finding things out!\n\n00:21.410 --> 00:26.260\nSo, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\nIt gives us information and helps us make decisions.\n\n00:26.260 --> 00:29.370\nAnd that's the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n00:29.370 --> 00:31.140\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
