    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:23.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:29.300\nThink about it. When you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:34.100\nThat's a test!\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:41.900\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works, you screw it into a lamp and flip the switch.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:46.700\nAnother test! Tests aren't just for cooking or fixing things.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:56.400\nYour doctor might run tests to see how healthy you are, or your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:56.400 --> 00:57.000\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n```"
