    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_051653.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it like this: a chef might test the soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:27.700\nOr a doctor might test your vision to see how well you can see. These are all tests!\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:42.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you\u2019ve learned. Whether it's a quiz, a written exam, or even just answering questions in class, it's all part of the testing process.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:51.400\nTests help us learn and grow. So, remember, a test is just a tool to check understanding or to measure something.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:59.400\nIt\u2019s a way to learn more about ourselves and the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
