    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:24.000\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even your opinion about something.\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\nA taste test tells you which food you prefer.\nAnd a medical test can tell you if you're feeling okay.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:31.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big exams.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:41.900\nThey help us understand where we're at and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:51.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding.\nIt helps us learn about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
