    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_051828.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:21.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:28.800\nThink about it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:39.400\nThese are both tests! So, tests help us measure things, like health, knowledge, or even the strength of a material.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.400\nThey give us information. They can be simple, like tasting food to see if it's good, or complex, like launching a rocket to test its capabilities.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:59.600\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and understand more. Basically, a test is a question, and the results tell us the answer.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:03.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
