    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.799\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.799 --> 00:08.119\nWhat are they, really?\n\n00:08.119 --> 00:17.929\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it as a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:17.929 --> 00:25.899\nThis answer helps you understand something better. For example, a taste test helps you figure out which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:25.899 --> 00:34.109\nOr, a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice. Tests aren\u2019t just for school, though.\n\n00:34.109 --> 00:41.779\nYou test recipes when you're cooking to see if they taste good. You test different routes to work to find the fastest one.\n\n00:41.779 --> 00:50.349\nSo, a test is all about asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn and make decisions. They help us explore and understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.349 --> 00:53.699\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
