    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.000\nNow, you might think of school, but a test, in a general sense, is really just a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:28.500\nIt's a process or a procedure designed to see if something is true, or to measure something.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:36.300\nThink about it like this: If you want to know if a lightbulb works, you screw it into a lamp and turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:42.500\nOr, if you want to see if your cookies are done baking, you poke them with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, that's a test too!\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:55.000\nSo, tests aren't always scary. They're just a way to gather information and learn something new. From checking if your shoes fit, to seeing if a plant needs water, you're performing little tests all the time!\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:03.400\nSimply put, a test helps you confirm or deny something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
