    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.770\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.770 --> 00:03.190\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.190 --> 00:04.990\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:04.990 --> 00:09.090\nIt could be to see how well you understand a topic, or even to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:09.090 --> 00:12.400\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:16.660\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:16.660 --> 00:18.440\nAnother example?\n\n00:18.440 --> 00:20.070\nBaking a cake!\n\n00:20.070 --> 00:23.250\nYou might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:23.250 --> 00:28.740\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:28.740 --> 00:31.060\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:31.060 --> 00:31.980\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
