    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:17.900\nA test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like a question, or a challenge, that helps us understand if something is working correctly or if someone understands a concept.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:28.100\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:42.800\nEven pressing the power button on your TV is a kind of test \u2013 you're checking if it turns on! So, a test helps us learn, diagnose problems, or just confirm that everything is okay.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:49.400\nIt's all about gathering information. In short, tests are a tool for understanding.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:53.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
