    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:13.000\nYou might think of school exams, but in this case, we mean testing something to see if it works the way it should.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:23.800\nBasically, a test is a way to check if something is correct or effective.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:28.200\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and then you taste it.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:32.200\nTasting it is the test! You're checking if it tastes good.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:38.200\nAnother example? Imagine you build a birdhouse.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:42.200\nYou might put it outside to see if birds actually use it.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:46.700\nThat's a test, too! You're checking if it works for birds.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:52.000\nSo, a test helps us learn if something is doing what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:54.900\nIt could be testing a cake, a birdhouse, or even a new idea! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
