    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.800\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:32.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:44.100\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:52.700\nTests can come in all sorts of forms. They might be multiple choice, true or false, or even practical, like a driving test.\n\n00:52.700 --> 01:05.000\nThe important thing is that they help us measure something specific. So, a test isn't just about getting a grade. It's about understanding where you are and what you might need to learn next.\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:13.600\nThey're a tool for learning and improvement. In short, a test is a procedure used to evaluate your skills, knowledge, or performance in a specific area.\n\n01:13.600 --> 01:17.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
