    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:31.700\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:36.900\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:42.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:47.300\nOr, if you\u2019re learning to ride a bike, the test is whether you can balance and pedal without falling.\n\n00:47.300 --> 01:03.700\nWe also take tests in school to see how well we've learned something. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information, whether it's about a cake, a bike ride, or what you know about a subject.\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:09.000\nIt's all about finding out something new.\n\n01:09.000 --> 01:15.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
