    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a specific area.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\nA math test checks your math abilities.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:32.400\nEven a simple quiz about a movie you watched is a kind of test, to see how well you remember the details.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:42.700\nTests can come in many forms, like multiple choice questions, true or false statements, or even hands-on projects.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:51.400\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\nThey help us understand what we know well and what we might need to learn more about.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:59.300\nSo, a test is just a way to check our understanding.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
