    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:04.900\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:08.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how well you understand something, or how well something works.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:14.300\nThink of it like this: you take a quiz in school to see how much you learned in class.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:22.100\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter before you bake it to test if it needs more sugar.\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:25.500\nIt helps you adjust things before the final result.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:31.800\nAnother example is trying out a new app.\nYou\u2019re testing it to see if it\u2019s easy to use and if it does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:44.200\nSo, tests are all about checking things out, seeing what you know, or making sure something is working correctly.\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
