    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.000\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.700\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:28.800\nTests can be used to check if something is working properly, like testing a lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:37.900\nOr, they can help us understand something better, like taking a quiz to see how much we've learned about a topic.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:40.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:43.100\nA baker might test their dough to make sure it's ready to bake.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:45.700\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:55.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new or confirm something we already suspect. It's all about finding answers!\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:56.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
