    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information or evaluate something. \nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:26.700\nIt helps us understand how well someone knows something, or how well something performs. \nFor example, a school test shows how much a student has learned.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:37.600\nOr, a stress test on a bridge tells us how much weight it can hold.\nAnother example could be a taste test to see which cookie recipe people like best.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:42.100\nSee? It's all about finding things out in a structured way.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:53.100\nSo, remember, a test is a method for gathering information and evaluating something. \nIt helps us understand and make informed decisions.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
