    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_053901.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is, in its most basic form.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:17.000\nThink of a test as simply a way to find out something. It's a procedure we use to gather information or to see if something is true.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:27.300\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:40.500\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, a test is really just a way to learn more, to confirm something, or to discover something new.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:50.700\nIt's a process of asking a question and then finding the answer through observation or experiment. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
