    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.400\nA test, in its simplest form, is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it as a question you ask to see if you get the right answer. It could be a quiz at school, where you're tested on what you've learned.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:33.600\nOr, it could be something like testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:39.800\nThe recipe is the thing being tested, and your taste buds are giving you the answer!\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:44.300\nAnother example? Imagine you're building a tower of blocks.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:48.800\nYou might gently push it to test its stability.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:59.500\nIs it strong, or does it fall over? That's a test too! So, a test is basically a way to evaluate something, to see if it works, if it's correct, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:01.000\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n```"
