    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:30.700\nThe \u201csomething else\u201d could be anything! Like checking if a cake is done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.500\nOr, seeing if you understand a lesson by taking a quiz. The toothpick poke and the quiz are both tests.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:44.300\nLet\u2019s say you want to know if it's raining outside. You could look out the window \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:50.400\nOr, if you want to know if your phone is charged, you check the battery icon \u2013 another test!\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:57.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to learn more. It helps us understand things and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
