    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:32.000\nIt could be anything from checking if a lightbulb works to figuring out your favorite ice cream flavor!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:38.900\nBasically, you present something \u2013 a question, a task, a situation \u2013 and you observe the result.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:46.800\nThat result tells you if the thing being tested is working, true, or correct.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:51.100\nThink of it like this: you have a cake recipe and you want to test if it's good.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:55.400\nYou bake the cake! The result, how the cake tastes, tests the recipe.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.700\nOr, imagine you're learning your ABCs.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:03.300\nYour teacher might give you a quiz to test your knowledge.\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:06.200\nSee? Tests are all around us, helping us learn and understand the world.\n\n01:06.200 --> 01:19.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to find something out by observing the result of a question or task.\n\n01:19.700 --> 01:23.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
