    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:16.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. That's a test!\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:23.000\nYou're testing the lightbulb to see if it lights up. Another example is a taste test.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.500\nYou taste a cookie to see if it's sweet enough. Or, think about a spelling test in school.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:44.100\nThat test is designed to see how well you know your spelling words. So, a test is really just a way to get information, to check something out, or to see if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:48.900\nPretty simple, right? Remember, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:54.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
