    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_055134.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re diving into something called a test.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if the water in your pool is warm enough to swim.\nThe test is you dipping your toe in!\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:35.900\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain requirement.\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:47.100\nOr, you might take a test at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:53.400\nSo, whether it's testing the temperature, testing for an illness, or testing your knowledge, remember a test is just a way to find something out.\nIt\u2019s all about checking and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
