    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific. Think of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:26.000\nWe ask a question, or set up a situation, and then observe what happens to get an answer.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:36.700\nFor example, a simple math quiz is a test to see how well you understand addition.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:39.300\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:41.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test showing the cake is done.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:52.000\nSee? Tests are everywhere! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:57.000\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information. Remember that, and you're well on your way to understanding tests!\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
