    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_055539.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:14.900\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. A doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.300\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:47.100\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions. They can be formal, like a standardized exam, or informal, like checking the temperature of a bath to see if it's too hot.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:56.000\nThe key is they provide us with data to learn and improve. In short, a test is a process that provides information.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:02.000\nIt's about learning and understanding. And that's the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:05.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
