    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.800\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It could be to see how well you know a subject, or even to check if something is working properly.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste a tiny bit to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:34.200\nAnother example? Schools use tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:46.300\nAnd engineers test bridges to make sure they can hold a lot of weight. So, a test is simply a process for gathering information and making a decision based on the results.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:52.400\nRemember, tests help us learn, improve, and ensure things are safe and reliable.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
