    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like a question, but instead of just asking, you're using a process to get an answer.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:31.400\nSo, what kind of answer? Well, it depends on the test!\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:36.200\nFor example, a taste test tells you which food someone prefers.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:41.100\nA math test shows how well you understand numbers.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:46.200\nAnd a medical test can check if you're healthy.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:49.700\nSee how that works?\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:56.900\nEach test is designed to give you information about a particular topic. We design them to learn something!\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:04.100\nWhether it's about your knowledge, your health, or even just your favorite flavor.\n\n01:04.100 --> 01:07.800\nBasically, a test is just a structured way to gather information.\n\n01:07.800 --> 01:14.800\nIt helps us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
