    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_060215.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:26.000\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, you might try to balance to test your skills.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:34.400\nTests help us understand things better. Another example: a doctor might give you a checkup to test your health.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:44.900\nOr your teacher might give you a quiz to test what you've learned in class. So, a test is just a method to gather information or evaluate something.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:55.700\nIt can be anything from a simple taste test to a more formal exam. Testing helps us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
