    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like checking your understanding. They come in all shapes and sizes, from short quizzes to big exams.\nTests help you and your teachers figure out what you've learned well and what you might need to spend a little more time on.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:34.500\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve problems, showing you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:48.400\nOr a reading test could ask you questions about a story to see if you understood what happened.\nSo, to recap, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge and identify areas for improvement.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:54.400\nIt's a snapshot of what you know at a particular moment in time.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:60.199\nDon't be afraid of them! They are there to help you learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
