    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.100\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to see if something works, or if you know something.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on \u2013 that's a test! The main idea is to ask a question or try something out, and then see what happens.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:33.500\nIf the lightbulb lights up, the test passed! If it doesn't, the test failed.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:40.700\nHere are some other examples. A spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:45.300\nA taste test checks if you like a certain food.\n\n00:45.300 --> 01:00.500\nA medical test checks if you're healthy. All of these are tests! So, to recap, a test is simply a way to find out information.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:04.100\nWhether it's about lightbulbs, spelling, or even your health, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n```"
