    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:18.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to check or evaluate something. Think of it like a quick way to see if something works, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.600\nIt can be anything! A chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:32.000\nA student takes a test at school to show what they've learned. Or, you might test a new toy to see if it's fun.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:42.400\nSo, whether it's a taste test, a school exam, or just playing around, a test is all about finding out information.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:52.200\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. Tests help us understand the world around us better!\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:59.100\nIn short, a test is an evaluation. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
