    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge. It helps you and others understand where you're at and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:29.500\nTests come in lots of different forms. You might have a quiz in school, that's a test.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:37.100\nOr maybe a driving test to show you can safely operate a car. Even baking a cake can be seen as a test; did you follow the recipe correctly and get a delicious result?\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:44.700\nSo, tests are all about checking understanding or skills.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:52.000\nThey give us valuable information about what we've learned and what we need to learn.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:57.200\nRemember, tests are a tool to help you grow, not something to be afraid of! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "3961f26d-c737-44d6-aa29-cedee2baf5f3": {
    "id": "3961f26d-c737-44d6-aa29-cedee2baf5f3",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T01:51:36.714742",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-02T06:13:14.152332",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_061314.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_061314.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like an experiment you do to see what happens.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:29.300\nThe main idea behind any test is to ask a question and then try to answer it.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:39.500\nThis could be a question about anything! For example, is this flower getting enough sunlight?\nOr, does this new recipe taste good?\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:49.600\nTo answer those questions, you might measure how much sunlight the flower gets, or ask your friends to try the new recipe and tell you what they think.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.400\nThese measurements and opinions are the results of your tests!\n\n00:53.400 --> 01:03.500\nSo, a test is just a structured way to ask a question and find an answer. It helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n01:03.500 --> 01:07.200\nIn short, tests help us discover information.\n\n01:07.200 --> 01:09.900\nThey are a fundamental part of learning.\n\n01:09.900 --> 01:16.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "9919fe70-0c48-41a0-9aab-e1fdf5c59774": {
    "id": "9919fe70-0c48-41a0-9aab-e1fdf5c59774",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T01:51:36.966302",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-02T06:13:57.772730",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_061357.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_061357.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test, simply put, is a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you taste it to test if it's sweet enough. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:27.400\nOr, imagine your doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:39.000\nIn science, tests can be experiments to see if a hypothesis is correct. For example, you might test if a plant grows faster with more sunlight.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:52.400\nYou give one plant lots of sun, another less, and see what happens! So, a test is just a way to find out something, by trying something out and observing the result.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:58.900\nIt's all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
