    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_061442.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to check how well you understand something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:29.200\nThink of it like this: it's like a measuring stick for your knowledge. The main idea behind a test is to see if you can remember and use what you've learned.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:37.200\nIt helps you, and maybe your teacher, understand what you know well and what you might need to study a little more.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:44.400\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve some problems, showing you know your addition and subtraction.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:54.000\nOr, a spelling test could ask you to write words correctly, proving you understand how they're spelled.\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:02.600\nSo, in short, a test is a tool. It helps measure your understanding and points you in the right direction for future learning. Remember to always try your best, and see it as a chance to grow! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
