    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:36.200\nTests help us measure or evaluate things. For example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:46.800\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even tasting a new food is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing whether you like it or not!\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:55.500\nSo, tests are all about gathering information in a clear and reliable way. They help us understand things better and make informed decisions. Remember, a test is just a tool for learning and finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
