    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_061750.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:17.800\nThink of it like an investigation.\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:28.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:38.300\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\nThey can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like seeing if your shoes still fit.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:50.200\nThe key thing is that a test is a way to learn something new.\nIn short, a test is an investigation that helps us learn or confirm something.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:54.400\nThat's the basics of tests!\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by\n\n00:56.500 --> 00:57.000\nApilage\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:57.300\nAI.\n```"
  },
