    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.799\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.799 --> 00:15.400\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you know something well.\nIt\u2019s really that simple.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.700\nWe use tests all the time without even realizing it.\nWhen you check if your bike brakes work before riding, that\u2019s a test!\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:31.200\nOr when you answer questions in class, that's a test of your knowledge.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:37.700\nAnother example?\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou taste a little bit of the batter.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:42.100\nThat's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:53.900\nSo, a test is just a way to see if something meets a standard, works as expected, or if you understand something.\nWe use them to learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
