    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_061925.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.400\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to. It's like a little experiment to see if things are doing what they should.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:22.800\nFor example, imagine you're baking a cake. You test it by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, that means the cake is done!\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:35.100\nOr, if you're building a tower with blocks, you might gently push it to see if it's stable enough to stand. That's a test!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:44.200\nSo, tests help us know if things are right, if they're safe, or if they're working correctly. They\u2019re a crucial part of learning and building things!\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:51.900\nIn short, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
