    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_062426.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.200\nIt's a process or procedure designed to measure or evaluate. Think about it like this: You take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:32.600\nA doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test, to see if you like how it tastes!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:44.900\nSo, tests help us learn, understand, and make better decisions. They can be formal like exams, or informal like trying something new.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:53.100\nThe key is that they give us information. To recap, a test is a way to evaluate or measure something.\n\n00:53.100 --> 01:02.400\nThey come in all shapes and sizes and help us learn more about the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
