    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_062617.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:09.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:16.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:21.700\nThink about it like this: You might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:27.100\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:34.700\nAnother example is testing a recipe. Maybe you adjust the amount of sugar in a cake.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:41.400\nYou'd then bake the cake and test it by tasting it, to see if the change made it better!\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:48.800\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and making sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:50.600\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:52.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
