    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.900\nHey there! Welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:09.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:19.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:25.400\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a checkup.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:30.800\nThat's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:36.200\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:41.600\nThat's a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:50.100\nAnother example is baking a cake. You taste it after it's done.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:51.900\nThat taste test tells you if you used the right amount of sugar\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:54.700\nor if it needs more flavor.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:57.300\nSo, a test is just a procedure designed to gather information.\n```"
