    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:02.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:07.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:09.300\nIt helps us understand if something is true,\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:11.800\nor working correctly, or meeting a certain standard.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:14.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:16.100\nif you know how to spell words.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:18.400\nA taste test checks if you like\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:20.200\nthe flavor of something.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:23.200\nAnd a medical test can check if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:27.300\nSo, a test is basically a question or a procedure\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:28.800\ndesigned to give us some kind of answer.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:34.200\nWhether it's a school exam, a product review, or even\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:37.100\njust trying out a new recipe, it's all about\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:40.300\ngathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:42.400\nNow you understand the basics\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:43.700\nof what a test is!\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:45.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
