    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and then trying to get the right answer.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:26.600\nTests help us understand how well we've learned something, or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.900\nFor example, a spelling test shows you how well you know your words. Or, a taste test helps you decide which cookie is the most delicious!\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:46.700\nAnother example could be testing a light bulb to see if it still works. You plug it in, and if it lights up, the test is successful!\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:55.400\nIf it doesn't, well, you know it's time for a new bulb. So, remember, a test is simply a way of finding out information.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nIt's about exploring and discovering! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
