    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_063208.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:18.900\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see if something works, or if something is true. Think of it like checking if your shoes fit before you leave the house \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:25.700\nWe use tests all the time. For example, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:34.300\nOr, a chef might taste the soup to test if it needs more salt. Even playing a video game is a test of your skills!\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:45.100\nIn all these situations, we're gathering information to make a decision. So, a test helps us understand something better by giving us evidence.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:54.900\nIt's a simple but powerful tool we use every day. Remember, a test is just checking to see if something works or is true.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
