    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.100\nA test is really just a way to find out something. \nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:22.500\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time! \nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:30.400\nOr, if you push a door to see if it's locked, that's a test too! \nYou're testing whether you can open it.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:36.800\nAnother example? \nImagine you're trying to figure out if your flashlight needs new batteries.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:42.300\nYou turn it on. \nIf it's dim, that's a test telling you the batteries are low.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:52.100\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a way to check something and get information. \nIt helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
