    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like an experiment to see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:26.700\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:35.000\nYou might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through. Or, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how well you understand the words and grammar.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:44.200\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on when you're not feeling well. They might take your temperature or do a blood test.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:52.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool. A way to learn something new or confirm what we already know.\n\n00:52.200 --> 01:00.300\nIt helps us make better decisions and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
