    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:21.800\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something specific. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps us find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:31.700\nOr, if you bake a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it's delicious! Another example is a doctor checking your temperature.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:41.500\nThat's a test to see if you have a fever. Tests can be written, like quizzes, or practical, like trying to ride a bike.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:56.700\nThe important thing is they give us information. So, to recap, a test is a method of finding something out, whether it's your spelling skills, the taste of a cake, or even your temperature.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:04.200\nThey help us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
