    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_063909.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:15.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:26.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a checkup to test your health.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:35.100\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to test your knowledge. Even baking a cake is a test to see if you can follow a recipe!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:46.700\nTests can be written, spoken, physical, or even just observing something. The important thing is that they help us learn and understand more.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:56.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a process for gathering information. It helps us check things out and see how they measure up.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
