    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:19.900\nNow, a test is basically a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like checking if you've learned your ABCs, or seeing if a toy car can zoom down a ramp.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:31.100\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:40.600\nA school quiz is a test. Trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good is a test.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:48.400\nEven pushing a button to see if a light turns on is a simple test!\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:56.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words. A taste test checks your opinion of food.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:04.500\nAnd a simple on-off switch test checks if something is functioning correctly.\n\n01:04.500 --> 01:12.300\nSo, in short, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:12.300 --> 01:17.100\nIt helps us understand how things work and how much we know!\n\n01:17.100 --> 01:19.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
