    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:36.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to check how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:44.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from multiple choice questions to hands-on projects.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:49.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:54.700\nA driving test checks your ability to drive safely.\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:05.200\nAnd a recipe test... well, that checks if your cake tastes good!\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for figuring something out.\n\n01:05.200 --> 01:10.000\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we might need to learn next.\n\n01:10.000 --> 01:13.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
