    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_065327.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is working, or if we understand something, or even if we like something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:31.300\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes the soup \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more salt. Or when you take a quiz at school, that\u2019s a test to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:48.100\nEven trying on a new pair of shoes is a test to see if they fit and feel comfortable. So, a test can be anything from a simple check to a more formal assessment, but the main idea is always the same: to get some information.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:56.000\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
