    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.600\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well something works. Think about it like this: A baking test is when you stick a toothpick into a cake to see if it's done.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.800\nOr, a spelling test helps your teacher see if you understand how to spell certain words.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:38.700\nAnother example? Let's say you want to know if a new toy is fun.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:46.000\nThe test is simply playing with it! You're finding out if you like it. So, a test is just a method to learn or confirm something.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:53.100\nIt can be a formal exam, or just trying something out. It's all about discovering the answer!\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
