    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_065456.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really fundamental: tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to see if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:32.200\nYou put them on, walk around, and see if they're comfortable. That's a test! In science, we might test if a plant grows better with more sunlight.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:37.600\nWe give one plant more sun than another and then see which one grows taller.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:43.000\nOr imagine you're baking cookies.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:49.300\nYou taste one to see if you need more sugar. That\u2019s another kind of test!\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:55.700\nSo, a test is just a process to check something, find out information, or see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:57.700\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve things all the time! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
