    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:18.600\nIt's a method for gathering information and seeing how well something works, or how much of something there is.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:27.600\nThink about it like this: A doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. A teacher gives you a test to see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:39.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:51.100\nSo, tests help us understand things better and make informed decisions. They come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to get answers.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.600\nIn short, a test is just a way to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
