    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:24.200\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you the cake is done!\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:34.000\nOr, imagine you're checking if a lightbulb works.\nYou flip the switch.\nIf the light comes on, the test passes!\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:38.900\nTests can be simple or complex, but they all share the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:53.700\nWe use tests to learn, to improve things, and to make sure everything is working as it should.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of asking a question and getting an answer.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
