    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.500\nIt's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:31.300\nThink about it. When you go to the doctor, they might run some tests to see if you're healthy. Or, when you're learning something new in school, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:42.500\nFor example, a simple test could be tasting different fruits to see which one you like best. Or maybe counting the number of red cars you see on your way home.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:52.400\nThat's a test too! So, remember, a test is just a way of learning something by asking questions or observing the world around you.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:58.800\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
