    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like this: you might test your new bicycle brakes before riding down a big hill, right? That's a test!\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:34.900\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even simple activities.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:42.700\nImagine you're building a tower of blocks. You might test it by gently pushing it to see if it's strong enough to stand.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:48.100\nThat's another kind of test! So, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:59.500\nThey give us information about what we know and what we need to work on. They can be a little nerve-wracking, but remember they're just tools to help us understand things better.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:07.000\nIn short, a test is just a way to check something! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
