    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.400\nDon't worry, it's not as scary as it sounds! A test is simply a way to find out something, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You plug it in, and that's the test.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:27.700\nIf it lights up, it passes! Tests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:38.900\nYour doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Or, if you're baking a cake, you might test the batter to make sure it tastes good before you bake the whole thing.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:47.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:53.800\nIt helps us learn and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
