    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information or measure something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:29.500\nYou turn it on \u2013 that's the test! And whether it lights up or not tells you the result.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:38.500\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. In school, you take tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:47.500\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing if the recipe works!\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.100\nSo, a test is just a process to get information. You do something, and you get a result.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:55.200\nAnd that result helps you learn or make a decision. Pretty simple, right?\n```"
