    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_070150.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:12.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like this: you might test if the water in the shower is too hot before you get in.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:18.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:22.000\nOr, a baker might taste a cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:25.000\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:29.000\nA science experiment is a test to see if a hypothesis is correct.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:33.000\nEven playing a video game is a test of your skills!\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:40.000\nBasically, a test is any method for gathering information and checking something.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:47.000\nSo next time you encounter a \"test,\" remember it's just a way to learn and discover something new.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
