    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_070237.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really fundamental: a test!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:19.600\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. It's a process we use to evaluate or measure something, anything really.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:29.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher uses a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:45.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test, you're testing the recipe to see if it works! So, tests can be written exams, physical exams, or even just trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:52.400\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:58.900\nBasically, a test is a tool. A tool to learn, to measure, and to improve!\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:02.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
