    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb is good. You screw it in, flip the switch, and test if it lights up.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:35.700\nIn school, a test helps your teacher understand what you've learned. It could be answering questions, solving problems, or even giving a presentation.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:49.200\nAnother example is testing a new recipe. You follow the instructions, cook it, and then test it by tasting it to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:55.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check understanding or functionality. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
