    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a method to gather information or check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:35.800\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:38.800\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:41.800\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:52.600\nSo, whether it's checking your battery, tasting a soup, or answering questions on paper, a test helps us understand something better.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:59.100\nThey help us see if things are working, if we understand a topic, or just to gather useful information.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:01.000\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
