    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.699\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:27.699\nThink of it like asking a question to see if someone knows the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:40.599\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test lets you see if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:52.299\nDoctors use tests to check if you're healthy, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe. Basically, tests help us learn things and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.199\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to complex experiments.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:55.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something!\n```"
