    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.900\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know or can do.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like this: your teacher might give you a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:29.200\nTests aren't just for school, though. When you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:36.200\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:43.200\nSo, tests help us measure things. They can be quizzes, exams, or even simple experiments.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:52.500\nThe important thing is they give us information. To recap, tests help us understand what we know, what we can do, and even what might need a little improvement.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
