    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.490\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.490 --> 00:03.770\nIn everyday life, we take tests all the time, right?\n\n00:03.770 --> 00:07.430\nThink of it like this: a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly,\n\n00:07.430 --> 00:09.180\nor to see if you understand something.\n\n00:09.180 --> 00:09.960\nIt's a way to get information.\n\n00:09.960 --> 00:14.570\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter before you bake it \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:14.570 --> 00:18.800\nOr, when you get a new toy, you play with it to test if it does what it's supposed to.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:22.640\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:22.640 --> 00:25.690\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking you questions in class.\n\n00:25.690 --> 00:29.700\nThe important thing is that tests give us useful information.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:33.880\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and get information.\n\n00:33.880 --> 00:38.390\nIt can be anything from tasting cake batter to taking a big exam.\n\n00:38.390 --> 00:40.310\nTests help us learn and improve!\n\n00:40.310 --> 00:41.850\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
