    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it as a question with a method for finding the answer.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:26.800\nTests can be anything! You might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:32.300\nOr, imagine baking a cake. You taste it to test if it's sweet enough. That\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:41.900\nAnother example: A scientist might test different fertilizers on plants to see which one makes them grow the best. They're testing the effect of the fertilizer.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:50.300\nSo remember, a test is a process used to gather information and learn about something. It\u2019s a question, a method, and an answer, all rolled into one.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:54.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
