    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, welcome! \nToday we're talking about something super important: Tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.300\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works correctly. \nIt's like asking a question and seeing if you get the right answer.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.600\nThe main idea behind a test is to make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do. \nIt helps us find problems early on, before they become bigger issues.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:33.500\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might taste a little bit of the batter. \nThat's a test!\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:40.700\nYou're checking if it tastes good before you bake the whole thing. \nOr, imagine you're building with blocks.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:45.900\nYou might try stacking a few to see if they stay up. \nThat's another test!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:56.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check if something is working as expected. \nIt helps us find and fix problems early on.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
