    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:29.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:35.700\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:41.500\nThat's a test to see if it's done! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:47.300\nOr, imagine you have a new lightbulb. You screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:52.900\nThat's a test to see if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:59.100\nSo, a test is just a simple way to check something, whether it's a cake, a lightbulb, or anything else you want to learn more about. It helps us understand the world around us, one question and answer at a time. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
