    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.700\nA test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly or meeting a certain standard.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:31.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, it passes the test! Tests are used everywhere.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:43.800\nDoctors use tests to check your health, like a blood test. Schools use tests to see how well you're learning. Even video games use tests to make sure the game is running smoothly.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:49.600\nSo, basically, a test helps us understand if something is good enough or needs improvement.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:58.000\nWe look at the results and decide what to do next. That\u2019s the basics of testing! Remember, it\u2019s all about checking if something works as expected. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
