    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: a baking test. You follow a recipe, and the result, the cake, tells you if you did it right.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:34.900\nOr imagine a doctor giving you a check-up. Each part of the exam, like listening to your heart, is a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.500\nTests aren't just for baking or doctors, though. You take tests in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:54.800\nYou might even test out a new video game before deciding to buy it. So, a test is really just a method for gathering information and evaluating something.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:02.900\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
