    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:03.500\nToday we're going to talk about something really important: tests.\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:07.000\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:11.500\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you put it in a lamp.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:14.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:17.500\nYou might have a quiz at school, which is a small test on what you learned in class.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:21.500\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:27.000\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test, to see if you can make it taste good!\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.000\nSo, tests help us understand where we're at, and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:35.000\nThey give us information that we can use to improve.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:40.000\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools for learning.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:42.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
