    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.300 --> 00:02.700\nToday we're tackling the basics of tests.\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:05.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:8.700\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer.\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:12.500\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:17.200\nOr, a baker might test the temperature of their oven to make sure the cake bakes perfectly.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:27.800\nTests can be used to measure all sorts of things \u2013 from your knowledge, to the quality of a product, to even how well a new medicine works.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:37.900\nThe important thing is that they give us information that helps us understand something better.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:40.600\nSo, a test is all about discovering information.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:51.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
