    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.400\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand better.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:25.400\nWe use tests all the time!\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:38.700\nYou poke the cake, and if the toothpick comes out clean, that's your test telling you it's ready.\nOr, if you're trying to guess someone's favorite color, you might ask them directly.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:52.000\nTheir answer is the result of your test!\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like trying out different flavors of ice cream to see which one you like best.\n\n00:52.000 --> 01:03.300\nThe main idea is that you're doing something to gather information.\nSo, a test is just a method to discover something new or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:06.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
