    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:22.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:36.200\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, falling down is a way of testing your balance. Tests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like trying a new recipe.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:46.400\nThe important thing is they help us learn and understand things better. They show us what works, what doesn't, and what we need to improve on.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:54.900\nSo, whether it\u2019s a science experiment or just trying something new, remember that testing is a valuable tool.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
