    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_072324.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it as a way to check or evaluate.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:30.200\nTests can come in many forms. You might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:38.800\nEven tasting food to see if it needs more salt is a kind of test! The important thing is that a test gives you information.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:49.800\nSo, whether it's a quiz in class, a medical exam, or even just trying a new recipe, tests help us learn and understand more.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:59.400\nThey provide valuable data that we can use to make better decisions.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:03.000\nRemember, a test is simply a method for finding information.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
