    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.600\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate something \u2013 like your knowledge, a product's quality, or even the strength of a bridge.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:25.600\nThink about it. When you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:39.800\nOr, imagine a toy company checking if a new toy can withstand being dropped; that's also a test. Even a doctor checking your temperature is performing a simple test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:47.200\nSo, a test is really just a method to gather information and make a judgment based on that information.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:53.100\nThey help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
