    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.300\nIt's a method we use to check or measure something. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:33.800\nOr, you might take a test at school to see how much you've learned. Another example could be testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or testing a toy to see if it's safe.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:43.300\nSo, a test can be anything from a formal exam to just trying something out. It helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:54.000\nIn short, tests are ways to gather information and make decisions. They are used to check for qualities, knowledge, or performance.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
