    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:26.100\nIt could be finding out if a cake is ready, or if you understand a new concept. Think of it like this: you're baking a cake, and to test if it's done, you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:35.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you the cake is ready! Or, imagine you're learning about colors.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:43.100\nA test could be someone asking you to point to the blue object. If you point to the right one, you pass the test!\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:55.100\nSo, tests are just tools to help us learn and understand. They come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:02.800\nThey help us confirm what we know, and show us where we need to learn more. That's the basics of testing!\n\n01:02.800 --> 01:06.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
