    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.300\nIt's a process designed to gather information. Think of it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:33.900\nOr, a chef tastes food to test if it's seasoned correctly. In school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:42.500\nThey can be written exams, quizzes, or even practical demonstrations.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:50.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words, while a science experiment tests a hypothesis.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool.\n```"
  },
