    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nEver wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:07.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how many words you can spell correctly.\nThat shows your understanding of spelling.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:22.000\nTests aren't just for school though!\nA chef might taste a sauce to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.000\nOr, a mechanic might run a test on a car engine to see if it's running smoothly.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:35.000\nBasically, a test is a method of evaluating knowledge, skill, or performance.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.000\nIt can be as simple as a quick check, or as complex as a long exam.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:48.000\nSo, tests help us understand where we are, and what we might need to learn or improve.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
