    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:05.000\nToday we're diving into something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:08.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:12.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:14.800\nYou poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:15.500\nThat's a test!\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:18.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:22.700\nChecking if the water's hot enough for a shower?\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:23.100\nTest.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:25.700\nSeeing if your shoes still fit?\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:26.100\nTest.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:28.500\nThese tests give us information.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:33.100\nSo, a test is basically a procedure or question that helps us evaluate or measure something.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:37.700\nFrom school exams to simple everyday checks, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:39.900\nThey give us answers.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:43.300\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:44.000\nHope that helps!\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:47.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
