    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.800\nNow, you might be thinking about school tests, but in general, a test is just a way to check if something works the way it should.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and turn it on. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:26.900\nOr, imagine you're baking cookies.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:33.200\nYou test if they're done by poking them with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, they\u2019re ready. That's another kind of test!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:45.000\nBasically, we use tests to make sure things are good, whether it's a lightbulb, a cookie, or even a computer program.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:55.300\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way of checking something to see if it\u2019s working correctly. It helps us know if we're on the right track.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
