    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:19.900\nIt helps us find out if something works the way it should, or if something is true.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:26.500\nThink about baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:33.100\nOr, imagine a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:42.100\nEven when you try a new video game, you're kind of testing it out to see if you like it!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:57.400\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and checking things. They can be simple, like tasting cake, or more complex, but the basic idea is always the same: to learn something.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:00.100\nIn short, tests help us understand the world around us a little bit better.\n```"
