    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.200\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:06.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:13.700\nThink of it like an experiment, but instead of mixing chemicals, we're trying to measure knowledge, skill, or even understanding.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:18.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:21.800\nOr a math test sees if you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:26.400\nEven tasting a new food is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing to see if you like it!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:31.700\nTests can come in many forms, like multiple choice, true or false, or even essays.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:43.400\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and grow by showing us what we already know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:48.600\nSo, a test is just a tool to help us discover something about ourselves or the world around us.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:52.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
