    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.000\nA test is really just a way to find out how much you know about a topic.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain! Tests can come in all sorts of forms, like multiple choice questions, true or false statements, or even just writing out your answers.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:35.200\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve problems, while a history test might ask you about important events.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:37.700\nSee? Pretty straightforward.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:48.300\nSo, remember, a test is simply a tool to help you and your teachers understand what you've learned and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:54.400\nIt's all about learning and growing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
