    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific. Think of it like checking if something is working correctly, or seeing how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:28.100\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health. Or, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:35.800\nTests help us understand something better by giving us results, which we can then use to make decisions.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:41.800\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a kind of test!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:53.700\nIt helps you decide if you need more sugar or another ingredient. So, to sum up, a test is a process that helps us learn something by providing information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:02.100\nIt could be about your health, your knowledge, or even your baking skills. It\u2019s all about getting answers!\n\n01:02.100 --> 01:05.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
