    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_075443.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nEver wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but usually with a specific question in mind.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:29.100\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:35.300\nImagine you're baking a cake. You taste the batter, that's a test!\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:38.300\nYou're testing if it tastes right.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:44.500\nOr, think about a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:53.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple taste tests to big exams at school. They help us understand things better and make important decisions.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:58.700\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information. Whether it's baking, medicine, or school, tests are everywhere helping us learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
