    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:22.000\nIt's a process that gives us information or results.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like this: a taste test for ice cream!\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:32.800\nYou taste different flavors to find out which one you like best. That's a test!\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:38.400\nOr maybe a doctor checks your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:43.600\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:54.400\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking you questions in class. Tests help us understand things better and make decisions.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:57.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and discovering.\n```"
