    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_080055.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:29.700\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a specific area.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:39.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health, right?\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:49.600\nSimilarly, tests in school help your teacher see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.400\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz on animals is a test.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.000\nA practical exam where you have to bake a cake is also a test.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:01.600\nEven asking someone trivia questions can be seen as a mini-test of their general knowledge.\n\n01:01.600 --> 01:11.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool.\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we might need to learn next.\n\n01:11.600 --> 01:16.000\nIt's not about being \"right\" or \"wrong,\" but about learning and growing.\n\n01:16.000 --> 01:19.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
