    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_080158.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:14.800\nBasically, a test is a way to check how well you understand something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you learn about colors, and then someone asks you, \"What color is the sky?\" That's a test!\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:31.100\nTests aren't just about grades in school, though. They help you see what you know and what you might need to practice more.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:39.300\nFor example, a recipe could be a test. You follow the instructions, and if the cake comes out great, you passed!\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:47.500\nOr maybe you're learning to ride a bike. Falling down is part of the test, showing you need to work on your balance.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:56.700\nSo, remember, tests are just tools to help you learn and grow. They show you where you're strong and where you can improve.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:02.000\nDon't be afraid of them! See them as a chance to learn even more.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:05.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
