    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:39.300\nMaybe you want to know if a plant needs more water, so you test it by giving it extra water and seeing what happens.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:49.000\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, a quiz is a test to see how well you remember them.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:50.700\nTests can be big, like an exam in school, or small, like trying a new recipe to see if you like it.\n00:50.700 --> 00:52.400\nThe important thing is you're gathering information to learn something.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:54.300\nSo, a test is just a method to discover or confirm something.\n```"
