    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.250 --> 00:01.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:04.670\nToday we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:04.670 --> 00:08.720\nBasically, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.720 --> 00:13.500\nThink of it like a question or a series of questions designed to give us information.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:17.700\nFor example, a spelling test helps us understand how well someone knows how to spell different words.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:21.360\nOr, a taste test can tell us which snack someone prefers.\n\n00:21.360 --> 00:24.990\nDoctors use tests too, like blood tests, to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.990 --> 00:35.140\nSo, tests are really just tools that help us learn and understand more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:35.140 --> 00:40.060\nThey can measure knowledge, preferences, or even the condition of something.\n\n00:40.060 --> 00:42.820\nRemember, tests help us gather information!\n\n00:42.820 --> 00:45.080\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
