    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works. Think of it like a little check-up!\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:21.200\nThe main idea is to gather information. We can test all sorts of things.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:33.400\nFor example, a teacher might give you a test in school to see how much you've learned in math. Or, you might test the batteries in your flashlight to see if they still have enough power.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.900\nAnother example could be testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good! Different tests give us different kinds of information.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:56.300\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working properly. To sum it up, a test is a way to gather information to see how well something works or how much you know.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
