    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.900\nNot the kind that stress you out, but the kind that helps us understand something better. Think of a test as simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see what something is made of.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:26.300\nIt's like a little experiment! For example, a simple test could be checking if a light bulb works.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:38.000\nYou turn it on, and if it lights up, the test is successful! Or, a taste test can tell you if a food is sweet, sour, or salty.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:44.600\nThese are all ways to gather information. Tests are super useful because they give us data.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:54.200\nThis data then helps us make decisions and solve problems. So, remember, a test is just a method to learn more about something.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
