    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:27.700\nIt's a process designed to gather information and see what you know or how something works.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:32.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:40.400\nOr, a taste test for a new soda helps decide if people like the flavor.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:45.200\nAnother example? A doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:53.300\nSo, tests are used everywhere! They help us learn, improve things, and make important decisions. Basically, a test is just a method to learn something new or confirm what we already suspect. It's a way to get answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
