    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:13.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:29.400\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:33.700\nBasically, a test helps us answer a question.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:38.000\nAre you good at math? Is the water safe to drink?\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:42.300\nTests give us the answers!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:45.800\nSometimes the answer is a number, like on a temperature check.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:52.600\nOther times, it's a simple yes or no. So, to recap, a test is just a method for getting information.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:54.700\nIt can be used to check skills, measure things,\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:56.900\nor find out if something is true or false.\n\n00:56.900 --> 00:57.900\nPretty simple, right?\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
