    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:17.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a right or wrong answer.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:31.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:39.100\nImagine you're baking a cake. You taste the batter \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:46.700\nYou're testing to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.700\nOr, when you turn on a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:05.900\nIt's a quick and easy way to get information. Schools use tests to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:13.300\nDoctors use tests to check your health.\n\n01:13.300 --> 01:20.700\nEven video games use tests to see if you can jump over an obstacle.\n\n01:20.700 --> 01:28.100\nThey're all designed to measure something specific.\n\n01:28.100 --> 01:35.300\nSo, a test is just a tool we use to learn, to check, and to understand things better.\n\n01:35.300 --> 01:43.100\nIt helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n01:43.100 --> 01:49.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
