    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:35.400\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. For example, your doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:50.600\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. A chef might even taste their soup \u2013 that\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:50.600 --> 01:03.000\nSo, a test is a process, often with specific steps, designed to evaluate something. It could be your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the presence of a specific substance.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:06.500\nTo recap, a test helps us learn something by providing information in a reliable way.\n01:06.500 --> 01:10.600\nIt's a question, a process, and an answer all rolled into one!\n01:10.600 --> 01:13.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
