    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is ready. You do a test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:25.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! See? We learned something.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:30.000\nTests aren't just for baking, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:36.600\nTeachers use tests to see how much you've learned. Even your phone uses tests to make sure all its parts are working properly.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:53.300\nSo, whether it's a toothpick in a cake, a checkup at the doctor, or an exam at school, a test helps us gather information and make decisions. It\u2019s all about learning and understanding.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:57.900\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
