    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.200\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information and see how well someone, or something, performs.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to test your knowledge of a subject. Or, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:39.900\nEven a car company puts its new cars through rigorous tests to make sure they're safe. So, tests can be anything from a written exam to a physical trial.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:49.300\nThe important thing is that they help us understand something better. They give us data and insights that we can use to make informed decisions.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:55.700\nIn short, a test helps us learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
