    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even how well a machine is working.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:31.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A taste test helps decide which cookie tastes better. And a medical test can help doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:42.700\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions. They give us information to work with.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:54.200\nThey can be big or small, simple or complex, but the basic idea is always the same: to get answers.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:03.000\nIn short, a test is a method to evaluate something and get data. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
