    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_082214.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.200\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if the batteries work, or you might take a quiz at school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:40.100\nTests can be anything from simple yes or no questions, to more complex problems you need to solve. For example, a mechanic might test your car's brakes to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:52.700\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt. So, remember, a test is just a way to find out information and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:58.500\nThey help us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
