    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it like a detective trying to solve a case \u2013 they gather clues and evidence to figure out the truth.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:29.400\nIn school, a test checks how well you understand a subject. In cooking, you might test if a cake is done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:36.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:47.500\nThey might check your temperature or take a blood sample. So, a test is really just a way to find out information or see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.300\nIt helps us learn and make better decisions. And that's tests in a nutshell!\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
