    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: Tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:13.900\nSo, what is a test?\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:23.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It helps us find out if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your toy car works.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:33.900\nYou push it, and see if it rolls. That's a test!\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:39.400\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking cookies. You taste one to see if it\u2019s sweet enough.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.100\nThat's another test! Tests aren't just for science class, they're everywhere. We use them all the time to learn and make sure things are right.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:57.200\nSo remember, a test is a way to check something and find out information. It could be as simple as pushing a toy car or tasting a cookie. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
