    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.900\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like a question you ask to see if you understand an idea, or a way to see if something works correctly.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:29.300\nWe use tests all the time! Like, when you take a spelling quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you know your words. Or, if you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:37.900\nThe results help you learn and improve. Another example is when you try a new toy. You're testing it out to see if it's fun and works the way it should!\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:45.500\nSo, remember, tests are simply ways to check things and learn from the results.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:54.800\nThey help us understand and improve.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
