    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_083137.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's a process, a question, or even a challenge that helps us understand more about ourselves or the world around us.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like this: you're trying to figure out if an apple is ripe. You might squeeze it gently, smell it, or even take a small bite. Those are all little tests!\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:37.700\nOr, if you want to know if a lightbulb works, you screw it in and flip the switch. That's a test too!\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:48.100\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like checking the ripeness of an apple.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:54.900\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:03.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
