    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn more.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:25.100\nThe main idea behind a test is to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\nIt could be a quiz at school to see what you've learned in class.\nOr it could be a test on a new toy to see if it's strong enough.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:32.100\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might test the batter to see if it tastes good before you bake the whole thing.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:39.100\nOr imagine you're building a tower of blocks; you're constantly testing to see if it will stay standing.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:53.600\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information and check something out.\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "87ba7d37-5ac2-4ecc-8a09-631510995fc7": {
