    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to test your understanding of the lesson.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:27.300\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:36.100\nSee? Different situations, same idea. Another example: Before a new car comes out, engineers run lots of tests to make sure it's safe and reliable.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:48.500\nThey test everything from the brakes to the engine. So, remember, a test is simply a process used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or quality.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:54.900\nIt helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
