    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_083637.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.275 --> 00:04.075\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.075 --> 00:07.475\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out\nhow much you know about something.\n\n00:07.475 --> 00:09.075\nIt's like a measuring stick\nfor your knowledge!\n\n00:09.695 --> 00:12.695\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes,\nfrom short quizzes to big final exams.\n\n00:13.135 --> 00:17.235\nThink of it this way: If you're learning\nto bake a cake, a test might be asking you\n\n00:17.235 --> 00:19.805\nwhat ingredients you need.\nOr if you're learning about animals,\n\n00:19.805 --> 00:23.165\na test could ask you to name different\ntypes of birds.\n\n00:23.605 --> 00:27.635\nThe goal of a test isn't just to get a grade.\nIt's also a chance for you to see what\n\n00:27.635 --> 00:30.275\nyou've learned and what you might need\nto study more.\n\n00:30.795 --> 00:35.805\nSo, next time you see a test, remember\nit's just a tool to help you learn and grow.\n\n00:36.975 --> 00:39.675\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "27403929-509d-42bf-a4fe-d8cfda45e8dd": {
    "id": "27403929-509d-42bf-a4fe-d8cfda45e8dd",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T01:52:20.589423",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-02T08:37:25.022943",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_083724.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_083724.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:28.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain requirements. Think of it like this: if you want to know if your cookies are done baking, you might do a simple test by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:36.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cookies pass the test! Another example is a spelling test in school.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:44.100\nIt checks if you know how to spell certain words. Or even testing if a lightbulb works before you screw it in!\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:55.100\nTests are everywhere, helping us make sure things are right. So, remember, a test is a way to check if something works or meets a standard.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:02.600\nIt\u2019s a simple but powerful tool we use all the time. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "56a9bb73-9230-4e47-a934-67eeb3055164": {
    "id": "56a9bb73-9230-4e47-a934-67eeb3055164",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T01:52:20.987842",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-02T08:38:13.432582",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_083813.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_083813.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of getting a verbal answer, you're getting results that show you the answer.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:31.400\nThe main idea behind a test is to measure something. This could be anything from how well you understand a topic, to how strong a material is, or even if a plant needs more water.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:41.600\nFor example, a spelling test helps determine how well you know your spelling words. A doctor might run a blood test to see if you have enough vitamins.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:53.900\nAnd a scientist might test different fertilizers to see which helps plants grow the best. So, to recap, a test is a process used to measure something and gather information.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:00.900\nIt helps us understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
