    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHello, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:11.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:17.500\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:22.400\nThat's a test! Tests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.100\nMaybe you want to test if a cake is done by poking it with a toothpick. Or perhaps you're testing if a toy car needs new batteries.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:39.900\nYou're trying to learn something by observing the result. Another example: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:50.900\nThe results help them understand what's going on. So remember, a test is just a process to learn something new or confirm something we think is true.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:57.100\nIt's all about gathering information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
