    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:09.200\nWhat is a test, anyway?\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:19.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:26.300\nThink about it like this: you might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:33.100\nOr maybe you test if your shoes fit by trying them on.\nIf they're comfortable, they pass the test!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:43.700\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\nFrom checking if a toy works, to seeing if you understand a new idea.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:51.800\nThey help us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something out and see what's what.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
