    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.700\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like checking if your cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it!\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:36.700\nBasically, you have a question, problem, or task, and then you try to answer it, solve it, or perform the task.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:42.200\nThe test tells you how successful you were.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:47.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:56.600\nA fitness test might see how many push-ups you can do. And a taste test? Well, that tells you if something tastes good!\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.200\nSo, a test is a way of checking understanding or ability.\n\n01:00.200 --> 01:04.000\nWhether it's a school exam, a software trial, or even just trying a new recipe, it helps us learn and improve.\n01:04.000 --> 01:07.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
