    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_084741.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.100\nA test, simply put, is a way to find out how much you know about something. Think of it like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:23.800\nThere are lots of different kinds of tests. Maybe you've taken a spelling test, where you write down words.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:29.700\nOr a math test, where you solve problems. Even quizzes online are a type of test!\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:41.300\nThey all help show what you've learned. For example, if you've been learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of animals or what they eat.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:55.300\nOr, if you're learning about colors, you might be asked to identify the primary colors. So, remember, a test is just a tool to see what you know and what you might need to learn more about.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:59.400\nDon't be scared of them! They're a normal part of learning.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:02.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
