    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it as a question you're asking to get an answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.400\nTests can be all sorts of things. It could be a school test to see what you've learned, a medical test to check your health, or even testing a recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:36.300\nFor example, you might test if a toy car rolls faster on a smooth floor or a carpet. You'd be testing the effect of the surface on the car's speed.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:43.500\nOr, you could test different types of fertilizer on plants to see which one makes them grow the tallest.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.100\nSo, to recap: A test is a way to ask a question and get an answer. It helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
