    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_085306.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling a fundamental concept: what is a test?\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:23.300\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a taste test tells you if you like a food.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.300\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your spelling words. And even your doctor uses tests to check your health, like taking your temperature.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:47.200\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us information. They can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying a new recipe to see if it's good.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:58.000\nThe main idea is that a test helps you learn something! To recap, a test is a process for gathering information to answer a specific question.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:05.700\nIt's a simple yet powerful tool for learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
