    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.600 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:05.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:09.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:11.500\nIt's like a little quiz that helps you check your understanding.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:18.200\nThink of it this way: imagine you're learning to ride a bike. A test ride would be a way to see if you can balance and pedal on your own.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:22.200\nOr maybe you\u2019re learning your ABCs. A test could be pointing to a letter and saying its name.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:27.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from short quizzes to big exams.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:34.500\nThe important thing is they help you and your teachers see what you've learned and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:39.500\nSo, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge and understanding.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:42.400\nIt helps you learn and grow!\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:45.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
