    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_085740.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: a test.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is basically a way to check your knowledge or skills on a particular topic.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your brain! The main idea behind a test is to see what you know and what you might need to learn more about.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:38.500\nIt helps you and your teachers understand your progress. For example, you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:50.000\nOr, a math test to check your understanding of addition and subtraction. Even playing a video game can be a test of your reflexes and problem-solving skills!\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:57.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn and grow. It's a chance to show what you know and figure out what you still need to work on.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:00.900\nIt's not something to be afraid of! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
