    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea, or checking if something works like it should.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:21.800\nSo, what kind of things can we test?\nWell, practically anything!\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:30.200\nIn school, you take tests to see how well you've learned the material.\nYour doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:41.000\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like the taste!\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:53.500\nOr, imagine testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\nBasically, a test is just a tool to help us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:00.000\nIt helps us understand something better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
