    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_090059.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It helps us measure or evaluate skills, knowledge, or even abilities.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like a recipe. You follow the steps, and the test tells you if your cake is ready!\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:28.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A math test checks your math knowledge.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:37.100\nAnd even a taste test checks if you like the flavor of something! They all follow a specific method to give us information.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:46.100\nSo, tests are a simple way to gather information about what we know or what we can do. They help us learn and improve.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:49.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
