    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.300\nEver wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:05.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:07.900\nIt\u2019s like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:11.300\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:16.000\nThink about it: When you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:19.800\nOr, if you try to open a door, you're testing if it's locked.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:23.500\nIn school, tests help us see how well we understand a subject.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:27.900\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just doing a project.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:30.200\nThe goal is to show what you've learned.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:33.800\nSo, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:37.700\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:38.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
