    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_090309.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:01.400\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:01.400 --> 00:03.100\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:04.600\nWhat is a test, really?\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:07.300\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:10.200\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:10.200 --> 00:13.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:16.900\nThink about baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:22.300\nOr imagine you're trying to figure out which key opens a lock. You test each key until you find the right one.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:27.300\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:34.000\nThe important thing is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:38.300\nSo, a test is just a way to check things out and get answers.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:39.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
