    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.900\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:27.800\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:34.500\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:38.100\nThat's a test!\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:44.800\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\nThe cake's ready.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:50.500\nOr, imagine you want to know if a lightbulb works.\nYou screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:53.100\nIf it lights up, the test is passed!\n\n00:53.100 --> 01:06.000\nTests help us make decisions.\nThey give us information that we can use to understand something better or to solve a problem.\n\n01:06.000 --> 01:13.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something and learn from the results.\n\n01:13.200 --> 01:16.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
