    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like checking if your cake is done \u2013 you poke it with a fork, and if it comes out clean, you know it's ready!\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:36.500\nIn school, tests help your teachers figure out what you've learned and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:44.500\nThey can come in lots of forms, like multiple choice questions, short answers, or even drawing a picture.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:51.300\nFor example, a test might ask you what color the sky is, or to name the first month of the year. See? Pretty straightforward!\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:55.900\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a tool for measuring knowledge.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:58.400\nIt helps you and your teachers understand what you know. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
