    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:23.900\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand better.\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:31.800\nThat's a test to see how well you understand the lesson.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:43.400\nEven trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and even try new things.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:55.400\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the main idea is always the same: to get information.\nThey give us insight and allow us to make informed decisions.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:04.400\nTo recap, a test is a method of gathering information.\nIt's used everywhere, from classrooms to kitchens!\n\n01:04.400 --> 01:08.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
