    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like an experiment, but often simpler.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:26.500\nWe use tests to measure things, to check if something works, or to see what someone knows.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:33.100\nImagine baking a cake.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:39.800\nYou might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:42.100\nThat's a test!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:46.400\nOr, think about taking a spelling test in school.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:51.000\nThat shows what words you've learned.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:52.200\nEven checking if your phone charger works is a type of test!\n```"
  },
