    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.700\nIt's a process we use to evaluate or measure something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:33.900\nThink about it: a spelling test at school checks your understanding of words. Or, when you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if you like how it tastes.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:43.600\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:52.100\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information we can use to make decisions and improve.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:59.200\nThey're all around us, helping us learn and grow. That's the basic idea behind what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
