    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_091137.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHello, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:20.300\nIt's a process we use to gather information. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:30.500\nOr, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:41.800\nTests aren't just for finding out what you know, they can also check if something works. For example, engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:55.300\nOr a company might test a new product before they sell it. So, a test is really just a way of checking something, whether it's knowledge, health, or how well something functions.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:01.300\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
