    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something, right? It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You screw it in, flip the switch, and poof \u2013 you\u2019re testing if it lights up.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:33.200\nAnother example could be a taste test. You try a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:39.600\nYou're testing your own preference! Or maybe you\u2019re taking a quiz at school; that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:52.100\nSo, whether it's a quiz, a taste, or a lightbulb, a test helps us learn something new. In short, a test is just a way of finding something out.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
