    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_091327.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like a question, but instead of just asking, we're using a process to get the answer.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:24.300\nSo, what kind of things can we test? Well, you can test if a lightbulb works by turning it on. That's a test!\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:30.000\nOr you can test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, it passes the test!\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:37.000\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. That test helps your teacher find out how well you know your words.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:45.400\nTests help us learn and understand things better. They give us information.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:52.300\nSo, remember, a test is a process to find something out. It can be simple or complex, but it always has a purpose.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:60.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
