    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:22.800\nIt\u2019s how we check if something is working, or if something is true. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:27.400\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:33.200\nSee? Different kinds of tests, but same basic idea.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:39.000\nAnother example? Let's say you bake a cake. Tasting the cake is a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:44.400\nIf it does, great! If not, you know what to change next time.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:54.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to get information. It helps us understand things better and make better decisions.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
