    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test helps us see how well you know your words.\nA taste test lets us decide which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:42.200\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on inside your body.\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, your abilities, or even the quality of a product, a test provides information.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:48.200\nIt helps us learn and make better decisions.\nIt\u2019s really just a way to get answers!\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:58.700\nRemember, tests are all around us, helping us understand the world a little bit better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
