    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.600\nDon\u2019t worry, it\u2019s not the kind you need to study for! In this case, a test is simply a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a light bulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and flip the switch. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:29.500\nThe light either turns on, meaning the test passed, or it doesn\u2019t, meaning the test failed.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:38.700\nAnother example is baking a cake. You follow the recipe, then you taste it. If it tastes good, the test of your recipe was successful!\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:44.700\nIf it's not so great, you know you need to tweak something.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:53.600\nSo, a test is just a way to find out if something is working the way it should. It helps us identify problems and make improvements.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
