    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\nThink about it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best!\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.100\nTests aren't just in school, though.\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're essentially testing it out to see if it works.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:46.200\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to evaluate or learn something new.\nIt can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like trying a new game.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:59.200\nThe important thing is that it helps us understand more about ourselves or the world around us.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
