    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_092727.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:20.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be finding out how much you know about a subject, or it could be figuring out if something works the way it should.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:27.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:37.200\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. Tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:46.900\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz, a science experiment, or even just tasting your food, you're performing a test.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:55.900\nThey are all about learning and improving. Remember, tests aren't always about grades, they're about understanding.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
