    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:27.900\nOr a baker might taste their cake batter to see if it's sweet enough. These are both tests!\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:40.400\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned. If you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of animals, or explain what they eat.\n\n00:40.400 --> 01:00.200\nTests can come in many forms, like multiple choice questions, or even just drawing a picture! So, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something, whether it's your health, cake batter, or how much you know about animals.\n\n01:00.200 --> 01:06.000\nIt\u2019s a tool for understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
