    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:31.100\nThat toothpick is your test! Tests help us understand something better. They can measure knowledge, like a school quiz, or abilities, like a driving test.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:42.200\nThey can even check the quality of something, like that cake. For example, a doctor uses tests to figure out what's wrong when you're sick.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:52.600\nOr, a software company tests their programs to find bugs.\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:01.000\nSo, whether it's baking a cake, fixing a computer, or learning in school, tests are all about finding out information. Basically, a test is just a tool we use to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
