    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:22.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think about it: a chef tasting a soup to see if it needs more salt is doing a test.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:32.800\nOr when you try on a shoe to see if it fits, that's a test too! In school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:43.800\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve some problems to see if you understand addition. Or a spelling test checks if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:52.200\nSo, a test is just a process for gathering information. It helps us, and others, learn and improve.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:59.100\nRemember, tests are a tool for learning, not something to be afraid of.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
