    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests help us understand if something is working the way it should, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:31.200\nFor instance, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:38.500\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:46.300\nImagine you're baking a cake. You could test it by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:56.800\nThat's a test. Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, a test might be whether you can ride without training wheels.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out. It\u2019s a question, a check, a way to see how things are going. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
