    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.500\nNow, a test, in a nutshell, is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it as a way to find out if something is working correctly, or if you understand a topic.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:41.700\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run a test to check your health. A baker might even taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:48.500\nSo, tests help us learn, they help us stay healthy, and they even help us make delicious treats.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:52.200\nThey're all about checking and understanding. Remember, a test is just a way to check something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
