    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:29.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\nOr, in school, you might take a test to show what you've learned.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:35.100\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:39.700\nThat's a test!\nYou're finding out if the batter tastes right.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:55.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and check something.\nIt helps us understand things better, whether it's our health, our knowledge, or even if our cake batter is sweet enough!\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
