    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_094805.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the concept of a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:21.200\nThink about it.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:30.800\nA doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. A teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:39.200\nEven baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you taste it to see if it's good! The main idea is to gather information.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:48.800\nTests help us learn, diagnose problems, or make decisions. They can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb works, or complex, like running experiments in a science lab.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:59.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and finding something out. It helps us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
