    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer,\nor trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:22.000\nThe main idea is to gather information.\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:31.000\nYour teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:42.600\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, you're testing your balance and coordination.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:56.700\nSo, in short, a test is a way to learn and understand something better by checking or trying it out.\nIt helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:04.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
