    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:23.800\nIt's a method we use to gather information or see if something works the way it should.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:31.600\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:45.600\nOr a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt. Even a game you play can be a test of your skills!\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:53.500\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your phone is charged. They all have the same goal: to give us some kind of answer or result.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.000\nSo, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what we already know. Easy, right?\n```"
