    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us learn more about a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like a detective gathering clues!\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.700\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing to see if you like it!\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:47.600\nTests can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like tasting a new flavor of ice cream.\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:56.700\nSo, tests are tools that help us understand the world around us better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
