    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a process designed to gather information or evaluate something specific. Think about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you have a virus.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:31.500\nThat's gathering information. Or, your teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. That's evaluating your knowledge.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.300\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:50.200\nFrom simple yes or no questions, to complex experiments in a lab. The important thing is that they have a purpose: to help us learn or understand something better.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:59.000\nSo remember, a test is a process for gathering information or evaluating something. It's a tool for discovery!\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:02.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
