    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:19.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:27.800\nTests help us check if something is working, if something is true, or even just to see what someone knows.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:37.500\nFor example, your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:48.500\nThere are all sorts of tests, big and small, happening all around us, all the time.\nThey're a valuable tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:53.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
