    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:06.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:12.600\nIt helps us understand if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:17.100\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:21.800\nOr, maybe you test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:25.400\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:31.200\nA scientist might test a new medicine to see if it cures a disease.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:34.600\nOr you might even test the batteries in your remote to see if they still work.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:42.900\nSo, a test is just a structured way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:45.000\nIt's all about finding answers!\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:50.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
