    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:40.600\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned. And a chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:49.800\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share one thing in common: they help us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:55.500\nWhether it's a quiz, a blood sample, or even just a quick experiment, tests are all about gathering information. That's testing in a nutshell! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
