    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:18.200\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:26.200\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you're baking a cake. You taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:33.200\nOr, maybe you try on a new shirt. That's a test to see if it fits.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:40.300\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, true or false, or even essays.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:47.500\nThe important thing is that they give us information. We use that information to learn and improve.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:51.100\nSo, tests aren't scary, they're helpful tools!\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:53.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
