    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something really important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:20.900\nNow, a test, at its core, is just a way to find out something. It's a method we use to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone understands a topic.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:31.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar. Both are examples of tests.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:38.400\nIn school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:50.800\nAnd in the real world, companies test their products to make sure they're safe and reliable.\n\n00:50.800 --> 01:03.800\nSo, tests help us gather information and make sure things are working as they should. They're all about checking and understanding!\n\n01:03.800 --> 01:07.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out something, whether it's about your health, your baking, or your knowledge.\n01:07.400 --> 01:11.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
