    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.100\nA test is simply a way to find out\nhow much you know about something,\nor how well you can do something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like checking your understanding.\nIt can be written, like a quiz\nwith multiple choice questions,\nor it can be practical,\nlike showing you know how to bake a cake.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:34.000\nFor example, a spelling test\nchecks your knowledge of spelling words.\nAnd a driving test\nshows whether you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:45.600\nTests help you and others see\nwhat you've learned and where\nyou might need to focus more.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:53.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool\nto measure knowledge or skills.\nIt's a chance to show what you know\nand learn from the experience.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
