    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_101036.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it\u2019s a way to check something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:28.600\nThat's a test! In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:41.100\nBut tests aren't just for school. A doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy. Or, a company might test a new product to make sure it works properly before they sell it.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:51.900\nSo, tests can be anything from a simple toothpick in a cake to a big exam. They all have the same goal: to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:57.800\nThey help us learn, diagnose, and improve things. That's the basics of tests. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
