    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_101123.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:17.100\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is true, or working, or even just to see what you know!\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:23.700\nThink about it like this: You might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:34.600\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check if you're healthy. Even baking a cake is a kind of test - you're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:50.200\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and make sure things are working the way they should. They come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to complex scientific experiments.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:58.500\nBasically, a test is an experiment or procedure designed to provide information. We use them everywhere!\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
