    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.800\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate or measure a quality, ability, or knowledge.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:32.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health. Or, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:41.700\nTests can come in many forms. Multiple choice, true or false, even just answering questions aloud.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:51.400\nThe important thing is that they give us information. Maybe a test shows you need to study a topic more, or maybe it shows you're doing great!\n\n00:51.400 --> 01:05.000\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is just a tool to help us understand things better by evaluating them. Remember, tests are a part of learning, and they can help you grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
