    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out, or to see if something is working properly.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if your cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.000\nYou're testing to see if it comes out clean. Or, if your toy car isn\u2019t moving, you might check the batteries.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:37.300\nThat's a test too! You're testing the batteries to see if they have enough power.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:51.400\nTests can be big or small, simple or complicated, but they all help us understand something better.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking things and learning more.\n```"
