    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_101521.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are, and why we use them.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:17.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:31.000\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge! We use tests in all sorts of places, like in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:40.100\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see if you've learned how to spell new words.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:52.000\nOr, a math test checks if you understand addition and subtraction. Tests aren't just about getting a grade, though.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:59.800\nThey also help you see what you're good at and what you might need to practice more. So, a test is a tool to measure knowledge, give feedback, and help you learn. It's all about understanding where you are and where you want to go. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
