    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_102242.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:20.400\nIt's a method used to gather information.\nThink of it like this: you might test the water in a pool to see if it's safe to swim in.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:29.100\nOr, a doctor might run tests to understand what's making you feel unwell.\nTests come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:34.700\nA quiz in school is a test.\nSo is trying out a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:42.000\nThe key is that you're performing an action and observing the result.\nThat result gives you information.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:49.300\nSo, from checking the temperature to taking an exam, you're using a test to learn something new.\n\n00:49.300 --> 01:01.800\nIn short, a test is a process for gathering information.\nIt's a way to explore and understand the world around us.\n\n01:01.800 --> 01:02.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
