    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_102510.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.000\nWhat are they and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:25.700\nThink about tasting a new food. That's a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:31.300\nOr checking if a lightbulb works. You\u2019re testing to see if it will turn on.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:41.300\nIn school, tests help us see how much we've learned. If you get most of the answers right, it shows you understand the material.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:55.200\nTests can be simple, like a quick quiz, or more involved, like a big exam. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see where you stand.\n\n00:55.200 --> 01:01.200\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
