    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:10.900\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:23.300\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:32.800\nA taste test helps determine which flavor is the best. And a medical test can help doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:40.400\nTests can be written, spoken, or even hands-on. The key is that a test gives us information.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:51.800\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to gather information!\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:57.000\nThat's all for today! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
