    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.600\nIt's a process we use to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well something performs.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:32.300\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:45.800\nA mechanic might run a diagnostic test on your car to see if the engine is running smoothly.\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as expected.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:53.100\nThey\u2019re all about gathering information.\nTesting is a simple but powerful tool we use all the time.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
