    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_103015.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt helps us check our knowledge, skills, or even the quality of things.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nA taste test tells you which food you like better.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:39.800\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\nTests can be formal, like the exams you take in school, or informal, like asking a friend if they like your new haircut.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:46.400\nThe important thing is that a test gives you information.\nIt gives you results to learn from.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:58.700\nSo, a test is a method for gathering information, whether it's about your understanding of a subject, your personal preferences, or the condition of something.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:02.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
