    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:09.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:19.800\nThink of it like this: you're testing if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\nOr a baker tests if their cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:27.700\nIn school, tests help us see how well we understand a topic.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.900\nThey can be written, like filling in the blanks, or practical, like showing you know how to do something.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:44.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\nA science experiment tests a hypothesis.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:47.400\nEven playing a video game tests your skills!\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:54.500\nSo, a test is just a way to find out something, to see if something works, or to check your understanding.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:57.200\nIt's all about learning and improving!\n\n00:57.200 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
