    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:13.700\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like checking if you know your ABCs or seeing how fast you can run.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:31.900\nEssentially, a test gives us information. It helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:37.900\nFor example, a spelling test tells us how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:42.300\nOr, think about baking a cake. You might taste it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:46.700\nYou're testing to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:58.500\nAnother example? A doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. So, tests are all around us, helping us learn, improve, and understand the world better.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:05.000\nSo remember, a test is just a method to gather information.\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:11.700\nIt could be a quiz, a physical challenge, or even just tasting something. It all helps us find out something new.\n\n01:11.700 --> 01:16.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
