    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_103708.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.900\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.200\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\nThink of it this way: a spelling test in school checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:31.300\nOr, imagine a doctor giving you a checkup.\nThat's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:38.100\nThey might listen to your heart or check your reflexes.\nAnother example could be a taste test.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:45.900\nSomeone might give you two different kinds of cookies and ask you which one you like better.\nThat\u2019s a test of your preference!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:55.300\nSo, tests help us learn things, whether it's about our knowledge, our health, or even just our favorite cookie!\nThey give us information.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:03.100\nThat's the key thing to remember.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
