    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_103850.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What is a test?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:22.300\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:31.000\nFor example, a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:39.700\nA spelling test shows you know how to spell words.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:52.500\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what\u2019s happening inside your body. So, tests help us learn things, check our understanding, or diagnose problems.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.900\nThey give us information that we can use to make decisions or improve something.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.400\nThey can be simple, like asking a friend a question, or complex, like a scientific experiment. In short, a test is just a way of getting information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
