    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_104021.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's a structured process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a specific area.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: you're trying to solve a puzzle, and the test is the puzzle itself.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:39.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A math test checks your understanding of math concepts.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:49.800\nEven a taste test, like trying different flavors of ice cream, is a kind of test! It helps you decide which flavor you like best.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:56.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you and others understand what you know or can do. It gives you information and helps you learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
