    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_104103.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what kind of answer you get.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:32.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:46.800\nMaybe you're testing if the water is hot enough for a bath by sticking your toe in. Or testing if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:52.600\nIn school, a test helps your teacher see how well you understand a topic. It's just another way to learn!\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.100\nSo, whether it's a science experiment, a math quiz, or even just checking if your shoes fit, a test helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n```"
