    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_104210.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:08.000\nToday we're tackling something super important: tests.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:13.000\nThink of a test as just a way to see what you know, or what something can do.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:18.000\nIt's like checking if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:22.000\nThe main idea is simple: you present something, and then you observe the result.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:25.000\nDoes it work?\nDoes it pass?\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:28.000\nDid you learn something new?\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:37.000\nOr, a battery test checks if the battery still has enough power to work.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:41.000\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test!\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:43.000\nYou're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:51.000\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:53.000\nThey're everywhere!\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "65cc8703-08ce-4acf-9501-62edf7f12ca5": {
    "id": "65cc8703-08ce-4acf-9501-62edf7f12ca5",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T13:46:25.012464",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-02T10:43:12.803988",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_104312.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_104312.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a method we use to gather information or check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:23.800\nThink about it like this. If you want to know if your cookies are done baking, you might poke them with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:31.300\nOr, if you want to see if your new toy car works, you turn it on and watch it go. That's another test!\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:41.900\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like tasting soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:49.700\nThe important thing is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:57.500\nSo, a test is just a process of checking things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "12b3a8d1-a1a3-4432-91c2-faef10f0496b": {
