    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:24.600\nIt's how we check if something is working, if something is true, or if we understand something. Think about it like this: a recipe is a test for making a cake.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:39.200\nYou follow the steps, and if it tastes good, the recipe passed the test! Or, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how well you're understanding the words and grammar.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:51.600\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is a kind of test to see if you're healthy. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:59.000\nThey're a useful tool in all sorts of situations. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
