    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct. Think of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might poke it with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:32.500\nOr, if you want to know if your friend knows the answer to a question, you ask them. That's also a test!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:36.700\nTests aren't just in school.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:40.900\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and scientists use tests to learn about the world.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:55.300\nThey all follow a similar idea: ask a question, do something, and see what happens. So, remember, a test is just a way to find things out.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:00.200\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us better.\n\n01:00.200 --> 01:03.890\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
