    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_105201.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:17.600\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you understand something.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:29.100\nBasically, it's a way to get information. For example, when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:36.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:45.700\nOr, think about taking a quiz in school. That's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:56.900\nTests can be simple, like checking if a light bulb turns on, or more complex, like a medical test to check your health. The key is that they give us useful information.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.500\nSo, tests help us learn, fix problems, and make sure things are working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
