    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.600\nToday we're talking about something super important: tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:07.900\nNow, a test is basically just a way to find out what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:11.200\nThink of it like checking in on your learning progress.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:15.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:20.200\nYou might have multiple choice questions, true or false questions, or even be asked to write out your answers.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:25.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:30.800\nA math test checks if you understand how to solve problems.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:35.300\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you can bake a cake!\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:42.100\nSo, in short, a test is an assessment that helps measure knowledge or skills.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:44.700\nIt's a chance to show what you've learned!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
