    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_105337.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in this case, we're talking about tests that check if something works correctly.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:29.300\nBasically, a test is a way to find out if something does what it's supposed to do. Think of it like this: if you build a birdhouse, you might test it by putting it outside and seeing if birds actually use it.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:39.200\nOr, if you bake a cake, you test it by tasting it to see if it\u2019s good! Tests help us find problems early so we can fix them.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:50.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check if something is working the way it should. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
