    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:26.100\nIt's how we check if something is working, if something is true, or if we've learned something new. Think of it like this: if you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:37.800\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, the wobbly start is a test of your balance. Teachers give tests to see how well you understand what you\u2019ve learned in class.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:50.200\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all help us gather information and learn more. They help us understand what we know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:58.400\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools for learning. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
