    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_110137.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.300\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:7.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something,\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:8.000\nor\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:11.600\nhow well you can do something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:14.600\nIt's like a snapshot of your current skills or understanding.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:18.200\nThink of it like this: if you're learning to ride a bike,\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:22.300\na \"test\" might be seeing if you can ride around the block without falling.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:25.700\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, a test could be naming all the letters.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:30.500\nTests aren't always scary! They help you, and others, see what you've learned\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:33.100\nand what you might need to work on.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:37.600\nSo, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge or skill.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:39.600\nIt helps you learn and grow.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:49.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
