    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_110420.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:05.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.100\nIt\u2019s a process or procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, performance, or even just to see if something works.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:15.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:20.200\nOr, when a doctor orders a blood test, they\u2019re checking your health.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:21.700\nSee? It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:25.900\nFor example, if you bake a cake, you might taste it.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:27.000\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:28.900\nYou're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:35.100\nOr, if you try a new recipe, following the instructions is a test to see if you can make the dish successfully.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:40.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a method used to gather information and evaluate something.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:43.600\nIt helps us understand and learn.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:46.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
