    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:18.000\nToday, we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:24.900\nThink of a test as a way to check something, or to find out more about it.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.900\nIt could be a school exam, a medical checkup, or even testing a new recipe.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:44.700\nBasically, a test helps us gather information. In school, tests show what you've learned.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:57.900\nDoctors use tests to see how healthy you are. And when you\u2019re baking, you might test the cake with a toothpick to see if it's done. So, examples? A spelling test, a blood test, or even just testing if your umbrella is waterproof by pouring water on it.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.500\nAll different, but all ways to learn something new.\n\n01:01.500 --> 01:05.100\nIn short, tests are tools that give us information to make decisions, learn, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:05.100 --> 01:08.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
