    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:25.600\nIt's a process we use to check if something is working, true, or present.\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:33.000\nOr, if your car won't start, a mechanic might run tests to figure out what's wrong.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:43.100\nEven your doctor uses tests to check your health, like checking your temperature.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:54.700\nSo, tests help us understand things better.\nThey give us information to make decisions.\nWhether it\u2019s baking a cake, fixing a car, or staying healthy, tests are a really important tool.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
