    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:27.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct. Think of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:36.400\nOr, maybe you test the batteries in your flashlight to see if they still work. In both cases, you're performing a small action to get an answer.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:40.700\nAnother example: your teacher might give you a quiz. That's a test!\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:45.000\nIt helps them understand what you've learned.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:50.600\nOr, a doctor might run some tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:50.600 --> 01:05.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure used to determine the quality, performance, or reliability of something. It helps us understand and learn.\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:12.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
