    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:23.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something, or to check if something is working correctly. Think of it like this: you use a test to see if you know the answers to questions, or if a new toy actually does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:28.100\nThere are all kinds of tests! You might take a spelling test at school.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:37.400\nOr maybe you've seen a doctor use a test to check your health. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 are you following the recipe correctly?\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:46.800\nSo, basically, a test helps us understand something better by giving us information. It's like a little investigation!\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:55.400\nKnowing how to test things helps us learn and improve. Remember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
