    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:22.100\nIt's a process we use to gather information and learn more about a subject, a skill, or even ourselves.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You perform a test!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:32.900\nYou poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:39.900\nTests come in many forms. A school exam tests your knowledge. A blood test checks your health.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:50.100\nAnd even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it. So, in a nutshell, a test is just a way to check something, gather information, and see if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:53.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
