    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something specific. Think of it like an experiment, but often on a smaller scale.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:26.700\nWe use tests to check if something is working correctly, or to see how good something is. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:35.700\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Another example could be testing a new recipe.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:42.400\nYou try it out to see if it tastes good. If it does, that means the recipe passed the test!\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:53.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to learn something by checking or trying something out. It helps us understand if things are working as they should.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
