    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it as a question you ask to get an answer. The answer can tell you whether something is working correctly, how well you understand something, or even what someone's opinion is.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:35.000\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a mechanic might run a test on your car to see if the engine is working properly.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:46.600\nEven tasting food to see if it needs more salt is a kind of test! So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:50.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
