    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_112832.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain! The main idea behind a test is to give you questions or tasks related to a specific topic, and then see how well you can answer or complete them.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:34.500\nYour score on the test then shows how well you understand that topic.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:45.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words. Or, a math test sees how well you can solve math problems.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:58.800\nTests can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like a driving test. So, to recap, a test is a tool used to measure your knowledge or ability in a particular area.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:02.300\nIt helps you and others see what you already know and what you might need to learn more about. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
