    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:26.100\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like how well you understand a topic or how strong a material is.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:33.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:40.200\nOr, a taste test can tell you which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:46.800\nDoctors use tests to see if you\u2019re healthy, and scientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.000\nSo, a test isn't something to be afraid of. It's just a tool for learning and understanding. It helps us gather information and make better decisions. Remember, tests are everywhere, helping us learn and improve all the time. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
