    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you taste it to test if it's good. Or, you press a light switch to test if the light will turn on.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:36.100\nIn science and other fields, tests are more formal. We might run an experiment to test a new medicine and see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.100\nOr, we might test the strength of a bridge to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:53.000\nSo, remember, a test is all about checking something. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
