    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_113920.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:33.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test. Another example: A doctor uses tests to check your health.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:43.200\nA blood test can tell them if you're healthy or if something needs attention. So, tests help us understand things and make decisions.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:52.500\nIn short, a test is a way to find out information by checking something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
