    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_114015.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but it doesn't always have to be in a lab.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:30.700\nFor example, you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:47.000\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to see if you're healthy. Even baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe and your baking skills to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:53.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and see if something works, if something's true, or how well something is done. It's all about learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
