    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE duration:55.4\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:09.200\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:19.900\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer. For example, a taste test helps us figure out which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:27.000\nOr, a spelling test shows us how well we know our words.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:34.100\nDoctors use tests to see if we're healthy, and teachers use tests to see what we've learned in class.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:46.400\nSo, whether it's checking if your cake is baked by sticking a toothpick in it, or answering questions on a school quiz, a test helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:51.800\nBasically, it's a tool to measure or evaluate something. That's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
