    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:24.800\nIt's a process designed to gather information about a person, a product, or even an idea. Think about it like this: when you take a quiz in school, that's a test of your knowledge.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:36.800\nOr when a company tries out a new recipe for a snack, that's testing to see if people like it. Doctors use tests to check your health, like taking your temperature.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:48.600\nSo, tests help us learn and make decisions based on facts. They involve asking questions, trying things out, and then looking at the results.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:57.300\nIn short, a test helps us understand if something works, if it's good enough, or if we need to make some changes.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
