    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:17.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or working correctly.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:28.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:30.900\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:38.100\nThey help us understand things better. For example, in school, a test checks what you've learned.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:50.100\nAt home, you might test if a light bulb works by switching it on. So, remember, a test is just a method for collecting information and checking something.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:57.500\nIt helps us make informed decisions and understand the world around us. It's all about finding things out!\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
