    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea, or checking if something works the way it should.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.100\nTests can be used for lots of things. In school, you might take a test to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:30.500\nBut tests aren\u2019t just for school. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:44.900\nOr, before a new phone comes out, engineers run tests to make sure it works perfectly.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:52.500\nSo, a test is just a way to find out information or check if something is working correctly. It's all about learning and making sure things are right!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.200\nI hope that helps you understand the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
