    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we don't just mean exams at school. A test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out if something works as it should.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:26.400\nThink about it like this: You have a lightbulb. To test if it works, you screw it into a lamp and flip the switch. If it lights up, the test is successful!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:36.100\nAnother example: a chef tests the soup by tasting it to see if it needs more salt. So, a test is really just a way of checking something.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:49.900\nWhether it's a lightbulb, soup, or even a new app on your phone, testing helps us make sure things are working properly.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:56.200\nIn short, a test is a way to verify. And that's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
