    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:22.200\nIt's a structured way to gather information and see if something is true or accurate. Think about it like this: a recipe is a test for making a cake.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:33.000\nYou follow the steps, and if everything goes right, you get a delicious cake! Or, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:41.200\nThey check your temperature and maybe look at your throat. Tests can be big or small, simple or complicated.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:54.400\nThey're all about learning something new or confirming something we already suspect. So, in short, a test helps us learn, confirm, and understand things better.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
