    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:27.100\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific right or wrong answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:38.700\nFor example, when you bake a cake and taste it, you're testing to see if it's good. Or, when a doctor checks your temperature, they're testing to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:51.500\nIn school, tests help us see how much we've learned about a topic. They can be multiple choice, true or false, or even essays.\n\n00:51.500 --> 01:00.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to discover information or evaluate something. They help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
