    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:23.200\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or if you know the answer to a question. Think of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:30.800\nThey might check your temperature or your blood pressure. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:36.100\nThey help your teacher see if you understand the material.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:44.200\nAnother example? Before you buy a car, you might take it for a test drive. This helps you check if it runs well and if you like it.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:57.000\nSo, tests are all about checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or expectation. Basically, a test is a simple way to evaluate or assess something.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
