    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.220 --> 00:04.160\nOkay, so you're wondering what a test is, right?\n\n00:04.160 --> 00:07.850\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out how much you know about something,\n\n00:07.850 --> 00:11.180\nor how well you can do something.\n\n00:11.180 --> 00:17.430\nThink of it like checking if a cake is done. You poke it with a toothpick \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:17.430 --> 00:21.230\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:21.230 --> 00:25.250\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:25.250 --> 00:29.880\nIt could be a quiz with multiple choice questions, or maybe even a hands-on activity.\n\n00:29.880 --> 00:32.800\nEven a spelling test is a way to see if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.370\nAnother example is when you get your eyesight checked - that's a test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:37.370 --> 00:44.040\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for evaluating knowledge or skills.\n\n00:44.040 --> 00:49.460\nIt helps us measure and understand things better, whether it's baking a cake or learning in school.\n\n00:49.460 --> 00:52.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
