    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:22.500\nWe use tests all the time! If you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:31.100\nOr, if you're learning a new skill, like riding a bike, you're essentially testing your balance and coordination.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:43.600\nAnother example is a spelling test at school, where you're testing your knowledge of spelling words.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:55.100\nOr, a doctor might run tests to find out what's causing you to feel unwell. So, to recap, a test is a tool we use to gather information and learn something.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.700\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
