    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_120543.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.800\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out information about something.\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it this way: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:31.400\nOr, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:41.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe to see if it comes out delicious.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:50.000\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a medical checkup, or even trying a new recipe, a test helps us understand something better.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:52.500\nIt gives us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:54.800\nBasically, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:55.600\nThat\u2019s all there is to it!\n```"
