    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you get the right answer.\nTests help us figure out if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a topic.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:35.000\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:52.700\nAnother example?\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste a little bit of the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good before you bake the whole thing.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:58.700\nSo, remember, tests are just ways to check things.\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working like they should.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
