    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE duration:59.2\n1\n00:00.228 --> 00:04.228\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n2\n00:04.228 --> 00:7.878\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n3\n00:07.878 --> 00:16.458\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt could be about you, about a product, or even about an idea.\n\n4\n00:16.458 --> 00:21.818\nWe use tests all the time to see if something works, if it's safe, or if it's any good.\n\n5\n00:21.818 --> 00:26.738\nThink about a taste test!\nYou try a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it.\n\n6\n00:26.738 --> 00:28.458\nThat's a test!\n\n7\n00:28.458 --> 00:34.928\nOr, imagine a doctor giving you a checkup.\nThey're running tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n8\n00:34.928 --> 00:41.858\nAnother example?\nA company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n9\n00:41.858 --> 00:54.358\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information to help us make decisions.\nWe use them to learn, to improve, and to make sure things are working properly.\n\n10\n00:54.358 --> 00:59.108\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
