    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nThink of a test as a way to check something.\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or checking if you understand what you just learned.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:25.300\nBasically, a test helps us see if something is true or false, right or wrong, yes or no.\nIt gives us information.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:34.000\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:44.900\nAnd in school, you take tests to show what you\u2019ve learned about a subject.\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and figuring things out.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:52.200\nThey help us confirm something or learn something new.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
