    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. It helps us gather information and see how well something works, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. A taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:31.400\nAnd a stress test on a bridge checks how much weight it can hold.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:41.200\nSee? Different tests, different things we want to learn. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:48.900\nIt gives us a way to measure, observe, and understand something better. It's all about learning!\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:52.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "2b45313c-7899-4739-9680-cfbc359278a4": {
