    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:24.900\nIt helps us learn more about a person, object, or even an idea.\nThink about it like this: when you take a spelling test at school, it shows you how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:34.300\nOr, when a doctor gives you a medical test, they're checking on your health.\nTests can also be used to try out new things.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:42.600\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might test a small amount of the batter to see if it tastes good before baking the whole thing.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:54.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a method to gather information or try something out.\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
