    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:10.700\nWhat are they? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:18.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready. You do a simple test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:25.000\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Tests are used everywhere.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:31.200\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:38.600\nTeachers use tests to see how well you've learned something.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:45.500\nEven when you're buying a new phone, you might test out the camera or the screen to see if you like it.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:51.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.800\nWe use tests all the time to learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
