    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:22.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an investigation.\nWe ask a question, or set up a situation, and then observe what happens.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:33.100\nThis helps us understand more about the thing we're testing.\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:40.200\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:47.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:53.200\nSo, remember, a test is all about gathering information.\nWe use tests to learn, to improve things, and to make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
