    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the lesson. That's a test!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:28.900\nOr, maybe you take a driving test to show you know how to drive safely. That's a test too!\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:34.400\nTests can come in many forms. They can be written, like quizzes or exams.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:43.500\nThey can be practical, like a sports trial or a musical audition. The main idea is to check your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:54.200\nSo, to recap, a test is an evaluation to measure your understanding or ability. It helps you and others see how you're progressing.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
