    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:20.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:31.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:44.800\nIt can be something formal, like a quiz in school, or something informal, like trying a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:47.400\nThe main idea is that you're trying to gather information.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:58.600\nYou're observing something, measuring something, or asking questions to see what the outcome is.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:02.100\nSo, to recap, a test helps us learn about something by asking a question and observing the answer.\n```"
  },
