    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_123007.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nA test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:25.100\nIt helps us understand if something is working, if we've learned something, or if something is true. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.700\nYour teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Or, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:48.300\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and improve things. They come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic goal: to get information.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:58.200\nIn short, a test is a way to learn something by asking a question and getting an answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
