    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_123053.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like a detective looking for clues.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:32.400\nTests can be used for all sorts of things! Imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:39.200\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you're getting better at balancing.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:46.000\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. It\u2019s a way of checking your understanding.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.000\nSo, whether it's tasting batter, riding a bike, or taking a quiz, a test helps us understand something better.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.000\nIt's all about learning and improving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "fe3ff83a-2bb7-4e1f-b785-f3ea4a226c85": {
    "id": "fe3ff83a-2bb7-4e1f-b785-f3ea4a226c85",
