    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_123138.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:33.900\nFor example, if you want to know if the oven is hot enough to bake cookies, you might put your hand near it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:44.700\nOr, if you want to know if your friend knows the answer to a question, you ask them! That's another test!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:57.200\nA test can be simple, like checking if a light switch works by flipping it on and off. Or it can be more complex, like a spelling quiz at school.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:03.100\nThe important thing is that it helps you understand something better.\n```"
