    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_123231.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.500\nSimply put, a test is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you test if the water's hot before you jump in the shower, right?\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.900\nThat's a test! In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:31.400\nBut it's not just about grades. Tests can also check if a new medicine works, or if a bridge is strong enough to hold cars.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:40.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A taste test checks if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:52.600\nEven a simple \"knock-knock\" joke is a mini-test to see if someone knows the punchline! So, a test is really just a method for finding out information about something.\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:02.200\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
