    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_123316.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.800\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:02.800 --> 00:06.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:10.600\nIt helps show what you've learned and what you might need to practice more.\n\n00:10.600 --> 00:16.700\nThink of it like this: Imagine you\u2019re learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:21.400\nA test could be how well you can balance or how smoothly you can pedal.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:25.700\nOr, if you're learning the alphabet, a test could be identifying all the letters correctly.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:32.100\nTests aren't just about getting a grade. They help you, and your teachers, understand what you're doing well and where you can improve.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:39.100\nSo, a test is just a tool to measure your knowledge and help you learn better.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:47.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
