    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you understand something, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like checking to make sure everything is doing what it's supposed to.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:32.900\nSo, how does it work? Well, usually a test involves some kind of question or task.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:45.500\nYou try to answer the question, or complete the task, and then someone or something checks your answer.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:48.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:50.700\nOr, if you're building a bridge, you might test the materials to make sure they're strong enough.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:53.300\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:57.900\nBasically, a test helps us learn and improve by showing us what we know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:00.500\nThanks for watching! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
