    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how many words you know.\nOr, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it's safe and effective.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:32.500\nTests can be simple or complex.\nA simple test might be pressing a light switch to see if the light turns on.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:44.000\nA more complex test might involve lots of steps and measurements.\nFor example, a baker tests their cake recipe by baking it and seeing if it tastes good.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:54.400\nOr, a student tests their knowledge by answering questions on a quiz.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:03.000\nIt's all about gathering information and seeing if things are as they should be.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
