    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_124827.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:06.300\nToday we\u2019re going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:12.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like this: you're trying to figure out if a cake is done baking. The test?\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:21.800\nSticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:25.700\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test and is ready!\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:28.600\nAnother example: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy,\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:31.500\nlike checking your temperature.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.400\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:42.200\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and make a decision.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:44.900\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:50.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
