    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:28.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Whether it's a school test to see what you've learned, a taste test to decide which cookie is better, or even a medical test to check your health, they all help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:40.300\nFor example, a simple spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like most.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:42.900\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:52.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information. It helps us understand things better and make smart choices.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
