    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.100\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:20.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:31.800\nIt could be a written test in school, to see what you've learned.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:37.600\nOr it could be testing a new toy to make sure it works.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:40.600\nEven baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you taste it to see if it's good!\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:43.600\nFor example, your doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:46.600\nA chef might test a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:48.600\nSee? Tests are all around us.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:53.800\nThey help us understand things better and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:58.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:00.500\nIt can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just a taste.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:03.500\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n01:03.500 --> 01:04.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
