    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_125634.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:05.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:11.300\nIt's a process we use to gather information and measure something, whether it's your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:16.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:19.800\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:22.700\nSee? Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:26.200\nThey help us understand where we're at and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:32.600\nSo, in summary, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:38.300\nIt's a structured way to get information and evaluate something.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:41.200\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:51.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
