    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:23.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process that helps us gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:31.900\nThink about it like this: you want to know if your cake is done. You do a test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:40.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you the cake is ready.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.800\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. Each time you try, you're testing your balance and coordination. You might fall at first, but that's just the test giving you feedback!\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:58.700\nSo, tests are everywhere, helping us learn and understand the world around us. They\u2019re basically just ways to check things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
