    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:19.900\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests. Now, a test is basically just a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:31.000\nThat's a test! Or, imagine you're baking a cake. You might test the batter to see if it tastes good before you put it in the oven.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:40.800\nThat's another kind of test! Tests can be written, like quizzes, or practical, like trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:47.400\nThey help us learn and improve. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something, whether it's your knowledge or the quality of something else.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:53.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
