    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_131210.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.600\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:34.000\nTests come in many forms.\nYou've probably taken quizzes in school, those are tests!\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:40.700\nA taste test can help you decide which ice cream is your favorite.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:52.200\nEven checking if a light bulb works is a type of test.\nYou're testing if the bulb is functional.\n\n00:52.200 --> 01:02.900\nSo, whether it's a written exam, a physical challenge, or just a simple observation, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n01:02.900 --> 01:10.700\nThey help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n01:10.700 --> 01:18.500\nTo recap, a test is an evaluation that helps determine something.\nIt could be skills, knowledge, or even just a preference.\n\n01:18.500 --> 01:23.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
