    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.000\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:11.000\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt\u2019s a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:19.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:24.400\nSo, a test can be anything from a written exam to a simple observation.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:29.000\nFor example, baking a cake is a test!\nYou're testing if your recipe works.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:39.200\nOr trying a new restaurant?\nThat's a test too, to see if you like the food.\nBasically, a test helps us answer a question or solve a problem by giving us some data.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:47.100\nSo remember, a test is just a way of gathering information to learn something new.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:54.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
