    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_131940.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think of it like this: you might test if the stove is hot by carefully putting your hand near it.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:30.100\nOr, you might test if a cookie is ready by poking it with a fork. Those are simple tests!\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:41.700\nIn school, tests help us see how well we've learned something. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just a few questions at the end of a lesson.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:56.500\nThe goal is to check our understanding. So, tests are all about finding things out, whether it's how hot something is, how well-baked a cookie is, or how much we know about a subject.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
