    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:06.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly,\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:11.000\nor if you know something well. Think of it like this: you take a math test at school to see how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:12.500\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:15.500\nBut tests aren\u2019t just for school.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:18.500\nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:22.000\nYou might taste the batter before it goes in the oven \u2013 that\u2019s a test to make sure it tastes good!\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.000\nOr, a doctor might give you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to check your overall health.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:35.000\nSo, tests help us understand things better, from knowing your math facts to making sure your cake is delicious.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.000\nThey help us identify what we know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:44.000\nIn short, a test is a check!\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:47.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
