    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:08.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:16.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:16.800\nThink about it.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:25.100\nA spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite, even trying to turn on a light switch is a kind of test.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:29.600\nYou're testing if the light will turn on.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:34.800\nSo tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:39.000\nSome are serious like exams at school.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:43.100\nOthers are just for fun like trying new foods.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:47.500\nBut they all have the same goal to learn something new or confirm what we already know.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:54.200\nRemember, tests aren't always about right or wrong answers, they can also help us learn and improve.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:58.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
