    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_132420.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.800\nHey there, welcome!\n\n00:01.800 --> 00:05.500\nToday we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:10.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something.\n\n00:10.200 --> 00:13.400\nIt helps us understand how much of something there is, or how well something is working.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:18.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test measures how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:21.200\nOr, a temperature check is a test that measures how hot or cold something is.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:27.200\nLet's say you're baking a cake. You might test the batter by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:31.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you the cake is done!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:36.300\nTests are everywhere, helping us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:42.400\nSo, a test is just a tool to measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:45.100\nIt gives us information we can use.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:48.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
