    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it as asking a question and getting an answer. It helps us understand something better, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even how well a new medicine works.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:36.600\nFor example, a spelling test in school shows how well you know your words. A taste test helps determine which soda tastes the best.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:48.100\nAnd in science, a test might involve mixing chemicals to see what happens.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:56.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for getting information. It helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
