    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:13.100\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like a detective trying to solve a mystery. We use tests to measure things, to see if something is working correctly, or to understand something better.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:25.300\nImagine you're baking a cake. You taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.700\nOr when you go to the doctor, they might run some tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:43.600\nAnother example is when you\u2019re learning something new. A quiz or exam is a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:49.000\nSo, a test is simply a method to gather information and learn something important.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:51.700\nTo sum it up: tests help us measure, diagnose, and learn. They\u2019re everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
