    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_133648.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.300\nWhat are they and why do we need them?\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:18.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process of checking or examining something to see if it's working correctly, or to measure its quality or performance.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you take a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:37.800\nFor example, a car company might test a new car's brakes to make sure they stop safely.\nA baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:47.300\nEven playing a game is a type of test \u2013 you're testing your skills!\nSo, tests help us understand things better, improve products, and learn new skills.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:54.200\nThey\u2019re all around us, helping us every day.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
