    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_134104.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:10.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:22.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt could be figuring out if you know your multiplication tables, or seeing if a new medicine works.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.000\nThe main idea is to ask a question, or present a challenge, and then look at the result.\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you can spell words correctly.\nA taste test checks which flavor you like best.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:35.200\nThink of it like this: Your teacher gives you a quiz.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:40.400\nYou answer the questions, and your score shows how well you understood the lesson.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:49.400\nOr, you might try out different brands of cookies to see which one tastes the best.\nThat's also a test!\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:55.600\nIt helps us learn things and make decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
