    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_134227.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:10.800\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, maybe in school.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:21.200\nBut what is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:27.900\nIt helps us measure something, like how much you know about a subject, or even how well something works.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:34.600\nThink about it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:40.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready. Or, if you want to know if your phone is working, you might try making a call.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:45.700\nThat\u2019s testing too! So, tests are all about getting answers and understanding something better.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:49.400\nThey help us learn and improve things. That's a basic look at what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
