    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of asking a person, you're asking a specific process or system.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:31.800\nBasically, a test helps us understand if something works as expected, or how well it performs.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:44.700\nFor example, think about a simple spelling test at school. It checks if you know how to spell certain words correctly. Or, imagine testing a new recipe. You taste it to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:50.500\nSo, tests can be big or small, simple or complex, but they all have the same goal: to gather information and learn something new. In short, a test is how we check things! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
