    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_134840.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:14.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:25.900\nOr maybe a physical fitness test to see how strong you are.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:32.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes! For example, a teacher might give you a quiz in class.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:38.000\nThat's a test! Or, when you try out for a sports team, that's also kind of a test to see if you have the skills they're looking for.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:44.000\nThe results of a test can help you understand what you're good at and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:46.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure your knowledge or abilities.\n```"
  },
  "7cb4a26d-fb1f-4227-8b32-fe8b37b4b22b": {
    "id": "7cb4a26d-fb1f-4227-8b32-fe8b37b4b22b",
