    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_135414.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:11.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:21.800\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:31.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:39.500\nEven tasting a new food is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:51.700\nSo, tests help us learn and understand. They give us information that we can use to make decisions. They can be big, like a final exam, or small, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:59.100\nIn summary, a test is just a method for gathering information. It helps us answer questions and learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
