    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:06.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:09.200\nThink of it like asking a question.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:15.000\nBut instead of just asking, you're giving someone or something a task to see how they do.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:19.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:23.500\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:27.100\nAnd your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:32.300\nTests aren't just in school!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:37.900\nThey're everywhere, helping us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us better.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:44.800\nSo remember, a test is just a way of finding something out by giving someone or something a task.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:50.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
