    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.100\nEver wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:05.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:08.100\nThink of it like a detective collecting clues.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:10.900\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not!\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:14.900\nImagine baking a cake. You taste the batter before putting it in the oven \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:17.900\nYou're testing if it tastes good enough.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:22.500\nOr think about trying on a new pair of shoes. You walk around a bit \u2013 you're testing if they're comfortable.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:27.400\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They're like check-ins to see if the information is sticking.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:37.500\nUltimately, a test is just a tool to measure something, from the sweetness of batter to your understanding of a subject. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:41.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
