    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:25.000\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or even your opinion on a specific topic. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:34.400\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is your favorite. And a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:43.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big exams. The important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:56.600\nBy taking a test, you can see what you know, what you need to learn, and how you're improving. So, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and grow.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
