    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is ready.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:29.300\nYou can test it by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:37.900\nTests aren\u2019t just for baking, though.\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, like taking your temperature to check for a fever.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:46.500\nTeachers use tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:56.300\nEven scientists use tests to see if their experiments worked!\nSo, a test is really just a method or procedure for determining the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:04.600\nIt helps us make decisions and learn new things.\nIn short: tests help us learn about the world around us.\n\n01:04.600 --> 01:07.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
