    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.500\nHey there, welcome! Today we're diving into something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:20.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it as a question you're trying to answer, and the test helps you get the answer.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:27.500\nIt could be a test to see if a lightbulb works, you plug it in! If it lights up, it passes the test.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:33.500\nOr, maybe you want to know if you like a new flavor of ice cream. You taste it!\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:39.700\nYour taste is the test, and your reaction tells you the answer.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:50.900\nTests can be simple, like checking if a door is locked by trying the handle. Or more complex, like a doctor running blood tests to understand your health.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:59.900\nThe important thing is that a test helps you learn something. So, remember, a test is a way to find something out. It's a question with a method to get the answer.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:06.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
