    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:14.400\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works correctly, or to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:23.500\nBasically, it's like asking a question and getting an answer. If the answer is what you expect, then the test passes!\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:30.900\nFor example, if you're testing a lightbulb, you turn it on. If it lights up, the test passes.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:46.400\nOr, if you're taking a quiz and you get the answer right, that's also a test passing! Tests help us make sure things are working as they should, whether it's a simple lightbulb or a complicated computer program.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:55.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It asks a question and looks for the right answer. That's it!\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
