    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nOkay, so you're curious about tests!\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:19.400\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:29.500\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:43.000\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you take a quiz at school to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:50.500\nFor example, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, you could test a toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.000\nBasically, any time you're trying to figure something out or check on something, you're probably doing a kind of test.\n```"
