    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.700\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, whether it was in school or even online.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:28.300\nBut what is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:39.100\nIt's a process designed to see how well you know something, how well something works, or even what something is.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:49.900\nThink about a taste test \u2013 you're testing different flavors to see which one you like best.\n\n00:49.900 --> 01:00.500\nOr consider a light bulb test; you\u2019re checking if it lights up. In school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:09.000\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even essays. The goal is to show what you know.\n\n01:09.000 --> 01:14.900\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and understanding something better.\n\n01:14.900 --> 01:18.500\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n01:18.500 --> 01:24.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
