    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: A spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes the best!\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:45.100\nIn science, a test might be an experiment to see if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, finding your favorite flavor, or proving a scientific idea, a test helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:56.600\nThey give us information and help us make decisions.\nTests can seem a little scary sometimes, but remember, they're just tools to help us learn and grow.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
