    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_142704.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is good. You screw it in, and if it lights up, the test is passed!\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:30.600\nTests aren't just for school. A chef tastes their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:39.200\nA doctor runs bloodwork to test your health. Even your phone runs tests on itself to make sure all the apps are working correctly.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:48.800\nSo, tests help us understand things better, identify problems, and make sure everything is running smoothly.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:54.100\nThey're a crucial part of learning and improving! That's the basics of testing!\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
