    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question, but instead of just listening to the answer, you're observing or measuring something to get that answer.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:30.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know how to spell words.\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:39.100\nEven a simple yes or no question is a type of test!\nWe use tests all the time to learn more and make better decisions.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:49.200\nSo, tests help us learn, discover, and figure things out.\nThey're a fundamental tool in so many areas of life.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
