    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_142926.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:14.800\nYou've probably taken a lot of them, but what is a test, really?\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:28.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a method for gathering information.\nWe use tests to see what we know, how well something works, or even what someone's opinion is.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:34.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:40.800\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake and you taste it to see if it needs more sugar.\nThat's testing the flavor!\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:52.800\nWe also take tests in school to show what we've learned.\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.500\nBasically, a test is just a way to check something and get some information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
