    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:15.900\nThink of a test as a way to find out what you know or how good you are at something. It's like checking your understanding.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:21.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. A simple quiz in school is a test.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:32.600\nSo is a cooking competition where judges taste your food. Even when you try on different outfits to see which one looks best, you're kind of doing a test!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.200\nFor example, a math test checks your math skills. A spelling test checks your spelling.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:53.900\nAnd a taste test checks how delicious something is. So, remember, a test is just a way of measuring something, whether it's your knowledge, your ability, or even just your opinion.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:01.300\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we've learned. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
