    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_143201.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You're testing the lightbulb to see if it lights up!\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:34.000\nIn school, a test helps your teacher see how well you understand a topic. It could be multiple choice, filling in the blanks, or even drawing a picture!\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:39.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:45.100\nA math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations. See? Simple!\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:51.900\nSo, a test is just a tool to help us learn and understand more. It shows us what we already know, and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.400\nThat's all there is to it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
