    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:18.300\nIt's like a question you ask, or a challenge you give, to see what happens.\nThink about it.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:34.000\nWhen you bake a cake, you might taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough.\nOr, if your toy car isn't working, you might change the batteries \u2013 that's a test to see if the old batteries were the problem.\nTests aren't just for baking or toys, though.\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and teachers give tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:43.900\nSo, a test helps us understand something better by giving us information.\nIt\u2019s a way of exploring and checking things out!\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:52.900\nIn short, a test is a question or procedure designed to reveal information.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:55.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
