    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.400\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this:\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:31.600\na doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:34.200\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:34.900\nSee?\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:37.400\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:47.900\nA simple example is a multiple-choice quiz. You read a question, choose the best answer, and that shows how much you know about that topic.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:55.100\nAnother example could be a driving test, where you demonstrate your ability to safely operate a vehicle.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:57.300\nSo, in short, a test is a tool\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:02.200\nused to measure something.\n\n01:02.200 --> 01:05.700\nWhether it's your understanding of math, your physical fitness, or even the quality of a product,\n\n01:05.700 --> 01:08.900\ntests help us learn and improve.\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:11.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
