    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:12.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to check something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like a quick investigation. We want to see if something works, if it's true, or if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:31.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. A teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:48.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and your baking skills! So, tests help us understand things better, identify problems, and confirm that something is working as expected.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:57.200\nIn short, a test is just a way of checking to see if something is true. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
