    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:18.300\nWe use tests all the time. For example, a taste test!\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:22.800\nYou try a new food to see if you like it. That\u2019s a test.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:28.800\nOr, maybe you check the weather to see if it's going to rain. That's also a test!\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:35.000\nYou're testing your assumption about the weather. Another common example is a school test.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:39.800\nIt helps your teacher see what you've learned. They're testing your knowledge.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:49.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way of gathering information or checking something. It's a question and an answer. It's a way to learn!\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
