    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.240 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.800\nIt\u2019s how we check if something is working, or how well we understand something.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:32.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:39.400\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:47.500\nMaybe you're trying to fix a broken toy. You try different things, and each attempt is a test to see if it works.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:59.300\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do. They can be as simple as tasting a cake or as complex as a big exam.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:01.900\nThe main idea is that a test is a way to get information.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:07.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
