    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.700\nIt\u2019s a process of asking a question or performing an action to see what happens.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:34.600\nThe test? Screwing it into a lamp. If it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:41.000\nOr maybe you want to know if your cookies are done baking. You poke them with a toothpick.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:47.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a successful test! Tests help us understand things,\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:49.200\ncheck if things are working correctly,\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:51.500\nand make important decisions.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:59.800\nSo, a test is just a way to get information and confirm if something is how we expect it to be. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
