    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.300\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like asking a question, and the test gives you the answer.\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:30.800\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:37.300\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:49.700\nAnother example is when you bake a cake.\nYou might test it with a toothpick to see if it\u2019s done.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:54.800\nSo, remember, a test is a way of getting information.\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, or even just know when our cake is perfectly baked!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
