    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:23.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand more.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:28.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:34.500\nThink about baking a cake. You might taste the batter to see if it's sweet enough. That's a test!\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:40.100\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a light bulb works.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:45.700\nYou screw it in and flip the switch. If it lights up, the test passes.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:52.100\nTests help us make decisions and solve problems. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:54.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
