    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What is a test, exactly?\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use them every day, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:26.700\nThink about it: when you try a new food, you\u2019re testing to see if you like it! Or, when you press a button on a remote, you're testing to see if it works.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:36.600\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:47.600\nThe important thing is that they give us information. So, tests help us learn, help us fix things, and help us discover new things.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:54.500\nThey're a super useful tool for getting answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
