    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.000\nNow, a test is really just a way of checking if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:26.100\nThat tells you if the cake is done! Tests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:33.600\nA doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold. A scientist might run a test to see if a new medicine works.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:48.300\nAnd you might take a test at school to see how well you understand a subject. So, whether it\u2019s checking a cake, checking your health, or checking your knowledge, tests help us understand something better.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:56.700\nThey provide information and help us make decisions. In short, a test is simply a way to find something out!\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
