    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:15.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:27.100\nIt's a method we use to see if something is true, or to measure how well something works.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:37.700\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:48.800\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:53.800\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:56.500\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:56.500 --> 00:58.400\nThey're everywhere, from science experiments to everyday decisions.\n```"
