    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:23.800\nWe use tests to see if something is working correctly, or to check our understanding.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:28.000\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:32.200\nThat's a test! You're testing to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:40.900\nOr, imagine you're learning a new language. A quiz is a test to see how well you're understanding the words and grammar.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:51.900\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from little everyday checks to big important exams.\n\n00:51.900 --> 01:02.400\nThe main thing is that they help us learn and improve. They give us information about what we know and what we still need to work on.\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:06.400\nSo, tests aren't something to be afraid of, they're just a tool!\n\n01:06.400 --> 01:07.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
