    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_150132.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.700\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how much you know about something. It's like checking your understanding.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like this: you've been learning about animals, and a test might ask you to name different types of animals or describe what they eat.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:30.300\nOr maybe you've been practicing your math skills; a test could have you solve some simple addition problems.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:39.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from quizzes with just a few questions, to longer exams that cover a whole topic.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:46.300\nThey help you and your teachers see what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:56.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool to measure your knowledge. It uses questions or problems to see how well you understand a subject. It's all about learning!\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:02.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
