    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.300\nA test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, that help us learn more about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:31.900\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test can help you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:42.200\nDoctors use tests, too, like blood tests, to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:53.900\nSo, tests aren't just about getting a grade. They're tools we use to gather information and make decisions. They can be fun, like trying different snacks, or important, like checking your health.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:01.500\nTests help us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
