    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.500\nEver wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:7.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:12.200\nIt's like asking a question or giving a task to see what happens.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:17.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:22.000\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:25.000\nIn both cases, we're using the test to learn something.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:29.700\nFor example, if you take a math test, it shows how well you understand math concepts.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:35.300\nOr, if a doctor gives you a physical exam, that\u2019s a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:42.300\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information and understand something better.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:46.800\nIt helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
