    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to the answer, you're actively checking to see if the answer is correct.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:28.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:41.800\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor you like best.\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a kind of test - you're testing if the light bulb works!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:53.700\nSo, tests help us learn, make decisions, and figure things out.\nThey can be big and important, like a school exam, or small and simple, like checking the mail.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
