    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_150925.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.800\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\nIt could be checking if a cake is done by poking it with a fork, or seeing how well you understand a topic by answering questions.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:30.700\nTests help us learn and improve.\nThink of it like this: if you're baking and the cake comes out flat, that's a test showing you need more baking powder next time.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:45.700\nOr, if you take a quiz and get some answers wrong, that shows you what you need to study more.\nTests aren't about being right or wrong all the time, they're about understanding where you are and how to get better.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:57.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to learn and grow.\nIt helps us check things, identify problems, and improve our understanding.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
