    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:18.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:22.700\nIt's how we check if something is working, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:29.500\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:38.200\nOr, a doctor might test your eyesight to see how well you can see.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:43.700\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:47.500\nIt's like a little quiz to check your understanding.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:52.800\nMaybe it's a math test with addition problems, or a spelling test with a list of words.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.100\nSo, a test is just a method for checking something.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:01.700\nWhether it's checking your knowledge, checking a recipe, or checking your health, tests help us understand and improve things.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:05.100\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools!\n\n01:05.100 --> 01:07.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
