    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information or measure something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:32.900\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to measure things like your cholesterol.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:37.500\nTests come in many forms.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:42.400\nThere are quizzes, exams, experiments, surveys\u2026\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:45.200\neven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test!\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:49.500\nThe goal is always the same: to gather data and learn something new.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:57.600\nFor example, a baker might test different amounts of sugar in a cake recipe to see which one tastes best.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.900\nOr, a student might take a practice test to see what topics they need to study more.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:08.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n01:08.400 --> 01:13.100\nIt helps us understand things better, whether it's our knowledge, our health, or even the perfect cake recipe.\n\n01:13.100 --> 01:15.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
