    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_151434.mp4",
    "subtitles": "WebVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:13.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:25.100\nThink about it like this: a cookie recipe is a test. You follow the instructions, and the result, the cookie, tells you if the recipe works.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:33.700\nOr, imagine you\u2019re trying to find the right key for a lock. Each key you try is a test to see if it opens the lock.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:43.500\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. From figuring out if you like a new flavor of ice cream to checking if your car is running smoothly.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:54.400\nThey all involve trying something and observing the outcome. So, to recap, a test is a way of gathering information by trying something out.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:01.900\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI."
