    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:14.800\nThink of a test as a way to find out what you already know about something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:25.700\nIt's like a little check-up for your brain! They come in lots of forms, from multiple choice questions to writing essays, but they all have the same goal: to measure your understanding.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:33.400\nFor example, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of birds.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.500\nOr, if you're learning to play the piano, a test might involve playing a simple tune.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:49.700\nTests aren't meant to be scary! They're just a tool to help you and your teachers see what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:49.700 --> 01:00.600\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to measure your knowledge, helps you learn, and comes in many forms.\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:04.100\nRemember, it's just a tool! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
