    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.500\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you information.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:27.800\nIt could be a test to see how well you've learned something in school, like a spelling test.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:35.000\nOr it could be a test to see if something is working correctly, like a lightbulb. You turn it on, and if it lights up, the test is passed!\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:45.400\nAnother example is a taste test. You try a new food, and the test is whether or not you like it.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:51.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for getting information. It asks a question, and the result tells you something.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.100\nThat's the basic idea! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
