    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:23.500\nIt\u2019s a process to see if something is true, or to measure something. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:33.600\nOr a taste test tells you which food you like better. Even a simple click of a button on a website can be a test to see if the website is working.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:46.800\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, your preferences, or if something is working properly, a test is all about getting information and making sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.400\nTests help us learn and improve. To recap, a test is a procedure designed to gather information. It can be about anything!\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:60.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "91fe110b-7122-4044-b456-be0e99e5c29a": {
    "id": "91fe110b-7122-4044-b456-be0e99e5c29a",
