    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:27.500\nThink of it like this: a math test checks how well you understand numbers and equations. Or, a taste test tells you which cookie is the most delicious!\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:36.700\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if a lightbulb works by plugging it in.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:42.300\nAnother example is a spelling test. It checks if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:52.500\nOr a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see where you stand.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:58.700\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
