    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it this way: a test can be as simple as tasting a new food to see if you like it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:31.000\nOr, imagine a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\nThat\u2019s another kind of test.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:41.300\nTests help us learn and make decisions.\nFor example, you might take a practice quiz before a big exam to see what you need to study more.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:50.100\nThe quiz is a test that helps you prepare!\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:56.400\nIt helps us understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
