    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_152406.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like this: it\u2019s a tool to measure your understanding.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:25.300\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:29.700\nA spelling quiz in school? That's a test!\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:34.100\nTrying out a new recipe and seeing if it tastes good?\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:42.200\nThat's also a kind of test! You\u2019re testing the recipe!\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:56.700\nFor example, imagine you're learning about animals. A test might ask you to match the animal to its habitat. Or, if you're learning your ABCs, a test might ask you to write the next letter in the alphabet.\n\n00:56.700 --> 00:59.900\nSo, a test helps us figure out what we already know and what we might need to learn more about. It's a way to check our knowledge and see how far we've come. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
