    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:03.800\nToday, we're diving into something super important:\n\n00:03.800 --> 00:04.300\ntests.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:05.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:08.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:11.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:14.300\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:17.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:20.100\nOr a math test sees if you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:22.700\nTests aren't just about grades, though.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:27.400\nThey help you and your teacher understand what you know well, and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:30.000\nSo, tests are tools to help you learn.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:31.700\nThey check your understanding.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:32.900\nThat's the main idea!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:35.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
