    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.000\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see what happens. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:31.500\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:44.800\nAnother example: baking a cake! You follow a recipe, and the \"test\" is whether the cake comes out delicious and fluffy. Did you use the right ingredients and follow the instructions correctly?\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:55.800\nThe cake tells you! So, a test is really just a way of asking a question and getting an answer, whether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even how well you can bake.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.500\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:05.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
