    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.900\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe by tasting it to see if it's yummy.\nOr, you might test a lightbulb to make sure it lights up.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:34.100\nBasically, it's a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:44.500\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:54.900\nSo, to recap: a test is an action you take to evaluate something and find out if it works or meets a certain criteria.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:60.400\nPretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
