    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like a ruler for your knowledge, skills, or even physical abilities.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:35.600\nIt helps us understand how well someone knows something, how capable they are at a task, or even how strong they might be.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:44.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling rules. A driving test measures your ability to safely operate a car.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:55.000\nAnd a fitness test might measure how many push-ups you can do. So, to recap, a test is a tool for measurement.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.600\nIt helps us understand and evaluate different things, from academic subjects to practical skills. Hopefully, that clears things up! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
