    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: you're trying to figure out if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:30.400\nYou wouldn't just guess, right? You'd probably do a test, like sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a good test result! It tells you the cake is likely ready.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:45.300\nOr imagine you're getting your eyesight checked. The eye doctor uses different tests to see how well you can see.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:52.900\nTests can be used for all sorts of things, from baking to health to even checking if your toy car still works.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.800\nThey all have one thing in common: they help us get information.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new!\n```"
