    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nIt could be finding out if you understand a lesson, or if a machine is working properly.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more.\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:36.700\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a test to see how well you remember facts.\nOr, if you're baking a cake, tasting it is a test to see if you need more sugar.\nSee?\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:39.300\nSo, to recap:\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:50.800\nA test is a method for gathering information.\nIt helps us understand something better by providing answers to specific questions.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:57.800\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools for learning and improving.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
