    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something, like checking if something works or seeing how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to make sure all the buttons do what they're supposed to.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:30.800\nOr, your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:39.400\nAnother example is baking a cake. You might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:53.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! So, remember, a test is simply a process to evaluate something.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.600\nWhether it's a toy, a quiz, or even a cake, tests help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
