    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:26.700\nIt's a method used to determine the quality, performance, or reliability of something. Think about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:32.800\nThat's a test! Or, maybe you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:38.900\nAgain, that's a test. In school, tests help your teacher understand how well you've learned something.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:46.200\nIn science, tests can help prove or disprove a hypothesis.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:57.800\nBasically, tests are all around us, helping us learn and make decisions. So remember, a test is just a tool to get information.\n\n00:57.800 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
