    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:12.500\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\nIt could be a quiz at school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:28.800\nOr maybe you're testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you're healthy!\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:44.400\nSo, a test involves a procedure, some observations, and then a conclusion.\nFor example, if you bake a cake and it rises perfectly, that's a successful test of your baking skills.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:57.100\nIf it falls flat, well, you know you need to adjust something next time!\nEssentially, a test helps us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:02.800\nThat's testing in a nutshell!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
