    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about yourself or something else.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:25.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn. Think about it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:31.500\nOr, maybe you taste a new cookie to test if you like it. That's a test too!\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:39.000\nDoctors use tests to check if you're healthy, and even chefs test their food to make sure it tastes delicious.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:53.300\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the goal is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:05.700\nTo recap, a test is a method for gathering information or evaluating something. It can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just trying something new!\n\n01:05.700 --> 01:09.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
