    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.300\nToday we're talking about tests. Now, you might think of tests as something scary, like a pop quiz, but really, a test is just a way to check if something works like it's supposed to.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, right? You test it by sticking a toothpick in.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:27.400\nIf it comes out clean, the cake's done! That's a test.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:31.900\nOr, if you\u2019re building with blocks, you might gently push your tower to test its stability.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:41.000\nWill it stand or will it fall? That\u2019s a test too! Tests help us catch mistakes and make things better.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:46.400\nThey\u2019re important for everything from cooking to building bridges.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:54.900\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
