    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:28.100\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. Imagine you're baking a cake. You might test the batter to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:40.000\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Another example: a teacher gives a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:49.300\nThe results help them understand what you know, and what you might need more help with.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:54.900\nSo, a test is a process, a question, or an examination used to gather information and understand something better. It's all about finding out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
