    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:24.000\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or if you've learned something new.\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:31.600\nOr, a doctor might test your temperature to see if you have a fever.\nTests help us figure things out!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:44.700\nThey give us information.\nSo, whether it's a school test, a medical test, or even just checking if your phone is charged, tests are all about finding answers.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:53.400\nThey help us understand what's going on and make better decisions.\nIn short, a test is a check to gain information.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
