    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_155814.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like a simple experiment to see if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:25.800\nFor example, imagine you want to know if a light bulb works. You can test it by screwing it into a lamp and turning it on!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:31.300\nIf it lights up, the test passed. Another example is a taste test!\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:41.900\nYou try a new cookie to see if you like it. Your reaction, \"yum!\" or \"yuck!\", is the result of the test.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:52.500\nTests help us learn and understand things better. They can be as simple as checking if your shoes fit, or as complex as a medical exam.\n\n00:52.500 --> 01:00.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
