    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:18.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something. It's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.800\nThink about it. When you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:32.000\nOr when you get a new toy, you test it out to see if all the buttons work. These are all types of tests!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:43.800\nSo, a test helps us learn if something is true, correct, or working as it should. It's a simple way to get information and make sure things are in order.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:53.100\nIn short, a test is just a process to find out if something meets a certain standard or works the way we expect it to.\n\n00:53.100 --> 01:03.300\nAnd remember, tests are all around us, helping us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
