    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re diving into the basics of a test.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:29.200\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:36.300\nOr maybe you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is broken. You try switching it on; that's a test!\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:42.500\nIf it lights up, it\u2019s working. If not, well, it\u2019s time for a new bulb.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:55.500\nSo, whether it's a school exam, a science experiment, or just checking if your shoes fit, a test is a simple way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:04.500\nIn short, it's a method to gain insight or confirm an expectation. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
