    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.700\nThink of it like this: it's a chance to show what you've learned!\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:30.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might have a multiple-choice test where you pick the best answer from a list. Or maybe it's a fill-in-the-blank test where you complete a sentence.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:42.300\nSometimes, it's even a practical test, like showing you can ride a bike. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test shows if you understand numbers and equations.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:48.400\nAnd that bike test? Well, that shows you can balance and pedal!\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:58.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to see what you've learned and where you can improve. It's a chance to demonstrate your knowledge and skills.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:05.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
