    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey there, welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of testing.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something works like it's supposed to. Think of it like checking if a light bulb turns on after you screw it in.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:20.700\nThat's a test! We use tests all the time without even realizing it.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:24.900\nDid your recipe taste good? That was a taste test!\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:29.300\nDid your car start this morning? That's another kind of test.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:40.700\nIn more formal situations, like in science or engineering, tests help us prove that our ideas are correct and that our creations are safe and effective.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:58.400\nSo, tests are a fundamental way to learn, improve, and make sure things work as expected. Basically, testing is all about asking a question and then finding the answer through observation and experimentation.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
