    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_160825.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests to see how well we understand things, how strong something is, or even if something is working correctly.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:32.400\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:43.400\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like the taste! So, a test is just a method to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:50.500\nIt helps us understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
