    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:25.400\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:38.000\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:48.000\nTests can be used to measure all sorts of things!\nThey can tell us if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a concept.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:54.300\nFor example, a taste test can tell you which flavor of ice cream you like best.\nOr a strength test can show you how much weight you can lift.\nBasically, a test is a process with a goal: to learn something new.\nAnd that\u2019s the core idea of testing!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
