    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is really just a way to check your knowledge or skills on a particular topic.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like a snapshot of what you know right now.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:33.100\nIt helps you and others understand what you've learned and where you might need a little extra practice.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A math quiz tests your understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:52.700\nAnd even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you can follow the instructions and create something delicious! So, a test is simply a tool to help you learn and grow.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.300\nIt's not about being perfect, it's about understanding where you are on your learning journey. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
