    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like an experiment, but not always in a lab! For example, you might take a math test in school to see how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.500\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test showing the cake is done.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:42.100\nDoctors use tests all the time to check your health, like checking your temperature or blood pressure.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:52.900\nSo, tests help us learn, measure, and understand the world around us. They give us information we can use to make decisions.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:61.800\nIn short, a test is a way to gather data and see where things stand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
