    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nEver wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:28.400\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer.\nThe main idea is to gather information.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:37.100\nThis information can help us understand what someone knows, how well something works, or even what kind of person someone is.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:45.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\nA taste test helps you decide which food you like best.\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:54.300\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information about something.\nIt helps us learn and make decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
