    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_162209.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.800\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, like a quiz at school.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:30.400\nBut what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:39.900\nIt helps us learn and understand. Think of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:47.500\nThe toothpick tells you if the cake is ready! Another example is a doctor giving you a test to check your health.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:55.100\nOr even trying out a new recipe \u2013 that's a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:00.000\nBasically, a test is an action or series of actions done to find out if something is true or correct.\n```"
  },
