    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.200\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:28.300\nThat's a test! Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:37.600\nYour school quizzes are tests to see what you've learned. A doctor might run tests to check your health. And even baking a cake is a test to see if you followed the recipe correctly.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:44.100\nFor example, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. Falling down a few times is part of the test!\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:50.600\nYou're testing your balance and coordination. Or maybe you're trying a new video game.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:57.000\nPlaying the first level is a test to see if you understand the controls.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:08.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:08.800 --> 01:12.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
