    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.600\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly or if we understand something. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:31.600\nOr, when you're learning a new skill, like riding a bike, you're constantly testing yourself to see if you can balance.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:39.100\nTests can be written quizzes in school, or even just trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:48.400\nThey all help us get information. So, tests are all about gathering information and making sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:54.200\nThey're a vital part of learning and improving. That's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
