    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:29.700\nThe main goal of any test is to gather information. That information helps us understand something better.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:40.100\nFor example, a taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. A weather test helps scientists predict if it will rain.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:51.000\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a medical check-up, or even trying a new recipe, a test helps us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:57.900\nTests are all about checking and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
