    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:31.700\nTests can come in lots of different forms. You might take a written test with questions and answers, or a practical test where you have to show someone how to do something, like baking a cake or riding a bike.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:41.500\nEven a quiz in class is a type of test. For example, if you're learning your ABCs, a test might ask you to write them all down.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:51.300\nOr, if you're learning to play the piano, a test might ask you to play a simple song.\n\n00:51.300 --> 01:01.400\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check your understanding and see how far you've come.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:05.400\nIt helps you, and your teachers, know what you've mastered and what you still need to work on.\n\n01:05.400 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
