    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:12.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You're testing the lightbulb!\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:28.800\nEssentially, a test involves asking a question or setting up a situation and then observing the result.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:39.400\nThat result helps us understand something. For example, a doctor might test your reflexes with a little hammer. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:50.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe! So, a test is just a method to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.100\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
