    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.200\nIt could be about you, like a quiz to see how much you know, or about an object, like checking if a toy car still works.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:29.000\nThe main idea is to try something out and see what happens.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:36.800\nFor example, a taste test! You try a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:46.600\nOr, imagine you're building a tower of blocks. You're essentially testing to see if the tower is strong enough to stand tall.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:59.200\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things better. They can be fun, like trying new foods, or important, like making sure things are safe.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.900\nRemember, a test is just a way to learn by doing and observing. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
