    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_163120.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a check-up to test your health.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:37.600\nIn many areas, we use tests to make sure things meet certain standards. For example, before a new video game comes out, testers play it to find any bugs or glitches.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:50.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to test your understanding of a subject.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:58.200\nSo, tests help us find out information and make sure things are in good working order.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.700\nThey are often used to verify if an idea is correct. Basically, tests are all about checking things! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
