    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.500\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:21.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:33.600\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:39.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:45.400\nOr, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:51.300\nThe main idea is that we're trying to measure or understand something better.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:55.900\nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:01.200\nTasting it is a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n01:01.200 --> 01:07.100\nOr if you're planting a seed, checking to see if it sprouts is a test to see if it's growing.\n\n01:07.100 --> 01:10.400\nThese are all simple tests!\n\n01:10.400 --> 01:17.300\nSo, remember, a test is a way to ask a question and then find the answer, helping us learn and understand things better.\n\n01:17.300 --> 01:20.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
