    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nNow, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like an experiment. You're checking to see if something is true or how well something works.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:26.300\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:40.500\nThat's a test! You're testing if the cake is done. Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, each time you try, you're testing your balance.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:50.900\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly. They can be simple, like the toothpick test, or more complicated, but the idea is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:56.000\nThat\u2019s the basic idea of a test!\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
