    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.600\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if we know something. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:29.100\nOr, a taste test might check if you like a new flavor of ice cream. See?\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:34.600\nTests can be used for lots of different things.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:43.300\nAnother example: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, you might test a toy car to see how fast it goes.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:55.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and learn about something. It could be about your knowledge, your preferences, or even how well something works.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:00.100\nAnd remember, tests help us learn and improve!\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:03.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
