    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.800\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. For example, your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:30.000\nOr, when you're learning something new, a test can help you see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:34.400\nImagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:46.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test showing the cake is done. Or, if you're learning your ABCs, a quiz is a test to see if you know them.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:58.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to gather information and see where you stand. It helps us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:02.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
