    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_164343.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:22.500\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something.\nIt could be about you, like a personality test, or about a skill, like a math test.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:33.700\nThe main idea behind any test is to gather information.\nWe give you questions or tasks, and your answers help us understand something better.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:43.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:45.900\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if you like a food.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:48.500\nOr, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:50.400\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:56.000\nSo, remember, tests are tools for learning and understanding.\nThey help us discover things about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
