    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.200\nToday, we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:22.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something works correctly or meets certain standards.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb turns on after you screw it in.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:34.800\nThat's a simple test!\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.200\nIn everyday life, we see tests all the time.\nYour doctor gives you tests to check your health.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:48.200\nA chef tastes food to test the flavor.\nEven pressing the buttons on a remote control is a test to see if it will change the channel.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:55.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to confirm something is doing what it's supposed to do.\nIt helps us identify problems and make sure things are working as expected.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:59.300\nPretty simple, right?\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
