  "ba4256db-16fb-459a-8406-ddff7ae043c1": {
    "id": "ba4256db-16fb-459a-8406-ddff7ae043c1",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T13:50:03.223746",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-02T16:46:19.515873",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_164619.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_164619.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.300 --> 00:07.900\nEver wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it as a tool for measuring.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:25.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:31.500\nImagine baking a cake. You might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:41.100\nThat means it's cooked! Or, think about checking if a light bulb works.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:45.900\nYou screw it in and flip the switch. If the light turns on, that's the test!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:53.100\nThe bulb is good. If it doesn't light up, the bulb failed the test. So, a test is just a way to get information.\n \n00:53.100 --> 00:57.000\nIt's an action or procedure designed to reveal something about an object or situation. In short: tests help us learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
