    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:05.400\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:07.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:12.900\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:15.900\nIt could be anything from a quiz at school to checking if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:18.500\nThe main idea behind a test is to gather evidence.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:23.000\nYou're looking for information that will help you understand something better.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:25.700\nThis information is usually in the form of results or answers.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:30.500\nFor example, a taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:35.500\nOr, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:38.500\nSee, different tests, different questions, different answers.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:43.900\nSo, in short, a test is a method for getting information and answering a question.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:48.200\nIt helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:50.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
