    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_164952.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:23.100\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand a subject. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:29.500\nBut tests aren't just for school. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:38.500\nEngineers test bridges to make sure they're strong. So, whether it's a pop quiz, a blood test, or a strength test, the goal is always the same:\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:51.200\nto gather information and see how something performs. Tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:51.200 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
