    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a baker tastes the cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:32.100\nWe use tests all the time! Another example is when you\u2019re trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:39.300\nYou\u2019re testing to see if you like it! Or, when you try a new toy to see if it works as advertised.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:45.800\nThat's a test too! So, to recap: a test is a method for checking something.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:57.200\nWhether it's your health, a recipe, or a new toy, tests help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
