    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.500\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:31.700\nOr, you take tests in school to show what you've learned. It helps teachers know how well you understand the topic.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:40.700\nHere's another example: a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt. They're checking to see if it tastes just right!\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:48.500\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see where things stand. It helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
