    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough. Or, a doctor might test your eyesight to see how well you can see.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:38.800\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned. A math test checks if you understand numbers, and a spelling test checks if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:46.100\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and seeing if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:53.100\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
