    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or a taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes best.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:29.400\nSee? Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:40.200\nDoctors use tests to check your health, teachers use tests to see what you've learned in class, and even scientists use tests to prove their theories.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:52.700\nThe key is, a test gives us information that helps us understand something better. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn more.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
