    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.300\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you do a test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:34.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, if you want to know if you know your ABCs, someone might give you a test where you have to write them down.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:41.700\nThe more letters you get right, the better you did on the test. So, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:50.700\nWhether it's checking if a cake is baked, or checking what you've learned, tests help us understand where we're at.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
