    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific goal in mind. For example, a cooking test might involve tasting a new recipe to see if it\u2019s delicious.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:35.200\nOr, a science test could be dropping a ball to see how fast it falls.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:42.600\nEven something like checking if your shoes fit is a type of test!\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:49.900\nTests help us learn and improve. If the recipe isn\u2019t tasty enough, we can adjust the ingredients.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:54.800\nIf the ball falls faster than expected, we can investigate why.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:04.100\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand the world around us, one experiment at a time! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
