    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.500\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in this case, we're talking about testing something to see if it works like it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: You bake a cake, right? Before you serve it to your friends, you probably take a little bite to test if it tastes good. That's a test!\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:29.900\nOr maybe you're building a toy car.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:39.100\nYou'll test it by pushing it around to see if the wheels turn properly. Testing helps us find problems before they become big issues.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:47.100\nIt's like checking the batteries in your flashlight before you go camping. You want to make sure it will work when you need it!\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:57.100\nSo, testing is just a way to check something and make sure it\u2019s doing what it\u2019s meant to do. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
