    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.600\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is actually working before you install it. That's a test!\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:38.600\nWe run tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. If you try a new recipe and taste it to see if it's good, you're testing the recipe.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:46.100\nOr, if you press a button on your remote to see if it changes the channel, you\u2019re testing the remote.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:53.100\nSo, a test helps us understand something better, and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to. It\u2019s a fundamental part of learning and problem-solving.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.700\nRemember, testing helps us know for sure! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
