    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_170624.mp4",
    "subtitles": "WebVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like this: you have a new lightbulb, and you screw it into a lamp to see if it lights up. That's a test!\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:25.700\nWe use tests all the time, not just with lightbulbs.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:30.300\nImagine you bake a cake. You taste it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:34.900\nThat's testing the cake!\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:39.600\nOr maybe you build a tower out of blocks. You gently push it to see if it\u2019s stable.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:44.300\nThat's testing your tower.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:49.000\nSo, a test is just a way to make sure something is doing what you expect it to do.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:53.300\nIt helps us find problems and fix them.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.200\nTests are important!\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.000\nbecause they help us build better things and make sure everything works properly!\n\n00:59.000 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI."
