    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you poke them with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:22.700\nBasically, a test helps you figure out if something works the way it should.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.100\nIt can be anything from a school exam to checking if your car's headlights are working.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.700\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, before launching a new website, developers will test it to make sure all the buttons and links work correctly.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:44.300\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:57.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check if something is working or true.\nIt helps us make sure things are safe, reliable, and doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
