    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.800\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:27.200\nIt helps us figure out if something works correctly, or if someone understands a topic. Think of it like this: your mom might \"test\" the temperature of your bath water to make sure it's not too hot or too cold.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:39.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to \"test\" your knowledge of what you've learned in class.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:42.000\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to make sure it's safe to play with.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:52.300\nSee? Tests are all around us. They help us learn, improve things, and make sure things are safe.\n\n00:52.300 --> 01:03.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. Whether it's the water temperature, your knowledge, or a new toy, tests help us get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
