    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:17.800\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:26.000\nThink about it. A spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A taste test helps decide which cookie tastes better. Even a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:40.100\nSo, tests can be used for lots of different things, from checking your knowledge to figuring out what someone likes. They help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:47.300\nIn short, a test is a method to gather information. That\u2019s the basic idea of what a test is.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:53.000\nWe hope this helps you understand.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
