    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:20.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:29.200\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance in a specific area.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:38.200\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a blood test to check your health.\nOr a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more seasoning.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:50.800\nWe use tests every day, even if we don't realize it!\nMaybe you try a new route to work to test if it's faster.\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.300\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your coffee is hot enough.\nRemember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
