    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_172005.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It helps us see if things are working as they should or if we understand something correctly.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.200\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:41.600\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test! You're testing whether you like the taste.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:48.700\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn more. It can be a formal exam or just a simple experiment.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:52.200\nIt's all about finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
