    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:04.700\nToday, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:06.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:13.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your oven is hot enough to bake a cake, so you use a thermometer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:14.900\nThat thermometer is performing a test.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:20.200\nBasically, tests help us understand if something is working correctly, or meeting a certain standard.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:25.900\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:30.600\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:34.600\nEven tasting your food before adding more salt is a type of test!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:41.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn more about it.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:44.700\nIt helps us make informed decisions.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:47.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
