    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to see how much you know about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:16.600\nThink of it like checking if a plant is growing well.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:26.300\nYou wouldn't just guess, right? You'd measure it! Tests do the same thing for your knowledge.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:34.400\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just a few questions someone asks you.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:42.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A math quiz tests your understanding of numbers.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:51.200\nSo, a test helps you and your teachers see what you've learned and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.800\nIt's a snapshot of your knowledge at a particular moment. Remember, tests are just one way to learn, and they help you grow! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
