    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:06.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:10.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:12.500\nYou don't just guess, right? You test it!\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:16.500\nMaybe you poke it with a toothpick. The toothpick is the tool,\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:20.000\nand seeing if it comes out clean is the test.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:22.500\nIt tells you if the cake is ready.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:27.000\nTests aren't just for baking, though!\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.000\nYou can test your knowledge with a quiz, test if your car is working properly with a mechanic's checkup,\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:36.000\nor even test a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:44.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something to learn more about it.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:50.000\nIt helps us make better decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
