    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.500\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give us information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells us how well you know how to spell words. Or, a taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:36.700\nEven a simple experiment, like seeing if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade, is a type of test.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:50.300\nSo, tests help us learn, compare things, and make decisions based on evidence. They can be written, spoken, or even involve doing something practical. They're all about gathering information.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:56.400\nThat\u2019s the basic idea of what a test is.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
