    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:28.000\nSo, what kind of things do we test? Well, lots! We test if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:38.200\nWe test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:49.100\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on when you're not feeling well. They might test your temperature or your reflexes.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:59.900\nBasically, a test is a simple way to gather information and make sure everything is running smoothly. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:03.400\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding things out.\n\n01:03.400 --> 01:06.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
