    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_173710.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:07.000\nToday, we're tackling a fundamental concept: the test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like this: you're trying to figure out if something works, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.000\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:37.000\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.000\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:50.000\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to gather information.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:54.000\nThey're a valuable tool for understanding the world around us.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
