    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.800\nBasically, it's a way to find out something specific. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:33.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:40.000\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:46.200\nOr, if you're trying to figure out why your toy car isn't moving, you might test different batteries to see if that's the problem.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:52.500\nSo, a test helps us to confirm or deny something.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.400\nIs the cake delicious? Does the car work with this battery?\n\n00:56.400 --> 00:59.500\nThese are the kinds of things we can learn from a test.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:00.000\nIt's all about trying something out to get an answer.\n```"
