    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:17.400\nThink of it like asking a question. We're trying to get information.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:24.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Your doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.400\nA chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt. Or, you might take a quiz at school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:40.600\nSo, a blood test checks your health, tasting soup checks the flavor, and a quiz checks your knowledge.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:43.800\nSee? All ways to get information!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:50.900\nBasically, a test is just a method for gathering data. It helps us understand something better.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:54.400\nRemember that, and you've got the basics of what a test is all about.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
