    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_174453.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.500\nToday we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, like how well you know a topic, or how something works.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:16.500\nThink of it as a kind of investigation.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:21.000\nImagine you're trying to bake a cake. You test if the oven is hot enough before putting the batter in.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:26.000\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, you test your balance by trying to pedal.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:28.500\nTests help us learn and improve!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:34.000\nA test can be anything from a quiz at school to a scientist experimenting in a lab.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:38.500\nThe goal is always the same: to get information and understand something better.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:44.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and find things out.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:48.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
