    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.300\nThink of a test as a way to check something. It could be checking if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick, or it could be a more formal exam at school.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:28.600\nBasically, a test helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:33.900\nFor example, a doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:45.600\nOr, you might test a new recipe by making a small batch first. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:52.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a procedure to see if something meets a certain standard, or if it's working the way it should. It helps us make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
