    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:20.600\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:28.500\nWe use tests all the time.\nYour doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:36.400\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:45.800\nEven baking a cake is kind of like a test!\nYou follow the recipe, and then taste the cake to see if it turned out right.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:52.000\nIf it's delicious, the \"test\" passed!\nIf it's not so great, you know you need to adjust something next time.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:58.000\nSo, a test is just a process to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
