    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher gives you a test to see how much you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:36.200\nEven when you bake a cake, you're doing a test \u2013 tasting it to see if it's good!\nTests can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like trying a new recipe.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:47.100\nThey all have the same goal: to gather information and learn something.\nSo, a test is really just a tool we use to understand things better.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:50.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
