    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.300\nA test is simply a way to check if something works, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:21.100\nThink of it like a detective looking for clues.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:29.000\nInstead of clues, we're looking for information. There are all kinds of tests!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:42.800\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Your teacher gives you tests to see how well you understand the material. Even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test, to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:56.000\nFor example, if you're building a tower of blocks, you're testing its stability each time you add a block. Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you can balance.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:03.000\nSo, in short, a test is a way to gather information and learn something.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:06.100\nIt helps us understand things better and make improvements.\n\n01:06.100 --> 01:07.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
