    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_175447.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.200\nA test is really just a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a specific area.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:42.900\nTests can be written, like multiple-choice questions, or practical, like performing a task. The goal is to get a measurable result, a score or observation that tells us more about whatever we're testing.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:53.000\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a medical check-up, or even testing a new recipe, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
