    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_175552.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if it's true.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like this: your mom might test the temperature of your forehead to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:28.600\nThat's a test! Or, maybe you take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:33.400\nThat's another kind of test. Tests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:44.500\nA doctor might test your blood, or a scientist might test a new medicine. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the recipe works!\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:56.300\nSo, to recap, a test is just a way of finding out information about something. It's a check to see if something is working, true, or correct.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.800\nIt's all about learning and understanding.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
