    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.800\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like this: A doctor gives you a physical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:38.400\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Even checking if the light switch turns on the light is a kind of test!\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:51.000\nSo, a test helps us understand something, measure something, or check if something is working correctly. It gives us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:58.900\nIn summary, tests are everywhere, helping us learn, diagnose, and verify all sorts of things. They're a fundamental part of understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
