    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_180104.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:11.700\nToday, we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.500\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like this: you're testing the temperature of water to see if it's hot enough for tea.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:24.200\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:29.300\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking if your shoelaces are tied.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:33.500\nA doctor uses tests to check your health, and a baker tests the cake to see if it's done.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:46.000\nSo, whether it\u2019s a science experiment, an exam, or just poking a melon to see if it's ripe, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:48.800\nIt's all about finding things out!\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
