    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_180150.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You might use a toothpick \u2013 that's a test!\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:27.600\nTests aren't just for baking, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature or listening to your heart.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:34.500\nTeachers give tests to see what you've learned in class. Even computer programs use tests to make sure everything is working correctly.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:43.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to evaluate or check something. It helps us understand if something is working, healthy, or correct.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "c39f0ac6-3233-41a2-b9e8-1fbc3d9c8ef3": {
    "id": "c39f0ac6-3233-41a2-b9e8-1fbc3d9c8ef3",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T13:50:49.682914",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-02T18:02:45.012571",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_180244.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_180244.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:18.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:28.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words. A taste test helps you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:45.000\nAnd a medical test can help your doctor understand how your body is doing. So, whether it's a school quiz, a survey about your preferences, or even checking if a lightbulb works, it's all a test in some form.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:53.200\nTests help us gather information and make decisions. They give us a clear picture of something we want to understand.\n\n00:53.200 --> 01:03.700\nIn summary, tests are tools for gathering specific information. They help us learn, decide, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:07.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
