    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's how we gather information.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.100\nWe use tests all the time! For example, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:42.200\nThat's a test! Or, if your phone isn't working, you might try restarting it to see if that fixes the problem.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:49.300\nThat's testing too! Another example is when a doctor checks your temperature.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:53.400\nThey're running a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:59.000\nTests help us understand things better and make decisions based on what we find out. So, a test is really just a way to ask a question and get an answer. It helps us learn and solve problems. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
