    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:07.100\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to see what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:12.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You turn it on \u2013 that's the test \u2013 and seeing if it lights up tells you if it's good or not.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:18.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes! You might take a quiz in school to see what you learned in a lesson.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:25.000\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:32.700\nSo, tests are all about gathering information. They help us understand things better, whether it's your knowledge, your health, or even just if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:37.800\nRemember, tests are tools for learning and improvement.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:41.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
