    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You flip the switch \u2013 that's the test!\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:32.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. It could be a quiz in school, a driving exam, or even trying a new recipe to see if it tastes good. The goal is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:41.600\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words. A taste test tells you if you like the flavor.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:52.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see how something performs. It helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
