    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_180945.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:25.100\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:36.500\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:47.500\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Scientists use tests to see if their ideas about the world are accurate.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.700\nThey might design an experiment and see if the results match what they expected. So, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand the world better! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
