    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:16.500\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:22.600\nThink about it. When you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:32.400\nThat's a test to see if it's done! Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test of your balance.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:38.200\nYou're testing yourself to see if you can stay upright.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:44.000\nTests aren't always about pass or fail. They help us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:52.300\nMaybe you take a practice quiz before a big exam. That's a test to see what you already know and what you need to study more.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:56.400\nThey're a valuable tool for understanding.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n```"
