    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about something called a test.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.500\nNow, a test is just a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb turns on. That's a simple test!\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:34.800\nThe main idea behind any test is to get some information. We want to find out if our answer is correct, or if the light bulb is working properly.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:45.300\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words. Or, a taste test tells you which cookie you like best.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:55.600\nEven checking the temperature outside is a kind of test to see how hot or cold it is. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.300\nIt helps us understand things better and see if we're on the right track. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
