    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_181307.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:16.100\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. Think of it as a process of asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:25.400\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:36.100\nA teacher gives you a quiz to check your understanding of a subject.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:53.900\nOr even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 will it rise properly and taste good? So, a test isn't just about grades or being right or wrong. It's about gathering information and using that information to learn, improve, or make a decision.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:59.700\nWhether it's checking your spelling or figuring out if your car needs an oil change, tests are all around us, helping us understand the world better.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:03.300\nIn short, a test is a method of evaluation.\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:05.000\nPretty simple, right?\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:06.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
