    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.300\nToday we're going to talk about tests. A test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like asking a question, but the answer is usually a score or a result.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:30.600\nSo, what are we testing? Well, it could be anything! A test could check your knowledge on a subject, like a quiz in school.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:38.500\nOr, it could measure something physical, like how fast you can run. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:45.400\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:52.300\nOr, a company might test a new product to make sure it works properly. These are all tests!\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.000\nBasically, a test is a process designed to find out something specific.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.600\nIt helps us learn more and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
