    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_182245.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or ability in a specific area.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:28.200\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher might give you a test in math to see how well you understand fractions.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:33.400\nSo, examples?\nA spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.800\nA driving test checks your ability to drive safely.\nAnd even taste-testing a new cookie recipe is a type of test!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:49.000\nYou're testing how good it tastes.\nBasically, a test is a tool used to evaluate something.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:54.600\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
