    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:07.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:13.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:18.000\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:21.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test showing the cake is done.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:25.000\nOr, if you try to open a door and it's locked, that's a test telling you you need a key.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:31.000\nTests help us make decisions, understand things better, and make sure everything is working correctly.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:39.000\nFrom simple everyday actions to big scientific experiments, tests are essential for learning and problem-solving.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:43.000\nSo next time you try something out, remember you're doing a test!\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:46.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
