    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.300\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out information about something. \n\n00:14.300 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests help us understand if something works, or how well it works.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.400\nThey can be anything from a simple quiz in school to checking if a light bulb turns on.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:45.300\nFor example, a taste test tells you which juice tastes better. A spelling test shows you how well you know your words. And a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening in your body.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:54.200\nSo, remember, tests are all about gathering information to learn more. They help us check, measure, and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
