    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.800\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even your understanding of a particular topic.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:31.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, if you're learning to bake, you might taste your cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:42.000\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned in class. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects!\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:51.200\nSo, tests are just tools. They help us learn and grow by showing us what we already know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:57.100\nThey're a valuable part of learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
