    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about yourself, or about something else.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:30.100\nIt's a way to gather information by asking questions or performing actions. Think about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:38.700\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it before it's done \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:48.700\nTests can be written, like quizzes, or hands-on, like trying to fit a puzzle piece. They help us learn and improve.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:55.700\nSo, a test is just a method for learning or confirming something. Pretty useful, right?\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
