    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.100\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:24.300\nIt's a process to see if something works, is true, or meets a certain standard. Think about it like this: a chef tastes the soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:34.900\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even when you click on a link to make sure it goes to the right webpage, you're running a test!\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:49.300\nSo, tests help us confirm things. They give us information to make decisions, whether it's adding salt to soup, understanding your health, or making sure a website works properly.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:59.800\nTesting is all about finding out if something meets our expectations. To recap, tests are processes for checking something against a standard.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:06.600\nThey help us make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
