    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:24.300\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\nThink about it: when you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:36.500\nWhen a doctor checks your temperature, they're testing to see if you have a fever.\nOr, when you try to open a door and it's locked, you're testing if you have the right key.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:45.800\nTests can be formal, like school exams, or informal, like figuring out which route to take to avoid traffic.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:53.500\nThe important thing is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspected.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:02.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
