    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:19.900\nWhat is a test, anyway? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:28.000\nIt could be about yourself, like a personality test, or about something else entirely, like testing if a cake is baked.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:38.000\nThe main idea is to perform an action, observe the result, and then use that result to learn something.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:50.700\nThink about checking the temperature outside. You look at a thermometer, that's your test, and the number tells you how hot or cold it is.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:57.000\nOr imagine you're trying a new recipe.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:03.300\nYou follow the instructions, taste the food, and based on how it tastes, you know if you need to add more salt or pepper next time.\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:09.600\nThat's a test, too! So, a test is just a structured way to learn and improve.\n\n01:09.600 --> 01:17.300\nRemember, it's all about observing, learning, and making better decisions.\n\n01:17.300 --> 01:19.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
