    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:34.900\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, if we\u2019ve learned something new, or even just to see what something is like.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:40.500\nFor example, your doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:46.100\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you\u2019ve learned in class.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:54.800\nLet's say you bake a cake. Tasting it is a test to see if it\u2019s delicious! You are testing your recipe!\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:00.300\nSo, remember, a test is simply a procedure designed to evaluate something. It can be a quiz, a physical exam, or even just trying something out to see what happens. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
