    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_184102.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:20.100\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but instead of mixing chemicals, you're trying to measure knowledge, skills, or even abilities.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:31.100\nThe main idea behind a test is to see how well someone understands a topic or can perform a task. It gives us a snapshot of what they know at that moment.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:40.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your words. A driving test shows if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:52.900\nEven a taste test tells you which flavor you prefer! So, a test is simply a tool for evaluation, helping us understand where we stand and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
