    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_184147.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.900\nWhat is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like this: you learn about, say, the alphabet, and then a test checks if you remember your A-B-Cs.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:42.400\nIt could be a multiple choice quiz, where you pick the right answer from a few options. Or maybe you have to fill in the blanks. It's all about showing what you've learned.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:50.100\nFor example, your teacher might give you a test after studying dinosaurs to see if you can name different types, like a T-Rex or a Triceratops.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:56.200\nSo, a test helps you and your teachers see what you understand and what you might need to learn more about. It's just a tool to help you grow! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
