    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or works correctly.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:36.500\nThink of it like this: you might test a recipe by trying it out to see if it tastes good.\nOr, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:48.600\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the material.\nSo, whether it's testing a new toy to see if it's durable, or testing a hypothesis in a science experiment, tests help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:57.900\nRemember, a test is just a way to check something out and get more information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
