    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in a broader sense, a test is really just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:24.000\nIt's a process to gather information.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this:\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:33.300\nYou want to know if a cake is done baking. What do you do? You test it!\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:39.700\nYou might poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:46.100\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is working. You screw it in.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:52.300\nIf the light turns on, the bulb passes the test. If not, well, it failed!\n\n00:52.300 --> 01:02.300\nSo, a test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works, if it\u2019s true, or if it meets certain requirements.\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:09.500\nIt helps us make decisions and learn new things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
