    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:35.300\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good. Or, if you push a door to see if it's locked, that's a test too!\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:51.000\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, fill-in-the-blank, or even just a conversation.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:57.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to learn something, to see if something works, or to check understanding. It's all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
