    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.500\nIt helps us understand how well something works, or if it meets certain standards. Think of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:39.600\nOr, a teacher might give you a test in school to see how well you understand a subject. The test provides information, like whether the recipe needs more salt, or if you need to study a topic a little more.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:48.900\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids. The results of the test help us make informed decisions.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:57.100\nSo, a test is a way to gather information and measure something. It's all about finding out what's what!\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
