    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_185300.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered exactly what it means? Well, you're in the right place!\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:12.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.900\nIt's a process we use to check if something is true, or to see how well something works.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:31.200\nThink about it like this: a teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned in class. That's one kind of test!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:40.300\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check if you're healthy. That's another kind!\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.200\nTests aren't always about right or wrong answers, sometimes they just help us gather information. So, whether it's checking your spelling, seeing if your cookies are baked enough, or even trying out a new recipe, you're performing a test!\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:58.100\nA test is just a way of learning something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
