    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:29.900\nBasically, you perform an action or ask a question, and then you look at the result.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:36.400\nThat result tells you something about the thing you're testing.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:42.900\nFor example, a taste test! You try a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:56.200\nThe test is your reaction: Do you like it? Another example: a spelling test. You write down words, and the test tells you how well you know those spellings.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:01.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to discover information by observing the outcome of something.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:07.800\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
