    "subtitles": "WebVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand better.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:20.800\nTests are used all the time!\nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:30.800\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\nOr, when you go to the doctor, they might check your temperature.\nThat's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:37.100\nAnother example is when you're learning something new.\nA quiz in school is a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:47.400\nSo, a test can be anything from a simple taste to a complex exam.\nIt\u2019s all about gaining information.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:59.600\nBasically, a test is a process designed to give you information about a specific quality or characteristic of something.\nIt gives us data we can use.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:05.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI."
