    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.800\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:25.700\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:30.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:35.400\nYou're testing it!\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:40.100\nBasically, a test involves a specific action or question,\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:44.800\nand then observing or measuring the result.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:49.800\nDid the lightbulb light up? Great, it passed the test!\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.000\nAnother example: a taste test.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:57.500\nYou try a new flavor of ice cream. The question is, \"Do I like this?\"\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:02.600\nYour reaction, whether you smile or frown, is the result of the test.\n\n01:02.600 --> 01:15.700\nTests help us make decisions, learn new things, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:15.700 --> 01:22.000\nSo, a test is an action, a question, and a result.\n\n01:22.000 --> 01:27.800\nKeep it simple, and you'll ace it!\n\n01:27.800 --> 01:33.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
