    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. It could be about you, or an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. Even a scientist runs tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:31.600\nSo, examples? A spelling test checks your spelling skills. A battery test checks how much power is left. And a taste test checks how something tastes!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:38.000\nBasically, a test is just a way of gathering information and making a decision based on that information.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:48.700\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
