    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:15.500\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we're talking about a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like this: a test is an experiment or a question designed to give us information.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:37.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:48.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing a recipe! So, in short, a test helps us learn something or confirm something.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:55.300\nIt gives us evidence to support an idea or diagnose a problem. We use tests every day without even realizing it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
