    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see if you know your spelling words. Or, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:33.500\nTests can come in all sorts of forms. It could be a written exam, a practical demonstration, or even just answering questions.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:45.400\nFor example, a chef might test a new recipe by having people taste it and give feedback. A software developer tests their code to make sure it doesn't have any bugs.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:56.500\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method of evaluating knowledge, ability, or performance. They help us learn and improve.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
