    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with questions or tasks.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:27.300\nThe main idea is to see what you know, what you can do, or even how something works.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:39.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you can spell words.\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:50.000\nSo, a spelling test measures your knowledge of spelling, and a taste test measures your preference.\nSee how that works?\n\n00:50.000 --> 01:00.000\nTests can be big or small, simple or complex, but they all have the same goal: to find out information.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:03.600\nIn short, a test is a tool we use to learn about something, whether it's your knowledge, your preferences, or anything else!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
