    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.500\nNow, a test, simply put, is a way to find out something. Think of it like a question you're asking, and the answer helps you understand something better.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:22.100\nWe use tests all the time. Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:30.300\nYou might test if it's done by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:38.600\nOr, think about a doctor testing your eyesight. They ask you to read letters on a chart to see how well you can see.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:48.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a process to gather information. It helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:53.000\nIt's a question and an answer. That's all there is to it!\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
