    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_190603.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:34.700\nOr even, you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's just right. So, a test can be anything from a multiple-choice quiz to a science experiment.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:42.900\nThe key is that it helps us gather information and make decisions. It gives us a result that we can then understand.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:50.500\nIn short, a test is a tool for learning and discovery! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
