    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works. Think of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:20.700\nThat's a test! We use tests all the time.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:28.700\nYour teacher gives you a quiz to test your knowledge of a subject. A baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:38.000\nOr, a doctor might check your temperature to test if you have a fever. So, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:45.800\nThey let us know what we've learned, if something is working correctly, or if we need to make some adjustments.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:51.700\nThey're like little checks along the way to make sure we're on the right track. In short, a test is a way to evaluate something.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:58.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
