    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_190739.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:26.400\nIt could be checking if you understand a topic, like in a school test. Or it could be checking if something works, like testing a new toy to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:35.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might test your temperature to see if you have a fever. Or a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:50.100\nTesting helps us learn and make sure things are working correctly. So, whether it's a quiz at school, checking your batteries are working, or even trying a new recipe, remember that a test is just a way to find out more information and make sure everything is A-Okay.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:53.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
