    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\nThink of it like an experiment, but often much simpler.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:24.100\nWe use tests all the time!\nFor example, a baking test \u2013 you taste a cake to see if it\u2019s sweet enough.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:31.800\nOr a spelling test \u2013 you write words to see how well you know them.\nAnother example is a medical test.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:43.800\nDoctors use tests to see if you are healthy.\nThese tests can be simple, like checking your temperature, or more complex, like analyzing a blood sample.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:55.600\nSo, tests are all about gathering information.\nThey help us understand things better, whether it's about baking, spelling, or your health.\n\n00:55.600 --> 01:03.300\nThey provide evidence and help us make informed decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
