    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_191427.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:17.500\nThink of it like an investigation.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:22.300\nWe use tests all the time! Your doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:30.200\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. Even tasting a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:38.800\nSo, a test helps us gather information. It could be to measure something, understand something, or even just to see if something works.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:49.800\nRemember, it's all about finding out more. Tests are everywhere and help us learn and improve all sorts of things.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
