    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.600\nIt's like an experiment or a question you ask to see what the answer is. Think about it like this: a food test could be trying a new snack to see if you like it.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:35.200\nOr, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Even a medical test, like checking your temperature, tells you something about your health.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:48.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and learning something new. It can be as simple as trying a new food or as complicated as a scientific experiment.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:55.200\nThe key is that it helps us understand something better. That's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
