    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_191601.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to measure or evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, a doctor might run blood tests to check your overall health.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:40.300\nTests aren't just in school or at the doctor's office, though.\nYou might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or a company might test a new product before they sell it.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:42.900\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:51.100\nBasically, a test gives us information.\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:59.200\nSo, remember, a test is a way to find something out about something.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
