    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:27.600\nThis information can be about anything! It could be a quiz in school to see what you've learned, a medical test to check your health, or even tasting a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:34.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A blood test checks your health.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:43.400\nEven trying a new pizza flavor is a test to see if you enjoy it! So, a test is just a tool for finding out something.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:53.100\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, and make decisions. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
