    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.400\nIt\u2019s a method for gathering information about a person, a thing, or a situation. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:36.700\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough! Even a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on in your body.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:44.400\nSo, tests can be written, like exams. They can be physical, like running a race to test your speed.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:56.700\nOr they can even be observations, like watching how a plant grows to test the effect of sunlight. Basically, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:02.300\nThey give us data and feedback. That's the core idea behind what a test is.\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:05.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
