    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:35.400\nOr maybe you test a new toy to see if it works properly. In both cases, you're trying to learn something.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:45.900\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:55.000\nThe key is that they all involve some kind of activity or observation to gather data. This data helps us make decisions or understand things better. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed choices. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
