    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_192854.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:25.400\nIt's how we check if something is true, or accurate, or working properly.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:33.500\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a physical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:41.600\nOr a teacher might give you a quiz to see if you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:55.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe and your baking skills to see if you get a delicious result. Tests can be short or long, easy or hard, but they all have the same goal: to gather information.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:05.300\nSo remember, a test is just a way of checking things and learning something new.\n\n01:05.300 --> 01:07.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
