    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.600\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like a little investigation. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:35.000\nFor example, a taste test tells you if you like the flavor of something. Or, if your doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you might have a fever.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:47.200\nTests can be simple, like checking if a light bulb works by turning it on. Or they can be more complicated, like a school exam that checks your understanding of a subject.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:55.200\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and make decisions. Tests are important tools to understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
