    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:20.800\nTests are used all the time. For example, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:31.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you the cake is done! Or, when you go to the doctor, they might take your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:38.000\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. It helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:51.500\nSo, whether it's checking a cake, your temperature, or your spelling, a test helps us understand something better. Basically, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
