    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super fundamental: a test!\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:19.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something, like checking if something works, or understanding how much of something you have.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:29.600\nThink of it like this: If you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake's done! That's a test!\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:34.500\nOr, imagine you're learning your ABCs. Your teacher might give you a quiz to test how well you know them.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:43.300\nTests can be big or small, formal or informal. But the main idea is always the same: to get some information or check something out.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:56.300\nSo, a test is a method for gaining information or verifying functionality. Pretty useful, right?\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
