    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_194019.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand things better.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:33.700\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:39.100\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:44.500\nBoth of these are tests! They help us learn where we're doing great, and where we might need to focus a little more.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:50.800\nTests aren't scary, they're just tools. They give us information. They help us improve, and they help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:53.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
