    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_194103.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:27.500\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a particular area.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:37.100\nThink of it like this: imagine you want to know if a cake is ready.\nYou use a toothpick \u2013 that's your test!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:48.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\nSimilarly, a math test checks your understanding of math concepts.\nA spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:54.500\nAnd even trying a new recipe is kind of a test to see if you can follow instructions and create something delicious.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:00.000\nSo, tests help us measure and understand things.\nThey give us information!\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:02.200\nRemember, a test is just a tool for learning and measuring.\n\n01:02.200 --> 01:04.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
