    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.600\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:22.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:31.400\nThink of it like a quick check-up.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:39.900\nThe main idea behind a test is to give you some questions or tasks, and then see how you do.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:51.300\nThis helps you, and whoever gave you the test, understand what you already know and what you might need to learn more about.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:53.900\nFor example, a doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.500\nOr, your teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:56.500 --> 00:57.300\nSee?\n\n00:57.300 --> 00:57.900\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:00.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to check understanding or functionality.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:03.500\nIt helps identify strengths and areas for improvement.\n\n01:03.500 --> 01:04.600\nPretty simple, right?\n\n01:04.600 --> 01:06.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
