    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_194328.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:19.400\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:29.800\nWe use them all the time to measure, check, or evaluate things.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:42.200\nThink about it: When you step on a scale, that\u2019s a test to see your weight. Or when you bake a cake, you test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:50.600\nIn school, tests help us see how well you understand a subject. They can be multiple choice, true or false, or even essays.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.100\nThe results help you and your teacher know what you're doing well and where you might need a little more help.\n```"
  },
  "e5522ae0-2daf-43bb-a3ab-59afb642fea1": {
    "id": "e5522ae0-2daf-43bb-a3ab-59afb642fea1",
