    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_194456.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:19.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process or procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:29.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a chef might taste a soup to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:41.600\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned in class. They come in all shapes and sizes, from multiple-choice questions to writing essays.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:51.400\nSo, remember, a test isn't just something scary in a classroom. It's a method for gathering information and making decisions.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:59.900\nIt helps us understand ourselves and the world around us a little better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
