    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:20.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a method we use to gather information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of bath water to see if it's too hot or just right.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:36.600\nOr, a baker tests a cake by poking it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:43.700\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned. Different tests measure different things.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:53.600\nThe bath water test measures temperature. The cake test measures doneness. And a school test, well, that measures your understanding! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something or learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
