    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_195332.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something. Think of it like checking your understanding.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.100\nBasically, a test presents you with questions or tasks, and your answers show what you've learned. It's not about being perfect, it's about seeing where you're at.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:35.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test sees if you understand how to solve equations.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:48.800\nEven tasting food to see if it needs more salt is a kind of test! So, tests help you, and your teachers, understand what you know and what you might need to work on a little more.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:55.200\nThey\u2019re just a tool to help you learn better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
