    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_195426.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE duration:60.0\nNOTE average_segment:6.7\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information and see what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:21.100\nThink of it like this: your eyes are testing the light to help you see, or a doctor might run tests to understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:28.900\nIn school, a test might be a quiz on math problems, or a spelling test to see how well you remember words.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:35.400\nOutside of school, a chef might taste their sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:41.100\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:50.300\nThey help us learn, understand, and improve.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:56.400\nSo, a test is just a way to check understanding or ability. In short, tests are information-gathering tools.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nThey can be formal or informal, big or small. They help us learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
