    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:36.000\nOr a chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the recipe works!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:44.600\nSo, tests help us learn, check, and understand things better.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:52.000\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying a new route home to see if it's faster.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.700\nBasically, a test is just a process of gathering information to make a decision or learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
