    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_200522.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:28.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. The main idea behind a test is to see if something is true or false, good or bad, or even just to measure how much of something there is.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:38.100\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Your teacher gives you tests to see how well you understand the subject.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:48.100\nEven baking a cake is a test, you're testing if the recipe works!\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:59.100\nSo, a test is just a method for finding something out. It helps us understand the world around us and make better decisions.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:02.600\nRemember, tests are a tool, and understanding how they work is really helpful. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
