    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.100\nToday we're talking about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:22.600\nIt\u2019s how we find out if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it's too hot or just right.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:33.100\nThat\u2019s a test! Or, you might test a cookie to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:38.100\nAnother test! In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:48.900\nThey help teachers see if you understand the material. So, a test is just a way to check something, from bath water to cookies to schoolwork. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:49.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
