    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_200723.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:23.700\nIt's like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, we're looking for proof. Think about it like this: a chef tastes their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.900\nOr a doctor checks your temperature to test if you have a fever. They're performing tests!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:37.400\nAnother example is when you take a quiz at school. That's a test to see how well you understand the subject.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:44.900\nOr maybe you test out a new toy to see if it works the way it should.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:56.800\nSo, a test is just a process for gathering information and seeing if something is true or correct. It's a simple way to learn and understand the world around us! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
