    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:32.900\nWe use tests all the time! For example, your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:38.800\nTests help us measure things, check for problems, or just learn more.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:43.600\nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:48.400\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:59.600\nThat's a test too! It helps you make sure the cake will taste good. So, remember, a test is a way to gather information.\nIt can be a simple question, a complex experiment, or anything in between.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:01.700\nIt's all about finding out something new!\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:06.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
