    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_201343.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:06.800\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:13.600\nWhat is a test, exactly? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:22.000\nIt's a process we use to see if something is true, or to measure something, or even to check if something works correctly.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:34.700\nThink about it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might poke it with a toothpick. That's a test! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is probably ready.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:47.400\nOr, if you\u2019re learning your ABCs, your teacher might give you a little quiz to see if you remember them. That's another kind of test.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.300\nTests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:01.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for figuring something out. It's a way to check, measure, or confirm.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:04.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
