    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a physical test to see how healthy you are. Or, maybe you take a quiz in class to see how much you learned from a lesson.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:34.700\nTests can come in many forms. There are written tests with multiple choice questions, or tests where you have to solve problems.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:42.700\nSome tests might even involve showing someone how to do something, like baking a cake or playing an instrument.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.500\nSo, tests help us measure knowledge or skills. They're a tool to help us understand where we are and what we might need to learn next.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
