    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_201845.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests! In simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.800\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.200\nThink about it like this: if you want to know if your cake is done, you do a test! You stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:35.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you the cake is ready. Or, if you're wondering if your toy car needs new batteries, you turn it on.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:51.200\nIf it doesn't move very fast, that's a test showing you need fresh batteries. Tests can be simple like that, or more complicated, but the idea is always the same: to get information and learn something.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:57.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
