    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it as a question or a challenge designed to give you information. It could be a test at school to see what you've learned, or even a doctor's test to check on your health.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:34.900\nTests help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:40.300\nFor example, a taste test can tell you which cookie is the most delicious.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.100\nOr, a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice. See? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:58.700\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information, understand something better, and learn. They come in many forms and help us in all sorts of ways. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
