    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:21.400\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer. Think about it: when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:29.300\nThat's a test to see if it's cooked through! Or, when you go to the doctor, they might check your temperature.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:41.300\nThat's a test to see if you have a fever. Tests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like tasting your food to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:51.100\nThe main idea is that a test helps us gather information and make decisions. So, a test is just a method to learn something new.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
