    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.400\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:20.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:32.000\nIt could be checking if you know something, like in a school exam. Or it could be checking if something works, like a new toy.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:40.300\nThe main idea is to see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:48.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A taste test checks if you like the flavor of a new food.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:55.800\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They show us what we're good at and what we might need to work on. They also help us make sure things are working the way they should. Basically, a test is a way of finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
