    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_202331.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nWe use them all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:23.400\nIt\u2019s a process where we ask a question, do something, and then see what happens to get an answer.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.200\nThink about it like this: you\u2019re baking a cake.\nThe recipe is like a test!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:42.100\nYou follow the steps, and the result \u2013 the cake \u2013 tells you if you followed the recipe correctly.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:54.200\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works, you screw it in and flip the switch.\nThe light turning on? That's the test result!\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:01.500\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information, whether it's about your baking skills, a lightbulb, or anything else.\nIt\u2019s all about asking a question and finding the answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
