    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be to see how well you've learned something, like a quiz in school.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:34.200\nOr it could be to check if something is working properly, like a doctor testing your eyesight.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:44.600\nTests usually involve answering questions or performing tasks. For example, a spelling test asks you to spell words correctly.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:54.000\nA taste test might ask you to choose which food you prefer. The results of a test can help us understand more about ourselves or the things around us.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and checking.\n```"
