    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.799\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.799 --> 00:10.400\nWhat are they?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like a question, or a series of questions, designed to see what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:28.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you can spell words correctly.\nA taste test tells you which flavor you like best.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:39.800\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what\u2019s happening inside your body.\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:51.800\nThey're a way of gathering information.\nTests can be big or small, long or short, but their main purpose is always the same: to learn something new.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:57.700\nThat's the basics of testing!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
