    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test is basically a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works \u2013 you turn it on, and that's the test!\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:37.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. There are quizzes in school, which check your knowledge of a subject. There are also tests you take when learning to drive, to make sure you know the rules of the road.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:46.100\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test, to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:52.600\nSo, tests help us understand what we've learned and identify areas where we might need a little more practice. They're a way to measure progress and improve our skills.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:58.300\nRemember, tests aren't scary! They're just tools for learning. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
