    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nThink of a test as simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:21.400\nIt's like a little experiment.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:30.900\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through. That's a test!\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:37.500\nOr, if you\u2019re building a Lego tower, you might gently push it to see if it's strong enough to stand on its own.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:44.100\nThat's another test! Tests are super important because they help us learn and improve things.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:49.100\nThey help us figure out what's right and what's wrong.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:50.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to check something.\n```"
