    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:28.300\nIt could be a quiz in school, a medical check-up, or even just trying a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:39.600\nThe main idea is that you're doing something to get information.\nThink about it like this: you give something an input, and you get an output.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:48.800\nThe output is the result of the test!\nFor example, if you're taking a spelling test, the words are the input, and your answers are the output.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:57.800\nOr, if you're testing a cake recipe, the ingredients and baking process are the input, and the taste of the cake is the output.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:02.300\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information by trying something out and seeing what happens.\nYou're learning something new!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
