    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:19.800\nIt's a process where we ask a question or perform a task to see what the answer is or how well something works.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:30.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or a taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:43.500\nWe can even test a toy to see if it's safe for kids to play with. So, tests help us learn new things, make decisions, and ensure things are working correctly.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.200\nThey're used everywhere! To recap, a test is a way to gather information by asking a question or doing something to get an answer.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:59.200\nAnd that's the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
