    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.100\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:37.200\nThink about it like this: you get a blood test at the doctor to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:44.600\nA test can be a set of questions, a physical challenge, or even just observing something carefully.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:54.800\nFor example, a baker might test their cake by poking it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked through. Or a scientist might run an experiment to test their hypothesis.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:01.100\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and making an assessment. They help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
