    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_205239.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re diving into the world of tests!\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:13.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:20.600\nIt could be about anything! Think of it like this: Your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:31.300\nOr, you might take a test at school to see how much you've learned. Even baking a cake is a little bit of a test \u2013 are you following the recipe correctly?\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:41.600\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things better. They give us answers, or at least clues, about what's going on.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:52.900\nWhether it's checking your spelling, measuring the temperature, or figuring out your favorite flavor of ice cream, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:57.800\nThat\u2019s the basics of tests! They\u2019re all about finding things out.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:01.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
