    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_205510.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check to see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:26.500\nThink about it like this: You take a taste of a new food to test if you like it. Or, a doctor might run some tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:39.500\nEven your teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned in class! Tests can be big or small, easy or hard, but they all have the same goal: to get information.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:52.700\nSo, a test is just a method or procedure for determining something. In summary, tests help us learn, diagnose, and evaluate all sorts of things.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
