    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHello, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:18.900\nNow, you might think of school, but a test is really just a way to find out something.\nIt\u2019s a process to check if something is working correctly, or to see what the result is when we try something.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a lightbulb works, you test it by screwing it in and flipping the switch.\nThe light turning on is the result of the test!\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:37.000\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:47.900\nSo, a test is simply a way of getting information and confirming something.\nIt helps us understand how things work and whether they're doing what we expect.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
