    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_210502.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.300\nA test is simply a way to see what you know or what you can do.\nThink of it like a tool to measure something, in this case, your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:22.900\nThere are lots of different kinds of tests.\nYou might take a written test with questions and answers.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:34.700\nOr maybe a practical test where you show someone how to do something.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:49.500\nA simple example is a spelling test in school, where you write down words to show you know how to spell them.\nAnother example is a driving test, where you show you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:57.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to measure your knowledge or abilities, and they come in many different forms.\nIt helps you and others understand what you've learned and where you can improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
