    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_210545.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:10.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:17.000\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:29.100\nThink about it. You want to know if the water's hot enough for a bath? You stick your toe in \u2013 that\u2019s a test! Tests help us see if something is working, if something is true, or if something is safe.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:36.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you\u2019re healthy. Or a chef might taste the soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:43.600\nEven playing a video game is a kind of test. Can you beat the level?\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:49.100\nSo, a test is just a way to check something out and get some information.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:52.000\nIt\u2019s a simple tool we use to learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
