    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:30.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\nA taste test tells you how something tastes.\nA medical test can tell you if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:42.000\nTests aren't always about right or wrong answers.\nSometimes they just help us learn something new, or give us important information.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:45.500\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn more.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
