    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_210752.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process designed to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like this: a baking test. You try a small piece of the cake batter to see if it tastes good before baking the whole thing. That's a test!\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:31.600\nOr, when you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you can balance.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:40.700\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas about the world are correct. Doctors use tests to figure out what's making you sick.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:52.100\nSo, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect. It helps us make better decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
