    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_210837.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.800\nAlright, let's talk about tests! Think of a test like a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you've learned something new.\n\n00:09.800 --> 00:17.400\nIt's just a process to see if things are as they should be.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:29.700\nFor example, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:35.900\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, a test might be seeing if you can ride across the driveway without falling.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.500\nAnother example? A doctor might give you a physical exam to test your overall health. They check your heartbeat, reflexes, and things like that.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:53.100\nSo, a test is simply a way to evaluate something. It helps us understand if things are working, if we're learning, or if something needs attention.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
