    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nDon\u2019t worry, it\u2019s not as scary as it sounds! A test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:26.000\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.600\nThink about it like this: a baker might test a cake by poking it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.500\nOr, a doctor might test your reflexes to see if your nerves are working properly. See? Simple!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:46.400\nAnother example: You might test a new toy by playing with it to see if you like it.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:55.100\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:00.100\nSo, in short, a test is just a way of gathering information and confirming something.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:03.600\nHopefully, now you understand the basics of what a test is.\n\n01:03.600 --> 01:06.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
