    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:21.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a method or procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, a product's performance, or even just checking if a light bulb works.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:26.200\nThink about it. A quiz in school is a test of what you've learned.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:35.500\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you sick. And when you bake a cake, you're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:51.600\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the core idea is always the same: to learn something by putting something to the\u2026 well, test!\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:59.600\nIn short, a test is a way of checking or evaluating something. It helps us understand more about the world around us.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:05.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
