    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_211209.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:34.100\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They might ask you questions on paper, or even ask you to show them how to do something.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:43.500\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve a problem like two plus two. Or a science test might ask you to name the planets.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:54.000\nSo, tests are just tools to help us learn and check our understanding. They're not something to be afraid of, but a chance to show what you know.\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:01.800\nIn short, a test helps to measure your knowledge or ability. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
