    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_211258.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.300\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:9.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:14.600\nThink of it like asking a question to see what the answer is.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:15.100\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:19.400\nA doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:23.100\nA chef might taste their food to test the seasoning.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:27.800\nEven your teacher gives you tests to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:34.600\nFor example, if you want to know if a toy car works, you test it by turning it on and seeing if it moves.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:39.600\nOr, if you want to know if an apple is sweet, you test it by taking a bite.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:46.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:52.200\nIt\u2019s a simple but powerful tool we use in everyday life.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
