    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand a topic or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.500\nThe main idea behind a test is to gather information and see if a certain requirement is met.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:35.100\nIt can be anything! For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:42.400\nEven pressing a button to see if a light turns on is a type of test! You're checking if the button works.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:53.200\nSo, remember, a test is all about checking something to see if it passes or fails. It's a way to learn and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
