    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nA test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like a check-up. The main idea behind a test is to get information. You can test yourself to see how much you\u2019ve learned after studying, or a doctor might test your blood to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:33.600\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school. That shows your teacher how well you know your spelling words. Or, a software company might test a new app to make sure it doesn't crash.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:46.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information about knowledge or performance. It helps us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
