    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it like this: you try a new recipe.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:24.900\nYou're testing to see if you like it.\nOr maybe you push a door to see if it opens.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:29.500\nThat's also a test!\nYou're testing if the door is unlocked.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:35.900\nTests aren't always about pass or fail.\nSometimes they just give us information.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.400\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\nOr a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:55.700\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information, whether it's about a recipe, a door, your health, or your knowledge.\nIt\u2019s a way of finding something out!\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
