    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_212114.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.500\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information and see if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, imagine you bake a cake and taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:38.400\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned. Let\u2019s say you want to know if a toy car needs new batteries.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:43.100\nYou put new batteries in and see if it runs. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:55.500\nOr, if you plant a seed, you\u2019re testing to see if it will grow. So, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and find something out.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:02.500\nIt helps us understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "c96ec8db-7b71-4b74-8c68-ad00c1a07c8d": {
    "id": "c96ec8db-7b71-4b74-8c68-ad00c1a07c8d",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T13:52:55.736005",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-02T21:22:03.356532",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_212203.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_212203.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.400\nA test, in simple terms, is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:20.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:28.900\nThink about baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:32.200\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is broken.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:35.500\nYou try turning it on. That's a test!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:42.700\nIf it lights up, it's working. If it doesn't, well, the test showed you it's probably broken.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:46.000\nTests aren't always about finding problems.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.400\nThey can also show you how well something works. For example, a spelling test shows you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:04.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand if things are working as expected, or if we need to make some changes.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:08.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "5ad5c7eb-054a-4fcd-9ce1-89dbc14f1b0f": {
    "id": "5ad5c7eb-054a-4fcd-9ce1-89dbc14f1b0f",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T13:52:56.281296",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-02T21:23:22.408126",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260102_212322.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_212322.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:27.200\nIt's a process designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a specific area. Think of it like this: your doctor might give you a physical exam - that's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:35.500\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to make sure it's sweet enough - that's a test of your baking skills!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:42.600\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned and where you might need some extra help.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:49.700\nSo, tests come in many forms, from quizzes and exams to experiments and observations.\n\n00:49.700 --> 01:06.200\nThey all share the same goal: to gather information and learn something new. Remember, tests aren't something to be afraid of, they're just tools for learning!\n\n01:06.200 --> 01:07.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
