    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.900\nThe main idea behind a test is to see if something works, if it's good, or if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:41.500\nIt's a way to check things out! For example, when you bake a cake, you might taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:52.500\nOr, if you're buying a toy, you might try pressing all the buttons to make sure they all work \u2013 that's another test. Even your doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:59.600\nSo, in short, a test is a simple way to check something and get some information about it. It helps us make sure things are working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
