    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just asking, you're creating a situation to get an answer.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:37.200\nFor example, a math test helps us understand how well you know addition.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:51.000\nA taste test helps us figure out which cookie is the most delicious! Even a simple experiment, like seeing if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade, is a kind of test.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:58.400\nSo, tests are a way to gather information and learn more. Whether it's in school, at work, or even in your own kitchen, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:01.000\nIn short, a test is a method of assessment to determine a quality, ability or knowledge.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
