    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome!\nEver wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:29.000\nEven baking a cake is a test!\nYou\u2019re testing your recipe and your skills.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:36.800\nSo, tests aren\u2019t just about grades.\nThey're really about gathering information and seeing where you're at.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:49.700\nThey help us understand things better.\nIn short, a test is a process to get information, whether it\u2019s about your health, your knowledge, or even a delicious cake.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:53.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
