    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to reveal information.\nIt could be a quiz in school, designed to see what you've learned.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:31.200\nOr it could be a medical test, like when a doctor checks your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:34.200\nAnother example? Baking a cake!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.500\nYou test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\nIf it comes out clean, the test says the cake is ready!\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:50.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\nIt asks a question and gives you an answer.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:56.900\nIt's all about learning and understanding.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
