    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:19.900\nWhat are they, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the strength of a bridge.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:30.200\nThink about it like this: a pop quiz in school is a test of what you've learned.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:38.200\nA taste test of a new soda is a test of how good it tastes.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:47.900\nAnd when engineers check if a building can withstand an earthquake, that's a test of its structural integrity.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:59.900\nSo, tests help us understand, measure, and make decisions. They give us information that we can then use.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:03.600\nFrom simple quizzes to complicated scientific experiments, tests are all around us.\n```"
