    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_212852.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.200\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. Think of it like this: a teacher gives you a test in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:30.200\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:45.400\nYou're testing if your recipe works and if the cake tastes good. So, whether it's a pop quiz, a medical exam, or even trying a new recipe, a test helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:52.400\nIt gives us information. In short, a test is a process designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:01.600\nIt's about gathering information and making informed decisions based on the results. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
