    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:19.100\nIt helps us understand if something is working, if something is true, or even how well you know a subject.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or a chef tastes their food to test if it needs more salt. Even pressing a button on a toy to see if it lights up is a type of test!\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:35.800\nTests aren\u2019t just in school. They are everywhere! They help us make sure things are right and that we are on the right track.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:41.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:49.000\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:52.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
