    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests!\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:21.200\nIt's a method of checking or proving something.\nThink about it like this: You might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:26.000\nOr, a doctor might run blood tests to test your health.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.300\nSee? It\u2019s all about gathering information.\nTests can be anything from a quick observation to a long, detailed experiment.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:47.000\nFor example, you could test if a toy car rolls faster on carpet or hardwood.\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a process for learning and confirming something.\nIt's about exploring and getting answers.\n\n00:56.400 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
