    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time to see if things are working correctly, or to measure something specific.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:43.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:53.400\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test! You're testing your recipe to see if it comes out delicious. So, a test is really just a way to gather information.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:56.900\nIt helps us learn, diagnose problems, and make sure things are working as they should. Remember, it's all about finding something out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
