    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.800 --> 00:04.000\nToday, we're diving into the basics of testing.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:06.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:09.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:12.300\nIt's like a question, and the answer helps us understand that \"something.\"\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:16.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:20.000\nOr, a taste test tells you which food you like best.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:24.800\nIn the world of science and technology, tests are used all the time!\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:28.800\nWe test if a new medicine works, or if a bridge can hold a lot of weight.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:32.200\nThe results of a test give us important information.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:34.600\nSo remember, a test is just a way to learn and explore.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:51.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
