    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:07.400\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:12.700\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:16.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:25.200\nThink about it: if you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you the cake is done.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:34.000\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike and you try to balance without holding on, that's a test to see if you're ready to ride solo.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:41.500\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like tasting soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:50.000\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.400\nSo remember, a test is simply a way to get information.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
