    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE This subtitles file was auto-generated by an AI.  Please review and correct any errors.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:18.000\nWhat is a test?\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:21.200\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:29.500\nIt's a process where we try to determine if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:30.900\nThink of it like this: a cooking test.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:34.800\nYou taste the soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:38.800\nOr a spelling test at school \u2013 it shows you how well you know your words.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:43.600\nScientists also use tests to see if their ideas about the world are correct.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:46.900\nThey might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:50.700\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and understanding something better.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:52.500\nThey help us make decisions and learn.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:54.800\nRemember, a test is just a way to check things out!\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
