    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:19.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like checking to see if your cake is done baking \u2013 you use a toothpick, right?\nThat's a kind of test!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:37.600\nTests can be anything from a quiz at school to checking if your phone charger is actually charging your phone.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:45.400\nWe use them all the time to see if we're on the right track.\nFor example, a spelling test shows if you've learned your spelling words.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:53.200\nOr, testing a new toy makes sure it's safe for kids to play with.\nIt's all about gathering information.\n\n00:53.200 --> 01:01.900\nSo, remember, tests are just tools to help us learn and improve, whether it's our knowledge, our skills, or even the things we make.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:07.100\nThey help us understand what's working and what needs a little more work.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
