    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.600\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if we understand something. Think about it like this: Your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:38.400\nOr, in school, your teacher gives you a test to see how well you\u2019ve learned the material. Another example: Before a company releases a new phone, they put it through lots of tests to make sure it won't break easily.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:50.300\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly. Basically, a test is just a process to get information.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:58.600\nIt can be big or small, formal or informal. The important thing is that it helps us answer a question.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:02.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
