    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer. It could be a written exam in school, designed to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:30.400\nOr maybe you're testing out a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Even just trying to see if a door is locked is a kind of test!\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:39.300\nYou\u2019re trying to confirm something. For example, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:47.500\nOr you might test a toy car to see how far it can travel. In each case, you're doing something to learn more.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:58.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and answer a question. It helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
