    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_214352.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:07.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:13.000\nIt's a method we use to gather information and see how well something performs, or how much someone knows.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:18.000\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes a sauce.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:20.100\nThat's a test to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:24.700\nOr, you might read a book review before buying it.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:27.000\nThat review is a test of whether the book is good!\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:28.600\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:32.600\nYour teacher gives you a quiz to test your understanding of a lesson.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:35.800\nA doctor runs blood work to test your health.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:41.000\nSo, a test is just a process, big or small, designed to give us answers.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:44.800\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
