    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_214438.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests to see if something is true, or to measure something.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:33.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:43.000\nOr, when you bake a cake, you're testing if the recipe works! You're checking if the cake tastes good.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:52.100\nSo, tests help us understand things better and make sure everything is working the way it should. They can be big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.800\nIn short, a test is just a process to gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
