    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_214543.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:20.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:29.500\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz, that's a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:41.800\nOr, imagine you're trying out a new lightbulb. You turn it on, and if it lights up, that's a test to see if it's working!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:51.200\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes, from simple yes or no questions, to longer exams, or even trying out a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:51.200 --> 01:00.000\nThe important thing is that they give you information. They help you understand what you know, or whether something is working as expected. So, remember, a test is just a way to find out information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
