    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore the concept of a test.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something. Think of it like a detective gathering clues.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:18.900\nTests can come in many forms. You might take a quiz at school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:28.000\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing a recipe!\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:36.500\nFor example, let's say you want to know if your plant needs water. You can test it by sticking your finger in the soil.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:42.400\nIf it feels dry, that's your clue! Another example: a taste test!\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:58.600\nTrying a new ice cream flavor helps you decide if you like it. So, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new, whether it\u2019s about your knowledge, your health, or even your taste buds!\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:04.900\nIt's all about discovering something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
