    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.900\nA test is really just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.300\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:30.500\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve problems, showing if you know your addition and subtraction.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:37.500\nOr a spelling test checks if you've learned the new words.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:45.200\nOutside of school, tests are everywhere. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:56.700\nCar mechanics use tests to find out what's wrong with your car. Basically, a test helps us find out information about something.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:03.100\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something and get information. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
