    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.700\nIt's a process that helps us understand or evaluate.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.500\nOr a taste test helps you decide which cookie is the tastiest!\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:49.300\nIn science, you might test a plant to see if it grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:52.800\nSo, tests aren't just about grades in school. They're a tool we use every day to learn and make decisions.\n```"
  },
