    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:18.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to check what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: it's a snapshot of your understanding at a particular moment.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:37.100\nTests can come in lots of forms. Maybe it's a multiple-choice quiz at school, or a simple exam to see if you've learned something new.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:46.200\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you can follow the instructions and make something delicious!\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:53.400\nSo, the next time you hear the word \"test,\" don't panic! Just remember it's a tool to help you learn and grow.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.000\nIt helps you and others understand what you know well and what you might need to work on. It\u2019s all about learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
