    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.800\nIt's a method for gathering information to see if something is true, or to check how well someone understands something.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:30.400\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick. Or, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.800\nWe use tests all the time! For example, you might test if a lightbulb works by plugging it in.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:47.300\nOr, you could test a recipe by actually cooking it and seeing how it tastes. Tests help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:56.900\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to gather information and find something out. It helps us check things and learn more!\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
