    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHi everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.400\nToday we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:07.900\nA test is simply a way to find out information.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:12.600\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:16.400\nIt helps you measure something, check if something works, or see how much you know.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:22.100\nFor example, your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:27.200\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:30.200\nEven baking a cake is a test!\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:33.700\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:41.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information, whether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even a delicious cake.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:43.800\nIt's all about finding answers.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:46.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
