    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.900\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:32.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:39.000\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:52.800\nTests aren't just for people, though! You can test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. You can test a toy to see if it's safe. The important thing is that a test gives you information. It helps you make decisions or improve something.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school or trying out a new flavor of ice cream, remember that a test is just a way of learning and finding things out.\n```"
