    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a subject, or if a product works correctly, or even if a recipe tastes good.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: if you're learning to ride a bike, your first few tries are a test. You're testing if you can balance!\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:36.300\nOr, if you're baking cookies, you might taste one before they're all done. That's a test to see if you need more sugar or chocolate chips.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:42.900\nTests help us learn and improve. They give us information so we can make better decisions.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:52.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something. It helps us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
