    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:23.200\nIt's a method for gathering information. Think of it like a detective looking for clues.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:30.000\nFor example, a simple spelling test helps us understand how well someone knows their spelling.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:40.800\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. Tasting the batter is a test to see if you need more sugar. It's a quick check to get some useful information.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:50.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from quizzes in school to checking the temperature of your oven. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:54.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
