    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're tackling the basics of a test.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.300\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find something out!\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:21.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, a product's quality, or even how well a plant is growing.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:30.000\nThink of it like this: a school exam is a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:39.800\nOr, imagine baking a cake. Tasting it afterwards is a test to see if you used the right amount of sugar.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:50.100\nEven checking if your bike tires have enough air is a kind of test! So, tests help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:54.700\nThey're all about gathering information and seeing where things stand.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:56.200\nIn short, a test is an evaluation.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
