    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:10.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:22.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:33.100\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. Even tasting a new food is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you like it!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:45.200\nTests can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like trying out a new recipe. The important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:57.400\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and seeing where we stand.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
