    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.400\nA test is basically a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like a check-up, but for knowledge or performance.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:38.700\nFor example, you take a test in school to see how much you've learned in math. Or, a car company might test a new car to see how safe it is in a crash.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:46.400\nTests can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like trying to bake a cake.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:54.000\nThe goal of a test is to get some information. It helps us understand what we know, where we need to improve, or if something is working the way it should. So, tests are all about learning and making things better! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
