    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: you might \"test\" the temperature of the water before you jump in a pool. That tells you if it's too cold, too hot, or just right.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.200\nOr, maybe you take a written test in school. That test helps your teacher understand how well you learned the material.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.800\nScientists run tests to see if a new medicine works. Chefs taste food to \"test\" if it needs more salt.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:48.100\nSee? Tests are all around us, helping us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:57.700\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and answer a question. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
