    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:17.600\nA test is really just a way to check something. It's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or running an experiment to see what happens.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:25.300\nWe use tests all the time to learn, to improve things, and to make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:31.500\nThink about a spelling test at school. It checks if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:38.000\nOr imagine a taste test for new cookies. It checks which cookie people like the best.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:48.300\nEven a simple check-up at the doctor is a test to see how healthy you are!\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:55.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way of checking something. It helps us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
