    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer. For example, a spelling test helps us find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:31.900\nA taste test helps us find out which food tastes best. Or, when you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:44.900\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, figuring out your favorite flavor, or making sure your cake is perfect, a test helps us gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:50.100\nIt's all about finding out the answer. That's the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:53.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
