    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE duration:55.5\nNOTE each slide stays on screen for the full narration duration.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:15.800\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:26.500\nWe use them to see if something works, if something is true, or to check our understanding.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:38.200\nThink about it like this: You might test a new recipe by cooking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:51.800\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. In school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just a simple question and answer session.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.500\nThe goal is to see if you grasp the main ideas.\n```"
