    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:23.000\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly or if something is true. Think of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:30.300\nOr a doctor might run blood tests to check your health. The result of the test tells us something important.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:43.700\nFor example, if you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Or, if you build a toy car, you might roll it down a ramp to test if it moves smoothly.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:46.300\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:55.400\nSo, a test is basically a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or requirement.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:05.100\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
