    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.600\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:30.500\nIt's like asking a question, but instead of just listening for an answer, we're looking for evidence.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:38.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake recipe by baking the cake and seeing if it tastes good.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:45.900\nOr, a doctor might test your eyesight to see how well you can see.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:57.300\nTests can be used to check anything from how strong a bridge is to how well you understand a new subject. So, to recap, a test is a procedure to gather information and evaluate something. It helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions. And now you know the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
