    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something called a test.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.700\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it as a question you're asking, and the answer tells you something important.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:37.600\nIt could be testing if a light bulb works, checking if you understand a new concept, or even finding out what your favorite color is!\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:47.100\nThe main idea is to use a specific method or process to gather information.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:49.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:52.300\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:52.300 --> 01:04.900\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n01:04.900 --> 01:17.500\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information about something.\n\n01:17.500 --> 01:22.300\nWe use them to learn, to make decisions, and to understand the world around us.\n\n01:22.300 --> 01:25.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
