    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:16.700\nIt could be about anything!\nThink of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:26.100\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:35.600\nEven a simple taste test, like trying a new ice cream flavor, is a type of test!\nYou\u2019re testing whether you like it or not.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:50.000\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\nThey can be big and formal, like a school exam, or small and informal, like checking if the bath water is too hot.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:57.400\nThe key thing is, they help us learn.\nTo recap, a test is a method for discovering something.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:08.600\nWhether it's your health, your knowledge, or just your taste preferences, tests are all around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
