    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:22.000\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:31.600\nYou perform a test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nOr, imagine you want to know if you understand a new word.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:39.400\nYou might try to use it in a sentence.\nIf you can use it correctly, you've passed your understanding test.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:44.400\nTests aren't just in baking or vocabulary.\nThey're everywhere!\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:54.800\nFrom checking if your phone battery is charged to a doctor running bloodwork.\nThey all help us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:03.000\nSo, remember, a test is a method for gathering information to answer a question.\nIt's a simple way to learn and confirm.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:06.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
