    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It could be a written exam at school, sure, but it's much broader than that.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:30.500\nA test can be anything from checking if a lightbulb works to seeing if a plant grows in sunlight.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:42.100\nWe're trying to learn something new. For example, you might test if a cookie recipe works by baking a batch and tasting it.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:50.900\nOr you might test if a toy car rolls faster on carpet or hardwood. You\u2019re observing the results!\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:57.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:00.400\nIt's about asking a question and finding the answer through observation or experimentation.\n```"
  },
