    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_222644.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:15.200\nA test is basically a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like this: you take a quiz in school; that's a test to see how much you learned. Or, a doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.500\nTests aren't just for people, though! If you're building a website, you can test it to make sure all the buttons work.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:39.000\nIf you bake a cake, you can test it by poking it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:50.800\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, in short, a test is a method for figuring out if something meets a certain standard or if it's working the way it should.\n\n00:50.800 --> 01:00.500\nWhether it\u2019s a school exam or checking if your cookies are baked, testing helps us learn and improve.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:04.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
