    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: you give your plant water and then observe if it grows.\nThat's a test to see if water helps plants grow!\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:39.700\nOr, if you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if you like the taste.\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying a new route to work to see if it's faster.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:47.300\nThe important thing is that a test helps you learn something new or confirm something you already suspected.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:57.300\nSo, a test is all about gathering information.\nIt can be about anything, from plants to recipes to your own knowledge.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
