    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:6.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:11.700\nThink of it like an investigation. We want to learn more about something, so we use a test.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.300\nThe main idea behind a test is to give you a specific task or question, and then see how you do. Your performance helps us understand your knowledge, abilities, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:35.300\nFor example, a spelling test tells us how well you spell. A taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes best. Or, a stress test on a bridge helps engineers know if it's safe.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:46.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a method of finding something out about something else. We give a task, observe the result, and learn from it.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:49.900\nThat's testing in a nutshell!\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:52.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
