    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.400 --> 00:02.900\nToday we're going to explore something super important: tests.\n\n00:02.900 --> 00:05.800\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:08.000\nBasically, it's a way to find out an answer.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:12.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:17.000\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you get a yummy treat.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:25.600\nSo, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:28.800\nThey give us information to make better decisions.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:34.300\nRemember, tests are everywhere, helping us understand the world around us.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:36.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
