    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_223558.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:26.400\nThe toothpick comes out clean? The cake's ready.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:29.700\nIt comes out gooey? Needs more time.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:35.600\nTests aren't just for baking though. A doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:44.000\nYour teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned. Even trying a new flavor of ice cream is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:58.100\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. Whether it's about cake, your health, or even ice cream, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
