    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:24.000\nIt helps us understand if something works, or if something is true. Think of it like this: you might test a cake recipe by baking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:34.800\nOr, a doctor might test your vision to see how well you can see. In school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.000\nSo, tests can come in many forms. They can be written, like quizzes or exams.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:51.500\nThey can be practical, like trying out a new skill. Or they can be observations, like watching how a plant grows under different conditions.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:58.800\nBasically, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. That's the core idea.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:02.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
