    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:13.100\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:27.700\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:36.500\nYour doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:41.300\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:46.100\nEven trying a new recipe is a test!\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:48.900\nYou're testing to see if you like how it tastes.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:53.700\nSo, a blood test checks your health, a quiz checks your knowledge, and trying a recipe checks your taste preference.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:01.100\nSee? Tests help us learn, diagnose, and discover.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:08.500\nBasically, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n01:08.500 --> 01:13.900\nIt could be an object, a person, a system, anything!\n\n01:13.900 --> 01:18.900\nSo remember, tests are all about finding things out.\n\n01:18.900 --> 01:23.100\nThey help us understand the world around us.\n\n01:23.100 --> 01:26.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
