    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:18.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It's like an experiment or a check-up that helps us understand more about a person, object, or even an idea.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:30.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words. Or, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:33.000\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:39.100\nLet's say you're baking a cake. You might test the oven temperature to make sure it's hot enough.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:48.600\nOr, you could test a small piece of the batter to see if it tastes good. These are both mini-tests within the bigger task of baking.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:59.200\nSo, remember, a test is a way of gathering information to help us learn and make better decisions. They come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
