    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:20.200\nNow, a test is basically a way to see how well something works, or how much of something there is.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like checking to see if a light bulb still shines, or measuring how tall you are.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:31.200\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine baking a cake. You might stick a toothpick in to test if it's done.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:37.700\nIf it comes out clean, that's a pass! Or, think about a doctor checking your temperature.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:48.200\nThat's a test to see if you have a fever. So, in short, a test helps us understand or evaluate something.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:57.600\nIt provides information that we can use to make decisions. It's all about gathering data and seeing where things stand.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.100\nHopefully, this gives you a good basic understanding of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
