    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.100\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:29.300\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done. You poke the cake, and if the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you the cake is ready!\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:35.200\nOr, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:48.100\nAnother example? You take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:58.200\nSo, whether it's cake, your health, or spelling, a test is just a method for getting information. They help us understand things better.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:03.300\nTo recap, tests are tools we use to gather information and check if something is working or true. They're everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
