    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:16.900\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:39.100\nFor example, when you try a new food, you're testing if you like it or not. Or when you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it will turn on the TV.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:50.000\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They might ask you questions about a book you read, or have you solve a math problem. These tests help them understand how well you understand the subject.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.500\nSo, a test is really just a tool for learning and understanding more about something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
