    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:11.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:23.800\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:34.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:37.500\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:40.400\nA simple test could even be checking if a lightbulb works by flipping the switch.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:43.300\nDoes it turn on? That's a test!\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:52.800\nTests help us make decisions and learn new things. By testing, we can confirm our assumptions and correct our mistakes.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:57.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for finding information or confirming something.\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "b0f742e5-5ebf-428d-83ff-30f7ba1b9d13": {
    "id": "b0f742e5-5ebf-428d-83ff-30f7ba1b9d13",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
