    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:24.900\nIt's a process designed to give us information. Think about it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you might use a toothpick.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:36.100\nSticking the toothpick in and seeing if it comes out clean is a test. Or, if you want to know if you understand a new word, you might try using it in a sentence.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:41.700\nThat's a test too! Tests aren't just about baking or vocabulary, though.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:57.000\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned. Basically, anytime you're trying to figure something out by asking a question or performing an action, you're conducting a test!\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:04.900\nSo remember, a test is all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
