    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a baker might taste their cake batter as a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a written test in school, or a scientist might run a test in a lab.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:44.600\nEven checking the weather forecast is a kind of test to see if you need an umbrella!\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:57.300\nBasically, a test is just a method to get an answer or measure something. They help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us better.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.800\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it\u2019s just a way of finding something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
