    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like gathering information. The main idea is to present a question or a challenge, and then observe the response.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:32.500\nThe response gives us data. We can then use that data to draw conclusions.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:42.700\nFor example, a simple taste test helps us decide which cookie is yummier. Or, a spelling test shows us which words a student knows how to spell.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:51.800\nEven checking if a light switch turns on the light is a type of test! So, to recap, a test is a process for gathering information by observing a response to a question or challenge.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:58.900\nIt helps us learn and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
