    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.500\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:37.500\nTests help us see if something works, if it's good enough, or if it meets certain rules.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:47.400\nFor example, a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a strength test at the doctor's office can tell you how strong your muscles are.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:53.400\nTests can even be as simple as trying on shoes to see if they fit. So, tests are all about checking things and getting information. They help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
