    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of testing.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake, and you taste it. That taste is a test to see if you used the right amount of sugar.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:32.800\nIn everyday life, we're constantly testing things. You check the weather forecast to see if you need an umbrella.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:42.100\nYou try on a new pair of shoes to make sure they fit. Testing is all about making sure things are correct and reliable.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:52.600\nIt helps us catch mistakes early on and prevents bigger problems later. So, remember, a test is simply a check to see if something is working as expected. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
