    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nWhat are they and why do we use them?\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:22.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.900\nThink of it like this: you use a taste test to see if your soup needs more salt.\nOr a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:42.700\nTests help us measure knowledge, skills, or even abilities.\nFor example, a fitness test might measure how many push-ups you can do.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:49.800\nA math test shows how well you understand numbers.\nSo, tests are just tools to help us learn and understand more.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:56.900\nThey give us information.\nThey help us see where we're strong and where we might need a little more practice.\nRemember, tests aren't scary.\n\n00:56.900 --> 00:58.000\nThey're just a way to learn!\n```"
