    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.200\nA test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb is good. You screw it in, and if it lights up, the test shows it\u2019s working!\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:39.600\nTests can be anything from a quick quiz at school to checking if a new medicine is safe. For example, your spelling tests at school show how well you've learned your words.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:50.800\nOr, when you bake a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it\u2019s delicious! So, in a nutshell, a test is just a process to evaluate something.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.300\nIt helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
