    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_231648.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.600\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we don't just mean school exams. A test is simply a way of finding out something about something else.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready. You poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:25.400\nThe toothpick comes out clean? The cake's done.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:30.500\nOr, maybe you want to know if your phone is working. You try to make a call.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:36.100\nIf you can hear the other person, the test passes! So, a test is just an action we take to get information.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.000\nWe perform the action, and then look at the result to see what we learned. Pretty simple, right?\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:55.100\nTests help us understand the world around us, one little experiment at a time.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
