    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:21.000\nThink about it.\nWhen you take a spelling test at school, it's to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:34.400\nOr, if you bake a cake and then taste it, that taste is a test to see if the cake is good!\nAnother example is a doctor giving you an eye test, to see if you need glasses.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:41.800\nTests help us understand things better, and they can show us what we're good at and what we can improve on.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:52.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
