    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_231918.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how much you know or how well you can do something. Think of it like this: it\u2019s a tool to measure your understanding.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:24.200\nTests come in many forms. You might take a written test at school, answering questions on paper.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:36.500\nOr maybe you take a practical test, like driving a car to show you know the rules of the road.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:45.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test sees if you can solve problems.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:56.500\nAnd a cooking test shows if you can follow a recipe and create a tasty dish! So, remember, a test is just a way to measure your knowledge or skills in a particular area. It helps you and others understand what you've learned.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
