    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260102_232808.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.900\nThink of a test as a way to see if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:26.900\nBasically, it's a check-up! We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:37.600\nFor example, when you try to turn on a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:48.300\nOr, when you taste food, you're testing if you like the flavor.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:57.300\nIn school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:06.300\nIn science, tests can confirm or deny a hypothesis.\n\n01:06.300 --> 01:15.300\nSo, tests can be simple like checking a light, or more complex, like a school exam.\n\n01:15.300 --> 01:18.900\nIn short, a test is any procedure designed to evaluate or assess something.\n\n01:18.900 --> 01:22.500\nAnd that's the basics of what a test is!\n\n01:22.500 --> 01:26.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
