    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like an experiment, where you're trying to learn the answer to a question.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:36.900\nMaybe you want to test if a plant grows faster in sunlight or shade. Or maybe you want to test if a toy car rolls further on carpet or tile.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:49.100\nTo do a test, you need to have something you're changing, like the amount of sunlight, and something you're measuring, like how much the plant grows.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:52.600\nAfter you do your test, you'll have some results that help you answer your question.\n```"
