    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just asking, you're getting proof or evidence to back up your answer.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:22.400\nSo, what kind of things can we test? Lots!\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:28.800\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might test if the oven is hot enough before putting the cake in.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:34.900\nOr, think about your eyes. An eye exam is a test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:41.000\nEven taking a quiz at school is a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:52.200\nBasically, tests help us understand things better and make sure things are working the way they should. They are important for making sure everything is safe and accurate.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:58.700\nTo recap, a test is a method of finding something out, by gathering evidence.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
