    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.500\nToday we're going to explore something really fundamental: a test.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:30.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but it doesn't always need be complicated.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:42.500\nBasically, you're checking to see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:51.400\nFor example, a taste test is a test to see which snack people like best. Or, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:51.400 --> 01:01.300\nWe can also use tests to see if something is safe, like testing a new toy before kids play with it.\n\n01:01.300 --> 01:11.200\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and learning something new. They help us make decisions and improve things.\n\n01:11.200 --> 01:15.400\nSo, remember, a test is a way to find things out.\n\n01:15.400 --> 01:21.100\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better choices.\n\n01:21.100 --> 01:24.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
