    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:20.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a topic, checking if a machine is working correctly, or even checking if a recipe tastes good!\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: Your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.500\nA doctor might run a blood test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:48.200\nOr you might taste a cake you baked to test if you used enough sugar. So, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and make sure things are working as expected.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:55.800\nThey\u2019re a super important part of understanding the world around us. In short, a test is just a way of checking something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
