    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:04.600\nToday we're going to talk about tests\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:07.100\n\u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:11.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:15.800\nIt could be about you, like a quiz at school,\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:18.700\nor about a thing, like checking if a toy works.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:21.800\nThink of baking a cake.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:24.500\nYou might taste it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:27.700\nYou're checking if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:32.200\nOr imagine you're building with blocks.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:36.400\nYou might try to balance a tall tower \u2013 that's a test\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:38.300\nto see if it will stand up.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:40.600\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:45.200\nIf your cake isn\u2019t sweet enough, you know to add more sugar next time.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:49.400\nIf your tower falls, you know to build a wider base.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:51.800\nThey give us information to make better choices.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:54.600\nSo, tests are all about finding things out!\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
