    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.700\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:01.700 --> 00:03.700\nToday we're diving into something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:06.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:8.400\nIt could be checking if you understand a lesson,\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:10.800\nor if a machine is working correctly.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz - that's a test to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.300\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it \u2013 that's a test to see if it's done!\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:22.600\nTests aren't just in school, though.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:25.000\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:28.600\nMechanics use tests to find out what's wrong with your car.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:29.800\nAll sorts of things can be tested!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:38.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain requirement or standard.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:45.100\nIt helps us learn, fix problems, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:46.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
