    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.700\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to see what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:26.100\nIt's like checking if a lightbulb works before you put it in a lamp. You're testing to see if it will light up!\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:38.200\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. A simple quiz in class, a driving exam, or even checking if a recipe tastes good are all different kinds of tests.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:55.400\nIf you're baking a cake, tasting the batter is a test to see if it needs more sugar. So, a test is simply a process used to gather information, whether it's about your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:01.500\nIt helps us understand and learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
