    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:21.200\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it like this: you might \"test\" the temperature of your bath water to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:44.200\nOr maybe you \"test\" a new recipe to see if it tastes good. In each case, you're doing something to learn something new.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:56.200\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like seeing if your keys fit in the lock. The important thing is that they help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.800\nSo, a test is a method for gathering information to evaluate or measure something. It can be as simple as checking the weather or as complex as launching a rocket! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
