    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:19.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:31.000\nThink of it like this: it's a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you information.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:42.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it! For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing whether you like it.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:54.200\nOr, when you click a link online, you're testing to see if it takes you where you expect. In school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:03.000\nBut tests aren't just for school. Scientists use tests to prove if their ideas are correct, and doctors use tests to figure out what's wrong when you're not feeling well.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:08.500\nSo, tests help us learn, prove, and understand things.\n\n01:08.500 --> 01:11.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
