    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about something really important: a test!\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:21.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how much you know or how well you can do something.\nThink of it like this: it's a snapshot of your skills or understanding at a specific point in time.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:29.800\nThere are all sorts of tests.\nYou might take a spelling test in school, or a driving test to get your license.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:37.100\nEven baking a cake can be a kind of test \u2013 did you follow the recipe correctly?\nDoes it taste good?\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:49.000\nSo, a test helps us understand where we are, and what we might need to learn or practice more.\nIt's not about being perfect, but about learning and growing.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:56.900\nIn short, a test is a way to measure knowledge or ability.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
