    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:14.400\nIn everyday life, a test is simply a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:19.600\nThink of it like asking a question.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:28.900\nIn school, a test helps your teacher see what you've learned.\nBut it's not just about grades.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:31.700\nTests can be used to check anything.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:40.400\nFor example, a doctor might order a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nA chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:47.900\nSee?\nLots of different kinds!\nSo, a test is really just a method for checking something or someone.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:56.400\nIt gives us information we didn't have before.\nIt\u2019s a tool to help us understand things better.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nTo recap, tests ask questions and give us answers.\nThey\u2019re used in school, at the doctor's, and even in the kitchen.\nThey help us learn and make better decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
