    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. It could be how well you know a topic, how strong a material is, or even if a plant has enough sunlight.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:28.700\nBasically, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. You perform an action or ask a question, and then you observe the result.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:34.000\nThis result gives you information.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:42.600\nThink about a simple taste test. You taste a food, and the result tells you whether you like it or not.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:55.500\nOr, imagine a spelling test at school. The test tells you how well you can spell certain words. So, remember, a test is a process for evaluating something, providing you with information about it.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:01.500\nIt's all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
