    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:19.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question, or a set of questions, designed to see what you know, what you can do, or even how something works.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:28.700\nThe main idea is simple: you give something a test, and then you get a result.\nThis result tells you something important.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:39.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:53.000\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if it tastes good!\nSo, to recap: a test is a question or a procedure, that gives you information.\nIt helps us learn and understand.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
