    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well someone or something performs.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:27.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie recipe is the best.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:37.600\nIn science, you might test if a plant grows faster with sunlight or without.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:50.100\nAnd in everyday life, you're constantly testing things!\nLike, \"Will this shirt look good on me?\" or \"Is this apple ripe enough to eat?\"\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:58.700\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and making informed decisions.\nThey help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:02.300\nThat's the basic idea of what a test is.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
