    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.700\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, whether it was in school or even online.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:28.300\nBut what is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:36.600\nIt could be checking your knowledge, like a quiz, or checking if something works properly, like testing a new toy.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:43.000\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:49.400\nThat's a test! If it comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:49.400 --> 01:00.700\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. Each time you try, you're testing your balance. So, a test is just a simple way to see if something is correct, working, or ready. It's all about checking and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
