    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:14.700\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check how well you understand something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how well you've learned your words.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:29.800\nThat's one kind of test! But tests aren't just for school.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:34.600\nA mechanic might test your car's brakes to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:38.900\nOr a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:43.200\nSee? Tests are everywhere! They help us learn and improve.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:55.900\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a method for evaluating knowledge, skills, or performance. It helps us identify strengths and weaknesses.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
