    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_000638.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nA test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking, so you do a simple test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:23.100\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Tests are everywhere.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:33.700\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, teachers use tests to see what you've learned, and even scientists use tests to prove their ideas.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:39.400\nLet's say you want to test if a toy car needs new batteries. You turn it on.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:48.300\nIf it goes zoom, the batteries pass the test! If it barely moves, the batteries probably need replacing. That's another test!\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:57.000\nSo, a test is just a way to find out if something is working, or if something is true. It helps us make decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:04.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
