    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:19.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:32.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It could be about anything! We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:44.900\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like the taste. Or, if you turn a light switch on, you're testing to see if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:54.600\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The important thing is that they help us understand something better. So, a test is just a process of asking a question and seeing what the answer is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
