    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It helps us understand if something is working, if something is true, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:32.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:40.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if the recipe works and if you followed the instructions correctly.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:52.200\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and checking things out. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. They are used in many areas of life.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
