    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: the test.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:20.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. It could be to see if something works, if you understand something, or even if you like something!\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:30.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to test what you've learned.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:42.300\nEven trying a new flavor of ice cream is a kind of test, to see if you like it! So, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:51.200\nThey give us information we didn't have before. They're all about finding out something new or confirming something we already thought.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:58.300\nRemember, a test is just a way to check! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
