    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:22.600\nIt\u2019s a process that helps us measure or evaluate something. Think about it like this: Your doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:29.300\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you know. Those are both tests!\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:37.400\nAnother example is a taste test. You might try two different kinds of ice cream and decide which one you like better. That\u2019s also a test!\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:46.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information and learning something new. It helps us understand and measure things.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:52.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
