    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:28.000\nIt could be to see if you know your multiplication tables, or if a doctor needs to check your health.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:34.600\nBasically, it's a method for getting information.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:41.200\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:47.200\nThat's a test! Or, if you want to know if it\u2019s raining outside, you look out the window.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:51.700\nThat's another kind of test!\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.100\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like checking the weather.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.700\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and understand things better.\n```"
