    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.200\nIt's a method used to evaluate or measure something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even how well a new medicine works.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:33.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A taste test helps decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:45.900\nAnd scientists use tests to see if their ideas about the world are correct. So, tests are all about gathering information and making informed decisions based on that information.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:56.400\nThey help us learn, improve, and understand things better. So, remember, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:02.300\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
