    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_003602.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:16.200\nAt its core, a test is just a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:34.600\nWe use tests all the time without even realizing it.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:43.500\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like it.\nOr when you check the weather forecast, you're seeing the results of a weather test.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:51.800\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\nImagine you're learning about animals. A test might ask you to name different types of animals or describe where they live.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.500\nThe answers you give show what you understand.\nSo, a test is simply a tool to gather information and see what's what.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
