    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works. You screw it into a lamp, and that's your test!\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:36.500\nBasically, a test helps you find out if something is true, correct, or meets certain standards.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:50.800\nFor example, you might take a math test at school to see if you understand the material. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:59.500\nSo, a math exam, a spelling quiz, even a simple \"yes\" or \"no\" question can be considered a test.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.100\nThey all help us measure or evaluate something.\n```"
