    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHi there, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:12.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:24.100\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.100\nThink of it like this: You might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:42.100\nOr, a doctor might test your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:53.800\nIn school, tests are used to see what you\u2019ve learned. They can be multiple choice, true or false, or even written essays.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.600\nThe important thing is that they help your teacher see how well you understand the material.\n```"
