    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like a detective collecting clues.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:28.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nA doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\nA baker tastes their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:36.600\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\nThey can be written exams, quizzes, or even projects.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:43.600\nThe goal is to show what you understand.\nSo, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:52.400\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand things better.\nIt's not something to fear, but rather a way to see how far you've come.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
