    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_004626.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It\u2019s a process for checking or evaluating something to see how well it works, or if it's true.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:27.500\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you know. Or, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:45.700\nDoctors use tests to see if you\u2019re healthy, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe. So, tests can be big or small, simple or complicated, but they all have the same goal: to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:52.500\nThey help us understand the world around us better. That's the basic idea of what a test is!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
