    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:24.100\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs or if something is true.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.400\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.800\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt. In both cases, they're using a test to learn something.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:53.900\nTests can be formal, like a science experiment, or informal, like trying a new recipe to see if you like it. The important thing is that you're trying to get an answer to a question.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:59.400\nSo, a test helps us learn, confirm, and understand things better. Tests are everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
