    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:14.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:18.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:24.100\nYou poke it with a toothpick. That's a test! The toothpick comes out clean?\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.200\nThe cake passes the test \u2013 it's done! If it comes out gooey, it fails, and needs more time in the oven.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:41.800\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. It helps your teacher see how well you understand spelling rules.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:56.000\nOr even checking if your phone charger works by plugging it in. If your phone starts charging, the charger passes the test!\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:03.400\nSo, a test is just a simple way to check if something works, if something is true, or how well something is done. Hopefully, that makes tests a little less scary! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
