    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really fundamental: tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.500\nThink of a test like a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to. It's like asking a question and seeing if you get the right answer.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:21.800\nFor example, imagine you\u2019ve baked a cake. The test is tasting it!\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:25.400\nDoes it taste good? Is it cooked all the way through?\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:33.900\nThat's you testing your cake. Or, if you've built a tower of blocks, the test is whether it stands up straight.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:46.100\nIf it falls over, it failed the test! So, simply put, a test is a way of checking if something is working correctly, by observing the result.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:53.800\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
