    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling a really important concept: the test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:18.600\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It could be anything from checking if a lightbulb works, to seeing how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like this. You want to know if your cake is done baking. So, you insert a toothpick. That's your test!\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:27.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test \u2013 it's ready!\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:35.800\nAnother example is spelling. When you take a spelling test, you're showing what words you know how to spell.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:47.700\nSo remember, a test is just a method for gathering information or confirming something. It helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
