    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:22.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you're checking if something is working correctly, if something is true, or even just seeing how well you understand something.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:28.600\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might stick a toothpick in it to see if it comes out clean. That's a test!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:33.500\nOr, maybe you're learning your ABCs. Your teacher might ask you to write them down to test your knowledge.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:44.400\nTests can be anything from a simple yes or no answer to a more complex series of questions. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:55.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:58.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
