    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_005657.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, maybe in school. But what exactly is a test?\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information. It's a process of asking questions or performing actions to see what the result will be.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:33.700\nThink about it like this: A doctor might give you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:42.600\nA chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, you might try pressing a button on a toy to test if it still works.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:54.500\nTests help us understand things better. They give us data and information so we can make decisions. So remember, a test is just a way of learning something new by asking a question or trying something out.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
