    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:15.600\nNow, a test is basically a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough. In school, a test helps your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:34.200\nBut tests aren\u2019t just for school. When you get a new toy, you might test it out to see if it does what it\u2019s supposed to.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:46.500\nOr if a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever. So, tests are all about finding out information and making sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:54.300\nRemember, testing is a normal part of learning and life. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
