    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_011000.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.228 --> 00:01.828\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:02.078 --> 00:05.148\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:05.558 --> 00:07.678\nThink of it like gathering information.\n\n00:07.998 --> 00:12.238\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:12.448 --> 00:17.928\nIt could be anything from a simple quiz at school to see how well you understand a lesson,\n\n00:17.928 --> 00:21.468\nto a doctor running bloodwork to check your health.\n\n00:21.788 --> 00:24.578\nThe goal is always the same: to get a better understanding of something.\n\n00:24.998 --> 00:28.188\nFor example, a taste test helps you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n00:28.578 --> 00:31.268\nOr, a spelling test shows which words you know how to spell.\n\n00:31.558 --> 00:32.448\nSee?\n\n00:32.448 --> 00:33.988\nTests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:34.318 --> 00:37.258\nSo, a test is an information-gathering tool.\n\n00:37.418 --> 00:41.488\nIt helps us measure, understand, and learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:41.788 --> 00:42.928\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
