    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.300\nIt's like a question you ask, or an action you take, to see what the result will be.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:38.600\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you're testing the recipe. You're seeing if the ingredients and instructions work together to create a delicious cake.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:49.900\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how well you understand the vocabulary and grammar.\n\n00:49.900 --> 01:00.400\nEven pressing a button on a remote control is a test to see if it turns on the TV.\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:04.700\nSo, tests are all about trying something out and observing the outcome.\n\n01:04.700 --> 01:09.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:09.300 --> 01:12.800\nRemember, a test is simply a method for discovering information.\n\n01:12.800 --> 01:16.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
