    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_011236.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:18.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\nYou can test it by sticking a toothpick in; if it comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:40.200\nTests aren't just for baking, though.\nDoctors use tests to check your health, like taking your temperature.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:54.200\nTeachers use tests to see how well you've learned something in class, like a quiz.\nEven scientists use tests in their experiments to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:02.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\nThey help us make better decisions and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
