    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:24.400\nIt could be about you, like a quiz to see what kind of learner you are. Or it could be about something else entirely, like a taste test to see which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:33.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:43.700\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class. And a baker might test a new recipe to make sure it tastes good.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:55.800\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us information. They come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to learn something new.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.300\nIn short, a test is a way to gather information and learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
