    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something. Think of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might use a toothpick.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:35.400\nSticking the toothpick in and seeing if it comes out clean is a test! Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is like a little test to see if you're getting better.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:46.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple things like checking if the light switch works, to more complicated things like school exams.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:58.800\nThe important thing is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm what we already know. So, to recap: A test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:04.900\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
