    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_011529.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.200\nIt helps us see if something is true, or if something works the way we expect it to. Think of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:34.400\nOr, if you want to know if your toy car still works, you put batteries in it and see if it moves. That's another test!\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:39.800\nTests are important because they give us information.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:51.100\nThey help us learn and improve things. Whether it's testing a recipe, a new toy, or even our own knowledge, tests are a valuable tool.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:59.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and get some answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
