    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a process or procedure designed to measure or evaluate a skill, knowledge, or ability.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:36.300\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:49.700\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like how it tastes! So, tests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to complex experiments.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:57.900\nThey all help us learn and understand more about ourselves and the world around us. In summary, a test is a tool for measurement and evaluation. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
