    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about yourself, or something else!\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:27.600\nIt's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even your opinion. Think about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:32.700\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:38.600\nSee? Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:44.500\nAnother example is a fitness test. It might measure how many push-ups you can do, showing how strong you are.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:55.300\nSo, remember, tests are just tools to help us learn more. They can show us what we already know and what we need to work on.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:02.000\nBasically, a test helps to measure something. It can be your knowledge, ability, or opinion.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:05.000\nTests are everywhere and they help us learn and grow.\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:08.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
