    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:20.400\nMaybe you want to know if you understand a lesson, or if a new medicine works, or even if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:26.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Think about a multiple-choice quiz in school.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:34.300\nThat's a test to see what you've learned. Or imagine tasting a spoonful of soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:42.400\nThat's a test too! So, a test is just a procedure that helps us gather information or make a decision.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:53.400\nWe perform the test, look at the results, and then we know a little bit more than we did before. Tests help us learn and improve things all the time.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
