    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:19.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something. It could be your knowledge, your skills, or even your physical abilities.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: a recipe test measures how well you followed the instructions, right? Or a speed test measures how fast your internet connection is.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:33.000\nSo, tests aren't just about school.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:41.000\nA doctor might run tests to check your health. A builder might test the strength of materials. It's all about getting information.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:45.600\nFor example, a quiz in class tests your understanding of a lesson.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:57.300\nA driving test checks if you can safely operate a car. See? Tests are everywhere, helping us learn and improve.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:01.200\nIn short, a test is a tool to evaluate something, giving us valuable data and feedback. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
