    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just asking, you're using a method to get an answer.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:27.400\nThe main idea of a test is to see how well something performs or what its qualities are. It helps us understand if something works as expected.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:34.000\nFor example, a spelling test in school checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:40.600\nOr, think about testing a new recipe. You taste it to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:47.200\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a simple test. So, a test is simply a way to gather information and understand something better.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:53.000\nWe use them every day to learn and make decisions.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
