    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.100\nThink of a test as a way to check something, to see if it works or if it's true. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you something important.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:27.300\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a baker might test their oven to make sure it's the right temperature for baking a cake.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:37.900\nA student might take a test to show what they've learned in class. So, tests help us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:46.900\nThey can be big or small, simple or complicated, but they all have the same basic purpose: to check something out.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:55.300\nIn short, a test is a structured way of gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
