    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:14.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something. Think of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:25.900\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. For example, a spelling test at school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:40.200\nOr, when you try a new recipe, tasting it is a test to see if it's delicious! Another example is checking if a lightbulb works by screwing it in; that's testing if it's still good.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:50.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly. They're all about gathering information.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:53.700\nThat's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
