    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_012318.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:29.200\nThink of it like an experiment, but not always in a lab. Essentially, you're giving something a question or challenge, and then observing the response.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:39.800\nThe response, or result, tells you something you didn't know before.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:50.700\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words. A taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. Even a simple weather check outside is a test to see if you need an umbrella!\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a process for gaining information. It's all about asking questions and learning from the answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
