    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:16.100\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:38.400\nFor example, when you try a new food, you're testing if you like it. Or when you flip a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:47.300\nThe \"test\" is the action, like tasting or flipping the switch, and the \"answer\" is whether you like the food or if the light turns on.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:56.200\nAnother example: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or a teacher gives you a quiz to see what you've learned.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:03.000\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a way to gather information and see what the result will be. It's a fundamental way we learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
