    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_012949.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:23.700\nIt could be finding out if you understand a topic in school, or if a certain ingredient is in your food.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:34.500\nYou poke it with a toothpick, right? That's a test!\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:39.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:48.500\nOr, maybe you want to see if your friend knows the answer to a riddle. You ask them the riddle \u2013 that's also a test!\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:55.800\nTests help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:00.200\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic goal: to get information. So, remember, a test is just a way to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
