    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_013035.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.600\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:19.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like a question.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:30.700\nYou ask the question, and the answer helps you understand something better. For example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:42.600\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie is your favorite! Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and scientists use tests to see if their ideas work.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:52.300\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information. It helps us learn and make decisions. Remember, tests aren't always about getting a grade; they're about finding things out.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
