    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:26.300\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or checking how well you understand a new concept. Think about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:37.500\nOr, if your toy car isn't moving, you might check the batteries \u2013 that's testing them! Tests help us learn and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:46.900\nSo, a test is just a way of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or works the way we expect.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:56.300\nThey're used everywhere, from science experiments to everyday life. We use tests to learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
