    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:18.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something. It helps us measure knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to test how well you understand a lesson. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:38.700\nEven when you try out a new recipe, you're testing if you like it! Tests can be anything from a simple question to a complicated exam.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:52.300\nThey help us learn where we're strong and where we might need to improve. So, whether it's a spelling test or a taste test, remember that tests are all about understanding and learning more.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
