    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:10.000\nSimple tests.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:18.600\nThink of a test as a way to check something. We want to know if something is working, if it's correct, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:24.100\nImagine you bake a cake. You'd probably taste it to test if it's sweet enough, right?\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:30.000\nThat's a test! Or maybe you're building with blocks. You might shake the tower to test if it's stable.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:33.100\nSame idea!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:39.900\nTests are everywhere. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Teachers use tests to see how well you've learned.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:50.600\nCompanies test their products to make sure they work properly. So, tests are just ways of checking things to see if they're doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:59.300\nThey help us understand things better and make sure everything is working as planned. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
