    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:20.100\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:30.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:41.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and your baking skills!\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:52.900\nSo, tests help us learn and improve. They give us information we can use to make better decisions or understand things better.\n\n00:52.900 --> 01:00.300\nThey're everywhere, from checking your eyesight to figuring out if a new product works. In short, a test is just a way to get answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
