    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_014114.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:25.900\nIt\u2019s a method or procedure designed to reveal information about a person, thing, or situation. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:35.900\nOr, a doctor might run tests to check your health. Even a baker testing if a cake is done is using a test \u2013 poking it with a toothpick!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.300\nTests can be used to measure knowledge, abilities, quality, or even just to see if something works the way it should.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:55.600\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz or a scientific experiment, remember that a test is all about gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
