    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:31.700\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something, like your knowledge, a product, or even an idea.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:34.000\nThink about it like this:\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:36.300\na spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:38.600\nOr, a taste test might let you decide which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:40.300\nSee?\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:42.300\nWe're testing them!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:53.700\nTests can come in many forms, from quizzes and exams to experiments and evaluations.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:08.700\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and improve. They give us information to make better decisions.\n\n01:08.700 --> 01:12.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for finding something out,\n\n01:12.300 --> 01:15.300\nused to check, evaluate,\n\n01:15.300 --> 01:16.900\nand ultimately,\n\n01:16.900 --> 01:18.600\nhelp us learn.\n\n01:18.600 --> 01:22.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
