    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_014428.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how much you know about something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like checking the temperature of a cake to see if it's baked all the way through.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.300\nInstead of cake, tests usually involve questions or problems.\nYou answer them, and those answers show how well you understand the topic.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:45.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr a math test might ask you to solve equations.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:54.900\nTests aren\u2019t meant to be scary!\nThey're just a tool to help you and your teachers understand what you've learned and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.400\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check your knowledge, with questions and problems, like a spelling or math test.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
