    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_014511.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:06.000\nToday, we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:07.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:12.000\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:16.000\nIt helps us find out if something works, if something is true, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:20.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health, like a blood test.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:24.500\nOr, a teacher gives you a test at school to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:27.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if your recipe works!\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:34.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to get information and see where things stand.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:38.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn more.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:42.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "a134ccfe-6dd6-4686-8c7e-432318a4362a": {
    "id": "a134ccfe-6dd6-4686-8c7e-432318a4362a",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T13:55:58.189358",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-03T01:46:13.737387",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260103_014613.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_014613.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.600\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:43.000\nIn science, tests help us see if our ideas are right. We can test if a plant grows faster with more sunlight, or if a new medicine works.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:50.900\nWe set up an experiment, which is a special kind of test, and see what happens.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:59.400\nFor example, if we want to test if fertilizer helps plants grow, we'd give fertilizer to one plant and not to another.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:07.900\nThen, we'd compare their growth. The plant with fertilizer growing taller would suggest the fertilizer works!\n\n01:07.900 --> 01:15.000\nSo, tests help us learn and prove things. They're a way of checking our assumptions and finding out what's true.\n\n01:15.000 --> 01:19.100\nRemember, testing is all about finding out!\n\n01:19.100 --> 01:24.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "174b0a7f-c15f-4326-8574-a55c0ebe0781": {
