    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.399\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it as a quick check-up or a small experiment.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:29.099\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:34.099\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:40.699\nAnother example? A baker might taste a cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:47.299\nSee? Tests are everywhere! They help us learn, diagnose, and make better decisions.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:50.999\nSo, remember, a test is a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:53.199\nIt's a way to check something out and learn more about it.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:54.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
