    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:17.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to show what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:25.300\nA simple example is a spelling test at school.\nIt helps your teacher see how well you've learned to spell different words.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:34.800\nOr, imagine testing a new toy to see if it's strong enough to handle being played with.\nWe put it through different things to see if it breaks.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:46.800\nSo, whether it's a test at school, a medical test, or even testing out a new product, the goal is always to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.900\nTests help us understand the world better and make informed decisions.\nThat\u2019s the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
