    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:26.700\nIt could be your knowledge, your skills, or even your physical ability.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:34.400\nThink of it like this: a thermometer is a test for temperature.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:42.100\nIt tells you how hot or cold something is.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:49.400\nIn school, tests usually measure how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:56.700\nSo, a test is basically a way to check your understanding.\n\n00:56.700 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
