    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.600\nThink of a test as simply a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:24.700\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:32.500\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're essentially testing it to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:47.200\nOr, if you turn a light switch on, you're testing whether the light bulb works. It\u2019s a simple check! Tests help us confirm things, identify problems, and learn new information.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:56.700\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. So, in short, a test is just a method for getting information.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.200\nIt\u2019s about asking a question and seeing what the answer is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
