    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_015722.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.300\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:34.900\nTests aren't just about grades though!\nThey can help you identify your strengths and weaknesses, so you know what to focus on.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:44.000\nFor example, if you take a practice driving test and struggle with parallel parking, you know that's something to practice more.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:54.500\nSo, a test is really just a tool to learn and improve.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:04.800\nIn short, a test is a method for gathering information and measuring something.\nIt can be used in all sorts of situations, from school to sports to science.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:07.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
