    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:33.400\nSo, how does it work? Basically, you give someone or something a challenge, and then you observe what happens.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:40.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:46.000\nA medical test checks if your body is healthy.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:54.500\nAnother example could be testing a new recipe.\nYou follow the instructions, and then you taste it to see if it's good.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:00.600\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
