    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:25.700\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:29.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:38.300\nOr, imagine you're testing if your toy car rolls down a ramp. You let it go and see what happens! That's a test!\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:45.700\nTests are used everywhere. Doctors use tests to check your health, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:49.500\nThe important thing is that a test helps us get answers. So, a test is a way to learn and explore!\n```"
