    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like checking your understanding.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:35.500\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. Sometimes it's a quiz with multiple choice questions, like, \"What color is the sky?\"\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:47.800\nOther times, it might be showing someone how to ride a bike, proving you understand how it works.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:58.300\nFor example, a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a cooking test might ask you to bake a cake, showing you understand the recipe.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:05.200\nSo, a test is just a method to measure knowledge or skill. It helps you and others see how much you've learned or how well you can perform a task.\n01:05.200 --> 01:06.800\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about!\n01:06.800 --> 01:12.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
