    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.300\nThink about it: a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:37.700\nOr a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite. Even checking if the light switch works is a kind of test \u2013 it tells you if the bulb is good or not.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:47.700\nSo, tests help us learn, make choices, and see if things are working correctly. They come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:51.200\nThat's the basic idea of a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
