    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:09.700\nToday, we're going to talk about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to check something,\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:16.600\nor to see if something works the way it's supposed to. Think of it like checking if your bike tires have enough air before you go for a ride.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:17.400\nThat's a test!\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:29.000\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell different words. Or, a math test might ask you to solve some problems to see if you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:36.200\nAnother example is when you try a new recipe. Tasting it to see if it tastes good is also a test!\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:48.200\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn and make sure things are working correctly. In short, a test is a way to evaluate or check something.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:50.400\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:52.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
