    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.600\nIt's a process designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities. Think of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it\u2019s done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:35.900\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Similarly, in school, a test helps your teacher understand what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:41.500\nLet's say you have a spelling test. It helps show how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:47.100\nOr imagine testing a new toy car to see how fast it goes. That\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:53.400\nBasically, any time you're trying to find out information by performing an action or asking questions, you're conducting a test.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.600\nSo, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:04.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
