    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like a question you're asking, and the answer helps you understand more. For example, a simple taste test helps you decide if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:37.000\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test that tells you the cake is done!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.300\nTests aren't just for food, though. Doctors use tests to check your health, and teachers use tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:57.500\nEssentially, a test is any process that helps you learn or confirm something. So, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of getting information.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
