    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:17.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like a quick way to see if something is working, or if you understand something.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:27.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.000\nThey can be written, like answering questions, or practical, like showing you know how to do something.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:41.400\nImagine you bake a cake. Tasting it is a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:44.000\nSee? Tests are everywhere.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:54.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:59.800\nThanks for watching! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
