    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.400\nIt's a method we use to gather information. Think of it like this: a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it works.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:30.400\nOr, a chef might test a new recipe to make sure it tastes good. Even you take tests in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:38.400\nTests aren't always about right or wrong answers. Sometimes, they're about exploring and discovering.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:48.800\nSo, whether it's a science experiment, a taste test, or a quiz at school, remember that a test is just a way to learn more. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
