    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:24.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:31.300\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:38.200\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:45.000\nOr, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:50.500\nTests help us understand things better and make decisions.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:56.000\nFor example, a doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:01.500\nA car mechanic might test your car's engine to find out what's wrong.\n\n01:01.500 --> 01:03.700\nSee?\nTests are everywhere!\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:08.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:15.800\nThey help us check things, understand things, and make informed choices.\n\n01:15.800 --> 01:16.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
