    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:23.600\nIt's a process we use to gather information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:28.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:39.100\nOr, a taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you like best. See? Tests come in many forms.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:52.000\nFor example, you might take a multiple-choice test at school, or a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you can cook it well.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:59.100\nSo, a test is just a method for learning something new or confirming something we already think is true.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:01.400\nWhether it's checking your knowledge,\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:03.900\nyour skills, or even your opinion,\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:06.900\ntests help us understand the world around us.\n\n01:06.900 --> 01:10.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
