    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: the test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know or how well you can do something. Think of it like checking your understanding.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:27.200\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. You might have a written test with questions to answer, or a practical test where you show someone how to do something.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:36.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your words, while a driving test sees if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:44.200\nSo, tests help us measure our knowledge and skills.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:53.300\nThey\u2019re a useful tool for learning and improving. Remember, a test isn\u2019t just about getting a good score, it\u2019s about seeing where you\u2019re at and figuring out what you need to learn next.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
