    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process or a procedure designed to evaluate, assess, or measure a specific skill, knowledge, or ability.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:33.200\nOr maybe you\u2019re baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it tastes good before it goes in the oven!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:47.300\nSchools use tests to see how well you understand what you've been learning.\nSo, tests can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like tasting that cake batter.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:56.200\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and make informed decisions.\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we might need to learn or improve on.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:01.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
