    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_024737.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.400\nEver wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:13.000\nIt's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:17.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:22.200\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:26.400\nTests aren't just for school, though!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:30.800\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers might test a bridge to make sure it's strong enough.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:38.000\nSo, a test is just a tool, a tool to gather information and help us understand things better.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:47.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
