    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_024849.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:19.800\nTests aren't just in school! You use them all the time.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:34.600\nFor example, when you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done. Or when you're trying to figure out which route to take home, you might test different streets to see which is fastest.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:45.800\nSo, a test is really just a process. It's a way of gathering information and using that information to make a decision or learn something new.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:57.600\nWhether it's a science experiment, a math quiz, or even just trying out a new recipe, you're using tests to explore and understand the world around you.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:05.600\nIn short, tests help us learn and make informed choices. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
