    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it as a way of gathering information. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:26.700\nA chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. A doctor uses tests to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:38.000\nAnd, of course, in school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. For example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:48.200\nThe results of a test help us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:54.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
