    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:27.200\nIt's a method we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:31.100\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:39.700\nSo, you perform a test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:41.100\nIt's done!\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:49.900\nOr maybe you're learning your ABCs. Your teacher might give you a test to see which letters you know.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:53.500\nThat test helps show what you've learned and what you still need to practice.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:56.700\nTests are used everywhere, from baking to school and even in science to prove if something is true.\n\n00:56.700 --> 00:58.900\nThey all help us learn and understand things better.\n```"
