    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something or someone to see how well they do.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:29.800\nThink of it like a measuring stick for knowledge or skills.\nBasically, it\u2019s a set of questions or tasks designed to evaluate what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:41.900\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you\u2019ve learned your spelling words.\nOr, a chef might taste a dish to test if it has enough seasoning.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:51.200\nTests come in all sorts of forms, from written exams to practical demonstrations.\nThe important thing is that they give us information about performance.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:57.300\nSo, a test is a tool to measure abilities or knowledge.\nHopefully, now you have a better understanding of what tests are all about.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
