    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:17.600\nWhat is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you test them by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:37.400\nIf it comes out clean, they're ready! In school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand the lessons.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:46.400\nThey can be multiple choice, short answer, or even projects. The goal isn't just to get a good grade, but to help you learn and grow.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:49.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.200\nA math test shows if you understand numbers and equations.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.600\nSee? Simple checks on what you've learned.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:08.900\nSo, a test is just a tool to see how much you know about a topic. It helps you and your teachers understand what you're doing well and where you might need some extra help.\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:12.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
