    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHello, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.900\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in this case, a test is simply a way to see if something works the way it should.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like checking if your bike tires have enough air. That's a test!\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:32.600\nBasically, a test helps you understand if something is true or false, right or wrong. For example, you might test if a light bulb works by screwing it in.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.100\nIf it lights up, the test passes! Or maybe you taste a new food to test if you like it.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:45.800\nYour reaction is the result of the test. So, a test is just a simple way to check something.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:54.400\nIt helps us learn and make sure things are working correctly. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
