    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's how we check if something is working correctly, or if we know something well enough.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:35.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, your teacher might give you a little quiz to test your knowledge.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:44.900\nThe quiz is just a way to see how much you've learned.\nSo, a test is basically a method to examine or evaluate something.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:56.700\nWhether it's a cake, your knowledge, or even a new toy, tests help us understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
