    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why they're important.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and then figuring out the answer.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it this way: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:39.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good! So, tests help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:45.800\nThey give us information we didn't have before. Remember, tests aren't always scary.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:51.200\nThey're just a tool for learning. That's it for this quick introduction to tests!\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:56.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
