    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You stick a toothpick in it, right? That's a test!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:25.600\nThe toothpick tells you if the cake is cooked all the way through.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:34.200\nAnother example: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy. They might check your temperature or listen to your heart.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.700\nThese tests give them information about your body. So, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:49.900\nIt's a way to check something and learn more about it. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
