    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\nIt helps us find out if something works, if something is true, or how well something performs.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like this: a taste test!\nYou try a new flavor of ice cream to test if you like it.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:41.100\nOr, imagine a doctor tests your temperature to see if you have a fever.\nTests can be used for lots of things, from checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in, to seeing how well you understand a new topic in school.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:51.500\nIt's all about gathering information and making sure things are working as they should.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:59.700\nIt gives us information to help us understand and improve things.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
