    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: you might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:34.000\nOr, you might use a ruler to test the length of a table. In science and technology, tests help us understand how things work.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:46.400\nWe might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better. Or, we could test a bridge to make sure it's strong enough to hold lots of cars.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:51.700\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and make sure things are safe. They\u2019re all about finding answers!\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.400\nNow you know the basics about tests. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
