    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE\nAll timings are approximate and may need slight adjustments.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:31.700\nIn school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand the things you\u2019re learning.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:41.900\nThey can be multiple choice, where you pick the best answer, or maybe you have to write out your answer in full sentences.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:50.300\nFor example, a math test might ask you what 2 + 2 equals. Or a science test might ask you to name the planets in our solar system.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.700\nTests aren\u2019t scary, they\u2019re just tools!\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:58.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check understanding. It helps you and others see what you know and what you might need to learn more about. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
