    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:17.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:25.400\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:34.900\nOr, think about a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:50.500\nTests can be simple, like that, or more complex, like a school exam. But the basic idea is the same: we're trying to learn something by gathering information.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:59.000\nWe perform the test, analyze the results, and then use that information to make a decision or understand something better. So, a test helps us learn, decide, and understand! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
