    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:14.400\nThink of a test as a way to check something. It could be checking if a light bulb works, or if you know your ABCs.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.600\nBasically, a test helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone has learned something.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:31.100\nFor example, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. A chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:43.100\nAnd in school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned. So, a test is just a simple way to check, assess, or evaluate something.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:53.800\nIt gives us information to help us make decisions or understand things better. Remember, tests are all around us, helping us every day!\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
