    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.399\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.399 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, a math test helps your teacher see how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:31.900\nOr, think about a taste test! Someone might try different flavors of ice cream to find out which one they like best.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:39.700\nAnother example is a test you might take at the doctor's office. They might check your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:56.100\nSo, whether it's in school, with food, or at the doctor, a test helps us gather information. In short, a test is a process used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even a preference.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:02.399\nIt\u2019s all about finding out information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
