    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, whether it was in school or maybe even just a quiz online.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:25.900\nBut what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:36.000\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb is good. You plug it in, and if it lights up, the test shows it works!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:46.700\nIn school, a test helps your teacher understand what you've learned. For example, a math test might ask you to solve problems to see if you understand addition.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.800\nOr a reading test might ask you questions about a story. So, remember, a test is just a way to check knowledge or function.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.300\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
