    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like checking if your food is cooked. You might poke it with a fork \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:30.700\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, where you're testing your knowledge.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.800\nOr they can be informal, like tasting a sauce to see if it needs more salt. That's a test too! You're testing the flavor.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:41.200\nAnother example: If your bike tire looks flat, you might push on it.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:51.300\nThat's testing if it has enough air. See? We use tests all the time to understand the world around us.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:59.300\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us confirm what we think is true, or discover something we didn\u2019t know.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
