    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:14.900\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.600\nIt's a process designed to give us results we can use to learn and understand.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:33.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:45.000\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to check your understanding of a topic. Even baking a cake is a test! You're testing the recipe to see if it works.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:52.700\nSo, a test helps us measure something, assess a situation, or confirm if something is true. It\u2019s all about gathering information.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.200\nRemember, tests are everywhere, helping us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
