    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:23.200\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:29.100\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:38.600\nAnother example is baking a cake. You might taste it \u2013 that\u2019s a test! \u2013 to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:45.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and understand something better. It helps us learn and make good decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
