    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_032552.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a structured process for gathering information.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:29.700\nOther tests are a little more formal.\nWhen you go to the doctor, they might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:39.100\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\nThese tests usually have questions or problems to solve.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:51.200\nThe important thing is that a test helps us understand something better, whether it's how well a cake is baking, how healthy you are, or how much you know about a subject.\n\n00:51.200 --> 01:01.200\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding things out!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
