    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:15.100\nAt its core, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\nYou poke one with a toothpick, right? That's a test!\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:35.200\nIn general, a test helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:44.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr, a taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:51.600\nTests can be simple, like checking the weather before you leave the house, or more complex, like medical tests to check your health.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:58.400\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\nThey help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:02.200\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to find out something important.\n```"
