    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.200\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we understand something well. Think of it like this: when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:29.200\nThat's a test! It tells you if the cake is done.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:33.200\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, your teacher might ask you to recite them.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:39.200\nThat's a test to see how well you know your letters.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:47.200\nTests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking if a bridge is safe to see if you've learned a new skill.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:50.200\nThey give us information and help us improve.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:54.200\nSo, a test is really just a way to get answers.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
