    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_032852.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is really just a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:27.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:35.000\nThink about it: When you try a new cookie recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.400\nOr, when you push a button on a remote, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:49.800\nSo, what does a test do? Well, it gives us information.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:57.900\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:02.100\nMaybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n```"
  },
