    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.700\nA test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done, so you stick a toothpick in. That's a test!\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:35.100\nIn the world of science and everyday life, tests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:43.500\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:51.900\nOr, you might test the water temperature before jumping in a pool.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:58.000\nLet's say you're building a tower of blocks.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:04.100\nEach time you add a block, you're testing if the tower will stay standing.\n\n01:04.100 --> 01:15.300\nIf it falls, you know you need to adjust something. Tests give us information!\n\n01:15.300 --> 01:18.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n01:18.900 --> 01:25.500\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:25.500 --> 01:29.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
