    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.600\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.500\nWe use tests all the time! For example, you might test if a new recipe is good by cooking it and tasting it.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:45.600\nOr, you might test if a toy car works by pushing it down a ramp. In school, you take tests to see how well you've learned a subject.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:51.800\nSo, whether it's trying out a new game, checking if the light switch works, or answering questions in a classroom, a test helps us understand things better.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:53.700\nIt gives us information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:55.300\nBasically, a test is a way to learn and explore!\n```"
