    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_033354.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:18.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:26.300\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:35.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:42.500\nYou test them by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:49.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test is passed \u2013 the cookies are ready!\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:55.500\nOr, maybe you're learning to ride a bike. Each time you try, you're testing your balance.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
