    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.300\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea, or using a tool to see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:28.500\nThe main idea behind a test is to get information. We want to know if something is true or false, right or wrong, good or bad.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:35.900\nIt helps us make decisions. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:43.300\nA medical test checks if you're healthy. And even tasting a cookie is a kind of test to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:53.600\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check something and get information about it. It helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
