    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:13.700\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\nTests help us measure or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, a product's quality, or even how well a recipe turned out.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:34.700\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\nA taste test helps decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\nAnd a stress test on a bridge makes sure it's safe and strong.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:41.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for gathering information.\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:49.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
