    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, a math test helps your teacher understand how well you understand numbers.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:29.500\nOr, think about a taste test! You try different foods to see which one you like best.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:39.700\nAnother example is a spelling test, which shows how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:52.400\nTests aren't always about grades, though. Sometimes they just help us learn more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:55.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a simple way to gather information and learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
