    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:14.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, right?\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:17.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:20.400\nHow do you find out? You test them!\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:26.200\nMaybe you poke them with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, they pass the test.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:32.200\nTests aren't just for cookies though. They can be used to check all sorts of things.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:38.200\nLike, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy, or a teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:45.900\nA simple test can be observing if water boils at 100 degrees Celsius.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:52.800\nSo, a test is just a way to find out if something is true, correct, or working as it should be.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:54.900\nBasically, testing is all about checking up on things!\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
