    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but instead of chemicals, we're often using questions or tasks.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:29.000\nThe main goal of a test is to get some information. This information can tell us how well someone understands a topic, or how good something is at doing a certain job.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:40.200\nFor example, a school test helps your teacher see what you\u2019ve learned in class. Or, think about testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:49.500\nThose are both tests! So, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:49.500 --> 01:00.000\nThey\u2019re super important in all sorts of fields. To recap, tests are all about finding things out, whether it's knowledge or ability.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:06.900\nThey give us data to make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
