    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:25.800\nIt's like an experiment or a series of questions designed to give you information.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:28.100\nThink about it like this:\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:34.300\na spelling test helps your teacher know how well you spell.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:36.600\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie you like best!\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:38.200\nSee? Both are tests.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:44.300\nAnother example is baking a cake. You test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:46.400\nIf it comes out clean, your cake is ready!\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:47.700\nThe toothpick is giving you information.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:53.200\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is just a tool we use to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:55.200\nIt helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
