    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:19.000\nBasically, a test is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you test a recipe to see if it tastes good,\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:26.000\nor you test a toy to make sure it's safe. In school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:34.400\nThey can come in all shapes and sizes. Maybe it's a multiple-choice quiz, or a fill-in-the-blank worksheet, or even just answering questions out loud.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:41.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A math test checks your math knowledge. See? Pretty straightforward.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:44.000\nSo, to recap, tests are simply tools we use\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:54.600\nto evaluate or check something, from recipes to your understanding of a subject. They help us learn and improve.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
