    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.100\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. It's how we find out if something works the way it's supposed to, or if something is true.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:35.600\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:45.700\nEven your parents test if the door is locked before leaving the house. So, tests are all around us!\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:58.900\nThey help us make sure things are accurate, safe, and working correctly. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned. Outside of school, tests help us make important decisions.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:04.500\nBasically, a test is a question, or a series of questions, designed to give us information.\n\n01:04.500 --> 01:08.000\nWe use that information to learn and improve.\n\n01:08.000 --> 01:11.600\nThat's tests in a nutshell! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
