    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.070\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.070 --> 00:06.070\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.070 --> 00:11.320\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skill, aptitude, or even physical ability.\n\n00:11.320 --> 00:14.420\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a check-up \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:14.420 --> 00:16.840\nThey're testing your health.\n\n00:16.840 --> 00:21.470\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:21.470 --> 00:24.890\nMaybe it's a quiz about animals, or a spelling test.\n\n00:24.890 --> 00:29.160\nThese tests help your teacher understand how well you understand the material.\n\n00:29.160 --> 00:33.600\nTests aren't just for school, though.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:36.990\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:36.990 --> 00:45.320\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to gather information or evaluate something.\n\n00:45.320 --> 00:52.140\nIt can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying out a new game.\n\n00:52.140 --> 00:58.900\nThe goal is always to learn something new or confirm what you already know.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
