    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.000\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:6.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:9.700\nThink of it like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:11.500\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:16.000\nFor example, a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:19.500\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:21.200\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:25.300\nThey're not just about grades or right and wrong answers.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:27.600\nThey're about gathering information.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:30.500\nWe use that information to learn and improve.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:34.200\nSo, a test is a tool that helps us measure and understand.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:36.600\nRemember, a test is just a way to learn!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:39.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "58c1bac9-cc9f-4f3e-9aee-9d6a6b15fb16": {
    "id": "58c1bac9-cc9f-4f3e-9aee-9d6a6b15fb16",
