    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:27.500\nThe toothpick comes out clean? The cake passes the test, it's ready! If it's gooey, well, it needs more time.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:35.100\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Your doctor gives you a check-up, that's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:44.900\nA teacher gives a quiz, that's a test to see what you've learned. So, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:54.100\nIt helps us understand things better and make decisions.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
