    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:23.200\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if we understand something. Think of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:34.700\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar. In school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:43.300\nSo, tests can be anything from a quick taste to a long exam. The important thing is they give us information.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:54.600\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. In short, a test is a check to see if something is correct or effective.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
