    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.100\nYou can test lots of things!\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:28.900\nA baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\nAnd in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:39.800\nSo, whether it's checking your temperature, tasting food, or answering questions on paper, a test helps us understand something better.\nIt's all about gathering information!\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:48.400\nTo recap, a test is a method used to discover or evaluate something.\nIt can take many forms, but the goal is always the same: to learn.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
