    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.100\nWhat is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:25.500\nIt's a process designed to gather information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:42.800\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to see if it needs more sugar \u2013 that\u2019s a test too!\nTests can be formal, like the quizzes you take in school, or informal, like checking if your bathwater is the right temperature.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:56.500\nThey all have the same basic purpose: to help us learn and understand something better.\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
