    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.700\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your lightbulb works, so you put it in a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:28.000\nThat's a test! We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:34.200\nDid you study for that quiz? The quiz itself is a test to see if you learned the material.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:40.000\nOr maybe you\u2019re baking a cake. You might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:45.800\nThat's a test too! So basically, a test is any procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:56.100\nIt helps us understand if things are working as expected, or if we need to make some changes. In short, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
