    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like asking questions to learn more. For example, a spelling test helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:32.300\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite. Tests can be used in lots of different situations!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:41.400\nAnother example, a doctor might use a test to see if you're healthy. They might check your temperature, or listen to your heartbeat.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:49.400\nThese are all types of tests! So, remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:57.600\nIt helps us learn, evaluate, and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
