    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.799\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.799 --> 00:12.199\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.199 --> 00:24.999\nIt's a process that helps us understand, measure, or evaluate something.\n\n00:24.999 --> 00:36.199\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to check your health. Or, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:36.199 --> 00:48.199\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if something is sweet or sour. A spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:48.199 --> 01:00.199\nTests come in many forms, but the basic idea is always the same: to gather information.\n\n01:00.199 --> 01:06.799\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure used to gain knowledge or assess something.\n\n01:06.799 --> 01:10.299\nIt helps us learn, understand, and make better decisions.\n\n01:10.299 --> 01:13.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
