    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.700\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:05.300\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:09.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:12.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:15.800\nYou poke it with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:19.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test, it's done.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:22.900\nTests aren't just for baking, though.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:26.000\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:30.300\nOr a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:33.000\nIn each case, the test is designed to provide information.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:39.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a process designed to gather information about something.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:44.700\nIt could be about a cake, your health, or even your knowledge!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
