    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_042137.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.700\nWhat are they and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:24.300\nIt helps you and others see what you've learned and where you might need some extra practice.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: imagine you're learning to bake a cake.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:43.600\nThe recipe is like the information you're learning. The act of baking the cake and then tasting it? That's the test! It shows if you understood the recipe and followed the instructions correctly.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:50.700\nTests can come in many forms, like multiple choice questions, short answers, or even performing a task. The important thing is they give us feedback.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:57.300\nThey tell us what we're doing well and what we need to work on. So, tests are really just a tool for learning and improvement.\n\n00:57.300 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
