    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE: The subtitles are estimated and might not be perfectly aligned with the audio.  Adjust timings as necessary.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:18.900\nThink of it as a mini-experiment. You're trying to get information!\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:31.300\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. See? Tests aren't always scary!\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:34.500\nThey can be used to check if something works, like testing a new toy to see if it actually does what it's supposed to.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:42.400\nThe most important thing is that a test gives you data, which is just a fancy word for information, that you can use to learn and improve.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:49.600\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information. It can be about anything!\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:59.100\nAnd that information helps us understand the world better.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:06.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
