    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_042741.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.500\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge, your skill, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:13.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:17.800\nOr, a taste test might see which cookie someone likes best.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:22.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.000\nFor example, you might take a multiple-choice test in school, or a mechanic might run a diagnostic test on your car to see what's wrong.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:29.200\nSee? Different things, same idea: finding something out.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:34.500\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and making an assessment.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:37.800\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:40.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
