    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:21.700\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see what's happening.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:28.700\nThink about it like this: a cookie recipe is a test. You follow the instructions and see if you get a delicious cookie.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:35.600\nOr, imagine a light switch. Flipping it is a test to see if the light turns on.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:42.500\nAnother example is checking the weather forecast. It's a test to see if you need an umbrella.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:49.200\nWe use tests all the time without even realizing it!\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:56.000\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to find something out, whether it's about cookies, lights, or the weather.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.000\nIt helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
