    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.500\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It could be about your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is cooked, you might poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:33.300\nOr, if you want to know if you understand a math problem, you might try to solve it. Again, that's a test.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:44.100\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. There are quizzes in school, taste tests for new foods, and even medical tests to check your health.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:55.400\nThey all share the same goal: to give us information. So, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:58.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
