    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:27.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate, assess, or measure knowledge, ability, or even performance. Think of it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:40.700\nOr, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. A test can be a quiz, an exam, a survey, or even just observing something closely.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:47.700\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:55.200\nThey can help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions. Tests really are all around us!\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
