    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.200\nAt its core, a test is simply a way to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain! Tests can come in many forms: multiple choice questions, short answers, even practical demonstrations.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:33.200\nThe goal is always the same: to measure your knowledge or skills. For example, a spelling test checks your understanding of how to spell words.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:39.000\nA math test assesses your ability to solve equations.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:44.800\nAnd a cooking test? Well, that shows if you can actually whip up a delicious meal!\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:53.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you and your teachers see what you've learned and where you might need some extra help.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:59.300\nIt's a learning opportunity! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
