    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:20.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking, right?\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:33.400\nYou use a toothpick. That toothpick is performing a test! The test tells you if the cake is ready. Other tests can tell you if you understand a lesson at school, if your car is working properly, or even if you have a certain illness.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:40.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know spelling. A blood test checks your health.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:42.700\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:54.200\nSo, in short, a test is a tool we use to get information. It helps us learn, diagnose, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
