    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand more.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:21.300\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think about tasting a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:25.200\nThat's a test! You're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:29.100\nOr, imagine checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:36.100\nYou're testing the lightbulb. Tests can also be more formal, like a quiz in school.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:44.300\nThat test helps your teacher see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:50.900\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:53.400\nIt's all about discovery! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "34a5978c-ebf3-41bc-a2dd-0ec1efa4cccf": {
    "id": "34a5978c-ebf3-41bc-a2dd-0ec1efa4cccf",
