    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_045001.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 01:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:17.400\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well someone understands a topic. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:23.400\nOr, imagine baking a cake \u2013 you taste it to test if it's sweet enough. That taste is a test!\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.500\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, true or false, or even essay questions.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:41.100\nAll of them are designed to test your knowledge. So, a test is just a method for gathering information and checking understanding.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:47.400\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:50.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "15b24a0f-95dd-4ee8-ab16-211c4e6f8f2c": {
    "id": "15b24a0f-95dd-4ee8-ab16-211c4e6f8f2c",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
