    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:15.900\nThink of a test as a way to check what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:24.700\nIt's like a mini-investigation to get some answers.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:33.500\nThe basic idea is simple: you ask a question, or you give something a task, and then you see what happens.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:40.100\nThe result helps you understand things better. For example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:47.700\nOr, if you're baking a cake, tasting it is a test to see if you need more sugar. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:57.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn. It helps us understand things better, whether it's our own knowledge or how well something performs. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
