    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:18.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:31.400\nIt could be checking if something is working correctly, or checking how much you know about a subject.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:36.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:40.800\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:45.500\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:55.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Some are short and simple, like checking if a lightbulb turns on. Others are long and complicated, like a school exam.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:56.600\nBut the main idea is always the same: to find out something specific.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n```"
