    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.200\nWhat are they, exactly? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:19.900\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or how well we understand something.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like this: Your mom tests the oven temperature before baking a cake to make sure it's hot enough.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:34.900\nOr a doctor runs tests to figure out what's making you feel sick. Even your school exams are tests to see how much you've learned!\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.700\nSo, a test can be a physical check, like testing a battery to see if it has power. Or it can be a series of questions, like that exam we talked about.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:53.400\nThe main goal is always the same: to get some information. Basically, a test is any way to gather information.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:59.300\nThat's tests in a nutshell!\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:05.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
