    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_045637.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.830\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.830 --> 00:05.340\nYou've probably taken a test before, maybe in school.\n\n00:05.340 --> 00:06.880\nBut what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.880 --> 00:12.890\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:12.890 --> 00:19.310\nThink of it like this: imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:19.310 --> 00:24.300\nA test could be seeing if you can ride all the way down the street without falling.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:29.270\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, a test might be naming all the letters correctly.\n\n00:29.270 --> 00:35.170\nTests aren't just about grades!\n\n00:35.170 --> 00:40.370\nThey help us see what we've learned and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:40.370 --> 00:42.980\nThey're a tool for learning and growth.\n\n00:42.980 --> 00:48.740\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check your knowledge or skills in a specific area.\n\n00:48.740 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
