    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_050019.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:11.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:21.100\nIt's a method we use to get information. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:30.100\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt. Even checking if a lightbulb works is a kind of test!\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:42.400\nTests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying a new recipe. The main idea is that you're doing something to learn or confirm something.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:47.600\nSo, a test is a process for gathering information or checking something out.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:52.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
