    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:16.600\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:25.900\nIs the lightbulb working? Is this cake sweet enough? You're performing a test to get the answer.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:32.900\nBasically, a test involves checking something against a standard or expectation.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:39.900\nIf the lightbulb lights up, the test passes! If the cake tastes good, the test passes!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:46.900\nLet\u2019s say you're testing if a toy car can roll down a ramp.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:51.800\nYou put the car at the top, let it go, and see if it reaches the bottom.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:56.700\nThat's a test! Or maybe you're testing if you know your ABCs.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:02.100\nSomeone asks you the alphabet, and you say it.\n\n01:02.100 --> 01:07.500\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check something and see if it meets a certain condition.\n\n01:07.500 --> 01:13.300\nIt's all about finding out the answer to a question.\n\n01:13.300 --> 01:15.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
