    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_050351.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:35.300\nOr, a taste test might see which cookie people like best. Tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:43.700\nFor example, a doctor might order a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:50.900\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see if you understand the lesson. Even trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:57.300\nSo, tests are everywhere! They help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us. They give us information we can use. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
