    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.000\nIt's a process, a procedure, or even just a question we ask to gather information.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:33.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see what you've learned.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:45.000\nOr, you might even test the temperature of your bath water to make sure it's just right.\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:52.300\nThey help us understand things better, make informed decisions, and learn new things.\nIn short, a test is a tool for finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
