    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_050649.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like this: a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it works. Or a teacher might give a test to see how well their students understand a subject.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:33.900\nTests aren't just about grades or right and wrong answers, though. They help us learn and improve.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:41.500\nFor example, if you take a spelling test and miss a few words, you now know what you need to practice.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:52.200\nTests help us understand where we are and what we need to work on. So, tests are a useful tool for learning and progress in all areas of life.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
