    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:05.000\nWhat is a test anyway?\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:08.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:08.300 --> 00:10.500\nIt's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:17.100\nThink about it like this: a scientist might test if a new medicine works.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:23.000\nThey give the medicine to some people and not to others, and then see if the people who got the medicine get better.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:27.800\nOr, imagine baking a cake.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:32.000\nYou might test if the oven is hot enough by putting your hand near it \u2013 carefully, of course!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:37.400\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:41.700\nWe ask a question, do something, and then look at the results.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:44.000\nThat's testing in a nutshell!\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:47.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
