    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. \n\n00:14.300 --> 00:25.000\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:28.000\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:37.300\nAnother example? Baking a cake! You're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:48.800\nThe outcome, the taste, tells you if you followed the recipe correctly. So, a test is really just a procedure or a method used to gather information.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:57.400\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, or evaluate something. It could be a medical test, a school test, or even testing out a new video game.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:01.100\nThat's the core idea! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
