    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, that\u2019s a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:35.300\nOr, if you push a door to see if it opens, that's a test to see if it's unlocked.\nIn schools, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:46.900\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and answer a question.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:53.900\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
