    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:19.900\nIt could be about anything! Think of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:31.800\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Even baking a cake is kind of a test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:38.600\nTests help us learn and improve. They give us information so we can understand things better.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:48.900\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to gather information. It\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:52.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
