    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:18.700\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:28.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A taste test tells you if you like a certain flavor.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:39.500\nEven a medical test can tell you if you're healthy! We use tests all the time, in school, at the doctor's, even when trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:51.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
