    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like this: you take a quiz in school to test your understanding of a lesson.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:41.200\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar. So, tests aren't just for classrooms! They're used everywhere.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:49.300\nDoctors use tests to check your health, engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe, and even video game designers test their games to make sure they're fun to play.\n\n00:49.300 --> 01:01.000\nBasically, a test helps us learn and improve. It gives us information we can use to make things better.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:12.700\nWhether it's your knowledge of a subject, the quality of a product, or even your own health.\n\n01:12.700 --> 01:19.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It\u2019s a helpful tool for learning and improvement.\n\n01:19.500 --> 01:26.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
