    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_051636.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:18.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done. You poke it with a toothpick, right? That's a test!\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:24.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:29.500\nAnother example is a spelling test. It helps you see if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:35.700\nOr even trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:45.600\nSo, a test is just a method or procedure for determining something. It can be as simple as tasting food or as complex as a big exam.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:48.900\nThe main idea is to learn something new!\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:52.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
