    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests! A test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.700\nThink of it like a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:26.200\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time. For example, when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:42.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, before buying a new pair of shoes, you try them on to test if they fit comfortably.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:53.400\nSo, a test helps us understand if something is working correctly, is good enough, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:53.400 --> 01:01.200\nWe use tests to gather information and make decisions based on that information. They're useful for confirming assumptions and making sure things are as they should be. In short, a test is a way to check if something is okay. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
