    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:20.600\nIt's a process we use to gather information. Think about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:31.500\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject. And even baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you check if it's done by poking it with a toothpick!\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:41.000\nTests can be formal, like a multiple-choice exam, or informal, like tasting a soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:52.900\nThe key thing is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm what we already suspect. So, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
