    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.300 --> 00:02.400\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:02.800 --> 00:04.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:06.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:08.900\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a topic.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:12.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:17.000\nOr, when you're learning to ride a bike, falling down is a kind of test \u2013 it shows you what not to do.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:21.300\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:24.700\nThey might be multiple choice, or asking you to write an answer.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:27.900\nThe point is to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:32.300\nSo, tests help us measure things, learn from mistakes, and see how far we\u2019ve come.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:34.800\nThey're a valuable tool for understanding!\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:37.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
