    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.200\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:18.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something, or someone!\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like this: you're trying to learn about a new plant.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:25.800\nYou might water it differently, or put it in a sunnier spot.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:29.200\nThat\u2019s a test! You\u2019re seeing what happens.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:37.400\nTests aren't just for plants. They're used everywhere. A doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:48.000\nYour teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. Even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:60.300\nSo, a test is just an experiment or a way to gather information. It helps us learn, understand, and make better decisions. They can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying a new snack.\n\n00:60.300 --> 00:63.700\nThe main goal is to gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
