    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:17.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s a process we use to gather information or evaluate something's qualities or performance.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:24.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher understand how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:36.300\nOr, imagine a chef tasting a soup; that's a test to see if it needs more salt. Even checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in is a quick test!\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:52.000\nSo, tests come in many forms, from quizzes and exams to simple observations and experiments. The goal is always the same: to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:59.000\nBasically, a test is a way to check things out and get answers.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
