    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.200\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, you're constantly testing your balance.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:31.000\nHere's another example.\nA doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:39.800\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to test what you've learned in class.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:50.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something holds up.\nIt's a tool we use to learn and understand things better.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
