    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:14.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.700\nFor example, you might take a math test at school to see how well you understand addition and subtraction. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:26.700\nSee? Different types of tests, but they all help us learn something.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:39.400\nAnother example: When you bake a cake, you might taste a little bit of the batter to test if it needs more sugar! So, a test is really just a method to gather information or confirm something.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:55.000\nWhether it's in school, at the doctor's office, or even in the kitchen, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
