    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_053148.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.700\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:27.000\nIt's like a little experiment to see if something works, or if something is true.\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:40.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nOr, a doctor might test your eyesight to see if you need glasses.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:49.700\nTests can be anything from a simple yes or no question, to a more complicated series of steps.\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:58.000\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
