    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:15.200\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.200\nThat's a test! In science, tests help us see if something is true or works the way we think it should.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:32.400\nFor example, imagine you're planting seeds. You might test different types of soil to see which one helps the seeds grow best.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:40.500\nYou plant some seeds in one type of soil, and some in another. Then you observe and compare the results. That's a simple test!\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:52.200\nSo, to sum it up, a test is just a way of checking something to see if it works or if it's true. We use them every day, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
