    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_053327.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.100\nToday, we're going to talk about tests. \n\n00:12.100 --> 00:20.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:31.500\nIt's a process to find out if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:35.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a physical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:40.200\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:52.500\nEven baking a cake involves a test! Does it taste good? Does it look right? Tests help us learn and improve. They give us information to make better decisions.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:55.500\nSo, a test is just a way of checking something, whether it's your health, your knowledge, or even a recipe.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
