    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:34.500\nFor example, your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:44.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:53.400\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's our health, our knowledge, or even if a cake is delicious. They provide information we can use.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:56.900\nBasically, a test is just a structured way of getting information about something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
