    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like an investigation. You're trying to learn more about something by asking questions or performing actions.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:30.400\nFor example, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Or, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:39.000\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test! You're testing the recipe and your skills to see if you can make something delicious.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:50.300\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see how things are. It helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
