    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:32.900\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:39.100\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works, you screw it into a lamp. If it lights up, it passes the test.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:46.900\nTests aren't just for baking or lightbulbs, though. They help us understand lots of things, from checking if a medicine is safe to making sure a building is strong.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:56.400\nSo remember, a test is just a way to get information and learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
