    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think about it like this: your mom might test the temperature of your forehead to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:27.600\nThat's a test!\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:34.200\nOr, imagine baking a cake. You might stick a toothpick in it to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:39.700\nThat's testing if the cake is done. In school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:47.000\nThey're a way to check your understanding. So, remember, a test is just a way of checking something, whether it's your temperature, a cake, or what you know in class.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
