    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_054022.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.900\nThink of a test as a way to check something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:24.800\nIt could be checking if you understand a lesson, like a quiz in school.\nOr, it could be checking if something works correctly, like a doctor testing your reflexes.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:37.700\nThe main idea behind a test is to get information.\nThis information helps us understand if something is good, bad, working, or not working.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:46.900\nFor example, a spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\nA taste test lets you decide if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:57.000\nAnd a simple battery test tells if your batteries still have power.\nSo, tests help us learn, decide, and make sure things are in order.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:02.700\nThey give us valuable information to work with. That's the basics of tests!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
