    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\nIt helps us understand more about it.\n\n00:15.100 --> 025.100\nThink of it like this: you take a test in school to show your teacher what you've learned.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\nBoth are tests!\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:28.300\nAnother example?\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:35.900\nYou might test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\nThe recipe is being tested to see if it works.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.000\nSo, a test is really just a procedure or a set of questions designed to gather information and evaluate something.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:48.800\nIt's a simple way to learn and improve.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:51.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
