    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_054412.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nWell, in a nutshell, a test is simply a way to find something out.\nIt\u2019s a process we use to check if something is true, working, or accurate.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:31.800\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:42.500\nThat taste is a test!\nTests can be formal, like a science experiment with lots of steps.\nOr they can be informal, like quickly checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:57.500\nThe important thing is, they help us gather information and make decisions.\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school or checking the temperature outside, remember that a test is just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
