    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:19.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something, or to see how well you know something.\nThink of it like a question or a series of questions, designed to give you a measure of your understanding.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:30.200\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you can spell words.\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:37.200\nEven a simple quiz at the end of a chapter is a type of test!\nIt just helps you see what you've learned.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:50.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check knowledge or find out information.\nIt can be big or small, easy or hard, but it always has a purpose.\nIt\u2019s a tool for learning!\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:55.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
