    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something works correctly, or to see how well something performs.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your new toy car will go down the ramp. You put it at the top and let it go \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:28.700\nTests help us find problems and make things better.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:38.400\nImagine baking a cake. You taste it to see if it's sweet enough \u2013 that's a taste test!\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:48.100\nOr, a doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:55.800\nSo, tests can be big or small, simple or complicated, but they all have the same purpose: to learn something. They help us understand how things work and improve them. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
