    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer. In science, we use tests to see if our ideas are correct.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:34.000\nFor example, if you think a plant needs sunlight to grow, you could test that by putting one plant in the sun and another in the dark.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:39.900\nSee what happens! Or, imagine you want to know if a new toy is durable.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:52.700\nYou could test it by playing with it really hard and seeing if it breaks. So, a test helps us learn, prove things, and make sure things work the way we expect. It\u2019s all about exploring and finding out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
