    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_055810.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE\nAll timings are approximate.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary in school, but really, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:26.100\nIt's a process that helps us learn more about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:31.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:37.700\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:47.700\nSee? Tests are everywhere! They help us check something and see if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:57.900\nMaybe you test out a new toy to see if it works. Or, your parents might test the temperature of your bathwater to make sure it's not too hot.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:03.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a method used to determine something.\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:07.900\nIt helps us evaluate and understand different things around us.\n\n01:07.900 --> 01:12.000\nIt's all about learning and checking!\n\n01:12.000 --> 01:17.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
