    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:20.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out information about something.\nIt could be a test to see if you understand a topic, like this video, or even a test to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:31.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:43.000\nThe test gives them data to make a decision.\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes, from simple multiple-choice questions to experiments in a lab.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:52.800\nThe key is that they give us information.\nSo, remember, a test is a tool for gathering knowledge and making informed choices.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
