    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_060030.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:14.900\nIt's a structured process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: a recipe test tells you if a cake will turn out yummy.\nA medical test helps doctors understand what\u2019s going on inside your body.\nAnd a school test shows your teacher how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:28.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr, a driving test sees if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:33.100\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big exams.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:37.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:39.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
