    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.000\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.000\nSo, you screw it into a lamp and turn it on.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:29.400\nBasically, you're giving something a task or a challenge to see how it performs.\nMaybe you want to test how fast you can run.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:35.600\nYou would time yourself running a certain distance.\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:43.900\nYou might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:55.600\nSo, a test is just a process to evaluate or examine something.\nIt can be a physical action, a question, or even a scientific experiment.\n\n00:55.600 --> 01:02.000\nIt's all about finding out information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
