    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.900\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, but what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:28.600\nIt helps us measure knowledge, skills, or abilities. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:38.700\nA taste test helps decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest. Even a doctor uses tests to understand what's happening inside your body!\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:49.600\nSo, tests help us learn and improve. For example, a short quiz at the end of a lesson is a test to see if you understood the main points.\n\n00:49.600 --> 01:03.100\nOr, a simple experiment in science class is a test to see if your hypothesis is correct. So, to recap, a test is a tool used to gather information and measure something.\n\n01:03.100 --> 01:11.800\nThey come in many forms and help us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
