    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance in a specific area.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:35.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you can spell words.\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:48.900\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you have a fever.\nSo, tests help us understand things \u2013 about ourselves, about products, about pretty much anything!\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:54.300\nThey give us information we can use to learn and make decisions. Remember, tests are just tools.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.900\nThey're not scary, they're helpful! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
