    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.000\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in general, a test is just a way to see if something works like it's supposed to.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:22.500\nThink about it. When you bake a cake, you might taste a little bit to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:33.100\nOr, if you buy a new toy, you test it out to see if all the buttons work. In science, we use tests to learn about the world.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:40.400\nFor example, we might test different fertilizers on plants to see which one makes them grow the tallest.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:51.300\nOr test different materials to see what's the strongest. So, a test is really just a way to check something, try something out, and see what happens.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:57.600\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
