    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:19.700\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, that helps us learn more about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:29.600\nThe main idea behind any test is to get some kind of information.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:38.100\nFor example, a doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:42.300\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to show what you\u2019ve learned in class.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:47.300\nAnother example is testing a new recipe.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:56.500\nYou taste it to see if it needs more salt or pepper.\nSee? You're testing!\nSo, tests help us understand things better.\nThey give us information we can use to make decisions or learn more.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.000\nRemember, a test is just a way to find out something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
