    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.700\nIt helps us understand if something is true, or if something works the way we expect it to.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:38.800\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:48.800\nOr, imagine you're testing a new toy to see if it's fun. You play with it, and if you enjoy it, the toy passes the \"fun\" test.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:59.100\nTests are everywhere! From checking if your shoes fit to seeing if you remember what you learned in class, tests help us learn and improve.\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something and see if it meets our expectations. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
