    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE duration:58.2\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to measure your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:29.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\nOr, when a chef tastes a dish, that's a test to see if it's seasoned correctly.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:40.100\nEven your doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature, to understand your health.\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:49.100\nIt helps us learn and understand things better, whether it's about ourselves, our work, or the world around us.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:54.600\nIt gives us information to improve!\nThat's the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
