    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:18.100\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a light bulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:41.200\nThe light either turns on or it doesn't - that's your test!\nTests help us figure out if things are working as expected, or if something needs fixing.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:51.500\nFor example, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, before you buy a used car, you might take it for a test drive to make sure it runs smoothly.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:57.600\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or works the way it's supposed to.\nIt\u2019s all about finding out the truth!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
