    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_062045.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:27.600\nIt's like an investigation. Think of it as a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or even your abilities.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:33.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:44.500\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is the yummiest. And a fitness test can tell you how strong you are. Tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:50.600\nThey show us what we already know and what we need to work on. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a tool for learning and discovering. It's all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
