    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_062128.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: when you take a spelling quiz, that's a test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:35.400\nOr, if a doctor checks your reflexes, that's a test to see how your nervous system is working.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:47.500\nEven baking a cake is a test! You're testing your recipe and your baking skills.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:55.800\nSo, a test can be formal, like an exam at school, or informal, like trying a new recipe. The main idea is to gather information and see where you stand.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.500\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
