    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_062217.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:21.400\nWe use them all the time! Think about it: a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:28.800\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream is the tastiest.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:35.300\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a kind of test!\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:45.600\nSo, tests help us gather information. They can measure knowledge, like in a school test.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:54.700\nOr they can measure preferences, like in a survey. And, of course, they can check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:03.800\nFor example, your doctor might run tests to see if you\u2019re healthy. Or a mechanic might test your car to find out what\u2019s wrong with it.\n\n01:03.800 --> 01:08.900\nBasically, a test is just a tool for learning something new.\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:14.900\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all help us understand the world a little better.\n\n01:14.900 --> 01:17.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
