    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nEver wonder what a test actually is?\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:16.500\nIt's a method for gathering information, kind of like being a detective!\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:20.000\nTests help us understand more about ourselves, about objects, or even about ideas.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:23.500\nThink about it: a taste test lets you find out which flavor you like best.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:26.000\nA spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:29.500\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:37.500\nSo, whether it's figuring out your favorite ice cream or checking if a bridge is strong enough, tests are all about learning and discovering.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:42.500\nThey give us answers and help us make better decisions.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:46.000\nIn short, a test is just a tool to learn something new.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
