    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:22.700\nIt's a process we use to check if something is working, or if something is true.\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a physical test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might bake a cake and do a taste test to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.100\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\nSo, a test can be anything from a simple observation to a more formal exam.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:46.700\nThe important thing is that it's a way to gather information and make a decision based on that information.\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:53.500\nTo sum it up, a test is a method of checking something.\nIt helps us understand, diagnose, and evaluate.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
