    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.899\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:32.200\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:37.799\nOr when a doctor checks your temperature, they're testing if you have a fever.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:43.399\nTests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:49.000\nImagine you're baking cookies.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:51.299\nYou test the batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:57.000\nOr, think about a video game \u2013 each level is a test of your skills. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:03.899\nSo, remember, a test is a method for finding something out.\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:06.999\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n01:07.000 --> 01:09.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
