    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.000\nIt's a process we use to check if something is working, if something is true, or to see what someone knows.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:33.200\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, if you're learning a new language, you might take a test to see how well you understand the vocabulary.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:39.900\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test! You're testing your recipe and your baking skills.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:46.600\nSo, tests help us learn and improve. They give us information that we can use to make better decisions.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:56.800\nTo recap, a test is a method used to gain information about something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
