    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:27.300\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a topic.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:35.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:46.300\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned. A test usually involves answering questions or performing tasks.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:55.500\nThe results tell us something specific. For example, a baking test might involve following a recipe to see if you can make a cake. Or a spelling test checks if you know how to write words correctly. So, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn more! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
