    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific goal in mind.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:28.200\nWe use tests every day, even if you don't realize it!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:35.200\nFor example, when you try a new food, that's a test!\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:41.700\nYou're testing to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:44.800\nOr, when you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:48.400\nThe result of the test tells you something.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:51.300\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:54.400\nIn science, tests help researchers discover new things.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:57.600\nNo matter what, a test gives you information.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.400\nSo remember, a test is just a way to learn more!\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:04.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
