    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:23.700\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are baked enough.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:36.500\nYou do a simple test \u2013 you poke one with a toothpick.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:42.300\nIf it comes out clean, your cookies pass the test!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:48.100\nIf it's gooey, they need more time.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:54.800\nOr imagine you're checking if a lightbulb works.\n```"
