    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more about the thing you're testing.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:25.900\nThink about it this way: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words. Or a taste test tells you which snack you like better.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:41.500\nEven when you try out a new recipe, that's a test to see if you can cook it! Tests can be as simple as checking if a light bulb works by flipping the switch, or as complex as a doctor running bloodwork to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:50.900\nThe important thing is that a test gives you information. So, remember, a test is just a way of learning something new.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:54.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
