    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.800\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:26.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:41.000\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something. And when you try to turn on a light switch, that's a test to see if the light bulb works.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:51.600\nSo, tests help us learn what we know, what we like, and if things are working the way they should. They can be simple or complex, but they all have the same basic purpose: to check something out!\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.300\nThat's the fundamental idea of a test. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
