    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_063529.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:25.900\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance. Think about it like this: a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:35.600\nOr, a doctor might check your temperature to test for a fever. In school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:42.400\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even projects! So, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:49.200\nIt helps us understand where we are, and what we might need to learn next.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:56.900\nIt's all about learning and growing! To recap, a test is a way to evaluate something, it can take many forms, and it helps us learn.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:02.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
