    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_063613.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.500\nIt's a process, or a procedure, designed to give us information.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:35.900\nThink of it like this: a taste test tells you if you like a food.\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.400\nTests can be anything from a simple quiz to a complex scientific experiment.\nThey all have the same goal: to answer a question or learn something new.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:57.100\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and answer questions.\nIt's a valuable tool we use to learn and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
