    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_064139.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to learn about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like this: you want to see if your cookies are done baking. You do a test \u2013 you poke them with a toothpick!\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:30.000\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time. A doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:36.700\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:45.200\nA simple test could be tasting a soup to see if it needs more salt. So, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:53.600\nIt helps us understand if something is working, if something is correct, or if something needs to be changed. Remember, tests are all about checking things! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
