    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.370\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:01.370 --> 00:03.930\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:03.930 --> 00:07.940\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:07.940 --> 00:11.790\nThink of it like this: you\u2019re trying to figure out if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:11.790 --> 00:12.800\nThat's a test!\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:16.160\nMaybe you want to see if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:16.160 --> 00:18.950\nYou poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, that\u2019s a test, showing the cake is ready.\n\n00:18.950 --> 00:22.360\nTests come in many forms, from quizzes in school to medical exams.\n\n00:22.360 --> 00:26.770\nThey help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:26.770 --> 00:28.280\nSo, a test is just a simple way to check something out!\n\n00:28.280 --> 00:30.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
