    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:11.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:19.400\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how something works, or how well someone understands something.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:29.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, your teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:36.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:47.300\nSo, tests help us learn, evaluate, and understand. They're a really useful tool in all sorts of situations.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:51.900\nRemember, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
