    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_064550.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:21.300\nIt could be anything! Think about it: a taste test tells you how something tastes.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:31.600\nA spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words. Even checking if a lightbulb works is a test to see if it's still good.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:47.200\nSo, a test uses questions or procedures to help us learn more. It helps us understand qualities, abilities, or knowledge about something.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:56.600\nBasically, if you're trying to figure something out by asking questions or trying something out, you're probably doing a test! We use tests every day, even without realizing it.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:05.100\nTo recap: a test is a way to get information about something. It involves asking questions or performing actions to learn more. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
