    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_064635.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:17.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:21.700\nYou poke it with a toothpick, right? That's a test!\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:36.700\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning. They can be written quizzes, like multiple choice questions, or even practical tasks, like building a model.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:45.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test checks if you can solve problems.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:59.400\nSo, to recap, a test is just a tool for figuring something out. Whether it's checking if a cake is baked or seeing what you've learned in class, tests help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
