    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:07.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:14.100\nWhether it's checking if a cake is cooked, seeing how well you understand a new topic, or figuring out if a lightbulb still works.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:17.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if the cake is ready.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:20.800\nYou poke it with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:25.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test says the cake is done.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:29.900\nOr, let's say you're learning about animals.\nA quiz about animal names\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:32.800\nis a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:40.700\nSo, a test is just a method, an action, to give you some information.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:45.700\nIt can be simple, like poking a cake, or more complex, like a school exam.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:48.500\nThe goal is always the same: to learn something!\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
