    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.900\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\nThink about it like this:\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:34.400\nyour doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might test a cake to see if it's done baking by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:44.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\nTests can be big, like a final exam in school, or small, like checking if your phone is charged before you leave the house.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:56.100\nThe key is that they give you information.\nSo, a test is a method for gathering information to see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:01.800\nPretty straightforward, right?\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
