    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:35.700\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if you like it. Or, if you press a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb still works.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:51.000\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just class projects.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:57.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something is true, working, or understood. It's about learning and finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
