    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_065142.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.700\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and looking for an answer.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\nYou can do a test!\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:27.000\nYou stick a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you the cake is ready.\nIf it's gooey, it needs more time.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:34.000\nOr imagine you\u2019re checking if your bicycle tires have enough air.\nYou can squeeze them!\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:39.000\nIf they feel firm, they pass the test.\nIf they\u2019re squishy, they need air.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:47.100\nSo, a test is just a method to check something and get information.\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:54.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
