    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.899\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. We use tests all the time without even realizing it!\n\n00:19.899 --> 00:30.500\nThink about it: you bake a cake and taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it's good. Or, you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit. That's a test too!\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:36.600\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:47.900\nThey can be written questions, or even a project. So, a test is just a method to check something, learn something, or prove something.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:57.100\nFrom baking to learning, tests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "da18e8a5-78df-44c7-b14a-c1474ef7e4b4": {
    "id": "da18e8a5-78df-44c7-b14a-c1474ef7e4b4",
