    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_065355.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:06.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:12.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think of it like checking if the water's hot before you get in the shower.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:13.600\nThat's a test!\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:20.600\nMore formally, a test is a process or procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:25.800\nThat something could be anything: your knowledge, a product's quality, or even the strength of a material.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:31.300\nFor example, a spelling quiz is a test of your spelling skills.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:38.300\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:42.900\nSee? Tests are everywhere, helping us understand and improve things.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:49.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and make a judgment.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.300\nIt\u2019s a simple concept, but a really important one.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
