    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.200\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:05.200\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:10.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find something out.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:18.000\nIt's a process for gathering information to see if something is true or works the way it should.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.000\nOr, a chef might taste their soup \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.000\nAnother example is a lightbulb. Before selling it, the company will test it to make sure it lights up.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:40.000\nTests help us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:47.000\nSo, remember, a test is a method of gathering information to evaluate or prove something.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:50.000\nIt's all about finding out the truth!\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
