    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_065615.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about you or something else.\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.100\nOr, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:48.600\nAnother example: You can test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\nSo, to recap, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:52.200\nIt helps us understand things better, whether it's about our health, our knowledge, or even a delicious cake.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "158ac12c-a608-4b3f-8574-2d3556201610": {
    "id": "158ac12c-a608-4b3f-8574-2d3556201610",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T13:59:45.968088",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-03T06:56:58.423903",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260103_065658.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_065658.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests, and what they're all about.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:14.800\nBasically, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something. Think of it like checking your knowledge!\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.400\nIt helps you and others see what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:34.300\nTests can come in many forms. It could be answering questions on paper, like a multiple choice quiz. Or, it could be showing someone you can do something, like riding a bike.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:43.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words. A math test checks if you can solve problems.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:54.000\nEven baking a cake can be a test of your cooking skills! So, to sum it up, a test is just a way to measure your understanding or ability.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:59.900\nIt helps you learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
