    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:35.500\nWhen you try a new cookie recipe, that's a test to see if you like it. Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you can balance.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:44.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:50.600\nThey might ask you questions about a book you read or give you a math problem to solve. The answers you give show what you understand.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.100\nSo, a test is just a tool to check understanding. It helps us learn and grow! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
