    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:25.000\nIt helps us learn more about a person, an object, or even an idea. Think of it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:32.700\nOr, imagine testing a toy car to see how fast it can go. We give it a push and measure the distance.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:39.500\nTests aren't just for school, though. Scientists use tests to see if a new medicine works.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:46.300\nChefs test their recipes to make sure they taste delicious.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:55.800\nSo, a test is a method to gather information and measure something. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:02.100\nTo recap, a test is a procedure to learn about something by measuring or observing.\n\n01:02.100 --> 01:04.600\nKeep exploring and keep testing!\n\n01:04.600 --> 01:06.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
