    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:21.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process that helps us understand if something is true, or works correctly, or even how well we understand a subject.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:34.500\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Or, if your toy car isn't moving, you might test the batteries to see if they're dead.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:45.300\nIn school, tests help your teachers see how well you've learned the material. So, a test is just a way to gather information and check something.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:52.400\nIn short, tests help us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
