    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_070351.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:13.900\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:25.900\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or evaluating how well you understand a subject. The goal is to get information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:37.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Or, when baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:50.200\nThese are both examples of tests! So, remember, a test is just a method of checking something, whether it's a product, a skill, or even an idea.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:57.500\nThey help us understand if things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
