    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.500\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:33.200\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. Or, when you buy a new phone, you try out the camera to test its quality.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:41.600\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you\u2019ve learned. They're a way to check your understanding of a topic.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:52.200\nSo, remember, a test is really just a tool for learning and finding things out. It helps us see what we know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
