    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:14.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like an experiment, but often on a smaller scale.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:35.800\nThe main idea is to present something, and then see how it responds.\nThis response gives us information.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:46.400\nFor example, a food allergy test exposes you to a tiny amount of a food to see if you react.\nA math test asks you questions to see how well you understand the subject.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:53.900\nAnd even trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\nSo, remember a test is just a way to gather information by observing a response.\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
