    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:24.800\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or performance in a specific area.\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\nA math test sees how good you are at solving equations.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:32.000\nEven a taste test is a type of test!\nIt tells you which food you prefer.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:42.200\nTests can be written, like quizzes in school, or practical, like a driving test.\nThey help us understand what we know and where we can improve.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:52.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and measuring skills.\nThey help us learn and grow.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
