    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in this case, we're talking about a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like a little investigation. A test is simply a procedure designed to confirm, evaluate, or assess something.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:32.200\nIt could be anything from checking if a lightbulb turns on, to seeing if your favorite recipe tastes good.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:43.700\nFor example, you might test if your bike brakes work before going down a hill. Or, you might test if your microphone is working before recording a video.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:45.400\nSee?\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:47.100\nSimple!\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:48.800\nYou're checking to make sure things are doing what they're supposed to.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:57.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us make sure things are working as expected.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:01.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
