    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.500\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:19.600\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:28.300\nYou poke it with a toothpick. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:33.600\nOr maybe you\u2019re checking if your shoes fit. You try them on and walk around.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:41.100\nAnother test! Tests can be formal, like a school exam that helps your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:49.500\nOr they can be informal, like tasting your soup to see if it needs more salt. They all help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:53.400\nSo remember, a test is just a way to gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
