    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:21.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge, your ability, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:33.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test helps decide which flavor of ice cream tastes the best.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:40.500\nIn science, we might test a new medicine to see if it works. So, tests are all around us.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:49.000\nThey give us information to help us make decisions, understand things better, and see how well something is working.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:56.200\nThey're a really useful tool for learning and improving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
