    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.800\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something about a particular subject.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:35.000\nThink of it like this: if you bake a cake, you might take a bite to test if it tastes good. Or, if you're learning your ABCs, a teacher might give you a quiz to test your knowledge.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:48.200\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big exams. They can be used to check anything from the strength of a bridge to how well you understand a new concept.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:55.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It's a tool to help us learn and improve.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
