    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:04.100\nToday we're going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:08.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:08.300 --> 01:02.400\nThink of it like a snapshot of your current skills or knowledge.\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:06.800\nIt helps you, and sometimes others, understand what you've learned and what you might need to work on.\n\n01:06.800 --> 01:10.200\nTests come in lots of forms.\n\n01:10.200 --> 01:12.700\nMaybe you've taken a quiz in class, that's a test!\n\n01:12.700 --> 01:17.400\nOr perhaps you've had to show how well you can kick a soccer ball, that's a test of your athletic ability.\n\n01:17.400 --> 01:20.400\nEven a doctor checking your reflexes is performing a simple test.\n\n01:20.400 --> 01:27.100\nSo, a test is just a method for evaluating something.\n\n01:27.100 --> 01:28.900\nIt helps us measure and understand skills and knowledge.\n\n01:28.900 --> 01:31.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
