    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.200\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you've learned something new.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.900\nIt's like a little experiment to see if you got the right answer.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:30.600\nFor example, imagine you're baking a cake. You can test if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:38.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:45.400\nOr, think about a spelling test at school. It checks if you remember how to spell certain words.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:56.500\nTests aren't just for school or baking, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers use tests to make sure buildings are safe.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:01.300\nSo, a test is simply a way to find out if something is correct, functional, or up to standard.\n\n01:01.300 --> 01:05.800\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve!\n\n01:05.800 --> 01:09.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
