    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.600\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance. Think of it like this: you take a test in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:37.000\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to learn about your health. Even a simple taste test, like trying a new flavor of ice cream, is a type of test!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:48.800\nSo, whether it's a quiz, an exam, or just trying something new, tests help us learn and understand more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:56.300\nIn short, tests provide valuable information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
