    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.500\nHey there, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:10.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to check something.\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you test if the water's hot before you jump in the shower, right?\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.600\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:42.000\nThey can come in lots of forms, like multiple choice questions, true or false, or even short answer questions.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:44.900\nImagine you\u2019re learning about animals.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:57.400\nA test might ask you to identify a picture of a dog or name what kind of animal lives in a nest. See? It's just checking your knowledge.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:01.200\nSo, a test is basically a method for finding out how much you know or how well something works.\n```"
