    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_073252.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.900\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:26.600\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if something is true. Think of it like this: if you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:35.900\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, falling down is a test of your balance!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.900\nIn science, we might test if a plant grows better in sunlight or in shade. We could give it water and measure the amount of growth. The test shows us the best condition for the plant.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:49.500\nSo, tests are everywhere, helping us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
