    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_073356.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: Tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:20.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:29.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test!\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:36.800\nAnother example? Imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:43.800\nYou might test your balance by taking your feet off the ground for a few seconds. That's also a test!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:47.900\nIt helps you see if you're ready to ride.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:51.700\nSo, remember, tests are all about checking things!\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:54.000\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:54.600\nThey're everywhere!\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:54.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
