    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:18.600\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:29.000\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:37.200\nThink about it this way: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:45.400\nOr, a taste test sees if you like a certain food.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:54.500\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a test to see if the light bulb works! Tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.100\nThey show us what we already know, and what we need to work on.\n```"
