    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_073617.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something about someone or something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:28.500\nThe main idea is that a test measures a specific skill, knowledge, or ability.\nIt helps us understand where someone's at, or how well something works.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:38.000\nFor example, a spelling test tells us how well someone can spell.\nOr, think about a taste test for a new soda.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:45.700\nThat tells the company what people think of the flavor.\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a type of test!\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:58.000\nIt tells you if the bulb is good or needs replacing.\nSo, in short, a test is a process designed to get information about a specific quality or characteristic.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:05.600\nIt's all about gathering data to understand something better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
