    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working or true.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:24.500\nBasically, we use tests to get information. For example, a doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:36.600\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge. Even baking a cake is a kind of test, you're testing if you can follow the recipe and get a delicious result!\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:52.100\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and confirm things. They can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all have the same goal: to find out something.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:59.000\nRemember, a test helps us get information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
