    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:14.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.200\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or if you understand a new topic.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:38.800\nThe main idea behind a test is to get information. We want to know if something is working correctly, or if our understanding is accurate.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:44.500\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:50.200\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you learned the lesson.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:51.900\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:56.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a check, it gives us information, and it helps us understand something better.\n```"
