    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_073830.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.210 --> 00:05.610\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.610 --> 00:13.010\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.010 --> 00:24.310\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand things better.\n\n00:24.310 --> 00:29.210\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.210 --> 00:34.110\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n00:34.110 --> 00:39.010\nSee? Different tests, different questions, different answers.\n\n00:39.010 --> 00:49.210\nAnother example: your doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Tests can be about all sorts of things!\n\n00:49.210 --> 00:56.610\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information. It can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:56.610 --> 01:01.600\nThey\u2019re all ways to learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
