    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.300\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or performance.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a check-up to test your health. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:44.100\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:54.000\nTests can come in many forms, like multiple choice questions, fill-in-the-blanks, or even hands-on activities.\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:01.100\nThey all have the same goal: to measure something. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see how well something performs or how much someone knows. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
