    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check something or someone to see how well they do or what they know.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like a way to measure performance. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:33.400\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:44.700\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test! You\u2019re testing to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:51.700\nSo, tests help us understand where we are, what we know, and what we might need to learn more about. They're a valuable tool for learning and improvement. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
