    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_074215.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.600\nIt helps measure your understanding of a topic.\nThink of it like this: a test is like a measuring cup for knowledge.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.600\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words.\nA math test shows how well you understand numbers and equations.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:53.900\nEven a taste test, like when you try different ice cream flavors, is a type of test \u2013 it helps you figure out which flavor you like best!\nSo, tests come in many forms, but they all have the same goal: to check what you've learned.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.000\nThey help you and your teachers see what you already know and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:57.900\nRemember, tests are just one way to learn and grow!\n```"
  },
