    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.800\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:37.500\nThink about it like this: if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:43.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:48.700\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, your teacher might give you a quiz to test how well you know them.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:52.700\nTests can be simple or complicated. They help us learn and improve.\n\n```"
