    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:20.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to see what you know or what you can do. Think of it like checking if a lightbulb works \u2013 you turn it on, and if it lights up, you know it's good!\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:27.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:36.400\nOr, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. For example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:40.900\nAnd a cooking test might see if you can follow a recipe.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:50.600\nSee? Tests help us understand things better. So, in a nutshell, a test is a tool for measuring knowledge or ability. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
