    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.600\nIt's a structured way to gather information. Think about it like this: a doctor gives you a physical test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:28.100\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:36.700\nYou're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you get a delicious result. Let's say you want to know if a toy car works.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:40.900\nYou put batteries in it and turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:45.700\nOr, you want to know if a plant needs water. You check the soil.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:49.900\nIf it's dry, that's a test telling you it's time to water it.\n\n00:49.900 --> 01:00.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to learn something. It's a way to check if something works, if something is true, or if you understand something.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:06.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
