    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_080157.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:23.100\nIt's like an experiment or a check-up to see how something is working or what someone knows.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:36.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:48.500\nOr, a taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you like best! Tests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking if a bridge is safe to see if a new medicine works.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:54.500\nThe important thing to remember is that a test helps us gather information. So, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm something we already suspected. It\u2019s all about gathering data. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
