    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.400 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:09.000\nA test is really just a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:12.000\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb lights up.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:13.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:16.500\nIn school, you take tests to show your teachers what you've learned.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:19.000\nBut tests are everywhere!\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:22.500\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:26.000\nA car company tests its cars to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.000\nSo, a test is simply a process, or a set of questions, designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:36.000\nIt could be your knowledge, or the quality of a product.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:38.000\nBasically, it's a way to check things out!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:41.500\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:43.500\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:47.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
