    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it as a question you're asking, and you're looking for the answer.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:22.700\nTests can be all sorts of things. Like, a spelling test in school checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:29.800\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. That's a test too!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:36.400\nAnother example is checking if a light bulb works. You screw it in and see if it lights up. That's testing the light bulb!\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:44.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to learn or confirm something. It\u2019s a simple way to get an answer!\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:50.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
