    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_080620.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.300\nWhat are they and why do we take them? Simply put, a test is a way to check what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like a snapshot of your current understanding. It helps you and others see how well you've grasped a particular subject or skill.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:31.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. A driving test shows if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:40.300\nAnd even a simple taste test lets you decide which flavor you like best! So, tests aren't meant to be scary.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:49.700\nThey're just tools to help us learn and improve. They give us valuable feedback on what we\u2019ve learned and what areas we might need to focus on.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:56.600\nRemember, it's okay to not know everything! Tests help us figure out what those things are.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
