    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question, but instead of just asking, you're also looking for proof.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:27.100\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you test it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\nThat's a test!\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:34.300\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, your ability to stay upright is the test.\nIf you can ride without falling, you've passed the test!\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:47.600\nSo, a test is really just a way to check something and see if it meets a certain standard or if you've learned something new.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:53.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
