    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:04.900\nToday we're diving into something called a \"Test.\"\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:09.600\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:09.600 --> 00:12.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:15.100\nYou poke it with a toothpick, right?\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:16.600\nThat's a test!\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:19.200\nYou're testing to see if the batter is still wet.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:22.900\nAnother example is taking a quiz at school.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:25.800\nThat's a test to see how much you've learned about a certain topic.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:30.200\nOr, maybe you're testing if a toy car goes faster with bigger wheels.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:35.100\nSo, a test is really just a way of asking a question and getting an answer, by doing something specific.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:39.700\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:42.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
