    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.114 --> 00:05.204\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.204 --> 00:19.474\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's baked all the way through, or test the water to see if it's warm enough to swim.\n\n00:19.474 --> 00:29.724\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\nThey're not meant to be scary, but to show what you've learned!\n\n00:29.724 --> 00:39.004\nSo, a quiz on the alphabet tests your knowledge of letters.\nA science experiment tests a hypothesis, like if plants grow better with more sunlight.\n\n00:39.004 --> 00:48.104\nBasically, a test is a tool to measure or examine something.\nIt helps us understand more about the world around us.\n\n00:48.104 --> 00:54.984\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn from it.\nDon't be afraid!\n\n00:54.984 --> 00:59.874\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
