    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate something \u2013 like your knowledge, a product\u2019s quality, or even how well a new medicine works.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:36.700\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:49.700\nScientists might run tests on soil samples to check for pollutants. So, tests help us gather information and make decisions based on that information.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:59.900\nThey're used everywhere, from schools and workplaces to hospitals and research labs. They help us understand things better and ensure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:03.000\nIn short, a test is a tool for evaluation and discovery.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:06.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
