    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and looking for the answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:19.400\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:27.700\nThink about baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. Or, imagine you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is broken.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:31.700\nYou can test it by turning it on. Does it light up?\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:38.500\nThat's a test! Tests help us understand things better and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:45.300\nThey can be big, like a school exam, or small, like checking if your shoes are tied.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:51.900\nSo, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:53.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
