    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:08.500\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:11.800\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are done \u2013 you poke them with a toothpick, that\u2019s a mini-test!\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:16.000\nTests can be used in all sorts of ways.\nIn school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:20.400\nA doctor might run tests to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:26.600\nEven when you try a new recipe, you're kind of testing it out to see if you like it!\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:30.900\nSo, a test is really just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:37.300\nIt helps us understand things better, whether it's your knowledge of math, your physical health, or even just how delicious that new cookie recipe is.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:46.400\nTo recap, tests help us see what we know, how things work, and give us information to make good decisions.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:49.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
