    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.300\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something. Think of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.600\nWe use tests all the time to check our knowledge, skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:28.600\nImagine you're learning to ride a bike. Your first test is probably just trying to stay upright!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:33.800\nOr, let's say you're baking a cake. Tasting it afterwards?\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:45.600\nThat's a test to see if it's delicious. Tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like asking a friend for their opinion.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:52.300\nThe important thing is that they give us information. So, a test is basically a method to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
