    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:33.800\nWe use tests all the time. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you're learning something new in school, your teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:41.000\nAnother example is baking a cake. You might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:48.900\nThe toothpick coming out clean tells you the cake is ready! So, remember, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:55.800\nIt helps us gather information and make informed decisions. It allows us to learn more.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
