    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:25.600\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we've learned something new.\nThink of it like this: When you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:34.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! Or, imagine your doctor giving you an eye exam.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:39.400\nThat's a test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:50.500\nTests are all around us! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
