    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.199\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.199 --> 00:15.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:25.100\nIt helps us learn more about a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:37.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words. A taste test tells you which food you like best.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:48.000\nAnd even scientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct. They might test a new medicine to see if it works, or test a new material to see how strong it is.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.600\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n```"
