    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.300\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary, but really, a test is just a way to find out what you know about something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:20.900\nIt's like a mini-investigation!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it this way: imagine you're building a house. You need to test the wood to make sure it's strong enough, right? Or if you're baking a cake, you test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:36.800\nTests help us understand if things are working correctly.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:43.900\nSchool tests are similar. They help your teacher see what you\u2019ve learned in class.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:51.000\nA spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A math test checks if you understand numbers and equations.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:55.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a tool to check your understanding.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.800\nIt helps you and others see what you know.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:01.800\nAnd that's it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
