    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something called a test.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:17.300\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:31.200\nIt could be about you, like a quiz to see what you've learned. Or it could be about a thing, like checking if a toy car still works after you drop it.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:48.000\nThe main idea is that you do something, you observe what happens, and then you learn from the result. For example, if you're baking a cake, the \"test\" might be tasting it to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:57.400\nOr, if you\u2019re trying to figure out which light switch controls the lamp, you flip one switch and see if the lamp turns on. That's a test!\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:04.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new by doing something and seeing what happens. It helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
