    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nA test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like an experiment or a question that helps us learn more.\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:33.800\nFor example, trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it.\nOr, pressing a button on a remote to see if the TV turns on is another kind of test.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:45.300\nAnother example is taking a quiz in school.\nThat's a test to see how much you've learned about a certain topic.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:56.100\nThe results of the test, whether you like the recipe or the TV turns on, gives you information.\nSo, in short, a test is a way to gather information by trying something out or asking a question.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.600\nIt helps us understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
