    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_083327.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:15.600\nA test, at its core, is simply a way to find something out. Think of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:27.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:37.500\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, if you're trying to remember a friend's phone number, you're testing your memory.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:55.000\nSo, a test helps us confirm something, check if something works, or learn something new. They can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if the milk is still good before pouring it into your cereal.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:03.600\nTests are everywhere, helping us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
