    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more. For example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:30.100\nOr a doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:42.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if your recipe and ingredients will create something delicious.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:52.700\nSo, tests help us measure knowledge, skills, or even the properties of things. They give us information that we can use to learn and improve.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.200\nBasically, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
