    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:26.000\nIt's a process where you ask a question or try something out to see what happens.\nThink about it like this: a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:39.800\nOr, a spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\nTests are used everywhere.\nDoctors use tests to check your health, scientists use tests to discover new things, and even video game developers test their games to make sure they're fun to play.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:48.000\nSo, whether it\u2019s a quiz at school or a quality check at a factory, a test helps us understand something better.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:53.800\nThat's testing in a nutshell! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
