    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something, or to find out if something works the way it should.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:22.700\nThink about it like this: If you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:35.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, if you're buying a used car, you might take it for a test drive to see how it runs. That's another kind of test!\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:45.600\nSo, tests help us learn things, make sure things are working right, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:58.000\nThey're used in all sorts of situations, from baking to buying cars, and even in science and school.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:01.600\nIn short, a test is a way to get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
