    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You perform a test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:32.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test, and it's ready!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:40.700\nTests aren't just for baking, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:48.000\nSchools use tests to see how much you've learned. Even video games use tests to see if you can beat a level.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:55.400\nSo, a test is really just a question or a procedure designed to give us an answer or some information. It helps us understand something better.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nSo remember, a test is a process to gain information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
