    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:20.600\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: you touch a hot stove.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:32.200\nThat's a test to see if it's hot!\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:38.700\nYou ask a friend if they like pizza.\nThat's a test to see their food preference.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:51.300\nIn science and school, tests are more formal.\nThey help us measure knowledge or skills.\nFor example, a math test shows how well you understand numbers.\nA science experiment tests a hypothesis, like whether plants grow better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:55.400\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nIt's a way to prove or disprove an idea or see how much you know.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
