    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_084403.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:18.400\nBasically, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:35.100\nYou don't just guess, right? You might poke it with a toothpick. That toothpick is performing a test!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:43.500\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:51.900\nMaybe it's a multiple choice quiz about animals, or a spelling test to see if you know your words. These tests help show what you know, and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:57.700\nSo, tests check things. They help us learn. And they're a common way to see how much we understand. Remember, tests aren\u2019t scary, they are just another tool for learning. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
