    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:18.300\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it as a little investigation.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:32.500\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:42.800\nEven just trying a new flavor of ice cream is a kind of test to see if you like it!\nTests can be formal, like the quizzes you take in school.\nOr they can be informal, like checking if your shoes fit before you go outside.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.200\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:58.300\nSo, remember, a test is a way to learn something new, whether it's about your health, your baking, or even just your ice cream preferences.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
