    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_084626.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:35.600\nOr, imagine a doctor giving you a check-up; that's a test to see how healthy you are. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:46.400\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if you like it. Or, when you push a button on a toy, you're testing to see if it works.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:55.000\nSo, a test is really just a method for gathering information. It helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
