    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_084716.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just asking, we're also getting proof.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:26.000\nIt's a way to measure or evaluate something. For example, a school test checks how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.600\nOr, think about a taste test! You try different foods to see which one you like best.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:40.400\nEven a simple experiment is a type of test, like seeing if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:51.700\nSo, a test helps us gather information and make decisions. Basically, a test is a process designed to answer a question or prove a point.\n\n00:51.700 --> 01:00.800\nIt helps us learn, compare, and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
