    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_084826.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something.\nThink of it like this: you have a question, and a test helps you find the answer.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:23.600\nIt could be a school test to see how well you've learned something, or a medical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:32.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\nYou're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you get a delicious result.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:42.500\nFor example, a math test might ask you \"What is 2 + 2?\".\nThe test is checking if you know the answer is four.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your vitamin levels.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:55.100\nSo, remember, a test is really just a way of gathering information and checking something important.\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:01.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
