    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:28.600\nA chef might taste their soup to test the flavor.\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school to test what you've learned.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:37.600\nIn each case, the test is giving us information.\nIt's helping us learn something new or confirm what we already know.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:48.900\nSo, whether it's a medical test, a taste test, or a school test, they all share the same basic idea: to gather information.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:57.200\nSo remember, a test is just a way to get an answer.\nIt's a question asked in a structured way to learn something.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
