    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:21.900\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think about it: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:30.100\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:43.600\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. For example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:51.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to learn something new or to measure something we already know. It helps us understand the world around us a little better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
