    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_085324.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:22.700\nIt's a process used to evaluate, measure, or check.\nThink about it like this:\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:32.300\nyour doctor gives you a blood test to check your health.\nA baker tastes their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:47.900\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nSo, tests can come in many forms and be used for all sorts of things, from checking if a bridge is safe, to seeing if a new medicine works, or even just figuring out if you like a new flavor of ice cream!\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:57.100\nTests help us make decisions and understand the world around us.\nIn short, a test is a method of gathering information.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.300\nThat's the core idea!\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:03.800\nThanks for watching!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
