    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_085418.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.500\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:10.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.600 --> 00:17.500\nLike, are you hungry? You might take a mental test by thinking about your stomach or smelling food.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:28.200\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, fill-in-the-blank, or even a hands-on activity.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:38.200\nThink of it like this: a recipe is a test for your cooking skills! If you follow the steps correctly, you get a delicious result.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:43.100\nOr, a game is a test of your abilities. Can you win?\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:56.000\nSo, a test helps us measure something, whether it's knowledge, skill, or even just a feeling. It helps us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.900\nThat\u2019s the basics of a test!\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
