    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to check something. It\u2019s how we find out if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:29.700\nThink about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Or, if you build a tower with blocks, you give it a little shake to test if it's sturdy.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:40.600\nTests aren't just for baking and building, though! Doctors use tests to check if you're healthy, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:51.000\nSo, a test is basically any way to get information and see if something meets a certain standard. Remember, it's all about checking things!\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
