    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.600\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you put it in a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.900\nThat's a test! Tests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:51.000\nSo, remember, a test is simply a process to gather information. It helps us learn and make decisions. That's the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
