    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_090001.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:33.700\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific goal in mind. We use tests all the time, even if we don\u2019t realize it! For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:46.700\nOr, if you're trying to figure out why your bike tire is flat, you might test different areas to see if you can find a hole. Tests can be written, like school exams, or they can be hands-on, like trying to fix something.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:56.300\nThe important thing is that they help us gather information and learn! So, remember, a test is just a structured way to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
