    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.700\nIt's a process we use to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone understands a topic.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:34.200\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to check if you're healthy. Or, when you learn a new skill, like riding a bike, you're constantly testing yourself to see if you can balance and steer.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:39.700\nEven baking a cake involves testing! You check to see if it's cooked through.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:48.500\nSo, tests are everywhere! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:51.800\nThey\u2019re a key part of understanding the world around us.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
