    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.300 --> 00:02.300\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:05.250\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:05.250 --> 00:6.500\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer.\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:09.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:13.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:16.500\nTests aren't just for people though! We can test a recipe to see if it tastes good,\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:19.000\nor test a toy to see if it's safe.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:24.000\nSo, a test is basically a procedure designed to evaluate something. It helps us learn more and make better decisions.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:31.000\nWhether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even the quality of a new product, tests are super useful.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:34.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
