    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nA test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:21.100\nThat's a test! In everyday life, we use tests all the time.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:26.000\nMaybe you taste a soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:30.900\nThat's a test. Or perhaps you check the weather forecast to see if you need an umbrella.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:37.500\nAgain, that's a test. Tests help us confirm if something is working as expected, or if something needs to be changed or fixed.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:45.300\nSo, a test is just a way to check something, using simple observations or more complex procedures.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:52.800\nRemember, testing helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
