    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like asking a question, but in a more structured way. We use tests all the time.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:29.500\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:37.400\nOr, when you go to the doctor, they might check your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:47.900\nTests help us understand things better. They can be as simple as a taste, or more complicated, like a science experiment.\n\n00:47.900 --> 01:01.100\nBasically, a test gives us data, and that data helps us make decisions or learn something new.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:07.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information. It's a question with a plan to find the answer.\n\n01:07.700 --> 01:12.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
