    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_091125.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something, or someone. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:22.100\nIn school, tests help us understand what you've learned.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:33.300\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking questions. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or a math test sees if you can solve problems.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:42.700\nTests aren't about being perfect; they're about showing what you know and helping you learn more.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:51.400\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information, whether it's about cake or your understanding of a subject. Pretty simple, right?\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
