    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You flip the switch, and if it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:27.500\nTests can be used for lots of things. Maybe you're testing if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:38.300\nOr, if you're watering your plants, you might test the soil to see if it's dry.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:50.700\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, true or false, or even essays.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:59.400\nNo matter the form, tests are really just tools to see if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:02.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n```"
