    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:21.200\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, a product's quality, or even a hypothesis.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:29.500\nThink about it like this: When you take a spelling test at school, it's checking how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:40.600\nOr, when a car company crashes a car, that's a test to see how safe it is. Even scientists run tests when they're trying to prove a new idea.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:49.800\nSo, a test is a structured way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:56.900\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
