    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it like an experiment or a question that helps you learn more about something.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:40.400\nThere are lots of different kinds of tests. You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words, or a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:53.300\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like the way it tastes! For example, if you\u2019re baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it\u2019s cooked all the way through. Or, if you\u2019re planting seeds, you're testing to see if they will grow.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:59.600\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a process to gain information or check something. It's all about learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
