    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: a test.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:17.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like a snapshot of your understanding at a particular moment.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:34.400\nIt's a process where you answer questions, complete tasks, or perform actions that are then evaluated.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:46.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A driving test shows if you can safely operate a car. Even tasting food can be a test to see if you can identify different flavors!\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:53.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for evaluating your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.600\nIt helps you and others understand what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
