    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct. Think of it like this: a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:33.300\nOr, a doctor might check your temperature to test if you have a fever. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:40.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Some are simple, like checking if a light switch works.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.100\nOthers are more complex, like scientific experiments. But the basic idea is the same: to explore and understand something better.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:58.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and discovering!\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
