    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.800\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:42.200\nFor example, a simple test could be tasting food to see if you like it.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:49.400\nYou're testing your taste buds!\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:56.600\nOr, if you try to open a door and it's locked, you've just tested whether you have the right key.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:03.800\nThe door lock is the test, and your key is the answer.\n\n01:03.800 --> 01:11.000\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking if your phone is charged.\n\n01:11.000 --> 01:18.200\nThe important thing is, a test gives you information.\n\n01:18.200 --> 01:23.700\nIt helps you learn and make decisions.\n\n01:23.700 --> 01:28.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find things out.\n\n01:28.900 --> 01:31.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
