    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:10.600\nWhat are they? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.600 --> 00:15.400\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:22.600\nIt could be anything! A spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A taste test checks if you like a certain food.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:29.700\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. So, a test helps us learn more.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:36.800\nIt gives us information. For example, if you study hard and do well on a test, you know you've learned the material!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:46.100\nIf the food tastes good, you know you like it! Basically, a test is just a method for gathering information and checking understanding.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:53.900\nIt can be fun, and it's definitely a helpful tool.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
