    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy. Or, your teacher gives you a test to see what you\u2019ve learned in class.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:29.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it works.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:40.000\nTests can come in many forms, like multiple choice questions, giving a speech, or even just observing how something behaves.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:50.500\nThe important thing is that a test helps us understand something better. So, a test is a way to learn, to measure, and to discover.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
