    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.900\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It could be about how much you know, how good something is, or even if something is working correctly.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:29.300\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Or, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:37.400\nA mechanic might run a diagnostic test on your car to see if there are any problems. So, a test is just a process.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:49.700\nYou do something and then look at the results to learn something new. Whether it\u2019s a pop quiz or checking the temperature of food, tests help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:60.800\nTo recap, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
