    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.800\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:20.600\nThink about it. When you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:30.300\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, falling down is a test of your balance. Each time, you're gathering information.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:36.600\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:44.300\nBut tests aren't just for school! Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and even game developers test their games to make sure they're fun to play.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:52.000\nSo, a test is simply a method to gather information and see what's going on. Pretty useful, right?\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
