    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a process we use to check if something is working, or to see how well something performs.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:35.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:41.300\nA test can be as simple as trying to turn on a light switch to see if the light bulb works.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:50.800\nIf it lights up, the test passed! If not, well, something's not working. Tests are all around us, helping us understand the world better.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.300\nSo remember, a test is just a way of checking things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
