    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:39.900\nThese tests have questions or tasks, and your answers or performance tell us something specific.\nFor instance, a taste test helps you decide which food is tastier, or a driving test shows if you can operate a car safely.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:49.300\nSo, a test is all about gathering information through a structured process.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
