    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.300\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Think about it \u2013 when you check if the oven is hot enough to bake cookies, that's a test!\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.100\nYou're testing the temperature. Tests can be used to check if something is working correctly, like testing a lightbulb to see if it lights up.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:42.400\nOr they can be used to see how well you understand something, like a quiz in school. The goal is always to get information.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:49.600\nSo, tests help us learn and make decisions. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:57.300\nRemember, a test is just a way to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
