    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:22.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:31.700\nThe test itself could be anything \u2013 a set of questions on paper, a physical challenge, or even an experiment in a science lab.\nThe important thing is that it gives you information.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:37.600\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:46.600\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\nSee?\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:51.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and answering a question.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:53.600\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n```"
