    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_094825.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What are they?\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:19.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, you're getting information from something or someone in a more structured way.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:30.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:38.500\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:50.700\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\nThey can be used to measure knowledge, preferences, or even the condition of something.\nIn short, a test is a way to learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
