    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:07.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how much you know about something,\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:11.000\nor how well you can do something.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:14.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:18.000\nYou flip the switch, and if it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:21.700\nTests can come in many forms.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:25.400\nIt could be a quiz at school, a driving test to get your license,\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:28.400\nor even just tasting a new recipe to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:30.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:34.800\nA fitness test checks your physical abilities.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:37.200\nAnd that taste test?\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:39.200\nWell, that checks your culinary judgement!\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:42.600\nSo remember, a test is just a way to measure something.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:46.800\nIt helps us learn, improve, and see where we stand.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:50.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
