    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_094945.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:20.700\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about someone or something. It helps us understand what someone knows, how well something works, or even what something is made of.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:32.200\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:44.900\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:56.000\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what's wrong when you're not feeling well. So, a test can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just checking something out.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:03.800\nIt's all about gathering information and learning more. Tests help us make better decisions, improve things, and understand the world around us. In short, a test is a tool for learning and discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
