    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_095431.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like an experiment or a question designed to give you an answer.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:20.100\nThink about it. You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:31.500\nOr, a chef might test a soup to see if it needs more salt. Even a doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature, to understand your health.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:43.800\nSo, a test can be a quiz, an examination, a trial, or even just a simple check. The point is to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:51.300\nTests help us understand things better and make better decisions. That's the basic idea of a test!\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
