    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_095614.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:18.900\nSo, what do we test? Well, lots of things!\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:25.700\nWe test if a cake is done by poking it with a fork. We test our knowledge in school with quizzes.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:35.100\nAnd doctors use tests to see if we're healthy. For example, a simple spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:44.500\nOr, imagine testing a new toy to see if it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:55.300\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and make decisions. It's a way of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or tells us something useful.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:00.200\nSo, a test helps you know something you didn't know before. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
