    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_095655.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.799\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.799 --> 00:14.199\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, maybe in school. But what exactly is a test?\n\n00:14.199 --> 00:25.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information. It's a process we use to check something, to see if it works, or to learn more about it.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:35.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:47.600\nEven trying out a new video game is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:56.800\nThey're all around us, helping us understand the world a little better. In short, a test is just a way to get answers.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
