    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_101144.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:06.300\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:07.600\nThink of it like an experiment.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:11.200\nWe're trying to see if something is true or if something works.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:16.700\nFor example, a spelling test helps us find out if we know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:20.800\nOr a taste test helps us figure out which flavor of ice cream we like best.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:26.200\nThe key is that we're asking a question and then using the test to get an answer.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:32.500\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz in class or trying out a new recipe, remember that a test is simply a method for discovering information.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:37.900\nIt\u2019s a way to check our knowledge or see if something meets our expectations.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:43.600\nIn short, tests are tools that help us learn and understand the world around us better.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:46.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
