    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:20.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but getting a more detailed answer than just \"yes\" or \"no.\"\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:26.600\nWe use tests all the time! A simple example is a taste test.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:34.800\nYou try a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it. Or, think about a spelling test in school.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:43.100\nIt helps your teacher understand how well you know your vocabulary. A doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:56.200\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions. They can be fun, like trying new foods, or important, like checking your health.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:02.400\nThey all have one thing in common: they\u2019re designed to give us useful information. That's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
