    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_101320.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:18.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skill, aptitude, or some other characteristic.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:35.300\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:47.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe! So, tests aren't just for school. They help us understand things better, from ourselves to the world around us.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:56.100\nThey come in many forms \u2013 quizzes, experiments, surveys... all designed to give us information. In short, a test is a structured way to gather data and learn something new.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
