    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.600\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:23.900\nA test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well something performs.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:34.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:39.200\nTests aren't just for baking, though.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:42.600\nImagine you're building with blocks.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:47.500\nYou might test if your tower is strong by gently pushing on it.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.400\nIf it stays standing, that's a successful test! We use tests all the time to make sure things are safe, reliable, and do what they're supposed to do. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
