    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:20.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate or assess something, whether it\u2019s your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even how well a new medicine works.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:32.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test helps decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:42.100\nScientists use tests all the time to see if their ideas are correct. They might test a new fertilizer to see if it makes plants grow bigger.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:54.700\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and making a judgment based on the results. Tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
