    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.600\nIt helps us understand if something is working, if something is true, or if someone knows something.\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher gives you a test to see if you learned the material.\nOr even simpler, you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's just right.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.000\nSo, in each of those examples, the test gives us information.\nThe doctor learns about your health.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:48.800\nThe teacher learns about your knowledge, and you learn about the bathwater temperature.\nSee? Tests are all around us, helping us understand the world better.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:54.100\nIn summary, a test is just a tool for gathering information.\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:03.300\nIt helps us figure things out and make informed decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
