    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:05.500\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:09.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:14.700\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like this: a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:24.500\nOr, when you get a new toy, you test it out to see how it works.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:32.500\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned, and they help you learn too!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:37.800\nThey show you what you already know and what you might need to practice a little more.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:43.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:48.300\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:53.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
