    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_102525.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey there, welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests!\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:15.100\nA test is simply a way to check or evaluate something. Think of it like this: you test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:25.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:32.900\nA spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling, and a math test checks your ability to solve problems.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:41.400\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test, seeing if you can follow the instructions and create something delicious.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:54.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. Whether it's a cake, your spelling skills, or a new recipe, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
