    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHello and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:12.900\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:28.700\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:38.200\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:50.800\nAnother example is a school test. These tests help your teacher see how well you understand what you've been learning. The result shows whether you need more practice on a certain topic.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.500\nSo, in short, a test is just a tool for checking something and getting information. So remember, tests are just checks that help us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
