    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a method we use to gather information or check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are done baking.\nYou might poke them with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:29.800\nOr when you take a spelling test at school, that tells your teacher how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:42.900\nTests can be simple, like that toothpick, or more complex.\nBut the main idea is always the same: to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:47.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find things out.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:51.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
