    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:15.700\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.500\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:31.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:38.300\nOr a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:44.700\nThey use tests to gather information.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:58.800\nSo, tests can come in many forms. It could be a written exam, a physical examination, or even just observing how something behaves. For example, you might test if a toy car works by pushing it to see if it rolls.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:05.300\nBasically, a test is a way to gather information and learn more.\n\n01:05.300 --> 01:11.000\nIt helps us understand things better and make decisions.\n\n01:11.000 --> 01:16.200\nWe use tests every day, even if we don't realize it!\n\n01:16.200 --> 01:19.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
