    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_103105.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:7.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:13.800\nThink of it as a question or a set of questions designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:19.600\nIt's like when you bake a cake and taste it. That's a test to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:25.400\nOr imagine a doctor checking your temperature. That\u2019s a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:35.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a multiple-choice quiz in school, or a driving test to get your license.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:39.600\nThey all have the same basic purpose: to give us information.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:52.400\nSo, a test is really just a tool for understanding something better, whether it's how much you know about a subject, or if your cake needs more sugar.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
