    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:14.500\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:24.100\nIt's like a detective looking for clues! Basically, a test helps us see if things are right or wrong.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:34.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:38.400\nOr, imagine you bake a cake \u2013 you taste it to test if it's delicious!\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:42.800\nWe use tests every day, even without realizing it.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:51.100\nDid the light switch turn on the light? That's a quick test! Did your shoelaces stay tied? Another test passed!\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:57.900\nSo, tests are all about checking things and making sure they're doing what they should. They help us learn and improve. Remember, testing is a vital tool. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
