    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.200\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, testing the temperature outside, or even taking a quiz at school.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:34.700\nThe main idea is to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:41.600\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:50.500\nOr, before you buy a used car, you might take it for a drive to test its engine. See? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:59.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for checking or evaluating something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly or meets our needs. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
