    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_104259.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.400\nA test is basically a way to check how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a simple test!\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:36.100\nTests can be used in lots of different ways.\nMaybe your teacher gives you a quiz to see if you understood the lesson.\nOr, a company might test a new product to make sure it's safe and reliable before selling it.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:47.600\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\nThey give us information we can use to make better decisions.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:55.700\nIn short, a test is just a method to evaluate something!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "75c0a16b-a5cb-4168-a0a5-468e260f76a4": {
    "id": "75c0a16b-a5cb-4168-a0a5-468e260f76a4",
