    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:19.600\nThink of it like this: you test your bath water to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:31.700\nThat's a test! In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:35.700\nA spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling, and a math test checks your math skills.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:39.700\nAnother example?\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:44.700\nImagine you're baking cookies. You might taste a little bit of the dough to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:54.500\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something and see if it's working or if you understand it.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:56.500\nThey help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
