    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_104600.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:24.100\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think about it: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:32.500\nA chef tastes their food to see if it needs more salt. Or, you might try a new route home to test if it's faster.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:46.600\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a blood test at the doctor, or just trying something new to see if it works, remember that a test is all about gathering information and finding things out.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:53.200\nWe run tests to understand the world around us. And that's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
