    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_104727.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.200\nIt's like an experiment where you ask a question and see what the answer is.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:33.100\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:43.600\nOr, you might take a test at school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:52.400\nEven trying a new recipe is kind of a test \u2013 you're testing to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```\nMANIM_CODE:\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass TestExplanation(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # ===== SECTION 1: TITLE (5.4 seconds) =====\n        title = Text(\"What is a Test?\", font_size=42, color=GOLD)\n        title_bg = RoundedRectangle(width=title.width + 1, height=title.height + 0.5, corner_radius=0.2, fill_color=BLUE_B, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        title_group = VGroup(title_bg, title).move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(Write(title_group), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(3.9)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 2: Definition (6.6 seconds) =====\n        definition_text = Text(\"A test is a way to find out something.\", font_size=32, color=WHITE)\n        definition_bg = RoundedRectangle(width=definition_text.width + 1, height=definition_text.height + 0.5, corner_radius=0.2, fill_color=GREEN_B, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        definition_group = VGroup(definition_bg, definition_text).move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(FadeIn(definition_group), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(5.1)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 3: Test as Experiment (10.2 seconds) =====\n        experiment_text = Text(\"It's like an experiment...\", font_size=32, color=WHITE)\n        experiment_bg = RoundedRectangle(width=experiment_text.width + 1, height=experiment_text.height + 0.5, corner_radius=0.2, fill_color=TEAL_A, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        experiment_group = VGroup(experiment_bg, experiment_text).move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(Write(experiment_group), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(8.7)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 4: Doctor Example (10.9 seconds) =====\n        doctor_text = Text(\"Doctor's test: Are you healthy?\", font_size=32, color=WHITE)\n        doctor_bg = RoundedRectangle(width=doctor_text.width + 1, height=doctor_text.height + 0.5, corner_radius=0.2, fill_color=ORANGE, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        doctor_group = VGroup(doctor_bg, doctor_text).move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(FadeIn(doctor_group), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(9.4)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 5: School Example (10.5 seconds) =====\n        school_text = Text(\"School test: What have you learned?\", font_size=32, color=WHITE)\n        school_bg = RoundedRectangle(width=school_text.width + 1, height=school_text.height + 0.5, corner_radius=0.2, fill_color=PINK, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        school_group = VGroup(school_bg, school_text).move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(Write(school_group), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(9.0)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 6: Recipe Example (8.8 seconds) =====\n        recipe_text = Text(\"Recipe: Does it taste good?\", font_size=32, color=WHITE)\n        recipe_bg = RoundedRectangle(width=recipe_text.width + 1, height=recipe_text.height + 0.5, corner_radius=0.2, fill_color=BLUE_B, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        recipe_group = VGroup(recipe_bg, recipe_text).move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(FadeIn(recipe_group), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(7.3)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 7: Ending (3.6 seconds) =====\n        ending_bg = Rectangle(width=14, height=8, fill_color=BLUE_E, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        ending_text = Text(\"Apilage AI Video\", font_size=48, color=GOLD)\n        ending_text.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(FadeIn(ending_bg), run_time=0.5)\n        self.play(FadeIn(ending_text, scale=0.8), run_time=1.1)\n        self.wait(2.0)\n        self.play(FadeOut(ending_text), FadeOut(ending_bg), run_time=0.5)\n```"
  },
