    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_104959.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.000\nWhat are they? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:22.500\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:29.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A math test sees how well you understand numbers.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:41.400\nEven trying a new recipe is a test! You're testing to see if you can make it and if it tastes good.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:54.000\nTests are used everywhere, from school to sports to even figuring out what clothes to wear when you check the weather. They help us understand where we are, and what we might need to learn.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something about ourselves or the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
