    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.900\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of a school exam.\nBut a test, in its simplest form, is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:29.600\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if something is true.\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's too hot or just right.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:38.600\nOr, you might test a new recipe by making a small batch first to see if you like the taste.\nThese are all little tests!\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:47.600\nThey help us learn and make decisions.\nSo, a test is a way to gather information and understand something better.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:54.700\nIt's a simple concept, but it's used everywhere!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
