    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You poke it with a toothpick, that's a test!\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:30.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready. Or, imagine you\u2019re checking if a lightbulb works. You screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:36.000\nIf it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:48.300\nTests aren't just for cakes and lightbulbs, though. They help us understand lots of things, from our eyesight, to how well we understand a new topic.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:56.300\nThey give us information and help us make decisions. So, a test is just a simple way to get an answer.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
