    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are baked enough, so you might poke one with a toothpick.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:23.300\nThat's a test! Essentially, a test helps you find out if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a quiz to see if you understand the lesson.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:45.300\nAnother example is testing a toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with. So, tests are all about figuring things out and making sure everything is working correctly.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:57.600\nIn short, a test is a procedure to evaluate the quality, performance, or reliability of something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
