    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.900\nIt helps us understand if something is working, true, or present.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:31.700\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:39.500\nA chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt. And a student might take a quiz to test what they've learned.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:42.100\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:48.300\nThey help us gather information and make better decisions.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:51.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out something important. It's a tool we use to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
