    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, so what is a test, really?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:07.300\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:11.100\nIt's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:17.300\nThink about it: a cookie recipe is a test.\nYou follow the steps, and the result tells you if you did it right \u2013 you get a delicious cookie!\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:23.100\nOr imagine checking if a light bulb works.\nYou flip the switch.\nIf it lights up, the bulb passes the test.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:25.900\nIf it doesn't, well, it failed.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:31.800\nTests help us understand how things work, find problems, and make sure everything is running smoothly.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:37.200\nThey can be simple, like checking the mail, or complex, like a doctor running blood work.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:41.100\nBut the idea is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:44.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
