    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.200\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:05.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:10.400\nIt could be checking if you understand a new concept, like addition, or checking if a product works as expected.\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:15.100\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:16.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:20.000\nOr, a doctor might test your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:20.900\nThat's another kind of test.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:32.500\nSo, whether it's a math quiz, a science experiment, or even tasting food, tests help us learn and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:36.600\nThey give us information to improve or confirm something.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:38.600\nIn short, a test is a check.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:41.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
