    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:09.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on after you screw it in.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:20.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:27.100\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:31.900\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just completing a project.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:39.000\nOutside of school, tests help us make sure things are safe and reliable.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:46.400\nFor example, car manufacturers test their cars before they sell them to make sure they're safe to drive.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:53.400\nSo remember, tests are just tools to measure understanding or performance.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:56.000\nThey help us learn and improve!\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
