    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. The main idea behind a test is to see if something works, or how well it works.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:32.700\nFor example, a taste test can tell you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:39.400\nOr, a simple spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.400\nAnother example? Imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You could do a \"taste test\" to see if you need to add more sugar. It's all about checking and seeing!\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:55.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a way of checking something to see how it performs or what it's like. It's a simple way to get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
