    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something, like how well you know something, or how something works.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:20.600\nThink of it as a way to check or examine something closely.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:30.500\nSo, how does it work? Well, you usually get a set of questions or tasks, and your answers or performance show what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:40.300\nFor example, a math test checks your math skills. Or, imagine testing a new toy to see if it's safe and fun to play with.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:44.700\nThat\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:57.400\nTests help us learn and improve. They can show us our strengths and weaknesses, so we know what to focus on. To sum it up, a test is a process of checking something to see what it's like or how well it works.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
