    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to check something, to see if it works or if it's true.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:36.700\nOr, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. Tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying out a new video game.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:46.800\nThe main idea is always the same: we're looking for information. We're trying to understand something better by putting it to the test.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:59.300\nFor example, if you're building a tower of blocks, you're testing its stability. Every block you add is a little test!\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:05.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to check something, whether it's an idea, an object, or even yourself. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
