    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb is working: that's a test!\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:35.300\nTests can be used in all sorts of places. Your teacher might give you a test in class to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:46.500\nOr, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people feel better. Let's say you want to bake a cake.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:57.300\nYou might \"test\" the batter by tasting it to see if it needs more sugar. Or, a software developer might test their code to find and fix bugs.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:01.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.700\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n01:04.700 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
