    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:28.500\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct. Think of it like this: You might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it's hot enough, or a chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more salt. Both of those are tests!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:35.100\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:45.800\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just completing a project. So, a test is just a way to learn and measure understanding.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:55.200\nRemember, tests are tools for learning, not something to be afraid of. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
