    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_110717.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like an investigation. You're trying to discover information.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:31.200\nMainly, tests help us figure out if something is true, working correctly, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:43.300\nFor instance, a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words. A medical test checks if you're healthy. And a taste test helps you decide if you like a new flavor of ice cream!\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:55.000\nSo, basically, a test is just a method we use to gather information and make decisions. They can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:59.000\nThe important thing is they help us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
