    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_111409.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:15.500\nAt its most basic, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like an experiment, where you're trying to get information.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:37.000\nIt could be a quiz at school to see what you've learned, or a taste test to find out which cookie is your favorite. Doctors use tests to check your health, and scientists use them to learn about the world.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:47.100\nFor example, if you want to know if a plant needs more water, you could water it and see if it grows better. That's a test!\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:57.200\nOr, if you want to know which toy your dog likes best, you could offer them a few different ones and see which one they play with.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:01.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.500\nThey help us understand the world around us.\n\n01:04.500 --> 01:07.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
