    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:17.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:31.200\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste it while it's baking to test if it needs more sugar.\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:36.300\nTests aren't just for school; they're everywhere.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:54.600\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, a product's quality, or even your health.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:01.000\nIt's all about gathering information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
