    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.700\nIt's a method for gathering information, or checking if something is working correctly. Think about it like this: a spelling test shows what words you know how to spell.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:31.500\nA taste test tells you which food you prefer. And a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:40.900\nTests can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like trying out a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:48.300\nThe important thing is that they help us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:58.500\nSo, tests help us learn, understand, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
