    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are baked \u2013 you poke them to see if they're done, right?\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:35.600\nThat's a test! In school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:47.500\nIn science, a test might be trying out a new experiment to see if it works. For example, you might test if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.700\nYou observe the results! So, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something is true, works correctly, or meets a certain standard. It's all about learning and understanding! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
