    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.600\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of school, but a test in general is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:30.300\nFor example, a simple test could be checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:41.000\nYou screw it in, flip the switch, and see if it lights up. That's the test! The question is, \"Does this lightbulb work?\" and the answer tells you the result.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:50.300\nAnother example is tasting a new food to see if you like it. Your taste buds are testing the flavor!\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:58.100\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something and get information. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
