    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.700\nIt's a process used to evaluate, measure, or check something. Think about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:33.500\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, your teacher might give you a quiz to test what you've learned.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:40.100\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. A doctor might run tests to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:48.500\nA scientist might run tests to prove a theory.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:57.600\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something out. It helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
