    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.300\nA test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to make sure it doesn't break easily, or you might take a quiz at school to see how much you've learned about a topic.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:30.200\nThere are different kinds of tests. Some tests are physical, like checking if a lightbulb turns on. Others are mental, like answering questions on a worksheet.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:40.800\nFor example, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar. Or, a doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:51.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to evaluate or check something. It can be used to see if things are working, or to measure knowledge or ability.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:59.300\nPretty simple, right?\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
