    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is just a way of finding something out. It could be anything from a quiz at school to checking if your new toy works.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.800\nBasically, it's a process where you ask a question or perform an action, and then observe the result.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:30.400\nThat result gives you information. For example, a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:36.600\nOr, pressing the power button on your TV is a test to see if it turns on.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:47.800\nSee? You're constantly running little tests without even realizing it. So, remember, a test is just a method to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:55.500\nIt's all about asking questions and seeing what happens! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
