    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:01.500 --> 00:03.800\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.800 --> 00:07.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:12.100\nThink of it like a question, but instead of just asking, we have a specific way of getting the answer.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:15.800\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:20.800\nFor example, a doctor might use a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:25.500\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:30.200\nImagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:33.900\nYou taste the batter \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:39.000\nOr if you're building a tower with blocks, you might gently push it to test its stability.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:44.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a structured way to get information.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:48.600\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:51.100\nIt's all about finding out the facts!\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
