    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_112915.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:09.100 --> 00:17.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You screw it in, flip the switch, and see if it lights up.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:24.000\nThe light lighting up is the \"test\" result! Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:34.100\nYou might take a spelling test in school, which shows how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:41.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 does it taste good? Did you follow the recipe correctly?\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. Whether it's knowledge, skills, or even the health of your body, tests help us understand more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
