    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening, you're also watching and measuring.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:31.000\nFor example, a spelling test helps us find out how well someone knows how to spell words. Or, a taste test helps us figure out which flavor of ice cream people like best.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:44.200\nTests are used all the time! They can be used to check if a bridge is safe, to see if a new medicine works, or even to find out what kind of soil is best for growing tomatoes.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:55.600\nThe key is that a test provides information. So, remember, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new about a specific thing.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
