    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_114022.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.500\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means in a general sense?\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:14.600\nWell, you're in the right place. Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:20.900\nIt's a method for gathering information.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:27.200\nThink about it like this: a taste test! You taste a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:32.500\nThat's a test.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:37.800\nOr, maybe you give a plant more water to see if it grows taller.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:44.100\nThat's also a test! We're using an action to observe a result.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:50.400\nTests aren\u2019t just for science or school. When you try on different outfits to see which one looks best,\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:56.700\nyou're testing which outfit you prefer. So, a test is basically any process that helps us learn something new.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:02.200\nIn short, tests are all about exploring, experimenting, and discovering.\n```"
  },
