    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:26.100\nIt helps us understand if something is true or false, or how well something works.\nThink of it like this: you might give your dog a treat and see if he sits when you say \"sit.\"\nThat's a test!\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:34.400\nOr maybe you plant two seeds, give one water and not the other.\nThat's testing if water helps plants grow.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:44.100\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\nIn science, tests help us discover new things about the world.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:52.100\nSo, a test is just a way of asking a question and finding an answer.\nIt's about observing and learning.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:61.100\nSo remember, a test is simply a method to find information.\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:61.100 --> 00:64.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
