    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 01:03.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it like asking a question and then trying to find the answer.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:19.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:26.200\nImagine you're baking a cake. You taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:32.100\nOr think about a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:45.400\nTests can be used to see if something works, if it's safe, or even just to see what someone knows.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:51.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:54.600\nIt helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.800\nSo, that's the basics of tests!\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:02.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
