    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:29.500\nTests are used all the time! For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:45.300\nA teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the recipe works!\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:54.900\nSo, whether it's a blood test, a quiz, or even just trying out a new recipe, a test helps us learn and understand.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.500\nWe use them to check things, measure things, and make decisions based on the results. That\u2019s the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
