    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_115527.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:26.800\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we understand a topic. Think of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy, or a chef tastes food to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:36.300\nIn school, we take tests to show what we've learned. For example, a spelling test checks if we know how to spell words.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:45.200\nA math test checks if we can solve problems. Even trying out a new video game is a kind of test, seeing if you like it!\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:53.900\nSo, remember a test is just a way to check things and learn more. It helps us see what we know and where we can improve.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
