    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:14.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it as a tool to gather information. It could be anything from a school exam designed to see what you've learned, to a taste test to figure out which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:33.900\nThe goal is always the same: to measure or evaluate something. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:46.000\nOr, a software developer might run a test on their code to make sure it works correctly.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for getting answers. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
