    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a method of gathering information or checking if something is correct.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: Your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:29.300\nSee? Tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:39.400\nFor example, you could test if a lightbulb works by plugging it in. Or you could test a recipe by following it and seeing if it tastes good.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:51.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure for gathering information or confirming something.\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, and verify.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
