    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, it's a way to check something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:21.100\nIt could be checking if you understand a topic, checking if a machine is working correctly, or even checking if a recipe tastes good!\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:28.700\nThink about it like this: a school test checks your knowledge.\nA doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:40.500\nAnd a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\nTests help us learn, diagnose problems, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:50.700\nSo, tests are all about finding out information and confirming something.\nThey're used everywhere, in all sorts of different ways.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:59.900\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nKeep that in mind, and you'll start seeing tests everywhere!\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:03.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
