    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:07.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:12.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.000\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:22.000\nOr they can be informal, like when you try a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.000\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.000\nA chef might taste a soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:37.000\nAnd you might try different lightbulbs in a lamp to see which one is the brightest.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:50.000\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
