    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_120013.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:18.900\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:27.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to see what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.900\nThink of it like this: You take a test in school to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:40.300\nOr, a company might test a new product to make sure it's safe and reliable.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:43.900\nTests can come in many forms.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:47.200\nThere are written tests, like quizzes or exams.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:51.600\nBut there are also practical tests, like driving tests, or even just trying out a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.500\nThe key is that a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:00.100\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:02.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something out and learn more about it.\n\n01:02.800 --> 01:03.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
