    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:25.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're basically testing if it tastes good.\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you can balance.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.200\nTests help us understand things and improve.\nAnother common test is a school exam.\nIt helps your teacher understand what you've learned and where you might need more help.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:43.300\nTests aren't always about right or wrong answers; they're about learning and exploring.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:57.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what you already know.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "21682e98-6e56-4ca2-bdee-b39858c8a6a6": {
