    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:22.400\nIt's like asking questions, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:30.000\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:37.600\nThat's a test to see how much you understand about a topic.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:48.200\nOr, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health. Tests aren't just for people, either!\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:51.800\nWe can test a new toy to see if it's safe, or a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.400\nThe key is that a test gives us information we didn\u2019t have before.\n```"
