    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nWhat is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:22.500\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:37.600\nYou plug it in, and that\u2019s the test. If it lights up, it passes! Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:47.600\nIt could be a multiple-choice quiz in school, a blood test at the doctor's office, or even a taste test for new ice cream flavors.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:57.900\nThey all help us gather information and make decisions. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly or if someone understands a specific topic.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:04.900\nIt's a tool for evaluation and improvement.\n\n01:04.900 --> 01:08.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
