    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.400\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:32.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. The lightbulb is the thing we're testing, and seeing if it lights up is the test itself.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:38.700\nWe might use tests in school to see how much you've learned in a class, or a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:44.600\nAnother example? Trying a new recipe is a test to see if you can cook it well!\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:53.000\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and understand things better. They give us information. That's the most important thing to remember.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:53.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
