    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:23.800\nIt's a process where you try something out to see how it works or what happens.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:31.200\nThink about it like this: you're baking a cake, and you want to know if it's done.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:38.600\nYou might use a toothpick \u2013 that's a test! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:46.900\nOr maybe you're trying out a new video game. Playing the game is testing it to see if you like it and if it works correctly.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:52.800\nTests can be big, like a science experiment, or small, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:59.400\nThe important thing is you're trying to learn something by doing something. So, a test is just a way to learn and discover! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
