    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE\nAll timings are approximate.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process, or a procedure, designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:35.900\nOr, a chef might taste a dish to test if it's seasoned correctly.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:44.200\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:54.300\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a test. So is a spelling bee. Even checking if a light bulb works before screwing it in is a tiny, simple test!\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:58.100\nSo, a test helps us understand something better by evaluating it in some way. It's about gathering information and making a judgment. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
