    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.800\nThink of a test as a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and then getting an answer that helps you understand more.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:29.800\nThe results of the test give them information. Let's say you're baking a cake.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:35.900\nTasting it is a test! It tells you if it needs more sugar or if it's just right.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:44.900\nOr, imagine checking if a light bulb works. You screw it in, and if it lights up, the test is passed!\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:55.200\nSo, tests help us learn, check, and understand things better. They give us valuable information to make decisions.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
