    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is working, or if we understand something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, your teacher gives you a test to see if you learned the lesson.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:34.300\nTests can be all sorts of things. It could be answering questions on paper, like in a math test.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:44.900\nOr, it could be something more hands-on, like testing if a new toy works properly. You might even test a recipe by trying it out yourself!\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:52.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
