    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_121650.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:20.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:28.900\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:41.500\nFor example, a math test at school helps your teacher see how well you understand the concepts you've been learning. Or, imagine testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:51.900\nTests come in many forms, from simple quizzes to complex scientific experiments. The key is that they give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.600\nSo, a test is basically a method to gather information to help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
