    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:24.100\nIt helps us understand how well something works, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:32.200\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to check your health.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:40.300\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:47.700\nEven baking a cake is a test! You\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:55.100\nSo, tests can be quizzes, medical exams, or even just trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:03.900\nThey give us valuable information and help us improve things. The goal is to learn and understand better.\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:07.300\nIn short, a test is a tool for evaluation.\n\n01:07.300 --> 01:10.800\nIt helps us understand, improve, and ultimately, learn.\n\n01:10.800 --> 01:14.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
