    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_121915.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or ability in a specific area.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:34.900\nTests come in all shapes and sizes!\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a type of test.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:50.100\nSo is a practical exam where you have to demonstrate a skill, like baking a cake or driving a car.\nBasically, if you're being evaluated to see what you know or can do, you're probably taking a test.\n\n00:50.100 --> 01:02.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool used to measure something.\nIt helps us understand what we know, what we can do, and where we might need to learn more.\n\n01:02.500 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
