    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:30.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests can be used to check if something works, like testing a new toy to see if it needs batteries. Or, they can help us understand something better, like taking a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:40.200\nFor example, a doctor might test your vision to see if you need glasses. Or a baker might taste a cake batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:42.800\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:55.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a way of getting information. It helps us check things, understand things, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:61.600\nAnd that's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
