    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_123200.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into something called a test.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:12.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like a question.\nWe ask the question, and the test helps us get the answer.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:30.800\nIt could be a quiz in school to see how much you've learned,\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:39.400\nor a taste test to find out your favorite flavor of ice cream.\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is a type of test to see if you have a fever!\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:48.700\nSee?\nTests are all around us.\nFor example, if you want to know if a plant needs water, you can test the soil.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:58.000\nIf it's dry, it probably does!\nOr, if you want to know if a cookie is done baking, you can stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:06.600\nIf it comes out clean, it's ready!\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:06.600 --> 01:11.500\nThey help us understand the world better.\n\n01:11.500 --> 01:13.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
