    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:06.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:10.700\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge,\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:13.700\na product's quality, or even how well a new medicine works.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:17.000\nThink about it: a spelling test at school checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.100\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:22.300\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:27.400\nTests help us make decisions based on evidence.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:31.500\nThey give us information so we can improve things or understand them better.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:34.700\nSo, a test is simply a method of evaluating something.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:35.600\nGot it?\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:49.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
