    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:18.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:28.400\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:35.600\nThink of it like this: you touch a hot stove, that's a test to see if it's hot, and, ouch, it is!\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:42.800\nOr, when you take a quiz at school, it\u2019s a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.300\nTests can be big or small. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.000\nBoth are using tests to get information and make decisions.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\n```"
  },
