    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:22.200\nIt's a process used to evaluate or measure something. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:32.000\nA taste test tells you which flavor is the most delicious. Even a doctor using a thermometer to check your temperature is performing a test!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:41.500\nSo, tests can be used to measure all sorts of things, from knowledge and skills to preferences and even physical conditions.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:49.600\nThey give us information and help us make decisions. In short, a test is a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
