    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.800 --> 00:06.100\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:08.700\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:13.400\nBasically, you're trying to answer a question by checking something out.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:17.800\nThink about it like this: a chef tastes the soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:22.600\nOr, you might try turning a light switch on to test if the power is working.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:23.900\nThose are tests!\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:28.300\nThey help us understand if something is working correctly, or if something needs to be changed.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:32.700\nAnother example is a doctor running a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:36.900\nOr a teacher giving you a quiz to test what you've learned.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:41.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to get information.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:49.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding out something by checking it. It's a question, and the test is how you find the answer.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:52.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "534f71f3-823a-49c8-8fc9-d097811dabca": {
    "id": "534f71f3-823a-49c8-8fc9-d097811dabca",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:03:59.255962",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-03T12:49:20.526359",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260103_124920.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_124920.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.000\nIt's a process, or a procedure, designed to evaluate something, like your knowledge, or the quality of a product.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:34.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\nOr, a taste test might help you decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.000\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\nThey might test a new medicine to see if it works.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:54.600\nBusinesses use tests to make sure their products are safe and reliable.\nSo, tests help us learn things, make decisions, and improve the world around us.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:00.200\nThey're everywhere!\nIn short, a test is a tool for gathering information.\n\n01:00.200 --> 01:03.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "d7e65ab2-47bd-429a-b7f4-959a38638ed9": {
