    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.500\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a right or wrong answer.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:35.300\nTests help us measure knowledge, skills, or even abilities. For example, you might take a math test to see how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:46.500\nOr maybe you take a driving test to show you know the rules of the road and can drive safely.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:57.100\nEven a simple taste test to see which cookie you like better is a type of test! So, tests are all about gathering information and seeing where you stand.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.700\nThey help you, and others, understand what you know and what you can do. Remember, tests are just a tool to help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
