    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.900\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, but what is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:23.900\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like testing the water in a pool before you jump in.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:34.800\nYou want to know if it's cold or warm, right? That's a test!\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.000\nOr maybe you're baking a cake. You might stick a toothpick in it to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:53.000\nThat's testing if the cake is done. Tests can be used for all sorts of things \u2013 from checking if a lightbulb works to seeing how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:59.600\nBasically, if you're trying to learn something or figure something out, a test can help you get there.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:03.600\nSo remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn!\n```"
