    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:20.300\nIt\u2019s a question or a series of questions designed to see what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:30.700\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might taste a little bit of the batter. That\u2019s a small test to see if you need more sugar or vanilla.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:41.200\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each time you try, you're testing your balance. Tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:52.800\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a recipe you're trying, or even just seeing if your shoes fit, a test is all about gathering information.\n\n00:52.800 --> 01:02.400\nIt\u2019s a tool to help us learn and improve. Remember, tests aren't always about being right or wrong, they\u2019re about learning!\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
