    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:02.500\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:04.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:08.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is ready.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:09.400\nYou stick a toothpick in it!\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:09.900\nThat's a test.\n\n00:09.900 --> 00:13.600\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:17.400\nThey're like check-ins to make sure you're understanding the lessons.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:21.600\nThey can be multiple choice, where you pick the best answer, or maybe you have to write out your answers.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:26.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:29.200\nA math test checks if you can solve problems.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:34.500\nSo, a test helps us learn where we're doing well and where we might need a little extra help.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:37.300\nIt\u2019s all about learning and growing.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:42.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us understand things better.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:45.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
