    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:16.800\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we simply mean a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:35.900\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned. It's all about finding out the answer to a question.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:41.900\nFor example, you might test the temperature of water to see if it's hot enough for a bath.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:48.800\nOr, you might test a recipe by tasting it to see if it needs more salt. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:55.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new. It helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
