    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_130045.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.700\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think about it: when you try a new recipe, you're essentially testing it to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:35.800\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if your phone charger is working. You plug it in, wait a bit, and see if your phone's battery increases. That's a test!\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:43.200\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:53.500\nSo, tests are just tools to gather information and see how things are working, or how much we know. They help us learn and improve.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
