    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test is basically a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like a doctor giving you a check-up, but for an object or an idea.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:34.200\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you bake a cake. You test it by sticking a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean. Or, if you're building a tower of blocks, you test its stability by gently pushing it to see if it falls over.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:47.000\nAnother example: a school exam is a test to see how much you've learned. So, tests help us understand if something is good, bad, or needs improvement.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:55.400\nThey give us information. To sum it up, a test is a simple way to evaluate something and get useful results.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
