    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_130257.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nNow, you might be thinking about school tests, but we're talking about something a little broader.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:24.700\nA test is really just a way to find out something. It's a process, a set of steps you take to see if something is true,\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:32.800\nworks correctly, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:42.100\nThink about it like this: If you want to know if your cookies are done, you might test them by poking them with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:51.600\nOr, if you're buying a new bike, you might test ride it to see if it's comfortable.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:59.000\nSo, in short, a test is a way to check something, learn about it, and make sure it's doing what it's supposed to do. Tests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
