    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out\nsomething about someone or something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like asking a question,\nbut the answer helps us understand more.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:33.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:44.200\nOr, a taste test lets us figure out which\ncookie tastes best! Doctors use tests too,\nlike checking your temperature to see if you're sick.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:51.700\nEven trying out a new video game before you buy it is a kind of test to see if you like it.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to gather information and learn something new.\nIt helps us measure and understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
