    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:06.200\nToday, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:10.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:16.500\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:20.600\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:24.600\nOr, a taste test tells you which food you like best.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:29.000\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what might be going on with your body.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:37.700\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a survey about your favorite colors, or a medical exam, they're all different kinds of tests.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:42.600\nThey help us learn more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:46.600\nIn short, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
