    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:13.500\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but really, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.900\nIt's a process to see if something works, or to check its quality. Think of it like this: you might test if your bike brakes work before going down a big hill.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:30.700\nThat's a test! Or, a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.600\nThey're checking to see if it meets their expectations. We use tests all the time in everyday life.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:44.500\nWhether it's testing if the water is hot enough for a shower, or testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:54.300\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something and see if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
