    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:25.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it! Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:35.300\nFor example, you might test if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, the test says they're ready!\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:48.500\nOr, you might test the water in a pool with your toe. If it feels cold, the test tells you it's too chilly to jump in.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:57.700\nBasically, a test helps us make decisions by giving us information. We perform a test, observe the results, and then use those results to understand something better. So, a test is just a simple way to learn and explore the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
