    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_131001.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:23.100\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:31.900\nThe \"question\" could be anything.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:33.900\nDoes this light bulb work?\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:36.000\nDoes this cake taste good?\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:39.400\nDoes this student understand the lesson?\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:43.700\nAnd the \"answer\" is what the test reveals.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:49.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:55.200\nOr you might take a quiz in school to see how well you've learned a topic.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:59.800\nAnother simple test? Trying on shoes to see if they fit!\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:08.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a procedure used to determine something. They help us learn, diagnose, and make better decisions.\n\n01:08.100 --> 01:11.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
