    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.200\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true. Think about it like this: your doctor might give you a physical exam \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:42.000\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it\u2019s done \u2013 that\u2019s a test too! Tests can be used in lots of different ways, from checking if a lightbulb works, to seeing if a new medicine is safe.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:51.800\nThe main idea is to gather information and learn something. So, remember, a test is just a method for finding things out.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
