    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.600\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something, whether it's how well you know a subject, or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.300\nThat's a test! Similarly, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:42.100\nOr, a doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy. Tests can be simple, like checking if a door is locked, or more complex, like a big exam at school.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:48.700\nThe important thing is that a test gives you information. It helps you understand something better.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:58.600\nSo, in short, a test is a way of finding out information about something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
