    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about a person, thing, or process.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:20.700\nThink of it like gathering information.\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:31.100\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject.\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:42.100\nSo, a test can be anything from a formal exam to a casual experiment.\nThe key is that it helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:54.000\nIn summary, tests are tools for gathering information and making decisions.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
