    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:36.600\nA test is a procedure intended to establish the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:46.700\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if you like a food.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:57.800\nOr, a spelling test at school shows how well you know your words. A doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:01.200\nSo, tests help us understand things better,\n\n01:01.200 --> 01:04.600\nmake decisions, and learn new things.\n\n01:04.600 --> 01:09.800\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from quick and easy to long and complicated.\n\n01:09.800 --> 01:13.200\nBasically, if you're trying to find something out\n\n01:13.200 --> 01:16.200\nin a structured way, you're probably doing a test!\n\n01:16.200 --> 01:18.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
