    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.300\nIt helps us understand if something is true, or working correctly, or even how well you know a certain subject.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:34.300\nThink about it like this: a recipe test is how you find out if a new cake recipe tastes good! Or, a lightbulb test checks if the bulb is working before you screw it in.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:38.700\nAnd your school tests? Those check what you've learned in class.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:49.400\nSo, tests can be used in lots of different ways. They help us learn, improve things, and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:54.800\nThey\u2019re important for checking if things are right, and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
