    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:28.800\nEssentially, a test helps us see if something is working correctly, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:34.500\nFor example, a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:47.600\nA taste test tells you if you like a new flavor. Imagine you're baking a cake. You might test it with a toothpick to see if it\u2019s done.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:58.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, before launching a rocket, engineers run many tests to make sure all the systems are working properly.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:03.500\nSo, a test is just a method to check something and get information.\n\n01:03.500 --> 01:15.100\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
