    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. It\u2019s a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:20.900\nThink about it like this: a cookie test. You bake a batch of cookies, and then you try one.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:29.900\nThat taste test tells you if they're sweet enough, or if they need more chocolate chips. Or imagine you\u2019re taking a quiz in school.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:37.100\nThat test helps your teacher understand what you've learned, and it helps you see what you might need to study more.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:48.800\nTests can be as simple as trying a new food or as complex as a medical exam. They all have the same purpose: to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:57.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
