    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, but instead of chemicals and beakers, we're measuring knowledge, skills, or even abilities.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:26.000\nWe use tests all the time.\nA spelling test tells us how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.300\nA taste test helps decide which flavor is best.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:38.600\nAnd when you see a doctor, they might run tests to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:46.600\nSo, tests help us measure things.\nThey give us information to learn and improve.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:52.500\nRemember, a test isn't about passing or failing, it's about finding out where you are and how you can grow.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
