    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.300\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer. We use tests all the time.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:28.300\nFor example, a taste test lets you discover which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:34.900\nOr, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:46.100\nAnother example? Imagine you're baking a cake. You might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:50.400\nSo, a test is just a method, a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:51.100\nPretty useful, right?\n```"
