    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into something called a test.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.500\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with questions or problems to solve.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:31.200\nThe main idea is to see how well you understand something, or how well something works.\nIt could be a test to see if you know your ABCs, or a test to see if a new toy is strong enough.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:40.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\nOr, a taste test helps decide which cookie tastes best.\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:43.500\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:55.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for figuring something out, whether it's your knowledge, a product's quality, or even just your preference.\nIt\u2019s a way to get answers.\n\n00:55.200 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
