    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:22.700\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:32.800\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:42.400\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. In both cases, we're using the test to get information.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:52.000\nSo, a test could be anything from answering questions on paper to clicking buttons on a website to even just observing something.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:59.800\nThe important thing is that it helps us learn and improve. Tests are super useful for all sorts of things!\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:06.100\nTo recap, a test is a method for gathering information, like checking if soup tastes good or seeing how many words you know.\n\n01:06.100 --> 01:09.600\nIt helps us understand and get better!\n\n01:09.600 --> 01:15.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
