    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:34.300\nThink of it like an experiment, but one that gives you a result, usually a score or some kind of feedback.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:42.900\nThe main idea behind a test is to measure your knowledge or skills in a specific area.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:50.900\nIt could be anything from a spelling test in school, to a driving test to get your license, or even a medical test to check your health.\n\n00:50.900 --> 01:05.700\nFor example, if you take a quiz on animals, the test will tell you how much you know about different kinds of animals. Or, if you take a taste test of different flavors of ice cream, it will tell you which flavor you like best!\n\n01:05.700 --> 01:09.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool we use to learn something about ourselves or the world around us.\n\n01:09.200 --> 01:15.600\nIt helps us understand what we know, what we can do, and sometimes even what we like. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
