    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer. The thing we're trying to learn about could be anything!\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:37.500\nIt could be how well you know your multiplication tables, or how strong a bridge is, or even how much sugar is in your soda.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:44.800\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.000\nA strength test for a bridge checks if it can hold a lot of weight. And a lab test can tell us the sugar content of your drink.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:52.800\nSo, tests help us gather information.\n```"
