    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:18.900\nIt helps us understand if something works, if something is true, or how good something is.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:31.100\nA taste test tells you which food you like best.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:37.300\nTests are used all the time, everywhere!\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:45.600\nWhen you bake a cake, you can poke it with a fork to test if it's done. Doctors use tests to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:46.900\nEven trying out different toys\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:50.100\nis a kind of test to see which one is the most fun!\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:54.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information and learning more. They help us make decisions and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
