    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.800\nHi everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.800 --> 00:06.000\nToday we're tackling something fundamental:\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:10.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information or evaluate something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like checking if something works, or figuring out what someone knows.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:24.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:28.500\nA teacher gives tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:30.500\nEven baking a cake is a test!\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:33.500\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:41.000\nSo, a test is all about gathering information, whether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even how well a cake bakes.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:44.000\nIt helps us understand and make better decisions.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:46.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
