    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:08.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:21.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows certain information. Think of it like this: your doctor might give you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:30.900\nOr, in school, you take a quiz to show your teacher what you've learned. Even baking a cake can be a test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:42.400\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give us information. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:45.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
