    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_135906.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.600\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch. That's a test!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:40.200\nBasically, a test helps us understand if something is working correctly or if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:49.300\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it\u2019s done.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:52.800\nSo, remember, tests are all about checking things. They help us learn and make sure things are working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
