    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_140104.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.799\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.799 --> 00:17.799\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something! It's a process, a procedure, or a method we use to gather information.\n\n00:17.799 --> 00:28.099\nThink of it like this: a spelling test helps us see how well you know your spelling words. Or a taste test tells us which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:28.099 --> 00:37.799\nEven a simple color test can help us identify different shades. Tests help us measure things, understand things, and learn things.\n\n00:37.799 --> 00:46.199\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz, a scientific experiment, or just trying out a new recipe, you're conducting a test!\n\n00:46.199 --> 00:54.599\nIt's all about gathering information to answer a question. Basically, a test is a way of checking things out.\n\n00:54.599 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
