    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and then trying to find the answer.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:18.700\nWe use tests all the time!\nImagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:28.900\nYou might taste the batter - that's a test to see if it tastes good!\nOr, if your toy car isn't working, you might check the batteries.\nThat\u2019s a test to see if they're dead.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:40.200\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking if the water is warm enough for a bath.\nThe important thing is, you're trying to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:47.300\nSo, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
