    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:16.800\nA test, at its core, is just a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like asking a question, but with a structured way to get an answer.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:34.700\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a mini-test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:43.900\nOr, a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature or blood pressure.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:55.300\nAnother simple example is a quiz in school. It's a test to see how well you understand the material. Tests can be as simple as a quick check or as complex as a big exam.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:02.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a structured way to gather information and learn something. It can be anything from tasting cake batter to taking a quiz.\n\n01:02.800 --> 01:03.500\nIt helps us understand the world around us a little better.\n01:03.500 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
