    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s a process designed to give us information about something specific.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:27.600\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:32.800\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:38.000\nSee? They\u2019re both tests!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:47.400\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. That helps your teacher see how well you understand spelling rules.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:58.300\nTests aren't scary; they're just tools for learning and understanding. So, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information. It helps us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
