    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHello everyone, and welcome! \nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? \nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:27.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health, like taking your temperature or blood pressure.\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:39.500\nA test could be a quiz, an exam, or even just trying something out to see if it works.\nFor example, a baker tests a new recipe by making a small batch first.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:49.300\nSo, tests help us understand things better. \nThey give us information we can use to make decisions or learn and improve.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:59.000\nIn short, a test is a way of gathering information.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:02.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
