    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:05.500 --> 00:15.700\nToday, we're diving into the world of tests! A test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:28.400\nYou wouldn't just guess, right? You'd probably stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:38.400\nTests help us understand if something is working as it should, or if it needs some tweaking. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:47.500\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:52.000\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and check something.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.600\nThey help us learn and improve!\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
