    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:25.600\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something works, or what someone knows.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:42.400\nThink about it like this: a taste test tells you how good food tastes. A spelling test shows how well you can spell. A medical test helps doctors figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:51.100\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions, whether it's choosing the best ice cream flavor or making sure a bridge is safe.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.600\nThey are a vital way to understand the world around us. In short, tests are all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
