    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests!\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.000\nA test, at its most basic, is just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:23.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:27.400\nDid you ever check if your shoes were tied before running?\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:32.500\nThat's a test! You're testing to see if they're secure.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:38.000\nOr maybe you tasted your food to see if it needed salt.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:43.500\nAnother test! You\u2019re checking the flavor.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:56.100\nIn school, tests help us see what we've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just a simple question from your teacher.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:06.800\nThe key thing is, tests help us understand where we are and where we need to go. So, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:06.800 --> 01:11.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
