    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHello and welcome! Today we're going to learn about what a test is.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be to see if you understand a topic, or to check if something works correctly.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:30.100\nSee? You're performing a test!\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:39.900\nSo, a test is just a structured way of gathering information. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:54.000\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. In short, a test is a process to evaluate knowledge, skills, or the functionality of something.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
