    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:19.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like this: it's a method to see if something is working correctly, if something is true, or if you understand something.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:24.400\nTests can come in many forms. A doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:33.500\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you've learned the material. Or, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:42.300\nSo, let's say you're building a birdhouse. You might test it by placing it outside to see if it can withstand the weather.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:58.700\nOr, if you're learning to play the piano, you might test your skills by playing a simple song. In short, a test is a procedure used to verify information, assess skills, or evaluate performance.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:04.700\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
