    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.000\nNow, you might be thinking of school, but in general, a test is just a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:21.900\nIt's like asking a question to see if you get the right answer.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:30.700\nThink about baking a cake. You might test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:40.000\nOr imagine you're trying to figure out why your flashlight isn't working. You might test if the batteries are dead by putting them in another device.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:49.300\nIf they don't work there either, you've found the problem!\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:56.000\nSo, a test is basically a check. It helps us confirm things and solve problems. We use them all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
