    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or examine something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:24.000\nWe use tests to see if something is working correctly, or to find out more about it.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:30.400\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:41.300\nOr, a chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt. These are all tests!\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:52.100\nWe use them every day to make sure things are okay, or to learn something new.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:59.000\nFor example, you might test a new lightbulb to see if it turns on. Or, you could test the temperature of water to see if it\u2019s hot enough for a bath.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:05.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something. It helps us understand the world around us.\n\n01:05.800 --> 01:08.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
