    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.900\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in this case, a test is simply a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you take a little bite to test if it tastes good. That bite is a test!\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:33.600\nOr, maybe you're building a birdhouse. You might test it by putting it outside to see if it can withstand the wind and rain. That's another test!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:39.400\nTests help us find problems early so we can fix them.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.200\nThey can be as simple as looking at something to see if it's broken, or more complicated, like running a computer program to check for errors.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:54.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check if something is doing what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
