    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt could be about you, about a product, or even about an idea.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nThe main point of a test is to gather information.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:33.200\nWe use that information to make decisions or understand things better.\nFor instance, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:44.200\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\nAnother example: A scientist might run a test to see if a new medicine works.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:56.200\nTests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for finding something out.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
