    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're tackling a fundamental concept: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:18.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:41.900\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to test your knowledge of a subject. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:53.000\nSo, tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying out a new phone. The key thing is they help us evaluate something, learn more, and make decisions.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.500\nIn a nutshell, a test is a way of checking things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
