    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else. Think of it like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:20.400\nTests can be all sorts of things. Your doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:31.800\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:38.000\nFor example, imagine you want to know if a plant needs water. You can touch the soil.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:47.700\nIf it feels dry, that's your test telling you it probably needs water. Another example, you push a door to see if it's locked. That's a test too!\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:54.900\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something or get information. It's all about asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:02.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
