    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like an experiment or a way to check if something is true or works correctly.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:21.700\nThink about it this way. If you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might use a toothpick.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:32.500\nSticking the toothpick in and seeing if it comes out clean is a test. Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you can balance.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:43.700\nTests aren't just for baking or biking, though! They're used in all sorts of areas, from science and medicine to school and even video games.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:55.700\nThe key is that a test helps you learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:01.900\nSo, remember, a test is a simple way to find something out. It helps us check things and learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
