    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are, and why we use them.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:20.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be finding out how much you know about a subject, or even checking to see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:32.600\nThink of it like this: a school test helps your teacher see how well you've learned the material. Or, imagine your parents testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:44.900\nTests aren't just about right or wrong answers, they help us understand things better. For example, a doctor might run tests to figure out what\u2019s making you feel sick.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:57.300\nOr, an engineer might test a bridge design to make sure it\u2019s strong enough. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:06.600\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
