    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:17.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. It's a method we use to see if something is true, or to check how well something works.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:29.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough. Or, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:42.600\nTests can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on. Or, they can be more complex, like a doctor running blood tests to understand your health.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:52.800\nBasically, a test is any process that gives us information. So remember, a test helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
