    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:22.500\nIt's like asking a question to see if you understand the answer.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:26.300\nThink about it this way: When you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:29.700\nThat's a test! You're checking if the cake is done.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:40.200\nOr, when you're learning to ride a bike, falling down is kind of a test of your balance.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:45.600\nTests aren't just in school, they're everywhere!\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:47.900\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:50.800\nSo remember, a test is simply a way to check something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "30c69255-f813-4956-8351-38078848403c": {
