    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_144759.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.900\nSimply put, a test is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:19.500\nYou do a test \u2013 you poke them with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, they pass the test!\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:24.000\nTests aren't just for cookies, though. They're used everywhere!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:28.500\nYour doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:35.800\nTeachers give tests to see what you've learned in class. Even video games have tests built in, like when you try to jump over a gap.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:44.600\nIf you make it, you pass the test! So, a test is a way to see if something works, if something is true, or if something is good enough.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:52.300\nIt's a check, a challenge, a way to learn.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
