    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_144907.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:24.900\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.100\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:39.000\nOr maybe you want to know if you're ready for a bike race, so you time yourself riding a practice lap.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:44.900\nThat's another kind of test. Tests help us understand where we are and what we're capable of.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:52.900\nWhether it's a school exam, a medical checkup, or even just trying a new recipe, tests give us valuable information.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a process for learning something about ourselves\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.300\nor the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
