    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_144948.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:18.800\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:32.000\nA test helps us see if something is true, or if something works the way we expect it to.\nThink about it like this: when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\nOr, when you push a button on a toy, you're testing if it will make a sound.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:41.200\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:52.600\nDoctors use tests to figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:00.100\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way of checking something out, whether it's a recipe, a toy, or your understanding of a new topic.\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us better.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:05.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
