    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_145032.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.400\nIt could be anything from a school quiz to checking if your cookies are done baking. The main idea behind a test is to gather information.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:29.800\nThink about it: a math test helps your teacher understand what you've learned. Or, poking a cake with a fork? That's a test to see if it's cooked all the way through!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:37.600\nLet's say you're testing if a toy car needs new batteries. You try to turn it on.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:45.600\nIf it doesn't work, that's your test result: it probably needs new batteries!\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:57.100\nSo, remember, a test is a way to learn something by observing or trying something out. It helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
