    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:22.200\nWe use them all the time, even if you don\u2019t realize it.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, a simple test could be tasting a new food.\nYour taste buds are testing the flavor, and your brain tells you if you like it or not.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:38.500\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is broken.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:48.600\nYou flip the switch. If the light turns on, the bulb passes the test! If it doesn't, well, it failed.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:54.100\nTests help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:00.700\nThey can be anything from a school exam to checking if your car is working properly.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:04.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way of getting information.\n\n01:04.400 --> 01:07.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
