    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:26.200\nIt helps us see if something works the way it should, or if it meets certain requirements.\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and then you test it by taking a bite to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:33.200\nOr imagine you're buying a new toy, you might test it out in the store to make sure all the buttons work.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:44.000\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the material.\nIn software, tests make sure a program runs correctly.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:59.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: to check and verify.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and make sure it works as expected.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
