    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:24.900\nThe toothpick comes out clean? The cake passes the test.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:30.000\nTests are everywhere. Your doctor gives you tests to check your health.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:35.100\nSchools give you tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:43.400\nEven your phone runs tests to make sure all its parts are working correctly.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:51.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and see if something meets a certain standard or requirement.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:56.000\nUnderstanding this fundamental idea is the first step to understanding all sorts of testing in the world around you.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
