    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.700\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:31.600\nYou screw it into a lamp and turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:37.100\nOr maybe you want to know if a cookie is sweet enough. You take a bite and see. That's a test too!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:42.900\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like tasting that cookie.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:48.700\nThe important thing is they give you information. They help you understand something better.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:56.100\nSo, tests are all about gathering information through a structured process.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.000\nThey help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
