    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_150432.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:11.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:21.300\nIt's like a measuring stick for your knowledge and skills. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:30.300\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes the best! Tests aren't just in school, they're everywhere.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:38.300\nThey help us learn and improve. For example, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you sick.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:50.000\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it needs more sugar. Basically, a test helps you gather information to make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:50.000 --> 01:03.400\nSo, a test is a method of evaluation, measuring knowledge, skills, or abilities. Tests are everywhere and help us learn and make informed decisions.\n\n01:03.400 --> 01:07.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
