    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.800\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in a broader sense, a test is really just a way of checking something out.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.700\nIt's how we find out if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:34.600\nThink of it like this: When you bake a cake, you might test it by sticking a toothpick in.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:39.600\nThat's a test!\nOr, imagine you're trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:44.500\nYou're testing if you like it!\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:58.400\nWe perform them to get results, to gather data, and to ultimately make better decisions.\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a way to evaluate or check something.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:08.200\nIt could be a school exam, a cake recipe, or even a new video game.\nThe purpose is always to get information.\n\n01:08.200 --> 01:13.100\nThanks for watching!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
