    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:20.900\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:29.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in. That's a test!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:42.700\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like tasting a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:50.900\nThe point is to get information. So, if you're learning to bake, you might test if your oven is heating evenly by placing bread slices on different parts of the rack.\n\n00:50.900 --> 01:02.600\nOr, if you're building with blocks, you might test if your tower is stable by gently pushing on it. See? Tests are all around us, helping us learn and improve.\n\n01:02.600 --> 01:06.000\nBasically, a test is just a quick way to gather information and check if something is as it should be.\n\n01:06.000 --> 01:09.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
