    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_150749.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out. It's like asking a question, but instead of just talking, you're doing something to get an answer.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:22.300\nThink about it. A taste test tells you if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:31.300\nA spelling test shows how well you know your words. And a medical test can help doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:36.500\nSo, tests aren't just about grades in school. They're everywhere!\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:42.900\nThey help us learn, understand, and make decisions. They give us information.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:57.200\nBasically, a test is a process or procedure used to determine something. It can be as simple as checking if a lightbulb works, or as complex as figuring out if a new medicine is safe.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:04.600\nRemember, a test is all about finding something out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
