    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: What exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about a person or thing.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:26.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling knowledge.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:34.300\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie you like best. A medical test can tell you if you're feeling okay.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:45.800\nSo, we use tests all the time to learn new things. They help us measure skills, preferences, or even health.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:51.100\nThey can be as simple as asking a friend a question or as complex as a standardized exam.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.800\nIn short, a test is just a way to gather information. Now you know! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
