    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_151125.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:18.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check or evaluate something.\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:29.300\nTests help us understand how well something is performing or what its qualities are.\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:37.200\nOr, think about testing a new recipe.\nYou follow the steps and then taste it to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:49.600\nAnother example is testing a toy to see if it's safe for kids to play with.\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a process used to gather information and assess something.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:57.000\nThey're all around us, helping us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
