    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.500\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:25.800\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we understand a topic.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:29.500\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:34.900\nOr, you take tests in school to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:47.500\nAnother example?\nImagine baking a cake.\nYou might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\nThe taste is your test!\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:51.100\nSo, a test is just a procedure or an activity used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n```"
