    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_151250.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check something. It helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.200\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:35.000\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.800\nEven baking a cake is a test! You\u2019re testing if you followed the recipe correctly and if the cake will taste good.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:55.200\nTests can be big or small, formal or informal. The important thing is that they give us information. They let us know if we're on the right track, or if we need to make some adjustments.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn from the results. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
