    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.311 --> 00:05.031\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.031 --> 00:17.281\nA test is basically a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to see what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:17.281 --> 00:25.631\nThere are all kinds of tests!\nYou might take a math test at school to see how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:25.631 --> 00:34.681\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\nFor example, imagine you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:34.681 --> 00:43.241\nYou can do a simple test: stick a toothpick in the middle.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:43.241 --> 00:46.871\nIf it's gooey, it needs more time.\n\n00:46.871 --> 00:50.311\nSee?\nThat's a test!\n\n00:50.311 --> 00:56.801\nSo, to recap, a test is a method to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:56.801 --> 01:01.421\nIt helps us understand, diagnose, and make decisions.\n\n01:01.421 --> 01:03.121\nPretty useful, right?\n\n01:03.121 --> 01:05.701\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
