    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.000\nToday we're going to explore something super important:\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.000\nwhat a test actually is.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:17.000\nIt's like asking a question, but instead of just listening, you're looking for proof.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.000\nThink about it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:22.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:26.000\nOr, imagine baking a cake.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:29.000\nYou might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:30.000\nThat\u2019s also a test!\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:36.000\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like tasting soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:42.000\nThe key is, you're gathering information to make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:46.000\nSo, a test is just a way to learn and check things out.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:50.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
