    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:19.700\nIt\u2019s a process designed to see if something is working correctly, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:30.300\nThink about it like this: your doctor might give you a test to check if you're healthy. Or, your teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:37.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You\u2019re testing your recipe to see if it comes out delicious.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:52.400\nSo, tests come in many forms and are used to evaluate all sorts of things. Whether it's checking your health, your knowledge, or even your baking skills, tests help us understand something better.\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:02.800\nThey give us information we can use. In short, a test is an evaluation process that helps us gather information and understand something.\n\n01:02.800 --> 01:06.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
