    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something really important: tests!\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:26.300\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think about it: When you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:42.200\nOr, if you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it turns on the TV. Tests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if the water is hot before you get in the shower.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:50.800\nThey help us understand things better and make decisions. So, tests are all about gathering information!\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
