    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you poke one with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:23.400\nYou're checking if the inside is cooked.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:35.000\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:43.800\nAnother simple example is checking if a lightbulb works.\nYou screw it in and flip the switch.\nIf it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:49.400\nTests are all around us, helping us learn and improve things.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:55.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something!\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
