    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_153925.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:17.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much someone knows about a particular subject, or how well they can perform a specific skill.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:24.700\nThink about it like this: if you want to know if your cake is done, you can poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:29.700\nThat's a test! Or maybe you want to see if your friend can ride a bike.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:42.300\nYou watch them try, and that's a test of their biking ability. Tests can be written, like quizzes in school, or they can be practical, like a driving test.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:51.400\nThe important thing is that they help us understand something better. So, a test helps us learn what someone knows or can do.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:56.900\nPretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
