    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:15.700\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like asking a question, and the test helps you get the answer. It could be anything, really.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:31.500\nLike a spelling test at school, which helps your teacher see if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:39.700\nOr even trying a new recipe to see if it tastes good! That's a test too!\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:41.400\nLet's say you want to know if your plant needs water.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:43.100\nYou could poke your finger in the soil.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:53.300\nIf it feels dry, that's your test telling you it's time to water the plant. See? Simple!\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:54.800\nSo, a test is just a method for finding information or checking something.\n```"
