    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:15.100\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to find out how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on. That's a test!\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:28.200\nThe main idea behind a test is to get information. We use tests all the time.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:34.000\nFor example, a teacher gives you a quiz to test what you learned in class.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:39.200\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:44.200\nHere\u2019s another example. Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:45.800\nYou taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:47.200\nSee? A test!\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:56.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information about knowledge, performance, or even just if something is working as it should.\n\n00:56.500 --> 00:59.400\nIt helps us understand and learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
