    "updated_at": "2026-01-03T15:43:09.837320",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260103_154309.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_154309.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.300\nHey there, welcome! Ever wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:21.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:28.500\nYou might take one out and try it \u2013 that's a test! Tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:41.000\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you've learned the material. If you're learning to ride a bike, falling down is a test \u2013 it shows you what not to do next time.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:55.600\nAnother example: You try a new recipe. Tasting it afterwards is a test to see if it's good. Tests can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all help us learn and improve.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see how things are going. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
