    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_154447.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:19.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. We use them all the time to see if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:29.500\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:49.100\nOr, a chef might taste their food to test if it's seasoned right. Even when you try a new video game, you\u2019re testing it out to see if you like it!\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:56.800\nSo, whether it's a medical test, a taste test, or even testing out a new app, the basic idea is always the same: to gather information and make a judgment.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:01.100\nTests help us understand the world around us and make better decisions. That\u2019s the core idea of a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
