    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.000\nIt helps us learn about ourselves, or things around us. Think about it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:37.000\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject. Tests can be written, like a multiple choice exam, or they can involve doing something, like a science experiment.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:46.600\nFor example, a taste test helps you decide which cookie is your favorite. A spelling test shows you which words you need to practice.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:49.200\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:56.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool. It's a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:03.200\nThey help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
