    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:05.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:05.500 --> 09.600\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:09.600 --> 12.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking,\n\n00:12.000 --> 13.700\nso you insert a toothpick.\n\n00:13.700 --> 14.300\nThat's a test!\n\n00:14.300 --> 16.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:16.700 --> 20.100\nIt could be a multiple-choice exam at school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:20.100 --> 22.400\nOr a medical test to check your health.\n\n00:22.400 --> 24.700\nMaybe even testing a new toy to see if it's safe.\n\n00:24.700 --> 27.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:27.900 --> 31.000\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\n\n00:31.000 --> 35.600\nSee? Tests are all around us, helping us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:35.600 --> 38.900\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:38.900 --> 41.900\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n00:41.900 --> 44.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
