    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:20.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how well you understand something or how well something works.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:34.100\nThink of it like this: You want to know if your cookies taste good, so you give one to a friend to test it out! In school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:42.800\nThey can be written exams, like multiple choice questions, or even a practical test, like baking those cookies!\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:51.100\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve some problems. Or, a science test might ask you to explain a concept.\n\n00:51.100 --> 01:01.700\nThe results of the test show you, and your teacher, where you're doing great and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:07.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to check understanding or performance, whether it's tasting a cookie or answering questions in class.\n\n01:07.900 --> 01:13.200\nIt helps us all learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
