    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it like an experiment, where you try something out to see what happens.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:30.200\nThe main idea is to ask a question or present a situation and then observe the response.\nThis helps us understand how something works, how well it performs, or what it's made of.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:37.300\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done, you stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:52.300\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, falling down a few times is a test of your balance.\nTests can be big or small, simple or complex, but they all involve trying something to get an answer.\n\n00:52.300 --> 01:02.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something by trying it out.\nWe ask a question and look at the answer.\n\n01:02.100 --> 01:07.100\nEasy peasy!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
