    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_155824.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:14.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.600\nIt helps us understand if something works, if something is true, or even how well someone knows something.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.300\nThink about it like this: you might test a new recipe by cooking it and tasting it. That's a test!\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:39.100\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. In school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:49.800\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and seeing where things stand. They can be used to check anything from a lightbulb to your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:59.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
