    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.300\nIt's like asking a question and then figuring out the answer. Think about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:30.700\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic. A test helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:43.200\nFor example, you might test the temperature of water to see if it's hot enough for tea. Or, you might test a recipe by making a small batch first to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:54.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate or measure something. It helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
