    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:36.600\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, tasting it is a test to see if it's good.\nOr, if you try turning on a light switch and the light doesn't come on, that's a test that tells you something might be wrong with the bulb.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:49.500\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\nThe important thing is they help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:58.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
