    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_160537.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to see how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.200\nIt's like checking your knowledge. Think of it like this: if you're learning to ride a bike, a test might be seeing if you can ride without training wheels.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:35.400\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, a test could be naming all the letters. Tests help us understand what we've learned and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:44.100\nThey can be written, like filling in the blanks, or they can be hands-on, like showing someone how to do something.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:51.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and grow. It helps show what we know!\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
