    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea, or checking if something works the way it should.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:28.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes better!\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:38.400\nA scientist might run a test to see if a new medicine is safe. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:46.300\nThey give us information we didn't have before. Basically, a test is just a way of finding out something.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:54.000\nKeep that in mind and you'll be testing like a pro in no time! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
