    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works \u2013 you turn it on to test it! In school, tests help teachers understand how well you're learning the material.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:31.800\nBut tests aren't just for school. You might take a test to get a driver's license, or even test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:40.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words. A math test checks your ability to solve problems.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.600\nAnd taste-testing a cookie is, you guessed it, a test to see how yummy it is! So, remember, a test is just a way to measure something. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
