    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:23.300\nIt's a process designed to give us information or measure something specific. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:29.500\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Those are both examples of tests.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:40.900\nTests can be written, like quizzes, or they can be practical, like a driving test. The important thing is that they give us a result or some feedback.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:47.900\nThey help us understand something better. So, to recap, a test is a procedure used to gather information and measure a particular skill, knowledge, or attribute.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:53.900\nIt helps us learn and understand.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
