    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a method for gathering information about something, or someone. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.700\nOr, a taste test lets you compare different flavors to see which one you like best.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:42.200\nTests aren't just in school, either. When you try a new video game, you're essentially testing it out to see if you enjoy playing it.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:48.500\nThe test result is whether you had fun!\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:51.900\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.500\nThey provide information we can use. In short, a test is a way to learn something new!\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
