    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_161244.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:3.800\nToday we're diving into something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:03.800 --> 00:07.000\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:08.700\nThink of it like an investigation.\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:13.000\nYou want to know if something is true, or how well something works, so you run a test.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:18.000\nFor example, if you want to know if a toy car is fast, you could run a test by timing how long it takes to go across the room.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:24.000\nOr, if you want to know if a plant needs more water, you can check the soil \u2013 that's a simple test!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:27.000\nTests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:31.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find something out by trying something out.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:32.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
