    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: you're testing if a lightbulb works by screwing it into a lamp. If it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:33.100\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time. A doctor might run tests to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:45.100\nA chef might taste their food to test if it needs more salt. Even a game of \"hide and seek\" is a test to see if the seeker can find you!\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:53.600\nSo, tests help us understand things and make sure they are doing what they're supposed to do. They're all about checking and confirming.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.200\nRemember, a test is simply a way to check if something is working or true. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
