    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information about something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:24.800\nTests can be about anything! Maybe you're taking a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:34.800\nOr perhaps a scientist is testing a new medicine to see if it works.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:45.600\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like the taste!\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:53.700\nSo, whether it's a quiz, an experiment, or just trying something new, a test is all about learning and finding out information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.400\nRemember, tests aren't always scary; they're just tools to help us understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
