    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is basically a way to see how much you know about something. Think of it like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:23.200\nIt helps you, and maybe your teacher, understand what you've learned and what you might need a little extra help with.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:33.600\nThere are lots of different kinds of tests. For example, a quiz in class, a spelling test, or even a practice test online.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:40.200\nThey all have the same goal: to show what you understand.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:52.100\nImagine learning about animals. A test might ask you to name different animals or match them to their habitats.\n\n00:52.100 --> 01:00.500\nOr, if you're learning math, a test might ask you to solve some simple addition problems.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:08.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn. It shows what you know and where you can improve.\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:14.200\nDon't be scared of them! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
