    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:06.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:08.500\nWe use them all the time, even if we don\u2019t realize it.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:13.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:17.400\nThe test?\nYou poke them with a toothpick.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:20.600\nIf it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:23.700\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:27.700\nThey can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like building a model.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:32.000\nA doctor might use a test to see if you have a cold by checking your temperature.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:36.800\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:39.600\nThey're not always scary, they're just tools!\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:42.500\nRemember, practice and preparation are key.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:44.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
