    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting a verbal answer, you're getting information through a specific process.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:28.900\nFor example, a math test helps us understand how well you know your numbers.\nA taste test tells us which food we like best.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:46.100\nEven a medical test helps doctors learn about your health.\nSo, whether it's finding out your favorite color, checking the strength of a bridge, or making sure a product works correctly, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:54.700\nBasically, a test is just a structured way to get answers.\nAnd with those answers, we can learn and improve.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
