    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_162725.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:15.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.600\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nFor example, when you flip a light switch, you're testing if the lightbulb works.\nIf it turns on, great!\nThe bulb passes the test.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.100\nIf it doesn't, well, it failed.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:36.900\nAnother example is tasting food.\nYou\u2019re testing if you like the flavor!\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:49.600\nSo, tests help us figure out if something is working correctly, if something is true, or just if something meets a certain standard.\nThey're a fundamental way we learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
