    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:14.100\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\nThink of it like checking if the lightbulb in your lamp works.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:24.700\nYou flip the switch \u2013 that's your test!\nThe main point of a test is to see if something meets a certain standard, or if it works as expected.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:34.200\nIt could be a written exam in school, testing your knowledge.\nOr, it could be a medical test, checking your health.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:40.800\nLet's say you're baking a cake.\nTasting it after baking is a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:56.700\nOr, if you're building with LEGOs, checking if the pieces fit together properly is also a test.\nSo, a test is simply a way to find out if something is working, meeting requirements, or is up to par.\nIt's all about checking!\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
