    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.325 --> 00:01.925\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.925 --> 00:04.255\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.255 --> 00:06.635\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.635 --> 00:10.175\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:10.175 --> 00:10.845\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:10.845 --> 00:12.075\nThink about it.\n\n00:12.075 --> 00:16.575\nWhen you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:16.575 --> 00:20.085\nThat toothpick is giving you information, telling you if the inside is still gooey or nice and cooked.\n\n00:20.085 --> 00:24.875\nOr, imagine you're learning new words. A quiz is a test to see how many words you've learned.\n\n00:24.875 --> 00:32.625\nSo, a test is just a structured way to gather information and see what you know, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:32.625 --> 00:34.345\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:34.345 --> 00:36.085\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
