    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_163337.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.600\nNow, what is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:23.500\nIt helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if something is true. Think of it like this:\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:36.800\nA doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it \u2013 if it comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:49.300\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand a topic. These tests can be anything from multiple choice questions to writing an essay.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:57.200\nSo, a test is basically a method to see if something meets a certain standard or expectation. It's a way to gather information and make sure things are on the right track.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:00.300\nThat's the basic idea of what a test is!\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
