    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, so you're wondering, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:10.800\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:16.300\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific right or wrong answer.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:18.800\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:24.100\nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:27.400\nYou taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:32.500\nOr, think about taking a spelling test in school.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:35.900\nThat's testing your knowledge of how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:40.800\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and drivers take tests to show they know how to drive safely.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:51.300\nBasically, a test helps us measure something, whether it's a skill, knowledge, or even just the sweetness of cake batter.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:53.900\nIt's all about finding out information!\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:00.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:03.200\nIt helps us learn and understand.\n\n01:03.200 --> 01:04.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
