    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_163744.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is basically a way to check if something works correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to make sure it's safe, or a chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:35.000\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just activities.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:50.000\nThey show what you already know and what you might need a little extra help with. For example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words, while a math test checks your understanding of numbers and calculations.\n\n00:50.000 --> 01:02.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to check understanding or performance, used in lots of different situations, from toys to soup to school.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:08.000\nIt helps us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
