    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_163824.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is working, if something is true, or how good someone is at something.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like this: a baking test lets you know if your cake is cooked all the way through.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:34.800\nOr, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:45.300\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are the way they should be.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:48.900\nIn short, a test is just a process to gain information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
