    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question, or setting up a situation, and then observing the results.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:25.300\nThink about it this way: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.500\nA teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:42.700\nEven baking a cake is like a test! You're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you get a delicious result.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.600\nSo, tests aren't just about grades or feeling stressed. They're a fundamental way we learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:00.900\nThey help us gather information and make better decisions. In summary, a test helps us learn about something by observing the results. It could be anything from a medical checkup to trying out a new recipe! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
