    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_164042.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:14.800\nThink of a test as a way to check something and see how it performs.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:27.600\nIt's like a detective looking for clues. The basic idea is simple: you give something a challenge, and you see how it responds.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:37.300\nFor example, a taste test checks if you like a new flavor of ice cream. Or, a spelling test checks if you know how to write certain words.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:49.400\nAnother example could be testing a toy to see if it's safe for kids. We shake it, drop it, and make sure nothing breaks off easily.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:58.200\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and make sure things are safe. In short, a test is a way to gather information by seeing how something reacts to a challenge.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.100\nThat's the basic idea!\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
