    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something, to see if it works or if it's true.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe by cooking it. The taste is the result of your test!\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:28.700\nOr, imagine testing a toy car by letting it roll down a ramp. Does it reach the end? That's your test result.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:34.000\nTests aren't just for cooking or toys, though.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:39.300\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:53.300\nBasically, any time you're trying to find out if something is working as it should, you're performing a test. So remember, a test is all about checking something.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
