    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nFor example, when you flip a light switch, you're testing if the lightbulb works.\nIf it lights up, the test passed!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.400\nOr, when you try a new food, you're testing if you like the taste.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:46.000\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking if your shoes are tied.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:55.500\nThe important thing is that a test helps you get information or confirm something you want to know.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:00.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find something out.\nIt's about asking a question and seeing what the answer is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
