    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:16.400\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\nIt's how we check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:29.900\nYou do a test, right?\nYou might poke them with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you the cookies are ready!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:38.300\nOr maybe you want to know if your plant needs water.\nYou can test it by sticking your finger in the soil.\nIf it feels dry, the test tells you it's time to water it.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:52.200\nTests aren't always about baking or plants, of course.\nThey're used in science, in school, even in everyday life to help us understand things better and make smarter choices.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:57.700\nSo remember, a test is just a way to get information!\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
