    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.700\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.700 --> 00:03.400\nToday, we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:04.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:07.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:11.100\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:14.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:17.600\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor you like best.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:21.100\nOr, a medical test helps doctors understand what\u2019s going on inside your body.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:23.700\nSo, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:28.200\nThey help us measure things and make decisions based on the results.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:33.000\nWhether it's acing that exam, picking the perfect ice cream, or staying healthy, tests play a role.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:35.500\nIn short, a test is a way to learn and evaluate!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:37.800\nWe hope this helps you understand the basics of tests.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:39.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
