    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or measure something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:21.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working properly, if you've learned something new, or even how good something is.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:33.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, after learning about animals in school, you might take a test to see how much you remember.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:43.700\nAnother example is testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with. So, tests are all about finding out information.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:54.000\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. In short, a test helps us understand and measure things!\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
