    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about something really important: tests.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:19.900\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on. That's a test!\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:33.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Your teacher gives you a quiz to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:45.300\nA doctor might order a blood test to see if you're healthy. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like the food!\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:54.700\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better by providing information or results.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.400\nSo, remember, tests are just tools for learning and understanding. They help us see where we're at and what we can improve on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
