    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:17.700\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests. Now, in the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out information. Think of it like asking a question and then getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:23.400\nTests are used everywhere! Your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.600\nA chef might taste their food to test if it needs more salt. Even when you play a game, you\u2019re constantly testing your skills to see if you can win.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:46.000\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz at school, or checking if your cookies are baked through, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions. Basically, a test is a process to see if something is working or true.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:57.700\nTo recap, tests are all about gathering information and checking things. They\u2019re a crucial part of learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
