    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: you're trying to understand if a cookie is delicious. You take a bite \u2013 that's your test!\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:34.600\nEssentially, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. It could be your knowledge, like a school quiz.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:43.900\nOr it could be the quality of a product, like checking if a new toy is safe.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:54.200\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. A chef might taste-test a sauce to make sure it's seasoned correctly.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:04.300\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a simple test! So, in short, a test is a way to gather information and make a judgment.\n\n01:04.300 --> 01:09.799\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n01:09.799 --> 01:13.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
