    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like a way to see if something works, or if it's true. Maybe you test a cake by tasting it to see if it's good.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:29.900\nOr maybe a doctor tests your eyesight to see how well you can see. In school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:41.500\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just simple exercises. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test checks if you understand how to solve problems.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:55.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something, whether it's your knowledge, a recipe, or even your eyes. It helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
