    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:08.200\nToday we're diving into the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:12.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:20.100\nIt's a process or a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:24.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:28.000\nA taste test lets you decide which food you like best.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:31.500\nAnd a strength test measures how strong you are.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.700\nSo, tests help us learn, compare, and make decisions.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:39.500\nThey give us information based on evidence.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:44.500\nRemember, a test is just a way to get information about something.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:48.600\nWe use that information to understand the world around us better.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:54.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
