    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:05.200\nAt its simplest, a test is just a way to find something out, right?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:7.900\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:12.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:16.200\nFor example, you might test the temperature of your soup to see if it's too hot to eat.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:20.700\nOr, imagine a doctor runs a blood test to check your vitamin levels.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:22.300\nThese are both tests!\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:26.000\nThey help us understand something better by giving us concrete results.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:30.100\nSo, a test is really just a method for evaluating or measuring something.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:36.500\nWe use tests all the time, in big ways and small, to learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:38.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
