    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's like an experiment or a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it this way: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:38.600\nOr, a taste test tells you which cookie tastes the best.\nEven a simple blood test at the doctor helps them understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:52.800\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz in school to a scientific experiment in a lab.\nThe main idea is that it's a structured way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nTo recap, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
