    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.700\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:29.800\nThis question could be about anything! Maybe you want to test if a cake is done baking \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:37.200\nOr perhaps you want to test if a toy car works \u2013 you wind it up and see if it goes! These are all mini-tests.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:46.300\nIn science, tests are called experiments. Scientists use them to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:56.500\nFor example, they might test if a plant grows faster with more sunlight. They give some plants more sun and see what happens!\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.000\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to learn something by trying something out. It\u2019s about asking a question and then finding the answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
