    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.300\nToday we're diving into a really important concept: what is a test?\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:24.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:30.900\nThink of it as a question we're asking the world, and the test gives us an answer.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:37.200\nIt could be anything! Like, a taste test to see if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:44.000\nOr a spelling test at school to see how well you remember your words.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:47.700\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a kind of test.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:49.800\nYou're testing if it lights up!\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:52.800\nTests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:54.600\nThey give us information we didn't have before.\n```"
