    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_171756.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly,\nor if we know something.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:40.000\nA taste test tells us if food tastes good.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:47.800\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:51.900\nSo, tests can be used to check lots of different things, from your knowledge to the quality of a product.\nThe results give us information we can use to learn and improve.\nIn short, a test is a way to get answers!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
