    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you get the right answer. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a concept.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:34.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy. Or, your teacher might give you a test in class to see how well you\u2019ve learned the material.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:45.700\nMaybe you even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good! So, a test is just a simple way to check, measure, or evaluate something.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:52.700\nRemember, it's all about finding out information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
