    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.800\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\nIt helps us figure out if something works the way it should, or if it's true or false.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb works.\nYou screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.200\nIf it lights up, the test passes!\nIf it doesn't, the test fails.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:34.200\nAnother example could be a taste test.\nYou try a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:39.000\nDo you like it?\nThat's a test of your own personal preference.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:45.400\nOr think about a spelling test at school.\nIt checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:57.600\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a process to see if something is working, true, or correct.\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
