    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:23.900\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:29.700\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\nSee? Different things, same idea.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:35.700\nAnother example is a doctor giving you a checkup.\nThey're running tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:45.700\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are as they should be.\nThey are a way of gathering information.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:53.700\nBasically, a test is a process designed to answer a question.\nIt can be simple or complex, but its purpose is always to provide information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:03.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
