    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:20.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, that helps us understand more about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:30.900\nThe main idea is to measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:40.300\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well someone knows how to spell words. Or, a taste test can help us decide which kind of ice cream is the yummiest!\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:49.800\nDoctors even use tests to check if we're healthy.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:59.000\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have one thing in common: they help us learn and understand. They give us information that we can then use to make decisions or improve things.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:02.500\nRemember, a test is just a tool for learning. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
