    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_172421.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests, specifically what a test is.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:24.500\nThink about it: a taste test lets you find out which food you like best.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:30.400\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:43.000\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a test! You're testing if it turns on.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:51.900\nSo, a test can be anything from a school exam to a simple everyday check. The important thing is that it helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:57.600\nIt\u2019s all about gathering information. Basically, a test is a question, and the result tells you the answer. Easy peasy, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
