    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_172519.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.100\nHey everyone,\n\n00:01.100 --> 00:01.500\nand welcome!\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:03.400\nToday we're going to talk\nabout tests.\n\n00:03.900 --> 00:05.800\nNow, a test is simply a way\nto find out something\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:07.200\nabout something else.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:09.300\nIt's like asking a question\nand seeing\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:09.700\nwhat answer\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:10.100\nyou get.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:12.000\nThink of it like this:\nyou might \"test\"\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:13.900\nif your cookies are done by\npoking them\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:14.400\nwith a toothpick.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:17.100\nIf the toothpick comes out\nclean, the cookies\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:17.900\npass the test!\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:20.300\nOr, maybe you \"test\" the\nwater temperature\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:20.700\nbefore you\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:21.100\nget in the pool.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:22.100\nIs it too cold?\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:23.100\nToo hot?\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:23.800\nJust right?\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:25.400\nThese are all simple tests.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:28.100\nIn science and other fields,\ntests are more formal.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:31.200\nScientists might run experiments\nto test a new medicine.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:34.000\nTeachers give quizzes to test\nwhat students have learned.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:37.400\nSo, remember, a test is just\na way of gathering information.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:39.500\nIt helps us understand things\nbetter.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:41.700\nThis video was created by\nApilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "dd6a482f-2a22-4e68-805a-caa5e6893623": {
    "id": "dd6a482f-2a22-4e68-805a-caa5e6893623",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:07:12.819652",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-03T17:26:00.662483",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260103_172600.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_172600.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It's really just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.100\nFor example, a school test helps your teacher see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:41.500\nA taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. And a medical test helps doctors check your health.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:55.900\nSo, whether it's a quiz in class, trying a new food, or visiting the doctor, all these are tests in action. They help us learn, decide, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.400\nEssentially, a test is a tool for getting information, which helps us make better choices and understand things more clearly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
