    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_172643.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What are they?\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:24.500\nYou can test anything!\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:35.500\nFor example, you might test if a new toy car goes faster than your old one. You run them both and see which one wins. That's a test!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:47.300\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:51.000\nTests help us learn, improve things, and make sure things are working correctly.\n```"
