    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:06.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:09.500\nIt's how we gather information to see if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:14.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:20.400\nOr, you take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:21.900\nSee?\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:23.900\nTests can be about anything!\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:30.700\nAnother example is baking a cake. You might test the oven temperature to make sure it's right, or taste the batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:32.200\nThose are tests too!\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:38.500\nSo, a test is just a way to check something, learn something, or confirm something.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:44.300\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:47.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
