    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:11.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like an experiment, or a way to check if something is working as it should. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:33.400\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health. Another example is testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:45.500\nSo, tests help us learn things, check on things, and make sure things are working properly. They can be used in all sorts of different situations.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:55.700\nIn short, a test is a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
