    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_173415.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like checking to see if you've learned the basics. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:36.400\nOr, you could test a new toy to make sure it doesn't break easily.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:44.300\nTests help us understand what we're good at and what we need to work on.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.500\nThey also help us make sure things are safe and reliable. So, whether it's a quiz at school or checking a new product, tests are all about learning and improving.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:57.100\nTo recap, a test is a method for evaluating knowledge or performance.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:01.300\nIt uses examples to highlight strengths and weaknesses.\n\n01:01.300 --> 01:04.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
