    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:17.800\nThink of it like a measuring tool. It helps us check where you are in your learning journey.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:25.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words. A fitness test might measure how strong you are.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:39.200\nEven trying a new recipe is like a test \u2013 you're seeing if it turns out the way you expect! So, tests aren't scary, they're just a way to see what you've learned and where you can improve.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:46.300\nThey give you, and your teachers, helpful information. Remember, it's all about learning!\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:49.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
