    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb actually lights up. The main idea behind a test is to give you a clear result.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.300\nIt tells you if you passed or failed, if something is working correctly, or if you need to study more.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:39.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:42.700\nA taste test checks how good food tastes.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:45.800\nAnd a medical test checks your health.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:59.800\nSee? All different, but they all give you information based on a set standard. So, to recap, a test is a process used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or quality. It gives you valuable feedback to help you improve or understand something better.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:02.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
