    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:07.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:12.200\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:16.800\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:22.400\nThink about it.\nWhen you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:28.900\nOr, if you\u2019re learning your ABCs, your teacher might give you a quick quiz to test your knowledge.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:35.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nSome are written, like exams at school.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:42.300\nOthers are practical, like checking if your bike brakes work.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:53.700\nThey all help us understand something better, whether it\u2019s how well we\u2019ve learned something, or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:00.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn.\nIt helps us improve and understand the world around us.\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:03.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
