    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:05.900\nToday we're tackling something super important:\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:08.100\nwhat is a test?\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:11.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:15.500\nThink of it like a detective trying to solve a mystery.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:16.800\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:21.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:26.000\nOr, your teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:29.600\nEven baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you taste it to see if it's good!\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:34.100\nTests can be simple or complex, but they all share the same goal: to gather information.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:40.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something out.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:44.900\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:47.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
