    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:17.700\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in a broader sense, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly or meeting certain standards.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes the soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:39.200\nOr a mechanic checks your car's engine to test if it's running smoothly.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:46.700\nIn science, you might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.900\nIn computers, you might test a program to make sure it doesn't have any bugs.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.600\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and see if something is performing as expected. It helps us make sure things are safe, effective, and reliable. That's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
