    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:35.100\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. A taste test helps you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:47.900\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body. So, tests come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:52.900\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. Remember, tests are just tools for understanding.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:55.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
