    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_174448.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.800\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a cookie to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:31.000\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Tests aren't just for food or health, though.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:43.000\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand a subject. It could be a quiz, a worksheet, or even just answering questions in class.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:53.400\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve a problem like 2 + 2. The answer tells the teacher if you understand addition.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:59.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check your knowledge or the quality of something. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
