    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:31.400\nThe thing we're trying to learn about could be anything. Maybe you want to test if a cake is done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:39.200\nThe toothpick coming out clean is the answer telling you the cake is ready. Or think about a doctor testing your eyesight.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:49.200\nThey have you read letters to see how well you can see. So, a test isn't just something you do in school. It's really just a way to gather information and make decisions based on that information.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:56.900\nIt's all about asking questions and finding answers. In short, a test helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
