    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.200\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.200\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:08.000\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:11.000\nThink about it: a spelling test helps us find out how well we know our words.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:15.600\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:16.800\nThat taste is a test!\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:19.000\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:21.600\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:25.000\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:28.000\nEven video games have tests to see if you can beat the level!\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:34.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a process or procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:39.000\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:41.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
