    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_175338.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It helps us measure or evaluate.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:31.400\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well you know your spelling words. A taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:39.200\nA medical test can help doctors figure out if you're healthy. So, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:45.600\nThey help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us. They're just a tool for getting information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "693ae59c-b587-46ab-b429-e7d9c320cea6": {
    "id": "693ae59c-b587-46ab-b429-e7d9c320cea6",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:07:32.207960",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-03T17:54:25.769170",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260103_175425.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_175425.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.100\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:30.200\nThink of it like this: You might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:38.100\nOr, maybe you're testing a new toy to see if it's fun. You play with it and decide whether you like it or not. That's a test too!\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:43.000\nTests aren't just for cakes and toys, though. We use tests in school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:50.700\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct. Tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.700 --> 01:09.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find things out. It's a process to gather information and see if something is true or how well it works. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "537b66b0-300b-4b8d-9a04-0765d2a8a562": {
    "id": "537b66b0-300b-4b8d-9a04-0765d2a8a562",
