    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.400\nEver wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:06.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:14.400\nThink of it like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\nThe goal of a test is to gather information.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.900\nIt could be to see if a plant is getting enough sunlight, if your cookies are baked all the way through, or, more commonly, if you understand a new concept.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:29.900\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you have enough iron.\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see if you've learned the material.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:32.400\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:44.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for getting information and seeing how things are doing.\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world better.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:48.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
