    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out information. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:21.700\nTests are used everywhere!\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:31.500\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Your teacher gives you tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:44.100\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it works! So, whether it's a quiz in school, a blood test at the doctor's office, or even just trying a new recipe,\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:57.200\ntests help us learn and understand things better. They give us valuable information to make decisions. In short, a test is a procedure intended to establish the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:03.000\nThat's the basics of tests. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
