    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.600\nThink of a test as a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a lesson, if a new medicine works, or even if a cake is done baking!\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:29.400\nBasically, a test helps us find out information or see if something meets a certain standard. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:42.300\nA doctor might run tests to see what's making you sick. And when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it; if it comes out clean, that's a test showing the cake is ready!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:54.500\nSo, in simple terms, a test is a process or procedure to evaluate something. It helps us learn, diagnose, or confirm things.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
