    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.400\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we don't just mean school exams.\nA test is really just a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see what something is like.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:29.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe by cooking it to see if it tastes good.\nOr, a doctor might run tests on your blood to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:40.700\nIn science, we use tests all the time.\nWe might test if a plant grows faster with more sunlight, or if a new medicine helps people feel better.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:50.700\nSo, a test is simply a procedure designed to evaluate something.\nIt helps us learn and understand more about the world around us.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.700\nBasically, it's a way to ask a question and find an answer.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
