    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:18.900\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:30.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nThink about it.\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:39.400\nThat's a test to see if it fixes the problem.\nTests can also be more formal, like a quiz at school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.100\nWhether it's a casual experiment or a structured assessment, the goal is the same: to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:59.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of asking a question and seeing what happens!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
