    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy. Or, in school, you take tests to show what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:32.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if your recipe works.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:42.700\nFor example, you might test if a toy car rolls faster on carpet or hardwood. You push it on both surfaces and see which goes further. That's a test!\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:50.100\nSo, a test is just a simple way to gather information and learn something new. Basically, we use tests to understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
