    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:02.100 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:06.900\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:11.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:14.700\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:17.800\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:24.300\nImagine you're baking a cake. You test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:25.100\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.500\nOr, if you\u2019re trying to figure out if your toy car needs new batteries, you try turning it on. If it doesn\u2019t go, that's a test showing you need new batteries!\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:40.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:43.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
