    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:24.700\nIt's a process or a procedure designed to see if something is true, correct, or working properly.\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA baker tests their cake batter to make sure it tastes good.\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:34.300\nTests aren't just for school or the doctor's office, though.\nWe use them every day without even realizing it.\nLike when you try a new recipe, that's a test!\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:42.200\nYou're testing to see if you like it.\nSo, a test is really just a way to learn and understand something better.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:48.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:59.400\nIt helps us determine if something is accurate, functional, or meeting our expectations.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:04.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
