    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:06.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:22.000\nIt could be a math problem, a science experiment, or even just tasting a new food to see if you like it!\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:25.000\nThe whole point is to get some information.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:30.000\nFor example, your teacher might give you a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:35.000\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:38.000\nSee? Different situations, but both are tests trying to give us answers.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:45.000\nSo remember, a test is just a process to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:50.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
