    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_181428.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.145 --> 00:05.405\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.405 --> 00:15.805\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something! It helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we understand a topic.\n\n00:15.805 --> 00:24.105\nThink of it like this: if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.105 --> 00:41.205\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, your teacher might give you a quiz to test how well you know them.\nTests can be written, like a spelling test, or they can be practical, like seeing if a toy car can roll down a ramp.\n\n00:41.205 --> 00:55.205\nSo, in short, a test is just a process to gather information and see how things stand. Whether it's baking, learning, or building, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:55.205 --> 00:58.705\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
