    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.000\nWhat are they, and why are they important? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like this: you might test if a cake is done by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:31.100\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned. They're like a snapshot of your understanding.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:40.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell certain words. A math test sees if you can solve problems.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:45.900\nTests aren't meant to be scary. They're just a tool to help you and your teachers.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:56.300\nThey show where you're doing well and what areas you might need a little extra help with. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
