    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_181750.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests. \nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. \nIt helps us understand if something works, if something is true, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like this: a chef tests the soup to see if it needs more salt. \nOr, a student takes a test at school to show what they've learned.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:38.100\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. \nTests can be simple, like tasting that soup, or more complex, like a big exam.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:49.800\nBut the main goal is always the same: to get information and learn something new. \nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn and improve.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
