    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:20.700\nThink of it like asking a question, but sometimes with a specific method or procedure.\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:28.700\nYour doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:39.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 will it rise properly and taste good?\nSo, a test is any process designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:50.400\nIt could be your knowledge, a person's health, or even the quality of a product.\nThe results of the test help us make decisions or understand things better.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:56.700\nIn short, tests help us learn!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
