    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:06.200\nToday, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:13.100\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:14.900\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:26.000\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:31.800\nAnother example is a taste test! You try different flavors and decide which one you like best.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:37.400\nSo, a test helps us learn information or make a decision.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:42.100\nIt involves trying something out or answering questions to get a result.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:45.600\nWe use tests every day, even without realizing it!\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:50.800\nRemember, a test is a simple way to find out something.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
