    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:14.900\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.100\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:29.900\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:36.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:43.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done. If it's sticky, it needs more time.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:50.100\nTests are used for all sorts of things. Your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:53.700\nYou take tests in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.000\nEven scientists use tests to prove if their ideas are right.\n```"
