    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:05.800\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:06.600\nIt could be anything, really!\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:10.700\nThe main idea is that we're trying to get information by asking questions or performing an action.\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:14.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:17.700\nA taste test tells you which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:23.100\nEven pressing a button to see if a light turns on is a kind of test! You're testing if the button works.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:26.700\nSo, a test is simply a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:30.900\nBy asking questions or observing the results, we can gather data and learn more.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:35.200\nRemember, tests are all around us, helping us understand the world a little better.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:37.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
