    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_182252.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:26.500\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or performance in a specific area.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:36.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words. A math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:46.100\nEven baking a cake can be a test to see if you can follow a recipe correctly! So, tests can be written, like exams at school, or they can be practical, like a driving test.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:56.100\nThe important thing is that they give us information about what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:00.600\nBasically, a test is a tool for learning and improvement,\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:04.600\nhelping you understand where you excel and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n01:04.600 --> 01:08.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
