    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.600\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand things better.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:39.300\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie is your favorite. Scientists use tests to see if their ideas about the world are correct.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:52.000\nThey might test if a new medicine works, or if a plant grows faster with a certain type of fertilizer.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:59.900\nSo, testing is all about exploring, learning, and figuring things out. It's a fundamental part of science, learning, and even everyday life! We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
