    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_182750.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:16.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:20.700\nThat's a test! It helps you find out information.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:30.400\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They might ask you questions about reading, math, or science.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:39.100\nBut tests aren't just in school. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature or blood pressure.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:51.800\nSo, whether it's poking a cake or answering questions on paper, a test is simply a way to gather information and see where things stand.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:56.900\nTests help us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
