    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:14.200\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.600\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like checking if your lightbulb works before you screw it into the lamp. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:37.600\nWe use tests all the time. When you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it\u2019s cooked all the way through.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:40.200\nThat's testing!\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:42.800\nOr, if you\u2019re learning to ride a bike,\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:45.400\nyou might test your balance by slowly lifting one foot.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:48.000\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:55.100\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check something. It gives us information and helps us make decisions. It's all about figuring things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
