    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:25.400\nIt's a process we use to gather information or check if something is working correctly. Think about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:33.100\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might test the batter with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.400\nAnother example is a doctor giving you a checkup. They might test your reflexes or listen to your heart to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:53.800\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn and make sure things are in order. To recap, a test is just a way to gain knowledge or verify something.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
