    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.000\nNo need to worry, it's not that kind of test! In this case, a test is simply a way to find out if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch. That's a test!\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.200\nAnother example could be seeing if a plant grows when you give it water. You're testing if water helps the plant grow.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:37.700\nOr maybe you're testing a recipe to see if it tastes good. You follow the instructions and then taste the result.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:49.500\nSo, to recap, a test is just a simple way to see if something does what it\u2019s expected to do. It's about observing and finding out if things are working correctly.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:51.800\nPretty straightforward, right?\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
