    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_183648.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:22.100\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. A taste test to see if your soup needs more salt? That's a test!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:27.300\nChecking if a light bulb works before screwing it in? Another test!\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:33.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:40.900\nA math test checks if you understand numbers, and a spelling test shows if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:49.100\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see where you're at. It helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:52.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
