    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_184043.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s a process designed to give you information about a person, thing, or idea.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.100\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:34.200\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.300\nOr, even simpler, you might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:50.100\nSo, tests can be anything from a big exam to a quick check. The important thing is that they help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:52.400\nThey help us understand something better.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:55.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
