    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_184128.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: Tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:19.100\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to see how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works \u2013 the test is plugging it in.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:32.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. There are tests you take in school, like quizzes on history or math.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:49.800\nThese help your teachers see what you've learned. But tests aren't just for school! A doctor might run tests to check your health, or a chef might taste a dish to test the flavor.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:56.600\nSo, whether it\u2019s a pop quiz, a blood test, or even just trying a new recipe, a test is simply a way to gather information.\n\n00:56.600 --> 00:58.900\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:00.900\nRemember, tests are tools for learning and improving.\n01:00.900 --> 01:02.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
