    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.500\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:11.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is ready, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:13.700\nThat's a test!\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:15.900\nYou're testing if the cake is cooked through.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:19.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:24.400\nA doctor might give you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:28.900\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:33.600\nAnother example is when you try a new recipe.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:36.800\nYou're testing whether it tastes good and if you like it.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:44.300\nBasically, anytime you're trying to find out something about something else, you're performing a test.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:51.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information or evaluate something.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.800\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:60.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
