    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:21.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch. That's a test! You're checking if the lightbulb passes or fails.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:26.200\nTests aren't just for lightbulbs, though. Your doctor might give you a blood test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:33.500\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:43.000\nEven baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you taste it to see if it's good!\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:53.400\nSo, basically, a test is any process you use to see if something meets a certain standard or works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:55.000\nAnd that's the core idea behind a test.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
