    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:07.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:11.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:17.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:22.000\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:23.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.000\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:33.000\nThat's testing to see if a simple restart fixes the problem.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:40.000\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if the water is hot enough for a shower.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:46.000\nThe important thing is that you're trying to get information to make a decision.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.000\nSo, a test is basically a way to check something and learn from the result.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
