    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, it's simply a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:18.800\nThink of it like checking if something is working the way it should, or figuring out what someone knows.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:27.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:41.200\nA teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class. Even baking a cake is kind of a test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:51.500\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: to gather information.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:55.100\nThat's testing in a nutshell! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
