    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nUnderstanding Tests\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.700\nA test is a way to find out what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:24.900\nSchool Tests: Show what you've learned.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.300\nHealthcare Tests: Check if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:42.700\nEngineering Tests: Ensure things are safe and working.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.400\nSpelling Test: Check spelling.\nBlood Test: Check vitamin levels.\nBridge Test: Check strength.\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:01.700\nTests help us learn, stay healthy, and keep things working properly.\n```"
