    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:21.200\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like checking if your bike tires have enough air.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:31.800\nYou're testing the pressure.\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:38.300\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\nA chef might taste their soup to test the flavor.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:48.300\nEven a computer runs tests to make sure all its parts are working together.\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:51.900\nIt can be simple, like checking your tires, or more complex, like a medical exam.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:56.500\nBut the goal is always the same: to get information and understand something better.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
