    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.900\nIt's a process of asking a question and then figuring out the answer.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:32.200\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:36.900\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:41.600\nTests can be big or small. A quick quiz is a test. So is a huge exam.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:48.500\nThe important thing is that they help us gather information and learn more.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:54.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a structured way to ask a question and find the answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
