    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:25.000\nIt helps us understand if something works, if we know something, or even if we have certain skills.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:32.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows you if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:44.600\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might do a \"taste test\" to see if it tastes good and needs more sugar.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:54.000\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
