    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.799\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.799 --> 00:18.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand a topic, or checking if a piece of equipment is working correctly.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:29.400\nThe main idea behind a test is to get information. We want to know if something is true or false, working or not working, good or bad.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:37.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:46.200\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:56.500\nAnother example could be testing a recipe. You follow the instructions and then taste the result to see if it\u2019s delicious!\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:02.300\nSo, in short, a test is a way of finding out information about something. We ask a question or perform a task to get an answer. That\u2019s the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
