    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat are they?\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:11.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:16.600\nWe use them all the time!\nThink about it.\nA taste test tells you if you like the flavor of food.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:25.800\nA spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly.\nA medical test can help doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:36.400\nSo, tests help us learn and measure things.\nThey can be used to check your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:47.900\nBasically, a test is a structured way to get information.\nThey come in many forms, from simple quizzes to complex scientific experiments.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:55.300\nRemember, tests are all about gathering information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
