    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:15.900\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works the way it should.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:25.300\nIt's like a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:32.100\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time!\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:42.100\nWhen you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:51.000\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again. That\u2019s testing a solution.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.600\nSo, a test is really just a simple way to see if something is okay, or if it needs some fixing.\n```"
