    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.900\nIt helps us see if something is working, if we understand something, or even if something is true.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:34.500\nOr, you take a quiz at school to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:38.400\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:48.200\nAnother example? You might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good before making it for your friends.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:55.600\nOr you might test a toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:58.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a process or procedure designed to gather information or evaluate something.\n```"
