    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_185938.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:18.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:30.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test tells us which flavor of ice cream people like best.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:33.000\nSee? We're finding something out!\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:41.200\nAnother example could be testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or even testing a toy to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:49.300\nSo, a test is just a way to get answers and learn more. It helps us make decisions and understand the world around us better.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:56.800\nIn short, a test is a tool for discovery. It's how we learn, improve, and find out what's what.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
