    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:04.800\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:07.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:12.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:15.800\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:27.100\nYou do a test! You poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:30.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test, and it's ready.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:37.000\nOr, imagine you want to know if you know your ABCs.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:39.300\nYou can test yourself by reciting them!\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:43.900\nTests can be big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:51.700\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:56.700\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to find out something!\n\n00:56.700 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
