    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.300\nTests can be used to check all sorts of things.\nMaybe you want to test if a lightbulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch.\nThe light turning on is the answer!\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:29.400\nOr perhaps you're taking a spelling test at school.\nThat test helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:36.700\nAnother example could be testing a recipe.\nYou follow the instructions, taste the result, and see if it\u2019s delicious!\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:46.300\nThat taste test tells you if the recipe worked.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm something you already know.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:57.300\nThey help us understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
