    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:27.700\nIt's a process, a method, used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even just a quality. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words. Or a taste test helps you decide which cookie is the yummiest. Even shaking a wrapped gift to guess what's inside is a kind of test!\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:37.000\nSo, tests come in many forms. They can be written, like exams, or practical, like a cooking demonstration.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:47.300\nThe important thing is that they help us learn something new or confirm what we already know.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:58.400\nBasically, a test is an investigation to learn something.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:07.200\nTo recap, a test is a method used to learn about something, by evaluating knowledge, skill or quality.\n\n01:07.200 --> 01:10.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
