    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:20.000\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt could be finding out how strong something is, or how well you know a subject, or even if a food tastes good!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:30.300\nBasically, you're trying to get information.\nYou ask a question, or create a situation, and then you observe the results.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:39.200\nThink of it like this: you're testing if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\nThe light turning on is the result of your test!\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:46.800\nAnother example is taking a quiz in school.\nThe quiz is a test to see how much you've learned about a topic.\n\n00:46.800 --> 01:00.500\nOr imagine trying a new recipe \u2013 tasting it is a test to see if you like it!\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see what happens when you try something.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:06.800\nIt's all about learning and understanding.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
