    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:06.800\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:18.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information and learn more.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:32.500\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes a sauce \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt. Or a doctor checks your temperature \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:42.400\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking if the water is warm enough for a swim.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:51.000\nThe key is that you're trying to answer a question or evaluate something. We use tests every day, often without even realizing it.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:55.100\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a tool to help us understand the world around us a little better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
