    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. We use tests all the time to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:29.200\nFor example, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:37.500\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. See? It's just a way to find out information.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:52.200\nAnother example could be testing a toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with. Or, testing a lightbulb to see if it actually turns on.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:59.400\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a procedure to determine the quality, performance, or reliability of something. It helps us learn and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "b6ecfc55-519d-44af-9742-5f300f2e4ffd": {
    "id": "b6ecfc55-519d-44af-9742-5f300f2e4ffd",
