    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_191444.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process or procedure designed to give you information about a specific thing.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like this: a taste test lets you find out which flavor of ice cream you like best. Or, a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:34.200\nDoctors use tests to find out if you're healthy, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:45.800\nSo, whether it's a quiz, a medical exam, or just trying out a new recipe, a test is all about gathering information to answer a question.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:56.900\nTests help us learn, diagnose, and make better decisions. In short, a test is a way of learning something about a specific thing.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
