    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_191530.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.300\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:32.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:38.100\nOr, a doctor might test your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:47.100\nTests aren't just for cakes and doctors though. We use them all the time! A teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:54.900\nA company might test a new product to see if people like it. So, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:57.900\nIn short, tests help us understand, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
