    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.100\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:18.800\nThink of it like an experiment, but instead of mixing chemicals, we're checking for knowledge or ability.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:27.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A taste test checks which food you like better.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.100\nEven trying to open a door is a little test \u2013 you're testing if it's locked!\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:44.400\nTests help us learn and improve. They show us what we already know and what we need to work on.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:51.600\nSo next time you take a test, remember it's just a tool to help you understand something better.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.400\nIt's about learning, not just getting the \"right\" answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
