    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:18.900\nIt's a process to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone understands a topic.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:29.700\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you learned the material. Even baking a cake is a test!\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:36.300\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:50.100\nSo, tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying a new recipe. The key thing is, they help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:57.500\nTests are everywhere, helping us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
