    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:20.500\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a plant needs water.\nThe test is to check the soil.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:33.100\nIf the soil is dry, that\u2019s your answer \u2013 it needs water!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:38.900\nOr, maybe you're testing if a cake is done.\nYou poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:48.800\nIf it comes out clean, the test says it's ready to eat!\nTests can be simple, like that, or more complicated.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:52.800\nBut the main idea is always the same: to get information.\nSo, a test helps us learn something we didn't know before. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
