    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.500\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think of it like this: you're baking a cake, and you want to know if it's ready.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:30.500\nYou use a toothpick \u2013 that's your test! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:37.600\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. Your ability to stay upright without falling is a test of your balance.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:45.800\nYou pass the test when you can ride smoothly. So, a test is just a procedure, or a method, used to determine if something is true, correct, or present.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:51.900\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
