    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:25.100\nIt helps us figure out if something is working correctly or if it meets certain standards. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:31.900\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:40.300\nEven baking a cake involves a test! You check if it's done by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.700\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and make a decision based on that information. It's a fundamental part of learning and problem-solving.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
