    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:27.300\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:35.000\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. See? Different kinds of tests, but they all give us information.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:41.500\nAnother example is testing a new recipe. You follow the instructions, taste it, and that\u2019s your test!\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:46.300\nDoes it taste good? Does it need more salt?\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:55.400\nYou\u2019re finding out if the recipe works. So, remember, a test is just a method of gathering information. It helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
