    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_192626.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like using a ruler, but instead of measuring length, we might be measuring knowledge, skill, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:39.400\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information.\nIt helps us understand where we are, what we're good at, and what we need to work on.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:43.200\nFor example, a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:55.800\nA taste test helps a company decide which new soda flavor people like best.\nSee? Different things, but both are tests.\nSo, a test is just a method for measuring something to gain information.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.300\nWhether it's a quiz at school or trying out a new recipe, tests help us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
