    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:39.800\nOr, a doctor might test your vision to see how well you can see.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:51.100\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:57.100\nThe goal isn't just to get a good grade, but also to show what you know and where you might need some extra help. So, remember, a test is just a tool to understand something better, whether it\u2019s cake, eyesight, or your understanding of a subject. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
