    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.300\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate a characteristic or skill.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:32.300\nThink of it like this: a cookie taste test tells you how good the cookie tastes.\nMore generally, a test could be a math quiz to see how well you understand addition, or a driving test to show you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:44.500\nEven a medical test, like checking your temperature, is a test to see if you have a fever.\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us information.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:51.200\nThey're everywhere, from school to the doctor's office and even when you're just trying out a new recipe!\nThey\u2019re a fundamental way we learn and improve.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
