    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it this way: you might test the temperature of your bath water to make sure it's just right.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:32.100\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. So, a test is really just a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:44.000\nIt could be your knowledge, your ability, or even the quality of a product. For example, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:53.100\nCompanies test their products to make sure they work before they sell them.\n\n00:53.100 --> 01:00.500\nIn short, a test is a tool for learning and improvement. It helps us know where we stand and what we need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
