    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something, or someone.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:21.400\nIt's like asking a question, but getting a more formal answer.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:26.600\nThink about it. A spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.500\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes best. Even when you try out a new recipe, you're kind of doing a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:44.400\nTests can be used to measure all sorts of things, from your knowledge of a subject to how strong a material is.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:51.200\nUltimately, they help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn!\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
