    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_193904.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:07.100\nYou've probably taken a test at school, but what is it, really?\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:11.200\nA test is just a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:15.200\nIt's like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if you can bake a cake, you take a baking test \u2013 you bake a cake!\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:27.800\nThe result tells you how well you understand the recipe.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:34.200\nTests can be written, like multiple choice questions, or they can be practical, like showing you can ride a bike.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:41.900\nThe important thing is they help us figure out what we've learned and where we might need more practice.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:47.000\nSo, tests are just tools to help us learn and grow.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:52.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
