    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:11.700\nThink of it like a question-and-answer session, but it can be much more than just questions.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:16.400\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:20.800\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:25.300\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like how it tastes!\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:29.800\nSo, tests help us gather information and understand things better.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:35.100\nThey can be used to measure knowledge, check health, or even just try something new and see what happens.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:40.000\nTests are all around us, helping us learn and grow.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:43.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
