    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:22.200\nIt's like a measuring stick for your knowledge. Think of it like this: if you wanted to know how tall you are, you'd use a ruler, right?\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:28.600\nA test is like a ruler for your brain! It helps you and your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:40.600\nTests can come in many forms. There are multiple choice questions, true or false questions, or even short answer questions. Each type helps show what you understand in different ways.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:50.000\nSo, a test is just a tool to help you learn and grow. It shows you where you're strong and where you might need a little extra practice.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:55.200\nIt's all about learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
