    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 08:40.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, to see if it's working correctly or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:08.400 --> 014.200\nThink of it like checking if your shoes fit. You try them on, that's a test!\n\n00:14.200 --> 019.900\nThere are all sorts of tests. Your doctor might give you a test to check your health.\n\n00:19.900 --> 025.600\nA baker might taste their cake batter, that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:25.600 --> 036.900\nOr, maybe you're taking a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic. That's a test too!\n\n00:36.900 --> 042.300\nSo, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:42.300 --> 050.800\nThey give us information to make decisions or fix problems. Just remember, a test is simply a way of checking something.\n\n00:50.800 --> 054.700\nThat's it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
