    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how good you are at spelling.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:33.300\nTests aren't just for school, though! Imagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:43.900\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it\u2019s safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:52.200\nSo, whether it's a quiz in class, trying out a recipe, or checking if a product is safe, a test helps us learn and improve.\nIt gives us information to make better decisions.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.800\nIn short, a test is a way of gathering information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
