    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like a question you ask to get an answer. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:37.000\nFor example, if you want to know if the water is hot enough for a bath, you might stick your toe in - that\u2019s a test!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:48.100\nOr, if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you can poke it with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, you know it\u2019s ready \u2013 that\u2019s another test!\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:59.100\nTests help us make decisions and understand the world around us. They can be simple like checking the temperature, or more complicated like a school exam.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:02.700\nBut at their heart, they all do the same thing: they give us information. So, remember, a test is just a way to get an answer.\n```"
