    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but often with a specific answer in mind.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:27.100\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not. For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:41.600\nOr, if your car won't start, you might test the battery to see if that's the problem. Doctors use tests to figure out what's making you sick, and students take tests to show what they've learned.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:55.000\nSo, a test is simply a procedure designed to reveal something about a person, object, or situation. It helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:02.100\nRemember, tests are all about gaining knowledge. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
