    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_195732.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:26.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a structured and reliable way.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.400\nThink about it like this: a baking test tells you if a cake is done. You poke it with a toothpick, and if it comes out clean, that's a positive test!\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:44.500\nOr, imagine a spelling test in school. It helps you see how well you remember the spelling of different words.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:52.600\nTests aren't just in baking or school, though. Doctors use tests to check your health, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:04.800\nBasically, a test helps us learn something by giving us clear results.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:08.300\nSo, remember, a test is a structured way to find out something specific and get reliable results.\n\n01:08.300 --> 01:13.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
