    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:29.300\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or seeing how well you understand a new topic. Basically, it's an experiment or a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:37.000\nThink about it like this: a teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:50.600\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health. Even baking a cake can be a kind of test! You\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:58.100\nSo, a test is a method for gathering information, evaluating performance, or checking the quality of something. It helps us understand more about the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
