    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. Think of it as a way to gather information.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:22.100\nIt could be a written exam in school, designed to see how much you've learned. Or, it could be testing out a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:35.700\nTests help us confirm if something works, if we understand something, or even just to see how things compare.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:47.400\nFor example, you might test the water in a pool to make sure it's safe to swim in. Or, you might test different light bulbs to see which one shines the brightest.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:57.100\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to get information. It helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
