    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information or see if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:33.400\nThink about it like this: a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.800\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your words. Even checking if your car starts in the morning is a kind of test!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:50.000\nTests can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like trying out a new recipe. The important thing is that they help us understand something better.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:54.300\nSo, whether it's checking your homework or trying a new game,\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.900\nremember that a test is just a way to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
