    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.700\nFor example, when you try a new food, you're testing whether you like it or not.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:44.300\nOr, when you turn on a light switch, you're testing if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:52.900\nAnother example is a spelling test in school. That test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:58.000\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n```"
  },
