    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests! A test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:17.400\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer. We use tests all the time to see if something is working correctly, or to check our understanding.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:27.000\nFor example, your doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to test what you've learned.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:45.800\nEven baking a cake involves a test: tasting it to see if it's delicious! So, whether it's a science experiment, a quiz in class, or even just checking if your phone charger is working, a test is just a structured way to get information.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:55.600\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
