    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:24.000\nIt helps us check if something is working properly, or if we understand something. Think of it like this: your mom might test the oven to make sure it's hot enough to bake cookies.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:36.000\nOr, your teacher gives you a test at school to see if you've learned what was taught in class.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:45.000\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to see if it works the way it's supposed to. We use tests all the time to learn and improve things.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:51.000\nSo, a test is just a way to check something and get information. Pretty straightforward, right?\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:52.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
