    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:28.900\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:31.800\nThat's a test!\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:37.400\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\nThe cake is ready.\nSticky?\nNeeds more time.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:41.000\nAnother example is checking if your phone is charged.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:44.400\nYou look at the battery icon.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:52.700\nThe icon is full?\nYou're good to go.\nEmpty?\nTime to plug it in.\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and make a decision.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:55.800\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
