    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:06.400\nA test is really just a way to check something, to see if it works or if it's true.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:11.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:13.100\nThat's a test!\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:16.800\nWe use tests all the time without even realizing it.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:22.300\nFor example, when you taste your food before adding salt, you\u2019re testing it to see if it needs more flavor.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:27.500\nOr if you try on a shoe to see if it fits, that's a test too.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:34.300\nBasically, a test helps us make sure things are the way we expect them to be.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:40.300\nIt's a simple but powerful tool for learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:43.200\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:49.100\nSo, remember, a test is a check.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:52.100\nIt\u2019s a way to see if something works, fits, or is true.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
