    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: you're testing if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:32.600\nOr maybe you're testing the water temperature before you jump in the pool.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:40.500\nIn school, tests help us see what we\u2019ve learned. A math test checks if you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:48.100\nA spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:52.900\nTests aren't meant to be scary! They're just a tool to show what you already know and what you might need to learn more about.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check your understanding.\n\n00:56.400 --> 00:59.400\nIt\u2019s a helpful tool for learning.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
