    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:06.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:9.700\nWe use them all the time to check if things are working,\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:12.100\nor to see what we know.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:16.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:20.200\nFor example, your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:24.700\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:31.200\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the light bulb works!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:34.700\nSo, tests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:36.800\nThey give us information.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:43.100\nWhether it's a simple yes or no, or something more complicated, a test helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:52.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
