    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like asking a question and then finding the answer.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:25.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don\u2019t realize it. For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:36.500\nOr, when you try a different route to school, you're testing to see if it's faster. In school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:45.800\nThey might be quizzes, exams, or even projects. These tests help them understand if you're understanding the material.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:54.100\nSo, a test is really just a way to check something and get some information. Tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
