    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.500\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs, or what its qualities are.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:32.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:41.800\nIn science, you might test whether a plant grows better in sunlight or in shade. We can even test a recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:55.200\nSo, tests help us understand things better, learn new things, and make informed decisions. They're all about gathering information and seeing what we can discover.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
