    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:06.100\nYou've probably taken lots of them in school,\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:06.800\nbut what is a test, really?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:11.100\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:14.500\nIt helps us check our knowledge, skills,\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:15.200\nor even the quality of something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:17.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:20.000\nchecks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:22.600\nA taste test decides which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:26.900\nAnd a stress test on a bridge checks if it's strong enough to hold cars.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:30.600\nSo, a test is a way to evaluate or measure something.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:36.400\nWe use tests to learn what we know, improve things, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:39.500\nThat's the basic idea behind a test!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:40.500\nThis video was created\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:42.000\nby Apilage AI.\n```"
