    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: Tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:14.600\nA test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly or to see how well something is doing.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. That's a test!\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:31.700\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Basically, it's gathering information to make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:43.600\nFor example, you take a quiz at school, that's a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:53.300\nOr, you might test a toy to make sure it's safe before giving it to a child.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:59.400\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check something, understand something, or make a decision based on information. It's all about learning and improving! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
