    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.900\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.100\nIt's like asking a question and checking the answer.\nThink of it this way: imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:30.200\nYou might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\nOr, maybe you're learning a new language.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:38.500\nA quiz is a test to show how many new words you've learned.\nDoctors use tests to figure out what\u2019s wrong when you're sick.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:52.300\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\nThey can be as simple as checking if a lightbulb works, or as complex as a big exam at school.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:59.000\nBasically, a test is just a way to check something!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
