    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_202627.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.800\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, you're using a specific method to get information.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, a spelling test helps us find out how well someone knows how to spell words. Or, a taste test helps us figure out which flavor of ice cream people like best.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:41.300\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas about the world are correct, and doctors use tests to see if we're healthy.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:48.500\nSo, tests are everywhere! They help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:56.500\nThey can be as simple as asking a friend what their favorite color is, or as complex as a medical diagnosis. The important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:03.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
