    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how much you know about something.\nIt\u2019s like a little challenge to show off what you've learned.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like this: imagine you\u2019ve been learning about animals.\nA test might ask you to name different types of animals, or match animals to their habitats.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:37.400\nThe test helps you, and your teacher, see what you understand.\nFor example, a multiple-choice question might ask: \u201cWhich animal barks?\nA) Cat, B) Dog, C) Bird.\u201d\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:51.900\nThe correct answer, of course, is dog!\nAnother type of test could ask you to write a short paragraph about your favorite animal.\n\n00:51.900 --> 01:04.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn and grow.\nIt's a way to check your understanding and identify areas where you might need a little more practice.\n\n01:04.500 --> 01:08.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
