    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:04.300\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:05.800\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:11.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done, so you test them with a toothpick.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:13.800\nIf it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:14.400\nThat's a test.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:17.600\nAnother example is a spelling test at school.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:20.600\nIt helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:23.700\nOr even trying on shoes at the store \u2013 you're testing to see if they fit!\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:36.300\nSo, a test is basically just a way to check something, to see if it works, if it's correct, or if it meets a certain requirement.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:38.800\nIt helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:42.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
