    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it as a mini-experiment.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:35.700\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:43.800\nEven checking if the lights work by flipping a switch is a kind of test. You're testing if the lightbulb is good!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:54.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a simple process of trying something out to learn about it. It helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
