    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:10.600\nAlright, let's talk about tests! A test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:10.600 --> 00:18.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is good. You screw it in, and if it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:23.300\nTests are everywhere.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:27.300\nYour spelling quizzes in school? Those are tests.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:34.100\nA doctor checking your reflexes? That's a test too. Even trying out a new recipe is kind of a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:44.000\nSo, basically, a test helps us figure out if something meets a certain standard or if it's doing what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:53.900\nIt's all about gathering information and understanding something better. In short, a test is just a way to check something out and see what's what.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
