    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in this case, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: you have a lightbulb, and you want to know if it's good. You put it in a lamp and turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:29.100\nIf the lightbulb shines, the test passes. If it doesn't, the test fails. Easy, right?\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:33.400\nAnother example: you're baking a cake. You taste a little bit of the batter.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:38.900\nThat's a test to see if it tastes good before you bake the whole thing.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:50.100\nSo, in short, a test is just a way to make sure something works the way it's supposed to. It's all about checking things!\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:55.500\nThat's it for this quick introduction to tests.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
