    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to explore something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:18.100\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:31.200\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer. It could be anything from checking if a light bulb works, to seeing if you know your ABCs.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:41.200\nThe main idea is to perform an action or ask a question, and then observe the result. If the light bulb lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:50.700\nIf you can recite your ABCs correctly, you pass that test, too! For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:53.300\nOr, you might test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:01.700\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is a method of finding something out by observing the result of an action or question.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:08.000\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
