    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a checkup to test your health. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:42.200\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if it needs some improvement. So, whether it\u2019s a school exam, a quality check on a product, or even just trying out a new recipe, tests are all around us.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:46.300\nThey give us information. They help us learn and grow.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:55.100\nIn short, a test is a process to gather information about something. And that information helps us make decisions.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
