    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.700\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we understand something.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:33.100\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:40.400\nOr, when you're learning a new skill, like riding a bike, you're constantly testing yourself, seeing if you can balance.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:47.700\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. It checks if you've learned how to spell certain words.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:57.100\nTests can be big or small, formal or informal. The important thing is that they help us learn and improve. So remember, a test is just a way of finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "9b9e1142-e293-4d3f-9f23-01beeb0760e0": {
    "id": "9b9e1142-e293-4d3f-9f23-01beeb0760e0",
