    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260103_203836.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_203836.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:17.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be anything, like figuring out if you know your ABCs, or if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:29.200\nBasically, you give a test, and you get a result. The test is the activity, like answering questions, and the result tells you something.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:37.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A taste test tells you if you like a certain flavor.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:49.300\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:57.500\nSo, remember, tests are just ways to gather information and learn something new. They help us understand where we are and what we might need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "4f3ea62e-f1f2-4c21-892f-f78b97245569": {
    "id": "4f3ea62e-f1f2-4c21-892f-f78b97245569",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:09:34.767517",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-03T20:39:23.187744",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260103_203923.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_203923.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:19.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give us information.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:28.000\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:38.600\nA chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more salt. Or, you might take a quiz to see how well you understood what you just learned!\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:46.200\nIn each case, the \"test\" helps us understand something. It helps the doctor understand your health, the chef understand the flavor, and you understand your knowledge.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:56.400\nTests are all about gathering information and making informed decisions. So, remember, a test is simply a way to learn more.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "43215d5c-d3d7-4ac3-8faf-01d7e32989f5": {
