    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_204022.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHello, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:11.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:18.600\nIt's a process used to gather information. Think of it like this: Your doctor gives you a check-up.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:27.300\nThat's a test to see how healthy you are. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:38.100\nThat taste is a test! Tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if the bathwater is too hot.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:45.300\nThe important thing is that they help us understand something better. They give us data to make decisions.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:51.800\nSo, a test is all about gathering information to learn something new.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:54.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
