    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:08.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:29.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\nOr, when you're learning to ride a bike, falling down is a test to see if you need to adjust your balance.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:36.800\nIn school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:48.300\nThey can be multiple choice, short answer, or even a project.\nSo, a test is really just a method to check knowledge or abilities.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:51.900\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:54.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
