    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.400\nThe toothpick helps you find out if the cake is ready. Or, imagine you\u2019re trying to figure out if your phone is working.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:37.900\nYou might try calling someone. If they answer, the phone passed the test!\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:44.900\nTests give us information. They help us check if something is true, working, or ready.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:54.700\nThey can be simple, like that toothpick, or more complex, but the idea is always the same: to find out something.\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:04.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and check things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
