    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, whether it's knowing if you understand a topic, or checking if something works correctly.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz. That's a test to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.500\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake and you taste the batter. That's a mini-test to make sure it tastes right before you bake it.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:41.700\nTests can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like trying on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:53.300\nThey all have the same goal: to give us information. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should!\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
