    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:23.800\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\nThink about it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:29.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:40.200\nOr, if you want to know if a lightbulb works, you can screw it into a lamp and turn it on.\nIf it lights up, the lightbulb passed the test.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:49.200\nSo, tests help us understand things and make sure things are working correctly.\nThey\u2019re all about gathering information.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
