    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.100\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:20.600\nThink of it like asking a question to see if someone understands.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:30.700\nIn the real world, we use tests all the time! A doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:47.200\nOr, when you\u2019re learning to drive, you take a driving test to prove you know the rules of the road. Even baking a cake involves a little test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick to see if it\u2019s done!\n\n00:47.200 --> 01:01.800\nSo, tests help us understand if something is working correctly, if someone has learned something, or if something is ready to go. They\u2019re a super important part of learning and making sure things are safe and reliable.\n\n01:01.800 --> 01:05.400\nTo recap, a test is a way to check something, we use them everywhere,\n01:05.400 --> 01:08.400\nand they help us understand how things are going.\n01:08.400 --> 01:12.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
