    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.144 --> 00:05.344\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.344 --> 00:17.144\nNow, a test is really just a way to find something out. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to the answer, you're also checking it.\n\n00:17.144 --> 00:28.444\nTests are super useful because they help us see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:28.444 --> 00:41.544\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick. Or, when baking, you might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:41.544 --> 00:51.344\nEven playing a video game is a kind of test, seeing if you can beat the level. So, remember, a test is simply a way of checking something, giving us information, and helping us make decisions.\n\n00:51.344 --> 00:57.744\nAnd that's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
