    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.700\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:45.500\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:57.700\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned. So, tests can be big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:12.500\nThey all have the same goal: to gather information and help us understand something better. Remember, a test isn't about being right or wrong, it's about learning.\n\n01:12.500 --> 01:20.500\nTo recap, a test is a way to gather information, check if something is working, or see if something is true.\n\n01:20.500 --> 01:28.100\nHopefully, this helps you understand the basics of tests! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
