    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:24.300\nIt could be finding out if you understand a new concept, if a product works as expected, or even if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:33.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:46.200\nA taste test helps you decide if you like something. And a quality control test makes sure a product is safe and well-made.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:58.000\nSo, a test is really just a process, a method, for evaluating or measuring something. It helps us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:09.900\nWhether it\u2019s in school, at work, or even in our daily lives, tests are all around us, helping us understand the world a little bit better.\n\n01:09.900 --> 01:18.800\nTo recap, tests help us discover information, evaluate something, and make decisions.\n\n01:18.800 --> 01:21.100\nThey\u2019re a fundamental tool for learning and improvement.\n\n01:21.100 --> 01:24.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
