    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just asking, you're performing an action to get an answer.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:27.700\nFor example, a simple taste test! You taste two different candies and decide which one you like better.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:32.600\nThat's a test! Or think about checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:38.800\nYou screw it in, flip the switch, and see if it lights up. That's another test!\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:49.000\nBasically, you're looking for a result, a confirmation, or some information. You're putting something to the\u2026 well, the test!\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:59.300\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information by observing the outcome of an action.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
