    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a process designed to check knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:31.600\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:42.400\nA taste test checks which ice cream flavor you like best.\nA medical test can check if you're healthy.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:50.500\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes.\nThey can be written, spoken, practical, or even just an observation.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:57.700\nThe important thing is, they give us information.\nThey help us understand something better, whether it's how well we've learned something, or what our preferences are.\nBasically, a test is a way to get answers.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
