    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or performing an action to see what happens.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:30.300\nBasically, tests help us learn and understand things better. For example, your teacher gives you a quiz, that's a test to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:40.400\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt. Even when you try a new game, you're testing it out to see if you like it!\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:51.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something to learn more about it. It helps us confirm what we know and discover what we still need to learn.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
