    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about what a test is.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, a teacher might give you a test at school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:35.100\nAnother example could be testing a toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with. We use tests all the time in different ways!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:47.200\nSo, in short, a test is just a procedure we use to get information. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:50.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
