    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE duration:64.4\n1\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n2\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n3\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.900\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n4\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n5\n00:33.100 --> 00:42.700\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. Even baking a cake is a test!\n\n6\n00:42.700 --> 00:53.400\nYou're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you can make something delicious. So, tests aren't always scary exams.\n\n7\n00:53.400 --> 01:04.400\nThey're just tools we use to learn and understand things better. They help us identify strengths and weaknesses, and figure out what we need to work on.\n\n8\n01:04.400 --> 01:08.400\nTo recap, a test is a process used to evaluate something, from your health to your knowledge.\n01:08.400 --> 01:11.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
