    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well something is done.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's cooked all the way through. That's a test!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.800\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test of your balance and coordination.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:47.800\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. So, whether it's testing a recipe, your bike skills, or your knowledge, tests help us understand things better and improve.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:54.900\nThey give us information. Remember, tests aren't scary; they're just a way to learn and grow.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
