    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_212741.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:06.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:13.000\nWe use them all the time to check our knowledge, skills, or even our physical abilities.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.000\nThink about it. If you're learning to ride a bike, wobbling around and eventually staying upright is a test of your balance.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:26.000\nOr if you're taking a quiz at school, that's a test of what you've learned in class.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.000\nTests can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like tasting a new recipe to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.000\nThe important thing is they give us information. They tell us where we're at, and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:49.000\nSo remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new!\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:55.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
