    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more formal way.\nTests help us measure knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:37.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words.\nA driving test checks your ability to operate a car safely.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:46.300\nEven a taste test can be considered a test \u2013 it checks your ability to taste different flavors!\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:55.400\nSo, tests are used in lots of different situations, from school to getting a job to even just trying new food.\nThey provide a way to evaluate something and learn more.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.100\nIn a nutshell, a test is a process to gain information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
