    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:21.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. It's a procedure designed to evaluate something \u2013 like your knowledge, your abilities, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:32.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your understanding of spelling rules. A taste test helps decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:47.600\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to provide information and help us make decisions.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:55.200\nRemember, a test helps us learn more about something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
