    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.600\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an answer, you're getting proof or evidence.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:28.000\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:34.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:40.600\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see if you understand a lesson.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:43.600\nAnother example? Baking a cake!\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:54.700\nYou might taste the batter before you bake it to test if it has enough sugar. See? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.100\nSo, to sum it up, a test is a way to gather information and check if something is right or working. They help us learn and make better decisions.\n```"
