    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.300\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something, whether it's a person's knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the functionality of a machine.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:33.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:43.100\nA taste test helps determine which food tastes the best.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:53.800\nAnd a medical test can help doctors figure out what's going on inside your body. So, tests help us learn and improve things.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
