    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like a little experiment you run to see what happens. The main idea is to ask a question and then gather information to answer it.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:36.100\nFor example, you might test if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade. You\u2019d put one plant in the sun and another in the shade, then observe the results.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:47.200\nOr, imagine you're testing which toy car rolls the furthest. You'd push each car and measure how far it goes.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:54.400\nSo, a test helps us learn and understand things better by providing evidence to support our ideas. It's all about asking a question and finding the answer! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
