    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:20.200\nIt's a method for gathering information, usually to see how well someone knows something, or how well something works.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:31.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test might help you decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:35.000\nSee? Different tests, different information.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:44.600\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like trying a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:56.800\nThe key is that they all involve a process and usually give us some kind of result. So, tests help us learn, compare, and understand things better.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
