    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_215127.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific question in mind.\nIt helps us understand if something works, or how well something works.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.600\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how many words you know.\nOr, a baker might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:44.000\nAnother example is a toy maker testing how durable their toys are before selling them to the public.\nThey want to make sure the toys are safe for kids to play with!\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:52.600\nSo, in short, a test is a process we use to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\nIt's all about learning and improving.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
