    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:29.200\nA test can be as simple as tasting a new food to see if you like it. That's a test!\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:36.900\nOr, maybe you try turning a light switch on and off to see if the lightbulb works. That's testing too!\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:47.600\nSo, a test is really just a way of gathering information and learning something new. It helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:50.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
