    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.200\nIt\u2019s a process we use to gather information, often to see if something is working correctly or to measure a specific skill or knowledge.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:33.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, your teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You\u2019re testing your recipe and your skills to see if you get a delicious result.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:55.900\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and understand things better. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the core idea is always the same: to get answers.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:02.100\nThat\u2019s the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
