    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:13.100\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It helps us check if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a topic.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:27.700\nFor example, your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:41.600\nSee? Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:53.800\nAnother example is testing a new recipe. You follow the instructions, and then taste it. The tasting is the test! You're figuring out if the recipe works and if you like the results.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:59.600\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for gathering information or checking something.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:02.000\nIt's all about finding answers and seeing if things are working as expected.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:04.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
