    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:14.100\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out. Think of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:25.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:33.600\nOr, if you're trying to figure out why your plant is wilting, you might test different amounts of water to see what helps.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:43.200\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if your coffee is hot enough before you take a sip.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:54.300\nThe key is that you're trying to gather information and learn something new. So, remember, a test is simply a method for discovering information.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
