    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.500\nToday we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:10.500\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you understand a topic.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:13.200\nIt's like a little experiment to see what's going on.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.500\nA simple example?\nImagine baking a cake.\nYou might test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:24.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:32.000\nOr, maybe you're learning your ABCs.\nA test could be someone asking you to recite the alphabet to see if you remember it.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:36.200\nSo, tests help us understand and learn.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:41.300\nThey show us what we know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:47.500\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools to help us improve!\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
