    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:00.900\nHey there, welcome!\n\n00:01.100 --> 00:02.500\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:06.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:11.400\nThink of it like this: you take a test in school to see if you understand the material.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:13.900\nBut tests aren't just for school!\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:19.700\nImagine you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:24.600\nOr, before buying a new toy, you might play with it to test if you like it.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:28.700\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:32.900\nThey can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like tasting that cake.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:37.800\nBasically, anytime you're checking something to see if it meets your expectations, you're performing a test!\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:41.300\nTo recap, a test is a way to verify something.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:46.400\nWe use them to understand things better and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:47.900\nThis video was created by\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:48.300\nApilage AI.\n```"
