    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_221219.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.222 --> 00:02.052\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:02.252 --> 00:06.372\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.762 --> 00:10.822\nIt helps us measure or evaluate skills, knowledge, or even performance.\n\n00:11.462 --> 00:17.192\nThink of it like this: you're trying to bake a cake, and you taste it to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:17.192 --> 00:17.842\nThat's a test!\n\n00:18.362 --> 00:23.072\nCommon examples are school exams, which check how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:23.542 --> 00:27.912\nOr a medical test, like a blood test, which helps doctors understand your health.\n\n00:28.362 --> 00:31.492\nEven a simple quiz on your favorite movie is a type of test.\n\n00:31.992 --> 00:34.232\nTests give us information.\n\n00:34.662 --> 00:37.932\nThey help us understand where we are and what we might need to improve.\n\n00:38.542 --> 00:45.592\nSo, a test is just a tool for gathering information, whether it's about your knowledge, your health, or even your baking skills.\n\n00:46.342 --> 00:49.112\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
