    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_221701.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests! You've probably taken a few in school, but what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:20.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use tests to measure or evaluate something, like how much you've learned, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:31.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test might see if people like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:34.900\nSee? Different things, same idea!\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.400\nSo, a test helps us gather information. It lets us see where we're at, and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:52.100\nIt's a tool for learning and improvement. To recap, a test is a method for measuring or evaluating something.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:59.900\nIt gives us information and helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
