    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:19.500\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:29.700\nThink about it: your teacher gives you a test to see how well you've learned the material. Or, maybe you're baking a cake and you taste the batter.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:38.200\nThat's a test to see if it needs more sugar! Even a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:46.900\nTests help us understand things better. They give us information we can use to make decisions or learn something new.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:51.900\nSo remember, a test is just a way of checking something.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
