    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.500\nIt's a process designed to get information about a person, object, or even an idea.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:42.500\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned. Or, you might even test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:53.100\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. They can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like trying to build something.\n\n00:53.100 --> 01:02.300\nThe important thing is that they help us understand something better. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn. They're everywhere, and they help us make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
