    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_222117.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like this: we use tests to measure knowledge, skills, abilities, or even just to see if something works.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:27.400\nIt's like baking a cake. You wouldn't just serve it without checking if it's cooked, right?\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:33.500\nYou might stick a toothpick in it. That toothpick test tells you if the cake is ready.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:41.900\nAnother example: a spelling test in school. It helps your teacher see how well you understand spelling rules.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:50.000\nOr a test drive before buying a car, making sure it runs smoothly.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:54.800\nSo, a test is just a tool to gather information.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:57.200\nIt helps us understand more about the world and ourselves! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
