    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process of asking a question or performing an action to see what happens.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if water is hot.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:29.500\nYou touch it \u2013 that's a test! You're testing the water's temperature.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:37.600\nTests aren't just about temperature, of course. A spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:42.700\nA taste test lets you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:50.400\nIn all these cases, you're performing the test to get information. So, remember, a test is a way to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
