    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.000\nIt helps us learn more about a person, thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:36.800\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:45.800\nOr, a doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:54.800\nTests can also be used to see if a product works the way it's supposed to, like testing a new toy to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:02.000\nSo, tests are all about gathering information. They help us understand things better and make informed decisions. They can be quizzes, experiments, or even just observations. The key is that they give us data we can use. That's the basic idea of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
