    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.400\nIt helps us learn if something is true, or how well something works. Think of it like this: if you want to know if your cake is ready, you test it with a toothpick.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:30.800\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:37.700\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. Each time you try, you're testing your balance.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:44.600\nYou might fall, but that's part of the test! Tests can be big, like a school exam, or small, like checking if your shoelaces are tied.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:58.200\nBasically, anything that helps you gather information and learn something new is a test. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn and explore!\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
