    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.300\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. It helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:28.300\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:34.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 does it taste good? Did it rise properly?\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:50.100\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and see if something passes or fails. Whether it's checking your health, your knowledge, or even a recipe, tests help us understand where we stand.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:53.800\nThat\u2019s the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
