    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:14.900\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:27.100\nThink about tasting a new food. That's a test!\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:33.300\nYou're testing its flavor. Or imagine checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:41.600\nThat's testing if it's functional. In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:52.200\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel unwell. So, a test is just a process to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:52.200 --> 01:02.100\nBasically, a test helps us understand what something is, or how it works. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
