    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHello and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:13.200\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:19.400\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:29.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think about baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:38.600\nOr, when you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test of your balance and coordination.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:48.200\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. So, a test can be anything from a simple taste to a big exam.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:52.000\nThe goal is always the same: to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.600\nRemember, tests aren't about being perfect, they're about understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
