    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out how well you know something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like checking if you understand a new game's rules. The main idea behind a test is to see what you've learned.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:35.800\nIt can be questions on paper, doing a task, or even answering questions out loud. It's all about showing what you know.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:41.300\nFor example, a spelling test shows if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:51.000\nA cooking test might see if you can follow a recipe. And a driving test? Well, that shows you can safely operate a car!\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:58.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to check your knowledge or skills. It helps you and others see what you've learned and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:02.000\nPretty simple, right?\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:05.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
