    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_223837.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:18.800\nIt's a process, a method, a check-up to see if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:24.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test at school checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:30.800\nOr, a taste test checks which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:35.800\nSee? Different tests, different results!\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:44.300\nAnother example is a medical test. A doctor might run tests to find out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:49.300\nThe results help them figure out the best way to help you get better.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:56.200\nSo, tests are all about learning information. They help us understand things better, whether it's our own skills, our preferences, or even our health.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:00.500\nTests are a key part of learning and discovery! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "300fe3ab-f61d-48d9-b3e6-c949d94e7adb": {
    "id": "300fe3ab-f61d-48d9-b3e6-c949d94e7adb",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:11:08.818968",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-03T22:39:25.918735",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260103_223925.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_223925.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, we're also looking for proof.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:26.800\nThink about it like this: If you want to know if your cookies are baked enough, you can test them!\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:30.900\nYou might poke them with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, they're done! That's a test.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:41.700\nOr, if you're wondering if you know your ABCs, someone might give you a quiz. That quiz is a test to see how well you know the alphabet.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:51.500\nSo, a test is just a process, a way of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or if you understand something. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "29ec842e-7c06-4793-b294-e8eca827c7eb": {
    "id": "29ec842e-7c06-4793-b294-e8eca827c7eb",
