    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.120 --> 00:01.720\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.720 --> 00:04.320\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.320 --> 00:07.820\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:07.820 --> 00:12.420\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more.\n\n00:12.420 --> 00:17.220\nThe thing we're finding out about could be anything!\n\n00:17.220 --> 00:20.620\nIt could be how well you know your multiplication tables,\n\n00:20.620 --> 00:24.220\nor how much sugar is in a soda.\n\n00:24.220 --> 00:28.420\nThe test is the method we use to get that answer.\n\n00:28.420 --> 00:33.320\nFor example, a spelling test helps show how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:33.320 --> 00:39.120\nOr, a doctor might do a blood test to find out if you have enough vitamins.\n\n00:39.120 --> 00:43.520\nWe can even test the strength of a bridge to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:43.520 --> 00:50.620\nSo, remember, a test is just a procedure to gather information.\n\n00:50.620 --> 00:56.320\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:56.320 --> 01:00.120\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
