    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.300\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, but what is a test, really?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:24.000\nIt helps us check your understanding.\nThink of it like this:\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:34.800\nimagine you're learning to bake a cake.\nA test would be like asking you what ingredients you need, or how long to bake it for.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:47.200\nIf you answer correctly, it shows you understand the recipe!\nTests can be written, like quizzes in school, or even practical, like showing you can ride a bike.\nThe important thing is they help measure your knowledge or skill.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:54.900\nSo, tests help us learn where we\u2019re doing well and where we might need a little more practice.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
