    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:29.400\nThat's a test! We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:40.000\nMaybe you check the weather app to test if you need an umbrella. Or perhaps you try on a new pair of shoes to test if they fit.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:50.600\nIn school, tests help us see how well we've learned something. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just simple activities.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:57.000\nThe goal is to see what we know and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:01.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something, whether it's a cake, the weather, or how much you've learned.\n\n01:01.200 --> 01:04.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
