    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_224427.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.900\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.900 --> 00:07.000\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests, which are basically just ways to see what you know about something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:14.000\nThink of it like a quiz in school, but tests can be used for all sorts of things, not just in classrooms.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:23.000\nEssentially, a test gives you questions or tasks to complete, and then someone looks at your answers to see how well you understand the topic.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:28.500\nFor example, you might take a spelling test to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:33.000\nOr, a doctor might give you a physical test to check your overall health.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:34.500\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:43.000\nSo, to sum it up, a test is just a method for checking knowledge or ability in a specific area.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:48.500\nThey help us understand what we already know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:51.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
