    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:18.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.600\nIn school, tests help us see how much we've learned about a subject.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:45.900\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even written answers. Imagine you're learning about animals. A test might ask you to name different animals or describe their habitats.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:54.800\nSo, tests help us understand what we know, and what we might need to learn more about. They're a tool for learning, not just a measure of what you already know.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:00.500\nRemember, tests are just one way to learn. They help you grow and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
