    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:20.200\nIt could be checking if you understand a topic, like in school, or checking if something is working properly.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:32.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you're baking a cake, and you taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:34.600\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:48.900\nSchool tests, like quizzes or exams, help your teachers see what you've learned. And testing new products, like phones or cars, helps companies make sure they're safe and reliable.\n\n00:48.900 --> 01:03.400\nSo, tests are all about checking things \u2013 checking knowledge, checking health, checking quality. They help us understand, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:03.400 --> 01:07.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
