    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.800\nA test is simply a way to find out something specific.\nThink of it like a detective looking for clues.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.300\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:36.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test that tells you the cake is done!\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, falling down is a test \u2013 it shows you what not to do next time.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:49.100\nTests help us understand things better and make better choices.\nThey can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:58.200\nThe main idea is to gather information and learn from it.\nSo, remember, a test is a way to get information.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:04.900\nIt could be about a cake, a bike, or anything else!\nTests help us learn and grow.\n\n01:04.900 --> 01:08.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
