    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.600\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we simply mean checking something to see if it works correctly or meets certain standards.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like this: you test the water before jumping in to make sure it's not too cold!\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:30.400\nTests can be all sorts of things. A doctor gives you a medical test to check your health.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:42.400\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and your baking skills!\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:51.500\nFor example, you might test a toy car to see how fast it goes. Or you might test a new lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:51.500 --> 01:00.600\nThe point is to gather information and see if something passes or fails.\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:03.100\nSo, to recap:\n\n01:03.100 --> 01:06.100\na test is a way of checking something to see if it meets expectations.\n\n01:06.100 --> 01:09.700\nIt's how we learn and improve things all around us.\n\n01:09.700 --> 01:12.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
