    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:20.900\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think of it like this: you taste a new food to test if you like it.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:31.500\nOr, you might test the temperature of the water before getting into a pool. In school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:42.100\nThey might be multiple choice, fill-in-the-blank, or even just answering questions out loud. So, a test isn't something scary!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:51.100\nIt's just a tool for understanding and learning. It shows us where we're doing well and what areas we might need to focus on a little more.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:58.300\nRemember, tests are all about learning and growing. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
