    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a checkup, that's a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done \u2013 that's also a test!\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:37.100\nTests can be big or small. A simple test might be checking if the light switch turns on the light.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:48.800\nA bigger test could be a school exam to see what you've learned. So, remember, a test is just a way to find out information and make sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:58.000\nFrom checking your homework to launching a rocket, we use tests every day. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
