    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.400\nIt could be to see if you understand a topic, like in school. Or, it could be to check if something works correctly, like testing a new toy.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.800\nThink of it this way: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:45.800\nIn both cases, they're gathering information. So, tests help us learn, improve things, and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:56.400\nThey're all about finding answers and getting a better understanding. In short, a test is a method for gathering information or evaluating something.\n\n00:56.400 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
