    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a light bulb works, you put it in a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:30.800\nThat's a test! Or, if you want to see if your cookies taste good, you have someone try one.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:40.700\nThat's also a test. Tests can be simple, like checking if your shoes fit, or more complicated, like a science experiment.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:49.400\nThe main idea is to gather information. So, a test is just a way to check something and learn more about it.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:53.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
