    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:14.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:30.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:35.400\nOr, think about baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. That's a test too!\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:45.300\nAnother example is taking a quiz at school. It's a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:56.000\nTests can come in many forms, from simple yes or no questions to more complex problems. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information, whether it's about your health, a recipe, or how much you know.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:02.500\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
