    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.400\nIt's how we gather information and see if something works, or if something is true.\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:29.400\nSee?\nTests can be big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:36.700\nAnother example is a medical test.\nDoctors use tests to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:49.000\nAnd, when you're building something, like a bridge, engineers run tests to make sure it's strong enough to hold up.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:59.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new by trying something out.\nIt helps us understand and make better decisions.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
