    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:16.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.100\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time.\nA doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:39.800\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned.\nThe goal of a test is to give us information.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:48.800\nFor example, let's say you want to know if your toy car needs new batteries.\nYou could test it by turning it on.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:57.800\nIf it runs weakly or not at all, that's a test telling you the batteries are probably dead.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:01.200\nSo, tests are everywhere, helping us understand the world around us.\n\n01:01.200 --> 01:04.100\nThey help us confirm things and make sure everything is working as it should!\n\n01:04.100 --> 01:04.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
