    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:19.500\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer,\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:27.700\nor trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:34.600\nThink about it: your teacher gives you a test in class to see how well you understand the material. That's a test!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:43.800\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to see if it needs more sugar. That's also a test!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:54.600\nTests can be big or small, simple or complicated, but they all have the same goal: to find out something. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working properly.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
