    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:10.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out information or see how well something works.\n\n00:10.300 --> 00:17.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is good before you screw it in.\nYou're testing it to make sure it lights up.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:27.800\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just a class activity.\nIt's a way to measure your understanding of a topic.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:33.000\nAnother example?\nImagine baking a cake.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:38.400\nYou might taste the batter before putting it in the oven.\nThat's a test!\nYou're checking if it tastes good.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:42.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information or evaluate something.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:56.300\nFrom checking lightbulbs to taking quizzes, we use tests every day to learn and improve.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
