    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.300\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:34.000\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:45.900\nEven engineers test bridges to make sure they're strong enough to hold cars. So, tests help us understand, measure, and ensure things are good.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:52.500\nRemember, a test is simply a check! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
