    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:21.700\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think about it: a spelling test at school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:28.200\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar. That's a test too!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:33.500\nAnother example is a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:44.500\nTests can be written, like quizzes, or they can involve doing something, like tasting batter. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:54.900\nIt helps us understand something better by getting some kind of result.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
