    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:03.200 --> 00:07.300\nToday, we're going to talk about something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:11.900\nNow, in simple terms, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:16.600\nIt's like asking a question or doing a simple experiment to see what happens.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like this: You might test a new lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:22.400\nThat's a test!\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:26.400\nOr, a doctor might test your reflexes by tapping your knee.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:27.800\nThat's another kind of test.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:31.700\nTests help us understand things better.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:34.800\nThey tell us if something works, if something is safe, or if something is true.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.300\nSo, whether it's checking a new toy or taking a quiz at school, remember that a test is just a way to find out information.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:47.000\nIn short, a test is an investigation or a way of checking something.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:50.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
