    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.200\nIt's like an experiment, but often a little simpler.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:25.800\nThink about it. A test can be anything from a quick quiz at school to see what you've learned,\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:30.200\nto checking if a light bulb works before you screw it in.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:35.000\nWe're testing its ability to give light.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:39.500\nAnother example? Baking a cake!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:46.900\nYou test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in. If it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:56.500\nSee? Tests are all around us, helping us understand things better and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something or check if something works.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:03.500\nIt\u2019s a simple but powerful tool!\n\n01:03.500 --> 01:06.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
