    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.900\nIt's like an experiment or a way of gathering information.\nThink of it like this: a cooking test!\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:27.600\nYou try a small bite of your soup to see if it needs more salt.\nThat's a test.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:35.900\nOr, maybe you tap your tires before a long car ride to see if they're properly inflated.\nThat's also a test.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:47.900\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nThey can be simple, like checking the temperature with a thermometer, or more complicated, like a medical exam.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:57.300\nThe key is that they help us learn something we didn't know before.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:05.100\nIt's a tool we use to learn and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
