    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb still lights up. That's a test!\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:37.300\nTests can be anything from a quiz at school to checking the temperature of your food to see if it's cooked.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:43.200\nThey help us understand where we're at and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:50.400\nFor example, a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice. Or, a taste test can help you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:57.300\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is just a way to learn more and improve. It's a tool, not something to be afraid of. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
