    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:23.200\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:34.400\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:44.300\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:49.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and your skills!\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:54.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.500\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.000\nSee? Tests are all around us, helping us learn and make decisions.\n```"
  },
