    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_232651.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something, like how well you know a subject, or if something works correctly.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like this: Your doctor gives you a physical test to check your overall health. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you've learned your vocabulary.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:37.000\nAnother example is testing a new recipe. You follow the instructions and then taste it to see if it\u2019s delicious!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.800\nThat\u2019s a test! So, a test is just a process of gathering information or evaluating something.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:51.000\nIt helps us understand and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
