    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:18.900\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests all the time in our everyday lives.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:24.700\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might test if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:38.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you the cake is ready! Or, if you're buying a new phone, you might test the camera by taking a quick picture to see if you like the quality.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:48.900\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and make a decision. It helps us understand something better by providing evidence.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:59.400\nRemember, tests are about learning and understanding, not just getting things right or wrong. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
