    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like an experiment. We want to learn more, so we create a situation and observe what happens.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:28.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:34.800\nOr a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:54.100\nSo, to recap, a test helps us gather information. It can be used in lots of different ways, from checking our health to seeing how well we've learned something.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.100\nIt's all about learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
