    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:20.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something.\nIt could be about you, like a quiz in school, or about something else, like testing a new toy to see if it's safe.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:29.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if an apple is ripe.\nYou might look at its color, smell it, or even take a bite.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:34.800\nThose are all little tests! You're testing the apple to see if it's ready to eat.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:38.700\nAnother example?\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:45.600\nA doctor gives you a check-up.\nThey\u2019re running tests to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:55.300\nThey might listen to your heart or check your reflexes.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:58.900\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
