    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_234037.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:22.700\nIt's like asking a question to get an answer. Think about it: a taste test tells you how something tastes.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:31.900\nA spelling test shows you how well you can spell. And a medical test can tell doctors about your health.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:44.600\nTests can be simple, like checking if a light bulb works by turning it on. Or they can be more complicated, like the tests engineers do to make sure a bridge is safe.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:54.100\nBasically, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a tool for discovery! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
