    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: you want to see if your cake is ready, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:25.800\nThat's a mini-test!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:33.100\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned in class.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:43.400\nThey can be in different forms, like multiple choice where you pick the right answer, or written answers where you explain things in your own words.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:48.700\nFor example, a test might ask you what's two plus two, or it could ask you to describe your favorite animal.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:59.300\nSo, to recap, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge, whether it's about math, science, or even baking a cake!\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.000\nIt helps us see what we know and what we might need to learn more about.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:04.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
