    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:15.600\nWhat is a test, exactly? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:27.400\nThe toothpick comes out clean? Great, the cake is ready!\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:32.100\nSimilarly, doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:37.900\nTeachers give tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:45.000\nAnd engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:50.300\nTests help us understand things better and make important decisions.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.100\nSo, a test is just a method or procedure used to find something out.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:54.400\nPretty simple, right?\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
