    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.000\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out what you know, or what something can do.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: you might take a math test at school to show your teacher how well you understand adding and subtracting.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.500\nBut tests aren't just for school! They can also be used to check if a new medicine works, or to see if a bridge is strong enough to hold cars.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:38.000\nBasically, any time you're trying to learn something about a person, object, or idea, you can use a test.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:41.800\nFor example, a taste test can help you decide which cookie recipe is the best.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:45.200\nOr, a spelling test can show you which words you need to practice.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:46.800\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
