    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:22.400\nIt helps us see if something is true, or how well something works. Think of it like this: You might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.000\nOr, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it makes people feel better.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:39.600\nAnother example is a school test. It helps your teacher see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:49.100\nTests can be written, spoken, or even hands-on activities. They all help us gather information.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:56.600\nSo, a test is just a process for gathering information and evaluating something. It's a way to learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
