    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:25.700\nIt's a process designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance. Think of it like this: a teacher might give you a math test to see how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:32.500\nOr, a food taster might test different flavors to see which one is the most delicious. See? Different situations, same idea!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:42.400\nTests can be written, like quizzes, or practical, like a driving exam. They can even be as simple as trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:54.600\nThe important thing is that a test helps us learn something new, or measure what we already know. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn and evaluate.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:01.000\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
