    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260103_235652.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nEver wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:26.600\nIt's a process we use to gather information and learn more.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:45.500\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:53.300\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:01.100\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking questions in class.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:09.700\nThe goal is to see if you understand the material.\n\n01:09.700 --> 01:16.000\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve a problem.\n\n01:16.000 --> 01:23.400\nA reading test might ask you to answer questions about a story.\n\n01:23.400 --> 01:30.900\nThese examples help your teacher and you know what you already understand and what you might need more practice with.\n\n01:30.900 --> 01:38.700\nSo, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n01:38.700 --> 01:45.400\nIt helps us find out what we know and what we need to learn.\n\n01:45.400 --> 01:49.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
