    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:14.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:33.300\nTests can take many forms. It could be a written exam at school, a simple yes or no question, or even observing how something behaves.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:45.000\nFor example, a scientist might test a new fertilizer on plants to see if they grow bigger. Or, you might test if a lightbulb works by plugging it in.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:53.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to gather information and see if something meets a certain requirement.\n\n00:53.400 --> 01:02.800\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
