    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.000\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we don't just mean school exams.\nA test is really just a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you might test if a lightbulb works by screwing it in and flipping the switch.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:35.500\nOr, a chef might test a sauce by tasting it to see if it needs more salt.\nIn software, tests are little programs that check if other programs are doing their job correctly.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:46.300\nFor example, a test might make sure that when you click a button, the right thing happens.\nSo, a test is all about checking and confirming.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:53.300\nIt helps us make sure things are working the way they should.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
