    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like this: a recipe is a test for making a cake. You follow the instructions, and the result, the cake, tells you if you did it right.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:32.600\nOr, a spelling test! It shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:40.000\nAnother example could be testing the batteries in your flashlight. You put them in and see if the light turns on.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:52.800\nIf it does, the batteries pass the test! So, a test is just a way to check things out, learn something new, or make sure something is working as expected.\n\n00:52.800 --> 01:01.200\nIt\u2019s a simple but important tool for understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
