    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_000217.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.200 --> 00:02.900\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:02.900 --> 00:05.600\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:9.500\nIt helps us check if things are working as they should, or if we understand a certain topic.\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:14.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:18.300\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:24.000\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:25.800\nBasically, anything can be tested!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:28.400\nSo, a test is all about gathering information.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:34.200\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are safe and reliable.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:36.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
