    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:31.300\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. Your first few tries are like a test to see if you can balance.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:42.000\nAnd school exams? Those are tests to see how well you've learned the material. We use tests every day, in all sorts of situations, to learn and improve.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:51.500\nSo, a test is just a process to gather information and see where we stand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
