    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like checking your knowledge or the performance of something.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you can spell words.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.400\nOr, a taste test checks how good a food tastes. Even a car can be tested to see how fast it can go.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:50.800\nSo, tests help us understand where we are and what we need to learn or improve.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:57.200\nThey can be used for all sorts of things, from schoolwork to product development. To recap, a test is a way to evaluate knowledge, skills, or performance. It gives us valuable information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
