    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_000659.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.800\nIt helps us understand more about a person, thing, or process.\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells us how well someone knows their spelling words.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:37.800\nOr, a taste test helps us decide which ice cream flavor we like best.\nEven when you check if your car keys are in your pocket, that's a mini-test to make sure you have them!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:49.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple questions to complex experiments.\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:58.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
