    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_000830.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests help us measure or evaluate things.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:31.500\nFor example, a math test helps your teacher see how well you understand adding and subtracting.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.600\nA taste test can tell you which cookie tastes the best!\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:47.500\nDoctors use tests too. When you get a check-up, they might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.500\nIt's all about gathering information to make sure everything's working as it should.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:01.000\nSo, to recap: A test is a way to learn something. It can be used to measure knowledge, evaluate performance, or even check on your health.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:06.400\nTests help us understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
