    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.499\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:20.399\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, you might take a spelling test at school.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:28.499\nThat test helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words. Or, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:34.499\nYou might taste a little bit of the batter to test if it needs more sugar. That's a test too!\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:43.499\nAnother example is checking if a lightbulb works. You screw it in, flip the switch, and see if it lights up. The light turning on is the result of the test.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:57.099\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something, whether it's about your spelling, your cake batter, or even a lightbulb. It\u2019s all about gathering information!\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:03.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
