    "subtitles": "```webvtt\n    WEBVTT\n    \n    00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\n    Okay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n    \n    00:05.200 --> 00:17.200\n    Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n    \n    00:17.200 --> 00:27.300\n    It's a process we use to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well something is performing.\n    \n    00:27.300 --> 00:34.600\n    Think about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n    \n    00:34.600 --> 00:45.200\n    Or, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n    \n    00:45.200 --> 00:55.400\n    Even baking a cake is a kind of test, to see if you followed the recipe correctly and it tastes good!\n    \n    00:55.400 --> 01:03.800\n    Tests can be simple, like pressing a button to see if a light turns on. Or they can be more complex, like running a science experiment. The important thing is that they give us information. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and check on something. It helps us understand how things work and if they're working the way they should.\n    \n    01:03.800 --> 01:08.400\n    This video was created by Apilage AI.\n    ```"
