    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.500\nWhat is a test?\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:17.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nTests can be all sorts of things.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:26.000\nA math test in school checks your understanding of numbers.\nA taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.600\nEven checking if a light bulb works is a kind of test!\nYou're testing to see if it lights up.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:38.200\nSo, let's say you want to know if your plant needs water.\nYou can test it!\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:45.000\nStick your finger in the soil.\nIf it feels dry, that's your answer \u2013 it needs water!\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:48.600\nSee?\nTest, question, answer.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:55.800\nTests help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\nThey're everywhere!\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
