    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_002059.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.600\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:26.800\nIt helps us understand if something works, if we know something, or if something is good or bad. Think of it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:33.100\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.700\nAnother example? A company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:50.700\nSo, tests are all about checking things! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.200\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
