    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:21.200\nIt's a method for gathering information. Think about it like this: a taste test tells you about the flavor of food.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:28.600\nA spelling test tells you about your spelling skills. Or a doctor might run a blood test to learn about your health.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:37.800\nThe idea is always the same: you perform some action or ask some questions, and the results give you insights.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:50.500\nIt's like a detective gathering clues! Tests help us understand things better, whether it's our knowledge, the quality of a product, or even how well something works.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a structured way to get information.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
