    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_002453.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, so you're probably wondering, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:06.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:09.700\nThink of it like an experiment, but often less complicated.\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:12.900\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:17.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:22.500\nOr, think about baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:23.800\nThe taste is the test!\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:29.700\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:36.300\nThese tests help your teachers understand what you know and what you might need more help with.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:44.000\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see where things stand.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:47.700\nBasically, it's a method for checking something out.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
