    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just talking, you're actually doing something to get the answer.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:23.900\nTests are used everywhere. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:31.700\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to see how much you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:42.200\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious. So, remember, a test is a way of finding something out by doing something.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:50.600\nIt could be anything from a science experiment to a simple question-and-answer session. It's all about getting information.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:53.800\nThat's the basics of testing!\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
