    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260104_002610.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_002610.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. Think of it like asking a question, but getting an answer that's more reliable than just guessing.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:28.500\nThe main idea of a test is to measure something. Maybe you want to know how well you understand a subject, or how strong a material is, or even how good a new recipe tastes!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:39.100\nFor example, a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words. A strength test on a bridge tells engineers how much weight it can hold.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:50.300\nAnd a taste test tells a chef if they need more salt or pepper. So, a test is just a tool to help us learn and understand more about the world around us.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:58.700\nIt helps us measure and evaluate things in a clear and organized way. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
