    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:22.200\nIt's a process we use to check if something is working, or to see what something is made of, or even to find out what someone knows.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:33.100\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health. Or, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:40.600\nEven baking a cake involves a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it comes out delicious.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:53.800\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us understand the world better. They can be simple or complicated, but they all share the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:04.500\nTo recap, a test is a procedure used to gather information. It's used everywhere, from science to school, and even in the kitchen!\n\n01:04.500 --> 01:08.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
