    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:16.800\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but sometimes the question is asked through an activity or a problem to solve.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:28.700\nThe main idea behind a test is to measure something. It could be how well you understand a topic, how fast you can run, or even how strong a material is.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:34.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:40.300\nA fitness test measures your physical abilities.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:45.800\nAnd a safety test on a car checks how well it protects you in an accident.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:46.700\nSee?\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:47.700\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:53.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a process used to measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.200\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we need to work on.\n\n00:57.200 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
