    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_002858.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.283 --> 00:01.173\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.893 --> 00:03.783\nToday we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:03.783 --> 00:06.463\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:06.983 --> 00:08.743\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:09.083 --> 00:10.803\nIt's a way to see if you've learned the material.\n\n00:11.233 --> 00:14.033\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:14.033 --> 00:16.953\nYou might have multiple choice, where you pick the best answer from a few options.\n\n00:17.333 --> 00:18.723\nOr maybe a true or false test.\n\n00:19.123 --> 00:21.363\nSometimes, you even get to write out your answers in short essays.\n\n00:21.743 --> 00:24.623\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve a problem.\n\n00:25.073 --> 00:28.123\nOr a science test might ask you to explain how something works.\n\n00:28.493 --> 00:36.123\nThe important thing is, tests help you and your teachers understand where you're doing well and where you might need a little more help.\n\n00:36.583 --> 00:41.533\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn.\n\n00:41.533 --> 00:45.863\nIt's a chance to show what you know and identify areas to improve.\n\n00:46.123 --> 00:47.683\nDon't be scared, just do your best!\n\n00:48.283 --> 00:49.853\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "a58d0671-09dd-4eea-8b0d-06196a6f4c53": {
    "id": "a58d0671-09dd-4eea-8b0d-06196a6f4c53",
