    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:20.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:27.800\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if your recipe works.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:46.700\nSo, tests help us learn, understand, and make better decisions. They come in many forms, from simple questions to complicated experiments.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.600\nUltimately, they're all about gathering information. Remember, a test is just a way to find out something! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
