    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it\u2019s too hot or too cold.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:26.600\nThat's a test! Or maybe you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:30.500\nThat\u2019s another kind of test. Tests aren't just in school though.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:38.500\nDoctors use tests to figure out what's making you sick, and chefs test their food to make sure it tastes delicious.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:49.000\nSo, a test helps us learn, diagnose, or confirm something. Remember, it's all about gathering information.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:52.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
