    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome!\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.400\nToday we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:25.400\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:29.700\nThink of it like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:35.000\nFor example, a taste test tells you how something tastes, like if a new cookie is yummy or not.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:39.000\nOr, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:42.600\nDoctors even use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:45.100\nThey might take your temperature or check your heartbeat.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:48.900\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:50.600\nThey're all around us, from school to even the kitchen!\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:51.400\nRemember, a test is just a way to find something out.\n```"
  },
