    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_003551.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.100\nOkay, so you're curious about tests?\nGreat!\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:39.000\nA driving test evaluates your ability to drive.\nAnd a product test, well, that checks the performance of that product.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:49.900\nTests can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like trying out a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:53.500\nBasically, anytime you\u2019re trying to measure or assess something, you're using a test.\nSo, remember, a test is an evaluation.\n```"
