    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_003629.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:17.400\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:26.200\nIt's a process or procedure we use to gather information.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:35.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you take a quiz in school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:45.400\nThe main idea is that a test helps us understand something better.\nFor example, a taste test can tell you which juice is sweeter.\nA spelling test shows you which words you know how to spell.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:53.800\nSo, remember, a test is really just a tool.\nIt's a structured way to learn something or confirm something we already suspect.\nIt helps us make informed decisions and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
