    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_003721.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand more.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.200\nThink about it like this: a taste test! You try a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:27.400\nThat's a test! Or, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:32.600\nYou check it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's another kind of test!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:37.500\nTests aren't just about food, though. They can be about anything.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:45.300\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:56.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It's all about exploring and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
