    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.999\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.999 --> 00:13.699\nSimply put, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:13.699 --> 00:22.899\nThink of it like this: you're trying to bake a cake, and you taste the batter.\n\n00:22.899 --> 00:26.999\nThat's a test!\n\n00:26.999 --> 00:34.799\nYou're checking if it tastes good before you bake it.\n\n00:34.799 --> 00:39.099\nTests help us see if something is working correctly or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:39.099 --> 00:41.999\nYour school exams are tests to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:41.999 --> 00:43.999\nA doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:43.999 --> 00:51.599\nAnother example?\n\n00:51.599 --> 00:53.199\nImagine you built a birdhouse.\n\n00:53.199 --> 00:56.399\nYou might test it by putting it outside and seeing if birds actually use it.\n\n00:56.399 --> 01:00.099\nThat would tell you if your design works!\n\n01:00.099 --> 01:08.399\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information, check for quality, or measure performance.\n\n01:08.399 --> 01:12.699\nIt's a simple way to learn and improve.\n\n01:12.699 --> 01:14.699\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
