    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:21.300\nIt helps us learn and measure things. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a physical test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:27.200\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:32.900\nSee? Different kinds of tests for different things.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:38.700\nAnother example is baking a cake. You might test the batter by tasting it to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:50.700\nThat\u2019s a test! So, a test is just a process to gather information. It can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like tasting cake batter.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.700\nIt's all about finding something out.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.300\nThanks for watching! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
