    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:16.800\nBasically, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, or a way to check if something is working as it should.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:24.600\nIt could be a simple question, like \"What's your favorite color?\" The answer is the result of the test.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:33.500\nOr, it could be something more complicated, like a math problem. You solve it, and that's your test result.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:44.200\nHere's another example: when you try a new recipe, you're testing it out to see if it tastes good. If it does, the test was successful!\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:52.500\nSo, in short, a test is just a way to gather information or see if something meets a certain standard. It helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
