    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:05.900\nToday, we're going to talk about something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:12.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:14.300\nThink of it like a detective trying to solve a mystery.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:15.900\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:19.400\nYour doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:24.300\nOr your teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:28.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:31.500\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.000\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:39.200\nIt helps us understand things better and make decisions.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:42.700\nThey come in all shapes and sizes and are used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:46.800\nTo recap, a test helps us learn something by giving us information.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:53.600\nWhether it's a school quiz, a medical checkup, or even trying a new recipe, tests are all around us.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
