    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:24.300\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something needs to be improved.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:36.500\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might test a recipe to see if it tastes good before making it for a big party.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:46.800\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:57.100\nSo, a test can be a health check, a taste test, or even a school exam. The important thing is that it gives us information.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:06.100\nIt tells us whether something passes or fails, and why. By understanding the results, we can make things better.\n\n01:06.100 --> 01:09.600\nSo remember, a test is a check-up, a way to learn and improve.\n\n01:09.600 --> 01:14.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
