    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:24.400\nIt helps us gather information and see how well something works, or how much someone knows.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, if you're learning a new language, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you're understanding the lessons.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:42.800\nTests aren't just for people, either! We can test a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or test a toy to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:51.100\nSo, tests are all about collecting information and understanding something better. They help us learn and improve!\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:60.900\nSo remember, a test is a method of gathering information to evaluate something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
