    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.500\nYou've probably taken lots of them in school, but what is a test, really?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:27.100\nIt helps us understand something better by asking questions or performing actions to get an answer.\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:38.000\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it\u2019s sweet enough.\nAnother example is testing a toy car by pushing it to see how far it goes.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:43.100\nThat's a test! We're learning about the car by observing what happens.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:50.800\nSo, a test is a way to learn something by asking a question or trying something out to see what happens.\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
