    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, and that's true.\nBut in general, a test is simply a way to find something out.\nIt's a way to gather information.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:20.100\nThink about it.\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:27.200\nA chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\nOr a mechanic might test your car battery to see if it needs replacing.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:41.200\nSo, tests are all about checking something, or seeing if something works, or finding out more information.\nThey help us make decisions and solve problems.\nWe use them every day, even if we don't always realize it.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:48.900\nEssentially, a test is a question you ask the world and then you look at the answer.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
