    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.100\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, and that's definitely one kind.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:24.100\nBut in general, a test is really just a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:34.100\nYou plug it in. That's a test! You\u2019re testing the lightbulb to see if it lights up.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:37.700\nOr maybe you're baking a cake.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:41.300\nYou taste it to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:41.300\nThat's another test!\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:44.900\nYou're testing the flavor.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:57.700\nSo, a test is any procedure designed to confirm or deny a specific idea. It can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like tasting your cake. The important thing is you're trying to learn something.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.400\nTests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
