    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:12.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like asking a question.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:29.800\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you're baking a cake. You might test if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:41.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a pass! Or, think about checking if your shoes fit. You try them on and walk around \u2013 that's a test to see if they're comfortable.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:56.500\nTests can be simple, like that, or a little more complicated, like a quiz at school. But the idea is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:02.100\nSo, in short, a test is a way to gather information to see if something is working as expected, or meets a certain standard. Pretty useful, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
