    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher uses a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:35.500\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it! Tests can be anything from answering questions on paper, to observing something in action, to even just trying something out.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:51.500\nThe important thing is that it helps us understand something better. So, to recap, a test is a method for gathering information, whether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even just your taste in food.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:58.900\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
