    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:04.600\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:06.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:09.600\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:09.600 --> 00:14.300\nFor example, when you flip a light switch, you're testing if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:19.000\nOr, when you taste a new food, you're testing if you like the flavor.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:25.000\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:29.800\nThey can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like building something.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:38.900\nSo, remember, a test is a way to learn something, to check if something works, or to see how much you know.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:42.600\nIt's all about gathering information.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:45.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
