    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHi there! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.000\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:34.800\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if we need to make some changes.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:43.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:49.800\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test to see if you follow the recipe correctly! So, a test is a process of asking a question, gathering information, and then figuring out the answer. It's all about learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
