    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:23.300\nIt could be checking if you understand a lesson, like a quiz in school. Or, it could be checking if something works correctly, like testing a new toy to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:32.600\nThink of it like this: A doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or a baker might taste their cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.000\nTests help us learn and improve things. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:45.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:55.600\nFrom quizzes to quality control, tests are all around us. They are helpful tools for gaining knowledge. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
