    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_010125.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process that helps us measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even how well something works.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:32.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\nOr a taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:36.400\nSee?\nIt's all about gathering information.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:46.700\nTests can be written, spoken, or even a physical activity.\nThe important thing is that they give us some kind of result or answer.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:57.700\nSo, a test helps us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:04.300\nTo recap: a test is a process for gathering information.\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n01:04.300 --> 01:07.900\nAnd it gives us results that we can use.\n\n01:07.900 --> 01:11.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
