    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_010425.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give us information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells us how well you know your words. Or, a taste test helps us decide which cookie is the yummiest!\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:34.700\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and scientists use tests to see if their theories are correct.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:47.400\nSo, basically, a test is just a question or a set of questions, or even an action, that helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:57.500\nWe use tests all the time, often without even realizing it! They're a crucial part of learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
