    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_010509.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:25.700\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well someone or something performs. Think of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might use a toothpick.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:34.200\nThat's a test! Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, falling down a few times is also a kind of test.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.900\nYou're testing your balance and learning from your mistakes. Schools use tests to see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:54.100\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They can show us what we know, what we need to work on, and how things are working.\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:01.400\nTesting is an important part of learning and improving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
