    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.700\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in a broader sense, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:27.000\nIt's a procedure designed to check or evaluate something. Think about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:34.500\nOr, when you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit, that's also a test.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:44.000\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in class, or informal, like checking the weather forecast before going outside.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:53.400\nThe important thing is that they give you information. So, a test is simply a method to gather data and learn something new.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
