    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:05.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:08.200\nThink of it like asking a question, but getting an answer that shows you what you need to know.\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:12.600\nIt could be something like a spelling test in school, where you see if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:17.200\nOr maybe you\u2019ve seen someone test the temperature of bathwater to make sure it's not too hot or too cold.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:20.800\nAnother example is a taste test!\nTrying a new ice cream flavor to see if you like it.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:24.800\nAll of these are tests because they help us learn something.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:34.300\nSo, a test is just a method, any method, of gathering information to see if something is true, correct, or working like it should.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:37.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
