    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_011234.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it as a question or a series of questions designed to get information.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.800\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:45.500\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your overall health. Even a simple quiz online is a type of test!\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:55.000\nTests help us measure things, like knowledge, skill, or ability. They can tell us what we know, what we need to learn, and how we're improving.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:06.500\nSo, tests aren't scary, they're just tools to help us understand ourselves better. They give you important information.\n\n01:06.500 --> 01:10.100\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information,\n01:10.100 --> 01:13.700\nwhether it's a spelling test, a medical test, or even a fun online quiz!\n01:13.700 --> 01:16.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
