    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nNow, you might be thinking about school tests, but in this case, a test is a way to check if something works the way it should.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: imagine you're baking a cake. You wouldn't just throw it in the oven and hope for the best, right?\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:29.300\nYou'd probably test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through. That's a test!\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:37.500\nOr, let's say you're building with LEGOs. You might test if two pieces fit together properly before moving on.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:45.600\nTesting helps us find problems early on so we can fix them. It's all about making sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:56.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check if something is doing what it's supposed to do. It helps us avoid mistakes and create better things.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
