    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a process that helps us gather information or check if something is working correctly. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.400\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie you like best. In science, a test might involve mixing chemicals to see what happens.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.500\nMaybe you're testing if a new plant food makes plants grow faster. You'd compare plants with the food to plants without.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:53.300\nSo, a test is really just a structured way to ask a question and get an answer. It helps us learn, improve things, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
