    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.100\nEver wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:07.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:11.400\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:16.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test in school.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:19.500\nIt helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:25.000\nOr imagine testing a new toy to see if it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:28.200\nTests help us understand things better.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:35.300\nFor example, you might take a taste test to see which cookie you like best, chocolate chip or oatmeal raisin.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:37.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:42.200\nAnd when you go to the doctor, they might do tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:51.100\nSo, a test is just a tool for learning, checking, or finding out more information.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:53.700\nIt's a simple way to get answers.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
