    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but often with a specific goal in mind.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:26.600\nWe use tests all the time, in all sorts of situations. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:34.600\nOr a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:45.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if the recipe works and if you followed the instructions correctly.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:53.000\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and learning something new. It helps us understand what we know, what we don't know, and how things work.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.700\nPretty useful, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
