    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_012132.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.900\nA test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb works before you screw it into a lamp.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:32.200\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time. A doctor gives you a physical exam \u2013 that\u2019s a test to check your health.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:41.200\nWhen you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done. That's another test!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:54.800\nSo, tests help us make sure things are right, safe, or meet a certain standard. They can be simple or complex, but the basic idea is always the same: to verify something.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.400\nTests are essential because they help us make informed decisions and avoid problems. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
