    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.100\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:01.100 --> 00:02.800\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:02.800 --> 00:04.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:06.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:09.300\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:11.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:13.900\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:16.200\nDoctors use tests to see if you\u2019re healthy, and scientists use tests to prove or disprove ideas.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:19.500\nSo, tests can be anything from quizzes in school to experiments in a lab.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:24.700\nThe important thing is they help us learn and understand more about the world around us.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:26.800\nThey help us measure and evaluate things.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:28.400\nBasically, a test is a tool we use to get answers.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:29.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
