    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:38.100\nOr, a doctor might give you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to check your health.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:48.700\nAnother example: Before releasing a new phone, companies put it through all sorts of tests to make sure it's durable and functions correctly.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:58.400\nThey might drop it, bend it, or run software tests. So, a test is just a way of gathering information and checking something out.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:02.000\nWhether it's a school exam, a medical check-up, or a product evaluation, tests help us understand where we stand.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:05.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
