    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.880\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:01.880 --> 00:04.570\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out!\n\n00:04.570 --> 00:07.450\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information or evidence\n\n00:07.450 --> 00:08.000\nabout something specific.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:08.810\nThink of it like this:\n\n00:08.810 --> 00:11.220\na doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:11.220 --> 00:13.890\nOr, you take a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:13.890 --> 00:16.860\nTests can be anything from a simple question-and-answer session\n\n00:16.860 --> 00:17.730\nto a more complicated experiment.\n\n00:17.730 --> 00:22.890\nFor example, you might test if a toy car goes faster down a ramp when the ramp is steeper.\n\n00:22.890 --> 00:26.450\nYou're changing something, like the ramp's angle, and seeing what happens.\n\n00:26.450 --> 00:31.870\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better by providing us with facts and data.\n\n00:31.870 --> 00:33.980\nIt's how we learn and prove things!\n\n00:33.980 --> 00:36.150\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
