    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:25.700\nIt could be anything from a quiz at school to checking if a new toy works properly.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:35.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:47.900\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. The main idea is to gather information and understand something better.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:59.900\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words. And a stress test on a bridge makes sure it can handle lots of weight.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:03.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n```"
