    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:24.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think about it: When you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:30.600\nThat's a test! Or, if your car won't start, you might check the battery.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:42.800\nThat's testing the battery to see if it's the problem. Tests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:53.700\nThey all have the same goal: to gather information and learn something new. So, remember, a test is just a way to find things out!\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
