    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:23.900\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:33.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:42.400\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:51.200\nOr, you might even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good! Tests aren't always about grades or right and wrong answers.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:58.300\nSometimes, they're just about gathering information. So, whether it's a pop quiz, a science experiment, or even trying a new flavor of ice cream, you're performing a test!\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:07.400\nBasically, a test is a method to investigate or assess something. Hope this helps you understand the basics of tests!\n\n01:07.400 --> 01:10.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
