    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.800\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability,\nor even the quality of something.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:28.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\nSee? Different tests, different purposes!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:32.000\nAnother example is a medical test.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:39.200\nWhen you go to the doctor, they might run tests to see if you're healthy.\nThey're gathering information to help them understand what's going on.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:55.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information,\nwhether it's about your spelling skills, your favorite ice cream, or your health.\nTests help us learn and make decisions!\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
