    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_013109.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.600\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:22.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nMaybe your doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:33.900\nOr, if you're learning to bake, you might taste your cake to test if it needs more sugar.\nEven playing a game is a kind of test \u2013 can you beat the level?\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:50.700\nThe main goal of a test is to gather information and make a decision based on what you find out.\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a quality check at a factory, or even just trying a new recipe, you're performing a test.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:57.800\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
