    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:11.000\nWe use them every day without even realizing it!\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it like this: you taste a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:16.500\nThat's a test!\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:19.000\nYou're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:23.000\nOr, when you try to turn on a light, you're testing if the bulb works.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:27.000\nIn school, tests help us see how much you've learned.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:30.000\nThey're just one way to check your understanding.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:34.000\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even a written essay.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:37.000\nThe main goal is to show what you know.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:46.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new, whether it's about ice cream, light bulbs, or school subjects.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:50.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
