    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat are they, and why do we need them?\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:20.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:27.700\nIt helps us check something, like how well you understand a subject, or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:34.700\nThink of it like this: if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:41.700\nThat toothpick is doing a simple test! In school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:53.400\nIf you\u2019re buying a used car, a mechanic might run a test to make sure the engine is healthy.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:56.400\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and checking things.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nThey come in many forms, from simple observations to complex exams, but the goal is always the same: to learn something!\n```"
