    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:08.100\nEver wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it as a check-up for your brain! It helps you and others understand how much you've learned about something.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:35.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a written test with questions and answers, or maybe even a practical test where you show someone how to do something.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:39.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:50.600\nA cooking test might see if you can follow a recipe. See? It's all about demonstrating your skills.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge or ability. It's a chance to show what you've learned and identify areas where you can improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
