    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nWhat is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:27.400\nIt's a process we use to check if something is working, or to see how much someone knows about a topic.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:34.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:39.600\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see if you understand the lesson.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:50.400\nIt could be as simple as checking if a light bulb works by flipping the switch. That's a test! Or, tasting food to see if it needs more salt. That's testing too!\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:56.200\nSo, to recap, a test is just a way of checking something, whether it's your health, your knowledge, or even if a light bulb works. It\u2019s all about finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
