    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:22.000\nIt's how we check if something is working, or if we know something.\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:31.900\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:41.900\nTests can come in many forms.\nMaybe it's a multiple-choice quiz, a written assignment, or even just answering questions out loud.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:49.700\nThe important thing is that it gives you a chance to show what you know or if something is functioning correctly.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:56.800\nSo, tests help us understand things better.\nThey give us feedback so we can improve and learn.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:02.500\nThat's the basics of tests!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
