    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.000\nIt helps us check if something is true, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:35.600\nOr, maybe you take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a lesson. These are both tests!\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:39.500\nAnother example could be baking a cake.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:43.400\nTasting it is a test to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:54.000\nDid you use enough sugar? Is it cooked all the way through? So, tests help us learn, check, and understand things better. They're a really useful tool in all sorts of situations!\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
