    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_015020.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests! In simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:17.800\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it. A test helps us check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and then you taste it. That's a test!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:29.900\nYou're testing if the cake tastes good. Or, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:39.100\nEach time you try, you're testing your balance and coordination. Tests aren't always about finding right or wrong answers.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:47.100\nSometimes they help us understand things better. A doctor might run tests to see what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:55.100\nA scientist might run tests to see if a new medicine works. So, a test is basically a way to gather information and learn more about something.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:01.000\nThey're used everywhere to help us understand the world around us.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
