    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: Tests.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.500\nIn its simplest form, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but not always in a science lab. A test can be anything from a quiz at school to checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:42.700\nYou're trying to figure out if something is true, correct, or functioning properly. For example, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:54.800\nOr, before you leave the house, you might test if your umbrella opens, just in case it rains. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something out, to get information.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:00.700\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us a little better. That's the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
