    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_015454.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.600\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:19.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:27.100\nThink about it: a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\nA baker might taste their cake to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:31.500\nAnd you take tests in school to show what you've learned!\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.100\nLet\u2019s say you want to know if a plant needs water. The test?\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:40.700\nYou check the soil. If it's dry, the plant needs water.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:47.400\nOr, imagine you want to see if a lightbulb works. You screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:51.600\nIf it lights up, the test passed!\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:57.400\nSo, a test is a simple way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:57.400 --> 00:59.400\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n```"
  },
