    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:16.200\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:26.800\nIt helps us measure knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:34.900\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.000\nA taste test helps decide which cookie tastes the best. Or, a stress test on a bridge checks if it's strong enough.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:50.100\nTests can be written, like a quiz, or hands-on, like building something.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:54.700\nThey give us information that helps us make decisions or understand things better. So, a test is just a tool for learning and measuring. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
