    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.200\nNow, you might be thinking of school, but a test is really just a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and turn it on.\nThat's a test! You're testing if the lightbulb will light up.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:30.400\nOr, maybe you're baking a cake and you poke it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:40.600\nSo, a test is simply an action you take to get information or confirm something.\nIt's all about finding out the answer to a question.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:50.300\nWe use tests every day, even without realizing it!\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
