    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_020414.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:18.600\nNow, you might be thinking of a school exam, and that's one kind, but in general, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:29.800\nThink of it like this: you taste a soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, you might try turning a light switch on and off to test if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:33.300\nSee? It's just a way to gather information.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:44.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a baker might bake a small sample of bread to test if the recipe is working.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:55.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for learning more about something, whether it's food, a lightbulb, or even your own health.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:02.100\nIt's all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
