    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.000\nIt could be finding out if you know the answer to a question, or if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:30.300\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:40.900\nTests help us understand things better and make sure things are working correctly. So, a test is just a way to check something and get some information.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:44.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
