    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like this: you might test if a lightbulb works by plugging it in. If it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:26.200\nTests are used all the time. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:34.900\nTeachers use tests to see how much you've learned. Even bakers test their cake batter to make sure it's just right before baking.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:44.900\nFor example, a simple test for a cookie recipe might be: \"Does the dough taste good?\" If it does, the recipe passes! If not, you need to make some changes.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:55.300\nSo, tests help us understand if something is working correctly or meeting a certain standard.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:03.200\nThey're all about checking and making sure things are as they should be. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
