    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: tests.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:25.500\nBasically, a test helps us find out if something is working, if something is true, or even just how good something is.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:36.500\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:46.500\nEven a simple taste test of a new recipe is a test! So, a test is any process designed to evaluate something specific.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:56.100\nWe can test a new toy to see if it's durable, or test a lightbulb to see if it lights up. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:05.600\nIn short, tests are all around us and help us understand the world better. They give us valuable information to make decisions.\n\n01:05.600 --> 01:09.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
