    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:17.800\nNow, a test is basically a way to see how much you know about something. Think of it like checking your knowledge, like a quick assessment of what you've learned.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:25.800\nIt could be anything from a simple quiz with multiple choice questions to something more involved, like writing an essay.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, your teacher might give you a math test to see if you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:45.700\nOr, a spelling test to see how well you've learned your vocabulary words. Tests help you and your teacher understand what you're doing well in, and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:54.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method to evaluate knowledge or skills. It's a learning tool to help you grow.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
