    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:17.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a method to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:28.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test helps you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:39.000\nA test isn't always about school; it's about gathering information. For example, a doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:47.000\nA mechanic might run a test to see if your car engine is running smoothly. They're all using tests to get answers.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:58.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what we already think we know. It helps us measure and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:02.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
