    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the concept of a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:19.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is ready.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:23.000\nYou stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:25.800\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:26.600\nThe cake's done!\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:27.700\nIt's sticky?\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:28.700\nNeeds more time.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:31.300\nSee? A simple test gives you information.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:34.700\nAnother example: a doctor uses tests to check your health,\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:37.300\nlike taking your temperature.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:42.400\nOr maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:47.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all help us learn and understand more.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:58.200\nIt helps us make better decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
