    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.400\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:29.700\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:39.300\nSee? Different kinds of questions, different kinds of answers. Another example: a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:52.800\nThey're using their senses to get an answer about the flavor. Tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:58.900\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information and get an answer to a specific question. It\u2019s all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
