    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.999 --> 00:13.899\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:13.899 --> 00:22.399\nNow, you might think of school exams, but in this case, we're talking about checking if something works the way it should.\n\n00:22.399 --> 00:31.599\nThink of it like this: a test is simply a way to see if something passes or fails based on a specific set of rules.\n\n00:31.599 --> 00:36.799\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, the \"test\" might be sticking a toothpick in the center to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:36.799 --> 00:41.999\nThat tells you if the cake is done!\n\n00:41.999 --> 00:52.799\nOr, imagine a toy car. A test could be seeing if it moves forward when you push the button. So, remember, a test is just a check to make sure things are working properly.\n\n00:52.799 --> 00:54.300\nIt helps us find problems and make improvements.\n```"
