    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey there, welcome! Today we're diving into something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:07.000\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:11.400\nIt's like a question, or a set of questions, that helps us understand more about whatever we're looking at.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:15.800\nThink of it like this: a teacher gives you a quiz.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:18.100\nThat's a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:22.400\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:26.900\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Some are short and easy, others are long and complicated.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:31.700\nBut the main idea is always the same: to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:34.400\nSo, a test helps us to learn about what we are looking at.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:41.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:47.900\nWhether it\u2019s your knowledge, your health, or anything else, tests help us understand and measure.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:50.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
