    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore something really important: a test.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:19.700\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it as a question, or a set of questions, designed to give you an answer.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:31.900\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine baking a cake. You test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:37.700\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:43.500\nOr, maybe you're checking if your shoes fit. You try them on and walk around.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:49.500\nThat's a test to see if they're comfortable. So, tests help us learn, confirm, and make decisions.\n\n00:49.500 --> 01:00.900\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather before going outside. They all help us gather information.\n\n01:00.900 --> 01:08.400\nRemember, a test is just a way to get an answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
