    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.000\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think about school, but tests are really just ways to see if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:28.100\nThat's a simple test!\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:33.600\nAnother example is baking a cake. You taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:40.500\nOr, imagine you're building a tower with blocks. You might gently push it to test if it's stable.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:49.700\nSo, a test is basically an action you take to check if something is functioning correctly or meeting a certain requirement.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:52.900\nIt helps you identify problems and make sure things are working as expected.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:55.600\nIt's all about checking and confirming. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
