    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_022150.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.400\nSimply put, a test is a way of finding something out.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer. We use tests all the time, in lots of different ways.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:31.500\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:44.100\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:48.900\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:52.400\nSo, whether it's checking your temperature, answering questions on paper, or experimenting in the kitchen, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n```"
