    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_022233.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.100 --> 00:17.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about a person or thing.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:32.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:44.400\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:50.800\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how well you understand the words and grammar.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:57.200\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned in class.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:03.600\nThey can be multiple choice, essays, or even just answering questions out loud.\n\n01:03.600 --> 01:13.600\nThe important thing is that they give us information. Tests can help us learn and improve.\n\n01:13.600 --> 01:20.700\nThey show us what we already know and what we need to work on.\n\n01:20.700 --> 01:27.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information. It's a way to check understanding and track progress.\n\n01:27.900 --> 01:34.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
