    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really important: the test.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a method we use to check or evaluate.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see. Or, you might take a spelling test in school to show what you know.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:30.500\nTests aren't just for doctors and schools, though.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:35.900\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:50.000\nThat's a test too! It\u2019s a way to check your recipe. So, remember, a test is any procedure designed to check something, whether it's your eyesight, your knowledge, or even the sweetness of cake batter.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:57.700\nIt's all about finding out information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
