    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something called a test.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but often in a more structured way.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.400\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. For example, you might take a math test in school to see how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:32.000\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:38.700\nSee? Different kinds of tests, different things they're checking.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:45.400\nAnother example is a taste test! You might try two different flavors of ice cream and decide which one you like best.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:52.700\nThat's a test too! So, a test is really just a method for gathering information and making a decision based on that information.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:59.100\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
