    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_022714.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:27.300\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, abilities, or performance. Think of it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health, like taking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:36.100\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:43.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it works.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:53.900\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information and allow us to learn and improve.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.600\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
