    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, but one that helps us measure or evaluate.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:27.300\nTests can be used to see how well you understand something, like a school test.\nOr, they can be used to check if something is working correctly, like testing a new toy to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:35.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\nA taste test helps us decide if we like a new food.\nAnd a medical test can check if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:47.500\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new about yourself or the world around you.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:51.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
