    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:25.400\nWe use them all the time to see if something works, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:36.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:44.400\nOr, your teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:52.800\nEven baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you taste it to see if it\u2019s good! So, tests help us figure things out.\n\n00:52.800 --> 01:06.600\nThey give us information and let us know if something needs improvement. Whether it's a quiz, a physical exam, or even tasting food, tests are a really useful tool.\n\n01:06.600 --> 01:10.200\nIn summary, a test is a method of evaluating or checking something.\n\n01:10.200 --> 01:11.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
