    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:19.500\nWe use them all the time to check if something is working, is true, or is correct.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:31.700\nThink about it.\nWhen you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to test if it's done.\nOr, when you learn a new word, your teacher might give you a quiz to test your understanding.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:43.600\nEven doctors use tests, like blood tests, to see if you're healthy.\nSo, tests are just tools we use to gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:54.900\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:03.100\nTo recap, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\nIt gives us information to help us understand or make a decision.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
