    "updated_at": "2026-01-04T02:36:44.555313",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260104_023644.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_023644.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.300\nEver wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:08.300 --> 00:17.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:37.100\nIt's not just about school exams, though those definitely count! A test can be anything from a quiz in class, to a driving exam, or even a simple recipe test in the kitchen to see if you can bake a cake.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:45.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A fitness test shows how strong or fast you are. And a taste test helps you decide if you like a new flavor.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:56.400\nSo, a test is just a tool to assess something. It helps you, or someone else, understand how well you understand a topic or perform a task. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "02c7ffc7-2589-44df-a3c2-e955420308f4": {
    "id": "02c7ffc7-2589-44df-a3c2-e955420308f4",
