    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_023858.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a certain area.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:31.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:42.100\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which food you like best. Tests aren't just in school, either!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:48.900\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:59.100\nWhen a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:04.900\nThey can be simple or complex, but they all have the same goal: to give us information.\n\n01:04.900 --> 01:09.100\nRemember, tests are just tools to help us understand something better.\n\n01:09.100 --> 01:14.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
