    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:27.900\nIt could be to see how well you know a subject, like in school. Or it could be to check if something is working correctly, like testing a new toy.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:36.900\nBasically, a test asks a question or presents a challenge, and then looks at the answer or the result.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:48.700\nThink about it: a spelling test checks if you can spell words correctly. A taste test checks if you like the flavor of something. Even baking a cake is a kind of test to see if you can follow a recipe!\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:55.300\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method of checking or evaluating something.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:58.900\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. Thanks for watching! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
