    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:21.500\nIt's a process designed to gather information.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:27.700\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:33.900\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see what you've learned.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:47.100\nEven baking a cake is a test! You're testing if your recipe and ingredients will create something delicious.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:58.500\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, from school exams to scientific experiments.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:09.100\nThe key idea is that they help us understand something better. They give us data, or results, that we can then use to make decisions or learn more.\n\n01:09.100 --> 01:12.900\nIn short, a test is a process for gathering information.\n\n01:12.900 --> 01:16.400\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:16.400 --> 01:19.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
