    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.500\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in this case, we're talking about something that checks if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you get a new toy, and you want to make sure it actually works, right?\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:40.400\nSo you try it out \u2013 that's a test! It's a way to see if something meets a certain standard or does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:47.500\nFor example, a software developer might write a test to make sure a button on a website takes you to the right page.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:58.900\nOr a chef might taste a sauce to test if it has enough salt. Essentially, a test is just a check. It helps us catch problems early and make sure things are running smoothly.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:02.500\nSo remember, a test is simply a way to verify that something is working as expected.\n\n01:02.500 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
