    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.400\nIt's like asking a question and looking for the answer. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:31.800\nOr, in school, you take a test to show what you've learned. Maybe you even test the temperature of your bathwater to make sure it's just right.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:43.300\nTests can be big, like a final exam, or small, like checking if your shoes are tied. The important thing is they help us understand something better.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:53.500\nThey give us information we didn\u2019t have before. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:59.000\nIt's all about finding out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
