    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:07.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:12.500\nIt's how we gather information about, well, anything!\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it like this: you're trying to figure out if an apple is ripe.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:25.600\nYou might look at its color, smell it, and maybe even give it a gentle squeeze.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:26.800\nThose are all little tests!\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:31.600\nTests aren't just for apples, though.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:35.900\nA math quiz is a test to see how well you understand numbers.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:41.100\nA doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:46.400\nEven trying out a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:53.700\nSo, a test is any process designed to get information and help you make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:56.500\nThey come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.100\nThey're happening around you all the time, helping us learn and explore the world.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
