    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_025345.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:25.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Think about it: When you try a new recipe, that\u2019s a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:35.600\nOr, when you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it works. In science, tests are called experiments.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:45.300\nScientists use them to see if their ideas are correct. They might test a new medicine to see if it helps people, or test a new fertilizer to see if it helps plants grow.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:55.300\nSo, tests are simply a way to gather information and see if something is true. They help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
