    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_030024.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like an experiment where you're trying to get an answer. It could be a math test at school, where you're showing what you know about numbers.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:32.900\nOr it could be a taste test, where you're deciding which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:39.300\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a type of test. You're testing to see if it lights up!\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:50.100\nSo, tests help us learn, compare things, and figure out if something is working properly. They\u2019re all about finding information.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:57.700\nTo recap, a test is a method for gathering information and measuring something. Whether it's your knowledge, a product's quality, or just about anything else!\n\n00:57.700 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
