    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's a process designed to measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge on a subject, or how well a product performs.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:27.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:34.900\nA taste test checks how much you like a certain food.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:45.800\nEven a doctor's exam is a test to see how healthy you are.\nSo, a test helps us learn something.\nIt gives us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:52.800\nIt can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying out a new recipe.\nThe important thing is that it\u2019s a structured way to get answers.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.300\nThat's the basic idea of a test.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
