    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:13.500\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like gathering information to see where you stand. For example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:34.400\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which snack you like best. The important thing is that a test gives us a result, something we can learn from.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:45.700\nMaybe you need to study your spelling more, or maybe you just really prefer chocolate chip cookies! So, remember, a test is just a way to learn something.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:54.900\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we might need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
