    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_030320.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of\u2026 tests!\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:13.400\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:20.600\nIt\u2019s a process designed to gather information.\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a checkup.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:30.600\nThat's a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:40.600\nTests can be written, like quizzes in school, or they can be physical, like trying to lift a heavy box to see how strong you are.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:54.300\nThey help us understand things better and make decisions based on the results.\nSo, whether it\u2019s checking the temperature or taking a pop quiz, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
