    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:24.300\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:34.000\nThink about it like this: a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:43.700\nOr, a student might take a quiz to test their knowledge of a subject. In both cases, they're using a test to learn something.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:50.700\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. Some are formal, like a big exam at school.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:59.800\nOthers are informal, like quickly checking the temperature of your bath water. The important thing is that they give you information.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:03.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and learning something new.\n01:03.000 --> 01:06.500\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n01:06.500 --> 01:09.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
