    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_030444.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a specific area.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:28.700\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:44.300\nA test can be a quiz, an exam, a physical activity, or even just observing someone doing something.\nFor example, a chef might test a new recipe by having people try it and give feedback.\nOr a company might test a new product before selling it to everyone.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:53.700\nThe goal of any test is to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:04.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check, measure, and understand.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
