    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:06.700\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.700 --> 01:04.200\nIt\u2019s how we check if something works, or if something is true. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, a simple math problem like two plus two equals four is a test of your addition skills. Or, checking if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch is a test to see if the bulb is good. Tests can be used for all sorts of things, from figuring out if you understand a lesson at school, to making sure a new toy is safe to play with. They help us learn and improve things. So, remember, a test is just a way to get information and see if something is working as it should.\n\n01:04.200 --> 01:05.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
