    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nA test, simply put, is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time to check if something is working, to see how well we understand something, or even just to learn more about the world.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. A baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:45.100\nAnd you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge of a subject. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:54.700\nIt helps us confirm things, identify problems, and improve our understanding. That's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
