    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:19.800\nIt could be to see if something works, if something is true, or to measure how well you know something.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:31.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:41.600\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned. So, tests are really just tools we use to gather information.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:54.400\nThey help us make decisions and understand the world around us a little bit better. Remember, tests aren't always about right or wrong answers; they're about learning and understanding.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
