    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_031133.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, so you've heard the word \"test\" before, right?\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:16.000\nIn a general sense, a test is simply a way to find something out, to check if something is working, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.800\nThink about it like this: a taste test checks if food tastes good.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:32.800\nA medical test checks if you're healthy. And a school test checks if you've learned the material.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:44.400\nBasically, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:56.700\nWhether it's the strength of a bridge, the quality of a product, or your understanding of a new concept, tests help us measure and understand the world around us. They provide valuable information to make informed decisions.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.400\nSo, in short, a test is a method for evaluating or assessing something to gain information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
