    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_031938.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It's how we find out if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:25.600\nThink about it like this: you might test a new recipe by tasting it to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:37.400\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:50.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand what you've been learning. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just a homework assignment.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:57.100\nAll of these things help measure your understanding. So, a test is just a method of checking something, whether it's a recipe, your health, or what you've learned in class. It's a way to get information and learn more. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
