    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out\nsomething about something else.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.600\nThink of it like asking a question.\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:28.300\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test\nto see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:32.700\nOr, you might take a quiz in school\nto see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:37.100\nLet's say you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter before you bake it.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:39.800\nThat's a test!\nYou're testing if the batter tastes good.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:46.000\nOr think about trying on shoes before you buy them.\nThat's a test to see if they fit.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:51.300\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information,\nto learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:58.700\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
