    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_032158.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:23.600\nIt could be a math test to see how well you understand numbers, or a spelling test to check your vocabulary.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:31.100\nA test can also be something like a taste test, where you try different foods to see which one you like best.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:40.600\nThe key is that a test helps us measure or discover something.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:52.600\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to find out if you're healthy. Or, a company might test a new product to see if people will buy it.\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:01.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions. They come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:07.699\nTo recap, a test is a process used to evaluate or determine something. It provides us with information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
