    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_032250.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey there, welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests!\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:12.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:23.700\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.600\nThink of it like this: You might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:35.500\nThat's a test! Or maybe you're testing a toy to see if it's durable enough to play with.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:47.700\nSame thing! Tests can be written, like a quiz in school, or they can be hands-on, like checking if a light bulb works by screwing it in.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:52.800\nThe goal is always to gather information and make a decision based on the results.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are up to par. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
