    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.399\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.799\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information, whether it's to check if something works, see how well you understand a topic, or even to find out what your favorite color is!\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:33.399\nThink about it: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.099\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. So, tests are all about checking and learning.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:54.099\nThey help us understand the world around us and improve things. Remember, a test isn't always about right or wrong answers, it's about gathering information.\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:00.399\nWe use the results to learn and grow! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
