    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:20.600\nIt's a method we use to gather information.\nThink of it like this: a taste test!\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:27.600\nYou taste a new cookie, and that\u2019s a test.\nYou\u2019re testing how good it is.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:37.100\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that\u2019s a test \u2013 it tells you the cake is done!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:45.900\nTests aren\u2019t just about food, though.\nThey\u2019re everywhere!\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and teachers use tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:53.100\nThe main thing is, a test helps you learn something new or confirm something you already thought was true.\n\n00:53.100 --> 01:00.600\nSo, a test is just a way to get information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
