    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_032829.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:11.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer. It could be anything from figuring out if a cake is baked all the way through, to seeing how well you understand a new subject.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:29.300\nThe main idea is to gather information. We do this by asking questions, observing things, or performing actions.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:35.700\nFor example, a taste test tells you if food tastes good, or a spelling test shows you how well you can spell words.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:42.400\nImagine you're testing if a toy car works. You put batteries in it and see if it moves.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:47.000\nThat's a test! You\u2019re checking if it meets your expectation.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:59.300\nSo, a test is just a way to check something, gather information, and see if something works or if you understand something. It's all about finding answers!\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:05.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
