    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you poke it with a fork.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:30.100\nThat poke is a test! In everyday life, we use tests all the time.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:41.700\nA doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:51.900\nThe point of a test is to get information. It helps us figure out if something is working correctly, if we understand something, or if we need to make changes.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.600\nSo, whether it's a taste test for new ice cream flavors or a spelling test in school, remember that a test is just a way to learn and improve.\n```"
