    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:17.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:26.700\nWe use tests all the time! When you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:36.100\nThe toothpick comes out clean? Test passed! Or, if you're trying to figure out which flavor of ice cream you like best, you might try a little bit of each.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:45.100\nThat's a taste test! Tests help us make decisions, understand the world around us, and learn new things.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:52.700\nSo, a test is just a process to get information. Remember, it's all about learning and figuring things out.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
