    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us understand if something is true, works correctly, or meets certain standards.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this:\nIf you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:31.800\nOr if you want to see if your new toy car works, you push it across the floor.\nAnother test!\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:38.800\nTests aren't just for cakes and toys.\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas are right.\nDoctors use tests to figure out what's wrong when you're sick.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:47.400\nBasically, a test is just a way to check things out.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:57.500\nSo, remember, a test is any process designed to find something out.\nIt's a simple but powerful tool we use every day.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
