    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:05.400\nToday we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:09.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.800 --> 00:13.300\nIt helps us understand if something is working,\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:15.500\nor if we know something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like this: your mom might test the temperature of your forehead\nto see if you have a fever.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:21.500\nThat's a test!\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:25.600\nOr, your teacher might give you a quiz to test what you've learned in class.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:32.200\nAnother example is baking a cake.\nYou might taste a little bit of the batter \u2013 that\u2019s a mini-test to see if it tastes right before you bake the whole thing!\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:40.300\nSo, a test is just a way to check something, to get information, or to see if something is the way we expect it to be.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:43.400\nThat\u2019s the basics of what a test is all about.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:46.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
