    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_033207.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.500\nNow, you might think of tests as scary exams, but really, a test is just a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: you have a recipe for cookies, right? You bake a batch, and then you test them by tasting one to see if they're sweet enough.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:32.900\nThe same idea applies to lots of things! A doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:43.800\nA car mechanic uses tests to find out what\u2019s wrong with your car. Even you test things every day, like checking if your shoes fit before you go outside.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:52.200\nSo, a test is simply a way of checking something to make sure it meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:58.600\nIt helps us understand if things are working properly. That's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:02.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
