    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:22.700\nIt could be checking if you understand a new topic, checking if a machine is working correctly, or even checking if a recipe tastes good!\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:36.500\nBasically, a test helps us find out if something is working as expected or if it needs improvement.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:44.800\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a test to see if you've learned the material. A mechanic tests your car to see if it needs repairs.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.200\nAnd you might taste your soup while cooking to see if it needs more salt. So, tests are all around us!\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:59.600\nThey help us learn, fix problems, and make things better. Understanding the purpose of a test is the first step to using them effectively.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
