    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: tests.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:25.000\nIt's a method we use to gather information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes their soup. That's a test!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:35.800\nThey're testing if it needs more salt. Or, imagine you're building with blocks.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:42.000\nYou might test if a block will fit in a certain spot. You're testing its size and shape.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:48.200\nTests aren't just for chefs or block builders, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy,\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:54.900\nand teachers use tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:00.100\nSo, a test is simply a way to learn something or verify something. Remember that. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
