    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like this: imagine you're baking a cake. You test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, maybe you're learning your ABCs.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:36.500\nYour teacher might give you a quiz to test how well you know them. That quiz is a test!\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:46.600\nTests can be big or small. They can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:57.800\nThe important thing is, they help us learn and understand things better. So, a test is simply a method to evaluate or find something out.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:01.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
