    "updated_at": "2026-01-04T03:40:00.873142",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260104_034000.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_034000.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a specific area.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: a simple quiz in class is a test. It helps your teacher see how well you understood the lesson.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:31.300\nOr, imagine a taste test! You're trying different foods to see which one you like best. That's also a test, just a different kind.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:37.700\nTests aren't just for school, though. Doctors use tests to check your health,\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:44.100\nand companies use tests to see if someone is a good fit for a job.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:57.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool used to gather information and make a judgment about something. They come in all shapes and sizes and help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "884b6002-2de1-4766-8864-6d1fd4293063": {
    "id": "884b6002-2de1-4766-8864-6d1fd4293063",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:15:14.446634",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-04T03:40:52.233447",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260104_034052.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_034052.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:19.600\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just asking, you're using a set of questions or activities to get a more complete answer.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:25.200\nSo, what kind of things can you test? Well, pretty much anything!\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:37.500\nYou can test how well you know your ABCs, how fast you can run, or even how strong a bridge is. Tests help us understand things better and see how we're doing.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:50.700\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see if you're learning how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test can help a company figure out which soda flavor people like best.\n\n00:50.700 --> 01:01.800\nTo sum it up, a test is a tool we use to gather information and see where we stand. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n01:01.800 --> 01:05.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "27ff23cd-d93d-47f3-89a3-6b37e51f9f2b": {
    "id": "27ff23cd-d93d-47f3-89a3-6b37e51f9f2b",
    "topic": "Test",
