    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_034211.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:16.300\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:23.800\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:36.600\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Think about it: if you're baking a cake and you poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done, that's a test!\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:51.400\nThe toothpick tells you if the batter is still wet or if the cake is ready to come out of the oven. Doctors use tests to check your health, like taking your temperature to see if you have a fever. Schools use tests to see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:57.200\nSo, whether it's a cake, your health, or your schoolwork, a test helps us gather information and make better decisions. They\u2019re a really useful tool! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
