    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: the concept of a test.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:18.300\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a method we use to gather information and learn more about a specific subject.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:26.600\nThink about it like this: a simple spelling test at school helps your teacher understand how well you know your vocabulary.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:42.100\nOr, imagine baking a cake and tasting it \u2013 that's a test to see if you've added enough sugar! Tests can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit before you go outside.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:53.900\nThe main goal is always the same: to evaluate something and get some answers. So, a test helps us to check, learn, and improve.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
