    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nHi everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:04.600\nToday we're going to talk about\nsomething called a \"test.\"\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:08.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form,\nis just a way to check or find something out.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:13.000\nIt's like asking a question to see if you\nknow the answer, or checking something to see if it's working right.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:16.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test\nchecks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:23.800\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might test it\nwith a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:26.700\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\nThat's a good test result!\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:36.100\nSo, a test is really just a process that helps\nus learn something, confirm something, or make sure something is working as it should.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:38.400\nIt\u2019s a simple way to get answers.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:42.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
