    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_034609.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like checking to see if a lightbulb is good. You screw it in, and if it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:36.800\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned. It could be questions on paper, or even showing you know how to do something.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:45.100\nAnother example: your doctor might give you a test to check if you're healthy. They might listen to your heart or check your temperature.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:51.700\nSo, tests are all about finding out information. They help us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:54.000\nThey're a tool for understanding!\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
