    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_034951.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.300\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:06.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:10.000\nIt helps us figure out how much of something there is, or how well someone can do something.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:13.300\nThink of it like this: a ruler is a test for length.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:16.600\nYou use it to measure how long an object is.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:21.000\nOr, imagine a spelling test at school.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:23.200\nThat's a test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:26.800\nTests aren't just in school, though.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:30.100\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:33.300\nA chef might taste their food to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:34.900\nSee?\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:36.100\nTests are all around us!\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:40.600\nSo, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:44.400\nIt helps us understand and measure things.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:48.800\nIt gives us information that we can then use to make decisions.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
