    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHello, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like this: your teacher might give you a math test to see how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:31.700\nOr, maybe you try out for a sports team. The tryout is a test to see if you have the skills they're looking for.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:39.800\nSo, tests aren't just about grades in school. They help us measure progress and see where we need to improve.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:47.900\nRemember, a test is just a tool for learning. It helps you understand what you know and what you still need to learn.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:51.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
