    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.600\nIt's like asking a question and looking for the answer. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:29.200\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:37.600\nEven trying a new recipe is a test! You're testing to see if you like the way it tastes.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:50.200\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things better. They can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying a new game to see if it's fun.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:55.700\nNo matter what, the goal is to get information. Tests help us learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
