    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests \u2013\nwhat they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out\nhow much you know about something, or how\nwell you can do something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like checking if a cake is done.\nYou use a toothpick, right?\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:26.500\nThe toothpick is like a little test.\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:36.800\nYou might have a quiz at school, which checks\nyour understanding of a lesson.\nOr maybe you take a practice driving test to\nsee if you're ready for the real thing.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:48.100\nEven just trying out different recipes to see\nwhich one tastes best is a kind of test!\nSo, tests help us learn where we're strong\nand where we can improve.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:56.700\nThey give us information to make better decisions.\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just\nhelpful tools.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
