    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out if something is working the way it should, or if something is true.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like this: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test to see if the cake is cooked all the way through.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.000\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\nEach attempt is a test to see if you can balance and pedal at the same time.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:45.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nFrom school exams that check your knowledge, to medical tests that check your health, they all help us gather information and make informed decisions.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:55.900\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather evidence and see if something meets a certain standard.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
