    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.400\nIt's a process for gathering information or checking if something works correctly. Think of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.900\nOr, you might test a recipe to see if it tastes good. In school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:42.700\nFor example, you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your words. Or, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:53.900\nThe results of a test give us information we can use. So, to recap, a test is a way to gather information or check if something works.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:01.000\nIt helps us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
