    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_035910.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.600\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:08.900\nThink of it like checking if you understand the rules of a game.\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:13.000\nIt helps you see what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:18.100\nImagine you're learning the alphabet. A test might ask you to write down all the letters,\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:21.600\nor maybe match uppercase letters with lowercase ones.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:23.600\nThat shows if you know your ABCs!\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:29.000\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, a test might be seeing if you can ride in a straight line without wobbling.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:33.100\nSo, a test isn't scary, it's just a tool!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:39.300\nIt helps you and your teachers understand how well you're doing and what to focus on next.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:41.500\nRemember, it's all about learning!\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:44.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
