    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but often shorter and more focused.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:23.600\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:31.900\nImagine you're baking a cake. You taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:37.700\nOr, think about taking a quiz in school. That's a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:50.700\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Mechanics use tests to see if your car is working properly. So, a test is really just a method for gathering information and making a decision based on that information.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:57.600\nIt helps us understand something better. In essence, it's a question with a way to get an answer.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
