    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:17.600\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer.\nTests can be used for lots of things.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:27.800\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:33.700\nSee?\nDifferent situations, same idea: a way to get information.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:40.700\nLet's say you want to know if a cake is done baking.\nYou can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:47.100\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready!\nIn this case, the toothpick is the test.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:58.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information or checking something.\nIt\u2019s a process of asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
