    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_040152.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.300\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, and that's true!\nBut in general, a test is just a way to check if something is working as expected.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:27.400\nIt's like giving something a trial run.\nThink about it: you might test the water temperature before jumping into a pool to make sure it's not too cold.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:34.100\nOr, a baker might taste a cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\nThese are all tests!\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:43.000\nWe're trying to get information to help us make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:53.500\nSo, tests aren't always scary!\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are just right.\nIn short, a test is simply a method used to evaluate something.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
