    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. It's a process of asking a question and getting an answer,\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:29.100\nor checking something to see if it works the way it should. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:30.800\nOr, when you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:36.300\nSee? Simple! Tests can be big or small.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:42.400\nA spelling test in school is a test. So is carefully checking the brakes on your car.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:54.300\nBoth are designed to give you information. So, to recap: a test is a process to get information, by asking a question or checking something.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:59.800\nIt helps us understand something better. And it's all around us! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
