    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_040409.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:20.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something. It's a process or procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:30.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words. A medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:46.800\nEven tasting a new flavor of ice cream is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, whether it's a quiz in school, a health check-up, or even just trying something new, a test helps us gather information and learn more.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.500\nIn short, a test is a way to assess and understand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
