    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like an experiment or a structured way to check something. It helps us understand if something works, how well it works, or what its properties are.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:37.900\nFor example, a simple taste test helps you decide if you like a new flavor. A spelling test shows how well you remember words.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:47.600\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body. So, a test is just a process to get answers.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:56.300\nIt can be a formal exam, a quick check, or anything in between. The key is that it's designed to give you information you didn't have before.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.900\nRemember, testing helps us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
