    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.200\nIt's how we check if something is true, or if something works like we expect it to.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:32.600\nThink of it like this: you have a new toy car. A test would be pushing it to see if it rolls.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:41.900\nOr, if you're baking a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:50.200\nWe use tests all the time without even realizing it! Scientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:58.500\nDoctors use tests to find out what's wrong when you're sick. Tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:00.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking things. It\u2019s a simple, but important tool.\n```"
