    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of testing.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:16.900\nThink of a test like a question you ask to see if something works the way it should. Basically, a test checks if the answer you get is the answer you expect.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:20.800\nThis could be anything!\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:31.000\nImagine you're baking a cake. You test it by sticking a toothpick in; if it comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:40.000\nOr, think about trying out a new video game. You test it by playing, seeing if it's fun and if everything runs smoothly.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:51.300\nTests help us find problems and fix them. So, whether it\u2019s baking a cake, playing a game, or even checking your homework, testing is all about making sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:59.000\nIn short, testing is simply the process of checking if something works as expected.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
