    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. The main idea behind a test is to see if something passes or fails, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:36.500\nWe often use tests to see how well we've learned something in school, but tests are used everywhere!\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:52.900\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A car company might test a new car to make sure it's safe. And even when you bake a cake, you're kind of doing a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:52.900 --> 01:00.100\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way of checking something to see if it works, if it\u2019s safe, or if it meets a certain requirement.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:02.700\nTests help us learn and improve things all the time.\n01:02.700 --> 01:02.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
