    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.200\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skill, or performance. Think about it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:33.800\nA taste test lets you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. Or even a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:43.300\nSo, tests help us learn what we know, discover our preferences, and understand more about the world around us.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:53.900\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the main idea is always the same: to get some information. That's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
