    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.200\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:28.300\nTests help us understand things better. For example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:35.900\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:44.900\nEven trying out a new recipe is a test! You're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:54.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn more. It can be a quiz, a science experiment, or even just trying something new.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.100\nThey all give us valuable insights. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
