    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:12.800\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like asking a question, but sometimes instead of asking with words, you're asking with an experiment, or a series of questions.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:31.100\nSo, what kind of things can you test?\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:35.600\nWell, you can test how well you understand something in school, like a math test.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:40.200\nYou can test if a cake is done by poking it with a fork.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:44.800\nYou can even test if a lightbulb works by flipping the switch.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:53.700\nSee? In each case, you're doing something to get an answer. The math test tells you how well you know math. The fork tells you if the cake is ready.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:56.400\nAnd the light switch tells you if the bulb is good.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:02.600\nBasically, a test is any procedure designed to evaluate something. It's all about learning and understanding! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
