    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:17.400\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:27.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:37.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:51.400\nEven tasting a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple yes or no questions to complex problem-solving exercises.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:57.000\nThe main goal is always the same: to gather information and learn something new.\nThey help us understand where we are and what we need to work on.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:02.400\nThat's the basics of tests!\nThey're everywhere, helping us learn and grow.\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:04.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
