    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:18.800\nA test is simply a way to see how well you understand something or how well something works.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb actually turns on after you screw it in. That's a test!\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:35.900\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. It could be answering questions on paper, solving a math problem, or even giving a presentation.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.500\nOutside of school, tests happen all the time. When you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:54.500\nIf you press a button on a toy, you're testing if it still works. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:00.900\nWhether it's your knowledge or if something's functioning correctly. Tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
