    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something, whether it's checking if a light bulb works or checking your knowledge on a subject.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, imagine a chef tasting a soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:38.500\nThese are all different kinds of tests! Tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes are tied.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:44.300\nThe important thing is they give you information. They help you understand something better.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn from the results. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
