    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_042316.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:10.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:10.100 --> 00:22.200\nWe use them all the time! Think of it like checking if something is working, or seeing what you know. The main idea is to ask a question or give a task, and then look at the answer or the result.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.100\nThis helps us understand something better. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:40.600\nOr, a teacher might give you a pop quiz to check if you understand the lesson. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:51.700\nSo, a test is just a process of asking, doing, and then understanding based on the results. It helps us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
