    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.800\nThat poke, and the result \u2013 if the toothpick comes out clean \u2013 is a test!\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:37.000\nTests aren't just for baking, though. They're used everywhere!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:42.200\nA doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:47.400\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see what you've learned.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:51.800\nEven trying on a new pair of shoes is a test to see if they fit!\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:54.500\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:55.500\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us. Remember, it\u2019s all about finding something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
