    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand what's going on.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:20.100\nTests are used everywhere! Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:28.700\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough. Or, think about a doctor checking your temperature.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:34.100\nThat's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:42.600\nLet's say you're learning to ride a bike. Each time you try, you're testing your balance.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:55.200\nYou might fall, but that tells you what you need to work on. So, to recap, a test is simply a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.800\nIt helps us understand, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
