    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_042537.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:07.000\nToday we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.200\nA test, at its core, is simply a way to find out information.\n\n00:10.200 --> 00:16.200\nThink of it like a question you're asking to get an answer.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:18.500\nTests can be anything from a simple quiz at school\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:21.000\nto a doctor checking your temperature.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:26.500\nIn school, a test helps your teacher see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:31.000\nIf your temperature is high, that test tells the doctor you might be sick.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:32.900\nSee?\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:35.400\nTwo totally different situations, but both are tests!\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:40.000\nAnother example is baking a cake.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:43.000\nYou test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:45.900\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:54.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and getting answers.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.700\nIt's a fundamental tool we use every day.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
