    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone understands a topic.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: you test a cookie by tasting it to see if it's good.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:40.900\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned and where you might need some extra help. A test can be a quiz, an exam, or even just asking you questions in class. Outside of school, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy, or a builder might test the strength of a bridge.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:51.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
