    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.800 --> 00:06.200\nToday we're talking about tests,\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:11.300\nwhich are really just ways to see what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:16.300\nThink of it like this: a test is like a measuring stick for your skills or knowledge.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:22.400\nThe main goal of a test is to give you, and sometimes others, information about what you've learned.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:27.200\nIt helps you figure out what you're good at and where you might need some extra practice.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:32.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:36.900\nOr, a driving test shows if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:37.800\nSee?\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:38.200\nSimple!\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:44.300\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a tool to measure learning or ability.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:51.000\nIt helps you understand your strengths and weaknesses so you can keep growing.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
