    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's like asking a question to see what the answer is.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.500\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:31.400\nEven baking a cake involves a test!\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:43.500\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a medical check-up, or even trying a new recipe, a test is all about gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:51.700\nIn short, a test helps us measure or evaluate something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
