    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.800\nIt's a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:34.000\nA taste test helps determine which food tastes best. And a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:42.400\nSo, tests can be used to measure all sorts of things. They give us information and help us make decisions.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:49.800\nThey can even help us learn and improve. Remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
