    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to see how well you know something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\nYou try to turn it on, and if it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:35.500\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\nThey can be written, like quizzes, or even practical, like showing you can dribble a basketball.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:44.500\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve a problem.\nIf you get the right answer, you've passed that part of the test!\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:53.100\nOr, a reading test might ask you questions about a story.\nSo, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge or skill.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.700\nIt helps you and others see how much progress you're making.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
