    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about something called a test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:14.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to find out if you're healthy, or a chef tastes food to test if it's seasoned correctly.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:36.300\nTests can be simple, like checking if a light bulb works by turning it on. Or they can be more complex, like taking a quiz to see how much you\u2019ve learned in school.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:47.500\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information. For example, you might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:57.500\nOr you might test a new recipe by making a small batch first. So, to recap, a test is a way to gather information about something.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:03.900\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
