    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_043836.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see what you know, what you can do, or how something works.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works by turning on the switch.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:35.100\nThe switch is the test, and the light is either on or off, showing you the result.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:43.100\nTests come in many forms. You might take a quiz in school, which checks your knowledge.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:51.100\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:51.100 --> 01:00.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if your recipe and skills will give you a delicious result. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information. It helps us understand something better, whether it's our own understanding, our health, or even a recipe. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
