    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_044013.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:19.900\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like a question that you're trying to answer, but instead of just guessing, you use a process to get a more accurate answer.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:31.100\nFor example, a chef might test their soup by tasting it to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:40.400\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:53.300\nTests can be written, like a quiz at school, or they can be hands-on, like experimenting with a science project. The key is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.900\nSo, remember, tests are everywhere and they help us understand the world better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
