    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_044052.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey there, welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:14.000\nA test is really just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.500\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! In everyday life, we use tests all the time.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:28.400\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Or a teacher might give you a quiz to test your knowledge.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:35.700\nThe main goal is to get information about something. Let's say you want to know if a toy car still works.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:41.300\nYou put batteries in it and turn it on. If it moves, it passed the test!\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:53.300\nIf not, well, something might be wrong. So, remember, a test is simply a way to find out more about something by observing or checking it.\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:01.600\nIt helps us understand how things work and if they're working correctly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
