    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.000\nThat's a test! The toothpick coming out clean tells you the cake is ready.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:27.000\nAnother example is a spelling quiz in school. That test helps your teacher see how well you understand the words you've been learning.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:31.000\nOr, maybe you test out a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:37.000\nTests come in many forms and help us learn and improve.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and make decisions based on what we find out.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:49.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
