    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.200\nIt's a process that helps us measure or evaluate. Think about it like this:\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.600\na doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:42.200\nA chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. Or, you might take a quiz in school to test what you've learned.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:53.800\nSo, tests can be used in lots of different ways, from checking your health, to improving a recipe, to seeing how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.400\nThey all have the same basic goal: to get information and learn something new. Basically, a test is a method of trying something out and seeing what happens!\n```"
  },
