    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like a question that needs an answer, or a challenge that needs to be solved.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:21.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:29.200\nImagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might taste the batter before you bake it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:38.300\nYou're testing to see if it tastes good enough. Or, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:53.600\nThat's a test to see if it fixes the problem. Tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to check something, whether it's a cake or a phone or anything else! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
