    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:18.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:39.000\nTests can be anything from a quick quiz in school to a medical exam at the doctor's. They help us measure knowledge, skills, or even physical health.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:46.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling knowledge, and a fitness test measures your physical abilities.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:53.000\nAnother example is when you try a new recipe. You taste it to see if it needs more salt or sugar. That taste-test is also a test!\n\n00:53.000 --> 01:05.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information. They come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to help us learn and understand.\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
