    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:21.400\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:29.800\nThink about it: When you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick. That's a test to see if it's done.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:37.500\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again. That's a test to see if it fixes the problem.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:45.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, true or false, or even just a discussion.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:50.700\nSo, a test is just a tool to learn and understand things better. Remember, they're not scary, just helpful!\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
