    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_045009.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.600\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:23.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:34.900\nIt could be to see how well you know a subject, like in a school exam. Or it could be to check if something works, like testing a new toy.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:46.200\nTests help us understand where we are and what we need to learn or improve.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:53.200\nFor example, a spelling test shows which words you know and which ones you need to practice. Or, testing a recipe helps you figure out if you need more salt or sugar. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information. It helps us learn and improve all sorts of things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
