    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_045049.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.600\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary in school, but really, a test is just a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: a baker tests their cake by tasting it to make sure it's delicious.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:34.300\nOr a doctor tests your eyesight to see if you can read clearly.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:42.900\nWe use tests all the time in everyday life. For example, you might test a new toy to see if it's fun.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:52.400\nOr you might test different routes to school to find the fastest one. It's all about learning and making sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.000\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check if something is working as expected. It helps us learn and improve.\n```"
  },
