    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE: The timing here is approximate and should be refined based on the actual audio.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:19.500\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting a verbal answer, you're often getting a more detailed or measurable result.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:28.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:43.700\nA taste test figures out which flavor people like best. And even a doctor's test, like checking your temperature, is a way to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:51.700\nSo, tests help us learn things, make decisions, and understand the world around us better.\n\n00:51.700 --> 01:00.300\nThey can be as simple as asking a friend which movie they prefer or as complex as a science experiment. The key is that they all involve gathering information.\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:03.900\nRemember, a test is just a way to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
