    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us gather information and see how well something works, or how much someone knows.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.900\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to check if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:44.600\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test, you\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\nSo, whether it's a quiz, a medical exam, or even trying out a new recipe, a test is just a way to learn more and see what's what.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:52.900\nThey are really important for checking progress and figuring things out.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
