    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like a question, or a series of questions, designed to see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:29.000\nThe main idea of a test is to get information. It helps us measure things, like how well you understand a topic, or how strong a material is.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:38.600\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you can spell words. A strength test for a bridge tells us how much weight it can hold.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:51.400\nEven tasting a cake before serving it is a kind of test to make sure it tastes good! So, to recap, a test is a method for gathering information and measuring something.\n\n00:51.400 --> 01:02.500\nIt can be as simple as tasting food or as complex as a scientific experiment. Hopefully, that gives you a good basic understanding of what a test is.\n\n01:02.500 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
