    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_045857.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey there, welcome! Today we're tackling a super important concept: tests!\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:16.900\nBasically, a test is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:22.500\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:27.900\nBut tests aren't just for school. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:39.300\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. So, tests are all about gathering information and seeing if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:50.700\nThey can be simple, like tasting a cookie, or more complex, like a math exam. The key thing is, they help us understand something better.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.100\nIn short, a test is a check, a measurement, or a way to find out more. They are everywhere!\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
