    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.222 --> 00:05.402\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.402 --> 00:15.922\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.922 --> 00:25.172\nThink of it like this: If you're learning to ride a bike, your first few wobbly attempts are a test to see if you've understood the basics.\n\n00:25.172 --> 00:33.352\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\nTasting it afterwards is a test to see if you used the right amount of sugar!\n\n00:33.352 --> 00:42.952\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if your phone charger actually charges your phone.\n\n00:42.952 --> 00:53.332\nThey all help us understand if we're on the right track.\nBasically, a test helps us find out what we know, and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:53.332 --> 01:02.602\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check understanding or performance.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
