    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:26.600\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well someone or something performs. Think about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:34.500\nOr, imagine testing out a new recipe. You taste it to see if it's delicious and needs any adjustments.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:46.100\nTests aren't just for school or cooking, though. Scientists use tests to see if new medicines work, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:54.600\nSo, a test is just a method for checking something. It's about gathering information and seeing where things stand.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:00.800\nThat's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
