    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.900\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skill, or performance.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:32.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:43.900\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you can cook it! So, examples? A multiple-choice quiz, a blood test, even trying to start your car in the morning \u2013 that's testing if the battery works!\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:49.900\nTests help us learn and improve. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:59.300\nIn short, a test is a process for gathering information. It helps us understand where we are and what we need to do next.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
