    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_051255.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:19.500\nIt could be anything! Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:25.400\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:35.000\nSee? Tests help us measure or evaluate something. For example, a taste test can tell you which cookie is the most delicious.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:44.100\nOr, a strength test can see how much weight you can lift. Tests aren\u2019t just for schools or doctors; they're everywhere!\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:54.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool used to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
