    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:17.400\nA test, simply put, is a way to find out something. It\u2019s a process or a set of questions designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy, or a chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.400\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:44.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills, and a math test checks your understanding of numbers.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:53.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and understand things better. It gives us information.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
