    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_052236.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:14.000\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might test a cookie recipe to see if it tastes good before making a big batch.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:39.400\nIn school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning. They can be written quizzes, hands-on experiments, or even just asking questions out loud.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.500\nSo, tests help us learn and improve things, whether it's our health, a recipe, or our understanding of a new subject.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:55.700\nThey give us valuable information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
