    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:03.800\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.800 --> 00:05.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:09.400\nSimply put, it's a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:17.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:22.100\nIn science, you might test a hypothesis with an experiment.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:26.300\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:32.600\nTests aren't just about finding mistakes, though. They help us understand things better and improve them!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:36.800\nSo, a test is a check to see if something works or is true.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:44.300\nWe use them all the time in everyday life and in more formal settings.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:46.000\nThis video was created by\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:46.700\nApilage\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:47.100\nAI.\n```"
