    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process where we ask questions or perform actions to gather information.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:27.800\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.000\nSee? Both are examples of tests! Another good example is a simple battery test.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:46.900\nYou might use a battery tester to see how much power is left in a battery. That test helps you decide if you need to replace it.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:53.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and learning something new. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
