    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about a person or thing.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:34.800\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:39.500\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:44.600\nThe taste is the test! Tests aren't just for school, though.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:56.400\nA doctor uses tests to check your health, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:03.500\nSo, a test is really just a method for gathering information.\n\n01:03.500 --> 01:05.500\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:05.500 --> 01:12.700\nIn short, a test is a way to get information.\n\n01:12.700 --> 01:16.400\nIt can be a quiz, a taste, or an examination.\n\n01:16.400 --> 01:19.000\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n01:19.000 --> 01:22.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
