    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_052758.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:25.200\nThink about it.\nWhen you bake a cake, you taste it to test if it's sweet enough, right?\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:31.400\nOr when you get your eyes checked, the doctor is testing your vision.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:41.000\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking you questions in class.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:50.000\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:58.500\nWhether it's a delicious cake or understanding a new concept, tests help us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
