    "subtitles": "[WebVTT]\nNOTE duration:56.800\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.700\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, and then getting an answer.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:20.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. For example, a taste test!\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:33.100\nYou try a new kind of ice cream, and that's a test to see if you like it. Or, when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.900\nAnother example is a medical test, like when a doctor checks your temperature. That helps them test if you might be sick.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:53.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a process to gather information and learn something new. It helps us answer questions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
