    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_053206.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nEver wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.300\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:08.000\nIt could be anything!\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:11.000\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:14.500\nThe main idea is to see how something performs under certain conditions.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:17.500\nWe might test a toy to see if it's safe, or test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:20.500\nTests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:25.000\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:28.500\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:29.500\nSee?\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:31.000\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:36.000\nSo, in summary, a test is a method for gathering information about something by observing its performance.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:40.000\nIt helps us understand and evaluate things around us.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:42.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
