    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. \nIt's like asking a question and looking for the answer.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:19.400\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:27.800\nThink about baking a cake. You test if it's done by poking it with a toothpick. \nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:34.300\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if your phone charger is working. \nYou plug it in.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:40.800\nIf your phone starts charging, the charger passes the test.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:54.600\nBasically, a test helps us confirm if something is true or false, working or broken, or even just right or wrong. \nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
