    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: You might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\nOr you might test a toy to see if it\u2019s safe for a child to play with.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:41.000\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\nThese tests can be multiple choice, true or false, or even written answers.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:49.700\nThe important thing is that a test helps us understand something better, whether it's the sweetness of a cake or your understanding of a subject.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
