    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like this: You want to see if your cookies are done baking, so you use a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:31.900\nIn science, tests are used to see if something is true or false.\nFor example, if you think a plant grows better with more sunlight, you can test that!\nYou'd grow some plants in the sun and some in the shade, and then compare how they grow.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:42.100\nTests help us learn and understand the world around us.\nThey help us figure out what works and what doesn't.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:51.700\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something and find out if it's true.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
