    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_053907.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:24.800\nIt's a process, a procedure, or even a question, designed to reveal information. Think about it like this: a doctor uses a blood test to learn about your health.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:36.300\nA chef tastes food to test the seasoning. Or, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how well you understand the words and grammar.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:46.300\nSo, a test can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your bathwater is the right temperature.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:57.000\nThey all have the same goal: to give us information and help us understand something better. Remember, tests are all about learning and discovery!\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
