    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_053947.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.300\nOkay, so you're probably wondering, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:06.400\nWell, in its simplest form, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:11.000\nIt's like asking a question to see if you get the right answer.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:14.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:20.000\nThink about checking if your shoes are tied tight before you go for a run \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:23.400\nOr tasting your food to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:28.100\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the lessons.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:33.300\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just raising your hand to answer a question in class.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:36.900\nThe point is to see if you've learned what's been taught.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:45.400\nSo, a test is simply a way to find out something by examining it or asking a question.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:51.100\nIt helps us understand if things are working as they should, or if we need to learn more.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:55.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
