    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.300\nYou've probably taken lots of them in school, but in general, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:18.700\nThink of it as a question or a challenge that helps you learn more.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:24.600\nSo, how does it work? Well, you try something out, and then you see what happens.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.200\nThat's the test! For example, if you're trying to bake a cake and you use too much sugar, that's a test!\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:46.000\nYou're finding out what happens when you add too much sugar. Or, if you're trying to start a new hobby and you try painting, that's a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:50.800\nTests help us understand things better.\n\n00:50.800 --> 01:03.500\nThey show us what works and what doesn't. It's all about learning! In short, a test is a simple way to explore, experiment, and discover new things.\n\n01:03.500 --> 01:07.100\nIt's about asking \"what if?\" and then finding out the answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
