    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Basically, a test helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:43.800\nIt could be your knowledge, like a school exam. Or it could be checking if something is working correctly, like testing a new toy to see if it needs batteries.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:46.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:49.000\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:51.600\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:51.600 --> 01:03.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool we use to learn something or check if something is right. It helps us understand the world around us a little bit better.\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:06.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
