    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_054254.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us learn more about a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is ready, you do a test. You might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:31.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's your test result telling you the cake is done!\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:43.300\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. Each time you try, you're essentially testing your balance and coordination.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:53.600\nYou might fall at first, but eventually, you'll pass the test and ride smoothly.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:03.900\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information. It can be as simple as tasting food or as complex as solving a math problem.\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:07.500\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n01:07.500 --> 01:11.100\nRemember, a test is just a tool for learning.\n\n01:11.100 --> 01:14.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
