    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.800\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:34.100\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. The test gives us information.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:50.600\nFor example, a cooking test could be tasting a new recipe to see if it's delicious. Or a material test could be bending a piece of metal to see how strong it is.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:57.700\nSo, a test is really just a process for gathering information, whether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even how good a cookie tastes! It helps us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
