    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.300\nIt's a process for gathering information and seeing if something is true or correct.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:30.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:37.700\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:50.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if your recipe and ingredients will combine to create a delicious treat.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:55.100\nSo, tests can be used in lots of different situations to help us learn, diagnose problems, or simply see if something works.\n```"
