    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.900\nIt's a process, or a procedure, designed to get information.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:35.200\nThink about it like this: a doctor uses a blood test to find out about your health. Or, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:38.200\nIn cooking, you might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:41.200\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:50.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:51.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
