    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE duration: 56.7\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:10.700\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:24.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards. Think of it like this: when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:33.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, imagine your doctor giving you an eye exam.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:43.800\nThat\u2019s a test to see how well you can see. Tests are everywhere, from checking if your internet connection is working, to big exams at school.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:53.100\nThey provide information and help us make decisions. So, a test is just a way to check and see if something is as it should be.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
