    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_055759.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey there, welcome! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:17.200\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like an experiment or a way to check if something is true or working correctly.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:27.200\nThink about it: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:37.100\nOr a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:48.400\nA doctor might run some blood tests to check your health. Tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are safe and reliable.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:51.900\nWe use them every day, even if we don't realize it. So next time you hear the word \"test\", remember it's just a way of finding something out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
