    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:14.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer. Tests help us check if something is working, if something is true, or even just to see what someone knows.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:37.300\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz at school to test your understanding of a subject.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:43.100\nAnother example could be baking a cake! You taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:45.700\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:56.400\nThey're a vital tool for learning and understanding the world around us. So, remember, a test is a way to get information and check things out.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:06.300\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to help us learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
