    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a process, or a procedure, designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:39.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nThat's a test!\nOr, when you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject, that's also a test.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:52.900\nTests can be written, like exams, or they can be practical, like a driving test.\nBasically, any time you're trying to measure something, you're using a test.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for evaluating skills, knowledge, or abilities.\n```"
