    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something or someone to see how well they perform or what their abilities are.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a doctor might run some tests to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:36.100\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if it tastes good! So, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:48.300\nThey give us information about what we know or how well something works. They come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big, important exams.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:54.600\nBasically, a test is just a way of finding things out. That's all there is to it!\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
