    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:26.200\nIt's a process, a question, or a task designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:39.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\nA taste test tells you which food tastes best.\nAnd even a medical test can tell you if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:49.300\nTests can be formal, like a big exam at school, or informal, like checking if your cake is done by poking it with a fork.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:57.900\nThe important thing is that they give you information.\nSo, to sum it up: a test helps you learn something by measuring something.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.600\nWhether it's your spelling, your baking skills, or your health, tests are all about gathering information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
