    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like an experiment, or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:20.800\nIt could be testing if a toy car goes faster with a bigger push. Or maybe testing your knowledge with a quiz at school.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:35.300\nEven a doctor checks you over with tests to see if you're healthy. So, the toy car test tells you about speed, the quiz tells you about what you know, and the doctor's tests tell you about your health.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:46.500\nSee how each test gives you different information? Basically, a test is just a tool we use to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:57.000\nWe ask a question, perform the test, and then look at the results to find the answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
