    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like this: you use a measuring cup to test if you have enough flour for a cake, right?\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:34.800\nIn everyday life, we test things all the time! You might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:43.700\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge on a subject.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:49.300\nSo, a test is just a method, a procedure, a way to figure something out or to see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:52.800\nIt could be a physical test, like checking the air pressure in your tires, or a mental test, like solving a puzzle.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.200\nBasically, a test helps us learn something! It gives us information.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
