    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, a simple test could be checking if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:40.600\nThat's testing if the bulb is working. Or, imagine your teacher giving you a quiz. That's a test to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:50.900\nTests can be big or small, easy or hard. But they all share the same goal: to get information.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:54.400\nSo remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
