    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:11.600\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:21.600\nIt helps us see what we know or how well something works.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:33.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test tells you which cookie tastes the best!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:45.400\nTests come in many forms, from quizzes in school to scientists testing new medicines.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:57.200\nFor example, you might test a new recipe by cooking it and seeing if you like the result. Or, you might test how strong a paper airplane is by throwing it.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:07.000\nThe results of these tests help us learn and improve. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something.\n\n01:07.000 --> 01:14.700\nIt helps us gather information and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
