    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:26.400\nThat's a test!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:34.100\nTests can come in many forms. It could be a quiz at school, a taste test of different foods, or even a doctor checking your reflexes.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:44.300\nThe main point is to gather information. For example, if you're learning to ride a bike, falling down a few times is like a test.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:52.600\nIt shows you what not to do! And when a chef tries a new recipe, they're testing it out to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:58.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to learn more about something, whether it's your knowledge, a skill, or even a new recipe.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:06.000\nIt helps us understand what works and what doesn't. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
