    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_061450.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.300\nWhat are they and why do we use them?\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:20.300\nIt could be your knowledge of a subject, your physical abilities, or even your opinion on a particular topic.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:31.900\nThink of it like a ruler, but instead of measuring length, it measures something else.\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\nA fitness test might see how many push-ups you can do.\nAnd a survey asks your opinion on different things.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:39.500\nTests help us understand where we're at.\nThey can show us what we're good at and what we need to work on.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:46.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and grow.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
