    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nIt could be about your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you can do a test!\nYou stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:34.900\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\nOr, if you\u2019re learning to ride a bike, the test is whether you can balance and pedal without falling.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:42.900\nTests are used everywhere, from checking if your eyesight is good, to seeing if a bridge is strong enough.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:54.300\nThey help us make sure things are working as they should and that we understand things properly.\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for finding something out.\n\n00:54.300 --> 01:00.300\nIt helps us learn and improve!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
