    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_061630.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:03.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.900 --> 00:05.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:08.700\nThink of it like an experiment, but instead of chemicals,\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:12.300\nyou're usually testing knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:17.600\nThe main idea behind a test is to measure something and see where you stand.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:19.800\nAre you good at math?\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:22.600\nA math test will help you find out.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:26.200\nDo you know the capitals of all the states?\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:28.700\nA geography test can check that.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:31.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:34.500\nA multiple-choice quiz checks your understanding of a topic.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:37.500\nEven your doctor uses tests to check your health!\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:42.800\nSo, a test is just a tool for figuring things out.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:47.400\nIt helps you, or someone else, understand what you know, what you can do,\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:49.100\nor even how healthy you are.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:51.900\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:53.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
