    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.900\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary, like a big exam. But really, a test is just a way to see if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if your light bulb works, you turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:31.700\nIf it lights up, the test passed. If it doesn\u2019t, the test failed.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:36.600\nAnother example is baking a cake. You taste it to see if it's good.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:45.600\nThat's a test too! So, in simple terms, a test is just checking something to see if it meets expectations.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:54.700\nWhether it\u2019s a light bulb, a cake, or even a school exam, it\u2019s all about finding out if something works as it should.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
