    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_062733.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.100\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.100\nThink about it like this: a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.600\nOr, a doctor might give you an eye exam to test your vision.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:52.900\nIn school, you take tests to show what you\u2019ve learned. These tests can be anything from multiple-choice questions, to writing an essay, or even performing a task.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.400\nThe results of the test then give us information or a grade.\n```"
  },
