    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests! In its simplest form, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:13.600\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:17.100\nIt could be anything, really.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:19.700\nIs the lightbulb working?\n00:19.700 --> 00:22.300\nThat's a test.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:25.600\nAre you hungry?\n00:25.600 --> 00:27.400\nAnother test!\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:30.000\nYou're testing to see if you need food.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:37.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:43.600\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:45.300\nSee?\n00:45.300 --> 00:46.500\nIt's all about checking something.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:53.000\nSo, a test is a process or procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's an object, a person's ability, or even just a feeling.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:54.300\nIt helps us understand and make decisions.\n```"
  },
