    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:18.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a method we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:27.700\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:39.100\nBasically, a test helps us answer a question or solve a problem. It could be anything from checking if a lightbulb works to figuring out the best way to bake a cake.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:48.300\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and learning something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
