    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like a quick investigation to see if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:23.900\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:27.900\nThat's a test! Or maybe you're buying a used car.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:34.300\nYou'd probably want to test drive it to see if it runs smoothly. That's another kind of test.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:43.900\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like checking the temperature of a baby's forehead.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.500\nUltimately, they all help us learn something or make a decision.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
