    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.800\nIt's a procedure or question designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:36.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:39.200\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:42.200\nOr even a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:45.200\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:56.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information, whether it's about your skills, your preferences, or your health.\nIt\u2019s a valuable tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
