    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_063255.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:28.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it out to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:38.600\nOr, if you press a button on a toy, you're testing if it works. In school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:49.900\nAnd in science, tests are used to prove or disprove ideas. So, tests are a valuable tool for learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:56.800\nThey help us answer questions! So remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
