    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:25.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:38.900\nThink about it this way: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:47.000\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you like it!\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:56.900\nSo, tests can be anything from quizzes and exams to experiments and even just trying something new. They all help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.500\nThey provide evidence and allow us to make informed decisions.\n```"
