  "d1efae0f-5427-4116-ba6b-3f4c51f6d5b7": {
    "id": "d1efae0f-5427-4116-ba6b-3f4c51f6d5b7",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:17:36.916010",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-04T06:40:39.454988",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260104_064039.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_064039.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:10.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like a way to gather information. We use them every day without even realizing it!\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:30.500\nA test is really just a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:39.000\nIt helps us see what you know or can do. For example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:53.700\nOr, imagine trying out a new recipe. That's a test to see if you can follow instructions and bake a delicious cake!\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:01.400\nEven a doctor checking your reflexes is performing a test. So, a test is just a tool to learn more about something, whether it's your knowledge, your skills, or even how well a recipe works.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:03.800\nIt gives us information to help us understand things better.\n\n01:03.800 --> 01:07.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
