    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.500\nNow, you might think of school exams, but a test in general is really just a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.900\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:32.100\nThink about it this way: you bake a cake.\nThe test is whether it tastes good!\nOr, if you build a tower of blocks, the test is whether it can stand up without falling over.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:41.400\nSo, a test helps us understand if we've succeeded in doing something correctly.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:47.900\nWe try something, and then we test it.\nIf it passes the test, great!\nIf not, we know we need to make some changes.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:54.400\nIt's all about learning and improving.\nBasically, a test is a simple way to see if something works the way it should.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
