    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_064252.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about something called a test.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:16.500\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:34.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:49.800\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and make decisions.\n\n00:49.800 --> 01:00.500\nThey can be simple like tasting a food to see if it's salty, or more complicated like taking a multiple-choice exam.\nThe key thing is, they give us information.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:04.200\nBasically, a test is just a process for gathering information to help us understand something better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
