    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:29.500\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:32.500\nOr, you might take a test in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:35.500\nThese tests give us information.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:39.900\nAnother example? Baking a cake! You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:44.300\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:51.500\nSo, a test is really just a process to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
