    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_065008.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy, or a teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:35.900\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if you like a new flavor of ice cream. Or, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:51.300\nEven checking if a light bulb works is a type of test! So, a test is just a tool to gather information, whether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even just if something is working correctly.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:60.300\nRemember, tests help us learn and understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "1e4c7ce6-8e17-48ec-b1e8-62a94f54965c": {
    "id": "1e4c7ce6-8e17-48ec-b1e8-62a94f54965c",
