    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_065323.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.200\nToday, we're going to talk about tests. Now, a test is just a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it as a question you're trying to answer, or a skill you're trying to measure.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.100\nIt could be a quiz at school, a blood test at the doctor, or even just trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:41.200\nThe main idea behind any test is to get information.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:47.300\nFor example, a math test helps your teacher see if you understand fractions.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:53.600\nOr, a taste test can help you decide if you like a new flavor of ice cream. See? Simple!\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:04.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information. It helps us understand things better and make decisions.\n\n01:04.600 --> 01:08.000\nIt can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like trying a new game.\n\n01:08.000 --> 01:10.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
