    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_065359.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:23.400\nIn science, tests help us see if an idea is true or not. For example, imagine you think plants grow taller in sunlight.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.700\nTo test that, you could put one plant in sunlight and another in the shade. Then, you'd measure them after a week to see if your idea was right.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:40.900\nAnother example is a taste test! You might try two different cookies and decide which one you like better. That's a test too!\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:50.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something by trying it out or checking it.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:57.300\nIt helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
