    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_065618.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. It's a process we use to get information.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.000\nThink about it like this. A taste test tells you how good food is.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:26.500\nA spelling test shows how well you know your words. A medical test can tell you about your health.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:30.900\nSo, tests aren\u2019t just for school! They're everywhere.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:40.000\nThey help us understand things, make decisions, and learn more. They help us see if something is working as it should.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:50.200\nBasically, a test is just a method, any method, used to gather information. Hopefully, that clears things up!\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:53.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
