    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give us some information.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:31.000\nIt can be anything, really. A doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to check what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious!\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:36.200\nSo, examples? A spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:43.400\nA blood test tells you about your health. And even trying a new pizza topping is testing to see if you like it!\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:53.700\nBasically, a test helps us learn something new, or confirm something we already suspect. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
