    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:24.700\nIt's a process designed to gather information.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:31.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:44.500\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how much you've learned in class. Even baking a cake is a test! You're testing your recipe to see if it comes out delicious.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:52.100\nSo, a test can be anything that helps us check something or learn more about it. From science experiments to spelling quizzes, tests help us understand the world around us. Remember, a test is just a way to get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
