    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process, or a procedure, designed to measure or evaluate.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:24.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.600\nA taste test tells you which food you prefer.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:43.800\nEven a simple question, like \"Are you hungry?\", is a kind of test! It's testing your hunger level.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:53.400\nTests help us learn more about ourselves, about products, or even about scientific ideas. They give us information we didn't have before. So, a test is just a way to learn by asking a question and finding the answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
