    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:32.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand more. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Think about it: a doctor uses a test to see if you're sick, a chef tastes food to see if it needs more salt, and a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:41.800\nThese are all tests! They can be written, like a multiple-choice exam, or practical, like trying to bake a cake.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:52.500\nThe goal is always the same: to gather information. So, a test is a process designed to collect data and evaluate something.\n\n00:52.500 --> 01:00.600\nWhether it's your knowledge, your health, or even the quality of a product, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:04.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
