    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.200\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:28.600\nYou poke it with a toothpick, right? That's a test! Tests help us understand if something is working correctly or not.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:33.400\nIn school, tests show your teacher how much you've learned.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:38.200\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:44.600\nAnother example? Imagine you build a tower of blocks.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:51.000\nYou gently push it to see if it's strong enough to stand. That's testing its stability.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:53.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for checking something,\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nwhether it's a cake, your knowledge, your health, or a tower of blocks.\n\n00:57.300 --> 00:59.600\nIt helps us figure things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
