    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.200\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:25.600\nTests help us understand how well something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:34.300\nFor example, a taste test can tell you which cookie tastes better. A spelling test shows you how well you know your spelling.\nOr even a doctor's test can help them understand what's going on in your body.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:44.700\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions by giving us information. They're all about finding answers.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:48.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
