    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_070415.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests all the time to see if something is working correctly, or to learn more about it.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:37.200\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:47.900\nOr, a baker might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good before making a big batch. Even a doctor uses tests to check if you're healthy!\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:56.100\nSo, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should. Remember, tests aren't scary, they're just helpful tools! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
