    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.400\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something. Think of it like an experiment, where you're trying to find out if something is true or works correctly.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:22.100\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:26.300\nOr maybe you're trying out a new recipe. Tasting it is also a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:32.500\nTests are used everywhere. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:39.300\nScientists use tests to discover new things. Even video games have tests to make sure they're fun and working properly!\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:54.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to check something and see if it meets a certain standard or expectation. It's all about finding out the answer.\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
