    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.999\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:18.499\nBasically, a test is a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a simple test!\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:24.099\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time. Your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:30.899\nYour teacher gives you tests to see what you've learned. So, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:37.799\nThey give us information to make decisions. For example, a car company might test its new car to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:50.199\nOr, you might take a practice test before a big exam to see where you need to study more. In a nutshell, tests help us check, learn, and improve.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:57.599\nThey're a really useful tool!\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
