    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.200\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, but what exactly is a test?\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:27.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know or how well you can do something. It's like a little check-up for your knowledge.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:36.900\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if your cake is ready, you stick a toothpick in it. That toothpick is a test!\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:45.900\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, falling down a few times is a test of your balance.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:51.500\nTests can come in many forms, like quizzes, exams, or even just trying something new.\n\n00:51.500 --> 01:00.500\nThey help us learn and improve by showing us what we've mastered and what we still need to work on. So, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
