    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.600\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:01.600 --> 00:03.200\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:04.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:06.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:11.400\nIt's a method we use to gather information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:16.200\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:17.900\nThat's gathering information!\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:21.500\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:22.900\nThat's another kind of test!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:28.100\nAnother example could be testing a new recipe. You try it out, see if it tastes good, and adjust it.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:29.300\nThat's testing too!\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:33.800\nTests help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:39.500\nSo, a test is just a process of gathering information to learn something new.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:41.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
