    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:20.400\nA test, in its simplest form, is really just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done, so you give them a little poke \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:28.500\nBasically, a test helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:35.300\nWe use tests all the time. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:45.700\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:55.300\nEven checking if the light switch turns on the light is a tiny test! So, remember, a test is a way to check something to see if it's working or true.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:58.900\nIt helps us learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
