    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHello everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:25.300\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or performance.\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:34.600\nA taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes the best.\nOr, a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:47.300\nSo, tests come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to provide information or an answer.\nThey help us measure things and make informed decisions.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:52.700\nRemember, a test is just a tool!\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
