    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:23.600\nIt's like asking a question and seeing if you get the right answer.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:37.600\nA test confirms whether something is true or false, correct or incorrect. It helps us find mistakes and fix them.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:45.400\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Or, if you're building a bridge, engineers run tests to make sure it's strong enough to hold weight.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:51.400\nSo, in short, a test is a check-up. It's a way of verifying that something is working as intended. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
