    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:22.200\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or seeing how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:32.200\nThink about it: your doctor gives you tests to check your health. You might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:41.400\nEven baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you check if it's done by poking it with a fork!\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:50.500\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.100\nWe use tests all the time, in all sorts of ways. Basically, a test helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
