    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of bathwater to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:31.700\nOr maybe you test a cookie to see if it tastes good! In both cases, you're performing a test to get information.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:45.500\nTests can be simple, like tasting a cookie, or more complex, like a school exam. But the core idea is always the same: to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:55.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to learn and understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
