    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_073951.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary, but really, they're just a way to check what you know.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like this: a test is like a game where you try to answer questions correctly. The point of a test isn't to trick you, it's to see if you understand the material.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:37.700\nFor example, a simple test might ask, \"What color is the sky?\" The answer is blue!\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:46.400\nAnother test could ask you to add two numbers together, like two plus two. That equals four!\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:51.600\nSo, remember, tests are just tools to help you and your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nDon't be afraid of them! Just do your best, and you'll be fine. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "2cc4c956-d75b-4bec-b298-4d4524235db1": {
    "id": "2cc4c956-d75b-4bec-b298-4d4524235db1",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:18:24.949411",
