    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_074122.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\nIt's a method we use to gather information.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:25.000\nOr, you might take a quiz in school.\nThat's also a test, to see what you've learned.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:31.000\nTests aren't always about right or wrong answers.\nSometimes they're about understanding.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:40.800\nFor example, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\nThey're using their senses to gather information and make a decision.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:50.700\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's our health, our knowledge, or even the flavor of our soup.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.500\nIn summary, a test is a way of getting information.\nWe use them all the time to learn and make decisions.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
