    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_074338.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:28.200\nIt\u2019s a way to check if something works, if something is true, or if something is the right size or shape.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:35.900\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:43.600\nOr, if you're building a tower of blocks, you're constantly testing its stability to see if it will fall.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:48.800\nEven trying a new flavor of ice cream is a test \u2013 you're testing if you like it!\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:56.400\nSo, in short, a test is just a way to learn something by trying something out. It helps us figure things out and make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
