    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.400\nIt's a process used to evaluate or measure something.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:32.800\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:46.400\nAnother example? Baking a cake! You might test the cake with a toothpick to see if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:57.000\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, your health, or even your baking skills, a test helps us get information. In summary, a test is a method for evaluating or measuring something.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.400\nIt gives us valuable insights and helps us make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
