    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, and that's true, but in general, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:29.300\nIt's a process of examining something to see if it meets a certain standard or works correctly. Think about it like this: If you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:38.100\nThat's a test! Or, if you're buying a used car, you might take it for a test drive to see if it runs well.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:48.900\nThat's another test! So, tests help us understand if things are working as they should, and they can be used in tons of different situations.\n\n00:48.900 --> 01:00.700\nWhether it's checking if your cake is baked, your car runs smoothly, or even if you understand a new concept, tests are all about checking and understanding.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:10.500\nIn short, a test is an evaluation to see if something meets expectations. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
