    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_074637.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.200 --> 00:02.100\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:03.500\nNow, what is a test?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:05.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:08.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but instead of mixing chemicals, you're checking for knowledge or skill.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:12.300\nFor example, a spelling test tells you how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:14.100\nA taste test tells you which food you prefer.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:17.200\nEven when a doctor checks your reflexes, that\u2019s a test to see how your body is working!\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:22.300\nSo, a test helps us learn something new about ourselves or the world around us.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:23.700\nIt's a tool for discovery.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:28.000\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just a way to learn and grow!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:31.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
