    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a topic, like in school, or checking if something is working correctly, like a new toy.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:30.700\nBasically, you're asking a question or performing an action to see what the result will be. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:41.900\nOr, if you try turning on a light switch, that's a test to see if the light bulb is working. Tests help us learn what we know and what we need to learn.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:51.100\nThey also help us make sure things are safe and reliable. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something!\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
