    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.600\nIt could be to check if something works, see how strong something is, or even find out what you know!\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:27.300\nThink about it like this: a baker tests their cake batter to make sure it tastes good before baking the whole cake.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:34.500\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. These are all different kinds of tests!\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:43.500\nTests are super important because they help us make sure things are working correctly, are safe, and are doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:55.200\nSo, to recap: a test is a way of finding something out, and they're used all over the place. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
