    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:16.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:26.400\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:33.200\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:45.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it comes out right.\nSo, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:50.700\nThey give us information we can use to learn, improve, or just know more about the world around us.\nThey\u2019re super common and used everywhere!\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.300\nThat's the basics of what a test is.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
