    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:20.600\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:31.700\nThink about it. A math test in school is designed to see how well you understand numbers and equations.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:45.200\nA taste test lets you find out which flavor of ice cream you like best. Even trying on a new shirt is a kind of test, a test to see if it fits and looks good!\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:55.300\nSo, tests can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like trying something new. They all have the same goal: to gather information and learn something.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:58.900\nTests help us learn, improve, and make decisions. In short, a test is a tool for exploration and discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
