    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:21.400\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It could be to see if you understand a topic, like in school, or to check if something is working correctly, like a new toy.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake. You test it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:32.500\nOr, imagine you're trying to open a door. You try different keys until one works. Each key is a test.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:37.600\nSo, a test is really just a process. You ask a question, or try something out, and then you look at the result.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:47.200\nThat result tells you something important. Tests help us learn, fix things, and make sure everything is running smoothly.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:56.900\nTests help us learn, fix things, and make sure everything is running smoothly.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
