    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.500\nA test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a quiz. We use tests to see if something is working, or to measure how well someone understands a topic.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.100\nFor example, you might test a new recipe by cooking it and seeing if it tastes good. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:44.900\nEven a simple quiz in school is a test to see how much you've learned. The results of a test help us make decisions or understand things better.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:53.200\nSo, remember, a test is a method for discovering information.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.800\nIt could be anything from trying a new flavor of ice cream to taking a big exam. It's all about finding out something new! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
