    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nA test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:18.800\nThink of it like checking your understanding.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:29.500\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. Maybe it's a multiple-choice quiz in school, a practical exam like a driving test, or even just trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:38.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words. A taste test checks if you can identify different flavors. And a fitness test checks your physical abilities.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:50.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge, skills, or abilities. It helps you understand what you already know and what you still need to learn.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
