    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\nIt helps you see if something is working, how well you understand something, or even if something is true.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:39.900\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nOr a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\nYou could even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:47.500\nIn each case, you're performing an action and observing the result to learn something.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:51.000\nSo, a test is a process to gain information.\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
