    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:06.100\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:11.300\nWhether it's a school test to see what you've learned, or a medical test to check your health,\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:13.900\nthe goal is to gather information.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:17.900\nThink about it like this: you might test if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:20.600\nIf it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:25.200\nOr, you might test a recipe by making it. If it tastes good, your recipe passes the test!\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:30.500\nSo, a test helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:33.400\nIt gives us evidence to make decisions.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:37.400\nWe use tests every day, even without realizing it!\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:41.600\nThey are fundamental to learning and problem-solving.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:43.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
