    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: when you take a spelling test at school, it shows how well you've learned to spell those words.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:36.200\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. Tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like that cake tasting.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:47.800\nWhether it's checking your knowledge or checking a recipe, tests help us understand and improve. So, a test is a way to evaluate or measure something.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:51.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
