    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.230 --> 00:02.220\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:02.220 --> 00:06.730\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.730 --> 00:13.070\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge or ability in a specific area.\n\n00:13.070 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like this: a recipe is a test for your baking skills!\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:25.620\nYou follow the instructions, and the deliciousness of the cake shows how well you did.\n\n00:25.620 --> 00:31.700\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like when you try a new video game to see if you like it.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:37.600\nThe important thing is that a test helps you gather information.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:42.170\nFor example, a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice.\n\n00:42.170 --> 00:47.570\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and improve.\n\n00:47.570 --> 00:52.320\nIt provides information about what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:52.320 --> 00:56.160\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
