    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_080952.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.799\nThink of a test as a way to check something. We use tests all the time to see if things are working the way they should.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.599\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:31.099\nIt's all about gathering information to make sure everything is okay.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:39.899\nAnother simple test is checking if a light bulb works. You flip the switch, and if it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:51.499\nIf not, the bulb probably needs replacing. So, basically, a test is a process of checking something to see if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:54.300\nIt helps us understand if things are working correctly.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
