    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:13.100\nNow, you've probably taken lots of tests at school, but we're talking about something a little different.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:28.600\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\nThink about it like this: If you build a birdhouse, you might test it by putting it outside and seeing if birds actually use it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:35.400\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to see if it's sweet enough.\nThat's another kind of test!\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:41.300\nTests help us find problems and make things better.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:53.000\nSo, whether it's checking if your bike brakes work, or making sure your video game level is fun, tests are all about finding out if things are doing what they should.\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:58.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
