    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_081158.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:14.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give us answers.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:28.600\nIt's like when you bake a cake. You might stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean. That's a test!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:36.400\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a light bulb is working. You screw it in and flip the switch. If it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:44.300\nTests are all about gathering evidence and understanding something better.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:53.100\nThey help us make decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
