    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.700\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:31.700\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:36.600\nSee? They're both tests!\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:44.800\nLet's say you want to know if your cake is ready. You can stick a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test that tells you the cake is done!\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:54.500\nIf it's gooey, you know it needs more time. So, a test is really just a tool to gather information and help you make a decision. It helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
