    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:22.700\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:33.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:38.800\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:43.300\nYou might taste the batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:44.900\nThat's also a test!\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:54.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a written test in school, or a physical test in sports. A company might test a new product to see if it works well.\n\n00:54.300 --> 01:05.600\nThe key thing is, a test helps us gather information and make decisions. So, remember, a test is just a method for finding something out.\n\n01:05.600 --> 01:09.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
