    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.900\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\nThink of it like this: a chef might taste a soup to test if it has enough salt.\nOr, a doctor might check your temperature to test if you have a fever.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:34.000\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\nA car company might do crash tests to make sure their cars are safe.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:39.300\nSee?\nTests are everywhere, helping us learn and improve things.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:49.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nIt gives us information we can use to make decisions.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
