    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nA simple test could be tasting food to see if it's sweet or sour.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:33.200\nOr, it could be something more formal, like a spelling test at school.\nThe important thing is, a test helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:42.000\nFor example, a doctor might use a blood test to check your health.\nA baker might test their bread dough to see if it\u2019s ready to bake.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:44.600\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:54.800\nSo, to recap, a test helps us understand or measure something by providing information.\nIt\u2019s a question that leads to an answer.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
