    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:19.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a topic, checking if a machine is working correctly, or even checking if a recipe tastes good!\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like this: a school quiz is a test of your knowledge.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:45.400\nA doctor might run tests to check your health. And you might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:52.500\nSo, whether it's a written exam, a medical checkup, or even just a taste test, the main idea is the same: to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.100\nTests help us learn, diagnose, and improve things. That's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
