    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_082339.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.100\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:07.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:13.100\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:17.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:21.900\nOr, you take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:25.800\nSo, how does it work?\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:29.900\nWell, a test usually involves asking questions or performing tasks.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:33.700\nYour answers or performance then get evaluated.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:37.100\nFor example, a taste test tells you which soda you like best.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:40.500\nA spelling test shows how well you spell words.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:44.900\nSee? Tests are everywhere, helping us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:51.300\nBasically, a test is a structured way to get information. It helps us measure, evaluate, and learn.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:52.400\nNow you know!\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
