    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:22.800\nIt's like an experiment, but often simpler.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:29.400\nThink about it like this: a taste test! If you try a cookie, you're testing to see if you like the flavor.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:34.600\nOr, if you try to turn on a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:39.800\nSee? Testing is all around us.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:49.300\nAnother example is checking the weather. You might look outside to test your theory that it's sunny. The results of your test, sunny or cloudy, give you information.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:55.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand how things work, and what we like!\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
