    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:25.700\nIt could be about you, like a quiz at school, or about a product, like checking if a toy is safe.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:31.600\nBasically, you're asking a question and the test helps you find the answer.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:37.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:43.500\nThe test? Sticking a toothpick in them. If it comes out clean, the test tells you they're ready!\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:49.500\nAnother example is a doctor using a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:56.100\nThey might take your temperature. A high temperature is a sign, a result of the test.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:03.600\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information and learn something. It helps us make decisions and understand things better.\n\n01:03.600 --> 01:06.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
