    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information and see how well something works, or how well someone understands something.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:29.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:37.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:43.500\nIn both cases, they're using a test to get information.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.800\nAnother example is testing a new recipe. You follow the instructions, taste it, and see if it's good! That's a test too!\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:00.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for getting information. It can be anything from a formal exam to simply trying something out. And it helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
