    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:15.600\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done. You do a test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:39.100\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! In many areas, we use tests to see if something meets certain requirements or standards.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:52.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or a medical test, like a blood test, checks if your body is working properly.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:59.700\nSo, whether it's checking if your cake is baked, your spelling is on point, or your health is good, a test is simply a way of finding out if something is working as it should.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:05.700\nThey help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n01:05.700 --> 01:09.400\nRemember, a test is just a tool.\n\n01:09.400 --> 01:12.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
