    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.220 --> 00:02.150\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.150 --> 00:06.570\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:06.570 --> 00:08.140\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:08.140 --> 00:10.670\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:10.670 --> 00:14.480\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:14.480 --> 00:15.210\nThat's a test!\n\n00:15.210 --> 00:19.790\nOr, let's say you're buying a new phone. You might read reviews online to see what other people think.\n\n00:19.790 --> 00:20.790\nThat's a test, too!\n\n00:20.790 --> 00:25.180\nSo, a test is really just a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:25.180 --> 00:29.680\nIt could be anything from your knowledge of a subject, to the quality of a product, or even just whether your cake is ready to eat.\n\n00:29.680 --> 00:34.050\nWe use tests to make informed decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:34.050 --> 00:36.980\nEssentially, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:36.980 --> 00:39.510\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "d2b5765c-3237-4fa4-8c94-364592ac5051": {
    "id": "d2b5765c-3237-4fa4-8c94-364592ac5051",
