    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_083816.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like a quick way to see if something is working as it should, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:23.000\nIt could be a science experiment to test a hypothesis, like seeing if plants grow faster in sunlight.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:34.500\nOr it could be a simple math problem on a worksheet to test your understanding of addition. Even your doctor uses tests, like a blood test, to check your health.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:49.300\nSo, basically, a test helps us get information and make decisions. We learn from the results, whether it's confirming something we already knew, or discovering something completely new.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:57.700\nTests are all around us! To recap, a test is a process that checks something to see if it works or is true.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:04.900\nIt helps us learn and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
