    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like asking a question, and the answer tells you what you need to know.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:28.700\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:42.100\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check if you're healthy. See? Different tests, different questions, different answers.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:51.500\nTests can be written, like quizzes, or they can involve doing something, like a science experiment. The important thing is that they help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:59.200\nSo, tests are tools we use to learn and discover. Remember, a test is just a way to find out something! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
