    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore what a test is, in the simplest way possible.\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:21.100\nBasically, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to see what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:32.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, think about testing a new toy to see if it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:38.200\nWe're checking to see if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:46.000\nTests aren\u2019t just for school! Doctors give you tests to check your health, and engineers test bridges to make sure they\u2019re strong enough to hold traffic.\n\n00:46.000 --> 01:02.400\nSo, a test is simply a way to gather information and learn something new. To sum it up, tests help us understand things better, whether it's our knowledge, the safety of a product, or even our own health.\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
