    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:26.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information or see how well something performs. Think about it like this: when you take a spelling test at school, it's designed to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:34.900\nOr, if you're trying out a new recipe, you're essentially \"testing\" it to see if you like the way it tastes.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.200\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a simple test! You're seeing if it does what it's supposed to do: light up.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:53.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something or check if something is working correctly. It's about gathering information.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
