    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_084639.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:25.000\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:32.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy, or a chef tastes their soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:40.500\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:46.500\nMaybe it's a quiz on the alphabet, or a spelling test, or even a physical education test where you show how well you can throw a ball.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:51.400\nThe results of these tests help guide you and your teacher on what to work on next.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:53.300\nSo remember, a test isn't just about grades, it's about learning and growing!\n```"
  },
  "3b8a4b0a-3bf9-4aa8-a76b-2e3e2420783b": {
    "id": "3b8a4b0a-3bf9-4aa8-a76b-2e3e2420783b",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:19:17.245819",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-04T08:47:27.236688",
