    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_084727.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore the concept of a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:27.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words. A taste test lets you decide which food you like best.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:42.800\nEven pressing a button to see if a light turns on is a type of test! So, whether it's a school exam, a medical screening, or even just trying a new recipe, you're using a test to gather information.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:53.000\nTests help us understand things better and make informed decisions. In short, a test is a method for gathering information about something.\n\n00:53.000 --> 01:00.400\nIt's a simple but powerful tool we use every day. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
