    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:18.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you poke them with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\nOr maybe you want to see if your plant needs water, so you stick your finger in the soil.\nAnother test!\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:26.600\nTests are used all the time, everywhere.\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\nTeachers use tests to see what you've learned.\nEven scientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.400\nSo, a test is just a simple way to find out information about something.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:37.800\nIn a nutshell, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:47.900\nIn a nutshell: check something, find information, learn and understand\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
