    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_084856.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:18.400\nThink of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:23.800\nWe use tests all the time! At school, you take tests to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:31.200\nBut it's not just about school. A doctor might run tests to check your health. Or a company might test a new product to make sure it works correctly.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:37.800\nSo, a school exam is a test. A blood test is a test.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:47.100\nEven trying out a new recipe to see if you like it is a kind of test! Basically, a test is just a method for gathering information and learning more.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:50.700\nWe use them to understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
