    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.900\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:24.200\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:27.800\nSee? It's all about finding out information.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.600\nAnother common example is testing a new recipe. You follow the instructions, and then you taste it to see if it's good!\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:52.100\nIf it's not, you might adjust the recipe and test it again. So, to recap, a test is a process used to gather information and check if something is accurate, correct, or functioning as it should. Simple as that!\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
