    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:12.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:26.800\nIt's a process we use to see if something is true, or to measure how well something works. Think of it like this: if you want to know if your cookies are done, you might test them by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:38.600\nIf it comes out clean, they're ready! Or, if you want to know if your bicycle brakes work, you test them by squeezing the levers and seeing if the bike stops.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:49.100\nWe use tests all the time, in all sorts of ways. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:58.100\nSo remember, a test is just a way to find out something important. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
