    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_085504.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:33.600\nTests aren't just for school! You might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or test a toy to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:43.200\nIn school, a test helps your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:52.700\nLet's say you're learning about animals. A test might ask you to name different animals or explain what they eat. If you get the answers right, it shows you understand animals!\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check your knowledge or see if something works. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
