    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_085553.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:03.500\nToday we're talking about something super important: tests.\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:06.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:07.300\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:13.700\nThe main idea behind a test is to see if you've understood the information you've been learning.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:19.500\nIt helps you, and your teachers, figure out what you're good at and what you might need a little more practice with.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:28.600\nFor example, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of animals or describe what they eat.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:32.600\nOr, if you're learning about numbers, it could be a simple addition problem.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:41.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn better. It shows you where you shine and where you can grow.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:43.800\nDon't be afraid of them!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:46.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
