    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.600\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, maybe in school, but what exactly is a test?\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:30.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:36.900\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:46.500\nThat toothpick is your test! If it comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:58.000\nOr, if you want to see if a lightbulb works, you screw it into a lamp. If it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:05.500\nTests can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The important thing is they help us understand something better. So, a test is just a way to check things out.\n\n01:05.500 --> 01:07.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
