    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.350\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.350 --> 00:02.780\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:02.780 --> 00:04.940\nNow, a test is simply a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:04.940 --> 00:07.980\nThink of it like a quick way to see how well something works or how much you know.\n\n00:07.980 --> 00:09.820\nThere are all kinds of tests.\n\n00:09.820 --> 00:12.810\nYou might take a spelling test in school to see how well you remember words.\n\n00:12.810 --> 00:16.610\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:16.610 --> 00:22.460\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 a test to see if you can follow the recipe and make something delicious!\n\n00:22.460 --> 00:27.230\nSo, examples of tests are school exams, medical checkups, or even trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:27.230 --> 00:30.730\nTests help us understand things better and learn from our mistakes.\n\n00:30.730 --> 00:34.880\nIn short, a test is just a method of evaluation.\n\n00:34.880 --> 00:38.090\nIt helps us measure, assess, and learn.\n\n00:38.090 --> 00:39.880\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
