    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.900\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it as a question we're asking to get an answer. For example, a math test helps us see how well you understand numbers and calculations.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:36.900\nA taste test helps us decide which food tastes best. Or, think about a doctor checking your temperature \u2013 that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:50.300\nWe use tests every day, even without realizing it! When you decide which route to take to school, you're testing which one is faster.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.800\nSo, remember, tests are just tools to gather information and learn more about the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
