    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into the very basics of a test.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:29.200\nIt's all about gathering information or figuring something out. So, if you're taking a spelling test at school, it's checking how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:40.800\nOr, if a baker is tasting their cake batter, that's a test to see if it tastes good enough.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:55.900\nAnother example, maybe you're trying a new route to school. That's a test to see if it's faster than the old one. Basically, a test is just a way to find out something you don't already know, by asking a question, trying something out, or checking something over.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
