    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:10.500\nWhat are they? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:22.300\nIt could be a quiz in school, a medical exam, or even just checking if your phone is working. The main idea behind a test is to gather information.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:37.400\nWe want to see if something is true, false, working properly, or meeting a certain standard. Think of it like this: you might test the water temperature before jumping in a pool to see if it's comfortable.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:44.800\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. Tests help us make decisions.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:53.100\nIf your phone fails a test, you know it needs to be fixed. If you pass a test at school, you know you've learned something!\n\n00:53.100 --> 01:04.300\nSo, tests are tools that give us information to understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
