    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:06.400\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:10.900\nIt helps us measure knowledge, skill, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:17.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:22.700\nA taste test helps decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:28.700\nOr, a stress test on a bridge confirms it can handle heavy loads.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:33.400\nSo, whether it's a quiz in school, a product review, or a medical examination, a test provides information.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.000\nIt gives us a result that we can use to make decisions or learn more.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:47.600\nBasically, a test is just a structured way to gather information and see where things stand.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "13c012e4-833a-4a8d-944f-7672ec6ffe08": {
    "id": "13c012e4-833a-4a8d-944f-7672ec6ffe08",
    "topic": "Test",
