    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_091456.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey there, and welcome! Ever heard the word \"test\" used in different ways?\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.600\nWell, at its core, a test is really just a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and looking for the answer.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:20.400\nThink about it. A science test in school checks what you've learned.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:29.000\nA taste test tells you if you like a new flavor. And even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if it works!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:43.500\nSo, whether you're testing your knowledge, testing a product, or even testing your skills, the basic idea is the same: you're putting something to the test to see what happens or what you discover.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.800\nTests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. In a nutshell, a test is a method for determining something.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:59.900\nIt's an evaluation or a procedure designed to reveal information.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:02.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
