    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.800\nA test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:27.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how much you've learned.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:36.700\nBut tests aren't just for school. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Even bakers test their cake to make sure it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:51.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A blood test tells a doctor what's going on inside your body. And poking a cake with a fork is a test to see if it's ready to eat.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:57.900\nSo, a test is simply a method of finding out information, whether it's about your knowledge, your health, or even a delicious cake. It helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
