    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_092047.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:22.000\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate something, anything really!\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.300\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:32.600\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:43.900\nSee? Different situations, but the same idea. Tests help us understand, measure, and learn.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:46.100\nThey give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:49.700\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a simple way of finding something out!\n```"
