    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:13.700\nWhat are they, and why do we even need them?\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:21.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly or if someone understands something.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:37.000\nIt's like a little investigation! Think about it this way: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:46.600\nTests can be written questions, like in school, or they can be practical, like checking if a lightbulb turns on.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:51.900\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:54.600\nIt helps us know if we're on the right track, or if we need to make some changes.\n```"
