    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.200\nIt's a process designed to give us information about something specific. Think of it like this: a taste test for ice cream.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:28.700\nYou try a spoonful to see if you like the flavor. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:37.600\nEven a simple quiz at school is a test to see what you've learned. So, a test is really just a question or a procedure.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:46.500\nWe use it to gather data, measure something, or confirm something.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:56.300\nWhether it's checking if a lightbulb works or solving a math problem, it's all about finding answers.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.100\nRemember, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n```"
