    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_092606.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:25.300\nIt's like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests to see if something is working correctly, or to learn more about it.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:36.500\nThink about it like this: a taste test is a test to see if you like a certain food. Or, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:48.300\nIn science, a test might be used to see how plants grow in different conditions.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:53.900\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a medical examination, or trying out a new recipe, a test is simply a method for gathering information.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.400\nIt helps us understand things better. That's the basic idea of a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
