    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:33.900\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, if we've learned something new, or even what our preferences are.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:45.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, your teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understood the lesson.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:53.500\nEven trying a new flavor of ice cream is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:58.100\nSo, in short, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: question, answer, learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
