    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.800\nA test is really just a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: if you're learning your ABCs, a quiz is a test to see if you remember them.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:36.900\nTests aren't just for school, though! Imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:51.100\nOr, if you're building a birdhouse, you might give it a little shake to test if it's sturdy enough.\n\n00:51.100 --> 01:00.900\nSo, tests help us learn and improve things. Whether it\u2019s a spelling test, a taste test, or even testing out a new toy, tests are all about finding out information.\n\n01:00.900 --> 01:03.900\nIn short, a test is a method of evaluation.\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:08.700\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:08.700 --> 01:12.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
