    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.700\nIt's like asking a question and trying to get the right answer. Think about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:33.700\nOr, if you're playing a game, each level is a test of your skills. Tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:43.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or your teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:49.400\nSo, tests aren't always scary! They're just tools to help us figure things out.\n\n00:49.400 --> 01:01.700\nIn short, a test is a method of evaluation. They come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to provide information and measure understanding.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:05.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
