    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.100\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something. Think of it as a structured way to gather information.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:21.900\nWe use tests all the time. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:31.600\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject. A chef might even taste a dish to test if it needs more salt!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:43.100\nSo, tests can involve questions, tasks, or even observations. The results help us make decisions or understand something better.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:50.700\nWhether it's checking your knowledge, your health, or even the flavor of your food, tests are everywhere.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:60.200\nBasically, a test is just a process to get information and learn something new. We hope this helped you understand what a test is!\n\n00:60.200 --> 00:63.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
