    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.800\nIt's like a quiz, but it doesn't always have to be about school. Think about it: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it\u2019s done.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:31.300\nThat\u2019s a test! Or, if your car won't start, the mechanic might run a test to figure out what\u2019s wrong.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:44.000\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you\u2019ve learned. But in everyday life, tests help us make sure things are working correctly or to find out new information.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:49.000\nSo, a test is really just a way to check, learn, and understand.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
