    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.300\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your lightbulb works, so you flip the switch. That flip of the switch and the resulting light, or lack of it, is a test.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:32.200\nWe use tests all the time! Before baking a cake, you might test the oven temperature.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:45.900\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you can balance. Even when a doctor checks your reflexes, that's a test to see if your nerves are responding properly.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:54.700\nBasically, a test gives us information to help us understand something better and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple check!\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:02.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
