    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows you how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:37.100\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie is your favorite! In school, tests often involve answering questions,\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:51.400\nbut tests can also be practical, like testing your driving skills. The goal of a test is to measure something and give us information.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.000\nSo, to recap: a test helps us learn where we stand, whether it's knowing your letters, or knowing your favorite flavor. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
