    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: the concept of a test.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:25.800\nIt's a process designed to gather information.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:34.200\nThink of it like this: you\u2019re baking a cake, and you use a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.600\nThat toothpick test tells you if the cake is ready.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:52.600\nOr, imagine you\u2019re learning to ride a bike. Each time you try, you\u2019re testing your balance and coordination.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:59.200\nThe result, whether you stay upright or fall, gives you information about your progress.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:04.800\nTests aren\u2019t just for school or baking.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:10.200\nThey\u2019re everywhere!\n\n01:10.200 --> 01:16.200\nThey help us understand the world around us, learn new skills, and make informed decisions.\n\n01:16.200 --> 01:23.600\nSo remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n01:23.600 --> 01:25.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
