    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of a quiz at school, but in general, a test is really just a way of finding something out.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:29.100\nIt's a way of checking if something is true, or if something works the way it's supposed to. Think about it like this: you might test if a lightbulb works by screwing it into a lamp.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:40.700\nOr, a doctor might test your reflexes to see if your nervous system is healthy. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like the way it tastes!\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:49.900\nSo, a test is simply a procedure that helps us gather information and draw conclusions. It helps us answer questions.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:59.000\nIn short, a test is a way to learn something new by trying something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
