    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.000\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if we understand something. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:31.300\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:35.300\nAnother example is testing a lightbulb.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:42.900\nYou plug it in to see if it lights up! That's a test! So, a test is just a way of checking something.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:50.300\nIt gives us information and helps us make decisions. Remember, testing is about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
