    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking. You do a test \u2013 you poke them with a toothpick!\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:34.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, they pass the test; they're ready! In school, tests help us see how much we've learned.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:43.600\nMaybe it's a multiple-choice quiz, or a written exam. The goal is to see if we understand the material.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:50.200\nOutside of school, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:50.200 --> 01:01.600\nOr, a mechanic might test your car to find out what's wrong. So, tests are everywhere! They help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n01:01.600 --> 01:05.100\nThey\u2019re simply a way to get information and confirm if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n01:05.100 --> 01:08.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
