    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.800\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in general, a test is simply a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like this: if you buy a new lightbulb, you test it by screwing it in to see if it lights up.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:31.000\nAnother example: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if your body is healthy.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:46.600\nCar mechanics test engines to find out if they need repairs. So basically, a test is just a way of figuring something out, checking to make sure things are working correctly, or finding out more information.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:58.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it! So, to recap, tests help us understand how things work and if they're working properly.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
