    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_094351.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:06.900\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us measure knowledge, skills, or even abilities.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:19.500\nThink of it like this:\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:31.700\nyou want to know if a plant needs water.\nYou check the soil.\nThat's a test!\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:41.000\nIt can be a quiz, a written exam, or even a practical demonstration.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:47.800\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words.\nA math test shows how well you can solve problems.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:51.400\nAnd a cooking test shows how well you can follow a recipe.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:54.800\nSo, a test is just a tool.\nA way to gather information and see where we stand.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:57.700\nIt can help us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
