    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_094440.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat are they?\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have the flu.\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:36.900\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a type of test.\nSo is a written exam, or even a practical demonstration where you show someone how to do something.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:45.400\nThe results of a test give you information.\nThey tell you how well you understand the topic or how skilled you are at a task.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:55.900\nSo, to recap: a test is a tool for measuring something.\nIt can be a quiz, an exam, or a demonstration.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:03.600\nAnd the results help you understand your strengths and weaknesses.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
