    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find something out.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done.\nYou do a test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:31.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you the cake is ready!\nOr, imagine you\u2019re trying to figure out if it\u2019s raining outside.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:34.400\nThe test? You look out the window!\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:42.200\nThe result tells you whether to grab an umbrella.\nSo, a test involves doing something to get information.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:52.800\nIt could be a question, an action, or even just observation.\nUltimately, tests help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
