    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:20.600\nIt's a process designed to gather information. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:25.900\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to check if it needs more salt. See? Both are tests!\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:30.400\nTests can come in many forms. A school exam is a test of your knowledge.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.800\nClicking a button on a website to see if it works is a test. Even just observing something to see what happens is a form of testing.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:52.500\nSo, to recap: a test is a procedure used to gather information and see how something works or what the results are. Pretty straightforward, right?\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
