    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_094832.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:19.400\nThink of it like a quick check-up! We use tests all the time.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:30.200\nA spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your words. A taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:41.300\nEven a simple question like, \"Are you feeling okay?\" is a mini-test to check on someone's health.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:49.500\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz, a survey, or even trying out a new recipe, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:53.100\nThey're a fundamental part of learning and understanding the world around us. Remember, a test is just a tool! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
