    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:22.900\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it! Think of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:33.300\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:39.900\nEven tasting a new food is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you like the flavor!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:47.700\nTests help us understand things better. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:55.500\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information or checking something out. Pretty simple, right?\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:01.700\nIn summary, a test helps us learn more about something, whether it's our health, our knowledge, or even just our taste in food. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "bb903c8f-6e5e-4a6b-9298-043ccfd07ae1": {
    "id": "bb903c8f-6e5e-4a6b-9298-043ccfd07ae1",
