    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_095422.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done, so you poke them with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:26.600\nMore formally, a test is just a procedure to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:38.800\nIt could be a multiple-choice quiz at school, a driving exam to see if you can safely operate a car, or even a simple taste test to see if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:50.000\nThe key thing is that a test gives you information. It helps you understand something better, whether it\u2019s your own understanding of a subject or the quality of a product.\n\n00:50.000 --> 01:00.100\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to learn and evaluate. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
