    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.900\nA test is simply a way to find out something. It's a method we use to check or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the effectiveness of a new medicine.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:30.900\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test helps you decide which cookie is the tastiest. Doctors use tests to figure out what might be making you sick.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:35.900\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:43.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure designed to gather information.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:51.100\nIt helps us understand, evaluate, and make decisions. It's a tool for learning and improvement.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
