    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.899\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.899 --> 00:17.599\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process, usually with questions or tasks, designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even your attitude about something.\n\n00:17.599 --> 00:26.599\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling. A taste test tells you which flavor you like best. Or even a medical test can show if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.599 --> 00:33.599\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes! The important thing is they help us understand something better by giving us a way to measure it.\n\n00:33.599 --> 00:42.399\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:42.399 --> 00:45.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
