    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:15.700\nA test, in simple terms, is a way to find out something.\nIt's a method we use to gather information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:29.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a checkup \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake and taste it to see if it needs more sugar \u2013 that\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:45.100\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like seeing if your shoes fit.\nThe main goal is always the same: to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:55.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking things out and getting answers.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
