    "updated_at": "2026-01-04T10:06:06.116886",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260104_100606.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_100606.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:22.600\nA test, simply put, is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:29.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy, or a chef tastes their soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:38.400\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned and what you might need more help with.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:48.000\nThey can come in many forms.\nMaybe it\u2019s a multiple-choice quiz, a written exam, or even a practical demonstration.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:57.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words.\nA math test sees if you understand how to solve equations.\nAnd a science test might ask you about the different parts of a plant.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:03.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure something.\nIt helps us learn and grow.\n\n01:03.600 --> 01:09.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "5207e58a-c482-4b9f-90a1-1a23b7cf8207": {
    "id": "5207e58a-c482-4b9f-90a1-1a23b7cf8207",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:20:19.621912",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-04T10:06:45.954726",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260104_100645.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_100645.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.900\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out. Think of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:26.100\nWe use tests all the time! For example, when you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:37.000\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:50.400\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a type of test! So, whether it's checking if a cake is ready, seeing how well you understand something, or making sure a lightbulb shines, a test is all about gathering information.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:56.900\nIt helps us understand something better. In short, a test is a way to learn and improve!\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
