    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_100730.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.278 --> 00:04.128\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.128 --> 00:05.068\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.758 --> 00:06.878\nNow, what is a test?\n\n00:06.878 --> 00:10.048\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.048 --> 00:12.398\nIt's a process we use to gather information\n\n00:12.398 --> 00:14.988\nor check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:15.488 --> 00:18.608\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test\n\n00:18.608 --> 00:20.488\nto see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.948 --> 00:24.648\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test\n\n00:24.648 --> 00:25.358\nif it needs more sugar.\n\n00:25.818 --> 00:28.548\nWe run tests all the time without even realizing it!\n\n00:28.968 --> 00:33.918\nAnother example could be checking if a light bulb works before you screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:34.278 --> 00:35.308\nThat's a test!\n\n00:35.308 --> 00:37.218\nYou're seeing if it lights up.\n\n00:37.748 --> 00:41.368\nTests help us make informed decisions and solve problems.\n\n00:41.778 --> 00:44.858\nThey're a fundamental part of learning and discovery.\n\n00:45.368 --> 00:48.268\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:48.788 --> 00:53.598\nIt helps us gather information and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:53.598 --> 00:55.868\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "10335f9a-2ff1-4ddf-8320-8f7dc9d8cf8f": {
