    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:27.000\nIt's how we check if things are working as they should, or if we understand something properly.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:37.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:42.700\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:47.600\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:52.500\nFor example, a light switch is tested to make sure it turns the light on and off.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:57.200\nA spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. See? Tests are everywhere!\n```"
