    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working, how well something performs, or even what something is made of.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a check-up. That's a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:32.700\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. Tasting it is a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:42.900\nTests are everywhere! We test recipes, we test new products, even playing a game is a kind of test to see how good you are.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:52.000\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new. And that's the basic idea behind a test!\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
