    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:17.500\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:23.500\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:32.300\nYou screw it in, flip the switch, and see if it lights up!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:34.100\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:38.500\nAnother example?\nMaybe your doctor checks your temperature.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:42.900\nThat's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:48.200\nOr when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:51.600\nSo, tests help us measure things and get information.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.800\nWhether it's checking a lightbulb, taking your temperature, or answering questions in class, a test helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
