    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_101109.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.300\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:32.500\nA taste test tells you which food tastes better.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:44.500\nEven trying to fix a broken toy is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing different solutions to see what works!\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:55.600\nSo, whether it's answering questions in school, trying out a new recipe, or figuring out why your computer isn't working, you're performing a test. It\u2019s all about gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.200\nIn short, a test helps us understand things better by giving us information we didn't have before. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
