    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_101236.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:27.900\nTests aren't just for people, though!\nYou can test a toy to see if it works, or test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:40.600\nFor example, you might test a new toy car by pushing it to see how far it goes.\nThat's a test!\nOr, you might test a cake recipe by baking it and tasting it.\nAnother test!\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:46.800\nSo, a test is just a way to explore and learn something new.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:52.900\nIt helps us figure things out!\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
