    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something really fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:20.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information or evaluate something. Think of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:24.500\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:32.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. A doctor might give you a blood test to check your health. A teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:43.700\nAnd even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it. Basically, a test helps us answer a question or make a decision based on evidence.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:55.500\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz or a science experiment, a test is all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
