    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.500\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's a method we use to gather information, like checking if something is working correctly, or seeing how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:30.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, your teacher might give you a quiz to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:37.600\nEven baking a cake is kind of like a test! You're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:54.300\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to learn something new. From checking your spelling to evaluating a new product, tests are a fundamental part of how we learn and improve.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
