    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:13.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It could be testing if a light bulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:32.100\nThe answer is either \"yes, it lights up\" or \"no, it doesn't.\" Or, maybe you're taking a quiz at school. That test helps your teacher see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:40.500\nAnother example is when a doctor orders a blood test. That helps them learn about your health.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:48.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information. It's about discovering something new or confirming something you already suspect.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
