    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.500\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:36.000\nOr maybe you test a recipe to see if it tastes good! Tests can be written, like a quiz, or hands-on, like trying to fix something.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:46.000\nThe important thing is that they give you information. They help you understand what you know, what you don't know, and what needs improvement.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:55.800\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a tool to learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
