    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.300\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in general, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:27.000\nIt's a process to check if something is working, or to see what its properties are. Think about it like this: a taste test is a test to see how something tastes.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:36.100\nA doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Even trying a new recipe for the first time is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:44.300\nSo, a test is really just an investigation. It's a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.000\nTo recap, it's all about checking, exploring, and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
