    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_101933.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, but instead of mixing chemicals, we're trying to measure or evaluate.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:22.500\nSo, what are we testing?\nWell, it could be anything!\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:30.000\nMaybe a teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class.\nOr a doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:34.200\nLet's say you're baking a cake.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:43.500\nYou might taste the batter.\nThat's a mini-test to see if it needs more sugar!\nOr, imagine a toy company testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.800\nBasically, a test is a way to gather information and make a decision based on that information.\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
