    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:33.100\nTests help us gather information.\nThey can be used to measure skills, knowledge, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:45.400\nFor instance, a chef might taste a soup \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more salt!\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for finding things out.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:52.200\nWe use them all the time, in all sorts of situations.\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
