    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_102129.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:21.800\nIt could be checking if you understand a concept, like in a school test. Or it could be checking if something works properly, like testing a new toy.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:30.400\nBasically, a test gives you information. Think of it like this: If you bake a cake and then taste it, that's a test!\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:38.400\nYou're checking if it tastes good. Or, if you try to turn on a light switch and the light comes on, that's a test that the lightbulb works.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:47.100\nTests help us learn and improve things. By testing, we can figure out what's working well and what needs to be fixed.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:55.700\nSo, a test is just a way to check something and get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
