    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.800\nOkay, so you're wondering, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.800 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:13.500\nIt\u2019s a process designed to gather information and measure a specific skill, knowledge, or ability.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:17.800\nThink of it like this: a test is like a detective looking for clues!\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:24.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:28.800\nA taste test helps us decide which flavor of ice cream we like best.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:33.400\nAnd a medical test can help a doctor figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.200\nSo, remember, a test isn't something to be scared of. It\u2019s just a tool we use to learn and understand things better.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:47.000\nIt helps us see where we are, and where we might need to improve.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:55.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
