    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.400\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:27.000\nEssentially, a test helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:36.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A doctor might order a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:45.900\nSo, whether it's checking a cake, your spelling, or your health, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:52.800\nThey're all about finding out the truth! In short, a test is just a method for checking something.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
