    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process used to evaluate knowledge, skill, or performance.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy. A teacher uses tests to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:35.100\nA software developer uses tests to see if their code works correctly. For example, a simple quiz with multiple-choice questions is a test.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:43.200\nRunning a program to see if it crashes is a test. Even checking if a light bulb turns on is a kind of test!\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:54.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to check or evaluate something. It helps us understand how well something works or how much someone knows.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
