    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_103000.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: the test.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information. It helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or even how much of something we have.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy. A baker tests the cake batter to make sure it's ready to bake.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:40.200\nAnd you take tests in school to show what you've learned. So, whether it's a quiz, a blood sample, or even just trying out a new recipe, all these things are tests. They give us valuable information.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:47.300\nA test is simply a method for gathering and understanding data.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:56.000\nTo recap, tests help us learn, diagnose, and improve things. They are a fundamental part of our world.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
