    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nNo need to worry, it\u2019s not that kind of test! In this case, a test is simply a way of checking if something is working as it should.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like this: you get a new toy and you turn it on. That's a test to see if it powers up.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:27.200\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:37.200\nIf it comes out clean, that's a test to see if the cake is done. Tests help us know if things are good, or if we need to fix something.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:47.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to check if something is working correctly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
