    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\nThink of it like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:25.400\nWe use tests all the time!\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:33.600\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is broken, you might try turning it on.\nAgain, a test!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:43.300\nSo, a test is simply a way to confirm something is working or to find out if something is true or false.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:51.300\nWe run tests to see if our ideas are right, if our products are working, and even to learn new things.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:59.200\nIn short, tests help us understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
