    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing if you get the right answer.\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if we understand something.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:35.000\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:41.700\nOr, think about a spelling test at school \u2013 that checks if you know how to spell certain words correctly.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:48.400\nEven baking a cake involves a little test!\nYou check if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:48.400 --> 01:00.100\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:07.300\nIn short, a test is just a way to find out information by checking something.\n\n01:07.300 --> 01:10.900\nThanks for watching!\n\n01:10.900 --> 01:14.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
