    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.910\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.910 --> 00:03.700\nToday we\u2019re going to explore something super important: tests.\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:05.590\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.590 --> 00:08.350\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:08.350 --> 00:11.130\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's just right.\n\n00:11.130 --> 00:11.950\nThat's a test!\n\n00:11.950 --> 00:16.650\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:16.650 --> 00:22.400\nThey can be written tests with questions, or even practical tests where you show what you can do.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:26.760\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills, while a cooking test shows if you can follow a recipe.\n\n00:26.760 --> 00:32.010\nTests are a useful way to learn and improve.\n\n00:32.010 --> 00:35.210\nThey help us see where we\u2019re doing well and what we need to practice more.\n\n00:35.210 --> 00:39.120\nSo, remember, tests aren\u2019t scary; they\u2019re just tools for learning!\n\n00:39.120 --> 00:41.150\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
