    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.900\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:24.600\nIt could be about you, about a product, or even about an idea. Think of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.500\nA baker tests their cake to make sure it tastes good. And a scientist tests a new medicine to see if it works.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:46.100\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and make informed decisions. They can be simple, like tasting a cookie, or more complex, like taking a school exam.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:54.000\nBut the goal is always the same: to learn something new. So, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
