    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:12.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:16.500\nThink of it like a check-up.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:23.300\nImagine you're learning to ride a bike. A test might be seeing if you can ride all the way down the street without falling.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:29.400\nOr, if you're baking a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:34.700\nTests help us understand what we're good at and what we need to work on.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:38.500\nThey're a chance to learn and improve.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:44.400\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school or trying out a new recipe, remember that tests are all about learning.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:46.800\nThey give us information.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:50.600\nBasically, a test is just a way to see how things are going!\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
