    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_105448.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:20.400\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to check or evaluate something, like your knowledge, a skill, or even how well something works.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:36.900\nThat's a test! Or, if you want to know if you understand a new concept, you might try answering some questions about it.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:47.300\nThat's another test! Tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the temperature of your bathwater.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:55.800\nThe important thing is that they give you information. They help you learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:04.500\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
