    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:22.000\nWe use tests all the time to measure or evaluate different things. Think about it: a spelling test checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:30.400\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is the yummiest. And even a doctor might run tests to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.300\nSo, tests help us gather information. For example, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:45.900\nYou might test the oven temperature to make sure it's hot enough. Or you might test the batter's consistency to see if it's smooth enough.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:55.500\nBasically, a test is just a method for getting answers. It's a way to learn more about something by observing it or trying it out.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
