    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else. Think of it like asking a question, and the answer you get is the result of the test.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:20.500\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:26.100\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might take a toothpick and poke it in to see if the cake is done. That's a test!\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:30.700\nThe toothpick comes out clean? The cake passes the test!\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:35.300\nAnother example? A doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:40.300\nThey might check your temperature, or listen to your heart.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.600\nThese are all tests that give them information. So, remember, a test is a method to gather information about something. It's a question and an answer, helping us understand the world around us.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
