    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake. You test the cake by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:26.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, your cake is done. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:31.900\nAnother example: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:41.000\nThey might take your temperature, or run blood work. These are all tests to understand more about your body.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:50.600\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a method of checking something. It helps us confirm if something is right, works properly, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:57.200\nA cake, your health, even a lightbulb can be tested!\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
