    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:16.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like this.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:28.700\nMaybe your doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy. That's a test!\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:32.700\nOr, imagine you\u2019re taking a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:36.700\nThat\u2019s another kind of test.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:40.700\nTests aren't just for people, though.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:49.500\nYou could test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, a car company might test a new car to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:52.900\nSee? Tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see where things stand.\n\n00:56.400 --> 00:59.400\nIt can be about anything from your health to your knowledge. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
