    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.000\nWe use tests to see if something is working correctly, or to check our understanding of a topic.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:28.700\nThink of it like checking if your lightbulb works. You flip the switch \u2013 that's the test!\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:35.000\nIf the light turns on, it passes the test. If it doesn't, it fails.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.600\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. In science, tests help us prove or disprove ideas.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:48.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:58.400\nSo, tests are everywhere. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:02.400\nThey are a crucial part of any learning or development process.\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:05.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
