    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_110630.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\nYou can test it by poking it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:33.500\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\nIt's like a little quiz to show what you understand.\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even writing an essay.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:39.900\nAnother example is a doctor giving you a checkup.\nThey're running tests to make sure you're healthy!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:51.200\nThey might check your temperature or listen to your heart.\nSo, a test is just a process to see if something meets a certain standard or if it's working correctly.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:58.400\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
