    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_110848.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:14.800\nNow, a test, at its most basic, is just a way to find out something. It's a procedure we use to gather information.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like this: you take a cookie out of the oven to test if it's done. You're checking for doneness!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:33.100\nTests can be simple, like that cookie test, or a little more complicated. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:37.400\nOr you might take a quiz in school to test your knowledge.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:42.500\nSee? Tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:47.600\nThey give us answers.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:57.600\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to get information. It's a procedure to find something out.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:00.400\nWhether it's baking cookies, checking your health, or learning in school,\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:04.000\ntests play a role in helping us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
