    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:18.200\nThat question could be about anything!\nAre you ready to go outside?\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:22.000\nThat\u2019s a test.\nYou look at the weather and see if it\u2019s raining.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:25.800\nIs this cake delicious?\nYou taste it and decide.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:36.100\nMore formally, a test helps us check if something is true or false.\nFor example, a math test checks if you understand numbers.\nA science experiment tests if your idea about how something works is correct.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:50.500\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and answer a question.\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:56.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
