    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_111034.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:21.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on. That's a test!\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:27.600\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Your teacher giving you a quiz?\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:31.500\nThat\u2019s a test! A doctor checking your temperature?\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.700\nThat's a test too! They\u2019re both trying to figure out something specific.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:40.500\nAnother example? Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:44.300\nTasting it to see if it's sweet enough is a test!\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:49.900\nYou're testing the flavor. So, remember, a test is just a method for finding out information or verifying something.\n\n00:49.900 --> 01:03.300\nIt can be a quiz, a medical checkup, or even just tasting your cooking. Tests help us learn and make sure things are working as expected.\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:11.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
