    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.700\nSimple as that: what is a test? Basically, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:21.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. So, you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:26.300\nThe toothpick helps you test if the cake is cooked through.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:30.600\nAnother example? Let's say you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:34.900\nA test would be trying to ride without training wheels.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:42.000\nIf you can stay upright, you pass the test! So, a test can be a question, an experiment, or really anything that helps you gather information and see if something is true or working correctly.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:49.100\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
