    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something fundamental:\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:03.600\na test.\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:11.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:13.600\nYou might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:14.200\nThat's a test!\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:16.900\nThe toothpick tells you if the cake is cooked through.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:21.700\nAnother example? A doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:28.400\nOr imagine a teacher giving you a quiz. That quiz is a test to see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:36.400\nSo, a test is just a process, a way of gathering information to answer a question or solve a problem.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:38.000\nIt helps us learn more!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:41.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
