    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.200\nIt helps us see if something is true, or how well something works. Think of it like this: you might test a cake recipe by baking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:31.900\nOr, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people. Tests can be used for all sorts of things!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:42.800\nFor example, a teacher gives you a test to see how much you\u2019ve learned in class. Or, a doctor runs tests to figure out what\u2019s making you feel sick.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:53.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. Basically, we use tests to check things out!\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
