    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_111742.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.700\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:29.600\nIt's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even your physical condition.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:38.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:50.200\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. And a medical test can help doctors figure out if you're healthy.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:59.300\nSo, tests aren't always scary exams. They're just tools we use to learn more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:03.000\nThey help us understand what we know, what we can do, and what we might need to work on.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:05.600\nBasically, a test is just a way of asking questions and getting answers.\n\n01:05.600 --> 01:09.300\nIt's a fundamental part of learning and understanding.\n\n01:09.300 --> 01:12.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
