    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of testing.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.900\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.400\nIt's like a little experiment to make sure everything is doing what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:34.800\nFor example, you might test if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.800\nOr maybe you test if a recipe tastes good by trying a small bite. These are simple tests!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:52.600\nTesting helps us find problems early on so we can fix them before they cause bigger issues. Imagine not testing a new toy before giving it to a child!\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.200\nWe want to be sure it's safe and fun. So, remember, a test is just a way to check if something works.\n```"
  },
