    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_112122.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is, in a really simple way.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:14.600\nThink of a test as a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:21.600\nFor example, a simple test could be squeezing a lemon. You're testing to see if it has juice!\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:27.800\nOr, think about baking a cake. You're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:37.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you\u2019ve learned. In science, tests help us prove or disprove ideas.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:51.300\nSo, basically, a test is just a way of finding something out. Whether it's the juiciness of a lemon or what you know about history, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:54.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
