    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_112203.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:13.700\nA test, in the simplest terms, is a way to check something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\nYou turn it on, and that's your test!\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:27.600\nTests are used everywhere to make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:33.100\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:38.500\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:43.900\nImagine baking a cake.\nYou might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:52.900\nOr, think about a game.\nEach level is a test of your skills.\nIf you pass, you move on!\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:54.800\nSo, a test is just a way to find out if something is working, if something is true, or if something is good enough.\nTests help us learn and improve things all the time.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
