    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works, or if it's true.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like this: you might test a new lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:32.900\nThat's a test! In school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:39.600\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even asking you to solve a problem.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:46.300\nLet's say you learned about addition. A test might ask you what 2 plus 2 equals.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:53.100\nIf you answer 4, you pass the test! Tests aren't just for school, though.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:58.700\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:02.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something.\n```"
