    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an answer, you're getting proof.\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:37.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:51.500\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\nThe test helps us see if it breaks easily or has any small parts that could be dangerous.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:57.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and make sure things are as they should be.\nIt\u2019s about confirming something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
