    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_112806.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:25.000\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.300\nThink of it as a friendly investigation! Tests help us understand how well something works, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:43.000\nFor example, you might test a cake recipe by baking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:50.700\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.900\nAnother example is when you try a new video game level. You're testing your skills to see if you can beat it!\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:08.700\nSo, tests are all about learning and figuring things out. They help us improve and make better decisions.\n\n01:08.700 --> 01:12.300\nIn short, a test is a way to get information and understand something better.\n\n01:12.300 --> 01:16.800\nIt's a super useful tool in all sorts of situations!\n\n01:16.800 --> 01:20.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
