    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like checking if your cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it. The toothpick is a tiny test!\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:33.400\nSo, tests aren't just for school. A chef might taste their soup to test if it has enough salt. A mechanic might run a diagnostic test on your car to see if everything is running smoothly.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:43.300\nEven trying out a new video game is a kind of test, seeing if you like it! Basically, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:50.500\nThey give us information about where we're strong and where we might need a little more practice or adjustment.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:58.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
