    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.800\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake. You taste it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:31.400\nYou're checking if it tastes good.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:36.700\nOr, imagine you're trying to turn on a light.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:41.300\nIf the light comes on, that's a test passed! You know the lightbulb works.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:45.900\nTests are used everywhere.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:52.900\nDoctors use tests to check your health. Teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:59.200\nEngineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:01.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking things.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:08.000\nIt can be as simple as tasting a cake or as complicated as launching a rocket.\n\n01:08.000 --> 01:11.000\nIt's all about finding out information.\n\n01:11.000 --> 01:14.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
