    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:23.800\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\nThink of it like this: you taste a new food to test if you like it.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:46.600\nOr, you try a different route to school to test if it's faster.\nIn school, tests are usually quizzes or exams that help your teacher understand what you've learned.\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve a problem, like \"What's two plus two?\"\nOr a spelling test might ask you to spell words like \"cat\" or \"dog.\"\nThe goal is to show what you know.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:55.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check your knowledge or try something out.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
