    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:25.300\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.200\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:41.100\nOr, if your doctor wants to check if you're healthy, they might run some blood tests.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:49.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. There are quizzes in school, driving tests for your license, and even taste tests for new food products.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:57.900\nThe key is that they all aim to give us information. They help us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to learn and improve.\n\n01:01.500 --> 01:05.100\nIt's a way of gathering information.\n\n01:05.100 --> 01:08.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
