    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_114056.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:36.200\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you\u2019re testing if it tastes good. Or, if you press the power button on your TV, you're testing if it turns on.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:45.200\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. But tests aren't just for school!\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:55.900\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for learning something, big or small. It's all about asking a question and finding the answer.\n```"
