    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:18.200\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:29.600\nThink of it like an experiment, but it can be anything from a school exam to trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:40.700\nThe main idea is to see how something performs or if something is true. We use tests to measure knowledge, skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:51.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills. Or, if you're baking a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:59.800\nEven doctors use tests to figure out what's going on inside your body. So, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and learn more about something. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
