    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it this way: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:29.700\nA chef might taste their food to test if it needs more salt. Or, you might take a quiz in school to test what you've learned.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:41.600\nSo, examples could be like a spelling test, where you show you know how to spell words. Or a taste test, where you decide which food tastes better.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:52.900\nThe goal of any test is just to get information. Basically, a test is a tool we use to learn, check, or understand something better.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:58.700\nIt helps us figure things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
