    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_114415.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:20.200\nIt\u2019s a process designed to gather information and see how well something performs or how much someone knows.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:31.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you can spell words.\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes best.\nSee?\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:35.900\nTests can be used in all sorts of situations.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.000\nFor example, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\nA company might test a new product to make sure it works correctly.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:57.300\nAnd you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\nSo, to recap, a test is just a structured way to learn something new or evaluate something we already have.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:06.100\nIt helps us make informed decisions and understand the world around us better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
