    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, and that's true.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:30.000\nBut in a broader sense, a test is really just a way of finding out something.\nIt's a process that helps us learn more about what we're looking at.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:40.300\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a lightbulb works, you test it by screwing it into a lamp and turning it on.\nIf it lights up, the test is successful!\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:55.300\nOr, if you're baking a cake and want to see if it's done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's your test telling you the cake is ready.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:01.700\nSo, a test is simply a way to gather information and see if something is working as expected, or if something is true.\nIt's a simple, but powerful tool. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
