    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_114950.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.100\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:25.700\nNow, you've probably taken lots of tests in school, but in general, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:36.300\nIt's a method or procedure for determining the presence, quality, or truth of something.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:40.800\nThink about it like this: a baking test.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:44.600\nYou taste the cake to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:49.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:53.400\nOr a weather test.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.800\nYou look outside to see if it's raining.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:02.200\nThat's another test!\n\n01:02.200 --> 01:06.600\nTests help us make decisions.\n\n01:06.600 --> 01:11.000\nIf the cake isn't sweet enough, add more sugar.\n\n01:11.000 --> 01:15.400\nIf it's raining, grab an umbrella.\n\n01:15.400 --> 01:23.100\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and learn something.\n\n01:23.100 --> 01:29.800\nIt can be anything from a school exam to checking the temperature.\n\n01:29.800 --> 01:36.200\nAnd that information helps us understand the world around us.\n\n01:36.200 --> 01:38.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
