    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:15.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to check something, to see if it's working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like checking if your bike tires have enough air. You're testing the tire pressure.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:29.100\nIn everyday life, you encounter tests all the time. A doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:40.400\nA teacher gives you a test in class to see how well you understand the material. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe and your skills!\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:51.200\nThe goal of a test is to give you information, so you can make improvements or adjustments.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:57.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a check. It helps us learn and get better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
