    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_115216.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.500\nNow, you might think of school, but a test is really just a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to check the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:37.400\nA chef tastes their soup to test the flavor. Or, a game developer plays their game to test for bugs.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:45.200\nSo, tests can be simple, like checking if the light switch works. Or they can be complex, like a science experiment.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:54.200\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They tell us if something is working as it should, or if it needs some improvement.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:00.400\nTests help us learn and make things better. That's the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
