    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us check our knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\nA taste test checks which food tastes better.\nOr, a strength test sees how much weight someone can lift.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:40.000\nSo, whether it's a quiz in school, a survey about your favorite color, or a medical check-up, all of these are examples of tests.\nThey give us information and help us make decisions.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:48.600\nBasically, a test is just a method for gathering information.\nAnd that information can be super useful!\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
