    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question, but often a more structured one.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it this way: you might test if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:29.800\nOr maybe you're taking a test in school to see how well you understand a subject.\nTests can be about anything.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:35.900\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\nA scientist might test a new medicine.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:46.100\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and learning something new.\nThey help us understand things better.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:52.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
