    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:26.800\nIt\u2019s a process we use to gather information and see how something works or performs. Think of it like this: you might test a new cookie recipe by baking a small batch to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:38.900\nOr, a doctor might run tests to figure out what\u2019s making you feel unwell. Tests can be anything from a quick experiment to a long, detailed investigation.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:54.000\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and understand. So, whether it\u2019s testing a new toy to see if it's safe, or testing a plant to see if it needs more water, tests are all about getting answers.\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:03.600\nThey help us make better decisions and improve things. To recap, a test is a way to gather information and see how something works.\n\n01:03.600 --> 01:08.300\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n01:08.300 --> 01:10.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
