    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like this: you might have a test in school to see how well you've learned the material.\nOr, you might test a new toy to see if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:37.400\nAnother example: A doctor might run some tests to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a baker might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:50.100\nSo, a test is just a way of checking something, gathering information, and learning more.\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us a little bit better.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:53.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
