    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like checking if your cake is done baking by sticking a toothpick in it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:39.100\nThe main idea behind a test is to get information. This information helps us understand where we are and what we need to work on.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:49.900\nFor example, a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice. Or, a taste test can tell you which flavor of ice cream is the most popular. Even checking your phone's battery level is a kind of test!\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:57.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information and learning more. It helps us see what we know and what we need to learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
