    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:23.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.600\nOr, your teacher might give you a test to see if you learned the material.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:34.900\nAnother example? Imagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:40.100\nYou can test it by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:46.600\nThat's a test! So, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:56.000\nIt helps us gather information and make decisions. It can be as simple as poking a cake, or as complex as a medical exam. The important thing is it gives us answers!\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
