    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us learn.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:22.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy, or a teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:31.900\nA chef might even taste a sauce, which is a test to see if it needs more seasoning! So, tests aren't just about grades. They're about getting information.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:40.900\nThey help us understand ourselves, the world around us, and how things work.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:48.700\nRemember, a test is just a tool to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
