    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\nIt helps us understand and measure things.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:23.300\nThink about it like this: Your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.300\nOr imagine you're baking a cake; you taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\nTesting isn't just about school though, it's everywhere!\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:45.700\nCar companies test their cars for safety, and doctors run tests to figure out if you're healthy.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:54.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a process of checking something.\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.800\nThat's the basics of testing!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
