    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260104_121701.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_121701.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to check your health.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:34.800\nOr, you take a quiz in school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:47.300\nTests aren't just for school or the doctor's office though. Baking a cake is a test \u2013 are you following the recipe correctly? Planting a seed is a test \u2013 will it grow?\n\n00:47.300 --> 01:00.800\nBasically, anything that helps you learn something new or confirm something you already suspect can be considered a test.\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:04.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see how things measure up.\n\n01:04.400 --> 01:08.700\nIt\u2019s a tool for learning and evaluation, used in all sorts of situations.\n\n01:08.700 --> 01:12.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "93d9cfee-c67e-4674-ab90-507c6b48eeb5": {
    "id": "93d9cfee-c67e-4674-ab90-507c6b48eeb5",
