    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:06.900\nToday we're going to explore something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:10.600\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:10.600 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:17.600\nIt\u2019s a method to see what you know, how well something works,\n00:17.600 --> 00:18.300\nor even just to check if something is true.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:25.100\nA taste test helps you decide which food tastes better.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:29.200\nAnd a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:33.700\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to get answers!\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:38.500\nWe use tests every day without even realizing it.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:41.300\nThey are a simple way to learn and grow.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:44.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
