    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_121957.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:18.800\nThink of it like this: you might test if a lightbulb works by turning it on. That's a test!\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:31.300\nIn school, tests help us see how much we've learned about a subject. A math test might ask you to solve problems, and a spelling test checks how well you can spell words.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:40.700\nOutside of school, you might test a recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, a doctor might run tests to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:53.000\nSo, tests are just ways of finding out information. They help us understand if something is working, if we've learned something, or if everything is okay. They're a really useful tool!\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
