    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:20.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to see what you know or how well you can do something. Think of it like this: it's a structured process designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:29.300\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a spelling test in school checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:39.300\nA driving test sees if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:48.800\nEven trying out a new recipe and tasting it is a mini-test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:57.100\nSo, tests come in many forms, but they all help us understand where we are and what we might need to learn or practice more.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.700\nRemember, tests aren't always about getting a perfect score. They're also a helpful tool for learning and improving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
