    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:15.700\nWhat are they, and why do we even need them?\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:22.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:33.900\nIt helps us see if something works, if it's good, or if it's right.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:46.300\nThink about it like this.\nWhen you bake a cake, you might take a little bite to test if it's sweet enough.\nOr when you buy a new toy, you test it out to see if it's fun.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:52.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the things you've been learning.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.800\nSo, a test can be a little bite of cake, playing with a toy, or answering questions in a classroom.\nThe important thing is, it gives us information.\nIt tells us something about the thing we're testing.\nTests help us learn and improve!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
