    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:03.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.800 --> 00:07.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:11.800\nThink of it like this: you have a question, and the test is how you get the answer.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:17.000\nIt could be a quiz in school to see how well you learned something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:22.500\nOr, it could be testing ingredients in a recipe to see if they taste good together.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:28.100\nEven checking if a light bulb works is a kind of test!\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:29.700\nYou're testing if it will light up.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:36.000\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things work the way they should.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:44.500\nThey can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all share the same goal: to get information!\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:51.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
