    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nNow, you might think of school exams, but in this case, a test is simply a way to check if something works correctly.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake, and you taste the batter. That's a test!\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:25.500\nYou're testing if the batter tastes good.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:30.900\nAnother example? Imagine you\u2019re building with blocks.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:36.500\nYou try to put one block on top of another. If it stays, the test passes! If it falls, the test fails.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:47.500\nSo, a test is just a way to see if something meets a certain requirement or works the way it should.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:52.900\nIt's a simple check to make sure things are going as planned. Pretty easy, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
