    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_122742.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:26.400\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. Think of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:35.200\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even tasting a new recipe is a test to see if you like the flavor!\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:39.800\nTests aren't just for school or doctors. They're everywhere!\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:49.500\nThey help us learn, improve, and make decisions. So, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:55.900\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
