    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like this: you're testing if a light bulb works by turning it on. If it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:36.800\nTests help us understand if something is working the way it should, or if it needs some fixing. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:41.500\nOr, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:50.800\nAnother example? You might test a recipe by making it. If it tastes good, the recipe passes the test!\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:59.200\nSo, tests are all about checking things and getting information. They help us make sure things are working properly and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
