    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see how well something works, or how much of something there is.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on \u2013 that's a test! We use tests all the time.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:32.100\nMaybe you take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject. Or perhaps a doctor runs a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:35.500\nSee? It's about gathering information.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:46.400\nFor example, a taste test helps us decide which ice cream flavor is the yummiest. And a spelling test shows us which words we need to practice.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:56.700\nSo, remember, a test is a process for finding out information. It helps us understand, improve, and learn.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
