    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_123155.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:19.400\nIt's like checking your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: your mom asks you what two plus two is.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:29.200\nThat's a little test!\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:38.400\nOr, imagine you're trying to bake a cake. The taste test at the end is a way to see if you followed the recipe correctly.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:43.700\nTests can be written, like a quiz in school.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:49.000\nThey can be practical, like a driving test. Or even just a simple question.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:52.900\nThe goal is always the same: to evaluate something. So, a test is an evaluation used to measure your knowledge or ability. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
