    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a set of questions or activities designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or ability.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.800\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:44.500\nA baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar. And you take tests in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:44.500 --> 01:02.500\nSo, examples of tests could be a quiz on animals, a driving exam, or even trying out different recipes to see which one tastes best. The common thread is that they all help us gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:02.500 --> 01:08.900\nIn short, a test is a tool we use to evaluate something, whether it's your understanding of a subject, your physical fitness, or even just the tastiness of a cake.\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:14.700\nTests help us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
