    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.000\nNow, what is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how well someone or something performs.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:20.600\nIt's like checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:29.900\nWe use tests all the time.\nYour teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand the material.\nA doctor might run tests to see what's going on inside your body.\nEven a baker tests their cake to make sure it's baked all the way through!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:39.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\nA driving test sees if you can drive safely.\nAnd a taste test?\nWell, that tells you how something tastes!\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:44.600\nSo, a test is really just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:49.800\nand seeing how things are doing.\nPretty simple, right?\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by\nApilage AI.\n```"
