    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:19.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:26.200\nSo, what kind of things can we test? Well, pretty much anything!\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:39.700\nYou might take a test at school to see how much you've learned. Or a doctor might run a test to check your health. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:52.100\nFor example, you could test if a toy car rolls faster on a smooth floor or a carpet. Or you could test different amounts of water on a plant to see which amount helps it grow best.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:59.200\nBasically, a test helps you learn and understand things better by giving you information. It\u2019s all about asking a question and finding the answer! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
