    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_123752.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:04.500\nToday we're going to talk about\nsomething really important: tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:07.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find\nout something about something else.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:12.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know\nif a cake is done baking.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:13.900\nSo, you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:14.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:18.300\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\nThe cake passes the test, and it's ready to eat!\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:22.200\nIf it comes out with batter on it, the\ncake fails the test and needs more time in the oven.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:26.400\nWe use tests every day, even without realizing it.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:28.600\nA doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:31.400\nA teacher uses tests to see if you've learned something.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:38.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to\nlearn more about something.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:41.700\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:43.500\nAnd that's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:45.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
