    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_123840.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.100\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:35.100\nOr, a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:44.200\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned in class. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:51.900\nFor example, if you've been learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different animals or describe where they live.\n\n00:51.900 --> 01:01.900\nTests help us learn and improve. They show us what we already understand and what we might need to study more.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:05.400\nSo, remember, tests are just tools to help us learn and grow.\n```"
  },
