    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific question in mind. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:36.400\nOr a chef might taste a soup to test if it has enough salt. A test can also be more scientific, like testing the pH level of water to see if it's safe to drink.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:48.200\nSo, a test is just a method, a way of gathering information. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:55.300\nRemember, tests are all about finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
