    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:15.000\nWhat is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:29.100\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even essays.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:35.400\nBut it's not just about grades.\nImagine you're building a bridge.\nYou need to test the materials to make sure they're strong enough.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:41.700\nOr if you're a doctor, you might run tests to figure out what's making someone sick.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:52.000\nSo, tests are all about gathering information.\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.900\nThey're a vital part of learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
