    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:15.100\nNow, what is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like checking if your shoes fit before you go for a run.\nYou're testing if they're the right size!\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:28.000\nThere are all sorts of tests.\nA doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.800\nA teacher gives tests to see if you understand the material.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:39.800\nEven when you bake a cake, you're kind of doing a test!\nYou taste it to see if it's good.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:46.400\nSo, testing is just a way of checking things.\nMaking sure things are right.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:49.400\nAnd it's something we do all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:59.000\nTests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
