    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_124628.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process that helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like this: When you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done. You poke the cake, and if the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! That's a test!\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:34.900\nOr, if you\u2019re learning to ride a bike, a test might be trying to ride without holding on. If you stay upright, you passed that test!\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:46.300\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:55.400\nThey all help us learn and understand things better. So, remember, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:03.200\nIt\u2019s a simple process that helps us measure or evaluate. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
