    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.800\nIt's a process that helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:29.400\nThink about it like this: You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:36.900\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. See? Different kinds of tests, but the same basic idea.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:42.400\nLet's say you want to know if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:47.900\nYou could test it by plugging it in! If it lights up, the test passes. If it doesn't, the test fails.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:58.000\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard. They help us learn and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:58.000 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
