    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_124755.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.100\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, your teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:35.700\nThese tests help us understand things better. For example, a taste test can tell you which juice is sweeter.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:40.500\nA spelling test can show you which words you know how to spell.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:47.500\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:56.700\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
