    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:19.500\nThink of it like a detective trying to solve a mystery. They use clues and questions to uncover the truth.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:27.100\nIn school, a test helps your teacher see what you've learned. It's like a snapshot of your understanding.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:36.900\nBut tests aren't just for school! A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy, or a chef might taste-test their food to make sure it's delicious.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:42.100\nSo, examples? A spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:47.500\nA blood test checks your health.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.300\nAnd a taste test checks how yummy something is.\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:01.700\nSee? Tests are all around us, helping us learn and understand the world better. They help us measure things and see where we stand.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:05.100\nRemember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and improve.\n\n01:05.100 --> 01:07.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
