    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\nThink of it like a way to check your understanding.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:22.200\nThere are all kinds of tests.\nYou might take a spelling test at school to see how well you can spell.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:33.900\nOr a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it's safe and effective.\nEven your doctor gives you tests, like checking your temperature, to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:41.100\nSo, a spelling test checks your spelling knowledge.\nA taste test might see which snack you like best.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:45.700\nAnd a battery test checks if your batteries still have power.\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:56.200\nEssentially, a test is just a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, abilities, or performance.\nIt helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:02.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
