    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we simply mean a way to check something.\nIt's like a little experiment to see if something works, or if it's true.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like this: You want to know if your new toy car works.\nYou push it across the floor. That's a test!\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:27.000\nYou're testing if it can roll.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:34.000\nOr, maybe you're testing if your dog knows a new trick.\nYou say the command and see if he does it.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:39.200\nAgain, that's a test!\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:46.300\nTests aren't just for toys or pets.\nScientists use tests to learn about the world, and teachers use tests to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:56.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
