    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:18.900\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:31.100\nIn science or school, tests help us see what we know or how something works. For example, a math test checks your understanding of addition and subtraction.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:41.400\nOr, a science experiment might test whether a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:48.000\nSo, tests help us learn and improve! They give us information we can use.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:54.000\nThey're a way to see where we are and where we need to go. That\u2019s the basics of testing.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:54.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
