    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_130202.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.400\nNow, what is a test, exactly?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:26.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well someone or something performs.\nThink of it like this: You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:37.600\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\nEven a doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature, to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:53.800\nSo, tests help us measure things, understand things, and make decisions based on the results.\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:00.500\nThat's the fundamental concept of a test!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
