    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:13.800\nA test is basically a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:31.000\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:41.200\nFor example, a math test tells you how well you understand math. Or, a taste test lets you decide which food tastes best. Doctors use medical tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:51.400\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to provide information and help us make decisions.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:53.700\nThey're super useful in learning, science, and even everyday life.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:55.100\nRemember, a test is just a tool for understanding.\n```"
