    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_130519.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nBasically, a test presents you with a question, task, or situation, and then measures your response.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.100\nThis helps us understand something better.\nThink about it: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:45.100\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a mini-test to see if the bulb works!\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:55.200\nSo, tests help us learn, make decisions, and figure things out.\nThey're a really useful tool for understanding the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
