    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_130600.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.400\nA test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your brain. It helps you and your teachers see what you've learned and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:36.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. There are quizzes, which are usually short and focus on a specific topic. Then you have exams, which are often longer and cover a wider range of material.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:45.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills, while a math test might check your ability to solve equations.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:52.100\nSo, remember, tests aren\u2019t scary monsters. They're just tools to help you learn and grow.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:59.400\nThey show you what you've mastered and what you can work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
