    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:25.800\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:33.200\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:40.900\nAnother example: imagine you bake a cake. You might test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:48.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test!\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:56.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn more and check if something is right. It helps us make better decisions and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
