    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.899\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.899 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skill, or performance.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:40.200\nAnother example is a spelling test in school. The teacher asks you to spell certain words, and your answers determine how well you understand spelling rules.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:50.799\nOr imagine testing a new toy to see if it's durable enough. So, a test is really just a method of gathering information and drawing conclusions.\n\n00:50.799 --> 01:01.700\nIt can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The key is that it helps you understand something better.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:05.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
