    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.700\nIt could be finding out if you know your ABCs, or if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:30.100\nBasically, you're asking a question and then using some kind of process to get an answer.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:40.300\nThink of it like baking a cake. The recipe is the test. You follow the steps, and the end result, the cake, tells you if you did it right!\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.000\nAnother example is taking a quiz at school. The questions are the test, and your answers show how well you understand the subject.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:58.200\nSo, a test helps us learn and understand things better. It's a way to explore and discover!\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:07.300\nTo recap, a test is a process for finding something out. It involves asking a question and then using a specific method to get the answer.\n\n01:07.300 --> 01:09.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
