    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:19.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but instead of mixing chemicals, you're checking knowledge, skills, or even opinions.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:30.500\nBasically, a test helps us understand what someone knows or can do. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:34.800\nA taste test lets you decide which flavor you like best.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.500\nSee? Different kinds of tests for different things. So, remember, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:49.100\nIt helps us learn and improve. It\u2019s a way to measure progress and figure out what areas need more attention.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:51.900\nTests aren't scary, they\u2019re helpful!\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
