    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.200\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test is?\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:11.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:18.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:27.400\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might taste it. That's a test! You're testing to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:34.100\nOr, if you\u2019re trying to learn your ABCs, your teacher might give you a quiz.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:41.200\nThat's another kind of test to see how much you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:47.900\nTests aren't just for school or baking. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:52.600\nA scientist might run tests to see if a new invention works.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out.\n```"
