    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_133033.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. It could be checking if something works, if something is true, or even how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if the batteries work. Or, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:38.600\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned. For example, if you\u2019re learning about colors, a test might be asking you to point to the red object.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:54.900\nOr if you\u2019re learning about numbers, a test might ask you to count to ten. So, to recap, a test is just a way to check something, whether it's a toy, your health, or your understanding of a new concept.\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:02.599\nIt helps us learn and make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
