    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:16.600\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you test them by poking them with a toothpick.\nIf it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:22.800\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just class activities.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:32.200\nThe goal is to figure out what you understand and maybe what you need a little more help with.\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr a math test shows if you can solve problems.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:40.200\nBasically, tests are just tools to help you and your teachers understand how things are going.\nSo don't be afraid of them!\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:47.200\nThink of them as a way to learn even more.\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to check understanding, whether it's cookies or spelling.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:50.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
