    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.600\nHey there! Welcome!\n\n00:01.600 --> 00:05.600\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:09.600\nWhat are they?\n\n00:09.600 --> 00:15.000\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:19.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:24.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:27.500\nOr a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:31.400\nTests can be written, spoken, or even involve doing something.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:36.300\nFor example, a doctor might give you a physical test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:40.700\nA scientist might test a new medicine to see if it works.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:44.600\nAnd a teacher might give you a quiz to see if you understood the lesson.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:51.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or to see how well you already understand something.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.100\nIt's a tool for discovery!\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
