    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: it's a check-up for your brain! The main idea behind a test is to see if you understand the things you've been learning.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:35.500\nIt could be about anything, from math problems to the names of animals. For example, a simple test might ask you to name the colors of the rainbow.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:43.300\nOr, it could ask you to solve a basic addition problem like two plus two. The answers you give help show what you've learned.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:50.500\nSo, remember, a test is simply a tool to measure your understanding. It helps you, and your teachers, see what you know and what you might need to learn more about.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:53.600\nGood luck with your next one! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
