    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:11.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:19.500\nThink of it like trying to solve a puzzle or answer a question. It helps us understand more about something.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:24.500\nFor example, a spelling test tells us how well someone knows how to spell words.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:31.600\nOr, a taste test lets us decide which food we like best. See? Tests can be all sorts of things!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:38.100\nAnother example is a doctor giving you a test to see if you're healthy. They might check your temperature or listen to your heart.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:44.900\nAll these little things give them clues. So, a test is just a tool. It helps us learn, understand, and discover things.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:50.600\nIt's a simple way to get answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
