    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:08.700\nNow, what is a test?\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:17.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It's how we find out if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:22.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:29.600\nOr, a taste test checks if you like the flavor of something. See? Tests help us learn and understand.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:37.000\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to see if it's safe to play with. Or, even testing the weather by looking outside to see if it's raining.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:45.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn, understand, and make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
