    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_135656.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:07.800\nToday, we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:17.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give us information about a specific thing.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: you might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough. Or a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:28.400\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:35.700\nLet's say you want to know if a plant needs more water. You could check the soil \u2013 that's a simple test!\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:42.600\nIf the soil is dry, the plant probably needs water. If it's damp, it's probably okay.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:53.400\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It's a tool we use to understand the world around us a little better.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
