    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like asking a question and then checking the answer.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:33.500\nWe use tests all the time! Like, if you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:40.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test showing the cake is done.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:47.300\nOr, if you're trying to guess what's in a box, you might shake it.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:54.200\nThe sound is a test, giving you clues.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:01.100\nAnother example is a spelling test at school.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:07.000\nIt helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n01:07.000 --> 01:17.300\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and making sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:17.300 --> 01:24.900\nTo sum it up, a test is a method for evaluating or determining something.\n\n01:24.900 --> 01:30.700\nIt can be a simple check or a more complex process.\n\n01:30.700 --> 01:35.100\nThanks for watching!\n\n01:35.100 --> 01:35.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
