    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:19.400\nIt could be used to check if something works, to see how much you know, or even to understand what you prefer.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:28.700\nThink about it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher uses a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:42.700\nAnd you might even test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good. So, tests can come in many forms, from simple yes or no questions to big, complicated projects.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:49.500\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:56.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information. It helps us understand the world around us a little bit better.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:62.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
