    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_140151.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:15.600\nA test, simply put, is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:26.100\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate, measure, or prove something.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:33.100\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:42.100\nOr, you might take a math test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:55.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Sometimes it's a quiz with multiple-choice questions. Other times, it's a physical examination. And sometimes, it's just observing something to see how it behaves.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:04.200\nFor example, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. So, to recap, a test is a process for gathering information and making an evaluation.\n\n01:04.200 --> 01:09.000\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:09.000 --> 01:13.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
