    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like checking if your shoes fit. You try them on, that's the test, and you see if they're too big, too small, or just right.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.300\nWe use tests all the time! A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:47.900\nA baker might taste their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar. In school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:55.200\nThey\u2019re not about being right or wrong all the time, but about understanding where you are and what you need to learn next. So, a test is simply a way to check something! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
