    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:23.500\nIt's a process designed to gather information. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:31.600\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes the best! Tests aren\u2019t just for school or food.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:41.000\nDoctors use tests to check your health, like taking your temperature. Car manufacturers test their cars to make sure they\u2019re safe.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:56.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what we already know. It helps us understand things better, whether it's our spelling, our favorite cookie, or even our health.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
