    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_140417.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.200\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. Think of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:32.400\nThat's a test! Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, wobbling around is a test of your balance.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:42.800\nIn school, tests are used to see how well you understand the material. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:50.200\nThe results of a test help you and your teacher understand what you've learned and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:57.600\nSo, a test is just a tool for learning and growth. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
