    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:22.800\nIt's like asking a question and looking for the answer. We use tests every day, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:34.100\nThink about it: if you're trying a new recipe, that's a test! You're testing if the ingredients and instructions will create something delicious.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:44.300\nOr, when you're trying to figure out if a door is locked, you try the handle. That's a test to see if it opens.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.500\nTests can be simple, like checking the door, or more complex, like a science experiment. But the basic idea is the same: you're trying to learn something by observing or doing something.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:01.400\nSo, a test is just a systematic way of asking a question and finding the answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
