    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_141638.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:07.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.000\nIt's like asking a question or trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:30.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:37.000\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:43.000\nAnother example is when a doctor checks your temperature; that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:52.000\nSo, tests can be used to measure knowledge, skills, or even physical conditions.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.000\nThey help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:57.000\nThey give us information!\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.000\nRemember, a test is just a way of learning something.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
