    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.999\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.400\nToday we're going to talk about something really fundamental: tests!\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:23.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:29.600\nWe're checking its properties or abilities.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:46.400\nThink about it like this: a taste test is a test to see how something tastes.\nA spelling test checks your spelling skills.\nEven when you try a new recipe, you're kind of running a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:54.200\nSo, tests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like seeing if your new shoes are comfortable to walk in.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:56.400\nThe key thing is, you're gathering information by observing something or doing something.\n```"
