    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:15.100\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:26.000\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:37.600\nA baker might test a cake to see if it's cooked properly.\nSo, a test can be a question, an experiment, or even just a simple observation.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:50.300\nThe goal is always the same: to get some kind of answer.\nBasically, we test things to learn, to improve, and to make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:55.900\nThat's testing in a nutshell! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
