    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but one where you get a result that tells you about the thing you're testing.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:22.800\nSo, what kind of things can we test? Well, you can test anything!\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:28.000\nYou can test if a light bulb works by turning it on. That's a test!\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.800\nOr, you can test how well you understand something by taking a quiz.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:44.800\nSee? It's just about gathering information. For example, if you want to know if your soup is hot enough, you can test it by carefully touching the bowl.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:58.400\nOr, if you want to know if your friend likes your new hat, you can test it by asking them! Essentially, a test helps you learn something new or confirm something you already thought was true.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:04.300\nIt's all about getting answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
