    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.800\nWe use them all the time!\nThink about it: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:32.600\nA chef tastes food to test if it needs more salt.\nBasically, a test involves doing something and then observing the results.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:41.800\nIf you're testing a toy car, you might push it down a ramp and see how far it goes.\nThat distance is the result, and it tells you something about the car's speed.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:54.600\nAnother example: a teacher gives you a quiz.\nThe quiz is the test, and your score shows how well you understand the material.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:02.200\nSo, tests help us learn, check, and understand all sorts of things.\nThey're a really useful tool!\n\n01:02.200 --> 01:05.800\nTo recap, a test is a process of observation to gather information.\n01:05.800 --> 01:06.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
