    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more. Think about it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:31.100\nOr, maybe you test the temperature of soup to see if it's too hot to eat. Those are both tests!\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:41.800\nWe use tests all the time to check things. A doctor uses tests to check your health, and a scientist uses tests to see if their ideas are right.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:52.700\nSo, a test is just a way to learn more and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.300\nHopefully, you now have a better understanding of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
