    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:28.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand things better.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:36.800\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:45.500\nOr, a doctor might test your eyesight to see how well you can see. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:53.600\nFor example, a teacher gives you a test in class to see how much you've learned. Or, you might test a new toy to see if it actually works.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:56.000\nTests come in many forms, from written quizzes to hands-on experiments.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.600\nSo, a test is just a method to explore, learn, and check something out. It's a way to get answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
