    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_143132.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:14.500\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:24.200\nIt could be checking if you understand a lesson, if a product works, or even if a recipe tastes good.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:30.800\nBasically, you're trying to find out information about something.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:37.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:44.000\nA taste test checks your opinion on food.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:50.500\nAnd a stress test on a bridge checks its strength.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:57.100\nSo, we use tests to learn, to improve, and to make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:03.700\nThey help us understand what we know, what we need to work on, and if something is safe and reliable.\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:11.600\nRemember, a test is just a tool for gathering information.\n\n01:11.600 --> 01:14.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
