    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:21.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs, or what its properties are.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:31.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:39.000\nOr, you might even test a recipe to see if it tastes good!\nTests can be used for almost anything.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:48.800\nWe use them to check if bridges are safe, to see if a new medicine works, or even to figure out which lightbulb lasts the longest.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:60.400\nThe main idea is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\nSo remember, a test is just a way of finding things out!\n\n00:60.400 --> 00:64.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
