    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much someone knows about something, or how well they can do something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if your cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. That toothpick is a kind of test!\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:37.200\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, fill-in-the-blanks, or even asking you to write an essay.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:42.400\nAnother example? A doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:53.600\nSo, tests come in many forms and are used in many different situations. Basically, a test is a tool to measure knowledge or ability.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:59.700\nWe use them to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
