    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_143813.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nWhat are they and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to check knowledge or skills.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like this: you\u2019ve been learning to ride a bike, and the test is when you show someone you can actually do it.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:27.300\nTests can come in many forms. There are quizzes, exams, even practical demonstrations.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:36.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words, while a driving test checks your ability to operate a car safely.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:45.700\nThey all help us see what we know, and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:55.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool. It\u2019s a chance to show what you\u2019ve learned and identify areas where you can improve.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.200\nIt's not about being perfect, it's about learning and growing. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
