    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.500\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like an experiment. We're trying to see how something works, or how well someone knows something.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:32.200\nIt could be a simple question-and-answer thing, like a quiz in school. Or it could be more hands-on, like testing if a new toy works properly.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:35.400\nMaybe you're testing if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:46.100\nSee? Lots of different ways to test! So, a test is just a process for gathering information. We ask a question, perform an action, and then look at the results.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:49.300\nThat's it! Pretty straightforward, right?\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:57.000\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
