    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up.\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:35.100\nFor example, a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\nOr, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:43.600\nTests can be short and simple, like tasting a cookie to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:59.500\nOr they can be longer and more complicated, like a science experiment to see if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\nThe main idea is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.100\nSo, a test is a method for finding something out, whether it's in school, in the kitchen, or anywhere else.\n```"
