    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a lesson, if a machine is working correctly, or even if a recipe tastes good.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:27.300\nThe main idea is to find out information. Think of it like this: you're baking cookies, and you want to know if they're done.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:37.400\nYou might use a toothpick \u2013 that's your test! You poke a cookie, and if the toothpick comes out clean, the test says they're ready.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:44.400\nAnother example is a spelling test in school. It checks if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:57.500\nSo, a test is just a tool to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
