    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.700\nIt's a process that helps us understand if something is true or correct.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:30.300\nYou do a test! You stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:36.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test. It's done!\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:43.100\nOr, maybe you want to know if you know your alphabet. Someone asks you to recite it.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:47.800\nThat's a test too! Tests aren't just for school or baking.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:55.200\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Scientists use tests to prove if their ideas are right.\n\n00:55.200 --> 01:05.500\nA test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new. So, remember, a test helps us understand something better.\n\n01:05.500 --> 01:09.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
