    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.700\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in general, a test is simply a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:25.300\nIt's how we find out if our ideas, products, or even recipes are actually good.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:32.600\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake. The test is tasting a little bit of the batter before you put it in the oven.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:36.000\nDoes it taste sweet enough?\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:39.200\nDoes it need more vanilla? That's a test!\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:45.000\nOr imagine you\u2019re building a toy car. The test is pushing it to see if it rolls.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:50.800\nSo, tests help us make sure things are working correctly and let us improve them.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:58.500\nThey're important in everything from building bridges to writing software.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.800\nIn short, a test is a check to see if something is working as it should.\n\n01:02.800 --> 01:05.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
