    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out about something. Think of it like an investigation, where you're trying to gather information.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:25.800\nIt could be a written exam in school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:35.500\nOr, maybe you're testing out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:45.400\nEven a doctor uses tests, like blood work, to check on your health!\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:55.000\nFor example, imagine you're growing a plant. You might \"test\" different amounts of water to see which amount helps it grow the tallest.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.700\nThe result of each test tells you something new. So, a test is really just a method for getting information and understanding something better. It's a simple concept that's used everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "ede4ffbf-10bf-42a3-971c-b3a8dc2893db": {
    "id": "ede4ffbf-10bf-42a3-971c-b3a8dc2893db",
