    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_145344.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.100\nHey there! Welcome to this quick introduction to tests.\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:17.400\nThink of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:27.800\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you're baking a cake. You taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:35.300\nOr, if your toy car isn't working, you might try changing the batteries. That's a test to see if the batteries were the problem.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:42.800\nTests aren't just for baking or toys, though. Scientists use tests to learn about the world, and doctors use tests to check your health.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.400\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.800\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to gather information and answer a question.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nIt helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
