    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:10.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, think of it as a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:18.500\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:22.500\nImagine baking a cake. You taste it afterwards, right?\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:26.500\nThat's a test! You're testing if the cake tastes good.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:32.300\nOr think about a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:42.400\nTests can be simple like that, or they can be more complicated, like a school exam. So, a test is really just a way to check things out.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:50.200\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. Remember, testing is all about getting information!\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:56.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
