    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_145754.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.200\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary, but really, a test is just a way to see what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb turns on \u2013 that's a test! Basically, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:33.100\nIt could be a quiz in school to measure your understanding, or a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:42.200\nEven baking a cake and tasting it is a test to see if it's delicious! So, tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:54.100\nSome are simple, like that light bulb example, while others are more complex. But the main idea is always the same: to get information about something.\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:05.000\nTo recap, a test is a method for evaluating knowledge, ability, or performance. It helps us understand and improve things.\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:08.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
