    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_145843.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like a little experiment or a mini-quiz. The main idea is to give something a challenge, and then observe the result.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:37.000\nThis helps us identify any problems, or just confirm that things are running smoothly. For example, a doctor might test your reflexes to see if your nervous system is working properly.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:48.600\nOr, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned in class. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and your baking skills!\n\n00:48.600 --> 01:01.100\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:04.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
