    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:22.100\nIt's a process, a question, or a series of questions designed to measure knowledge, ability, or even just to see if something works.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:31.600\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. That test measures things like your cholesterol and blood sugar.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:39.600\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake! You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:48.000\nTests are everywhere! They help us learn, diagnose problems, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:56.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
