    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out information or check something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a cookie to see if it tastes good.\nOr a scientist might test a plant to see if it grows better with more sunlight.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:31.800\nBasically, you do something and then observe the result.\nThat result gives you data.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:40.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\nA doctor might do a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.700\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us information we can use.\nThey are a fundamental way to verify what we know or what we expect.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:59.100\nRemember, tests are all about learning and improving!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
