    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something works, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb is working, so you screw it in and flip the switch \u2013 that\u2019s a test!\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:32.300\nTests can be big, like a final exam, or small, like checking the weather before you leave the house. You're testing if you need an umbrella!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:39.200\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Did my cookies bake all the way through?\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:49.800\nPoke them with a fork \u2013 that\u2019s a test! So, remember, a test is just a way to get information and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:55.900\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
