    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, correct, or working the way it should.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:29.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:41.000\nA taste test helps you decide if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\nOr, a medical test can tell you if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:49.400\nSo, in short, a test is just a method, a procedure, a way of checking something.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:53.100\nWhether it's in school, in cooking, or at the doctor's office, tests help us learn and make decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
