    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:28.100\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how much you've learned. Tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:38.900\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if you like a new flavor of ice cream. Or, bouncing a ball tests if it's still got air in it.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:41.900\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:52.700\nSo, in short, a test is a process used to gather information and evaluate something. It can be a big exam or just a quick check.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:59.000\nWe use tests to learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
