    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.300\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like an experiment or a quiz that helps us learn more.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.600\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:43.500\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to see if it needs more sugar - that's a test!\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:57.600\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try restarting it to see if that fixes the problem. That's also a test. Tests can be formal, like a school exam that shows what you've learned, or informal, like trying different routes to work to find the fastest one.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.300\nThe main idea is to try something and see what happens, so we can understand things better.\n\n01:01.300 --> 01:04.300\nSo, a test is simply a method for gathering information to make a decision or to learn something new.\n01:04.300 --> 01:07.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
