    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.600\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests help us check if something is working correctly, if something is true, or even just how well something performs.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:35.800\nFor example, imagine you're baking a cake. You might take a small piece out with a toothpick to test if it's cooked all the way through. That's a test!\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:40.000\nOr maybe you're learning a new language. A quiz is a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:52.800\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn, improve, and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:52.800 --> 01:00.400\nThey help us answer questions and understand the world better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
