    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes a soup \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more salt.\nOr maybe you take a quiz in school \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:40.300\nTests can be formal, like a standardized exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\nThe key is that you're performing an action to gather data and learn something.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.100\nWe use tests every day, often without even realizing it!\nSo, remember, a test is a procedure to gather information.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
