    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests, and not the kind you cram for!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:17.000\nIn general, when you hear the word \"test,\" it usually means trying something out to see if it works, or to learn more about it.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like experimenting.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:37.900\nSo, if you're baking a cake, you might test the oven temperature to make sure it's right. Or, if you're trying out a new video game, you're testing its features and gameplay.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:46.900\nEven trying a new flavor of ice cream is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:58.600\nBasically, a test helps us gather information, make sure things are working correctly, or discover something new. It\u2019s a way of finding things out.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:02.200\nSo remember, a test is a way to learn by doing, whether it's in science, cooking, or just everyday life.\n```"
