    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nWhat exactly is a test?\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:24.200\nIt helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\nA chef might taste their food to test if it's seasoned right.\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:33.300\nSee?\nTests are everywhere!\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:35.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:46.600\nIt could be anything from your health to your cooking to your knowledge.\nThey give us valuable information.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
