    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something. Think of it like a detective trying to solve a mystery.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:24.800\nThey gather clues, which are like the answers you give, to figure out the truth. So, what kind of things do we test?\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:32.000\nWell, lots of things! You might take a math test in school to see how well you understand numbers.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:39.200\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:47.600\nA chef might even taste their food to test if it needs more seasoning!\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:52.400\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better by giving us information. It's a way to learn and improve.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:55.000\nThat's tests in a nutshell. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
