    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_151806.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:31.200\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it.\nWhen a doctor checks your temperature, they're testing if you have a fever.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:42.900\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\nThey might give you a quiz or a bigger exam.\nThese tests help them, and you, understand which topics you understand well and which ones you might need to practice more.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:53.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\nIt helps us check on things and see how they're doing.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
