    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be about you, like a quiz at school, or about something else, like checking if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:29.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if you understand a topic. The test, like a set of questions, helps you and your teacher figure that out.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:34.100\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:42.500\nIf it comes out clean, the cake has passed the \u201ctest\u201d and is ready to eat!\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:46.900\nTests aren't just about grades. They help us learn and improve.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:51.300\nThey give us information. In both cases, the test provides valuable information.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:58.200\nSo, remember, a test is a way to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
