    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:19.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:28.300\nOr maybe you want to know if you understand a new topic, so you answer some questions about it. That's another kind of test!\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:40.200\nTests help us measure things, check our understanding, or see if something works. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:48.900\nOr a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you've learned. So, tests are just tools we use to get information.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:57.100\nThey can be big or small, formal or informal. The important thing is that they help us learn and improve.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
