    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:31.300\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, when you learn a new skill, like riding a bike, you're constantly testing yourself to see if you can stay balanced.\nExams in school are a common type of test, used to check what you've learned.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:43.300\nAnother example could be baking a cake \u2013 you test the recipe to see if it tastes good!\nSo, a test is all about gathering information and checking something out.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:52.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
