    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.400\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:06.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:09.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.600 --> 00:12.000\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:16.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:21.700\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:25.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:29.300\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:33.000\nSo, tests help us learn and understand.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:37.900\nThey can show us what we know, what we don't know, and where we need to improve.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:44.100\nRemember, tests aren't about being perfect; they're about learning and growing.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:51.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
