    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you information.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:33.700\nMaybe you're taking a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or perhaps a doctor orders a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:46.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you can make something delicious. So, tests help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.600\nThey can be used to measure knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something. Remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
