    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.950\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:01.950 --> 00:04.650\nA test is basically a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:04.650 --> 00:07.350\nThink of it like asking a question, but often with a more structured approach.\n\n00:07.350 --> 00:11.050\nTests are used everywhere!\nIn school, you take tests to see how well you\u2019ve learned something.\n\n00:11.050 --> 00:13.750\nDoctors use tests to check your health.\n\n00:13.750 --> 00:16.850\nEven when you try a new recipe, you're kind of running a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:16.850 --> 00:21.050\nFor example, a math test helps your teacher understand if you understand addition.\n\n00:21.050 --> 00:24.250\nA blood test can tell your doctor if you have enough iron.\n\n00:24.250 --> 00:27.450\nAnd tasting a new cookie recipe helps you decide if you need more sugar.\n\n00:27.450 --> 00:35.050\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:35.050 --> 00:37.050\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
