    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer that helps you understand things better.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:25.000\nTests can come in all sorts of forms.\nYou might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:33.300\nOr maybe you bake a cake and taste it to test if you added enough sugar.\nDoctors even use tests to check if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:40.300\nLet's say you want to know if your plant needs water.\nYou can test it by sticking your finger in the soil.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:45.400\nIf the soil feels dry, that's a sign it needs watering!\nSee? That's a test!\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:54.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new by asking a question and finding the answer.\nIt helps us figure things out every day.\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
