    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It's how we measure or evaluate things.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.700\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words. A taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:35.500\nOr, a medical test can tell you if you're feeling sick or healthy.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:45.600\nSee? Tests come in all shapes and sizes! Basically, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:55.300\nThey are useful tools for learning and understanding the world around us. So, to recap, a test is a method for finding out information, used everywhere to measure and understand things better.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
