    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_154409.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! \nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. \nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.600\nWe use tests all the time to see if something works, or if something is true. \nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:33.500\nOr, imagine you're learning your ABCs. \nYour teacher might give you a quiz to test your knowledge.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:43.100\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see where things stand. \nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:52.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "bd6a3680-9b39-45af-87dd-5a0dee1182b5": {
    "id": "bd6a3680-9b39-45af-87dd-5a0dee1182b5",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:24:13.216728",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-04T15:45:00.712791",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260104_154500.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_154500.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.400\nWhat is a test anyway? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:19.600\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a cake is done.\nYou stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:33.300\nThat's a test! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test, and it's ready.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:39.900\nOr maybe you're taking a quiz in school.\nThat's a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:50.100\nDoctors use tests, too, to check if you're healthy.\nTests help us learn, diagnose, and make decisions. They're all around us!\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:58.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\nIt's a simple tool we use to answer questions and learn new things.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```\nMANIM_CODE:\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass TestExplanation(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # ===== SECTION 1: TITLE (5.0s) =====\n        title_bg = RoundedRectangle(corner_radius=0.2, width=6, height=1.5, fill_color=BLUE_B, fill_opacity=0.8)\n        title = Text(\"Tests!\", font_size=42, color=GOLD)\n        title.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        title_bg.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(FadeIn(title_bg), Write(title), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(3.5)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 2: What is a test? (8.4s) =====\n        header = Text(\"What is a test?\", font_size=36, color=TEAL_A)\n        definition = Text(\"A way to find something out.\", font_size=32, color=WHITE)\n        header.to_edge(UP)\n        definition.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(Write(header), FadeIn(definition), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(6.9)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 3: Cake Example (6.2s) =====\n        cake_example = Text(\"Cake Test: Toothpick\", font_size=36, color=GREEN_B)\n        cake_example.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(Write(cake_example), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(4.7)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 4: Quiz Example (7.1s) =====\n        quiz_example = Text(\"Quiz: Check understanding\", font_size=36, color=ORANGE)\n        quiz_example.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(Write(quiz_example), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(5.6)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 5: Doctor Example (6.6s) =====\n        doctor_example = Text(\"Doctor: Check health\", font_size=36, color=PINK)\n        doctor_example.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(Write(doctor_example), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(5.1)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 6: Tests Help Us (10.2s) =====\n        tests_help = Text(\"Tests help us:\", font_size=36, color=TEAL_A)\n        learn = Text(\"Learn\", font_size=32, color=WHITE).shift(UP * 1)\n        diagnose = Text(\"Diagnose\", font_size=32, color=WHITE).shift(DOWN * 0)\n        decide = Text(\"Decide\", font_size=32, color=WHITE).shift(DOWN * 1)\n        tests_help.to_edge(UP)\n        self.play(Write(tests_help), FadeIn(learn), FadeIn(diagnose), FadeIn(decide), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(8.7)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 7: All Around Us (6.8s) =====\n        all_around = Text(\"Tests are all around us!\", font_size=42, color=GOLD)\n        all_around.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(Write(all_around), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(5.3)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== SECTION 8: Summary (8.4s) =====\n        summary_header = Text(\"Summary\", font_size=36, color=BLUE_B).to_edge(UP)\n        summary_text = Text(\"Tests = Information\", font_size=32, color=WHITE).move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(Write(summary_header), FadeIn(summary_text), run_time=1.5)\n        self.wait(6.9)  # KEEP ON SCREEN!\n        \n        self.play(*[FadeOut(mob) for mob in self.mobjects], run_time=0.5)\n        \n        # ===== ENDING (5s) =====\n        ending_bg = Rectangle(width=14, height=8, fill_color=BLUE_E, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        ending_text = Text(\"Apilage AI Video\", font_size=48, color=GOLD)\n        ending_text.move_to(ORIGIN)\n        self.play(FadeIn(ending_bg), run_time=0.5)\n        self.play(FadeIn(ending_text, scale=0.8), run_time=1.0)\n        self.wait(2.5)\n        self.play(FadeOut(ending_text), FadeOut(ending_bg), run_time=0.5)\n```"
  },
