    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:18.000\nToday we're going to learn about tests. A test is simply a way to check something or find out information.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:28.200\nThink of it like a question you ask to see if you know the answer, or a procedure you follow to see how something works.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:40.500\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words. Or, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:49.500\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like how it tastes! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something or gather information.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:53.100\nIt can be a quiz at school, a medical check-up, or even trying something new. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
