    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:06.600\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:18.200\nIt helps us see if something is true, working correctly, or how well someone knows something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: a simple test is checking if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.100\nThat's testing if the bulb works! Or, a teacher might give you a quiz.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:34.500\nThat's a test to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:41.900\nTests can be all sorts of things, from science experiments to spelling bees.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:50.500\nThey all have one thing in common: they help us learn and understand the world around us better.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
