    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:06.000\nThink of it like an investigation.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:07.500\nWe're trying to get information.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:13.500\nThe thing we're testing could be anything! It could be a new medicine to see if it works, your knowledge of a subject in school, or even how well a new lightbulb shines.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:17.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:20.500\nOr, you might take a quiz to see how much you remember from a lesson.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:23.500\nEven baking a cake is a test, to see if your recipe works!\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:30.000\nSo, remember, a test is a tool. It helps us learn something new or confirm what we already think.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:35.000\nIt's all about gathering information to make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:38.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
