    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_154939.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.200\nNot the kind you take in school, but a more general idea of what a test actually is.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:25.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something works as it should.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:34.400\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you taste it. That taste is a test to see if the cake is good!\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:46.100\nOr, imagine you're buying a new toy. You might play with it for a few minutes to test if it's fun and if all the parts work.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:55.900\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you're healthy. So, a test is really just a way to get information about something by trying it out.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.500\nWhether it's tasting a cake, playing with a toy, or checking your temperature, tests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
