    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_155024.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.100\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in general, a test is really just a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like this: You bake a cake, and you taste it \u2013 that's a test! You\u2019re checking if it tastes good.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.500\nOr, if you build a tower with blocks, and then gently push it to see if it\u2019s stable, that's another kind of test. You're seeing if it can stand up.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:41.900\nTests help us find out if things are working correctly and let us fix them if they aren't.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:52.400\nSo, a test is simply a way of checking something to see if it meets our expectations. It's all about making sure things are as good as they can be!\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
