    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like asking a question and then finding the answer through an activity.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.800\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done, you can do a \"toothpick test\".\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:42.600\nYou stick a toothpick in the middle, and if it comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:51.300\nAnother example? Maybe you want to see if your plant needs water. You can stick your finger in the soil, and if it feels dry, it's time to water it.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:55.500\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us clear results.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:57.300\nThey are all about getting information.\n\n00:57.300 --> 00:59.200\nRemember, a test is just a way to explore and learn!\n```"
