    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_155347.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.000\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information or see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:27.400\nThink about it like this: a recipe is a test! You follow the instructions, and the test is whether you get a delicious cake at the end.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:36.100\nOr, if you\u2019re trying to figure out if a lightbulb works, you screw it in. The test is whether it lights up!\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:48.900\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The important thing is they help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:58.200\nSo, tests help us understand the world around us by giving us feedback. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
