    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like a simple question you ask to see if you get the right answer.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:19.100\nTests can be all sorts of things! It's how we learn about the world.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:27.300\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done, you can do a simple test: stick a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:40.100\nOr, if you want to see if your friend knows their ABCs, you can test them by asking them to recite the alphabet.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:52.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a simple process to check something. It can be a question, an experiment, or anything that helps you learn and understand.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:55.200\nPretty simple, right?\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
