    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to see what you know or can do. Think of it like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.400\nThe main idea behind a test is to measure your understanding. It could be about anything \u2013 math, history, or even your ability to follow instructions.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:37.200\nFor example, a simple math test might ask you to solve a problem like 2 + 2. Or, a reading test might ask you to read a short story and then answer questions about it.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:39.700\nSee? Pretty straightforward.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:50.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you and your teachers understand what you've learned and where you might need some extra help. It\u2019s a learning opportunity!\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
