    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.300\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:11.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:24.700\nIt helps you see if something is true or false, good or bad, working or not working.\nFor example, a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:38.000\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\nEven a simple experiment, like seeing if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade, is a type of test.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:52.900\nSo, tests help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:58.800\nRemember, a test is just a way to find things out!\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
