    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.100\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, like a quiz in school.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:23.300\nBut what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:31.600\nIt's a procedure we follow to gather information about something we want to understand better.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:39.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You perform a test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:50.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you the cake is ready! Or, imagine you want to know if a toy car needs new batteries.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:56.300\nYou try to turn it on. If it doesn\u2019t work, the test shows you the batteries are dead.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:02.300\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information. It helps us make decisions and learn more about the world around us.\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:07.500\nRemember, a test is a tool! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
