    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_160855.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.700\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.700 --> 00:03.100\nToday we're diving into something\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:03.500\ncalled a \"test.\"\n\n00:03.900 --> 00:06.200\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:07.600\nto find out something.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:09.500\nIt's like an experiment or a check\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:11.300\nto see if something is working, or if\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:12.400\nsomething is true.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:15.500\nThink about it like this: a baking test.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:17.600\nYou taste a cake to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:18.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:21.800\nOr, when you use a ruler to measure something,\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:23.200\nyou're testing its length.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:25.600\nDoctors also use tests, like blood tests,\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:27.100\nto see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:29.800\nSo, a test is really just a method\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:31.500\nof gathering information.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:33.400\nIt helps us learn, improve,\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:35.000\nand make better decisions.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:37.800\nRemember, a test is a tool, and like any tool,\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:39.800\nit's there to help us understand\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:41.200\nthe world around us.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:43.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
