    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_160943.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:06.300\nWhat are they? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:10.000\nIt could be to see if you know something, like a quiz at school.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:14.500\nOr it could be to see if something works correctly, like testing a new toy.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:17.800\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:18.800\nThat's a test!\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:22.000\nOr, if you want to see if your bike tires have enough air, you might squeeze them.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:23.400\nThat's another kind of test.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:26.500\nTests help us understand things better.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:28.000\nThey give us information to make decisions.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:32.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn from it.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:34.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
