    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.600 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:17.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but usually with a specific goal in mind.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:24.700\nSo, instead of just guessing, we use tests to get information.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:32.300\nThis information can help us make decisions, understand something better, or see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:37.200\nFor example, a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:42.500\nA taste test helps decide which cookie recipe is the best.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:47.500\nOr think about testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.600\nBasically, tests are all about gathering information in a reliable way.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:55.600\nThey help us learn and improve.\n```"
