    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.700\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher uses a test to see if you understand the material.\nAnd even you use a test when you try a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:34.000\nTests can be big or small.\nA single math problem is a test.\nSo is a huge exam.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:38.200\nThe key thing is that a test gives us information.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:44.200\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:52.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and get some information.\nIt\u2019s a learning tool!\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
