    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_161607.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:33.300\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:39.000\nA math test checks your ability to solve problems.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:44.700\nTests aren't about being perfect! They're about learning and figuring out what you need to work on.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:54.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check or evaluate something, whether it\u2019s a recipe, your health, or what you've learned in school.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
