    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:18.299\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:26.399\nThink of it like checking to see if a lightbulb still lights up, that's a test!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:36.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a written test in school to see how much you learned about history. Or a car company might test a new car to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:44.300\nFor example, a simple math test could be asking you what 2 plus 2 is. The answer, four, shows you understand basic addition.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:55.000\nOr, imagine you're testing a new toy. You'd play with it to see if it's fun and easy to use.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:03.700\nSo, a test is just a way to check something, whether it's your knowledge or the quality of something else. It helps us understand how things work and if they're working correctly.\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:05.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
