    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_161841.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really fundamental: the test.\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like a question, but designed to give you a specific answer.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:23.100\nTests can come in many forms. It could be a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:30.500\nOr maybe you\u2019re baking a cake and you test it with a toothpick to see if it's done. The toothpick comes out clean? That's a pass!\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:37.600\nA test can even be as simple as checking the temperature outside to decide what to wear.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:48.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:52.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
