    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:06.600\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:18.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like a question, or a series of questions, designed to give us information.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:28.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it!\nYou're seeing if the ingredients and instructions result in a tasty dish.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:35.900\nOr, imagine you're trying to fix a toy.\nYou might try different things to see what works and what doesn't.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:42.500\nEach attempt is a little test.\nTests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:54.700\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like figuring out why your plant is wilting.\nThe important thing is that they give us data to work with.\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:04.000\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to get information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
