    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:33.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:47.100\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter to test if it's sweet enough. Schools use tests to see how well you've learned something in class.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:56.100\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even essays. So, tests help us understand where we are, what we know, and what we might need to work on. They're a tool for learning and improvement, not just something to be afraid of.\n```"
