    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.900 --> 00:24.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a set of questions or tasks designed to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:35.400\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\nOr, if you're trying to guess what's in a box, you might shake it to test if you can hear anything.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:46.800\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\nA spelling test checks your spelling skills, while a math test checks your understanding of numbers.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.400\nThey come in many forms, like multiple choice, true or false, or even writing an essay.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:02.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for finding out information.\nIt helps us understand what we know and what we need to learn.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
