    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_163135.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, where you're trying to get information.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:27.300\nFor example, a chef might test a soup by tasting it to see if it needs more salt. Or, a student takes a test at school to show what they've learned.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:36.700\nMaybe you test the batteries in a toy to make sure they still work. So, a test can be anything from a quick taste to a big exam.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:46.400\nThe important thing is that it helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:51.400\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to find things out.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
