    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_163248.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:18.900\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. It helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:35.400\nA teacher uses a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:41.500\nEven a baker tests their cake by poking it to see if it's done!\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:52.500\nSo, tests can be about anything. A lightbulb test makes sure it turns on. A taste test tells you if food is yummy. And a spelling test checks if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.900\nBasically, a test is a method for gathering information and making sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:56.900 --> 00:58.000\nThat's all there is to it!\n\n00:58.000 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
