    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.000\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just asking, you're giving someone a task or a set of questions to answer.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:26.500\nThe main idea behind a test is to see how well someone understands something, or how skilled they are at a certain task.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:37.000\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words. Or, a driving test shows if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.000\nAnother example is a taste test! Maybe you're trying to decide which type of cookie you like best.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:55.300\nYou taste each one, and that's your test! So, to recap, a test helps us measure knowledge, skills, or preferences.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:02.200\nIt's a structured way of finding out information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
