    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test is, in the world of science or even everyday life?\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to see if something is true, accurate, or effective.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like this: You might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, imagine a scientist testing a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:39.400\nThe goal is to gather information and learn something new. For example, a teacher gives you a test in school to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:47.700\nOr, you might test a toy car to see how far it can travel. All these are ways of finding out information.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:56.200\nSo, a test is just a way of checking something and getting a result. It helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
