    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:28.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe by cooking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:40.300\nOr, you might test a toy to see if it's durable enough for playtime. In science and math, tests help us prove ideas.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:52.700\nFor example, if you think plants grow taller with more sunlight, you could test that by growing some plants in the sun and some in the shade, then comparing their heights.\n\n00:52.700 --> 01:00.100\nA test is just a structured way to gather information and see if your idea holds up. So, remember, a test is all about checking things out and seeing what's true.\n```"
