    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how much you know about something. Think of it like checking your knowledge.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.400\nTests can come in many forms. You might have multiple choice questions, where you pick the best answer.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:30.400\nOr maybe fill-in-the-blanks, where you write in the missing word. Sometimes it's a written essay, where you explain your understanding.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:40.500\nFor example, a teacher might give a math test to see if you understand addition and subtraction. Or a spelling test to check your vocabulary.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:46.800\nEven quizzes are a type of test!\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:55.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool. It helps you and others see what you've learned. It's a way to measure your knowledge and figure out what you might need to study more.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
