    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's a process where we gather information to learn more about a person, object, or even an idea.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: your doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to check your understanding of a lesson.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:38.800\nEven tasting a new food is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you like it!\nTests can be written, spoken, physical, or even just an observation.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:45.500\nThe important thing is that they give us data.\nThey help us answer questions and make decisions.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:55.200\nSo, a test is just a way of getting information, whether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even your taste buds!\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
