    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.100\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:05.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:10.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:10.100 --> 00:16.300\nIt's a process that helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:25.700\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:31.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is probably ready.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:39.600\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how well you understand the vocabulary.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:46.400\nTests can be big, like a final exam in school, or small, like checking the batteries in your flashlight.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:49.300\nThey all have the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:55.600\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and confirming something.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
