    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:18.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb turns on.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:24.600\nThe test? Flipping the switch! If the light comes on, the test passes.\nIf it doesn't, the test fails.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:29.800\nTests are everywhere. A doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:34.900\nA baker tests the oven temperature to make sure the cake will bake right.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:44.100\nEven you test things every day, like tasting food to see if it's good.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:51.100\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to confirm that something is doing what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:53.400\nIt\u2019s a simple check.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:54.300\nThat's all there is to it!\n```"
