    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:19.600\nThink of it like asking a question, and the test is how you get the answer.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:27.800\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.300\nOr, a doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:44.800\nAnother example? When you're learning something new, like riding a bike, falling down is kind of like a test.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.000\nIt shows you what not to do next time! So, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:53.200\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n```"
