    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_170629.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:23.900\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if the cookies you just baked are done.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:37.100\nYou might poke one with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:43.600\nThe toothpick coming out clean means the test passed, the cookies are ready.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:50.100\nOr, imagine you're checking if a lightbulb works. You screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:53.400\nThe light turning on? That's a test passing!\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:55.900\nThe light staying off? The test failed.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.400\nSo, a test is just an action that gives you information about something.\n```"
  },
  "d05ea4a2-0954-4566-b4d2-ecc60b6b6da6": {
    "id": "d05ea4a2-0954-4566-b4d2-ecc60b6b6da6",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:25:14.395764",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-04T17:07:18.740513",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260104_170718.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_170718.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, you might think of school, but a test in general is really just a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you test it by sticking a toothpick in.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:33.300\nThat's a test.\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works, you screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:43.300\nIf it lights up, the test is passed!\nTests help us make sure things are safe, reliable, and do what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:56.800\nThey can be simple, like checking if your shoes fit, or more complex, like testing a new medicine.\nBasically, it's all about finding out if something works as expected.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:06.200\nSo, remember, a test is a way of checking something.\nIt helps us understand if it's working right or if it's true.\n\n01:06.200 --> 01:09.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "068b96e2-3e14-4579-b85c-518e9e5a1437": {
    "id": "068b96e2-3e14-4579-b85c-518e9e5a1437",
