    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_170807.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE duration:60.0\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test tells you which food you like best.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:29.600\nTests aren't just for school, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:37.800\nEngineers test bridges to make sure they're safe. Even bakers test their cake batter to see if it's ready for the oven!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:51.200\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. Whether it's a pop quiz or a science experiment, tests help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:56.400\nThey give us information. That\u2019s the basics of testing in a nutshell!\n\n00:56.400 --> 00:60.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
