    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE This subtitle file was created to match the provided narration and timing.  Since the audio file is not provided, the timestamps are approximations based on the requested durations of each section.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to see if something is working correctly, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch \u2013 that's a simple test!\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:34.200\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. Your teacher might give you a test to see how well you've learned a topic in class.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:46.200\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with. For example, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:57.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that means the cake is ready! So, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.300\nRemember, a test is just a way to check something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
