    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:07.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:16.300\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like this: a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it makes people feel better.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:29.600\nOr, a chef might test a recipe by tasting it to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:32.200\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:36.300\nWhen you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:40.400\nWhen you try a new restaurant, you're testing if you like their food!\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:48.000\nSo, a test is just a method to evaluate something, gather information, or check if something works.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:50.800\nIt helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:52.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
