    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_171014.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like an experiment. You ask a question, and the test helps you find the answer.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:37.900\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you which cookie is sweeter. Or, a spelling test can show you which words you know how to spell.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:49.200\nA test can be a quiz in school, checking your understanding, or even a medical test, like checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.800\nSo, remember, tests are all about gathering information. They help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
