    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_171204.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge! It helps you and others see what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:34.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. For example, a quick pop quiz in class is a test. So is a spelling bee, or even just answering questions your teacher asks.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:43.400\nLet's say you're learning about animals. A test might ask you to name different types of birds, or explain what mammals eat.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:58.200\nIt\u2019s just checking to see if you remember the information. So, to recap: a test is a way to measure your knowledge, it comes in many forms, and it helps you and others understand what you've learned.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
