    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:29.500\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an opinion, you get an answer based on evidence.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:39.800\nFor example, a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:47.600\nOr a taste test can help us decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:54.300\nEven doctors use tests to figure out what's going on inside your body. They might test your blood or your vision. So, tests help us learn, compare, and understand things better. They give us information that we can use to make decisions. That's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
