    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:08.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:12.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like an experiment, but often much simpler.\nWe use tests all the time to see if things are working, or to check our knowledge.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:28.600\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:40.500\nOr, think about a spelling test at school.\nThat's a way to test how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:47.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:54.100\nThey help us learn and improve all sorts of things.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
