    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_171647.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.000\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:22.700\nWe use them to find out information or to see if something works the way it should.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:32.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:41.000\nA taste test checks if food tastes good. Even when you try a new video game, you're kind of testing it out to see if you like it!\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:52.200\nTests are important because they help us learn and improve. If you do poorly on a math test, you know you need to study more.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.900\nIf a new toy breaks easily, the company knows they need to make it stronger. So, tests help us understand things better and make things better too! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
