    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_171735.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:27.100\nThink about it. When you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good. Or when you push a button on a remote, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:36.800\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. They can be as simple as multiple choice questions or even drawing a picture.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:46.300\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:57.600\nOr a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people. Tests give us information that helps us make better decisions.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:05.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:09.800\nIt's a tool we use to understand the world around us.\n\n01:09.800 --> 01:14.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
