    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:24.900\nIt could be about you, like a quiz in school, or about a product, like seeing how strong a new phone is.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:29.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if an apple is sweet.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:34.500\nSo, you take a bite \u2013 that's your test!\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:46.200\nThe taste tells you if it's sweet or not. Another example? Imagine you're trying to bake a cake. The recipe is like a test. If you follow it correctly and the cake rises, you passed the test!\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:50.700\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and learn more about whatever we're testing.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.300\nIt gives us evidence. It's all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
