    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.500\nIt's a process that helps us learn more about an object, a person, or even an idea.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:32.500\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:46.600\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it comes out delicious.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:53.400\nSo, tests come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to gather information and help us understand things better.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.000\nThey help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions. That's the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
