    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: you take a quiz in school to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:36.400\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:45.700\nSome are multiple choice, others require you to write out your answers. Some tests are physical, like testing how far you can jump.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:55.400\nOthers are more about your thoughts and feelings. For example, a taste test can help you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:03.200\nOr, a spelling test tells you how well you know your words. Ultimately, tests help us learn more and make better decisions.\n\n01:03.200 --> 01:07.500\nSo, a test is just a tool for gathering information.\n\n01:07.500 --> 01:10.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
