    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_172658.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question, but instead of just listening, you're looking for evidence.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor might test your temperature to see if you have a fever. That's one kind of test!\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:30.100\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic. That's another kind of test.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:38.100\nTests aren't just for people, either. A mechanic might test a car battery to see if it's working properly.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:48.100\nThey use special tools to gather information and make a decision. So, a test is all about gathering information to answer a question.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:54.400\nIt helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
