    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests! In simple terms, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:15.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is baked properly, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:26.000\nThat's a test! More formally, a test helps us see if something works as expected, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:36.200\nWe use tests all the time. For example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:50.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. Even video games use tests to make sure everything is running smoothly.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:59.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check if something is working correctly or meeting specific requirements.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:00.000\nTests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n```"
