    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.300\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:34.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test, to see if you can follow the recipe and create something delicious!\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:46.600\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a medical exam, or even trying out a new recipe, a test helps us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:56.400\nRemember, tests aren't scary; they're just tools for learning and improvement. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
