    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:25.900\nFor example, you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:30.100\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:36.200\nSee? Different kinds of tests, different purposes.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:41.400\nAnother example is baking a cake.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:46.600\nYou test the cake by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:51.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test!\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:56.500\nSo, a test helps us learn or confirm something. It gives us information we didn't have before. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
