    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.600 --> 00:06.600\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: a test!\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:11.600\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:13.800\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:18.400\nThink of it like this: you touch a hot stove. That's a test!\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:21.600\nThe result? You learn it's hot.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:23.900\nOr, you try a new recipe.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:26.600\nThe taste? That's the test result!\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:32.900\nIn school, tests help us see how well we've learned something.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:35.700\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just practice problems.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:42.000\nTests aren't about being scary. They\u2019re about learning and improving.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:47.200\nThey give us information to understand where we are and where we need to go.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:50.600\nSo embrace the test! It's just a tool.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
