    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:37.400\nFor example, when you flip a light switch, you're testing if the lightbulb works. Or, when you taste a new food, you're testing if you like the flavor.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:48.000\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. And in science, tests, or experiments, help us understand how the world works.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:54.600\nSo, tests are all about gathering information. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:56.000\nThat's the basics of tests!\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
