    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_173925.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:28.200\nIt helps us see if something is working, how good something is, or even if we understand something. Think of it like this: a chef might taste their soup \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:39.700\nOr, when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you learned the material. Even checking if your phone charger is working is a type of test!\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:50.100\nYou're trying to find out if it's doing its job. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:56.100\nThey're all around us! In short, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
