    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test, at its core, is really just a way to find something out.\nIt's a process of asking a question and then figuring out the answer.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: you might take a quiz in school to test your knowledge of a subject.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:33.000\nEven baking a cake is a test!\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:42.000\nSo, tests can come in many forms and measure all sorts of things.\nWhat's important is that they give us information.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:53.200\nThey help us understand something better, whether it's our understanding of history, or the health of our bodies, or even just how well a cake recipe works.\n\n00:53.200 --> 01:01.000\nEssentially, a test is a question, a method, and an answer.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
