    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_174204.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: Tests.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:17.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information or see if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:29.500\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of a bath to make sure it's just right. Or, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel unwell.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:45.300\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand a subject. So, whether it's checking if a lightbulb works or answering questions on a quiz, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:52.700\nThey give us valuable information and help us make better decisions. That's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
