    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_174259.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.799\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.799 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:26.600\nIt helps us see if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:33.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:39.800\nA taste test checks if food tastes good.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:46.400\nOr, a medical test checks if you're healthy. Tests come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:57.300\nSo, a test is really just a method to gather information and make a judgment about something. Whether it's a school exam or checking if your bike tires have enough air, you're performing a test! Remember, tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
