    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_174356.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.500\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:38.400\nThat's a test! Or maybe you want to know if your friend likes your new shoes, so you ask them.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:47.100\nThat's another kind of test! Tests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:53.700\nThe main point is, tests help us learn something new or confirm something we already thought.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:56.800\nSo, a test is a method for getting information, from baking a cake to taking a quiz. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
