    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:10.700\nWhat are they?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:25.500\nIt's a method or procedure for determining the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\nOr if you\u2019re buying a used car, you take it for a test drive to test how well it runs.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:37.000\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\nTests can be anything from a simple question to a complex experiment.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:45.700\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\nThey help us make decisions, improve things, and learn more.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:57.600\nSo, tests are all about gathering information to better understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
