    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_175140.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:04.700\nToday we're diving into the world of \"Tests.\"\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:07.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:11.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:16.000\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, correct, or working as expected.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:19.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:24.000\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:27.000\nSee? In both examples, we're using a test to get an answer.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:30.500\nMaybe it's the right spelling, or maybe it's your favorite flavor.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:37.000\nTests are all around us, helping us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:41.500\nSo, remember, a test is a process to get information and find something out.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:44.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
