    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_175233.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:07.300\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.300\nWhether it's checking if you understand a lesson in school, if a new medicine works, or even if a website works correctly.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:24.600\nThe main goal of a test is to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:28.300\nThink about it like this:\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:32.200\na spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:36.500\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:44.500\nAnd computer programmers use tests to make sure their software doesn't have any errors.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:52.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.900\nBasically, they give us valuable feedback.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:01.600\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check something and get information about it.\n\n01:01.600 --> 01:03.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
