    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:22.800\nWe use tests every day without even realizing it! Think about it: When you try a new recipe, you're testing if it's delicious.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:32.600\nOr when you flip a light switch, you're testing if the lightbulb works. In school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:41.300\nThey can be multiple choice, short answer, or even hands-on projects. The goal is to show what you know.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:55.700\nSo, tests help us learn, discover, and check if things are working the way they should. They come in many forms, but all tests have the same purpose: to give us information.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
