    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see what we've learned, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:25.900\nThink about it like this: If you're learning to bake a cake, the tasting is a test!\nYou're testing to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:36.900\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how many words you've learned.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:45.800\nTests aren't just about grades in school, though.\nThey can be used to check if a new toy is safe, or if a medicine is effective.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:54.600\nThey help us understand things better.\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and evaluating something.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.200\nIt's all about learning and improving!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
