    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:27.000\nIt helps us understand if something is true, working correctly, or meeting a certain standard.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:41.400\nThink about it like this: You take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words. Or a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n00:41.400 --> 00:49.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious!\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:58.300\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. They can be as simple as tasting food to see if it needs more salt, or as complicated as a scientific experiment.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.700\nThe important thing is that a test provides information.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:05.300\nIn short, a test is a process for gathering information to evaluate something.\n01:05.300 --> 01:08.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
