    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:25.700\nThe main idea behind any test is to get information.\nIt could be to see if a bridge is strong enough, or if you understand a lesson in school.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:33.600\nTests help us measure things!\nFor example, your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:40.000\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\nThese are both tests!\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:50.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information or measuring something specific.\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
