    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_181532.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling the concept of a test.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:17.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.700\nTests help us learn and understand. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:35.800\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. Scientists also use tests all the time to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:51.100\nThey might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better. So, remember, a test is just a way of checking something \u2013 whether it's your knowledge, your opinion, or if something actually works.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:56.800\nTests are super important for learning and discovering new things.\n\n00:56.800 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
