    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.800\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:25.800\nIt could be checking if you understand a topic, like in school, or checking if something works correctly, like a new gadget.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:36.900\nThink of it like this: you're trying to find out if something is true or false, good or bad, working or broken.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:40.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:50.500\nOr imagine you're baking a cake, and you taste it to see if it's sweet enough. That's a test! You're checking the cake's sweetness.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:57.700\nSo, a test is simply a method to evaluate or examine something to see if it meets a certain standard or works as expected. It\u2019s a way to gather information and make a decision. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
