    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_182020.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:09.100\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:09.100 --> 00:21.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\nThink of it like a detective collecting clues.\nThe 'something' could be anything!\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:32.500\nA test could check your knowledge, like a quiz at school, or it could check the quality of a product, like making sure a toy is safe.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:35.100\nFor example, a cookie company might test new recipes to see which one people like best.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:45.900\nOr, a doctor might use a blood test to check if you're healthy.\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:52.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\nThey help us make better decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
