    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:22.000\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:32.100\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nThink about it.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:45.400\nA doctor gives you a checkup \u2013 that's a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:55.100\nEven a quick glance outside to see if it's raining is a kind of test!\nSo, tests help us learn, check things, and make decisions.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.700\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like tasting that cake.\nThe important thing is they give us information.\nTo recap, a test is simply a way of gathering information to answer a question.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
