    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_182521.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:18.800\nIt could be about anything! Think of it like an experiment, but often on a smaller scale.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:30.100\nFor example, a spelling test helps you find out how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test can help you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:38.500\nTests aren\u2019t just in school, either. When you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:49.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a method of gathering information. It helps you learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:56.400\nIt's a simple way to explore the world around you. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
