    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like an experiment, or a way to gather information.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:32.300\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:43.100\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned. Even tasting a new food is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:50.600\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's about our health, our knowledge, or even just our personal preferences.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:58.700\nThey give us valuable information. To recap, a test is a procedure used to gather information. It helps us learn and understand more about the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
