    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_182716.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.400\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skill, or performance.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You insert a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:25.600\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:35.000\nOr, maybe you're learning to ride a bike. You practice balancing, and eventually, you can ride without training wheels. That's a test of your balancing skills!\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:41.800\nTests aren't just about grades in school. They're about checking if something works, if you've learned something, or if something is true.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:52.300\nSo, a test is just a method to get information. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
