    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:07.700\nIt's like an experiment, but maybe a little simpler.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:11.000\nWe use tests all the time to see if something is true, or to measure something.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:18.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:21.900\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which food tastes the best.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:24.600\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:29.200\nSo, tests help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:33.300\nThey come in many forms, but they all have the same basic idea: to get information.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:37.500\nIn a nutshell, a test is just a way to gather data and answer a question.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:38.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
