    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_183047.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.300\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we don't just mean a school exam. A test is really just a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:24.100\nThink about it like this: if you bake a cake, you might taste a small piece \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:30.100\nOr, imagine you're buying a new toy. You'd probably try it out, right?\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:36.500\nSee if it moves, makes noise, whatever it's supposed to do. That's a test too!\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:42.900\nTests help us find problems and make things better.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:59.400\nSo, whether it's checking if a car engine is running smoothly or making sure your video game works correctly, tests are all about making sure things are doing what they should.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:02.600\nIn short, a test is simply a way to check if something is working as expected.\n\n01:02.600 --> 01:04.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
