    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:23.800\nIt's a process designed to give us information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:32.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells us how well you can spell. A taste test tells us how good something tastes.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:40.800\nOr, a test drive helps you figure out if you like a new car. Tests aren't just in school, they're everywhere!\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:51.400\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:56.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
