    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_183217.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.400\nToday we're going to talk about something really important: tests.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:22.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about a specific topic. \n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.200\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain! The purpose of a test isn't just to give you a grade. \n\n00:30.200 --> 00:40.200\nIt's actually a tool to help you learn. By identifying what you know and what you still need to work on, tests can point you in the right direction.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:47.900\nFor example, a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice. A math quiz reveals which types of problems you might need to review. \n\n00:47.900 --> 00:54.800\nAnd even a taste test can tell you which flavors you like best! So, remember, tests aren't scary. \n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.400\nThey're just helpful tools that give you information. They show you what you've learned and where you can grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
