    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:25.300\nIt's like checking to see if you've learned the material. Think of it like this: if you're learning to ride a bike, a test might be seeing if you can ride around the block without falling.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.400\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, a test could be pointing to different letters and naming them correctly. See, simple!\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:37.900\nTests aren't just about getting a grade.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:45.200\nThey help you and your teachers understand what you're doing well and what you might need a little more practice with.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:50.400\nSo, don't be afraid of tests! They're just a tool to help you learn.\n\n00:50.400 --> 01:01.000\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check your knowledge and see how you're progressing. It's a learning tool, not something to be scared of.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
