    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_183622.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHey there, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: Tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it this way: a doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.800\nIn both cases, they're using the test to gather information.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:40.000\nAnother example? You might test if a toy car works by putting batteries in it and seeing if it moves.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:48.300\nThe result of that test tells you if the car is working correctly.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:56.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and see if something is true or working as expected.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.200\nWhether it's checking your health, your knowledge, or a toy, tests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
