    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a process designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:36.900\nOr, if you're learning to drive, you'll take a driving test to prove you know the rules of the road. Even baking a cake can be a test \u2013 did you follow the recipe correctly? Does it taste good?\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:46.700\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, from quizzes at school to practical exams in real life. They help us understand where we're at and what we need to learn.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:56.700\nBasically, a test is a method to determine something about you or something else.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
