    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.500\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:36.000\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're basically testing it to see if you like the taste. Or, if you're trying to figure out why your bike won't move, you might test each part, like the tires or the brakes. These tests can be simple, like checking if the light switch works, or more complicated, like a doctor running blood tests.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:45.600\nBut the idea is always the same: to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:57.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out. It helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:03.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
