    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:06.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:11.600\nThink of it like checking if something works, or seeing how much you know about a topic.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:15.700\nIt's a structured way to get an answer to a question.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:21.200\nA test can be anything from a simple yes or no question, to a more complex exam with lots of parts.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:24.500\nFor example, a taste test can tell you which flavor you prefer.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:27.900\nOr, a spelling test can show how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:31.700\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:35.800\nThey show us what we understand, and what we need to work on.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:41.400\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to learn something new about yourself\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:43.400\nor the world around you!\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:45.300\nThis video was created by\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:47.400\nApilage AI.\n```"
