    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the wonderful world of tests!\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:35.100\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to see how healthy you are. Tests help us understand where we're at and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:41.300\nAnother example is a taste test! You try two different kinds of cookies and decide which one you like best.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:52.400\nThat's a test too! So, in short, a test is just a method for finding information, whether it's about your knowledge, your health, or even your favorite cookie.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:58.200\nThey help us learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
