    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.400\nIt's a process designed to get information. Think about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:29.900\nOr maybe you take a quiz in school to show what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test, to see if the recipe works!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:45.800\nTests can be written, like a multiple-choice exam, or practical, like driving a car. They can be formal, like a scientific experiment, or informal, like trying out a new restaurant.\n\n00:45.800 --> 01:01.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a way of gathering information through a specific process. It helps us understand something better, whether it's our health, our knowledge, or even just how tasty a cake is.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:05.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
