    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.800\nWhat is a test anyway?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:22.000\nIt helps us check if things are working, or if we understand something.\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you taste it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:25.800\nYou're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:34.600\nOr, maybe you're learning to ride a bike, and you try to ride without training wheels.\nYou're testing if you can balance.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:42.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nIn school, you take tests to see how well you\u2019ve learned the material.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:50.800\nAt the doctor's office, they might run tests to see if you're healthy.\nSo, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:58.500\nTo recap, tests help us check things, understand things, and learn things.\nThey're everywhere!\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
