    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_184838.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're tackling something fundamental: the concept of a test.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a method used to gather information or see if something works as expected.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:28.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:32.700\nSee? Different situations, same idea.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:40.800\nAnother example is a spelling test in school. It helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:53.500\nOr even testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids. So, in short, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate, measure, or confirm something.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:00.400\nIt helps us learn and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
