    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like checking your knowledge or checking if something is good enough.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:32.400\nWe see tests all the time. Like, in school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:43.000\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt. Even a phone company tests their new phone to make sure it doesn't break when you drop it.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:52.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something. Whether it's your understanding of a topic, the quality of food, or the durability of a product.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.700\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
