    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.500\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think about it like this: you might test if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:32.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you they're ready! Or, maybe you test the batteries in your remote to see if they work.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:44.700\nYou're trying to find out something specific. Tests can be simple, like checking the weather before you go outside, or more complex, like taking a quiz in school.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:54.700\nBut in all cases, you're using a test to learn something new. So, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:01.500\nIt helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
