    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.800\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:01.800 --> 00:04.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:07.100\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see what happens.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it like this: you're trying to bake a cake. The recipe is your plan, but tasting the batter before baking is a test.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:18.700\nYou're testing if the ingredients are balanced and if it tastes good.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:23.300\nAnother example is checking if a light bulb works before you screw it in.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:25.200\nYou\u2019re testing to see if it lights up.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:32.700\nTests help us make decisions, learn new things, and make sure everything is working the way it should.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:34.600\nIn short, testing is all about finding out!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:48.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
