    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_185828.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:33.500\nIt's a process, usually with questions or tasks, designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even your feelings about something.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:41.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:49.900\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:58.200\nEven a doctor giving you an exam is performing tests to understand your health.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:06.200\nSo, tests are everywhere!\n\n01:06.200 --> 01:10.600\nThey help us learn about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n01:10.600 --> 01:18.900\nThey can be used to assess progress, identify strengths and weaknesses, and make informed decisions.\n\n01:18.900 --> 01:24.000\nBasically, a test is just a tool for gathering information.\n\n01:24.000 --> 01:24.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
