    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_190328.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:24.300\nIt helps us check if things are working correctly or if someone knows something. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.900\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:41.100\nTests aren't just for people, either! Engineers test bridges to make sure they're strong enough.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:52.300\nCompanies test new products to see if they work as expected. So, to recap, a test is a way to evaluate or examine something to see if it meets certain standards or to measure its knowledge or abilities.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:59.400\nThey help us learn and improve things all around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
