    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE\nAll timings are approximate.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you an answer.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:26.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. When you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:35.600\nWhen a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:41.900\nLet's say you want to know if a plant needs water. You can test this by touching the soil.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:48.200\nIf it's dry, the plant probably needs water. That's a simple test!\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. It's a question that we ask to get an answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
