    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_190457.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use them all the time, in all sorts of situations.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like this: you might test if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick. Or, you might test the water temperature before jumping in a pool.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:35.600\nIn school, a test helps your teacher understand what you've learned. It could be a quiz, an exam, or even just a project.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:48.300\nThe goal is to see if you understand the main ideas. So, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of animals or describe what they eat.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:59.600\nBasically, a test is just a check-up to see where you're at. It helps you, and others, understand what you know and what you might need to learn more about.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:03.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
