    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a way of measuring or evaluating something, whether it's your knowledge, your abilities, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:28.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:37.300\nA taste test lets you evaluate how good something tastes.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:44.300\nAnd a stress test on a bridge helps engineers find out if it's strong enough.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:52.700\nSo, tests help us learn. They give us information. They can show us what we already know, and what we still need to work on. They can even help us make better decisions.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.300\nBasically, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
