    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like an investigation.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:20.500\nWe want to see if something is true, or how well something works. For example, maybe you're baking a cake.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:28.500\nYou might take a small taste to test if it needs more sugar. Or, think about taking a spelling test at school.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:36.100\nThat shows how well you know your spelling words. Doctors use tests too, to see if you're healthy!\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:43.700\nThey might check your temperature, or your heart rate. So, a test is simply a method or procedure for determining the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:57.200\nIt helps us learn more and make better decisions. That\u2019s the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
