    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_191102.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.700\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in a broader sense, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:22.600\nIt's how we find out if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: you test a lightbulb to see if it turns on. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.700\nOr, you might test a recipe by cooking it to see if it tastes good. That\u2019s another test!\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:42.400\nEven checking if your shoes fit properly before you buy them is a type of test.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:52.500\nSo, a test is simply a procedure designed to verify or evaluate something. It helps us make decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.800\nTo recap, tests are everywhere, and they help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
