    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:19.100\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something specific. Think of it like a question you're trying to answer, but instead of just guessing, you use a process to get a more accurate answer.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:31.600\nFor example, a spelling test helps you find out how well you know how to spell different words. Or think about a taste test, that helps you find out which food you like better.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:40.700\nDoctors use tests to see if you are healthy.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:51.200\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information to answer a question. Whether it's about spelling, food, or your health, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:55.800\nThat's the basic idea of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
