    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.999\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.999 --> 00:19.300\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:25.500\nIt's like an experiment, but often shorter and more focused.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:33.800\nWe use tests all the time to see if something is working, to check our knowledge, or to compare different things.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:45.500\nThink about it. When you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test! Or, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:59.200\nEven a doctor using a stethoscope to listen to your heart is performing a kind of test. Basically, a test involves setting up a situation and then observing the results.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.200\nThe results help us make decisions, improve things, or just learn more.\n\n01:02.200 --> 01:05.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to get information!\n\n01:05.200 --> 01:07.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
