    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.800\nA test is simply a way to find out information about something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.900\nIt can be anything, from a simple yes or no question to a more complex assessment.\nThe main goal of a test is to evaluate or measure something.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:35.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\nA taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\nAnd even a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:50.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and measure something, whether it's knowledge, preferences, or even your health.\nThey help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
