    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:11.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:22.000\nIt could be checking if something is working, or if something is true. Think about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:30.400\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see if you understand a lesson. In both cases, they're checking something!\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:34.200\nAnother example? Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:38.600\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:43.000\nSee? Testing is all around us.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:50.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something. It helps us understand if things are working, true, or need a little adjustment.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
