    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of testing.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:14.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you test it by sticking a toothpick in. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done. That's a test!\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:29.700\nOr maybe you're learning a new language. A quiz is a test to see how well you understand the vocabulary.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:36.900\nTests can be big or small. A school exam is a big test, but even just trying out a new recipe is a little test to see if you like it.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:44.700\nThe main idea is that a test helps us learn and make sure things are working as expected.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:54.700\nSo, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
