    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_192003.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It could be to see if something works, to check if you know something, or even to try something new and see what happens.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:28.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:39.700\nA test can be as simple as trying a new recipe to see if you like it! So, tests help us learn, understand, and improve things.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:51.100\nThey're a fundamental part of how we explore the world around us. From checking if a lightbulb works to taking an exam, tests give us valuable information.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:56.400\nIn short, a test is just a way to get answers!\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nThanks for watching. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
