    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nNow, you might be thinking of school exams, but in this case, a \"test\" is just a way to check if something is working as expected.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, right? You test it by sticking a toothpick in.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:26.900\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:31.500\nOr, imagine you're building a tower of blocks.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:34.300\nYou gently push it to see if it's stable.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:37.100\nThat little push? Another test!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:43.500\nTests help us find problems early, before they become bigger issues.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:51.900\nSo, testing is all about checking things to make sure they are doing what they're supposed to be doing. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
