    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.800\nHey there! Welcome.\n\n00:01.800 --> 00:07.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:12.200\nNow, what is a test?\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:21.300\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:29.100\nA chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:33.600\nOr maybe you take a quiz in school to test what you've learned.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:38.900\nSo, tests help us understand something better, or see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:43.600\nWhether it's a medical exam, a taste test, or a school assignment, tests are everywhere.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:45.700\nThey give us information.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:49.200\nIn short, a test is a way to find out about something.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
