    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:19.700\nIt's like an experiment where you try something out and see what happens.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your plant needs water.\nThe test? You poke your finger in the soil.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:32.000\nIf it feels dry, the test tells you it needs water!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:37.800\nAnother example: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\nThe test? You stick a toothpick in them.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:42.800\nIf it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:45.800\nSo, a test is just a simple procedure to check something and get an answer.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:49.500\nIt helps us learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
