    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:28.100\nIt's a process we use to evaluate, check, or measure things.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:31.900\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:37.700\nOr, a baker might taste a cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:46.900\nSee? Different situations, same idea. Tests aren't just for school, though they're definitely part of that! They're everywhere.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:55.600\nWe test recipes, we test products to make sure they're safe, and even scientists test their ideas to see if they're true.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.200\nSo, a test is simply a method to gather information and assess something. It helps us understand things better!\n```"
  },
