    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_193228.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: Tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and then finding the answer.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:27.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if you don't realize it. For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good. Or, if you press a button on a toy, you're testing if it still works.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:37.200\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you\u2019ve learned. They can be quizzes, projects, or even just asking questions in class.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:50.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and learn something new. They help us understand things better.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
