    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:10.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:22.300\nIt's a method we use to check knowledge, abilities, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:29.200\nA taste test checks how good food tastes.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:31.900\nAnd a strength test checks how strong you are!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:35.800\nTests can come in many forms.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:38.000\nThey can be written, like quizzes.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:40.900\nThey can be practical, like a driving test.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:45.200\nOr they can be observations, like watching how a plant grows in different conditions.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:51.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.500\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we need to improve.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
