    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. It could be about you, like a quiz in school, or about a product, like checking if a toy is safe.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:26.500\nThe main goal is to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:35.300\nThink about baking a cake. You taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Or imagine a doctor checking your temperature; that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:50.400\nTests help us make decisions and understand the world around us better. So, remember, tests are all about gathering information to see if something works, is safe, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
