    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is baked, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:29.700\nThe toothpick is your test! Tests help us see if something is working correctly, if something is true or false, or even just to gather information.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:39.500\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Or, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:48.600\nSo, whether it's checking if your cookies are ready or making sure a bridge is safe, tests are all about finding things out.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:55.900\nThey help us understand the world around us. Remember, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
