    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:21.600\nYou use a test \u2013 poking them with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, they pass the test!\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:28.500\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:37.500\nTeachers give you tests to see what you've learned. Even trying a new recipe is a test \u2013 you're checking if you like the taste!\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:47.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information about something. It helps us make decisions and understand things better.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:53.400\nIt's about checking and learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
