    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.000\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:34.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:45.800\nA taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you like best.\nAnd a medical test can help doctors figure out what's going on with your health.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:55.600\nSo, whether it's a quiz in school, trying out a new recipe, or a doctor checking your blood pressure, these are all examples of tests!\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.300\nThey all help us gather information and make decisions.\nRemember, tests are just tools to help us learn and understand things better.\n```"
  },
