    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:08.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.100\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, a product's quality, or even how well a plant is growing.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:28.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:32.300\nA taste test decides which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:37.500\nAnd even when you check if a lightbulb works, you're performing a test!\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:41.400\nTests give us information.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:46.100\nThey help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:51.000\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a method for getting answers.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:51.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
