    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand what you're looking at.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:24.500\nThe main idea behind a test is to check if something works correctly, or has the properties you expect.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:37.100\nFor example, you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough. Or, a doctor might test your reflexes to see if your nervous system is working properly. Even a quiz at school is a kind of test, checking what you've learned!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:48.500\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and making sure things are as they should be. Remember, a test helps you understand and evaluate something.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
