    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. It helps us understand if something is working the way it should, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:33.500\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:43.200\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:51.800\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test! You're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:58.800\nSo, tests are just tools we use to learn and make sure things are okay. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the main idea is always the same: to check something and get information. Remember, a test is a tool for learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
