    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.000\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps us see how well we know our spelling.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:34.200\nA taste test lets us decide which food we like best. Even a simple battery test tells us if a battery is working properly!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:47.300\nSo, a test helps us measure or evaluate something. We use tests to learn what we know, find out what we need to improve on, and even compare different things.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:57.500\nBasically, tests are everywhere, helping us understand the world a little bit better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
