    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:20.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something,\nwhether that's your knowledge, a product's quality,\nor even if a plant is getting enough sunlight.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:34.000\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if you learned something in class,\nyou take a test. Or, if you want to make sure a new toy is safe for kids,\nyou test it to see if it breaks easily.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:46.800\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on when you're not feeling well.\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:59.200\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: to get information.\nWe use tests every day, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
