    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process that gives us information.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:35.600\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\nOr, a doctor might test your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:48.100\nTests can be used for all sorts of things!\nThey can help us learn new things, check if something is working correctly, or even compare different things to each other.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:58.200\nFor example, you might take a quiz in school \u2013 that's a test to see how much you learned.\nOr, you might test different brands of batteries to see which one lasts the longest.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\nIt helps us answer questions and learn more about the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
