    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_195504.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey there, welcome! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered exactly what it means?\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:15.900\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:25.900\nIt's a method we use to check or evaluate. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:36.100\nOr, a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough. A teacher gives you a test in school to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:43.600\nSo, tests can be anything from a quick taste to a long exam.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:48.600\nThe important thing is they help us understand something better or make a decision based on the results.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:55.100\nThey give us information! That's the basic idea behind a test. It's all about checking and evaluating. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
