    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 specifically, what a test is in the simplest terms.\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:17.500\nBasically, a test is just a way to find something out. It's a procedure you follow to get information.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:29.700\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes a soup \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt. Or, you might check the temperature outside before deciding what to wear.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:34.500\nThat\u2019s a test to see if it's cold or warm.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:42.900\nAnother example? A doctor might give you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:51.900\nOr you might take a written test in school to show what you've learned. So, to recap, a test is just a process for gathering information.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.400\nIt helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
