    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:09.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like this: your teacher might give you a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:28.400\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:31.200\nThe main goal is to gather information.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:36.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling rules.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:39.500\nA taste test checks how good a new recipe tastes.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:42.700\nThey both give us information about something specific.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:50.300\nSo, a test is really just a way of gathering information to see what you know, or how something performs.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.700\nIt helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
