    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like an experiment, but usually with questions or tasks. We use tests to see what someone knows, how well something works, or even what something is made of.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:35.300\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words. A battery test checks if your batteries are still good.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:47.100\nAnd a blood test can tell doctors about your health. So, tests help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:55.200\nThey're a crucial part of learning and problem-solving in all sorts of fields. Remember, a test is simply a tool for gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
