    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.900\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate something specific. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:30.600\nA taste test tells you which food you like better. Or even a simple tap of your knee at the doctor's is a test of your reflexes.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:41.000\nSo, tests aren't just about school. They're all around us, helping us learn, compare, and understand things better.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:56.300\nThey help us measure and assess different qualities. To recap, a test is a method used to evaluate something, whether it's your spelling skills, your taste preferences, or your physical abilities.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:02.300\nIt's all about finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
