    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_200519.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much someone knows or how well they can do something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like checking if a cake is baked properly.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:27.600\nYou wouldn't just guess, right? You'd stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:37.100\nTests do the same thing for knowledge and skills. They help us measure what we've learned.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:45.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or a driving test shows if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:53.500\nSo, tests are just tools. They help us learn where we're strong and where we might need a little more practice. They give us information.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:58.300\nRemember, tests aren't about being perfect, they're about showing what you know and helping you improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
