    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.300\nNow, in the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:30.900\nIt's a process we use to see if something is working correctly, or to measure how well something is performing.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:37.900\nThink of it like this: you might give a plant some water and then test to see if it grows.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:47.300\nOr, you might test a new recipe by cooking it and then tasting it.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:56.800\nThe results tell you something about the water's effect on the plant, or how delicious the recipe is.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:02.400\nTests can be formal, like a math exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes are tied before you go outside.\n```"
