    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It\u2019s a process we use to gather information and learn more about something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done. You use a toothpick \u2013 that's your test!\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:30.700\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready. Or maybe you want to see if a plant needs water.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:36.700\nYou stick your finger in the soil. If it feels dry, you know it's time to water. That's another test!\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:45.500\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking the cake. The important thing is that they help us understand something better.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:55.100\nSo, a test is just a tool for learning and gathering information.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
