    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:25.100\nIt could be to see if you've learned something new, like a quiz in school. Or, it could be to check if something is working correctly, like testing a new toy to make sure it doesn't break.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:36.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy. A baker might test their cake batter to see if it tastes good before baking the whole cake.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:39.100\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:51.600\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:58.400\nIt helps us understand more about the world. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
