    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_201342.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:05.100\nToday we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:08.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out what you know about something.\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:11.900\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your brain!\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:16.100\nBasically, a test presents you with questions or tasks, and your answers show how well you understand the topic.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:19.600\nThere are lots of different kinds of tests.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:24.400\nImagine a spelling quiz where you write down words, or a multiple-choice test where you pick the best answer.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:27.400\nEven a driving test is a test!\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:30.000\nIt shows if you know how to operate a car safely.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:35.800\nSo, tests help you and your teachers see what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:38.300\nThey're not scary, just a helpful tool.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:43.400\nRemember to relax, do your best, and think of a test as a chance to show off your knowledge!\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:45.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
