    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.100\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, your teacher gives you a test in class to see what you've learned.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:36.100\nTests can be written, like a quiz, or they can be practical, like seeing if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:43.200\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:51.400\nThey help us make decisions and learn new things. So, a test is simply a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.000\nThat's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
