    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.900\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in this case, we're talking about something a little broader: a test is simply a way to check if something works as it should.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you test it by tasting it to see if it's good. That's a test!\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.800\nOr, maybe you write a new email. You send it to yourself to test if the formatting looks right. That\u2019s another test!\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.600\nTests are all about verifying things.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:50.100\nThey help us find problems early, so we can fix them before they become bigger issues. So, in a nutshell, a test is a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:54.900\nIt helps us find and fix problems.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
