    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.600\nIt helps us check if something is working, understand a subject better, or even see how well we've learned something new.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:30.700\nThink of it like this: You might test a toy to see if it needs new batteries. Or your teacher might give you a spelling test to see how many words you know.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.100\nAnother example is a taste test! You try different foods to see which one you like best.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:49.800\nSo, tests are just tools to help us learn and understand. They can be used in all sorts of situations, from checking your toys to learning new things in school. They help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
