    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it as a question you're asking, but instead of just asking with words, you're asking with actions or observations.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:29.600\nThe main idea is to see how something behaves under certain conditions. For example, a taste test helps you find out which food people like the most.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:36.500\nOr a medical test can tell you if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:43.700\nAnother example is when you try a new recipe. You're testing if it works, right?\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:56.300\nYou follow the instructions and see if you get a delicious cake! If it doesn't work, you learn something and can try again.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:03.700\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is an experiment or a process to gather information and learn something new. It helps us answer questions and make better decisions.\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:07.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
