    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, think of it as a way to find out information.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a process where you try something out to see what happens or to see if something works.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:30.300\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:37.200\nOr, imagine you're trying a new toy. You're testing it to see if it's fun and how it works.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:46.200\nEssentially, a test helps us learn and make sure things are working as they should. It's a way of checking things out.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:52.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information by trying something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
