    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:19.500\nA test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:29.400\nThink of it like a measuring tool for your knowledge.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:38.600\nYou can have tests in school, like quizzes or exams, but tests can also be used to check anything, really.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:41.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:46.800\nOr, you could even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:50.000\nSo, basically, a test helps you understand something better by giving you information about it.\n```"
