    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_204159.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, right?\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:25.500\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it like this: you might test if the oven is hot by carefully holding your hand near it, or you might test if a lightbulb works by flipping the switch.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:36.700\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned. A math test, for example, checks if you know how to add and subtract.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:44.700\nA spelling test checks if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:53.500\nSee, testing is all about checking something. So, remember, a test is just a way to check if something is true or working, or if you understand something.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:59.500\nIt helps us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
