    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.800\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:8.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:13.400\nThink of it like this: you use a thermometer to test the temperature.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:16.300\nOr a taste test to see if food is good.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:20.300\nIn school, tests help us figure out how much you've learned.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:22.900\nThey're like check-ins to see where you're at.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:27.600\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:32.100\nA math test shows how well you understand numbers and equations.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:37.200\nSo, tests aren't scary! They're just tools to help you and your teachers understand what you know\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:42.500\nand what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:47.700\nThey show us where we are on our learning journey.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:51.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
