    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like an experiment, but usually with a specific goal in mind.\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:28.000\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter to see if it's sweet enough \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:38.500\nOr, if you're learning a new skill, like riding a bike, you're constantly testing your balance.\nYou try different things to see what works.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:50.200\nTests can be simple, like that cake batter, or more formal, like a school exam.\nThe important thing is they help us gather information and learn.\n\n00:50.200 --> 01:00.800\nSo, a test is really just a way of checking something, experimenting, and learning from the results.\nPretty cool, right?\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:04.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
