    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_204451.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHi there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:17.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out or see how well something works.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:36.300\nOr, maybe you want to know if your toy car can go fast. You'd test it by pushing it and seeing how far it goes.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:48.000\nA test can be anything from a quick check to a more formal exam. For example, a doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see. Or, a teacher might give you a quiz to test what you've learned in class.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:53.700\nSo, a test helps us understand something better by giving us information or results. It's all about finding out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
