    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:23.300\nIt's a process designed to give us information about something specific. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:30.400\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. These are both tests!\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:40.200\nTests aren't just for people, either. We can test products to see if they're safe, or test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:49.700\nThe key is that we're trying to get some kind of answer. So, a test is a way to gather information and understand something better.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:55.400\nThat's the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
