    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a right or wrong answer.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:34.900\nThe main idea behind a test is to see what you know, or how well something works.\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.900\nFor example, a spelling test tells us how well you spell.\nOr, a taste test helps decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.400\nEven a medical test can tell you if you're healthy.\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool for finding information.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.000\nIt can measure knowledge, performance, or just about anything else!\nI hope that helps you understand the basics of tests.\n```"
