    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_204718.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.700\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. Think of it as a question you ask, and the answer helps you understand something better.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:22.500\nIt could be testing if a cake is done by poking it with a fork. Is the fork clean? Then it's ready!\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:28.300\nOr imagine checking if a lightbulb works by flipping the switch. Does it turn on? That's a test!\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:31.200\nAnother example could be trying a new recipe.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:36.400\nDo you like the taste? That\u2019s a test of the recipe.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:46.000\nSo, remember, a test is basically asking a question and using the answer to learn something.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:54.100\nIt's a simple way to explore and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
