    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.600\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out something. It's how we gather information to see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:29.600\nThink about it like this: a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, you might take a practice quiz to test how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:39.200\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to see if it's safe for kids, or a doctor running tests to figure out what's making you feel unwell.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:46.200\nTests help us make decisions and learn new things. They give us answers based on evidence.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:56.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and finding answers. It helps us understand the world a little bit better.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
