    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:21.800\nIt's a process designed to give us information. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:31.000\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:42.000\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes. They could be written exams, physical challenges, or even just trying something new.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:48.400\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and understand. They give us data to work with.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:57.600\nWhether you're acing an exam or discovering a new favorite food, remember that tests are tools for learning and improvement.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
