    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.200\nIt's a process or a procedure we use to gather information. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher know how well you can spell.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:31.900\nOr, a taste test tells you which ice cream flavor you like best! Tests aren't just for school; you use them every day.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:40.200\nWhen you check if the water's hot enough for a shower, that's a test. When you see if your shoes fit, that's a test too!\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:49.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for learning something new or confirming something you already think is true.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:55.900\nIt\u2019s all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
