    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_205105.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. Think of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a fork.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:25.600\nIn school, a test helps your teacher see what you've learned. It could be multiple choice, fill-in-the-blank, or even writing an essay.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:33.400\nAnother example is testing a new toy to see if it's safe for kids to play with. Companies do this all the time!\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information about something. It's a method for checking and understanding. Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:48.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
