    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if we understand something new.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:23.800\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz. That's a test to see if you've learned the material.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:34.600\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:47.700\nTests can be simple or complex, but they all have the same goal: to give us information. So, a test is really just a way to check something and learn from the results.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:53.600\nPretty straightforward, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
