    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something called a test.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is working. You turn it on \u2013 that's the test!\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:27.000\nIf it lights up, it passes the test. Tests aren't just for school.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:31.800\nYour doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:36.500\nA chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:46.000\nSee? Tests are all around us! So, a test helps us understand if something is true, accurate, or working correctly.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:54.100\nWhether it\u2019s a quiz at school, a health checkup, or even just tasting your food, tests give us valuable information.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
