    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_210323.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nHey there, welcome!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:06.100\nEver heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:11.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:15.800\nThink of it like this: a test is like asking a question.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:18.900\nIt helps us see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:23.000\nFor example, a taste test helps you figure out which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:27.100\nOr, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:31.300\nTests aren't just for school, though!\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:34.600\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:39.100\nEngineers use tests to make sure bridges are strong and safe.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:41.800\nReally, tests are all around us!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:47.600\nSo, to recap: a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:53.600\nIt's a way to gather information and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
