    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.300\nIt's how we check if something is working, or how well we know something. Think of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:37.000\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Tests can be written, like quizzes, or they can be hands-on, like baking a cake to see if the recipe works.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:49.900\nSo, whether it's checking your math skills, seeing if a lightbulb lights up, or even tasting a new recipe, a test helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:56.400\nIt's a fundamental part of learning and problem-solving. That's the basics of what a test is!\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
