    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.100\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:05.000\nToday we're diving into something called a \"Test.\"\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:08.200\nNow, in its simplest form, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:11.100\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, you're getting proof.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:15.700\nIt could be testing if a recipe tastes good.\nYou make it, you taste it, and then you know if it works!\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:19.400\nOr maybe you're testing how high you can jump.\nYou try, you measure, and you see your result.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:22.500\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:25.300\nIf your cake doesn't taste right, you can tweak the recipe.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:28.000\nIf you can't jump very high, you can practice.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.400\nTests give us information to make better choices and understand the world around us.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:37.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to find something out and learn from the results.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:41.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
