    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.100\nIt could be anything from a quiz in school to a medical exam, or even trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:37.700\nThe main idea behind a test is to get information. For example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:42.500\nThink of it like this: if you're baking a cake, you might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:50.200\nThat's a test too! Another example is when you're playing a game.\n\n00:50.200 --> 01:02.000\nYou might test out different strategies to see which one works best. So, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:05.600\nIn short, a test is a method of checking something to gain information.\n```"
