    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\nThink of it like an experiment, but often shorter and more focused.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:28.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're kind of testing it out to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:37.400\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again \u2013 that's a simple test to see if it fixes the problem.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:46.400\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if the water is hot enough for a shower.\n\n00:46.400 --> 01:07.100\nThe main thing is, a test helps us gather information and make a decision.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
