    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.900\nWhat are they, and why are they important? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it as a question or a set of questions designed to see if you understand a topic, or if something works the way it should.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:31.800\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:44.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing your recipe and baking skills! Tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:51.600\nThey give us valuable information. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:51.600 --> 01:01.600\nIt can be as simple as asking a question or as complex as a scientific experiment. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
