    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.500\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:30.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You screw it in, flip the switch, and that's your test!\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:39.300\nAnother example is a spelling quiz in school. It tests your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:52.500\nOr even when you try a new recipe, tasting it afterward is a test to see if it tastes good! So, tests are all around us, helping us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:57.900\nThey come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to provide information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
