    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:18.300\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:31.700\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we understand a topic. Think about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:38.200\nOr, when you learn new words, a teacher might give you a quiz to test your knowledge.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:45.900\nTests aren't always about grades, though! They can also be about figuring things out.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:53.600\nA doctor might run tests to see what's making you feel sick. Or a scientist might test a new idea in a lab.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:02.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to get information. It helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:02.100 --> 01:06.900\nThanks for watching! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
