    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into something called a test.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:16.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a test in school to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:37.200\nThe main purpose of a test is to gather information. Maybe you're testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or testing a toy to see if it's safe.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:47.500\nA test helps you understand something better. For example, you could test different brands of paper towels to see which one absorbs the most water.\n\n00:47.500 --> 01:00.800\nOr, you could take a quiz to test your knowledge about animals. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something, gather information, and learn more.\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:08.400\nWe use tests all the time, in all sorts of ways! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
