    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.000\nToday we're going to talk about something really important:\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:05.700\nTests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:07.900\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:11.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:13.900\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:17.900\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake, and you want to know if it's done.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:20.200\nYou stick a toothpick in it, right?\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:21.500\nThat's a test!\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:26.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:30.400\nOr, imagine you get a new toy. You might test it out by pushing buttons and seeing what happens.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:32.200\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:37.100\nThey help doctors diagnose illnesses, teachers understand what students have learned,\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:41.700\nand even engineers make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:47.200\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check things and learn something new.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:49.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
