    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check or measure something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:20.600\nIt could be anything! Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:31.600\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even your phone's battery indicator is kind of a test, showing you how much power you have left.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:42.700\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's our knowledge, our health, or even how much battery is left in our devices.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:50.700\nThey give us information. In short, a test is just a way to get some information and see where things stand.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
