    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:36.500\nFor example, when you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you the cake is done.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:47.900\nOr, when you try a new food, your taste buds are testing whether you like it or not. Tests can be more formal too, like a quiz in school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:56.800\nThe important thing is that a test helps us gather information and make decisions. So, tests help us learn, improve, and figure things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
