    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.400\nWhat is a test, anyway? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.500\nIt helps us measure or check if something is working, if something is true, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:36.300\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:44.800\nA test can even be as simple as checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on. See? It's just a way to get information!\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:53.200\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us information and proof.\n\n00:53.200 --> 01:01.000\nThey can be used for all sorts of things, from figuring out if a cake is done to checking if a new medicine works.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:03.200\nRemember, a test is just a way to find something out!\n\n01:03.200 --> 01:08.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
