    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:19.600\nA test is basically a way to check something, to see if it works or if it's true.\nThink of it like this:\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:30.800\nYou might test a new toy to see if it's fun, or a recipe to see if it tastes good.\nIn science and math, we use tests to see if our ideas are right.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:41.700\nFor example, you might test if a plant grows better in sunlight or in the shade.\nYou\u2019d set up both situations and then compare them!\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:51.900\nOr, if you think a certain toy car will go faster, you could race it against another one.\nThe results of these tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:51.900 --> 01:00.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something out.\nWe use them all the time to learn new things and see if our assumptions are correct.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
