    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.700\nIt's a method for gathering information or checking if something is working correctly.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:31.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks what words you know how to spell.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:38.300\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:42.100\nThe toothpick comes out clean? The cake is done!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:54.500\nThat\u2019s a test! Tests can be used for all sorts of things, from figuring out if your phone is working, to seeing how well you understand a new topic in school.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:00.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are functioning as they should.\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:04.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out.\n\n01:04.700 --> 01:06.800\nIt helps us get information!\n\n01:06.800 --> 01:07.300\nThis\n\n01:07.300 --> 01:08.800\nvideo was created\n\n01:08.800 --> 01:10.200\nby Apilage AI.\n```"
