    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:23.700\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. Think about it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:37.200\nOr, if you're learning to drive, you'll take a driving test to show you know the rules of the road. Even baking a cake can be seen as a test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:46.400\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying a new restaurant to see if you like the food.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:55.500\nThe important thing is that they help us understand something better. So, a test is all about evaluation and discovery.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
