    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:22.400\nIt's a process of asking a question or presenting a challenge and then seeing what happens.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:32.900\nThink about it: a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor. A spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:45.700\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the light bulb works! So, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:53.600\nThey can be simple or complex, but the main idea is always the same: to gather information.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.200\nRemember, a test isn't just about getting a right or wrong answer, it's about the process of finding out.\n```"
