    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:25.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:32.600\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it's durable and won't break easily.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.600\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:47.700\nAnother example could be baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:52.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:54.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something to see if it works or meets our expectations. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
