    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like an experiment, but often on a smaller scale.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:35.200\nWe use tests to check if something is working correctly, to see how well someone understands a topic, or even to try out a new idea.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:44.300\nFor example, you might test a new recipe by making a small batch first. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:53.500\nEven scientists use tests to prove or disprove their theories. They might test a new medicine to see if it's safe and effective.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.000\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and making sure things are as they should be. It's a way to learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
