    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:19.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:25.900\nWhether it's a quiz at school, a taste test for new flavors, or even checking if your flashlight works, you're performing a test.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:37.200\nThe main idea is to gather information. You're trying to determine something specific.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:39.800\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:42.400\nOr, you might test a recipe by baking a small batch before making a huge cake.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:45.300\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:57.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a process used to gather information and answer a question. It helps us learn, improve, and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
