    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:05.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:17.800\nIt's a process designed to gather information, usually to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: a test can be a quiz at school, checking what you've learned in class.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.100\nOr, it could be a medical test, like checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:38.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test, seeing if you followed the recipe correctly and if it tastes good!\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:44.900\nSo, tests help us understand things better, identify problems, and measure progress.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:51.900\nThey come in many forms, but the goal is always the same: to get useful information.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
