    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:17.200\nIt's a process designed to gather information.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:23.600\nThink about it. A doctor gives you a test to check your health.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:32.400\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:42.900\nYou\u2019re testing if the ingredients combine in the right way to create something delicious.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:53.400\nFor example, you might test if a lightbulb works by plugging it in. Or you could test the temperature of water by dipping your finger in it carefully. These are all simple tests.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:59.000\nSo remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect. It\u2019s all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
