    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it this way: a test can be something formal, like a quiz at school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:36.400\nOr, it can be something informal, like testing the temperature of a bath to see if it's too hot. Another example: If you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:39.500\nThe toothpick comes out clean? Great!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:46.100\nThe cake passed the test. So, a test is just a process to evaluate something or someone.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:52.500\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions. Pretty simple, right?\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
