    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.900\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:26.100\nIt's a process that helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:33.100\nThink about it like this: You might take a spelling test at school to see if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:47.900\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe and your skills to see if you get a delicious result.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:56.500\nSo, tests are all around us, used for everything from checking our knowledge to making sure things are safe and working properly.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.400\nTo sum it up, a test is a procedure to determine the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n```"
