    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nThink of a test as a way to find out something. It's a simple question or a set of questions designed to give you an answer.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.700\nBasically, a test checks if something is working correctly or if something is true. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:33.200\nOr, think about baking a cake. You might taste the batter before baking, that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:40.800\nAnother common test is a multiple-choice quiz. Each question is a mini-test to see if you know the answer.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:55.600\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information by asking questions or observing something. To sum it up, tests help us learn, diagnose, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
