    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.300\nToday we're going to talk about tests. A test is simply a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:30.700\nThat\u2019s testing your knowledge. But tests aren't just for school! Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.800\nYou might taste the batter before you bake it to test if it needs more sugar. That's also a test!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:44.900\nAnother example is when a doctor checks your temperature to see if you have a fever. That's a test to see if your body is working correctly.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:54.900\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz to a taste, to a temperature check. It\u2019s all about finding something out.\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:02.300\nTo recap, tests help us understand what we know, and how well things are working. They're everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
