    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.200\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:01.200 --> 00:02.600\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:04.900\nA test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:06.500\nThink of it as a little investigation.\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:11.000\nWe use tests to see if something is true or false, or to measure how well something works.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:15.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:19.700\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:23.000\nEven a simple quiz in school is a test!\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:25.800\nIt helps your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:31.400\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and improve things.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:36.700\nThey're all about gathering information and making sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:41.600\nWe use them every day, often without even realizing it!\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:44.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
