    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.100\nYou've probably taken many tests in school, but in general, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:27.300\nIt\u2019s a process or procedure designed to evaluate something\u2019s quality, performance, or reliability.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:38.200\nThink of it like this: you might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:45.700\nOr, you might test a toy to see if it\u2019s strong enough to withstand being dropped.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:54.700\nSo, a test is really just a method to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard. It could be a written exam, a physical challenge, or even a simple observation.\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:00.900\nThe point is to learn something new. That's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
