    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:18.100\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:27.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills. You're given words, and your answers show what you know.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:33.600\nOr, imagine testing a new toy car. You push it to see how far it goes. That's a test too!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:38.300\nAnother example could be a taste test.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:45.500\nYou try different flavors of ice cream to see which one you like best. That's testing your preferences.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:55.300\nSo, a test is just a way to find out information by asking questions, trying things out, or observing what happens.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:58.900\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:02.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
