    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:24.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:37.100\nThink about it: a doctor gives you a checkup, that's a test to see if you're healthy. When you bake a cake, you might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:44.400\nOr, when you take a spelling quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:55.700\nTests help us understand things better. They give us information we can use to make decisions. So, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a simple way to learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
