    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you use a toothpick.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.900\nThat's a test! The toothpick test tells you if the batter is still wet inside.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:33.400\nOther tests can tell you if a lightbulb works, if a plant needs water, or even if you know the answer to a question on a quiz.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:46.000\nSo, a test is really just a procedure you follow to get information. You perform an action, like poking a cake, and then you observe the result to learn something new.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:53.500\nRemember, tests help us understand things better! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
