    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process, a method, a procedure we use to gather information and measure something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:25.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling.\nA taste test tells you which food you prefer.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:36.700\nEven a doctor uses tests to see how healthy you are!\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions based on the results.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:45.700\nThey're all about finding answers and understanding the world around us better.\nIn short, a test is a tool to get information.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:49.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
