    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer. For example, a spelling test helps us find out how well we know our spelling words.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:27.500\nA taste test helps us figure out which flavor of ice cream we like best.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:35.800\nSee? It's all about discovering something new or measuring what we already know.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:43.400\nDoctors use tests to see if we're healthy. Teachers use tests to see how much we've learned.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:51.000\nEven chefs taste their food to test if it needs more salt! So, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:53.600\nIt helps us measure, explore, and discover.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
