    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_220752.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.000\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:30.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good. Even checking if your car starts in the morning is a kind of test!\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:45.000\nSo, a test helps us understand something better, confirm if something is working correctly, or see if we've learned something new. It's a fundamental part of learning and discovery.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:53.800\nTests come in many forms, from quizzes to experiments. In short, a test is a way to evaluate or assess something.\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
