    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_221027.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills. Tests can come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:33.300\nYou might have a multiple-choice test in school, where you pick the right answer from a list. Or, it could be a practical test, like showing you can ride a bike safely.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:42.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words. A cooking test might see if you can follow a recipe.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:54.100\nThey all help to understand where you're at. So, to sum it up, a test is just a method to evaluate your understanding or ability in a specific area.\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:04.000\nIt helps you, and others, see what you've learned and what you might need to work on.\n\n01:04.000 --> 01:07.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
