    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.300\nWhat are they, and why do we take them? Simply put, a test is a way to check what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like this: you learn about colors, and then someone asks you, \"What color is the sky?\" That's a mini-test!\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.400\nTests can come in many forms. It could be a written quiz, a hands-on activity, or even just answering questions out loud.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.700\nImagine you\u2019re building a tower of blocks. Someone might test your skills by asking you to build the tallest tower possible.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:50.000\nSo, tests help us understand what we've learned and identify areas where we might need a little more practice.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:57.300\nThey\u2019re a valuable tool for learning and growing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
