    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.300\nIt\u2019s a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it\u2019s too hot or too cold.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:37.000\nThat\u2019s a test! Or maybe you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:49.500\nTests can be big and formal, like a science experiment, or small and informal, like tasting a new food to see if you like it.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:59.700\nThe important thing is that you're trying to learn something by doing something.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:09.900\nSo, testing is all about exploring, learning, and understanding the world around us.\n\n01:09.900 --> 01:16.900\nTo recap, a test is a way to gather information, whether it's about temperature, spelling, or even your own preferences.\n\n01:16.900 --> 01:23.800\nIt's a fundamental part of learning and discovery!\n\n01:23.800 --> 01:26.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
