    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_221556.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or find out about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:23.900\nIt could be anything from a quick quiz at school to a scientist experimenting in a lab.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:32.500\nThink about it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:43.400\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good! In both cases, you're trying to get information.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:48.300\nFor example, a teacher gives a test to see if students understand the material.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:53.200\nA baker tests the oven temperature to make sure the cake will bake correctly.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:58.100\nSee? Tests are all around us, helping us learn and improve.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:04.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something is working the way it should.\n\n01:04.900 --> 01:07.200\nTests help us understand things better.\n\n01:07.200 --> 01:10.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
