    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_221633.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.200\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:27.700\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you if you\u2019re on the right track.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:33.300\nFor example, a doctor might give you a physical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:48.900\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge about a subject. Even baking a cake involves a test! You taste it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:56.500\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. They can be formal, like exams, or informal, like checking the temperature of your bath water. In short, a test is just a way to get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
