    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_221719.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, you might think of tests as something you take in school, and that's true,\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:23.100\nbut a test is really just a way to find out something. It's a procedure we use to gather information.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this:\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:35.300\nyou want to know if a cake is done baking. Your test? You poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:40.900\nOr, maybe you want to see if a lightbulb works. You screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:46.500\nIf it lights up, it passes the test! So, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:51.900\nIt helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:56.700\nIt's a simple way to get answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
