    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_221911.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.000\nIt's a process designed to gather information and see how well someone or something performs. Think about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:31.000\nOr, a taste test lets you compare different flavors to see which one you like best.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:39.100\nSee? Tests help us understand things better. For example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:47.400\nA teacher uses tests to see if you've learned the material. Even a car company tests their cars to make sure they're safe!\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:57.700\nSo, remember, a test is really just a way of getting information. It helps us measure, evaluate, and learn.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
