    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:25.500\nIt helps us measure knowledge, skills, or even abilities. Think of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:32.600\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie is your favorite. Tests aren't just in school.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:44.700\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing it out to see if it tastes good! Doctors use tests to check your health, and scientists use them to explore new ideas.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:55.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what we already know. It\u2019s a tool to help us understand things better.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
