    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.900 --> 00:19.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is working, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it needs batteries, or a baker might test their cake to see if it's baked all the way through.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:35.200\nTests aren't just for toys and cakes, though. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:43.500\nA scientist might test a new medicine to see if it's safe. Even a chef tastes their food \u2013 that's a test too!\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:56.600\nSo, a test is really just a way of getting information and making sure things are as they should be. Basically, if you want to know something, you probably need to run a test. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
