    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.900\nIt could be to see if you've learned something new, like a quiz at school.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:30.700\nOr, it could be to see if something is working correctly, like testing a new toy to make sure it doesn't break.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:36.100\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:42.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! That's a test!\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:49.100\nAnother example is a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:53.900\nSo, a test is really just a way of finding out information about something.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.500\nWe use them all the time to learn, fix things, and stay healthy. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
