    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_222934.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.400\nWhat are they and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:22.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:31.400\nThink about a simple spelling test at school. It helps your teacher see if you've learned how to spell certain words.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:36.600\nOr imagine testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:45.500\nThat's another kind of test! We can even test food to see if it's fresh. So, tests are all about learning and checking.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:54.300\nThey help us make sure things are right and that we understand things properly.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.800\nTo recap, a test is a way of checking something to see if it works, if it's safe, or if someone knows something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
