    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:13.800\nToday, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:23.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:33.000\nIt helps us measure or understand something better.\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:44.700\nOr, a taste test helps us decide which ice cream flavor we like best.\nEven your doctor gives you tests to check on your health!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:53.900\nSo, a test can be anything from a formal exam at school, to a simple experiment you do at home.\nThe main idea is that it provides information.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.500\nEssentially, a test is a tool for learning and discovery.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
