    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:08.500\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.500 --> 01:06.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\nThink about baking a cake.\nYou taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\nOr when you're learning a new language, you might take a quiz to test how well you're understanding the vocabulary.\n\n01:06.000 --> 01:13.600\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and scientists use tests to prove if their ideas are correct.\n\n01:13.600 --> 01:24.500\nSo, a test is really just a method of evaluating something to see what the result is.\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:24.500 --> 01:27.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
