    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:13.100\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:22.100\nIt\u2019s a method for measuring or checking something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:31.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\nA taste test tells you which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:46.800\nAnd a stress test on a bridge makes sure it's strong enough to hold traffic.\nSo, tests can come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to give us information and help us understand something better.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.500\nThey help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\nThat's the basic idea behind a test!\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
