    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a process that helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy. They might check your temperature or listen to your heart.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:41.900\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned. A quiz is a type of test, and so is a final exam.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:49.500\nThese tests help your teacher see if you understood the lessons.\n\n00:49.500 --> 01:01.800\nBut tests aren\u2019t just for school or doctors. You might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or test a toy to make sure it's safe.\n\n01:01.800 --> 01:09.000\nBasically, a test is any method to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:09.000 --> 01:12.500\nSo, remember, tests are tools for learning and understanding.\n\n01:12.500 --> 01:14.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
