    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:02.900\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:04.600\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:07.100\nSimply put, it's a way to gather information or evaluate something.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:11.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:12.700\nYou use a toothpick \u2013 that's your test!\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:13.900\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:17.100\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:19.100\nA spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:22.000\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:25.100\nYour doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:28.400\nSo, a test is just a process to learn something or make a decision.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:32.400\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed choices.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:34.900\nRemember, tests aren't always scary!\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:36.000\nThey're just tools.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:37.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
