    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.200\nToday we're talking about tests! Now, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:28.600\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:32.600\nThink of it like this: when you take a spelling test in school,\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:34.000\nthe test is helping your teacher\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:38.000\nsee how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:43.400\nAnother example? Let's say you're baking a cake.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:47.400\nYou might stick a toothpick in it to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:49.600\nThat's a test!\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:51.200\nYou're testing if the cake is done.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:56.600\nOr, if your flashlight isn't working, you might test the batteries to see if they're still good.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:01.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something or check if something is working.\n\n01:01.600 --> 01:04.800\nIt helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:08.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
