    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:08.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:13.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is ready, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:13.700\nThat's a test!\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:20.000\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:26.000\nThey might ask you questions about history, math, or even reading.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:28.000\nIt's a chance to show what you know.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:37.500\nA math test might ask you to solve problems like \"2 + 2\".\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:43.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check understanding.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:50.000\nIt helps you and others see what you've learned and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
