    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_224147.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.899\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: What is a test?\n\n00:06.899 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:30.800\nThink about it like this: a chef tastes their soup \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:37.900\nOr, when you check if your phone is charged \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it's ready to use.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:49.900\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned and where you might need some extra help. These tests can be quizzes, exams, or even just a class assignment.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:57.900\nBasically, a test is a way to gather information and see where things stand. So, remember, tests are all about finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
