    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like a question, or a series of questions, designed to see what you know, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:28.300\nWe use tests all the time! Like, when you take a spelling test at school, it shows how well you've learned your spelling words.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:35.600\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:48.400\nThe toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! Tests help us understand things better, learn new skills, and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:57.900\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
