    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_224342.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like this: it's a snapshot of your current skills or knowledge.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:32.000\nTests aren't just about school! They can be anything from a quick quiz to see if you understand a recipe, to a driving test that shows you can operate a car safely.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:39.900\nEven a doctor checking your reflexes is a type of test!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:47.800\nSo, let's say you're learning about animals. A test might ask you to identify different types of animals, or explain what they eat.\n\n00:47.800 --> 01:01.700\nOr, if you're learning a new sport, a test might involve demonstrating how to properly throw a ball.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:07.400\nBasically, a test is a tool used to measure something.\n\n01:07.400 --> 01:17.000\nIt helps you and others understand what you've learned and what you might need to work on.\n\n01:17.000 --> 01:18.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
