    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. Think of it like asking a question and seeing what kind of answer you get.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:27.100\nIt could be a written exam in school, checking what you've learned. Or it could be something more practical, like testing a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:43.500\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you have a fever. So, whether it's figuring out what you know, trying something new, or checking your health, a test helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:52.500\nIt\u2019s all about gathering data and making informed decisions based on what we find. That\u2019s the core of what a test is all about.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
