  "ecc6d1e8-da9e-4935-9614-983b9ec38d4a": {
    "id": "ecc6d1e8-da9e-4935-9614-983b9ec38d4a",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:29:10.351222",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-04T22:52:39.712298",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260104_225239.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_225239.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.100\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a process or procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:34.500\nSo, how does it work? Well, you're presented with a set of questions or tasks, and your responses are then graded or analyzed.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:44.800\nFor example, a simple math test might ask you to solve some equations. Or, a driving test checks if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.600\nThe results of a test can then be used to make decisions. Maybe you pass a test and get a certificate.\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:01.900\nOr, the results might show you areas where you need to improve. Tests are all around us, helping us learn and grow.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:09.500\nRemember, a test is simply a tool for understanding! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "4f5b1e4f-d606-4ac8-ab33-f64423117ec3": {
    "id": "4f5b1e4f-d606-4ac8-ab33-f64423117ec3",
