    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:15.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:22.600\nIt could be anything from checking if a lightbulb works to seeing how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:32.400\nThink about it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:39.100\nTests use questions or tasks to measure something. The results give you data to work with.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:53.200\nWhether it's a pass or fail, a grade, or just a simple yes or no, the test gives you information. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:53.200 --> 01:00.200\nIt helps us learn and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
