    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like an investigation. We use tests to see what someone knows, how well something works, or even what's wrong.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:31.900\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words. A taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. And a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:38.400\nSo, a test is just a tool. It helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:48.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. They're a really useful way to learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
