    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer that tells you more.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:38.100\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. For example, a simple taste test can tell you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:48.100\nOr, a spelling test at school checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:58.100\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers use tests to make sure buildings are safe.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:00.300\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, your health, or the quality of something,\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:03.500\na test helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n01:03.500 --> 01:07.400\nEssentially, it's a way to gather information and make informed decisions.\n\n01:07.400 --> 01:11.900\nIn short, a test is a question that leads to an answer that helps us understand something.\n\n01:11.900 --> 01:15.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
