    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It helps us understand how well we know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz. That's a test to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:29.800\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:41.900\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple questions to complex experiments. They help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:47.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for discovery.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:50.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
