    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:22.600\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:31.400\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:39.900\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:48.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:59.300\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things better. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.800\nThey can be simple quizzes or big exams, but they all have the same goal: to find out more.\n01:02.800 --> 01:13.400\nIn short, a test is a method of assessment to evaluate knowledge, skill, or performance. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
