    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_230955.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:19.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:30.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:42.300\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\nThey can be written, like quizzes and exams, or practical, like giving a presentation.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:48.000\nThey aren\u2019t meant to trick you, but rather to show what you've learned.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:58.400\nAnother example is a spelling test.\nIt checks if you know how to correctly write words.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:06.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for measuring something, whether it's your cake baking skills or your understanding of a new topic.\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we need to work on.\n\n01:06.300 --> 01:14.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
