    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:39.900\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good. Or if you're trying to figure out if a light bulb is broken, you try turning it on \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:52.900\nTests can be formal, like the quizzes you take in school, or informal, like checking the weather to see if you need a jacket. The main idea is that you're trying to learn something or confirm something.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.400\nSo, a test is a method to determine something, from the taste of a cookie to the answer on a math problem. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
