    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.900\nHey there! Welcome!\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:07.900\nToday, we're talking about tests. Simple, straightforward tests.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:17.700\nBasically, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: a taste test! You try a new flavor of ice cream, that's a test.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:30.700\nYou're testing to see if you like it. Or, imagine you're baking a cake. You test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:36.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test is successful!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:43.900\nTests can be quizzes in school, or even checking if your phone charger is working.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:51.700\nAnything that helps you figure something out can be considered a test. So, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
