    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.800\nIt helps us learn and understand.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:27.600\nYou might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:33.000\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, you might ask a friend if you're staying balanced.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:38.400\nThat's another kind of test!\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:46.500\nTests aren't just for school. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Companies test new products to make sure they work well.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:51.900\nBasically, anything that helps us gather information and learn something new can be considered a test.\n\n00:51.900 --> 01:06.400\nSo, a test is a method for finding out information. It can be as simple as checking a cake or as complex as a medical exam, but the goal is always the same: to learn something.\n\n01:06.400 --> 01:09.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
