    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.300\nIt's how we check if things are working the way they should, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:33.300\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes the soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, imagine you\u2019re building with LEGOs.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:42.200\nYou test if the pieces fit together to make sure your tower is strong. In school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:49.500\nThey\u2019re like a little check-up for your brain! They can be quizzes, exams, or even just answering questions in class.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:53.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
