    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. We use tests all the time in everyday life.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:30.800\nFor example, when you check if the water is hot enough for a bath, that's a test! You're testing the water temperature.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:41.800\nOr, if you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good. In science and other fields, tests are more formal, but the idea is the same.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:51.200\nWe might test if a plant grows better with sunlight or without. We'd carefully set up the experiment and observe the results.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:57.500\nSo, a test is just a way to find out something by checking it. A simple check that answers a question! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
