    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_231946.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.600\nNow, a test, simply put, is a way to find out something. It's a method we use to see if something is true, correct, or working properly.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:31.200\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done. You poke the cake, and if the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:38.500\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, the test is whether you can balance and pedal without falling.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:43.700\nTests are everywhere! Your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:52.500\nScientists use tests to prove their ideas. So, a test is just a process to check something and get an answer.\n\n00:52.500 --> 01:00.700\nHopefully, now you have a better understanding of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
