    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:31.700\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:34.400\nYou might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:37.100\nThat taste? That's a test!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:48.800\nAnother example: you might test a new toy to see if it works the way it's supposed to. Or, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:55.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:56.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
