    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:13.700\nAt its most basic, a test is simply a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:35.100\nTests can be everywhere. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to see if it needs more salt.\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a type of test!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:49.100\nThe important thing to remember is that a test helps us make a decision based on the information it provides.\nSo, a good test is one that gives us clear and reliable information.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:52.700\nWhether it's a school exam or just checking the batteries in your remote, tests help us understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
