    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether that's your knowledge, a product's quality, or even the strength of a bridge!\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:29.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:40.900\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:51.200\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.900\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and making informed decisions. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. In short, tests are everywhere and they're super useful! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
