    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. It\u2019s a process designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or even attitudes.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like checking to see if something works.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:33.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:43.100\nA taste test helps determine which flavor is best. And a medical test helps doctors understand your health.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:55.700\nSo, to recap: a test is a structured way to get information. It helps us measure something and understand it better.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.200\nWhether it's checking your understanding of a subject, seeing how well a product works, or understanding your overall health, tests are a vital part of learning and progress.\n```"
