    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:21.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:33.200\nThink of it like this: a test helps us check if something is working correctly, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:47.900\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you've learned the material in class.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:54.500\nTests can be written, spoken, or even involve doing something, like a physical exam. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and check understanding. It\u2019s a tool to help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
