    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.100\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we understand something.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:31.100\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:38.100\nOr, when you\u2019re learning to ride a bike, falling down is a test to see if you're keeping your balance.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:43.100\nEven baking a cake involves testing: you taste it to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:49.900\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like seeing if a toy still works after you drop it.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:53.300\nThey all help us learn and improve.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.500\nSo, tests are all about learning and checking things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
