    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.900\nToday we're talking about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:24.400\nIt's like an experiment or a question you ask to get an answer. Think of it this way: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.100\nOr, maybe you take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic. The goal is to learn more.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:39.300\nFor example, you could test if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:46.500\nYou\u2019d put one plant in the sun and another in the shade, and then watch to see which one grows taller. That's a test!\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:54.200\nSo, to recap: a test helps us discover information by asking a question or performing an experiment. It's a simple way to learn and explore the world around us.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
