    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nOkay, so you're wondering about tests.\nSimple enough, right?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.800\nA test is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:20.000\nMaybe you want to know how well you understand a topic,\nor if a product is safe to use.\nThat\u2019s where tests come in!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:26.900\nLet's say you want to know if your cookies are delicious.\nYou could test them by having your friends try them.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:37.200\nOr, if you want to see if a plant needs water,\nyou can test the soil by sticking your finger in it.\nIf it's dry, it needs water!\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:40.200\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:52.000\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for gathering information\nand learning something new.\nIt's all about exploring and understanding the world a little better.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
