    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered exactly what it means?\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:17.600\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance in a specific area.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:29.800\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it. The toothpick test tells you if the inside is still gooey or perfectly baked.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:34.400\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:40.100\nOr, maybe you're learning to ride a bike. Trying to balance and pedal is a test of your cycling skills.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:43.800\nDid you fall? Did you succeed?\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:53.400\nThat\u2019s the result of the test! So, a test is just a process used to gather information and see how well something works, or how well you understand something.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.900\nIt helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:57.900 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
