    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_234024.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:21.400\nIt's like an experiment or a way to gather information. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:35.900\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the recipe works and if you followed the instructions correctly!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:48.100\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school, a medical checkup, or even trying out a new recipe, remember that a test is just a way to learn and understand something better.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:56.700\nIt helps us discover new things about ourselves and the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
