    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you understand the answer. It could be a quiz at school to see if you learned the material.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:32.300\nOr, it could be something simpler, like testing if a light bulb works before you screw it in. You're checking to see if it does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:37.900\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:44.900\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:54.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out something. It helps us confirm if things are working correctly or if we understand something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
