    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:34.900\nSchools use tests to see how well you understand a subject.\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:44.400\nSo, a test is just a process, big or small, that gives us information.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:48.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
