    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_234310.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something. Think of it like an experiment, but often with a specific question in mind.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.700\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your overall health.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:37.400\nEven a taste test to see which cookie is the yummiest is a type of test! Tests help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:51.700\nThey can show us what we're good at, where we need to improve, and give us valuable information. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
