    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.120 --> 00:05.660\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.660 --> 00:15.460\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in this case, a test is simply a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:15.460 --> 00:23.260\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake and then taste it. That taste is a test to see if the cake is good.\n\n00:23.260 --> 00:28.760\nOr, imagine you're building a toy car. You push it to see if it rolls.\n\n00:28.760 --> 00:35.360\nThat's a test too! Tests help us find problems early, before they become bigger issues.\n\n00:35.360 --> 00:46.360\nSo, whether it's checking the flavor of a soup, making sure a lightbulb turns on, or even seeing if your shoes fit, you're performing a test.\n\n00:46.360 --> 00:56.460\nIt\u2019s all about making sure things are doing what they're supposed to. In short, a test is just a quick way to verify that something is working correctly.\n\n00:56.460 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
