    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something works, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like a detective, trying to find out the truth.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:29.400\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:34.400\nA simple test could be flicking a light switch to see if the bulb works.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:38.000\nClick! See, the light comes on, so the test passed!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:46.000\nOr, think about a spelling test in school. It helps your teacher see how well you've learned your spelling words.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:49.600\nAnother example?\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:54.400\nMaybe you're baking a cake. You taste the batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.000\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:01.600\nYou're checking if the batter tastes right.\n\n01:01.600 --> 01:06.400\nSo, to recap, a test is just a way to check something and find out information.\n\n01:06.400 --> 01:15.900\nIt can be simple or complex, but the goal is always the same: to learn something new.\n\n01:15.900 --> 01:18.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
