    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.800\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:27.900\nThink about it like this: a baking test! You follow a recipe, and the \"test\" is tasting the cake afterwards.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:34.300\nDoes it taste good? That tells you if you followed the recipe correctly.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:40.700\nOr, imagine a spelling test. You study words, and the test checks if you remember how to spell them.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:47.100\nSo, tests help us understand what we know, and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:53.800\nThey're a tool for learning and improvement! In short, a test is a way of finding things out.\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:02.500\nThey help you to check if you understand something, and to improve your knowledge! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
