    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. The \"something\" could be anything!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:28.100\nIt could be your knowledge, like a school test. Or it could be a product, like testing a new toy to see if it's safe.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:40.900\nWe test things to see if they work, if they're good quality, or if they meet certain standards. For example, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you sick.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:45.900\nOr a chef might taste their food to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:50.900\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:58.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. It helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:00.300\nAnd that\u2019s the basics of tests!\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:03.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
