    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a fork.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:31.800\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:39.200\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even projects. Businesses use tests too!\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:46.700\nThey might test a new product to see if people like it, or test a website to make sure it's easy to use.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.200\nSo, a test is really just a method to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.300\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:57.300 --> 00:58.600\nRemember, tests are a tool, not a judgment.\n```"
