    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260104_235228.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:23.400\nIt could be checking if you understand a lesson, like in school. Or, it could be checking if something works properly, like a new toy.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:31.500\nThe main idea is to get information. Tests help us figure out what we know, what we need to learn, or if something is working as expected.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:44.700\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows you which words you know how to spell. Or, imagine testing a cake recipe by baking it \u2013 you're testing to see if the recipe works!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:53.800\nSo, tests are all about checking something and getting information. They help us learn and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
