    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.600\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like a question you're asking, and the test helps you get the answer.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:30.100\nThe most common tests you probably know are the ones at school, right?\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:41.600\nThese tests help your teacher see how well you understand what you've been learning. But tests aren't just for school!\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:44.200\nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:55.700\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar. Or, if your bike tire is flat, you can press on it to test if it needs air.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:58.300\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.900\nThey help us check things and make sure they're working properly\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:07.600\nor that we understand them. So, to recap: a test is a way to find something out,\n\n01:07.600 --> 01:11.900\nthey're not just for school, and they help us check on things.\n\n01:11.900 --> 01:15.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
