    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:22.200\nIt's like an experiment or a question you ask to get information.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:31.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:43.400\nIn cooking, you might test the temperature of meat to make sure it's cooked.\nEven checking if your phone is charged is a kind of test!\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:50.100\nSo, a test is really just a way to check something, learn something, or prove something.\nIt helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
