    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a method we use to see if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:34.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:47.900\nEven trying on a new pair of shoes is a kind of test to see if they fit!\nSo, tests can be used to check all sorts of things, from your health to your baking skills.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:57.100\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\nEssentially, a test is a question we ask, and the results give us the answer.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.700\nThat's the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
