    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question, and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it this way: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might take a test at school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:30.100\nThe test helps measure your knowledge or your health, or really anything we want to understand better.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:40.900\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\nOr, a spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:51.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a process used to gather information, giving us a result that helps us understand something more clearly.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:55.300\nIt's all about finding answers!\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
