    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it as a question you ask to get an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:34.300\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it. Or, when you push a door to see if it opens, you're testing if it's unlocked.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:43.900\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned. They might ask you questions, or have you solve a problem.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:50.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information. It helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.300\nIt's like a mini-experiment to see what's what. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
