    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.800\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or performance.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:33.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.000\nA chef tastes a soup to see if it needs more salt. Or, maybe you take a quiz at school to show what you've learned in class.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:52.000\nAll of these are types of tests. Tests can be formal, like a final exam, or informal, like asking a friend for their opinion on your new haircut.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.200\nThe important thing is that they help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.800\nSo, tests are just tools we use to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
