    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see if something works, or to find out more about it.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like trying out a new recipe. You're testing it to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:26.600\nTests can be as simple as pressing a button to see if a light turns on. That's a test!\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:35.000\nOr, imagine you're watering a plant and checking if the soil is damp. You're testing to see if it needs more water.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:47.100\nSo, tests help us understand things, make sure things are working properly, and learn new things. They're everywhere, and they're super important.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:56.400\nTo recap, a test is a way to check something. It helps us figure out if something works, or tells us more about it.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
