    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:20.800\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information and see how well someone, or something, performs.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:27.600\nThink about it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how many words you know.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:38.000\nOr maybe you test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\nThose are both examples of tests!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:47.500\nTests can be used for lots of things, like checking your knowledge, evaluating products, or even diagnosing medical conditions.\nThey help us make informed decisions based on the results.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:51.200\nSo, a test is really just a systematic way of getting answers.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
