    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:22.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us measure or evaluate something specific.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:37.100\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:45.900\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Some are written, like school exams. Others are practical, like a driving test.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:54.800\nAnd some are even just for fun, like a personality quiz online. The important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:01.500\nThey help us understand something better, whether it's our knowledge, our abilities, or even just our preferences. So, tests help us learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
