    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:19.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information or evaluate something. Think of it like this: you use a test to see if your cake is done baking by poking it with a fork.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:30.400\nThat's a test! Tests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking the weather app to see if you need an umbrella.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:40.900\nThe goal is always the same: to get some sort of result or answer. For example, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:53.200\nOr, you might test out a new recipe to see if you like it. So, in a nutshell, a test is any procedure used to gather information or assess something.\n\n00:53.200 --> 01:01.000\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
