    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_002754.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information, often to check understanding or see how well something works.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:28.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:36.800\nAnd when you try out a new recipe, you're essentially testing it to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:42.500\nSo, tests aren't scary.\nThey're just tools.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:53.600\nThey help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\nWhether it's a written exam, a physical challenge, or even just trying something new, a test helps us understand the world around us a little bit better.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
