    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_002835.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:27.300\nIt could be a quiz in school, a medical checkup, or even trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:37.400\nThe goal is to get information. Think about it: a math test helps your teacher see how well you understand numbers.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:48.200\nA doctor's test helps them see if you're healthy. And when you taste a cake, you're testing if it's delicious!\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:56.500\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and discover. They're a valuable tool for understanding the world around us and ourselves. From school exams to science experiments, tests are everywhere. Remember, they're just tools for learning and finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
