    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_002914.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are, and why they're important.\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:19.000\nBasically, a test is just a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is good. You screw it in, and if it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:35.500\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. If you get a good score, it means you understood the material.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:40.600\nBut it's not just about school! Tests are used everywhere.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:48.900\nDoctors use tests to check your health. Engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:56.300\nSo, a test is a way to check knowledge or performance. They're super common and help us learn and make things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
