    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.800\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in general, a test is just a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:24.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it this way: you might test a lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.900\nOr you could test a recipe by making it and tasting it to see if it's good. Scientists use tests all the time to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:47.500\nThey might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better. So, a test is simply a way to gather information, check something out, and see if it meets your expectations.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:54.300\nIt helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
