    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_003138.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:04.300\nToday, we're going to explore\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:05.300\nwhat a test is.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:08.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:12.100\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:16.800\nThink of it like this: a chef tasting soup is testing if it needs more salt.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:21.100\nOr, when you take a quiz at school, that\u2019s a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:24.600\nA doctor might run tests to understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:28.100\nEven trying out a new recipe is a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:33.000\nSo, a test is really just a method for gathering information and making a judgment.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:38.000\nIt can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like trying a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:43.000\nTests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:46.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
