    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_003221.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something really fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:16.100\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. It\u2019s a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like this: you\u2019re baking a cake. You test it with a toothpick to see if it\u2019s done.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:30.000\nThat\u2019s a test! Or, maybe you\u2019re trying out a new recipe and you taste it to see if it needs more salt. That's another test.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:38.100\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if something needs to be changed.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:46.900\nFrom checking if your shoes fit to taking a quiz in school, tests are all around us, helping us learn and improve.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:57.100\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information and understand something better. It\u2019s a simple, but powerful tool.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
