    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.000\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:30.800\nThink of it like this: a taste test! You try a new flavor of ice cream and decide if you like it or not.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:37.400\nThat\u2019s a test. Or, when you take a spelling test at school, it helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:44.000\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:54.600\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Scientists use tests to see if their experiments worked. Even video games have tests built in to see how skilled you are!\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:03.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information, whether it's about ice cream, spelling, or anything else. It helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
