    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.600\nA test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it as a question that you\u2019re trying to answer.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:30.300\nIt could be a written exam at school, a science experiment, or even just trying a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:39.900\nThe main idea behind any test is to get information.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:48.800\nIn school, a test checks how well you understand a topic. In science, an experiment tests if a hypothesis is correct.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:51.400\nAnd with our recipe, we\u2019re testing if it tastes good!\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:54.000\nFor example, a math test shows if you know your numbers.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:56.600\nA taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you prefer.\n\n00:56.600 --> 00:57.800\nSee?\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:00.200\nTests are everywhere!\n\n01:00.200 --> 01:08.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and answer a question.\n\n01:08.200 --> 01:11.300\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n01:11.300 --> 01:14.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
