    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\nIt's a process that helps us gather information and see where things stand.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:25.700\nThink about it like this: a simple test could be tasting a new food to see if you like it.\nOr maybe you're taking a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:29.400\nThose are both tests!\nThey give you information.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:34.200\nAnother example?\nA doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:45.400\nOr a baker might test their oven temperature to make sure their cookies bake perfectly.\nSo, a test is simply a way to get information and evaluate something.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:53.400\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
