    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like this: You buy a new lightbulb. To test it, you screw it into a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:26.900\nIf it lights up, the test passes! If it doesn't, the test fails.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:31.800\nTests are everywhere! A doctor uses tests to check your health.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:39.400\nA chef tastes food to make sure it's delicious. Even you checking if your shoes are tied is a kind of test!\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:50.300\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a way of checking if something is working correctly. It helps us make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
