    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like an investigation.\nYou're trying to learn more about a specific thing by asking questions or performing actions.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:33.600\nFor example, a spelling test helps us discover how well someone knows how to spell words.\nOr a taste test lets us find out which flavor of ice cream people like best.\nEven when a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:43.600\nSo, a test is a tool to gather information.\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:56.700\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just a way to learn more about the world around us, and ourselves!\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
