    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_004306.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling a really important concept: the test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like an experiment to see if something is true, or to measure something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.500\nTests can be big, like a final exam in school, or small, like tasting a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:38.500\nWhen you go to the doctor, they might run tests on your blood to check if you're healthy. Or, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:49.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
