    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:25.300\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or how well someone understands something.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:34.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it works properly.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:41.800\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:49.200\nThey can be written quizzes, like multiple choice questions, or even practical tests, like building something.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.600\nAnother example is a taste test!\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:54.900\nYou try different flavors of ice cream to see which one you like the best.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:56.000\nThat's a test too!\n```"
