    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.900\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like this: you're learning about animals, and your teacher gives you a quiz. That's a test!\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.700\nIt shows what you've learned about different animals. Or, imagine you're trying out a new toy.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:41.900\nYou're testing it to see if it's fun and if it works the way it should. Tests can be written quizzes, like the one about animals.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:53.500\nThey can also be hands-on activities, like trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good. The main thing is, a test helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:04.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check our knowledge or the quality of something. It helps us understand where we are and what we can do better.\n\n01:04.300 --> 01:07.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
