    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.000 --> 00:02.100\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:04.700\nA test is basically a way to check something.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:07.800\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:10.700\nIn school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:15.000\nBut tests aren't just for school. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:18.400\nOr you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:25.500\nFor example, a simple test could be asking your friend, \"What color is the sky?\" If they say \"blue,\" they pass the test!\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:28.800\nOr, you could test a toy to see if it works by turning it on.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:31.400\nIf it lights up, it passes the test.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:42.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and see if it works or if you know the answer. It helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:45.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
