    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_004725.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:20.800\nThink about it. When you take a spelling quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:30.800\nOr when a baker tastes their cake batter, that's a test to see if it needs more sugar. Tests help us understand things and make decisions.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:41.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, you might test your toys to see which one floats best in the bathtub.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:44.100\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:57.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. It can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like trying out a recipe. It's all about finding answers.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:03.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
