    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:13.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:21.100\nIt could be about anything! Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:31.100\nYou might poke it with a toothpick \u2013 that's a test! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test and is ready to eat.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:42.700\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. Falling down a few times is part of the test of learning.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:53.000\nEach time, you learn something new and get closer to passing the test, which is riding smoothly.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:59.100\nSo, a test is simply a procedure, or a question, used to see if something is true, ready, or working correctly. It helps us learn and improve.\n```"
