    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. Think of it like this: you use your senses to test if the stove is hot before touching it.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:25.900\nIn a more formal setting, a test helps us measure something. This could be your knowledge in school, the strength of a material, or even if a website is working correctly.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:34.900\nFor example, a math test checks your understanding of numbers. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:46.600\nTests help us understand things better and make informed decisions. So, a test is just a structured way to gather information and measure something specific.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:51.300\nRemember, it's all about learning and understanding.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
