    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. It's a process, or a series of steps, designed to see if something is true, or to measure how well something works.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:26.200\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:34.900\nOr, when you try on a new pair of shoes, you walk around to test if they fit comfortably. That's another kind of test.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:45.000\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking the temperature of your bathwater.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:57.200\nThe key is that you're trying to get information or make a judgment. So, in short, a test is a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:05.500\nTests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
