    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:13.300\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you get the right answer.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.800\nIt helps us understand if things are working as they should, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:42.200\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. For example, your teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:53.200\nOr, a doctor might run a test to check if you're healthy. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re checking if the ingredients and instructions work together to make something delicious!\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something. It helps us learn, understand, and make sure things are working correctly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
