    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:26.400\nWe use tests all the time, without even realizing it.\nFor example, when you try a new cookie recipe, you\u2019re testing it out to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:41.400\nOr, if your car won't start, you might test the battery to see if it's the problem.\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if the oven is hot enough.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:48.900\nThe important thing is they give us information.\nThey help us understand things better and make decisions.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:57.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
