    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.300\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:23.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:30.900\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:38.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:46.200\nA driving test checks your ability to drive a car. A taste test checks your preference for different flavors!\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:54.200\nTests aren't just about getting a grade. They help us understand what we already know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:58.600\nThey give us a chance to practice and improve.\n```"
