    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:04.600\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:07.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:10.300\nThe main idea behind a test is to see if something is true, accurate, or effective.\n\n00:10.300 --> 00:11.800\nWe use them all the time!\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:15.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:19.100\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:21.800\nEven when you try on a new pair of shoes, you're testing if they fit!\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:28.000\nSo, tests are just tools we use to gather information and make decisions based on what we learn.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.200\nThey help us confirm things, solve problems, and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:35.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
