    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to the answer, you're looking for proof.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.600\nThe main idea behind a test is to see if something is true or false, good or bad, or maybe even just how well something works.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:42.700\nFor example, if you bake a cake, you might test it by tasting it to see if it's delicious.\nOr, if you're building a birdhouse, you might test it by putting it outside to see if it can withstand the wind and rain.\nDoctors even use tests to figure out if you're sick or healthy.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:54.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and find answers.\nIt helps us learn and make decisions about all sorts of things.\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
