    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:13.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you understand the answer.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:34.500\nIn science and math, tests help us prove if an idea is right or wrong.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:43.000\nWe set up an experiment, which is a kind of test, and observe what happens.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:50.400\nFor example, if we want to test if plants need sunlight, we can put one plant in the sun and another in the dark.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:57.800\nIf the plant in the sun grows, and the one in the dark doesn't, that's a test showing sunlight is important! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something and see if it works the way we think it should. It helps us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
