    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_011113.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:28.200\nThink of it like this: you check your phone to see if you have any messages \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:36.500\nOr maybe you test the water in the shower to make sure it's not too hot or too cold.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:44.400\nIn school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:52.100\nThey can be written, like answering questions on paper, or practical, like showing you can do something.\n\n00:52.100 --> 01:00.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us see what we know and what we might need to learn more about. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
