    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:22.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:30.500\nA doctor might use a blood test to check your health.\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:46.200\nA programmer tests their code to make sure it works correctly.\nSo, whether it's checking a cake, your health, or computer code, tests are all about getting information and making sure things are working as they should.\nThey help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:53.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
