    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_011631.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:20.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:33.800\nIt could be anything! Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:42.100\nWe use tests all the time. Like, when you bake a cake, you might taste the batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:50.700\nOr, if your toy car isn't working, you might try different batteries to test which one works.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:59.000\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned. And doctors use tests to figure out if you're healthy.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:04.900\nBasically, tests are tools that help us learn and solve problems.\n\n01:04.900 --> 01:08.600\nThey give us evidence to make better decisions.\n\n01:08.600 --> 01:15.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n01:15.200 --> 01:19.000\nIt's all about learning and understanding!\n\n01:19.000 --> 01:22.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
