    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like a little experiment. The main idea is to gather information.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:39.400\nWe ask questions or set up a situation, and then we look at the results to see what we've learned.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words correctly. Or, testing a new recipe helps you see if it tastes good and if the instructions are easy to follow. Even playing a video game is a test of your skills!\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:55.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and check understanding. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
