    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:07.400\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:12.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:19.500\nIt's how we gather information to see if something is true or works the way we think it should.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:27.000\nThink about it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.000\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:34.900\nEven when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good!\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:42.200\nSo, tests can be anything from quizzes in school to checking if a new toy works properly.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:46.800\nThe main idea is to find something out, to learn and improve.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:50.400\nRemember, a test helps us understand things better.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
