    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like a detective trying to solve a mystery. The test helps us gather information.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:37.700\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, seeing how well you understand a new topic, or even figuring out if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:49.600\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz to test your knowledge of animals.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:57.300\nIn both cases, the test provides valuable insights. So, remember, a test is all about gathering information and learning something new. It's a tool we use to understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
