    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_012106.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:26.400\nIt's like asking a question and looking for the answer. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:35.100\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:42.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if the ingredients and recipe work together to make something delicious.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:51.400\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information and help us make decisions.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:59.300\nWhether it's figuring out if you need more sleep, or if a new product is safe, tests are a crucial part of learning and growing. Remember, a test is just a way to learn something new! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
