    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb works.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:30.800\nYou screw it in, flip the switch, and see if it lights up.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:34.400\nThat's a test!\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:37.900\nOr imagine baking a cake.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:40.900\nYou follow the recipe, put it in the oven, and then taste it to see if it's good.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:41.500\nThat's another test!\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:49.400\nTests help us understand things better. They can show us if something is working correctly, or if we need to make some changes.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:54.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
