    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.700\nIt helps us learn more about a person, a thing, or even an idea. Think about it like this: When you go to the doctor, they might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:31.700\nThat's one kind. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to see if it's good.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:42.100\nThat's also a test! So, tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying a new recipe.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:55.800\nThey all share one thing in common: they help us gather information and make decisions. Whether it\u2019s checking your understanding or checking the quality of something, tests are all around us.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:04.300\nTo sum it up, a test is just a process for learning something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
