    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nNow, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or works as it should.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like this: You might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:33.200\nOr a doctor might run tests on your blood to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:42.300\nTests aren't just for food or medicine, though. We use them all the time!\nWhen you take a quiz in school, that's a test.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:50.600\nWhen you try to turn on a light switch to see if the bulb works, that's a test too!\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:57.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\nIt helps us learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
