    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.000\nIt's like an experiment, but often a little less complicated.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:28.100\nWe use tests all the time to check our knowledge, skills, or even just to see how things work.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:36.600\nThink about it: a spelling test in school? That's a test! It shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:45.000\nOr what about baking a cake for the first time? Tasting it afterwards is a test to see if you followed the recipe correctly.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:54.600\nTests help us understand things better and learn from our mistakes. They give us information we can use to improve.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of exploring and finding things out. Tests are useful tools that guide us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
