    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.700\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:05.000\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:06.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:11.000\nSimply put, it's a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe by tasting it to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.000\nOr, imagine a toy car.\nYou test it by pushing it to see if it rolls.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:23.500\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:28.000\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even just drawing a picture.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:31.500\nThe important thing is that the test shows what you know.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:34.000\nSo, tests aren't scary!\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:37.000\nThey're just a way to check understanding.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:41.500\nRemember, they help you and your teachers learn.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:44.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
