    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:22.000\nIt helps us learn more about ourselves, or about the world around us. Think of it like this: a baking test checks if your cake is ready.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:32.500\nYou poke it with a toothpick, and if it comes out clean, it passes the test! Or, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:45.700\nYou answer questions, and the results tell you what you've learned. Tests can be big, like exams at school, or small, like trying out a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:51.900\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us understand and improve.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:59.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and discover. It's a tool for understanding.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
