    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.980\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:01.980 --> 00:05.190\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.190 --> 00:08.180\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:08.180 --> 00:11.030\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:11.030 --> 00:14.400\nWe give a test, and then we look at the results to learn more.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:20.830\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.830 --> 00:26.330\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:26.330 --> 00:29.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe!\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:37.060\nSo, tests come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to provide us with answers and help us understand something better.\n\n00:37.060 --> 00:41.500\nRemember, a test is just a tool to learn and improve.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:50.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
