    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process we use to gather information and see what happens.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a plant needs water. So, you touch the soil.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:24.600\nThat's a mini-test!\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:29.500\nThe soil is dry? The plant probably needs water. That's the result of your test!\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:39.200\nAnother example, a doctor might do a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a chef might taste a soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:44.300\nThese are all tests! They help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:55.600\nSo, a test is a way to explore, experiment, and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
