    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like a detective looking for clues.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:33.500\nA test can be anything from a simple quiz at school, to checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:43.100\nThe quiz tests your knowledge, and checking the bulb tests if it\u2019s functional.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:46.100\nWe use tests to see if something is true, accurate, or working correctly.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:49.100\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:52.700\nOr a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:55.700\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:06.200\nSo, remember, a test is a method for gathering information to learn something. It helps us understand the world better and make informed decisions.\n```"
