    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: Tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:17.400\nThink of a test as a way to check something, to see if it works or if it's true.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:25.300\nBasically, a test helps us find out information.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.800\nIt could be a quiz at school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:42.100\nOr it could be a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:50.700\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:50.700 --> 01:00.400\nFor example, baking a cake is a test. You follow the recipe, and the result, the cake, shows whether you followed the instructions correctly.\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:04.800\nAnother example is checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:08.900\nYou turn it on, and if it lights up, the test is passed!\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:15.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n01:15.700 --> 01:20.700\nIt helps us learn and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n01:20.700 --> 01:24.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
