    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be about anything!\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but it doesn't always have to be in a lab. So, what kind of things can we test?\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:28.800\nWell, a cookie recipe, for example. You test it by baking the cookies and seeing if they taste good.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:39.200\nOr maybe you're testing how well a new toy works by letting a child play with it. Even taking a quiz in school is a type of test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:50.000\nThe main goal is to learn something new or confirm something we already thought to be true. Tests help us make better decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:58.600\nThey\u2019re all about gathering information. In short, a test is a simple way to check something out and get answers.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:08.200\nHopefully, this gives you a good foundation for understanding what tests are all about. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
