    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like an experiment, or a way to check if something is true. For example, you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:33.200\nOr, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better. The idea is to gather evidence and get a result.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:47.100\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions. They can be as simple as tasting a new food to see if you like it, or as complex as a medical diagnosis.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:56.800\nNo matter the type, tests all serve the same purpose: to give us information. That's a quick look at the basics of tests.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
