    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_014211.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.900\nIt's a process designed to gather information. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:30.500\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. A chef might taste their sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:33.200\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:44.900\nThey help us learn, diagnose problems, and make improvements. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:48.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
