    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_014350.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.200\nA test is simply a way to check something, or find out how well you know something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like a way to measure. It can be a quiz in school, a medical exam at the doctor, or even checking if your bike tires have enough air.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:31.900\nThe main idea behind any test is to get information. Tests help us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:39.100\nFor example, a spelling test shows you which words you're good at spelling and which ones you need to practice.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:45.200\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie recipe is the yummiest! See? Tests aren't always scary!\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:54.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for gathering information and checking something. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
