    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like an experiment, where you try something and see what happens.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:33.300\nThe main idea behind a test is to check if an idea is correct, or if something works the way you expect.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:42.800\nYou set up a situation, and then you observe the results.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.500\nFor example, imagine you're testing a new lightbulb to see if it lights up. Or, you might test a recipe by actually baking it to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.200\nSo, a test helps us learn and improve. It confirms what we know, or shows us where we need to make changes. Testing is a crucial part of learning and discovering new things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
