    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.700\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\nIt's how we find out if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:25.600\nThink about it like this: your doctor might give you a vision test to see if you can see clearly.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:36.400\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:48.500\nTests help us make sure things are right, from big things like bridges needing safety tests, to smaller things like checking if your phone charger actually charges your phone.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:59.500\nSo, a test is really just a way to check, confirm, and understand something better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
