    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What is a test?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:18.600\nIt helps us measure or evaluate things.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a cake is ready. You do a test! You poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:32.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, maybe you're learning to spell.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:44.400\nYour teacher gives you a spelling test to see how well you've learned the words. That test shows you and your teacher what you know, and what you still need to practice.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:52.100\nSo, a test is just a tool to check understanding or measure progress. It can be as simple as poking a cake, or as formal as a school exam.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.700\nIt helps us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
