    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.799\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.799 --> 00:18.599\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:18.599 --> 00:22.299\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:22.299 --> 00:30.699\nThat's a test! The toothpick comes out clean? The cake passed the test, it's ready! If it comes out with batter, the cake failed, and needs more time.\n\n00:30.699 --> 00:39.099\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. The test helps your teacher see how well you understand the spelling words.\n\n00:39.099 --> 00:47.899\nSo, tests are just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:47.899 --> 00:54.900\nThey help us learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
