    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.900\nIt\u2019s a process designed to give us information. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps us find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:32.200\nA taste test helps us discover which flavor of ice cream you like best. Or, a medical test can help doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:47.500\nTests can be written, like school exams, or hands-on, like trying a new recipe. The important thing is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspected.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:55.200\nSo, a test is just a method of gathering information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
