    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.700\nIt's a process for gathering information to see if something is true, correct, or working as it should.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:30.700\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.100\nEven baking a cake can be a test! You're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:49.700\nSo, tests come in many forms and help us learn and understand things better. They help us check our knowledge, diagnose problems, and even improve recipes!\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:59.400\nTo recap, a test is an organized way of getting information to check something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
