    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:26.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:36.800\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:46.400\nMaybe you even test the temperature of your bath water to make sure it's not too hot or too cold.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:50.100\nTests help us learn what we know and what we still need to learn. They also help us make sure things are safe and working as they should.\n```"
