    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_015531.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.800\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.200\nThink of it like this: if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:34.800\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning. They can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like showing you can solve a math problem.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:42.500\nAnother example is a doctor using a test to see if you're healthy. They might check your temperature or blood pressure.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:54.900\nSo, tests are tools that help us learn, improve, and understand things better. They give us valuable information about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
