    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:22.800\nWe use tests all the time! For example, you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:31.100\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:36.900\nLet's say you're baking a cake. You might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:42.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! That's a test!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:52.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and answer a question. It helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
