    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:15.500\nA test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works or is true.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like this: you have a lightbulb and you want to know if it's good.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:30.800\nYou screw it into a lamp and turn the switch. That's a test! In school, a test helps your teacher see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:35.600\nIf you get most of the questions right, it means you've learned a lot.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:40.400\nAnother example? A doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:46.600\nThey take a sample and check it. So, a test is a check, a way to find out if something is working, true, or present.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:49.400\nIt's all about getting information.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:52.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
