    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_015938.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:21.200\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of getting a simple yes or no, you get information that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:32.000\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words. Or, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:40.600\nTests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking if a bridge is strong enough to seeing if a new medicine works.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:47.400\nSo, a test is really just a tool. It helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:53.700\nIt's all about learning and understanding! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
