    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:23.300\nIt's a process or procedure designed to measure or evaluate a specific thing.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.000\nThink about it like this:\nyou take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:41.900\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:52.600\nA test can be a quiz, an exam, or even a simple experiment.\nSo, if you bake a cake and taste it to see if it's good, that's a kind of test!\nYou're testing the result of your baking.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:54.300\nTests help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:56.200\nBasically, a test is just a method for getting information.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:57.000\nGot it?\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:57.900\nGreat!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
