    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:14.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:37.800\nOr, a doctor might test your temperature to see if you have a fever. The main idea is to perform an action, or make an observation, to get some information.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:47.700\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well you know your words. A car safety test checks how safe a car is in a crash.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:55.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information. It helps us understand something better by observing or measuring. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
