    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like a simple question with a right or wrong answer. The main idea behind a test is to make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.800\nIt helps us catch mistakes or problems early on. For example, you might test a lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:36.900\nOr, you might test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:39.000\nSee? Simple stuff!\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:51.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a straightforward way of checking if something is working correctly. It helps us identify problems and ensures things are functioning as intended.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:53.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
