    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.400\nIt\u2019s a structured process to see if something is true, or if something works the way it\u2019s supposed to.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like this: a taste test! You try a new flavor of ice cream to test if you like it.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:38.400\nOr, when you take a spelling test in school, it tests your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:54.600\nA doctor might order blood tests to test your health. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:01.300\nWhether it's trying new food, checking your knowledge, or ensuring your body is healthy, tests are all around us! That's the basic idea of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
