    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey there, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something. Think of it as asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:22.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. A doctor might run a test to check your health.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:31.600\nA teacher gives tests to see what you've learned in class. Or, you might even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:40.600\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a test of your knowledge. Tasting a spoonful of soup is a test of its flavor.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:51.300\nEven observing how a plant grows is a test of the effects of sunlight. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:59.600\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, and improve things all around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
