    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.940\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.940 --> 00:04.380\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.380 --> 00:06.690\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.690 --> 00:09.440\nIt helps us understand if something is true,\n\n00:09.440 --> 00:11.970\nhow well something works, or what someone knows.\n\n00:11.970 --> 00:15.770\nThink of it like this: your mom might test if the cake is done\n\n00:15.770 --> 00:17.970\nby sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:17.970 --> 00:20.590\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\n\n00:20.590 --> 00:21.620\nThe cake passes the test!\n\n00:21.620 --> 00:24.840\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school.\n\n00:24.840 --> 00:27.650\nThat test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.650 --> 00:32.620\nAnother example: a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people feel better.\n\n00:32.620 --> 00:37.420\nThey give the medicine to some people and a fake medicine to others, and then compare the results.\n\n00:37.420 --> 00:41.550\nSo, a test is just a process for gathering information to answer a question.\n\n00:41.550 --> 00:45.550\nWe use tests all the time to learn and make decisions.\n\n00:45.550 --> 00:47.530\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
