    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_021318.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:24.200\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:34.600\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. And a medical test can help doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:43.700\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like asking a friend a trivia question.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:52.200\nThe key thing is that they all involve gathering information to learn something new or confirm what we already know.\n\n00:52.200 --> 01:02.000\nSo, tests are tools we use every day to learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
