    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:29.600\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:34.400\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:37.000\nThey\u2019re both tests!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:40.000\nThey're helping us learn or improve something.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:46.800\nAnother example is a medical test. A doctor might run tests to see if you have a cold or if you're healthy.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:51.800\nThe results help them understand what's going on.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:57.200\nIt helps us check our knowledge, skills, or even our health.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:01.600\nIt's all about gathering information to learn and make better decisions.\n\n01:01.600 --> 01:03.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
