    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_022400.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: a school test checks your understanding of a subject, like math or history.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.400\nBut tests aren't just for school. A scientist might test a new medicine to see if it\u2019s safe and effective.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:43.200\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good! So, examples, right? A spelling test, a driving test, even tasting a new flavor of ice cream \u2013 all tests!\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:58.000\nThey all help us gather information and make decisions. In short, a test is a way to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even just your taste buds.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:04.000\nIt's all about finding out the answer! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
