    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_022442.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:25.200\nIt helps us understand if something works, or if it's good, or if it meets a certain standard.\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:35.000\nAnd a medical test, like a blood test, checks if your body is healthy.\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:48.600\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your bike tires have enough air.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:57.800\nBasically, any time you're checking something to see if it meets a need, you're performing a test.\nThat's the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
