    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:19.800\nIt's a method we use to measure or evaluate.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like checking if a cake is done.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:29.000\nYou poke it with a toothpick, right? That's a test!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:32.800\nOr maybe you're trying to figure out if it's raining outside.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:47.000\nYou might look out the window. That's also a test. In school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. Outside of school, tests can help doctors diagnose illnesses, or even help you decide which phone to buy by reading reviews.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:51.800\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and make a decision.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:54.700\nIt\u2019s all about finding things out!\n```"
