    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore something super fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:18.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give us information.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:26.600\nThat information could be about anything! For example, a spelling test helps us see how well we know our words.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.700\nA taste test lets us compare different flavors and decide which we like best. Even checking if the light switch works is a type of test, right?\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:46.200\nYou\u2019re testing if the light will turn on! So, a test is just a method for gathering information or checking if something works.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:52.800\nIt's all about learning and finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
