    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:05.800\nToday, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:10.100\nWhat is a test?\n\n00:10.100 --> 00:12.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:14.200\nIt's a way to gather information.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:18.600\nThink of it like this: a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it works.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:23.800\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:27.500\nTests aren't just for science or school, though!\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:30.300\nYou test things all the time.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:34.900\nWhen you try a new food, you're testing to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:41.800\nWhen you turn a light switch on, you're testing if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:48.200\nSo, tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying new things.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:52.700\nThey all help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:57.500\nIn short, a test is just a way to check something and get some answers.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
