    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, it's a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done, so you stick a toothpick in them.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:20.100\nThat's a test! The toothpick helps you check if they're ready.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:31.300\nIn other situations, a test could be a quiz at school to see how much you've learned. Or, imagine a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:45.100\nSo, a test is really just a procedure designed to evaluate something. It helps us confirm if something is working, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:55.800\nWhether it's baking cookies or learning new things, tests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
