    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.200\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:35.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy. Or maybe you take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:44.400\nTests can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like asking a friend if they like a certain song.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:55.500\nThe important thing is that a test gives you information. For example, a taste test can tell you which cookie is yummier. A spelling test shows you which words you need to practice.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:01.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for gathering information.\n\n01:01.200 --> 01:04.400\nIt helps us learn, understand, and make better decisions.\n\n01:04.400 --> 01:06.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
