    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.120 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.400\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in a broader sense, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:27.300\nIt's a process of trying something out to see what happens. Think of it like this: If you want to know if a lightbulb works, you screw it into a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:35.600\nThat's a test! Or, if you're baking a cake and want to know if it's done, you stick a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:42.600\nIf it comes out clean, the cake has passed the test. Tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:49.600\nThey give us information that we can use to make decisions or improve something.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:54.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information by trying something out.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:57.300\nIt\u2019s everywhere!\n\n00:57.300 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
