    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:19.700\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out. It's a process, or a procedure, designed to see how well you know something, how good you are at something, or even just to check if something works.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:24.100\nThink about it. A spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:29.000\nA taste test checks how something tastes. And a battery test?\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.100\nThat checks if your battery is still working! Tests aren't just about getting a grade.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:42.200\nThey help us learn and improve. They show us where we're strong and where we might need a little more practice.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:49.600\nSo next time you hear the word \"test\", remember it's just a way to learn and understand something better.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
