    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nHey there! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out if something is true or correct.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You screw it in, flip the switch, and that's your test.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:22.600\nDoes it light up?\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.000\nGreat! It passed the test. Tests can be anything from a simple yes or no question to a more complex process.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:39.400\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Or, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.100\nSo remember, a test is just a method to check something. It helps us confirm if what we think is true, actually is true.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:54.700\nPretty useful, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
