    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_023551.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.600\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works, or if you know something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:23.200\nIt's like asking a question to see if the answer is right.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:28.400\nFor example, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:38.000\nYou might test it by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:44.200\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, your teacher might give you a quiz to see if you remember them.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:56.800\nThat's another kind of test. Tests aren't just about getting a right or wrong answer. They help us learn and improve. They show us what we already know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:01.400\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way of checking something to see if it works or if you know the answer.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:04.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
