    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:13.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well something is performing.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: You test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a fork. If the fork comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:30.600\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time. A doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:39.200\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge. Even trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:48.200\nSo, a test helps us understand something better by giving us information. Basically, it's a way to check and see!\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:51.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
