    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_024012.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your brain!\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:25.900\nThe main idea behind a test is to see if you've learned the information you were supposed to.\nTeachers use tests to understand what students are learning and what they might need help with.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:36.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell certain words.\nA math test checks if you understand how to solve problems.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:50.500\nAnd even a quiz is just a short, simple test.\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to measure your knowledge, helps teachers understand what you've learned, and comes in many different forms.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:59.200\nLearning is a journey, and tests are just checkpoints along the way.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
