    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_024107.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.900\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:21.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how well someone knows something, or how well something works.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are baked enough.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.900\nThe main idea behind a test is to measure something.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:37.300\nAre you learning in school?\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:42.000\nA test helps your teacher see what you understand.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:44.800\nDoes a new medicine work?\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:47.300\nScientists use tests to find out!\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:59.700\nFor example, a simple spelling test can show if you know how to spell certain words. Or, a taste test can help you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. Both are tests, just in different ways.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:05.000\nSo, tests help us measure knowledge, skills, and even preferences.\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:08.900\nThey're a useful tool for learning and making decisions.\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:15.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
