    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_024406.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure or a set of questions designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:28.300\nThink of it like this: a math test checks how well you understand addition and subtraction.\nOr, a recipe is kind of a test for your cooking skills!\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:39.300\nYou follow the instructions, and the result \u2013 hopefully a delicious cake \u2013 shows how well you did.\nTests aren't just for school, either.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:53.100\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and engineers use tests to see if a bridge is strong enough.\nSo, a test is just a structured way to learn something about yourself or the world around you.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:59.600\nTests help us understand and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
