    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:18.300\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it as a question you're asking, and you're looking for the answer.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:36.900\nIt could be a written exam in school, where you're trying to show what you've learned.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:44.300\nOr it could be something much simpler, like testing if the water is hot enough for a bath.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:51.700\nYou touch the water, that's the test, and the feeling tells you the answer.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:56.300\nAnother example: you might test if a lightbulb works by screwing it in.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:00.600\nDoes it light up?\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:04.200\nThat's the result of your test!\n\n01:04.200 --> 01:13.900\nSee, tests are all around us, helping us understand things.\n\n01:13.900 --> 01:19.300\nThey help us see if something works, if something is true, or if something is good enough.\n\n01:19.300 --> 01:27.000\nSo, a test is just a way to ask a question and get an answer.\n\n01:27.000 --> 01:29.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
