    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a topic.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:26.600\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:34.600\nLet's say you want to know if a lightbulb works. The test is simple: you screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:41.400\nIf it lights up, it passes the test! Another example: you study for a math test.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:53.400\nThe test itself will show if you understood the material. So, remember, tests are just ways of checking things and seeing if they work or if you know something.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:59.700\nIt's all about finding out information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
