    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand better.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.100\nTests can come in many forms. Maybe you're taking a multiple-choice quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:36.300\nThat's a test! Or, perhaps you're trying a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:43.500\nThat's a test too! You're testing out the recipe. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:50.700\nA baker might test their oven temperature to make sure their cakes bake properly. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:55.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:05.400\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
