    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.150 --> 00:05.390\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.390 --> 00:18.590\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an answer, you're collecting evidence to understand something better.\n\n00:18.590 --> 00:29.290\nFor example, a doctor might order a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:29.290 --> 00:43.470\nEven baking a cake can be a test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious! So, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and make better decisions.\n\n00:43.470 --> 00:55.960\nThey come in many forms, from simple questionnaires to complex scientific experiments. The key is that they provide information to help us understand something more clearly.\n\n00:55.960 --> 01:00.930\nIn short, a test is a way of gathering information to evaluate or assess something.\n\n01:00.930 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
