    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_025309.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.100\nIt's a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:35.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake recipe by baking it to see if it tastes good. Or, a doctor might test your blood to check your health.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:47.700\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:55.000\nSo, a test is just a tool to measure something, whether it's your understanding of a subject, the quality of a product, or even your physical well-being. Essentially, tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
