    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_025354.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling a fundamental concept: tests.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:18.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else. Think of it like an experiment, where you try something out to see what happens.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.500\nSo, what kind of things can we test? Well, almost anything!\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:33.900\nFor example, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:42.200\nImagine you're building a tower out of blocks. You might test its stability by gently pushing it to see if it falls over.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:47.200\nThat's a test! It helps you understand how strong your tower is.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:57.200\nBasically, a test is a way of gathering information and learning more. It helps us make better decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:07.300\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to explore and discover! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
