    "subtitles": "WebVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the concept of a test.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:17.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information or measure something. Think of it like an experiment, but usually a little less complicated.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:23.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:33.700\nA doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. A teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:39.100\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:47.100\nSee how different those are? In each case, they're trying to learn something.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:58.500\nThe doctor learns about your health, the teacher learns about your understanding, and the baker learns about the flavor. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information or measuring something.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.100\nIt's a tool we use to learn and understand the world around us.\n```"
