    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_025743.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we've learned something new. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:34.500\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Another example: you might test a new toy to see if it works like it's supposed to.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:48.900\nYou press the button, and if it makes the right sound, the test passes! So, a test is just a way to check things out, to learn something, or to make sure something's working right.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:57.300\nHopefully, now you have a better understanding of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
