    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_025832.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like a game where you answer questions to show what you've learned. It can be written, like a quiz with multiple choice or short answer questions.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:36.000\nOr, it can be practical, like showing you know how to bake a cake or play a musical instrument.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:39.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills,\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:42.400\nwhile a driving test checks if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:42.900\nSee?\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:44.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:51.500\nSo, a test is a tool to measure your knowledge or ability in a specific area. It helps you and others understand what you've learned and where you can improve.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:54.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
