    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.200\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of school, but a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:27.600\nIt's a process to see if something is true, or if something works the way it should. Think of it like this: a baker might taste their cake batter - that's a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:39.900\nOr, a doctor might check your temperature - that\u2019s a test to see if you have a fever. A test can be anything from a quick check to a long, detailed investigation.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:53.100\nThe important thing is that it gives us information. So, to recap, a test is a procedure designed to gather information and see if something is true or working correctly.\n\n00:53.100 --> 01:00.200\nIt\u2019s used everywhere, from baking to medicine! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
