    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something really important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:21.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. It's how we find out if something works, if something is true, or even if we understand something ourselves.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:33.000\nThink about it like this: a cooking test might be tasting a sauce to see if it needs more salt. Or, a spelling test checks if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:49.900\nIn science, a test could be an experiment to see if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic goal: to give us information and help us learn.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:59.100\nThey help us confirm what we know, and identify what we still need to work on. That\u2019s the core of what a test is all about!\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:02.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
