    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.700\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:30.900\nThink of it like a question you're asking, but instead of just asking with words, you're asking with actions or problems to solve.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:43.000\nThe main idea is to check if something is working correctly, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:51.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A driving test checks if you know how to drive safely.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:57.300\nEven baking a cake can be a test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and skills to see if it comes out delicious!\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:01.400\nSo, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:04.600\nThey show us what we already know, and what we still need to work on.\n\n01:04.600 --> 01:08.800\nIn short, a test is a method to evaluate something, whether it's knowledge, skill, or even the quality of a product.\n\n01:08.800 --> 01:12.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
