    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs, or what it's made of.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:27.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:34.500\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. That\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:41.000\nAnother example is a doctor checking your temperature. That\u2019s a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:54.100\nTests can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all help us learn something new.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:59.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:03.500\nIt can be a quiz, a taste, or even a simple check. They're all tests!\n\n01:03.500 --> 01:07.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
