    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like an experiment, but instead of mixing chemicals, you're trying to learn about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:33.800\nFor example, you take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:46.700\nA doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\nOr, a company might test a new product to see if people like it.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:56.800\nSo, tests help us gather information, measure abilities, and make decisions.\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: to learn something new.\n\n00:56.800 --> 00:59.200\nThat\u2019s testing in a nutshell!\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
