    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: Tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:19.000\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:24.200\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:28.900\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:33.600\nDid I lock the door? I check the handle \u2013 that's a test.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:38.800\nIs the lightbulb working? I flip the switch \u2013 another test!\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:49.300\nTests help us confirm if something is working as expected, or if something needs fixing. They provide information that helps us make decisions.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:58.000\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something. It can be big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:58.000 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
