    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:19.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how well you understand something.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:32.400\nThink of it like this: you\u2019ve been learning about different fruits, and a test would be asking you to name them when you see their pictures.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:40.900\nThe main idea is to see what you know. Tests can be written, like multiple choice questions, or practical, like showing you can bake a cake after learning a recipe.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:49.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words. A math test checks your ability to solve problems.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:56.700\nEven a driving test checks if you know the rules of the road and can drive safely.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:03.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to see what you've learned.\n\n01:03.800 --> 01:07.800\nIt helps you and your teacher understand where you're doing well and where you might need a little more practice.\n01:07.800 --> 01:10.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
