    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.899\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something about something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand things better.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:23.599\nThe main idea behind a test is to see how well something performs or how much of something is present.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:35.199\nFor example, you might take a math test at school to see how well you understand the concepts. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your vitamin levels.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:46.899\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with. Basically, if you want to know about something, a test can give you information.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:57.399\nSo, a test is a method for finding out information or evaluating something.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:07.399\nTo recap, tests help us learn and evaluate. From school exams to medical checkups, they're all about gathering information.\n\n01:07.400 --> 01:09.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
