    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_032155.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:16.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just guessing, you're trying to get a real answer.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:26.300\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. In school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:36.000\nBut you also take tests every day without even realizing it! For example, when you try a new food and decide if you like it, that's a test.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:49.100\nOr when you try to open a door and it doesn't open, that's a test to see if it's locked! So, a test is simply a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:54.600\nIt helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
