    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_032251.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.500\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to give you information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:34.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it works.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:45.500\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic purpose: to gather information and help us learn something new.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:54.400\nWhether it's a pop quiz, a science experiment, or even just trying a new recipe, you're conducting a test.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:06.000\nTo recap: A test is a process for gathering information.\nIt helps us learn about ourselves, the world around us, and everything in between.\n\n01:06.000 --> 01:09.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
