    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:20.800\nThe toothpick comes out clean? The cake passes the test.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:29.200\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly or meeting a certain standard. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:39.000\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. So, tests are basically just a way to get information and make sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:50.300\nThey\u2019re used everywhere, from baking to medicine to school. Remember, a test is just a check!\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
