    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: a test!\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:15.300\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in a broader sense, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.600\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if something is true. Think of it like this: baking a cake.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:33.000\nThe taste test is a test to see if you used the right amount of sugar. Or, checking if a lightbulb works after you screw it in.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:39.800\nThat's a test to see if it's functional. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:44.300\nTrying a new recipe? That's a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:53.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
