    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE duration: 59.200\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:27.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it! Think of it like this: you check if the oven is hot enough before putting a cake in \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:37.600\nOr, maybe you try on a shirt to see if it fits. Another test!\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:46.000\nBasically, a test helps us confirm if something is working correctly, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:55.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A taste test checks if food tastes good.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a check. It helps us find out if something is right, or if it needs a little work. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
