    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.500\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:19.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out, to check if something is true, or to see how well something works.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like this: You might test if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\nIf it comes out clean, the cookies pass the test!\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:31.800\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:35.600\nEach time you try, you're testing your balance and coordination.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:47.300\nTests aren't just for school.\nThey're everywhere!\nWe use them all the time to learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:52.200\nSo, tests help us understand the world around us better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
