    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.100\nIt's a method to gather information or see how well something works.\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:31.400\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream is your favorite.\nOr, a medical test can tell you if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:41.200\nSo, a test can be anything from answering questions to trying something out.\nThe main goal is to get some kind of result or answer.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:47.300\nTests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\nThey're everywhere!\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:58.500\nTo recap: a test is a process for gathering information.\nIt can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just trying something new.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
