    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_033206.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something called a test.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us learn more about ourselves or the things around us.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like this: You want to know if your cookies are done baking.\nYou can test them by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.400\nIf it comes out clean, the cookies pass the test!\nOr maybe you want to know if you remember your ABCs.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.600\nSomeone could give you a quick test by asking you to say them.\nTests aren't just for cookies or letters.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:48.000\nThey can be used for all sorts of things!\nDoctors use tests to check if you're healthy, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:58.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and understand things better.\nIt's a way of asking questions and finding answers.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
