    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.100\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out. It's a method for gathering information.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like this: you might test if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, the cookies pass the test!\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:29.400\nOr, maybe you test the temperature of the water before you get in the shower. Too cold? Too hot? That\u2019s a test too.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:32.000\nBasically, a test helps you make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:43.300\nSo, a test is an organized way to check something out and get some answers.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:47.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
