    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_033324.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more about whatever you're curious about.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:21.800\nThink about it.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:31.100\nA spelling test shows how well you know your words. A taste test helps you decide which cookie is yummier. And even a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:42.000\nSo, tests can be quizzes, experiments, or even just observations. They all help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:50.200\nWhether it\u2019s checking if a lightbulb works or seeing if a plant grows taller with more sunlight, we\u2019re performing a test.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:56.600\nBasically, a test is just a method to gather information. Pretty simple, right?\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
