    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_033455.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:07.800 --> 00:16.500\nToday we're going to talk about tests \u2013 specifically, what a test is.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:27.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. Think of it like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:35.900\nFor example, a spelling test helps us understand how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes the best!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:48.000\nDoctors use tests to see if we're healthy, and scientists use tests to learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:54.400\nSo, whether it's a school quiz, a quick experiment, or even just trying out a new recipe, remember that a test is just a way of finding something out.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:57.900\nThey help us learn, improve, and understand. And that's what tests are all about! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
