    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:29.100\nFor example, imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might stick a toothpick in the middle to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:36.400\nThat's a test to see if the cake is done!\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is broken, you might try turning it on.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:44.800\nThat's a test too!\nSo, a test is really just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:56.900\nIt helps us understand something better or confirm whether something is true or false.\nTests can be super simple, like checking the cake, or more complex, like a school exam.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.300\nBut the basic idea is always the same: to get an answer.\n01:00.300 --> 01:03.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
