    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:20.800\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb works. You flip the switch \u2013 that\u2019s your test!\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.000\nIf the light comes on, great! It passed the test. If it doesn't, well, it failed.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:39.400\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. The test helps your teacher see if you've learned how to spell certain words.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:43.800\nIf you spell them all correctly, you pass the test!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:51.000\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something. Whether it's a light bulb, your spelling, or anything else,\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:59.400\ntests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
