    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:28.300\nIn everyday life, tests help us make decisions. A doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you sick.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:37.900\nA car mechanic might run tests to see why your car isn't working right. Even something as simple as trying on shoes is a kind of test.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:46.800\nYou're testing to see if they fit and if you like them. So, tests are all about gathering information to answer a question.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:56.200\nThey help us understand things better. To recap: a test is a procedure used to gain information or answer a question.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:06.200\nIt can be simple, like poking a cake, or more complex, like medical exams. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
