    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_034013.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:20.500\nA test is basically a way to find out how much you know about something. Think of it like a measuring tool, but instead of measuring length or weight, it measures your understanding.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:30.800\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:39.200\nA math test shows how well you understand numbers and equations.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:46.800\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you can follow the instructions and make something delicious!\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:55.100\nSo, a test helps you and your teachers see what you've learned and what you might need a little more help with. It's all about learning and growing!\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.700\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just a way to check your progress. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
