    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_034054.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the wonderful world of tests.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:16.500\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:37.200\nOr, you might take a spelling test to see if you know your words. In the world of computers and software, tests are super important!\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:49.900\nThey help us make sure everything is running smoothly and doing what it's supposed to do. For example, imagine you build a website.\n\n00:49.900 --> 01:00.700\nYou might test to make sure the buttons work, the links go to the right places, and everything looks good on different devices.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:04.300\nTesting helps catch problems early, before they become big headaches.\n\n01:04.300 --> 01:07.900\nSo, testing is all about checking things and making sure they work!\n\n01:07.900 --> 01:11.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
