    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.400\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of school, but a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:24.300\nIt's like asking a question to see if you get the right answer. Think about it like this: You might test if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:37.300\nOr, you might test a recipe by trying it out to see if it tastes good. In both cases, you're performing an action and observing the result to see if it meets your expectations.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:50.300\nTests can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like checking if your shoes are tied. The important thing is that they help us understand if something is working as it should.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:60.900\nSo, a test is simply a way to check something by performing an action and observing the result. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
