    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.400\nHey there, welcome to a quick introduction to testing!\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it like this: you make a cake, then you taste it. That taste test is, well, a test!\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:39.500\nIn many situations, like building software or even designing a new product, we run tests to find problems early.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:51.100\nFor example, if you're writing a computer program, you might test if a button clicks correctly. Or if you\u2019re building a toy car, you'd test if the wheels spin freely.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:58.500\nTests help us make sure things are reliable and do what they are supposed to do. So, testing is just a way to check, verify, and improve things. It's a crucial part of making sure everything works great. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
