    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:24.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:29.400\nIt helps us check knowledge, skills, or even abilities.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:35.200\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:41.000\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:41.900\nSee?\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:43.700\nDifferent situations, same idea.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:53.900\nLet's say you're building a birdhouse. You might test the wood to make sure it's strong enough. Or after you finish, you might test it by putting it outside to see if it can withstand the weather.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.200\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:58.400\nand see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:00.500\nIt's a simple tool we use every day\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:02.000\nto learn and improve.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:04.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
