    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like this: you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works. You test it by screwing it in and flipping the switch. That's a basic test!\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:26.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:34.300\nA doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:43.300\nA baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:51.700\nEven checking if your shoes fit is a kind of test!\n\n00:51.700 --> 01:01.700\nSo, tests help us understand things and make decisions. They can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:06.699\nThey all have the same goal: to get information.\n\n01:06.699 --> 01:11.599\nIn short, a test is a process to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:11.599 --> 01:16.699\nThanks for watching! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
