    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.300\nIt\u2019s a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or accurate. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.500\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:45.400\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, whether it's checking your knowledge, figuring out what's wrong, or just trying something new, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:51.000\nThey're all about discovery! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
