    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it as a question or a series of questions designed to give us information.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:30.400\nThis \"something\" could be anything! It could be your knowledge of a subject, like a quiz in school.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.700\nOr it could be a way to check if something is working correctly, like testing a new toy to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:40.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:43.700\nA baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:46.700\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:57.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a method, a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand the world better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
