    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_035222.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:19.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see what the results tell us.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:33.600\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of water to see if it's hot enough for tea.\nOr, a baker might test a cake with a toothpick to see if it's baked all the way through.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:48.300\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoelaces are tied.\nThe important thing is that you're performing an action to get an answer.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:56.700\nSo, whether it's a science experiment, a quiz, or just poking a cake, a test is all about finding out something new.\nWe use tests all the time to learn and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
