    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_035321.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE duration:66.5\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if someone knows the answer, or measuring something to see how big it is.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:22.700\nTests can be all sorts of things. A quiz at school is a test of your knowledge.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:31.500\nA doctor might run tests on your blood to check your health. Even trying out a new recipe is a test to see if you like how it tastes!\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:41.600\nSo, if you\u2019re building a tower of blocks, you're testing its stability. If it falls over, you know you need to make some changes.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:44.200\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.200 --> 01:00.000\nThey help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us. To recap, a test is a way to check something, whether it's your knowledge, your health, or even just how well a recipe turns out. It\u2019s all about finding out information.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:06.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
