    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.100\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:18.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:25.900\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. Your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:38.900\nA doctor might run a test to check your health. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe!\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:45.700\nFor example, if you want to know if water boils at 100 degrees Celsius, you can run a test.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:52.500\nYou heat the water and see what temperature it reaches when it starts to boil. That\u2019s a simple test!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.300\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.900\nIt's all about asking questions and finding the answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
