    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:23.500\nIt's a method for gathering information or checking if something is working correctly.\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:35.600\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and your baking skills!\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:46.300\nTests can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb turns on.\nOr, they can be more complex, like a science experiment.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:56.500\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and understand things better.\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and checking things out!\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
