    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_040224.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:23.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information about something, whether it's your knowledge on a subject, the quality of a product, or even just to see if something works.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:33.500\nThink of a spelling test at school \u2013 that's testing your spelling skills. Or imagine a scientist testing a new medicine to see if it helps people.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:39.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe and baking skills.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:51.500\nThe result tells you if you did it right. So, a test is really just a method of finding things out, by observing the results of something you do or create.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:56.800\nFrom school to science, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:56.800 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
