    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into a really important concept: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is just a way of finding out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.700\nWe use tests all the time, without even realizing it. Did you ever try to open a door to see if it was unlocked? That's a test!\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:28.900\nOr maybe you tasted some food to see if it was too hot. Another test!\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:35.600\nIn school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand the material. Doctors use tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:45.500\nEven game developers use tests to make sure their games are fun and work properly.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:55.400\nSo, whether it\u2019s checking a door, tasting food, or taking a quiz, a test is all about gathering information.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:01.700\nThat's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
