    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.200\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:21.400\nIt's like an experiment or a way to check if something is true.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:31.300\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a cake is done baking. You perform a test by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:36.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test shows the cake is ready!\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:41.300\nOr, maybe you want to know if you remember your ABCs.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:45.800\nSomeone might test you by asking you to recite them.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:46.900\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:53.700\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is just a method we use to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:55.400\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n```"
  },
