    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or measure something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:27.800\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your overall health. Tests can be used to measure all sorts of things!\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:35.500\nFrom your knowledge of a subject, to the strength of a bridge, or even how well a new video game works.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:45.000\nThe key is that a test gives us information. So, a spelling test shows how well you spell, and a blood test shows your health.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:55.200\nIn both cases, we're using the test to learn something. Remember, a test is just a way to check or measure something to learn about it.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
