    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_041602.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process we use to gather information and see how something performs.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:30.900\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes best.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:40.000\nSee? It's about gathering evidence. Another example is a product test.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:52.200\nCompanies test their products to make sure they're safe and work correctly before selling them to you. These tests help improve the quality of almost everything we use.\n\n00:52.200 --> 01:02.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for learning something new or evaluating something. It can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like trying out a new recipe.\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:03.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
