    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a question that helps us learn.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.200\nTests can be formal, like the quizzes you take in school. Or they can be informal, like trying a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:33.100\nThe key is that you're trying to get information. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.200\nA baker might taste their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar. Even a child throwing a ball is testing their aim!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:52.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a way of gathering information or checking something. It can be anything from a school exam to a simple experiment. The goal is always to learn something new.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
