    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:19.800\nNow, tests can come in many forms. It could be a written exam at school, like a multiple-choice quiz.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:31.800\nOr, it could be something more practical, like testing if a lightbulb works by plugging it in. The lightbulb either turns on or it doesn't \u2013 that\u2019s the answer!\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:38.500\nAnother example could be testing a recipe. You follow the instructions and then taste the food.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:53.000\nThe taste test tells you if the recipe worked well. So, to recap: a test is a process to gather information and see if something is true, works, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:58.800\nIt's all about finding answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
