    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:19.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you poke them with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:28.400\nIn science and everyday life, we use tests to see if something is true, or to measure something.\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:38.700\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\nTests can be simple or complex, but they all have the same basic goal:\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:47.700\nto gather information and learn something new.\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to check and learn!\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
