    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:21.100\nIt's a method to measure or evaluate. Think of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:33.000\nOr imagine you're baking a cake and you taste it \u2013 that's a test to make sure it's sweet enough. Even doctors use tests, like blood tests, to check your health.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:42.100\nSo, tests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking your knowledge to checking if something is working correctly.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:49.200\nThey help us understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
