    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like a question that needs an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:32.800\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done. You poke the cake, and if the toothpick comes out clean, you know it's ready.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:40.200\nThat's a test! Or, if you're learning new words, a quiz is a test to see how many you remember.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:48.000\nTests help us understand where we are and what we need to learn. They aren't scary, they're just tools.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find something out. It's a simple question looking for an answer.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
