    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just asking, you're doing something to get the answer.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.900\nThe main idea of a test is to see if something is true or not.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:42.700\nFor example, a simple test could be dropping a ball to see if it falls.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:49.500\nWe already know it will, but the test proves it!\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:56.000\nAnother test could be tasting something to see if it's sweet. You're testing its sweetness.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:00.100\nSo, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n```"
