    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_043826.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something! It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:24.400\nThink about it this way: a test can be a quiz at school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:38.000\nIt can also be tasting a new cookie to see if you like it. Or even trying on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:40.100\nSo, a school quiz checks your knowledge, tasting a cookie checks your preference, and trying on shoes checks their fit.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:48.500\nSee? All tests! They all give us information. Basically, a test is just a method for getting information or making a decision.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:54.800\nIt helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
