    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_044051.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something.\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:21.600\nIt helps you, and sometimes your teachers, understand what you've learned and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:32.500\nFor example, you might take a spelling test to see how many words you can spell correctly.\nOr a math test to check your understanding of addition and subtraction.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:41.100\nTests can be written, like quizzes, or even practical, like showing you know how to ride a bike safely.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:52.000\nSo, in short, a test is a tool to evaluate your knowledge or skills.\nIt helps you identify your strengths and areas where you can improve.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:59.500\nRemember, tests are just one way to learn and grow!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
