    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give us information or measure something specific.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: a taste test tells you if you like a food.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:37.300\nA spelling test shows how well you can spell. Or even a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:48.900\nTests can be written, spoken, physical activities, or even just observations. The important thing is that they help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:52.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see where you stand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
