    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:21.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you some information about a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:31.600\nFor example, a simple quiz in school is a test to see how well you understand a subject.\nA taste test tells you how good something tastes.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:43.700\nAnd even a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\nSo, basically, tests help us learn and make decisions based on the results.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:56.200\nWe use them every day, in big ways and small.\nFrom checking the weather to taking an exam, tests are all around us, giving us the information we need.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:03.200\nIn short, a test is a way to get answers!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
