    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:18.200\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we don't just mean school quizzes. A test is really just a way to check if something works like it's supposed to, or to see how well it performs.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: if you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:35.000\nThat's a test! Or, if you're buying a new lightbulb, you're testing it when you screw it in to make sure it lights up.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:46.600\nBasically, a test is any action you take to get information about something. It helps you figure out if things are working correctly, or if they need some adjustments.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:57.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something out and learn more about it. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
