    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:22.400\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\nIn school, you take tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.100\nBut tests aren't just for school.\nYou might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or test a toy to see if it's safe.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:42.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr imagine you're baking cookies; you taste one to test if you need to add more sugar.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:55.000\nThat's a test too!\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a way to gather information and see if something is true, correct, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:01.000\nThey help us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
