    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.700\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:18.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about a person or thing.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy, or a teacher uses a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.800\nThe main idea is to get information.\nWe ask questions or give tasks, and the answers or results help us understand something better.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:40.100\nFor example, a taste test can tell you which soda people like best.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:44.500\nOr, a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:52.500\nSo, tests help us learn, evaluate, and make decisions.\nThey're everywhere, from school to science to even figuring out what snack to buy!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
