    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is working. You flip the switch, and if it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:31.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. In school, you might take a quiz to see how much you learned in a chapter.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:41.000\nDoctors use tests to check your health, like taking your temperature. And even game developers test their games to make sure they's fun and bug-free.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:50.300\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and make sure things are working correctly. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:57.800\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they\u2019re useful! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
