    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_045849.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. Think of it like checking if something works, or seeing how well you understand something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:20.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:27.500\nImagine baking a cake. You taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:34.200\nOr, think about a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:44.400\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking you questions in class.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:54.500\nThe important thing is that they help us learn and improve. So, a test is really just a way to collect information and see where we're at.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
