    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_045926.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like an experiment. You're checking to see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.300\nThe basic idea is that you give something a try, then you look at the results.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:48.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test, seeing if you like the way it tastes!\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:54.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something by trying it out and observing what happens. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
