    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.210 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.970\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.970 --> 00:25.770\nThink of it like checking to make sure everything is running smoothly. For example, a teacher might give you a test in school to see how much you've learned about a topic.\n\n00:25.770 --> 00:36.100\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Even when you try out a new recipe, you're kind of testing it to see if you like the taste!\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.400\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's our knowledge, our health, or even just a new cookie recipe.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:55.900\nThey give us information that we can use to improve and learn. Remember, a test is just a way to check in and see where things stand.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
