    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE\nAll timestamps are approximate.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information. It's like a question you ask, or a task you give, to see what someone knows or how well something works.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:23.300\nThink about it. A spelling test in school checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:32.300\nA taste test tells you which food tastes best. Even a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:44.500\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz in class, trying out a new recipe, or checking if your phone is working properly, all of these are different kinds of tests.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:52.400\nThey all help us learn something new. Essentially, a test is just a process for gathering information. Pretty simple, right?\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
