    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_050148.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the concept of a test.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like a question you ask to see what the answer is.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:34.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:48.700\nLike, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good! Or when you press the power button on your TV, you're testing if it turns on.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:58.600\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They can be written, like a quiz, or hands-on, like a science experiment.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:02.200\nReally, anything that helps us gather information and see if something is true can be considered a test.\n```"
