    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_050236.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:25.800\nIt's a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:34.200\nThink of it like this: you might take a math test in school to see how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:43.700\nOr, a chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt. The test gives them information to help them improve.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:53.200\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. They can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like a driving test.\n\n00:53.200 --> 01:01.700\nThey can even be something simple, like testing the temperature of your bath water!\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:09.900\nSo, a test is a method for gathering information to check something or measure something.\n\n01:09.900 --> 01:16.600\nHopefully, that gives you a good basic understanding of what a test is.\n\n01:16.600 --> 01:24.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
