    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:10.800\nWhat is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:23.300\nIt's a process we use to check if something works, or to see what something is like.\nThink about it like this: a spelling test at school checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:36.800\nOr, a taste test for a new cookie recipe helps you decide if it's delicious!\nTests can be big, like exams, or small, like checking if your phone is charged.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:43.700\nThe key is, you're trying to learn something.\nYou perform an action, and then you see the result.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:53.500\nThis helps you understand whatever you're testing a little bit better.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and check things.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:00.400\nIt's a simple process we use all the time!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
