    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_050359.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:18.400\nIt helps us understand if something is true, or if something works.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:25.600\nThink about it like this. If you want to know if your cookies are done baking, you might poke them with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:32.200\nOr, if you want to know if a light bulb works, you screw it into a lamp. Another test!\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:38.800\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school to see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:50.200\nOr they can be informal, like checking if the water's warm enough for a bath. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something is what you expect it to be.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:58.300\nIt helps us learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
