    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:28.000\nIt\u2019s a process designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even your understanding of a particular subject.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:35.900\nThink of it like this: a math test checks how well you know your multiplication tables.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:43.800\nA spelling test sees if you can correctly write different words. And a taste test? Well, that checks if you can tell the difference between, say, Coke and Pepsi!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:50.900\nTests can be used to see what you've learned, identify areas where you need more practice, or even help you find the right career path.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:56.800\nSo, tests aren't about being right or wrong all the time, they're really about learning and growing. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
