    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_050620.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:25.800\nWe use tests all the time to see if something works, or to measure its quality. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:35.800\nA baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough. Or, you might take a quiz in school to test how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:46.900\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working properly. They're a fundamental part of learning and building things.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:54.600\nRemember, a test is just a way to find something out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
