    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.370\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.370 --> 00:02.670\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:02.970 --> 00:06.040\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.040 --> 00:09.170\nIt's a process we use to see how well something works,\nor to check if something is true.\n\n00:09.570 --> 00:12.220\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe\nto see if it tastes good.\n\n00:12.220 --> 00:13.180\nThat's a test!\n\n00:13.480 --> 00:18.410\nOr, imagine you're building a tower out of blocks.\nYou might gently push it to test if it's stable.\n\n00:18.410 --> 00:19.970\nTests are all around us!\n\n00:20.270 --> 00:24.870\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, teachers\nuse tests to see what you've learned,\n\n00:24.870 --> 00:28.670\nand even scientists use tests to prove their ideas.\n\n00:28.970 --> 00:32.780\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information\nand learn something new.\n\n00:33.180 --> 00:35.050\nIn short, tests help us understand\nthe world better.\n\n00:35.050 --> 00:37.650\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
