    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.200\nIt's a process or a procedure designed to evaluate something's quality, performance, or reliability.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:34.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A taste test determines if you like a certain food.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:48.000\nEven checking the weather outside is a kind of test to see if you need a jacket! Tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:58.800\nThey can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like trying out a new recipe. The important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:02.300\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a method for gathering information to evaluate something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
