    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_050833.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's like asking a question, but instead of just listening for an answer, we're looking for proof.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:22.600\nThink about it this way: a baking test.\nYou want to know if your cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:32.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's your proof \u2013 the cake is ready!\nOr, imagine a spelling test in school.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:38.400\nThe test checks if you know how to spell certain words.\nYour answers show what you've learned.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:48.300\nSo, tests help us learn, measure, and understand things.\nThey're all about finding evidence to answer a question.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:55.400\nRemember, tests are just tools to help us!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
