    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:07.100\nAt its most basic, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it like asking a question, but getting an answer that shows you what you wanted to know.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:21.600\nThere are all kinds of tests.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:24.900\nA spelling test helps you see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:28.400\nA taste test lets you compare different flavors.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:32.900\nEven clicking a button on a website to see if it works is a kind of test!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:38.700\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:42.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:44.100\nSee? Simple!\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:51.300\nSo, a test is really just a method for gathering information and confirming something.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:55.400\nIt helps us understand, compare, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
