    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_051011.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:23.100\nIt\u2019s a method to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:29.600\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:34.200\nThat's a test! Or when you try to turn on a light, you're testing if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:38.800\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:45.100\nDoctors use tests to check your health. Teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:53.200\nThey all help us understand something better. So, remember, a test is just a way to get information and see if something is accurate.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:55.200\nIt's a tool for learning and understanding the world around us.\n```"
