    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_051057.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.600\nNo need to worry, this isn't a pop quiz! A test, in general, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:24.100\nIt's how we check if something is working, or if something is true. Think about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.900\nA baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough. Even your video game has tests built in to make sure everything runs smoothly!\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:47.000\nSo, a test is simply a process or procedure designed to evaluate something. It could be your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the performance of a machine.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:55.200\nIn short, tests help us understand the world around us better. To recap: tests are evaluations.\n\n00:55.200 --> 01:01.800\nThey help us learn and improve things. They're everywhere, from the doctor's office to the kitchen!\n\n01:01.800 --> 01:05.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
