    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.900\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, your ability to stay upright without falling is a test of your balance.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:33.900\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, if we've learned something new, or even just to measure something.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:43.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:56.500\nBasically, tests are all about gathering information to make a decision or learn something new. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to check something out!\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
