    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:13.400\nThink of it like this:\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:19.300\nyou're trying to figure something out, and a test is a tool to help you get there.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:24.200\nIt could be a quiz at school, designed to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:28.800\nOr maybe a medical test, like a blood test, which tells doctors important things about your health.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:33.200\nEven something as simple as tasting a new food is a kind of test!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:34.600\nYou're testing whether you like the flavor.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:39.400\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:43.700\nThey give us data, which we can then use to make decisions or draw conclusions.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:49.900\nRemember, a test is just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
