    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:27.200\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words. Or, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:31.000\nSee? Different situations, same idea.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:39.700\nAnother example is a doctor using a test to see if you have a cold, or a mechanic testing your car battery to see if it's working.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:48.500\nThe test gives them information they need. So, remember, a test is just a method used to determine something.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:56.100\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, or just check how things are working. That's the basics of tests!\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
