    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:10.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use them all the time!\n\n00:10.100 --> 00:17.600\nImagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a mini-test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:23.500\nOr think about a doctor checking your temperature. That\u2019s a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:32.300\nTests can be written, like quizzes in school, or they can be hands-on, like trying to fit a puzzle piece.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:46.100\nThe point is to gather information and learn something new. So, a test helps us understand things better, whether it's about cake batter, our health, or what we've learned in class.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:49.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
