    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.000\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think about it like this: you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:30.200\nThat's a test! Or, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:34.600\nThe toothpick comes out clean? That's a successful test!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:44.100\nTests aren't just for science or cooking, though. Every time you try something new to see if it works, you're performing a test.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:52.600\nSo, a test is all about checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or answers a specific question.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.900\nIn short, tests help us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
