    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.900\nHey there! Welcome to this quick intro to tests.\n\n00:03.900 --> 00:12.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, it's a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it like a detective looking for clues. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:29.000\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to see if it comes out clean. That's a test!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:38.100\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try restarting it to see if that fixes the problem. That's another test.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:54.000\nTests can be simple, like the toothpick test, or more complicated, like a doctor running blood work. The important thing is that they give us information to help us understand if something is functioning properly.\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:04.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check if something is working as expected. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
