    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.800\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.800 --> 00:06.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:09.800\nIt's a process designed to measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:09.800 --> 00:14.000\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:18.000\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:22.700\nTests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like checking if the water is hot before you jump in the shower.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:26.300\nAnother example?\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:31.300\nA bakery might test a new cookie recipe before selling it to customers.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:33.200\nThey want to make sure it tastes good!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:41.200\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is just a way of gathering information and seeing how something performs or measures up.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:44.800\nTesting helps us learn and improve things.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
