    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nA test is really just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Essentially, you're checking to see if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:28.600\nMaybe you want to test if a lightbulb works. You screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:36.200\nIf it lights up, the test passes! Or, imagine a simple math problem: 2 + 2 = 4.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:43.700\nYou can test if that's correct. And yes, it is! So, tests help us confirm things and make sure everything is as it should be.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:57.300\nThey're used everywhere, from checking your spelling to making sure a bridge is safe. So, remember, a test is a question, and the answer tells you if something is right or wrong.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
