    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:16.000\nNow, the word \"test\" can mean a lot of things, but at its core, a test is simply a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:27.000\nIt's a process we use to gather information or evaluate something. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:37.200\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. Or, a medical test can help a doctor understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:51.200\nSo, whether it's checking your skills, your preferences, or your health, a test is really just a structured way to learn and understand more about\u2026 well, almost anything!\n\n00:51.200 --> 01:01.100\nIn short, a test is a method for gathering information, plain and simple. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
