    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know about something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:27.500\nThink of it like a quick check-up for your brain! The main idea is to answer questions, solve problems, or perform tasks.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:36.800\nYour answers then get compared against what's expected, showing you how well you understand the topic.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:47.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test sees if you can solve equations. Even tasting different foods to identify them can be a kind of test!\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:53.900\nSo, in short, a test helps measure your knowledge or skills. It gives you a snapshot of what you've learned. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
