    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_053229.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:18.700\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see if something is working as it should.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:33.000\nThink of it as a check-up for an idea, a product, or even yourself! For example, before you sell a new toy, you test it to make sure it's safe and fun.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:45.400\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you're getting better at balancing. Even a simple quiz at school is a test to see how well you've understood the lesson.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:52.200\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working right. They give us valuable information.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.800\nIn short, a test is simply a way to check something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
