    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.900\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but usually in a more structured way.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling.\nA taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:37.400\nOr, a medical test can help doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\nThe point is, tests help us gather information.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:48.800\nThey can measure skills, preferences, or even physical conditions.\nSo, a test is simply a method for getting information about something.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:57.500\nThey're everywhere, helping us learn and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
