    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.100\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:25.500\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand things better.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:31.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:37.400\nOr a taste test! You might try different kinds of cookies to see which one you like the best.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:43.600\nThat's a test! We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:58.800\nSo, tests help us learn, discover, and make decisions based on the information we gather. They can be fun, like a taste test, or a little more serious, like a school exam. But in the end, they're all about learning.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:06.400\nTo recap, a test is a method for finding something out. They can be about anything, from spelling to cookies!\n\n01:06.400 --> 01:07.700\nAnd they help us understand the world around us.\n\n01:07.700 --> 01:11.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
