    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_053447.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\nIt helps us understand how well someone knows something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:28.700\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might take a little taste \u2013 that's a mini-test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:34.200\nAnother example: a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:45.200\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for checking knowledge, abilities, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:51.200\nIt helps us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
