    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:06.200\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a way to find something out!\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:13.500\nIt's a procedure, like an experiment or a questionnaire, that helps us gather information.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:17.300\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is ready, you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:18.300\nThat's a test!\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:21.500\nThe toothpick comes out clean, and you know the cake is done.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:26.000\nAnother example is a spelling test at school.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:29.700\nIt helps your teacher see how well you've learned to spell certain words.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:33.600\nTests aren't just about grades though.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:37.800\nThey help us understand things better, make decisions, and improve.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:44.100\nSo, a test is a process for gathering information to help us understand something.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:47.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
