    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.200\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:7.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:12.200\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:16.500\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:20.500\nOr when you push a door, you're testing to see if it opens.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:24.500\nIn school, a test helps your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:27.500\nIt's like a check-up to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:32.500\nThink of a spelling test \u2013 it shows if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:36.500\nOr a math test, which shows if you understand how to solve problems.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:44.000\nSo, a test is really just a tool to gather information and see what's up.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:47.000\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:49.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
