    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.300\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in general, a test is simply a way to find out if something works as expected.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you want to know if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:27.700\nYou take a bite, right? That's a test!\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:34.100\nYou're testing the cake's flavor. Or, imagine you're building a tower of blocks.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:39.600\nYou gently push it to see if it's stable. That little push?\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:45.100\nThat's a test to see if your tower is strong enough to stand.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:51.200\nSo, a test is really just a simple check to make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.800\nRemember, it's all about finding out if something does what it's supposed to do. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
