    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_054352.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.300\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:31.100\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:36.500\nSee?\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:44.200\nWe can use tests to check all sorts of things.\nMaybe you test if a toy car will roll down a ramp, or you test if a plant needs more water by checking the soil.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:53.900\nThe results of the test help us make decisions.\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to find out information.\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
