    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.000\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in a broader sense, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.300\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if it's true.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:31.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works.\nYour test is to screw it into a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:37.700\nIf it lights up, the test passes!\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:48.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's your test telling you the cake is done.\nTests are everywhere!\nThey help us make sure things are safe, reliable, and doing what they're supposed to.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:57.100\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something and see if it's working correctly.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
