    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like a question that helps you learn more. Tests can be used for all sorts of things!\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.300\nFor example, your doctor might give you a test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:41.200\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class. Another good example is baking a cake.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:48.700\nYou might taste the batter before putting it in the oven. That's like a mini-test to see if it needs more sugar! So, a test is just a method or procedure for figuring something out. It helps us understand more about the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
