    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nDon't worry, it's not the kind you stress about! \nIn general, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it as a way to see if something works, or if something is true. \nFor example, you might test a new lightbulb to see if it lights up.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:30.000\nThat's a test! \nOr maybe you test a recipe by cooking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:37.000\nAgain, that's a test! \nWe use tests all the time to help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:49.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for checking something. \nIt could be anything from checking a toy to see if it's broken, to trying out a new game to see if it's fun.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:58.100\nTests are a super important part of learning and discovering new things. \nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
