    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_054655.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.900\nA test is really just a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:32.500\nTests can come in many forms. You might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge of a subject. Or, a doctor might run tests to check your health. Even a chef tastes their food to test if it needs more seasoning.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:40.200\nFor example, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of birds.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:52.700\nOr, if you're building a toy car, you might test its speed to see if it's fast enough. So, remember, a test is simply a way to evaluate something. It helps us understand what we know, what works, and what needs improvement.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:62.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
