    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:18.000\nIt could be anything! A doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:27.400\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned. Or, even simpler, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:39.300\nSo, in each case, you're doing something, whether it's taking a blood sample, answering questions, or cooking, to get information.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:51.800\nThe result of that action gives you the answer you're looking for. A good result means the test passed, a bad result means it failed, and both cases teach you something new.\n\n00:51.800 --> 01:01.700\nBasically, a test helps us learn and make better decisions. Tests are everywhere, helping us understand the world around us.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:05.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
