    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.400\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.800\nBasically, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:32.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:34.600\nYou do a test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:39.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:44.000\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:48.700\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:52.900\nAt the doctor\u2019s office, tests can help figure out what\u2019s making you feel sick.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:57.400\nEven when buying a used car, you might take it for a test drive to see if it runs well.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:00.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information or see if something is working the way it should.\n```"
  },
