    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_055417.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.800\nIt helps us measure or check something to see if it's working, if it's true, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:33.800\nThink of it like this: a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Or, imagine you're baking a cake and you taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good. A doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:37.500\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:47.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for finding things out, for checking and measuring.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:55.500\nIt can be as simple as tasting a cake or as complex as a medical exam. It\u2019s all about gathering information.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "6a6ffbfa-e1d2-4a3f-b02f-8b0683c6b968": {
    "id": "6a6ffbfa-e1d2-4a3f-b02f-8b0683c6b968",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:34:55.735065",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T05:55:13.895315",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_055513.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_055513.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:23.300\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct. Think about it like this: a cookie recipe is a set of instructions.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:31.600\nA test is baking the cookies to see if the recipe actually works! Or, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:43.400\nThe test is actually trying to ride the bike to see if you've learned. Tests can be big, like a school exam, or small, like checking if your shoes are tied.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:54.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. So, a test is just a process to learn and confirm something.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "6bdd5e47-055f-4e8a-bf58-d00c4ac3284d": {
    "id": "6bdd5e47-055f-4e8a-bf58-d00c4ac3284d",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:34:56.373157",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T05:56:02.797923",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_055602.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_055602.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:21.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:25.200\nThat's a test! You're testing if the bulb lights up.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:36.400\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand a subject. For example, a math test checks if you know your addition and subtraction. Or a spelling test shows if you can spell words correctly.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:43.000\nTests aren't just for school, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are strong.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:56.000\nBasically, a test is any process to see if something is working as it should. So, tests are a simple way to find out if something is okay, or if it needs some work.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
