    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_055906.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.200\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out how well something works, or how good someone is at something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.200\nIt's like checking if your cake is ready by sticking a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:29.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Think about a spelling test at school, that helps you learn and shows your teacher what you know.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:40.200\nOr a medical test at the doctor's office, which helps them understand your health. Even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:50.500\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:58.600\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just helpful tools. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
