    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.300\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like a tool that helps us measure or understand something better.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:20.300\nIt could be anything! Like, a spelling test tells us how well we know our words.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:29.200\nOr, a taste test helps us decide which cookie is the yummiest. Even a simple yes or no question can be a test.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:36.400\nFor example, if you want to know if water is hot, you might carefully touch it. That's a test!\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:44.100\nOr, if you want to see if a lightbulb works, you screw it in. If it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:52.500\nSo, tests help us learn, explore, and make decisions. They're all about gathering information.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
