    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:19.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:31.200\nYou stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:36.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:42.600\nOr, maybe you want to know if you understand your homework.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:48.800\nYou take a practice quiz. That's another test!\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:55.000\nThe results show you what you know and what you need to study more.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:01.000\nTests aren\u2019t just for school or baking. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Scientists use tests to see if their ideas work. So, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new. Basically, tests help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
