    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:16.700\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:26.300\nThink about it. You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:29.300\nOr, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it works.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:36.800\nAnother example? Baking a cake! You're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:46.500\nIf it doesn't, you adjust things and test again! So, remember, a test is just a process for gathering information\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:51.000\nand seeing if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:53.500\nIt's a fundamental part of learning and discovery.\n```"
