  "92f3dcf4-ac1d-4061-924d-731eb46e3978": {
    "id": "92f3dcf4-ac1d-4061-924d-731eb46e3978",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:35:06.094003",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T06:06:24.474766",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_060624.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_060624.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something well.\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:35.900\nOr, your teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\nTests can be big, like a final exam, or small, like a quick quiz.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:43.900\nAnother example is testing a new toy.\nYou might play with it to see if it's fun and if it does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.400\nSo, tests are all about checking things out and learning more.\nThey help us improve and make sure everything is working the way it should.\n\n00:53.400 --> 01:01.500\nIn short, a test is a way to learn and evaluate.\nIt helps us confirm, improve, and understand.\n\n01:01.500 --> 01:05.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "9dc5d244-57b3-42d0-9bec-98128d616beb": {
    "id": "9dc5d244-57b3-42d0-9bec-98128d616beb",
