    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_060705.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like an experiment, or a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:33.700\nThe main idea behind a test is to give you information.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:43.300\nIt could be to see how well you understand a subject, like a quiz in school. Or it could be to check if a new medicine is safe.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:52.200\nTests help us make decisions based on evidence. For example, you might test a new lightbulb to see how bright it is. Or you might taste a new recipe to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:57.800\nThese are all simple tests! So, remember, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. It\u2019s about finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
