    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:18.400\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like an experiment or a quiz. We use tests to measure things, check if something works, or see how well we understand a topic.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:39.000\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you know.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:46.800\nAnother example is testing a new toy to make sure it\u2019s safe for kids to play with. So, remember a test is just a tool to learn or check something. It helps us understand the world around us a little bit better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
