    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like a detective looking for clues! We use tests to check if things are working correctly, or to see how well we understand something.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:32.300\nFor example, your doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test in school to see how many words you know.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:45.400\nEven baking a cake is like a test \u2013 you're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious! So, remember, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:53.400\nThey give us important information and help us make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
