    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_061058.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:23.700\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.200\nThink of it like this: you use a ruler to test the length of something. Or a thermometer to test the temperature.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:42.500\nIn school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:51.200\nThey can come in many forms. Multiple choice questions, where you pick the best answer. True or false questions, where you decide if a statement is correct. Or even writing an essay to show your understanding.\n\n00:51.200 --> 01:00.700\nSo, remember, a test isn't something to be scared of. It's just a tool to help you and your teachers see how you're doing.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:04.300\nIt helps identify what you already know and where you might need a little more help.\n\n01:04.300 --> 01:07.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
