    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.400\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:09.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about\u2026 well, anything!\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:13.200\nIt helps us gather information.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:19.600\nThink about it like this: a taste test lets you find out which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:23.800\nOr a spelling test shows what words you know how to spell.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:28.700\nEven a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:38.400\nSo, whether it's an exam in school, a survey about your favorite color, or a check-up at the doctor, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:42.600\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:49.000\nRemember, tests aren't scary; they're just a way to explore and discover!\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:52.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
