    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.800\nNow, what is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:24.400\nIt helps us understand if something works, if something is true, or if we've learned something new.\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.900\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\nEven baking a cake involves a test!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:41.100\nYou check to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf it comes out clean, then the cake has passed the test!\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:49.300\nTests are all around us, helping us learn and improve.\nThey give us information to make better decisions.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:57.100\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
