    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_061430.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.800\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if we understand a topic.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:30.200\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a physical exam. That\u2019s a test to check your health.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:35.400\nOr, if you\u2019re learning to bake, you might taste your cake batter.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:46.000\nThat\u2019s a test to see if it needs more sugar! Tests are used everywhere. Teachers use them to see how well you've learned, scientists use them to prove their theories, and even you use them every day to make small decisions.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:57.900\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something is true, works, or is good. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
