    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_061605.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:06.300\nToday we're tackling a really fundamental idea: what is a test?\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:10.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:10.100 --> 00:11.900\nThink of it like gathering information.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:15.100\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:19.200\nYour doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:22.600\nA baker might taste their cake to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:26.600\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.100\nSo, a test can be anything from a simple observation to a formal exam.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:37.000\nThe key is that it's a method for getting information and making a judgment.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:39.300\nRemember, tests help us understand things better!\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:43.300\nTo recap, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
