    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_061648.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something or someone to see how well they perform or what they know.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:20.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:31.600\nOr, maybe you want to see if your dog knows a new trick, like \"sit.\" You ask them to sit, and if they do, they pass the test!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:43.900\nTests can be big, like a school exam, or small, like checking if your shoelaces are tied.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:52.500\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better. It gives us information and helps us make decisions.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.100\nSo remember, tests are all about checking and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
