    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_061742.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.700\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:42.100\nOr, your teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:55.600\nAnother example could be testing a new recipe! You follow the instructions, and then taste the result. The taste is the test \u2013 it tells you if the recipe is good, or if you need to adjust something.\n\n00:55.600 --> 01:01.400\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
