    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE duration:47.7\n1\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nEver wonder what a test really is?\n\n2\n00:06.400 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n3\n00:14.100 --> 00:23.900\nIt's a method we use to gather information and see how something works, or if something is true.\n\n4\n00:23.900 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if your cookies are done,\n\n5\n00:28.400 --> 00:32.200\nyou might test them by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n6\n00:32.200 --> 00:36.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cookies pass the test!\n\n7\n00:36.000 --> 00:39.100\nOr, maybe you want to see if a toy car works.\n\n8\n00:39.100 --> 00:41.900\nYou test it by winding it up and letting it go.\n\n9\n00:41.900 --> 00:43.200\nDid it move?\n\n10\n00:43.200 --> 00:44.300\nThat's a test!\n\n11\n00:44.300 --> 00:46.400\nSo, a test is just a way to explore and learn.\n\n12\n00:46.400 --> 00:47.700\nWe use them everyday to understand the world around us.\n```"
