    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_062148.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but really, a test is just a way to find out if something works like it should.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like this: if you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Or, if you buy a new toy, you\u2019ll probably play with it to test if it's fun.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:38.900\nIn science and technology, tests are super important! For example, engineers might test a bridge to make sure it can hold a lot of weight.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:54.200\nOr, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick. So, remember, a test is simply a way of checking something to see if it's working correctly or has the properties we expect.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:01.400\nIt helps us learn and improve things all around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
