    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.400 --> 00:04.200\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:07.900\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school,\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:12.900\nbut in reality, a test is really just a way to check if something works the way it should.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:15.600\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:21.400\nThink about it this way: if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:24.600\nThe toothpick comes out clean? Great, it passed the test!\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:31.400\nOr, if you're checking if a lightbulb works, you screw it in and flip the switch. If it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:39.000\nTests are all about making sure things are doing what they're supposed to. They help us find problems and fix them.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:43.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:45.200\nSimple as that!\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:47.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
