    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nThink of it like asking a question to see if someone knows the answer, or checking if something is working correctly.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\nA taste test checks how something tastes.\nAnd a medical test checks your health.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:36.200\nTests can be big, like a final exam, or small, like trying a new cookie to see if you like it.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:46.300\nThe main idea is that a test helps you learn something or make a decision.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:49.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check things! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
