    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\nThink about it like this: a recipe test checks if a new cake recipe tastes good.\nOr, a medical test helps a doctor understand what\u2019s going on inside your body.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:40.100\nTests can be written, like a school exam, or practical, like checking if a light bulb works by turning it on.\nSo, tests help us learn and improve.\nThey give us information about all sorts of things, from recipes to health to even electronics.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:51.100\nThey are important for making sure things are safe, effective, and reliable.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:60.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
