    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like an experiment, where you're trying to discover information.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:30.900\nTests are used everywhere! For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:43.200\nOr, a baker might test the oven temperature to make sure their cake will bake properly. Even just trying a new flavor of ice cream is a mini-test to see if you like it!\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:50.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new by trying something out.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.200\nWe use tests to check things, to find answers, and to make sure things are working the way they should. Tests are a fundamental part of learning and discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
