    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.600\nIt's a procedure designed to measure knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:29.200\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:39.500\nIt helps them understand what you've learned. Or maybe you're trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:50.900\nTasting it is also a kind of test, to see if it tastes good. Even checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in is a simple test.\n\n00:50.900 --> 01:02.300\nTests can be formal, like school exams, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:13.000\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n01:13.000 --> 01:16.600\nSo next time you take a test, remember it's just a way to learn something new.\n\n01:16.600 --> 01:20.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
