    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.400 --> 00:02.700\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:04.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:08.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:12.200\nIt's how we check if something is working, or how we measure how well you know something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:17.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it needs batteries.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:21.000\nOr, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:25.200\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:31.600\nSo, tests can be used in many different ways to give us information.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:34.300\nThey help us understand things better.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:35.800\nThat's the basic idea!\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:37.000\nThis video was created\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:37.300\nby\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:38.000\nApilage AI.\n```"
