  "7d42b9b7-7de7-4cea-9a9f-0902c20b2cc8": {
    "id": "7d42b9b7-7de7-4cea-9a9f-0902c20b2cc8",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:35:28.306996",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T06:32:37.115905",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_063236.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_063236.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:07.000\nToday we're going to talk about something really important: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:13.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to see what you know about something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:22.000\nIt helps you, and others, understand how well you've learned a particular topic.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.000\nTests can come in many forms.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.000\nMaybe it's a multiple-choice quiz, where you pick the best answer.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:37.000\nOr perhaps it's a written exam where you explain what you've learned.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:40.000\nEven a simple pop quiz in class is a type of test!\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:47.000\nFor example, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to identify different types of birds.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:55.000\nOr, if you're learning to bake, a test could be trying to follow a recipe and see how well your cake turns out.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:02.000\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a tool that helps you gauge your understanding and identify areas where you might need a little extra practice.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:07.000\nRemember, tests are opportunities to learn and grow!\n\n01:07.000 --> 01:13.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
