    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:21.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:25.600\nThat's a test! Tests can be used in lots of ways.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:34.100\nYour teacher might give you a quiz to test what you've learned in class. Or, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:39.700\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:48.400\nSo, basically, a test is just a method for gathering information and checking understanding.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:52.100\nWhether it's a written exam, a medical check-up, or even baking a cake,\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:56.800\ntests help us learn and make sure things are working properly.\n\n00:56.800 --> 00:58.300\nThat's it for the basics of tests!\n```"
