    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_064155.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:06.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:12.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:16.500\nFor example, imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:22.500\nOr think about checking if a lightbulb works by flipping the switch.\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:29.000\nTests help us learn about things, check if they're working properly, or even see how much we know about a subject.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:34.500\nThey can be as simple as tasting something or as complex as a school exam.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:38.500\nThe main idea is to gather information.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:46.500\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for gathering information and finding answers.\nIt's all about learning and checking things out!\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:51.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
