    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.399\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.799\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we know something well.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:31.299\nThink about it like this: You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:43.699\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Tests help us get information.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:51.199\nFor example, if you're building a tower of blocks, you might gently push it to test its stability.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:58.599\nIf it falls over, you know you need to build it differently next time! Tests give us feedback.\n```"
