    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of a test.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.700\nNow, in simple terms, a test is really just a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:25.500\nIt helps us gather information and see if something is true or not.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:39.500\nThink of it like this: you might \"test\" the temperature of your bath water to see if it's too hot or just right.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:49.700\nOr maybe you take a quiz at school \u2013 that's a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:57.500\nEven a doctor uses tests, like checking your reflexes, to see how your body is working.\n```"
