    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.600\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school. That's a test to see what you've learned!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:41.600\nA car manufacturer might test a new car to make sure it's safe before they sell it.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:52.200\nTests can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all have the same goal: to give us information.\nSo, tests help us understand, check, and improve things all around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
