    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something, to see if it works, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:24.400\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to check your overall health.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:35.200\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might stick a toothpick in the center to see if it comes out clean \u2013 that's a test to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:46.700\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned. So, a test is just a way to find out information or check if something is correct.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:57.500\nIt can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just a simple observation. Remember, tests are all about learning and understanding!\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
