    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like a question you ask to see what the answer is. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:34.600\nFor example, when you check if the stove is hot before touching it, that's a test! You're testing to see if it will burn you.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:39.400\nOr, if you\u2019re baking a cake and poke it with a toothpick, you're testing to see if it's done.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.400\nThe toothpick comes out clean? Great, it passed the test! So, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:53.100\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
