  "cd241ca7-1ad2-418a-b317-c207c093bddd": {
    "id": "cd241ca7-1ad2-418a-b317-c207c093bddd",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:35:44.190976",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T06:52:55.063547",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_065254.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_065254.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore something really fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.800 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information about something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like checking if your oven is hot enough to bake a cake.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:28.700\nYou use a thermometer, right? That's a test!\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:36.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Maybe it\u2019s a quiz at school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:44.700\nOr a doctor using blood work to check your health.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:53.300\nEven trying a new recipe to see if you like it is a kind of test! The main idea is that you're performing an action or using a tool to learn something specific.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:58.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information. It helps us understand things better and make informed decisions. That\u2019s the core concept. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "0cbacdb3-15fb-4ecc-85cb-852af45b5b53": {
    "id": "0cbacdb3-15fb-4ecc-85cb-852af45b5b53",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:35:44.810590",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T06:53:35.902020",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_065335.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_065335.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific. It helps us check if something is true, or if something works correctly.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:24.600\nThink about it: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:36.500\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of food. And a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:48.100\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz at school to checking if a new toy works like it should. It's all about gathering information and finding answers!\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:51.700\nIn short, a test helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as expected. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
