    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_065424.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:27.200\nThe whole point of a test is to give you information. It tells you if something is right or wrong, strong or weak, good or bad.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:36.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:48.100\nEven trying to open a door is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if it's unlocked! So, remember, a test is simply a way to get information about something.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:54.000\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
