    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_065513.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand a topic, or checking if something is working properly.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:27.300\nIt's all about finding out information. The main idea behind any test is to see if something meets a certain standard or requirement.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:36.400\nWe use them all the time! For example, a doctor might give you a physical exam, that's a test to check your health.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:48.600\nOr, when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you've learned the material. Even tasting a new recipe to see if it needs more salt is a kind of test!\n\n00:48.600 --> 01:00.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a way of checking something to see if it meets a requirement. It helps us learn and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:04.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
