    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_065558.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.800\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:33.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:40.200\nThe toothpick test tells you if the cake is ready.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:46.400\nOr, imagine you\u2019re learning to ride a bike. Falling down isn't fun, but it's a test!\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:52.600\nIt shows you what not to do next time. Tests aren't always about grades in school.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:57.700\nThey can be anything that gives you information. So, tests help us learn, improve, and understand things better. They provide information about where we are and where we need to go. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
