    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:18.500\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a topic, like in school, or checking if something works correctly, like a new toy.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you can do a test by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:35.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test says the cake is ready! Another example is checking if a light bulb works.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:40.100\nYou plug it in. If it lights up, that's the test passing!\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:51.200\nSo, a test is just a method to see if something is true, correct, or working. It helps us learn and make sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
