    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:20.200\nIt's a process designed to get information.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:26.200\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:36.000\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to show what you've learned. These are both tests! They help us understand something better.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:48.200\nFor example, you could test if a toy car rolls faster on a smooth surface or a carpet. Or, you could test different types of soil to see which one helps a plant grow the best.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:54.600\nSo, remember, a test is all about getting information and finding answers.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.200\nIt's a way of exploring and learning. Tests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
