    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.900\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. For example, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you've learned the material in class.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:33.100\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:39.200\nLet's say you're baking a cake. You might test it with a toothpick.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:45.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test!\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:53.300\nAnother example: a factory might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:57.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.300\nIt helps us understand if things are working as they should or if we need to learn more. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
