    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:19.900\nThink of it as a mini-experiment. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:29.300\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, that's a test! You're testing if the recipe works and if you like the taste.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:40.700\nOr, if you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it will change the channel. In school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:50.100\nThey can see if you understood the lessons and where you might need some extra help.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:57.000\nSo, a test is really just a way to learn and grow. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:02.700\nTo recap, a test is a way to get information.\n\n01:02.700 --> 01:06.200\nIt can be a formal exam or a simple everyday action. Now you know!\n\n01:06.200 --> 01:08.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
