    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.900\nNow, a test is basically just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, or a structured way to ask a question and get an answer.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:30.200\nIt's all about figuring out if something is true, or correct, or working the way it should.\nFor example, a quiz in school is a test to see how well you understand a subject.\nA medical test checks to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:38.800\nEven baking a cake can be a test \u2013 you\u2019re testing if your recipe works!\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:50.500\nSo, in short, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
