    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:18.800\nThink of it like an experiment, but often simpler. We use tests all the time in everyday life.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:26.300\nFor example, if you're baking a cake and poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done, that's a test!\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:36.900\nOr if you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit, you're testing their size. In school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:49.600\nSo, tests help us gather information. They can be a quiz in class, a taste test for new food, or even just trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:56.900\nThey all help us understand things better. Remember, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
