    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nIt\u2019s like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:30.400\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see what you've learned.\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake, and you taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:42.900\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is running a test to see if you have a fever.\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:54.200\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to get information.\nRemember, a test is just a way of checking something!\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
