    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in this case, we mean testing something to see if it works.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:27.500\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on before you screw it into a lamp.\nTesting is simply the process of checking something to see if it meets a specific requirement or does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:39.000\nIt's like making sure your shoes fit before you go for a run.\nFor example, before releasing a new app, developers test it to make sure it doesn\u2019t crash.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:56.000\nOr, before you bake a cake, you might test the oven temperature with a thermometer.\nSo, to recap, testing is all about checking something to make sure it works correctly before using it in a real-world situation.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:04.100\nIt helps us avoid problems and ensures things work as planned.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
