    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:20.000\nThere are all sorts of tests!\nA doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:27.800\nYour teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\nEven trying a new recipe is a test!\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:35.600\nYou're testing to see if it tastes good.\nSo, testing is really just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:49.900\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\nWhether it's figuring out if you need more vegetables or acing your next exam, tests are a part of everyday life.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:58.100\nIn summary, a test is a way to get information, we use tests all the time for various different things.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
