    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:26.400\nIt's like a check-up for your brain, or your skills!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:35.900\nThink about it this way: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\nA math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:47.200\nAnd even a taste test checks your ability to tell the difference between flavors!\nSo, tests aren't meant to be scary.\n\n00:47.200 --> 01:00.300\nThey're just tools to help you and your teachers understand what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to measure something.\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:07.500\nIn short, a test is a way to measure your knowledge or skills in a specific area.\nRemember, it's just one way to learn and grow!\n\n01:07.500 --> 01:14.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
