    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:14.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:22.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:27.900\nThink about baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:34.500\nOr imagine trying on a new pair of shoes. You walk around to test if they fit comfortably.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:43.400\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if the water is warm enough for a bath.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:54.500\nThe important thing is that a test helps us gather information and make decisions. So, remember, a test is just a method for getting information.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
