    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_073016.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:20.300\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a method we use to gather information, whether it's about your knowledge, a product's quality, or even how well something works.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:32.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test at school checks how well you know your words. Or, when you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. See?\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:35.400\nIt's all about checking things! Another example is a doctor who runs a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:44.600\nOr a company that tests a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:57.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a way of gathering information to evaluate something. It helps us understand, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
