    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_073108.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:03.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:03.900\nSimple, right?\n\n00:03.900 --> 00:04.900\nBut what is a test, really?\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:07.700\nWell, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:11.700\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:17.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:22.000\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see if you understand the lesson.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:26.600\nOr a chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:32.700\nSo, tests aren't just about grades in school. They're used everywhere to measure things and make decisions.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:38.800\nThey help us understand where we are and what we need to learn or improve.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:41.800\nIn short, a test is a tool for evaluation.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:44.300\nAnd, that's the basics!\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:47.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
