    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know or what you can do. Think of it like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:26.100\nThe main idea behind a test is to measure something. That something could be your understanding of a topic, your skills at a task, or even your personality traits.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:35.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling. A driving test checks if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:41.200\nAnd a simple quiz at the end of a lesson? That's a test too, just a small one!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:52.000\nSo, to recap: a test helps us understand how much we've learned or how well we can perform. It's a tool for measuring knowledge and skills.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
