    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:15.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.700\nThink of it like checking in on your progress.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:27.500\nIt's not just about school, either! A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:30.100\nA chef might taste their food to test the seasoning.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:32.700\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:42.000\nFor example, a spelling test shows if you've learned your spelling words. A driving test shows if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:52.400\nThey help us understand what we've mastered and what we still need to learn. So, to recap, a test is a tool to measure knowledge or skill.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:57.300\nIt helps us see where we stand and what we need to improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
