    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like this: you might test if your bathwater is too hot before getting in, right? Well, in science, math, or even everyday life, we use tests to see if something is true, correct, or working properly.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:39.100\nFor example, a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy. A teacher uses tests to see if you understand a lesson.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:47.800\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the ingredients and the oven will create a delicious treat!\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:59.500\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are as they should be. They\u2019re a fundamental part of how we understand the world around us.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
