    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like an experiment, but usually shorter and more focused.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:31.300\nWe use tests all the time. Your doctor might give you a blood test to check your health. Or, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. A chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:42.200\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and understand things better. They give us information we can use to make decisions.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:51.000\nRemember, a test is just a tool to gather information. It's a way to explore and understand the world around us.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
