    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:33.900\nTests can be used for all sorts of things! Maybe you want to test if a new recipe tastes good, so you have your friends try it.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:43.900\nOr, you could test if a toy is durable by dropping it a few times. The key thing is, you're doing something to observe the result.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:52.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something by trying it out and seeing what happens.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:57.900\nThat's the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
