    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:16.300\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:28.300\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:37.300\nFor example, when you flip a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:50.900\nThe switch is the question, and the light turning on or off is the answer. Or, if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done. A clean toothpick means it's ready.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:58.800\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The main thing is, they help us understand something better or make a decision. So, a test is simply a way of gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
