    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:20.100\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:27.300\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see what you learned in class.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:34.900\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt. Tests come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:50.000\nFrom simple quizzes to complex experiments, they help us gather information and make decisions. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what we already know.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
