    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, where you try something out to see what happens.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:23.000\nTests can be all sorts of things.\nImagine baking a cake; you taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:34.800\nOr think about a doctor checking your temperature \u2013 that's a test to see if you have a fever.\nEven trying out different routes to school to see which is fastest is a kind of test!\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:47.300\nSo, tests help us learn and make decisions.\nWe use them to check if something is working, to see if we understand something, or to compare different options.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:58.700\nThey're a valuable tool in everyday life and in all sorts of subjects.\nTo recap, a test is a way to gather information and learn by trying something out.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:07.100\nIt helps us understand, improve, and make informed choices.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
