    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_075434.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:06.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:11.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nYou're testing to see what the answer is.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:14.700\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:20.200\nFor example, when you flip a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:24.800\nOr, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like the taste.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:28.700\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:36.000\nBut really, a test is just a tool to help us understand things better.\nIt helps to confirm an idea or check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:41.900\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's simply a way to gather information.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
