    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like the taste. Or, when you click a link on a website, you're testing to see if it goes to the right place.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:39.500\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The important thing is that a test helps us confirm something, or learn something new.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:50.500\nIt's a way to check if something works, or if something is true. So, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
