    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_080038.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.300\nHey there!\n\n00:01.300 --> 00:03.600\nEver heard the word \"test\" thrown around\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:05.000\nand wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:08.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.300 --> 00:10.800\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:15.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy,\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:19.300\nor a chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:20.800\nBoth of those are tests!\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:24.400\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:27.900\nThey might be written quizzes, or even just asking questions in class.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:32.100\nThe important thing is that the test helps them understand your knowledge.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:36.100\nSo, a test is really just a method for checking something.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:41.400\nIt could be checking your health, checking the flavor of food, or checking your understanding.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:43.200\nIt\u2019s all about gathering information.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:45.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
