    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.299\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something!\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:26.699\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way. For example, when you take a spelling test in school, the teacher is testing your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:34.199\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake and you taste it \u2013 that's a mini-test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:41.699\nTests can be used to check your skills, your knowledge, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:47.399\nSo, a test is really just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:51.199\nRemember, it's all about finding something out!\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:52.899\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
