    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_080610.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:27.500\nThink of it like checking your understanding. The main idea behind a test is to get information. It could be a quiz at school to see how much you learned in class, or it could be a doctor testing your reflexes to check your health.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:34.000\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a test. You read the question and pick the best answer.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:40.400\nAnother example is baking a cake. You're testing the recipe to see if it turns out yummy!\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:49.900\nSo, in short, a test is a process to gather information and evaluate something. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
