    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_080656.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:18.700\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more about a person, thing, or situation.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:24.900\nThink about it.\nWhen you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:36.700\nOr when a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you're healthy.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:51.100\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us information.\nThey can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:60.600\nRemember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
