    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.900\nNot the kind you take in school, but a more general idea.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:24.800\nA test is simply a way to find out something. It's a process we use to check if something works, or to see what something is like.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:29.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your bike tire has a leak.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:35.900\nSo, you pump it up and listen for hissing. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:40.200\nOr, maybe you want to know if a plant needs water.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:49.300\nYou poke your finger in the soil. If it's dry, it needs water. That's another test!\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:57.800\nTests help us make decisions and understand the world around us. We use them all the time, even without realizing it. So, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
