    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're diving into something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:08.000\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something,\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:11.700\nor to see how well you know something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a cookie to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.200\nOr, your teacher might give you a test at school to see how much you've learned about a certain topic.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:22.800\nThere are lots of different kinds of tests.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:26.100\nA doctor might use a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:30.000\nA chef might test a recipe to make sure it's perfect.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:34.000\nAnd you might even test out a new game to see if you like it!\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:44.300\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method used to evaluate something or someone. It helps us get information and make decisions.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
