    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_081134.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something or someone to see how well they perform or what they know.\nThink of it like an evaluation.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:18.300\nThe main idea is to get information.\nWe use tests to measure progress, identify strengths and weaknesses, and even predict future success.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:26.700\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you know.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:36.600\nEven trying out a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool to gather information, whether it's about knowledge, abilities, or even just a preference.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:52.300\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
