    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see if something works, or to find out information about it.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on.\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:26.600\nWe use tests all the time.\nIf you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:32.000\nOr maybe you're trying out a new video game to see if you like it.\nAnother test!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:39.600\nTests aren't just in the kitchen or with games.\nScientists use tests to see if new medicines work.\nTeachers give tests to see how much students have learned.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:51.400\nSo, basically, a test is a way to learn something or check if something is working as expected.\n\n00:51.400 --> 01:05.400\nSo, remember, a test is a way to find out information or check if something works.\nFrom baking a cake to checking a lightbulb, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n01:05.400 --> 01:09.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
