    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone knows something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like this: a baker might taste their cake batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:35.900\nOr, imagine your doctor checking your temperature \u2013 that's a test to see if you have a fever. In school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:47.200\nSo, whether it's checking if a lightbulb works, measuring the speed of a car, or answering questions on a quiz, all of these are tests.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:54.000\nThey help us gather information and make decisions. Tests are all about finding things out.\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:00.600\nThat's the basic idea of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
