    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.234 --> 00:03.494\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.494 --> 00:50.104\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. We use them all the time! Think of it like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. See? It's about getting information. Another example is a spelling test at school. It helps your teacher see what words you already know and what words you still need to learn. Tests aren't scary; they're just tools to help us understand things better.\n\n00:50.104 --> 00:59.874\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and learn more. Whether it's about your health, your baking, or even your spelling skills, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:59.874 --> 01:02.384\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
