    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:28.000\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter, that's a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:38.200\nOr think about checking if the lights are working. You flip the switch, and if the light comes on, that's a test that tells you the bulb is good.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:48.400\nAnother example is when you go to the doctor. They might use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:57.200\nTests help us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:00.000\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way of finding information.\n```"
