    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's a process to evaluate or measure something, whether it's your knowledge, your ability, or even just the quality of a product.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:29.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\nA doctor's test, like a blood test, checks your health.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:40.000\nOr, imagine a chef tasting a dish \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\nSo, a test is a structured way to get information.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:53.700\nIt helps us understand something better by giving us a measurable result.\nRemember, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share that same goal: to provide information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
