    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\nIt could be anything from checking if a cake is done to evaluating your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you\u2019re baking a cake, and you stick a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test!\nYou've tested the cake and found out it's ready.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:32.200\nOr, imagine taking a quiz in school.\nThat's a test too!\nIt helps your teacher see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:38.100\nTests can come in many forms, like multiple choice questions, true or false statements, or even hands-on activities.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:48.600\nSo, a test is just a method for figuring out if something works, if something is true, or how much someone knows.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:57.800\nIt's all about checking things out!\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:03.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
