    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.314 --> 00:04.344\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.344 --> 00:08.564\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something, or someone.\n\n00:08.564 --> 00:10.394\nThink of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:10.984 --> 00:13.384\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:13.984 --> 00:18.324\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou poke it with a toothpick to see if it\u2019s done.\n\n00:18.324 --> 00:19.244\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.844 --> 00:23.154\nOr, when you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit, that's another test.\n\n00:23.744 --> 00:28.344\nTests can be written, like a quiz in school, or practical, like that cake.\n\n00:28.344 --> 00:30.924\nThey all help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:31.484 --> 00:35.724\nThey help us understand if something works, if something is true, or if something is ready.\n\n00:36.324 --> 00:42.434\nSo, a test is simply a method for gathering information to make informed decisions.\n\n00:43.014 --> 00:45.894\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
