    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:14.400\nIt could be anything from checking if a lightbulb works, to seeing how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:21.700\nBasically, you're presenting something with a question or a challenge, and then observing the result.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:31.000\nThe result tells you something about the thing you're testing. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you have enough iron.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:41.700\nOr, you might take a quiz to test your knowledge of animals. The blood test shows your iron levels, and the quiz shows what you know about animals.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:52.300\nSo, tests are just a way to gather information and learn something new, whether it's about yourself, an object, or anything else!\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:59.100\nThey help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
