    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something or someone to see how well they perform or what they know.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:19.800\nThink of it like this: it's a way to get information.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:30.100\nTests can come in many forms. It could be a written exam at school, checking what you've learned in class.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:39.500\nOr, maybe you're testing out a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Even a doctor using a blood test to see if you're healthy is a type of test.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:48.900\nLet's say you give your dog a treat and see if they sit. That's a simple test!\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:57.700\nOr, maybe you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp. If the light comes on, the lightbulb passes the test.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:06.400\nSo, in short, a test is just a method for finding something out. It helps us understand things better and make decisions based on the results. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
