    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:34.900\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:42.700\nCompanies also use tests to make sure their products are safe and reliable.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:50.200\nThey might test a new toy to see if it's strong enough, or test a new phone to see if the battery lasts long enough.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:55.700\nSo, in short, a test is a way to gather information and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:58.000\nTests are all around us, helping us learn and improve.\n\n00:58.000 --> 00:58.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
