    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you know something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like this: if you build a birdhouse, you might test it by putting it outside and seeing if birds move in.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:26.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:34.300\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, a teacher might ask you to write them down.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:37.600\nThat\u2019s a test too, to see if you remember them.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:46.100\nTests help us understand where we're at and what we need to work on. Maybe you test a recipe by adding a little extra spice, or test a toy to see if it's strong enough.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:52.400\nBasically, a test is just a way to try something out and see what happens.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:57.500\nSo remember, tests are all about learning and improving.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
