    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:20.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be a question, a task, or even an experiment.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:30.300\nWe use tests all the time to see what we know, how good we are at something, or if something works.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:38.700\nThink about it: a spelling quiz is a test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:47.300\nA baking contest is a test to see who makes the best cake. Even trying out a new recipe is kind of a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:54.900\nThe results of a test give us information. Maybe you ace the spelling quiz, or maybe your cake needs a little more sugar. Either way, you learned something.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.500\nSo, a test is just a method for learning and evaluating. It\u2019s a way to get information and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
