    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:24.700\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:29.300\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly or if we understand something.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:33.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:38.500\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:44.500\nSee? It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:57.000\nAnother example is testing a new toy. You might play with it to see if it's fun and if it works the way it's supposed to. So, tests help us learn, improve things, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.700\nIn short, a test is a way to get information about something.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:02.300\nPretty straightforward, right?\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:05.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
