    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:20.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works the way it should.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and flip the switch.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:30.500\nThat's a test! You're testing if the lightbulb lights up. Tests aren't just for lightbulbs though.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:39.600\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Teachers give tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:47.700\nEven bakers test their cake batter to make sure it tastes good before they bake a whole cake.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:56.100\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly or meeting a certain standard. It's a simple, but super important, part of everyday life. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
