    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:20.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. It's how we find out if something works, if something is true, or if something meets certain requirements.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:30.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough. Or, you might test a lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:40.300\nIn school, you take tests to show you've learned something. These tests help us understand what's working well and what needs improvement.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:50.200\nSo, whether it's a taste test, a lightbulb test, or a school exam, a test is simply a way to check and learn. That's the basics of testing!\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
