    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process where we check or examine something to see if it meets certain standards or expectations.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:29.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:31.500\nSee? We're checking something.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:41.100\nAnother example is a medical test, like checking your temperature to see if you have a fever. The results tell you something important.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:52.300\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information by observing or trying something out. It helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
