    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_085143.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.200\nNow, in everyday language, a test is simply a way to check something.\nIt could be a school exam, but it could also be a test to see if a cake is done.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:32.500\nBasically, a test helps us determine if something is true, correct, or working as expected.\nThink of it like this: you might test the water temperature before getting in a pool to make sure it\u2019s not too cold.\nOr a chef might test a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:38.300\nThese are all tests!\nThey provide information to help us make decisions.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:47.200\nSo, a test is any process designed to evaluate something.\nIt\u2019s all about gathering information.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:59.100\nTo recap: a test is a procedure used to determine the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:02.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
