    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_085416.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:20.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you understand something, or how well something works.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:37.100\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt. It's all about finding out information.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:46.800\nFor example, a car company tests new cars to make sure they're safe. A doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.800\nThese tests help us learn and improve things. So, remember, a test is just a method for checking knowledge or performance. It helps us understand, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
