    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_085456.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process we use to check if something is working correctly, or to see how good something is.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:26.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:40.600\nAnother example could be testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good. So, a test can be anything from a medical exam to a school assignment to even trying out a new cookie recipe.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:50.400\nUltimately, tests help us understand things better and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "60a6b13e-c37f-4cb6-beb1-e41d4f9751d8": {
    "id": "60a6b13e-c37f-4cb6-beb1-e41d4f9751d8",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:37:17.622694",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T08:55:51.749164",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_085551.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_085551.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:26.000\nIt's like asking a question and looking for the answer.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:31.500\nThink of it this way: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.300\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:43.100\nLet's say you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:50.400\nYou can do a simple test! You poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:51.700\nThat's a test!\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:59.000\nAnother example, you might test if a lightbulb works by screwing it into a lamp. If it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:05.800\nSo, basically, a test is just a process or procedure designed to determine something.\n\n01:05.800 --> 01:11.600\nIt could be about your health, your knowledge, or even just whether a cake is ready to eat.\n\n01:11.600 --> 01:13.100\nHope that helps!\n\n01:13.100 --> 01:16.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
