    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:13.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:18.000\nIt's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is ready.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:26.000\nYou stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:29.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is probably done.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:33.000\nAnother example is a spelling test.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:35.000\nIt shows how well you know how to spell different words.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:38.000\nOr maybe you take a test to see if you're allergic to something.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:43.000\nSo, a test helps us gather information to make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:46.000\nBasically, it's a way to check things out!\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:51.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
