    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.300\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a physical test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:31.000\nOr, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:39.100\nYou're testing a recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\nTests aren't just about getting a grade or a diagnosis.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:48.500\nThey help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\nThey show us what we know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:52.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
