    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_090126.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like an experiment, or a way to check if something is true.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:22.300\nMaybe you're testing if your cake is done by poking it with a toothpick. Or maybe you're taking a quiz in school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:33.400\nA test can be anything from a simple observation to a complex scientific study. For example, a doctor might test your vision to see if you need glasses.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.900\nOr, a chef might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Tests help us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:52.300\nSo, to recap: a test helps us discover something. It can be a simple check or a detailed investigation.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:58.400\nAnd it's all about finding answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
