    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nWhat is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:31.900\nThink of it like this. If you want to know if a light bulb works, you put it in a lamp and turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:37.600\nOr, if your teacher wants to know if you learned about dinosaurs, they might give you a quiz.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:44.200\nThat's another kind of test! Tests aren't just in school or with light bulbs.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:52.000\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Chefs taste food to test if it's delicious.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.600\nSo, a test is just a way to get information and see if something meets a certain standard. Now you know! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
