    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_090250.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of testing.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:16.000\nThink of a test as a way to check something to see if it works like it should. It's how we find out if something is right or wrong, good or bad.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:21.800\nImagine you're baking a cake. Before serving it, you might taste a small piece. That's a test!\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:26.300\nOr think about a doctor checking your temperature. That's another kind of test, to see if you're running a fever.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:34.300\nWe use tests all the time in everyday life. They help us make sure things are safe, accurate, and effective.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:45.900\nSo, testing is simply a way of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard. It's a fundamental process for learning and improving.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:53.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
