    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_090336.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_090336.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:33.100\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate or measure a specific quality, skill, or knowledge. Think of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you\u2019re healthy, a baker tastes the batter to see if it\u2019s sweet enough, and a student takes a quiz to show what they\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:45.900\nTests can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like quickly checking if your shoelaces are tied. The important thing is, they give us information.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:54.800\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "e2dd7ad4-a933-41d9-83c8-80572885ed96": {
    "id": "e2dd7ad4-a933-41d9-83c8-80572885ed96",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:37:23.679125",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T09:04:35.839162",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_090435.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_090435.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question you're asking, and the test helps you get the answer.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:30.000\nBasically, a test checks if something is working correctly, or if something is true or false.\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:43.200\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nEven pressing the power button on your TV is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing to see if it will turn on!\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:54.800\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn and understand the world.\nThey help us confirm things, and learn more about what we don't know.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "1e3b7d99-7edd-4340-ac9e-740c04216956": {
    "id": "1e3b7d99-7edd-4340-ac9e-740c04216956",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:37:24.246534",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T09:05:27.604187",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_090527.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_090527.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, and that's true!\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:25.700\nBut in a broader sense, a test is really just a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:32.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:39.300\nYour test is to screw it into a lamp and turn it on. If it lights up, the test is passed!\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:56.300\nOr, maybe you want to know if a cake is done baking. You stick a toothpick in it, and if it comes out clean, that's your test result: the cake is ready! So, a test involves performing an action or observation to gather information and confirm or deny something.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:03.100\nIt's a fundamental way we learn and understand the world around us.\n\n01:03.100 --> 01:06.600\nIn short, tests help us answer questions.\n\n01:06.600 --> 01:08.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
