    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.700\nIt\u2019s how we check if something is true, or how well something works. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:29.500\nA taste test checks if you like a certain food. Or even a medical test can check if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:36.300\nSo, tests help us understand the world around us. They give us information.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:44.600\nWhether it's knowing if you passed a class, or if a new product is safe, tests are all about getting answers.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:51.700\nRemember, a test is just a way of finding something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
