    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how well you know something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like checking your understanding of a topic. It could be a quiz in school, a driving test to get your license, or even a simple taste test to see if you like a new flavor of ice cream!\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:34.200\nThe main goal of a test is to measure your knowledge or skill. For example, a math test might have questions about addition and subtraction.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:39.600\nOr, a spelling test might ask you to write down different words.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:48.000\nSee? Pretty straightforward. So, to recap, a test helps us figure out what we've learned or what we can do.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:58.000\nIt\u2019s a way to check our progress and identify areas where we might need a little more practice. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
