    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_091842.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.700\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like this: you take a quiz in school to test your understanding of a subject. That's a test!\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:31.200\nOr maybe you try out a new recipe to test if it tastes good. That\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:45.600\nEven your doctor uses tests, like a blood test, to check on your health. So, tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying out a new game.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:54.800\nThe important thing is that they help us gather information and learn something new. They help us see what works and what needs improvement.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:02.800\nIn short, tests are everywhere, helping us learn and grow! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
