    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_091930.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:12.200\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:17.400\nThink of it as a question you're asking, and the answer helps you understand something better.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:22.600\nFor example, you might test the temperature of water to see if it's hot enough for tea.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:28.200\nOr a doctor might test your reflexes to check your nervous system.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:29.300\nSee?\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:30.400\nIt's all about gathering information.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:36.000\nAnother example is a taste test!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:39.700\nYou might try two different cookies to see which one you like better.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:41.800\nThat\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:48.000\nSo, a test is simply a procedure used to gather information and make a decision or learn something new.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.000\nIt can be anything from checking the weather to taking a quiz.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:52.800\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
