    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_092018.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:26.500\nIt helps us learn more about a person, a thing, or even an idea. Think of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you can do a test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:38.500\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, if you're learning your ABCs, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you remember them.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:48.800\nTests aren't scary, they're just tools. Tests can be as simple as asking a question, or as complicated as a big exam.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:59.500\nBut the goal is always the same: to get information. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn and understand things better.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
