    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:08.500\nIn simple terms, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:15.000\nIt helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:19.000\nThink about it like this: You might test a new lightbulb to see if it lights up.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:20.500\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:26.500\nOr, your doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:29.000\nTests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.000\nAnother example is baking a cake.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:39.000\nYou can test the cake with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:42.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:47.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:50.000\nIt can be big or small, but it always helps us get information.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
