    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_092313.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:29.000\nTests are used to measure all sorts of things.\nFor example, a doctor might give you a physical test to check your health, or a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:36.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 are the ingredients right?\nIs the oven temperature correct?\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:46.200\nThe result tells you if you succeeded.\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:53.900\nThey're all around us, helping us understand the world better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
