    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE Duration: 55.8 seconds\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt\u2019s how we check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:33.900\nAnother example is testing a new toy.\nYou might play with it to see if it\u2019s fun and works the way it\u2019s supposed to.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:46.500\nSo, tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like just trying something out.\nThey all help us learn and make sure things are doing what they should.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:51.200\nEssentially, a test is any method to evaluate or determine something.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
