    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:30.500\nThink of it like a question you're asking, and the answer helps you understand things better. For example, a spelling test helps you find out if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:40.100\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:49.700\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas about the world are correct, and doctors use tests to figure out what's making you feel unwell.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:53.600\nSo, tests help us gather information and learn new things.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:59.100\nThey can be fun, like figuring out your favorite color, or important, like checking your eyesight.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:02.800\nRemember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and understand more.\n\n01:02.800 --> 01:04.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
