    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. The \"something else\" could be anything!\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.200\nIt could be testing if a cake is done by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:47.800\nOr, imagine you're testing to see if your toy car will roll down a ramp. You let it go, and if it rolls, it passes the test.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:54.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple process of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:55.000\nWe use tests every day without even realizing it!\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
