    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of getting a simple answer, you get a result based on how something performs.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:29.200\nSo, what does that mean?\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:34.600\nWell, imagine you're testing a toy car.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:39.100\nYou might want to see how far it can travel when you push it.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:44.900\nThe distance it goes is the result of the test.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:52.300\nOr maybe you\u2019re testing a new recipe. You taste it, and that\u2019s the test!\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:58.100\nThe deliciousness, or lack thereof, is the result.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:04.400\nTests help us understand things better.\n\n01:04.400 --> 01:11.800\nThey can show us if something works, how well it works, or if it needs improvement.\n\n01:11.800 --> 01:28.200\nWhether it's a car, a recipe, or even your own understanding of a topic, tests are a valuable tool for learning and discovery.\n\n01:28.200 --> 01:38.800\nIn short, a test is a way to get information about something by observing its performance.\n\n01:38.800 --> 01:43.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
