    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.800 --> 00:07.300\nIn everyday language, a test is simply a way to find something out.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:15.300\nThink of it as a question, or a set of questions, designed to see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:18.700\nIt's like when you try a new recipe \u2013 you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:24.700\nOr when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:28.600\nFor example, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:33.400\nA car company might test a new car model to see if it's safe.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:37.900\nEven trying a new flavor of ice cream is kind of a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:44.800\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:47.300\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:54.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
