    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_094410.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE: The subtitle timings are approximate and may need adjustment to perfectly match the audio.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.100\nA test, at its most basic, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:40.300\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you can follow the instructions and make something delicious!\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:52.300\nOr, if you try to open a door, you're testing if it's unlocked. In school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:52.300 --> 01:01.700\nThey might be quizzes, exams, or even projects. These tests help you understand where you're doing great and where you might need a little extra practice.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:05.300\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check your understanding or the state of something.\n\n01:05.300 --> 01:08.900\nIt helps us learn and improve!\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:12.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
