    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your toy car rolls.\nThe test?\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:26.100\nYou push it and see if it moves!\nTests help us catch mistakes early on.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:31.300\nMaybe you\u2019re baking a cake.\nYou taste the batter \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:39.900\nIt helps you make sure it tastes good before you bake the whole thing.\nAnother example: You want to know if it's raining outside.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:45.800\nThe test is simply looking out the window.\nYou observe and that gives you the answer.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:55.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nIt helps us find problems and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
