    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_095313.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.400\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:22.400\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time! When you step outside and feel the air, you're testing if it's cold or warm.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:30.100\nA doctor uses tests to figure out if you're healthy. A chef tastes their food to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:41.600\nSo, a test helps us to know something we didn't know before. They can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:53.500\nThe goal is always to gather information and make a decision based on that information. In short, tests are everywhere, helping us understand the world around us!\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
