    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_095400.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:18.400\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:25.400\nThere are all sorts of tests. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:37.500\nYour teacher gives you tests to see how much you've learned. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you like it!\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:48.300\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done, you can poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:57.100\nOr, if you want to see if your dog knows a trick, you ask them to do it. If they do it, they pass the trick test!\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:04.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a method of checking something. It helps us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
