    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it as a simple question with a specific way to answer it.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:31.900\nTests can be used for lots of different things. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:44.900\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even baking a cake can be a test \u2013 you\u2019re testing if your recipe works!\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:51.700\nSo, tests help us learn things, check things, and even make delicious cakes.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:58.000\nThey all follow a basic structure of asking a question and finding an answer. Tests are everywhere! That\u2019s a quick introduction to tests. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
