    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:34.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:46.400\nOr, if you're building something, you might test to see if it's strong enough.\nSo, tests come in many forms, from quizzes at school to trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:55.500\nThe main goal is always to gather information and learn something new.\nWhether you're passing with flying colors or learning from your mistakes, tests are a valuable part of understanding the world around us.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
