    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_095619.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:19.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is ready.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:24.700\nThe test? Sticking a toothpick in it! If it comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:31.100\nTests aren't just for baking though. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:43.700\nA teacher gives tests to see what you've learned. Even trying on a new pair of shoes is a kind of test to see if they fit.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:52.300\nSo, a test is really just a process, a way to gather information and make a decision.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:56.400\nIt helps us understand things better, from figuring out if our cake is done, to understanding how well we\u2019re learning. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
