    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:04.600\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:08.000\nA test, in its simplest form, is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:11.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking, so you stick a toothpick in.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:12.600\nThat's a test!\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:17.600\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:22.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:25.800\nOr, a strength test might measure how much weight you can lift.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:29.200\nSo, tests aren't scary; they're just tools.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:34.200\nThey give us information that helps us make better decisions, learn new things, and improve.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:37.600\nRemember, a test helps us check something.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:38.400\nIt's that simple!\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:39.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
