    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the strength of a material.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\nA taste test tells you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:43.700\nAnd a stress test on a bridge checks if it can handle heavy loads.\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to provide information and give us some sort of result.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:55.700\nFrom simple quizzes to complex experiments, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\nIn short, a test is just a way to get an answer!\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
