    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.999\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:13.599\nYou've probably taken a test before, maybe in school.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:23.599\nBut what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:31.599\nIt could be about your knowledge, your skills, or even your opinion.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:39.599\nThink of it like this: a test is like asking a question. The answers you give show what you know.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:51.399\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or a taste test helps someone decide which kind of soda they like best.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:56.399\nSo, a test is just a structured way to gather information.\n```"
