    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:05.600\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly,\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:06.800\nor if you know something.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:10.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy,\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:14.300\nand teachers use tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:17.100\nSo, what do tests actually do?\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:19.900\nThey help us understand something better.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:24.600\nFor example, a taste test lets you find out which cookie is the tastiest!\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:28.500\nOr, a simple quiz can show you how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:29.500\nTests give us information.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:35.500\nImagine you're building a tower with blocks.\nYou might gently push it to test if it's stable.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:39.500\nIf it falls, you know you need to build it differently.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:40.300\nSee?\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:44.800\nBasically, a test is just a way of checking something.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:50.700\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:53.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
