    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.300\nIt\u2019s a process to check or evaluate something, whether it\u2019s your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even how well a recipe works.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:31.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A taste test checks if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:40.400\nOr imagine a lightbulb. Before it's sold, it's tested to make sure it shines brightly and doesn't burn out too quickly.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:49.600\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. They give us information!\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:55.200\nThat's the core idea behind any test. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
