    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.100\nIt helps us see if something is working, or if something is true. Think of it like checking if a light bulb works.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:25.600\nYou plug it in \u2013 that's your test.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:29.600\nIf it lights up, great! It passed the test.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:32.700\nIf not, well, it failed.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:42.100\nAnother example? A taste test! Trying a new flavor of ice cream is a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:52.400\nOr a spelling test at school, to see how well you know your words. So, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:55.200\nThey are a really important tool for learning and understanding the world around us.\n00:55.200 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
