    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.600\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a light bulb works, so you put it in a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:31.800\nThat's a test! We use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:38.200\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:44.600\nA teacher gives tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:47.800\nEven baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you taste it to see if it's good!\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:53.000\nSo, testing is really just about asking a question and finding an answer.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.200\nAre you healthy? Did you learn the material?\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:00.500\nDoes the cake taste good? These are all questions we answer through testing.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:03.900\nIn short, a test helps us confirm something\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:07.000\nor discover new information.\n\n01:07.000 --> 01:09.000\nThat\u2019s the basics of testing!\n\n01:09.000 --> 01:12.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
