    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_101852.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:28.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:42.300\nA taste test checks how good food tastes.\nAnd a medical test checks your health.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:51.900\nSo, whether it\u2019s a pop quiz in class, trying out a new recipe, or getting your eyesight checked, all of these are examples of tests.\nThey all involve gathering information to see where things stand.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:58.200\nIn short, a test is just a way of measuring or assessing something.\nIt helps us understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
