    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:30.700\nTests can be all sorts of things! For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:39.600\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:49.200\nEven trying a new recipe is a test \u2013 you're testing whether it tastes good!\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:56.700\nSo, a test is really just a method, a procedure, something we do to gain information and check the result.\n```"
