    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:23.100\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if something is true. Think about it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:30.700\nOr, a doctor might test your vision to see how well you can see. Tests help us gather information.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:40.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. A battery test checks how much power is left in a battery.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:42.800\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and find out information. It helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
