    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_102345.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.700\nToday we're going to talk about tests. In simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:23.800\nIt could be to see if something works, to measure how well you know something, or even to check if something is safe.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:30.300\nThink about a taste test. You try different foods to see which one you like best. That's a test!\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:42.900\nOr when you take a quiz at school, that's a test to see how much you've learned. Even checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on is a simple test!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:53.200\nTests help us make decisions, learn new things, and make sure things are working correctly. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it\u2019s just a way of finding out information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "e883e6cb-85f2-4fc7-8383-55735d5351a7": {
    "id": "e883e6cb-85f2-4fc7-8383-55735d5351a7",
