    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_102431.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests, a fundamental tool in many fields.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information about something. It could be about your knowledge, like a quiz in school, or about the quality of a product, like checking if a bridge can hold a certain weight.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to understand your health, like checking your temperature or blood pressure.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.000\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt. See?\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:37.000\nTests are everywhere! So, in a nutshell, a test is just a procedure designed to evaluate something and give us useful information.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.000\nRemember that, and you're well on your way to understanding more complex concepts.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
