    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:15.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like a question, but instead of just asking, we're looking for evidence.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:31.800\nThis evidence helps us understand if something is true or working correctly.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:39.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. A teacher might give you a quiz to see if you understand the lesson.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:42.200\nThink about baking a cake.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:44.800\nYou might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:47.400\nOr imagine checking your bike tires to test if they have enough air.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:48.800\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:57.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain requirement.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.400\nThey help us learn, diagnose problems, and make sure things are working as they should.\n```"
