    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:26.200\nIt's a process or a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:42.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A taste test determines which food you like best. Or, if you\u2019re baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:51.900\nThese are all different kinds of tests, but they all share the same basic idea: they help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.300\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz in school or trying out a new recipe, remember that a test is just a way to learn and improve.\n```"
