    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_102658.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:20.300\nIt's a process we use to see if something is true, to measure something, or to check if something works correctly.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:27.400\nThink about it like this: a baking test!\nYou might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:40.000\nOr, a spelling test at school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\nEven a doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature, to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:49.400\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us gather information.\nThey're used to check everything from recipes to your health.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:57.500\nIn short, a test is just a way of checking something.\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
