    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.400\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to check how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.600\nOr, a doctor might run tests to check your health. Basically, it's a way to gather information.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:40.800\nTests can be written, like quizzes, or practical, like trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:52.100\nFor example, you might test a new toy to see if it's durable, or a new app to see if it's easy to use.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for checking knowledge, skills, or performance. It helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
