    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_102827.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.200\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like gathering information. The goal of a test is to see what someone knows, how well something works, or what its properties are.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.000\nIt's like a little experiment! For example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:41.500\nA stress test on a bridge checks how much weight it can handle before it breaks. And a taste test might compare different flavors of ice cream to see which one people like best.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:50.200\nSo, a test is just a method for getting answers. It helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:55.800\nPretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
