    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_102915.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:13.300\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:19.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You turn it on to test if it lights up.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:29.400\nIn school, tests help teachers understand how well you've learned something. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects!\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:38.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words, and a math test checks your ability to solve problems.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:48.500\nSo, tests help us measure understanding and skills. They give us information to see what we're good at and where we might need a little more practice.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:53.900\nThey're a tool for learning, not something to be afraid of!\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
