    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of school, but really, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:26.900\nIt\u2019s a way to find out if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:34.200\nThink of it like this: if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:45.900\nOr, if you're buying a new phone, you might test the camera to see if you like the pictures it takes.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:53.800\nSo, a test is simply a way to gather information and make sure things are working as expected. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
