    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a light bulb works,\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:31.900\nso you screw it into a lamp and turn it on. That's a test! You're testing if the bulb can light up.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:41.200\nWe use tests all the time, not just with light bulbs. A doctor might give you a blood test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:53.200\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. Even tasting food is a test \u2013 you're checking if it tastes good!\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.800\nSo, tests are simply ways to find out something about something else. They help us understand if things are working as they should, or if there's something that needs attention. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
