    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It could be anything from checking if a lightbulb works to seeing how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:26.500\nBasically, a test helps us measure or evaluate something. Think of it like using a ruler to measure how long something is.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:36.300\nThe ruler is the tool, and the measurement is the result of the test. For example, a spelling test shows how well you can spell words.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:45.900\nA taste test helps you decide which food you like better. Even a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:56.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure used to evaluate or measure something. It helps us gain information and make decisions.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
