    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.600\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of school, but a test is really just a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:23.300\nIt's like an experiment, but simpler. Basically, you're checking to see if something is true or works correctly.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:31.700\nFor example, you might test if a light bulb works by screwing it in. If it lights up, the test passed!\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:42.200\nOr, if you're baking, you might test to see if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:55.000\nTests help us learn and improve things. They can be simple, like checking if your shoelaces are tied, or more complex, like checking if a new medicine works.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:04.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something by trying it out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
