    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you can do the toothpick test.\nYou poke the cake with a toothpick, and if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nIt's done!\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:30.800\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works.\nYou screw it into a lamp and flip the switch.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:38.000\nIf the light turns on, the bulb passes the test.\nIt works!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:45.900\nSo, a test is just a simple way to check something and see if it meets a certain requirement.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:53.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
