    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_103626.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:21.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt could be about anything!\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, you might test if a toy car rolls faster on carpet or on a smooth floor.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:40.600\nYou give it a push on each surface and see what happens.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:48.200\nOr maybe you're baking cookies.\nYou test if they're done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:48.200 --> 01:00.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, they're ready.\nSo, tests help us learn things and make decisions.\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:03.900\nThey can be big, like a school exam,\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:07.500\nor small, like tasting soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n01:07.500 --> 01:13.000\nNo matter what, a test helps us get information.\n\n01:13.000 --> 01:16.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
