    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:33.300\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. That test checks if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:43.800\nOr, imagine you're testing out a new toy to see if it does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:55.200\nSo, a test is really just a way of checking something. It can be a question, a physical action, or even just observing something to see what happens.\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.700\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve things! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
