    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.300\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: if you're learning your ABCs, your teacher might give you a little quiz to test if you remember them.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:28.200\nThat's a test!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:34.200\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it before it's finished to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:40.200\nThat's also a test! Tests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:53.300\nWe use them in school, in science, and even in everyday life to make sure we're on the right track and learning what we need to learn.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.100\nSo, a test is just a way to check our knowledge or how something performs. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
