    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.700\nIt helps us learn more about things, from our knowledge to the strength of materials. Think of it like this: You might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:31.000\nThat's a test! Or, imagine a company checking if a new toy is safe for kids.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:37.300\nThey'll put it through tests to make sure it won't break easily.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:46.600\nTests can be simple, like tasting a new food to see if you like it. Or, they can be complex, like scientists running experiments to discover new medicines.\n\n00:46.600 --> 01:00.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn more. They help us understand the world around us and make sure things are safe and effective.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:03.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
