    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_104329.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into something super important: the concept of a test.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something or someone, to see how well they perform or what their qualities are.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to check your health.\nOr, a chef might taste their soup \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:39.900\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\nTests can be formal, like a written exam, or informal, like trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:49.300\nThe main idea is that you're gathering information to understand something better.\nSo, a test is just a method of evaluation.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:57.300\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
