    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:03.200\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:04.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.000\nWe use tests to gather information and see how well something works,\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:11.800\nor how good someone is at something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:14.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:18.000\nOr, if you bake a cake and try a slice, that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:21.000\nMaybe you're testing a new toy to see if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:23.500\nSo, tests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:26.300\nThey can be formal, like a school exam,\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:28.300\nor informal, like tasting that cake.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:30.500\nThe key is that we're trying to gain information.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:32.000\nTests are all around us!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:35.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
