    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:23.200\nIt's like an experiment, but often with a very specific goal.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:32.100\nWe use tests all the time to measure things, check if something works, or see if someone understands a concept.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:41.200\nThink about it: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. A chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:50.500\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class. So, a test helps us get information. It's a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.100\nWhether it's a simple taste test or a big exam, the goal is to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
