    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's a process where you ask a question, or try something out, to get an answer or see what happens.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:30.300\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes their soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, when you're learning to ride a bike, you test your balance to see if you can stay upright.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:43.000\nEven a doctor asking you to say \"ah\" is a quick test to check your throat! So, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:57.200\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your phone is charged. Basically, if you're trying to figure something out, you're probably doing a test!\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:03.400\nIn short, a test is just a way to gather information. That's all there is to it!\n\n01:03.400 --> 01:07.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
