    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\"\nand wondered what it really means?\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:13.400\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a method for checking or proving an idea.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:30.300\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\nTests aren't just for people, either!\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:36.500\nA company might test a new product to make\nsure it works correctly before selling it.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:43.600\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:51.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and confirm something.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
