    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_105154.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.800\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a check-up.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.500\nWe use tests all the time to see if something is working, or to understand something better. For example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:32.500\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Even baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:39.000\nYou're testing if the recipe works. If the cake tastes good, the test was successful!\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:49.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what we already know. It helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
