    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_105331.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.500\nThink of a test as a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a lesson, or even checking if a cake is ready to come out of the oven!\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:29.800\nBasically, a test helps us see if something is working correctly or if we've learned something new. For example, your teacher might give you a math test to see if you understand addition and subtraction. Or, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:42.400\nAnother example: when you bake cookies, you might test one to see if it's soft enough before taking the whole batch out. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:45.000\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check understanding or condition.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:54.400\nIt helps us know if we're on the right track.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
