    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.800\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:21.400\nIt could be checking if you understand a lesson, checking if a machine is working correctly, or even checking if food tastes good!\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:32.200\nBasically, a test helps us learn more about something. Think about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to test what you've learned in class.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:41.300\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Even when you bake a cake, you taste it to test if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:54.700\nSo, tests help us understand, diagnose, and improve things all around us. So remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn more about it.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
