    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about something super important: Tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:18.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to see if something works correctly or if you know something. Think of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on after you screw it in.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:28.800\nThat's a test! Or, if your teacher asks you questions about a book you read, that\u2019s a test to see if you understood the story.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:42.300\nWe use tests all the time, from testing new medicines to checking if your spelling is correct. For example, a food company might test a new recipe to see if people like the taste.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:54.500\nOr a doctor might test your vision to see if you need glasses. So, to recap: A test helps us find out information or check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:00.300\nThey help us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
