    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.000\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It\u2019s a method for gathering information.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:17.900\nThink of it like this: you take a taste of soup to test if it needs more salt. That's a test!\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:27.300\nOr, a doctor uses a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:39.800\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They might ask you questions on a piece of paper, or give you a practical task to complete.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:48.300\nSo, a test can be anything from tasting soup to answering questions in class. It\u2019s all about getting information.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:51.400\nRemember, tests are just tools to help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:52.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
