    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.400\nIt could be checking if something works, if something is true, or even checking your knowledge.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to check your health.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:49.600\nOr, maybe you test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned. They're like little checkpoints to see how you're doing.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:59.900\nSo, whether it's checking your spelling, your math skills, or even testing a new toy to see if it\u2019s fun, that's essentially what a test is all about: a way to find something out.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:02.900\nIn short, tests are all around us, helping us learn and understand the world better.\n\n01:02.900 --> 01:03.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
