    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_110636.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like an experiment, but often much simpler. We use tests to measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge, your ability, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:38.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test can help a company decide which flavor of ice cream people like best.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:50.100\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions based on that information. They can be formal, like an exam at school, or informal, like trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:58.600\nBasically, if you're trying to find something out in a structured way, you're probably using a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
