    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.200\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:28.400\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned. Tests can be lots of different things.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:35.700\nA simple test could be tasting a new food to see if you like it. A more formal test might be a written exam.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:43.000\nThe goal is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:46.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:50.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
