    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works, or if it's true.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: you test a lightbulb to see if it lights up. That's a simple test!\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:29.900\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:36.600\nThey can be multiple choice, short answer, or even a project. The goal is to show what you understand.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:43.300\nAnother example is a taste test! You might try two different cookies to see which one you like better.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:51.300\nThat's a test of your preference. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:55.700\nWhether it's a lightbulb, a math problem, or a cookie, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
