    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, but often a lot shorter.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:24.800\nWe use tests all the time in everyday life, even if we don't realize it.\nFor example, you might taste a new food to test if you like it.\nOr, you might try turning on a light switch to test if the power is on.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:35.900\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\nThey're not meant to trick you, but to show what you've learned.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for finding information.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:56.700\nFrom tasting food to taking a quiz, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
