    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_111639.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests! \n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something. \nIt could be checking if you understand a lesson, or if a new medicine is safe, or even if your car is working properly.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:27.600\nBasically, you're trying to find out information. \nYou give something a try, or ask a question, and see what happens.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:38.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. \nA doctor might test your reflexes to see if your nervous system is working well.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:51.100\nA car mechanic might test your brakes to make sure they're safe. \nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something works, or if you understand something.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:57.700\nIt helps us learn and make sure things are safe. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
