    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.400\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bath water to make sure it's not too hot or too cold.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:32.600\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand a subject. If you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different kinds of animals or explain what they eat.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:41.200\nOr, if you\u2019re learning to bake, you might test your cake by poking it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:52.300\nSo, tests come in many forms, but they all have the same goal: to check if something is working, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.900\nRemember, tests are just one way to learn and improve!\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
