    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.500\nWhat is a test, exactly?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:24.000\nIt's a process to see if something is true, or to measure how well something works.\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school checks if you know how to spell words.\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.300\nEven checking if your phone charger works is a little test!\nYou're testing to see if it's charging your phone.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:43.000\nSo, tests help us learn, compare things, and make sure things are working properly.\nThey're all about gathering information.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:51.400\nIn short, a test is any procedure designed to evaluate something.\nThat's the basics of testing!\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
