    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:23.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand something, like a quiz in school. Or, it could be checking if something works correctly, like testing a new toy to make sure it doesn't break.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:32.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy. They might check your temperature or listen to your heart.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:38.300\nA baker tests their cake by poking it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:45.300\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:55.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out. Whether it's about knowledge, health, or just making sure things are working properly. Tests help us understand the world around us!\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
