    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're going to talk about something fundamental: tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:11.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\nYou test it!\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:14.300\nMaybe you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:16.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:18.600\nTests are used everywhere.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:21.100\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:23.800\nSchools use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:28.000\nA car company might test a new car to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:30.800\nSo, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:34.700\nWe perform an action, and the result of that action tells us something.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:38.200\nRemember, tests help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:41.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
