    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.100\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something or someone to see how well they perform or what they know.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\nOr, your doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:37.900\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nA math test checks if you understand addition, subtraction, and other math concepts.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:50.300\nSo, tests are just tools we use to learn and improve.\nThey help us identify what we already know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:54.400\nRemember, tests are just one way to measure understanding, and they can help us all grow.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
