    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_112601.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.300\nIt's a process for gathering information. Think about it like this: a taste test helps you find out which food you like best.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:29.000\nOr a spelling test helps your teacher find out which words you know how to spell.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:39.800\nTests aren't just for school though. When you try a new video game, you're testing it out to see if you enjoy playing it.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:53.600\nEven when you ask a friend a question, you\u2019re testing their knowledge. So, a test is really just a way to learn something new or confirm what you already know.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:00.000\nIt can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like trying out a new recipe. Remember, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
