    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_112725.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.200\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:09.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:09.600 --> 00:18.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:26.800\nThink about it: a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:38.700\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your words. Even checking if the light switch works is a tiny little test!\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:48.100\nSo, a test involves trying something or asking something to see what happens. The result helps you learn, decide, or confirm something.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:54.500\nWhether it's a school exam or just figuring out if your shoes fit, that's testing in action.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:57.000\nEssentially, a test is a way to gather information.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.400\nAnd that information helps us make better choices and understand the world around us.\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:02.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
