    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_112809.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:11.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:21.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think about it like this: when you\u2019re baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:31.900\nYou poke the cake, and if the toothpick comes out clean, then the cake passes the test! Or, imagine a spelling test at school.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:45.200\nIt checks how well you know your words. Tests can be big or small, simple or complicated, but they all help us learn something new or confirm something we already think we know.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:49.800\nSo, a test is really just a way to check things and learn from the results.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
