    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_112940.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:21.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it! Think about it.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:27.000\nWhen you try a new recipe, that's a test! You're testing if you like the taste.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:33.000\nOr when a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:47.600\nA test can be something written, like a quiz at school, or something more hands-on, like trying to fix a broken toy.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:57.000\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better. It gives us information so we can make a decision or learn something new.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:01.000\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding things out!\n```"
  },
