    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_113628.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.200\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how good something is.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like this: a chef tests a soup to see if it needs more salt. That's a test!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:36.000\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:44.700\nFor example, if you're learning to ride a bike, falling down is kind of a test. It shows you what not to do next time.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:49.600\nSo, tests are all about learning and finding things out.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.100\nThey can be big or small, easy or hard, but they all help us understand the world a little bit better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
