    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:18.200\nIn everyday life, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:30.500\nThink about it: you test the water temperature before getting in the shower, right?\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:35.600\nIn the world of science and learning, a test is pretty similar.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:40.700\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skill, or performance in something specific.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:44.000\nBasically, it's a way to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:47.000\nFor example, a quiz in class is a test.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:49.700\nA spelling bee is a test.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:51.800\nEven trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good is a kind of test!\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:53.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a method used to assess something.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.800\nIt helps us learn, improve, and see where we stand.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
