    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:20.400\nIt's a process of asking a question or performing an action to see what happens.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:25.700\nThink about it like this: a taste test!\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:31.000\nYou try a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it. That's a test!\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:40.000\nOr maybe you\u2019re baking a cake and poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you it's done.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:55.700\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if your phone is charged. The important thing is that they help us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
