    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and then finding the answer through an experiment or a procedure.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:22.100\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:30.500\nOr maybe a doctor runs a blood test to check your health. In both cases, they're using a test to get information.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:37.700\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. Checking if a cake is cooked by poking it with a fork? That's a test!\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:42.700\nSeeing if a lightbulb works by flipping the switch? That's also a test!\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information and finding out something you didn't know before. It\u2019s all about asking a question and finding the answer!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
