    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.200\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true. Think of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is ready, you can test it by sticking a toothpick in.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:30.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test!\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.100\nAnother example is a spelling test. It helps your teacher see if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:43.800\nSo, tests are all about checking things. They help us learn, improve, and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:53.000\nFrom baking a cake to taking a school exam, tests are a part of everyday life.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
