    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:24.800\nIt's a process to see if something is true, correct, or working properly. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:31.400\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:43.800\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you get a delicious result.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:56.200\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are as they should be. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.000\nRemember, a test is just a way to learn something new!\n\n00:59.000 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
