    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a method or procedure used to determine the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:39.600\nA medical test, like a blood test, checks your health.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:48.600\nOr, testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good! So, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:51.300\nThey can be formal, like a standardized exam, or informal, like asking a friend for their opinion.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:55.400\nThe important thing is that they give us data to work with.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:56.900\nRemember, a test is just a way to learn more.\n\n00:56.900 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
