    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something, right? It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:31.300\nIt\u2019s just a way to check up on things.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:37.500\nLet's say you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:46.400\nYou're testing to see if it tastes good. Or, if your bike isn't working, you might try pumping up the tires, that's a test to see if that fixes the problem.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:54.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard. It's all about finding things out.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
