    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:22.100\nThink about it: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. A chef tastes food to test if it's delicious.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:29.900\nOr maybe you take a quiz at school to test what you've learned. So, tests help us gather information.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:38.500\nThey can show us if something is working correctly, if we understand a topic, or even what someone's opinion is.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:51.200\nWhether it's a science experiment, a survey, or a simple game, tests are everywhere! Basically, a test helps us check something and learn something new.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
