    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question to see what the answer is.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:21.000\nWe use tests all the time!\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:33.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test showing the cake is done.\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works, you screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:45.900\nIf it lights up, you've passed the \"lightbulb test\"!\nTests can be big, like a school exam, or small, like checking if your phone is charged.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:53.800\nThe key thing to remember is that a test helps us learn something new, or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:01.200\nSo, tests are all about gathering information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
