    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a method we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\nThink of it like this: you might \"test\" if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\nIf it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:31.300\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\nThese are all examples of tests.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:41.500\nTests can be simple or complex, but they all have the same goal: to give us answers.\nWe use tests in school, in science, and even in everyday life to learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:49.900\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to get information.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
