    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.400\nNow, you've probably taken lots of tests in school, but in general, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:25.900\nIt's a procedure designed to see if something is true, or if something works.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:35.600\nThink about it like this: a taste test is a test to see if you like a new food. A doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:44.200\nEven shaking a vending machine is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if it will give you your snack!\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:53.500\nSo, tests are all about gathering information. They help us understand things better and make decisions. Remember, a test is simply a way to learn something by trying something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
