    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:12.700\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is working by flipping the switch. The switch is the test, and whether the light turns on is the result.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:30.100\nTests aren't just for school, though. A doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:40.100\nOr a chef might taste their food to test if it needs more salt. In both cases, they're using a test to gather information and make a decision.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:50.000\nSo, remember, a test is a tool we use to learn something. It helps us understand where we are and what we need to do next.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.800\nHopefully, this gives you a basic understanding of what a test is.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
