    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:23.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think of it this way: your doctor uses tests to check your health, like taking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:32.000\nOr, when you're baking a cake, you might test the batter to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:43.300\nEven video games have tests! When you press a button, the game tests to see if you pressed the right one.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:50.300\nSo, a test is just a simple way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
