    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_120636.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like this: a test in school helps your teacher see what you've learned. Or, if your bike isn't working right, you might test the brakes to see if they're the problem.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:31.400\nAnother example? Baking a cake!\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:39.900\nYou might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:50.900\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and checking things. They help us learn, troubleshoot, and make sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:53.600\nThat's the basic idea!\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
