    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:23.600\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:31.200\nThink of it like this: you might test if your lightbulb works by flipping the switch. If it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:38.800\nOr, you could test a cookie recipe by baking a small batch. If they taste good, the recipe passes the test.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:49.300\nTests are everywhere, from checking if your car is running smoothly to making sure a new medicine is safe. They help us make informed decisions and avoid problems.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:53.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something to see if it works or is true.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
