    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of getting a verbal answer, you get a result.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:29.600\nA test helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is present. It could be a test to see if a light bulb turns on, or a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:40.400\nFor example, your doctor might give you a blood test to check for certain things in your body. Or, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:43.000\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:54.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a process that gives you information. It helps you learn about something and see if it meets a certain standard or condition.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:01.300\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
