    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:25.600\nIt helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a topic.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:38.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows whether you know how to spell words.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:48.800\nA car test, or inspection, makes sure all the parts are working safely.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:55.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and your baking skills!\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:02.700\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic goal: to give us information and help us learn or improve.\n```"
