    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.430 --> 00:03.280\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.280 --> 00:06.390\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.390 --> 00:09.340\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:09.340 --> 00:11.770\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:11.770 --> 00:18.150\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:18.150 --> 00:20.690\nThat\u2019s a test! Or when you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit.\n\n00:20.690 --> 00:21.950\nThat's also a test.\n\n00:21.950 --> 00:27.300\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:30.760\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just class activities.\n\n00:30.760 --> 00:32.800\nThey all help measure your understanding.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:39.530\nSo, a test is just a tool to learn more about something, whether it's cake batter or fractions.\n\n00:39.530 --> 00:42.530\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
