    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nIt could be checking if you understand a topic, like in school, or checking if something is working correctly, like a new toy.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done, you can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:36.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nAnother example: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:44.700\nThey might check your temperature or listen to your heart.\nIf everything looks good, you pass that test too!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:52.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
