    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.400\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more about a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:27.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:35.600\nYou might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. In school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:45.000\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information. It helps us make better decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:53.900\nRemember, a test is simply a method for finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
