    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:16.500\nWe use tests all the time!\nThink about it.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:30.500\nA doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher uses a test to see how well you understand a subject.\nSo, a test is really just a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:39.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling abilities.\nA taste test checks your ability to identify flavors.\nSee?\nPretty simple!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:41.600\nBasically, tests help us understand where we're at,\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:51.300\nand what we might need to work on.\nThey're a tool for learning and improvement.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:54.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
