    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:18.300\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something specific.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:22.100\nThink about it like this.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:34.500\nYou might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:38.300\nSee? Different things, but the same idea.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:50.700\nTests can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like trying a new recipe to see if you like it. The important thing is that a test gives us information.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.700\nIt helps us learn and understand things better. So, remember, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:02.600\nIt can be anything from a school exam to trying a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n01:02.600 --> 01:06.100\nIt's all about gathering information!\n\n01:06.100 --> 01:09.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
