    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_122147.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.500\nToday we\u2019re talking about tests. A test is simply a way to find out something, whether it's how much you know about a subject, or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:31.100\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:37.800\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through. That's a test!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:46.600\nOr maybe you're trying out a new video game; playing the first level is like a test to see if you enjoy it.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:56.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or check if something is working. Tests help us learn and improve!\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
