    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_122332.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:21.300\nIt's a method used to see if something is true, to measure something, or to check how well something works.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:29.400\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you can poke it with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:37.900\nOr, if you want to see how well you understand a subject, you might take a quiz.\nThat's another kind of test!\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:45.900\nTests can be used for all sorts of things, from finding out if a lightbulb works to measuring your eyesight.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:58.200\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a procedure or method used to determine something, whether it\u2019s the quality, performance, or truth of something.\nIt's all about finding out information.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:04.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "4a2fe3a8-e647-445c-831a-417977b88201": {
    "id": "4a2fe3a8-e647-445c-831a-417977b88201",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:40:04.519722",
