    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_122420.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_122420.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:18.700\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:30.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a written test in school, where you answer questions on paper.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:38.300\nOr, you might have a practical test, like showing someone you can ride a bike safely.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:45.900\nEven a taste test is a kind of test \u2013 seeing if you can tell the difference between different flavors!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:58.000\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz, a driving exam, or even just trying a new recipe, tests help us understand what we've learned and where we can improve.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:01.600\nThey're a common way to check progress and see what you've mastered.\n\n01:01.600 --> 01:04.600\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just a way to measure your understanding!\n01:04.600 --> 01:08.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
