    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:20.600\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:27.800\nBasically, you're performing an action and observing the result to see if it meets your expectations.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:37.300\nOther examples include checking if a cake is done by poking it with a toothpick, or even a doctor checking your reflexes with a little hammer.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:47.300\nThey're testing to see if things are working as they should. So, a test is really just a simple experiment to see if something passes or fails.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:55.500\nIt's all about gathering information! Hopefully, this gives you a good basic understanding of what a test is.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
