    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.500\nIt's a process, or a procedure, designed to evaluate or measure something specific. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n \n00:23.500 --> 00:34.100\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. And even a simple experiment to see if a plant needs sunlight is a type of test!\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:47.400\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like trying out a new recipe. The key is that they help us gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:47.400 --> 01:00.300\nSo, to recap, a test is just a method for evaluating or measuring something, whether it's your knowledge, your preference, or even how well a plant grows.\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:06.300\nThey're all about finding answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
