    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it as a question you're asking, and the test helps you find the answer.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:34.300\nIt could be anything from a quiz in school to checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:44.200\nThe main idea is that you're trying to learn something specific. You set up a situation, like answering questions on paper, or screwing the bulb into a lamp, and then you observe what happens.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:47.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:56.500\nOr, you might test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good. See? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:03.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for gathering information, a way of asking a question and getting an answer. It helps us learn and understand things better.\n```"
