    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:19.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is, or trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:32.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, when you try a new recipe, that's a test to see if you like the taste!\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:40.100\nDoctors use tests to figure out if you're healthy, and scientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:50.100\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information.\nIt helps us learn, understand, and make better decisions.\n\n00:50.100 --> 01:00.100\nRemember, a test isn't always about right or wrong, it's about finding out more.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
