    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.800\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:30.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:42.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class. The test results help us understand something better.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:52.700\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if you like a new flavor of ice cream. Or, a quiz can show you how well you remember facts about animals.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:59.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes! So, to recap, a test is a tool we use to gather information and learn more about something. It helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
