    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:13.100\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:24.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process designed to see if something is true, or to measure something.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:30.900\nThink of it like this: you might have a taste test to see which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:36.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:41.100\nOr, your doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:43.200\nThat's another kind of test!\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:51.100\nTests can be used for lots of things.\nYou could test a recipe to see if it tastes good, or a company might test a new product to see if people like it.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.000\nThe important thing is that a test helps us get information and make decisions.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.600\nSo, a test is just a way to learn more about something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
