    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:15.300\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.600\nIt's like an experiment you do to see how something works, or to check if something is true.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:34.500\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:38.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:42.900\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:49.900\nThey're looking for clues to understand what's going on. Another example?\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:56.900\nImagine you\u2019re learning to ride a bike. Falling down is kind of a test!\n\n00:56.900 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
