    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something works, or how much of something exists.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like checking the batteries in your flashlight.\nThat's a simple test!\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:32.200\nAnother example: If you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\nThat's testing!\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:36.800\nThe toothpick comes out clean? The cake passes the test!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:42.200\nTests are everywhere! From school exams to checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:52.400\nThe key is, a test helps us understand something better.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find information and see how something measures up.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
