    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a check-up.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:21.800\nWe use tests all the time! For example, your doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:29.900\nOr maybe you take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:41.300\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test! You're testing your recipe to see if it comes out delicious.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:50.000\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and even improve recipes. They're a fundamental tool for gathering information.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.600\nJust remember, a test is simply a way to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
