    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.300 --> 00:02.600\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:06.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:08.400\nIt helps us measure or evaluate qualities.\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:13.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a blood test to find out about your health.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:17.100\nOr, when you're baking, you might taste the batter - that's a test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:23.300\nTests aren't just for science or cooking, though. When you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:27.500\nIt helps your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:35.400\nSo, a test can be anything from a simple taste to a complicated medical procedure, all designed to give us information.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:43.100\nBasically, tests help us learn, understand, and improve things.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:45.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
