    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:13.200\nToday we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:19.000\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like a measuring tool for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:29.800\nIt helps us see where you're strong and maybe where you need a little extra practice.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:36.700\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words. Or a math test shows how well you understand numbers and equations.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:41.700\nEven tasting food can be a test to see if you can identify different flavors!\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:47.600\nSo, a test is simply a way to check your understanding or abilities.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:50.800\nIt helps you and others see what you've learned and what you might want to focus on next.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
