    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_124002.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:07.000\nA test is really just a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:12.000\nThink of it like checking to see if your cookies are done \u2013 you test them by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.000\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:25.000\nIf you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different kinds of birds, or what a mammal is.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:30.000\nOutside of school, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:33.000\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:37.000\nA car company tests new cars to make sure they're safe to drive.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:46.000\nSo, basically, a test is a way to gather information and see where you stand. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
