    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nWhat is a test, exactly? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:24.100\nIt helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:34.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a test at school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:46.400\nA test can be a quiz, an experiment, or just a simple observation.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:57.000\nFor example, you could test if a toy car rolls down a ramp faster than another. Or, you could test if a plant grows taller in sunlight or in shade.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.500\nSo, remember, a test is all about checking something to find out information.\n```"
