    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like testing a cake. You bake it, then you taste it to see if it's good. That's a test!\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:24.400\nOr maybe you're testing a lightbulb. You plug it in to see if it lights up.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:29.300\nAgain, that\u2019s a test! Tests can be anything from a quiz at school to checking if your car is working properly.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:41.900\nThey help us understand if something is working the way it should, or if there's something we need to fix.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:51.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and see what the result is. It's about gathering information.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
