    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests!\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:17.400\nA test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you know something.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:41.100\nBut tests aren't just for school. Your doctor might run tests to check your health, like a blood test. Or, a company might test a new product to make sure it's safe and reliable.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:50.000\nSo, whether it's a quiz in class, a medical checkup, or checking if a new toy works, a test helps us understand something better.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.700\nIn short, a test is an evaluation or check to see if something meets a certain standard or if you know something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
