    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_124828.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. Think of it like this: you\u2019re trying to learn something new, and a test helps you see how much you've understood.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:25.600\nIt could be anything! A quiz in school, a taste test for new flavors, or even checking if your phone works after you drop it.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:34.600\nThey all help measure or evaluate something. For example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:41.200\nOr, a cookie taste test tells you which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:49.300\nTests can be fun and useful! So, a test is just a process for collecting information, helping us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:52.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
