    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how much you know about something. Think of it like checking your understanding.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:28.100\nThe main idea behind a test is to ask questions or give you tasks that show what you've learned. These questions can be multiple choice, true or false, or even asking you to solve a problem.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:37.700\nFor example, a math test might ask you what two plus two is. Or a spelling test could ask you to spell the word \"cat.\"\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:48.300\nSee? Pretty straightforward. So, to sum it up, a test helps you and your teachers understand what you've learned and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:54.400\nIt's all about learning and growing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
