    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.800\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, seeing how well you understand a topic, or even figuring out if a recipe tastes good.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:31.400\nThink about it: a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:45.200\nYour teacher gives you tests to see what you've learned in class. Even baking a cake involves a \"taste test\" to make sure it's delicious!\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:55.500\nSo, tests help us understand things better, identify problems, and see how well we're doing. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the core idea is always the same: to evaluate something.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.100\nThat's the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
