    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:16.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb lights up. That's a test!\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:33.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. When you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:39.200\nOr when you try a new recipe, tasting it is a test to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:50.400\nFor example, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. Or a car mechanic might test your brakes to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:59.300\nTests help us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:07.100\nSo, to recap: a test is a way of checking something. It could be your knowledge, how well something functions, or even your health.\n\n01:07.100 --> 01:11.900\nWe use tests to learn, improve, and stay safe.\n\n01:11.900 --> 01:13.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
