    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.900\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even your understanding of a specific topic.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if your cake is ready, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:36.300\nOr, if you want to know if you're ready for a bike race, you might time yourself riding a practice course. That's another kind of test!\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:41.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:46.700\nThey can be quizzes at school, medical exams at the doctor's office, or even experiments in a science lab.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:55.100\nThey all have the same goal: to give you information. So, to recap, a test is a method of gathering information, often about knowledge, skill, or understanding.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:04.500\nIt's a process that helps us learn and improve.\n\n01:04.500 --> 01:11.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
