    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.000\nA test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:31.500\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.100\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:45.700\nAnother simple test is baking a cake! You test the cake with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, the cake is done.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:56.600\nIf it's sticky, it needs more time. So, tests are all about checking things out and getting information. In short, tests are tools we use every day to check quality, knowledge, and understanding.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.300\nThey help us make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
