    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:14.700\nWhat are they, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:19.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:28.300\nThink of it like this. You want to know if your cookies are baked enough. You can test them by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:37.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cookies pass the test and they're done! Or, imagine you're learning a new language.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:44.700\nA quiz is a test to see how well you understand the vocabulary and grammar.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:57.000\nSo, a test is just a way to check something. It gives us information to help us learn and improve. Tests can be simple, like checking a cookie, or more complex, like taking an exam.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.600\nBut the basic idea is always the same: to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
