    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:22.900\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nThink about it: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:29.700\nOr, imagine baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that's a mini-test to see if it tastes good before you bake the whole thing!\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:36.100\nTests help us make decisions.\nIf the cake batter tastes bland, you add more sugar.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:42.500\nIf the blood test shows something unusual, the doctor knows what to investigate further.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and make informed choices.\nIt could be anything from a school exam to a simple taste test.\nIt's all about learning more!\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
