    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more. For example, a spelling test helps us find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:33.400\nOr a taste test lets you discover which snack you like best. Even checking if a light bulb works is a kind of test! You're testing if it will light up.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:46.400\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have one thing in common: they help us learn and understand things better. They give us information.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:51.800\nTests aren't scary, they're just tools!\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
