    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:24.600\nIt\u2019s a process or procedure designed to evaluate or measure. Think about it like this: a recipe test lets you know if your cake will taste good.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.800\nA spelling test shows how well you know your words. Or, if you\u2019re feeling a little under the weather, a doctor might run some tests to figure out what's going on.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:42.900\nTests aren't just for school or doctors, though. Companies test new products to make sure they work.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:49.900\nScientists test their ideas to see if they're true. Basically, a test is a tool to help us learn and understand.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:58.900\nSo, remember, a test helps us evaluate or measure something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
