    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.500\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we just mean a way to find out something. It's like an experiment or a way to check if something is true.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:29.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:32.900\nSee? It's all about finding out information.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:41.400\nAnother example is testing a new toy. You play with it to see if it works the way it should, or if it's fun to use.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:54.400\nSo, a test is simply a method to learn something new, or confirm something you already suspect. In short, a test is a way to gather information and check things out.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:01.900\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
