    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:17.900\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:25.200\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, seeing how well you understand a new topic, or even figuring out if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:29.600\nBasically, you're doing something to get an answer.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:34.000\nThink of it like this: you try to open a door. That's the test!\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:39.000\nIf it opens, you know it's unlocked. If it doesn't, you know it's locked.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:44.000\nAnother example? A spelling test! You're tested on how well you can spell words.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:47.300\nThe results show what you know.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:50.500\nSo, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:53.000\nThey help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n```"
