    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:10.800\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:14.300\nWhat is a test?\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:21.300\nWe use them all the time!\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:24.800\nThink about it.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:28.000\nWhen you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:30.600\nThat\u2019s a test to see if it's done.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:36.100\nOr maybe you try on a new pair of shoes. You're testing if they fit!\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:40.700\nIn science and math, tests help us understand how things work.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:46.000\nWe might test different fertilizers on plants to see which one makes them grow best.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:51.200\nOr maybe we take a quiz at school; that's a test to see how well we learned the material.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.900\nSo, tests are all about getting information and learning something new.\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:00.500\nThey help us make decisions and understand the world around us better.\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:02.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
