    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:07.400\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.000\nIt could be a person, a material, or even an idea. We use tests to see how well something performs, what its qualities are, or if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:24.800\nA strength test measures how much weight you can lift.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:28.500\nAnd a taste test helps you decide which cookie recipe you like best!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:37.200\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, measuring a physical property, or comparing different options, tests help us gather information and make informed decisions.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:43.400\nThey\u2019re a fundamental part of learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:47.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
