    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:17.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working as it should, or if something is true.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:28.300\nThink of it like a little investigation. We use tests all the time in everyday life. For example, if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:35.600\nOr, if you're feeling a little under the weather, a doctor might run some tests to see what's going on.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:51.400\nSo, a test is all about gathering information to make a decision, or to verify something. Whether it's baking a cake or figuring out why you're not feeling well, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:58.900\nIn short, a test is a method for checking something! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
