    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:22.100\nBasically, a test is a way to check if something works, or if you know something. Think of it like this: before a new toy goes on sale, it's tested to make sure it's safe and doesn't break easily.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:34.300\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, a quiz is a test to see how well you remember them. Tests help us understand what's working well and what needs improvement.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:44.500\nSo, whether it's testing a new phone, or a spelling test at school, they all serve the same purpose: to learn and grow.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:54.800\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to figure out why you're not feeling well. Or, a chef tastes their food to test if it's delicious.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:01.000\nTests are everywhere! So remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:09.900\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
