    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:27.700\nThat's a test! It\u2019s a way of finding out if something is true or false, right or wrong, working or not working.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:37.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:43.900\nTests help us learn and improve. They give us information to make better decisions.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:54.000\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something and get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
