    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_132811.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nIt's a process, a procedure, or an evaluation designed to measure knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\nA chef tastes their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:41.100\nAnd in school, you take tests to show what you've learned in class.\nThese tests can be multiple choice, written answers, or even practical demonstrations.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:56.500\nThe main idea is always the same: to get information.\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things better, whether it's about our health, our cooking, or our schoolwork.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:02.300\nThat's the basics of testing!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
