    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:19.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:28.800\nThat's a test! In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:39.000\nA quiz about animals tests your knowledge of animals. Spelling tests check your spelling skills.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:51.200\nAnd even your doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature, to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:51.200 --> 01:02.700\nSo, a test is really just a method for checking or evaluating something. It can be a simple observation, a written exam, or even a lab experiment.\n\n01:02.700 --> 01:09.000\nThey all help us learn and understand things better.\n\n01:09.000 --> 01:15.400\nTo recap, a test helps us determine something, like knowledge, skill, or even health.\n\n01:15.400 --> 01:18.900\nIt's a method of finding things out!\n\n01:18.900 --> 01:21.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
