    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:21.300\nIt's like an experiment or a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:26.500\nThink about it like this: a baking test.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:31.700\nYou bake a small piece of cake to see if the whole batch will turn out right.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:39.000\nOr, a spelling test! It shows you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:47.800\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. Doctors use tests to check your health. Teachers use tests to see what you've learned. And even engineers use tests to make sure bridges are strong enough.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:50.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and see if something is up to par. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
