    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:11.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like an experiment, but usually on a smaller scale.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:15.900\nWe use tests all the time without even realizing it.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:23.700\nThink about it. If you're baking a cake and you stick a toothpick in to see if it's done, that's a test!\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.900\nYou're testing if the cake is cooked through. Or, if you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit, that's a test too!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:36.100\nYou're testing the size. So, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:41.800\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like tasting soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:46.200\nBasically, a test is just a way of checking something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
