    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:10.700\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:19.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:25.400\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:31.500\nThink of it this way: If you want to know if a cake is done, you can use a toothpick.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.600\nThat's a test! You poke the cake, and if the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:43.700\nOr maybe you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:50.000\nYou can screw it into a lamp and turn it on. If it lights up, it passes the test.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.500\nTests can be big or small, simple or complex.\n```"
