    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into what a test is.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:12.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:17.000\nThink about it. If you want to know if a cake is done, you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake's ready.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:27.600\nOr, imagine you're learning your ABCs. Your teacher might give you a quiz to test if you know them.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:36.200\nTests aren't just in school, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and scientists use tests to see if their ideas are right.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:44.400\nSo basically, a test helps us learn something new or check if something is working. It's all about getting information!\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:47.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
