    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_135839.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, a taste test lets you find out if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:35.500\nOr a spelling test helps your teacher see if you've learned how to spell certain words. Even the weather forecast is a kind of test, predicting if it will rain!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:50.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to learn something. It can be used for almost anything, from checking if a light bulb works, to seeing how well you understand a new subject.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:56.500\nTests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "034d27b8-f3d6-41f1-a09d-d7e5f58de765": {
    "id": "034d27b8-f3d6-41f1-a09d-d7e5f58de765",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:41:06.503390",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T13:59:23.349120",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_135923.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_135923.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific answer we're looking for.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:33.500\nWe use tests all the time! When you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:45.900\nThat's a test to see if the cake is done. Or, when you try on a new pair of shoes, you're testing to see if they fit comfortably.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:55.100\nTests can be formal, like a school exam that measures what you've learned. Or, they can be informal, like checking the weather forecast before you decide what to wear.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:02.600\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something is true, correct, or working as expected. Tests help us learn, make decisions, and solve problems. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
