    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:25.400\nIt's a process designed to gather information or see how well someone, or something, performs.\nThink about it like this: a cooking test tells you if a cake is ready to come out of the oven.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:36.700\nYou poke it with a toothpick, and if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:47.100\nTests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking if a lightbulb works, to seeing how well you understand a new topic in school.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:58.600\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to learn more.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
