    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:29.200\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the strength of a bridge.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:44.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\nA taste test helps decide which cookie tastes better.\nAnd a stress test on a building checks if it can withstand strong winds.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:54.300\nSo, a test always involves a specific method or process, and gives you a result that tells you something useful about the thing being tested.\n\n00:54.300 --> 01:00.300\nIt helps you understand more or make a decision.\nTo recap, a test is a way to evaluate something and get information about it.\nIt\u2019s all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
