    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_140837.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skill, or performance.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:32.000\nA taste test figures out which food tastes better. Even a doctor's check-up is a test to see how healthy you are!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:39.700\nSo, tests aren't just about getting a grade in school. They help us learn about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:48.000\nThey give us information we can use to improve. In short, a test is just a tool for gathering information.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:54.300\nIt helps us measure something and understand it better. Pretty useful, right?\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
