    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:19.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. It's a process used to find out something specific, whether it's about an object, a person, or even an idea.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:35.100\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:47.100\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt. All of these are tests!\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:53.000\nTests can be formal, like a standardized exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The important thing is that they help us learn something.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.700\nSo, a test is just a systematic way of getting answers. Remember that.\n\n00:56.700 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
