    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:31.600\nIt's a process designed to gather information and see if something is true or working correctly.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:35.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works,\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:43.500\nso you screw it into a lamp and flip the switch.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:47.500\nThat's a test!\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:56.400\nOr maybe you're learning to ride a bike. The act of riding, wobbling, and hopefully staying upright is a test of your balance and coordination.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like trying a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:06.800\nThe key is that you're trying to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n01:06.800 --> 01:14.700\nSo, a test is just a process to gather information and check if something is right.\n\n01:14.700 --> 01:18.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
