    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:21.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:30.200\nIt's a structured way to gather information.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:38.600\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:47.900\nA teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:57.200\nA chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:06.500\nIn each case, they're using a test to get some information.\n\n01:06.500 --> 01:15.800\nThe blood test tells the doctor about your health, the quiz tells the teacher about your knowledge, and the taste test tells the chef about the flavor.\n\n01:15.800 --> 01:25.100\nSo, tests are all about gathering information in a clear and organized way.\n\n01:25.100 --> 01:34.400\nThey help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n01:34.400 --> 01:38.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
