    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE\nAll timestamps are approximate due to the dynamic nature of video generation.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, welcome! \n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.000\nToday, we're tackling something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:08.000\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:12.000\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is true.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.000\nIt can be a school exam, where you're tested on what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.000\nOr, it could be a taste test, where you decide which flavor is the best.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:27.000\nEven shaking a wrapped gift to guess what's inside is a kind of test!\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:29.000\nYou're trying to find out information.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.000\nSo, a test is all about gathering data or evidence to help you answer a question or make a decision.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:41.000\nWhether it's acing that quiz, picking your favorite ice cream, or figuring out what's in that present, you\u2019re performing a test.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:43.000\nIn short, a test is any procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:46.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
