    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE duration:58.000\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see what we get.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake and you want to know if it's done.\nYou stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:25.200\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\nThe cake is done.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:28.700\nIt comes out with batter?\nNot quite ready yet.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:35.600\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a toy needs new batteries.\nYou turn it on.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:39.700\nIf it works, the batteries are good.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:44.200\nIf it doesn't, time for new ones!\nThat's another test.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:54.400\nSo, a test is just a simple way to check something and learn more about it.\nWe use them all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
