    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.400\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true. Think of it like this: If you want to know if a lightbulb works, you can put it in a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:32.700\nThat's a test! Or, if you want to know if your cookies taste good, you can let someone try one. That's a taste test!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:40.000\nTests aren't just for objects, though. They can also be used to see how much you've learned in school,\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:44.800\nor even to see if you're healthy when you visit the doctor.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.800\nSo, tests are all about checking and verifying things. They help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
