    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_142049.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. Think of it like this: you're trying to figure something out, and a test helps you find the answer.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:25.500\nIt could be a written exam at school, sure, but it's also much more than that. A test can be anything that helps you learn about something.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:32.100\nFor example, baking a cake is a test! You're testing your recipe and your skills.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:37.200\nOr trying out a new video game? That's a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:48.200\nEven asking a friend a question is a mini-test to see what they know. So, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and gathering information.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:54.900\nIt\u2019s all about exploring and discovering. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
