    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.600\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:24.600\nIt's like asking a question and seeing if you get the right answer.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.400\nFor example, you might test if a light bulb works by screwing it into a lamp. If it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:41.500\nOr, imagine you're testing if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:51.700\nYou stick a toothpick in the middle, and if it comes out clean, the cake is ready. That's another test!\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.400\nTests are everywhere, helping us make sure things are good to go.\n```"
