    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:20.800\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something!\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:27.300\nWe use tests all the time to see how well we understand things, or how well something works.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:38.100\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\nA taste test checks how good something tastes.\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:44.600\nSo, a test is basically a way to gather information.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:55.000\nWe ask a question, or perform an action, and then look at the result.\nThat result tells us something.\nWhether you pass or fail, the test gives you information.\nIt shows you where you're strong, and where you might need to improve.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.500\nRemember, tests are just tools to help us learn and understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
