    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:06.200\nToday we're going to talk about something really important: a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:08.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:16.500\nThink of it like checking your understanding.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:22.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:25.600\nA taste test checks to see which food you like best.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:31.200\nEven a sports game is a kind of test \u2013 it tests which team is better at that sport!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:37.800\nSo, remember, a test helps us see where we're at, and what we might need to learn more about.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:39.500\nIt's a learning tool, really.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:44.700\nIn short, a test assesses knowledge or ability through a specific process.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:47.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
