    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer. For example, a math test helps us see how well you understand numbers.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:32.300\nOr, a taste test can tell us which cookie is the yummiest!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:43.400\nThe purpose of a test is to gather information. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:55.700\nAnd engineers use tests to make sure a bridge is strong enough. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.300\nBasically, a test is a tool used to evaluate or measure something.\n```"
