    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_142738.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:17.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process that helps us gather information and see how well something works, or how much of something there is.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:23.300\nThink about a spelling test in school.\nThat tests how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:31.200\nOr imagine a taste test for new ice cream flavors.\nThat helps decide which flavor people like the best.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:40.800\nAnother example could be testing the water in a swimming pool to see if it's safe to swim in.\nWe're checking for things like chemicals and bacteria.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:56.600\nSo, tests are all about gathering information.\nWhether it's your spelling skills, the deliciousness of ice cream, or the safety of swimming pool water, tests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
