    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something well.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.000\nThink about it like this: A doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:40.900\nOr, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:48.200\nTests can come in many forms. It could be a multiple-choice quiz, a physical exam,\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:55.500\nor even just trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:02.100\nThe important thing is that we're using the test to learn something new or confirm what we already know.\n\n01:02.100 --> 01:05.700\nSo, remember, a test is a way to check things and learn.\n\n01:05.700 --> 01:09.200\nIt helps us understand more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n01:09.200 --> 01:12.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
