    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out more about something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like an investigation. We ask questions or perform actions to see what happens and learn from the results.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.700\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick test. You stick a toothpick in the cake, and if it comes out clean, that means the cake is done! That's a test!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:39.100\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is working. You flip the switch. If the light turns on, the bulb passes the test!\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:52.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a simple process to gather information and see if something meets a certain requirement. It helps us understand things better and make decisions.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
