    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.300\nWhat is a test, exactly? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a process designed to gather information about a person, a thing, or even an idea. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.600\nA taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes best. And a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:45.600\nSo, whether it's learning new things, trying new flavors, or checking our health, tests help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:53.200\nThey give us valuable information we can use to make decisions. In short, a test is a way to learn!\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
