    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_143403.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:20.700\nThink of it like this: You're baking a cake. You taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:30.300\nOr, a doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see. Even a school exam is a test designed to check what you've learned!\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:42.800\nSo, a test can be a quick check, a detailed examination, or anything in between. The important thing is that it helps us get information and learn something new.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.500\nIn short, a test is a method for gathering information or evaluating something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
