    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:20.900\nIt's a process designed to gather information. Think of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:29.000\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. A doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:45.100\nTests help us understand something better, measure knowledge, or identify problems. So, whether it's a pop quiz, a science experiment, or even just trying a new recipe, you're performing a test.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:52.200\nTests are all about gathering information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
