    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:17.400\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:30.400\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nBasically, a test helps us measure or evaluate something.\nThink about it like this: a recipe is a test to see if you can bake a cake.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:35.900\nYou follow the instructions, and the result tells you if you passed the test \u2013 did you get a yummy cake?\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:49.800\nAnother example is a spelling test.\nIt checks how well you know your spelling words.\nThe more words you spell correctly, the better you did on the test.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:57.100\nSo, a test is simply a method for figuring out information, whether it\u2019s about baking, spelling, or anything else.\nIt\u2019s a way to see what you know or what something can do.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
