    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE This is a sample subtitle file.  Flesh it out with the actual narration.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like a little experiment to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:36.600\nThe main idea behind a test is to get some information.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:47.900\nWe ask a question, or we perform an action, and then we look at the result. That result tells us something!\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:59.800\nFor example, when you take a spelling test at school, it checks if you know how to spell certain words. Or, if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:03.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n```"
