    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_143818.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.500\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:35.100\nOr, a doctor might test your vision to see how well you can see. Tests aren't just for cakes and eyes, though.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:46.200\nThey're used everywhere! From checking if a car is safe to drive, to seeing if a new medicine works, tests help us make informed decisions.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:56.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something and see if it meets our expectations. It's all about getting information!\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
