    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:05.300\nToday we're diving into something called a \"Test.\"\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:08.100\nNow, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:11.500\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:16.400\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:21.600\nOr, a doctor might order a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:27.100\nTests can be simple, like tasting a new food to see if you like it.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:31.500\nOr they can be more complicated, like a math exam.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:39.400\nThe important thing is that they help us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:45.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:52.300\nIt helps us answer questions and understand the world around us better.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
