    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:20.300\nAt its most basic, a test is just a way to find something out. Think of it like an experiment, but instead of mixing chemicals, you're asking questions or trying something out.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:33.500\nSo, a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already think is true. For example, a spelling test helps your teacher see if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:45.900\nOr, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good! Another example is when you try to turn on a lightbulb, you are testing if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:55.800\nIf the light comes on, the test was successful! Basically, a test is a process to find out if something is true or correct.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:01.300\nPretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
