    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:06.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:13.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like a question that helps you understand more about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:28.000\nThe basic idea is that you give someone or something a challenge, or a set of challenges, and see how they respond.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:31.000\nThe results give you useful information.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:37.000\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:42.000\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:43.000\nSee?\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:44.000\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:53.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for gathering information by presenting a challenge and observing the response.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:58.000\nIt's a simple, but powerful tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
