  "ef4565ef-3a0e-4a54-bb43-9c3b3361f44e": {
    "id": "ef4565ef-3a0e-4a54-bb43-9c3b3361f44e",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:41:38.211216",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T14:45:23.301452",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_144523.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_144523.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:07.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information or check if something works the way it should.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:14.600\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if your cookies are done baking, you might do a little test, like poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:16.700\nIf it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:21.200\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:25.000\nA math test checks your math skills, and a spelling test checks your spelling.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:30.600\nBut tests aren't just for school! Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:36.100\nAnd engineers use tests to make sure bridges are strong enough to hold cars.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:43.900\nSo, tests are really all around us, helping us learn and making sure things are safe and working properly.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:47.500\nIn short, a test is just a way to check something!\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:50.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
