    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_144635.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:20.800\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:34.000\nIt helps you and your teachers understand what you've learned and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:46.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test shows if you understand how to add, subtract, multiply, or divide.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:55.400\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 to see if it tastes good! So, in a nutshell, a test is simply a tool for measuring knowledge or skill. It's a chance to show what you've learned, and it helps everyone learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
