    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.700\nIt's a process, like an experiment, that helps us gather information.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:33.500\nThink about it this way: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:45.300\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Even baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:54.200\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to learn something new.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.900\nThey help us understand the world around us better and make smarter decisions. Remember, a test is just a way of learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
