    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_145112.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.800\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary, but really, a test is just a way to find out what you know about something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: if you're learning to bake a cake, the final cake is the \"test\" of whether you understood the recipe.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:35.500\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big exams.\nThey help you see where you're doing well and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:48.900\nFor example, if you're learning your ABCs, a test might be naming all the letters.\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, the test is whether you can ride without falling!\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:55.500\nSo, remember, tests aren't about being perfect.\nThey're about learning and growing.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:03.800\nThey show you what you know and help you understand what you need to learn next.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
