    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out information about something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:20.700\nTests can take many forms.\nIt could be a written exam at school, like a quiz about history.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:29.100\nOr, it could be a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if the recipe works.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:35.200\nLet's say you want to know if a toy car works.\nYou put batteries in and try to turn it on.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:39.700\nThat's a test!\nIf it moves, the test passed.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:44.900\nIf it doesn't, the test failed.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:57.200\nIt helps us understand if something works, if something is correct, or if something is true.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
