    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.700\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. Think about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:35.100\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Another example could be a taste test to see which food people prefer.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:46.700\nTests come in many forms, from simple quizzes to complex experiments. The important thing is that they help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:55.200\nSo, in short, a test is a tool for learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
