    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:05.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:6.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:07.800\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:11.500\nFor example, when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:16.400\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:17.400\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:23.400\nTests can be formal, like a written exam, or informal, like checking if your bath water is the right temperature.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:27.600\nThe important thing is they help us understand something better.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:31.200\nSo, a test is a process or procedure to determine something.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:32.700\nPretty straightforward, right?\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:34.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
