    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.100\nIt's a process designed to gather information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:42.900\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. Or, you might even test out a new recipe to see if you like it!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:52.000\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes. They can be written, spoken, physical, or even just an experiment.\n\n00:52.000 --> 01:00.200\nThe important thing is they help us learn and make decisions based on the information we gather. They help us understand things better. In short, a test is a tool for discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
