    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:27.700\nIt helps us see if something works, if it's true, or how well someone understands something.\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it\u2019s durable by dropping it a few times.\nOr, a doctor might run a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\nAnother example is a teacher giving you a test in class to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:38.000\nSo, tests are just ways of gathering information.\nThey can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all help us learn and understand.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:49.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\nThat's it for today's quick intro to tests.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:53.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
