    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_150359.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find something out. It\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:33.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:36.800\nSee? Different situations, but both are ways to gather information.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:40.600\nAnother example is baking a cake.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:44.400\nYou might taste the batter before it goes in the oven. That's a test!\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:54.900\nYou're checking if it tastes good. So, a test is really just a method for checking something, whether it's your health, your understanding, or even the flavor of cake batter!\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:00.200\nIt helps us make decisions and learn more. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "7d99af6b-c01a-41ae-9163-e66467c28a10": {
