    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_150441.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs, or what it's like.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: a simple spelling test at school checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:36.700\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:48.400\nIn science, you might test if a plant grows faster with more sunlight. So, a test can be anything from a quiz to an experiment.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:51.900\nThe key thing is that it helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect. Basically, it's a way to explore and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "5c0ac3a3-09cb-4351-8570-5bfd9b259654": {
    "id": "5c0ac3a3-09cb-4351-8570-5bfd9b259654",
