    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:05.000\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:09.100\nA test, simply put, is a way to check if something works correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:09.100 --> 00:13.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:14.400\nThat's a test!\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:17.500\nOther examples? A doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:21.300\nA teacher uses tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:25.700\nEven trying out a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:33.700\nSo, tests help us understand things better and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:37.400\nThey\u2019re all about checking and confirming.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:39.300\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:43.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
