    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:30.100\nOr, you might take a test at school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:41.300\nEven baking a cake is a bit of a test! You're testing your recipe and your skills.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:49.500\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes. They help us understand things better, check if something works, or see how much we know.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:55.100\nA test helps you measure something. To sum it up, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. It's a tool for discovery! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
