    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_151047.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? \nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:26.700\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard. \nThink of it like this: a recipe test lets you see if a new cake recipe is actually delicious. \nOr, a spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:36.900\nEven a simple battery test on a toy helps you know if the batteries need changing. \nSo, tests come in many forms and help us in many different ways.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:45.800\nBasically, a test gives us information. \nIt confirms, denies, or helps us adjust things to make them better.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:55.600\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve. \nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
