    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_151153.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:13.700\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:22.200\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we understand a concept.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.700\nThink of it like this: If you want to know if a light bulb works, you put it in a lamp and turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:40.500\nOr, if your teacher wants to know if you learned about dinosaurs, they might give you a quiz. That's a test too!\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:46.800\nTests can be simple, like checking if your shoes fit, or more complex, like a medical exam.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:56.000\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us learn and improve things.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:00.300\nSo, remember, a test is a method for gathering information to determine something.\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:04.900\nWhether it's a light bulb, dinosaurs, or your shoe size, tests are all around us.\n\n01:04.900 --> 01:08.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
