    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.700\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or if you understand a new topic.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:35.300\nYou do a test!\nYou poke them with a toothpick.\nIf it comes out clean, the cookies pass the test, they're ready!\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:39.700\nOr, imagine you're learning your ABCs.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:44.100\nYour teacher might give you a little quiz.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:48.500\nThat's a test too!\nIt helps see if you've grasped the basics.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:51.900\nTests aren\u2019t scary, they just help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:54.600\nSo, tests are all about finding things out!\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
