    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:33.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, think about checking if a cake is done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:46.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the \"done-ness\" test! Tests help us make decisions.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:58.600\nA good test is reliable, meaning it gives similar results each time, and valid, meaning it actually measures what it's supposed to.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:02.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
