    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something. Think of it like a detective gathering clues.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:26.300\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. For example, a taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes best.\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:35.900\nDoctors use tests too, like checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\nSo, a test can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just an observation.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:47.600\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\nTo recap, a test helps us learn about something by giving us information.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:56.700\nThey come in many forms and are used everywhere!\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
