    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about yourself or something else.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:24.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think about it like this: your doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:32.400\nOr, maybe you took a spelling test in school to see how many words you know.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:40.600\nAnother good example is a taste test! Let's say you're trying out different flavors of ice cream.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:52.400\nEach spoonful is a little test to see which one you like the best. So, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.100\nIt helps us understand ourselves and the world around us a little better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
