    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like checking if something works or if you understand something.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:35.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\nA taste test checks if you like a certain food.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.600\nAnd a medical test, like a blood test, checks different aspects of your health.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:51.900\nSo, a test helps us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:57.100\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: to get information. That\u2019s the core concept of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
