    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_151654.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nIt could be about you, like a quiz in school, or about a product, like checking if a toy is safe.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:23.800\nThe main goal of a test is to gather information.\nThis information helps us make decisions.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:35.000\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you sick.\nOr, a company might test a new recipe to see if people like the taste.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.700\nThink of it like this: baking a cake.\nYou test the batter before it goes in the oven to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.800\nYou're gathering information to make sure the final cake is delicious!\nTesting is all about gathering information to help us understand something better.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:57.900\nSo, a test is just a way to learn more and make better choices based on what we find out.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:03.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
