    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like a way to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:33.500\nThe main idea is that you're trying to get information. You give something a test, and then you look at the results to learn more.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:42.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.500\nEven a simple taste test, like trying a new flavor of ice cream, is a kind of test! You're checking to see if you like it.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something and get information.\n```"
