    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_152202.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test is?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:10.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:18.000\nWe use them all the time! Think of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.600\nThat's a test! Or maybe you test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:36.600\nIn school, tests help us see how much we've learned. They can be written, like answering questions on paper, or practical, like showing you know how to do something.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:49.700\nIf you're learning to ride a bike, showing you can ride it without falling is a kind of test.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:55.600\nSo, a test helps us learn, helps us improve, and helps us understand things better. It's all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
