    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_152243.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out what you know, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to check your health. Or, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:34.100\nTests help us understand things better. For example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:38.400\nAnd a fitness test shows how strong and healthy you are.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:45.300\nSee? Tests are all around us! So, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge or ability.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:51.400\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
