    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.500\nIt helps us understand and measure things.\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz.\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:25.600\nIt shows what you\u2019ve learned in class.\nOr imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:30.700\nYou taste it to see if it\u2019s sweet enough.\nThat\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.100\nAnother example is testing a new toy to see if it works properly.\nWe push the buttons, see if it moves, and make sure it's fun.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:42.300\nSee?\nTests are all around us!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:47.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:55.800\nIt can be a quiz, a taste, or even playing with a new toy.\nIt helps us understand and measure things.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
