    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_152642.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: a test.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:14.200\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of school.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.000\nAnd you're right! A test is simply a way to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.600\nThink of it like this: imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:36.300\nA test would be seeing if you can actually ride it without falling.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:43.000\nOr maybe you're learning new words. A test would be seeing if you know what those words mean.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:49.700\nTests can come in lots of forms. They might be written questions, like multiple choice or fill-in-the-blanks.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:54.900\nOr they could be more hands-on, like showing someone how to do something.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.600\nThe point is to show what you've learned. So don't be afraid of tests! They're just a tool to help you learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
