    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_153104.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:11.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:23.600\nIt's a process or a procedure designed to evaluate something \u2013 whether that's your knowledge, the strength of a material, or even the presence of a specific substance.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:34.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your understanding of spelling rules.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:45.000\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. And a medical test can help doctors figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:55.800\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and making informed decisions. They help us understand things better and make choices based on evidence.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.400\nRemember, tests are just tools for learning and discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
