    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_153148.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:18.500\nThink about it. When you take a quiz in school, that's a test!\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:29.400\nIt helps your teacher understand what you've learned. Or, when a doctor checks your temperature, that's also a test, to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:35.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test. You're testing the recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:42.200\nIf it tastes good, the test passed. If not, you might need to adjust the ingredients.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:54.300\nSo, a test is really just a process for gathering information. It can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like trying out a new game.\n\n00:54.300 --> 01:00.500\nThe point is to learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
