    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. It's how we find out if something is working the way it should, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb works. You screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:30.400\nIf it lights up, the test passes! If it doesn't, the test fails.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:40.500\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature. Teachers use tests to see how well you've learned something in class.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:50.700\nSo, basically, a test is a question or a procedure designed to get an answer. It helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:60.300\nRemember, tests are everywhere, helping us figure things out all the time! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
