    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.700\nIt helps us find out if something works correctly, or if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:30.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking. You can use a toothpick to test them.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:35.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cookies are ready! That's a test.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:42.500\nOr, imagine you're checking if your bike tires have enough air. You can squeeze them \u2013 that\u2019s a simple test.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:49.200\nIf they feel firm, they\u2019re probably good to go. So, a test is just a way to examine something and see if it passes a certain standard.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:54.400\nIt\u2019s a simple way to gather information and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
