    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to learn about what a test is.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.400\nThink about it like this: a recipe is a test for making cookies. You follow the instructions, and the result tells you if the recipe works!\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.700\nOr, if you\u2019re baking a cake, poking it with a toothpick is a test to see if it\u2019s done. Clean toothpick? Cake\u2019s ready!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:41.900\nTests can be big, like a school exam, or small, like checking if your shoelaces are tied.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:51.600\nEither way, they help us learn and make sure things are working properly. So remember, a test is just a way to check something out.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
