    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:03.500\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:07.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:13.200\nIt's a process, or a procedure, designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:17.300\nThink about it like this: You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:22.100\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:23.300\nSee?\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:24.900\nDifferent things, but the same idea.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:29.700\nAnother example is testing a new recipe.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:33.900\nYou follow the directions, taste the result, and decide if it's good or needs adjustments.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:35.600\nThat's a test!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:40.500\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and improve.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:45.300\nThey give us information we can use to make better choices.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:52.700\nUnderstanding what a test is and what it does is the first step to understanding\u2026 well, a whole lot of other things!\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:55.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
