    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:24.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:30.200\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:36.300\nThink about it: a recipe is a test.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:42.400\nYou follow the instructions, and the result tells you if you can bake a cake!\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:48.500\nOr, if you touch a hot stove, that's a test to see if it's hot.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:51.000\nOuch!\n\n00:51.000 --> 01:00.400\nMore formally, a test can be a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:13.000\nThink of school tests, quizzes, or even trying to fit a puzzle piece into the right spot.\n\n01:13.000 --> 01:20.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a way of gathering information.\n\n01:20.800 --> 01:27.400\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n01:27.400 --> 01:30.300\nIt's all about asking a question and seeing what the answer is!\n\n01:30.300 --> 01:33.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
