    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_154057.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge. It helps you and others see what you've learned and where you might need a little extra practice.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:32.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes! You might have a multiple-choice test where you pick the best answer, or a short quiz with just a few questions.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:40.100\nFor example, if you're learning about colors, a test might ask you to name all the colors in a rainbow.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:48.600\nOr, if you're learning about animals, it might ask you to match an animal to its habitat. Simple as that!\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:56.800\nSo, to recap, a test is just a tool we use to check our understanding. It helps us learn and grow!\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
