    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something, or someone!\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.000\nIt's a way to measure or evaluate. Think about it like this: a simple spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:33.300\nOr, a taste test at the grocery store lets you try a new food before you buy it. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:44.900\nTests can be big, like end-of-year exams, or small, like a quick quiz. They can be written, spoken, or even hands-on.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:56.900\nThe important thing is they give us a snapshot of knowledge or ability at a specific point in time. So, remember, a test is just a tool to learn and understand.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:04.300\nIt helps us see where we are and where we need to improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
