    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us measure or evaluate skills, knowledge, or even abilities.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: a recipe test helps you see if a new cake recipe is delicious.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. There are quizzes in school that test what you've learned, or even a taste test to see which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:46.400\nThe goal is to gather information and learn something new from the results. For example, a spelling test tells you which words you need to practice, or a fitness test shows you how strong you are.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:55.800\nSo, a test is really just a tool to help us understand more about ourselves and the world around us. It's all about learning!\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
