    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_154606.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.400\nFor example, a spelling test helps us figure out how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.400\nA math test shows us what you understand about numbers.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:39.900\nAnd even a taste test helps us decide which ice cream flavor is the best!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:54.200\nTests aren't always about grades.\nSometimes they're just for fun or to learn something new.\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information or measure knowledge.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.800\nThey come in many forms, from quizzes to experiments, and they help us understand something better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
