    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_154707.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:14.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like a way to see how well you understand a topic, how strong a material is, or even how accurate a prediction might be.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:34.800\nIt's all about gathering information and measuring it against a standard.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:36.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:39.100\nA stress test on a bridge checks how much weight it can handle before breaking.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:42.500\nAnd a medical test checks your health.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:52.300\nSo, a test is essentially a process of examination to determine the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:56.000\nTests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
