    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_154749.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It's like asking a question to see if you understand the answer.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like this: Your mom might test if you brushed your teeth by asking you to open your mouth and smile.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:30.700\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to test how well you learned the material in class.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:40.800\nAnother example is a taste test! Trying a new flavor of ice cream is a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:51.600\nWe use tests all the time to learn about things and make sure they're working as they should. So, to recap, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nWe use them to learn, to check, and to explore! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
