    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_154837.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out about something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:23.700\nIt could be about your knowledge, your skills, or even how well something works.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:36.000\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:44.400\nThat\u2019s a test, too! Tests can be formal, like exams in class, or informal, like that cake tasting.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:53.100\nThey give us information and help us improve. They\u2019re used everywhere, from science experiments to checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:57.200\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information and learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
