    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.600\nWhat is a test, anyway?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:22.400\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:30.300\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou can test if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:38.500\nOr think about a spelling test at school.\nThe test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:47.300\nTests are everywhere, helping us learn and improve things.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:52.100\nWhether it's a simple check or a more complicated assessment, they help us understand what we know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:57.100\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to check something!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
