    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nA test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\nThink of it like this: you might test a new lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:23.100\nThat's a test!\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:33.800\nTests help us understand things better.\nFor example, a baker might test a recipe by baking a small batch before making a huge cake.\nThat way, they know the recipe is good!\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:44.700\nAnother example: you might test the water temperature before jumping into a pool to make sure it's not too cold.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:54.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nIt helps us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:00.300\nIt's all about finding out what's true!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
