    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:19.100\nIt's a process that helps us gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:25.600\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:31.400\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar. See?\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:37.200\nTests are everywhere! Another example is checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:43.000\nYou screw it in, flip the switch, and poof! You've tested it.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:48.300\nIf it lights up, it passes the test. If not, it fails.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:53.600\nSo, remember, a test is a process to get information.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:00.100\nIt helps us confirm things, measure things, and learn more about the world around us.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:03.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
