    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_160021.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but often in a more structured way.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:22.200\nThink about it. When you take a spelling test in school, it's testing your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.300\nOr when a doctor gives you a physical exam, they're testing your health.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:37.700\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test! You're following a recipe and testing if the ingredients and baking time will result in a delicious treat.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:49.300\nThe result of the test helps you understand something better, whether it's your understanding of a subject, your physical condition, or even if your cake recipe works.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:56.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a method of finding something out. It's a way to learn and improve!\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
