    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.500\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt's how we check if something is working, or if we understand something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a lightbulb works, you screw it in and flip the switch.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:30.500\nTests can be simple, like that, or a little more complicated.\nFor example, a math test at school helps your teacher see how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:38.300\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see what's making you feel sick.\nSo, basically, a test is an action or a series of actions, designed to give us information.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:51.300\nIt helps us confirm something, identify a problem, or measure our knowledge.\nThat's the core idea of a test!\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:58.400\nThat's the core idea of a test!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
