    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_160308.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.300\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:8.500\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:15.200\nIt's like an investigation or a little experiment.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:21.300\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:27.400\nThink about tasting a new food. You're testing to see if you like it!\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:36.200\nOr, consider when you check the weather forecast. You're testing to see if you should bring an umbrella.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:45.900\nIn school, tests help us see how well we understand a subject. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:54.400\nThe results show us what we've learned and where we might need a little extra help.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:57.000\nSo, a test is really just a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:57.900\nIt helps us discover new things, about ourselves and the world around us.\n```"
  },
