    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.600\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, but what exactly is it?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like this: you're building a tower out of blocks, and the test is seeing how tall you can make it before it falls.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:33.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nSometimes it\u2019s answering questions on paper, like in a school exam.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:48.600\nOther times, it might be a physical challenge, like seeing how fast you can run.\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling, while a math test checks your understanding of numbers.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:56.800\nA taste test checks which flavor you like best!\nSo, a test is really just a tool to measure something.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:06.000\nWhether it's knowledge, skill, or even preference, tests help us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n01:06.000 --> 01:09.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
