    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well something performs, or how much you know about a topic.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like this: a car company might test a new car to see if it's safe. Or, a teacher might give you a test in class to see how much you've learned about math.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:36.500\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes! There are quizzes, exams, experiments, and even surveys.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:45.500\nThey all help us gather information and understand something better. For example, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:53.200\nIn short, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us understand, improve, and learn.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
