    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:17.900\nA test is really just a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like checking your understanding. It's a tool teachers and instructors use to see if you've grasped the main ideas in a lesson or course.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:38.200\nThere are lots of different kinds of tests. Some are multiple choice, where you pick the best answer from a few options. Others are true or false, or even short answer where you write a sentence or two.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:47.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test checks your ability to solve problems.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:56.000\nSo, basically, a test is a way to measure your knowledge and skills. It helps you and your teachers see what you\u2019ve learned and what you might need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
