    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_162515.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:20.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:28.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:36.200\nThink about it. When you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how much you learned.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:47.600\nOr when a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:52.300\nEven tasting a new food is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:56.000\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us information.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:09.000\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from simple questions to complicated experiments. Basically, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:09.000 --> 01:12.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
