    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like a question, or a challenge, that helps us learn about ourselves, or about the world around us.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:31.300\nThere are all kinds of tests! Your doctor might give you a test to check your health.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:38.900\nYou take tests in school to see how well you understand the lessons.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:46.500\nEven trying a new recipe is kind of a test \u2013 will it taste good?\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:54.100\nFor example, a simple test could be tasting two different kinds of apples and deciding which one you like better.\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:06.600\nOr, in school, a test might ask you to answer questions about a book you read.\n\n01:06.600 --> 01:14.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool we use to learn and discover.\n\n01:14.200 --> 01:20.600\nIt helps us understand things better, whether it's about our health, our knowledge, or even just our taste in apples!\n\n01:20.600 --> 01:24.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
