    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_162722.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:02.300\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests.\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:07.100\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:13.500\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something works, or how good someone is at something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:18.600\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:23.500\nOr a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:24.800\nThey're both tests!\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:29.600\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to see if it\u2019s safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:34.500\nSo, a test can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just an observation.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:35.900\nIt's all about finding things out.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:41.600\nBasically, a test is a systematic way to evaluate something.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:46.400\nIt gives us results we can use to make decisions or learn more.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:48.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
