    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:20.800\nThink of it like an experiment where you try something out and see what happens.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:35.700\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. Maybe you want to test if a new recipe tastes good, so you let your friends try it. Or, perhaps a scientist wants to test if a new medicine works, so they give it to patients and observe the results.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:46.500\nHere\u2019s another example: let\u2019s say you\u2019re baking cookies and you change the amount of sugar. You\u2019re testing to see if that change makes the cookies taste better!\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:56.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for gathering information. It involves trying something out and observing the outcome.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:03.500\nIt\u2019s how we learn and discover new things every day. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
