    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.800\nIt's how we check if something is working, or if something is true. Think of it like this: if you want to know if a lightbulb works, you screw it into a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:31.800\nThat's a test! Or, if you're baking a cake, you can stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done. That's another test!\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:38.100\nTests can be simple like that, or a little more complicated.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:44.400\nBut the idea is always the same: to get an answer to a question.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:54.000\nSo remember, a test is just a way of checking things. It helps us learn and make sure things are working properly.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
