    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_163121.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like this: your teacher might give you a test on math to see how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:32.600\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. The goal of a test isn't just to get a good grade, but also to show you where you might need to improve.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:41.300\nFor example, if you miss a lot of questions about fractions on a math test, you know that's something you need to practice.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:44.500\nSee? Tests help us learn and grow.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:54.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge or ability. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
