    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.300\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a process or a procedure designed to measure or evaluate something specific.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.600\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:42.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it works and if you like the taste. So, tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying a new recipe.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:53.900\nBasically, any time you're trying to get information or assess something, you're performing a test. Remember, a test helps us learn and understand more.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
