    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.700\nNow, a test, in the simplest terms, is just a way to check something.\nIt's how we find out if something works, if something is true, or if something is good.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:29.300\nThink about it like this: you might test a new recipe by cooking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:42.300\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:52.700\nSo, tests can come in lots of different forms, from simple yes or no questions to big experiments.\n\n00:52.700 --> 01:01.700\nThe key thing to remember is they help us understand something better and make informed decisions. Basically, a test is a way to get information.\nIt's a check-up, a trial run, a chance to see if something measures up. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
