    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:21.400\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time in everyday life, even if we don\u2019t realize it.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:27.800\nThink about testing if a cake is done. You poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:32.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:36.800\nOr imagine checking if a light switch works.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:49.900\nYou flip it. If the light turns on, the switch passes the test. So, a test is just a process to check if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:54.900\nWhether it's baking a cake or figuring out if a lightbulb is working, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
