    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something. Think of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:25.400\nWe use tests all the time! Like when you take a spelling quiz in school \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:35.500\nOr when a doctor checks your temperature \u2013 that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:47.900\nEven trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like the taste! So, a test helps us gather information, understand things better, and make decisions.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:56.100\nIt's a fundamental tool for learning and understanding the world around us. Remember, tests aren't scary, they're just a way to learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
