    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:14.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.100\nIt's like asking a question or performing an action to see what happens.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:28.500\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:34.100\nYou're checking if the cake is done.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:41.500\nOr, imagine you're trying to find the light switch in a dark room. You reach out and flip a switch.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:46.700\nThat's a test to see if it turns on the light.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:51.200\nTests help us understand things better. They give us information we can use to make decisions. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something and get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
