    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.400\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:36.000\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it. Or, if you push a door to see if it's open, that's a test too!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:48.900\nIn science and school, tests are more formal, but the idea is the same: we're trying to learn something.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:55.700\nWe might test if a plant grows better with more sunlight, or if you understand a new math concept. Basically, a test is a tool to explore, discover, and learn. It helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
