    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_165032.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.900\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see what we've learned, or how something works.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:37.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows if you've learned your spelling words.\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which cookie recipe is the best.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:48.600\nTests aren't just for school, though!\nYour doctor might run tests to check your health, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:55.900\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us specific results.\nThey can be big and important, or small and just for fun.\nThe main thing is, they help us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
