    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.100\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. For example, your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:37.800\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:47.800\nAnother simple example is tasting food! You're testing whether you like it or not.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:57.700\nTests help us learn and understand things better. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a method of gathering information and getting answers.\n```"
