    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like this: You might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:36.700\nOr, a doctor might run tests to check your health. In school, tests help show what you've learned.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:46.700\nSo, a recipe test tells you about the food, a medical test tells you about your body, and a school test tells you about your knowledge.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.600\nThey all use questions or tasks to gather information and give you a result. Basically, a test is just a structured way to get answers! It helps us learn, improve, and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
