    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_165634.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.800 --> 00:5.300\nToday we're going to talk about tests \u2013\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:8.300\nspecifically, what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.300 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:20.300\nIt\u2019s a process, a question, or a task designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or even your opinion on something.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:27.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:32.300\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:37.900\nEven a simple question like, \"Are you feeling okay?\" is a type of test to gauge someone's well-being.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:43.800\nTests help us learn where we\u2019re strong and where we need to improve.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:46.600\nThey can also help us make decisions.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:52.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:57.900\nIt\u2019s a way to understand something better.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
