    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_165722.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.600\nThink of a test as a way to see what you know or how well something works.\nIt's like a checkpoint to make sure everything is on track.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:27.400\nIn simple terms, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\nThis could be your knowledge, a product's quality, or even a scientific theory.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:39.000\nFor example, a quiz in school is a test of what you've learned in class.\nOr, a taste test for a new cookie recipe checks if people actually like it.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:49.700\nEven scientists run tests to see if their ideas about the world are correct.\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for checking something.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:59.300\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
