    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information about something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You turn it on \u2013 that\u2019s your test!\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:26.600\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.300\nYour doctor gives you a check-up? That's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:36.000\nTaking a quiz in school? That\u2019s a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:45.500\nEven trying a new recipe is a test \u2013 will it taste good? Tests help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:51.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:59.300\nIt can be as simple as turning on a light or as complex as a medical exam. The goal is always the same: to learn something new! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
