    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:20.100\nIt helps us understand if something is working, if something is true, or how well someone knows something.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:30.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you know.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:36.500\nAnother example? A baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:46.700\nIt\u2019s all about checking and understanding. So, to recap, a test is a process used to gather information and evaluate something.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:55.900\nIt could be anything from a medical checkup to a quiz at school. Hopefully, this gives you a basic understanding of what a test is.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
