    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.200\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:21.700\nThat's a test! You're testing if the lightbulb turns on.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:27.000\nTests are everywhere. Your doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.300\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:39.500\nEven baking a cake is a test! You're testing if the recipe works and if you followed it correctly.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:55.700\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a process used to determine if something is working properly, meeting a standard, or just behaving as expected. Tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
