    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:24.800\nIt's a process we use to get information or check if something is working the way it should. Think about it like this: a spelling test at school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:32.600\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might take a little taste \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:44.600\nTests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like checking if your shoes are tied tight. The important thing is they help us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:54.100\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information and evaluate something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
