    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test, in the simplest terms, is a way to see what you know or what something can do.\nIt's like a check-up for your brain or even for a machine!\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:25.700\nWe use tests all the time. Think about it: a spelling test in school checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:37.700\nOr, if you're trying out a new video game, playing it is a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:47.700\nEven a doctor giving you an exam is running tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:57.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to evaluate something. It helps us understand what's known or how well something works. They can be formal, like in school, or informal, like trying something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
