    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:14.900\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, you've probably heard that word a lot, but what exactly is a test?\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:32.800\nIt could be checking if you understand something, checking if something works, or even checking if something is true.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:42.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to check if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz at school to test what you've learned.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:45.800\nAnother example is testing a new toy to make sure it's safe before kids play with it.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:50.700\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:53.100\nThey're a really important part of understanding the world around us.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:53.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
