    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: you're trying to figure out how well you know your alphabet. A simple alphabet test would check if you can name all the letters.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:32.200\nOr maybe you want to see if you can ride a bike. The test would be\u2026well, riding a bike!\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:45.800\nIf you can balance and pedal without falling, you pass the test. Tests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:53.900\nThe key is that it's an activity designed to give you information. So, a test helps you learn where you stand.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
