    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something.\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:25.400\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\nIn school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:29.800\nBut tests aren't just for school!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:38.200\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might test the oven temperature to make sure it's hot enough.\nOr, you might taste the batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:47.400\nThose are tests too!\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check if something is right or works the way it should.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:54.600\nIt helps us learn and make sure things are going as planned.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
