    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:01.000 --> 00:02.300\nToday we're talking about something super important: tests!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:04.900\nA test is simply a way to check how well you understand something, or how well something works.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:08.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if you learned your multiplication tables, so you take a math test.\n\n00:08.800 --> 00:13.100\nOr, you want to see if a new toy car goes fast, so you test it out on a ramp.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:17.000\nTests can be written, like a quiz, or they can be hands-on, like trying a new recipe.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.600\nAnother example: a doctor might do a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:24.500\nBasically, a test helps you find out information.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:28.800\nSo, tests are all about checking understanding or performance.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:31.200\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:33.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
