    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something, like checking if your answer to a math problem is correct,\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:24.900\nor checking if a lightbulb works. Think of it like this: you're baking a cake.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:32.500\nYou use a toothpick to test if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:37.500\nOr maybe you're learning to ride a bike. You test your balance.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:50.800\nIf you stay upright, you pass that test! Tests help us know if something is working, if something is true, or if we're on the right track.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.400\nSo, a test is just a way of checking to see if something meets a certain standard. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
