    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us gather information and learn more about a specific thing.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:24.600\nThink about it: a recipe test tells you if your cake will taste good. Or, a medical test tells your doctor about your health.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:31.800\nThey're all tests! For example, if you're learning to ride a bike, trying to balance is a test.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:41.300\nYou're testing your ability to stay upright. And when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:50.500\nSo remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see how something works or how well you understand something. It\u2019s all about learning and improving!\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
