    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_172841.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.700\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in general, a test is just a way to check if something works the way it\u2019s supposed to.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you test it by poking it with a fork.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:33.200\nIf the fork comes out clean, the cake is done! Or maybe you\u2019re buying a new toy.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:40.400\nYou test it by turning it on and seeing if it lights up or makes noise.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:52.000\nTests are super important because they help us find mistakes and make sure things are working properly. Whether it's baking a cake, playing with a toy, or even something more complicated like building a bridge, testing makes sure everything is safe and reliable.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:59.300\nSo remember, a test is simply a way of checking if something works.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
