    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.500\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check something.\nThink of it like trying to figure out if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:24.300\nWe use tests all the time!\nWhen you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nOr, maybe you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:38.200\nFalling down is a test!\nIt helps you figure out what not to do next time.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:49.700\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something.\nIt helps us see if something is right, wrong, or somewhere in between!\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:57.200\nKeep testing, keep learning, and keep growing!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
