    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:31.300\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:43.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it works!\nTests can be simple, like tasting a new food to see if you like it.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:55.500\nOr they can be more complicated, like a science experiment to see if a hypothesis is correct.\nThe important thing is that a test helps us learn and understand more about the world around us.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find something out.\n```"
