    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:32.100\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to test your understanding of a lesson.\nOr, a software company tests its new program to make sure it doesn't have any bugs.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:41.900\nTests can be written, like an exam, or practical, like a driving test.\nThey help us measure knowledge, skills, or performance.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:52.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:59.000\nSo, tests are a fundamental tool for measuring and evaluating all sorts of things.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:02.200\nRemember, a test helps us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n01:02.200 --> 01:04.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
