    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_173202.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:26.900\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge, skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:33.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:45.700\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which cookie tastes the best. Tests aren't just for school, though!\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:56.600\nScientists use tests to see if a new medicine works. Engineers use tests to make sure a bridge is safe. Basically, any time you need to gather information and make a judgement, you're probably using some kind of test. So, a test is a tool to help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
