    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_173855.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process that helps us gather information.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:23.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, you take a test in school to show what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:29.300\nIn cooking, you might taste the sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:40.700\nSee? Different types of tests everywhere. So, a test can be a quiz, a physical exam, or even just trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:49.100\nThe important thing is that it helps us understand something better. Tests are super helpful for learning and making decisions.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:57.000\nBasically, a test is just a way to gather information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
