    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:40.300\nOr, a taste test checks if you like the flavor of something. Even trying to turn on a light switch is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the light will turn on!\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:47.500\nSo, a test is just a procedure, or action, we take to gather information. We ask a question, perform an action, and then look at the result.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:55.700\nThat result tells us something! So, remember, a test is all about finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
