    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_174309.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.500\nIt\u2019s a process we use to gather information and see how well something works, or how much someone knows.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:31.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how many words you can spell correctly. Or, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes best.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.200\nSee? Different kinds of tests, different kinds of information.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:43.800\nAnother example is a simple battery test. You use a tester to see how much power is left in the battery.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:48.500\nIf the light turns green, the battery is good! If it's red, you need a new one.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:59.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or check on something you already have. They help us understand the world around us a little bit better.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:03.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
