    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's how we check if something is true, works correctly, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:27.400\nThink about it like this: You might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\nOr, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:34.400\nIn school, a test helps your teacher see how well you've learned a subject.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:40.900\nHere's another example.\nBefore a car is sold, it goes through safety tests to make sure it's safe to drive.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:47.700\nSee?\nTests are everywhere!\nThey help us make sure things are accurate, reliable, and safe.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:56.000\nSo, a test is really just a process for gathering information and making sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:01.800\nThey come in all shapes and sizes and help us understand the world around us.\n\n01:01.800 --> 01:04.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
