    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_175610.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:14.000\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:23.000\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\nThink of it this way: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:36.300\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nAnother example could be testing the temperature of your bath water to make sure it's not too hot or too cold.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:43.500\nYou're testing the water with your hand!\nSo, remember, a test helps us learn information.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.900\nWe use them to measure things, check for problems, or just to get a better understanding.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
