    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_175705.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let\u2019s talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like an experiment, but often much simpler.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:23.600\nWe use tests all the time to see if something is working, to check if something is true, or even just to see how good something is.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, you might test a new lightbulb to see if it lights up. Or, a doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:43.800\nEven baking a cake is kind of like a test \u2013 you're testing your recipe! So, tests help us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:51.700\nThey're a fundamental part of understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
