    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:06.600\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:10.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:17.400\nIt's a process designed to give us information about something specific.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:27.100\nOr, a doctor might test your vision to see how well you can see.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:29.800\nTests aren't just in school!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:30.900\nThey're everywhere.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:36.200\nA chef tests a soup, a mechanic tests a car, and you even test different routes to school to find the fastest one!\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:42.300\nSo, a test is really just a smart way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:44.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
