    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt could be about you, like a quiz to see what kind of pizza topping you are, or it could be about something else entirely.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\nYour test?\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:30.200\nSticking a toothpick in it.\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:37.000\nOr, maybe you want to know if your friend knows their colors.\nYou ask them to point to the blue one.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:43.200\nThat's a test too!\nTests help us understand things better by giving us information.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:49.400\nThey can be fun, like quizzes, or important, like a doctor testing your eyesight.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:57.000\nSo, a test is just a way of asking a question and getting an answer to learn something new.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
