    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:25.700\nWe use them all the time, whether we realize it or not. Think about it: When you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n \n00:25.700 --> 00:36.800\nOr when you flip a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n \n00:36.800 --> 00:46.400\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, true or false, or even writing an essay.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:52.800\nThe goal is to show what you know. So, a test is just a tool to learn information or check if something is working as expected. It helps us understand things better! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
