    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an answer, you\u2019re getting information that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:29.000\nTests can be anything from a quiz in school to checking if a lightbulb works.\nThe main idea is that you\u2019re doing something to see what the result will be.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:40.300\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\nOr, you might test a recipe by making a small batch before you make a whole cake.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:47.600\nYou're trying it out to see if it works!\nSo, remember, a test is a way to get information.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:54.500\nIt's about trying something to learn more.\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
