    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:29.000\nFor example, a common test is a multiple-choice quiz at school.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.400\nThe questions are designed to test what you've learned in class.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:41.800\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:53.600\nYou're testing to see if it needs more sugar. Tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The important thing is they help us understand something better.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:59.800\nSo, a test is basically a method of gathering information to learn more about a specific subject or quality. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
