    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:29.800\nIt's a question or a set of questions designed to check knowledge, ability, or even something like the quality of a product.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:33.400\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test of your understanding.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:47.100\nOr imagine you're baking a cake and you taste it to see if it needs more sugar.\nThat's a test too!\nYou're testing the flavor.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:53.300\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is running a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.800\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give us information.\n```"
