    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:18.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:28.600\nBasically, a test helps us figure out if something works the way it's supposed to, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:37.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A medical test checks if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:50.900\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a mini-test to see if the lightbulb is working. So, remember, a test is a way to check if something is working, or if something is true. It's that simple!\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
