    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.500\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something. Think of it like asking a question and then getting an answer that helps you understand things better.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:25.300\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school. That test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:31.700\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might test the batter by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:37.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test too!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:47.300\nTests can be used to check all sorts of things, from how well you understand a book, to whether a piece of equipment is working correctly.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:57.900\nThe important thing is that a test gives you information. So, remember, a test is just a tool to gather information and learn more.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:04.800\nIt helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
