    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is true, correct, or working properly.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: A spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:39.400\nA taste test helps you decide which food tastes best. Or, imagine testing a new toy to see if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.900\nSo, tests can be used to check knowledge, preferences, or even the quality of something. They give us information to make better decisions or learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:53.400\nIn short, a test is a tool for learning and discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
