    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:23.200\nYou're checking to see if it meets your expectation, which is to light up.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:28.500\nWe use tests all the time. Did you study enough for that history quiz? The quiz is the test!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:32.500\nDid you bake the cake long enough? Sticking a toothpick in it is a test to see if it\u2019s done.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:44.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to see if something works or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:50.700\nIt helps us learn and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.300\nPretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
