    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:19.000\nSimply put, a test is just a way to see how much you know about something. Think of it like this: your brain has learned a bunch of information, and a test helps show what you\u2019ve remembered.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:26.000\nIt can be anything! Like a spelling test in school, which checks your knowledge of spelling words.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.000\nOr even a taste test! If you try two different cookies and say which one you like better, that's a test of your preference.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:46.000\nTests aren't meant to be scary. They're just tools to help you and your teachers understand what you're learning well and what you might need a little extra help with.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:53.000\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check your knowledge or preference about something.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
