    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.300\nA test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it like a question, or a series of questions, designed to see what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:28.100\nFor example, you might take a math test at school to see how well you understand fractions. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:31.900\nSee? Different situations, same idea!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:39.900\nAnother example could be testing a new toy. You play with it to see if it's fun and if it works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:53.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for gathering information. It helps us understand things better, whether it's your knowledge, your health, or even how good a toy is.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:59.000\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
