    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.300\nIt's a process used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. Think about it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:36.700\nOr, if you take a taste test, you're finding out which flavor you like the best. Even a weather test, like looking outside to see if it's raining, is a form of testing!\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:51.500\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes and help us understand things better. They can be used to measure progress, identify strengths and weaknesses, or just to explore new possibilities.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:59.400\nIn short, a test is simply a method for getting information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
