    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:14.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone understands something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like a quick check-up.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:34.300\nBasically, we're trying to find out if something passes or fails.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:37.300\nFor example, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it cures a disease.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:44.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a test in school to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:52.200\nSee? It's all about checking something. Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:52.200 --> 01:02.300\nYou might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through. That's a test! Or, if you're building a bridge, you'll test the materials to make sure they're strong enough.\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:10.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a process used to evaluate something, to see if it meets a certain standard or criteria.\n\n01:10.400 --> 01:18.500\nIt can be used in science, school, or even baking! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
