    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests, what they are, and why we use them.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:23.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or what you can do.\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words, or a fitness test to see how many push-ups you can do.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.500\nTests aren't just for school.\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy, or a chef might taste a dish to test its flavor.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:40.300\nSo, tests help us measure things, understand things, and improve.\nThey give us information.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:49.600\nIn short, a test is a tool to help you see where you are and where you can go.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
