    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.800\nA test is really just a way to find out something about something. \nThink of it as a question or a series of questions designed to give you an answer.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:21.800\nIt could be a test in school to see how much you\u2019ve learned, or a test to see if a new medicine works.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:31.700\nThe important thing is, tests help us gather information. \nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:36.700\nOr a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:44.400\nSee? \nWe use tests all the time! \nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for getting information.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:50.300\nIt helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
