    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. The toothpick is the test.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:30.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test result tells you the cake is ready. If it's gooey, the cake needs more time.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:46.600\nTests aren't just for baking, of course! Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, teachers use tests to see what you've learned, and even video games use tests to see if you can jump high enough to reach a platform.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:52.000\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.600\nNow you know! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
