    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:30.500\nThink of it like a little investigation. We want to learn more, so we ask a question and see what the answer is.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:37.300\nFor example, a simple math test might ask \"What is 2 + 2?\" The test is seeing if you know the answer.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:42.300\nOr, think about a taste test!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:54.400\nYou're trying different foods to see which one you like best. That's a test too! Tests help us understand things better. They can show us what we know, what we need to learn, and what we prefer.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:57.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
