    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.300\nThat toothpick is your test! In school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the material they've been teaching.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:40.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:45.900\nA math test checks if you can solve problems.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:52.000\nTests aren't just for school, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Car mechanics use tests to find out what's wrong with your car.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:58.100\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something is working or understood correctly. It helps us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
