    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:26.400\nIt's a process or procedure designed to measure or evaluate a specific skill, knowledge, or ability.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:36.300\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:46.000\nOr a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar. In school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned in class.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:55.700\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to see if it's safe for kids to play with. Or, testing a recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:02.500\nSo, a test is really just a way to get information and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:02.500 --> 01:05.500\nIt's all about finding out.\n\n01:05.500 --> 01:14.700\nTo recap, a test helps us evaluate, measure, and understand something better.\n\n01:14.700 --> 01:18.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
