    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.100\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s a process, or a procedure, designed to evaluate something specific.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. A taste test helps decide which flavor of ice cream is the best.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:34.900\nAnd a medical test can help a doctor figure out if you\u2019re healthy. So, tests can be used for all sorts of things!\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:46.900\nThey help us measure skills, find out information, or even just decide what we like best. Remember, a test is just a tool to learn more about something.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:53.300\nThat's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
