    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:07.500\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:27.000\nIt could be anything, from a quiz at school to checking if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.000\nThe main idea is that you're doing something, then observing the result.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:37.500\nThe result tells you if you got the answer right, or if the cake is ready.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:40.500\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:47.500\nOr, when you poke a cake with a toothpick and it comes out clean, that's a test to see if it's baked through.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:48.500\nSee?\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:50.000\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:54.500\nSo, remember, a test is simply a process for gathering information.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:00.000\nYou do something, you see what happens, and that tells you something important.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
