    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary, but really, a test is just a way to check what you know.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:20.700\nIt's like a snapshot of your understanding.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:31.100\nThink of it this way: imagine you're learning to ride a bike. A test would be someone watching you ride to see if you can balance and pedal.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:42.800\nOr, if you're learning the alphabet, a test might be naming the letters. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes, from quizzes to exams, but the goal is always the same: to see how well you've learned something.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:49.900\nThey help you and your teachers understand what you're doing well and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:56.800\nBasically, a test is a tool for learning. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
