    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.400\nIt's like a little investigation. Think about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:34.300\nOr, a doctor might run some tests to see how healthy you are. Even a company testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids, that's a test too!\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:46.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple yes or no questions to complicated experiments. The important thing is they help us understand things better.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:55.100\nSo, remember, a test is a way to learn and measure something. It helps us understand the world around us!\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
