    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.600\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:23.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:37.200\nThat's a test! We use tests all the time. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:50.400\nOr your teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing if the recipe works!\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:58.700\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. They're a really important tool for understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
