    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Welcome to the basics of tests.\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:20.800\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you get the right answer.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:32.200\nWe use tests every day without even realizing it. When you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good. Or, if you press the power button on your TV, you're testing to see if it turns on.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:37.000\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:41.800\nA multiple-choice quiz is a test. So is spelling a word correctly.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:48.500\nThey show what you know! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:54.400\nIt can be big or small, formal or informal. It's all about finding out information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
