    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_185147.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! You've probably taken a test before, but what is a test, really?\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:18.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:28.500\nIt\u2019s like a snapshot of your current understanding.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:36.000\nThink about it like this: if you\u2019re learning to bake a cake, a taste test is a way to see if you followed the recipe correctly and if it tastes good.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:46.500\nOr, if you're practicing basketball, shooting free throws is a test of your aiming skills.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:53.300\nSee? Tests aren't always scary! They help you, or someone else, see where you're doing great and what areas you might need to work on a bit more. So, tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
