    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.500\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:11.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like a little investigation. We ask a question, or present a challenge, and see what happens.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:33.300\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test lets us figure out which flavor of ice cream is the most delicious!\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:43.200\nTests aren't just about grades in school, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:55.600\nSo, a test is just a tool. It helps us gather information and learn more. Whether it's a pop quiz, a science experiment, or even trying a new recipe, you're performing a test!\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
