    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn or make a decision.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:21.800\nThere are all sorts of tests. A quiz at school helps your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:30.600\nA taste test lets you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. And even checking if a light bulb works is a type of test!\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:41.600\nFor example, you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your words. Or, you could do a simple test by dropping a ball to see if it bounces.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:55.900\nThe results, whether good or bad, give you information. So, a test is just a way to gather information, learn something new, or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:01.800\nIt's all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
