    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.900\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:37.000\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to show what you've learned. Even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:48.600\nSo, a test can be anything from a blood sample to a survey, or even just trying something new. It all boils down to gathering information.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:55.600\nWe do tests all the time, even without realizing it, to learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.200\nBasically, a test helps us answer a question or solve a problem. It's a tool for discovery! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
