    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.100\nIt could be about your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:35.900\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.600\nA taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes best. And a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:53.900\nSo, tests help us measure and understand things. They give us information we can use to make decisions or learn more.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
