    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:32.000\nThink of it like an experiment, but not always in a lab! We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:43.300\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're basically testing it out to see if it tastes good. Or, if you press a light switch and the light doesn\u2019t turn on, you're testing to see if the bulb is working.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:52.000\nMaybe the bulb is bad, that's the result of your test! Tests help us understand things, confirm guesses, and learn new information.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:58.700\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like figuring out why your internet isn't working.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:01.300\nUltimately, a test is just a way to gather evidence and draw a conclusion. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
