    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:30.300\nThat's a test! Or, when you get a new toy, you might try it out to see if it does what it's supposed to.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:42.200\nThat's also a test! Tests aren't just for school or toys, though. Scientists use tests to see if a new medicine works, and engineers use tests to make sure a bridge is safe.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:54.100\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and make sure things are working correctly. Basically, a test is a way to check and see what's up.\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:00.100\nAnd that's tests in a nutshell! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
