    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHello, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:11.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:20.100\nIt helps us measure or understand something better. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:27.500\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how much you've learned. Tests can come in many forms!\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:36.100\nThey can be written, spoken, or even a physical activity. The important thing is they give us information.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.100\nSo, a test helps us learn about ourselves, objects, or situations. It's all about gathering information.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:55.300\nIn short, a test is a tool used to gather information and measure something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
