    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nA test is basically a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. In school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:37.900\nThey might be multiple choice, like \"What color is the sky?\", or maybe you have to write an answer. Outside of school, a software developer might run a test to make sure a new app doesn't crash.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:48.500\nOr a chef might taste-test a new recipe to see if it's delicious! So, a test is really just a process to check something and get some information.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:58.600\nIn short, tests help us understand things better and make sure they're working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
