    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:24.200\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate or measure something specific. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:31.700\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes best! Tests aren't just for school, though.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:39.000\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy, or a mechanic might test your car to find out what's wrong.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:53.700\nSo, tests help us learn things, evaluate things, and make decisions. They come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic goal: to provide information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:59.100\nRemember, a test helps us find something out!\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
