    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:07.100\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:10.800\nhow much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:15.100\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb is good.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:17.900\nYou screw it in, and if it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:20.200\nTests are used everywhere.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:25.100\nYour school exams are tests to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:28.400\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:32.400\nEven baking a cake involves testing \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick to see if it\u2019s done.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:40.300\nSo, whether it's a quiz, a medical check-up, or even checking if your cake is ready, a test helps us understand something better.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:42.700\nTests give us information.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:45.000\nThey help us make decisions.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:47.200\nAnd they help us learn!\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
