    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.300\nNow, you might think of school, but a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:30.800\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information about something specific. Think of it like this: a taste test to see if you like a new flavor of ice cream, that's a test! Or, checking the temperature outside to see if you need a jacket, that's another kind of test.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:40.100\nWe\u2019re testing the temperature! Doctors use tests to see if you\u2019re healthy, mechanics test cars to see if they're running smoothly.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:46.500\nSo, a test is just a way of checking something to learn more about it. Simple as that!\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:50.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
