    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the very basics of what a test is.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:40.700\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it! Or, if you\u2019re learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test to see if you can balance. Tests can also be more formal, like a quiz at school to see how much you've learned, or a medical test to check your health.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:49.500\nThe important thing is that a test helps us gather information. It gives us results that we can use to understand something better.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:58.800\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to learn or check something. It helps us gather information and get results.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:06.400\nI hope this helps you understand the core concept of a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
