    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.300\nIt's a procedure designed to reveal information about a person, thing, or situation.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:35.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:40.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:49.100\nSo, tests come in many forms. They can be written, like exams. They can be practical, like a driving test.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:59.700\nOr they can be experiments, like trying out a new plant fertilizer. The key thing is that they provide information or evidence.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:03.300\nIn short, a test is a systematic way to gather information\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:06.900\nand learn something new.\n\n01:06.900 --> 01:10.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
