    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your brain! It can come in many forms, like multiple choice questions, true or false statements, or even short answers.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:31.200\nThe goal is to see what you've learned and understood.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:44.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a math test might ask you to solve equations.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:52.000\nThese examples help teachers and even yourself understand where you're doing well and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.700\nSo, a test is just a tool to check your knowledge and help you learn better. It's nothing to be afraid of! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
