    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHello everyone, and welcome! \nToday, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? \nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. \nIt can be a written quiz in school, designed to see what you've learned.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:32.900\nOr it could be a medical test, like taking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\nEven tasting a new recipe to see if it needs more salt is a kind of test!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:43.100\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and improve things. \nThey give us information so we can make better decisions.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:52.400\nTests are all around us, helping us understand the world a little bit better. \nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
