    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:17.800\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:28.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Basically, a test involves asking a question or performing an action to see what happens.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:37.700\nThe answer or result tells us something we didn't know before.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:46.600\nThink about it: a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor. A spelling test shows you which words you know how to spell.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:53.400\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:57.000\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. They are a valuable tool to understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
