    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.100\nIt could be anything from checking if a lightbulb works to seeing how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:30.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough. Or, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel unwell.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:41.800\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, short answer, or even hands-on projects.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:55.300\nSo, tests are really just tools that help us learn and understand things better. They help us check if something works, see how much we know, or figure out what needs improvement.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:05.000\nUnderstanding what a test is for, is the first step to feeling confident when you take one. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
