    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:11.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be about anything!\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:20.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:29.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:48.300\nA teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned in class. Even trying a new cookie recipe is a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:56.700\nSo, whether it's a quiz in school, a medical check-up, or even experimenting in the kitchen, tests help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:05.100\nThey give us valuable information. In short, a test is a method of gathering data to evaluate something.\n\n01:05.100 --> 01:11.300\nThat's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
