    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:26.000\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\nThink of it like this: your mom might test the temperature of your forehead to see if you have a fever.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.900\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, falling down a few times is kind of a test to see if you've got the hang of it yet.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:51.900\nSchools use tests to see how well you're learning the material.\nSo, tests can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all have the same goal: to get information and see how things are going.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:57.900\nThey help us improve and learn.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
