    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test is basically a way to see what you know or what you can do. Think of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:23.500\nTests come in many forms. It could be a written exam with questions to answer, like multiple choice or fill-in-the-blanks.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:32.700\nOr, it could be a practical test where you show someone how to do something, like baking a cake or playing a musical instrument.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:42.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words. A driving test checks your ability to safely operate a car.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:45.700\nSee how that works?\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:53.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a method used to evaluate skills or knowledge. They help you and others understand what you've learned and where you might need to improve.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
