    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:06.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:09.000\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:19.000\nIt could be about you, about an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:28.000\nOr, you might test a cake recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:29.000\nSee?\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:31.000\nDifferent situations, same idea.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:38.000\nAnother example is when you take a spelling test in school.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:44.000\nThat test helps your teacher understand what words you know and which ones you still need to practice.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:48.000\nIt helps them figure out how to best help you learn!\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:53.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool we use to learn more about something.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.000\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
