    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_195212.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:29.200\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Tests help us figure out if something is working correctly, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:35.800\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:45.600\nOr, a doctor might run a test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:57.000\nAnother example is baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it's sweet enough! So, tests are all around us, helping us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.600\nThey help us confirm things, and find out if we're on the right track. In short, a test is a way to check, question, and understand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
