    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:07.500\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:11.700\nIt could be anything, really.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:14.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:21.000\nWe use tests all the time without even realizing it.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:25.400\nLike, if you touch a hot stove, that's a test to see if it's hot!\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:30.100\nOr, if you try a new flavor of ice cream, you're testing if you like it.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:33.600\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:39.300\nIf you\u2019re baking a cake, tasting the batter is a test to make sure it's sweet enough.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:45.600\nSee?\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:49.500\nTests are everywhere, helping us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:54.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:57.500\nIt's about exploring and finding things out.\n\n00:57.500 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
