    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_195352.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.200\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's too hot or just right.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:29.300\nOr maybe you test a cookie to see if it's baked all the way through. In school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:38.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell certain words. A math test checks if you can solve problems.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:45.800\nTests aren't meant to be scary! They\u2019re just a way to see what you know and what you might need a little more help with.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:54.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a check-up on your knowledge. It helps you and your teachers understand where you're at.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
