    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.900\nHey there! Welcome! \n\n00:01.900 --> 00:09.600\nToday, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:09.600 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:25.200\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:30.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:37.900\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:42.900\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:50.600\nAnother example is when you try a new toy. You play with it to see if it's fun and if it works the way it should.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.100\nThat's testing the toy! So, a test is just a way to find out information about something.\n```"
