    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test is.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nThink about it: when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like the taste.\nOr, when you press a button on a remote control, you're testing if it will change the channel.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:36.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\nSo, a test can be anything from a simple experiment to a formal exam.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:47.000\nThe key is that it helps us gather information and understand something better.\nRemember, tests aren\u2019t scary, they\u2019re just tools for learning!\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
