    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_195818.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.500\nIt's a process that helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:33.900\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a physical exam.\nThat\u2019s a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:46.900\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it\u2019s done \u2013 that's a test too!\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:59.200\nTests can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb works by flipping the switch.\nOr, they can be more complex, like taking a school exam to show what you've learned.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.600\nThe main idea is always the same: to get information and learn something new.\n\n01:02.600 --> 01:05.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check things and gain knowledge.\n01:05.600 --> 01:08.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
