    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_195913.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we\u2019re diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:22.200\nTests help us learn about things we can't see directly.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:33.900\nFor example, a doctor uses a blood test to see what's happening inside your body.\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:38.800\nAnother example?\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:46.100\nImagine you're building a tower out of blocks.\nYou might gently push it to test if it's stable.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:50.700\nIf it falls, you know you need to build it differently.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:55.300\nSee?\nTests are everywhere, helping us learn and improve.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:07.200\nSo, remember, a test is a process to gather information or evaluate something.\nIt helps us understand, diagnose, or predict.\n\n01:07.200 --> 01:10.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
