    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test is.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:13.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:34.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:46.300\nOr, a taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you like best. Even checking if a lightbulb works is a type of test! You're testing if it lights up.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:55.800\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give us information and help us make decisions. They're used in school, in science, and even in everyday life.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.400\nRemember, a test is just a way to learn more! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
