    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_200044.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:14.500\nToday, we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:24.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:31.700\nThink of it like this: you study for a math quiz, right? That quiz is a test to see how well you understand the math concepts.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:48.300\nTests aren't just for school, though. Maybe you take a driving test to prove you can safely operate a car. Or even a taste test to see which flavor of ice cream you like best! So, whether it's a pop quiz, a written exam, or even trying out a new recipe, a test is really just a tool to measure knowledge or ability. Remember that!\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:53.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
