    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:26.500\nThink about it: when you go to the doctor, they might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:31.100\nOr, when you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\nThose are both tests!\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:39.100\nAnother example is a spelling quiz.\nYour teacher tests your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:48.300\nOr even trying out a new recipe is a test \u2013 will it taste good?\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:55.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something, learn something new, or see if something works.\nIt helps us understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
