    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:19.600\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:29.800\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:43.000\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:52.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it comes out delicious!\n\n00:52.700 --> 01:05.000\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and even just have fun. They're a fundamental part of understanding the world around us.\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:14.700\nFrom checking your spelling to checking the weather, tests are everywhere.\n\n01:14.700 --> 01:25.300\nIn short, a test is a method for gathering information. It can be simple or complex, but the basic idea is always the same: to learn something new.\n\n01:25.300 --> 01:28.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
