    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_200304.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE duration:52.0\n1\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n2\n00:02.300 --> 00:05.700\nYou've probably taken a bunch of them in school, but what exactly is a test?\n\n3\n00:05.700 --> 00:09.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something.\n\n4\n00:09.200 --> 00:14.700\nIt could be your knowledge of a subject, your ability to solve problems, or even how well a product works.\n\n5\n00:14.700 --> 00:18.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test measures how well you know your spelling words.\n\n6\n00:18.200 --> 00:20.600\nA taste test measures how good a food tastes.\n\n7\n00:20.600 --> 00:23.500\nEven a doctor uses tests to check your health!\n\n8\n00:23.500 --> 00:27.000\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n9\n00:27.000 --> 00:31.300\nThey help us understand where we are, and what we might need to work on.\n\n10\n00:31.300 --> 00:33.300\nThey give us information.\n\n11\n00:33.300 --> 00:37.800\nIn short, a test is a tool for measurement and learning.\n\n12\n00:37.800 --> 00:39.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
