    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.600\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:27.200\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or if you understand a new concept.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:31.600\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you test it by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:42.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test. Or imagine taking a spelling test in school.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:50.500\nThat's a test to see how well you've learned your spelling words. Tests help us understand if something is working as it should, or if we need to learn more.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.100\nSo, tests are essentially just a way to learn and improve. Tests are everywhere and help us learn and improve!\n```"
