    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:17.000\nA test, simply put, is a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you information.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:25.600\nFor example, a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:30.000\nOr, think about baking a cake. Tasting it is a test!\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:34.400\nIt tells you if it tastes good.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:42.100\nAnother example is checking if your shoes fit. You try them on and that's a test to see if they're the right size.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:50.100\nTests aren't just in school, they're everywhere! They help us learn and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:56.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\nIt can be a quiz, a taste, or even just trying something out.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:03.700\nTests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
