    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.500\nNow, a test, in simple terms, is just a way to find out something.\nWe use them to check if things are working correctly, or to see what someone knows.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:28.100\nThink about it like this: A doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to test what you've learned in class.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:31.900\nAnother example? Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:39.400\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that\u2019s a test!\nYou're testing if it tastes good before you bake the whole thing.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:48.400\nSo, tests are all about gathering information.\nThey help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:60.400\nThey can be big or small, formal or informal, but the goal is always the same: to learn something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
