    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.800\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:23.200\nIt helps us figure out if something is working the way it should, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:35.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see if you understand the material.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:47.100\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if your recipe and method will create a delicious cake!\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:58.100\nSo, tests can be used for lots of things. They help us learn, they help us stay healthy, and they help us make sure things are working properly.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:04.900\nBasically, a test is just a way of finding out information. To recap, a test is a method for checking something to see if it works or is true. It's a valuable tool for learning and improving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
