    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.600\nA test is basically a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but sometimes the answer is a grade, a diagnosis, or even just a simple yes or no.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:26.100\nWe use tests all the time.\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:36.900\nAt the doctor\u2019s, tests help them figure out if you\u2019re healthy.\nAnd even when you bake a cake, tasting it is a kind of test to see if it\u2019s delicious!\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:47.300\nSo, whether it\u2019s a math quiz, a blood test, or tasting your cooking, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:56.800\nThey give us information and help us make better decisions.\nIn short, a test is a process or tool used to evaluate something.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:01.700\nSimple as that!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
