    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:18.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:29.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Think about it. When you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good. Or, if you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it turns on the TV.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:40.500\nThe result of a test tells you something. It can tell you if something works, if something is true, or even just if you understand something.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:49.100\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives tests to see if you've learned the material.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:56.300\nAnd you might test out a new game to see if it's fun!\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:03.500\nSo, testing is all about finding things out. It's a way to explore and understand the world around us.\n\n01:03.500 --> 01:10.600\nIn short, a test is a way to check something. It gives you information based on what you find.\n\n01:10.600 --> 01:13.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
