    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.600\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up.\nWe use them all the time!\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:28.300\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\nEven tasting a new food is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:37.100\nTests help us learn new things and make better decisions.\nThey give us information to work with.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:47.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and understand something better.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:57.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to help us learn.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
