    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_201450.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.100\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests to see if something works, if something is true, or even just to see how well we understand something.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:31.400\nFor example, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:43.700\nEven the quizzes you take in school are tests to see how much you've learned. Tests can be simple or complex, but they all have the same basic goal: to get information.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:53.000\nSo, a test is a method for gathering information. Remember that, and you're well on your way to understanding tests!\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
