    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:31.900\nHere's another example: If you want to know if a cake is done baking, you can stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:42.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's your test showing the cake is ready! So, a test is just a method for getting information.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:51.500\nIt helps us check things, learn things, and make sure everything is working the way it should. It's all about finding things out!\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
