    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:21.200\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if it's true, or if it's good enough.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:33.400\nThink about baking a cake. You taste it to test if it\u2019s sweet enough, right? Or, if you're buying a used car, you take it for a test drive to see if it runs smoothly.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:43.100\nScientists use tests all the time to see if their ideas are correct. They might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:54.500\nBasically, a test is just a procedure designed to give you information. You use that information to make a decision or learn something new.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.100\nSo, remember, a test helps us check things, from cakes to cars to cures! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
