    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nEver wonder what a test actually is?\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:12.900\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:19.100\nIt's like asking a question and then looking closely at the answer.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:29.400\nThink about it. When you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:43.000\nOr, if you\u2019re learning to ride a bike, wobbling around is a test to see if you can balance. Tests help us understand things better. They can tell us if something is working, if we're learning, or even just if we like something.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:46.600\nSo, a test is just a process to learn, to check, and to improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
