    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey there, welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:15.300\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like asking a question to see what answer you get. The main goal of a test is to give us information.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:39.800\nWe use tests to check if things are working properly, to see how strong something is, or even to understand how someone is feeling.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:47.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:55.200\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:55.200 --> 01:07.600\nEven something as simple as pressing a button on a remote to see if it turns on the TV is a kind of test!\n\n01:07.600 --> 01:11.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information.\n\n01:11.200 --> 01:17.400\nused to check things, understand things, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:17.400 --> 01:20.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
