    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_202929.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:26.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:37.300\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:47.900\nThink about it: When you try a new food, you're testing if you like it!\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:56.200\nOr when you push a door to see if it opens, that's a test too!\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:06.000\nIn school, tests help us see how much we've learned about a subject.\n\n01:06.000 --> 01:10.500\nThey can be multiple choice, short answer, or even projects.\n\n01:10.500 --> 01:17.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n01:17.700 --> 01:23.200\nA science experiment tests if a hypothesis is true.\n\n01:23.200 --> 01:33.400\nSo, tests help us understand things better and learn new things.\n\n01:33.400 --> 01:38.800\nThey're a way to explore and discover.\n\n01:38.800 --> 01:45.700\nBasically, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n01:45.700 --> 01:48.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
