    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.300\nIt helps us learn more or confirm what we already know. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy, or a chef might taste a dish to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.600\nThose are both types of tests! In school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the lessons.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:46.800\nThey aren't meant to trick you, but to show what you've learned. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words, and a math test checks your understanding of numbers.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:55.200\nSo remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
