    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a process of asking a question or performing an action to see what happens.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:27.600\nThink about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:31.800\nThat's a test! You're testing to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:40.000\nOr, when you try a new flavor of ice cream, that's also a test! You're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:48.200\nTests help us learn and make decisions. They're everywhere, from cooking to science, and even just figuring out what to wear in the morning.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:53.800\nSo next time you're trying something new or figuring something out, remember you're running a test!\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
