    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_203429.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:21.300\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:29.300\nThink of it like this: when you bake a cake, you might taste it.\nThat's a test to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:48.500\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each time you try, you're testing your balance.\nWe use tests all the time, in school with quizzes, in science to see if an experiment works, and even in everyday life to see if our keys fit the door.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:49.800\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information and confirming something.\n```"
