    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:14.200\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in this case, a test is simply a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.100\nIt's like asking a question to see if you get the right answer.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:23.600\nImagine you bake a cake. The test is tasting it!\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:27.100\nDoes it taste good? Is it cooked all the way through?\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:30.600\nThat's a test!\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:34.100\nOr, let's say you build a tower out of blocks.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:37.600\nThe test is gently shaking the table. Does it stay standing?\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:40.800\nAnother test!\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:47.400\nSo, a test is just a simple way to see if something is doing what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:50.600\nIt helps us find problems and make things better.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:52.200\nIt\u2019s all about checking and confirming.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:52.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
