    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.800\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something. It's how we find out if something works, if something is true, or if something is good.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:29.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe by tasting it to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:35.900\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:44.700\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned. They come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:54.000\nSome are written, some are spoken, and some are even hands-on. The important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.000\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:57.600\nPretty simple, right?\n```"
  },
