    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:07.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:12.000\nIt's like an experiment, or a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.000\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:27.000\nAnd even a doctor giving you a check-up is a kind of test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:31.000\nSo, a test helps us gather information.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:36.000\nIt could be about your knowledge, your opinion, or even the condition of something.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:39.000\nBasically, it's a way of getting answers.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:43.000\nTo recap, a test is a process for gathering information and checking something.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:49.000\nIt's a tool we use all the time to learn and understand things better.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
