    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cookie is sweet, so you take a bite \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:26.000\nBasically, it\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate something. This could be your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:28.600\nFor example, a school test checks what you've learned in class.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:31.200\nOr, a taste test checks if a new soda is delicious.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:33.800\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:43.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:51.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
