    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.800\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary, like in school, but in reality, a test is just a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:24.900\nThink of it like this: you buy a new lightbulb. The test is simply screwing it in to see if it lights up.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:31.200\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. The test is tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:35.500\nThat's it! You're checking if things are working as expected.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:43.900\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A mechanic might test your car to find out what's wrong.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:52.300\nSee, tests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is just a simple way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:59.100\nIt helps us identify problems and make sure things are doing what they should.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
