    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_204945.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.000\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:33.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:40.400\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test. In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:47.200\nA spelling test checks your knowledge of words. A math quiz assesses your problem-solving skills.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:51.400\nAnd even driving tests determine if you can safely operate a vehicle.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:56.700\nSo, tests are everywhere, helping us measure and understand things better. That's the basic idea! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
