    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:13.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:32.200\nThe main idea behind a test is to see if something meets a certain standard, or to learn more about its qualities.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:43.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words.\nA food taste test helps determine if a new recipe tastes good.\nAnd even pressing the power button on your TV is a mini-test to see if it turns on.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:54.200\nSo, a test is just a process to evaluate or learn about something.\nIt can be simple or complicated, but the goal is always to gain information.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.600\nIn short, tests help us understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
