    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just words, you might use tools or actions to get your answer.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:32.100\nFor example, a simple test is tasting food to see if it's sweet or sour.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:38.500\nYou're testing its flavor!\nOr, if you want to know if a light bulb works, you screw it in.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:44.000\nThat's a test too!\nYou're testing if it lights up.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:57.800\nTests help us understand things better.\nThey let us check if something is working correctly, or if something has a certain quality.\nSo, remember, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:01.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
