    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.100\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:28.900\nIt's like a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever, that's a test! Or maybe you're baking a cake and you use a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through, that's also a kind of test.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:39.400\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned. They give you questions, and your answers show them how well you understand the lessons.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:53.300\nSo, tests are basically just a way to find out information about something. To recap, a test is a way of checking something, like your health, a cake, or your knowledge.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:59.600\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
