    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:27.800\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:35.500\nOr, imagine your teacher giving you a quiz. That's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:42.400\nThe higher your score, the better you did on the test. So, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:50.900\nIt could be a cake, your knowledge, or even a machine. The results help us make decisions and learn more.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:55.000\nIn short, tests help us understand if something is working or understood.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
