    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:09.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, like checking if something works or seeing how well you know something.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, then you taste it.\nThat taste is a test to see if your cake is good.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.200\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, you try to ride it.\nFalling or staying upright is a test of your biking skills.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:49.100\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like seeing if your phone charger works.\nThe key is that you're performing an action and observing the result to learn something.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:55.000\nSo, a test helps you understand something better by giving you information.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:57.300\nBasically, it's a way to check things out!\n\n00:57.300 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
