    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:14.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's like an experiment, but usually with a specific question in mind.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it this way: a test helps us check if something is true, or how well something works. For example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:34.000\nA taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:43.600\nAnother example is a medical test. Doctors use them to see if you're healthy or if you might need some help.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:52.200\nSo, tests can be about anything from your knowledge to your health! Basically, a test is a procedure designed to get information.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.100\nIt helps us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
