    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_210250.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.000\nThink of a test as simply a way to check something. It could be checking if a light bulb works, or seeing if you understand a new concept.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:27.200\nBasically, a test helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if something is true. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:40.400\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, tasting it is a test to see if it's delicious! Or when you press the power button on your TV, you're testing if it turns on.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:49.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to see if something meets a certain standard, or if something is working as expected.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:56.200\nIt's a simple way to gather information and make sure everything is in order.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.700\nThanks for watching! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
