    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.100\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see if something works, or if something is true.\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:25.700\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:33.300\nA math test checks if you can solve problems, and a spelling test checks if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:44.000\nOutside of school, you might test a recipe by making it to see if it tastes good.\nOr, you might test a new toy to see if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:53.000\nSo, a test is really just a way to find out information about something.\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:59.400\nRemember, tests are everywhere!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
