    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a new light bulb to see if it lights up. That's a test!\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:29.600\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. It\u2019s all about gathering information.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:35.200\nAnother example is when you try a new recipe. You taste it, right?\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:44.400\nThat's a test to see if it tastes good! So, tests can be big or small, but they always help us learn something.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:53.300\nBasically, a test is a procedure designed to check the quality, performance, or reliability of something. It helps us make decisions and improve things.\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
