    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_210633.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like this: A doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, maybe you took a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:46.900\nA chef might even taste their soup \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt!\nSo, whether it's a formal exam, a quick check, or even a casual taste, a test helps us understand something better about ourselves or the world around us.\nThey give us information!\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:55.800\nIn summary, a test is a method for evaluation, used in many different ways.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "ffb0c719-b7dc-48b4-bef6-e55cf7b8bb72": {
