    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.700\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy. Or maybe you take a quiz at school to see how much you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:29.700\nEven baking a cake is a test! You\u2019re testing to see if your recipe works.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:41.000\nSo, a test can be anything from a complicated medical exam to a simple experiment. The key is that you\u2019re trying to gather information or check something.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:50.700\nTests help us understand the world around us and learn new things. It's how we know if something works or if we need to try a different approach.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:57.000\nThat\u2019s the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
