    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:02.600\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:04.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know about something.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:05.800\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:08.600\nThe main idea behind a test is to measure your understanding.\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:14.400\nIt can be questions, problems, or even activities designed to show how well you've learned a specific topic.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:17.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:21.100\nA math test shows how well you understand math problems.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:25.600\nEven tasting different foods to see if you can identify them is a kind of test!\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:29.600\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a tool to measure knowledge or skill.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:37.800\nIt helps you and others understand what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:39.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
