    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.500\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, you're using a process to get information.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:29.200\nFor example, a simple test could be tasting a new food to see if you like it. Or maybe taking a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:34.100\nA doctor might run tests to see what's causing you to feel sick.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:41.000\nSee? Lots of things can be tests! So, remember, a test helps us gather information.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:52.000\nWe perform an action, observe the result, and then learn something new. It's a really important part of learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
