    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:19.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know or how well you can do something. Think of it like this: it's a snapshot of your understanding at a specific moment.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:32.500\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. You might have a quiz in school, a driving test to get your license, or even a taste test to see which cookie is your favorite!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:43.900\nSo, if your teacher gives you a math test, they're checking to see if you understand addition, subtraction, and all those other cool math things.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.700\nIf you take a spelling test, they want to know if you can spell words correctly.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:03.900\nBasically, tests help us learn and improve. They show us what we\u2019re good at and what we might need to work on.\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:07.600\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just a way to learn more about yourself! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
