    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. Think of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:24.500\nTests can be used for lots of different things! Doctors use medical tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:34.700\nScientists use tests to see if their experiments work. And, of course, you use tests to see if you understand what you're learning.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:46.000\nFor example, you might test a new recipe by making it and seeing if it tastes good. Or, you might test a toy to see if it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:57.400\nThe important thing is to have a way to check something and see the results. So, remember, a test is just a way of checking something to learn more about it.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:04.300\nIt helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
