    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:23.400\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\nThink about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it\u2019s sweet enough.\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:30.800\nOr, if you want to know if a light bulb works, you screw it in and flip the switch.\nIf it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:42.700\nTests can be simple, like checking if your shoes fit, or more complicated, like a doctor running blood tests.\nThe important thing is they give us information.\nThey help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:49.200\nSo, tests are all about finding things out.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:58.600\nThey help us confirm, check, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:02.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
