    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:29.600\nThese are both tests!\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:37.600\nAnother example is baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:49.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:55.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out. It's an investigation!\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.700\nWe ask a question, and the test helps us find the answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
