    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of \"Tests\".\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if the batteries are working. Or, your teacher might give you a quiz to test what you've learned in class.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:35.600\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. Sometimes it's a simple question, like \"What color is the sky?\".\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:46.900\nOther times, it might be a bigger project that shows you understand a whole concept. For example, baking a cake could be a test of your cooking skills!\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:57.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something, whether it's a toy, your knowledge, or even your baking skills. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:03.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
