    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_213922.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:06.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something really important: a test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:35.500\nThe basic idea is that you answer questions or complete tasks, and your answers show what you've learned. These questions could be multiple choice, true or false, or even problems you need to solve.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:45.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words. A math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:56.900\nAnd even a taste test is a type of test to see which flavor you like best! So, tests help us understand what we already know and what we still need to learn. They're a tool for learning and improvement, not something to be afraid of!\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
