    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see if something is working correctly or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:25.000\nThink about it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or maybe you test a toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.300\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. For example, a spelling test checks if you can spell words correctly.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:42.200\nA math test sees if you understand how to solve problems. All these tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:51.000\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a way to check if something is working as it should, or if you've learned something new.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:57.500\nIt\u2019s a tool for learning and improvement! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
