    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:24.700\nThe main idea is to get some information and see where you stand.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:32.100\nTests can be about lots of different things.\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:36.800\nA taste test checks how something tastes.\nAnd a medical test checks your health.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:49.100\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might do a \"taste test\" to see if you need to add more sugar.\nOr if you're building a tower of blocks, you're essentially \"testing\" its stability to see if it will stand up.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:58.500\nSo, in short, a test is a way to evaluate or check something.\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
