    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:19.200\nToday we're diving into something called a \"test\". Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:31.300\nIt could be checking if you understand a lesson, like in school, or checking if something is working correctly, like a machine.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:41.600\nThink of it like this: Your mom might \"test\" if a cake is done by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:49.400\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, your teacher might give you a little quiz, a small test, to see how well you remember them.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:56.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Some are written, some are spoken, and some are even hands-on.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:03.600\nThe important thing is that they help us figure out what we know and what we might need to learn more about.\n\n01:03.600 --> 01:06.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something!\n\n01:06.800 --> 01:08.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
