    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:17.900\nIt's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:24.800\nThink about it. A doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:31.400\nA teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:38.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:44.800\nFor example, a simple test could be checking if a lightbulb works. You put it in a lamp.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:50.300\nIf it lights up, the test passes! If it doesn't, the test fails.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:56.600\nEasy, right? Tests help us understand things and make sure they're working correctly.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:10.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and check if something meets a certain standard. Whether it\u2019s a medical exam or a simple experiment, tests are all around us!\n\n01:10.900 --> 01:14.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
