    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nA test is basically a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you know something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:27.400\nThink of it like this: a chef might taste their soup \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more salt.\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you\u2019ve learned and what you might need more help with.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:42.700\nThey can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like building a model.\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills, while a science test might ask you about plants and animals.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:49.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:53.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
