    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:24.600\nIt helps us understand if something works, or how well something is doing.\nFor example, you might take a spelling test to see how many words you know.\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:34.900\nScientists use tests all the time to prove if their ideas are correct.\nThey might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:45.500\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and making sure things are right.\nIt's a way to learn and improve!\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:51.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
