    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:19.700\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:31.500\nOr, imagine testing a new toy to see if it's durable and safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:34.200\nWe could drop the toy and see if it breaks, that's a test!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:40.000\nSo, tests help us measure knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:44.200\nThey\u2019re used everywhere, from classrooms to laboratories.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:47.800\nIn short, a test is a method for evaluating something.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:50.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
