    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:33.100\nThink about it: if you try a new cookie recipe, that's a test to see if you like it.\nOr, if you push a door to see if it opens, you're testing whether it's unlocked.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.900\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like tasting a new fruit at the grocery store.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:54.800\nThe important thing is that a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\nWhether you're checking if your shoes fit or taking a big exam, you're using a test to learn something new.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:03.400\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
