    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.799\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.799 --> 00:17.500\nA test, at its core, is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, that help us understand more.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:33.800\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:43.300\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:51.800\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 does it taste good? Did you follow the recipe correctly?\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.500\nSo, tests can come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to get information and learn something new.\n```"
