    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to see what you know or can do.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You turn it on, and if it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:32.000\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:41.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A math test checks if you can solve problems. And a physical fitness test checks how well your body moves.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:49.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure something. It helps us understand where we're at and what we might need to learn more about. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
