    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.100\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out what you know or can do. Think of it like a measuring tool for your brain!\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:26.100\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a quiz in school, which is a small test to check your understanding of a specific topic.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:38.200\nOr, you might have a fitness test to see how strong or fast you are. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing a recipe to see if it turns out delicious!\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:48.900\nSo, the key thing to remember is that a test is just a way to gather information. It helps you understand what you're good at and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:55.000\nIt's all about learning and growing. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
