    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:03.700\nToday we're tackling something super fundamental:\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:04.100\na test!\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:05.900\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:08.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:12.100\nIt's a procedure designed to measure or evaluate a certain quality, skill, or knowledge.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:15.800\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:19.300\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:19.700\nSee?\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:21.700\nDifferent kinds of tests for different things.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:24.900\nAnother example is testing a recipe.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:27.100\nYou might try a new recipe and \"test\" if it tastes good to you!\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:33.200\nSo, remember, a test helps us learn something, whether it's about ourselves, a product, or anything else!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:34.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
