    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. Think about it: when you take a spelling test at school, your teacher is testing your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:35.700\nOr, if you're baking a cake and you taste the batter, you're testing if it tastes good! A test can be anything from a formal exam to a quick check.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:48.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a concept. So, tests are important tools for learning and making sure things are up to par.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:56.500\nThey help us identify what we know and what we still need to learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
