    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.400\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.100\nIt could be finding out how much you've learned, like in a school exam, or it could be finding out if something is working correctly.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:38.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:44.800\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:54.000\nThe goal is always to gather information and make a decision based on that information.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.400\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a test of your knowledge.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
