    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:14.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:30.000\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. It helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:37.800\nOr maybe you're trying out a new recipe. Tasting it along the way is a test to see if it needs more salt or sugar.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:52.900\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. They come in many shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic purpose: to give us information.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:59.100\nThat's the core of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
