    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:23.600\nIt's a process of asking questions or performing actions to get information.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:30.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:39.200\nA teacher uses a test to see what you've learned. So, how does it work?\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:48.000\nUsually, a test involves some kind of task or question.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:53.900\nYou perform the task or answer the question, and then someone, or something, evaluates your response.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:59.800\nFor example, a spelling test asks you to spell words correctly.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:05.700\nA taste test asks you to pick your favorite flavor.\n\n01:05.700 --> 01:09.100\nTests are everywhere!\n\n01:09.100 --> 01:12.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n01:12.300 --> 01:16.000\nRemember, tests are just tools for understanding.\n\n01:16.000 --> 01:21.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
