    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give us information about something specific.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough. Or, a doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:34.700\nIn both cases, they're using a specific method to get an answer. For example, a simple test could be asking someone their favorite color.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:42.700\nThe answer tells you their preference. Or, a math test checks if you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a method used to gather information or evaluate something. It helps us understand things better!\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
