    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:21.400\nIt's a process of asking a question and then trying to answer it.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:31.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:36.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:44.800\nSo, tests come in many forms. Some are written, like quizzes. Some are practical, like trying to fix a bike.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:48.600\nThe important thing is that a test helps us understand something better.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:56.000\nIt gives us information. It helps us learn. In short, a test is a way to gather information and answer a question.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.500\nIt can be about anything! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
