    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain! The main idea behind any test is to see what you've learned and what areas you might need a little more practice in.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:31.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words. A math test checks your knowledge of numbers and equations. Even a quiz on your favorite movie is a kind of test!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:40.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn and grow. It helps identify what you already know and what you still need to learn.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:47.500\nDon't be afraid of tests! Embrace them as a chance to improve.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
