    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Whether it's to check if you understand a topic, see how strong something is, or even discover if you have a certain condition.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:28.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:37.500\nA stress test on a bridge checks how much weight it can hold. And a medical test can check your blood sugar levels.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:50.600\nSo, tests help us gather information and make informed decisions. They come in many forms, from simple quizzes to complex experiments.\n\n00:50.600 --> 01:00.000\nThe goal is always the same: to learn something new or confirm what we already suspect. In short, a test is an evaluation or a method used to determine something about an item, person, or process.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:05.700\nIt's a tool for understanding! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
