    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:17.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:25.900\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a taste test tells you if you like a food.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:37.300\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:48.400\nEven checking the weather forecast is a kind of test to see if it will rain!\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:54.500\nSo, a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "e9b54a2a-5abe-4d99-88d5-2eaf12afa72a": {
