    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_221440.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:06.300\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:10.300\nA test, simply put, is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.300 --> 00:14.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:17.500\nTests can be used for all sorts of things!\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:24.600\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick test to see if it's done.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:28.400\nYou poke the cake, and if the toothpick comes out clean, it's ready!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:29.300\nThat's a test!\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:35.700\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how well you're understanding the vocabulary.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:43.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and see where you stand.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:46.400\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:53.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "d98640b8-9c07-40df-8af0-60492075362b": {
    "id": "d98640b8-9c07-40df-8af0-60492075362b",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:47:19.511101",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-05T22:15:40.296513",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260105_221540.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_221540.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:19.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific about something else. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of getting a spoken answer, you get results you can measure.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:29.500\nFor example, a simple quiz in school is a test to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:37.500\nOr, think about a doctor running a blood test. They're using the test to find out things about your health, like your cholesterol level or if you have any deficiencies.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:46.100\nAnother example could be testing a recipe. You follow the instructions, and then you taste the result to see if it's good.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:55.600\nThat's a test! So, remember: a test is just a way to gather information and learn something by observing the outcome. It's all about finding answers.\n\n00:55.600 --> 01:01.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
