    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_221702.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. For example, a simple spelling test helps us see how well you know your words.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:28.100\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:34.300\nThe taste is the result of your test! Tests aren't just for school or cooking, though.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:45.200\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe. So, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:54.400\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly. Basically, a test helps you check something!\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
