    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:29.700\nIt's a process we use to check if something is working, or to measure something, or even to see what someone knows.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:38.400\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:47.100\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:50.100\nAnd a mechanic might test your car battery to see if it's still good.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:53.700\nSo, tests help us understand things better.\n```"
