    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking, so you use a toothpick to test it.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:29.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nIn general, tests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:43.800\nFor example, your doctor might run tests to check your health, like a blood test.\nOr, when you're learning something new, like in school, quizzes and exams are tests to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:56.000\nSo, a test is really just a method to find out information.\nWhether it's about a cake, your health, or what you know, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
