    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:04.000\nToday, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:06.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:11.300\nThink of it like checking if something is true or false, or figuring out how well something works.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:15.800\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well we know our spelling words.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:20.400\nOr, a taste test can help us decide which cookie tastes the best!\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:22.800\nIt's all about gathering information.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:30.600\nSo, tests can be used in lots of different situations, from school to cooking, to even figuring out which route to take to get home faster.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:32.800\nIt\u2019s a way of checking and learning.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:39.200\nBasically, a test helps us learn more about something by trying it out and seeing what happens.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:41.100\nIt's like a little experiment!\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:43.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
