    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:10.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:10.600 --> 00:18.000\nIt's a method for gathering information.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:23.900\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:35.700\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. A science experiment is also a kind of test, seeing if a hypothesis is correct.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:46.500\nEven trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like the way it tastes!\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:54.200\nSo, whether it's checking bathwater, taking a quiz, or experimenting in the lab, a test is all about gathering information. It's a simple way to learn more about the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "6840fd25-8594-46cc-96a8-b4ee7572c2d7": {
    "id": "6840fd25-8594-46cc-96a8-b4ee7572c2d7",
