    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:11.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:28.300\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:37.400\nThe toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready. Another example: A doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:46.500\nOr a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject. So, tests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:53.300\nThey give us information. They can be big or small, formal or informal, but at their core, they're all about finding things out.\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
