    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_223056.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.100\nBasically, a test is just a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate something, like your knowledge, a product, or even an idea.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:25.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test at school helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:34.100\nOr, imagine a chef tasting a new sauce \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good and needs any adjustments.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:43.200\nTests can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb works, or more complex, like a medical test to check your health.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:54.800\nThe important thing is that a test gives you information. So, to recap, a test is a process used to evaluate something and get information about it.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
