    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.200\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your words. Or, a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:36.800\nHere's another example: a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better. Or, you might test a toy to see if it's durable and won't break easily.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:49.400\nSo, a test is just a method or procedure designed to gather information and answer a question.\n\n00:49.400 --> 01:01.200\nWhether it\u2019s spelling, cake, medicine, or toys, tests help us learn and improve things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
