    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you might test if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:26.400\nThat's a test! Or, you might test a recipe by cooking it.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:35.700\nDoes it taste good? That's the test result! In school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:47.400\nThey're like little check-ins to see if you understand the material. For example, a math test might ask you to solve a problem, testing your understanding of addition.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.300\nA spelling test checks if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:01.300\nSo remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something works or if something is understood. It helps us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
