    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:17.200\nToday we're talking about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your lightbulb works.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:27.300\nYou put it in a lamp and turn it on. That's a test! The test is seeing if the lightbulb lights up.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:34.900\nIf it does, the test passes! If it doesn't, well, the test fails. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:41.900\nLike checking if your shoes fit before you buy them, or tasting your food to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:52.800\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to verify something. It has a specific goal, and a clear result \u2013 pass or fail.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:57.900\nAnd just like that, you know what a test is!\n\n00:57.900 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
