    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:18.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:25.500\nIt could be a way to see if you understand a topic, like in school,\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:36.400\nor it could be a way to check if something works correctly, like a new toy.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:50.200\nThink of it this way: a test is like asking a question, and the answer tells you something important.\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr, a battery test on your phone checks how much power it has left.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:59.600\nSo, tests help us measure things and understand if something is working as expected.\nThey're used everywhere, from school to science to even making sure your favorite video game is fun to play!\nIn short, a test is a method used to determine capabilities or knowledge.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
