    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:17.200\nNow, you've probably taken lots of tests in school, but in this case, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you take a bite.\nThat bite is a test to see if the cake tastes good!\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:34.100\nOr, imagine you're building a tower of blocks.\nYou gently push the top block to test if the tower is stable.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:43.100\nIf it falls, you know it wasn't stable enough.\nWe use tests like these all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:53.200\nThey help us understand things and make sure everything is working as it should.\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
