    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or measure something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:33.400\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:44.900\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just class activities.\nOne example is a spelling test, which checks your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:52.100\nAnother is a math test, to see how well you can solve problems.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:58.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool.\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\nIt's a way to measure knowledge or skills.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
