    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:34.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:46.200\nTests can be written, like an exam, or practical, like driving a car.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:57.800\nThey can be used to check your understanding, your skills, or even your personality! For example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words. A cooking test checks your ability to follow a recipe.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:06.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to measure something. It helps us understand where we are and what we need to learn next.\n\n01:06.900 --> 01:11.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
