    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_224304.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 01:7.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:11.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much someone knows about something, or how well they can do something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:14.300\nThink of it like checking if you know your ABCs.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:20.600\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a multiple-choice test in school, where you pick the best answer.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:26.300\nOr, you could have a practical test, like showing that you can ride a bike safely.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:28.500\nEven a simple quiz is a type of test!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:35.700\nSo, if your teacher asks you what's 2+2 and you say 4, that\u2019s a mini test, and you passed!\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:42.900\nThe goal of a test isn't to trick you, but to see what you've learned and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:49.300\nRemember, tests are just one way to learn and grow.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:51.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
