    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:15.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to test your understanding of a lesson.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:33.700\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. In both cases, they're using a test to get information.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:45.900\nTests can be used for all sorts of things! Companies test new products to make sure they're safe and reliable.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:57.900\nScientists run experiments, which are basically tests, to learn about the world around us.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information about knowledge or performance.\n01:01.700 --> 01:04.200\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n01:04.200 --> 01:07.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
