    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.000\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you understand something. It's like a quick exam for... well, anything!\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:21.500\nFor example, you might test a lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:33.100\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it has enough salt. In school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned about a subject like math or history.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:43.300\nSo, a test is simply a process to evaluate something. It can be a physical object, a skill, or even your knowledge.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:56.900\nIt helps us identify if things are going as planned and where we might need to improve. In short, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things work the way they should.\n\n00:56.900 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
