    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we\u2019re diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt\u2019s a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:22.600\nThink about it: a spelling test in school checks your knowledge of words.\nA taste test helps you decide which snack is the yummiest.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:35.300\nAnd a medical test can help doctors understand your health.\nSo, a test always involves a question or a challenge, and we perform actions to get an answer or a result.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:46.400\nWe observe the outcome, and that result tells us something.\nWhether you're checking if a lightbulb works or taking an exam, you're performing a test.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:57.100\nTo recap, a test is a method for gathering information, using questions, actions, and observations to get results.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
