    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:20.300\nIt's a method for checking or evaluating something to see if it meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:27.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:38.000\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes the best!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:47.500\nEven when you check if the light switch works, that's a mini-test. You're testing if the switch turns the light on.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:56.000\nSo, tests are all about learning something new or confirming what we already know. They help us measure, assess, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.500\nThat's the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
