    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.800\nIt helps us learn more about ourselves, objects, or even ideas.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: a cookie test! You taste a cookie to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:33.800\nOr, a spelling test in school. It helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:41.800\nMaybe you test a toy to see if it still works by turning it on.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:48.200\nSo, tests help us to gather information and learn new things.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:51.800\nWhether it's a cookie, spelling, or a toy, testing is all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
