    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:21.700\nIt\u2019s a process designed to gather information and see if something is true or working correctly.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like checking if your bike tires have enough air. You might push on them \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:34.000\nOr, maybe you're baking a cake. You stick a toothpick in it \u2013 that's a test to see if it's done.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:40.400\nTests are everywhere! Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:51.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and understand something better. It helps us make decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
