    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:22.100\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is ready, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:29.100\nThat poke is a test!\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:39.400\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\nEach time you try to balance, that's a test of your balance skills.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.300\nYou might wobble and fall, but that's just information helping you learn.\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz at school to trying something new.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:56.400\nIt's all about gathering information and seeing what happens.\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
