    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_230119.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.700\nIt's like a little experiment or a series of questions designed to give us information.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:38.400\nOr, when you're learning something new, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:46.200\nMaybe you even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:55.000\nTests aren't just for school or the doctor, though. They're everywhere! We use them to learn, to improve things, and to make sure everything is working the way it should.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.500\nSo, a test is just a process for gathering information. It's a tool to help us learn and understand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
