    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_230204.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:22.800\nIt's a process designed to give us information. Think of it like this: a spelling test helps us learn if we know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:32.200\nOr, a taste test tells us which flavor of ice cream we like best! Tests aren't always about getting things right or wrong.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:40.500\nFor example, you might take a personality test to learn more about yourself. Or a medical test to check your health.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:50.300\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying out different recipes to see which your family enjoys.\n\n00:50.300 --> 01:00.100\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information. It helps us learn, understand, and make better decisions.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:03.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
