    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_230338.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.700\nNo need to panic, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like a little puzzle. The main idea behind a test is to check your understanding.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:41.000\nIt can be written, like answering questions on paper, or practical, like showing you can do something.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:50.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, if you're learning to ride a bike, your ability to stay balanced and pedal shows you've passed the \"test\" of learning to ride!\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.500\nSo, tests help us see what we've learned and what we still need to work on. They're a tool for learning, not something to be scared of! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
