    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_230428.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.900\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you an answer.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:25.500\nFor example, a simple quiz in school is a test.\nIt helps your teacher understand how well you learned the material.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.200\nOr, if you\u2019re baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test to see if it's cooked all the way through!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:47.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn, understand, and make better decisions.\nThey help us check if things are working as they should and guide us to improve.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:57.300\nIn short, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
