    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_230605.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:18.300\nNow, when I say \"test,\" I don't just mean school exams.\nA test is really just a way to find out if something works like it's supposed to.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:29.100\nThink about it like this: you bake a cake, and you test it by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:36.900\nOr, imagine you're buying a new toy.\nYou might test it out in the store to make sure all the buttons work.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:43.300\nTests help us make decisions and learn.\nThey give us information to improve things.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:51.100\nWhether it's testing a recipe or testing a new invention, tests are a crucial part of figuring things out.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:59.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
