    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:22.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\nIt could be about anything!\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.300\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\nOr maybe you test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:38.400\nThe main idea behind any test is to get information.\nWe're trying to gather some data to understand something better.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:47.500\nSo, if you're testing a toy car, you might see how far it can travel.\nThat distance is the information you're getting.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.500\nAnother example?\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:59.200\nThey're using the tests to gather clues and solve a puzzle.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:06.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n01:06.600 --> 01:13.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
