    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.900\nIt's a process designed to gather information or evaluate something. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps us see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:35.300\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie tastes better. Even a simple experiment, like trying a new recipe, is a kind of test to see if you like the results.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:44.600\nTests can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like trying out a new video game before you buy it.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:52.400\nThe important thing is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:04.100\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for gathering information or evaluating something. It can be formal or informal, but it always helps us learn.\n\n01:04.100 --> 01:07.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
