    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:19.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:27.500\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works \u2013 you're testing it to see if it does its job.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:35.300\nTests can come in many forms. There are written tests with questions and answers, like the ones you might take in school.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:43.000\nBut there are also practical tests, like a driving test, where you show you can actually do something.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:50.500\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve a problem. A cooking test might ask you to bake a cake.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:57.600\nBoth are testing your knowledge and skills in those areas. So, remember, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nIt helps us understand what we know and what we still need to learn. It's a way to measure understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
