    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:06.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:11.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:19.300\nIt's a process designed to gather information and see how well something works, or how much someone knows.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a check-up to test your health.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:29.600\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:32.600\nIn school, tests help show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:38.300\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, like multiple choice questions, essays, or even a practical demonstration.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:47.000\nSo, to recap: a test is a method for gathering information, evaluating performance, or measuring knowledge.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:52.300\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
