    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:23.000\nIt's a process we use to evaluate, measure, or check something.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:31.400\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:37.600\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:43.800\nTests aren\u2019t just for people! They\u2019re used to check everything!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:53.700\nA car company might test a new car to make sure it's safe. A food company might test a new recipe to make sure it tastes good.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:01.600\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions. They're important in almost every part of life.\n\n01:01.600 --> 01:09.400\nIn short, a test is a tool for learning and improvement. It helps us understand where we are and what we need to do next.\n\n01:09.400 --> 01:13.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
