    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.600\nIt's a process that gives you information about whatever you're testing.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:28.800\nThink about it like this: a taste test tells you how something tastes.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:36.000\nA spelling test shows how well you can spell. And a medical test can reveal information about your health.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:45.500\nTests can be formal, like a big exam at school, or informal, like quickly checking if your bathwater is too hot.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:52.200\nThe important thing is that a test helps you learn something new. So, remember, a test is just a way to get information and learn more. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
