    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:29.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a medical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:36.400\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to test your knowledge on a subject. See? Different types of tests, same basic idea.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:45.900\nAnother example could be baking a cake. You might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:55.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! So, remember, a test is just a way of checking something to learn more about it.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:01.800\nWhether it's your health, your knowledge, or even a cake, tests help us understand the world around us better.\n\n01:01.800 --> 01:05.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
