    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:34.400\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 will it taste good?\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:48.000\nSo, tests come in many forms.\nThere are written tests with questions and answers, practical tests where you perform a task, and even simple observations can be a type of test.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:57.100\nThe goal is always to learn something and gain information.\nEssentially, a test helps us measure and understand things better.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:03.600\nIt\u2019s a tool for learning and improvement.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
