    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_231800.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is just a way to see what you know about something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like a little check-up for your brain! It helps you and others understand how well you've learned a topic.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:34.900\nIt can be anything from a quick quiz in class, to a bigger exam at the end of the year.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:43.700\nFor example, if you've been learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of animals or what they eat.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:53.400\nOr, if you've been practicing your math facts, a test might ask you to solve some simple addition or subtraction problems.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:59.500\nSo, remember, a test is simply a tool to measure your knowledge. It shows how much you've learned and what you might need to work on. It\u2019s a chance to show what you know! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
