    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! \n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests. \nNow, a test is really just a way to check something. \nIt could be checking if you understand a new concept, or checking if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. \nOr, when you build with LEGOs, you test if your tower is strong enough to stand up.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:39.200\nSo, in school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. \nAnd in everyday life, tests help us make sure things are safe and reliable.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:51.100\nWe test cars before we drive them, and we test recipes before we share them. \nBasically, a test is a way to find out if something is true or correct.\n\n00:51.100 --> 01:00.100\nIt\u2019s a simple way to check our understanding and make sure things are working as they should. \nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
