    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:06.000\nToday we're going to explore something really fundamental:\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:08.600\nwhat is a test?\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:12.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:15.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:19.900\nFor example, a spelling test helps us figure out how well someone knows how to spell.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:23.600\nA taste test helps us decide which flavor of ice cream we like best.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:28.200\nAnd a medical test can help a doctor understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:30.800\nThe goal of a test is to get information.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:35.900\nWe use that information to make decisions, learn new things, or just understand the world a little bit better.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:41.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and discovery.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:44.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
