    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process or procedure designed to measure or evaluate something specific.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:28.500\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. The test gives us information.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:39.300\nAnother example: you might test a recipe by baking a small batch before making a huge cake. You're testing to see if the recipe works for you.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:50.600\nTests help us learn, improve, and make decisions. So, remember, a test is all about gathering information to learn more!\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:54.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
