    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:23.800\nWe use tests all the time without even realizing it. For example, when you try a new recipe, you\u2019re testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:34.500\nOr, when you turn on a light switch, you\u2019re testing if the light bulb works. In school, tests help your teacher see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:50.300\nThey can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like performing a science experiment. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or check if something is working as expected.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.800\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
