    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:07.300\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:12.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:16.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:22.500\nIt could be testing if a lightbulb works by flipping the switch.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:26.100\nThe switch is the test, and the light turning on is the answer.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:32.100\nOr maybe you're testing a recipe. You taste it \u2013 that's your test \u2013 and decide if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:37.500\nTests aren't always about right or wrong answers.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:44.100\nSometimes, they just give us information, like a taste test to see which flavor of ice cream people like best.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:50.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
