    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out, or to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:29.200\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:35.200\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:43.800\nThere are all kinds of tests!\nSome are written, like quizzes.\nOthers are hands-on, like building a model.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:55.700\nSome tests measure your speed, and others measure your knowledge.\nThe important thing is that they all give us information.\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:01.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool.\nIt helps us understand something better, whether it's our health, a recipe, or how much we know.\nIt's all about learning and improving!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
