    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.200\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:26.600\nThink about it. A cooking test might be tasting a sauce to see if it needs more salt. A spelling test in school checks if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.600\nOr even checking if a lightbulb works by plugging it in \u2013 that\u2019s a test too! So, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:43.400\nThey give us information. Maybe you need to study more, or maybe you're already doing great!\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:53.000\nUltimately, a test is just a simple way to check something and learn from the results. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
