    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:18.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on. That's a test!\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:31.000\nThe main idea behind a test is to get some information. You ask a question, perform an action, or observe something, and then you use the result to learn more.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:40.800\nFor example, a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice. Or a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:51.000\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas about the world are accurate. So, a test is a process used to gather information.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:58.900\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
