    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_233037.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:09.400\nSimple tests. Think of a test as a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:16.400\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. For example, a simple taste test!\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:22.100\nYou try two different cookies and decide which one you like better. That's a test!\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:31.200\nOr, you could test if a toy car goes faster on a smooth floor or a carpet. You just watch and see what happens.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:40.600\nTests help us learn and understand things. We can test if a plant needs more sunlight by watching how it grows in different spots.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:52.400\nOr, we can test if a new recipe is delicious by asking our friends to try it! So, a test is just a way to check something out and find out what\u2019s true.\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:00.100\nIt's all about asking questions and finding the answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
