    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.600\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or seeing how well you understand a new concept.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:32.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:39.200\nOr, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy. These are all different kinds of tests.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:50.500\nTests help us learn and improve. If the cake isn't sweet enough, we know to add more sugar next time. If you don't understand something, you know you need to study it more.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:55.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn from the results. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
