    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge on a subject, or even how strong a material is.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:34.300\nOr, imagine a company testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\nThey\u2019re testing its durability!\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:43.700\nTests can be written, spoken, or even hands-on.\nThey help us understand where we're at and what we need to work on.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:51.500\nSo, a test is just a method for learning and measuring.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
