    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.300\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if something is true. Think of it like this: you're baking a cake.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:26.400\nThe recipe is your plan, but tasting the cake after baking it? That's a test!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:34.600\nIt tells you if you followed the recipe correctly and if the cake tastes good. Or imagine you're building a tower with blocks.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:40.600\nYou might gently push it to see if it's strong enough to stand. That's another kind of test!\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:55.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. They can be as simple as tasting a cake or as complex as checking if a bridge can hold a lot of weight.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nBasically, a test is a check!\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
