    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_233540.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:14.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:22.600\nThink about it like this: Your teacher gives you a quiz. That's a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.200\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste a little bit of the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:34.100\nThat's a test too! Tests aren't just for school.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:42.200\nScientists use tests to see if new medicines work, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:50.500\nSo, a test is just a procedure to check understanding or quality. It's all about finding out information!\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:57.000\nIn short, tests help us learn and improve things.\n00:57.000 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
