    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.800\nIt helps us understand if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:29.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:33.500\nYou can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:37.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That\u2019s a test.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:44.100\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. Each time you try, you're testing your balance.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:48.200\nIf you fall, you know you need to adjust.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:51.800\nIf you stay upright, you're passing the test!\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:58.300\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:02.500\nIt can be a simple check, or a more involved process,\n\n01:02.500 --> 01:05.500\nbut the goal is always the same: to find out something.\n\n01:05.500 --> 01:08.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
