    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by poking it with a toothpick to see if it's done baking.\nOr, a doctor might test your eyesight to see how well you can see.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.600\nAnother example is a simple quiz in school.\nThat's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:46.200\nTests can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all serve the same purpose: to gather information.\nSo, a test is just a way to check things out and learn something new.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
