    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information and measure something specific.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:24.800\nThink about it: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:29.100\nSee? Different kinds of tests, but the same idea.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:45.300\nTests help us understand where we are, and what we need to work on. So, whether it's a pop quiz, a science experiment, or even just trying out a new recipe, you're essentially conducting a test.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:55.000\nIn short, a test is a structured way to gather information and measure something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
