    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey there, welcome!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:18.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like an investigation.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:28.200\nYou're trying to answer a question by gathering information.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:44.200\nThat information can come in many forms. Maybe it's a quiz at school to see how well you learned a subject. Or perhaps it's a taste test to decide which cookie is the most delicious. Even checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in is a kind of test!\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:53.500\nSo, whether it's answering questions on paper, trying different flavors, or simply observing what happens, you're performing a test. It's all about gathering evidence to answer a question.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:56.900\nIn short, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:56.900 --> 00:58.400\nEasy peasy, right?\n\n00:58.400 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
