    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:12.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:17.100\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an answer, you're getting proof or evidence.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.000\nThe main idea is to see if something is working correctly, or to understand how well someone knows a topic.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.300\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, your teacher might give you a quiz to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:45.700\nAnother example could be testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\nYou try it out, maybe make some adjustments, and then try it again.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:54.700\nThat's a test too!\nSo, remember, a test is a process of gathering information to learn something specific.\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:01.900\nIt helps us confirm things, diagnose problems, and improve what we're doing.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:06.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
