    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.900\nIt could be about your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of something.\nThink of it like this: a spelling test at school checks how well you know your words.\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:32.000\nTesting isn't just for school, though.\nEngineers use tests to make sure bridges are strong enough, and doctors use tests to diagnose illnesses.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:39.900\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\nThey give us important information.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:48.300\nIn short, a test is a process or procedure designed to evaluate something.\nPretty useful, right?\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
