    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, and that's true, but in general, a test is just a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake and you taste it. That's a test!\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:31.400\nYou're checking if it tastes good. Or, maybe you build a tower out of blocks and you gently push it to see if it's stable.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:39.300\nThat's another kind of test. So, a test is really just a way to find out if something does what you expect it to do.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:55.000\nWe use tests all the time in everyday life, even without realizing it. We test recipes when we cook, we test if our shoelaces are tied before we run, and we test if the door is locked before we leave the house.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:03.700\nSo remember, a test is a way to check if something works correctly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
