    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_235209.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.000\nWhat are they? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:18.100\nIt could be to check if something works, if you know something, or even if you have a particular skill.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:31.700\nThink of it like this: a chef might taste their soup \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt. Or, your doctor might check your temperature \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:42.500\nIn school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned. These tests can be multiple choice, short answer, or even projects!\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:55.400\nThe goal is always the same: to find out how much you understand. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new about yourself or something else.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:01.700\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
