    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:01.700 --> 00:04.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:06.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:07.900\nWe use them all the time!\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:11.600\nThink about it. When you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:17.100\nOr, if you're trying to learn a new skill, each practice session is like a mini-test to see how you're improving.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:21.300\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:24.700\nThey might be quizzes, exams, or even just asking questions in class.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:27.200\nThe goal is to check your understanding.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:31.500\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see where you're at.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:35.300\nIt helps you learn and grow.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:37.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
