    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_235430.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:06.000\nWhat is a test anyway?\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to see if something works, or if you know something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it does what it's supposed to, like a car that needs to drive forward when you push a button.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:31.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a test in school to see how much you've learned about a subject, like math or reading.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:39.000\nSo, whether it's checking if a toy works right, or checking your understanding of a lesson, a test helps us understand something better.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:42.000\nIt gives us information!\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:45.000\nIt's a way to find out if things are working as they should.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:49.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
