    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260105_235531.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling the fundamental concept of a test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:18.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:28.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your words. A taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:42.000\nEven a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on with your health. So, whether it's a school exam, a product trial, or a medical checkup, all these are tests.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:52.400\nThey all have a common goal: to provide us with valuable information.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.100\nRemember, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
