    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_000237.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:06.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:9.200\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:12.600\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:13.500\nThink about it.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:17.700\nWant to know if that cake is done?\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:19.800\nYou poke it with a fork \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:23.700\nNeed to see if your phone is charged?\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:26.400\nYou look at the battery icon \u2013 another test!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:31.400\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:36.200\nThey can be multiple choice, fill-in-the-blank, or even just a conversation.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:40.400\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:46.500\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and checking understanding.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:51.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
