    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:30.400\nWe use tests all the time to check if things are working, if something is true, or just to learn more.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.100\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:46.100\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned. Even checking if a light bulb works is a kind of test!\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:55.100\nYou're testing if the bulb will light up. So, tests are all about gathering information. They help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.600\nFrom simple checks to complex experiments, tests are a fundamental part of learning and understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
