    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_000630.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.300\nA test is really just a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like a measuring tool for knowledge or ability. For example, a spelling test shows you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:32.400\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:45.500\nAnother example is when scientists test a new medicine. They want to see if it's safe and if it actually helps people.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:51.900\nSo, in simple terms, a test helps us learn something new, or confirm something we already think is true. It's all about gathering information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
