    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:04.300 --> 00:07.800\nToday we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:11.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:14.300\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:15.100\nIt could be anything!\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:21.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:27.300\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:31.900\nEven baking a cake is kind of like a test \u2013 you're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:38.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to get information or prove something.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:41.100\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:46.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
