    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:33.400\nIt's a method we use to check if something is working, if something is true, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:47.400\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\nOr, when you learn your ABCs, your teacher might give you a quiz to test your knowledge.\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.800\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share one thing in common: they help us gather information and make decisions.\nThey\u2019re a fundamental tool for learning and understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
