    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_001140.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an answer, you're getting evidence.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:27.500\nThis evidence helps you understand something better. For example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:33.200\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:40.900\nSee? Tests are everywhere! They're used to check knowledge, skills, abilities, and even preferences.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:49.900\nSo, a test isn't just about getting a grade. It's about learning and understanding where you are and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:49.900 --> 01:00.700\nIn short, a test is a process for collecting information to help us learn and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
