    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find something out.\nIt\u2019s how we check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a lightbulb works, you put it in a lamp and turn it on.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:31.900\nOr, if you want to know if your cookies taste good, you ask someone to try one.\nThat's another test!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:42.500\nTests can be simple, like that lightbulb example, or they can be more complex, like a math quiz at school.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:55.100\nBut the basic idea is the same: we're trying to get some information or prove a point.\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something out and see what the result is.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
