    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_001528.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! \n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.600\nToday we're talking about tests. What is a test, really?\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:24.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a method we use to check or evaluate something's quality, performance, or ability.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:34.200\nThink about it: a spelling test in school checks your knowledge of spelling. A taste test for a new cookie helps decide if it's delicious.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:44.300\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you have a fever. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to give us information and help us make decisions.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:52.000\nRemember, a test is just a way to find something out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
