    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something about something. It helps us learn and understand.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like this: you might test if your bathwater is too hot before getting in. That's a test!\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:31.300\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:45.300\nEven baking a cake involves testing if it's done by poking it with a toothpick. So, tests can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all help us gather information.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:53.400\nThey show us what works, what doesn't, and what we need to improve. In a nutshell, a test is an experiment to learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
