    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_002825.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It helps us measure or evaluate things, like how well you understand a topic, or how strong a material is.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. A chef might test a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:37.500\nOr, you take a quiz in school to test your knowledge. So, tests come in many forms, from simple questions to complex experiments.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:46.900\nThey all have the same goal: to give us information. By observing the results, we can learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:58.300\nTo recap, a test is a method for gathering information to evaluate something. It could be used in school, at work, or even at home!\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
