    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: When you study for a school exam, the exam itself is the test!\nIt shows your teacher how much you've learned.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:29.100\nBut tests aren't just for school.\nImagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:40.400\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good before you bake the whole thing.\nOr, if you're buying a new phone, you might read reviews.\nThose reviews are like tests that other people have done.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:49.600\nSo, a test is just a way to check your knowledge or the quality of something.\nIt helps you learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
