    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_003216.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like an experiment, a way to see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:24.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:30.800\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite!\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:38.200\nAnother example? Imagine you\u2019re building a tower of blocks.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:49.600\nYou're testing to see how high you can build it before it falls over. That's a test too!\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:58.500\nSo, a test is just a way of finding information, learning something new, or checking if something is working as expected.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.200\nIt can be in school, in the kitchen, or even just playing with toys. It's all about exploring and learning!\n\n01:02.200 --> 01:04.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
