    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.400\nIt could be anything from a school quiz to checking if a lightbulb works. The main idea is to see if something meets a certain standard or passes a certain criteria.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.100\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:40.100\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:47.100\nOr imagine you're baking a cake; you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:54.100\nSo, a test is just a procedure or experiment designed to reveal something about a person, object, or situation.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:56.400\nIt helps us understand and evaluate things.\n\n00:56.400 --> 00:57.900\nThat's the basics of testing!\n\n00:57.900 --> 00:58.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
