    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give you information about a person, object, or even an idea.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:26.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:33.800\nA chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:51.100\nOr, you might take a quiz to see how much you've learned in school. Each of these is a test, right? They all have a specific purpose: to gather information and help us make a decision.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:59.700\nWhether it's figuring out if you need medicine, adjusting a recipe, or seeing if you understand a lesson, tests are all about learning and improving.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:03.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information.\n\n01:03.100 --> 01:05.700\nIt helps us understand something better.\n01:05.700 --> 01:06.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
