    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nYou know, like quizzes or exams. Basically, a test is just a way to find out what you know about a certain subject.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: imagine you\u2019re building a LEGO castle. A test is like someone checking to see if you've used the right blocks and put them in the right place.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:34.800\nTests can be written, like answering questions on paper, or they can be practical, like showing someone how to ride a bike.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.600\nA spelling test checks your knowledge of words, while a cooking test might see if you can bake a cake.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:53.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a tool to measure what you\u2019ve learned. It helps you and your teachers understand what you already know and what you still need to work on.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
