    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.200\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in this video, we're talking about a more general idea: a test is simply a way to check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a physical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:34.200\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:44.700\nAnother example is checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in. That's a test too! You're checking to see if it lights up.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:54.400\nSo, a test is a way to confirm something is true, or to find out if something is functioning correctly. We test things all the time, often without even realizing it!\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:57.900\nBasically, testing is all about checking and confirming. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
