    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_005116.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.300\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like how well you know a subject, or how strong a material is.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:31.200\nThink about it like this: a pop quiz in class is a test to see how much you learned from the lesson.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:38.000\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might stick a toothpick in it to test if it\u2019s cooked all the way through.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:48.500\nThe toothpick comes out clean? Great, it passed the test! Tests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to more complex scientific experiments.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:58.300\nThe important thing is they give us information. So, a test is simply a method for gathering information and evaluating something.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
