    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.000\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:14.600\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:19.400\nThink of it like checking if a cake is done.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:29.100\nYou poke it with a toothpick, right? That's a test! The toothpick is testing the cake's doneness.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is probably done.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:34.300\nIf it's covered in batter, well, it needs more time.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:39.500\nTests are everywhere.\nA doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:44.700\nA teacher uses tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:53.600\nEven you test things every day, like tasting food to see if it needs more salt.\nSo, a test is just a method, a process, for gathering information and making a decision.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:56.100\nThat\u2019s the basic idea.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
