    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:03.300\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:04.600\nWhat is a test?\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.000\nIt's a way to measure or evaluate something to see what it's like.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:14.700\nThink of it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:17.600\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:18.900\nSee?\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:19.900\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:25.400\nAnother example is a simple test on your computer. You can test whether the internet is working by opening a webpage.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:27.300\nIf it loads, the internet is working!\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:33.600\nSo, tests help us learn things, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:37.800\nThey come in many forms, but they all share the same basic idea: to get information.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:39.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
