    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: the test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:29.400\nThink of it like checking your progress. It could be a written exam, a practical demonstration, or even just answering questions.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:43.100\nThe main idea is to see if you've understood the information or learned a new skill.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:50.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:57.100\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, the \"test\" might be whether you can balance and pedal without falling. See?\n\n00:57.100 --> 00:58.900\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a tool we use to measure knowledge or ability. It helps us understand what we've learned and where we might need some more practice. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
