    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:04.200 --> 00:06.400\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:10.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:17.100\nThat's a test!\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:21.200\nWe use tests all the time in everyday life.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:24.300\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:27.600\nA chef tastes their food to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:32.900\nEven checking the weather forecast is a type of test to see if you need an umbrella!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:37.800\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and make better decisions.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:40.500\nThey help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:45.200\nSo next time you hear the word \"test\", remember it's just a way of finding something out.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "b516f614-5c0d-40db-b79d-c225d3213b05": {
    "id": "b516f614-5c0d-40db-b79d-c225d3213b05",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:49:32.031464",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-06T01:03:31.318464",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260106_010331.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_010331.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you get the right answer. Tests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:28.000\nMaybe your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:46.400\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned. For example, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask you, \"Does a dog bark or meow?\" The correct answer, barking, shows you understand something about dogs.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:57.000\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to check understanding or quality, using questions or other methods to get an answer or result.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:04.700\nI hope that makes tests a little less\u2026testy! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "3d7122e0-cf54-46ed-b818-e6ffe05f19fc": {
    "id": "3d7122e0-cf54-46ed-b818-e6ffe05f19fc",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:49:32.590253",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-06T01:04:21.094807",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260106_010420.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_010420.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nNo need to panic!\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:19.000\nA test is simply a way to check how well you understand something.\nThink of it like this: you learn about apples, and then someone asks you, \"What color are apples?\"\nThat's a mini-test.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:30.900\nTests can come in many forms.\nThey can be written, like a quiz with multiple choice questions, or they can be practical, like showing you know how to ride a bike.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:40.900\nThe main goal is always to see if you grasped the key ideas.\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:45.900\nA math test checks if you can solve problems using numbers.\nSee?\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:53.000\nNothing too scary!\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure your understanding.\n\n00:53.000 --> 01:01.800\nIt helps you and your teachers see what you've learned and what you might need to work on.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "106ba1ef-f40f-41f4-9432-4d6422a81bbd": {
    "id": "106ba1ef-f40f-41f4-9432-4d6422a81bbd",
