    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.500 --> 01:9.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n01:9.400 --> 03:2.000\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the presence of a specific substance.\n\n03:2.000 --> 07:1.000\nThink about it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n07:1.000 --> 09:6.000\nOr a baker might taste a cake batter, that's a test, to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n09:6.000 --> 13:0.000\nEven a doctor uses tests, like a blood test, to check your health.\n\n13:0.000 --> 16:8.000\nSo, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n16:8.000 --> 21:8.000\nIt\u2019s a tool we use to understand something better and confirm or deny our assumptions.\n\n21:8.000 --> 23:9.000\nIn essence, testing is all about getting answers.\n\n23:9.000 --> 25:900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
