    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_010759.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.210 --> 00:05.010\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.010 --> 00:11.610\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.610 --> 00:23.110\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well something works. Think about it like this: You might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:23.110 --> 00:28.610\nOr, a doctor might test your eyesight to see if you need glasses.\n\n00:28.610 --> 00:34.110\nSee? Different kinds of tests! For example, a teacher gives you a test in school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:34.110 --> 00:41.910\nA scientist does tests in a lab to see if a new medicine works. Even trying a new flavor of ice cream is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:41.910 --> 00:52.510\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out. It helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:52.510 --> 00:54.010\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
