    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:19.100\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand more.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz at school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:32.600\nSee? Different situations, same idea.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:43.700\nFor example, a baking test could be tasting a cake to see if it's sweet enough. Or, a simple test for a toy car is pushing it to see if it rolls.\n\n00:43.700 --> 01:00.000\nIt's just a way to check something. So, to recap, a test is a process, or action, designed to learn something, and it can be used in all kinds of situations to help us understand the world around us.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:03.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
