    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:16.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's too hot or just right.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:32.000\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:41.400\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:51.700\nSo, tests can be about physical things, like water or blood, or they can be about knowledge, like a quiz.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.400\nThe main idea is that a test helps us get information and make decisions. They are a super important part of learning and understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
