    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:28.300\nIt's a question or a set of questions designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or even your abilities.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:36.200\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:45.000\nA baker tests the temperature of their oven to make sure the cake will bake correctly. Or maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understood the lesson.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:53.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes! It could be a multiple-choice exam, a practical demonstration, or even just answering a few questions out loud.\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:06.400\nThe important thing is that it helps us understand something better. So, in a nutshell, a test is a tool for measuring knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n01:06.400 --> 01:09.800\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n01:09.800 --> 01:15.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
