    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into the basics of tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:19.500\nThink of it as a structured way to ask a question and get an answer.\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:24.300\nA simple example is baking a cake.\nYou're testing a recipe!\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:27.900\nDoes it taste good?\nIs it cooked all the way through?\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:34.500\nAnother example is a doctor checking your temperature.\nThey're testing to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:44.800\nSo, a test is really just a process.\nYou have something you want to know, you perform an action, and you observe the results.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:55.000\nIt's all about gathering information and making decisions based on what you learn.\nRemember, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
