    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.200\nA test is simply a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like an investigation. We're trying to figure out if something is true or not.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:29.800\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:36.600\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:45.500\nA mechanic might test your car battery to see if it's still working. Basically, a test helps us measure something.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:54.600\nIt gives us information we didn't have before. It's a tool for understanding. So, remember, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new. Tests help us understand the world around us, and even ourselves. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
