    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:13.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:23.400\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:36.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you take a test in school to show what you've learned.\nThose are both examples of tests.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:47.200\nA test can be anything from answering questions on paper, to running an experiment in a lab, or even just observing something carefully.\nThe key is that it's a structured way to get answers.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:55.100\nSo, remember, a test helps us learn something new or confirm what we already think we know.\nIt's all about gathering information in a systematic way.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
