    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the concept of a test.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information and see what's what.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:24.200\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a physical exam \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:34.600\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:44.300\nTests aren't just for school or the doctor, they're everywhere! They help us make informed decisions and understand the world around us better.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and get some answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
