    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:13.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:24.000\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true. For example, a taste test tells us if we like a new flavor.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.100\nOr, a spelling test shows us how well we know our words. Doctors use tests to see if we are healthy.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:40.300\nTeachers use tests to see if we understand what we've been learning. The results help us make better decisions.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand the world a little better.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
