    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.300\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Basically, a test is a way to find out something specific about something or someone.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:31.900\nYou might use a toothpick \u2013 that's your test! You poke the cake, and if the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:43.700\nThat\u2019s a positive result! Tests aren't just for cakes, though. They can be used to check your eyesight, your knowledge of a subject in school, or even if a machine is working properly.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:51.100\nIt's all about gathering information and seeing if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:58.400\nSo, a test helps you understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
