    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.100\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we don't just mean exams at school. A test, in its simplest form, is just a way of finding something out.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a light bulb works.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:28.300\nThe test? You screw it in and flip the switch. If it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:38.900\nOr, maybe you want to see if your dog knows how to sit. You say \"sit,\" and if he puts his bottom on the ground, that's a successful test!\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:46.400\nTests are used everywhere to check if things are working, if something is true, or just to learn more.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:53.900\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check something. It could be anything from a science experiment to seeing if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
