    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:11.100\nOkay, so you're wondering, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:19.900\nWell, in the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:23.800\nIt's a method we use to gather information or see how well something works.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:32.200\nThat's a test! You're testing if the bulb is good.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:36.400\nAnother example? Maybe you're taking a quiz in school.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:39.000\nThat's a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:45.900\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:48.500\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:51.100\nThey help us understand the world around us and make informed decisions.\n\n00:51.100 --> 01:03.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a process for gathering information or assessing something. It can be as simple as flipping a switch or as complex as a medical examination.\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:06.700\nIt's all about finding things out!\n\n01:06.700 --> 01:11.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
