    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:25.100\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nLike, if you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:33.100\nOr, if you try to turn on a light switch and the light doesn't come on, you're testing if the bulb is working.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:43.200\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\nIn science, scientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:53.400\nSo, whether it's a quiz, an experiment, or just trying something new, a test helps us gather information and learn.\n\n00:53.400 --> 01:03.300\nTo recap, a test is a structured way to find something out by asking a question.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
