    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_013125.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHello, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:24.300\nIt\u2019s a process designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even your feelings about something.\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\nA chef tastes their food to test if it's delicious.\nAnd in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.300\nTests can come in many forms. They can be multiple choice, like choosing the best answer from a list.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:39.300\nOr they could be essay questions where you write out your answers.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:47.300\nSometimes, a test isn't even written down! It could be a physical challenge, like running a race, which tests your speed and endurance.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:60.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for finding out information.\nIt helps us understand things better, whether it's about our health, our cooking, or what we know.\n\n00:60.000 --> 00:71.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
