    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_013750.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:24.600\nIt\u2019s a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:30.100\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:35.900\nSee? Different kinds of tests for different things.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.400\nTests help us learn and improve. If you don't do so well on a practice test, you know what you need to study more.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:50.900\nSo, tests aren't something to be afraid of!\n\n00:50.900 --> 01:05.100\nThey\u2019re just tools to help us understand where we are and where we want to go. To recap, a test is a tool for evaluation, used to measure skills, knowledge, or preferences.\n\n01:05.100 --> 01:09.900\nThey help us learn and grow.\n\n01:09.900 --> 01:15.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
