    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be about you, about an object, or even about an idea.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:34.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:43.800\nA battery test checks how much power is left in a battery. Even a taste test, like trying a new flavor of ice cream, is a type of test!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:49.300\nYou're testing to see if you like it. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
