    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.100\nIt's a process we use to gather information. Think of it like this: you take a quiz in school to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:25.900\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:33.600\nSee? Different situations, same idea: finding out information. Another example is baking a cake.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:41.000\nYou might taste the batter before baking it to test if it needs more sugar. The act of tasting is the test!\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:52.500\nSo, a test is just a procedure for gathering information. It can be a formal exam, a simple experiment, or even just a quick check.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:59.600\nTests help us learn and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
