    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_014140.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.600\nIt's like asking a question and then getting an answer.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:26.000\nYou can test it by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:31.400\nThat\u2019s a test.\nOr maybe you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:38.600\nThe test is whether you can ride without falling.\nYou try, and you either succeed or you don't.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:45.800\nThat gives you information about your progress.\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:56.200\nBasically, a test helps you understand something better by giving you some kind of result.\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to get information.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:03.200\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n01:03.200 --> 01:06.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
