    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:23.700\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:38.100\nOr, maybe you take a test in school to show what you've learned. Even a chef tasting their soup is a kind of test to see if it needs more salt!\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:48.400\nSo, a test can be anything from a written exam to a physical examination to even just a simple experiment. The goal is always the same: to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:55.400\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better. It's a way to check, explore, and learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
