    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_014907.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.170\nHi everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.170 --> 00:02.970\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:02.970 --> 00:07.600\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:14.410\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an opinion, you get an answer based on facts or actions.\n\n00:14.410 --> 00:20.140\nFor example, a spelling test helps you find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:20.140 --> 00:23.770\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which cookie is your favorite!\n\n00:23.770 --> 00:31.220\nIn science, a test might involve an experiment to see if a plant grows better with more sunlight.\n\n00:31.220 --> 00:40.760\nSo, a test is a process designed to gather information and measure something.\n\n00:40.760 --> 00:45.730\nIt could be your knowledge, your abilities, or even just your preferences.\n\n00:45.730 --> 00:49.560\nTests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:49.560 --> 00:55.770\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
