    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_014949.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.400\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:06.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:11.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:15.600\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:19.600\nThink about it like this: a taste test tells you if you like a certain flavor.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:23.700\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.200\nAnd a medical test can help doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:37.100\nSo, tests can be used in lots of different situations, from figuring out what your favorite ice cream is, to making sure a building is safe.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:42.500\nThey all have the same goal: to learn something new or confirm something we suspect.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:49.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and checking things out.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:52.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
