    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how well you understand something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like a quick investigation.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:30.200\nThe main idea is to gather information.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:39.100\nFor example, a math test checks your knowledge of math problems. Or, a taste test checks which flavor you like best.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:46.700\nLet's say you bake a cake. To test if it's done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:55.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! That's a test! Another example is when you go to the doctor, they might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.500\nSo, a test is just a way to get information and see where things stand. It helps us understand and learn!\n```"
