    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_015246.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you understand something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like checking if your cake is done.\nYou poke it with a toothpick, right?\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:31.900\nThat's a simple test!\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even writing an essay.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:40.300\nOutside of school, tests are everywhere too!\nWhen you play a video game, the game tests your skills.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:54.500\nWhen a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you're healthy.\nSo, tests help us understand things better, from our knowledge to our health to even the fun we have playing games!\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:02.600\nEssentially, a test is just a way of finding out information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
