    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.900\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:17.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:26.900\nYou screw it in and flip the switch. That's a test! The light either turns on, meaning it passed the test, or it doesn't, meaning it failed.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:32.100\nAnother example is a taste test.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:43.500\nYou try a new food to see if you like it. Your reaction, \"yum\" or \"yuck,\" is the result of the test.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:52.600\nSo, tests help us learn, check things, and make decisions. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: to get an answer.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.100\nThat's the gist of it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
