    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.900\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it this way: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nA taste test tells you which food you like best.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:35.500\nAnd even when you try to turn on a light switch, you're testing if the lightbulb works!\nSo, tests help us learn, discover, and make decisions.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:47.000\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like figuring out if your shoes fit.\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:54.800\nIn short, a test is just a way of gathering information to answer a question.\nPretty simple, right?\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "2e4bbb68-b4af-480f-9b69-00ff7ae79f0a": {
    "id": "2e4bbb68-b4af-480f-9b69-00ff7ae79f0a",
    "topic": "Test",
