    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:26.000\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true. Think about it like this: if you want to know if a light bulb works, you screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:31.400\nThat's a test! Or, maybe you want to know if your cookies taste good.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:36.400\nYou give one to a friend and ask them. That's another kind of test!\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:41.400\nTests are everywhere. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:46.400\nTeachers use tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:55.800\nSo, a test helps us get information and make decisions. It's a simple way to check things out.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
