    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_020709.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of \"tests.\"\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:07.700\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:12.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you poke them with a toothpick.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:13.300\nThat's a test!\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:18.400\nBasically, a test helps us find out information or see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:24.600\nIt could be a quiz at school to see what you've learned, or a doctor checking your reflexes.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:28.900\nEven tasting your soup to see if it needs more salt is a test!\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:33.000\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and checking things.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:40.900\nRemember, they help us learn, improve, and make sure everything is working the way it should.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:42.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
