    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:24.400\nIt\u2019s a process designed to get information or see if something is true. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:30.000\nThat's a test! Or, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:41.300\nAnother example is testing a new recipe. You follow the instructions, and the result, the taste, tells you if the recipe works.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:51.200\nSo, tests are all about gathering information. They help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:59.000\nRemember, a test is just a method to find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "d4b80ee8-868d-494f-b931-d2b592401d1e": {
