    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_021016.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:11.200\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:23.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:35.400\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well someone knows how to spell words.\nOr a taste test might help us decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\nScientists even use tests to see if a new medicine works.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:47.700\nSo, tests help us gather information.\nThey give us data, like scores or ratings, that we can then use to make decisions or learn more.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:49.500\nThey\u2019re a fundamental tool\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:52.400\nfor understanding the world around us.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:53.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
