    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, you\u2019re actually doing something to get the answer.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:33.400\nTests can be used for tons of things. Maybe you're testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.700\nOr perhaps you\u2019re testing a toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:51.400\nEven something as simple as checking if the water is hot enough for your shower is a kind of test! The key thing is that a test helps you understand something better, confirming an idea or finding out if something works as expected. So, a test is just a simple method for discovering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
