    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:06.200\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:13.000\nIt's like asking a question and then getting an answer that tells you more about the subject.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like this: a math test checks if you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:23.500\nIt asks you problems, and your answers show what you know.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:29.000\nOr, imagine a taste test! You try different foods and then say which one you like best.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:32.000\nThat's a test too \u2013 finding out your preference.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:38.500\nTests can be used to measure all sorts of things, from your knowledge to your skills, or even just your opinion.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:41.500\nSo, basically, a test is a tool for gathering information.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:45.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
