    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:28.200\nIt could be checking if you understand a lesson, or if a machine is working correctly, or even if a new medicine is safe.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:33.000\nBasically, you're trying to get information by asking a question or performing an action.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:43.600\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:52.400\nA doctor might do a blood test to check your health. Another example? When you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like the taste!\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:55.800\nSo, tests are all about gathering evidence and learning something new.\n```"
