    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_021702.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:12.100\nThink of a test as a way to check what you know about something. Like, did you learn what you were supposed to?\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:19.800\nIt's kind of like checking if a recipe worked. You follow the instructions, and then you taste the cake to see if it's good!\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:30.700\nA test does the same thing, but for knowledge. For example, your teacher might give you a spelling test to see if you learned how to spell certain words.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:35.300\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:43.200\nSee? Tests help us understand things. So, remember, a test is just a way to check understanding.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:51.700\nIt helps us see what we've learned and what we still need to work on. It's a tool for learning, not something to be afraid of!\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
