    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_021738.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.700\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:01.700 --> 00:04.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:06.500\nIt's a process designed to get information.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:11.500\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:15.200\nThat test helps your teacher understand what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:19.100\nTests aren't just for school, though.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:23.500\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick, like a blood test.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:27.900\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:32.300\nThe goal is always the same: to gather information and make a decision based on the results.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.800\nSo, tests help us learn, understand, and improve things all around us.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:41.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
