    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_021823.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.900 --> 00:07.300\nToday we're going to talk about tests \u2013\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:11.600\nnot the kind you might dread taking in school,\nbut the kind that help us learn and grow.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:15.700\nEssentially, a test is just a way to check\nif something works like it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and\nyou taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:25.700\nOr, if you're building with blocks, you might\ngently push your tower to see if it's strong enough to stand.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:26.600\nThat's another kind of test.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:31.400\nTests can be formal, like a quiz, or informal,\nlike checking if your shoelaces are tied.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:34.800\nThey help us identify problems and figure out\nhow to improve things.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.400\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember\nit's just a way to learn and make things better.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:43.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
