    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:26.000\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand things better. Think about it like this: You might test the temperature of your bath water to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:33.200\nThat's a test! Or, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:40.400\nSame idea. Tests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:50.200\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:58.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and understand something better.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
