    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! \n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.900\nToday we're going to talk about tests. Now, a test is simply a way to find out something. It's like asking a question, but the answer helps us understand what someone knows, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:27.500\nThink of it this way: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:41.100\nA taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes the best. A medical test can tell us if we're healthy.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:50.000\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz in school, to trying out a new recipe, to checking if your bicycle brakes are working properly. It's all about getting information.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:56.700\nIn short, a test is a process to gather information or evaluate something. It helps us learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
