    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:01.400 --> 00:04.200\nA test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:06.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:09.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:17.200\nFor example, if you're baking a cake and you poke it with a toothpick, that's a test!\nYou're testing if the cake is done.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:21.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:26.800\nAnother example is when you try on a new pair of shoes.\nYou're testing if they fit.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:30.800\nIf they're comfortable and the right size, they pass the fit test.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:33.900\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a method for checking something.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:41.900\nWhether it\u2019s a cake, a pair of shoes, or anything else, tests help us understand if something meets our expectations.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
