    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.500\nNow, you might think of school exams, but in the world of science and engineering, a test is simply a way to see how something works, or if it works the way we expect.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like this: you build a toy car.\nThe test is rolling it down a ramp to see how far it goes.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:30.100\nOr imagine you're baking cookies.\nThe test?\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:39.900\nTasting them to see if they're sweet enough!\nTesting helps us understand what's good, what's bad, and what needs to be improved.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:49.600\nIt\u2019s how we learn and make things better.\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a simple way to check things out.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
