    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.200\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:26.800\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:32.400\nOr a chef might taste a sauce to test if it has the right amount of salt.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:38.000\nSee? Different situations, same idea.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:44.300\nAnother example is a car safety test. They crash cars to test how safe they are for passengers.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:55.300\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all help us learn something.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:06.900\nBasically, a test is a way of getting information and measuring something specific. It helps us understand where we stand and what we might need to improve.\n\n01:06.900 --> 01:10.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
