    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.400\nNow, you might think of school, but a test is really just a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.800\nBasically, a test helps us understand if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:47.100\nFor example, a taste test tells us if food tastes good. A medical test helps doctors figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:55.500\nAnd a simple spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:03.900\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn and make better decisions.\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:13.700\nThey come in many forms, but the core idea is always the same: to gather information and get answers.\n\n01:13.700 --> 01:17.300\nIn summary, a test is a method for gathering information to evaluate something.\n\n01:17.300 --> 01:25.300\nIt could be anything from food to health to your knowledge! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
