    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:05.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:10.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if the soup is hot, so you take a little spoonful and taste it.\n\n00:10.300 --> 00:11.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:14.600\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:18.500\nMaybe you're testing if a toy car needs new batteries.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:21.400\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:23.800\nThe main idea is to find out something specific.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:27.900\nWe do something, observe the result, and then we know more than we did before.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:32.700\nSo, next time you're checking if your shoelaces are tied, remember you're performing a test!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:38.000\nIn summary, a test is just a simple way to check something and learn more about it.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
