    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:18.700\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:30.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:40.000\nOr, imagine a doctor testing your reflexes. They tap your knee, and if your leg kicks, that's a positive test result.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:46.200\nTests are everywhere! You take tests in school to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:55.200\nScientists run tests to prove if their theories are right. Basically, a test is a way to check something and get an answer.\n\n00:55.200 --> 01:05.100\nSo, remember, a test is a procedure for gathering information and determining something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
