    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how many words you know.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:28.000\nThose are tests!\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.000\nTests aren't just for people, though. We can test anything!\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:41.700\nWe can test a new toy to see if it's strong. Or we can test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:48.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something. It helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:52.000\nIt\u2019s a method for gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
