    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:02.200\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:03.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:08.100\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:16.200\nThink of it like this: a teacher might give you a test in class to see how much you've learned about a subject, like math.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:23.200\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:26.200\nSo, tests can come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:32.900\nThey can be written quizzes, practical demonstrations, or even just observations.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:37.300\nThe goal is always to get information and figure out if something is working as it should.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:44.800\nTo summarize, a test helps us check knowledge, skills, or functionality.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:47.500\nIt's a tool for learning and improvement.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
