    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:27.100\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you an answer.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:33.700\nThese answers help us understand things.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:43.000\nFor example, a spelling test tells us how well you know how to spell words. A taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes best.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:53.400\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a kind of test! You're testing to see if it lights up. Tests can be as simple as that lightbulb, or much more complicated. The important thing is that they give us information. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
