    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:14.200\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:19.700\nSo, what kind of things can we test? Well, almost anything!\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:29.000\nYou might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a chef might test a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:34.900\nLet's look at a couple examples. A doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:39.900\nA company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:44.900\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:54.200\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and make decisions. It's a way of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard, or to learn more about it.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:56.100\nAnd that's tests in a nutshell!\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
