    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_024456.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see if something works, or to find out what something is like.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe by cooking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:38.900\nOr, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel unwell.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:45.000\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:56.000\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just participating in class discussions.\nSo, tests aren't just about getting a grade.\nThey're about learning and understanding.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:03.700\nIn short, a test is a process to evaluate something.\nWhether it's a food recipe, a medical condition, or your knowledge in school.\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:09.500\nRemember, tests are there to help us learn and improve!\n\n01:09.500 --> 01:12.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
