    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_024632.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like an investigation.\nWe're trying to gather information.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:35.800\nFor example, a spelling test helps us find out how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, a taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes the best!\nEven when you kick a tire on a car, you're performing a small test to see if it's properly inflated.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:45.200\nSo, tests aren't just about grades.\nThey're about learning, discovering, and making informed decisions.\nThey give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:57.700\nIn short, a test is a procedure intended to establish the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:03.500\nThat's the basics of testing!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
