    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like a tool we use to check if something is working correctly, or if it has a specific quality.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:31.400\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:42.600\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. See? Tests come in all shapes and sizes!\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:55.300\nThey help us understand things better by giving us information we can use. Another example: if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:04.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you the cake is done!\n\n01:04.000 --> 01:09.200\nSo, in short, a test is a process or procedure designed to gather information.\n\n01:09.200 --> 01:15.100\nHopefully, you now have a better understanding of what tests are all about!\n\n01:15.100 --> 01:17.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
