    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.100\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:20.000\nIt could be about you, an object, or even an idea. Think of it like this: you might take a quiz in school.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:25.600\nThat's a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:30.600\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:35.600\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:47.800\nTests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The main idea is that you're performing an action to get information.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:56.200\nYou're asking a question, and the test provides the answer.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:06.600\nSo, whether it\u2019s a pop quiz, or just checking if the water's warm before you jump in, you're performing a test. In short, a test is a process to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:06.600 --> 01:11.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
