    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to check how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:31.500\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz, that's a test of what you've learned in class. Or, when you try out a new recipe, you're testing if you can make it successfully!\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:43.100\nTests can be questions on paper, experiments, or even just trying something out. The main goal is to get some information or see a result.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:53.500\nSo, remember, a test helps us learn and understand things better. We can use tests to improve ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
