    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. It\u2019s how we check if something works, if something is true, or how well something performs.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:26.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:31.900\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:38.500\nAnother example is a lightbulb. We can test it to see if it turns on.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:49.400\nIf it does, the test is successful! If not, well, we know something's wrong. So, tests are all about checking things and getting information.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:52.900\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
