    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working, if something is true, or if something is good.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:27.000\nThink about it like this: A doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:36.000\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:42.600\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 it shows if you can follow a recipe!\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:50.700\nSo, tests aren't just for school. They're everywhere! They help us make decisions, solve problems, and learn new things.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:57.500\nThey can be big and complicated, or small and simple. The important thing is that they give us information. And that information can be really useful. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
