    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:05.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:09.900 --> 00:13.100\nThink of it like checking if you understand the basics.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:16.700\nIt's not just about school, though.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:18.000\nTests happen all the time!\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:20.800\nBaking a cake is a test \u2013 does it taste good?\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:24.700\nTaking medicine is a test \u2013 does it make you feel better?\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:28.300\nEven trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:31.000\nSo, a test helps us measure something.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:35.300\nIn school, it might be your knowledge of math or history.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:41.100\nIn life, it could be testing if a new phone works properly or if a new product is safe to use.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:44.900\nEssentially, a test helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:48.400\nIt tells us what we\u2019re good at and where we might need to focus more.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:51.900\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:54.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
