    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.000\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in this case, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing if you get the right answer.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:31.200\nThink of it like this: imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:38.300\nA test might be poking the cake with a toothpick to see if it comes out clean, meaning the cake is done.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:49.900\nOr if you're building with blocks, a test could be gently pushing your tower to see if it stands up. So, a test helps us confirm that things are working as expected.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:55.300\nIt's how we know if something is good or needs some improvement. Remember, testing is all about checking and confirming. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
