    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.200\nNow, a test is basically a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain or your skills. The main idea is to measure something.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:34.600\nIt could be your knowledge of a subject, like math or history. Or it could be your ability to perform a task, like playing a musical instrument or driving a car.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:42.400\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words. A driving test checks if you can safely operate a vehicle.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:54.300\nAnd a quiz in class checks if you understood the lesson. So, in short, a test is a method for measuring knowledge or abilities. They come in many forms, but their purpose is always to evaluate something.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
