    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.800\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand more.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:37.200\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class. Or even simpler, you might test if the water is hot before getting in the shower.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:46.000\nEach of these tests has a purpose: to give us information we need. The doctor learns about your health, the teacher sees how well you understand the material, and you avoid a scalding shower!\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:56.000\nSo remember, a test is just a tool to gather information and learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
