    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.500\nIt's a way to gather information. Think about it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health, right?\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:25.400\nThey might take your temperature or listen to your heart. Those are tests!\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:36.100\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done. In school, tests help your teachers see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.300\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking questions in class. They\u2019re a tool to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:53.100\nSo, a test is basically just a method for checking or evaluating something.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:57.600\nGot it? Awesome! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
