    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test at school shows how good you are at spelling words. Or, imagine a car company testing a new car to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:34.100\nThey're both tests! Another example could be testing a cake recipe to make sure it tastes good.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:41.700\nYou follow the recipe, bake the cake, and then taste it. That's a test to see if the recipe works.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:56.600\nSo, remember, a test is all about finding out information. It helps us understand something better, whether it's your spelling skills, a car's safety, or even the taste of a cake.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:01.500\nTests are everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
