    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:22.700\nIt's a method used to evaluate knowledge, skill, or even performance.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:31.600\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. A chef tastes a dish to test its flavor.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:40.500\nOr, maybe you take a quiz at school to test how well you understood a lesson. Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:51.100\nIt could be a multiple-choice exam, a practical demonstration, or even just a conversation.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.600\nThe goal is always the same: to gather information\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:02.100\nand make a judgement based on that information. So, remember, a test is just a tool for evaluation.\n\n01:02.100 --> 01:05.000\nIt helps us understand where we are\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:08.000\nand what we need to learn next.\n\n01:08.000 --> 01:11.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
