    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_031534.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if something needs to be improved.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:34.600\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:43.500\nOr, a doctor might run a test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.600\nAnother simple test could be checking if a light bulb works. You turn it on, and if it lights up, the test is successful! If it doesn't, the test shows there's a problem.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:01.300\nSo, tests are all about gathering information. They help us learn, diagnose issues, and make better decisions. They are super important in lots of different areas of life. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
