    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:17.500\nWe use them all the time! Think about it.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:22.700\nYou might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:27.900\nThat\u2019s a test! Or maybe you try a new recipe to see if you like it.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:34.700\nThat\u2019s also a test! Basically, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:46.600\nIf you take a spelling test and get a bad grade, you know you need to study those words more. If you test out a new running shoe and find it uncomfortable, you won't buy it.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:55.900\nSo, tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying something new. They all serve the same purpose: to give us data and help us learn.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
