    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:04.600\nToday we're diving into something called a \"Test.\"\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:07.900\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:12.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a new lightbulb to see if it lights up.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:13.600\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:15.600\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:20.000\nA doctor might test your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:23.900\nA baker might taste their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:25.500\nThese are all tests helping us understand something.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:32.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:36.300\nIt\u2019s all about finding out if something is working as it should.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:38.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
