    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific right or wrong answer.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:31.300\nWe use tests all the time! Imagine you're baking a cake. You might stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:44.600\nThat's a test to see if the cake is done! Or, if you're learning a new language, a quiz helps show how much you've learned.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:53.900\nTests can be written, spoken, or even hands-on. They help us check our understanding, see if something is working, or just learn more about the world around us. So, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
