    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:08.600\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:12.700\nWe use them all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:16.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:18.800\nYou stick a toothpick in it, right?\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:20.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:24.900\nOr, maybe you're curious if it's raining outside.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:27.000\nYou might look out the window.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:27.700\nAnother test!\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.500\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking the weather.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:39.500\nThe key thing is they help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:47.600\nFor example, a doctor uses tests to figure out what's making you sick, and a chef tastes their food to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:57.600\nSo, tests are simply tools that help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:00.400\nThey give us answers to our questions.\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
