    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_032435.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:29.300\nIt could be a quiz at school to see how well you learned a subject.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:36.600\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You test it by sticking a toothpick in \u2013 if it comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:37.300\nThat's a test!\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:46.200\nAnother example is testing a new toy to make sure it works properly before giving it to someone. We test things all the time!\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:50.900\nSo, a test is basically a method for checking something, learning about something, or confirming something.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:53.500\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "ccac61c5-51ec-4736-a96a-433aecd60e35": {
    "id": "ccac61c5-51ec-4736-a96a-433aecd60e35",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:51:28.440479",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-06T03:25:22.033805",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260106_032521.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_032521.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:21.000\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, and that's true, but in a broader sense, a test is really just a way to find out something, to see if something works, or to check if something is true.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:34.900\nThink about it like this: if you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Or, if you buy a new toy, you might test it out to see if it does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:46.400\nScientists use tests all the time to see if their ideas are correct. They might do an experiment to test a new medicine or to test if a plant grows better in sunlight.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:57.400\nSo, a test is simply a way of checking something. We use tests to learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
