    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:15.300\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:20.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it as a question we ask to get an answer.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:36.100\nIt's like baking a cake.\nYou test if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready!\nOr imagine taking a spelling quiz.\nThat's a test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.100\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and students take tests to show what they've learned.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:51.600\nSo, a test is a tool for learning, checking, and understanding.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:53.900\nIt helps us make decisions based on the results.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.000\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just a way to gain information!\n```"
