    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.200\nWhat are they and why do we need them?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something works correctly, or to see how good something is.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like this: You bake a cake, right?\nYou taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:30.100\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\nA doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:39.800\nA teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned.\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:47.500\nSo, testing is all about finding out information.\nIt helps us make sure things are working properly, are safe to use, or that we've understood something correctly.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.100\nIt's a really important part of learning and making sure things are done right!\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
