    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.400\nWe use tests all the time to check if things are working as they should, or to see how much you know about a subject.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:28.100\nThink about it like this: a baker might taste their cake batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:39.500\nOr, your doctor might check your temperature \u2013 that's a test to see if you have a fever. In school, tests help your teachers understand what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:50.800\nThey ask you questions, and your answers show them what you know. So, tests are just tools we use to learn and to make sure things are on the right track.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:57.700\nRemember, they're not scary, they're helpful! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
