    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like an investigation.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:21.800\nWe ask a question, and the test helps us find the answer. For example, a spelling test helps us find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:31.000\nOr, a taste test helps us find out which flavor of ice cream people like best. Tests aren\u2019t just in school, though!\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:43.100\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe. So, a test is really just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:53.100\nIn short, a test helps us learn something new or check if we already know something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
