    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how much you know or how well you can do something. Think of it like this: a test is a tool that helps us measure knowledge or skills.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:29.200\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words. Or, a chef might taste a dish to test if it has the right flavors.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:38.200\nIt's just a way to get information! So, to recap, a test helps us figure out what we know or what we can do.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:48.700\nIt\u2019s a tool for measuring knowledge and skills, like a spelling test or a chef tasting food. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
