    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_033559.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something, right?\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking.\nYou do a simple test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:31.200\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:37.600\nYou take tests in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:47.400\nDoctors use tests to figure out what's making you sick.\nEven your phone uses tests all the time to make sure everything is working properly.\n\n00:47.400 --> 01:02.100\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate, assess, or measure something.\nIt can be as simple as checking a cake or as complex as a medical diagnosis.\nIt's all about finding out information.\n\n01:02.100 --> 01:06.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
