    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb works. You screw it in, flip the switch, and bam - the light comes on! That\u2019s a test passed.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:27.800\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:34.600\nYour doctor gives you tests to check your health. Teachers give you tests to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:44.300\nEven baking a cake involves a test: you taste it to see if it's good! So, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.100\nThey give us information and help us make sure things are working the way they should. In short, a test is a way of checking something to see if it's right.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
