    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_033903.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:14.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:31.700\nA teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class. And a chef might taste their food to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:42.900\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes. They can be written quizzes, physical exams, or even just simple observations.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:51.400\nThe key thing to remember is that a test helps us gather information and make better decisions. It's a tool for understanding!\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
