    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know, or what something is capable of doing.\nThink of it like this: it's a way to check your understanding.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.800\nThe core idea is to ask questions or perform actions and then measure the results.\nThese results tell you how well you did or how well something performed.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:40.900\nTasting it is a test to see if you added enough sugar.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:51.800\nSee?\nSimple!\nSo, remember, a test is a way to evaluate knowledge, skills, or performance through questions or actions.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:58.300\nIt's a tool for learning and improvement!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
