    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:29.900\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or how well someone understands something.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:36.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:47.100\nA teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned in class. And even baking a cake is a test! You're testing the recipe to see if it will turn out delicious.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:54.100\nSo, tests can be different sizes and shapes, but they all have the same basic goal: to gather information and learn something new. Tests help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
