    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_034121.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, maybe at school. But what exactly is a test in a more general sense?\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:28.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find something out. It\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate something \u2013 could be your knowledge, a product's quality, or even how well an idea works.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:37.800\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Or, a chef might taste a dish to test its flavor.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:44.200\nAnother example could be trying out different ways to tie your shoes to see which is fastest.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:55.800\nSee? Tests are all around us! So, to recap: a test is a way to evaluate something, by performing a procedure and seeing what happens.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:01.900\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
