    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.200\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:07.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:10.200\nIt's like checking your knowledge!\n\n00:10.200 --> 00:16.000\nThink of it like this: imagine you're learning to bake cookies.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:21.100\nA test would be like asking you questions about the recipe, like \"What's the main ingredient?\" or \"How long do you bake them?\"\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:26.600\nAnother example: If you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of animals or describe where they live.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:27.600\nSee?\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:35.300\nSo, a test is just a tool to help you and your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:41.400\nIt's a way to check your progress and see what you might need to work on.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:45.000\nIt's all about learning and growing!\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:52.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
