    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_034653.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:12.100\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:19.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:28.700\nThink of it as a question you ask to get an answer, or a challenge you set to see how something performs.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:39.200\nFor example, you might test a cake recipe by baking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:49.700\nOr a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Even when you try a new app, you're kind of testing it to see if you like it!\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:51.600\nTests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from simple taste tests to complex scientific experiments. So remember, a test is just a way of finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
