    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something, or to see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it into a lamp. That's a test!\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:29.400\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. Your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:36.200\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:45.800\nEven bakers test their cake batter to make sure it's the right consistency.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:51.600\nSo, tests help us learn, make sure things are working right, and even create delicious treats!\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:57.800\nThey are a way to gather information and make better decisions. That's the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
