    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_034831.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.200\nIt's a method for checking or evaluating something, like your knowledge, or even how well something works.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:32.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test at school checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:35.500\nThat taste? That's a test!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:46.100\nAnother example is testing a new toy to see if it's durable and safe. Tests help us understand things better and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:54.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check or evaluate something. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
