    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\nYou can test them by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:31.000\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cookies pass the test \u2013 they're ready!\nOr, imagine you\u2019re testing your eyesight.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:47.100\nThe eye doctor asks you to read letters on a chart \u2013 that's a test to see how well you can see.\nSo, tests help us understand things, check if something works, or see how well someone understands a subject.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:59.300\nThey can be simple or complex, but they all have the same goal: to get information.\nIn short, a test is a way to find out something you don't already know.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
