    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb turns on.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:30.700\nThat's a test! You're testing to see if it's working. In school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:39.300\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even projects. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:47.900\nOr, think about baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:58.100\nSo, a test is any process used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or the quality of something.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:01.700\nIt's a tool to see where you're at and what you might need to work on.\n\n01:01.700 --> 01:05.300\nIt can be formal or informal, but the goal is always to gain information.\n\n01:05.300 --> 01:08.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
