    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_035659.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.400\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something. Think about it like this: a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.300\nA spelling test shows how well you know your words. And a medical test can help doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:37.300\nTests are everywhere! Your teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:50.400\nA car mechanic might run a test on your car to figure out why it's making a funny noise. So, to recap, a test is just a way to gather information and evaluate something.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:57.600\nIt helps us understand, improve, and learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
