    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_035744.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:07.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:29.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if you don't realize it. For example, a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:41.100\nOr, a spelling test shows you how well you know your words. In science, a test could be an experiment to see if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:51.000\nThe key is, we're trying to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect. Tests help us gather information and make decisions based on evidence.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:55.100\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding things out!\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
