    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_035829.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:20.700\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check something, to see if it works, or if it's true.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:32.000\nThat\u2019s a test! Another example is a spelling test at school.\nIt checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:36.700\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might taste it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:45.500\nThat\u2019s a test too! You're checking the flavor.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding out if something is the way it\u2019s supposed to be.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:52.700\nIt helps us learn and make sure things are working right.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
