    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:34.200\nOr, a doctor might test your vision to see how well you can see. Tests can be used for all sorts of things!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:41.800\nSchool exams are tests to see what you've learned. Scientists use tests to see if their ideas are right.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:53.000\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, remember, a test is just a way to get information or check something.\n\n00:53.000 --> 01:00.400\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
