    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:18.200\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:22.300\nYou might poke one with a toothpick.\nThat's a little test!\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:42.900\nIn science and many other fields, tests help us gather information and see if our ideas are correct.\nFor example, if you want to know if a plant needs more sunlight, you could test it by putting one plant in a sunny spot and another in a shady spot and seeing which one grows better.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:47.900\nAnother example?\nMaybe you're testing different recipes for a cake.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:58.700\nYou bake each one and see which one tastes the best.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and explore the world around us by gathering information.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:01.700\nIt helps us answer questions and make decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
