    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:07.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:11.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:18.000\nIt's a process designed to get information.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:27.000\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:29.300\nSee? Different tests, same idea: gathering information.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:34.000\nAnother example: a chef might taste the soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:38.500\nOr, a builder might test the strength of a bridge before people drive on it.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:40.300\nTests are all around us!\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:45.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:50.400\nA tool we use to get information and make better decisions.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:53.400\nIt helps us understand things more clearly.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
