    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_040440.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:05.600\nToday we're talking about something super important: tests!\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:09.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:13.700\nIt's like asking a question and then figuring out the answer.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:18.600\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you can poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:20.400\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:24.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:29.100\nOr, if you want to know if you're ready for a spelling bee, you might take a practice spelling test.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:32.900\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:37.300\nThey show us what we know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:42.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:45.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
