    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.400 --> 00:02.900\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:02.900 --> 00:05.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:06.700\nThink of it like a quick check-up!\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:09.300\nIt helps us measure knowledge, skills, or even abilities.\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:13.600\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:17.700\nOr, in school, you take a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:21.700\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:27.500\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to complex scientific experiments.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:32.000\nThe main goal is always the same: to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:33.900\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:36.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
