    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time in everyday life.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:34.000\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it! Or, if you check the weather forecast, you're testing if you should bring an umbrella.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:41.700\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:51.600\nA math test shows if you understand addition, and a spelling test shows if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.100\nSo remember, a test is just a way to learn something new about yourself or the world around you.\n```"
