    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_041428.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.800\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but a test is really just a way to check something and see if it works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like this: a baker tests their oven temperature to make sure the cake will bake properly.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:29.200\nOr a doctor tests your vision to see if you need glasses. They\u2019re both checking something specific.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:36.800\nAnother example? A game developer might test a new video game level to make sure it's fun and challenging.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:49.800\nThey\u2019re looking for problems and making sure everything works right. So, in short, a test is simply a way of checking something to see if it meets expectations or works as intended.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:56.800\nIt helps us find problems and make things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
