    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:05.500\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:09.900\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:09.900 --> 00:14.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:18.300\nOr, imagine baking a cake.\nYou might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:24.200\nAnother example, if you're building with blocks, you might test how high you can stack them before they fall.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:26.900\nEach time you try, you're performing a test!\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:34.500\nSo, a test is just a way to find out information or see if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:37.400\nThey help us learn and improve!\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:41.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
