    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:24.900\nIt helps us gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:36.600\nThink of it like a detective gathering clues! We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:49.400\nFor example, tasting a new food is a test to see if you like it. Or, checking if your shoes fit before buying them is a test to see if they're the right size.\n\n00:49.400 --> 01:01.500\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. In science, tests can prove if a hypothesis is correct.\n\n01:01.500 --> 01:13.600\nTests can be simple, like a quick quiz, or complex, like a scientific experiment.\n\n01:13.600 --> 01:17.800\nBasically, a test helps us answer a question or confirm something.\n\n01:17.800 --> 01:25.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and check if something is true.\n\n01:25.900 --> 01:29.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
