    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific. Think of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:25.100\nThe test helps you gather information so you can answer that question. For example, a spelling test helps determine how well you know spelling.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:37.400\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is your favorite. Another example: if you want to know if a plant needs water, you can test it by sticking your finger in the soil.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:49.000\nIf it's dry, the test tells you it needs water! So, remember, a test is really just a structured way to get information and answer a question.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:58.300\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all help us learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
