    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_042106.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.700\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:28.100\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\nLike, if you try a new recipe, you're testing if you can follow the instructions.\nOr, if you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:43.200\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned, and they help you see what you understand well and what you might need to practice more.\nIt\u2019s all about learning and improving.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:52.800\nSo, tests are tools that help us discover things, learn, and get better.\nRemember, they're not about being perfect; they're about understanding.\n\n00:52.800 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
