    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_042157.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nHey there, welcome to this quick introduction to tests!\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:17.700\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:22.500\nThink about it. A taste test? You're testing if you like the food.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:26.500\nA spelling test at school? You're testing your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:30.500\nA medical test at the doctor? They're testing your health!\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:41.700\nBasically, a test involves doing something, like answering questions or performing an action, and then looking at the results to learn something new.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:51.800\nSo, whether it's checking if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it, or taking a multiple-choice exam, you're running a test.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.800\nTests help us understand things better.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:02.400\nTo recap, a test is a process that helps us discover information about ourselves, objects, or situations.\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
