    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_042240.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:18.700\nThink of it like this: you\u2019re baking a cake and you taste the batter. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:25.700\nYou're testing if it tastes good. Or, imagine you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:32.100\nYou screw it into a lamp and flip the switch. If it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:44.300\nWe also use tests in school to see what you\u2019ve learned, like quizzes and exams. These tests help teachers understand what you know and what they might need to explain again.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.400\nSo, a test is just a way to check something, learn something, or see if something works.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.000\nPretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
