    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working as expected.\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:32.200\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\nEven playing a game is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your skills!\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:46.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are right.\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:53.100\nRemember, tests are all about finding things out!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
