    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.000\nSimple as that.\nA test is really just a way to find out what you know or can do.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain!\nIt helps you and your teachers understand where you're doing great and maybe where you need a little extra help.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:30.500\nTests aren't scary, they're just information.\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\nOr a math test shows how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:43.100\nEven trying a new recipe is kind of a test to see if you can follow directions and bake something yummy!\nSo, remember, a test is a tool to learn and improve.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:52.500\nIt shows you what you've mastered and what you can work on next.\nDon't stress, just do your best!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:58.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
