    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_044417.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey there, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like a simple question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:29.100\nIt could be a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:40.200\nOr, it could be a doctor running some blood work to check your health. See? Different situations, same idea: we\u2019re trying to learn something.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:46.600\nFor example, you might test if a toy car needs new batteries by turning it on.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:53.000\nIf it doesn\u2019t work, the test tells you the batteries are probably dead. Another example: baking a cake!\n\n00:53.000 --> 01:03.600\nYou test if it\u2019s done by sticking a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, the cake is ready. So, a test is just a way to gather information and learn more about the world around us. They help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
