    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_044458.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:20.500\nIt's a method we use to check if something is working, if something is true, or even how well we know something.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:31.800\nThink about it like this: a teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class. Or, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you sick.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:43.100\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it comes out delicious!\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:51.500\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information we can use to make decisions and learn more. They're an important part of learning and problem-solving.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "1fc9d871-5ba9-4489-8653-0c102a1d315f": {
    "id": "1fc9d871-5ba9-4489-8653-0c102a1d315f",
