    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_044543.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.220 --> 00:05.420\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.420 --> 00:14.320\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary in school, but really, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.320 --> 00:25.520\nIt's a process or procedure designed to see what you know, or how something works.\n\n00:25.520 --> 00:35.020\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.020 --> 00:44.520\nOr a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:44.520 --> 00:50.720\nWe use tests all the time to gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:50.720 --> 00:56.220\nSo, tests can be written exams, like you have in class, but they can also be experiments, observations, or even just trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:56.220 --> 00:58.720\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better. And that's what it's all about! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
