    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_044634.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.200\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.300\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake. You use a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:40.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:47.200\nYou might wobble at first, but with practice, you'll pass the \"balancing\" test.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:53.500\nTests are everywhere! From your doctor checking your health, to a teacher giving you a quiz.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:02.300\nThey help us learn and improve. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something and see how it's doing.\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:05.900\nIt\u2019s a tool for understanding.\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:07.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
