    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.000\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:05.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:09.400\nIt's how we check if something is working correctly,\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:12.400\nor if we know enough about a topic.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:16.900\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:19.400\nYou taste it to test if it needs more sugar, right?\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:20.600\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:22.000\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:25.800\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the lessons.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:28.400\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:32.800\nEven video games have tests built in, like challenges to see if you can beat a level.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.300\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and check something.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:44.200\nWhether it\u2019s baking a cake, taking a quiz, or playing a game, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:47.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
