    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:33.000\nThat toothpick is performing a test! Tests are used all the time, everywhere.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:41.300\nA doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:50.000\nEven trying a new food is a little test \u2013 you're testing if you like the taste!\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:56.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a procedure to learn something new, whether it\u2019s about cake, your health, or what you've learned in school. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
