    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:21.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:25.900\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:30.700\nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:34.600\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:39.400\nOr, think about taking a quiz at school.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:41.700\nThat's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:45.800\nAnother example?\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:49.300\nA doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:53.800\nOr, a company might test a new product to see if people like it.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:56.600\nBasically, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:01.100\nThey can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like tasting that cake batter.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:05.900\nTests are all about learning and improving things.\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:08.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
