    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:21.600\nIt's a process designed to give us information. Think about it like this: a recipe test tells you if your recipe works.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:29.600\nA spelling test tells you if you know how to spell words. A taste test tells you if you like the flavor of something!\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:44.200\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes. They can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on, or complex, like a medical test to diagnose an illness.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:58.000\nThe important thing is, they all aim to give us an answer to a question. In short, a test is just a way of gathering information, a tool we use to learn and understand things better.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
