    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: the concept of a test.\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:21.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us find out if something is working correctly, if something is true, or if something meets certain standards.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:30.800\nThink of it like this: a baker tests their cake by sticking a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:39.200\nOr, imagine you\u2019re taking a spelling test in school. That test is checking how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:49.400\nAnother example could be testing the batteries in your flashlight to see if they still have power.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:56.200\nSo, a test is a simple way of checking something. It helps us understand and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
