    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_050202.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a structured process we use to get information or measure something specific.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:28.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:42.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it works! Tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to get a clearer picture of something.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:52.500\nSo, whether it's a math quiz, a science experiment, or even just trying a new brand of coffee, you're conducting a test.\n\n00:52.500 --> 01:00.800\nBasically, you're gathering information to learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
