    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to see what you know or can do.\nThink of it like checking your understanding.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:19.600\nA test can come in many forms.\nIt could be answering questions on paper, like a quiz in school.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:31.900\nOr it could be something more hands-on, like a driving test to see if you can operate a car safely.\nThe important thing is that it measures your skills or knowledge in a specific area.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:40.400\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve equations.\nA spelling test might ask you to write words correctly.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:46.900\nAnd a cooking test might ask you to prepare a simple dish.\nEach one checks a different skill.\n\n00:46.900 --> 01:00.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool for measuring what you've learned or what you can do.\nIt helps you and others understand your strengths and areas where you might need a little more practice.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:04.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
