    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:06.000\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:09.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:13.000\nWell, think of it as a way to check something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:17.000\nIt's like a quiz, but it doesn't always have to be graded.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.000\nBasically, a test helps us understand how well something works\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:25.000\nor how much of something there is.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:28.000\nFor example, you might test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.000\nOr, a doctor might run a test to see if you have a certain vitamin in your body.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:38.000\nImagine you're building a tower of blocks.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:42.000\nYou might gently push it to test if it's stable.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:45.000\nIf it falls, you know you need to rebuild it differently!\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:49.000\nSo, tests are simply ways of finding things out.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:52.000\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:54.000\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
