    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like seeing if your keys are in your pocket.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.200\nThe goal is always to gather data.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:41.200\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. A chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:52.800\nEven shaking a gift box to guess what's inside \u2013 that's a test! So, a test is really just a method of inquiry, a way to learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nIt helps us make decisions and understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
