    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:22.900\nIt's like asking questions or trying something out to see what happens. Think about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:33.800\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is a test of your balance.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:49.200\nScientists use tests all the time to see if their ideas are correct. They might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:55.200\nSo, whether it's tasting a cake, riding a bike, or doing a science experiment, a test helps us learn and understand things better. It's all about finding out the answer! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
