    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to see how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like a measuring tool for your knowledge or skills. There are all sorts of tests.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.800\nMaybe you've taken a spelling test in school, or a test to get your driver's license.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:42.200\nEven a taste test for new ice cream flavors is a kind of test! So, let's say you're learning about animals.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:50.200\nA test might ask you to name different animals or describe their habitats. The answers you give show how much you've learned.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:56.200\nBasically, a test helps you and others understand what you already know and what you might need to learn more about. It's a way to check your progress! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
