    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:28.400\nYou perform a test \u2013 you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:33.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:39.400\nTests are used everywhere. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:48.500\nTeachers use tests to see how well you understand a subject. Even video games use tests to see if you've completed a level.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:52.400\nThe main goal is always the same: to gather information and make a decision based on the results.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.000\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
