    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_051157.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE: The times below are approximate and should be adjusted to precisely match the audio.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nWell, a test is simply a way to find out information. Think of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:21.900\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. It could be a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic. Or it could be a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:31.300\nEven trying a new recipe to see if it tastes good is a kind of test! For example, you might test a toy to see if it's strong enough to not break, or test a new cookie recipe to see if your friends like it.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:41.100\nEach test gives you results that you can learn from. So, a test is all about gathering information to learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:53.900\nIt's a simple way to explore the world around you.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
