    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:22.400\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:30.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:39.300\nOr, you take a test at school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:48.900\nTests can be anything from a simple yes or no question, to a big project.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:52.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
