    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_052549.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nHi there! Today, we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:25.000\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:33.700\nThink of it this way: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:42.000\nOr your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:53.100\nFor example, a simple test could be asking someone their favorite color. The answer they give is the result of the test. Another example is baking a cake and tasting it \u2013 the taste is the \"test\" of whether the recipe worked!\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.600\nSo, to recap, a test is just a method for gathering information or evaluating something.\n```"
