    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_052628.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.600\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:28.400\nWe use them all the time in everyday life, even if we don\u2019t realize it. Think of it like checking if your shoes are tied before you go outside. That's a mini-test!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:37.500\nMore formally, a test is a procedure to evaluate the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:49.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A taste test tells you if you like the flavor of a new ice cream. And a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:57.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions. They're everywhere, helping us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
