    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:22.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how well someone knows something or how well something works.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.000\nIt's like a little investigation!\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:37.400\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:44.200\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:50.100\nYou might taste it before it's finished to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:50.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n```"
