    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:20.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like a question, or a series of questions, designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or ability.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:29.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you can spell words. A taste test helps decide which food tastes better.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:44.300\nEven a simple quiz on your favorite TV show is a type of test! So, tests come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to gather information and help us understand something better.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.300\nRemember, a test isn't about being perfect, it's about learning and improving! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
