    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_053025.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.600\nIn school, you take tests to see how well you've learned the material.\nBut tests aren't just for school.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:29.000\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you sick.\nA chef might taste-test a new recipe to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:34.400\nSo, examples?\nA math quiz is a test of your math skills.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:42.700\nA blood test checks different things in your blood.\nEven trying a new video game can be seen as a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:49.900\nBasically, a test is a method for gathering information.\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
