    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nToday we're going to talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like a detective gathering clues. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:35.000\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to test if it's done.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:39.000\nSee? Tests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:46.700\nAnother example is when you take a quiz in school. That's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.400\nTests aren't scary, they're just tools to give us information. So, remember, a test is a process or tool used to gather information and learn something.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:59.300\nIt's all about finding out more! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
