    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.500\nNow, in general, a test is simply a way to check something.\nThink of it like a quick way to see if something works, or if it's right.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:22.900\nWe use tests all the time.\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test showing the cake is done!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:32.300\nOr, imagine you're trying to turn on a light.\nIf you flip the switch and the light comes on, that's a test that shows the lightbulb is working.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:44.900\nSo, a test is just a simple check to see if something is working or correct.\nIt's a quick and easy way to find out information.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:52.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
