    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.200\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:9.800\nThink of it like gathering information.\n\n00:09.800 --> 00:11.000\nIt could be about anything!\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:16.600\nWe test things all the time without even realizing it.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:23.200\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might taste the batter.\nThat's a test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:29.800\nOr, if you're trying to turn on a lamp and it doesn't work, you might test the lightbulb to see if it's burned out.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:36.500\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:40.800\nThey can also be informal, like checking the weather before you decide what to wear.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:49.000\nSo, a test is just a method of gathering information to help you make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
