    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_053819.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.700\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, like in school, but what exactly is a test?\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:29.200\nBasically, a test is just a way to find out something. It\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether that's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even how well a plant grows with a new fertilizer.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:36.000\nThink of it like this: A baking test. You bake a cake, and then you taste it to test if it's good.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:42.900\nOr, imagine you're testing a toy car. You push it down a ramp to see how far it goes. That's a test!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:50.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to evaluate or find out something. It can be a simple observation or a more complex experiment.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:57.700\nIt's all about finding the answer to a question!\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
