    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:15.300\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:28.000\nIt helps us understand what we know, or how well something works. Think about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:38.000\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake and taste it to see if it's sweet enough \u2013 that\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:50.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. They can be written, like exams, or practical, like trying out a new recipe. They can even be digital, like a speed test for your internet connection.\n\n00:50.800 --> 01:00.600\nThe main idea is, they give us information. So, a test is simply a way of gathering information to learn something new.\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:04.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
