    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don\u2019t realize it.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:37.000\nThe main idea behind a test is to see if something is true or false, good or bad, works or doesn't work.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:47.400\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.900\nEven trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it! So, tests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:05.200\nThey provide information we can use. In short, a test is a process used to gather information and evaluate something.\n\n01:05.200 --> 01:09.900\nWe use tests to learn, to diagnose, and to improve things all around us.\n\n01:09.900 --> 01:11.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
