    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.800\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if something is true. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:33.000\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic. Another example could be testing a new lightbulb to see if it lights up.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:38.300\nIf it does, the test passes! If it doesn\u2019t, the test fails.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:49.100\nSo, a test helps us confirm something, or identify a problem. Basically, it's a way to check and see if things are as they should be.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:56.200\nSo, remember, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us check and confirm!\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
