    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.599\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:24.599\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a specific area. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:33.399\nA taste test tells you which flavor you prefer. Even a doctor checking your temperature is a type of test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:43.299\nTests can be written, spoken, or even hands-on. The important thing is that they give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:53.199\nSo, a test is just a way to learn something about yourself or the world around you. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
