    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something, whether it's about yourself, a product, or even an idea.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nThe important thing is to have a clear goal.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:27.600\nAre you testing if a cake recipe tastes good?\nOr maybe if a new phone charger actually works?\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:35.800\nLet's say you're baking cookies.\nYou test the batter by tasting a little bit before baking to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:42.600\nThat's a test!\nOr imagine trying out different routes to school to see which one is the fastest.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:53.400\nAgain, you're running a test!\nSo, a test is just a process of trying something out and seeing what happens, helping you learn and improve.\n\n00:53.400 --> 01:04.200\nRemember, clearly define what you want to learn, try it out, and see the results!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
