    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.400\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in this case, we mean a way to check if something works the way it should.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like this: you have a lightbulb. A test would be screwing it into a lamp to see if it lights up.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:27.500\nIf it does, the test passes! If it doesn't, the test fails.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:34.300\nAnother example is baking a cake. You follow the recipe, and the test is tasting it!\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:39.300\nDoes it taste good? If yes, the cake-making test passes!\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:49.700\nSo, a test is simply a way to make sure something is doing what it's supposed to do. It\u2019s all about checking and making sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:53.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
