    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_055621.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.600\nFor example, a math test helps us understand how well you know your numbers.\nOr a taste test lets us know if you like a new flavor.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:31.200\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a test \u2013 does the light come on?\nYes or no?\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:45.200\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\nThey come in many shapes and sizes, but the core idea is always the same: to gather information.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:52.900\nRemember, a test is just a way to find things out.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
