    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:08.700\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:17.700\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:20.300\nYou might poke one with a toothpick.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:20.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:28.400\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like showing you know how to play a song on the recorder.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:36.600\nDoctors use tests to check your health, like taking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:46.400\nSo, whether it's checking cookies, showing what you know in school, or making sure you're healthy, a test helps us understand something better.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:48.700\nBasically, it's a way to get information!\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
