    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_055753.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.600\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:20.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:29.700\nYou can test all sorts of things! For example, you might test if a new toy works by playing with it. Or, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:32.800\nTests can be as simple as tasting a new food to see if you like it.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:43.200\nSee? You're testing your taste buds! So, remember, a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect. It's all about gathering information. They come in many shapes and sizes.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:49.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
