    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:07.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:10.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:13.500\nIt's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:19.800\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:24.900\nOr, a doctor uses a thermometer to test your temperature.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:30.600\nIn both cases, they're using a test to get information \u2013 whether the soup tastes good, or if you have a fever.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:37.200\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:41.900\nThe key is they all help us learn something new.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:49.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to gather information and understand things better.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:53.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
