    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:13.600\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:20.400\nWe use them all the time!\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:29.800\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\nThe test is the question and the result you get is the answer.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:38.000\nFor example, a taste test.\nYou try a new flavor of ice cream, that's the test, and your reaction, whether you like it or not, is the answer.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:46.200\nOr, think about a simple quiz at school.\nThe questions are the test, and your answers show what you've learned.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:52.800\nSo, to recap, a test is just a method for getting information.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nIt helps us learn, evaluate, and understand things better, whether it's about ice cream or important facts.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
