    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:21.600\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if something is true. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:28.700\nOr, you might take a test at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:34.400\nAnother example? Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:46.400\nYou might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! So, a test helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working properly.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:51.900\nTests are all around us, helping us understand the world better.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
