    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE\nAll timings are approximate.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:26.600\nIt's how we check if something is true or false, or if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:38.100\nThink about it like this: If you bake a cake, you might taste it \u2013 that's a test! You're testing to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:46.700\nOr, if you're trying to learn a new skill like riding a bike, falling down a few times is also a kind of test.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:55.800\nYou're testing your balance and learning what works and what doesn't. So, tests are all about learning and understanding.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.400\nThey help us improve and make sure things are working correctly. Just remember, a test is simply a way to find something out!\n```"
  },
