    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_060627.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:22.600\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something well.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.900\nThink of it like this: Your mom might test the temperature of your forehead to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:39.200\nThat\u2019s a test! Or, before baking a cake, you might test the oven temperature to make sure it\u2019s hot enough.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:47.100\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. That helps your teacher see how well you\u2019ve learned your spelling words.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:52.400\nSo, tests aren\u2019t always scary. They just give us information.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:56.000\nThey help us check things and learn!\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:00.100\nBasically, a test is just a way to gather information and see where we stand.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:03.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
