    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_060710.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:26.200\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance in a specific area.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:34.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:44.400\nA chef tastes food to test its flavor. And in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:54.800\nFor example, a simple spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A math test checks your ability to solve math problems.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:05.200\nTests help us understand how well we're doing and where we might need to improve.\n\n01:05.200 --> 01:12.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a method to evaluate something, like knowledge or skill, through a set of questions or tasks.\n\n01:12.600 --> 01:19.000\nIt helps us measure progress and identify areas for growth.\n\n01:19.000 --> 01:24.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
