    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:18.600\nA test is simply a way to find out something. It's a process, usually with questions or tasks, designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or even just a characteristic.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:28.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:38.800\nA taste test helps you decide which food you like better.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:49.000\nEven a medical test, like checking your temperature, is a test to see if you might be sick. So, you see tests are all around us.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:55.000\nThey help us learn, make choices, and understand the world better. Remember, a test is just a tool to gather information. It\u2019s not something to be scared of! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
