    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_060946.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really important: the test.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:14.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:24.000\nWe use tests all the time to check if something is working, if something is true, or even to see how well we understand something.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:33.600\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:45.000\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge. A baker might even taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:55.800\nEssentially, a test is an action or procedure designed to reveal something we want to know. It helps us gather information and make decisions based on that information.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and understand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
