    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.800\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting an answer, you get a result that tells you more.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:21.100\nSo, what are we testing? Well, anything!\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:28.000\nYou might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or a doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:35.100\nFor example, a simple test could be tasting two different cookies and deciding which one you like better. That's a taste test!\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:39.500\nOr think about a classroom test.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:49.600\nThat's designed to see how well you understand what you've been learning. Basically, a test helps us gather information and make informed decisions.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:54.000\nIt's all about learning and figuring things out.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
