    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:13.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:23.900\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information, whether it's about your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even how well something works.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:32.000\nThink about it: a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A taste test tells you if you like a new flavor.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:42.300\nEven a doctor asking you questions to see if you\u2019re feeling okay is a type of test!\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:51.900\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us data, which we can then use to make decisions or learn more. They are a valuable tool for learning and evaluating.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
