    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nWe use them all the time!\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\nYou use a toothpick \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:30.200\nIf it comes out clean, the cookies pass the test and are ready.\nTests can also be a bit more formal, like a quiz in school.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:38.000\nThat test helps your teacher see how well you understand the material.\nOr imagine a doctor checking your temperature.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:48.500\nThat's a test to see if you have a fever.\nSo, a test is really just a tool to help us learn something new or confirm what we already suspect.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:58.500\nIt could be about cookies, school, or even your health!\nIn short, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:02.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
