    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_061750.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something.\nIt could be anything, really.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:26.200\nWe test things to see if they work, if they're safe, or even just to learn more about them.\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:37.900\nOr, when you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\nEven trying a new flavor of ice cream is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:46.500\nSo, tests help us make decisions and understand the world around us.\nThey're all about gathering information.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:55.900\nTo recap, a test is simply a way to check something, learn about it, and then make a decision based on what you find out.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
