    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like checking if something works, or seeing how well you know something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:25.600\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:31.800\nThey're using the test to gather information.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:39.700\nAnother good example is baking a cake. You might test the cake with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:50.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, you know it's ready! So, a test is just a process for getting information, whether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even if your cake is baked perfectly.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:53.900\nIt's all about learning something new.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
