    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone understands a topic.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:27.500\nYou turn it on \u2013 that's your test!\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:34.100\nIf it lights up, it passes the test. If it doesn't, it fails.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:45.400\nAnother example is a quiz at school. It's a test to see how well you learned the material. If you answer the questions correctly, you pass the test, showing you understand the topic.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:54.900\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
