    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_062618.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something really important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:15.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:23.200\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:35.300\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is ready, you can test it by poking it with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:40.000\nOr, if you want to know if your friend knows their ABCs, you can ask them to recite them.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:44.700\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:53.700\nTests aren't just for baking or school. They're used everywhere! Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:04.400\nBasically, a test helps us get information to make better decisions.\n\n01:04.400 --> 01:07.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find things out.\n\n01:07.800 --> 01:11.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
