    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.700\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.700 --> 00:03.400\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:06.800\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:11.100\nIt's a process where we ask a question, or set up a situation, and then observe the result.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:15.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a flu test to find out if you have the flu.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:19.700\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:23.800\nAnother example: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:27.200\nYou follow the instructions, bake the cake, and then taste it!\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:27.800\nThat's a test.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:33.100\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:36.800\nWe ask a question, perform an action, and then look at the result.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:38.200\nIt's all about finding things out!\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:40.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
