    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHello, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it as a question or a series of questions designed to reveal information.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:34.100\nIt could be a quiz at school, which tells your teacher what you've learned.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:40.500\nOr, it could be a medical test, like checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:47.300\nEven tasting a new food to see if you like it is a type of test! You're testing its flavor.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:50.900\nSo, a test helps us learn something we didn't know before.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:53.300\nWhether it's about your knowledge, your health, or even just your preferences, a test gives us valuable insights.\n```"
