    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is true or working correctly.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:21.300\nWe use tests all the time! Your doctor might give you a test to check your health.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:33.000\nA teacher uses tests to see how well you understand a subject. Even baking a cake is kind of a test \u2013 you\u2019re testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious!\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:49.200\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information and make sure things are as they should be. Whether it's a quiz in school, a science experiment, or even checking if your phone is working, it's all a form of testing.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:56.400\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
