    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_063137.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something. Think of it like a little investigation.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:24.600\nIt helps us understand what someone knows, what they can do, or even how something works.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:33.200\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words. A taste test helps you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:47.600\nAnd a medical test helps doctors figure out if you're healthy. Tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:51.300\nSo next time you hear the word \"test\", remember it's just a tool for learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
