    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_063222.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is really just a way to check something. It\u2019s how we find out if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:26.200\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it\u2019s done.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:37.600\nOr, if you're buying a new toy, you might test it out to make sure all the buttons work.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:44.800\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.600\nAnd in science, scientists use tests to see if their experiments worked the way they thought they would.\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:00.400\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do. So, remember, tests are all about checking things! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
