    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:17.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:27.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a medical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:32.600\nOr, a chef might taste a dish to test if it's seasoned correctly.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.800\nTests aren't just about school, though. You test things every day!\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:50.000\nYou might test if the stove is hot before you touch it, or test if your shoes are tied before you run.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.600\nSo, a test is really just a structured way to gather information and make a decision. Remember, tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
