    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific goal in mind.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:28.200\nIt\u2019s a way to measure your knowledge, skills, or even how well something works.\nFor example, a spelling test shows how many words you know how to spell.\nOr, a taste test helps decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:41.200\nTests can be written, like quizzes in school, or they can be practical, like testing the brakes on a car.\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:51.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a process for learning or measuring something.\nIt helps us understand more about the world around us, and ourselves!\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:60.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
