    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.400\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we simply mean a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:26.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:34.700\nThink about it like this: a cookie recipe is a test. You follow the instructions, and the test is whether or not you get delicious cookies at the end.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:40.700\nAnother example? A spelling test at school! It\u2019s a way to see if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:46.500\nOr, testing if a lightbulb works by screwing it in. Does it light up? Then it passes the test!\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:54.300\nSo, a test is just a method, a way to check something and get a result.\n\n00:54.300 --> 01:02.700\nIt's a fundamental part of learning and understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
