    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:32.100\nThe main idea is to give something a trial run to see how it performs.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:37.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:42.700\nOr, a software developer might run a test on a new app to see if it has any bugs.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:55.000\nAnother example? Imagine baking a cake! You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. So, to sum it up, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
