    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.400\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.900\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:26.800\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:31.700\nThat's a test! Or, when you try on a new pair of shoes, you're testing if they fit.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:42.900\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like tasting soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:47.800\nThey help us understand things better, make decisions, and learn.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:51.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
