    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:23.700\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:30.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:37.300\nA math test checks your understanding of math concepts. Even baking a cake can be a test!\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:44.500\nYou're testing your recipe and your baking skills to see if you get a delicious result.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:51.800\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes and help us learn and grow. They show us what we already know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:56.200\nRemember, tests aren't scary! They're just tools to help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
