    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information or see if something is true.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:20.200\nThink about it.\nA spelling test in school checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:29.200\nA taste test lets you decide which food you like best.\nOr maybe a doctor runs some tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:42.400\nSo, a test can be anything from a quick quiz to a detailed experiment.\nThe important thing is that it helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspected.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:51.000\nA test helps us know more about ourselves and the world around us.\nIn short, a test is just a way to get answers.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
