    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.100\nA test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but in a more formal way.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:23.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:33.300\nA teacher gives you a quiz to check if you understood the lesson. And even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe!\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:42.700\nSo, tests help us measure things, understand how well we\u2019re doing, and learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:53.500\nThey come in many forms, from simple questions to complicated experiments. Remember, a test is just a tool to gather information.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
