    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.200\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know or can do.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like this: your teacher might give you a test on the alphabet to see if you know all the letters.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:32.600\nOr a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.900\nA test helps us measure something. For example, a spelling test measures your spelling skills.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:46.900\nA math test measures your math skills. The results help us understand what you're already good at and what you might need to work on a little more.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:50.800\nSo, tests aren't scary, they're just tools for learning and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
