    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:25.600\nIt could be about anything! Essentially, you're asking a question, or presenting a challenge, and seeing what happens.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:34.000\nThink of it like this: a chef might test the soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:48.900\nOr, you might test a new lightbulb to make sure it works. Even a doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy!\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:56.100\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:03.300\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n01:03.300 --> 01:09.500\nThe key thing is that they give us information we didn't have before.\n\n01:09.500 --> 01:15.000\nThey help us understand something better. That's the basics of what a test is!\n\n01:15.000 --> 01:21.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
