    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_065658.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:24.500\nIt helps us measure or evaluate. Think about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:36.000\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste a little bit to test if it needs more sugar. Another example: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:51.900\nTests come in all shapes and sizes! So, to recap, a test is a tool we use to learn more about something, whether it's your spelling skills, the taste of a cake, or even your overall health.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:58.400\nIt's all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
