    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:21.100\nIt could be used to see how well you know a subject, like in a school exam.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:32.300\nBut tests aren't just for school! They\u2019re used everywhere. For example, a taste test checks if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:42.100\nOr, think about testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:49.200\nSo, whether it\u2019s a quiz, a survey, or even just trying something new to see if you like it, you're conducting a test!\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.600\nA test helps us gather information and learn something. In essence, it's a way to get answers.\n```"
