    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_070209.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.600\nIt's like a check-up for your brain! Think of it this way: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling words.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:34.000\nOr a math test shows how good you are at solving problems. Tests can also be practical, like a driving test to see if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:44.600\nSo, tests help us measure our understanding and skills. They're not meant to be scary, but rather a tool to help us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:53.300\nRemember to always try your best and see them as a chance to show what you know! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
