    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.700\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something. It's how we find out if something works, if something is true, or if something is good enough.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:27.100\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick. That's a test to see if it's done.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:34.000\nOr, when you buy a new phone, you might try making a call. That's a test to see if it works.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:41.800\nEven spelling tests in school are there to check if you know your words!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:52.500\nSo, tests are all around us. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. In short, a test is a way to confirm or deny something.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
