    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_070741.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore something super important: Tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.400\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly, or if you understand something.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:27.800\nIt\u2019s like a little quiz for a thing or for you! For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:40.000\nOr, a food company might test their products to make sure they're safe to eat. In school, your teacher gives you tests to see if you've learned the material.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:46.100\nSo, a test is really just a way to get information and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:49.600\nThey help us learn, improve, and stay safe. That\u2019s the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
