    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.000\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in general, a test is just a way to find out if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch. That's a simple test!\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:27.600\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You taste the batter to make sure it's sweet enough. That's a test too!\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:38.700\nWe run tests all the time, big and small, to make sure things are safe, effective, and doing what we expect.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:47.000\nFor example, doctors use tests to check your health, and engineers test bridges to make sure they're strong enough.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:54.400\nSo, a test is simply a way to check something! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
