    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.500\nIt's a process designed to get information. Think about it: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:29.400\nA chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, you might take a quiz in school to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:37.800\nThe key is that a test involves asking a question or performing an action, and then looking at the result to learn something.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:44.600\nYou're trying to get an answer! Tests help us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:56.400\nSo, remember, a test is a method for gathering information. It could be something as simple as tasting food or as complex as a medical examination.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:03.600\nThey all serve the same purpose: to help us learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
