    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_071011.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.500\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:05.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:07.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:10.200\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:10.200 --> 00:13.300\nThink about tasting a new food. That's a test!\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:15.700\nYou're testing to see if you like the flavor.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:20.100\nOr, imagine checking if a lightbulb works. You flip the switch \u2013 that\u2019s the test!\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:22.700\nIf it lights up, it passes.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:24.600\nIf it doesn't, well, the bulb failed the test.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:31.300\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like seeing if your shoes fit.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:37.300\nThe important thing is that a test helps you learn something new or confirm something you already suspected.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:40.300\nSo, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:43.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
