    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_071058.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:22.800\nA test, in simple terms, is a way to find out if something is working correctly or is true.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:31.400\nThink of it like this: you test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it to see if it comes out clean \u2013 that tells you if it's baked all the way through!\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:44.900\nTests are used everywhere. A doctor uses tests to check your health, like taking your temperature or drawing blood.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:56.200\nA scientist uses tests to see if their ideas are right, like mixing chemicals to see what happens. Even you test things every day, like tasting food to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.300\nSo, a test is really just a way of checking something to learn more about it.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:01.900\nIt helps us make sure things are working as expected and helps us discover new things.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:05.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
