    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_071139.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.900\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It helps us learn if something is true, or if something works the way we expect it to.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.100\nThink about it like this: you might test a new cookie recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:34.700\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:45.500\nScientists test their ideas with experiments. We test things all the time without even realizing it!\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:52.100\nSo, whether it's checking if your toy car still rolls, or taking a quiz at school, a test is just a structured way of getting information.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.700\nIt helps us understand the world around us better. A test is a way to learn and to improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
