    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:26.200\nIt's a structured process designed to measure knowledge, ability, or even just preference. Think of it like this: a math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:31.200\nA taste test helps determine which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:40.000\nSee? It's all about gathering information in a reliable way. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:54.900\nOr, a company might use a survey as a test to see how satisfied customers are. So, tests are all around us, helping us learn, evaluate, and understand things better.\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:05.100\nThey provide valuable insights, whether it's about ourselves or the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
