    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:23.200\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly,\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:27.800\nor to see how much someone knows about a subject.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:32.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.800\nYou screw it in and flip the switch. That's a test!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:42.800\nIf it lights up, it passes the test. If not, it fails.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:51.400\nOr imagine a spelling test in school. It shows how well you've learned to spell different words.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:56.900\nThe more words you spell correctly, the better you did on the test. So, a test is a way to get information. It can be used to check things, measure knowledge, or just explore something new. That's the core idea! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
