    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific right or wrong answer.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:27.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:35.200\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again to test if that fixes the problem.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:44.200\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if the water is hot enough for a shower.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:55.800\nThe main idea is to try something and see what happens, to get an answer or learn something new.\nSo, a test is just a way to find things out.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
