    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.000\nIt's a process designed to give us information. Think of it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:30.200\nOr, imagine a taste test! You try different flavors of ice cream to see which one you like best.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:35.000\nThose are both tests. Tests aren't just for school or food.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:45.700\nDoctors use tests to check your health, like taking your temperature to see if you have a fever. Scientists use tests to learn about the world around us.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:55.200\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new. Remember, it's all about finding things out!\n\n00:55.200 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
