    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_071954.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like a question you ask to get an answer. It could be a quiz at school to see what you've learned, or a taste test to see which ice cream flavor you like best.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:30.400\nEven checking if a light bulb works is a type of test! You're trying to find out if it's good or bad.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:41.800\nSo, in each case, you're doing something to get information. You ask the question, you try the ice cream, you flip the light switch.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:53.100\nAnd the result, the answer, tells you something. Essentially, a test helps us learn, decide, and understand things better.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:59.900\nRemember, it's all about finding something out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
