    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:13.800\nNot the kind you take in school, but tests in a more general sense.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:19.400\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:25.000\nWe use them all the time! Think about tasting a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:29.800\nThat's a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:33.000\nOr imagine you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb is broken.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:36.100\nYou put it in a lamp.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:39.200\nIf it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:42.300\nSee? It's just a way to check something.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:48.400\nWe might test a recipe to make sure it tastes good, or test a toy to see if it's safe.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:50.000\nSo, a test is a quick and easy way to learn about something by trying it out.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
