    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_072452.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, your abilities, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to test if it's done.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:31.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:39.900\nThere are quizzes in school to test what you've learned.\nCompanies test new products to make sure they're safe and work properly.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:47.200\nEven doctors use tests, like blood tests, to check your health.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:54.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\nIt helps us understand something better by giving us concrete results.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:58.200\nHopefully that clears things up!\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
