    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process where we ask a question or perform an action to see what the answer or result will be.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:40.000\nA taste test tells you if you like a certain flavor.\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a test \u2013 you're testing if the light bulb works!\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:49.800\nSo, tests help us gather information and learn more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:58.400\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like figuring out if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:05.700\nThe important thing is that they help us discover something new. To recap, a test is a way of finding things out.\nIt's asking a question and seeing what the answer is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
