    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.700\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:28.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:43.700\nOr, your teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class. Even baking a cake is kind of a test! You're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:51.500\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's our own health, how much we know, or even if a cake recipe works! They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:55.100\nRemember, a test is just a way of learning something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
