    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_073147.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:22.200\nA test, simply put, is a way to check how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:29.800\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:38.000\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:47.400\nAnother example could be testing a new recipe. You follow the instructions, bake it, and then taste it to see if it's delicious! You're testing the recipe!\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:52.500\nSo, tests come in many forms, but they all have the same goal: to find out information and learn something new.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:55.300\nThey help us understand where we're at and what we need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
