    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:19.200\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\nThink about it.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:32.700\nWhen you bake a cake and taste it, that's a test to see if it tastes good.\nOr, if you try to turn on a light switch and the light comes on, that's a test to see if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:46.900\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\nThe important thing is, they help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:57.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\nIt's an experiment, a question, a way to explore and learn!\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
