    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.900\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. We want to see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, you might press the power button on your TV to test if it\u2019s working.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:34.600\nIt's all about finding out information. For example, your doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:43.800\nA scientist might run an experiment to test a new idea. Even just trying a new flavor of ice cream is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:55.500\nSo, tests are everywhere, helping us understand the world around us. They're a simple way to gather information and make decisions based on what we find out.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
