    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.200\nNow, in the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance in a specific area.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:30.200\nThink of it like this: a teacher might give you a quiz to test what you learned in class. Or, a doctor might run some blood tests to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:36.200\nSee? Different situations, but the same idea: figuring something out.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:44.400\nAnother example is testing a recipe. You might add a little more salt or sugar and then taste it to see if it's better.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:52.900\nThat\u2019s a test! So, a test is all about gathering information to make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:52.900 --> 01:03.200\nIn short, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed choices. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
