    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:14.500\nYou've probably taken a bunch, but what is a test, really?\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:27.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are delicious, so you let someone taste one.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:32.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:36.900\nOr maybe you want to see if a lightbulb works, so you screw it in.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:41.900\nTest passed if it lights up!\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:49.000\nTests aren't just for school. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Engineers test bridges to make sure they're strong enough.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:56.200\nSo, a test is just a way of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.400\nIt's all about finding out what you know, or what something can do.\nBasically, a test is a way to check something!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
