    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.900\nSo, what are we testing? Well, it could be anything!\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:28.300\nWe test our knowledge with quizzes at school. We test recipes to see if they taste good.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:39.400\nEven scientists test their ideas with experiments. For example, imagine you\u2019re trying to figure out if a new toy car is faster than your old one.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:42.900\nYou could race them, right? That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:46.400\nOr, if you want to see if a plant needs more water, you could water it and see if it perks up.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:49.900\nAnother test! So, remember, a test is simply a way of finding out something.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:57.400\nIt\u2019s about checking and learning. And that's it!\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:02.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
