    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.300\nNow, you might be thinking about school, but a test is really just a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:24.300\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. The main idea behind a test is to see if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:36.900\nThink of it like this: your mom tests the temperature of your forehead to see if you have a fever. Or, a baker tests the cake with a toothpick to see if it's baked all the way through.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:44.200\nAnother good example is when you test the batteries in your remote control to see if they still have power.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:54.400\nSo, a test helps us understand what's going on and if something is good to go. Basically, a test is just a way of checking something!\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:59.200\nWe use tests every day to learn and make decisions.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
