    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.000\nIt could be to see if you understand a topic, like in school, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. Or, imagine you're baking a cake and taste it.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.000\nThat's a test to see if it tastes good! A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:51.500\nSo, tests help us measure things, check for problems, and see how much we've learned. They come in many forms, from quizzes to experiments, but they all share the same goal: to get information.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:58.300\nTests are super useful in everyday life. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
