    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just talking, you're using a specific method to get an answer.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:26.800\nIt could be anything from a school quiz to a medical checkup.\nThe important thing is that you're trying to measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:36.400\nFor example, a taste test tells you which flavor people like best.\nOr a math test shows how well you understand fractions.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:46.300\nThey all give you information!\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information by asking a question in a structured way.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:52.600\nIt helps us understand things better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
