    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:25.500\nIt helps us understand if something is true, working correctly, or meeting a certain standard.\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:36.700\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it has enough salt. Even a doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:48.600\nTests are all about gathering information. They can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like quickly checking if your shoelaces are tied.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:56.100\nSo, a test is really just a method for figuring something out!\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
