    "subtitles": "```WebVTT\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:10.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:21.800\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or checking your knowledge on a subject.\nThink of it like this: if you bake a cake, you might taste it.\nThat taste is a test to see if you added enough sugar.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:28.600\nOr, imagine you\u2019re learning to ride a bike.\nFalling down is a test to see if you\u2019ve mastered balancing yet.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:35.300\nTests aren't just in school.\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:42.000\nBuilders use tests to make sure a bridge is safe.\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:54.200\nIn short, a test is any process used to evaluate something.\nIt helps us understand if something is working as it should.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
