    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, that helps us understand what someone knows or how something works.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:25.200\nTests aren't just for school! When you bake a cake and taste it, that's a test to see if it's good.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:34.400\nOr, if your toy car isn't moving, you might try changing the batteries \u2013 that's a test to see if the batteries were the problem.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:45.200\nSchool tests, like quizzes or exams, help your teachers understand what you've learned.\nThey also help you see what you might need to study more.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:51.600\nSo, a test is really just a way to learn and improve. It helps us find things out!\n\n00:51.600 --> 01:06.600\nTo recap, a test is a question or a series of questions designed to give us information.\nWhether it\u2019s about baking, toys, or schoolwork, tests help us understand the world around us better.\n\n01:06.600 --> 01:10.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
