    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's how we gather information or check if something is working as it should.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.200\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:33.100\nA chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:45.400\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to test your knowledge on a subject.\nSo, a test is really just a process.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:54.800\nIt involves asking a question, doing something to get an answer, and then looking at the results.\nWe use tests every day, often without even realizing it.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.400\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do.\nThat's the basic idea behind a test!\n```"
