    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.300\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check if something is working the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:21.100\nThink of it like this: you have a lightbulb, and you want to know if it works. You screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:25.800\nThat's a test! If the light turns on, the test passes.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:31.600\nIf it doesn't, the test fails. We use tests all the time in real life.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:37.400\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A chef might taste their food to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:47.800\nSo, remember, a test is a simple way to verify something is working correctly. It involves checking for an expected outcome.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:55.100\nAnd that's the basics of testing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
