    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_080338.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:19.400\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works the way it should. It's like a doctor checking your temperature to see if you're healthy, or a chef tasting their soup to make sure it's delicious.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:35.200\nBasically, a test helps us understand if something is good or bad, right or wrong. For example, if you're building a tower of blocks, you might test it by gently shaking the table to see if it stays standing.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:42.900\nOr, if you're learning a new song, you might test yourself by trying to sing it without looking at the words.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:54.400\nSo, tests are all about figuring things out and making sure they're working correctly. They help us learn, improve, and build things that are reliable.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:01.800\nRemember, testing is a vital part of everything! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
