    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:05.000\nToday we're going to explore something really important: tests!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:08.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly,\n\n00:08.800 --> 00:12.300\nor to see how well someone understands something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:16.700\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:21.500\nOr, you take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:24.700\nTests can be big or small.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:27.900\nA quick check to see if a lightbulb works is a test.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:32.600\nA long exam with lots of questions is also a test.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:35.300\nThe goal is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:40.000\nWe test things to find out if they pass or fail, or to measure how well they perform.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:44.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get answers!\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:47.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
