    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, so you're wondering what a test is?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:08.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:13.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like checking if the water is hot enough for a bath.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:20.000\nThat's a mini-test!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:22.000\nYou\u2019re testing the water temperature.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.000\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:33.000\nThey can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like showing you know how to tie your shoes.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:39.000\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature or listening to your heart.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:47.000\nSo, a test is basically a way to gather information and understand something better.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:51.000\nThey help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:53.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
