    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests help us understand if something works the way it should, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:36.000\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:47.500\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar. Another example is a doctor giving you a check-up.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:56.000\nThey're running tests to see if you're healthy! So, in short, a test is a process, big or small, that helps us learn and confirm things.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.600\nSo, remember, tests are all about learning and confirming. They help us understand the world around us! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
