    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_081508.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:21.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information. It's a process designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the strength of a material, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:29.300\nThink about it: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A taste test tells you how something tastes. And a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:45.000\nTests use different methods, but they all share the same goal: to gather information and make a decision or assessment based on that information.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:52.000\nSo, a test is just a way to learn more! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
