    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_081555.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.600\nNow, a test, in the simplest terms, is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:28.100\nIt's a process to see if something is working correctly, or to check if something is true.\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:34.700\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good.\nSo, a test helps us learn, and improve.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:45.400\nAnd make sure things are working as they should.\nIt's a fundamental tool used in many aspects of our lives.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:53.900\nBasically, it's a structured way of checking stuff.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
