    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it as a little experiment.\nWe use tests every day, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:32.000\nFor example, if you touch a stove to see if it's hot, that's a test!\nOr, if you try a new recipe to see if it tastes good, that's another test.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:44.100\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\nTests can be written, like a quiz, or hands-on, like a science experiment.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:54.500\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\nSo, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
