    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.100\nIt's like an experiment, but often shorter and focused on a single question.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:30.400\nThink about it: a spelling test shows you how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:41.100\nA taste test tells you which flavor you like best. Even a simple quiz is a type of test! So, tests help us learn what we know, what we like, and even what areas we might need to work on.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:49.900\nThey give us information. Whether it's a pop quiz at school or trying a new recipe, tests are all around us.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:58.700\nThey help us discover things! To recap, a test is a tool for gathering information, used in lots of different ways.\n\n00:58.700 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
