    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:21.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific. It could be about you, like a quiz to see what kind of learner you are, or about something else entirely, like testing the temperature of your bathwater.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:31.500\nBasically, we use tests to gather information. Think of it like this: a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:39.000\nOr a spelling test shows you how well you know your words. Tests help us measure and understand things.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:49.000\nSo, remember, tests are just tools for learning and finding out more. They help us see where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:52.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
