    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if your cookies are done, you might use a toothpick as a test.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:37.500\nYou poke it in, and if it comes out clean, the cookies pass the test! Another example is checking if a light bulb works; you flip the switch, and if it lights up, it passes the test.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:45.100\nTests are super useful because they help us identify problems and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:53.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to check something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
