    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_082029.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:20.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, that helps us learn more about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:27.900\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. A simple example is tasting a cookie to see if it's sweet enough. That's a test!\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:34.800\nOr, imagine you're watering your plants and checking the soil to see if it's dry. That\u2019s testing too!\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:41.900\nEven when you try on a new shirt to see if it fits, you're performing a test.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:51.400\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and understand something better. It's all about finding out.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
