    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:29.100\nThe main idea is to see if something meets a certain standard or requirement. It could be a test in school to see how much you've learned, or a test of a new toy to see if it's safe.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:40.100\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:54.000\nOr, before a big race, athletes might test their speed and endurance. So, remember, a test is just a way of checking something to see if it works or meets a requirement.\n\n00:54.000 --> 01:01.200\nWe use them all the time in different situations. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
