    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:06.500\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:12.700\nThink of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:15.800\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:22.700\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick. That's a test to see if it's done!\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:29.200\nOr, if your phone isn't turning on, you might try plugging it in. That's a test to see if the battery is dead.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:35.900\nTests aren't always about right or wrong answers. Sometimes they just give us information.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:40.900\nThey help us understand things better and make decisions.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:47.600\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for gathering information.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:54.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
