    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.210 --> 00:04.370\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.370 --> 00:05.220\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:08.880\nSimply put, it's a way to find something out.\n\n00:09.180 --> 00:12.210\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:12.630 --> 00:14.960\nA test is really just a procedure we follow to gather information.\n\n00:15.380 --> 00:18.320\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:18.670 --> 00:21.270\nA chef tastes their soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:21.570 --> 00:24.080\nAnd you take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:24.450 --> 00:25.390\nSee?\n\n00:25.390 --> 00:27.120\nAll different, but they all have the same purpose:\n\n00:27.120 --> 00:28.490\nto answer a question!\n\n00:28.740 --> 00:31.750\nThe blood test answers the question, \"How healthy are you?\".\n\n00:32.070 --> 00:34.970\nThe chef's taste test answers, \"Does this soup taste good?\".\n\n00:35.250 --> 00:38.190\nAnd your quiz answers, \"Do you understand this material?\".\n\n00:38.580 --> 00:43.190\nSo, remember, a test is just a process to get information and answer a question.\n\n00:43.460 --> 00:47.800\nIt's a fundamental part of learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:48.070 --> 00:49.870\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
