    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: the test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:19.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:26.000\nYou do a test! You might poke them with a toothpick. If the toothpick comes out clean, that's a sign the cookies are ready.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:31.500\nThat's a test! Tests are used everywhere.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.000\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.100\nTeachers use tests to see what you've learned. Even video games use tests to see if you've won!\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:51.000\nSo, a test is just a way of finding something out, by checking it in a specific way.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.600\nRemember, tests help us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
