    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.400\nHey there! Ever wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like a tool we use to measure or evaluate. It could be a written exam in school, checking what you've learned.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:32.800\nOr maybe a taste test to see which flavor of ice cream you like best!\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:46.600\nEven a simple experiment, like dropping a ball to see if it bounces, is a kind of test. The main idea is that we're doing something and observing the result. We're trying to answer a question or prove a point.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:50.200\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to learn something new through observation and measurement. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
