    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand things better.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:31.800\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, you might test your balance by letting go of the handlebars for a second.\nThese are all little tests!\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:38.000\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\nThey're just one way to check your understanding.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:48.000\nSo, remember, a test is really just a tool for learning and discovering new things.\nIt helps us check, understand, and improve.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
