    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.400\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:37.500\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:47.600\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:57.700\nEven a doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature, to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:57.700 --> 00:59.200\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, the quality of food, or your health, a test is all about finding out information. It\u2019s a really useful tool for learning and making sure things are right. That\u2019s the basics of what a test is all about! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
