    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_084516.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.800\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check something, or to see how well something works.\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies taste good, so you ask your friend to try one.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:24.700\nThat\u2019s a test!\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:33.200\nWe can test if a lightbulb turns on, or if a plant needs water, or even if we understand a new concept.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:46.000\nFor example, a quiz at school is a test to see how much you've learned.\nOr, if you build a tower out of blocks, shaking the table is a test to see how strong it is.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:57.700\nBasically, a test helps us gather information and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
