    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_084729.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us understand if something is true, correct, or working as expected.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:28.700\nThink of it like this: a simple spelling test checks if you know how to spell certain words.\nA taste test helps you decide if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:41.600\nSo, tests can be formal, like in school, or informal, like deciding which movie to watch.\nThey all share the same goal: to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:52.800\nRemember, a test isn't about being right or wrong, it's about learning!\nNow you know the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
