    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.300\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. The thing we're testing can be anything!\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:32.700\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or seeing if you know your ABCs. We perform a test to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:45.100\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Even baking a cake is a test \u2013 you're testing if your recipe will turn into something delicious!\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:54.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and check if something is working or if you know something. It\u2019s all about finding out the answer!\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
