    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:14.000\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, it's a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:24.000\nWe use tests all the time to check if something is working, to see how well something is made, or even just to understand something better.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:29.800\nThink about it.\nWhen you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:39.400\nOr, if your toy car isn't working, you might try changing the batteries to test if that fixes the problem.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:48.000\nTests help us make decisions and learn new things.\nSo remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:55.800\nIt helps us check, understand, and improve things.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
