    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:25.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:27.300\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:35.500\nFor example, if you turn the light switch on and the light doesn't come on, you're testing the lightbulb!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:42.100\nIs it working?\nNope.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:55.300\nOr, if you're baking a cake and you poke it with a toothpick, you're testing if it's done.\nClean toothpick? Cake's ready!\nTests can be simple, like those examples, or more complicated.\nBut the main idea is always the same: you're trying to learn something.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:59.000\nSo, a test is just a way of asking a question and getting an answer to help you understand something better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
