    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.400\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you poke them with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:25.500\nIn science and everyday life, tests help us figure things out.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:36.100\nMaybe you want to test if a plant grows better in sunlight or in the shade. You'd put one plant in the sun and another in the shade and then observe the results.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.100\nOr, imagine you want to know which brand of paper towels absorbs more water. You'd test different brands to see which one soaks up the most.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:54.200\nBasically, a test is a structured way to ask a question and get an answer by observing or measuring something.\n\n00:54.200 --> 01:03.800\nSo, remember, tests are all about checking things and finding answers! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
