    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_085957.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like an investigation. We ask questions or perform actions to see what the results are. For example, a spelling test helps us understand how well someone knows how to spell words.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:36.500\nOr, a taste test can tell us which flavor of ice cream people like best. Even trying to turn on a light switch is a kind of test to see if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:45.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information. It helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:53.000\nWe use them every day, even without realizing it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
