    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:21.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:27.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:33.900\nThink of it like this: your mom might test if the cake is done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:41.500\nOr, a doctor might test your reflexes by tapping your knee. These are both tests!\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:46.400\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:50.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
