    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_090408.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:20.200\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. A doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:28.600\nA teacher gives you a test in class to see how well you understand the material. Even baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:39.000\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good. For example, you might test if a toy car rolls faster on carpet or a smooth floor.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:45.100\nOr you could test different types of plant food to see which one helps a plant grow the tallest.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:52.000\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is just a way of getting information.\n\n00:52.000 --> 01:00.500\nYou ask a question, you perform a test, and you get an answer. It's all about learning and finding things out!\n\n01:00.500 --> 01:04.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
