    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.600 --> 00:03.100\nToday, we're going to explore\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:03.800\nwhat a test is.\n\n00:03.800 --> 00:06.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out\nsomething about someone or something.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:09.000\nIt's like asking a question and seeing\nwhat answer you get.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:11.600\nThink about it like this: your teacher\ngives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:12.900\nto see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:16.500\nOr, imagine a doctor checking your\ntemperature \u2013 that's a test to see\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:17.800\nif you have a fever.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:20.900\nEven a taste test of new ice cream flavors\nis a test to see which one you like best!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:24.900\nTests can be written, like exams, or\nphysical, like a sports tryout.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:26.700\nThey can even be simple observations.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:30.100\nThe main idea is to gather information\nand learn something new.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:33.100\nSo, a test is just a tool for learning\nand understanding.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:34.700\nIt helps us figure things out!\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:36.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
