    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nWhat is a test? Simply put, it's a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz, that's a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:29.000\nOr, imagine you're trying out a new recipe. You taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.600\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. Checking if a lightbulb works is a test.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:43.800\nTaking a spelling quiz is a test. Even trying on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit is a kind of test.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:54.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out something, whether it's about your knowledge, or about the quality of something else.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
