    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.600\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:01.600 --> 00:03.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:06.700\nIt\u2019s a process designed to see if something works, if something is true, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:10.300\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a lightbulb works, you put it in a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:10.300 --> 00:11.200\nThat's a test!\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:13.600\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:16.100\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:20.000\nAnd even a baker tests their cake by poking it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:22.700\nSo, tests are all about checking things.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:28.000\nThey help us learn, diagnose, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:30.800\nThey come in many forms, but the core idea is always the same:\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:32.900\nto find out something specific.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:33.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
