    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.400\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:19.400\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:26.900\nWe use tests all the time! Your teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:39.500\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick. Or, you might even test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:50.000\nThe important thing is that a test helps us learn or confirm something. It can show us what we know, what we need to work on, or just give us information to make a decision.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:50.800\nSo, a test is just a tool for learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:53.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
