    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_092109.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:21.400\nIt's a process designed to give us information, like checking if something works, or measuring how much of something we have.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:31.900\nThink about it like this: a taste test is a test to see if you like a food. Or, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:46.400\nIn science, you might test a new plant food to see if it helps plants grow faster. So, tests help us learn, improve things, and make decisions based on real information.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:53.000\nThey're all about finding answers. Remember, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
