    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.800\nWe use them all the time to see if something works, if something is true, or even just to check our understanding.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:31.300\nThink about it like this: You might test a new recipe by cooking it to see if it tastes good. Or, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:43.000\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just a simple question and answer session.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:52.500\nSo, a test is just a method of gathering information. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
