    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_092721.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:26.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:30.100\nSee? Different situations, same idea.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:35.600\nTests aren't just for people or food, though. We test all kinds of things!\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:44.900\nAn engineer might test a bridge to make sure it's strong enough to hold cars. A software developer might test a program to check for bugs.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:53.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information or see if something is doing what it's supposed to.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.800\nIt helps us learn and improve things!\n\n00:56.800 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "b72d6d3c-51da-4571-a07e-a4714ec0fa81": {
    "id": "b72d6d3c-51da-4571-a07e-a4714ec0fa81",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T14:56:27.456008",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-06T09:28:07.901393",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260106_092807.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_092807.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:18.000\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb works.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:24.200\nYou screw it in and flip the switch. That's a test! We use tests all the time.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:33.000\nYour doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. A baker might taste their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:42.500\nEven trying on a pair of shoes is a test to see if they fit. So, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:49.200\nMaybe the light bulb doesn't light, so you know it's broken. Maybe the cake needs more sugar, so you add some.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:55.900\nTests help us learn and improve things. Basically, a test is an action or process designed to reveal something.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:01.500\nIt's a simple idea with lots of uses! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
