    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:03.900\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.900 --> 00:07.200\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:12.500\nIt's a process or a procedure designed to give us information.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:17.300\nThink of it like this: you might take a taste test of different cookies to see which one you like best.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:18.600\nThat's a test!\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:22.200\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:25.800\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:32.100\nSo, a test can be something simple like trying different flavors, or something more complex like a medical exam.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:37.900\nThe key is that it helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:40.500\nIn short, a test is just a way to learn more.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:50.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
