    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question, but in a more formal way.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:24.100\nThe main idea behind a test is to see if a hypothesis, that's basically an educated guess, is supported by evidence.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.100\nWe design a test to collect that evidence. For example, imagine you want to know if a plant grows faster with more sunlight.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:41.700\nYou could plant two plants, put one in the sun and one in the shade, and then measure their growth. That's a test!\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:55.200\nOr, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you have a certain vitamin deficiency. So, a test is just a structured way to gather information and see if your initial idea holds up.\n\n00:55.200 --> 01:02.900\nIt helps us understand the world around us a little bit better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
