    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_093244.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.000\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:06.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:12.000\nThink of it as a question, or a set of questions, designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or even your abilities.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:15.800\nIt's like when you bake a cake and taste it to see if it's good.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:16.800\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:20.200\nOr when a doctor checks your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:20.900\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:24.600\nTests aren't just about school.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:26.900\nThey help us understand things better.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:30.600\nThey can show us what we know well and what we need to learn more about.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:33.700\nBasically, a test is a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:39.600\nSo remember, a test is just a way to find something out. It helps us measure and learn!\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:42.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
