    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:17.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, to see if it works, or if it's true.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.800\nWe use tests all the time! A spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:42.900\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something. Your phone has tests built in to make sure the screen is working properly.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:51.300\nSo, tests help us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should. They're a crucial part of learning and building things. In short, a test is just a way of making sure things are right. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
