    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something, to see if it works, or to see if you know something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like this: you take a test in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:29.000\nBut tests aren't just for school! Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.800\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:45.500\nOr, if you're building with blocks, you might wiggle the tower to test its strength.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:52.900\nSo, tests are all about checking things! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:58.100\nWhether it's a school exam, tasting your cooking, or wiggling a tower, tests are everywhere. They give us information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
