    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:25.000\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how things measure up. Think of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.500\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:47.100\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be multiple choice, short answer, or even projects!\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:54.000\nSo, a test is just a method to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or anything else we want to understand better. Basically, it helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
