    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:14.000\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nWe use tests all the time without even realizing it.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:34.200\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it.\nOr, if you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.700\nIn school, a test helps your teacher understand what you've learned.\nIt's a way to see if you understand the main ideas.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:51.800\nAnd tests aren\u2019t just for school.\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:56.100\nSo, a test is just a tool to gather information and learn something new.\nIt helps us understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
