    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:17.200\nNow, in the simplest terms, a test is just a way to check something.\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:28.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\nOr, a doctor might test your vision to see how well you can see.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:38.400\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to see if it's safe for kids.\nWe put it through different trials to make sure it won't break easily and cause harm.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:48.900\nSo, remember, a test is simply a process to evaluate something and learn more about it.\nIt helps us make informed decisions.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:52.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
