    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_094120.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:03.700\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:07.200\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see what you know or what something can do.\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:11.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You turn it on, and if it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:16.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:22.300\nOr a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:26.300\nFor example, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:27.700\nSee?\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:29.900\nTesting is everywhere!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:35.300\nIt helps us learn, improve things, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:38.500\nSo remember, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:39.500\nAnd that\u2019s it!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:42.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
