    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:34.700\nThe main goal of a test is to see how well something performs or what its properties are.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:46.700\nIt helps us understand things better. For example, a spelling test tells us how well you know how to spell words. Or a taste test helps us decide which cookie is the tastiest. Another example is a medical test, which can tell us about our health.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to gather information and learn more. It helps us evaluate and understand things around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
