    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_094622.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.399\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.399 --> 00:20.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s a process, a procedure, or a method used to determine the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a chef tastes a dish to test if it's seasoned correctly.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:33.900\nAnother example? You might take a quiz in school.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:37.900\nThat's a test! It's designed to see what you've learned.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:45.400\nOr, a company might test a new product before releasing it to the public to make sure it works properly.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:58.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see how something measures up. It's a simple concept, but incredibly important in all areas of life.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
