    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:18.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it to see if it's done.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:27.800\nThat's a test! Or maybe you take a quiz at school. That's testing your knowledge.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:35.100\nTests can be used for lots of things. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A scientist might test a new medicine to see if it works.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:44.200\nEven a chef tests their soup to make sure it tastes good! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:50.000\nIt helps us understand if something is ready, working, or true.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:52.900\nGot it? Great!\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:54.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
