    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:19.400\nIt could be anything! Think of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:29.800\nA teacher uses a test to see what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it comes out delicious!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:39.100\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information that we can use to make decisions or learn more.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:51.100\nWhether it's a quiz in school, or trying a new recipe, tests are all around us.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:59.300\nTo sum it up, a test is a process designed to gather information. It can be as simple as tasting food or as complex as a medical exam.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.800\nThey all help us learn and improve.\n\n01:02.800 --> 01:06.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
