    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_095553.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure we use to gather information or evidence.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy. A chef tastes food to test if it's seasoned right.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:33.300\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking questions in class!\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:44.600\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve a problem, showing you understand addition. Or a spelling test checks if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:55.500\nSo, tests are just tools we use to learn more about things, whether it's your health, your cooking, or how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:01.700\nThey give us valuable information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
