    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome!\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:14.800\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\nA test is basically a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, right?\nYou can test it by sticking a toothpick in.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:26.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\nThat's the basic idea.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:31.900\nTests aren't just for cakes, though.\nWe use them all the time!\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:36.300\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:44.300\nTeachers use tests to see how much you've learned.\nEven scientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:52.900\nSo, a test is simply a procedure designed to gather information and help us make decisions.\nRemember the toothpick? That's a simple test.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.900\nA quiz at school?\nThat's another test.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.900\nThey all help us learn something new.\n\n01:00.900 --> 01:05.300\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" just think of it as a way to find out more!\n\n01:05.300 --> 01:09.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
