    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:36.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:50.200\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:58.800\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and your baking skills!\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:02.400\nSo, tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying a new recipe.\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:07.400\nThe key is that they help us gather information and understand things better.\n\n01:07.400 --> 01:11.400\nThey tell us what we know, what we can do, and where we might need to improve.\n\n01:11.400 --> 01:14.100\nThat's the basics of testing!\n\n01:14.100 --> 01:17.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
