    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:18.800\nThink of it like this: you want to see if a lightbulb works.\nYou screw it in and flip the switch.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:23.100\nYou're testing if the lightbulb lights up.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:28.200\nOr imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou taste it to see if it's sweet enough.\nThat's another test!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:31.800\nYou're testing the flavor.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:46.100\nTests help us know if something is working correctly, or if something meets our expectations.\nSo, a test is just a way to check something, using a simple action or observation.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:49.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
