    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_101006.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s how we check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a checkup \u2013 that's a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:33.700\nOr imagine baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:44.700\nSchools also use tests, like quizzes, to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:52.800\nIn science, experiments are tests to see if a hypothesis is correct. So, tests are all about gathering information and confirming things.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.500\nBasically, any time you're trying to verify or prove something, you're probably using a test in some form. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
