    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something specific about something else.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:19.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:26.900\nThe \u201csomething\u201d could be anything! It could be your knowledge on a subject, like a math test.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:37.100\nOr, it could be the quality of a product, like a stress test on a bridge. The test helps us understand its strengths and weaknesses.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:48.200\nFor example, a simple taste test tells you if you like the flavor of a new ice cream. Or, a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:51.800\nTests give us information.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:57.700\nSo, to recap, a test is just a method for gathering information about something.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:00.200\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n01:00.200 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
