    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:34.400\nA taste test lets you decide which food tastes better.\nOr, a medical test can help doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:45.600\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes.\nThey help us learn what we know, what we can do, and sometimes, even what we like!\n\n00:45.600 --> 01:00.600\nThey provide information that helps us make better decisions.\nTo recap, a test is a method for finding something out, whether it's your spelling skills, your favorite flavor, or your overall health.\nIt's all about gathering information.\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:07.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
