    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_101656.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHello everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:18.300\nToday we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:33.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out how much you know about something.\nThink of it like a game where you show off all the cool facts and ideas you've learned.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:41.100\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes.\nMaybe it's a simple quiz with multiple-choice questions, or perhaps it's a practical test where you actually do something, like baking a cake to see if you know the recipe.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:56.100\nFor example, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of birds.\nOr, if you're learning about math, you might have to solve a simple addition problem.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:05.300\nThe point is, tests help you and your teachers see what you understand and what you might need a little more practice with.\n\n01:05.300 --> 01:09.900\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a tool to measure your knowledge.\n\n01:09.900 --> 01:13.700\nIt\u2019s a chance to shine and show off what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n01:13.700 --> 01:16.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
