    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:19.400\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:25.200\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:34.600\nThink about baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter before you bake it.\nThat's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:45.000\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try restarting it.\nThat's a test to see if restarting fixes the problem.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:55.400\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like checking if the milk is still good before you pour it into your cereal.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:01.400\nThe important thing is that a test helps you get information and make decisions.\nSo, whether you're checking the weather or taking an exam, you're using a test to learn something new.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
