    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like a friendly check-up for your brain or skills.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:37.600\nIt could be a written test in school, where you answer questions.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:42.200\nOr it could be a practical test, like seeing if you can ride a bike or bake a cake.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:48.600\nThe main idea is to see where you're at.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:57.300\nSo, remember, a test is a tool to measure knowledge or ability. It helps you understand what you've learned and where you might need some extra practice.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.800\nTests aren't scary, they're just helpful! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
