    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.100\nA test is basically a way to find out if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like checking if your shoes fit before you go for a run.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Did you check the weather forecast before deciding what to wear? That's a test!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:42.800\nOr, if you tried a new recipe and tasted it to see if it needed more salt, that's also a test.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:58.900\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned. In science, experiments are tests to prove or disprove an idea. So, a test is really just a method for gathering information and making sure things are on track.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:05.400\nSo remember, a test helps us confirm something is functioning as expected, from checking the weather to taking a school quiz. It's all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
