    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: Tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:14.800\nThink of a test as a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how much you know about a subject.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.300\nIt\u2019s like a quality check, but for anything! For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:34.500\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar. Even in school, tests help you and your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:44.200\nSo, tests help us understand things better, make sure things are working well, and guide us on what needs more attention. They are everywhere around us!\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:50.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
