    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_102835.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:25.700\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or even your ability to do something.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:38.800\nThink of it like this: a math test checks how well you understand numbers and equations.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:49.700\nOr, a cooking test might see how well you can follow a recipe and create a delicious dish.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:59.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big final exams. They can be written, spoken, or even hands-on activities.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.600\nThe important thing is that they give us information about what we know or can do.\n\n01:02.600 --> 01:07.900\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz in class or trying out for a sports team, remember that a test is just a way to learn and improve.\n\n01:07.900 --> 01:11.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
