    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\nA taste test helps decide which flavor of ice cream is the best.\nAnd a medical test can tell a doctor about your health.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:40.600\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like asking a friend for their opinion.\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information to make a decision or learn something new.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:51.400\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information!\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
