    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:11.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests! A test is basically a way to find out if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone understands something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:16.800\nThink of it like checking if your bike tires have enough air. That's a test!\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:23.300\nYou're testing the tire pressure. In school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.200\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking you questions in class. Outside of school, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:41.200\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Companies test new products to make sure they're safe and work properly.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:49.800\nSo, whether it's checking your tire pressure or taking a pop quiz, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:56.000\nIt helps us understand things better. And that's the basics of what a test is all about.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
