    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_104519.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:18.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process, or a procedure, designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even performance.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:28.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:40.300\nA taste test tells you which food tastes better.\nEven a quick temperature check is a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.200\nSo, in all of these examples, a test is helping us gather information and make a judgment.\nIt\u2019s a way of measuring something to see where we stand.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.700\nWhether it's for school, for fun, or for your health, tests help us learn and understand.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
