    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey there, welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests!\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:13.800\nA test is basically a way to find out something. It's like an experiment or a set of questions designed to get information.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a test to see if you\u2019re sick, or a chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:30.100\nAnother example is when you take a quiz at school. That's a test to see how well you understand a topic. Or maybe you test out a new toy to see if it works the way it should!\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:42.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a method used to gather information or see if something is working correctly.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.300\nIt can be anything from a simple taste test to a complex scientific experiment. And tests help us learn and improve things all the time.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
