    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:06.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:10.000\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:14.600\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a check-up. That's a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:18.800\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:22.900\nTests are everywhere! They help us learn new things, solve problems, and make better decisions.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:29.300\nWhether it's a quiz at school, trying a new recipe, or checking if your car is running smoothly, you're performing a test.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:34.200\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way of finding something out. It's an information-gathering process we use all the time.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:36.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
