    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.500\nWhat exactly is a test?\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:26.900\nIt\u2019s like a checkpoint to see where you are in your learning journey.\nThink about it like this: if you\u2019re learning to bake a cake, a taste test is a test to see if you added enough sugar.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:40.300\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see if you remember the new words.\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from quick quizzes to big exams.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:49.800\nThe important thing to remember is that tests aren't scary!\nThey\u2019re just a tool to help you understand what you've learned and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:59.600\nSo, next time you see a test, remember it\u2019s just a way to check your progress.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
