    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_105032.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like a tool we use to measure knowledge, skills, or even abilities.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:37.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, when you try a new recipe, you're essentially testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:46.600\nOr, when you practice riding a bike, you're testing your balance and coordination.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:56.400\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:06.700\nThe goal is to check your understanding and help you learn even more. So, a test isn't scary, it's just a way to learn and grow!\n\n01:06.700 --> 01:16.400\nBasically, a test is a method of assessing something. Whether it's your cooking, your biking, or your understanding of a subject, tests help us understand where we are and where we can improve.\n\n01:16.400 --> 01:19.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
