    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:06.800\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:08.900\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:20.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you can spell.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:23.600\nA taste test lets you decide which food you like best.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:27.900\nEven a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:31.500\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:35.000\nThey can be written, spoken, or even hands-on activities.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:37.800\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:40.600\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:46.000\nIn short, a test is a tool we use to evaluate and understand something better.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:49.400\nIt's a way of checking in and seeing where we stand.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:52.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
