    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a right or wrong answer.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:33.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:50.200\nOr, you might take a multiple-choice test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:58.000\nAnother example could be testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:01.600\nSo, tests help us understand things better, whether it's about our health, our knowledge, or even just whether a new cookie recipe is a winner.\n```"
