    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:19.200\nA test is basically a way to check how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to see if you understood the lesson.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:31.300\nThat's a test! Or, if you're trying out for a sports team, they might have you run some drills.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:42.500\nThat\u2019s a test too! Tests can come in all shapes and sizes. Multiple choice, true or false, even building something with LEGOs could be considered a test of your creativity and problem-solving skills.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:53.900\nThe key thing is that it helps measure your knowledge or ability. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn where you're at and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.500\nDon't be scared of them! They're a chance to grow.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
