    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:31.000\nIt's a procedure that helps us gather information. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick. \n\n00:31.000 --> 00:39.600\nOr, you take a test in school to show what you've learned. A test could also be something as simple as trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:47.200\nSo, tests are all about getting answers, understanding something better, or checking if something works. They help us learn and make informed decisions.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:50.800\nIn short, a test is a way to explore and discover! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "a07eacd4-3ab3-4eb5-9817-ba4383a9c014": {
