    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_105703.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:20.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a process, a method, or a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance in a specific area.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:30.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:37.900\nA taste test helps you figure out which cookie you like best.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:51.900\nEven a doctor checking your reflexes is a type of test! They're all gathering information. So, whether it's answering questions on paper, trying out a new recipe, or even getting a check-up, tests are all about learning something new or confirming what we already suspect.\n\n00:51.900 --> 01:01.400\nThey help us understand ourselves and the world around us better. In short, a test is just a structured way to gather information.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:04.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
