    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_105945.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:14.500\nBasically, a test is just a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how many words you can spell correctly. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:25.800\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might taste it to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:31.200\nThat\u2019s also a type of test! Tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:41.100\nFor example, if you don't do so well on that spelling test, you know what words to practice.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:52.500\nIf your cake isn't sweet enough, you know to add more sugar next time. So, tests aren't scary, they're just tools for learning and making things better.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:59.100\nThey give us information to help us grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
