    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:07.300 --> 00:17.600\nToday we're going to explore something super important: tests.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:27.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:35.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:41.300\nBasically, a test helps us understand if something is true or false, good or bad, or even how well something works.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:51.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, think about baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:57.800\nSo, tests are all around us! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. Remember, a test is just a way to gather information. It's like a mini-investigation! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
