    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:12.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:24.500\nIt helps us learn or confirm information. Think of it like this: a doctor might run a test to see if you're sick, or a chef might taste their food to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:30.000\nBoth are conducting tests! Tests aren't just for doctors and chefs, though.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:42.800\nYou take tests in school to see how well you understand the material. And even when you build something, like a Lego castle, you're testing its stability to see if it will stand up.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:53.600\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new. It\u2019s a simple tool we use to understand the world around us better.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
