    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.500\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\nOr, if you press a button on a toy, you're testing if it still works.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:36.100\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\nThey can be written, like a quiz, or hands-on, like a science experiment.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:51.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\nIt's a valuable tool for discovery!\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
