    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:27.300\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, to see if it works, or to check its quality.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:38.600\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr, a taste test tells you if food tastes good.\nEven a doctor uses tests, like a blood test, to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:45.700\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:52.700\nThey can be used to see what you've learned in school, or to make sure products are safe before they're sold.\nThey are everywhere!\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:58.200\nIn short, tests are all about gathering data and evaluating something.\nThat's the basic idea.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
