    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:36.200\nBasically, a test helps you figure out if something is working correctly or if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:42.200\nFor example, a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:49.400\nOther examples? A car manufacturer tests a new car to make sure it's safe.\nA software developer tests their program to find and fix any bugs.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:59.900\nSo, tests are everywhere! In short, a test is just a method to evaluate something.\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:03.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
