    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like gathering information.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:36.400\nIt's a process where we ask a question or present a challenge, and then look at the answer or the result to learn something new.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:45.800\nFor example, a spelling test helps us learn how well someone can spell words.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:54.900\nOr, if you bake a cake and taste it, that's a test to see if your recipe worked!\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.500\nTests can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like trying a new restaurant to see if you like the food.\n```"
