    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about yourself or something else.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like this: when you take a spelling test in school, it shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:31.300\nOr, if you're testing out a new recipe, you're seeing if it tastes good! Tests can come in all sorts of forms.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:40.100\nYou might take a quiz with multiple choice questions, or you might experiment with baking different cookies to see which is the chewiest.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:50.700\nThe important thing is that you're gathering information and learning something new. So, remember, a test is just a way to discover something.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:58.300\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
