    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey there, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process, or a procedure, designed to evaluate or measure.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:27.700\nThink about it like this: you take a test in school to see how well you understand a subject. Or, a chef might taste a soup to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:41.600\nEven a doctor uses tests, like a blood test, to check your health. These examples, from school to cooking to medicine, all have the same goal: to get information.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:54.300\nWe use tests to confirm something, to identify problems, or just to learn more. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
