    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:27.100\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a cake is baked properly, so you use a toothpick to test it.\nOr maybe you want to know if you understand a new concept, so you take a quiz \u2013 that\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:44.800\nTests can be formal, like a big exam at school, or informal, like asking yourself questions to see if you\u2019re ready for something.\nThe important thing is that a test gives you information.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:55.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see where you stand.\nIt can be about baking, learning, or anything else!\n\n00:55.600 --> 01:03.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
