    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:24.000\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.600\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it before it's finished \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.000\nEven checking if your phone turns on is a test! It tells you if the battery is working.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:47.800\nSo, tests are all around us! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:55.900\nThey\u2019re a way to gather information and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
