    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.300\nToday we\u2019re going to explore the concept of a test.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:24.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. It's a method for gathering information.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:37.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, a spelling test helps us find out how well someone knows how to spell words. Or, a taste test can tell us which flavor of ice cream people like the most.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:48.200\nEven a weather test, like checking the forecast, helps us understand what the weather might be like later.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:51.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new. It helps us understand, evaluate, or measure something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
