    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:28.600\nWe use them all the time! Think of it like this: you might test the temperature of your bathwater to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:39.400\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:52.200\nIn school, tests help us see how well we've learned something. They can be multiple choice, true or false, or even asking you to write out your answer.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.800\nThe important thing is that tests give us information.\n```"
