    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're tackling a really important concept: Tests!\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:19.900\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something.\nThink of it like this: you're checking if something works, if it's true, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:28.900\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have the flu.\nA chef might taste a dish to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:38.400\nAnd you might even test a new video game to see if you like it!\nBasically, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:53.200\nThey can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes are tied.\nThe goal is always to see if something passes a certain requirement or meets a specific expectation.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:60.100\nSo remember, a test is just a check!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
