    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.200\nDon't worry, it's not as scary as it sounds!\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:26.200\nA test is simply a way to find out something specific. Think of it like asking a question, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:37.300\nBasically, you\u2019re trying to see if something is true or false, or maybe to measure how much of something there is.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:43.900\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if something is sweet or sour.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:50.500\nOr, a spelling test shows how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:57.800\nAnother example is a weather test. Scientists might test the air pressure to predict if it will rain.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:04.800\nTests help us understand the world around us and learn new things.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:07.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a structured way of finding information.\n\n01:07.700 --> 01:14.800\nIt helps us answer questions and learn about things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
