    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.900\nIt's a question or a task designed to see what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:32.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:39.500\nA taste test lets you decide which food tastes better.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:48.600\nOr even a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. So, tests aren't just about school. They're everywhere! They help us learn, make decisions, and even understand the world around us a little bit better. In short, a test is a tool to get information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
