    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:13.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something. Think of it like a quiz, but it doesn't always have to be about school.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:21.400\nWe use tests all the time! When you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:34.800\nOr, when you buy a new toy, you test it out to see if it works the way it's supposed to. In science, a test could be an experiment to see if a plant grows better with more sunlight.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:48.700\nIn cooking, you might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. So, a test is simply a process to see if something is true, works correctly, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:58.800\nTo sum it up, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as expected.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
