    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_113753.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.900\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe by tasting it to see if it's good. Or, a doctor might test your vision to see how well you can see.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:38.600\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. A math test checks your knowledge of numbers, while a science experiment is a test to see how things in the world behave.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:55.900\nFor example, dropping a ball is a test to see if gravity works! So, to recap, a test is just a method for finding out information about something, whether it's a recipe, your eyesight, or even gravity.\n\n00:55.900 --> 01:03.900\nIt's a way to learn and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
