    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like checking if something works or if you understand something.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:35.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words.\nA taste test checks your ability to tell the difference between flavors.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:45.500\nEven a medical test checks how well your body is functioning. So, tests help us measure things.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:58.200\nThey give us information about what we know, what we can do, and how things are working. They're useful tools for learning and understanding.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:02.600\nIn short, a test is a way to evaluate something, like knowledge or performance, through a specific procedure.\n01:02.600 --> 01:04.000\n\n01:04.000 --> 01:06.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
