    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey there, welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:13.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something specific. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:24.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:33.800\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite. In both cases, you're performing a test to learn something new.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:41.600\nTests aren't just for school. When a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:53.300\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if you like it. So, remember, a test is a way to gather information and understand things better.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:59.400\nIt\u2019s just a structured way of learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
