    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:18.200\nThink about it. A taste test tells you if food is yummy.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:27.300\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your words. Even trying out a new game is a kind of test, seeing if you like it!\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:35.900\nSo, a test can be anything from a formal exam at school to just trying something new to see what happens.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:45.700\nThe goal is always the same: to gather information and learn something. It helps us figure things out and make better decisions.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:52.700\nBasically, a test is just a way to learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
