    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake, and you taste the batter. That's a mini-test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:31.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. School exams are tests of what you've learned in class.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:40.600\nA medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body. Even trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:49.800\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz or a science experiment, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:51.400\nTesting helps us understand things better.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
