    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_115623.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you get the right answer.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:32.300\nThere are all kinds of tests. You might take a test at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:41.400\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:50.700\nEven a baker tastes their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.000\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz, a blood sample, or a spoonful of batter, a test is just a method of gathering information. Remember, tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
