    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_115756.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.800\nIt\u2019s a process designed to measure your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a specific area. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:33.800\nA taste test lets you decide which food you like best. Even checking if a lightbulb works is a kind of test!\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:45.200\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big exams. They help us understand what we already know and where we might need to learn more.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:52.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information. It helps us learn and grow.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
