    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_115940.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.000\nToday we're diving into something super important: Tests!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:08.000\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know or how well something works.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:12.000\nThink of it like this: a test helps us understand if we're on the right track.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.000\nIt can be anything from a simple quiz in school to checking if a new phone can make a call.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.000\nFor example, a spelling test shows how many words you know how to spell.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:26.000\nOr, when you bake a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.000\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working properly.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:34.000\nThey give us valuable information.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:37.000\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:54.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
