    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like this: imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\nA test might be seeing if you can ride without falling.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:32.600\nOr, if you're learning your ABCs, a test could be naming all the letters.\nTests aren't just for school, though.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:40.500\nYour doctor uses tests to check your health, and even bakers test their recipes to make sure they taste delicious!\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:49.600\nSo, tests help us see what we've learned and where we can improve.\nThey\u2019re a valuable tool for growth in all sorts of areas.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:53.900\nIn short, a test is just a way of checking your knowledge or ability.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
