    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:24.500\nIt could be checking if a lightbulb works, or evaluating how well you understand a new concept.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:28.100\nBasically, you're putting something to the test to see if it meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:31.700\nThink about a food tasting. That's a test! You're testing the flavor.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:38.500\nOr a spelling quiz in school \u2013 that's testing your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:50.300\nTests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. They come in all shapes and sizes, from quick checks to long, detailed examinations.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:53.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
