    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're going to explore something called a test.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:20.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:28.400\nOr, imagine you're trying out a new recipe.\nYou taste it to see if it's good \u2013 that's a test of your cooking!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:39.100\nTests can be all sorts of things.\nA simple spelling test, a taste test of different flavors, or even checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:50.900\nThe main idea is to check or evaluate something.\nSo, remember, a test helps us understand what's known, what works, or what's good.\nIt's a way of checking things out.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
