    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nThink of a test as a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works. It\u2019s basically a check-up!\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:25.500\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you remember your words. Or, a baker might taste a cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:29.300\nSee? Different kinds of tests for different things.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:39.700\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:49.900\nOr even checking the batteries in your flashlight to see if they still have power.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:56.200\nSo, remember, a test is a simple way to find out if something is correct, working well, or meeting a certain standard. It helps us learn and improve things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
