    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_121022.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information. Think of it like asking a question, but in a more organized way.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:24.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it! A doctor uses tests to check your health.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.000\nYour teacher uses tests to see what you've learned. Even tasting a new food is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:41.300\nFor example, a simple math test might ask you to solve 2 + 2. The answer tells you if you understand basic addition.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:54.600\nOr, a taste test of two different cookies helps you decide which one you prefer. So, remember, a test is just a structured way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:00.899\nIt helps us understand things better! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
