    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_121118.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.500\nToday we're tackling a really fundamental concept: the test.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:06.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:11.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:17.500\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:20.500\nThink about it like this: a baking test checks if a cake is done.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:25.500\nYou stick a toothpick in, and if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:28.500\nOr, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:32.500\nYou either spell them right, or you don't.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:37.500\nAnother example is a medical test, which can help doctors find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:43.500\nSo, a test is just a method we use to gather information and make a judgment based on the results.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:47.500\nIt's a basic tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:51.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
