    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.800\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a light bulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:27.400\nIn science and everyday life, tests help us understand if something is true, accurate, or working properly.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:37.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might bake a cake and taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:47.300\nSo, tests are all about checking things! They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:54.900\nRemember, a test is simply a way to check something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
