    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_122233.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.400\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:28.400\nThink about it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:39.000\nOr, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned. These tests help us measure things.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:42.000\nFor example, you might test the temperature of water to see if it's hot enough for tea.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:52.200\nOr, you could test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. See? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand the world a little better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
