    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_122413.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something, or someone.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.600\nIt helps us measure or evaluate.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:33.100\nThink of it like this: A cookie recipe is a test. You follow the instructions, and the result\u2014the cookie\u2014tells you if the recipe works!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:42.900\nOr, imagine a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:52.600\nWe use tests all the time, in school, at work, and even in everyday life. They help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.300\nSo remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
