    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_122600.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like a tool to measure or evaluate.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:24.200\nIt can be anything from a simple quiz in school, where you answer questions to show what you've learned, to a medical test that checks your health.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:30.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing a recipe to see if it works.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:36.700\nAnother example is a taste test. You try different flavors and decide which one you like best.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:47.100\nOr imagine testing a new toy to see if it's fun and safe. So, remember, a test is just a method for learning or confirming something.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:54.600\nIt helps us understand things better and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
