    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:19.300\nWe use them all the time! Think of it like this: You want to know if a cake is done, you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:22.900\nThat's a test! The toothpick comes out clean? Cake's ready!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:29.300\nTests aren't just for cooking, though. A spelling test tells you how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:35.700\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:44.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It gives you information you didn't have before.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:49.000\nThat information can then help you understand things better and make good choices.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
