    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_123012.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:06.300\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:13.100\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a specific goal.\nWe use tests all the time in everyday life, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:22.000\nFor example, if you're baking a cake and you poke it with a toothpick to see if it comes out clean, that's a test!\nYou're testing if the cake is done.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:29.400\nOr, if you try on a pair of shoes to see if they fit, that's a test too.\nYou're testing if the shoes are the right size.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:34.400\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:43.000\nWe use tests to check if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\nThey help us make decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:45.800\nTests are super useful, right?\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:47.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
