    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.500\nIt's a process designed to give us information, usually about how well someone knows something or how well something works.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:32.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\nThat taste is a simple test!\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:45.100\nTests can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like checking the water temperature before you get in the shower.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:55.900\nThe main idea is to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\nSo, a test helps us to evaluate and understand things better.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
