    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:19.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:29.800\nThink of it like checking if you've learned your ABCs, or making sure a new toy is safe to play with.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:43.100\nSo, what's involved? Usually, a test has some kind of question or task, and then a way to measure the answer or result.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:51.200\nFor example, a spelling test asks you to write words, and then counts how many you spell correctly.\n\n00:51.200 --> 01:01.500\nOr, a test on a new medicine checks to see if it makes people feel better. Here\u2019s another example.\n\n01:01.500 --> 01:05.900\nIf you're baking a cake, tasting a small piece is a test to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:16.400\nBasically, a test is a method for finding out information. It helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working the way it should.\n\n01:16.400 --> 01:19.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
