    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:04.400\nToday, we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:08.500\nA test is simply a way to find out something, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:13.200\nThink of it like this: you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:15.600\nThat's one kind of test!\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:19.200\nOr, a doctor might run a test to check your health.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:22.000\nTests can be used in lots of different ways.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:26.300\nA baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:31.500\nA scientist might run an experiment to test a new idea.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:34.800\nSee? Tests help us learn and make sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:40.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a process we use to gather information or confirm something.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:46.500\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from school quizzes to scientific experiments.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:50.500\nAnd they help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:53.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
