    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_123645.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, and that's one kind.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:28.400\nBut in general, a test is really just a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:33.500\nIt's a procedure designed to see if something is true, or if something works.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:38.600\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:45.500\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. See? Different kinds of tests, same idea.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:52.300\nSo, a test is a way to gather information. We use tests all the time to make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:58.400\nWhether it's checking if your phone charger works or trying out a new video game, you're performing a test!\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:02.400\nBasically, a test helps us answer a question. It's a simple idea, right?\n\n01:02.400 --> 01:02.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
