    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.400\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in this case, we're talking about something a little broader: a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:26.800\nBasically, a test is just a procedure designed to evaluate the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:33.800\nIt could be anything! Think about it like this: you test if your shoes fit by trying them on.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:39.600\nThat's a test! Or, you test if a lightbulb works by screwing it in.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:45.400\nAnother test! So, tests help us make sure things are doing what they\u2019re supposed to be doing.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:52.000\nThey give us information and help us make good decisions.\n\n00:52.000 --> 01:05.600\nWhether it's a recipe, a new gadget, or even just checking the weather before you go outside, you're performing a simple test.\n\n01:05.600 --> 01:09.100\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check if something is working correctly.\n```"
