    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information. Think of it as a tool to see what you know, or what something can do.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:25.600\nIt\u2019s really all about understanding something better. For example, a spelling test helps your teacher understand how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:31.600\nOr, think about a taste test. You try different flavors to see which one you like best.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:37.000\nTests aren't just for school! A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:42.400\nAnd a company might test a new product to make sure it works the way it should.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:56.400\nSo, a test is just a way to learn something new, find out how well you understand something, or check if something is working properly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
