    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_125010.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:14.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:28.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think about it this way: a spelling test helps us find out how well we know our spelling words.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:35.900\nA cooking test, like trying a new recipe, helps us see if we can make something delicious.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:42.700\nOr, even a simple taste test tells us if we like a particular food.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:55.800\nSo, tests aren't scary! They're just a way to learn and improve. They show us what we already know and what we can work on. Whether it's a quiz at school or trying out a new hobby, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.300\nIn short, a test is just a way to get information and learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
