    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: Tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:16.900\nAt its most basic, a test is simply a way to find out information. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:26.600\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:39.500\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check on your health. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:47.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:57.700\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from quick quizzes to long exams. The key is that they give us information.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.300\nIn a nutshell, a test is a method for gathering data or evaluating something. They help us measure and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
