    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt helps us understand if something is working as it should, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:24.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school tells your teacher if you've learned how to spell certain words.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:29.900\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:42.800\nSee?\nDifferent kinds of tests, but the goal is the same: to get information.\nFor example, you might test if a toy car needs new batteries by seeing if it still runs.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:50.400\nOr, you might test if your plant needs water by touching the soil.\nIf it's dry, it needs watering!\n\n00:50.400 --> 01:01.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a simple way to gather information and learn something new.\nIt helps us understand how things work and make decisions.\n\n01:01.800 --> 01:05.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
