    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.600\nWell, simply put, a test is a way of finding something out. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:29.700\nThink about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Or, if your doctor wants to know if you're healthy, they might give you a blood test.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:48.600\nA test can also be something you take in school to see how well you understand a subject. So, whether it's testing the water temperature before you jump in, or a scientist testing a new medicine, a test is all about gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:57.200\nIn short, a test helps us understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
