    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how well someone knows something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how good you are at spelling words.\nOr, a taste test checks to see how good a new flavor of ice cream is.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:33.800\nTests can be big or small.\nA big test might be a final exam at the end of a school year.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:46.200\nA small test could be just a quick quiz.\nWhether it's testing your knowledge, your skills, or even the strength of a new bridge, tests help us understand and learn.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:54.500\nSo remember, a test is just a method to evaluate something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
