    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_130239.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:29.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but often in a more structured way. We use tests all the time to see what we know, how well something works, or even what something is made of.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:40.400\nThink about it: a spelling test at school helps your teacher see how well you know your words. A taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:52.700\nAnd a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel unwell. So, tests help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:57.700\nThey're all about getting information!\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.300\nWe hope you found this helpful. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
