    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_130343.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.700\nThink about it. A doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:28.400\nThat's one kind of test. Or, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. That's another.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:33.000\nAnd even baking a cake is a kind of test.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:44.000\nYou follow the recipe to see if you get a delicious cake! Basically, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and make decisions. They give us information.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:51.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of getting information about something.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
