    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_130438.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.900\nOkay, so you're wondering what a test is?\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:05.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:09.400\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:14.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:19.200\nOr a teacher gives you a test to see if you understand a lesson.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:20.700\nThere are tests all around us!\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:25.400\nYou might test a cookie recipe by changing one ingredient to see if it tastes better.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:29.700\nOr you might test a toy to see if it's strong enough to handle being played with.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:37.300\nBasically, a test involves doing something, observing what happens, and then using that information to draw a conclusion.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:43.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and understand something better.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:46.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
