    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out information about something.\nThink of it like a question you ask to get an answer.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:22.600\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:34.300\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing to see if the recipe works!\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:43.300\nSo, whether it\u2019s figuring out if you have a fever, or if your cake will rise, a test helps you learn something new.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:52.200\nTests are all about gathering information and understanding the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
