    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.900\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.200\nIt\u2019s how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:31.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.300\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You taste it to test if it\u2019s sweet enough, right?\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:43.100\nTests are everywhere! Teachers give you tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:50.700\nEngineers test bridges to make sure they're strong and safe.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:55.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out. It helps us check things and learn more about the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
