    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.300\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check your understanding. It helps us see if something is working, or if we\u2019ve learned something new.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:45.800\nDoctors even use tests to see if you're healthy. So, tests come in many forms, but they all have the same goal: to give us information.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:52.100\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. That\u2019s the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
