    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_131815.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.000\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:28.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:36.800\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is the yummiest!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:47.900\nEven a car going through safety checks is a kind of test to make sure it's working properly.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:59.400\nTests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying out a new recipe to see if you like it. The key thing is, they give us information.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:04.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new about ourselves or the world around us.\n```"
  },
