    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:10.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:16.300\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests can be really simple.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:21.300\nImagine tasting a cookie to see if it's sweet enough. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:28.400\nOr, maybe you try turning a light switch on to see if the lightbulb works. That\u2019s another test!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:35.500\nTests can also be a bit more formal, like a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:50.900\nThe important thing is that a test helps you learn something or confirm something you already suspected. So, a test is really just a way of checking something out to see if it's what you expect.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:54.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
