    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.900\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like asking a question to get an answer. We use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.300\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or a chef might taste a soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:43.000\nEven clicking on a link to see if it works is a type of test! So basically, a test is just a process that helps us confirm something, learn something new, or make sure something is working as it should.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:51.600\nIt's all about gathering information and using it to make a decision or understand something better. We test things to be sure!\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
