    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt could be about you, like a quiz in school, or about something else entirely, like testing if a new toy is safe.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:26.300\nBasically, you ask a question or perform an action, and then you look at the result to get an answer.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:33.600\nThink of it like this: a taste test!\nYou taste something and then you decide if you like it or not.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:37.800\nThat's a test.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:43.700\nOr imagine a doctor testing your reflexes.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:57.500\nThey tap your knee, and your leg kicks. That shows your nerves are working. So, a test helps us gather information and learn something new. They come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to find out something we didn't already know.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
