    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.900\nIn its simplest form, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it as a question you're trying to answer. It could be a written exam in school, sure, but it's way more than that.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:30.900\nA test could be as simple as checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:36.100\nYou flip the switch \u2013 that's your test! Does it light up? Yes or no.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:41.300\nOr maybe you're baking a cake and you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:47.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you the cake is done.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:59.600\nSo, tests help us learn, discover, and make sure things are working correctly. They can be formal like exams, or informal like checking if your soup is hot enough.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:03.200\nJust remember, a test is simply a way to get information.\n\n01:03.200 --> 01:06.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
