    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_132658.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:21.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. Think of it like this: A doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:29.400\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned. Even trying a new cookie recipe is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:42.900\nSo, tests help us learn and understand. Whether it's figuring out if a new plant needs more water, or checking if your car is working properly, we use tests all the time.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:50.300\nThey help us make decisions and improve things. In short, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:55.400\nIt's that simple! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
