    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_132749.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.800\nOr, a mechanic might run a test on your car to see if the engine is healthy.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:36.800\nAnother example could be baking a cake.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:49.700\nYou might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. See? We use tests all the time! So, to recap, a test is a process or procedure designed to determine a quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:57.200\nIt's all about getting information and understanding the results. Tests help us learn and improve things.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:01.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
