    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:24.500\nIt helps us understand if something is working the way it should, or if we've learned something new.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:35.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:43.800\nTests can be anything from quizzes and exams to experiments and observations.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:59.200\nFor example, you might test a new toy to see if it's durable, or test a recipe to see if it tastes good. So, a test is really just a way to gather information and make decisions based on what we find out.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.300\nIn short, tests are tools we use to learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n01:02.300 --> 01:02.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
