    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:06.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:11.100\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:13.800\nWe use tests all the time, maybe without even realizing it.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:17.700\nThink about it.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:20.500\nDid you ever check if the water was hot before getting in the shower?\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:22.900\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:26.100\nYou're testing the water temperature.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:30.400\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:34.600\nYou might stick a toothpick in the middle to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:38.200\nThat's also a test to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:42.200\nTests aren't just for science class.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:46.300\nThey help us make decisions and learn new things every single day.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:51.300\nWhether it\u2019s checking if your shoes fit or taking a quiz at school, a test helps us gather information.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:54.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
