    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.300\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in this case, we're talking about a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:22.700\nIt's like a little investigation to see if everything is as it should be.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:30.700\nThink of it like this: Imagine you bake a cake. A test could be sticking a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean \u2013 that tells you if the cake is cooked through.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.300\nOr, imagine you're setting up a new lamp. The test is plugging it in to see if it lights up.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:43.900\nTests help us find problems early, before they become bigger issues.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.600\nSo, a test is simply a way to check something, using a specific action or observation, to confirm if it's working as expected.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
