    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.300\nOkay, so you've probably heard the word \"test\" before,\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:06.300\nbut what does it really mean?\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:10.300\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:10.300 --> 00:13.300\nIt's like an experiment\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:15.600\nor a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes a soup to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:25.500\nOr, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:31.700\nA car manufacturer might crash test a car to see how safe it is in an accident.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:36.800\nIn each of these cases, someone is doing something \u2013 the \"test\" \u2013 to gather information about something else.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:40.700\nThey want to know about the soup, your health, or the car's safety.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:44.800\nSo, a test is all about getting answers and learning something new.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:46.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
