    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.800\nNow, you might think of school tests, but a test, in general, is really just a way to check if something works the way it should.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:21.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb is working. The test is simply screwing it into a lamp and flipping the switch.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:24.700\nDoes it light up? Great, it passes the test!\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:30.000\nOr maybe you're baking a cake. Tasting it is a test to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:40.600\nSo, a test is just a simple way to see if something is working, behaving, or tasting as expected. It helps us make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:47.900\nTo recap, a test is a way to check if something works as expected. It could be anything from a lightbulb to a cake!\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:51.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
