    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:10.700\nNow, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer. Tests can be anything from a simple quiz at school to a doctor checking your temperature.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:30.000\nThe main idea is that you're trying to get information. For example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:39.100\nOr, if you bake a cake and taste it, that's a test to see if it's delicious! The results of the test tell you what you need to know.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:44.700\nSo, remember, a test is a way to learn something by asking a question and getting an answer. It helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
