    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:09.600\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.600 --> 00:19.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\nThink of it like a detective trying to solve a mystery; they use clues to figure things out.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:28.900\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time!\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:38.300\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\nEven trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like the way it tastes!\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:48.200\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and understand the world around us.\nThey come in many forms, but the core idea is always the same: to gather information.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:51.300\nIn short, a test is a procedure to determine something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
