    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:05.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:7.000\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:12.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:16.000\nThink about it: when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:20.000\nOr, if you press a button on a remote, you\u2019re testing if it turns on the TV.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:24.000\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:28.000\nThey might ask you questions about a book you read, or have you solve a math problem.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:30.000\nThese are all different kinds of tests.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:34.000\nBasically, a test is just a method to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:37.000\nHopefully, now you have a better understanding of what a test is.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:46.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
