    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_140908.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nAlright, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:24.900\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:31.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:38.800\nA taste test helps determine which food tastes the best. A medical test can tell you if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:47.100\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions. They can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like quickly checking if your cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:50.600\nThe main point is to get some evidence. Tests are useful in all sorts of situations, and we use them every day without even realizing it.\n```"
  },
