    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_141130.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:09.699\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:19.299\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:28.599\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a physical test to check your health. Or, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:36.499\nA baker might test their oven temperature to ensure their cake bakes properly.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:46.099\nSo, tests come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to gather information and make an assessment. They help us learn and improve, whether it\u2019s our health, our knowledge, or even our baking skills!\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:49.199\nIn short, a test helps you measure something.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
