    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nOkay, so you're wondering what a test is, right?\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us check if something is working correctly, or if someone understands something.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You might do a test \u2013 stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:29.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Another example is a spelling test at school.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:39.200\nIt helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words. Or, imagine testing a new toy to see if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:44.700\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
