    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like a way to check or evaluate.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:32.200\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:39.100\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done.\n00:39.100 --> 00:45.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:52.800\nOr, if you're trying to figure out if your friend likes a new song, you might play it for them and watch their reaction.\n00:52.800 --> 01:00.100\nThat's a test too!\n```"
