    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:06.700\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are ready.\nYou take one out and taste it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:32.600\nIn general, a test helps us understand if something works, if it's good enough, or if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.100\nFor example, a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\nA teacher uses tests to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:44.400\nLet's say you're building a tower with blocks.\nYou give it a little shake \u2013 that's a test!\nYou're testing its stability.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:53.000\nOr imagine you\u2019re trying out a new recipe.\nThe taste is your test to see if it\u2019s delicious.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:62.700\nSo, a test is just a method to examine or evaluate something.\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
