    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_142201.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:05.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:09.400\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:12.600\nThink of it like this: you use a recipe to bake a cake.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:15.300\nThe taste test is, well, a test!\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:17.500\nIt tells you if you followed the recipe correctly.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:20.500\nSimilarly, a school test checks what you've learned in class.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:23.700\nA medical test helps doctors understand what's happening in your body.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:27.400\nAnd a software test makes sure a program works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:35.100\nSo, whether it's a quiz, a physical exam, or checking if a lightbulb works, a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:38.400\nIt's all about finding things out!\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:41.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
