    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:26.000\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if something is true. Think of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:34.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Or, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:43.500\nThey're looking for certain signs to tell if everything is working correctly.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.500\nTests can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb works, or more complex, like solving a math problem. But the goal is always the same: to get information and learn something.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.200\nSo remember, a test is just a way to find things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
