    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.300\nIt's like asking a question and looking for an answer.\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:31.300\nThink about it: When you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you the cake is done!\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:39.500\nOr, if you're trying to figure out which route to take to school, you might try one route one day and another the next.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:49.700\nYou're testing which way is faster.\nSo, tests help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:59.100\nThey help us confirm if something is true or discover something new.\nIn short, a test is a procedure that gives us information.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:02.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
