    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, you might be thinking about school tests, but in general, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. In science, for example, we might test if a plant grows better with more sunlight.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.800\nWe give one plant lots of sun and another very little, and then we see which one grows taller. That's a test!\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:41.700\nOr, imagine you\u2019re testing if your new toy car is faster than your old one. You race them both and see which one wins.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:49.400\nAgain, that\u2019s a test! We're checking something by comparing it to something else or observing what happens.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:56.100\nSo, a test is simply a way to check, observe, or compare something to learn more about it.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
