    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:18.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:28.000\nHow do you find out? You use a test! You stick a toothpick in it. If it comes out clean, the cake passes the test and is ready.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:34.000\nTests aren't just for baking, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:42.500\nTeachers use tests to see what you've learned. Even your phone uses tests to make sure all its parts are working correctly.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:50.000\nSo basically, a test helps us understand something better by giving us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:55.500\nThey\u2019re a super useful tool! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
