    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:16.300\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:25.200\nIt could be about you, like a quiz in school, or about something else, like checking if a new phone works properly.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:30.100\nThe main idea is to get information.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:34.200\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you taste it to see if it's good.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:43.300\nThat's a test! Or maybe you try on a new shirt to see if it fits. Another test!\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:59.200\nTests help us make decisions. If your cake tastes bad, you know you need to adjust the recipe. If the shirt is too small, you need a bigger size. So, to sum it up, a test is a process that gives us information to help us understand things better.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.700\nAnd remember, tests can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all help us learn.\n```"
