    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:14.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us see if something is true, or if something works.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:28.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! That's a test!\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:38.400\nOr, if you're trying to learn your ABCs, your teacher might give you a quiz. That quiz is a test to see how well you know your letters.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:44.400\nTests aren't always about grades, though. They're about learning and understanding.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:55.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working like they should.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
