    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:10.799\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:10.799 --> 00:18.499\nIt could be about you, about a product, or even about an idea.\n\n00:18.499 --> 00:26.099\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer in a structured way.\n\n00:26.099 --> 00:32.599\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:32.599 --> 00:40.399\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:40.399 --> 00:44.399\nThe key is that a test has a clear purpose and a way to measure the results.\n\n00:44.399 --> 00:50.899\nSo, whether it's a quiz, a safety check, or even just trying out a new recipe, a test helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:50.899 --> 00:55.399\nWe ask a question, we perform the test, and then we analyze the results to understand what we've learned.\n\n00:55.399 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
