    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.900\nWhat even is a test?\nBasically, it's a way to check something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\nYou do a test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:29.400\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\nIn science, a test might be an experiment to see if a hypothesis is correct.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:40.500\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\nFor example, a taste test helps you figure out which flavor of ice cream you like best.\nOr a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:46.400\nThey all give you information.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:56.600\nSo, a test is simply a method for finding out something, whether it's about baking, science, or just your favorite ice cream.\nIt\u2019s all about checking and learning!\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:02.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
