    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:32.300\nThe thing we're trying to learn about could be anything, really. Maybe you're testing if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:40.900\nOr maybe you're taking a quiz at school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:49.800\nSo, a toothpick test for cake tells you if it's baked. A pop quiz tests your knowledge. We use tests all the time to learn new things and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.400\nTests help us understand the world around us. Basically, a test is just a simple way to gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
