    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_143831.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:35.200\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:45.500\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned. For example, a multiple-choice quiz on animals is a test.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:54.300\nAn experiment to see if a plant grows better with more sunlight is also a test. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and find something out. It could be about anything! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
