    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:09.200\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:12.900\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:13.800\nThat's a test!\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:18.600\nIt could be a quiz at school, checking what you've learned in class.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:22.600\nOr, if you're baking a cake, tasting it to see if it needs more sugar is also a kind of test.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:28.100\nCompanies use tests too, like making sure a new phone doesn't break easily.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:34.200\nSo, a test helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:39.000\nWhether it's a spelling test or a stress test, it's all about gathering information.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:43.600\nTo recap, a test is a method for evaluating knowledge or performance.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:47.700\nIt can be formal or informal, and used in many different situations.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:50.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
