    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_144427.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:25.500\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:35.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:41.000\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:49.100\nOr even a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:53.100\nSo, tests aren't just about grades or being right or wrong.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:57.100\nThey help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:01.400\nThey give us information.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:04.800\nWhether it's checking your spelling, seeing if a bridge is strong,\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:08.900\nor finding out your favorite ice cream flavor... that's a test!\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:12.100\nThey\u2019re all about gathering data.\n\n01:12.100 --> 01:15.700\nBasically, a test is just a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n01:15.700 --> 01:16.700\nEasy peasy!\n\n01:16.700 --> 01:19.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
