    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but designed to give us information.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.300\nIt could be a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject, or a taste test to find out which flavor of ice cream people like best.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:36.200\nMaybe you run a speed test on your internet connection to see how fast you can download files. The point is, a test helps us gather data and make informed decisions.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:45.100\nWe use the results to understand something better, improve a process, or simply learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:53.200\nSo, a test is just a structured way of asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:54.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
