    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question or a series of questions designed to give you an answer.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nFor example, if you touch a hot stove, that's a test!\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:35.500\nYou're testing to see if it's hot, and you quickly learn the answer.\nOr, if you try a new recipe, you're testing to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:50.200\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like seeing if your shoes still fit.\nThe key thing is that a test helps you learn something new or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:57.200\nSo, a test helps us discover things!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
