    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.600\nWe use them all the time!\nThink of it like this: a test asks a question, and we find the answer.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:33.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:45.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing to see if you can make something delicious!\nThe point of a test is to learn.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:49.100\nWhether it's about your health, your knowledge, or your baking skills,\n00:49.100 --> 00:54.600\ntests help us understand things better.\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us discover and learn.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
