    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_144731.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:05.300\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:07.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:11.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:14.700\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:17.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:22.000\nOr a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:23.600\nSee?\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:27.100\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:29.600\nThey help us understand where we are and what we need to work on.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:30.600\nAnother example?\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:33.500\nMaybe you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:35.600\nYou taste the batter \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:39.000\nYou're checking if it tastes good before you bake the whole thing.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:44.100\nSo, to recap, a test is a method used to assess something.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:47.600\nIt could be your skills, your health, or even the deliciousness of your cake batter!\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:50.100\nTests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:52.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "4720fe56-2568-4d25-8a66-67210ccb1eb0": {
    "id": "4720fe56-2568-4d25-8a66-67210ccb1eb0",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:00:21.138266",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-06T14:48:27.557124",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260106_144827.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_144827.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:14.900\nSo, what exactly IS a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.500\nIt's how we find out if something is working correctly, if it's strong enough, or even if you understand a new idea.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:34.200\nThink about it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it\u2019s sweet enough. Or a doctor might test your eyesight to see how well you can see.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:51.000\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand how well you're learning. Tests can come in many forms, like multiple choice quizzes, physical challenges, or even just trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:51.000 --> 01:00.900\nThe main goal is always to gather information and learn something new. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n01:00.900 --> 01:06.900\nIt helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
