    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_144926.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling a fundamental concept: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:25.800\nIt's a structured process designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:40.600\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to check your health. A teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. Even baking a cake is a test \u2013 you're testing your recipe!\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:49.200\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to provide information about whatever is being tested.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:57.200\nWhether it's your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product, a test helps us learn and understand.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:01.000\nBasically, it's a measured way of finding something out.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:02.500\nI hope that helps clarify what a test really is!\n\n01:02.500 --> 01:04.899\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "73a8e298-6dcd-4e59-9cc7-8c09217a9990": {
