    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_145010.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:07.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:15.000\nThat something could be almost anything!\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like this: When you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in to see if it's done.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:20.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:26.200\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, falling down and then getting back up is testing your balance.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:29.000\nTests help us understand things better.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:34.300\nDoctors use tests to check your health, teachers use tests to see what you've learned,\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:39.500\nand even scientists use tests to discover new things about the world.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:41.600\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:53.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
