    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_145050.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat is a test?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see what we get.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\nOr, a doctor might check your temperature to test if you have a fever.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:34.300\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\nThese tests can be quizzes, exams, or even just doing a project.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:44.700\nThey help your teacher see if you understood the lessons.\nSo, a test is just a tool, a way to check something out and learn from the results.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:48.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "ad70ca6d-a886-41c0-ad95-5aa7c415c638": {
    "id": "ad70ca6d-a886-41c0-ad95-5aa7c415c638",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:00:23.450736",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-06T14:51:34.226378",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260106_145134.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_145134.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:35.100\nIn science, we might test a hypothesis, which is like an educated guess. For example, we might hypothesize that plants need sunlight to grow. To test this, we'd grow one plant in sunlight and another in the dark.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:44.000\nTests can also be used in everyday life.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:51.400\nYou might test your car's brakes before driving, or test the temperature of your bathwater before getting in.\n\n00:51.400 --> 01:02.300\nSo, tests are a fundamental way we learn and make sure things are working as expected. They help us verify information and make informed decisions.\n\n01:02.300 --> 01:05.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "73e097e6-90d9-40a7-95bf-3d60a1bd04f9": {
