    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:06.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:07.700\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not!\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:13.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:18.600\nA teacher uses tests to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:24.100\nA chef might even taste their food \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more salt!\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:32.200\nSo, a test can be a quiz, a physical exam, or even just trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:37.300\nThe important thing is that it gives you information.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:44.700\nLike, if you try to open a door and it doesn't budge, that's a test showing it's probably locked!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:52.100\nBasically, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
