    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.300\nA test, in the simplest terms, is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:32.700\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:35.700\nTests aren't just for school or the doctor\u2019s office, though.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:38.700\nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:41.700\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:42.600\nSee?\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:44.600\nTests are all around us!\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:50.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a way of checking something to see if it meets a certain standard or if it's working correctly.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:53.400\nIt helps us learn, diagnose, and even bake better cakes.\n```"
  },
