    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_145911.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.100\nHey there! Ever wondered what a \"test\" really is?\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:11.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something! Think of it like an investigation.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:22.300\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:30.700\nOr, a teacher gives a test to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:44.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:58.200\nTests can be written questions, like in school, or they can involve doing something, like a science experiment. The key is that a test helps us gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:06.600\nWhether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even a cake recipe, tests help us understand the world around us. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
