    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:19.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to check if something works as expected. Think of it like this: you want to know if a light bulb turns on, so you flip the switch. That's a test!\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:24.600\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:29.500\nDid you taste your soup to see if it needed more salt? That's a test!\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:35.700\nOr, maybe you checked the weather forecast to see if you needed a jacket. Another test!\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:45.000\nSo, tests help us confirm things are working correctly, catch problems early, and make sure we're on the right track.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:55.200\nThey're all about checking, confirming, and making sure things are as they should be. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
