    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_150209.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered exactly what it means?\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out or see how well something works.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:30.800\nYou might use a toothpick to test them. If it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:40.900\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. You'll probably wobble a bit at first, but each try is a test.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:51.000\nYou're testing your balance and learning how to steer. Tests aren't always about right or wrong answers, they're about gathering information.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:56.800\nSo, whether it's testing cookies, testing your balance, or testing a new idea, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:56.800 --> 00:59.000\nThey're a super important part of understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
