    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_150309.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. The \"something else\" could be anything! It could be your knowledge of a subject, the quality of a product, or even the presence of a certain ingredient in a recipe.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:38.300\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test can help us decide which cookie recipe tastes the best.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:40.000\nSee? Simple!\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:50.800\nSo, a test is just a process, a procedure, or a method used to determine if something is true, accurate, or effective. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
