    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_150451.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:22.800\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:27.300\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:31.900\nSee? Different situations, same idea: finding something out.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:44.000\nFor example, if you\u2019re building a birdhouse, you might test the wood to make sure it\u2019s strong enough. Or, before baking a cake, you test the oven temperature to make sure it's right.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:53.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a process to gather information. It helps us understand something better by evaluating a particular skill, knowledge, or quality.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
