    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.500\nHey there, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:11.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:20.500\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:35.400\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re sick. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:46.000\nA test can be written, like filling in bubbles on a form, or it can be something you do, like following instructions.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:58.200\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you which flavor of ice cream you prefer! Or a spelling test can show you which words you need to practice.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn something new or confirm what we already know.\n```"
