    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_150944.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.700\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:25.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be about you, like a quiz in school, or about something else entirely, like testing if a new toy is safe.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:35.200\nThe main idea is to gather information. Tests help us measure things, understand how well something works, or see if something is true or false.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:37.800\nThink about it:\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:40.400\na doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:44.200\nOr, a baker tests a cake recipe to make sure it tastes good.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:44.900\nSee?\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:45.800\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:52.600\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. They give us answers!\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
