    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:19.200\nIt's a process to see if something works, or to check its quality, or even to measure its performance.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:30.400\nThink of it like this: a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, a car manufacturer might crash test a car to test its safety.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:39.900\nYou take tests in school to show what you've learned! So, tests can be about anything, from food to cars to your knowledge.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:47.600\nThe important thing is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspected.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:56.000\nTests help us improve things and make sure they're working as they should. In short, a test is an evaluation.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:02.400\nIt's a way of checking and verifying. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
