    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_151301.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:18.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like this: You might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:36.200\nOr, a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough. Even a doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature, to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:48.000\nSo, whether it's a written exam, a taste test, or a medical checkup, the goal is the same: to gather information and learn something.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:58.100\nTests help us understand where we're at and what we might need to work on. In short, a test is a way to measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:58.100 --> 01:03.600\nPretty simple, right? This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
