    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:19.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. \nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done baking, so you stick a toothpick in it. \nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:28.300\nBasically, a test helps us find out if something is working correctly or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:36.300\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. \nA medical test checks if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:46.700\nAnd even a simple taste test can tell you if your food is good!\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:56.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and get information. \nIt helps us understand if something is working, if it meets a goal, or even if it tastes delicious. \nThat's testing in a nutshell!\n\n00:56.600 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
