    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:22.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Think of it like this: you're trying a new recipe.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:28.500\nTasting the food is a test to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:36.100\nOr imagine checking if a light bulb works before you screw it in. That's a test too!\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:43.700\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They're like a snapshot of your knowledge.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:53.700\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking questions in class. The point is to see if you understand the information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:59.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for checking something. It can be big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:01.800\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n```"
