    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_152208.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:28.100\nIt could be about how well you know a subject, or how something works. Think of it like an experiment, but instead of chemicals, we're using questions or actions.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:36.000\nFor example, a spelling test tells us how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:42.600\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a toy car needs new batteries.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:52.100\nYou test it by turning it on. If it goes, the batteries are good! If it doesn't, the batteries probably need replacing.\n\n00:52.100 --> 01:00.300\nSo, tests help us learn, understand, and make decisions. They give us information we didn't have before. Remember, a test is just a tool to help us find something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
