    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! \nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. \nWe use them all the time!\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like this: you taste a cookie to test if it's sweet enough. \nOr, you might try turning a light switch on and off to test if the power is working.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:36.000\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, where you answer questions to show what you've learned. \nOr they can be informal, like wiggling a loose tooth to see if it's ready to come out.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:50.000\nThe main idea is always the same: we're trying to learn something by observing the result. \nSo, whether it's a math exam or checking if your shoes fit, you're performing a test!\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:56.700\nThey help us understand the world around us. \nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
