    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.999\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:13.299\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:22.799\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you understand an idea. It could be a quiz in school, making sure you know your facts.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:31.099\nOr it could be testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good! Even checking if a light bulb works is a kind of test.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:42.099\nYou're trying to figure out if something is working correctly, or if something is true. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:56.199\nOr, you might test a toy to make sure it's safe for kids. So, remember, a test is just a way to check something, whether it's knowledge, quality, or anything else!\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:03.899\nIt helps us learn and make sure things are working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
