    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, maybe in school.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:25.000\nBut what is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:35.500\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, abilities, or performance.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:40.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out about your health.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:45.300\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:50.200\nSo, tests aren't just about school. They\u2019re used everywhere!\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:55.400\nA car company might crash test a new car to see how safe it is.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:00.400\nA software developer might test their new program to make sure it works correctly.\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:04.800\nEssentially, a test helps us learn something specific.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:09.200\nIt gives us data to analyze and understand.\n\n01:09.200 --> 01:14.200\nThat\u2019s the core idea of a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
