    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_152809.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:17.100\nA test is basically a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a set of questions, designed to see what you know, or what something can do.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:25.400\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is ready, you can do a simple test: stick a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done!\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:36.100\nOr, if you're learning to spell, a spelling test shows you how well you've learned the words.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:46.100\nTests help us understand where we're at and what we need to work on.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:53.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to get information. It can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just a simple check.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.800\nIt helps us learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
