    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:06.900\nIn a nutshell, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:9.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:13.800\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:17.300\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:21.800\nOr when you flip a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:26.000\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:30.200\nThey might ask you questions on a quiz, or have you complete a project.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:35.800\nThe results of the test show where you're doing well, and maybe where you need a little extra help.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:41.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:44.300\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:46.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
