    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_153523.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.800\nWhat are they and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:27.300\nIt helps us measure or evaluate. Think about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:38.500\nA taste test tells us which ice cream flavor people like best. Even a doctor uses tests, like a blood test, to check your health.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:52.400\nSo, tests can be used to check knowledge, like in school. They can also be used to compare things, like different products.\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:00.100\nBasically, a test gives us information we didn't have before, helping us make decisions or understand something better.\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:07.600\nTo recap: Tests help us measure or evaluate something. They give us information to make choices. And they're used in all kinds of different situations. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
