    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb works.\nYou're testing the bulb to see if it lights up.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nA school exam is a test of what you've learned.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:36.400\nA medical test can check your health.\nEven trying out a new recipe is a test to see if you like it!\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:50.300\nSo, tests help us measure things, understand how well something works, and make informed decisions.\nThey're a fundamental part of learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:55.400\nRemember, a test isn't about passing or failing, it's about finding out something new.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
