    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_153843.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something or someone to see how well they perform or how well they know something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is ready. You do a test by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:35.300\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! Similarly, a student might take a test in school to see how well they understand a subject, like math or science.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:43.500\nDoctors use tests, too, to see if you're healthy. They might take a blood test or give you an eye test.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.400\nSo, in short, a test is just a method to find out information. It helps us see where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
