    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.800\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate or assess a quality, ability, or performance. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy. A chef tastes the soup to test if it needs more salt. And in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.700\nSo, tests can be about anything! They help us understand and measure things. They help us make better decisions.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:45.900\nIn short, a test is a method for gathering information. It gives us data to analyze and helps us learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
