    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_154453.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:03.900\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:03.900 --> 00:06.400\nA test, simply put, is a way to check something.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:10.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you use a toothpick.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:11.400\nThat's a test!\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:14.900\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:18.500\nThey can be multiple choice, short answer, or even projects.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:23.200\nImagine you're learning about animals. A test might ask you to name different animals or describe their habitats.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:26.800\nTests aren't meant to be scary.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:29.900\nThey're just a tool to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:35.500\nSo, remember to study, do your best, and don't stress too much.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:40.900\nThey're just a snapshot of what you know at that moment.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:45.600\nThey help you, and your teachers, figure out what to focus on next.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:47.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
