    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.100\nIt's a process or procedure designed to measure or evaluate a specific thing.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:33.700\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:44.300\nA chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:53.800\nOr maybe you take a quiz in school; that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:01.400\nSo, tests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking if a lightbulb works to figuring out what you've learned in class.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:09.300\nIn essence, a test is a way to gather information and make a judgment or decision based on that information.\n\n01:09.300 --> 01:18.900\nTests help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
