    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:15.199\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:22.399\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is good. You screw it in and see if it lights up \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:31.599\nTests can be used for lots of things. In school, you take tests to show your teacher what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:42.799\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick. Even when you bake a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.499\nSo, tests help us understand things better by giving us information. They let us know if we're on the right track or if we need to make some changes.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:55.199\nIn short, a test is just a way of finding something out.\n00:55.200 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
