    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.600\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in the world of technology, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like this: you build a toy car, and you need to test if the wheels spin.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:31.800\nWe use tests all the time to make sure our programs, websites, and even apps are doing what they're supposed to.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:44.000\nFor example, imagine a website where you can buy shoes.\nA test could be clicking the \"add to cart\" button to see if the shoe actually gets added to your cart.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:57.400\nOr, checking if the search bar finds the right shoes when you type in \"red sneakers.\"\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to verify that something works as expected.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:04.100\nIt's all about making sure things are working right!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
