    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.400 --> 00:02.700\nToday, we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:04.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:08.700\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly,\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:09.900\nor if something is true.\n\n00:09.900 --> 00:12.500\nThink of it like this: You might test a new recipe\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:14.000\nby tasting it to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:16.600\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:19.800\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:20.500\nwhat you've been learning.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:23.300\nSo, tests can take many forms, from quizzes to experiments.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:27.400\nThe key thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:30.200\nThey let us know if something passes or fails,\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:33.100\nif something is good or needs improvement.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:34.400\nThat's the power of a test!\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:36.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
