    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.400\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:07.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:11.400\nThink of it like a question we ask to learn more.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:11.900\nIt can be anything!\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:15.900\nWe use tests every day.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:20.000\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it's delicious.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:23.200\nOr, if you try a new route to school, you're testing if it's faster.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:28.600\nTests aren't just for school.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:33.000\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:38.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:47.200\nBasically, a test is a way to gather information and check if something is true or working as expected.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:56.900\nIt\u2019s a fundamental tool for learning and problem-solving in all sorts of situations.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "62cc33cb-eceb-4df6-be49-eebadb086b8b": {
    "id": "62cc33cb-eceb-4df6-be49-eebadb086b8b",
    "topic": "Test",
