    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like a check-up for your brain!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:29.800\nThere are all sorts of tests. You might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:41.200\nOr maybe a driving test to show you can safely operate a car. Even a simple quiz on your favorite TV show is a type of test!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:50.300\nSo, tests help us understand what we've learned and where we might need a little more practice.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:58.300\nThey aren't meant to be scary, but just a tool to help us grow and improve. They show us what we know and what we can learn!\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:01.800\nIn short, a test is a measurement of your knowledge or ability. It helps you and others see how you\u2019re doing. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
