    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are, and why they're important.\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process or procedure designed to give you information.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:27.700\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health. Or, a baker might taste their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:32.200\nThose are both tests! They help us understand something better.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:38.400\nAnother example? You might take a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:49.800\nOr, you might try a new recipe to test if you like it. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:57.500\nIt's about exploring and understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
