    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:07.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:27.900\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:31.700\nThink about it this way:\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:46.100\na spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words, or a taste test might help decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:51.200\nSee? Different tests, different purposes!\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:55.900\nSo, a test can be written, like an exam; physical, like testing how far you can jump; or even an experiment, like testing if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.600\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information.\n```"
