    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:19.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question, but with a specific method for getting the answer.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:25.400\nWe use tests all the time, in school, in sports, even in cooking!\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:35.800\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:43.800\nOr, in school, a test helps your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:54.000\nTests aren't just about getting a grade, though.\nThey help us understand where we're at and what we need to work on.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.600\nSo, a test is basically a tool for checking, measuring, or evaluating something.\nIt helps us learn and improve!\n```"
