    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:30.400\nWe use tests all the time to see what we know, or how well something works. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:35.000\nFor example, when you take a spelling test in school, you're showing what words you've learned.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:39.600\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:44.000\nThe toothpick comes out clean? That means it passed the test!\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:47.800\nTests help us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:51.100\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and check for understanding or functionality. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
