    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_160637.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:26.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick.\nOr, you take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:35.600\nA baker might taste their cake batter as a test to see if it needs more sugar!\nSo, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:43.000\nThey give us evidence and clues.\nThey're used everywhere from science experiments to everyday decisions.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:53.100\nThey allow us to evaluate and improve things.\nIn short, a test is a question we ask, and the results help us find the answer.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
