    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a question, or a set of questions,\ndesigned to give you information about a person,\na thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:29.100\nThink of it like this: your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to show what you've learned.\nThose are both tests!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:33.600\nAnother example is baking a cake.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:43.700\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it turns out right.\nSo, tests help us learn, check, and understand things better.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:51.500\nRemember, a test is just a tool to gather information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
