    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_160816.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nNow, what is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well something performs.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it\u2019s done by sticking a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:39.700\nOr maybe you test a toy to make sure it won\u2019t break easily.\nTests are used everywhere, from checking if your phone is working properly to making sure a bridge is safe to cross.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:50.700\nBasically, a test helps us understand if something meets our expectations.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
