    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.800 --> 00:04.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:06.700\nIt's how we check if something is working correctly,\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:09.300\nor if we know something, or even what someone prefers.\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:12.500\nThink of it like this: a test is like asking a question\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:14.400\nand then looking for the answer.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:17.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:21.300\nA taste test checks which food you like better.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:23.800\nAnd a medical test checks if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:25.200\nSee?\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:27.300\nDifferent tests, different questions.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:31.800\nSo, remember, a test is a way to learn something\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:34.800\nby asking a specific question and finding the answer.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:38.800\nIt helps us understand the world around us\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:40.800\nand ourselves a little bit better.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:43.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
