    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_161126.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into something fundamental: tests.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:14.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.100\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate, assess, or measure something.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:29.400\nThink about it. A spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:38.300\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:47.200\nOr even a blood test at the doctor gives them information about your health.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:53.900\nSo, tests aren't just about getting a grade in school.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:01.400\nThey're about gathering information and making decisions based on that information.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:04.400\nThey help us understand things better, whether it's our knowledge, our preferences, or even our physical well-being.\n\n01:04.400 --> 01:08.300\nUltimately, a test is just a way to learn and improve.\n\n01:08.300 --> 01:10.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
