    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_161217.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE duration:65.5\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:18.600\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Think about it.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:28.600\nWhen you try a new food, you're testing to see if you like it. Or when you flip a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:42.100\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand a subject. They can be written, like quizzes, or even practical, like performing a science experiment.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:52.300\nThe important thing is that they give us information. So, to recap, a test helps us understand something better by giving us results.\n\n00:52.300 --> 01:01.900\nTests can be simple, like trying a new flavor, or more involved, like a school exam. They all help us learn!\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:05.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
