    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:14.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.900\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information and see how something performs, or what its qualities are.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:37.700\nThink about it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might use a toothpick. That's a test! You stick the toothpick in, and if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:53.100\nOr, if you're learning to drive, you'll take a driving test to see if you know the rules of the road and can operate a car safely.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.300\nTests are everywhere, helping us evaluate, learn, and improve.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:00.400\nFrom simple checks to complex experiments, they all share the same goal: to provide us with valuable information.\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:03.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
