    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.700\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or if we know something.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:30.800\nThink of it like this: a teacher gives you a quiz. That's a test to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:38.900\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:49.300\nIf you try to turn on a light and it doesn't work, that\u2019s testing the light bulb. If it doesn't light up, the bulb probably needs replacing.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:55.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check things and learn more. It's all about finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
