    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:22.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something! It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:35.500\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\nOr when you get your eyesight checked, that's a test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:44.700\nTests can be written, like exams, or practical, like a driving test.\nThey help us understand where we stand and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:48.300\nSo, a test is just a tool for measuring something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
