    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.300\nIt\u2019s how we check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb works.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:32.300\nYou screw it in, flip the switch, and see if it lights up. That's a test!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:38.300\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick to test if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:42.100\nA clean toothpick means it's ready.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:47.900\nTests can also be used to see how well you understand something, like a quiz in school.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:53.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something out and see if it meets a certain standard. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
