    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you know the answer.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:30.900\nIt helps us figure out what we've learned or how well something works.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:41.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test can help you decide which cookie tastes better. It\u2019s all about finding things out.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:46.900\nSo, a test helps us understand where we are and what we might need to work on. Remember, it's just a tool for learning and improvement. Don\u2019t be afraid of tests! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
