    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:29.300\nTests aren't just for people, though! We can test all sorts of things.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:39.900\nFor example, you might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:51.900\nAnother example is checking the temperature of water to see if it's hot enough for tea. So, remember, a test is just a way of checking something to learn more about it.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:59.500\nIt helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
