    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.100 --> 00:02.900\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:02.900 --> 00:05.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:06.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:09.200\nThe goal of a test is to measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:12.400\nIt could be your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:15.500\nFor example, a spelling quiz is a test to see how well you know your spelling.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:18.300\nOr, a taste test is a test to see which food someone prefers.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:22.300\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is performing a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:26.600\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method to gather information and understand something better.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:29.500\nIt helps us make decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:32.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
