    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:19.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test in school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:28.400\nThat's one kind of test. Or, maybe you're baking a cake.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:32.900\nYou taste it to test if it's sweet enough. That's another kind!\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:44.100\nTests can be written like exams, or they can be practical, like trying out a new recipe. The important thing is that they give you information.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:51.600\nThey help you understand what you've learned, or how effective something is.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.300\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz or a taste test, tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
