    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.600\nIt's a process to see if something is true, or to measure how well something works.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: a taste test! You're testing different flavors to see which one you like best.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:38.300\nOr, a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you understand your spelling words.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:44.500\nTests can be used in lots of different ways. Doctors use tests to check your health.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:55.600\nScientists use tests to prove or disprove ideas. Even you test things every day, like trying different routes to school to see which is the fastest.\n\n00:55.600 --> 01:02.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find something out. It helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n```"
