    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:21.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a method to gather information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:32.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy, or a chef tastes their food to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:39.800\nIn school, you take tests to show what you\u2019ve learned. A test could be a quiz, an exam, or even a practical demonstration.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:51.600\nIt's a way for your teacher to see how well you understand the material. Another example is testing a new toy. You play with it to see if it's fun and if it works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:59.300\nSo, to recap, a test is simply a way to gather information or check something. It's used everywhere, from medicine to cooking to learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
