    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_163523.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHello! Welcome to a quick introduction to tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:10.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:10.600 --> 00:25.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities in a specific area.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.700\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:44.000\nThat's a test! Or, if you want to know if you understand a new concept, you might try answering some practice questions.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:51.500\nThose questions are also tests. Tests come in many forms, from simple quizzes to big exams.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:57.200\nThey help us understand what we know and what we need to learn more about.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:00.300\nSo, a test is just a tool for learning and evaluation.\n\n01:00.300 --> 01:07.600\nTo recap, a test helps you find out something, it evaluates your skills, and it can be a quiz or an exam.\n\n01:07.600 --> 01:11.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
