    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.500 --> 00:07.500\nToday we're going to talk about something really important: tests.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:16.800\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:20.600\nThink about it: a taste test tells you if you like a certain food.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:24.400\nA spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:28.700\nAnother example is a doctor giving you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:34.000\nOr even checking the temperature of water to see if it's warm enough for a bath.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:38.900\nSo, a test helps us gather information.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:45.700\nIt's a tool we use to learn more about the world around us, or about ourselves.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:50.000\nTests can be simple or complex, but they all have the same basic goal: to give us answers.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:54.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
