    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.200\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but a test, in general, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done. You test them by sticking a toothpick in.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:29.200\nIf it comes out clean, the cookies pass the test! Another example is checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:36.000\nYou screw it in and flip the switch. If it lights up, it passes the test; it works!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:42.800\nIf not, well, it failed the test. So, a test is really just a simple way of checking if something is working correctly or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:47.900\nIt helps us make sure things are good!\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
