    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.100\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:31.000\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if your cake is done, you do a test! You might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:35.400\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the test tells you the cake is ready.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:43.300\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. The test is... well, trying to ride!\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:47.700\nIf you can balance and pedal, you've passed the test!\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:53.500\nSo, a test is just a method for checking something.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:02.000\nWhether it's a cake, a bike, or even a computer program, tests help us understand what's going on.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:10.500\nTo recap, a test is a way to find out if something works or if something is true.\n\n01:10.500 --> 01:13.500\nAnd we use them all the time!\n\n01:13.500 --> 01:17.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
