    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but instead of mixing chemicals, we're trying to measure or understand something specific.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:29.900\nFor example, a spelling test helps us understand how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes the best!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:43.000\nTests can be used to check if something is working correctly, like a smoke detector test. Basically, a test helps us gather information and make a decision, or just learn more.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:50.900\nSo remember, a test is just a tool for understanding! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
