    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_164349.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in general, a test is just a way to see if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:20.700\nIt's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:27.300\nThink about it. If you want to know if a lightbulb is good, you screw it in and turn it on.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:35.500\nThat's a test! Or, if you want to know if your cookies taste good, you give one to a friend and ask them.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:43.700\nThat's another test! Tests help us know if things are working correctly, if they're safe, or if they're meeting our expectations.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:57.000\nThey're super important for all sorts of things, from building bridges to writing software. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of checking things out.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
