    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.400\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\nThink of it like this:\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:30.600\na doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:41.800\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test!\nYou're testing to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:50.100\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and check if something is working as expected.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:58.400\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from simple yes-or-no questions to complex scientific experiments.\nThe key is that they help us gather information.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:05.400\nTo recap, a test is a method for gathering information and understanding something better.\n\n01:05.400 --> 01:09.500\nIt's about asking a question and finding the answer!\n\n01:09.500 --> 01:16.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
