    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_164530.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:16.900\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:28.200\nThink about it. When you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like it. Or, if you wiggle a loose tooth, you're testing to see if it's ready to come out.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:38.700\nTests help us gather information and make decisions. For example, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it's safe and effective.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:45.200\nA teacher uses tests in school to see how well students understand the material.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:51.700\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, to recap, a test is a process we use to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:58.200\nThey help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
