    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_164709.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.200\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:25.200\nIt could be about anything! Think of it like an experiment, where you're trying to learn more. The main idea behind any test is to observe or measure something, and then use that information to draw a conclusion.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:36.100\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you which cookie is sweeter. Or, a spelling test can show you which words you need to practice more.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:44.000\nDoctors use tests to find out if you're healthy, and teachers use tests to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:57.600\nSo, to recap, tests are tools we use to gather information and learn something new. They help us understand the world around us, and even ourselves, a little bit better.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
