    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_165032.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:14.600\nNow, a test is really just a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, you might test your knowledge of a subject before a big exam.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:38.800\nEssentially, a test is a procedure designed to confirm, verify, or demonstrate something. It helps us understand if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:49.000\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Or, a car manufacturer might test a new car to make sure it\u2019s safe.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:59.300\nSo, remember, a test is all about checking things out! It gives us information to make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
