    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:18.300\nThink of it like an experiment, but designed to give us information.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:31.800\nWe use tests all the time! When you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick to test if it's done. Or, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how well you understand the vocabulary.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:48.900\nIn science, scientists run tests to see if their ideas are correct. So, whether it's checking a cake, taking a quiz, or running a scientific experiment, a test helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:54.900\nIt's all about gathering information! That's the basic idea of what a test is.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
