    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:29.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, when you learn a new skill, like riding a bike, practicing is a test to see if you're getting better.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:36.700\nEven trying a new recipe is a test to see if it tastes good!\nTests aren't just about grades in school.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:48.000\nThey're used everywhere to help us understand and measure things.\nWhether it's a simple taste test or a big exam, tests provide valuable information.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:58.800\nSo, remember, a test is a method for finding something out \u2013 evaluating knowledge, skills, or even the flavor of your cooking!\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:02.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
