    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:24.100\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb actually lights up.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:31.300\nTests help us understand if we've learned something new, or if a product is ready to be sold.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:41.700\nFor example, your teacher might give you a math test to see if you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:55.500\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\nSo, tests are important because they give us information.\n\n00:55.500 --> 01:00.700\nThey tell us what's working, what's not, and what we might need to improve.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:05.900\nThey come in many forms, like quizzes, experiments, or even just trying something out.\n\n01:05.900 --> 01:09.500\nBasically, a test is a way to check something.\n\n01:09.500 --> 01:12.400\nSimple as that!\n\n01:12.400 --> 01:16.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
