    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a method we use to check if something is working, if something is true, or how well something is done.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:29.600\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, if you're baking a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:39.800\nScientists use tests all the time to see if their ideas are right. They might run an experiment to test a new medicine or a new way to grow crops.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:47.600\nSo, a test is just a process for gathering information. It helps us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:55.200\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
