    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:14.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies taste good, so you give them to your friend to try.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:33.500\nThat's a test! Tests can be written, like a quiz in school, or they can be practical, like seeing if a new toy actually does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:45.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. Or, testing a new recipe makes sure it tastes delicious before you make it for everyone.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:53.200\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is just a way to find out information. It helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:59.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
