    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.800\nThink of it like this: you might test if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick. If it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:31.600\nIn science, tests are used to find out if an idea is correct. For example, you could test if plants grow better in sunlight than in shade.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:40.300\nYou'd grow some plants in the sun and some in the shade, and then compare them. Tests aren't just for science, though.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:48.200\nYou take tests in school to see how well you understand the material. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:60.500\nBasically, a test helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect. So remember, a test is just a way of checking something to see if it's true.\n\n00:60.500 --> 00:64.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
