    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_170856.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:14.800\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests all the time, without even realizing it!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:39.000\nBasically, a test helps us gather information. It could be to see if something works, to check someone's knowledge, or even to explore a new idea.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:50.300\nFor example, if you bake a cake and taste it, that's a test to see if it tastes good. Or, if you take a quiz at school, that's a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:56.500\nScientists use tests to discover new things about the world around us. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn more and confirm something. It's about gathering information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
