    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:17.600\nNow, a test, at its core, is simply a way to find something out.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:25.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:33.600\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is ready, you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:40.800\nOr, if you want to see if your plant needs water, you stick your finger in the soil. Another test!\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:51.900\nSo, in general, a test is just a procedure designed to evaluate something, like its quality, performance, or presence.\n\n00:51.900 --> 01:00.700\nIt helps us make decisions based on evidence. We use tests all the time, often without even realizing it.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:11.900\nTests help us check, verify, and learn new things. Ultimately, tests are super helpful tools for understanding the world around us.\n\n01:11.900 --> 01:15.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
