    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:14.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process of asking a question and then trying to answer it.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:24.800\nThink about it like this: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:31.500\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned. So, tests come in many forms.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:42.900\nIt could be a questionnaire, an exam, or even just observing something. The important thing is that it helps us gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:51.900\nThey help us understand the world around us. Basically, a test is any kind of procedure used to evaluate something.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:59.400\nRemember, it's all about asking a question and finding the answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
