    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:11.400\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:20.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. Think about it: a taste test tells you which food you like better.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:29.200\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your words. Even trying on clothes is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if they fit!\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:40.600\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information. It could be written questions, a physical activity, or even just observing something.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:52.000\nThe important thing is that it helps us learn or understand something new. From cooking to school, tests are all around us, helping us improve and grow.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:59.800\nRemember, a test isn\u2019t about being right or wrong, it\u2019s about learning!\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:01.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
