    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests! You've probably taken a test in school, but what is a test, really?\n\n00:08.300 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.500\nIt's a process for gathering information.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:42.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a chef might taste food to test if it needs more salt. In computers, we use tests to make sure our programs are working correctly.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:50.500\nFor example, we might test if a calculator program adds numbers properly by giving it \"2 + 2\" and seeing if it gives us \"4\".\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.100\nSo, a test is just a way to check if something is working as expected.\n```"
