    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.300\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.500\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. And a science experiment is a test to see if your hypothesis is correct.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:43.500\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school, or informal, like asking a friend a question to see if they know the answer.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:56.000\nThe key is that a test helps us gather information and learn more. So, tests help us measure things, learn new things, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
