    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.500 --> 00:12.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to an answer, you're collecting information to see if something is true or false, good or bad, or even just how much of something you have.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:27.000\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:31.500\nA doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.500\nOr, you could even test a recipe by baking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:44.000\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:47.500\nThey're all about getting information.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:51.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
