    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nThink of it like asking a question, but getting an answer that's more than just \"yes\" or \"no.\"\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:26.400\nTests help us measure or evaluate things.\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:39.000\nA taste test helps us decide which food we like better.\nAnd a medical test can tell us if we're healthy.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:48.000\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, comparing flavors, or assessing your health, tests are a valuable tool.\nThey help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:53.700\nRemember, a test is just a way to find something out!\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
