    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:19.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it like checking if you understand a lesson, or making sure a new toy isn't broken.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:37.700\nBasically, you're giving something a challenge and seeing what happens.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:46.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test checks if food tastes good!\n\n00:46.600 --> 01:00.400\nSo, tests help us learn and improve. They show us what we already know and what we still need to work on. And they also help us make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:04.000\nTo recap, a test is a simple way to check knowledge or performance.\n\n01:04.000 --> 01:07.400\nIt uses challenges or questions to measure understanding or functionality.\n\n01:07.400 --> 01:10.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
