    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260106_172203.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_172203.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:26.800\nThink of it like this: a baker tastes their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar. Or, you might check the weather forecast to test if you need an umbrella before you leave the house.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:40.100\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking if your shoes still fit. The main idea is that you're performing an action to see what the result will be.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:49.000\nIt helps you make decisions and learn new things. So, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:52.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "d150c8f1-ff8c-4b31-8c09-205a3e04b8fa": {
    "id": "d150c8f1-ff8c-4b31-8c09-205a3e04b8fa",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:02:17.372146",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-06T17:22:47.785491",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260106_172247.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_172247.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.300\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:19.500\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way of checking something. It could be anything, from seeing if you understand a new concept, to checking if a machine is working properly.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:27.100\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how well you learned the material. Or, a doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:36.300\nEven trying a new recipe to see if it tastes good is a kind of test! The main goal is to get information, to see if something passes or fails, or to learn more about it.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:53.800\nSo, tests are all about checking things and gathering information. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:53.800 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
