    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:07.800\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:15.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.400\nThe main idea behind a test is to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:31.500\nFor example, your doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, think about a taste test!\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:42.600\nYou try different foods to see which one you like best. Here's another example: When baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in to test if it's done.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:55.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! So, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:03.400\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
