    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch. That's a simple test!\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:29.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a quiz at school to see how much you learned in class, or a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:47.900\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if it tastes good! So, whether it's a pop quiz, a science experiment, or even just trying a new video game, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:54.700\nThey give us information to improve and grow. In short, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
