    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it as a question or a series of questions designed to get an answer.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:34.100\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something. For example, a math test helps us see how well you understand math problems.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:45.100\nA taste test helps us decide which flavor is tastier. Or, if you\u2019re baking a cake, you might do a quick test by sticking a toothpick in it to see if it's done.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:55.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake has passed the test! So, a test is just a method for gathering information and making decisions.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.200\nIt can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your coffee is hot enough. It's all about finding things out!\n```"
