    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:24.100\nIt's a method we use to get information, whether it's about a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:34.100\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a physical exam to test your health.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:44.100\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge on a certain subject.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:49.800\nEven a chef tasting a soup is testing if it needs more salt!\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.900\nTests can be formal, like a standardized exam, or informal, like checking if a lightbulb works by screwing it in.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:00.600\nThe main goal is always the same: to gather data and learn something new.\nTo summarize, a test is a procedure for gaining information.\nIt helps us understand the world around us better!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
