    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even the presence of a specific substance.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes better.\nAnd a medical test can tell you if you're feeling okay.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:34.100\nTests help us make informed decisions.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:41.800\nFor example, a car manufacturer might test a car's safety features before releasing it to the public.\nOr a teacher might use a test to see how well their students understand a particular topic.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:57.000\nSo, in short, a test is a procedure used to evaluate something, giving us valuable information to work with.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
