    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:28.900\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information, often to see how well someone knows something, or how well something works.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:35.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:41.500\nOr, imagine a car manufacturer testing a new engine to see if it's reliable.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:45.700\nThey're both tests!\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:59.100\nAnother example could be tasting a cake to see if it needs more sugar, that\u2019s a test too, you're testing the sweetness level.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:02.700\nBasically, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\n\n01:02.700 --> 01:06.700\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the goal of providing us with valuable information.\n\n01:06.700 --> 01:09.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
