    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_174745.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.500\nToday we're diving into something super important: Tests!\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:06.500\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information or check something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:18.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:22.500\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:30.000\nTests can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like checking if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:34.500\nThey all have the same goal: to give us some kind of result or answer.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:44.000\nSo, whether it's testing a new recipe or testing your knowledge, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:47.500\nThey give us valuable data!\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "c61754d3-16f4-4127-99c0-3d37e5d78b2e": {
    "id": "c61754d3-16f4-4127-99c0-3d37e5d78b2e",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:02:39.403732",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-06T17:48:31.543416",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260106_174831.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_174831.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.100\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. We use tests all the time to learn more about ourselves, or about the world around us.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:28.700\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your words. Or, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:39.700\nIn science, a test might involve mixing two things together to see what happens. Maybe you're testing if a plant grows better in sunlight or in the shade.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:49.700\nSo, a test can be anything from a quiz at school to a fun experiment at home. It's all about asking a question and finding an answer.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:58.400\nIn short, a test is a procedure that helps us gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
