    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_175106.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:11.300\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much someone knows about something, or how well they can do something.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are baked enough. A test can come in many forms.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.000\nIt could be written questions, like on a school exam. Or it could be a practical demonstration, like showing someone you can ride a bike.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:44.800\nIt's all about measuring understanding or skill. For example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:54.600\nA driving test checks your ability to operate a car safely. And a cooking test might assess how well you can follow a recipe.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.200\nSo, a test is just a tool. It helps us measure knowledge, skills, and abilities in a fair and consistent way. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
