    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.800\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something. It's a process to see if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like this: You might test a cake to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:37.100\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:45.600\nTests can be simple or complex. A quick taste test to see if your soup needs more salt is a simple test. A big exam in school is a more involved test.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:57.500\nBut they all have the same basic goal: to find something out. So, a test is just a way to check if something is working, true, or meets a standard.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
