    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore the very basics of what a test is.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:17.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something or someone. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:22.600\nTests can come in many forms. It could be a quiz at school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:31.600\nOr, it could be checking if a new toy works correctly. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:42.600\nFor example, a doctor might run tests to figure out why you're not feeling well. A software developer tests their code to make sure it does what it's supposed to.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:53.000\nSo, to recap, a test helps us understand something better by giving us data or results. It\u2019s all about gathering information!\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
