    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_180147.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:17.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:24.400\nYour doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nA chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:36.700\nOr, you might take a quiz to see how well you understand a subject.\nSo, tests help us learn things, diagnose problems, and make decisions.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:47.700\nThey can be simple, like tasting something, or complex, like a scientific experiment.\nThe key is that they give us information.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:56.500\nIn short, a test is a process designed to gather information or evaluate something.\nWe use them every day!\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
