    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.400\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something. It could be to see if you've learned something new, like in a school test.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:32.000\nOr, it could be to check if something is working correctly, like a car test.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:35.400\nThink about it like this:\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:43.800\na spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A taste test checks if food tastes good. A medical test checks if you're healthy.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:47.200\nSee? Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:56.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information. It helps us understand something better or make sure things are working as they should. That's the basics of what a test is all about! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
