    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_180337.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:11.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:20.200\nIt's like asking a question and looking for the answer. Think of it this way: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:25.800\nA teacher gives you a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:31.500\nEven baking a cake is a test! You\u2019re testing if the recipe will work.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.200\nSo, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:42.900\nThey give us information.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:51.100\nThey can be as simple as checking if the lightbulb works, or as complex as figuring out why a car won't start.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.300\nThe important thing is that a test helps us find out something we didn't know before.\n```"
