    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:25.200\nIt's how we check if something works, or if something is true. Think of it like this: if you want to know if a lightbulb works, you put it in a lamp and turn it on. That's a test!\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:32.200\nOr, if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you stick a toothpick in it. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:45.600\nTests can be simple, like checking if your shoes fit, or more complicated, like a doctor running medical tests. The main idea is always the same: to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:57.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
