    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:5.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:7.000\nIt's like a question you ask,\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:10.000\nand the answer helps you understand more.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:13.000\nTests are used everywhere!\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:17.000\nThink about it: When you go to the doctor, they might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:22.000\nOr in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:25.000\nEven baking a cake is a test!\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:27.500\nYou're testing a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:33.000\nFor example, a simple test could be checking if a light bulb works.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:35.000\nYou turn it on.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:37.500\nIf it lights up, the test is passed!\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:43.000\nOr, maybe you're tasting different kinds of apples to see which one you like best.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:44.500\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:50.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:55.000\nIt helps us learn, solve problems, and make decisions.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:62.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
