    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_180914.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question, but instead of just getting an answer, you\u2019re getting evidence.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done. You don't just guess, you test it by sticking a toothpick in.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:31.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! That\u2019s a test.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:38.800\nAnother example is a spelling test in school. It helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:46.500\nOr maybe you test a new toy to see if it works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:59.200\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information, checking something, or finding out if something is true. It helps us make better decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
