    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.200\nAt its core, a test is simply a way to gather information.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:32.400\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good. Or when you push a door, you're testing if it's locked.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:45.900\nIn school, tests help us see how much we've learned about a subject. They can be written, like multiple choice questions, or practical, like building a model.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:56.000\nSo, a test helps us understand something better by providing us with data. Whether it's about cooking, doors, or math, tests give us valuable insights.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.500\nThat's the basic idea behind a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
