    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:06.000\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:09.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:19.000\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:24.000\nA doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:29.000\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:32.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 does it taste good?\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:38.000\nSo, tests help us learn, understand, and make decisions.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:43.000\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic idea: to gather information.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:47.000\nRemember, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:53.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
