    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_181412.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:04.500\nToday, we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:04.500 --> 00:07.300\nA test, at its core, is simply a way to find out information.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:10.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:10.100 --> 00:12.200\nTests help us measure things.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:16.900\nThis could be knowledge, like a quiz in school, or skills, like seeing how fast you can run.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:21.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:27.000\nOr a baker might taste their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:28.200\nThose are both tests!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:33.200\nSo, tests are tools we use to learn about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:38.200\nThey help us understand where we're at and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:42.900\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just a way to gather information!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:46.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "ef67532a-e6b2-4785-81d1-d1808c7696c3": {
    "id": "ef67532a-e6b2-4785-81d1-d1808c7696c3",
    "topic": "Test",
