    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like a check-up. It could be a quiz at school to see if you understood the lesson,\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:28.300\nor a doctor giving you a physical to make sure you're healthy.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:40.500\nEven trying out a new recipe is a test! You're testing if it tastes good. For example, if you're learning to ride a bike, you're testing your balance. Or, if you're baking cookies, you're testing if you followed the recipe correctly.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:43.500\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:54.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to evaluate knowledge, skills, or performance. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
