    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.900\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if we know something. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:32.600\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. A chef might even taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:42.900\nTests can be big or small. They can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like quickly checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:49.700\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us make decisions and improve things.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:57.500\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
