    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_181746.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:6.500\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:18.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer. It could be a school test to see how well you understand a subject, or a taste test to see if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:31.100\nDoctors use tests to check your health, and scientists use them to learn about the world around us. For example, you might test if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:39.500\nYou would put one plant in the sun and another in the shade, and then see which one grows taller. That's a test!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:47.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:55.500\nIt helps us answer questions and understand the world.\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
