    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_181826.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.500\nYou've probably taken lots of them in school,\n\n00:07.500 --> 01:00.200\nbut what is a test, really?\n\n00:10.200 --> 00:14.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:18.500\nIt's a procedure designed to measure something,\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:23.000\nwhether it's your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:26.500\nThink about it: a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:31.000\nA chef might taste a sauce to see if it needs more seasoning.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:36.000\nOr, you might take a quiz online to find out what kind of pizza topping you are!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:38.500\nThese are all tests!\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:43.500\nThey involve doing something, observing the result, and then drawing a conclusion.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:48.000\nSo, a test helps us understand and evaluate things better.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
