    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you can spell. Or, a taste test tells you which food you like best.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.100\nTests can be used for lots of things. Your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:40.500\nScientists use tests to see if a new medicine works. Even chefs use tests to make sure their food tastes good.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:49.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information. It helps us measure something or see what we've learned.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:56.600\nIn short, tests help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
