    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:06.900\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like a question you ask to get an answer. We use tests all the time, in different ways.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:34.800\nFor example, your doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz at school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:42.000\nEven tasting a new food is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing to see if you like it!\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:49.200\nSo, a test helps us gather information and make decisions. It's a tool to learn and understand.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.100\nIt could be a formal exam, or just trying something new.\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.800\nThe important thing is that it gives us some data to work with.\n00:55.800 --> 00:58.600\nThat's the basic idea of a test!\n00:58.600 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
