    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.300\nThink of it as a question or a series of questions designed to see what you know or what something is like.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:24.900\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:34.600\nImagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:41.900\nOr, when you go to the doctor, they might check your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:54.800\nEven a simple quiz in school is a test to measure what you've learned. So, tests help us understand things better by giving us information. They come in all shapes and sizes, but the core idea is always the same: to get an answer.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
