    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.900\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we've learned something new.\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:30.900\nOr, when you're learning to ride a bike, falling down is a test to see if you've got your balance yet!\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:40.300\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned in class.\nSo, a test is really just a way to check on something.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:49.300\nIt can be formal, like a written exam, or informal, like trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:49.300 --> 01:00.000\nThe goal is always to get some information.\nIn short, tests help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:03.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
