    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:15.600\nWhat is a test? Simply put, it's a way to check something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and turn it on.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:35.600\nThat's a test! More generally, tests help us find out if something is working as it should, or if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:45.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:53.000\nSo, tests aren't just about passing or failing. They're about learning, improving, and making sure things are working correctly. They help us understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
