    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.999\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.299\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:18.699\nIt's like a question you ask to see if you understand a topic, or a checkup at the doctor to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:24.899\nThink about a spelling test at school. It checks if you know how to spell different words.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:31.099\nOr, imagine baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:35.399\nThat's a test too! Tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:39.799\nIf you do well on a test, great! If not, it shows you what you need to work on.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:44.199\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something,\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:53.399\nwhether it's your knowledge, your health, or even the taste of a cake. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
