    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something, like how good you are at something, or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:28.200\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:34.100\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:43.500\nAnother example is baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:52.500\nTests help us understand things better and make sure everything is as it should be. So, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.100\nWhether it's a quiz, a medical exam, or even just tasting your food, tests are all about learning something new.\n```"
