    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like this: a food taste test tells you if something tastes good.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.300\nOr a math test tells you how well you understand math problems.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:46.400\nA software test checks if a program is working as it should.\nTests can be big or small, simple or complex.\nBut the basic idea is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:49.900\nSo, a test helps us learn, improve things, and make sure things are working right.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
