    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_183941.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:17.100\nThink of it like an investigation.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:28.700\nWe use tests all the time! Doctors use tests to check your health, teachers use tests to see what you've learned in class, and even developers use tests to check if their programs work correctly.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:40.700\nFor example, a doctor might do a blood test to see if you have enough vitamins. Your teacher might give you a pop quiz to see if you remember the main points of yesterday's lesson.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:48.200\nIn programming, a developer might write a test to make sure their new button actually does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:56.300\nSo, tests are a fundamental tool for gathering information and making sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:04.600\nThey help us learn, diagnose, and improve all sorts of things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
