    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:20.900\nNow, a test is basically a way to see how well you know something or how well something works. Think of it like checking if you understand a lesson in school, or making sure a new toy actually does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:28.400\nSo, how does it work? Well, a test usually involves asking questions or doing tasks.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:39.800\nFor example, a spelling test asks you to spell words correctly. Or, if you're testing a new bicycle, you might see if it can go up a hill.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:48.500\nThese examples help us understand how tests help us to gauge how well we know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:55.800\nSo, in short, a test helps us check knowledge or performance. Pretty simple, right?\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
