    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test, in the simplest terms, is just a way to see what you know or what you can do.\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:24.800\nIt's not about being right or wrong all the time, but more about understanding where you're at in your learning journey.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:34.300\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, a fitness test might show how strong you are.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:46.900\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes, from quick quizzes to big exams.\nThey help you and your teachers figure out what you've learned well and what you might need to practice a little more.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:55.600\nSo, remember, tests are just tools to help you learn and grow.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
