    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.200\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or how well it's working. Think of it like this: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:31.200\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Tests can be big or small.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:39.800\nA scientist might run a huge experiment to test a new medicine, while you might test a new pen to see if it writes smoothly.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:50.600\nThe point is, tests give us information! So, to recap: a test is a way to gather information and understand something better.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:59.000\nFrom tasting soup to taking a quiz, tests are all around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
