    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: a test.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:14.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like a question that needs an answer.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:29.400\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:40.300\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned. A recipe is even a test of sorts, to see if you can bake a delicious cake!\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:51.800\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things better. They give us information. Whether it\u2019s a medical test, a school test, or even testing out a new game, tests are all about finding answers.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:60.300\nTo sum it up, a test is a question, and the results give us the answer. Pretty straightforward, right?\n\n00:60.300 --> 00:63.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
