    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific. It's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:20.000\nThink about it. A spelling test helps us see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:29.500\nA taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes better. Even a simple squeeze of a tomato to see if it's ripe is a type of test!\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:43.400\nWe're checking for something, looking for a specific result. So, tests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking your knowledge to figuring out if something is working correctly.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:52.900\nThey help us learn and make decisions. Basically, a test is a method of gathering information or evaluating something.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
