    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.300\nIt's like an experiment, but usually smaller and more focused.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:31.700\nWe use tests all the time to see if something is working, if something is true, or even just to get a better understanding of something.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:42.900\nThink about it like this: if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done. That toothpick is your test! Or, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how well you're understanding the vocabulary and grammar.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:53.100\nSo, a test is just a procedure designed to gather information. It helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
