    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_185410.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.300\nA test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer. You perform an action, observe what happens, and that helps you get your answer.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:27.500\nFor example, a taste test! You taste two different cookies and decide which one you like better.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:38.800\nThat's a test! Or, think about baking a cake. You follow a recipe, and the result \u2013 the cake itself \u2013 is the test of whether you followed the recipe correctly.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:41.700\nDid it rise? Does it taste good?\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:53.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a process of asking a question and finding an answer through observation. It\u2019s how we learn and improve things all the time!\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:56.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
