    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_185503.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:26.400\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:34.200\nBut tests aren't just for school.\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:40.500\nOr a chef might test a new recipe to make sure it tastes good.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:45.800\nLet's say you want to know if a plant needs water.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:49.400\nYou can test it by touching the soil.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:51.400\nIf it's dry, the plant probably needs water!\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:51.900\nThat's a test.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.600\nTests help us make decisions and learn new things all the time.\n\n00:55.600 --> 01:00.700\nSo, a test is just a way to check something and get information.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:04.800\nIt can be a simple question, an experiment, or even a big exam.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:05.700\nNow you know!\n\n01:05.700 --> 01:09.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
