    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:23.600\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skill, or performance. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:33.900\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes best. Even a simple weather test, like sticking your hand out the window, tells you if it's raining!\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:44.200\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes. They can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying a new recipe.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:52.200\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:52.200 --> 01:00.200\nIn short, a test is a tool for measuring something. It's a way to understand the world around us and ourselves a little bit better.\n\n01:00.200 --> 01:03.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "830b5cdb-55a9-4e8c-ae09-a742ed6f2e6a": {
