    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_185703.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.000\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: you might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it. Or, maybe you test out a new pair of shoes to see if they're comfortable.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:33.800\nThese are all simple tests! In schools, tests help teachers see how well you understand the things you've been learning.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:43.400\nA test could be answering questions, solving a problem, or even giving a presentation. It\u2019s just a way to measure what you know.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:54.100\nSo, a test is essentially an evaluation, a check-up, or a way to learn more about something. It's a tool we use every day!\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
