    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.800 --> 00:05.000\nToday, we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:07.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:11.200\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to see if something is true.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:13.100\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:17.500\nFor example, a doctor might run a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:21.300\nOr, a baker might test their cake to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:23.400\nAnother example?\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:26.300\nYou might take a quiz at school.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:29.100\nThat's a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:35.100\nSo, a test is just a structured way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:37.500\nIn a nutshell, it's about figuring things out!\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:48.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
