    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.150\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.150 --> 00:06.730\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:06.730 --> 00:11.110\nIt's a process, a question, or a task designed to measure something specific.\n\n00:11.110 --> 00:14.770\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:14.770 --> 00:20.180\nOr a teacher gives you a quiz to see what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test - you're testing your recipe!\n\n00:20.180 --> 00:28.790\nSo, tests can be used to check knowledge, skills, abilities, or even just the quality of something.\n\n00:28.790 --> 00:32.660\nIn short, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:32.660 --> 00:36.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
