    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_191050.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a structured way.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:25.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:33.500\nA taste test lets you see which flavor you like best.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:49.000\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. So, a test is a tool we use to gather information. It helps us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us a little bit better.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:52.600\nRemember, tests aren't always about right or wrong answers; sometimes they're just about exploring and discovering. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
