    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_191137.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.700\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:20.700\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:28.300\nThink of it like this: you might test if a toy car rolls down a ramp.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:35.800\nYou give it a push and see what happens. That's a test!\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:41.900\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:48.000\nThey can be written questions, or even showing what you know by building something or giving a presentation.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:54.100\nAnother example: a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:59.100\nSee? Testing is all about trying something out and observing the result.\n```"
  },
