    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:26.300\nThink about it. When you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:37.500\nA doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:49.900\nOr, before a new car is released, it goes through rigorous crash testing to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:59.200\nTests help us make decisions based on evidence. They give us information, which we can then use to improve, learn, or just understand something better. So, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
