    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:22.700\nIt's like asking a question, but instead of just listening to the answer, you're looking for evidence.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:27.900\nThink about it like this.\nIf you want to know if your cake is done, you do a test!\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:32.800\nYou stick a toothpick in it.\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.200\nThat's a test!\nOr maybe you want to know if you know your ABCs.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:41.600\nSomeone might ask you to recite them.\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:47.800\nTests are everywhere.\nFrom checking if your batteries work to taking a quiz in school.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:57.100\nThey help us learn and understand things better.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see what we've learned or discovered.\n\n00:57.100 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
