    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_191458.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and then looking for the answer.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:18.900\nThink about it.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:26.800\nYour doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you're learning something new, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:34.100\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a test! You read the question and choose the best answer.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:41.400\nA science experiment is also a kind of test. You're testing a hypothesis to see if it's true or false.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:51.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
