    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_191600.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.289 --> 00:05.799\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.799 --> 00:14.409\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in its simplest form, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:14.409 --> 00:22.709\nIt helps us measure or check something to see if it's working correctly, or to see how well someone understands a topic.\n\n00:22.709 --> 00:33.819\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you learned the material in class.\n\n00:33.819 --> 00:43.219\nAnother example is testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with. So, tests help us gather information.\n\n00:43.219 --> 00:52.809\nThey help us understand things better, and they help us make informed decisions. They're a fundamental part of learning and improving.\n\n00:52.809 --> 00:56.409\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
