    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests can be used to check if something works, or to see how good something is.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:33.200\nFor example, you might have a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:39.400\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:45.600\nAnother common test is a taste test! You might try two different cookies and decide which one tastes better.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:50.100\nThat's a test too! So, remember, a test is just a process for getting information.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:53.700\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
