    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:18.600\nWhat is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out, or to see if something works.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of a bath to see if it's too hot or too cold.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.200\nThat\u2019s a test! In science, we use tests all the time. For example, if a baker is making a new cake recipe, they might test it by baking a small version first to see how it tastes.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:41.300\nOr, imagine you're building a tower of blocks. You might gently push it to test if it's strong enough to stand up.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:55.900\nSo, tests are all about exploring, checking, and learning. We use them to understand the world around us and to make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
