    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nDon't worry, not the kind you stress about! In general, a test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:24.000\nIt could be to see if something works, or if it\u2019s good enough, or even if it\u2019s true.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:32.200\nThink about it: A chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:41.700\nA doctor might run a blood test to check your health. Or maybe you test a new video game to see if you like it before you buy it.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:56.200\nSo, basically, a test is just a way to gather information. It helps us make decisions and understand things better. We use tests all the time in our everyday lives, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.900\nTo recap, a test is a way to check something, provides information, and helps us make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
