    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:13.800\nYou've probably taken a lot of them, but what is a test, really?\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:25.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:36.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works \u2013 you flip the switch, and the light tells you if it's good or needs replacing.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:46.300\nTests can be written, like quizzes in school, or they can be practical, like a driving test.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:53.300\nThe important thing is that a test gives you information. For example, a doctor might use a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. So, a test is just a way to get information about something. It helps us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
