    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_192640.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.800\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:07.200\nYou've probably taken a test before, but what exactly is it?\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:11.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know or can do.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:15.900\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:18.800\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:20.500\nA spelling quiz is a test.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:22.700\nA driving exam is a test.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:27.200\nEven a recipe, where you're testing out if you can follow instructions, is a kind of test!\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:29.600\nSo, why do we take tests?\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:35.200\nWell, they help us understand what we've learned and where we might need some extra practice.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:39.500\nThey also help teachers and instructors see how well they're teaching.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:43.200\nBasically, a test is just a tool to help us learn and improve.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:45.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
