    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_192840.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like this: you want to see if your cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:37.000\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned in class. They can be multiple choice, like picking the right answer from a list, or short answer, where you write a sentence or two.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:51.400\nFor example, a test might ask, \"What's the capital of France?\" The answer, of course, is Paris!\n\n00:51.400 --> 01:00.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for checking your knowledge. It helps you and others understand what you know and what you might need to learn more about.\n```"
  },
