    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_193029.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:07.300\nToday we're diving into something fundamental:\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:07.800\nthe test.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:11.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to check if something works, or if it's true.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your lightbulb is working, so you screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:17.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:21.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:24.700\nA doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:27.600\nA chef might taste the soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:32.400\nEven a student taking an exam is participating in a test to show what they've learned.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:39.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:43.600\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
