    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:19.100\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:27.900\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:34.000\nFor example, imagine you're baking a cake. You might test the batter to see if it tastes good before you put it in the oven.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:41.800\nThat's a test! Or, think about a product like a new phone. It goes through lots of tests to make sure it works correctly.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:51.900\nSo, tests help us learn, check, and make sure things are working as they should. They\u2019re all about gathering information.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
