    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_193308.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.300\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:11.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:15.200\nThink of it like this: you're trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:18.600\nYou taste it, right? That's a test!\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:21.900\nYou're testing if the recipe worked.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:27.200\nOr, imagine you're buying a new toy. You might push a button to see if it makes a sound.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:30.600\nThat's another test! You're checking if the toy is working properly.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:37.600\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:43.800\nThey might ask you questions about a book you read, or how to solve a math problem.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:49.100\nThese tests help them understand how well you understand the material.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:54.200\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something, whether it's a recipe, a toy, or what you've learned in class.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
