    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:06.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:12.200\nIt's a process or procedure designed to measure or evaluate something specific.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:16.900\nThink of it like this: you take a quiz in school to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:21.900\nOr, a doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:25.700\nTests can be all sorts of things!\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:30.300\nA taste test to see which cookie is tastier, a strength test at the gym to see how much you can lift,\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:33.900\nor even testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:38.500\nThe important thing is that a test is designed to give you information.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:43.700\nSo, to recap, tests help us learn, evaluate, and understand things better.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
