    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like an experiment, but instead of chemicals, you're usually testing skills or knowledge.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:34.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words. A math test shows what you understand about numbers and equations.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:45.500\nEven a taste test, like trying different flavors of ice cream, is a type of test! You're testing which one you like best.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:52.000\nBasically, tests give us information. They help us understand what we know, what we can do, and where we might need to learn more. They're useful tools for learning and growing.\n```"
