    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_194221.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:05.600\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:07.400\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:11.400\nA test helps us understand if something is working properly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:15.400\nThink about it: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:17.800\nOr a taste test, that checks if food tastes good.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:20.800\nYour doctor might even run tests to check your health.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:24.200\nSo, a test is really just a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:31.700\nFrom checking the batteries in your remote to making sure a bridge is safe to cross, tests are everywhere, helping us make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:34.600\nThey help us learn, improve, and stay safe.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:36.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
