    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:20.000\nThink of a test like a way to check if something works, or if you understand something. Basically, it's a way of figuring out if an idea or a product does what it's supposed to.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:26.300\nLet's say you bake a cake. The \"test\" is tasting it to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:37.700\nOr imagine you're building a birdhouse; the test is seeing if birds actually use it. In school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:50.500\nAnd in science, tests help scientists prove if their ideas are correct. So, a test is simply a way to check, confirm, or explore something.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:55.700\nThat's the core idea! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
