    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.200\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like a detective trying to solve a mystery. They use clues to figure out the truth.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:33.400\nIn everyday life, you\u2019re taking tests all the time! For example, when you try a new food, you're testing if you like it. Or, when you press a button on a remote, you\u2019re testing if it will turn on the TV.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.900\nSo, tests help us understand the world around us. They let us gather information and make decisions based on what we learn.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:52.500\nWhether it's a science experiment or just trying out a new game, tests are a fundamental part of how we learn and grow.\n\n00:52.500 --> 01:01.200\nIn short, a test is a simple way to gather information. It helps us learn about things by trying them out and seeing what happens.\n\n01:01.200 --> 01:04.899\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
