    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:10.600\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.600 --> 00:18.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:25.200\nThink about it. When you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean. That's a test!\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:31.200\nOr, when you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit. That's another kind of test.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:37.300\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:48.400\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking you questions in class. The goal is to check your knowledge and see where you might need some extra help.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:57.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out. It\u2019s a simple process of asking and answering.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
