    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.500\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, usually about someone's knowledge or skills.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:20.600\nThink of it like a measuring tool.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:29.000\nWe use tests all the time!\nMaybe you took a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\nOr perhaps a doctor runs some tests to check your health.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:36.700\nThey all help us understand something better.\nFor example, a simple multiple-choice quiz is a test.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:45.700\nSo is trying to ride a bike for the first time - you're testing your balance!\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:59.200\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to gather information about knowledge, skills, or abilities.\nIt helps us understand what we know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:59.200 --> 01:02.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
