    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:26.400\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. Tests can be used to measure all sorts of things.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:35.500\nThink about a spelling test at school \u2013 that shows how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:44.600\nOr a taste test for new ice cream flavors, that helps decide which one people like best.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:52.600\nAnother example is a medical test. A doctor might run some tests to figure out what's making you feel unwell.\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:00.600\nSo, a test is basically a procedure to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:00.600 --> 01:05.600\nIt helps us understand things better, whether it's our knowledge, our preferences, or even our health.\n\n01:05.600 --> 01:08.600\nRemember, tests are everywhere and they help us learn!\n\n01:08.600 --> 01:12.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
