    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just getting a verbal answer, you're getting a result that helps you understand something better.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:41.600\nFor example, a spelling test helps you see how well you know your spelling words.\nOr a taste test can help you decide which cookie you like best.\nIn science, a test might involve experimenting to see if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:51.000\nBasically, a test is any process that helps you gather information and draw a conclusion.\nIt's a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.600\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to explore and discover!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
