    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_195437.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.500\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in general, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:24.400\nIt's a process to see if something works, or if something is true. Think about it like this: you might test if your car battery is working by trying to start the car.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:33.100\nIf it starts, the test passes! Or, a chef might test the soup by tasting it to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:40.700\nThat's a test too! Basically, a test is anything that helps you gather information and make a decision.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:51.700\nIt's a way to learn more. So, remember, a test is a check, a way to learn, and a process for finding out if something is right.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
