    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:22.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:27.500\nThat's a test! The toothpick tells you if the cake is cooked through.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:34.800\nTests are everywhere! A doctor gives you a check-up to test your health.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:48.400\nA teacher gives you an exam to test your knowledge. Even trying a new food is a test to see if you like it! So, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:59.500\nThey can be formal, like a standardized test, or informal, like checking if your coffee is hot enough. Basically, anything you do to check or evaluate something is a test.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.200\nIn short, a test is a process that helps us learn more about the world around us.\n```"
