    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:06.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:12.800\nA test is basically a way to check something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:16.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:21.400\nYou can't just guess, right?\nSo you test it!\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:31.500\nYou might stick a toothpick in it.\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:40.700\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just a class activity.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:53.300\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve some problems.\nA spelling test checks if you know how to write words correctly.\nA science test might see if you understand a concept, like how plants grow.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:59.900\nSo, a test is simply a tool to find out if something is working, or if you understand something.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
