    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_200127.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.100\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if we understand something.\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:30.100\nOr, if you're learning to bake cookies, you might taste one to test if you added enough sugar.\nSee? It's just checking something!\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:39.500\nAnother example: If you're building with LEGOs, you might test if your tower can stand up straight.\nIf it falls, you know you need to make it stronger!\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:49.700\nSo, tests are all about checking to see if something is correct or working as expected.\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:55.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
