    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_200544.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like an experiment, but you're trying to get a specific answer.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:33.200\nBasically, you're presenting something, like a question or a task, and seeing how someone or something responds.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:46.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nA taste test figures out which flavor people like best.\nEven a doctor running a blood test is just trying to find out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:58.000\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and understand things better.\nThey're a helpful tool to gauge knowledge, preference, or even health.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:01.700\nRemember, tests aren't always scary; they're just a way to get information!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
