    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_200638.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:08.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:11.000\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:16.400\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:21.000\nThink about it. When you try a new food, you\u2019re testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:24.500\nOr when you press a button on a toy, you're testing to see what happens.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:29.000\nIn school, tests help us see what we've learned.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:33.000\nA math test checks if we understand numbers,\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:36.500\nand a spelling test shows if we know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:43.200\nTests aren't meant to be scary; they\u2019re just tools to help us learn and grow.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:47.400\nThey show us what we already know and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.800\nSo, remember a test is just a question, and it helps us learn more about ourselves and the world around us.\n\n00:55.800 --> 01:00.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
