    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:20.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:37.100\nThat's a test! In school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. A spelling test, for example, shows how well you know your spelling words. A science experiment can be a test to see if your hypothesis is correct.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:47.600\nEven trying out a new recipe is a test to see if you like it! So remember, tests are just tools we use to gather information and learn.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:53.800\nThey're all about figuring things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
