    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_200846.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like a question, but instead of just asking, we're using a process to get the answer. For example, a math test helps us understand how well you know your numbers.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:33.500\nA taste test tells us which flavor you like best. Even a pregnancy test helps determine if someone is expecting!\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:46.500\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to gather information. They help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:57.300\nThey can assess knowledge, preferences, or even physical conditions. In short, a test is just a structured way to get an answer.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
