    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.220 --> 00:05.150\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.150 --> 00:13.840\nNow, a test is basically a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how good or bad something is.\n\n00:13.840 --> 00:23.530\nThink of it like a doctor checking your temperature.\nThey use a thermometer, which is a kind of test, to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:23.530 --> 00:32.570\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nFor example, a simple taste test can tell you if food is delicious or not.\n\n00:32.570 --> 00:43.000\nOr, a school exam is a test to see how much you've learned.\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a mini-test to see if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:54.790\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and find out something specific.\nIt helps us understand things better and make decisions based on the results.\n\n00:54.790 --> 00:56.440\nSimple, right?\n\n00:56.440 --> 01:00.620\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
