    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:22.300\nThink of it like a quick way to find out if something is working, true, or correct.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:33.100\nWe use tests all the time! When you take a spelling test at school, it checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:40.600\nOr when you bake a cake and taste it, that's a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:48.100\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers use tests to make sure a bridge is strong enough.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:55.400\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and make sure everything is working the way it should.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:58.500\nThey give us valuable information.\n\n00:58.500 --> 01:01.900\nThey are a simple process to assess what something is.\n\n01:01.900 --> 01:04.600\nAnd that's the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n01:04.600 --> 01:08.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
