    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:09.300\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:15.000\nIt's like an experiment or a question that helps us learn more.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, your teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:30.000\nTests can be written, like a quiz, or they can be hands-on, like baking a cake to see if you can follow a recipe.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:35.000\nThe goal is always the same: to get information and measure something.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:44.000\nSo, whether you're checking if your cookies are done or answering questions in class, you're taking a test.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:53.600\nThey help us learn, grow, and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
