    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:05.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:7.500\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:12.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.000\nThink about it: When you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:19.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:22.000\nOr maybe you try on a new shirt to see if it fits.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:23.000\nThat's another test.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:28.000\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:33.000\nThey might be multiple choice, or you might have to write out your answers.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:36.500\nBut the goal is always the same: to see what you know.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:42.500\nSo, a test is really just a tool to help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:45.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
