    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a method for gathering information to see if something is true,\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:27.600\nor to measure how well you understand something. Think about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:35.400\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to test the seasoning. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:47.400\nIn school, a test helps your teacher see how well you've learned the material. It\u2019s a way to check your understanding of the topics covered in class.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:57.300\nSo, tests aren't scary; they're just tools to help us learn and understand the world around us. They give us feedback, so we know what we're doing well and where we might need some extra help. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
