    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:31.000\nIt's a structured process we use to gather information and see how well something performs or how much someone knows.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:37.000\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:49.500\nOr, if you\u2019re learning to drive, you\u2019ll take a driving test to prove you know the rules of the road.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:57.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 does it taste good? Does it look right? So, a test helps us understand, evaluate, or measure something. It can be simple or complex, but the main goal is always to get some answers. Tests are a fundamental part of learning and improving! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
