    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:24.200\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true. Think about it like this: You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:28.800\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health. See?\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:40.100\nAnother example: You could test if a toy car works by pushing it and seeing if it rolls. The rolling, or not rolling, gives you information!\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:49.400\nSo, a test is really just a process of asking a question and getting an answer. It\u2019s a way to learn and confirm information.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:55.900\nAnd that's the basics of what a test is! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
