    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:09.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something, or someone!\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:12.100\nIt's a method used to gather information.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:17.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:21.900\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to see if it needs more salt. These are all tests!\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:28.100\nAnother example: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:33.500\nOr, you might test a new toy to see if it works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:37.700\nSo, a test is just a process. It's a way to check something, gather information, and learn more.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:41.400\nRemember, tests help us understand things better!\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:44.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
