    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:7.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.200\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\nIt's a procedure intended to establish the quality, performance, or reliability of something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:19.700\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:23.500\nThat's a test to see if the cake is done!\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:28.700\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:31.500\nThat's a test to see if it fixes the problem.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:42.000\nSo, basically, a test is just a way to check if something is working, or to see if something is true.\nThey help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:45.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
