    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_202533.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.900\nNow, you might think of school tests, but in this case, we mean testing something to see if it works correctly.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:25.900\nBasically, a test is a way to check if something does what it's supposed to do. Think of it like this: if you bake a cake, you test it by sticking a toothpick in.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:31.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:38.100\nOr, imagine you're trying out a new video game. You play it to test if it's fun and engaging.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:47.100\nBusinesses test new products all the time to make sure people will like them. Testing helps us find problems and make things better.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:57.900\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check if something is working as expected. It helps us improve things and make sure they're doing their job.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
