    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE This subtitle file was auto-generated.  Please check accuracy.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.599\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests, and no, not the kind you cram for!\n\n00:07.599 --> 00:18.299\nIn this case, a test is simply a way to find out if something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:18.299 --> 00:22.109\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is good.\n\n00:22.109 --> 00:27.909\nYou screw it in, and that's the test.\nDoes it light up?\n\n00:27.909 --> 00:32.709\nIf yes, the bulb passes the test!\nIf not, well, it failed.\n\n00:32.709 --> 00:36.809\nTests aren't just for lightbulbs.\n\n00:36.809 --> 00:40.909\nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:40.909 --> 00:45.009\nYou taste it to see if it's sweet enough.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:45.009 --> 00:55.509\nOr, if you're building a tower of blocks, you gently push it to see if it stays standing.\nAnother test!\n\n00:55.509 --> 01:00.409\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to check if something is working as expected.\n\n01:00.409 --> 01:02.609\nIt's all about finding out the answer to a question.\n\n01:02.609 --> 01:06.109\nNow you know what a test is!\n\n01:06.109 --> 01:08.609\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
