    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:26.100\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true or false. Think about it like this: you might take a test in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:34.300\nOr, a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:43.800\nHere's another example: Imagine you're baking a cake. You might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:51.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.200\nIt helps us learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "3bb6f9a3-65e5-4aac-a2f3-a5e8388d28ec": {
    "id": "3bb6f9a3-65e5-4aac-a2f3-a5e8388d28ec",
    "topic": "Test",
