    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_202851.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.600\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\"\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:04.700\nand wondered what it really means?\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:05.700\nWell, simply put,\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:09.000\na test is a way to find out something\nabout something else.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:11.600\nWe use tests all the time,\nwhether we realize it or not.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:14.200\nThink of it like this: you might\ntaste a cookie to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:17.900\nOr, a doctor might run blood tests\nto test your health.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:21.700\nTests can be written, like a quiz in school,\nor they can be hands-on, like trying to\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:24.400\nfix a broken toy to test your skills.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:26.600\nThe important thing is that a test\ngives us information.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:28.600\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:31.500\nSo, to recap, a test is just\na process for gathering information.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:34.800\nIt can be anything from tasting food\nto taking an exam.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:36.800\nTests help us learn and make decisions!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:38.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
