    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:22.800\nIt helps us understand if something is working the way it should, or if something is true.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:31.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:34.700\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:38.300\nAnother example is baking a cake. You taste it to test if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:44.200\nSee? Tests are all around us. They give us information and help us make decisions.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:50.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn more about it. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
