    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_203208.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:06.700\nEver wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly,\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:27.200\nif we've learned something new, or even just to see what happens when we try something out.\nThink of it like this: you might test a new recipe by cooking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:35.500\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the lessons.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:45.600\nSo, a test can be anything from trying out a new toy to taking a quiz.\nIt's all about gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:50.700\nBasically, a test is just a structured way of asking a question and finding the answer!\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:53.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
