    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:04.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:08.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:12.300\nWe use them all the time to check our knowledge, skills, or even just to see how things are working.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:15.600\nThink of it like a detective gathering clues.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:21.000\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:25.200\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:28.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe!\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:32.500\nSo, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:36.800\nThey give us information that we can use to learn and improve.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:43.000\nRemember, a test isn't about being perfect, it's about figuring out where you are now and where you want to go.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:46.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
