    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:07.300\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:11.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about you or something else.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:17.300\nThink of it like a detective gathering clues!\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:28.400\nIt helps us measure knowledge, skills, or even personality.\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\nA taste test tells us which flavor is the most delicious.\nAnd a medical test can help doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:42.100\nTests can be written, spoken, or even hands-on activities.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:53.900\nSo, whether it\u2019s a quiz at school, a cooking competition, or a check-up at the doctor\u2019s office, a test helps us learn and understand more about the world around us, and ourselves!\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.500\nIt's all about gathering information.\n\n00:56.500 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
