    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_203725.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.800\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something, or if we've improved.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:31.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, your teacher might give you a test after a lesson to see how much you learned.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:38.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:45.900\nSo, tests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking your health to measuring your knowledge.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:57.300\nThey give us information, and that information helps us make better decisions. In short, a test is a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
