    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:20.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question or a series of questions designed to give you information.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:26.400\nIt could be a quiz at school to see what you've learned, or even trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:32.500\nThe main goal of a test is to evaluate something.\nAre you ready for the next grade?\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:38.600\nDoes that new gadget work as promised?\nTests help us make informed decisions.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:48.000\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\nOr a company might test a new product before selling it to the public.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:52.900\nIn short, a test is a process of asking questions, gathering information,\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:59.100\nand then using that information to understand something better.\nIt's all about learning and improving.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
