    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test?\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:18.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like an experiment.\nWe're trying to learn more about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:36.900\nSo, how do we do that?\nWe ask questions, give tasks, or observe behavior.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:44.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling.\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream is your favorite.\nAnd a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:51.500\nThe important thing is, tests give us information.\nThey help us make decisions and understand the world around us a little bit better.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:54.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning.\n```"
