    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_203956.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: what is a test?\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:33.100\nYou might poke it with a toothpick, right? That's a test! Tests help us understand if something works, if it's true, or if it's good enough.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:42.100\nIn school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand the lessons. A doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:54.600\nEven when you play a video game, the game is constantly testing your skills! So, remember, a test is just a way to find out information by checking something.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:00.000\nIt could be baking a cake, learning in school, or even playing a game. Tests are everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
