    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_204138.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:26.500\nIt's a procedure designed to check the quality, performance, or reliability of something \u2013 anything, really!\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:39.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A taste test checks how something tastes.\n00:39.800 --> 00:44.800\nEven a doctor giving you a physical exam is performing a test to check your health!\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:52.400\nSo, tests can come in many forms, from quizzes at school to quality checks in a factory.\n00:52.400 --> 00:59.000\nThe key is that they provide information and help us understand something better. They give us data we can use.\n00:59.000 --> 01:01.000\nTo sum up, a test is any process used to evaluate something.\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.700\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n01:04.700 --> 01:07.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
