    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:26.400\nIt helps us understand if something works, if something is true, or if someone knows something. Think about it like this: a recipe test makes sure the cake actually rises!\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:34.200\nA medical test helps doctors figure out if you're sick. And a school test shows your teacher what you've learned in class.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.500\nSo, tests help us check things. They give us information that we can use to make decisions or learn more.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:48.300\nThey're everywhere! From testing your phone's battery life to testing a new medicine.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:53.200\nIn short, a test is a way of gathering information to help us understand something better.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
