    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.800\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:36.000\nThink of it like this: A doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:46.200\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe and your baking skills!\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:53.600\nSo, tests aren't just about exams. They help us measure things, identify strengths and weaknesses, and ultimately, learn and improve.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:00.600\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: to gather information and assess something. Remember, tests are tools for learning and growth! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
