    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:28.600\nIt's a process, a procedure, or even just a question that helps us gather information.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:37.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test helps us find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:45.600\nA taste test helps us discover which flavor of ice cream is the yummiest.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:52.700\nEven a simple click of a button on a website is a kind of test \u2013 it tells the website you're interested in something.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.600\nSo, tests come in many forms, from formal exams to everyday interactions. They all share the same goal: to give us answers and help us learn. They show us what we know and what we need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
