    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:06.000\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:09.000\nThink of it like an experiment, a way to gather information about something specific.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:10.700\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:16.500\nFor example, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test telling you the cake is done.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:21.500\nOr, if you\u2019re trying to guess what\u2019s in a box, each guess is a mini-test to see if you're right.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:26.000\nTests help us make decisions based on evidence, rather than just guessing.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:27.500\nThey give us data to work with.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:31.000\nSo, a test is simply a procedure to collect information.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:34.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
