    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_205251.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.800\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in a broader sense, a test is simply a way to check if something works as it should.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like this: You bake a cake, and then you taste it. That taste is a test to see if the cake is delicious!\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:31.300\nOr, imagine you build a birdhouse. You might watch to see if birds actually use it. That's a test too!\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:42.100\nTests help us understand if our ideas are good, if our creations are successful, or if something needs to be improved.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:50.900\nThey can be formal, like a science experiment, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit comfortably.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:59.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check if something works. It helps us learn and make things better.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
