    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:09.700\nToday we're going to learn about tests!\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:17.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: Your teacher gives you a quiz \u2013 that's a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:35.000\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste a little bit of the batter before you bake it \u2013 that\u2019s a mini-test to make sure it tastes good!\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.100\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\nThey can check your knowledge, like with a school exam.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:49.200\nThey can check if something is safe, like testing a car's brakes.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:53.900\nOr they can even check if a recipe tastes delicious!\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:59.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information.\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:00.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
