    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_205620.mp4",
    "subtitles": "[WebVTT]\n```\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.300\nHey there, welcome! Ever wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you stick a toothpick in.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:27.000\nThat's a test! We use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:39.200\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you're learning. It could be a multiple-choice quiz, a written exam, or even just answering questions in class.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:52.500\nThese tests help show what you understand and what you might need a little more help with. For example, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of birds.\n\n00:52.500 --> 01:05.300\nOr, if you're learning math, you might have to solve a simple addition problem. So, remember, a test is just a method for checking understanding or finding something out.\n\n01:05.300 --> 01:12.200\nIt's a tool for learning and growing.\n\n01:12.200 --> 01:18.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
