    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_205711.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.300\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:07.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:13.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:19.200\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time!\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:25.100\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:28.800\nOr, when you try to open a door, you're testing if you have the right key.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:35.500\nLet's say you want to know if your plant needs water. You might stick your finger in the soil.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:37.200\nIf it feels dry, that's a test telling you it needs water!\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:37.900\nSee?\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:38.300\nEasy!\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:43.500\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information and make a decision.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:46.400\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:51.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
