    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_205759.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.700\nIt's how we gather information to see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:33.700\nThink about it like this: a cookie recipe is a test. You follow the instructions, and the result \u2013 the cookie \u2013 tells you if the recipe works.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:48.500\nOr, maybe you're trying out a new phone case. The \"test\" is seeing if it protects your phone when you accidentally drop it.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:58.300\nTests can be formal, like a quiz in school, or informal, like trying a new brand of coffee to see if you like it. The key is that you're trying to learn something.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:02.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see what happens.\n\n01:02.900 --> 01:06.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
