    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_205859.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nWhat exactly is a test? In simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:19.400\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think of it like this: A test is any procedure that helps us gather information.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:29.100\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:39.000\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:51.500\nOr even tasting a new food to see if you like it \u2013 that's a kind of test too! So, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:51.500 --> 01:00.400\nThey can measure knowledge, skills, or even just preferences. The important thing is that they give us data, which we can then use to make informed decisions.\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:04.000\nTo sum it up, a test is a process for collecting information. It helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n01:04.000 --> 01:07.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
