    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.700\nIt helps us learn if something is working, if something is true, or how well we know something.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:33.500\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:46.400\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Even baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:54.900\nYou're testing if your recipe works. So, tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:01.700\nThey can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb works, or more complicated, like a science experiment. The main idea is to gather information and learn something new. In short, a test is a way to learn and explore. They help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
