    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_210121.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. It's a process we use to get information.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:24.400\nThink about it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:31.100\nOr, if you want to know if you\u2019re ready for a soccer game, you might run a lap. That's a test too!\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:35.900\nTests aren't just for baking or sports. They're used everywhere!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:48.900\nScientists use tests to understand the world, doctors use tests to diagnose illnesses, and even you use tests every day to make decisions.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:59.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and learn about something. It helps us answer questions and make informed decisions.\n\n00:59.900 --> 01:03.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
