    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:13.300\nNow, a test is basically a way to check how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like this: you take a math test to see if you understand fractions.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:22.900\nOr, a baker tastes their cake batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:29.400\nTests aren't just for school, though. We use them all the time!\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:35.900\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:41.800\nA car mechanic uses tests to see what's wrong with your car.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:49.200\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. They give us valuable information.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.700\nBasically, they help us check things out!\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:58.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
