    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:25.100\nIt's like a measurement. Think of it like this: If you want to know how tall you are, you use a measuring tape.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:35.000\nA test is similar, but it measures your knowledge or skills. For example, a spelling test checks how well you can spell words.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:45.100\nA math test shows how well you understand numbers and equations. Even a taste test, like trying different flavors of ice cream, is a type of test!\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:53.200\nIt helps you figure out which flavor you like best. So, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:59.800\nIt helps us understand what we know and what we might need to learn more about. It's a snapshot of your current understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
