    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:26.700\nWe use them all the time! Think about it.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:35.200\nYou might test if the water is hot enough before you get in the shower.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:43.700\nOr test if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:52.400\nIn school, tests help us see how much we've learned about a subject.\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:01.100\nThey can be written, like a quiz, or even a practical demonstration, like showing you know how to ride a bike.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:09.800\nThe goal is to check your understanding.\n\n01:09.800 --> 01:18.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n01:18.500 --> 01:27.200\nA math test checks if you can solve problems.\n\n01:27.200 --> 01:33.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to measure knowledge or ability.\n\n01:33.200 --> 01:39.200\nIt helps us learn and improve!\n\n01:39.200 --> 01:45.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
