    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in this case, we're talking about testing something to see if it works correctly.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb turns on when you flip the switch. That's a test!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:36.600\nBasically, a test is a way to confirm that something does what it's supposed to do. For example, if you build a birdhouse, you might test it by putting birdseed inside and seeing if birds actually come to eat.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:50.000\nOr, if you bake a cake, you test it by tasting it to make sure it's delicious! So, remember, a test is just a simple way to check if something is working as expected.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:57.400\nIt helps us identify any problems and make sure things are running smoothly. That's the basics of testing!\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
