    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:04.799\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.799 --> 00:06.999\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.999 --> 00:10.199\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:10.199 --> 00:16.099\nIt's a procedure designed to measure something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even just to see if something works.\n\n00:16.099 --> 00:19.999\nThink about it like this: a school test checks how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:19.999 --> 00:23.699\nA taste test lets you decide which flavor is best.\n\n00:23.699 --> 00:27.799\nAnd a medical test helps doctors figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:27.799 --> 00:31.599\nSo, tests help us make decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:31.599 --> 00:33.999\nThey give us information to work with.\n\n00:33.999 --> 00:41.599\nWhether it\u2019s a quiz, an experiment, or even just trying something out to see what happens, that's a test!\n\n00:41.599 --> 00:44.999\nRemember, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:44.999 --> 00:47.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
