    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_212134.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:24.000\nThink of it like this: you taste a new food to test if you like it. Or, you might try a new route to school to test if it's faster.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:31.100\nIn school, tests help us see what we've learned. Your teacher might give you a quiz on fractions. That's a test!\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:34.600\nOr maybe a spelling test.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:44.100\nThese tests show your teacher, and you, what you know about those subjects. They're not scary, they're just tools!\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:56.200\nSo, a test is a way of gathering information. It helps us understand things better, from whether we like a new flavor to how well we understand a subject.\n\n00:56.200 --> 01:04.000\nRemember, tests are just one way to learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
