    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_212423.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:23.500\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. Think of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is ready, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:28.800\nThe toothpick is your test! If it comes out clean, the cake is probably done.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:36.600\nAnother example? A spelling test! Your teacher gives you words, and how you spell them shows how well you know your spelling.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:45.900\nTests help us learn and understand things better. They can show us what we already know, and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:51.000\nSo remember, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
