    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_212752.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nHey there, welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:20.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a question, a task, or a procedure designed to see what you know, how well you can do something, or even what something is made of.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:26.700\nThink about it. When you take a spelling test, that\u2019s checking your knowledge of words.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:41.300\nIf you try a new recipe, that\u2019s testing if you can follow instructions and bake something delicious. Or, if a scientist analyzes a sample of water, that\u2019s a test to see if it's safe to drink.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:48.500\nSo, tests are everywhere! They help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:57.500\nThey help us confirm things or discover new things. Basically, a test is just a structured way to get information.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
