    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:04.300\nToday, we're going to explore\nsomething really important: the test.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:07.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:13.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information.\nThink of it like a question, or a series of questions,\ndesigned to see what you know, what you can do,\nor even how something works.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:18.300\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher\nsee how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:22.300\nOr, a taste test might let you decide\nwhich cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:26.700\nEven checking if a light bulb works is a simple kind of test!\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:32.800\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\nThey're a useful tool in lots of different situations.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.100\nIn short, a test is a process\ndesigned to gather information.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:39.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
