    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_213448.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.400\nIt helps us gather information or check if something is working correctly. Think of it like this: If you want to know if your cake is done baking, you use a toothpick.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.200\nThat toothpick is performing a test! Or, if you want to see if your shoelaces are tied tightly, you give them a little tug.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:43.500\nThat's a test too! Tests can be formal, like a quiz at school, or informal, like checking the weather before you go outside.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:56.200\nThe goal is always the same: to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect. So, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
