    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.000\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\nThink about it like this: a pop quiz in school is a test to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:31.000\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\nThese are all tests!\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:38.000\nTests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like checking the temperature of water with your hand.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:43.100\nThe key thing is that they help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:47.600\nSo, a test is a way to gather information.\nRemember that!\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:52.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
