    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_213716.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.900\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:22.500\nIt's how we find out if something works, or if something is true. Think of it like this:\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:32.900\na chef tastes the soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, a doctor gives you an eye exam to test your vision.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:39.300\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the lessons.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:45.700\nLet\u2019s say you build a tower out of blocks. You might gently push it to test if it\u2019s stable.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:55.100\nOr, if you plant a seed, you wait to see if it grows \u2013 that's a test of whether the seed was healthy.\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:02.600\nSo, testing is all about checking things out, learning something new, and making sure everything is working as it should.\n\n01:02.600 --> 01:03.900\nIt's a super important part of learning and building things.\n01:03.900 --> 01:06.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
