    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, welcome! Today, we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like an experiment, where you try something out to see what happens.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:35.700\nThe main idea behind any test is to check if something is true, or if something works the way you expect it to.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:43.000\nFor example, a food taste test helps us discover if people like a new recipe.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:53.700\nOr, a spelling test shows us how well someone knows how to spell words. Even checking if a lightbulb turns on is a type of test!\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.200\nYou're testing if the lightbulb is working. So, remember, a test is just a simple way to learn more and confirm things. It helps us to be more sure about our observations. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
