    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_214036.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:25.500\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, performance, or even just the presence of something.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:33.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:40.100\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\nThat's another kind of test.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:46.700\nTests aren't always about grades or scores.\nSometimes they're just about checking something.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:53.300\nLike testing if a lightbulb works before you screw it in.\nYou\u2019re testing to see if it lights up!\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:00.700\nSo, remember, a test is a process to evaluate something.\nIt can be about your knowledge, your health, or even a lightbulb.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:04.100\nIt\u2019s all about finding out information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
