    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be about you, about an object, or about anything, really!\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy. Or, you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:38.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready! Another example: a teacher gives you a test at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:46.800\nTests help us learn and understand things better. So, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:55.700\nIt can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your bath water is the right temperature. It's all about finding things out!\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
