    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a method we use to gather information.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a test at school to see what you've learned.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:37.800\nTests can be written, like a quiz, or they can be hands-on, like a science experiment. For example, you might test if a toy car rolls faster on a smooth surface or a rough one.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:48.100\nYou'd run the car on both, see which goes faster, and that\u2019s your test! Basically, you're trying something out to see what happens.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:57.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get answers and learn new things. It helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:01.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
