    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.700\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:06.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:11.500\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something to see how well it performs, or what it's made of.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:16.500\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how many words you know.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:21.200\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:24.200\nTests aren't just for school or the doctor's office, though.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:29.100\nImagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:32.500\nIt helps you see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:37.200\nSee? Tests are everywhere, helping us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:41.600\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:51.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "9acec316-1f9a-4eea-a68d-9eb5e1cb5162": {
