    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_214544.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like gathering clues to solve a puzzle. The main idea behind a test is to ask questions or perform actions to see how something responds.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:33.400\nThat response gives us valuable information. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher gives you a quiz to check how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:40.000\nEven baking a cake is a test! You're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:48.000\nSo, a test is just a method for getting information. It helps us learn, diagnose, and even create!\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
