    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test, anyway?\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:18.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:29.000\nIt's a process that helps us gather information and see if something is true or working the way it should.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:40.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:50.400\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Tests can be simple, like checking if a light bulb turns on.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:54.000\nOr, they can be more complicated, like taking a big exam at school.\n```"
