    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.600\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something.\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:24.800\nTests help us figure out if something is working correctly, or if we know something well.\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:31.800\nOr your teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:36.400\nImagine you build a toy car.\nYou test it by pushing it to see if it rolls.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:43.800\nThat's a test!\nOr if you're learning your ABCs, your mom or dad might ask you to say them to see if you remember them.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:50.400\nAnother test!\nSo, tests are just ways to check and see if things are as they should be.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:57.700\nThey help us learn and make sure everything is working right.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
