    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.999\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore something super important: the test.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:17.500\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out information. Think of it like asking a question and then finding the answer.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:24.800\nIt could be a quiz at school to see what you've learned, or even something you do every day without realizing it.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:34.600\nFor example, when you try a new food, you're testing if you like it! You're gathering information based on your experience.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:41.700\nAnother example is checking if your shoes fit before buying them; you're testing for size and comfort.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:53.300\nSo, a test helps us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us better. It's all about gathering evidence to answer a question.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
