    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:26.400\nIt's a process designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or even your abilities.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:33.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:36.700\nA driving test checks if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:40.400\nOr a taste test checks which flavor of ice cream you like best!\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:47.400\nTests come in many forms.\nSome are written, some are practical, and some are even just a simple observation.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.800\nThe important thing is that they give us information about something.\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for evaluation, used to understand skills, knowledge or preferences through different types of assessments.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
