    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_215632.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:21.200\nThink about it like this: your teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:29.200\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:36.700\nAnother example is baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:47.200\nOr imagine a doctor using a test to see if you have a cold. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:51.500\nIt helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working properly. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
