    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_215722.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something. It helps us understand how well something works, or if it's working the way it should.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like this: you might give a plant some water and then check its leaves to see if it's healthy. That's a test!\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:31.900\nOr, if you build a tower of blocks, you might gently push it to see if it's strong enough to stand. That's another kind of test.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:37.200\nSo, tests are all about observing and learning.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:49.800\nWe try something, and then we see what happens. They can be simple, like tasting food to see if it's good, or more complex, like a doctor checking your heart.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:56.800\nTests help us make decisions and improve things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
