    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.300\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:19.900\nThink of it like a detective looking for clues.\nThey're testing their theories to see if they hold up.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:25.800\nTests can take many forms.\nIn school, you might take a quiz to test your knowledge.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:33.900\nA doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:36.900\nSee? Tests are all around us!\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:48.700\nThey help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to check, evaluate, and learn.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:52.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
