    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:22.700\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:30.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:38.200\nOr a chef tastes their soup \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:49.300\nTests aren't just for school! They can be as simple as checking if a light bulb works before you screw it in. You\u2019re testing it to see if it lights up.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:57.500\nOr even asking a friend if they like your new haircut \u2013 that\u2019s a test of their opinion! So, remember, a test is just a way to get information. It helps us understand things better and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
