    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:04.300\nToday, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:06.200\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:09.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:11.500\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like this: you might test if your cake is ready by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:19.700\nIf it comes out clean, you know it's done!\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:24.200\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:26.000\nTests can be big or small.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:29.700\nA school exam is a test of what you've learned.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:32.900\nTasting a new recipe is a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:37.900\nSo, basically, a test is anything we do to learn more about something.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:42.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:45.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
