    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:06.000\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:13.000\nA test is basically a way to find out how much you know or can do. Think of it like checking if you've learned something new.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:16.500\nIt's not just about school. Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:20.000\nYour doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:23.500\nA chef might taste their food to test if it's delicious. See?\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:31.500\nSo, let's say you're learning about colors. A test might be asking you to point to the red one, or name all the primary colors.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:33.500\nIf you can do it, you've passed the color test!\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:38.500\nTests help us understand what we're good at and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:42.000\nThey're a tool for learning, not something to be afraid of.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:46.500\nRemember, tests show us where we are on our learning journey.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:50.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
