    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_221028.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\nIt's like asking a question, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:22.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health, like taking your temperature or blood pressure.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:37.100\nA teacher uses tests to see how well you understand a subject.\nSo, a test could be a quiz in school, a survey asking your opinion, or even a taste test comparing different flavors of ice cream!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:46.400\nThe key is that it's a method for gathering information.\nTests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:55.200\nThey're all around us, helping us understand the world a little better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "aa19c93f-0c45-43c4-8bde-119e0ab296c3": {
    "id": "aa19c93f-0c45-43c4-8bde-119e0ab296c3",
    "topic": "Test",
