    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.400\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like an investigation.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:40.000\nWe want to know if something works, or if it\u2019s true, or even just how good it is. So, how does it work? Well, we usually give something a challenge, or ask it a question, and then we see how it responds.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:46.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:56.400\nA taste test checks which food you like best. And a medical test can check if you're healthy. Tests help us make decisions, improve things, and learn more.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:06.200\nThey're all around us, helping us understand the world better. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding things out!\n```"
