    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:15.700\nThink of a test as a way to find out how much you know about something. It's like a little quiz, but it can be about anything.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:26.100\nSo, what exactly is a test? Well, it's really just a set of questions or tasks designed to see what you've learned or what you can do.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:36.500\nIt helps you, and others, understand your knowledge and skills.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:46.900\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you can spell words. A math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:55.300\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you can cook it successfully!\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:04.700\nBasically, tests help us learn and grow. They show us where we're strong and where we might need a little more practice.\n\n01:04.700 --> 01:08.300\nThey can be used for fun or for more serious things,\n\n01:08.300 --> 01:11.900\nbut the main idea is always the same: to check your understanding.\n\n01:11.900 --> 01:15.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
