    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.220 --> 00:05.420\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.420 --> 00:12.020\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.020 --> 00:25.720\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\nThink about it like this: a teacher gives you a test in school to see how well you understand the material.\nOr, a doctor might run a test to check your health.\n\n00:25.720 --> 00:34.620\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test \u2013 you\u2019re testing your recipe!\n\n00:34.620 --> 00:41.220\nTests can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb turns on.\nOr they can be more complex, involving lots of steps and analysis.\n\n00:41.220 --> 00:51.820\nThe key thing is, they give us information.\nThey help us make decisions and learn more.\n\n00:51.820 --> 00:58.420\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something works, measures up, or is in the right condition.\n\n00:58.420 --> 01:02.020\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
