    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.100\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even if something is working correctly.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:30.500\nThink about it: when you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:42.700\nOr, imagine a chef tasting a soup \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt. Even trying to turn on a light switch is a mini-test to see if the lightbulb works!\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:51.900\nSo, tests help us understand things better, make improvements, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:59.300\nThey're all around us, helping us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
