    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something!\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.700\nIt's a process of gathering information. Think of it like this: If you want to know if a cake is done baking, you can do a simple test.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:29.100\nYou stick a toothpick in the center. If it comes out clean, the cake passes the test! It's done!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:34.200\nOr, imagine you want to know if a lightbulb works. You screw it into a lamp and flip the switch.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:40.600\nIf it lights up, it passes the test! It\u2019s working. If not, well, it failed the test.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:45.000\nSo, to recap, a test is just a method for checking something\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:54.600\nand seeing if it meets a certain standard or requirement. It helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
