    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough. Or, you might test a lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:34.300\nIn science, tests are super important. Scientists use them to check their ideas and see if they're right.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:48.400\nFor example, they might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better. So, a test is just a way to check something, using a specific method, to get a clear result.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:55.800\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
