    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.000\nIt's a process to see if something is true, or to measure how well something works.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:31.800\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:41.700\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:55.000\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us understand things better.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.500\nThey can be simple or complicated, but the main idea is always the same: to get information.\nIn summary, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something!\n```"
  },
