    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:11.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be about anything!\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:19.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:26.600\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready. Tests can also be used to see what you know.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:38.100\nLike, a quiz at school is a test to see how well you understand the material. Or, you might test out a new toy to see if it works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:52.200\nBasically, a test is just a way of asking a question and getting an answer. Whether it's about cake, school, or toys, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:54.900\nSo remember, a test is all about finding things out.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
