    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_222613.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:26.200\nIt helps us learn more about a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:35.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:44.600\nEven a car company might test a new car to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:53.900\nSo, a test can be anything from a written exam, to a physical exam, to even observing how something works. The key is that it gives us information.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:06.600\nThat information can then help us make better decisions, solve problems, or just understand the world around us a little bit better.\n\n01:06.600 --> 01:13.000\nBasically, a test helps us learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "cba01c9a-a679-47d4-b65a-463548cee89f": {
