    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge or ability in a specific area.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:26.900\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know how to spell words.\nA math test shows how good you are at solving math problems.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:33.500\nEven a taste test is a type of test!\nIt helps you decide which food you like the best.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:42.700\nTests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking your progress in school to figuring out which product is the most popular.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.200\nThey help us gather information and make decisions.\nSo, in short, tests are tools that help us learn and understand.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
