    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_223609.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:12.800\nWell, simply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don\u2019t realize it.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:39.100\nFor example, when you bake a cake and taste it to see if it needs more sugar, that\u2019s a test! Or, if you try on a pair of shoes to see if they fit, you're testing them out.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:47.200\nTests help us check if something is working, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:57.600\nSo, tests can be anything from a quiz at school to checking the water temperature before getting in the pool. They all have the same basic goal: to get information and make a decision.\n\n00:57.600 --> 01:01.200\nRemember, a test is just a way of gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
