    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like this: you test your oven to see if it's hot before you put your pizza in.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:34.000\nOr, a doctor might give you a test to check if you're healthy. In school, tests help your teacher see how well you're learning.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:43.700\nThey can be multiple choice, written answers, or even showing what you know by doing something.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:48.000\nSo, a test is just a tool to see where you're at.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:53.000\nIt helps you and others understand what you know and what you might need to learn more about. Remember, tests are just one way to learn, and they help us grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
