    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:22.000\nIt's a process designed to give us information. Think about it like this: a simple quiz in school is a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:31.100\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health. Even tasting a new recipe is a test to see if you like the flavor!\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:40.700\nTests can be formal, like standardized exams, or informal, like trying out a new video game before you buy it.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:51.000\nThe key thing is they all help us gather information and make decisions. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
