    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:23.500\nIt's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge or skills. Think of it like this: your doctor gives you a checkup, that's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:33.300\nOr when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. In school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:44.400\nThey can be multiple choice, fill-in-the-blank, or even writing an essay. So, a test is just a tool to help us understand something better.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:50.800\nRemember, it's all about learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
