    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is a way to see how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:19.800\nThink of it like a checkup.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:32.400\nWe use tests all the time! For example, when you take a quiz in school, that's a test of your knowledge.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:42.200\nOr, if you're baking a cake and taste it to see if it's sweet enough, that\u2019s a test too.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:47.800\nA doctor might run tests to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:51.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something.\n```"
