    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_224114.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:15.400\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows you how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:31.300\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:39.100\nTests aren't just for school or baking, though. Scientists use tests to see if a new medicine works, and engineers test bridges to make sure they\u2019re safe.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:45.700\nThe main idea is that a test gives us information. It helps us learn and improve things.\n\n00:45.700 --> 00:51.900\nSo, tests are all about gathering information to understand something better.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
