    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_224401.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.300\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:22.900\nThink of it this way: if you want to know if your cake is done, you can test it by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:35.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\nOr, if you're learning new words, your teacher might give you a spelling test to see how well you're remembering them.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:47.800\nTests help us understand where we're at and what we need to work on.\nSo, whether it's testing a recipe or your knowledge, a test is all about gathering information.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:53.400\nIt's a tool for learning and improvement.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
