    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:21.300\nWe use them all the time. Think of it like this: you want to know if the oven is hot enough to bake a cake.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:30.100\nYou might put your hand near it \u2013 that\u2019s a simple test! More formally, a test helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:40.200\nIt could be your knowledge, like a school exam. Or it could be the quality of a product, like checking if a toy is safe.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:45.800\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:54.600\nA software engineer might test their code to make sure it works correctly. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
