    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.900\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:11.500\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:16.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:24.100\nThink about it. A spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:36.300\nA taste test tells you if you like a certain food. Even using a thermometer to check your temperature is a kind of test!\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:43.300\nSo, a test helps us learn something new, or confirm something we already thought was true.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:50.300\nIt gives us information. Maybe you take a test in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:55.400\nOr maybe you test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:03.000\nBasically, any time you're trying to get a specific answer or result, you're probably using a test.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:10.900\nRemember, tests help us learn and discover new things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
