    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:01.600 --> 00:02.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.900 --> 00:05.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:09.500\nIt's a process, a set of questions, or an activity that helps us understand something better.\n\n00:09.500 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:19.400\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:20.100\nSee?\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:23.500\nIn both examples, you're using the test to learn something.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:29.900\nTests can be used for lots of different things, like figuring out if a cake is ready by poking it with a fork, or checking if a battery is still working with a battery tester.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:32.600\nIt's all about gathering information!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us learn, discover, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:41.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
