    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_225117.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use tests all the time, even if we don\u2019t realize it.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if an egg is cooked. You might tap it with a spoon \u2013 that\u2019s a test!\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:27.500\nOr imagine you're baking a cake. You use a toothpick to check if it's done.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:31.200\nThe toothpick comes out clean? Test passed! The cake is ready.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:37.600\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:44.000\nThey're like a check-up to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:50.200\nSo, a test is just a tool to gather information and see where we stand. Remember that next time you have one!\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:53.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
