    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_225303.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome!\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:13.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\nWe use them all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if the water's hot enough for a bath, so you dip your toe in.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:28.000\nTests help us evaluate something, like our knowledge, or the quality of a product.\nFor example, a school exam is a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:39.800\nOr, a taste test helps decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\nSo, tests are all about gathering information to help us make decisions.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:53.400\nWhether it's checking the bathwater or acing an exam, tests give us valuable insights.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
