    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nHey there, welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.400\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It could be checking if a lightbulb works, seeing how well you know your multiplication tables, or even a doctor checking your temperature.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:28.400\nBasically, it\u2019s an activity designed to give us information.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:35.300\nThink about it like this: You taste a cookie to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:40.500\nOr, you might try a new recipe to test if you can cook it.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:44.900\nTests help us confirm things, identify problems, and learn new things.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:58.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a process, an action, or a set of questions used to gather information and evaluate something. It\u2019s a fundamental way we learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:01.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
