    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:21.700\nThink of it like an experiment, or a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:32.400\nWe use tests all the time!\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:38.100\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you've learned your words.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:48.500\nAnother example could be testing if a new toy works by playing with it.\nThe playing is the test!\nThe result tells you if the toy is fun and functional.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:52.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and learning something new.\nIt helps us understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
