    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to explore something super important: what is a test?\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:21.700\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:29.600\nA doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nYour teacher gives you tests to see how well you understand the lessons.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:38.100\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:49.100\nSo, tests help us learn and understand things better.\nThey give us information we can use to make decisions.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:52.700\nWhether it\u2019s a quiz in class or trying a new recipe, tests help us explore and discover!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
