    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to learn about what a test is.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with a right or wrong answer.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:32.600\nTests help us measure things. It could be how well you know a subject, like in a school exam. Or, it could be testing the strength of a bridge to make sure it's safe.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:40.600\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you can spell words. A taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes the best. Even your doctor uses tests to check your health!\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:55.500\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and see where things stand. They help us learn, improve, and make important decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
