    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:26.500\nWe use them all the time! Think about it: a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\nOr maybe you take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:35.200\nThe main idea is to ask a question, perform a task, or use a tool to get information.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:39.300\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:48.100\nFor example, you might taste a cake to test if it needs more sugar.\nOr bounce a ball to test how high it bounces.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:55.600\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\nIt's all about asking questions and finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
