    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: Tests.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.000\nA test is basically a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You turn it on, and the result \u2013 does it light up?\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:28.700\n\u2013 tells you if the bulb is good or bad.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:32.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:39.100\nYour spelling quizzes at school? Those are tests. A doctor checking your temperature?\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:48.600\nThat's a test too! Even just tasting a new food to see if you like it is a kind of test. You're testing your taste buds!\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:58.100\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and learn something new. From lightbulbs to spelling, tests help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
