    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a process we use to gather information or see if something works the way it should.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:29.400\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:34.200\nThat's a test! You're testing if the cake is cooked all the way through.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:39.000\nOr, when you go to the doctor, they might check your temperature.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:43.800\nThat's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:52.800\nTests can be big or small, simple or complicated, but they all have the same goal: to give us answers.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:57.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what we already think. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
