    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.500\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:18.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process, a set of questions, or even just an action, that helps us gather information and learn more.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:31.800\nThink about it like this: When you take a quiz at school, that's a test to see what you've learned.\nOr, when you bake a cake and taste it, that's a test to see if you added enough sugar.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:46.300\nEven checking if a lightbulb works by flipping the switch is a mini-test!\nSo, whether it's a formal exam or just trying something new, tests help us understand the world around us and improve.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:54.300\nThey help us see if something works, if we understand a concept, or if we need to try a different approach.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:59.700\nIn short, a test is just a way to get answers!\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
