    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_231021.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to explore something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.500\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something about\u2026 well, anything!\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like a question you\u2019re trying to answer. You perform the test, and the results help you answer that question.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:39.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you\u2019re healthy. Or, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:49.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing your recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:56.100\nBasically, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions. They give us information that we didn't have before.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.400\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to get answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
