    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.700\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to check something. Think of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.300\nWe use tests all the time! For example, when you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked through.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:39.200\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that means the cake is done \u2013 that's the \"answer\" to your test. Or, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how well you understand the vocabulary.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:50.800\nSo, tests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if we've learned something new. They're a really useful tool for learning and problem-solving.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:59.800\nTo recap, a test is a simple way to check something and get an answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
