    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:22.500\nIt's like an experiment, but often shorter and with a specific question in mind.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:31.800\nWe use tests all the time! Think about it: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:46.500\nA baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar. Or, you might take a quiz in school to test how much you've learned.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:51.500\nEssentially, a test involves trying something out and observing what happens.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:53.900\nThe results help us understand something better,\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.500\nwhether it's your health, the flavor of a cake, or your knowledge of a subject.\n```"
