    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something, right? It's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:20.300\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might test if it's done by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:28.900\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's your test saying the cake is ready! Or think about taking a quiz at school. That's a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:35.100\nTests aren't just for baking or school, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and scientists use tests to learn about the world.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:47.800\nSo, tests are basically a way of checking things and getting information. They help us understand the world around us!\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:54.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
