    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.270\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.270 --> 00:07.880\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something!\n\n00:07.880 --> 00:11.130\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:11.130 --> 00:14.130\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:14.130 --> 00:16.920\nThink about it: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:16.920 --> 00:21.630\nA teacher uses tests to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:21.630 --> 00:23.780\nEven baking a cake involves a test!\n\n00:23.780 --> 00:26.290\nYou taste it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:26.290 --> 00:31.150\nSo, a test can be a quiz, an experiment, or even just trying something out.\n\n00:31.150 --> 00:35.080\nIt's all about gathering information and learning something new.\n\n00:35.080 --> 00:42.350\nBasically, tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:42.350 --> 00:46.130\nThey\u2019re a super useful tool in all sorts of situations.\n\n00:46.130 --> 00:49.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
