    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.700\nA test is basically a way to check how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:27.900\nYou're testing it!\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:34.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. There are written tests in school, like quizzes or exams.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:46.400\nBut there are also tests in everyday life. For example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:52.200\nOr when a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:59.200\nSo, to recap, a test helps us understand something better, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even your health. It's all about finding out information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
