    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.500\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:23.000\nIt helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if it's true or false.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.900\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes the soup to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:36.800\nOr, your doctor might give you a vision test to see how well you can see. These are all tests!\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:46.000\nTests can be written, like a quiz in school, or they can be practical, like testing a new toy to see if it's safe.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.700\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information. It helps us understand something better.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:59.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and gather information.\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.000\nFrom checking the soup to taking a school exam, tests are all around us!\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:05.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
