    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you do a simple test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in!\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:29.100\nIn general, a test helps us find out if something works, if it's good, or if it's correct.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:39.300\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Teachers use tests to see how much you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:46.300\nEven video games have tests, like when you try to jump over a gap to see if you can make it.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:53.300\nSo, tests are all about checking things. They give us information and help us make decisions.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:57.200\nThey\u2019re used in all sorts of ways, big and small, to make sure things are working as they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
