    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:28.000\nWe use them all the time, even without realizing it! Think of it like this: a test is just a way to gather information.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:35.400\nIt could be a quiz at school, a taste test of a new ice cream flavor, or even checking if your phone is working by making a call.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:42.900\nThe goal is always the same: to learn something.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:53.100\nFor example, a quiz tests your knowledge. The ice cream taste test tells you if people like it. And the phone call test checks if your phone can connect.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.700\nSo, a test is a method for collecting information and gaining insights. It helps us understand things better and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
