    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.700\nNow, what is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.200\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if we understand something.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:37.700\nA teacher gives you a test to see if you learned the lesson.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:44.800\nOr, you might even test your cookies to see if they taste good!\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:54.600\nTests can be all sorts of things.\nThey can be questions you answer, like on a school exam.\nThey can be experiments you do, like in science class.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:01.400\nOr, they can even be just trying something out to see what happens.\nThe key thing is, you're trying to get information.\n\n01:01.400 --> 01:07.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn and check things.\nIt helps us understand the world around us.\n\n01:07.900 --> 01:14.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
