    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_232203.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:07.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.000\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, abilities, or even physical characteristics.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:18.500\nThink of it like this: when you go to the doctor, they might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:24.000\nBut tests aren\u2019t just for doctors! In school, you take tests to show what you\u2019ve learned in class.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:29.300\nA math test checks your understanding of numbers, and a spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:35.500\nAnother example could be testing a new recipe. You follow the instructions and then you taste it to see if it's good!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:37.000\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:42.500\nSo, a test is basically a process for gathering information.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:53.000\nWhether it's checking your health, your knowledge, or your cooking skills, tests help us understand something better.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:57.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
