    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:27.300\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:34.700\nThink about it like this: You might test a new toy to see if it needs batteries.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:37.300\nOr, a teacher might give you a test at school to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:39.900\nAnother example: Bakers test their cake batter\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:48.500\nto make sure it tastes yummy before baking the whole cake. See? Tests are everywhere! They help us make informed decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:52.000\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check and see if something is true or working the way it should.\n```"
  },
