    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_232600.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test, anyway?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working, or if we know something, or even how well we can do something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.000\nThink about it like this. Your doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:29.000\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you know. Even baking a cake can be seen as a test!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:36.000\nYou're testing if your recipe works and if you can follow the instructions correctly.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:47.000\nSo, tests help us learn and improve. They give us information that we can use to make better decisions.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:52.000\nRemember, a test is just a tool to help us understand things better.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
