    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_232847.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.100\nIt helps us check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:37.000\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:47.900\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:52.800\nIn both cases, the test is giving us information.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:54.800\nThe spelling test shows your spelling skills,\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:56.100\nand the blood test shows your health status.\n```"
