    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:07.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:11.500\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:18.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You perform a simple test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:22.900\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:26.700\nAnother example is a spelling test at school.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:31.500\nThat tests your knowledge of how to spell different words.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.800\nOr, if you\u2019re learning to ride a bike, your ability to stay balanced is being tested with every pedal.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:42.400\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:47.800\nIt helps us understand where we are, what we know, and what we can do.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:54.300\nWhether it\u2019s a cake, a spelling quiz, or riding a bike, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
