    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.000\nYou might think of tests as something you take in school, but in this case, we're talking about testing in a more general way.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.600\nEssentially, a test is just a way to check if something is working as it should.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:30.400\nThink about baking a cake. You might taste the batter before you bake it to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:41.000\nOr, imagine checking your car's tire pressure. That's a test to make sure your tires are properly inflated.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:48.500\nSo, a test can be anything from a simple taste to a complex scientific experiment.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:56.000\nThe important thing is that it helps us understand if something is working correctly or if there's a problem. In short, a test helps us learn and improve things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
