    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:06.300\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:12.400\nWhether it's to see if you understand a concept, or to make sure a product works correctly, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:18.100\nThink about it like this: if you're baking a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:19.200\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.200 --> 00:25.300\nOr, maybe you're learning a new language and take a quiz to see how well you're understanding the vocabulary.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:25.900\nThat's another kind of test.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:31.800\nTests can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like asking yourself questions while you study.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:35.900\nThe important thing is that they give you information.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:41.200\nThey help you figure out what you know, and what you still need to learn.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:44.800\nSo, tests are really just tools for learning and improvement.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:47.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
