    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.800\nIt's a process designed to see if something is true, or working correctly, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:30.400\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough. Schools use tests to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:37.200\nSo, tests aren\u2019t just about exams! They're everywhere, helping us understand the world around us.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:46.300\nThey help us check, measure, and confirm things. In short, a test is a way to get information.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:54.400\nIt\u2019s a structured process to answer a specific question.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
