    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_233940.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:19.500\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to. It's like a little experiment to see if a person, a product, or even an idea passes a certain standard.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:31.400\nFor example, a doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, before a new toy goes on sale, it\u2019s tested to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:39.300\nEven when you're writing a story, you might ask a friend to read it and give you feedback \u2013 that's a type of test too!\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:51.500\nSo, tests help us understand if things are working correctly, safely, and effectively. They give us information to improve things and make better decisions.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:60.500\nTests are everywhere, making sure things meet our expectations! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
