    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:19.100\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:29.900\nIt's like a detective gathering clues! Think about it. A doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:40.500\nA baker tastes their cake batter to see if it's sweet enough. Or, you might test the water temperature before jumping into a pool to make sure it's not too cold.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:50.600\nBasically, a test helps us learn more about something. It gives us information we can use to make a decision or understand a situation better.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:58.500\nWe ask a question, and the test helps provide the answer. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information. It's a tool we use to learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
