    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.500\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to check something, or to see how well something works.\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:25.700\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\nTests can be used for all sorts of things!\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:33.400\nA chef might taste their soup to test the flavor.\nA student takes a test in school to show what they've learned.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:48.500\nAnd, engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something, whether it's a toy, your health, a recipe, or a bridge.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:54.900\nIt helps us understand something better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
