    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260106_234331.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:05.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:08.600\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:12.900\nThink of it like this: you taste a new food to test if you like it.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:17.100\nOr, you try a new route to work to test if it's faster.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:20.700\nIn more formal settings, like school or work, tests help us measure knowledge or skills.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:25.200\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:28.700\nA driving test checks if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:33.300\nThe point is to see where you're at and what you might need to learn more about.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:40.000\nSo, a test isn't just about getting a good grade, it's about understanding what you know.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:42.600\nBasically, it's a tool for learning!\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:56.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
