    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:10.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:22.500\nIt's a process where you ask a question or perform an action to see what the result will be. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:36.300\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes better. Scientists use tests to see if their ideas are true, and doctors use tests to figure out what's wrong when you're not feeling well.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:47.000\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. Remember, tests help us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:50.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
