    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:09.800\nA test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.800 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up.\nWe use tests all the time to see if things are working correctly\nor to learn more about something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:27.900\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\nEven a doctor uses tests, like checking your temperature, to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:39.500\nSo, a test is just a process for gathering information.\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:47.500\nWe design them to answer specific questions.\nIn short, tests are everywhere and help us learn and improve!\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:54.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
