    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something fundamental: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:13.400\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works like it should.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:21.900\nIt's like a little experiment. Basically, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:29.100\nThat \"something\" could be anything! A product, an idea, or even your knowledge.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:38.100\nFor example, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:43.200\nOr, if you're building a toy car, you might push it to see if it rolls.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:54.900\nThat's a test! Tests help us understand if we're on the right track. They give us valuable information so we can improve things.\n\n00:54.900 --> 00:58.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way to check if something is doing what it's supposed to do. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
