    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but in this case, we're talking about testing something out to see if it works or not.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:24.200\nBasically, a test is a way to check if something is doing what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:30.300\nIt's like trying a new recipe. You're testing to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:39.600\nOr, imagine you're building a Lego tower. You test its strength by gently pushing it to see if it stays standing.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:48.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. You test a lightbulb by flipping the switch to see if it turns on.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:57.900\nYou test your brakes in a car to make sure they work properly. So, remember, a test is simply a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.600\nIt helps us understand and improve things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
