    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.100\nAlright, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:05.100\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:07.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:11.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:15.400\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to see if it needs more sugar - that's a test!\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:19.600\nOr, if your car won't start, you might check the battery. That's another test to see if the battery is the problem.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:26.200\nTests aren't just for baking or fixing cars. They can be used to check anything, from how well you understand a subject in school, to how strong a bridge is.\n\n00:26.200 --> 00:31.300\nThe goal is always the same: to get information and make a decision based on that information.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:34.700\nSo, a test is simply a method for gathering information.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:36.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
