    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:18.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:31.400\nThink of it as a way to check your understanding or the quality of a product.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:42.100\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:52.600\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:52.600 --> 01:01.400\nTests help us learn what we know, and identify areas where we can improve. They can also help us decide if something is good enough to use. So, remember a test is just a check-up! It can be about knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something. It's a tool that helps us learn, improve, and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
