    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.100\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:09.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:09.400 --> 00:12.600\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:17.300\nThink about it: a baking test is when you cook a little bit of your cake batter to see if it\u2019s ready.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:21.900\nOr, a color test might be when you show someone different shades to see if they can tell the difference.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:26.600\nEven a simple yes or no question can be a test!\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:35.400\nThe important thing is that we're using the test to learn something new or confirm something we already suspected.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:41.500\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is a process that helps us gather information.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:45.500\nIt's a tool for discovery!\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:50.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
