    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:10.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to check something.\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:18.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:28.900\nIn science, tests are used to see if an idea is correct.\nFor example, you might test if a plant grows faster with more sunlight.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:37.900\nYou'd give one plant lots of sun and another less, and then see which one grows taller.\nThat comparison is your test.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:53.600\nTests help us learn new things and make sure things are working properly.\nWhether it's checking if your car is safe, or seeing if a new medicine works, tests are all around us, helping us understand the world better.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:01.600\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
