    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's done by poking it with a toothpick. The toothpick is the test, and whether it comes out clean tells you if the cake is ready.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:34.800\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand a topic. Maybe it's a quiz about animals, or a spelling test.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:43.200\nTests can also be used to check other things, like if a toy works, or even if you can run really fast!\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:53.700\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see how things measure up. Remember, it's just a tool to help us learn and improve.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
