    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:29.600\nThink of it like an experiment, but instead of chemicals, we might be testing knowledge, skills, or even your eyesight!\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:39.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\nA math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:46.800\nAnd when you go to the doctor, they might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:54.000\nSo, whether it's on paper, on a computer, or even a physical exam, a test is just a way to gather information and see where you stand. In short, tests help us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
