    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nHey everyone, welcome!\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests!\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:16.800\nThink of a test as a way to see what you know or how well something works.\nIt's like checking your baking \u2013 you taste it to test if it's delicious.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:24.200\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\nBut tests aren\u2019t just for school!\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:31.800\nImagine you're buying a new toy.\nYou might push its buttons and play with it to test if it's fun and works properly.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:43.700\nSo, tests can be anything from a quiz in class to trying out a new recipe.\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:47.900\nBasically, a test helps us figure things out!\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:51.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
