    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:5.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:11.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:16.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:22.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:27.400\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like the taste.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:31.500\nOr, when you push a door, you're testing to see if it's locked.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.500\nIn school, tests help us understand what we've learned.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:40.700\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:43.600\nThe goal is to show what you know!\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:49.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:52.500\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
