    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_002442.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.300\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in this case, we're talking about a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:25.100\nThink of it like this: a test is simply a method to see if an idea, a product, or even a skill lives up to expectations.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:37.400\nFor example, a food company might test a new recipe to see if people like the taste. Or, a software company might test their program to make sure it doesn\u2019t crash.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:49.700\nEven you test things every day, like when you try on a new pair of shoes to see if they fit. So, to recap, a test is a simple way to verify something.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:57.800\nIt helps us confirm if it works as planned and meets our needs. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
