    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_002540.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:07.600\nYou might hear the word \"test\" used in a lot of different ways,\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:10.800\nbut basically, a test is just a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:14.100\nThink of it like a detective gathering clues.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:16.300\nWe use tests all the time.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:21.100\nFor example, when you take a spelling test at school, it's a way for your teacher to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:26.500\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might test the batter to see if it tastes right.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:27.500\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:31.400\nTests help us understand things better and make better decisions.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:37.600\nSo, a test is simply a process or procedure used to evaluate knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:40.800\nIt's all about gathering information!\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:43.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
