    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_002624.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:14.000\nIn its simplest form, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:24.300\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. A doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:35.300\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:42.800\nFor example, if you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:53.700\nOr, if you're buying a new phone, you might try out the camera to test if you like the picture quality.\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:00.400\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to gather information by asking a question, performing an action, or making an observation. It helps us learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
