    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something, like your knowledge, or even how well something works.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:19.900\nThink of it as a way to get information.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:30.800\nSo, what kind of information? Well, if you take a math test at school, it tells your teacher how well you understand addition, subtraction, and all those fun things!\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:39.800\nOr, imagine you're trying out a new video game. Playing the game is a kind of test, letting you see if you like it!\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:50.500\nFor example, a doctor might run blood tests to check your health. A chef tastes their food \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt or pepper!\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:53.100\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:53.100 --> 01:02.700\nBasically, a test is just a way to learn something by checking it out. They help us understand things better and make good decisions.\n\n01:02.700 --> 01:08.500\nThat's tests in a nutshell! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
