    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.300\nWhat is a test, exactly? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:24.100\nIt's a process designed to give us information about whatever we're testing. Think about it like this: a spelling test tells us how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:33.000\nA taste test helps us decide which cookie tastes the best. And a medical test can tell a doctor important things about your health.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:43.800\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, evaluating a product, or understanding your body, a test provides valuable information.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:52.800\nRemember, a test is just a method for gathering data and learning more. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
