    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:10.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know, or what something is capable of doing.\n\n00:10.400 --> 00:14.800\nThink of it like a check-up.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:22.100\nWe use tests all the time!\nImagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste the batter \u2013 that's a mini-test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:29.800\nOr, think about school.\nA quiz is a test to see how well you understand the material you've been learning.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:38.400\nTests can also be about physical things, like stress-testing a bridge to make sure it's strong enough to hold traffic.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:54.400\nSo, to recap: a test is a method for evaluating knowledge, skills, or the properties of something.\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we need to work on, or if something is safe to use.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
