    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: it's a tool we use to measure something. It could be a quiz in school to check your understanding of a lesson.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:35.500\nOr, it could be a recipe test, where you try out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:42.400\nEven trying on a new pair of shoes is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if they fit comfortably!\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:51.100\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes. They help us learn, improve, and make decisions. They're a way of gathering information.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:55.800\nTo recap, a test is a process for measuring your knowledge, abilities, or even the quality of something. Now you know! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
