    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. It could be checking if you understand a lesson, or if a product works correctly, or even if a website loads properly.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:30.600\nBasically, a test helps us figure out if something is the way it should be. Think about it like this: your doctor gives you a check-up \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:39.400\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's cooked all the way through \u2013 that's also a test!\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:50.900\nTests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as expected. So, remember, a test is just a way of checking something. It helps us understand if things are working the right way.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
