    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_003536.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something, or to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:36.200\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned!\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:41.700\nAnother example: you might test if a lightbulb works by screwing it into a lamp.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:53.200\nIf it lights up, the test passes! If it doesn't, the test fails. So, tests help us understand things better and make sure things are in good shape.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:58.000\nBasically, a test is a way to get information or confirm something. Now you know! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
