    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_003638.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:22.100\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, ability, or performance in a specific area.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:30.700\nThink of it like this: you might take a test in school to see how well you understand a subject, like math or science.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:40.300\nOr, a chef might test a recipe to see if it tastes good. Even a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on with your health.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:50.800\nTests can come in many forms, like multiple-choice questions, written assignments, or even practical demonstrations.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:59.500\nThe important thing is that they give us information and help us learn and improve.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:06.400\nSo, tests aren't something to fear! They're just tools for understanding and progress. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
