    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:26.600\nIt's basically just asking a question or setting up a situation to see what happens.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.700\nThink about it: a taste test tells you if you like a new flavor. A spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:42.600\nAnd even just trying to turn on a light switch is a test \u2013 you're testing if the lightbulb works!\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:57.500\nThe results of a test give us information. If the light turns on, great! If it doesn't, you know you might need a new bulb. So, a test helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nWhether it's in school, at the grocery store, or even just at home, tests are a simple way to explore and understand the world around us.\n```"
