    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:13.900\nA test is simply a way to check something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like a quick examination to see if something is working as expected, or if something is true or false.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:35.600\nFor example, you might test the batteries in your flashlight to see if they still have power.\nOr a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:47.300\nIn science, tests are used to confirm or deny a hypothesis.\nWe create an experiment, run the test, and look at the results.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:52.700\nSo, a test is really just a process of trying something out and observing the outcome.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.100\nIt's a fundamental part of learning and problem-solving in all areas of life.\nRemember, testing helps us understand what works and what doesn't.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
