    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.800\nWhat is a test, anyway? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:23.900\nIt\u2019s a process to see if something is true, works correctly, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:32.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:39.200\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:46.300\nTests aren't just for doctors and chefs though! Imagine you're building a tower of blocks.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:53.200\nYou test its strength by adding more blocks until it falls. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:54.500\nTesting helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as expected.\n```"
