    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_004921.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like a question that needs an answer.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:41.100\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a quiz to see what you've learned in class. Even tasting a new food is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:51.100\nSo, tests help us gather information, whether it's about our health, our knowledge, or even our taste preferences. They're a valuable tool for understanding the world around us.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.700\nRemember, a test is just a question, and the answer helps us learn. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
