    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_005005.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey there, and welcome! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:20.100\nBasically, a test is a way to find out something. It's like an experiment or a series of questions designed to see if something is true, or to measure how well someone knows something.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:30.100\nThink about it: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words. Or a taste test might help you decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:36.300\nA car crash test helps determine how safe a car is. So, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:48.800\nThey help us learn, improve, and make decisions based on evidence. They can be fun, like a taste test, or important, like a safety test.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:57.500\nBut they all have the same goal: to give us information. In short, a test helps us learn more about something.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
