    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you put it in a lamp.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:30.300\nAnother example is a spelling test in school.\nIt helps your teacher see how well you've learned to spell different words.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:37.900\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou might taste a little bit of the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:40.500\nSee?\nTests are everywhere!\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:56.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something and learn more about it.\nIt can be a simple check, or a more complicated process, but the goal is always the same: to gain information.\n\n00:56.100 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
