    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a process we use to check if something is true, or to see how well something works. Think of it like this: a spelling test in school checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:32.200\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:36.500\nThe toothpick comes out clean? That's a good test result!\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:42.700\nAnother example is testing if a lightbulb works by plugging it in. Does it light up?\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:48.900\nGreat, it passed the test! So, tests are all about finding things out.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:55.000\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:59.500\nTests are everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
