    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_005901.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:20.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well something works, or how much of something is there.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:36.900\nOr, you might test your knowledge of a subject by taking a quiz.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:46.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nA doctor might run tests to check your health, like a blood test.\nA scientist might test a new medicine to see if it works.\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test!\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:54.800\nSo, a test is really just a way of gathering information and learning something.\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
