    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.000\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:06.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:11.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.500 --> 00:14.600\nIt's a process we use to see if something is true,\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:16.500\nor to measure something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:20.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:24.800\nA taste test lets you decide which food you like better.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:29.500\nOr even a medical test can help doctors understand what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:34.000\nSo, a test isn't always about school! It's just a way to gather information\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:35.800\nand make a decision.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:40.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to learn something new.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:41.900\nThat\u2019s the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:44.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
