    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.900\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:33.100\nThink about it: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:39.000\nAnother example is baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:41.600\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:51.700\nSo, remember: a test is a method for gathering information. It helps us understand and learn more about the world around us.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
