    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really fundamental: a test.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like a quick check-up. It helps us understand if something works as expected, or if it has certain qualities.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:36.600\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Or, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:43.200\nAnother example? You could test if a toy car works by pushing it and seeing if it rolls.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:54.500\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it! So, remember, a test is just a way to learn more and check how things are working.\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
