    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, it's a way to check something. It helps us find out if something is working correctly, or if it's the way we expect it to be.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:24.400\nThink about it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.800\nA chef tastes food to test if it's seasoned well.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:39.400\nAnd a car mechanic might run a test on your engine to see if it needs repairs.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:48.700\nSo, tests aren't just for school! They're everywhere. They help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should. In short, a test is a check, a way to see if something measures up. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
