    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_010234.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:25.600\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or how well something is done.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:39.700\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you bake a cake, you taste it \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:52.800\nAnother example is when you take a quiz at school; it's a test to see how well you've learned the material. So, tests help us gather information and make better decisions.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the main idea is always the same: to learn something new! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
