    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:02.300\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:13.000\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or performance.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:18.000\nThink of it like this: you use a test to see how well you understand a topic,\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:21.600\nor how good you are at a certain task.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:25.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:28.200\nA math test checks your math knowledge.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:32.800\nAnd even trying out a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing whether it tastes good!\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:37.200\nSo, a test helps us measure something.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:40.400\nIt gives us information about what we know or what we can do.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:44.700\nRemember, it's just a tool to help us learn and improve.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:52.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
