    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like checking if a light bulb works before you screw it into a lamp.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:31.600\nYou're testing it. Tests can be anything from a quick quiz in school to a more complex experiment in a science lab.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:42.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words. Or, a taste test might help you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:51.900\nThe goal is always the same: to get information and see if something meets a certain standard. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
