    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:11.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like an investigation. You're trying to discover information or check if something is true.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:30.200\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words. A taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. Even checking if the lights turn on when you flip the switch is a kind of test!\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:42.300\nTests can be used to measure your knowledge, your skills, or even your preferences.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:49.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for finding things out. It's a way to learn and improve.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:53.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
