    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_011236.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:21.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in. That's a test!\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:30.200\nWe use tests everywhere. In school, tests help teachers see how well students understand the lessons.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:40.700\nAt the doctor's office, tests can tell us if we're healthy. Even baking a cake involves a test \u2013 sticking a toothpick in to see if it's done!\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:50.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. It's all about finding things out.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:53.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
