    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_011417.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:21.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:32.100\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it. A test helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something, or even what our preferences are.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:46.100\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:58.200\nEven trying out a new flavor of ice cream is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like trying that ice cream.\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.900\nBut the basic idea is always the same: you're gathering information to learn something new. Basically, a test is just a way to check something out and get some answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
