    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_011825.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.900\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, maybe in school, but what is a test, really?\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:30.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:38.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:45.200\nThat's a test! Or, if you want to know if your flashlight batteries are still good, you turn it on.\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:52.300\nAnother test! Tests can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like checking the cake.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:58.800\nThe important thing is that they give you information. Tests help us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:58.800 --> 01:02.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
