    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:08.500\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:13.800\nIt's a question, an experiment, or a procedure designed to give us information.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it like this: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:24.500\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\nThat's a good test result!\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:30.700\nOr maybe you're learning to ride a bike.\nYou might test your balance by letting go of the handlebars for a second.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:33.500\nA wobble tells you you need more practice.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:40.500\nTests aren't just for school, they're all around us!\nThey help us learn, improve, and understand the world better.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:44.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get some answers.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:53.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
