    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_012307.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: a test.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:17.400\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:29.300\nThat's one kind of test. Or, maybe you're trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:37.500\nYou taste it to test if it needs more salt. Another example is testing a toy to make sure it's safe for kids to play with.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:52.800\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and stay safe. They can come in many forms, but the core idea is always the same: to gather information and see where we stand.\n\n00:52.800 --> 01:02.700\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to measure or evaluate something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
