    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.700\nIt helps us see if something works, if something is true, or how well something is done.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:39.500\nThink of it like this: a spelling test in school checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:53.200\nOr, a taste test lets you decide which cookie is the tastiest!\n\n00:53.200 --> 01:00.500\nDoctors use tests to find out what's going on inside your body, like checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n```"
