    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_012516.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something, or someone!\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:21.200\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:27.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:33.100\nOr, a chef might taste their food to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:35.900\nThose are both tests!\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:40.100\nWe ask a question, and the test helps us find the answer.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:44.500\nFor example, a school test helps your teacher understand what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:48.900\nAnd trying out a new recipe is a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:54.200\nSo, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm what we already suspect.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:56.100\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n```"
