    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch. That's a test!\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:34.200\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned. In science, scientists run tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:48.000\nFor example, a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, before a new car is sold, it goes through many tests to make sure it\u2019s safe.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:55.700\nSo, a test is basically a way to check, measure, or evaluate something. It helps us learn and make sure things are working the way they should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
