    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_013212.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests, what they are, and why we use them.\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:19.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:41.700\nIn school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand what you've been learning.\nThey can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like showing you can solve a math problem.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:52.900\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you can make something delicious.\n\n00:52.900 --> 01:01.100\nSo, to recap, a test is a method to check something.\nIt could be your understanding of a subject, the quality of a cake, or even the effectiveness of a new idea.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:07.400\nTests help us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
