    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:34.200\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:44.500\nFor example, if you\u2019re baking a cake and you stick a toothpick in it, that\u2019s a test to see if the cake is done.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:56.400\nOr, if you try on a pair of shoes, that's a test to see if they fit. Tests help us confirm something, or learn something new.\n\n00:56.400 --> 01:00.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
