    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_013531.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment or a check-up.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.200\nWe use tests all the time to see if something is working correctly, or to measure something specific.\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:31.500\nFor example, if you're baking a cake, you might use a toothpick test to see if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:42.100\nOr, when you go to the doctor, they might run tests to see if you're healthy. Tests help us gather information and make informed decisions.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:53.500\nSo, remember, a test is a way of finding something out. It involves checking, measuring, or experimenting to get an answer.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:01.800\nIt's a fundamental tool for learning and understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
