    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_013608.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:8.700\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:12.200\nIt helps you understand if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:16.800\nFor example, a taste test can tell you if you like a new flavor of ice cream.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:21.100\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:24.100\nSchools use tests to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:28.300\nBasically, you perform an action, observe what happens, and then draw a conclusion.\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:34.200\nTests are everywhere in our daily lives, helping us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:37.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:40.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
