    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_013700.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling a really important concept: Tests!\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:14.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:30.100\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt. Even checking if the light switch works before you leave the room is a mini-test!\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:38.800\nYou are testing if the light turns on or off. So, a test is just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:47.600\nIt helps us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:53.900\nIn short, tests help us learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
