    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:16.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:33.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:40.700\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:47.700\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test! You're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:47.700 --> 00:52.000\nSo, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:56.000\nThey can tell us if something is working correctly,\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:00.400\nif we're making progress, or if we need to make changes.\n\n01:00.400 --> 01:03.900\nThey're everywhere!\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:07.200\nFrom checking if your phone battery is charged\n\n01:07.200 --> 01:10.800\nto seeing if a bridge is safe, tests are a vital part of our world.\n\n01:10.800 --> 01:14.400\nThat's the basics of what a test is.\n\n01:14.400 --> 01:17.200\nThanks for watching!\n\n01:17.200 --> 01:18.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
