    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.800\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:31.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a physical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:43.300\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to test your knowledge of a subject. Tests can come in many forms!\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:56.900\nThey could be multiple choice, true or false, or even a hands-on experiment. The important thing is they give us data to help us understand something better.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:00.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn more.\n```"
  },
