    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:13.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.700 --> 00:23.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:33.200\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:42.600\nOr, in school, you take a test to show your teacher what you've learned about a subject.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:50.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You\u2019re testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:50.500 --> 00:54.100\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and checking things out.\n```"
