    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.500 --> 00:06.000\nYou've probably taken a lot of them in school,\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:07.800\nbut what is a test, really?\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:10.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:13.800\nWe use tests to see what we know, what we can do,\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:15.100\nor even what we think.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:18.700\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:20.600\nto see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:23.500\nOr, when you take a quiz, it's a test\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:26.300\nto see how well you learned the material.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:28.100\nEven trying a new recipe is a test!\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:31.200\nYou're testing if you can make something delicious.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:33.500\nSo, tests help us understand things.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:35.200\nThey give us information.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:39.500\nThey can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying out that new recipe.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:46.800\nIn the end, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:49.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
