    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like an experiment, but often with questions or challenges.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:32.100\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:44.300\nOr, a taste test might help you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.700\nThe important thing is that a test helps us learn something new or confirm what we already know. So, to recap, a test is a method for gathering information.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.300\nIt can be a quiz, a survey, or even just trying something out to see what happens. Tests help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
