    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.600\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:28.600\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:38.200\nOr, a chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt. That's a test!\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:48.900\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Another example is checking if a lightbulb works by screwing it in.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:56.200\nThe light turning on is the result of your test. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain condition.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.700\nIt can be formal or informal, big or small. The main thing is, it helps us learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
