    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_015157.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.000\nYou've probably taken a test before, like a quiz in school. But what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.500\nEssentially, a test is just a way to find out information or see how well you know something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, abilities, or performance.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:35.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy, and a baker tests the oven to make sure the cake will bake properly.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:44.900\nTests can come in many forms, like multiple-choice questions, short answers, or even hands-on activities.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:58.400\nIf you're learning to ride a bike, your success in riding is, in a way, a test of your skills!\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:05.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a tool used to measure something. It helps us understand where we are and what we've learned.\n\n01:05.800 --> 01:07.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
