    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to check how much you know about something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:28.900\nThink of it like a little investigation into your understanding. It\u2019s how we see if you\u2019ve grasped the main ideas.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:39.900\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes with multiple choice questions to writing out longer answers.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:46.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to write words correctly.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:52.900\nOr a math test might ask you to solve problems using addition or subtraction. They all aim to see what you've learned.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:59.400\nSo, tests are simply tools to measure your knowledge. They help you and your teachers see where you're doing great, and where you might need a little more help. Remember, they're a learning opportunity! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
