    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out, like checking if your cookies are done baking, or seeing if you know the answers to a question.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you learn something new in school, you take a test to show what you've learned.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:38.100\nTests can be written, like quizzes, or practical, like riding a bike.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:46.300\nBasically, a test helps us measure or evaluate something. It gives us information!\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:49.800\nSo, a test is just a process for gathering information to see where we stand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
