    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:21.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be about you, like a quiz to see what kind of pizza topping you are, or about anything else, like checking if water boils at 100 degrees Celsius.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:28.500\nEssentially, you create a situation, then observe what happens.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:36.800\nThink of baking a cake. You're testing a recipe! You follow the steps, bake it, and then taste it to see if the recipe works.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:42.600\nOr imagine a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:52.300\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information by observing something. Remember, it's all about finding out something new!\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "8aa65c95-ce01-49c4-ad29-bfa34c9438b0": {
    "id": "8aa65c95-ce01-49c4-ad29-bfa34c9438b0",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:09:27.310501",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T01:57:00.881348",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260107_015700.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_015700.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:21.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\nYou poke it with a toothpick, that\u2019s a test!\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:30.900\nIn science, tests are usually more structured.\nWe create experiments to see if our ideas are correct.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:40.800\nFor example, you might test if adding fertilizer makes a plant grow faster.\nYou'd have some plants with fertilizer and some without, and then compare the results.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:46.200\nTests aren't always about right or wrong answers.\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:50.200\nThey show us what works and what doesn't.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:57.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and understand the world around us better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "ea656287-be2d-4252-a11b-afe21cc03904": {
    "id": "ea656287-be2d-4252-a11b-afe21cc03904",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:09:28.084222",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T01:57:50.151404",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260107_015750.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_015750.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.500\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, and that's true!\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:24.200\nBut in general, a test is just a way to check if something works the way it\u2019s supposed to.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:29.400\nThink of it like this: you\u2019re baking a cake.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:34.600\nYou can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:41.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done! That's a test.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:46.800\nOr, imagine you\u2019re building a birdhouse.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:53.100\nYou can test its strength by gently pushing on the sides. If it doesn't fall apart, it passes the test!\n\n00:53.100 --> 01:05.100\nSo, a test is simply a way to see if something meets a certain requirement or works correctly. It could be a written exam, a physical check, or even just observing something.\n\n01:05.100 --> 01:12.400\nThe important thing is to have a way to confirm that things are working as expected.\n\n01:12.400 --> 01:19.700\nIn short, tests help us make sure things are good!\n\n01:19.700 --> 01:26.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "b384e63f-6aff-4044-a047-3d6a19787269": {
    "id": "b384e63f-6aff-4044-a047-3d6a19787269",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
