    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:24.600\nIt could be anything! Think of it like a detective looking for clues.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:36.500\nWe use tests all the time without even realizing it. For example, if you try a new recipe and taste it, that\u2019s a test to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:45.400\nOr, if you press a button on your phone, that's a test to see if it works.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:55.500\nTests can be formal too, like the spelling tests you might take in school. Those tests help your teacher understand what words you know. Basically, a test is just a structured way to get information. So, the next time you're checking something out, remember, you're running a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
