    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:15.300\nIn pretty much everything we do, we need to check if something works, right?\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:21.200\nThat's basically what a test is.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:27.800\nIt's a way to see if something does what it's supposed to do.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:34.400\nThink about it like this: you bake a cake and you taste it.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:37.800\nThat's a test!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:44.100\nYou're testing if it's sweet enough and tastes good.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:50.800\nOr, imagine you're building with LEGOs. You might test if the tower you built is strong enough to hold another LEGO block.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.700\nSo, testing is just checking something.\n```"
