    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.700\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:23.000\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:32.200\nWe use tests all the time to see if things are working, to learn new things, or to check our understanding.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:38.800\nThink about it: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:45.400\nOr a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you learned the lesson.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:54.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.300\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information.\n```"
