    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:22.600\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand more.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:33.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:37.100\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:40.900\nEven trying on a new pair of shoes is a kind of test to see if they fit!\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:51.000\nTests aren't just in school. They're everywhere! They help us learn, make decisions, and improve things.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:52.200\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a tool for learning and discovery.\n```"
