    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_020528.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nHey there, welcome! Today we're tackling something fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:44.500\nEven a simple experiment in science class is a type of test! So, whether it's a pop quiz at school, trying out a new recipe, or checking if your car is working correctly, you're using a test to get information.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:50.800\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve. That\u2019s the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
