    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.210 --> 00:04.110\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.110 --> 00:06.670\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.670 --> 00:14.210\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us learn more about a person, an object, or even an idea.\n\n00:14.210 --> 00:19.680\nThink about it like this: When you go to the doctor, they might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:19.680 --> 00:24.860\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to show what words you know.\n\n00:24.860 --> 00:28.880\nTests can also be used to check if a product is safe or works correctly.\n\n00:28.880 --> 00:32.470\nSo, tests help us gather information.\n\n00:32.470 --> 00:40.000\nThey're used in all sorts of situations, from checking your eyesight to making sure a new toy is safe for kids.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:43.580\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:43.580 --> 00:47.770\nThat\u2019s a quick overview of what tests are all about.\n\n00:47.770 --> 00:49.770\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
