    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_020909.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:19.900\nToday we're talking about tests.\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:30.300\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, that helps us understand how good something is, or how well someone knows something.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:47.800\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nOr a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it works.\nEven baking a cake is like a test \u2013 you\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it turns out yummy!\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:54.900\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, trying out a new idea, or even baking something delicious, tests help us learn and improve.\nThey give us information to make better decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
