    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_020950.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.800\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:01.800 --> 00:06.100\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:10.700\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:10.700 --> 00:13.100\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:16.500\nThink about baking a cake.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:19.300\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:23.600\nOr, imagine you're buying a new phone.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:27.200\nYou might try out the camera to test its picture quality.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:32.700\nTests can be formal, like a school exam that checks what you've learned.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:37.900\nOr they can be informal, like checking if your shoes fit before you go for a walk.\n\n00:37.900 --> 00:42.500\nThe main idea is that a test helps you evaluate something or someone.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:47.900\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for gathering information.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
