    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE\nAll timings are approximate and may need fine-tuning.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:19.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process used to evaluate knowledge, skill, or performance.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:31.700\nThink of it like this: you use a test to see if your cake is done baking, right? You poke it with a toothpick, and if it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:40.900\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what students have learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:49.700\nA driving test checks if you know how to operate a car safely. So, a test is just a tool to measure or assess something.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:53.200\nRemember, tests help us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
