    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.400\nWhat is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:19.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb actually lights up.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:28.600\nThere are all sorts of tests.\nYou might take a spelling test in school, which shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:40.000\nOr, a scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people feel better.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:46.500\nAnother example: a baker might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:53.300\nThey're checking if it meets their standard!\nSo, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:59.800\nIt could be your knowledge, a product, or even an idea.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:08.900\nTo recap, a test is a way to check knowledge or function through examples.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
