    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_021239.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and looking for the answer.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:23.100\nThink about it: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nA taste test helps you decide which food you like best.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:27.000\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\nSee? They all help us learn something.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:35.800\nFor example, you might test if a toy car rolls faster on carpet or on wood.\nYou try it on both, and see which goes farther!\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:40.800\nThat's a test!\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:51.900\nSo, a test is just a simple way to explore, question, and learn more about the world around us.\nIt helps us discover new things.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
