    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:07.600\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:14.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:19.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:24.300\nThink about it.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:26.300\nWhen you try a new food, you're testing if you like it.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:29.200\nOr, if you push a button, you're testing what that button does.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:34.600\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:38.700\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just activities in class.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:41.800\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:45.800\nSo, a test helps us understand something by giving us data to examine.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:53.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a method of gathering information to understand something.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nSimple as that!\n\n00:57.300 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
