    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:17.200\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. It's how we find out if something works, if something is true, or how well someone understands something.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:26.700\nThink about it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it's fun.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:38.400\nOr, your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. In school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:43.900\nSo, for example, a simple test for a lightbulb is to screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:49.800\nIf it lights up, the test passes! If it doesn't, the test fails. Easy, right?\n\n00:49.800 --> 01:00.900\nEssentially, a test is just a method to get information. It helps us make decisions and learn new things.\n\n01:00.900 --> 01:04.599\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to check something out!\n\n01:04.599 --> 01:08.199\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
