    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:26.800\nTests help us understand what someone knows, how well something works, or even what's wrong.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:37.500\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words. A taste test tells you which food you like best.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:47.400\nAnd, if your car isn't running right, a mechanic might run a diagnostic test to find the problem.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.500\nSo, remember, tests are tools that give us information. They help us learn, improve, and solve problems. They are a fundamental part of learning and discovering new things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
