    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:10.200\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.200 --> 00:24.600\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. Tests can be anything from a simple yes or no question, like, \"Is the light on?\" to something more complex, like a math exam.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.500\nThe point is to gather information. For example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:37.700\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:44.600\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:51.500\nIt helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
