    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.200\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in this case, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:24.800\nIt\u2019s like giving something a little nudge to see how it responds.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:33.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a lightbulb by flipping the switch. If it lights up, the test passes!\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:44.700\nOr, you could test if your shoelaces are tied tight by giving them a little tug. If they stay put, they pass the test!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:53.700\nTests are super important because they help us find problems early on, before they become bigger issues.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:58.200\nSo, testing is all about checking things, giving them a little nudge, and making sure they're working the way they should. That's it! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
