    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:10.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:10.900 --> 00:15.800\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on.\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:22.000\nYou want to see if it's working properly.\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:31.200\nLike, a teacher might give you a test in school to see what you\u2019ve learned.\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:38.000\nEven baking a cake is kind of like a test!\nYou're testing your recipe and your baking skills.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:49.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out.\nIt\u2019s a simple way to check if something works, or if you understand something.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:55.400\nIt's all about gathering information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
