    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:22.500\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate something, like your knowledge, a product's quality, or even how well something works.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:33.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks what words you know. Or, imagine a chef tasting soup \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:42.200\nEven testing a toy to see if it\u2019s safe for kids is still a test. So, tests help us understand things better.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:53.400\nThey give us information and help us make decisions. They can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit.\n\n00:53.400 --> 01:00.800\nEssentially, a test is just a way to learn something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
