    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.400\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something specific. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\nA taste test checks how something tastes.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:26.800\nA medical test checks your health. Each test has a specific goal: to give us information!\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:37.700\nFor example, you might take a test in school to see how well you understand a subject.\nOr, a mechanic might run a test on your car to find out why it's not working properly.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:51.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information or evaluating something.\nThey come in many forms, but they all share the same purpose: to help us understand.\n\n00:51.400 --> 01:01.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
