    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:24.800\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:36.300\nA doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. A teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:52.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious! So, tests help us learn information, check for problems, or just see if something works as expected.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:54.000\nThey can be simple or complex, but the basic idea is always the same: to get an answer.\n```"
