    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.000\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:29.600\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even just the quality of something. Think about it like this: when you take a spelling test in school, it helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:38.300\nOr, if you\u2019re buying a new phone, you might read reviews \u2013 those are essentially tests performed by other users!\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:42.600\nAnother example is a taste test.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:46.900\nIs this juice sweet enough?\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:50.800\nIs this cookie too crunchy?\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:54.700\nThese are all tests!\n\n00:54.700 --> 01:05.700\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for evaluating something. It helps us learn, understand, and make better decisions.\n\n01:05.700 --> 01:07.800\nAnd now you know the basics of tests!\n\n01:07.800 --> 01:14.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
