    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process designed to give you information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:25.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows what words you know.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:32.300\nA taste test tells you which flavor is best.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:43.700\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a type of test! You're trying to figure out if it's functional.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:53.300\nFor example, a doctor might use a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, a software company might test their new program to make sure it doesn't have any bugs.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.900\nSo, in short, a test is a method used to evaluate or assess something. It helps us learn and make decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
