    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it like asking a question and then finding the answer.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:25.300\nFor example, a spelling test helps us see how well we know our spelling words. Or, a taste test can help us decide which cookie tastes the best.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:31.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes! Maybe you have a math test at school.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:44.700\nThat test shows how much you've learned about adding, subtracting, multiplying, and dividing. Or, you might even test out a new toy to see how it works and if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:55.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or measure what we already know. They help us understand things better and improve!\n\n00:55.500 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
