    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:11.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:15.200\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.400\nThink about it. Have you ever taken a quiz in school? That's a test! It helps your teacher see what you've learned.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.300\nOr maybe you've taken a taste test to see which flavor of ice cream you like best. That's another kind of test!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:43.000\nTests can be used to check if something is working, like testing a new toy to see if it\u2019s fun. They can also help us learn new things about the world around us.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:49.000\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and answer a question.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:51.000\nRemember, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
