    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something.\nThink of it like a tool to measure knowledge, skills, or even abilities.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:23.500\nWe use tests every day without even realizing it!\nWhen you try a new recipe, you're \"testing\" if it tastes good.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:33.500\nOr, when you see if your key opens a door, that's a test too!\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:42.300\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words.\nA math test shows how well you understand numbers.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:52.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new about yourself or the world around you.\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
