    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let\u2019s talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure, like an experiment or a questionnaire, designed to measure something specific.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:25.200\nThink about it like this: a math test measures your math skills.\nA taste test tells you how something tastes.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:41.400\nA medical test helps doctors understand what's happening inside your body.\nSo, whether it\u2019s checking if a cake is done by poking it with a fork, or answering questions to see what kind of animal you are, you're performing a test.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:49.700\nBasically, any time you want to learn something by gathering information in a structured way, you're using a test.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:58.500\nTo sum it up, tests are tools we use to measure and learn things.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
