    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.890\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.890 --> 00:03.140\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.410 --> 00:04.710\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.970 --> 00:08.230\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:08.420 --> 00:12.370\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:12.690 --> 00:15.230\nTests can be anything from a simple quiz in school to a medical exam.\n\n00:15.560 --> 00:18.550\nA quiz helps your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:18.850 --> 00:22.010\nA medical exam helps your doctor understand your health.\n\n00:22.240 --> 00:27.160\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done, you can stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:27.410 --> 00:30.510\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's your test!\n\n00:30.510 --> 00:32.710\nIt tells you the cake is ready.\n\n00:32.950 --> 00:35.000\nAnother example: a taste test!\n\n00:35.330 --> 00:37.210\nYou taste food to see if you like it.\n\n00:37.480 --> 00:42.500\nSo, a test is a method to gather information and make a decision.\n\n00:42.750 --> 00:46.490\nIt gives us evidence to understand something better.\n\n00:46.820 --> 00:47.680\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
