    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:19.800\nA test is basically a way to check how much you know about something. Think of it like this: you've been learning about animals, and a test helps see if you remember what you learned.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:31.100\nIt could be answering questions, like \"What sound does a cat make?\", or maybe even showing what you know, like drawing a picture of a dog.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:41.600\nTests aren't meant to be scary! They're just tools to help you and your teachers understand what you're good at and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:51.900\nSo, a test is a way to check knowledge, involves questions or tasks, and helps you learn. Pretty simple, right?\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
