    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE This subtitles file was automatically generated by an AI.  Please review and edit as needed.\n\n00:00.130 --> 00:01.530\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.530 --> 00:03.880\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:03.880 --> 00:06.070\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:06.530 --> 00:08.490\nThink of it like this: you want to know if the oven is hot.\n\n00:08.760 --> 00:11.420\nYou might put your hand near it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:11.790 --> 00:14.350\nOr, maybe you want to know if an apple is ripe.\n\n00:14.350 --> 00:16.230\nYou might squeeze it gently.\n\n00:16.230 --> 00:16.840\nAgain, that's a test!\n\n00:17.310 --> 00:21.200\nTests aren't just about ovens and apples.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:23.840\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.140 --> 00:26.970\nTeachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:27.210 --> 00:29.790\nAnd scientists use tests to explore the world around us.\n\n00:30.340 --> 00:32.960\nSo, a test is simply a way to check something and get an answer.\n\n00:33.480 --> 00:40.120\nWhether it's checking if the oven is hot or understanding a complicated scientific idea, tests help us learn and understand.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:43.280\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
