    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_025209.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.200\nEver wonder what a test really is?\n\n00:04.200 --> 00:8.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:13.600\nIt could be figuring out if you know your ABCs, seeing if a cake is ready,\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:17.600\nor even checking if a plant needs water.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:20.800\nBasically, you do something, and then you observe the result.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:24.800\nIf you answer all the ABC questions correctly, you pass the test.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:28.500\nIf a toothpick comes out clean from the cake, it's done.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:32.800\nIf the plant's soil is dry, it needs water.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:38.300\nSo, think of a test as a simple experiment. You\u2019re trying to learn something by doing something!\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:45.100\nIn short, a test is a procedure used to gather data about something.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:49.400\nYou perform the procedure, observe the results, and learn from them.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:55.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
