    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.400\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check if something is working correctly, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:25.600\nThink of it like this: you're baking a cake, and you use a toothpick to see if it's done.\n\n00:25.600 --> 00:33.000\nThat toothpick test tells you if the cake is ready. Tests can be big or small.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:41.700\nMaybe a scientist is testing a new medicine to see if it helps people. Or maybe you're testing out a new video game to see if you like it.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:54.900\nThe key is, you're gathering information to make a decision. So, to recap, a test is a way to gather information and check something.\n\n00:54.900 --> 01:00.800\nIt helps us understand if something is working as expected, or if it meets a certain standard. Keep testing and keep learning! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
