    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.600 --> 00:05.400\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:07.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:10.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something,\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:14.000\nor to see how well someone or something performs.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:16.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:18.600\nto see if you're healthy.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:22.200\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:23.400\nSee?\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:24.400\nDifferent things, same idea.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:29.200\nAnother example could be testing a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids,\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:32.200\nor even tasting a new recipe to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:35.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to evaluate something.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:40.700\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:43.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
