    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_025550.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:24.800\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something. Think of it like a simple question with a specific answer.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:33.900\nFor example, a temperature check is a test to see if you have a fever. A taste test helps us decide which flavor of ice cream we like best.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:46.500\nAnd in school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned! So, tests are all around us, helping us understand the world better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:54.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and discover new things. In short, a test is just a tool to gather information.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "ce3822be-81fb-4c6c-99ea-04e902da0247": {
    "id": "ce3822be-81fb-4c6c-99ea-04e902da0247",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:10:25.511318",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T02:56:35.574278",
