    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:28.100\nIt helps us learn about ourselves, about objects, or really anything we're curious about.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:40.500\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer. For example, a spelling test shows how well you know your words. A taste test lets you decide which cookie is your favorite. Even a simple experiment, like dropping a ball to see if it bounces, is a kind of test!\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:49.300\nEssentially, a test uses a specific method to gather information.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:57.400\nWhether it's a school exam or just trying out a new recipe, tests help us understand the world around us a little better. So remember, a test is just a way to explore and learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
