    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_030306.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.300\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests. What are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us measure or evaluate something, like knowledge, skill, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:29.300\nThink of it like this: a spelling test tells you how well you know your spelling words. Or a taste test helps decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:39.000\nIn science, a test might involve mixing chemicals to see what happens. We could test how strong a bridge is by putting weight on it.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:49.100\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:57.700\nIn short, tests are a way of gathering information and assessing something specific.\n\n00:57.700 --> 00:59.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
