    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_030605.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:22.800\nThink of it like this: You might taste a cake to test if it's sweet enough. Or, a doctor might check your temperature to test if you have a fever.\n\n00:22.800 --> 00:31.400\nThese are both types of tests! In school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:38.800\nThey might be multiple choice, short answers, or even projects. The goal is to show what you know.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:48.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn more. It helps us understand something better.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:51.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
