    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_030659.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.000\nNow, when you hear the word \"test,\" you might think of school, but in general, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:29.600\nIt helps us see if something is working correctly, or if something is true or false. Think about it like this: a doctor uses tests to check your health, like measuring your temperature or blood pressure.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:39.400\nA baker might taste their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar. Even when you try on a new pair of shoes, you're testing if they fit!\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:50.600\nSo, tests are all about finding information and making sure things are as they should be. They help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:56.800\nIn short, a test is just a way to find out more about something.\n\n00:56.800 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
