    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.100\nHello, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:12.700\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:18.700\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz to test what you learned in class.\n\n00:18.700 --> 00:25.100\nOr, maybe you're baking a cake and you taste a little bit of the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes right!\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:33.600\nOther examples could be testing a new toy to see if it's safe, or even testing the weather by looking outside to see if it's raining.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:42.300\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to find out information. It helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:53.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
