    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_030915.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nWhat are they? Simply put, a test is a way to check something, to see if it works correctly or meets certain standards.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.900\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it\u2019s sweet enough.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:38.900\nOr, a doctor might test your vision to see how well you can see. In science and many other fields, tests are used to gather information and prove or disprove ideas.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:50.000\nFor example, you could test if a plant grows faster with more sunlight. You'd give one plant more sun and compare it to a plant with less sun.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:56.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to check something and learn more about it. It helps us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
