    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a method for gathering information and seeing what you know, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:27.900\nThink about it like this: A doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\nOr, a teacher might give you a test in class to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:41.100\nTests can be written questions, like multiple choice, or they can be practical, like driving a car.\nThe important thing is that they help us measure and understand something.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:52.500\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\nIt helps us learn and improve!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
