    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate or measure something, like your knowledge, skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:31.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school checks how well you know your words. Or, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. These are both examples of tests.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:42.300\nTests can be formal, like an exam, or informal, like checking the temperature of bathwater.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:54.200\nNo matter what, they help us understand something better by giving us information. So, remember, a test is simply a method to learn or measure something.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
