    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nOkay, so you've probably heard the word \"test\" before,\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:04.400\nbut what does it really mean?\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:07.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:11.400\nIt's a way to check if something is true, or to see how well something works.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:15.400\nThink of it like this: you might test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:18.900\nOr, you might test a new toy to see if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:25.100\nIn science, we use tests to see if our ideas about the world are correct.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:31.500\nFor example, we could test if plants grow better in sunlight by putting some in the sun and some in the shade and watching what happens.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:37.700\nSo, a test is just a way to check things out and learn something new.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:41.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
