    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_031842.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\nThink about it like this: you might take a test in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:29.500\nOr, a doctor might run tests to check your health.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:43.100\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\nYou're testing if your recipe and method work to create a delicious result.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:54.800\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and even just see if something works as planned.\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from simple yes or no questions to complex experiments.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:06.200\nEssentially, a test helps us gather information.\nTo recap, a test is a process of asking a question, performing an action, or making an observation to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:06.200 --> 01:09.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
