    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.400\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like a detective looking for clues. We use tests to find out if something is working correctly, or if it's true.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:37.600\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Even baking a cake is like a test \u2013 you're testing if the ingredients and oven work together to create something delicious!\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:48.800\nSo, in simple terms, a test is a way to find information or confirm something. It helps us learn and make sure things are as they should be.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:56.600\nWe hope this helped you understand the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
