    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.900\nWhat is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:18.500\nThink of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer. We use tests all the time!\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:28.700\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:40.400\nA baker tests their cake by poking it with a toothpick to see if it's done. Or, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:50.400\nSo, tests help us learn, understand, and make decisions. They give us information!\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:56.700\nWhether it's checking if a cake is baked, or seeing how much you've learned in class, tests are useful tools. That's the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
