    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_032044.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:13.900\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:22.000\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\nThe test helps you get closer to that answer.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:32.500\nFor example, if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:39.700\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is likely ready.\nOr, imagine you're trying to figure out if a toy car needs new batteries.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:50.200\nYou might try to turn it on.\nIf it doesn't work, that's a test showing the batteries are probably dead.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:59.100\nSo, a test is really just a method or procedure used to determine something.\nWe use them all the time, even without realizing it.\nThey help us make decisions and understand the world around us a little bit better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
