    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:24.600\nIt's how we find out if something is working correctly, or if something is true. Think about it like this: you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:32.900\nOr, maybe you test the temperature of bathwater to make sure it's not too hot or too cold.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:39.600\nAnother example? Imagine you're baking a cake. You might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:46.500\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, then the cake passes the test! So, tests are everywhere.\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:53.400\nThey help us learn, stay safe, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:53.400 --> 00:55.800\nTests are simply a way of checking something.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
