    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_032207.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:10.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.000 --> 00:15.000\nIt\u2019s a process we use to gather information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:20.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:23.000\nThere are all sorts of tests.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:27.000\nYou might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:30.000\nA chef might taste a soup to test its flavor.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:36.000\nA mechanic might run a test on your car engine to make sure it's running smoothly.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:42.000\nSo, basically, a test is any action taken to evaluate or examine something.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:46.000\nIt helps us understand, diagnose, or confirm things.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:49.000\nRemember, tests are about learning and improving!\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
