  "04a3313a-b34e-4829-bdac-744a8e8809f3": {
    "id": "04a3313a-b34e-4829-bdac-744a8e8809f3",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:10:47.270671",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T03:22:56.324958",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260107_032256.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_032256.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests! You've probably taken a lot of them, but what is a test, really?\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like checking your knowledge. It can be a simple quiz in school, or even trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:35.200\nThe quiz checks what you learned in class, and the recipe test\u2026 well, it tests your cooking skills!\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:46.400\nAnother example? Imagine you\u2019re trying to fix a bike. You might try different things \u2013 tightening a bolt, oiling the chain \u2013 each try is a test to see if it fixes the problem.\n\n00:46.400 --> 00:57.900\nIf the bike works, the test was successful! So, a test is just a way to check something, learn something, or see if something works.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:05.400\nIt's a fundamental part of learning and problem-solving. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "e3772c32-71f3-4ae6-b964-36139810c617": {
    "id": "e3772c32-71f3-4ae6-b964-36139810c617",
