    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:23.000\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information.\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:30.000\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned.\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even projects.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:40.100\nTests aren't just about grades, though!\nThey help you see what you understand well and what you might need to work on.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:51.300\nFor example, a spelling test shows you which words you need to practice.\nOr, a science experiment tests your understanding of a scientific principle.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:58.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to learn and improve.\nIt helps you and others understand what you know.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
