    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.000\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well someone knows something.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:24.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to make sure it doesn't break easily, or a doctor might test your eyesight to see if you need glasses.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:31.000\nTests can come in many forms. You might take a written test at school with multiple choice questions.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:43.600\nOr, a chef might test a new recipe by tasting it and adjusting the seasonings. Even when you try a new video game demo, you're essentially testing it to see if you like it!\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:57.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a check or examination used to evaluate something. Whether it\u2019s a school exam or trying out a new flavour of ice cream, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:01.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
