    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_033116.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.000\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like this: we use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.300\nA test helps us evaluate or measure something. It could be anything!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:39.900\nWe might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. Or, a doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:47.500\nFor example, when you take a spelling test at school, it shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:53.700\nAnd, when you try out a new video game, you're testing to see if you like it. See? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:00.000\nSo, a test is just a process to gather information and learn more about something. It helps us understand things better.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:01.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
