    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_033158.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:06.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:12.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:17.000\nThink about it: you taste food to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.400\nA doctor might order blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:25.300\nIn school, tests help us see how well we've learned something.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:28.500\nIt's like a measuring stick for knowledge!\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:32.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks if we know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:37.000\nA math test checks our understanding of numbers and equations.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.000\nSo, tests are just tools to help us understand where we are and where we might need to focus our learning.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:49.500\nThey're not scary monsters, just helpful checkpoints on our journey.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:55.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
