    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.900\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:32.600\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You screw it in, flip the switch \u2013 that's your test!\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:39.900\nYou're testing if the bulb lights up. Tests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big exams.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:47.200\nA spelling test checks your knowledge of words, while a driving test checks your ability to operate a car.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:55.000\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information. It helps us understand what we know and what we need to learn.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:57.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for learning and improvement.\n```"
