    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:21.900\nThat's a test! Tests help us check if things are working as they should.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:34.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a physical exam to test your overall health. Or, when you build with LEGOs, you might test to see if your tower can stand on its own.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:49.900\nSo, tests are all about finding answers and checking how things are going. Whether it's baking a cake, visiting the doctor, or building with LEGOs, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:56.700\nThey are a crucial part of learning and improving! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "e85b6199-3a45-4ee2-aa88-5fc774b431be": {
    "id": "e85b6199-3a45-4ee2-aa88-5fc774b431be",
