    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_033952.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate something's quality, performance, or reliability.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:36.400\nTests aren't just for people, either!\nEngineers test bridges to make sure they're strong enough to hold cars.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:41.800\nSoftware developers test their code to make sure it works correctly.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:48.900\nSee?\nTests are everywhere!\nThey help us make informed decisions and ensure things are working as they should.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:59.800\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, your health, or the strength of a bridge.\nIt helps us understand and improve things.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:06.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
