    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer, or a puzzle you're trying to solve.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:35.400\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nFor example, if you're baking a cake and you stick a toothpick in it, that's a test!\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:43.800\nYou're testing if the cake is done.\nOr, if you try turning a key in a lock, you're testing if it's the right key.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:54.800\nThe result of the test gives you information.\nSo, a test is just a procedure designed to gather information.\nIt helps us understand something better and make decisions.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.400\nWhether it\u2019s a cake, a key, or something much more complex, tests are everywhere!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
