    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_034137.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you information.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:29.800\nIt could be a quiz at school, a medical exam, or even just trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:38.700\nThe main idea behind any test is to measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:41.600\nWe want to know how well someone understands a topic, how healthy a person is, or if an idea works.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:48.200\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:51.100\nA taste test tells you which soda people prefer.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:54.300\nEven checking if a light bulb works is a simple test!\n\n00:54.300 --> 01:01.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.500\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n01:04.500 --> 01:06.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
