    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.200\nWhat is a test, exactly?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:21.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\nThink about it: a taste test tells you which food tastes better.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:29.600\nA spelling test shows you how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, a doctor might run some tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.600 --> 00:38.800\nThe important thing to remember is that tests help us learn.\nThey show us what we already know, and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:44.800\nSo don't be afraid of tests!\nThey're just tools to help us understand things better.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:57.000\nIn short, tests are questions, experiments, or procedures used to get information about something.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
