    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.900 --> 00:02.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.900 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:14.100\nIt's a process that helps us evaluate or measure something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:18.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling knowledge.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:22.300\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes best.\n\n00:22.300 --> 00:27.000\nEven a weather forecast is a kind of test, predicting what the weather will be like!\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.400\nTests can be as simple as asking a question, or as complex as a long exam.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:36.900\nThe important thing is that they give us information.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:46.000\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new about ourselves, or the world around us.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:57.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
