    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_034500.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process of gathering information to see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:24.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:35.600\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. Scientists use tests all the time to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:45.600\nThey might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better. So, remember, a test is just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:54.800\nIt's a method to understand something better, whether it's your spelling skills, a cake recipe, or a brand new medicine.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "2d5474ad-5d2d-45f3-b489-852c18f1cbad": {
    "id": "2d5474ad-5d2d-45f3-b489-852c18f1cbad",
