    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_034546.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.200\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:08.500\nIt helps measure your understanding of a specific topic.\n\n00:08.800 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it like this: imagine you've been learning about animals.\nA test might ask you to identify different animals or explain what they eat.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:21.300\nTests aren't just about getting a grade.\nThey help you and your teachers see what you've learned well and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:27.800\nFor example, if a test shows you struggled with fractions, you know you need to focus on practicing those.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:33.900\nTests can be quizzes, exams, or even just simple activities.\nThey all serve the same purpose: to check your knowledge.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:37.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn and grow!\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:42.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
