    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nThink of it like an experiment, where you\u2019re trying to get information.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:27.600\nThis could be testing anything from how well you know your multiplication tables, to seeing if a new recipe tastes good, or even checking if a toy car still works after you drop it.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:37.100\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\nBaking a cake is like testing a recipe.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:46.500\nAnd trying a new video game is a test to see if you enjoy it!\n\n00:46.500 --> 00:55.100\nSo, a test is just a way of learning more and checking things out.\nIt's all about discovery!\n\n00:55.100 --> 01:04.900\nSo remember, a test is a way of learning something new or checking if something works.\nIt's a common part of life, and it helps us understand the world around us.\n\n01:04.900 --> 01:08.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
