    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really fundamental: the concept of a test.\n\n00:08.800 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:23.900\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:34.100\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer through observation or experimentation.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:40.600\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:50.400\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to check your understanding of a subject. Even baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:54.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for learning something new. It helps us understand things better by providing evidence.\n```"
