    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:9.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.800 --> 00:18.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:24.600\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:36.600\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you've learned.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:43.200\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test! You're testing to see if you like it.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:49.800\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:55.100\nWhether it's knowing your blood type or knowing the capital of France, tests help us learn and grow.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.300\nRemember, they're just a tool.\n```"
