    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_034958.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and then figuring out the answer.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done. You can test it by sticking a toothpick in the middle.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:26.500\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready! That's a test.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:34.200\nOr maybe you're taking a spelling test at school. The test is designed to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.500\nAnother example is a doctor giving you a physical exam. They're testing your health to make sure everything is working properly.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:54.600\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new. It can be as simple as checking a cake, or as complex as a medical exam.\n\n00:54.600 --> 01:00.600\nIt\u2019s all about finding answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
