    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:18.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something specific. Think of it like checking if something is true or false, or measuring how well you know something.\n\n00:18.900 --> 00:29.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.400 --> 00:39.000\nOr, your teacher might give you a quiz to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:52.600\nEven tasting a new food is a kind of test to see if you like it! So, tests help us gather information and make decisions. They come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic purpose: to learn something new.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.200\nHopefully, that gives you a good starting point to understand what tests are all about. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
