    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests. What are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills. For example, a spelling test checks how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:33.900\nA driving test checks if you can safely operate a car. Even a taste test, like trying different flavors of ice cream, is a kind of test!\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:40.800\nBasically, tests help us understand what we've learned and where we might need a little more practice.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:53.600\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, from quick quizzes to big exams. So next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a tool to help you learn and grow.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
