    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_035326.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests!\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.500\nA test is really just a way to find out something.\nThink of it as a question, or a set of questions, that help us understand if something is working, or how well something is working.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:28.100\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:37.400\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:54.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\nYou\u2019re testing if the recipe works by following the instructions and seeing if it tastes good.\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.900\nThey come in many forms, but the core idea is always the same: to gather information and learn something new.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
