    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.800\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:23.400\nWe use them all the time to check our knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:31.500\nThink about it. A spelling test checks how well you know your words. A taste test helps you decide which cookie is tastier.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:43.500\nOr imagine a builder testing the strength of a new bridge before cars drive over it. They need to be sure it's safe!\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:47.200\nSo, basically, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. It helps us make informed decisions and understand the world around us a little better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
