    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.600\nWell, simply put, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\nYou use a toothpick as a test!\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:32.200\nThe main idea behind any test is to get information.\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets a certain standard.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:39.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\nA strength test checks how much weight you can lift.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:51.800\nEven tasting your food is a test to see if it needs more salt!\nSo, a test is a method for gathering information about something, whether it's your spelling skills, the strength of a bridge, or the deliciousness of your dinner.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:57.000\nIt helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
