    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:06.800\nToday we're going to explore the concept of a \"test.\"\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:10.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information or check something.\n\n00:10.200 --> 00:14.300\nThink of it like this: you might test the temperature of water to see if it's hot enough for tea.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:17.900\nOr, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:24.100\nTests can be formal, like a school exam that shows how well you've learned something.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:28.500\nThey can also be informal, like testing out a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:37.100\nSo, a test is really just a method for finding out information, big or small, formal or informal.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:40.300\nIt helps us understand something better.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:42.600\nThat's the basic idea of a test.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:43.900\nThanks for watching!\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
