    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:04.800\nIn the simplest terms, a test\nis just a way to find something out.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:07.100\nIt's a process designed to answer a question.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:12.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:13.500\nThat's a test!\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:16.400\nThe toothpick coming out clean tells you it's ready.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:20.600\nOr maybe you want to know if you understand a new concept, so you answer some questions about it.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:21.900\nThat's also a test!\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:26.100\nTests aren't just about getting a grade.\nThey help us learn and see what we already know.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:33.600\nThey can be as simple as checking the weather forecast to decide what to wear, or as complex as a doctor running bloodwork.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:37.800\nBasically, if you're checking something to get an answer, you're performing a test.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:43.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information to answer a question.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:46.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
