    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:27.100\nIt's a process designed to give us information, like checking if something works, or measuring how well you've learned something.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:36.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:45.300\nOr, you might take a spelling test in school to see how many words you know.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:54.100\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if your recipe and ingredients will come together to make something delicious.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:59.700\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same purpose: to give us useful information.\n```"
