    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:27.600\nIt helps us understand if something works, if something is true, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:44.100\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. A teacher gives you a test to see how well you learned a subject. Or, you might even \"test the waters\" before jumping into a pool to see if it's cold!\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:52.200\nSo, tests come in many forms, but the basic idea is always the same: to get information and learn something. They help us make decisions and understand the world around us better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
