    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:24.100\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:34.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor runs tests to figure out what\u2019s going on with your body.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:48.300\nTests come in many forms. It could be a multiple-choice quiz in school, a blood test at the clinic, or even tasting a new recipe to see if it's good.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:57.500\nThe goal is always the same: to gather information and make a judgment based on that information. So, a test helps us learn something new or confirm what we already suspect.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.000\nIn short, a test is a structured way to gather information and evaluate something. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
