    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_040738.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:05.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:8.100\nIt's a process we use to gather information.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:11.100\nWe test things all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:14.800\nThink about it. If you're baking a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:18.000\nThat's a test to see if it's done!\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:21.200\nOr imagine you're trying to open a door.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:23.400\nYou jiggle the handle and push.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:25.400\nThat's a test to see if it's locked.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:29.200\nIn school, tests help us see how well we understand a subject.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:33.400\nScientists use tests to prove or disprove ideas.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:37.600\nBasically, a test is any kind of experiment or procedure that helps us learn something new.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:42.100\nSo remember, a test is just a way to get answers!\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:47.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
