    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:24.700\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if something needs improvement. Think of it like this: you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:34.200\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. In computers and technology, we also use tests all the time!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:42.000\nWe might test a new app to see if it works without crashing, or test a website to make sure it loads quickly.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:51.900\nSo, tests are just a way of checking things, making sure they're doing what they're supposed to do, and giving us useful information.\n\n00:51.900 --> 00:60.200\nTests are important for making sure everything works the way it should. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
