    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.000\nIt helps us understand if something works, or if we know something.\nThink about it like this: a spelling test at school checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:30.700\nOr, a taste test might see if you can tell the difference between two different flavors of ice cream!\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:37.100\nTests aren't just for school, though.\nEngineers use tests to make sure bridges are strong.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:47.500\nChefs test recipes to make them delicious.\nEven you test things every day, like checking if the water is warm enough before you get in the shower.\n\n00:47.500 --> 01:03.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\nWhether it's about spelling, flavors, or building bridges, tests help us understand the world around us.\n\n01:03.100 --> 01:06.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
