    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:20.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:29.800\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:33.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:37.800\nYou stick a toothpick in it \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:41.800\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:45.800\nOr, maybe you want to see if your toy car still works.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:50.900\nYou put batteries in it and turn it on. Does it move? That's another kind of test!\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:52.500\nTests help us confirm things,\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:54.800\ncheck if something works, or even just learn more.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:04.400\nSo, a test is just a simple way to check or find out something. It\u2019s all about asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n01:04.400 --> 01:06.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
