    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:19.700\nYou've probably taken lots of them in school, but what exactly is a test?\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:27.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:36.800\nIt's a process we use to check knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:47.200\nThink of it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:49.800\nA taste test checks if food tastes good.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:52.400\nEven a doctor uses tests to find out if you're healthy!\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:55.000\nSo, we use tests to gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:04.900\nFor example, your teacher uses tests to see what you've learned in class. A car manufacturer uses tests to make sure their cars are safe.\n\n01:04.900 --> 01:07.500\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n01:07.500 --> 01:17.400\nBasically, a test is just a structured way to get answers. It helps us understand things better and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:17.400 --> 01:21.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
