    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.300\nWe use them all the time to check our knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something.\nThink about it: a spelling test in school checks how well you know your words.\nA taste test helps decide which ice cream flavor is the best.\nAnd a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:32.600\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\nThey can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like asking a friend if they like your new song.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:46.000\nThe important thing is that they give us data to work with.\nIn short, a test is a process or tool used to evaluate something.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:55.400\nWe use them to learn, to improve, and to understand the world around us.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
