    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're talking about\u2026 tests!\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it like this: You want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you poke them with a toothpick.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:24.500\nThat's a test! The toothpick tells you if they're still gooey inside.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:30.600\nAnother example is a spelling test at school. It checks how well you know your words.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:37.600\nOr, maybe you're testing if a toy car will roll down a ramp. You're checking its speed and distance.\n\n00:37.600 --> 00:51.200\nSo, a test can be anything from a simple check to a more formal assessment. The main idea is that you're trying to find out something specific by putting something to the\u2026 well, test!\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:58.200\nTests help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
