    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process we use to gather information and see how something performs or what something is capable of.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a physical exam. That's a test to check your overall health.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:31.200\nOr maybe you're baking a cake. Sticking a toothpick in it to see if it comes out clean?\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:37.400\nThat\u2019s testing if the cake is done! Another example: a teacher gives you a quiz.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:51.200\nThat's a test to see how well you understand the material. So, whether it's checking the doneness of a cake, your health, or your knowledge, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:59.200\nIn short, a test is just a procedure to learn something new. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
