    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_041527.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests! You've probably taken lots of them, but what is a test, really?\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something. It could be your knowledge, your skills, or even how well something works.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:29.300\nThink about it like this: a spelling test measures how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:40.500\nOr, a taste test can measure which flavor of ice cream people like best.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:53.500\nA car manufacturer might test a new car design to see if it's safe. So, tests help us understand things better by giving us information we can use.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.200\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic goal: to find something out. Remember, a test is a way to measure something and give us useful information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
