    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like this: imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\nA test would be seeing if you can actually ride without falling!\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:33.400\nOr, if you're baking a cake, the test is tasting it to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:42.100\nTests come in many forms. It could be a quiz at school, a practice exam for a driver's license, or even just trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:54.500\nThe goal is always the same: to measure your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:01.799\nSo, remember, a test helps you understand what you've learned and what you still need to work on. It's a learning tool, not something to be afraid of.\n\n01:01.799 --> 01:04.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
