    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.100 --> 00:12.200\nWhat is a test?\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:24.200\nIt's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure your knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:29.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:36.400\nA chef tastes food as a test to see if it needs more seasoning.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:41.800\nAnd you take a math test at school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:43.900\nSo, examples of tests are everywhere!\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.600\nFrom quizzes to exams, from quality control checks to scientific experiments, they all involve asking a question and getting an answer that tells us something important.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.700\nBasically, a test is just a structured way of asking questions and getting answers to understand things better.\n\n00:57.700 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
