    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.999\nHello everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:07.000 --> 00:16.399\nToday, we're diving into the fundamental concept of a test. Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:26.299\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information or evaluate something. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a physical test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:36.799\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test its flavor. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:45.199\nFor example, a simple test could be checking if a lightbulb works by plugging it in. If it lights up, the test is passed!\n\n00:45.200 --> 00:55.799\nAnother example is baking a cake and tasting it to see if it's sweet enough. So, remember, a test is just a method of checking or evaluating something.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.200\nIt helps us understand more about the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
