    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:13.000\nA test is simply a way to find out something. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:24.600\nThink about it: when you try a new food, you're testing if you like it. Or, if you press a light switch, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.800\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking questions in class.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:46.600\nThese tests aren't meant to trick you, but to see how well you understand the material. Another example is a doctor using a test to find out if you are sick.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:59.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. Whether it's about yourself, the world around you, or what you've learned in class.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
