    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_042750.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we\u2019re diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:16.600\nA test, in its simplest form, is really just a way to find out something.\nIt's how we check if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:28.100\nThink about it: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\nOr, when you bake a cake, you might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:33.300\nThat\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:38.500\nAnother example is a doctor giving you a checkup.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:47.400\nThey're running tests to see if you're healthy.\nTests help us make informed decisions and understand the world around us a little better.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.800\nSo, remember, a test is a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard.\nThey're used everywhere, from school to cooking to the doctor's office.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:58.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
