    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:11.600\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:20.300\nIt's a process we use to gather information. Think about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:32.700\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words. Even baking a cake can be considered a test \u2013 you're testing a recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:42.800\nSo, tests can be quizzes in school, scientific experiments, or even just trying something new to see what happens.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:55.300\nThey all have one thing in common: they help us learn and understand the world around us. Basically, a test is just a way to ask a question and then find the answer.\n\n00:55.300 --> 01:03.200\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
