    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_042919.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:24.500\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:30.100\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:38.000\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school to check what you've learned.\nThat's also a test!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:43.100\nEven trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good can be considered a simple test.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:53.800\nSo, tests come in many forms.\nSome are formal, like exams.\nOthers are informal, like trying a new video game before you buy it.\n\n00:53.800 --> 01:03.800\nThe important thing is that they all help us gather information and make decisions.\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
