    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt helps us learn more about ourselves, or about the world around us.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:26.700\nThink of it like gathering information.\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned in a class.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:35.900\nThese tests can be things like answering questions on paper, doing a physical activity, or even just talking about a topic.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:42.300\nImagine you want to know if a plant needs water.\nThe \"test\" is touching the soil.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:51.500\nIf it's dry, the plant probably needs water!\nSo, tests help us make decisions and understand things better.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:58.400\nThey are simply a tool for learning and discovery.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
