    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:20.100\nIt's a process we use to see if something works, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:30.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have the flu.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:38.900\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:47.000\nEven building a tower with blocks is a kind of test \u2013 are you building it strong enough so it doesn't fall down?\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:55.400\nSo, tests help us confirm information, identify problems, and ultimately, make better decisions.\n\n00:55.400 --> 00:59.000\nThey're all around us, in different forms, helping us understand the world a little better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
