    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_043410.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nWell, simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:25.400\nIt's how we check if something is working properly, or if something is true.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:38.200\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it works. Or, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:52.600\nTests can be simple, like tasting a new food to see if you like it. Or, they can be more complicated, like a science experiment that takes days to complete.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.200\nThe important thing is that a test helps us gather information and learn something new.\n```"
  },
