    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_043503.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it as a question you ask, and the answer you get is how you learn.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:23.700\nIt can be as simple as testing if a light bulb works by flipping the switch \u2013 does it turn on? That's a test!\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:30.400\nOr maybe you're testing a cookie recipe; you bake a batch and taste it to see if it needs more sugar. That's another test.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:40.000\nTests help us understand things better, figure out what works and what doesn't, and improve things along the way.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:49.700\nSo remember, a test is all about asking a question and learning from the answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
