    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:09.700\nAt its most basic, a test is simply a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.700 --> 00:14.300\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:20.400\nThink about it: ever checked the weather app before going outside?\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:22.600\nThat's a test to see if you need a jacket!\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:28.000\nIn more formal settings, like school, a test helps us understand how much you've learned about a subject.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:31.900\nIt's like a snapshot of your current knowledge.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:35.300\nFor example, a multiple-choice quiz is a type of test.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:37.200\nSo is a written exam.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:42.200\nEven a simple experiment to see if a plant grows in sunlight is a test!\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:56.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information and checking understanding. It can be formal or informal, big or small, but it all boils down to learning something new.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:01.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
