    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.300\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:06.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:13.400\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:19.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if the cookies are done baking, so you use a toothpick to test them.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:21.900\nIf it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:27.100\nOr maybe you want to know if your car will start on a cold morning.\n\n00:27.100 --> 00:28.900\nTurning the key is a test.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:36.000\nTests aren't just for cookies and cars, though.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:39.800\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and teachers use tests to see what you've learned.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:46.600\nBasically, a test is any procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:49.900\nIt gives us information to help us make decisions.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:55.700\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of finding something out.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
