    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.300\nNow, a test is simply a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and flip the switch.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:22.600\nThat's a test! In everyday life, we're constantly running tests.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:26.900\nDoes this shirt fit? Does this recipe taste good?\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:31.200\nWill this umbrella keep me dry? These are all tests!\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:38.900\nFormal tests, like the ones you might take in school, are just a more structured way of checking knowledge.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:46.100\nA math test checks if you understand math concepts. A spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:52.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:55.000\nIt's that simple.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
