    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey there, and welcome! Today, we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:14.900\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something about something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer that tells you more.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.500\nTests can be used for all sorts of things. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:32.100\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. It's not just about people, either!\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:45.400\nYou can test if a new toy is safe for kids, or if a bridge can hold a certain amount of weight.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:54.000\nSo, to recap, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something. It helps us learn and make informed decisions.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.600\nTests are all around us and help us understand the world a little better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
