    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:01.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.000 --> 00:03.200\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:04.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:08.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:12.200\nIt's a process we use to see if something is working, or to understand more about it.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:16.200\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:20.500\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:24.800\nIn science, we might test a new medicine to see if it helps people.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:29.700\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 we're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:38.200\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:42.600\nThey're a fundamental part of understanding the world around us.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
