    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.900\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.900 --> 00:07.400\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:12.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:17.200\nWe use tests all the time. In school, you take tests to show your teacher what you've learned in class.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:24.100\nA doctor might run tests to figure out what's making you feel sick. Even when you try a new recipe, you're kind of testing it out to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:30.100\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:36.200\nThey can tell us if we're on the right track, or if we need to try something different.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:41.300\nReally, a test is just a way to learn and improve.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:43.900\nThat's the basics of what a test is all about!\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:46.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
