    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_044317.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process or a procedure designed to evaluate or assess something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like this: A doctor might run a blood test to check your health. A teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:33.800\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you get a delicious result.\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:45.800\nSo, tests can be formal like exams, or informal like trying a new restaurant. The goal is always to gather information and learn something.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:57.300\nThey help us measure knowledge, skills, abilities, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:06.500\nIn short, a test is a tool for evaluation. It's a way of asking a question and getting an answer through observation or measurement.\n\n01:06.500 --> 01:08.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
