    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:19.800\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out something. It\u2019s how we check if something is working, how well we understand something, or even just to see what something is like.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:29.000\nThink about it: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Your teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:36.600\nOr, you might test a new toy to see if it's fun to play with! So, tests can come in many forms.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:47.400\nThey can be written quizzes, physical exams, or even just trying something out. The important thing is that a test gives us information.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:54.400\nIt helps us learn and understand things better. In short, a test is an investigation.\n\n00:54.400 --> 00:59.500\nA way to check or to prove something.\n\n00:59.500 --> 01:03.000\nIt's all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
