    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:14.200\nBut don't worry, it's not scary! A test is simply a way to check what you know about something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like a little quiz to see how well you understand a topic. Tests can come in many forms.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:33.600\nMaybe it's a multiple-choice question, where you pick the best answer from a few options. Or perhaps it's a short answer question, where you write a sentence or two. Sometimes it's even a practical test, like showing you can ride a bike!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:46.100\nFor example, a teacher might give you a math test to see if you understand addition and subtraction. Or a driving instructor might give you a road test to see if you can drive safely.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:59.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help you learn and see where you might need a little extra practice.\n\n00:59.400 --> 01:06.900\nIt's not about being perfect, it's about understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
