    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_044903.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:25.500\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information or check if something is working correctly.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:35.700\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:46.600\nAnother example? Baking a cake! You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar. We test things all the time without even realizing it.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:50.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect. It's all about gathering information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
