    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:01.800 --> 00:05.100\nIn its simplest form, a test is just a way to find out information.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:07.900\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening to the answer,\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:11.900\nyou're also checking if the answer is correct or useful.\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:14.400\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:18.600\nImagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:21.700\nYou might taste the batter to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:26.400\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to test if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:30.600\nAnother example?\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:35.500\nThink about a video game.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:39.100\nEach level is like a test to see if you've learned the skills needed to move on.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:42.500\nYou pass the level, you pass the test!\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:48.900\nSo, basically, a test is a method for gathering information and evaluating something.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:54.800\nWhether it's cake batter or your health, tests help us learn and make better decisions.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
