    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like asking a question to see if you get the right answer. It helps us understand if something works, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:34.100\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold. Or, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:46.600\nMaybe you even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good! So, tests are all about checking things and learning from the results.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:54.900\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal: to give us information. In short, a test is a way to evaluate or assess something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
