    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:24.100\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. Think about it: a cookie recipe is a test.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:29.300\nYou follow the instructions, and the result \u2013 the cookies \u2013 tells you if the recipe works.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:34.500\nOr imagine trying on a new shirt. That's a test to see if it fits!\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:45.000\nWe're constantly using tests in our daily lives. Another example: a spelling test at school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:45.000 --> 00:54.500\nIt gives them information about what you\u2019ve learned. So, a test is really just a tool for gathering information and seeing what happens.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:01.000\nTo sum it up, tests are all about learning and finding things out. They help us understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
