    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:21.500\nWe use them all the time! Think of it like this: you might test if your cookies are done by poking them with a toothpick.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:29.100\nIf it comes out clean, hooray! They're ready. Tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like that cookie test.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:36.200\nA doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:44.800\nA chef might taste a soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:54.900\nSo, tests help us learn, confirm, or understand something. They give us information that we can use. In a nutshell, a test is a process designed to gather data and help us make a decision. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
