    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_045344.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:06.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:11.700\nIt's a process, or a procedure, that helps us gather information.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:18.300\nThink of it like this: you might test if a cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:21.700\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:21.700 --> 00:26.900\nOr maybe you test a lightbulb to see if it still works.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:31.400\nYou screw it in, flip the switch, and if it lights up, it passes!\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:38.100\nTests are everywhere, from school exams that measure your knowledge, to medical tests that check your health.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:44.200\nThe important thing is that a test gives us a result, a piece of information that helps us understand something better.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:51.800\nSo, a test is a procedure designed to gather information and give us a result.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:58.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
