    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_045653.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.300 --> 00:06.000\nToday we're tackling something fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:10.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:14.700\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:18.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:23.000\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:24.300\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:28.500\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:37.200\nSo, whether it's checking your cake, your health, or your understanding of a subject, a test is all about gathering information and making an assessment.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:42.500\nIt's a tool for learning and improvement.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:45.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
