    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs, or how much of something we have.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:24.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test in school helps your teacher see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:32.900\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which cookie tastes the best. Tests aren't just for school or food, though.\n\n00:32.900 --> 00:40.800\nScientists use tests to see if a new medicine works.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:48.900\nEngineers use tests to make sure bridges are strong.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:55.300\nSo, a test is really just a way of asking a question and then finding the answer through a set of actions. It helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
