    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_045940.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:14.700 --> 00:24.800\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate or measure. Think about it like this: a recipe test lets you know if a cookie recipe is any good.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:35.500\nOr, a spelling test shows how well you know your words. Even when you try out a new video game, you're kind of testing it to see if you like it!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:54.400\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same basic goal: to give us information. Whether it's checking your knowledge, evaluating a product, or even just seeing how something works, tests are a crucial part of learning and improving.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:02.600\nSo, remember, a test is all about finding things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
