    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.700\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\nIt's like an experiment or a check to see if something is true or works the way we expect it to.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:24.500\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\nOr, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it!\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:34.100\nTests can be used for all sorts of things.\nAnother example is a doctor giving you a test to see if you\u2019re healthy.\nOr, a teacher giving a test at school to see how much you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:42.200\nSo, to recap, a test is a way of checking something.\nIt helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:48.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
