    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_050406.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:16.400\nWhat is a test, anyway? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something, or see how well you know something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it's baked all the way through by poking it with a toothpick.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:32.100\nOr, your teacher might give you a quiz to test how much you learned in class.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:40.300\nTests aren't just about grades though. Doctors use tests to figure out what's making you sick.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:56.300\nScientists use tests to see if their ideas are right. So, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:59.900\nWhether it's a pop quiz, a blood sample, or even trying a new recipe, remember that tests are just tools to help us explore the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
