    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore what a test is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs or if something is true.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt.\nOr, a student takes a quiz to test their knowledge on a subject.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:39.200\nIn science, we might test a new medicine to see if it's effective.\nSo, a test could be anything from a quick taste to a complex experiment.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:48.900\nThe key is that it's a way of checking something and getting a result.\nWe use tests all the time, often without even realizing it!\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:57.000\nThey help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
