    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:28.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready, so you stick a toothpick in it.\nThat toothpick is a mini-test!\n\n00:28.300 --> 00:36.500\nIn general, tests help us check if something works the way it's supposed to, or if something has a certain quality.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:43.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills, or a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:49.100\nImagine you build a toy car.\nYou might test it by pushing it down a ramp to see if it rolls properly.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:54.500\nThat's a test!\nTests are super useful for learning and improving things.\n\n00:54.500 --> 01:01.500\nThey help us find problems and fix them.\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way of checking things out!\n\n01:01.500 --> 01:05.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
