    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:24.700\nIt's a process designed to measure your knowledge, skill, or even your personality.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:36.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy, or a chef tastes food to see if it's delicious.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:46.000\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:55.600\nThey might be multiple choice questions, essays, or even hands-on projects.\n\n00:55.600 --> 01:05.200\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve equations, while a science test could ask you to explain a scientific concept.\n\n01:05.200 --> 01:15.400\nUltimately, tests provide information.\nThey help you and your teachers see where you're strong and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n01:15.400 --> 01:23.400\nTests are learning tools, just like textbooks and homework.\n\n01:23.400 --> 01:27.100\nRemember, they're there to help you grow!\n\n01:27.100 --> 01:27.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
