    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! \nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:11.600\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:19.700\nIt's a process we use to check if something is working, if something is true, or how well something performs.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:27.500\nThink about it like this: If you want to know if a lightbulb works, you screw it in and flip the switch. That's a test!\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:34.300\nOr, if you want to know if your cookies are done, you stick a toothpick in them. If it comes out clean, that's a test, too!\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:46.900\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your shoelaces are tied. The important thing is that they give you information.\n\n00:46.900 --> 01:00.000\nSo, a test is really just a way of gathering information to see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:03.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
