    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:17.900\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:24.100\nYou do a test! You stick a toothpick in it. The toothpick is your test.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:29.800\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test and is ready.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:35.500\nIf it's gooey, the cake fails and needs more time.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:41.200\nTests are everywhere. A doctor might order a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:48.300\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see what you've learned.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:53.900\nEven trying a new ice cream flavor is a test \u2013 you're testing if you like it!\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:00.800\nSo, a test is just a way to check something and get some information.\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:09.100\nRemember, tests help us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n01:09.100 --> 01:17.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
