    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.800\nNow, you might be thinking about school exams, but in this case, a test is simply a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:24.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing if you get the right answer.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake and then you taste it.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:36.400\nThat's a test! You're checking if it tastes good.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:42.400\nOr, imagine you build a tower out of blocks. You give it a little push to see if it's strong enough to stand.\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:48.400\nThat's another kind of test! So, tests help us learn and improve things.\n\n00:48.400 --> 00:59.600\nThey tell us what\u2019s working well and what needs to be fixed. Whether it's a cake, a tower, or even a new app on your phone, tests are important.\n\n00:59.600 --> 01:03.700\nTo recap, a test is a way of checking something.\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:07.800\nIt involves asking a question and looking at the answer to see if things are working correctly.\n\n01:07.800 --> 01:11.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
