    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.600\nWhat are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:24.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information or see if something works the way it should.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:36.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly. Or, a taste test helps you decide which food you like best.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:46.200\nIn science, a test might involve trying out a new fertilizer on plants to see if it makes them grow bigger.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:51.700\nSo, tests are all about gathering information. They help us learn, make decisions, and improve things.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:54.200\nThey're a fundamental part of learning and discovering new things. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
