    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.900\nNow, what is a test, really? Simply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You flip the switch, and if it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:32.300\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. You might take a math test in school to see how well you understand adding and subtracting.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:40.100\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:47.300\nFor example, a simple quiz is a type of test. So is trying to bake a cake using a recipe.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:59.100\nIf the cake tastes good, you passed the baking test! So, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something, whether it's your knowledge, your skills, or even the health of a lightbulb.\n\n00:59.100 --> 01:07.200\nThey help us understand where we are and what we might need to work on. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
