    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.500\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you information.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:24.300\nTests can come in many forms. You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:30.600\nOr maybe you do a taste test to decide which flavor of ice cream you like best. Both are tests!\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:37.100\nAnother example is a doctor checking your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:40.700\nSee? It\u2019s all about gathering information.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:49.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for finding something out. It helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:49.500 --> 00:59.500\nWhether it\u2019s knowing your ABCs, or choosing your favorite snack, tests are everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
