    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really important: what is a test?\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:17.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:24.600\nWe use tests all the time! When you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:36.300\nWhen a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:47.900\nSo, tests help us gather information. They can be simple or complex, but the main idea is always the same: to learn something new.\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:55.400\nRemember, a test is just a way to get an answer! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
