    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:24.900\nIt\u2019s like checking your understanding, or checking if something is up to par.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:35.400\nThink about a spelling test at school. That test checks how well you know how to spell different words.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:45.900\nOr, imagine testing a new toy to see if it\u2019s durable and safe for kids to play with. That's another kind of test!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:53.600\nTests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking your knowledge to making sure products are safe and reliable.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:01.100\nThey help us learn and improve. So, remember, a test is simply a way to evaluate something.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:04.700\nWhether it\u2019s your understanding of a subject or the quality of a product,\n\n01:04.700 --> 01:07.500\ntests help us measure and assess.\n\n01:07.500 --> 01:08.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
