    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_052709.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:12.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something!\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:18.500\nIt helps us measure knowledge, skills, or even abilities.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:22.700\nThink of it like this: a test is like a detective, gathering information to solve a puzzle.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:27.900\nFor example, a math test checks how well you understand numbers and equations.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:31.700\nA spelling test shows how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:36.300\nAnd even a taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you like best!\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:41.300\nSo, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:46.600\nIt helps us understand where we're at, what we know, and where we can improve.\n\n00:46.600 --> 00:49.000\nIt's a snapshot of our current abilities.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:51.800\nRemember, tests are learning opportunities!\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:53.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
