    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_052753.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:20.600\nA test is simply a way to check how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:20.600 --> 00:27.800\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see how many words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:35.600\nOr, maybe you test a new toy to see if it's fun to play with.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:47.700\nTests aren't just for school, though. Scientists use tests to see if a new medicine works. Engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe. Even chefs test their food to make sure it tastes delicious!\n\n00:47.700 --> 01:00.700\nSo, tests help us learn, improve things, and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n01:00.700 --> 01:04.100\nTo sum it up, a test is a method to evaluate knowledge, functionality, or quality.\n\n01:04.100 --> 01:07.300\nIt's a tool for understanding and progress used in almost every area of life!\n\n01:07.300 --> 01:10.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
