    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to explore something super important: the test.\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:17.300\nNow, when we say \"test,\" we don't just mean a school exam. A test is simply a way to check if something works as expected.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: you want to bake a cake. Before serving it to your friends, you taste a little piece, right? That's a test! You're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:30.100\nOr, imagine you build a tower of blocks. You gently push it to see if it's stable.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:36.300\nThat's another test. You're checking if it can stand on its own.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:40.300\nBasically, a test helps us find out if something is ready to be used, shared, or relied upon.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:55.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a simple way of checking if something works the way it should.\n\n00:55.900 --> 00:59.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
