    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:07.900\nA test is really just a way to check something.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:11.800\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:12.700\nThat's a test!\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:15.400\nThe toothpick tells you if the cake is ready.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:20.100\nIn general, a test helps us find out if something works, if it's true, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:26.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:31.300\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:37.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:43.100\nIt could be a cake, your health, or your spelling skills.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:47.600\nThe goal is always the same: to get information and understand something better.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
