    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.900\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to explore something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:19.000\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:23.200\nThink of it like this.\nImagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:34.700\nA test might be seeing if you can ride all the way down the street without falling.\nOr, if you're baking a cake, tasting it is a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:44.700\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nThey can be a quiz in school, a medical check-up, or even just trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:54.400\nThe main idea is to check something and get a result.\nSo, remember, a test is a way to measure knowledge or performance.\n\n00:54.400 --> 01:00.300\nIt helps us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
