    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.400\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:29.800\nThink of it like this: you\u2019ve been learning about animals, and a test might ask you to name different kinds of birds.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:42.300\nThe idea is to check your understanding. Tests can come in many forms, like multiple choice questions, fill-in-the-blanks, or even just talking about what you've learned.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:50.100\nFor example, if you're learning about colors, a test might ask you to point to the color blue. Or, if you're studying numbers, you might be asked to count objects.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:56.200\nSo, a test helps you and your teachers see what you\u2019ve learned and what you might need to work on a little more. It's all about learning and growing! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
