    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:19.300\nWe use them all the time in everyday life. Think about it: you test if the bathwater is too hot before getting in.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:25.100\nThat's a test! Or maybe you test if your cake is done by sticking a toothpick in it.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:37.200\nAnother test! In school, tests help us see what we've learned. They can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like showing you can play a song on an instrument.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:46.300\nThe main idea is to measure understanding. For example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:51.700\nA math test checks if you can solve problems.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:57.100\nTests aren't meant to be scary. They're just a tool to help you and your teachers understand where you're at.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:10.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something, whether it's bathwater, cake, or your knowledge!\n\n01:10.800 --> 01:14.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
