    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:19.400\nIt's like asking a question and then seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:30.200\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think about it. When you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:38.600\nOr when you push a button on a remote, you're testing if it turns on the TV.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:47.000\nTests can also be more formal, like a quiz at school. That test helps your teacher see how much you've learned.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:55.000\nOr a medical test can help a doctor understand what's going on in your body.\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:01.000\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new. They can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all help us understand the world a little better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
