    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:19.900\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:26.900\nWe use tests all the time! Your doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:32.600\nOr, in school, you take a test to show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:41.700\nEven baking a cake is a test! You're testing your recipe to see if it turns out delicious.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:50.300\nAnother example? Imagine you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works. You screw it in, and if it lights up, the test is successful!\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:57.700\nIf it doesn't, you know the lightbulb is probably broken. So, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:01.300\nIt involves a question, an action, and an answer.\n```"
