    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.200\nWe use tests all the time to see if things are working correctly or to find out information.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:30.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to check if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:37.400\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:47.200\nHere\u2019s another example. If you\u2019re baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it to test if it's done.\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:50.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready!\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:58.400\nSo, tests are basically a way to confirm something, whether it's your health, your knowledge, or even if a cake is perfectly baked. They help us make decisions and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
