    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:16.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process, or a procedure, designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:33.700\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:48.700\nEven baking a cake is kind of a test!\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it works.\nSo, tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying a new recipe.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:56.800\nThe main idea is always the same: to gather information and learn something new.\nIn short, a test is a structured way to check something out.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
