    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:20.300\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. Think of it like this: you want to know if the water in your pool is warm enough to swim in, so you stick your toe in. That's a test!\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:31.100\nBasically, a test helps you find out if something is true or false, right or wrong, or even just good or bad.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:40.700\nFor example, your teacher gives you a math test to see if you understand the lessons. A doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:45.800\nOr, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good. See?\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:52.400\nTests are everywhere! So, remember, a test is just a way to check something. It helps us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
