    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.200\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.000\nIt helps us understand if something works, if something is correct, or if someone has learned something.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:28.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:40.400\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake \u2013 you might taste it to test if it's sweet enough. That's a test too!\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:45.900\nAnother example is when a doctor checks your temperature. That's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:56.000\nSo, a test is really just a method for gathering information or making a judgment about something. It can be a formal exam or a simple everyday check.\n\n00:56.000 --> 01:01.300\nTests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n01:01.300 --> 01:04.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
