    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_055444.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:16.600\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give you an answer.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:29.800\nWe use tests all the time!\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:37.000\nImagine you're baking a cake. You taste the batter \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more sugar.\nOr, think about a doctor checking your temperature.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.200\nThat's a test to see if you have a fever. In school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:57.200\nSo, tests are just tools. They help us measure, evaluate, or confirm something.\nThey can be simple, like tasting cake batter, or more complex, like taking a final exam.\nUltimately, they provide information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
