    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_055732.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE This subtitle file was automatically generated by Apilage AI\nNOTE Total video duration: 56.1 seconds\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:05.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:10.500\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer, and the test helps you get closer to that answer.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:11.200\nIt could be anything!\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:15.700\nImagine you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:18.400\nYou might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:19.500\nThat's a test!\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:24.300\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake's probably ready.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:28.400\nOr, if you want to know if your friend knows the capital of France, you ask them.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:29.700\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:36.800\nBasically, a test is just a procedure, big or small, that gives you information.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:40.400\nIt helps you check something, learn something, or confirm something.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:43.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get answers.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:46.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
