    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.900\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like a mini-investigation.\nWe want to know if something is true, or how well something works, or if we understand something.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:36.400\nBasically, we're asking a question and using the test to get an answer.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:48.700\nFor example, a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt.\nA doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:57.400\nAnd, of course, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand the lesson.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:05.400\nSo, a test is a tool we use to gather information and make decisions.\nWhether it's a simple taste test or a complex medical exam, the idea is the same: to learn something new.\nRemember, tests help us understand the world around us better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
