    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_060024.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's how we check if something works, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, your teacher might give you a test to see how much you've learned in class.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:36.700\nSo, tests can come in many forms.\nIt could be a multiple-choice quiz, a physical exam, or even trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:45.400\nThe key is that it helps us gather information and draw a conclusion.\nBasically, a test helps us answer a question.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:53.700\nIt's a useful tool for learning and understanding the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
