    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_060159.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.600\nNow, you might be thinking of school tests, but in general, a test is simply a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:28.800\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake, and you taste it to test if it's sweet enough. Or, you might try turning on a light switch to test if the lightbulb is working.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:35.700\nThese are all simple tests! Another example could be checking if your shoes fit before buying them.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:51.600\nYou try them on, walk around a bit, and test if they're comfortable. So, to recap, a test is just a way to examine or evaluate something to see if it meets certain requirements or expectations.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.600\nIt's all about checking things out!\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:57.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
