    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.600\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:27.800\nIt could be checking if a toy works, if you understand a lesson, or even if a recipe tastes good. The main idea is to see if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:36.500\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:42.900\nOr, imagine baking a cake. You taste it \u2013 that\u2019s a test!\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:57.100\nYou\u2019re testing if it\u2019s sweet enough and tastes yummy. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:06.500\nFrom checking your shoelaces are tied to taking a quiz at school, tests are all around us! They're a simple way to see if something is working, or if you understand something.\n\n01:06.500 --> 01:11.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
