    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:19.300\nIt's a method to gather information and see how well something performs, or how much of something exists.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:27.700\nThink of it like this: a taste test tells you how good food tastes. A spelling test shows how well you can spell.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:40.700\nA car's crash test shows how safe it is in an accident. Tests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking if your bath water is too hot.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:52.400\nThe goal is always the same: to learn something new. So, in a nutshell, a test is any procedure designed to evaluate or measure something.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
