    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.400\nIt helps us learn or check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:28.200\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows what words you know.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:35.400\nOr, a taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you like best!\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:45.100\nSee? They help us gather information. Another example is testing a new lightbulb to see if it lights up.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:54.700\nWe\u2019re testing its functionality. Tests can be anything from a simple yes or no question, to a more complex experiment.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.200\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to gain information or confirm something.\n```"
