    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:09.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:14.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:19.400\nTests help us measure knowledge, skills, or even abilities.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:24.600\nThink about it.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:29.800\nA spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:35.000\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:40.200\nEven a doctor uses tests, like blood tests, to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:43.000\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:46.300\nand seeing where we stand.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:49.000\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:50.800\nRemember, tests aren't scary;\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:52.200\nthey're just tools.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:53.200\nThis video\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:54.500\nwas created by\n\n00:54.500 --> 00:55.000\nApilage\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:55.300\nAI.\n```"
