    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.800\nNow, a test is really just a way to see what you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:27.700\nIt's like a measuring stick for your skills or knowledge. Think about it like this: a pop quiz in class, that's a test.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:35.800\nOr maybe when you try out for a sports team, that's a test too! Even baking a cake can be a test of your baking skills.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:43.900\nThe goal is to see where you\u2019re at and where you can improve. So, tests can be written, like filling out a worksheet,\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:53.000\nor practical, like showing someone how to ride a bike. They help us understand what we've learned and what we still need to work on.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:57.900\nIn short, a test is a way to check your understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
