    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:22.900\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, abilities, or performance. Think about it like this: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:30.200\nA driving test checks your ability to drive. And a taste test checks your preference for different flavors.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:43.100\nTests can be formal, like exams in school, or informal, like asking a friend a quick question. The goal is always the same: to get information.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:58.300\nSo, a test helps us understand what we know, what we can do, and what we like. In summary, a test is just a method for gathering information, used everywhere from classrooms to kitchens.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:02.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
