    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_061528.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.700\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly or if someone knows something.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:26.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:30.200\nA medical test might check if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:40.700\nSee? Tests help us learn and evaluate. For example, your teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:51.200\nOr, a mechanic might test your car's battery to see if it needs to be replaced. So, tests are tools that help us measure knowledge, ability, or condition.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:56.600\nThey give us information to make better decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
