    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure we use to gather information.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:20.200\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done baking, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.200 --> 00:31.600\nOr, if you're learning a new skill, like riding a bike, falling down is a kind of test, showing you what not to do.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:45.400\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned.\nSo, tests are all about figuring things out, whether it's about cake, bike riding, or school subjects.\n\n00:45.400 --> 00:51.600\nThey give us valuable information.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
