    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:16.200\nA test, in its simplest form, is just a way to find out something. Think of it as a question you're asking, and the test helps you get the answer.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:26.900\nFor example, a taste test helps you find out which flavor of ice cream you like best. Or a spelling test shows you which words you know how to spell.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:35.400\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy. Basically, tests help us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:45.500\nThey aren't scary, they're just tools! So, remember, a test is simply a way to get information and learn something new.\n\n00:45.500 --> 00:49.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
