    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.400\nWhat is a test, anyway? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:25.700\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer. Think of it like this: your doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, when you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's cooked all the way through.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:35.400\nTests can be written, like a quiz at school. Or they can be practical, like seeing if a toy car works when you push it.\n\n00:35.400 --> 00:42.600\nThe important thing is, a test gives you information about something.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:49.200\nSo, a test is a check. It helps you learn something new or confirm something you already know.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:52.700\nTests are everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
