    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nNOTE duration:54.1\nNOTE each subtitle should stay on screen for the duration of the narration\nNOTE all times are approximate\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat is a test?\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:20.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:26.800\nFor example, you might take a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:38.800\nOr a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Even baking a cake is a test! You're testing the recipe to see if it comes out delicious.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:49.300\nSo, tests help us measure things, check for problems, or even just see if something works. They're used everywhere, from school to science to even your own kitchen.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:54.100\nBasically, a test is a process designed to get information. Remember that! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
