    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.100\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\nThink of it like a detective trying to solve a mystery.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:20.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\nFor example, a taste test.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:25.200\nYou try a new ice cream flavor to see if you like it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:32.400\nOr when you try to turn on a light switch and the light doesn't come on, you're testing if the bulb is working.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:40.300\nTests aren't just for ice cream and light bulbs, of course!\nDoctors use tests to see if you're healthy.\nTeachers use tests to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:48.200\nReally, a test is just a way of gathering information.\nSo, remember, a test is a simple way to find out information about something.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:58.900\nWe use them every day in all sorts of situations.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:02.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
