    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:36.000\nOr, you take tests in school to show what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the recipe works!\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:42.300\nSo, a test can be a questionnaire, a physical exam, or even an experiment.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:49.200\nThe important thing is that it gives you information. It helps you understand something better.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:58.500\nIn summary, a test helps us learn and discover. It\u2019s a tool to check something and get results. Whether it's about your health, your knowledge, or even your baking skills. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
