    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_062339.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:19.400\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.400 --> 00:32.300\nWe use tests every day, even if we don't realize it.\nThink of it like this: a test helps us check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:38.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a physical exam \u2013 that's a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:52.400\nOr, when you learn something new in school, your teacher might give you a quiz.\nThat's a test to see if you understood the lesson.\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:02.700\nTests aren't always about grades, though!\nSometimes they're just about gathering information.\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for finding out information or checking if something is true or working properly.\nFrom doctor's visits to school quizzes, tests help us understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "52f75a0e-8a11-4671-b906-7b12e6bd0fb0": {
