    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_062421.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out! It's a procedure you use to gather information.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:32.300\nThat's a test! The toothpick coming out clean tells you the cake is ready. Another example: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy, like checking your temperature or listening to your heart.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:41.500\nOr, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:47.900\nTests aren't just in classrooms or hospitals though. You test things every day!\n\n00:47.900 --> 00:57.200\nYou test if your keys are in your pocket before you leave the house.\n\n00:57.200 --> 01:01.000\nSo, a test is just a way to check something, get some information, and make a decision based on what you find out.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
