    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:22.400\nThink of it like asking questions to learn more.\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:37.500\nOr, a chef might taste their soup \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt.\nTests can be written, like quizzes, or they can involve doing something, like a science experiment.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:48.300\nThe important thing is, they help us understand things better, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of food, or how something works.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:58.900\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\nIt can be simple or complex, but it always helps us learn.\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:02.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
