    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:07.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:12.800\nIt's how we check if something is working, if something is true, or if we understand something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:17.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:23.300\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you learned a lesson.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:25.000\nSee?\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:28.500\nDifferent situations, same idea: finding something out.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:34.000\nFor example, you might test a new lightbulb to see if it turns on.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:37.400\nOr, you could test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:43.200\nThe results of a test help us make decisions and learn new things.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:47.400\nSo, remember, a test is simply a method for gathering information.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
