    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it as a question you ask and then find the answer to.\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:26.400\nTests are used everywhere. Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:34.300\nYou might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar. Or, if your phone isn't working right, you might try restarting it to test if that fixes the problem.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:41.900\nAnother example: When you go to the doctor, they might give you a vision test to see how well you can see.\n\n00:41.900 --> 00:51.500\nIt's all about gathering information and figuring things out. So, remember, a test is simply a way to get information.\n\n00:51.500 --> 01:00.100\nYou ask a question, perform an action, and observe the result. That result tells you something important!\n\n01:00.100 --> 01:03.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
