    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.600\nIt helps us understand if something is working, or if something is true.\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, maybe you take a quiz in school to test your knowledge.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:29.300\nTests can be really simple.\nLike, you might tap a light switch to test if the light bulb is working.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:36.600\nBoom, that's a test!\nYou tried something and got a result.\nSo, tests are all about finding out information.\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:43.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n\n00:43.300 --> 00:53.000\nIn short, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:53.000 --> 00:56.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
