    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_063523.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:19.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking. You might use a toothpick!\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:29.200\nSticking the toothpick in and seeing if it comes out clean is a test to see if the cake is ready. Or maybe you want to know if your friend knows their colors.\n\n00:29.200 --> 00:43.500\nYou could point to a ball and ask, \"What color is this?\" That's a test too! Tests help us learn things, check if something is working, or see how well someone understands something.\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:50.100\nSo, a test is really just a way of gathering information. We use them all the time!\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:53.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
