    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:25.400\nIt's a method, a procedure we use to gather information.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like this: you might taste a new sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:33.700\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:39.900\nSee? It's all about checking something. Let's say you're baking a cake.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:52.200\nYou use a toothpick to test if it's done. If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready. That toothpick is your test!\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:58.800\nSo, a test is just a process to learn more about something. It could be a taste test, a medical test, or even testing if your cake is perfectly baked. It's all about gathering information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
