    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_064101.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something, or someone.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:32.200\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes!\nYour teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\nA doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:32.200 --> 00:41.500\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:47.600\nFor example, if you want to know if a toy car will roll down a ramp, you can test it by letting it go and watching what happens.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:53.700\nThe result tells you if it works!\n\n00:53.700 --> 01:03.800\nIn short, a test helps us learn something new.\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for gathering information.\nIt's a question we ask, and the results give us the answer.\n\n01:03.800 --> 01:07.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
