    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_064149.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey there! Ever heard someone say \"Let's run a test?\"\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:15.300\nBut what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:19.500\nIt's like asking a question and then finding the answer.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:28.400\nWe use tests all the time! Think about baking a cake. You taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:40.400\nOr when you're playing a game, you might try a new strategy to test if it works better.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:53.300\nIn science, tests are called experiments. Scientists might test if a new medicine helps people feel better, or test if a plant grows faster with more sunlight.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:56.300\nSo, a test is just a method to check something, try something out, or see if something works.\n\n00:56.300 --> 00:57.900\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n00:57.900 --> 00:58.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
