    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_064530.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:18.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we check if something is working correctly, or if we understand something, or even how good something is.\n\n00:18.100 --> 00:28.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words. A taste test tells you if you like the flavor of a new food.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:39.600\nAnd when a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever. So, tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:52.500\nThey come in many forms, but they all have the same basic purpose: to give us information. Basically, a test is just a structured way to ask a question and get an answer!\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
