    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.400\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:10.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:10.500 --> 00:12.100\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:12.100 --> 00:15.900\nThe toothpick tells you if it comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:17.500\nTests are everywhere.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:21.400\nYou might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:25.400\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:30.800\nAnother example: Before you buy a new toy, you might test it out to make sure it works the way you expect.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:33.600\nYou're checking its functionality.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:43.800\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information and see if something meets a certain standard or works correctly.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:47.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
