    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:07.700\nEver wondered what a test really is? \nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake to see if it tastes good.\nIn many areas, especially in science and education, a test helps us understand if something works, if someone has learned something, or if an idea is correct.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:36.000\nFor example, a doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy.\nOr, your teacher might give you a quiz to test what you've learned in class.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:44.700\nTests can be as simple as pressing a button to see if a light turns on, or as complex as running experiments in a lab.\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:56.500\nThe important thing is that a test gives us information. \nSo, a test is basically a check-up, an evaluation, or a way to gather information.\n\n00:56.500 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
