    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:15.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:23.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is good \u2013 you screw it in and see if it lights up. That's a test!\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:29.100\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:35.300\nAnother example? A taste test! Trying a new flavor of ice cream to see if you like it is also a test.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:40.200\nYou're testing your taste buds! Tests aren't always scary.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:48.100\nThey're just a way to gather information and learn. So remember, a test is a way to check something out.\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:54.400\nIt helps us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
