    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test?\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:18.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like an experiment.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:34.500\nYou're trying to learn more about something by giving it a try, or... well, testing it.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:40.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:45.600\nOr, a chef might taste a soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:48.600\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a test!\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:51.400\nYou turn it on and see if it lights up.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:53.200\nSo, a test helps us answer a question.\n\n00:53.200 --> 00:55.300\nDoes this work?\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:56.600\nIs this good?\n\n00:56.600 --> 00:58.200\nIs this person healthy?\n\n00:58.200 --> 01:01.100\nIt's all about gathering information.\n\n01:01.100 --> 01:03.800\nBy performing a test, we get results that help us make decisions.\n\n01:03.800 --> 01:07.500\nTests are everywhere, helping us understand the world around us.\n\n01:07.500 --> 01:09.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
