    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're diving into what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:15.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:23.900\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:30.200\nA teacher gives you a test to see what you've learned.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:39.500\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it works.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:51.200\nSo, a test involves a specific method to gather information, and then using that information to make a judgement or decision.\nIt can be as simple as checking if your shoes fit, or as complex as a scientific experiment.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.700\nIn short, a test is just a structured way to learn more.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
