    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.200 --> 00:03.200\nToday we're going to talk about\nsomething super important: tests!\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:05.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find\nout something about something else.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:08.700\nThink of it like this: you want to\nknow if your cake is ready.\n\n00:08.700 --> 00:10.300\nYou don't just guess, right?\n\n00:10.300 --> 00:11.800\nYou use a toothpick!\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:16.200\nSticking a toothpick into the cake and\nseeing if it comes out clean is a test\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:17.600\nto see if the cake is baked.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:20.700\nAnother example: your doctor uses tests\nall the time!\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:24.100\nChecking your temperature is a test to\nsee if you have a fever.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:28.800\nOr, a spelling test at school helps your\nteacher see how well you understand the\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:29.800\nwords you've been learning.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:34.700\nSo, a test is just a way to gather\ninformation and learn something new.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:38.000\nIt helps us understand the world around us better.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:38.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
