    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really fundamental: what is a test?\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:16.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:27.900\nThink of it like a small investigation. We use tests to see if something works as it should, or if someone understands a topic.\n\n00:27.900 --> 00:36.400\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:46.200\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you've learned the material.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:55.700\nEven baking a cake is a sort of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it turns out delicious. So, tests come in many forms and are used to measure all sorts of things.\n\n00:55.700 --> 00:59.400\nThey help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions. Remember, a test is just a tool for understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
