    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.200\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:24.700\nIt's how we check if something is working, true, or even just to see what we know.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:34.200\nThink about it like this: a recipe test.\nYou follow the recipe, and the test is whether the cake comes out delicious!\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:38.400\nOr, maybe you're learning your ABCs.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:42.600\nThe test is when someone asks you to say them all, and you show what you've learned.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:46.800\nTests aren't scary!\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:57.200\nWhether it's a math test at school or testing out a new video game, it's all about figuring things out.\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check something, give it a try, and see what happens!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
