    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_065630.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:14.200\nNow, you might think of school exams, but a test, in a general sense, is simply a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:22.200\nIt's a process that helps us determine if something is true, works correctly, or meets a certain standard.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:31.000\nThink about it like this: a taste test tells you if food tastes good.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:38.900\nA medical test helps doctors understand your health.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:46.800\nOr, if you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick \u2013 that's a simple test to see if it's done!\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:57.300\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn and make decisions. They involve checking something to see if it matches what we expect.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:02.100\nWhether it's a science experiment or just trying out a new recipe, tests are a valuable part of how we understand the world.\n\n01:02.100 --> 01:04.800\nThey help us verify and validate.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:06.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
