    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process or a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even performance.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: your doctor gives you a check-up. That's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:29.700\nOr, imagine baking a cake. You might taste it to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:32.300\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:41.800\nThere are all kinds of tests, from simple quizzes to big exams. They can be written, spoken, or even hands-on.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:52.900\nThe important thing is they help us understand where we're at and what we might need to work on. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn and improve.\n\n00:52.900 --> 00:56.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
