    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like an experiment or a way to check if something is true.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:32.400\nWe use tests all the time in everyday life.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:40.300\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like the taste.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:48.200\nOr if you push a door to see if it's locked, that's a test too!\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:52.900\nIn science and school, tests are more formal.\n\n00:52.900 --> 01:00.000\nLike a math test to see if you understand addition, or a science experiment to see if a plant needs sunlight to grow.\n\n01:00.000 --> 01:04.100\nThese tests usually have specific steps and results that we can measure.\n\n01:04.100 --> 01:16.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for discovering information or verifying something.\n\n01:16.800 --> 01:22.900\nIt's a fundamental way we learn and explore the world around us.\n\n01:22.900 --> 01:29.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
