    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_065956.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:18.800\nNow, a test is basically a way to check how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: you're trying to bake a cake, right? You taste it to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:30.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. In school, you might take a quiz to test your knowledge of history.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:44.500\nA scientist might test a new medicine to see if it's safe and effective. Even your phone goes through tests to make sure all the buttons and apps work correctly.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:53.100\nSo, to recap, a test is a process to evaluate knowledge, ability, or function.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:56.800\nIt helps us understand if we've learned something, or if something is working as it should.\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.400\nTesting is used everywhere! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
