    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_070256.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:16.100\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. The \"something else\" could be anything!\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:37.700\nIt could be how well you understand a lesson, how strong a material is, or even if a plant needs more water.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:48.300\nThe test is the process we use to get that information. For example, a spelling test helps us see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:59.300\nA stress test on a bridge helps engineers see how much weight it can hold. Even just checking the soil in your garden to see if it's dry is a kind of test!\n\n00:59.300 --> 01:02.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n01:02.800 --> 01:06.000\nIt's a tool to help us understand the world around us better.\n01:06.000 --> 01:06.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
