    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:16.400\nThat something could be anything! Think about it.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:26.800\nWhen you take a quiz in school, that's a test to see what you've learned. When a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:36.200\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like how it tastes! So, tests help us gather information.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:51.000\nThey give us results that we can use to make decisions or understand things better. Whether it's figuring out if you know your math facts, or if that new cookie recipe is a winner, tests are all about learning.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:58.600\nBasically, a test is just a way to check something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
