    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:14:04.217135",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T07:07:19.902217",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260107_070719.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_070719.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:04.300\nToday, we're going to explore\nsomething super important: tests.\n\n00:04.300 --> 00:06.100\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:09.200\nSimply put, a test is a way\nto find out something.\n\n00:09.200 --> 00:12.900\nIt helps us see if something\nis working, if something is true,\nor how well something is done.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:16.100\nThink about it like this:\na doctor might give you a test\nto see if you're healthy.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:19.500\nA teacher gives you a test to see\nhow much you've learned.\n\n00:19.500 --> 00:23.600\nAnd a chef might taste their food\nto test if it needs more salt!\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:27.700\nSo, tests can be big or small,\ncomplicated or simple.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:31.500\nThe main thing is they give\nus information.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:33.900\nThey tell us something we want to know.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:37.500\nThey help us make decisions\nand improve things.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:39.100\nIn short, a test is\njust a way to get answers!\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:43.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "96213137-ca35-42df-bcfe-1b65a8d53d78": {
    "id": "96213137-ca35-42df-bcfe-1b65a8d53d78",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:14:04.970924",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T07:08:03.370278",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260107_070803.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_070803.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.200\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:35.200\nThink about it like this: a taste test tells you if you like a food. A spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:48.500\nA medical test can tell you if you're healthy. So, tests come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to gather information.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:58.600\nWe use tests every day, even without realizing it! From trying on clothes to see if they fit, to checking the weather forecast to plan your day, you're essentially doing a test. Tests help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "3dce051d-bc7c-4cc0-afb8-7d48791d04b7": {
    "id": "3dce051d-bc7c-4cc0-afb8-7d48791d04b7",
    "topic": "Test",
