    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_071253.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:09.300\nOkay, so you're wondering what a test is, right?\n\n00:09.300 --> 00:19.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: it\u2019s a tool that helps measure something.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:34.000\nIt could be your knowledge, your skills, or even just how well something works.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:41.000\nImagine you're learning to ride a bike. A test could be seeing if you can ride in a straight line without falling.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:48.000\nOr, if you\u2019re learning about animals, a test might ask you to identify different creatures. See? Pretty straightforward.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:54.000\nTests come in all shapes and sizes, from simple quizzes to big exams. The important thing is they give us information.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:58.100\nThey help us understand what we\u2019ve learned and what we still need to work on. So, a test is all about measuring and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
