    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.900\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. For example, you might test if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:28.200\nThe light turning on is the answer! Or, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:34.200\nThe results tell them about your body. Tests aren't just in science or medicine though.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:40.200\nWhen you take a quiz at school, that's a test of what you've learned.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:49.200\nBasically, anything that helps you learn or confirm something can be thought of as a test.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:53.200\nSo, remember, a test helps us discover information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
