    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_071810.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.000\nEver wonder what a test really is? \nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to see how much someone knows about something.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:15.200\nThink of it like checking if you know your ABCs.\nIt helps measure your understanding.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:24.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nThere are quizzes, exams, even just asking you a question to see what you think.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:35.000\nThey can be written, spoken, or even a practical demonstration.\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:41.800\nA math test checks your math skills.\nAnd a driving test checks if you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:49.200\nPretty straightforward, right?\nSo, a test is simply a tool to evaluate knowledge or skills.\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:58.100\nIt helps identify what you already know and what you might need to learn more about.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
