    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_071920.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:21.200\nWe use them all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:27.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if the oven is hot.\n\n00:27.200 --> 00:33.200\nYou carefully put your hand near it. That's a test!\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:38.100\nOr, maybe you're trying to figure out if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:43.600\nYou screw it in and flip the switch. Again, that's a test!\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:46.800\nTests aren't just for science class.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:50.200\nThey help us make decisions every day.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:53.600\nIs that apple ripe? Give it a squeeze.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:02.100\nDoes my code work? Run it and see! The results of a test give us information.\n\n01:02.100 --> 01:07.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n01:07.000 --> 01:12.900\nBy observing or experimenting, we can learn about the world around us.\n\n01:12.900 --> 01:18.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
