    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_072058.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.400 --> 00:14.900\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. It's a procedure we use to gather information.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:23.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy. They might check your temperature or take a blood sample.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:28.200\nThese are tests!\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:33.400\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:43.200\nThat's a test too! So, tests aren't just about exams in school. They can be anything from a simple taste test to a complex scientific experiment.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:54.100\nThe main idea is that we're using some kind of process to get an answer or learn something new. They help us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:54.100 --> 01:04.700\nTo recap, a test is a way of gathering information through a specific procedure. It could be anything from a doctor's checkup to tasting cake batter!\n\n01:04.700 --> 01:08.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
