    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something.\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like how much you've learned, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:41.100\nEven a bakery might test a new cookie recipe to see if people like it.\nSo, tests can be used to check knowledge, performance, or even just preferences.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:51.200\nThey give us information that helps us understand something better.\nIn short, a test is a tool used to gather information and evaluate something.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:54.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
