    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nHey everyone, welcome!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.000\nToday we're diving into something called a \"test.\"\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:08.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:11.800\nThink of it like checking if a cake is done.\n\n00:11.800 --> 00:13.500\nYou poke it with a fork, right?\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:14.200\nThat's a test!\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:16.900\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:21.200\nYou might take a written test at school to see what you've learned in history.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:24.900\nOr, you might have a taste test to decide which cookie is the tastiest!\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:29.000\nEven a doctor checking your reflexes is performing a test.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:33.600\nThe important thing is that tests help us understand something better.\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:36.800\nThey give us information we didn't have before.\n\n00:36.800 --> 00:46.800\nSo, whether it's a quiz, a taste test, or a science experiment, remember that a test is just a way to learn and find things out.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:51.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
