    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.140\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.140 --> 00:06.450\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.450 --> 00:12.640\nIt's a process or procedure designed to measure or evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:12.640 --> 00:18.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:20.860\nYou perform a test \u2013 you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:20.860 --> 00:23.800\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:27.710\nAnother example: a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:27.710 --> 00:31.690\nOr a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:31.690 --> 00:37.340\nTests can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes are tied.\n\n00:37.340 --> 00:45.590\nBasically, anything that helps you learn something new or confirm something you already suspect can be considered a test.\n\n00:45.590 --> 00:47.930\nSo, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n00:47.930 --> 00:51.070\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
