    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something. Think of it like a question, but instead of just asking, we're giving you a chance to show what you know or can do.\n\n00:17.900 --> 00:30.700\nThe main idea behind a test is evaluation. We want to see how well you understand a topic, your skills in a certain area, or even just your personality traits.\n\n00:30.700 --> 00:40.200\nFor example, a math test checks your understanding of numbers and equations. A spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:53.200\nAnd even a simple quiz on your favorite movie is a kind of test! So, in short, a test is a tool we use to measure knowledge, skills, or characteristics.\n\n00:53.200 --> 01:01.500\nIt helps us understand where you are and what you might need to learn next. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
