    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to check something.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking, so you test them by poking them with a toothpick.\nIf it comes out clean, they're ready!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:38.800\nIn general, a test helps us figure out if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain requirements.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:53.100\nFor example, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\nOr a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\nSo, tests come in all shapes and sizes, but they all share the same goal: to give us information!\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:59.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should. That's the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
