    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:15.300\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary in school, but really, a test is just a way to check if something works like it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.300 --> 00:23.700\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake and then you taste it. Tasting the cake is a test to see if it's delicious!\n\n00:23.700 --> 00:33.200\nOr, imagine you're buying a new toy. You might try pressing all the buttons to make sure they work \u2013 that's a test too.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:42.700\nTests can be simple, like checking if a light bulb turns on, or more complicated, like a doctor running blood tests.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.400\nThe main idea is always the same: we're trying to find out if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:59.100\nSo, tests help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
