    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_074357.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us understand something better.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:23.300\nThink about it: when you bake a cake, you might test it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:33.200\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz is a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:42.600\nTests aren't just in school or the kitchen. Doctors use tests to figure out what\u2019s going on inside our bodies. Mechanics use tests to see if a car is working properly.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:53.300\nBasically, a test helps us check something and learn more about it.\n\n00:53.300 --> 01:01.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for getting information. It helps us understand, diagnose, or evaluate something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
