    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.400 --> 00:07.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.900 --> 00:12.800\nIt could be finding out if you know your multiplication tables, or if a new medicine actually works.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:17.300\nBasically, it\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:21.800\nThink about it like this: your teacher gives you a spelling test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:21.800 --> 00:27.000\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.100\nThese are all tests, and they help us learn and improve.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:35.700\nSo, a test is just a method for checking something.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:42.200\nIt helps us measure knowledge, evaluate performance, or see if something works as expected.\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:49.200\nFrom school exams to product quality checks, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:49.200 --> 00:56.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
