    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:21.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we measure, evaluate, or check something to see what it's like, or how well it works.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:31.500\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a medical test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a quiz in school to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:44.300\nEven trying a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like the way it tastes! Basically, it's any process designed to give us information.\n\n00:44.300 --> 00:54.000\nSo, a test can be a written exam, a physical assessment, or even just trying something out. The key is that it helps us learn something new or confirm something we already suspect. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
