    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:10.800\nOkay, so you're wondering what a test actually is, right?\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:15.800\nWell, in simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:25.000\nIt could be about anything! Think of it as a way to gather information.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:33.200\nThe main idea is to ask a question, or present a challenge, and see what happens.\n\n00:33.200 --> 00:41.400\nThe response gives us clues. For example, a spelling test helps us see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:56.100\nOr think about baking a cake. Taste-testing it is a test to see if it's delicious! The results of these tests help us understand things better, like what you need to study more, or what ingredients to add to make the cake even tastier.\n\n00:56.100 --> 01:02.000\nSo, a test is all about asking questions and learning from the answers. It's a simple way to check our knowledge or see if something works. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
