    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_075414.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.700\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\nThink of it like this: a test can be as simple as checking if the light switch works.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:30.500\nYou flip the switch, and if the light turns on, the test passes!\nOr, imagine a taste test.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:37.300\nYou try a new flavor of ice cream, and you decide if you like it or not.\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:52.000\nTests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\nWhether it's a school exam, a medical check-up, or even just trying a new recipe, tests are everywhere.\n\n00:52.000 --> 01:00.200\nThey help us understand the world around us.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information.\n\n01:00.200 --> 01:06.700\nIt's a process to explore and learn.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
