    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:13.400 --> 00:22.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out if something is working correctly, or to check the quality of something.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:27.500\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is!\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:32.800\nThink about it this way: a doctor might give you a physical exam.\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:38.700\nThat's a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:44.600\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:47.300\nYou might taste the batter before you bake it.\n\n00:47.300 --> 00:51.800\nThat's a test to make sure it tastes good!\n```"
