    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:23.600\nIt could be to see if you understand a topic, like in a school test.\nOr it could be to check if something works correctly.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:32.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\nThey might check your temperature or your blood pressure.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:42.900\nA baker tests their cake by poking it with a toothpick to see if it's done.\nSo, a test is just a procedure we use to gather information and make a judgment.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:53.600\nIt helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\nRemember, tests come in many forms, from classroom quizzes to scientific experiments.\n\n00:53.600 --> 00:57.300\nThey all help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
