    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.800\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.800 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:23.500\nIt's a process, or a set of questions, designed to measure your knowledge or ability. Think of it like this: a spelling test checks how well you can spell words.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:29.500\nA taste test checks how good something tastes. And a medical test can check your health.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:40.200\nTests help us learn where we're strong and where we might need a little more practice or attention. So, tests are all about finding information!\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:47.800\nRemember, tests are just one way to learn and grow. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
