    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:10.800\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:10.800 --> 00:17.600\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your spelling words.\nOr, maybe you take a hearing test at the doctor to check your hearing.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:34.600\nTests aren't just for school or doctors, though.\nA chef might test a recipe to see if it tastes good.\nAn engineer might test a bridge design to make sure it's strong.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:47.200\nThe goal is always the same: to learn something new or confirm something we already suspect.\nSo remember, a test is just a method for finding things out!\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:55.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
