    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_080021.mp4",
    "subtitles": "WEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.800\nOkay, so what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.800 --> 00:19.300\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like checking if your cookies are baked enough \u2013 you might poke one with a toothpick.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:31.100\nThat\u2019s a test! Tests aren't just for cookies, of course. In school, you take tests to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:38.300\nA doctor might run tests to check your health. And even engineers test bridges to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:38.300 --> 00:50.300\nSo, a test is really just a process. It involves setting up a condition, observing what happens, and then drawing a conclusion.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:56.000\nWe do it all the time, often without even realizing it. It helps us make decisions based on evidence.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:57.400\nThat's the power of a test!\n\n00:57.400 --> 00:59.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI."
  },
  "d57ecd2d-6d8d-4f64-a54f-f3a9ab1e2570": {
