    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.600\nWell, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.600 --> 00:23.200\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like your knowledge, a product's quality, or even how well a recipe works.\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:29.700\nThink of it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how many words you know.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:36.500\nThat's a test! Or imagine a chef trying a new sauce recipe.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:46.300\nThey're testing it to see if it tastes good. Tests can be anything from a quiz to a scientific experiment.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:52.600\nThe key is that they give us information. They help us understand, improve, or make decisions.\n\n00:52.600 --> 00:56.200\nSo, a test is just a way to find out something important. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
