    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it like an experiment, but often with questions or tasks.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:21.200\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:26.400\nImagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter to test if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:32.500\nThat's a test! Or, think about taking a quiz in school. That's a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:40.200\nAnother example could be checking if your phone is working. You might call a friend to test the speaker and microphone.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:42.800\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:52.300\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see if something works, if something is true, or how much you know.\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:54.200\nPretty simple, right?\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
