    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:25.200\nIt's a process where we ask a question or present a challenge to see what the answer or outcome will be.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:33.400\nThink about it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you stick a toothpick in it. That\u2019s a test!\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:38.700\nOr, if you want to see if your plant needs water, you stick your finger in the soil.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:44.700\nThat's another test. Tests aren\u2019t just for baking or gardening. We use them all the time!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:50.700\nDoctors use tests to check your health. Teachers use tests to see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:55.300\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information. It helps us understand something better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
