    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:26.500\nThink of it like this: You might take a spelling test in school to see how good you are at spelling words.\n\n00:26.500 --> 00:34.000\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:42.100\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. Sometimes they're written, like a quiz. Sometimes they're hands-on, like a science experiment.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:58.900\nAnd sometimes they\u2019re even just observing something, like watching how fast a plant grows with different amounts of water. So, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new!\n\n00:58.900 --> 01:02.000\nWhether it's testing your knowledge, testing a product, or testing an idea,\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:05.500\ntests help us understand the world around us better.\n\n01:05.500 --> 01:08.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
