    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:23.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it! Think about it: a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:35.000\nA chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt. Even just trying a new pizza place is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you like their pizza!\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:44.500\nSo, a test involves doing something and then observing the result. The result helps us answer a question or make a decision.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:48.100\nTests are a fundamental part of learning and understanding the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
