    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.800\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:22.200\nThink of it like asking a question, but maybe in a more structured way.\n\n00:22.200 --> 00:32.700\nWe use tests all the time to see if something is working, or to understand how well something is done.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:39.400\nFor example, you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:46.100\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:52.700\nEven baking a cake is a bit of a test! You're testing your recipe and your baking skills.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.800\nSo, tests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\n```"
