    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_082045.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like asking a question and then looking for the answer. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:38.200\nFor example, when you try a new food, you're testing whether you like it. Or, if you flip a light switch, you're testing if the lightbulb works.\n\n00:38.200 --> 00:52.800\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even projects. The goal is to show what you know about a particular subject.\n\n00:52.800 --> 01:05.000\nSo, a test is just a method to gather information, whether it's about your taste buds, a lightbulb, or your understanding of a topic. It helps us learn and understand the world around us better.\n\n01:05.000 --> 01:07.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
