    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:11.600\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:22.600\nIt helps us check if things are working correctly, or if we understand something well. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:30.800\nA chef might taste their food to test if it tastes good. And in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:40.200\nTests can be simple, like checking if a light bulb turns on. Or they can be more complicated, like a big exam.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:46.100\nThe important thing is that they give us information. They help us learn and improve.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:58.400\nSo, to recap: a test is a way to find out something, used to check understanding or functionality. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
