    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.400\nNow, a test isn't just something scary you take in school. It's really just a way to check if something is working properly or if you understand something.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if the batteries work.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:35.600\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking a cake. You test it with a toothpick to see if it\u2019s cooked all the way through.\n\n00:35.600 --> 00:49.800\nIn school, tests help your teacher see what you've learned. They can be quizzes, exams, or even just a simple check-in.\n\n00:49.800 --> 00:57.000\nTesting helps us learn and improve, whether it\u2019s a toy, a cake, or your understanding of a new topic.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:00.600\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check things. It helps us learn and make things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
