    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. \n\n00:04.200 --> 00:08.900\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:19.600\nIt's a process designed to give us information.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:24.000\nWe use tests all the time, whether we realize it or not!\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:28.100\nThink about it.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:31.500\nA doctor gives you a checkup \u2013 that's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.400\nOr maybe you're baking a cake.\n\n00:36.400 --> 00:40.100\nYou might stick a toothpick in it to see if it's done.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:40.900\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:45.300\nIt helps you decide if it's ready to eat.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:51.100\nTests can be formal, like a school exam, or informal, like checking the weather forecast before you go outside.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:55.000\nThe key is that they all provide us with some kind of answer.\n\n00:55.000 --> 00:57.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n```"
  },
