    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out something. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give us information.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:22.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Imagine you're baking a cake.\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:27.300\nYou poke it with a toothpick to see if it's done. That's a test!\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:31.900\nOr, if you're learning a new language, a quiz helps show you how much you've learned.\n\n00:31.900 --> 00:41.500\nTests aren't just for school, though. Doctors use tests to see if you're healthy, and engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:54.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool to help us understand something better. It helps us measure, evaluate, and learn.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
