    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_083305.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:20.800\nIt helps us check if something is working, if something is true, or how well someone understands something.\n\n00:20.800 --> 00:31.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have the flu. Or, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you learned the lesson.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:46.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing the recipe to see if it turns out right! Tests can be big or small, formal or informal, but they all help us gather information and learn.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:54.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find things out! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
