    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:09.100 --> 00:15.700\nA test is basically a way to see how well you know something or how well something works.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:20.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on when you flip the switch.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:31.200\nThat's a simple test! In school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned. They might ask you questions about a book you read, or have you solve a math problem.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:35.900\nThese tests show what you understand.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:41.700\nAnother example? Imagine you're baking a cake. Tasting it to see if it's sweet enough is a test.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:47.800\nYou're checking if you added the right amount of sugar. So, remember, a test is simply a way to check understanding or functionality.\n\n00:47.800 --> 00:53.200\nIt helps us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
