    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:20.700\nThink of it like checking your knowledge. It helps you, and sometimes others, see what you've learned and where you might need a little more practice.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:28.400\nFor example, if you're learning about animals, a test might ask you to name different types of birds.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:37.200\nOr, if you're learning to bake, a test could be trying out a simple recipe and seeing if you followed the instructions correctly.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:49.700\nTests can be written, like quizzes, or hands-on, like building something. Basically, tests are tools that help us measure and understand what we know.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:56.600\nThey're not scary, they're just a way to learn! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
