    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something, to see if it works or if it's true.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: a chef tests a sauce by tasting it to see if it needs more salt. Or, a doctor tests your vision to see if you need glasses.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:31.000\nThese are all tests! In science, tests are called experiments.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:38.600\nScientists might test if a plant grows better with sunlight, or if a new medicine helps people feel better.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:51.200\nThey gather information and use that to see if their ideas are correct. So, a test is just a way to find out if something is right, works well, or needs improvement.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:56.800\nIt\u2019s about gathering information to make a decision. That\u2019s the core idea!\n\n00:56.800 --> 01:00.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
