    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.500\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What is a test, anyway?\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:23.000\nThink about it.\nWhen you take a spelling test at school, the test is trying to find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:34.100\nOr, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:41.400\nAnother example: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\nIt could be a blood test, or even just checking your temperature.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:54.600\nThe test is giving them information.\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information or prove something.\nWhether it's a quiz, a recipe, or a medical checkup, it helps us understand something better.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
