    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_084041.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.000\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but with questions!\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:22.900\nWe use tests all the time to see what we know, what we can do, or even how something works.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:35.700\nSo, how does it work? Usually, a test presents you with a challenge, like a question on a quiz, or a problem to solve. Your response is then evaluated to see if it matches what we're looking for.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:44.900\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly. A taste test tells you which flavor you prefer.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:53.000\nEven a doctor uses tests to check your health! Basically, tests help us measure something and learn more.\n\n00:53.000 --> 01:02.800\nThey can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying out a new recipe. They are a tool for understanding.\n\n01:02.800 --> 01:06.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
