    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:14.100\nNow, a test is simply a way to check if something works correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to make sure it doesn't break easily, or a chef might taste their soup to see if it needs more salt.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:35.800\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\nThey can be multiple choice questions, short answers, or even projects!\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:45.300\nThe main goal is to show what you know.\nFor example, a math test might ask you to solve a simple equation like 2 + 2.\n\n00:45.300 --> 00:58.600\nOr, a spelling test might ask you to spell the word \"cat.\"\nEasy, right?\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to check understanding or functionality.\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:04.500\nIt helps us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
