    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.000\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests!\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:12.000\nIn everyday life, we use the word \"test\" to mean trying something out, or checking if something works.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:22.000\nA test, in its most basic form, is a procedure designed to evaluate something.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:29.000\nThink of it like a question or a challenge that gives you information about whatever you're testing.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:35.000\nFor example, you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:43.000\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you\u2019re healthy.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:46.000\nEven a simple spelling quiz is a test!\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:54.000\nThe results of these tests \u2013 like the flavor of the recipe, your health status, or your quiz score \u2013 give us valuable information.\n\n00:54.000 --> 00:57.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something by trying it out or examining it closely.\n\n00:57.000 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
