    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:37.000\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if you like it. Or when you press a button on a remote, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:37.000 --> 00:44.400\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:51.800\nA math test checks your understanding of numbers, while a spelling test shows how well you can write words.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:55.800\nTests aren't scary, they just help us learn and improve.\n\n00:55.800 --> 00:59.400\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to collect information and see what we know. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
