    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_085748.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.800\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a method we use to see if something is true, working correctly, or meeting a certain standard.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:27.300\nThink about it like this: a doctor gives you a test to see if you're healthy.\nA baker tastes their cake batter to test if it needs more sugar.\nOr, you might take a quiz at school to test your knowledge of a subject.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:40.300\nTests can be formal, like a final exam, or informal, like checking if your shoes are tied.\nThe important thing is that they provide information.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:49.300\nThey help us learn, improve, and make informed decisions.\nSo, remember, a test is simply a way to gather information.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:58.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
