    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:20.000\nA test is basically a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how good you are at spelling words.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:34.200\nOr, a chef might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:44.400\nTests aren't just for school!\nImagine you're buying a new phone.\nYou might read reviews \u2013 those are like tests other people have done.\n\n00:44.400 --> 00:52.200\nOr, a software company tests their new app to make sure it doesn't crash.\nWe use tests to check all sorts of things, big and small.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding out information.\nIt helps us learn and improve.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
