    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:08.900\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to see what you know or can do.\n\n00:08.900 --> 00:17.200\nThink of it like this: it's a snapshot of your understanding at a particular moment.\n\n00:17.200 --> 00:22.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:29.100\nYou might have a written test with multiple-choice questions, or maybe a practical test where you show someone how to do something.\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:31.100\nA spelling quiz is a test!\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:34.900\nBaking a cake and seeing if it tastes good?\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:36.300\nThat's kind of a test too, right?\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:45.100\nSo, imagine you're learning your ABCs. A test might ask you to write them down, or identify them when someone says them.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:48.100\nThat shows you're learning the alphabet!\n\n00:48.100 --> 00:56.200\nBasically, tests help us measure progress and identify areas where we might need a little more practice.\n\n00:56.200 --> 00:59.000\nThey're tools for learning, not just scary things!\n\n00:59.000 --> 01:01.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
