    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something fundamental: a test.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:18.800\nNow, in simple terms, a test is just a way to gather information. It helps us see what you know, what you can do, or even how something works.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:28.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:28.200 --> 00:34.900\nA teacher might give you a quiz to check your understanding of a lesson.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:40.900\nOr even a mechanic might run a test on your car to find out what's wrong.\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:51.100\nSo, examples? A multiple-choice quiz is a test. Trying a new recipe is a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:51.100 --> 01:00.900\nEven watching this video is a test to see if you learn something new! Basically, a test is any process designed to evaluate something.\n\n01:00.900 --> 01:04.500\nIt's about collecting data and making a judgment based on that data.\n```"
