    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:18.800\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to check something. It helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain expectations.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:26.000\nThink of it like this: You might test if a light bulb works by screwing it in. Does it light up? That\u2019s the test!\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:30.400\nOr, imagine you\u2019re baking cookies. You might taste one to test if it has enough sugar.\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:42.900\nSo, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate the quality, performance, or reliability of something. It can be anything from a simple check to a more complex experiment.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:52.800\nUltimately, tests help us make sure things are working as they should. That's the basics of what a test is.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:59.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
