    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_090502.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:07.700\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:14.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process that helps us gather information.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:20.700\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done baking.\nYou poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:23.200\nThat's a test!\n\n00:23.200 --> 00:28.600\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:34.000\nAnother example?\nA doctor gives you a checkup.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:38.000\nThey listen to your heart, check your reflexes \u2013\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:42.500\nthose are all tests to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:50.000\nTests can be used for all sorts of things, from checking if a lightbulb works to seeing how well you understand a new subject at school.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a method for getting answers.\n\n00:53.100 --> 00:53.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
