    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:18.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is ready.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:28.900\nYou might poke it with a toothpick, right? That's a test! In school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:39.300\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just asking questions in class. A test isn't about tricking you, it's about showing what you understand.\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:43.100\nFor example, a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:47.400\nA math test shows if you can solve problems.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:57.400\nSee? Tests are everywhere! They help us learn and improve. So, remember, a test is just a tool to check understanding.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:01.000\nIt\u2019s a way to see what you know and where you might need a little extra help.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
