    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn.\n\n00:14.100 --> 00:19.900\nThink about it. You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:19.900 --> 00:29.700\nOr maybe you bake a cake and give it a taste test to see if it's yummy. Even a doctor uses tests to figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:40.600\nSo, tests can be about knowledge, like knowing facts. They can also be about skills, like baking or playing an instrument.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:48.700\nThe key thing is, a test helps us understand something better. It gives us information we didn\u2019t have before.\n\n00:48.700 --> 00:56.400\nIn short, a test is a structured way to get answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
