    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_090720.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.300\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.300 --> 00:08.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it as a tool to measure or check something.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:23.000\nIt could be anything from a school exam to see how well you've learned, to a doctor checking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:27.000\nThe main point is that tests give us information.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.000\nA spelling test shows us which words you know and which you need to practice.\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:36.500\nA taste test helps us decide which flavor of ice cream is the best.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:40.500\nEven shaking a gift to guess what\u2019s inside is a kind of test!\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:46.000\nSo, to recap: a test is a method for gaining information.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:50.000\nIt helps us understand or evaluate something.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:53.500\nHopefully, now you have a better idea of what a test is.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:55.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
