    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how well someone knows something, or how well something works.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:18.200\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:26.000\nYou're testing if it's working properly.\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:35.000\nThey might ask you questions about a book you read, or a math problem you solved.\nAnother example is testing a new recipe.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:42.200\nYou taste it to see if it\u2019s good.\nIf it needs more salt, you know the test showed it wasn\u2019t quite right!\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:49.400\nSo, a test is just a way to check something.\nWhether it's your knowledge, or if something is working as it should.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:54.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
