    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_091005.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:08.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.400 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:20.700\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:24.800\nThe toothpick is your test!\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:25.300\nThat\u2019s a test.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:29.900\nOr, imagine you\u2019re trying to figure out which light switch turns on the lamp.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:33.900\nYou flip each switch, one by one, to test which one works.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:45.100\nSo, a test helps you confirm something, learn something new, or make a decision based on the results.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:52.700\nWhether it's baking a cake or finding the right light switch, tests are all around us!\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
