    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.900\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.600\nThink of it like an experiment, or a way to check if something is working as expected.\n\n00:27.600 --> 00:35.900\nFor example, a doctor might order a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:35.900 --> 00:44.200\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:44.200 --> 00:51.300\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing if the ingredients and recipe will create something delicious.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:59.000\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose problems, and make sure things are working correctly. They come in many forms, but they all share the same basic idea: to gather information. In short, a test is just a structured way to get answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
