    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.300\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.300 --> 00:15.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:24.200\nIt's like asking a question to see what the answer is.\n\n00:24.200 --> 00:31.200\nThink of it like this: a doctor uses a test to see if you're sick.\nA teacher uses a test to see if you understand the lesson.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:40.600\nAnd even you use tests every day!\nWhen you try a new food to see if you like it, that's a test.\nOr when you press a button to see what it does, you're testing it.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:51.000\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information.\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\nWe ask the question, and the test gives us the answer, or at least, a clue.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:54.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
