    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:19.600\nThink of it like a quick investigation.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:30.500\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:44.000\nOr, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:44.000 --> 00:52.400\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:00.800\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:15.000\nThey can be formal, like a standardized exam, or informal, like asking a friend for their opinion.\n\n01:15.000 --> 01:26.400\nBasically, if you're trying to learn something or check something out, you're probably using a test in some way.\n\n01:26.400 --> 01:30.000\nTo recap, a test is a process for getting information.\n\n01:30.000 --> 01:37.600\nIt can be used in many different situations, from school to cooking, and helps us learn and understand the world around us.\n\n01:37.600 --> 01:41.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
