    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_091707.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.000\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much someone knows about something, or how well they can do something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: you're learning to ride a bike, and your friend watches you to see if you can balance and pedal. That's a kind of test!\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:34.600\nTests can be written, like a quiz in school, or they can be practical, like that bike-riding example.\n\n00:34.600 --> 00:40.800\nAnother example is a spelling test. It checks if you know how to spell certain words correctly.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:52.800\nOr, a taste test can tell you which food tastes better. So, tests help us measure understanding, skills, or even preferences.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:59.800\nThey're a useful tool for learning and improvement. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
