    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:15.900\nNow, you might think of tests as something you take in school, but really, a test is just a way to find out if something works the way it's supposed to.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: you buy a new lightbulb, and you want to see if it lights up. You screw it in and flip the switch \u2013 that's a test!\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:32.400\nYou\u2019re testing if the lightbulb is working correctly. Or, imagine you bake a cake.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:36.700\nYou taste it to see if it\u2019s sweet enough. That's a test too!\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:46.100\nYou're testing the flavor. Basically, a test is any action you take to check if something meets a certain standard or expectation.\n\n00:46.100 --> 00:54.700\nYou're just trying to see if it does what you want it to do. So, remember, tests are all about checking things.\n\n00:54.700 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
