    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.000 --> 00:06.000\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:09.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:13.000\nIt helps us check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:18.000\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're sick.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:23.000\nOr, you might take a quiz in school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:26.000\nEven baking a cake is a test!\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:29.000\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:34.000\nTests aren't just for finding problems.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:40.000\nThey can also show us what we do know and what we're good at.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:46.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to learn more about something.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:48.000\nIt helps us understand things better.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:51.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "1e25b4c9-9564-4afb-a998-348e1c9d38c3": {
