    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:24.700\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even performance.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:32.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You screw it in, flip the switch \u2013 that's the test!\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:39.500\nAnother example: a spelling quiz. The test is seeing if you know how to spell certain words.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:43.400\nOr a taste test! Does this cookie taste good?\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:52.100\nThat's a test of your taste buds. So, a test can be anything from a simple check to a more complex evaluation.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:57.800\nThe key is that it helps us understand something better. It gives us information!\n\n00:57.800 --> 01:07.600\nFrom knowing if the lightbulb works, to understanding how well you know your spelling words, tests are all about gathering data.\n\n01:07.600 --> 01:18.600\nIn short, a test is a procedure designed to assess something. It gives us information about knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n01:18.600 --> 01:22.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
