    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:21.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. Think of it like an experiment, but instead of chemicals, we're testing things like your knowledge, your strength, or even just how well something works.\n\n00:21.100 --> 00:29.100\nThe main idea is to give you a question or a task, and then see how you do. This gives us information!\n\n00:29.100 --> 00:39.700\nFor example, a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:39.700 --> 00:42.300\nOr, testing a new toy can show if it's safe and fun to play with.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:52.700\nSee? Tests are everywhere! So, to recap: a test is a way to get information by asking questions or giving tasks. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:52.700 --> 00:56.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
