    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, so you're wondering what a test is, right?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:06.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:12.200\nIt's a process, a procedure, used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:17.000\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:21.300\nA taste test tells you which cookie tastes better.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:26.400\nOr, a medical test can help doctors figure out what's going on inside your body.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:31.800\nSo, tests aren't just about school! They help us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:31.800 --> 00:34.500\nThey give us information.\n\n00:34.500 --> 00:41.800\nIn short, a test is a way of gathering information to make a decision or draw a conclusion.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:45.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
