    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:24.700\nIt could be about you, about an object, or even about an idea. Think of it like this: A doctor gives you a physical test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:34.300\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt. Another example is taking a quiz in school to test what you've learned.\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:45.100\nBasically, a test helps us understand something better by giving us data or results. We then use those results to make decisions or learn more.\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:52.500\nSo, tests are all about gathering information! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
