    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_093117.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:28.700\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works. You screw it in, flip the switch \u2013 that's the test!\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:37.800\nIn general, tests help us measure or evaluate something.\n\n00:37.800 --> 00:48.200\nIt could be how well you understand a topic, the strength of a material, or even if a medical treatment is effective.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:51.800\nFor example, a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:51.800 --> 00:54.600\nA taste test determines which snack is the most delicious.\n\n00:54.600 --> 00:57.500\nAnd a pregnancy test checks if someone is pregnant.\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:03.900\nEssentially, a test is a procedure designed to give us information and help us make decisions.\n\n01:03.900 --> 01:08.900\nThey're all around us, helping us learn, improve, and understand the world better.\n\n01:08.900 --> 01:11.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
