    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_093203.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nOkay, so you're wondering what a test is?\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:15.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:28.400\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:40.600\nThink about it: when you try a new cookie recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\nOr when you turn a light switch on, you're testing if the light bulb works.\n\n00:40.600 --> 00:50.700\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand what you've been learning.\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even just a conversation.\n\n00:50.700 --> 00:56.700\nThe important thing is, they're giving information.\nSo, a test is just a method for gathering information and checking understanding.\nIt helps us learn and improve! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
