    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_093252.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nHey there, welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:12.300\nA test is basically a way to check if something is working correctly, or to see how well you understand something.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:23.600\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to make sure it doesn't break easily.\nOr, your teacher gives you a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:31.500\nTests come in all shapes and sizes.\nA simple test could be pressing a light switch to see if the light turns on.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:36.700\nA more complex test might be a big exam at school.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:45.600\nThe important thing is that a test gives you information.\nSo, to recap, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:56.700\nIt can be simple, like testing a light, or complex, like a school exam.\nTests give us information and help us understand things better.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
