    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:26.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:26.800 --> 00:32.400\nOr, you might take a test in school to show what you've learned.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:41.500\nEven baking a cake involves a test!\nYou taste it to see if it's sweet enough.\nThat taste is your test result!\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:49.000\nSo, tests are all around us, helping us learn and understand the world better.\nIn short, a test is just a way to get answers.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
