    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.300 --> 00:21.300\nIt could be checking if an answer is correct, checking if a piece of equipment is working, or even checking if you understand a new concept.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:32.100\nThink about it like this: a math quiz is a test to see if you know your addition and subtraction.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:40.500\nOr, a doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:48.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing your recipe and your skills to see if you get a delicious result.\n\n00:48.900 --> 00:58.300\nSo, tests help us understand things better, find problems, and make sure everything is working the way it should. They're everywhere around us!\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:04.600\nIn short, a test is a way to evaluate something. It helps us learn and improve.\n\n01:04.600 --> 01:06.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
