    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:12.500\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.500 --> 00:24.300\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:35.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:46.000\nOr, maybe you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test to see if you can follow a recipe!\n\n00:52.200 --> 01:00.800\nSo, tests can be used for all sorts of things. They help us understand what we know, what we can do, and what we might need to learn.\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:04.500\nThey're a tool for learning and improvement.\n\n01:04.500 --> 01:12.300\nIn short, a test helps to measure something. It can be a physical exam, a written quiz, or even trying out a new skill.\n\n01:12.300 --> 01:15.900\nNow you know what a test is!\n\n01:15.900 --> 01:19.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
