    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.000 --> 00:21.000\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer. Think of it as a simple experiment.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:30.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. A teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:42.100\nOr, you might even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good! So, tests help us measure things, check our understanding, or even just see if something works.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:54.300\nThey\u2019re all about gathering information. Understanding this simple concept is the first step to understanding more complex ideas later on.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:57.800\nIn short, a test is a question, and the results are the answer. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
