    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:16.500\nWhat are they and why are they important?\n\n00:16.500 --> 00:24.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:36.700\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if it meets certain standards.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:51.100\nThink about it: You take a spelling test to see how well you know your words. A doctor runs tests to check your health. A chef might taste a sauce to test if it has enough seasoning.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:59.600\nSo, tests can be written questions, physical checks, or even just observations. The goal is always to get information and make sure things are as they should be. From simple spelling quizzes to complex medical exams, tests help us learn, improve, and stay safe. In short, a test is a way to evaluate or examine something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
