    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_094234.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:13.500\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.500 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it as a question with a way to answer it. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:33.700\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good. Or, when you try a new route to school, you're testing if it's faster.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:40.100\nAnother example is a doctor giving you a checkup. They're running tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:50.900\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned. So, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:50.900 --> 00:58.600\nIt helps us understand the world around us and make better decisions. Remember, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:58.600 --> 01:02.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
