    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the very basic idea of what a test actually is.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.600\nSimply put, a test is just a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:25.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:33.300\nNow, tests can come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:40.100\nIt could be a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:46.900\nOr, it could be something like a taste test, where you try different foods and decide which one you like best.\n\n00:46.900 --> 00:53.700\nEven checking if a lightbulb works is a kind of test! You're seeing if it passes or fails.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:59.100\nEssentially, we use tests to learn things, make decisions, and understand the world around us better.\n```"
