    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something, or to see if something is working correctly.\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:16.200 --> 00:25.900\nThink about it this way: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.900 --> 00:40.300\nA teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\nOr, you might even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:48.800\nSo, whether it's checking your knowledge, your health, or even your cooking skills, a test helps us learn and improve.\n\n00:48.800 --> 00:52.400\nTests are all about gathering information and understanding the results. They help us make decisions based on evidence. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
