    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It could be anything, from checking if a light bulb works to seeing how well you understand a new topic.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:27.000\nThink of it like this: you bake a cake and then test it by tasting a slice to see if it's good.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:35.800\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike. Each time you try, you're testing your balance and coordination.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:50.300\nThe result of the test tells you something important. Tests help us learn, improve, and make decisions.\n\n00:50.300 --> 00:57.100\nSo, whether it's a pop quiz at school or trying out a new recipe, remember that a test is just a way to gather information. Tests help us understand things better. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
