    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.200 --> 00:06.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:11.000\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:11.000 --> 00:15.500\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, right?\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:18.500\nYou stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:22.000\nOr maybe you're wondering if you can lift a heavy box.\nYou try to lift it.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:23.000\nThat\u2019s also a test!\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:29.000\nTests can be formal, like a school exam to see what you\u2019ve learned.\nOr they can be informal, like checking the weather forecast before you decide what to wear.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:39.000\nThe important thing is, a test gives you information to help you make a decision or understand something better.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:42.500\nSo, a test is just a way of finding things out.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:46.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
