    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_095014.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:18.600\nToday, we're going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:18.600 --> 00:26.700\nNow, a test is basically a way to find out how much you know or how well you can do something.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:34.800\nThink of it as a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:43.700\nIt can be a written exam in school, a physical fitness challenge, or even a taste test for new flavors.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:51.000\nThe goal is to see where you stand.\n\n00:51.000 --> 01:05.400\nSo, to sum it up, a test is a tool used to assess what you've learned or how capable you are.\n\n01:05.400 --> 01:10.700\nIt helps you and others understand your strengths and areas where you might need a little more practice.\n\n01:10.700 --> 01:11.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
