    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:08.200 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to see what you know or can do.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:25.300\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:36.500\nYou plug it in, and if it lights up, you know it's good.\n\n00:36.500 --> 00:44.100\nTests can be on paper, like a quiz in school.\n\n00:44.100 --> 00:51.700\nThey can be hands-on, like a driving test to see if you can operate a car.\n\n00:51.700 --> 00:54.800\nOr, they can even be digital, like an online survey to get your opinion.\n\n00:54.800 --> 01:02.000\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words.\n\n01:02.000 --> 01:09.600\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie you like best.\n\n01:09.600 --> 01:16.500\nAnd a medical test can tell you if you're healthy.\n\n01:16.500 --> 01:25.600\nSo, tests help us measure things, learn new things, and make decisions.\n\n01:25.600 --> 01:30.100\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but they all have the same goal:\n\n01:30.100 --> 01:34.400\nto give us information.\n\n01:34.400 --> 01:38.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
