    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:16:26.535198",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T09:55:51.321708",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260107_095551.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_095551.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:04.000\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:04.000 --> 00:07.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:8.000\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge!\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:18.800\nIt could be a quiz in school, a driving exam, or even a taste test to see which cookie you like best.\n\n00:18.800 --> 00:24.000\nThe important thing is, it helps us understand where we are and what we might need to learn more about.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:31.000\nFor example, a spelling test shows which words you can spell correctly.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:35.700\nOr, a math test reveals your understanding of addition and subtraction.\n\n00:35.700 --> 00:41.500\nSo, a test is just a tool.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:47.000\nIt helps measure knowledge, skills, or even preferences.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:51.000\nIt provides valuable information to guide future learning and improvement.\n\n00:51.000 --> 00:53.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
