    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.000\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:06.000 --> 00:13.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.200 --> 00:21.500\nIt's how we gather information to see if something is true, or how well someone understands something.\n\n00:21.500 --> 00:28.400\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if a cake is done, you might stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:28.400 --> 00:33.800\nThat's a test!\n\n00:33.800 --> 00:39.500\nOr, if you want to know if your friend knows their ABCs, you might ask them to recite them.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:40.900\nThat\u2019s also a test!\n\n00:40.900 --> 00:45.900\nTests can be written, spoken, or even physical actions.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:49.300\nThey help us learn, evaluate, and make decisions.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:51.200\nSo, a test is just a method for getting information about something.\n```"
