    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What are they, and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something, or someone.\nIt helps us check knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:29.900\nThink about it like this: a spelling test tells your teacher if you know how to spell words.\nOr, a taste test can tell you which cookie is the most delicious!\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:38.100\nAnother example is when a doctor runs tests to see if you're healthy.\nThese tests help them understand what's going on.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:50.200\nSo, a test is just a procedure designed to gather information.\nIt can be formal like a school exam, or informal like trying different flavors of ice cream.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:56.800\nThe goal is always to learn something new!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
