    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:06.600\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\nA test is basically a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.600 --> 00:15.000\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:31.200\nThe main idea behind a test is to see if something is true, correct, or present.\nIt could be a medical test to see if you're healthy, a taste test to see if you like a new flavor, or even a simple quiz to see what you've learned.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:41.400\nFor example, a doctor might run a test to check your blood sugar.\nOr, a company might test a new product to see if customers like it.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:53.600\nEven putting a battery in a toy to see if it works is a kind of test!\nSo, in short, a test helps us get information and make decisions based on that information.\n\n00:53.600 --> 01:01.000\nIt's a simple yet powerful tool we use every day.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
