    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.700\nHi there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.700 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a process we use to gather information and see how well something performs, or what it's made of.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:24.500\nThink about it: a spelling test checks how well you know your words. A taste test helps you decide which cookie is the yummiest.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:38.800\nAnd a medical test helps doctors understand what's going on inside your body. So, basically, a test involves setting something up, doing something to it, and then looking at the results.\n\n00:38.800 --> 00:49.300\nWe then use those results to make a decision or understand something better. Tests are all around us, helping us learn and improve things every day!\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:57.500\nIn short, a test is just a simple way to gather information. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
