    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHello everyone, and welcome! \n\n00:05.800 --> 00:18.200\nToday, we're going to learn about tests. Simply put, a test is a way to check if something is working correctly or if something is true.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:28.500\nThink of it like this: you might test a new toy to see if it needs batteries. Or, you might test a recipe by making it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:36.000\nIn school, tests help your teacher understand what you've learned. A doctor might use tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:44.700\nAnd engineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe to cross. So, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:49.700\nThey help us learn, stay healthy, and make sure things are working properly.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:52.300\nIn short, tests are all about checking and confirming. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
