    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:09.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something really important: what exactly is a test?\n\n00:09.000 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to gather information about something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.100\nIt could be about anything! Think of it like a mini-investigation.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:34.200\nYou're trying to find out more about a person, a product, or even an idea.\n\n00:34.200 --> 00:41.000\nFor example, a school exam is a test to see how much you've learned.\n\n00:41.000 --> 00:51.200\nOr, imagine trying out a new recipe. That's a test to see if you like the taste! Even checking if a lightbulb works is a simple test.\n\n00:51.200 --> 00:59.300\nYou're gathering information to see if it's functioning as expected. So, remember, a test is just a method for collecting information. It helps us understand things better and make informed decisions. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
