    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\nNOTE: The subtitles below are placeholders. Precise syncing requires the audio file.\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into something super important: tests.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:15.000\nThink of a test as a way to check if something works the way it's supposed to. It's like a detective checking for clues!\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.800\nIn everyday life, we use tests all the time. For example, when you bake a cake, you might poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:34.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, that's a test showing the cake is done. Or, imagine you build a tower of blocks.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:39.600\nYou might gently push it to see if it's strong enough to stand. That\u2019s a test too!\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:53.400\nTests help us find problems and fix them. So, whether it's a cake, a tower, or something much more complicated, tests are all about making sure things are working correctly.\n\n00:53.400 --> 01:03.100\nTests help us learn and improve. So, remember, a test is simply a way to check if something is working as expected.\n\n01:03.100 --> 01:09.800\nIt's all about finding out if things are good to go! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
