    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:05.500\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:07.700\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:12.200\nWe use tests all the time without even realizing it.\n\n00:12.200 --> 00:15.900\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you\u2019re testing it out to see if you like it.\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:19.800\nOr when you push a button on a toy, you\u2019re testing to see if it works.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:25.300\nTests can be formal, like a school exam to see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:30.500\nOr they can be informal, like checking if the water's warm enough before you jump in the pool.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:35.500\nThe important thing is that a test helps us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:40.700\nSo, a test is a way to gather information or check something.\n\n00:40.700 --> 00:42.200\nNow you know!\n\n00:42.200 --> 00:44.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
