    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:04.900\nIn simple terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\n\n00:04.900 --> 00:08.500\nIt's like an investigation, a way to gather information to help us understand something better.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:12.800\nThink about it: when you go to the doctor, they might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:16.800\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:21.300\nA test can be as simple as tasting a new food to see if you like it.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:22.400\nThat\u2019s a test!\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:27.400\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might try turning it off and on again.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:30.300\nThat's also a test to see if it fixes the problem.\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:33.500\nSo, tests are everywhere!\n\n00:33.500 --> 00:38.100\nThey help us learn, diagnose problems, and make decisions based on evidence.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:42.700\nThey're about exploring and understanding the world around us.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:45.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
