    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_101308.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:10.100\nOkay, so what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:10.100 --> 00:18.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb is good. You screw it in, and if it lights up, it passes the test!\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:30.500\nIn school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned. They can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like showing you can ride a bike.\n\n00:30.500 --> 00:39.400\nImagine you're learning about animals. A test might ask you to name different types of birds, or explain what a mammal is.\n\n00:39.400 --> 00:49.000\nIf you answer correctly, you've passed that part of the test! So, tests are just a way to check understanding or functionality.\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:58.200\nThey come in many forms, but the goal is always to evaluate something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
