    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_101354.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. Think of it as a question, or a series of questions, that helps you learn more about a person, place, or thing.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:28.500\nFor example, a spelling test helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:28.500 --> 00:41.700\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a kind of test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:51.100\nDoctors use tests to find out if you're healthy, and scientists use tests to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:56.800\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and understand something better. Remember, tests aren't scary! They're just tools for learning. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
