    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:15.000\nNow, a test, in its simplest form, is just a way to see how well something works, or if something is true.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:21.400\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb turns on. You're testing if the lightbulb is working.\n\n00:21.400 --> 00:27.300\nThere are all kinds of tests.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:37.100\nA doctor might give you a physical test to check your health. A teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a subject. Even baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing your recipe!\n\n00:37.100 --> 00:48.600\nFor example, you can test if water is hot by touching it carefully. Or, you can test if a toy car needs new batteries by seeing if it still moves.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:56.700\nSo, a test is simply a way to find something out. It helps us learn, fix things, and make sure everything is working the way it should.\n\n00:56.700 --> 01:00.800\nIn short, a test is a way to check if something is working or true.\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:04.800\nIt's a simple but powerful tool we use every day.\n\n01:04.800 --> 01:07.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
