    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests!\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:12.400\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:20.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure designed to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like a way to get answers to questions.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:35.200\nWe use tests all the time! Your doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A chef might taste a sauce to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:35.200 --> 00:46.300\nEven trying on a new pair of shoes is a test \u2013 you're testing if they fit! So, whether it's checking your health, perfecting a recipe, or finding the right shoes, tests help us learn and make informed decisions.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:53.500\nThey give us information. To recap, a test is a procedure to check or evaluate something. It helps us find answers.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
