    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_102222.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:19.600\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:26.700\nIt's a process or a procedure designed to evaluate something, like your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:32.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test helps your teacher understand how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:38.400\nOr, a taste test helps you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:51.400\nSee?\nTests are everywhere!\nThey help us learn more about ourselves and the world around us.\nWe use them to measure progress, identify strengths and weaknesses, and make informed decisions.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:55.100\nSo, tests are a super useful tool for learning and improving.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
