    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something. It's a process or procedure designed to evaluate or measure.\n\n00:15.000 --> 00:24.700\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a physical test to check your health.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:30.200\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see what you've learned.\n\n00:30.200 --> 00:41.700\nTests can be used for all sorts of things! Imagine you're baking a cake. Tasting it is a test to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:52.000\nOr, if you're trying out a new video game, playing the first level is a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:52.000 --> 00:58.000\nSo, to recap, a test is just a way of gathering information. It helps us understand things better and make informed decisions.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:00.000\nWe use tests every day, often without even realizing it!\n```"
  },
