    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.200 --> 00:16.700\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find something out.\n\n00:16.700 --> 00:23.000\nThink of it like asking a question, but instead of just listening for an answer, you're using a specific method to gather information.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:27.500\nFor example, imagine you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:32.100\nYou could poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:34.700\nThat's a test!\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:41.800\nOr, think about a spelling test at school.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:45.900\nIt helps your teacher see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:52.100\nTests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like that toothpick trick.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:55.600\nBut they all share the same goal: to help us learn something new or confirm what we already suspect.\n```"
