    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:12.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.400 --> 00:22.700\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the strength of a material, or even if a cake is done baking!\n\n00:22.700 --> 00:31.100\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows what words you know.\nA doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:40.200\nAnd a baker might poke a cake with a toothpick; if it comes out clean, the cake passes the \"done-ness\" test!\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:53.500\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions based on that information.\nThey come in many forms, but the core idea is always the same: to learn something.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
