    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_103231.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:14.600\nWhat are they, and why do we use them? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is ready, so you poke it with a toothpick. That's a test!\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:34.100\nIn school, tests help teachers see how well you understand the material. For example, a spelling test shows if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:42.900\nOr imagine you're buying a new phone. Reading reviews and comparing features is like running tests to find the best one for you.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:53.900\nSo, tests help us gather information and make informed decisions. They come in many forms, from simple quizzes to product reviews.\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:02.500\nUltimately, they help us learn and understand the world around us. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
