    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_103532.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nWe use tests all the time to see how well we understand things, or how good we are at something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:24.300\nThink of it like this: if you want to know if your cake is done baking, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:24.300 --> 00:29.900\nIn school, tests help your teachers see what you\u2019ve learned.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:38.600\nThey can be multiple choice, true or false, or even writing an essay.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:44.700\nAnother example is a taste test.\nTrying different flavors of ice cream to see which one you like best?\n\n00:44.700 --> 00:56.000\nThat\u2019s a test too! So, remember, a test is just a way to get information and learn something new.\nIt helps us understand where we are and what we might need to work on.\n\n00:56.000 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
