    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_103619.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:25.000\nIt helps us understand how well something works, or how much someone knows.\nThink of it like this: a teacher gives a test to see how much students have learned in class.\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:30.000\nOr, a doctor might run a test on your blood to check your health.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:36.700\nSee?\nDifferent kinds of tests for different things.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:41.500\nAnother example is when you try a new recipe.\nYou taste it, right?\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:46.300\nThat's a test to see if it tastes good!\nSo, tests aren't always scary exams.\n\n00:46.300 --> 00:51.100\nThey can be simple ways to learn and understand.\nSo, in a nutshell, a test is an evaluation.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:56.800\nIt helps us learn, understand, and improve things.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "38c7d070-6ce5-4df0-9682-cb665f85f181": {
    "id": "38c7d070-6ce5-4df0-9682-cb665f85f181",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:17:00.174650",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T10:37:05.481350",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260107_103705.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_103705.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:16.300\nYou might take tests in school, or even online, but what exactly is a test?\n\n00:16.300 --> 00:29.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to measure something. We use tests to see what you know, what you can do, or even how something works.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:40.500\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:50.400\nA recipe is like a test for your cooking skills! It gives you instructions, and the result, the food, shows if you followed them correctly.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:58.100\nSo, a test is just a method for finding something out. They come in all shapes and sizes, and are used to learn and improve. Remember, tests aren't scary, they're just tools! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
