    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.100\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.100 --> 00:06.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:08.600\nWe use them all the time!\n\n00:08.600 --> 00:12.000\nThink about it: a taste test tells you if you like a new food.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:15.200\nA spelling test shows how well you know your words.\n\n00:15.200 --> 00:18.300\nThe main idea behind any test is to measure something.\n\n00:18.300 --> 00:23.300\nYou're trying to see how much of something there is, or how well someone can do something.\n\n00:23.300 --> 00:29.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to measure the levels of different things in your blood.\n\n00:29.500 --> 00:35.000\nOr, a teacher might give you a math test to see how well you understand fractions.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:41.700\nSo remember, a test is just a tool. It helps us learn and understand things better by measuring knowledge, skills, or even our preferences.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
