    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_104005.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.400\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:04.400 --> 00:15.800\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a light bulb works, so you screw it in and flip the switch.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:24.400\nThat's a test! You're checking if the light bulb passes.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:31.400\nTests can be about anything. Maybe you\u2019re checking if you learned something in class \u2013 that's a test too!\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:38.400\nOr maybe a doctor is checking your health. They might give you a blood test to see if everything is working properly.\n\n00:38.400 --> 00:43.000\nSo, tests help us understand if something is working, if something is true, or if something meets a certain standard.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:46.800\nThey give us information.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:49.400\nIn short, a test is a check.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:52.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
