    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.300 --> 00:06.700\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:15.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:27.300\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:36.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:36.600 --> 00:43.000\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if it tastes good.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:49.400\nOr, when you press a button on a remote control, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:53.400\nTests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:53.400 --> 01:02.700\nImagine you're building a tower of blocks.\n\n01:02.700 --> 01:06.300\nYou gently place each block, testing its stability.\n\n01:06.300 --> 01:09.900\nIf it wobbles, you adjust it.\n\n01:09.900 --> 01:11.900\nThat's a test!\n\n01:11.900 --> 01:14.200\nIt gives you immediate feedback.\n\n01:14.200 --> 01:22.400\nBasically, a test is any process that checks something to see if it meets a certain standard or performs as expected.\n\n01:22.400 --> 01:25.700\nIt's all about gathering information!\n\n01:25.700 --> 01:32.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
