    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, in simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:15.100 --> 00:25.000\nThink of it like an experiment or a check-up. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:25.000 --> 00:31.000\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:31.000 --> 00:38.600\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson. See?\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:44.800\nDifferent tests, different purposes, but the same basic idea.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:55.000\nAnother example is baking a cake. You might taste the batter before baking to test if it needs more sugar. That's a test too!\n\n00:55.000 --> 01:03.000\nBasically, a test helps us learn something new, confirm what we already know, or make sure something is working correctly.\n\n01:03.000 --> 01:07.800\nSo remember, a test is just a way to check things out.\n\n01:07.800 --> 01:09.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
