    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use them all the time to check if things are working, to see what we've learned, or even to explore new ideas.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:31.100\nThink about it like this: a chef might taste a soup to test if it needs more salt. Or, when you're learning to ride a bike, each attempt is kind of a test to see how well you're balancing.\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:42.100\nIn school, tests help teachers understand what students have learned. In science, experiments are tests to see if a hypothesis is correct.\n\n00:42.100 --> 00:53.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information. It helps us learn, improve, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:57.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
