    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_104555.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:16.100 --> 00:23.400\nThink of it as a question, or a series of questions, designed to give us information.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:32.400\nIt could be about anything. Maybe you want to test if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:41.600\nYou poke them with a toothpick; that's a test! Or, imagine you\u2019re learning a new language.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:54.300\nA quiz is a test to see how well you understand the vocabulary and grammar. Scientists use tests all the time to see if their ideas are correct.\n\n00:54.300 --> 01:01.000\nThey might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:07.700\nSo, a test is just a way to gather data and learn something new.\n\n01:07.700 --> 01:19.400\nIt helps us understand things better, whether it's cookies, languages, or medicine. Remember, tests are tools for learning!\n\n01:19.400 --> 01:26.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
