    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_104637.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.900\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.900 --> 00:08.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:08.000 --> 00:12.700\nIt's a set of questions or tasks designed to measure knowledge, ability, or even performance.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:18.000\nThink of it like this: you take a spelling test to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:21.900\nAnother example is a taste test!\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:27.000\nYou might try different flavors of ice cream to see which one you like best.\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:32.400\nIn science, you might test a hypothesis by running an experiment.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:36.100\nThe results help you decide if your initial idea was correct.\n\n00:36.100 --> 00:42.600\nEssentially, tests help us gather information and make informed decisions.\n\n00:42.600 --> 00:47.500\nThey come in all shapes and sizes, but the basic idea is always the same: to learn something new.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
