    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:19.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:19.600 --> 00:27.700\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:36.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cake is done, so you do the toothpick test!\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:45.100\nYou stick a toothpick in the middle, and if it comes out clean, you know the cake is ready. That's a test!\n\n00:45.100 --> 00:53.900\nOr, let's say you're learning to ride a bike. Each time you try and see if you can balance without falling, that's also a test. You're testing your balance!\n\n00:53.900 --> 01:02.700\nTests aren't just for school; we use them every day to learn and understand the world around us.\n\n01:02.700 --> 01:08.200\nThey help us confirm what we think is true and make better decisions.\n\n01:08.200 --> 01:12.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
