    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It helps us gather information about a person, a thing, or even an idea.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:23.800\nThink of it like this: a math test helps your teacher understand how well you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:35.100\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which cookie recipe is the tastiest. Even trying out a new game is a kind of test to see if you enjoy playing it.\n\n00:35.100 --> 00:43.100\nSo, tests aren't just about grades or right and wrong answers. They're a way to learn and discover things.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:55.600\nThey help us measure, evaluate, and understand the world around us. In short, a test is a process of gathering information to make a judgment or decision.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:59.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
