    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_105448.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to explore something super important: a test!\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:14.900\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:26.400\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:31.400\nThink of it like this: a chef might taste their soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:31.400 --> 00:37.200\nOr a doctor might check your temperature to test if you have a fever.\n\n00:37.200 --> 00:43.000\nSee? We use tests all the time! Another example could be a simple math problem.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:49.600\nSolving it is a test of your math skills! If you get the right answer, you've passed the test!\n\n00:49.600 --> 01:00.800\nTests help us learn and understand things better. So, to recap, a test is a method for finding information or evaluating something.\n\n01:00.800 --> 01:06.000\nIt can be big or small, simple or complex, but it always helps us learn and understand.\n\n01:06.000 --> 01:07.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
