    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:25.800\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:35.000\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:49.400\nOr, you might even test a new recipe to see if it tastes good! So, tests aren't just about getting a grade in school.\nThey're used everywhere to gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:49.400 --> 01:01.000\nWhether it's testing a new product, testing your eyesight, or testing your knowledge of a subject, tests help us learn and improve.\nIn short, a test is a method for evaluating something, used in countless ways every single day. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
