    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_110020.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.900\nHey there, welcome! Today, we're going to explore something really important: the test.\n\n00:06.900 --> 00:14.400\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information.\n\n00:14.400 --> 00:23.400\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. Think of it like this: a doctor uses tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:37.500\nOr, a teacher gives you a test to see how well you understand a subject. Tests can be written, like a quiz, or practical, like baking a cake to see if you can follow a recipe.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:51.300\nSo, a test helps us to learn things about ourselves, other people, or even the world around us. They give us information that we can use to make decisions or understand things better.\n\n00:51.300 --> 00:57.500\nIn short, a test is a way to gather data. That's the basic idea of a test!\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
