    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_110115.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about what a test is.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:14.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. We use them all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:14.600 --> 00:25.400\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, your teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:31.700\nEven trying a new recipe is a test! You're testing if you can make a delicious dish.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:36.700\nThe result of the test tells you something.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:41.300\nDid the recipe work? Did you pass the doctor's checkup? Did you understand the lesson?\n\n00:41.300 --> 00:45.900\nSo, a test is just a process to gather information.\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:55.300\nWe ask a question, and the test helps us find the answer. Remember, tests are all about learning and understanding.\n\n00:55.300 --> 00:58.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
