    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:07.100 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a process we use to gather information and see how well someone or something performs.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:28.800\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words. Or, a taste test helps you decide which cookie tastes the best!\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:44.800\nIn science, you might test if a plant grows better in sunlight or shade. So, whether it's a quiz in school, a medical check-up, or even trying out a new recipe, all of these are different kinds of tests.\n\n00:44.800 --> 00:53.300\nThey all help us learn and understand things better. Remember, a test is just a tool for gathering information.\n\n00:53.300 --> 00:57.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
