    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.200\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:06.200 --> 00:14.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.800 --> 00:19.000\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and seeing what answer you get.\n\n00:19.000 --> 00:24.700\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:29.700\nThink about baking a cake.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:32.800\nYou taste the batter, right?\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:34.900\nThat's a test to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:39.900\nOr imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:42.700\nYou try it out, and see if you can balance.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:43.900\nThat's another test!\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:47.400\nTests aren't just in classrooms.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:50.800\nDoctors use tests to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:53.900\nEngineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:57.400\nBasically, if you want to know something for sure, you do a test.\n\n00:57.400 --> 01:03.800\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to get information and see if something works, or if something is true.\n\n01:03.800 --> 01:07.500\nIt's a fundamental part of learning and understanding the world around us.\n\n01:07.500 --> 01:11.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
