    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.700\nHey there, welcome! Today we're diving into what a test is.\n\n00:04.700 --> 00:12.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:17.600\nThink of it like checking if a cake is done. You poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:23.400\nThe toothpick is the test! If it comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:35.000\nTests can be written, like the ones you take in school. Or, they can be practical, like a driving test where you show you can safely operate a car.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:47.000\nEven a doctor checking your temperature is a type of test to see if you have a fever. So, a test is just a method to measure knowledge, skill, or ability.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:55.500\nIt helps us understand where we're at and what we might need to learn next. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
