    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:13.900\nNow, a test is really just a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:21.900\nThink of it like asking a question, but in a formal way.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:31.200\nBasically, a test helps us understand if something is working correctly, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:31.200 --> 00:40.000\nIt\u2019s used to measure, evaluate, or check.\n\n00:40.000 --> 00:50.800\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or your teacher might give you a quiz to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:50.800 --> 00:56.800\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 does it taste good? Did it rise properly? So, in short, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or performance. It helps us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
