    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something really important: tests!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:17.400\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:28.000\nThink of it like a check-up. It could be a quiz at school to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:37.400\nOr, it could be a scientist testing a new medicine to see if it makes people feel better.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:47.500\nMaybe you even test out a new video game before you buy it to see if you like playing it! So, tests help us learn and improve.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:56.200\nThey give us information we can use to make better choices, whether it's studying harder for that quiz, or using a medicine that\u2019s proven to work. In short, a test is a way to gather information and see what's up! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
