    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.100\nIt's a process we use to check if something is true, or to measure how well something works.\nThink about it like this: you take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:29.700\nSee? It\u2019s all about finding things out.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:40.100\nOther examples could be testing a new recipe to see if it tastes good, or testing a toy to make sure it\u2019s safe.\n\n00:40.100 --> 00:55.400\nTests help us learn, improve, and make sure things are working the way they should.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find information, check something, or measure performance.\n\n00:55.400 --> 01:02.000\nIt's a valuable tool we use every day! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
