    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:15.900 --> 00:33.700\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think of it like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:43.400\nThe main idea of a test is to see if something is true or false, or to measure something.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:56.900\nIt could be physical, like testing if a bridge can hold a certain weight, or more abstract, like a school test to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:01.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n01:01.800 --> 01:05.800\nOr, a chef might taste a sauce to test if it has enough salt.\n\n01:05.800 --> 01:09.600\nYou might even test a new video game to see if you like it!\n\n01:09.600 --> 01:18.100\nSo, remember: a test is a way to get information, to check something, or to see how well something performs.\n\n01:18.100 --> 01:21.600\nIt's all about finding out!\n\n01:21.600 --> 01:23.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
