    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_112425.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.600\nThink of it like an experiment or a question that you're trying to answer. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.600 --> 00:28.800\nOr, in school, you might take a quiz to show what you've learned. Even baking a cake is a test!\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:37.500\nYou're testing whether your recipe works. Tests can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb works by turning it on.\n\n00:37.500 --> 00:48.200\nOr they can be more complex, like scientists testing a new medicine. The important thing is that a test helps us learn something or make a decision.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:53.900\nSo remember, a test is just a way of finding out information.\n\n00:53.900 --> 00:56.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
