    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:25.700\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something to see how it performs, or what its qualities are.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:28.900\nThink about it like this:\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:32.100\nA spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:35.300\nA taste test checks how something tastes.\n\n00:35.300 --> 00:38.600\nAnd a medical test checks your health.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:39.900\nSee?\n\n00:39.900 --> 00:41.800\nTests are all around us!\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:45.600\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for checking or evaluating something.\n\n00:45.600 --> 00:47.100\nIt helps us learn more about the thing we're testing.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:48.700\nWe use them every day, in lots of different ways.\n```"
