    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_112611.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:15.800\nIt's like asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:30.800\nThink about it. When you bake a cake, you might taste it \u2013 that's a test to see if it tastes good.\nOr, if you're trying to learn a new skill, like riding a bike, falling down is a test that shows you what not to do.\n\n00:30.800 --> 00:41.100\nTests aren't always about grades or right and wrong answers.\nThey can be about experimenting, exploring, and learning new things.\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:53.500\nThey help us understand the world around us better, one question and one answer at a time.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding something out.\n\n00:53.500 --> 01:00.900\nIt's a question, an experiment, a little adventure.\nAnd, it helps us learn and grow!\n\n01:00.900 --> 01:04.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "34986769-84a0-45da-91e8-60d0574701c5": {
