    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:28.000\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:37.400\nThink of it as asking a question and getting an answer that helps you learn something new.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:41.600\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:41.600 --> 00:46.800\nA taste test tells you which flavor of ice cream you like best.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:51.400\nA medical test can help a doctor figure out what's making you feel sick.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:52.500\nBasically, tests help us understand things better.\n00:52.500 --> 00:54.900\nThey give us information we can use to make decisions or learn new things.\n00:54.900 --> 01:01.100\nSo, whether it's a quiz at school or trying a new recipe, you're using a test to learn and discover.\n01:01.100 --> 01:04.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
