    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:22.400\nIt's a process we use to gather information. Think about it: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:22.400 --> 00:34.000\nOr, a doctor might order a blood test to see if you're healthy. In school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:43.000\nTests can be formal, like a quiz, or informal, like checking if your shoes fit. The important thing is they help us understand something better.\n\n00:43.000 --> 00:46.600\nSo, a test is really just a tool for learning and discovery. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
