    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_112948.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.300\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:07.300 --> 00:17.700\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.700 --> 00:24.900\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:24.900 --> 00:34.800\nThink of it like this: you're trying to figure out if your favorite shirt is clean.\n\n00:34.800 --> 00:45.900\nYou might smell it, look for stains, or even ask someone else. Those are all mini-tests!\n\n00:45.900 --> 00:57.000\nMore formally, a test is a procedure designed to evaluate something, like knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:57.000 --> 01:03.100\nFor example, a math quiz tests your understanding of math concepts.\n\n01:03.100 --> 01:08.100\nOr, a taste test can help you decide which cookie is the tastiest.\n\n01:08.100 --> 01:15.300\nSo, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n01:15.300 --> 01:21.400\nWhether it's a school exam or just figuring out what to wear, tests are a part of everyday life.\n\n01:21.400 --> 01:26.700\nThey help us learn and improve.\n\n01:26.700 --> 01:32.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
