    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.000\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.000 --> 00:07.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:12.000\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or performance.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:18.000\nThink of it like this: You want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:18.000 --> 00:20.000\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.000 --> 00:23.000\nThe toothpick comes out clean?\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:24.000\nThe cake passes the test.\n\n00:24.000 --> 00:26.000\nAnother example is a spelling quiz.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:29.000\nThe quiz tests your knowledge of how to spell words.\n\n00:29.000 --> 00:33.000\nOr, imagine trying to start a car.\n\n00:33.000 --> 00:36.000\nThe car's engine is being tested to see if it will turn on.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:38.000\nIf it starts, it passes the test!\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:42.000\nSo, to recap, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:47.000\nIt helps us understand if something works, if something is correct, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:49.000\nIt's all about finding answers!\n\n00:49.000 --> 00:54.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
