    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about something super important: a test.\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:15.700\nNow, a test is simply a way to find out how much you know about something, or how well you can do something.\n\n00:15.700 --> 00:23.100\nThink of it like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:23.100 --> 00:31.600\nTests can come in all shapes and sizes. It could be a quiz in school, a driving exam, or even trying out a new recipe to see if it tastes good!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:43.400\nThe main idea is that you're putting your understanding or abilities to the test.\n\n00:43.400 --> 00:51.500\nFor example, your teacher might give you a math test to see if you understand addition and subtraction.\n\n00:51.500 --> 01:01.600\nOr, if you're learning to ride a bike, each time you try, you're testing your balance and coordination.\n\n01:01.600 --> 01:06.000\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to check what you know or what you can do.\n\n01:06.000 --> 01:09.000\nIt helps you and others understand your progress.\n01:09.000 --> 01:12.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
