    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.900\nWhat is a test, exactly?\n\n00:11.900 --> 00:22.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's a procedure designed to evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the strength of a material, or even if a lightbulb works.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:29.800\nThink about it: a spelling test checks your spelling skills. A doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:39.800\nAnd when you try turning on a lamp, that's a simple test to see if it's plugged in and working. So, tests help us learn and understand.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:51.400\nThey give us information we didn't have before. They can be formal, like exams at school, or informal, like checking if your phone is on silent.\n\n00:51.400 --> 00:58.000\nThe important thing is they help us evaluate something.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:01.700\nThat's the basics of what a test is. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
