    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we\u2019re going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:17.600\nNow, you might think of tests as something scary, but in reality, a test is just a way to find out something new, or confirm something you already suspect.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:30.600\nThink of it like this: a test is a question, and you're trying to find the answer. It's a process, a way of checking if something is true, or how well something works.\n\n00:30.600 --> 00:39.800\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. A baker might taste their cake batter to test if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:39.800 --> 00:50.600\nAnd you might even test out a new video game to see if you like it! So, tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:50.600 --> 00:58.400\nThey're everywhere, and they're not always something to be afraid of. They are simply a way to gather information.\n\n00:58.400 --> 01:01.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
