    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.900\nIt's like an investigation to see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:21.900 --> 00:35.000\nThink of it like this: a chef tastes a soup to test if it needs more salt.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:43.700\nOr, when you learn something new, your teacher might give you a quiz to test your understanding.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:52.400\nA test helps us measure knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something.\n\n00:52.400 --> 01:02.900\nFor example, you might take a spelling test at school. That test measures how well you know how to spell different words.\n\n01:02.900 --> 01:12.200\nOr, a company might test a new toy to make sure it's safe for kids.\n\n01:12.200 --> 01:18.900\nSo, remember, a test is a way of finding something out.\n\n01:18.900 --> 01:23.800\nIt helps us learn, improve, and make sure things are working correctly.\n\n01:23.800 --> 01:26.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
