    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_114509.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.000\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're tackling something super important: tests!\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:17.600\nA test, at its core, is simply a way to check or measure something.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:22.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if your cookies are done baking.\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:35.500\nYou test them by poking them with a toothpick, right? That's a test! In school, tests help your teachers see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:43.800\nIt could be a multiple choice quiz, a written exam, or even a practical demonstration.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:52.100\nFor example, a spelling test checks your knowledge of words. A math test sees if you understand equations.\n\n00:52.100 --> 00:57.900\nAnd a science experiment tests a hypothesis, like whether plants grow better with sunlight.\n\n00:57.900 --> 01:04.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to find out information or measure understanding.\n\n01:04.300 --> 01:07.900\nIt's a tool, not something to be afraid of.\n\n01:07.900 --> 01:11.700\nTests help us learn and grow!\n\n01:11.700 --> 01:14.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
