    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:17:56.126278",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T11:46:59.183686",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260107_114659.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_114659.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:07.600\nEver wondered what a test really is? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something about something!\n\n00:07.600 --> 00:16.400\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is. We use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:25.800\nThink about it: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling. A taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:36.000\nEven a simple experiment, like trying a new recipe, is a type of test! You're testing if the recipe works and if you like the taste.\n\n00:36.000 --> 00:48.500\nSo, a test is just a method, a procedure, used to evaluate knowledge, ability, or even preferences. It gives us information.\n\n00:48.500 --> 00:58.000\nIn short, tests are tools we use to learn, explore, and understand the world around us.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:00.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
  "54145ef5-3438-475e-bbe2-39547b241c4d": {
    "id": "54145ef5-3438-475e-bbe2-39547b241c4d",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:17:56.775728",
