    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_115116.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.800\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.800 --> 00:13.800\nA test is simply a way to find out something about something else.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:24.500\nThink of it like asking a question and getting an answer. We use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:34.100\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:43.700\nOr, if you click a link on a website, you're testing to see where it goes.\n\n00:43.700 --> 00:48.600\nA doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:48.600 --> 00:52.200\nSo, testing is all about gathering information and making sure things work the way they should.\n\n```"
  },
  "55137325-8c41-4292-a200-15bfd550e1bd": {
    "id": "55137325-8c41-4292-a200-15bfd550e1bd",
    "topic": "Test",
    "level": "basic",
    "status": "completed",
    "queue_position": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-01-01T15:18:00.204817",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T11:52:06.556530",
    "video_url": "/uploads/MathExplanationScene_20260107_115206.mp4",
    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_115206.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:18.500\nNow, you've probably taken a test before, maybe in school, but what is a test, really?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out information about something.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:25.500\nIt's a method for gathering evidence to see if something is true, or to see how well something works.\n\n00:25.500 --> 00:33.300\nThink of it like this: a taste test for a new ice cream flavor.\nYou're testing to see if people like it.\n\n00:33.300 --> 00:41.100\nOr, if you're baking a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it.\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is done \u2013 that\u2019s a test!\n\n00:41.100 --> 00:52.100\nBasically, tests help us learn and make decisions.\nThey can be simple or complex, but they all have the same goal: to get information.\n\n00:52.100 --> 01:06.000\nSo next time you hear the word \"test\", remember it's just a way of finding things out!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
