    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, so what is a test?\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:05.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:09.600\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it!\n\n00:09.600 --> 00:12.800\nThink of it like this: you taste a new cookie.\n\n00:12.800 --> 00:13.800\nThat's a test!\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:17.400\nYou're testing to see if you like the flavor.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:22.000\nTests can be formal, like a quiz at school to see how well you understand a subject.\n\n00:22.000 --> 00:28.800\nOr they can be informal, like checking if the water is hot enough before you get in the shower.\n\n00:28.800 --> 00:31.100\nYou\u2019re testing the water temperature!\n\n00:31.100 --> 00:38.000\nBasically, any time you try something out to learn more about it or to check if it works, you're performing a test.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:42.800\nTests help us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:45.800\nThey\u2019re all about gathering information.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:49.700\nSo, remember: a test is just a way to find something out!\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:53.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
