    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's how we gather information to see if something is true or working correctly.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:25.700\nThink of it like this: you might test a cake recipe by baking it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:25.700 --> 00:37.400\nOr, you might test a new lightbulb to see if it lights up. In school, tests help your teacher see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:37.400 --> 00:44.500\nThey might ask you questions about what you\u2019ve learned, or ask you to solve a problem.\n\n00:44.500 --> 00:49.600\nThese tests help you too! They show you what you already know and what you might need to study a little more.\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:52.400\nSo, tests are just tools to help us learn and improve. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
