    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_115624.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:13.800\nNow, what exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:22.500\nIt helps us understand if something is working correctly, if someone knows something, or even what someone prefers.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:33.400\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, maybe you take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.400 --> 00:47.600\nEven trying a new flavor of ice cream is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing to see if you like it! So, tests can be anything from quizzes and exams to experiments and even just trying something out.\n\n00:47.600 --> 00:58.000\nThey all have one thing in common: they give us information. Tests help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:58.000 --> 01:05.800\nIn short, a test is just a way to find out something. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
