    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:07.700\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:14.000\nIt\u2019s like asking a question and getting an answer that helps you understand more.\n\n00:14.000 --> 00:21.000\nThink of it this way: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:26.000\nOr, in school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:32.000\nEven a simple taste test of two different cookies is a test to see which one you like better!\n\n00:32.000 --> 00:38.000\nTests aren\u2019t just about right or wrong answers.\n\n00:38.000 --> 00:42.000\nThey help us learn, improve, and make better decisions.\n\n00:42.000 --> 00:48.000\nThey can be formal, like a big exam, or informal, like trying out a new recipe.\n\n00:48.000 --> 00:53.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a process to gather information.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nIt helps us understand something better than we did before.\n\n00:57.300 --> 00:59.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
