    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.250\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.250 --> 00:08.550\nSimply put, a test is a way to see how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:08.550 --> 00:11.370\nIt helps us check knowledge, skills, or performance.\n\n00:11.370 --> 00:17.230\nThink about it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:17.230 --> 00:21.470\nOr, testing a new toy makes sure it's safe and fun to play with.\n\n00:21.470 --> 00:24.350\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.350 --> 00:30.050\nSo, tests are all about finding out information.\n\n00:30.050 --> 00:34.390\nThey can be written quizzes, physical challenges, or even just observing how something behaves.\n\n00:34.390 --> 00:38.600\nWe use the results to learn and improve.\n\n00:38.600 --> 00:41.870\nRemember, tests aren't scary, they're just helpful tools!\n\n00:41.870 --> 00:44.650\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
