    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:23.400\nIt helps us measure or evaluate.\n\n00:23.400 --> 00:34.100\nThink about it like this: a test in school helps your teacher see how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:40.800\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie is yummier.\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:47.500\nEven a simple check, like seeing if your toy car still works, is a type of test.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:54.300\nFor example, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:54.300 --> 00:59.800\nOr, you might test a recipe to see if it tastes good before making it for your friends.\n\n00:59.800 --> 01:01.400\nSee? Tests are everywhere!\n```"
