    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_120340.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Well, simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.700 --> 00:25.200\nIt helps us check knowledge, skills, or even the quality of something. Think about it like this: You might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:30.900\nOr a chef might taste a soup to test if it has enough salt.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:39.600\nAnother example? A scientist might test a new medicine to see if it helps people get better.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:52.400\nSo, tests can be all sorts of things! Basically, a test is a structured way to gather information and make a decision.\n\n00:52.400 --> 00:55.900\nSo next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a method for finding something out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
