    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:03.600\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test actually is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:12.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.000\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it. Think about it: a doctor gives you a checkup \u2013 that's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:23.000 --> 00:33.900\nOr when you try a new recipe, tasting it is a test to see if it's yummy! In school, tests help your teachers understand what you've learned.\n\n00:33.900 --> 00:43.100\nThey can be multiple choice, short answer, or even a project. The goal of any test is to gather information.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:53.000\nIt helps us understand something better, whether it's about our health, our cooking skills, or what we know about a certain subject.\n\n00:53.000 --> 01:03.500\nSo, next time you hear the word \"test,\" remember it's just a way to learn more! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
