    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.300 --> 00:22.900\nWe use them all the time, whether we realize it or not.\n\n00:22.900 --> 00:32.600\nThink of it like this: you want to know if the water in your shower is hot enough.\nYou touch it, and that's a test! You're testing the water's temperature.\n\n00:32.600 --> 00:42.300\nTests can be formal, like the ones you take in school to see how well you understand a subject.\nOr they can be informal, like checking if your shoes fit before you buy them.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:50.100\nYou're testing if they're comfortable! The important thing is that a test gives you information you didn't have before.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:52.500\nThey can help you make decisions, learn new things, and understand the world around you better.\n\n00:52.500 --> 00:56.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
