    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! \nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's how we check if something is working, if something is true, or if someone knows something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:23.500\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:30.000\nOr a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.000 --> 00:41.200\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\nYou're testing your recipe to see if it comes out delicious.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:50.200\nSo, tests help us learn, diagnose, and make sure things are going as planned.\nThey can be big or small, simple or complicated, but at their heart, they're all about getting information.\n\n00:50.200 --> 00:57.800\nRemember, a test is just a way to find something out.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
