    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.800\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\nIt's a process, a procedure, or even just a question that helps us get information.\n\n00:16.800 --> 00:27.400\nThink about it like this: a spelling test helps us find out how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:27.400 --> 00:38.500\nA taste test helps us find out which food you like best.\nOr even a simple \"yes\" or \"no\" question is a mini-test to see if you agree with something.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:49.300\nTests aren't just in school, either.\nWhen a doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:49.300 --> 00:59.700\nWhen you try on a new pair of shoes, you're testing to see if they fit.\nSo, tests are all about gathering information.\n\n00:59.700 --> 01:03.300\nThey help us learn, make decisions, and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
