    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:21.000\nIn the simplest terms, a test is just a way to find out something.\nIt's a process to check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:25.200\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a lightbulb works, so you screw it into a lamp and flip the switch.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:25.200 --> 00:30.400\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake.\nYou taste the batter to see if it's sweet enough.\nThat's another kind of test!\n\n00:30.400 --> 00:41.800\nTests help us understand things better and make sure things are doing what they're supposed to do.\nSo, a test is simply a way of checking or verifying something.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:52.200\nIt could be as simple as tasting cake batter or as complex as testing a rocket engine!\nIn short, tests are all about finding answers.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:56.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
