    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:16.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:24.800\nThink of it like asking a question and then getting an answer.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:33.600\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:33.600 --> 00:42.700\nFor example, a spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:42.700 --> 00:52.300\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that\u2019s a test to see if it needs more sugar!\n\n00:52.300 --> 00:55.900\nTests aren't just for school or cooking, though.\n```"
