    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_121440.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.700\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:06.700 --> 00:08.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:12.000\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:15.800\nWe use tests all the time, even without realizing it!\n\n00:15.800 --> 00:21.000\nThink about it: when you try a new recipe, you're testing it to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:21.000 --> 00:25.400\nOr when you push a button on a toy, you're testing if it works.\n\n00:25.400 --> 00:28.900\nIn school, tests help teachers see what you've learned.\n\n00:28.900 --> 00:32.300\nThey can be quizzes, exams, or even just doing a class activity.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:36.900\nSo, to recap, a test is a method for discovering information.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:41.200\nIt's a way to check something out and see what the results are.\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:46.800\nTests help us understand the world around us, from cooking a meal to learning in the classroom.\n\n00:46.800 --> 00:57.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
