    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_121526.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:01.200\nHey everyone, and welcome!\n\n00:01.200 --> 00:02.400\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:03.900\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.900 --> 00:07.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.000 --> 00:11.100\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:11.100 --> 00:16.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your spelling skills.\n\n00:16.000 --> 00:19.700\nA cooking taste test sees how good a dish is.\n\n00:19.700 --> 00:23.800\nOr, a strength test at the gym measures how much you can lift!\n\n00:23.800 --> 00:29.300\nTests can be formal, like an exam in school, or informal, like asking a friend if they like your new haircut.\n\n00:29.300 --> 00:34.700\nThe main idea is that you're trying to get some information or measure something.\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:39.500\nSo remember, a test helps us learn and understand things better.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:44.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
