    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.000\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.000 --> 00:11.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.600 --> 00:23.900\nIt's a process designed to give us information about whatever we're testing.\n\n00:23.900 --> 00:31.700\nThink about it like this: When you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in to see if it comes out clean. That's a test!\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:39.500\nOr, if your doctor checks your temperature, that's a test to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:39.500 --> 00:51.600\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. They can be simple, like checking if a lightbulb works, or more complex, like a school exam.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.100\nThe important thing is that they help us learn something we didn\u2019t know before.\n\n00:55.100 --> 00:58.700\nSo, tests are a fundamental way we gather information and make decisions based on the results. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
