    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:21.300\nIt's like asking a question and seeing what answer you get. Think of it like this: a scientist might test if a new medicine works.\n\n00:21.300 --> 00:29.900\nOr, you might take a spelling test at school to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:29.900 --> 00:36.900\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test! You're testing the recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:36.900 --> 00:49.700\nSo, tests can be about anything, really. They help us learn, improve things, and make sure things are working as they should.\n\n00:49.700 --> 00:57.300\nFrom simple questions to complex experiments, tests are all about finding answers.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:04.000\nTo recap, a test is a way to learn or confirm something by asking a question and observing the result. It's a fundamental tool used everywhere.\n\n01:04.000 --> 01:10.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
