    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:04.600\nHey there, welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:04.600 --> 00:12.000\nNow, what exactly is a test?\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:23.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:34.000\nThink of it like this: a doctor might run a blood test to see if you're healthy.\nOr, a teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:42.800\nEven baking a cake is a sort of test \u2013 you're testing the recipe!\n\n00:42.800 --> 00:51.600\nSo, tests can be formal, like exams, or informal, like trying out a new recipe.\nThey all have the same goal: to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:57.100\nRemember, tests aren't always about \"pass\" or \"fail.\"\nThey're just tools to help us understand where we're at.\n\n00:57.100 --> 01:00.700\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
