    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.600\nOkay, let\u2019s talk about tests. What are they and why do we use them?\n\n00:05.600 --> 00:16.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:26.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know how to spell words.\n\n00:26.400 --> 00:36.300\nA taste test helps you decide which cookie you like best.\nEven a doctor uses tests, like blood work, to check your health.\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:44.900\nSo, tests aren\u2019t always about grades in school.\nThey're a tool to gather information and measure something.\n\n00:44.900 --> 00:53.900\nThey help us understand where we stand and what we need to learn or improve.\nIn short, a test is a way to check something and learn from the results.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
