    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.700\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:23.600\nIt could be checking if something is true, if something works, or even how well something performs.\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:33.100\nThink about it like this: a recipe is like a set of instructions. You can test the recipe by following it and seeing if you end up with a delicious cake!\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:42.500\nOr, imagine you're building a tower with blocks. You can test its stability by gently pushing it to see if it falls over.\n\n00:42.500 --> 00:56.300\nTests are super important because they help us learn and improve. They show us what we're doing right, and what we need to work on.\n\n00:56.300 --> 01:02.300\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something, using examples like a recipe or a block tower. It helps us learn and get better.\n```"
