    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:19.800\nIn the simplest terms, a test is a way to find something out!\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:24.600\nIt's a procedure designed to check if something is working, or if something is true.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:34.700\nThink about it like this: when you bake a cake, you might stick a toothpick in it. That's a test!\n\n00:34.700 --> 00:43.100\nYou're testing if the cake is cooked all the way through. Or, if you're buying a used bike, you take it for a spin.\n\n00:43.100 --> 00:54.200\nThat's a test to see if the brakes work and the gears shift smoothly. Tests can be simple like that, or they can be more complicated, like a medical test or a school exam.\n\n00:54.200 --> 00:57.900\nBut at their core, they all help us gather information and make decisions. So, remember, a test is just a way to learn something new!\n```"
  },
