    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:25.100\nIt\u2019s a process or a procedure designed to see if something is true, or to measure something.\nThink about it like this: you might take a spelling test in school to see how well you know your words.\nOr, a doctor might run a blood test to check your health.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test \u2013 you\u2019re testing your recipe to see if it works!\n\n00:25.100 --> 00:35.500\nTests help us learn and improve.\nThey give us information we can use to make better decisions.\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:42.400\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of finding things out!\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:50.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
