    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.070\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:03.070 --> 00:07.680\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out information\n\n00:07.680 --> 00:12.170\nor see how well someone or something performs.\n\n00:12.170 --> 00:17.570\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works before you screw it in.\n\n00:17.570 --> 00:19.840\nThere are all kinds of tests.\n\n00:19.840 --> 00:23.520\nYou might take a spelling test in school\n\n00:23.520 --> 00:26.090\nto see how many words you know.\n\n00:26.090 --> 00:30.100\nOr a doctor might run tests to check if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.100 --> 00:34.940\nEven a chef tastes their food \u2013 that's a test to see if it needs more salt!\n\n00:34.940 --> 00:39.000\nFor example, a car company tests new cars to make sure they're safe.\n\n00:39.000 --> 00:43.560\nAnd you might test a new recipe to see if it tastes good.\n\n00:43.560 --> 00:48.860\nIt\u2019s all about learning something new or making sure things are working properly.\n\n00:48.860 --> 00:52.590\nSo, a test is just a way to get information and learn something.\n\n00:52.590 --> 00:57.400\nIt helps us understand things better and make sure everything is working as it should.\n\n00:57.400 --> 00:59.370\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
