    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.200\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.200 --> 00:05.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out.\n\n00:05.500 --> 00:08.500\nThink of it like a question you're asking, and the test gives you the answer.\n\n00:08.500 --> 00:10.200\nIt could be testing anything!\n\n00:10.200 --> 00:13.900\nMaybe you want to know if a cake is done.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:17.500\nYou do a test: poke it with a toothpick.\n\n00:17.500 --> 00:20.300\nIf it comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:24.800\nOr, imagine you're learning to ride a bike.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:27.300\nEach time you try, you're testing your balance.\n\n00:27.300 --> 00:30.300\nIf you stay upright, you're passing the balance test!\n\n00:30.300 --> 00:35.000\nTests help us understand things, learn new skills, and check if something is working the way it should.\n\n00:35.000 --> 00:40.200\nSo, a test is just a simple way to get information and see how things are going.\n\n00:40.200 --> 00:44.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
