    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_122913.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:06.500\nHey there, and welcome! Today we're diving into the basics of what a test actually is.\n\n00:06.500 --> 00:18.200\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something else. It's a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:28.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\n\n00:28.600 --> 00:37.700\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to see if it needs more sugar.\n\n00:37.700 --> 00:43.500\nEven a kid checking if the water's warm enough to swim is performing a simple test!\n\n00:43.500 --> 00:53.200\nTests aren't always about grades in school. They're everywhere! They help us make decisions and understand the world around us.\n\n00:53.200 --> 01:03.700\nSo, whether it's a quiz, an experiment, or just a quick check, a test is all about gathering information.\n\n01:03.700 --> 01:07.300\nIn short, a test is a way to evaluate something to learn more about it.\n\n01:07.300 --> 01:11.800\nWe use them constantly, often without even realizing it.\n\n01:11.800 --> 01:14.200\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
