    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:11.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nWe use them all the time!\n\n00:11.700 --> 00:22.500\nThink about it.\nA test helps us measure or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, your skills, or even the quality of a product.\n\n00:22.500 --> 00:32.100\nSo, it's really just a way to gather information.\nFor example, a spelling test checks how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:32.100 --> 00:41.700\nA taste test helps you decide which flavor of ice cream you like best.\nAnd a scientist might run a test to see if a new medicine works.\n\n00:41.700 --> 00:52.200\nSo, remember, a test is a process or tool used to assess something.\nIt helps us understand, measure, and learn.\n\n00:52.200 --> 00:55.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
