    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today, we're diving into something super important: the test.\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:17.100\nNow, a test, in simple terms, is just a way to find out how well you know something, or how well something works.\n\n00:17.100 --> 00:24.400\nThink of it like this: your teacher gives you a quiz, that's a test to see what you've learned in class.\n\n00:24.400 --> 00:32.500\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You taste it to see if it needs more sugar \u2013 that's also a kind of test!\n\n00:32.500 --> 00:40.400\nTests aren\u2019t just for school or cooking, though. Scientists use tests to see if a new medicine works.\n\n00:40.400 --> 00:50.000\nEngineers use tests to make sure bridges are safe. Basically, anything you want to check or evaluate, you can use a test.\n\n00:50.000 --> 00:55.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:55.700 --> 01:00.500\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
