    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:11.200\nWhat is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:11.200 --> 00:22.100\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see if something is true or correct.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:30.900\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:30.900 --> 00:43.900\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how well you understand a subject.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:43.900 --> 00:54.100\nYou're testing the recipe to see if it comes out delicious.\nSo, tests come in many forms, but they all share the same basic idea: to help us learn and understand.\n\n00:54.100 --> 00:57.600\nThey help us figure out what we know, what we don't know, and where we can improve.\nRemember, tests are just tools for learning.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
