    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_123733.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:13.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.900 --> 00:17.000\nIt's a process or procedure designed to evaluate your knowledge, skills, or abilities.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:20.100\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done, so you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:20.100 --> 00:20.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:23.600\nOther examples?\n\n00:23.600 --> 00:25.300\nA spelling quiz is a test of your spelling skills.\n\n00:25.300 --> 00:28.000\nA doctor might run blood tests to check your health.\n\n00:28.000 --> 00:31.300\nEven trying out a new recipe is a kind of test to see if you like it.\n\n00:31.300 --> 00:36.700\nBasically, tests help us gather information and make decisions.\n\n00:36.700 --> 00:41.800\nThey give us a measurable way to understand something better.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:47.500\nSo, a test is just a way to check, measure, or evaluate something.\n\n00:47.500 --> 00:55.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
