    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_124000.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.100\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:02.100 --> 00:03.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\n\n00:03.800 --> 00:07.700\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.700 --> 00:12.000\nIt's a process that helps us understand or measure something specific.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:16.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:16.600 --> 00:20.900\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:22.600\nThese are both tests!\n\n00:22.600 --> 00:24.800\nThey\u2019re designed to give us information.\n\n00:24.800 --> 00:28.700\nAnother example is a taste test.\n\n00:28.700 --> 00:34.100\nIf you're trying to decide which cookie recipe is best, you might have people taste each cookie and tell you which one they prefer.\n\n00:34.100 --> 00:35.500\nThat's a test too!\n\n00:35.500 --> 00:41.500\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:41.500 --> 00:44.600\nIt helps us understand the world around us.\n\n00:44.600 --> 00:47.400\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
