    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_124044.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nHello, and welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:12.600\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check or evaluate something.\n\n00:12.600 --> 00:25.800\nIt could be anything from a quiz in school to a medical exam, or even testing a new recipe. The main idea is to see how well something performs or to find out information about it.\n\n00:25.800 --> 00:34.400\nFor example, think about baking a cake. You might test the batter to make sure it tastes good before you bake the whole thing.\n\n00:34.400 --> 00:40.500\nOr, imagine a doctor giving you a checkup. That's a test to see how healthy you are.\n\n00:40.500 --> 00:51.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a method to learn something or check on something. It helps us understand things better.\n\n00:51.100 --> 00:53.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
