    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.400\nAlright, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.400 --> 00:16.400\nIn simple terms, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:16.400 --> 00:28.100\nThink of it like an experiment or a question you're trying to answer.\nWe use tests all the time, even if we don't realize it.\n\n00:28.100 --> 00:32.400\nFor example, when you try a new recipe, you're testing if you like it.\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:39.200\nOr, if your phone isn't working, you might test if it's plugged in.\n\n00:39.200 --> 00:46.000\nThat's a test!\nYou're checking to see if something is true.\n\n00:46.000 --> 00:52.800\nAnother example is a spelling test at school.\nIt\u2019s a way to test what you know about spelling.\n\n00:52.800 --> 00:58.600\nThe results help you and your teacher understand what you\u2019ve learned.\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something, learn something new, or see if something works.\nIt's all about finding answers!\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
