    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_124825.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.100 --> 00:02.400\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:02.400 --> 00:05.900\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:05.900 --> 00:8.800\nIt's a method for gathering information.\n\n00:08.800 --> 00:13.600\nThink of it like this: a doctor gives you a test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:18.200\nIn school, you take tests to show what you've learned.\n\n00:18.200 --> 00:20.300\nThat quiz on fractions?\n\n00:20.300 --> 00:20.900\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.900 --> 00:27.000\nEven tasting a new ice cream flavor is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing to see if you like it!\n\n00:27.000 --> 00:29.700\nTests can be written, like exams.\n\n00:29.700 --> 00:32.700\nThey can be practical, like a driving test.\n\n00:32.700 --> 00:39.600\nOr they can even be something you do without even realizing it, like trying that new ice cream.\n\n00:39.600 --> 00:43.800\nBasically, anything that helps you learn or check something is a test.\n\n00:43.800 --> 00:50.100\nSo, a test is just a way to gather information and see what's what.\n\n00:50.100 --> 00:54.800\nIt\u2019s a tool for learning and understanding.\n\n00:54.800 --> 00:59.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
