    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_124955.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.100\nHi everyone, and welcome!\nToday we're talking about tests.\n\n00:05.100 --> 00:11.400\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:11.400 --> 00:18.400\nIt's like asking a question to see if you know the answer, or trying something out to see if it works.\n\n00:18.400 --> 00:26.700\nThink about it: a spelling test checks your knowledge of spelling.\nA taste test checks if you like the flavor of something.\n\n00:26.700 --> 00:36.300\nEven trying to turn on a light switch is a simple test to see if the lightbulb is working!\n\n00:36.300 --> 00:48.300\nTests help us understand things better.\nThey can show us what we know, what we like, or if something is working correctly.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:55.700\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to check something.\nIt helps us learn and understand the world around us.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
