    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:14.200\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:14.200 --> 00:26.000\nWe use them all the time, even if we don't realize it. Think of it like asking a question and seeing what the answer is.\n\n00:26.000 --> 00:36.200\nThe main idea behind a test is to check if something is true, correct, or working as expected.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:47.100\nIt's a way to get information and make decisions based on that information. For example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:57.500\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand the material. Even trying a new recipe is a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if you like the taste!\n\n00:57.500 --> 01:01.100\nSo, remember, a test is just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n```"
