    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests! What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\nIt's a process we use to gather information and see how well something works, or how much of something exists.\n\n00:17.400 --> 00:26.300\nThink about it like this: a taste test!\nYou try a new flavor of ice cream, and that's a test to see if you like it.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:33.100\nOr maybe you're taking a spelling test at school.\nThat's to see how well you know your spelling words.\n\n00:33.100 --> 00:42.300\nTests aren't just for school though.\nDoctors use tests to check your health, like taking your temperature to see if you have a fever.\n\n00:42.300 --> 00:58.300\nEngineers use tests to make sure bridges are strong and won't fall down.\nSo, a test is just a way of gathering information, whether it's about your spelling, your health, or even if you like a new ice cream flavor.\n\n00:58.300 --> 01:06.800\nWe use tests all the time to learn and understand the world around us better.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
