    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.100\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, it's a way to find out something about something.\n\n00:13.100 --> 00:20.500\nThink of it like checking if a lightbulb works.\nThat's a test!\n\n00:20.500 --> 00:29.800\nThe main idea is to ask a question or perform an action, and then see what happens.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:38.500\nThe answer or the result tells you something you didn't know before.\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:47.200\nOr, a teacher might give you a quiz to see how well you understand a topic.\nEven baking a cake is a kind of test!\n\n00:47.200 --> 00:56.900\nYou're testing if your recipe works.\nSo, a test is really just a way to gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:56.900 --> 01:01.000\nIt can be used for all sorts of things, big or small.\n\n01:01.000 --> 01:04.500\nRemember, it's all about asking a question and finding the answer!\n\n01:04.500 --> 01:06.600\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
