    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_130011.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests.\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:16.900\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:16.900 --> 00:26.900\nIt's how we find out if something works, if something is true, or even just how good something is.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:34.900\nThink about it like this: you might test a cake by tasting it to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:34.900 --> 00:42.900\nOr you might test a toy to see if it breaks easily. In school, your tests check how well you understand what you've been learning.\n\n00:42.900 --> 00:48.300\nSo, tests aren't scary! They're just a way of gathering information.\n\n00:48.300 --> 00:54.600\nWhether it's a taste test, a durability test, or a school test, they all help us learn and improve. Remember, testing is just a way to check and understand. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
