    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHello everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:20.700\nIt's a process designed to gather information.\n\n00:20.700 --> 00:32.800\nThink about it like this: a doctor might give you a blood test to check your health.\nA teacher gives you a quiz to see what you've learned.\nEven baking a cake involves a kind of test \u2013 you're testing if the ingredients combine to make something delicious!\n\n00:32.800 --> 00:48.200\nTests come in many forms, but they all share the same goal: to provide us with data.\nThis data helps us make better decisions, understand the world around us, and improve things for the future.\n\n00:48.200 --> 00:56.000\nSo, a test is just a structured way to get answers. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
