    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_130606.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.500\nOkay, so what exactly is a test?\n\n00:07.500 --> 00:17.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's a procedure to evaluate knowledge, ability, or performance.\n\n00:17.600 --> 00:26.300\nThink of it like this: you want to know if a cake is done. You poke it with a toothpick \u2013 that's a test! If the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:31.700\nTests aren't just for school.\n\n00:31.700 --> 00:42.400\nA doctor might run tests to see if you're healthy. A software developer tests their code to make sure it works correctly. Even trying out different recipes to see which one tastes best is a kind of test!\n\n00:42.400 --> 00:57.300\nBasically, a test is just a structured way of asking a question and getting an answer. Whether it's a quiz, a blood sample, or a taste test, it helps us learn and make informed decisions.\n\n00:57.300 --> 01:00.900\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
