    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:03.100\nHey there! Ever wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:03.600 --> 00:13.600\nSimply put, a test is a way to find something out. It's like asking a question and getting an answer, but in a more structured way.\n\n00:13.600 --> 00:19.100\nThink about it. A spelling test checks if you know how to spell words correctly.\n\n00:19.100 --> 00:27.500\nA taste test helps you decide which ice cream flavor you like best. Even checking if a light bulb works is a kind of test.\n\n00:27.500 --> 00:43.200\nSo, a test can be anything from a formal exam in school to a casual experiment at home. The key thing is that it helps us learn something new, confirm something we already suspect, or make a decision.\n\n00:43.200 --> 00:49.600\nIn essence, it's a simple method to gather information. That's the basic idea of a test!\n\n00:49.600 --> 00:54.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
