    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey there! Ever heard the word \"test\" and wondered what it really means?\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:20.400\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about a person, thing, or process.\n\n00:20.400 --> 00:26.600\nThink of it like this: you're checking if something is working correctly, or seeing what someone knows.\n\n00:26.600 --> 00:36.200\nTests can be all sorts of things. A doctor might give you a blood test to check your health. A teacher gives you a quiz to see how well you understand a lesson.\n\n00:36.200 --> 00:47.400\nOr, you might even test out a new recipe to see if it tastes good! So, in short, a test helps us gather information and learn something new.\n\n00:47.400 --> 00:51.000\nIt's all about checking, exploring, and understanding. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
