    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.400\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:15.400 --> 00:24.700\nIt's a process we use to check or evaluate something, whether it's your knowledge, the quality of a product, or even just to see if something works.\n\n00:24.700 --> 00:34.000\nThink about it like this: a spelling test checks your understanding of spelling rules.\n\n00:34.000 --> 00:41.800\nA taste test checks how good food tastes. Even a doctor's appointment involves tests to check your health.\n\n00:41.800 --> 00:47.000\nSo, tests help us learn and improve. They give us information to make better decisions.\n\n00:47.000 --> 00:51.500\nThey might seem scary sometimes, but they\u2019re really just tools for understanding.\n\n00:51.500 --> 00:55.000\nRemember, tests are all about learning and finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
