    "error": null,
    "progress": "Completed!",
    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_131508.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:08.100\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests \u2013 what they are and why we use them.\n\n00:08.100 --> 00:17.000\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something. It's like asking a question and getting an answer that helps us learn.\n\n00:17.000 --> 00:22.100\nThink about it. A recipe is like a test to see if you can bake a cake.\n\n00:22.100 --> 00:33.700\nFollowing the steps and then tasting the cake tells you if you did it right. Or, when you take a spelling quiz at school, it's a test to see how well you know your words.\n\n00:33.700 --> 00:38.700\nThe score tells you what you need to practice.\n\n00:38.700 --> 00:46.200\nTests aren't scary! They just give us helpful information. They can show us what we already know and what we still need to learn.\n\n00:46.200 --> 00:54.500\nSo, remember, tests are tools for learning and improvement. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
  },
