    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:17.800\nWhat exactly is a test?\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:17.800 --> 00:26.900\nIt helps us measure or evaluate something, like how well you understand a topic or how strong a material is.\n\n00:26.900 --> 00:41.400\nThink of it like this: a spelling test shows how well you know your spelling words.\nOr a doctor might run a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:41.400 --> 00:49.900\nTests can be written, like quizzes, or they can involve doing something, like a science experiment.\nAnother example is testing the strength of a bridge by seeing how much weight it can hold.\n\n00:49.900 --> 00:56.900\nSo, tests are all about gathering information and learning something new.\nThey help us understand things better. Remember, a test helps us find something out.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
