    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_131634.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.200 --> 00:02.700\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:02.700 --> 00:07.800\nA test, in its simplest form, is a way to find out something.\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:13.800\nThink of it like an experiment, but more focused.\n\n00:13.800 --> 00:18.500\nWe use tests to see if something is true, or to measure how well something works.\n\n00:18.500 --> 00:24.500\nFor example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you have a cold.\n\n00:24.500 --> 00:29.800\nOr, a teacher might give you a test to see how much you learned in class.\n\n00:29.800 --> 00:34.300\nEven tasting a new food is a kind of test to see if you like it!\n\n00:34.300 --> 00:40.300\nSo, tests help us gather information and make better decisions.\n\n00:40.300 --> 00:45.800\nThey're all around us, helping us learn and understand the world.\n\n00:45.800 --> 00:49.400\nIn short, a test is just a way to check something.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:51.300\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
