    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:02.600\nEver wondered what a test really is?\n\n00:02.600 --> 00:06.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out something about someone or something.\n\n00:06.100 --> 00:08.800\nThink of it like a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:08.800 --> 00:12.300\nIt could be anything from a quiz in school to checking if a cake is ready.\n\n00:12.300 --> 00:14.900\nThe main idea is to gather information.\n\n00:14.900 --> 00:19.300\nWe use tests to see what we know, what we can do, or even how something works.\n\n00:19.300 --> 00:26.300\nFor example, a doctor might give you a blood test to see if you're healthy. Or, you might take a practice driving test to see if you're ready to get your license.\n\n00:26.300 --> 00:31.600\nEven baking a cake involves testing if it's cooked through by poking it with a toothpick!\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:35.800\nSo, tests help us learn and make decisions.\n\n00:35.800 --> 00:38.900\nThey give us data to understand things better.\n\n00:38.900 --> 00:41.200\nThat\u2019s the essence of a test!\n\n00:41.200 --> 00:44.100\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
