    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests. What exactly is a test?\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:15.500\nSimply put, a test is a way to check something.\n\n00:15.500 --> 00:24.600\nIt could be anything from checking if a lightbulb works to seeing how well you understand a topic.\n\n00:24.600 --> 00:31.500\nThink of it like this: you have a cake recipe, right?\nTo test if your cake is done, you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:31.500 --> 00:39.100\nIf the toothpick comes out clean, the cake passes the test!\nYou can also test your knowledge.\n\n00:39.100 --> 00:46.700\nMaybe your friend asks you a question about animals.\nAnswering correctly means you passed that little test.\n\n00:46.700 --> 00:51.600\nTests help us understand if something is working correctly, or if we know something well.\n\n00:51.600 --> 00:55.200\nSo, a test is basically a check-up to see if something meets a certain standard.\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
