    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.400\nHey everyone, and welcome! Today we're going to talk about tests.\n\n00:05.400 --> 00:12.000\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:12.000 --> 00:24.100\nIt\u2019s a procedure designed to evaluate knowledge, skills, or performance. Think of it like this: a doctor gives you a blood test to find out if you're healthy.\n\n00:24.100 --> 00:32.400\nOr, imagine you're baking a cake. You might taste the batter \u2013 that's a mini-test to see if it's sweet enough!\n\n00:32.400 --> 00:43.600\nSchools use tests to see how well you're learning the material. So, tests come in many forms, from simple quizzes to big exams.\n\n00:43.600 --> 00:50.400\nThey all help us understand where we're at and what we need to work on. They help us measure something.\n\n00:50.400 --> 00:58.200\nIn short, a test is just a tool for finding things out. This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
