    "video_filename": "MathExplanationScene_20260107_132749.mp4",
    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:07.800\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:07.800 --> 00:17.300\nYou've probably taken a bunch of them, but what is a test, really?\n\n00:17.300 --> 00:26.100\nSimply put, a test is a way to find out what you know or what you can do.\n\n00:26.100 --> 00:32.300\nIt's like a measuring stick for your knowledge or skills.\n\n00:32.300 --> 00:38.500\nThink of it like this: if you want to see if a cake is done, you stick a toothpick in it.\n\n00:38.500 --> 00:40.800\nThe toothpick is like a test!\n\n00:40.800 --> 00:49.400\nIf it comes out clean, the cake is ready. Tests come in all shapes and sizes.\n\n00:49.400 --> 00:53.500\nMultiple choice questions, fill-in-the-blanks, even running a race\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:55.600\ncan be a test of your speed and endurance.\n\n00:55.600 --> 00:57.700\nThey all help us understand something better.\n\n00:57.700 --> 01:09.300\nSo, to recap, a test is a tool we use to measure knowledge, skills, or abilities. It helps us see how much we've learned or how well we can perform.\n\n01:09.300 --> 01:12.800\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
