    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.200\nOkay, let's talk about tests!\n\n00:05.200 --> 00:13.300\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out something.\n\n00:13.300 --> 00:23.500\nIt's like asking a question and then looking for the answer. Think of it like this: a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:23.500 --> 00:27.700\nOr, a baker might taste their cake batter to see if it's sweet enough.\n\n00:27.700 --> 00:38.100\nThese are all tests! Tests aren't just in school. You test your shoelaces every time you tie them to make sure they're secure.\n\n00:38.100 --> 00:47.100\nYou test the water temperature before you jump in the pool to make sure it's not too cold.\n\n00:47.100 --> 00:50.600\nSo, remember, a test is just a way of checking something. It helps you learn more and make better decisions.\n```"
