    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.700\nHi everyone, and welcome! Today, we're going to learn about tests.\n\n00:05.700 --> 00:12.900\nA test is simply a way to find out something specific.\n\n00:12.900 --> 00:19.800\nThink of it as a question you're trying to answer.\n\n00:19.800 --> 00:31.600\nWe use tests all the time! For example, a doctor might give you a test to see if you're healthy. Or, a teacher might give you a test in class to see what you've learned.\n\n00:31.600 --> 00:39.300\nEven baking a cake involves a test \u2013 you check to see if it's done by sticking a toothpick in it!\n\n00:39.300 --> 00:53.700\nSo, tests help us understand things better. They give us information we can use to make decisions. Remember, a test is just a way of asking a question and getting an answer.\n\n00:53.700 --> 00:57.300\nWhether it's a quiz, a medical checkup, or even tasting your soup to see if it needs more salt, you're using a test! This video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
