    "subtitles": "```webvtt\nWEBVTT\n\n00:00.000 --> 00:05.300\nHey everyone, welcome! Today we're diving into the world of tests.\n\n00:05.300 --> 00:14.500\nWhat exactly is a test? Simply put, a test is a way to find out information or check if something works correctly.\n\n00:14.500 --> 00:21.200\nThink of it like this: you're testing your new shoes by walking in them to see if they're comfortable.\n\n00:21.200 --> 00:27.800\nTests come in all shapes and sizes. A doctor might run blood tests to see if you're healthy.\n\n00:27.800 --> 00:37.300\nA chef might taste a soup to see if it needs more salt. Or, think about a spelling test at school \u2013 that checks your knowledge of words.\n\n00:37.300 --> 00:49.100\nSo, tests help us learn, make decisions, and make sure things are working as they should. They provide valuable information that we can use.\n\n00:49.100 --> 00:53.500\nRemember, a test is just a way to gather facts and check things out.\n\n00:53.500 --> 00:58.000\nThis video was created by Apilage AI.\n```"
